#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:202
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "ການເຣນເດີ (Rendering)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:127
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:15
msgid "Godot 4 includes three renderers:"
msgstr "Godot 4 ປະກອບມີຕົວເຣນເດີ (renderers) ສາມແບບ:"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:129
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Forward+**. The most advanced renderer, suited for desktop platforms only. "
"Used by default on desktop platforms. This renderer uses **Vulkan**, "
"**Direct3D 12**, or **Metal** as the rendering driver, and it uses the "
"**RenderingDevice** backend."
msgstr ""
"**Forward+**. ເປັນຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ເໝາະສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ. ຕົວເຣນເດີນີ້ໃຊ້ **Vulkan**, **Direct3D 12**, ຫຼື **Metal** ເປັນໄດຣເວີ"
"ໃນການເຣນເດີ ແລະ ໃຊ້ **RenderingDevice** ເປັນແບັກເອນ (backend)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:132
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Mobile**. Fewer features, but renders simple scenes faster. Suited for "
"mobile and desktop platforms. Used by default on mobile platforms. This "
"renderer uses **Vulkan**, **Direct3D 12**, or **Metal** as the rendering "
"driver, and it uses the **RenderingDevice** backend."
msgstr ""
"**Mobile**. ມີຟີເຈີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ແຕ່ສາມາດເຣນເດີຊີ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ. ເໝາະສຳລັບທັງແພລັດຟອມມືຖື ແລະ "
"ເດັສທັອບ. ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖື. ຕົວເຣນເດີນີ້ໃຊ້ **Vulkan**, **Direct3D 12**, ຫຼື "
"**Metal** ເປັນໄດຣເວີໃນການເຣນເດີ ແລະ ໃຊ້ **RenderingDevice** ເປັນແບັກເອນ (backend)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:136
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Compatibility**, sometimes called **GL Compatibility**. The least advanced "
"renderer, suited for low-end desktop and mobile platforms. Used by default "
"on the web platform. This renderer uses **OpenGL** as the rendering driver."
msgstr ""
"**Compatibility**, ບາງຄັ້ງເອີ້ນວ່າ **GL Compatibility**. ເປັນຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ມີຄວາມສາມາດຕ່ຳສຸ"
"ດ, ເໝາະສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ມືຖືທີ່ເປັນລຸ້ນເກົ່າ ຫຼື ສະເປັກຕ່ຳ. ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແພລັດຟອມເວັ"
"ບ. ຕົວເຣນເດີນີ້ໃຊ້ **OpenGL** ເປັນໄດຣເວີໃນການເຣນເດີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:142
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_renderers` for a detailed comparison of the rendering methods."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_renderers` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນປຽບທຽບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະວິທີການເຣນເດີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:145
msgid "2D graphics"
msgstr "ກຣາບຟິກ 2D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:147
msgid "Sprite, polygon and line rendering."
msgstr "ການເຣນເດີ Sprite, polygon ແລະ ເສັ້ນ (line)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:149
msgid ""
"High-level tools to draw lines and polygons such as :ref:`class_Polygon2D` "
"and :ref:`class_Line2D`, with support for texturing."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືລະດັບສູງໃນການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນ ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ (polygons) ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`class_Polygon2D` ແລ"
"ະ :ref:`class_Line2D`, ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບການໃສ່ລວດລາຍ (texturing)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:152
msgid "AnimatedSprite2D as a helper for creating animated sprites."
msgstr "AnimatedSprite2D ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງ sprite ທີ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:153
msgid "Parallax layers."
msgstr "Parallax layers (ການສ້າງພາບພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວຕ່າງກັນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:155
msgid "Pseudo-3D support including preview in the editor."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ Pseudo-3D ລວມທັງການສະແດງຜົນຕົວຢ່າງໃນເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:157
msgid ""
":ref:`2D lighting <doc_2d_lights_and_shadows>` with normal maps and specular "
"maps."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ແສງສະຫວ່າງ 2D <doc_2d_lights_and_shadows>` ພ້ອມກັບ normal maps ແລະ "
"specular maps."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:159
msgid "Point (omni/spot) and directional 2D lights."
msgstr "ແສງ 2D ແບບຈຸດ (omni/spot) ແລະ ແບບມີທິດທາງ (directional)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:160
msgid "Hard or soft shadows (adjustable on a per-light basis)."
msgstr "ເງົາແບບຄົມ ຫຼື ແບບມົວ (ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະດວງໄຟ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:161
msgid ""
"Custom shaders can access a real-time :abbr:`SDF (Signed Distance Field)` "
"representation of the 2D scene based on :ref:`class_LightOccluder2D` nodes, "
"which can be used for improved 2D lighting effects including 2D global "
"illumination."
msgstr ""
"Custom shaders ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະແດງຜົນ :abbr:`SDF (Signed Distance Field)` ແບບສົ"
"ດໆ ຂອງຊີ້ນ 2D ໂດຍອີງຕາມໂນດ :ref:`class_LightOccluder2D`, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງເອັບເຟັກ"
"ແສງ 2D ລວມທັງ 2D global illumination."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:165
msgid ""
":ref:`Font rendering <doc_gui_using_fonts>` using bitmaps, rasterization "
"using FreeType or multi-channel signed distance fields (MSDF)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການເຣນເດີຕົວອັກສອນ <doc_gui_using_fonts>` ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitmaps, ການເຮັດ "
"rasterization ໂດຍໃຊ້ FreeType ຫຼື multi-channel signed distance fields (MSDF)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:168
msgid ""
"Bitmap fonts can be exported using tools like BMFont, or imported from "
"images (for fixed-width fonts only)."
msgstr ""
"Bitmap fonts ສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ BMFont, ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກຮູບພາບ (ສຳລັບຟອນທີ່ມີຄວາມ"
"ກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:170
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support monochrome fonts as well as colored fonts (e.g. for "
"emoji). Supported formats are TTF, OTF, WOFF1 and WOFF2."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບທັງຟອນສີດຽວ ແລະ ຟອນທີ່ມີສີ (ເຊັ່ນ: emoji). ຟໍແມັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ TTF, "
"OTF, WOFF1 ແລະ WOFF2."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:172
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support optional font outlines with adjustable width and color."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງຂອບ (outlines) ໃຫ້ກັບຕົວອັກສອນ ໂດຍສາມາດປັບຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ສີໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:173
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support variable fonts and OpenType features including "
"ligatures."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບ variable fonts ແລະ ຟີເຈີ OpenType ລວມທັງການເຊື່ອມຕົວອັກສອນ "
"(ligatures)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:174
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support simulated bold and italic when the font file lacks "
"those styles."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບການຈຳລອງຕົວໜາ ແລະ ຕົວເນີ້ງ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຟອນບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:176
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support oversampling to keep fonts sharp at higher resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບ oversampling ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດເມື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃນຄວາມລະອຽດສູ"
"ງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:177
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support subpixel positioning to make fonts crisper at low "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບ subpixel positioning ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:178
msgid ""
"Dynamic fonts support LCD subpixel optimizations to make fonts even crisper "
"at low sizes."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic fonts ຮອງຮັບການປັບແຕ່ງ LCD subpixel ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:179
msgid ""
"Signed distance field fonts can be scaled at any resolution without "
"requiring re-rasterization. Multi-channel usage makes SDF fonts scale down "
"to lower sizes better compared to monochrome SDF fonts."
msgstr ""
"Signed distance field fonts ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນທຸກຄວາມລະອຽດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ re-"
"rasterization ໃໝ່. ການໃຊ້ Multi-channel ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ SDF fonts ມີຄຸນນະພາບດີກວ່າເມື່ອຖືກປັບໃຫ້"
"ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍລົງ ຫາກທຽບກັບ monochrome SDF fonts."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:183
msgid ""
":ref:`Oversampling <doc_multiple_resolutions_font_and_image_oversampling>` "
"for SVG images using the :ref:`class_DPITexture` import type. This allows "
"for sharper results when scaling up the texture by re-rasterizing the SVG "
"source image to a new resolution at run-time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Oversampling <doc_multiple_resolutions_font_and_image_oversampling>` ສຳ"
"ລັບຮູບພາບ SVG ໂດຍການໃຊ້ປະເພດການນຳເຂົ້າ :ref:`class_DPITexture`. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບມີຄວາມຄົມ"
"ຊັດເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ ໂດຍການເຮັດ re-rasterization ຈາກພາບ SVG ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ໄປເປັນຄວາມລະ"
"ອຽດໃໝ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງລັນຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:187
msgid ""
"Oversampling can optionally take individual :ref:`class_CanvasItem` scales "
"into account for crisper rendering when scaling nodes."
msgstr ""
"Oversampling ສາມາດເລືອກນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າສະເກລຂອງແຕ່ລະ :ref:`class_CanvasItem` ມາຄຳນວນ ເພື່ອໃ"
"ຫ້ການເຣນເດີມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດເມື່ອມີການປັບຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:190
msgid ""
"GPU-based :ref:`particles <doc_particle_systems_2d>` with support "
"for :ref:`custom particle shaders <doc_particle_shader>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ອະນຸພາກ (particles) <doc_particle_systems_2d>` ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ GPU ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັ"
"ບ :ref:`custom particle shaders <doc_particle_shader>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:192
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:399
msgid "CPU-based particles."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກ (particles) ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:193
msgid ""
"Optional :ref:`2D HDR rendering "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_using_glow_in_2d>` for better glow "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການ :ref:`ເຣນເດີ 2D HDR "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_using_glow_in_2d>` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການສ້"
"າງເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow) ທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:195
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:232
msgid "Optional debanding to reduce banding artifacts in gradients."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ debanding ເພື່ອຫຼຸດບັນຫາພາບເປັນຂັ້ນ (banding) ໃນການໄລ່ສີ (gradients)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:196
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:233
msgid ""
":ref:`HDR output <doc_hdr_output>` on supported platforms and renderers."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR <doc_hdr_output>` ເທິງແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:199
msgid "2D tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື 2D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:201
msgid ":ref:`TileMaps <doc_using_tilemaps>` for 2D tile-based level design."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TileMaps <doc_using_tilemaps>` ສຳລັບການອອກແບບດ່ານ 2D ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນໄທລ໌ (tiles)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:202
msgid "2D camera with built-in smoothing and drag margins."
msgstr ""
"ກ້ອງ 2D ທີ່ມີລະບົບເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວລຽບນຽນ (smoothing) ແລະ ຂອບສຳລັບການລາກ (drag "
"margins) ໃນຕົວ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:203
msgid "Path2D node to represent a path in 2D space."
msgstr "ໂນດ Path2D ສຳລັບກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:205
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:462
msgid "Can be drawn in the editor or generated procedurally."
msgstr "ສາມາດແຕ້ມໄດ້ໃນເອດິເຕີ ຫຼື ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດ (procedurally)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:206
msgid "PathFollow2D node to make nodes follow a Path2D."
msgstr "ໂນດ PathFollow2D ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດຕ່າງໆເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຕາມ Path2D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:208
msgid ":ref:`2D geometry helper class <class_Geometry2D>`."
msgstr ":ref:`ຄລາດຊ່ວຍຈັດການເລຂາຄະນິດ 2D <class_Geometry2D>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:211
msgid "2D physics"
msgstr "ລະບົບຟີຊິກ 2D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:213
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:472
msgid "**Physics bodies:**"
msgstr "**ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ (Physics bodies):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:215
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:474
msgid "Static bodies."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຄົງທີ່ (Static bodies)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:216
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:475
msgid ""
"Animatable bodies (for objects moving only by script or animation, such as "
"doors and platforms)."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ (ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ແອນິເມຊັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ປະຕູ ແລະ ແທ່ນຢືນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:217
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:476
msgid "Rigid bodies."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸແຂງ (Rigid bodies)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:218
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:477
msgid "Character bodies."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຕົວລະຄອນ (Character bodies)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:219
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:479
msgid "Joints."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (Joints)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:220
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:482
msgid "Areas to detect bodies entering or leaving it."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ (Areas) ເພື່ອກວດຈັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ ຫຼື ອອກໄປ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:221
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:483
msgid ":ref:`Physics interpolation <doc_physics_interpolation>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຟີຊິກລຽບນຽນ (Physics interpolation) "
"<doc_physics_interpolation>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:223
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:485
msgid "**Collision detection:**"
msgstr "**ການກວດຈັບການຕຳ (Collision detection):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:225
msgid ""
"Built-in shapes: line, box, circle, capsule, world boundary (infinite plane)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງສຳເລັດຮູບ: ເສັ້ນ, ກ່ອງ, ວົງມົນ, ແຄບຊູນ, ຂອບເຂດໂລກ (ແຜ່ນພຽງບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:226
msgid ""
"Collision polygons (can be drawn manually or generated from a sprite in the "
"editor)."
msgstr "Collision polygons (ສາມາດແຕ້ມເອງ ຫຼື ສ້າງຈາກ sprite ໃນເອດິເຕີໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:229
msgid "3D graphics"
msgstr "ກຣາບຟິກ 3D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:231
msgid "Linear HDR internal lighting calculations."
msgstr "ການຄຳນວນແສງພາຍໃນແບບ Linear HDR."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:234
msgid "Perspective, orthographic and frustum-offset cameras."
msgstr "ກ້ອງແບບ Perspective, Orthographic ແລະ Frustum-offset."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:235
msgid ""
"When using the Forward+ renderer, a depth prepass is used to improve "
"performance in complex scenes by reducing the cost of overdraw."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ renderer, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ depth prepass ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນຊີ້ນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ໂດຍກ"
"ານຫຼຸດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການ overdraw."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:237
msgid ""
":ref:`doc_variable_rate_shading` on supported GPUs in Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
":ref:`doc_variable_rate_shading` ເທິງ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:239
msgid "**Physically-based rendering (built-in material features):**"
msgstr "**Physically-based rendering (ຟີເຈີວັດສະດຸໃນຕົວ):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:241
msgid "Follows the Disney PBR model."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ຕາມຮູບແບບ Disney PBR."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:242
msgid ""
"Supports Burley, Lambert, Lambert Wrap (half-Lambert) and Toon diffuse "
"shading modes."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບໂໝດ diffuse shading ແບບ Burley, Lambert, Lambert Wrap (half-Lambert) ແລ"
"ະ Toon."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:243
msgid "Supports Schlick-GGX, Toon and Disabled specular shading modes."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບໂໝດ specular shading ແບບ Schlick-GGX, Toon ແລະ ແບບປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:244
msgid "Uses a roughness-metallic workflow with support for ORM textures."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ roughness-metallic ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບ ORM textures."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:245
msgid ""
"Uses horizon specular occlusion (Filament model) to improve material "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ horizon specular occlusion (Filament model) ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:246
msgid "Normal mapping."
msgstr "Normal mapping."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:247
msgid ""
"Parallax/relief mapping with automatic level of detail based on distance."
msgstr ""
"Parallax/relief mapping ພ້ອມລະບົບປັບລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດ (LOD) ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:248
msgid "Detail mapping for the albedo and normal maps."
msgstr "Detail mapping ສຳລັບ albedo ແລະ normal maps."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:249
msgid "Sub-surface scattering and transmittance."
msgstr ""
"ການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ພື້ນຜິວ (Sub-surface scattering) ແລະ ການຊ່ອງຜ່ານຂອງແສງ "
"(transmittance)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:250
msgid ""
"Screen-space refraction with support for material roughness (resulting in "
"blurry refraction)."
msgstr ""
"Screen-space refraction ທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມຂຸ່ນ (roughness) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຫັກເຫຂອງ"
"ແສງແບບມົວໆ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:251
msgid "Proximity fade (soft particles) and distance fade."
msgstr ""
"Proximity fade (ອະນຸພາກແບບນຸ້ມນວນ) ແລະ distance fade (ການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:252
msgid ""
"Distance fade can use alpha blending or dithering to avoid going through the "
"transparent pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Distance fade ສາມາດໃຊ້ alpha blending ຫຼື dithering ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ transparent "
"pipeline."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:254
msgid "Dithering can be determined on a per-pixel or per-object basis."
msgstr ""
"Dithering ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ (per-pixel) ຫຼື ແຕ່ລະວັດຖຸ (per-object)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:256
msgid "**Real-time lighting:**"
msgstr "**ແສງສະຫວ່າງແບບສົດໆ (Real-time lighting):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:258
msgid ""
":ref:`Directional lights <doc_lights_and_shadows_directional_light>` (sun/"
"moon)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ແສງແບບມີທິດທາງ <doc_lights_and_shadows_directional_light>` (ດວງອາທິດ/ດວງຈັ"
"ນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:259
msgid ":ref:`Omnidirectional lights <doc_lights_and_shadows_omni_light>`."
msgstr ":ref:`ແສງແບບຮອບທິດທາງ <doc_lights_and_shadows_omni_light>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:260
msgid ""
":ref:`Spot lights <doc_lights_and_shadows_spot_light>` with adjustable cone "
"angle and attenuation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ແສງແບບສ່ອງສະເພາະຈຸດ (Spot lights) <doc_lights_and_shadows_spot_light>` ທີ່ສ"
"າມາດປັບມຸມກວຍ ແລະ ການຫຼຸດລົງຂອງແສງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:261
msgid ""
":ref:`Rectangular area lights <doc_lights_and_shadows_area_light>` with an "
"optional texture to determine the shape and color."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ແສງແບບພື້ນທີ່ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ (Area lights) <doc_lights_and_shadows_area_light>` ທີ່ສາມາດ"
"ໃສ່ texture ເພື່ອກຳນົດຮູບຊົງ ແລະ ສີໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:263
msgid ""
"Specular, indirect light, and volumetric fog energy can be adjusted on a per-"
"light basis."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Specular, ແສງທາງອ້ອມ (indirect light), ແລະ ພະລັງງານຂອງ volumetric fog ສາມາດປັ"
"ບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະດວງໄຟ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:264
msgid ""
"Adjustable light \"size\" for spherical omni and disc spot lights (will also "
"make shadows blurrier with variable penumbra)."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດປັບ \"ຂະໜາດ\" ຂອງແສງສຳລັບ omni ແບບຊົງກົມ ແລະ spot ແບບແຜ່ນວົງມົນ (ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາມົ"
"ວຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ variable penumbra)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:266
msgid ""
"Optional distance fade system to fade distant lights and their shadows, "
"improving performance."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ລະບົບ distance fade ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ ແລະ ເງົາຂອງພວກມັນຈາງຫາຍໄປ ເພື່ອເພີ່"
"ມປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:267
msgid ""
"When using the Forward+ renderer (default on desktop), lights are rendered "
"with clustered forward optimizations to decrease their individual cost. "
"Clustered rendering also lifts any limits on the number of lights that can "
"be used on a mesh."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ renderer, ດວງໄຟຈະຖືກເຣນເດີດ້ວຍ clustered forward optimizations ເພື່"
"ອຫຼຸດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະດວງໄຟ. ການເຣນເດີແບບ Clustered ຍັງຊ່ວຍປົດລັອກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຈຳນວນດວງໄຟທີ່ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ເທິງ mesh ໄດ້ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:270
msgid ""
"When using the Mobile renderer, up to 8 omni lights, 8 spot lights, and 8 "
"area lights can be displayed per mesh resource. Baked lighting can be used "
"to overcome this limit if needed."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile renderer, ສາມາດສະແດງ omni lights ໄດ້ 8 ດວງ, spot lights 8 ດວງ, ແລ"
"ະ area lights 8 ດວງ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ mesh. ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ ສາມາດໃຊ້ Baked lighting ແທນໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:274
msgid "**Shadow mapping:**"
msgstr "**ການສ້າງເງົາ (Shadow mapping):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:276
msgid ""
"*DirectionalLight3D:* Orthogonal (fastest), PSSM 2-split and 4-split. "
"Supports blending between splits."
msgstr ""
"*DirectionalLight3D:* ແບບ Orthogonal (ໄວທີ່ສຸດ), PSSM 2-split ແລະ 4-split. ຮອງຮັບ"
"ການ blending ລະຫວ່າງ splits."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:278
msgid ""
"*OmniLight3D:* Dual paraboloid (fast) or cubemap (slower but more accurate). "
"Supports colored projector textures in the form of panoramas."
msgstr ""
"*OmniLight3D:* Dual paraboloid (ໄວ) ຫຼື cubemap (ຊ້າກວ່າ ແຕ່ແມ່ນຍຳກວ່າ). ຮອງຮັບ "
"colored projector textures ໃນຮູບແບບພາໂນຣາມາ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:280
msgid "*SpotLight3D:* Single texture. Supports colored projector textures."
msgstr "*SpotLight3D:* Single texture. ຮອງຮັບ colored projector textures."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:281
msgid ""
"*AreaLight3D:* Single texture with dual paraboloid distortion to approximate "
"the light's shape."
msgstr ""
"*AreaLight3D:* Single texture ພ້ອມກັບ dual paraboloid distortion ເພື່ອຈຳລອງຮູບຊົງຂອ"
"ງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:283
msgid ""
"Shadow normal offset bias and shadow pancaking to decrease the amount of "
"visible shadow acne and peter-panning."
msgstr ""
"Shadow normal offset bias ແລະ shadow pancaking ເພື່ອຫຼຸດບັນຫາ shadow acne ແລະ "
"peter-panning ທີ່ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:285
msgid ""
":abbr:`PCSS (Percentage Closer Soft Shadows)`-like shadow blur based on the "
"light size and distance from the surface the shadow is cast on. Supported "
"for all light types."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດເງົາມົວແບບ :abbr:`PCSS (Percentage Closer Soft Shadows)` ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງ"
"ແສງ ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເງົາຕົກກະທົບ. ຮອງຮັບກັບໄຟທຸກປະເພດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:288
msgid "Adjustable shadow blur on a per-light basis."
msgstr "ສາມາດປັບຄວາມມົວຂອງເງົາໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະດວງໄຟ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:290
msgid "**Global illumination with indirect lighting:**"
msgstr "**Global illumination ພ້ອມກັບແສງທາງອ້ອມ (indirect lighting):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:292
msgid ""
":ref:`Baked lightmaps <doc_using_lightmap_gi>` (fast, but can't be updated "
"at runtime)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Baked lightmaps <doc_using_lightmap_gi>` (ໄວ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັ"
"ງລັນຢູ່)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:294
msgid ""
"Supports baking indirect light only or baking both direct and indirect "
"lighting. The bake mode can be adjusted on a per-light basis to allow for "
"hybrid light baking setups."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການ baking ສະເພາະແສງທາງອ້ອມ ຫຼື baking ທັງແສງທາງກົງ ແລະ ທາງອ້ອມ. ໂໝດການ bake ສ"
"າມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະດວງໄຟ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບ hybrid ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:297
msgid ""
"Supports lighting dynamic objects using automatic and manually placed probes."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການໃຫ້ແສງແກ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ probe ທີ່ວາງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ວາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:298
msgid "Optionally supports directional lighting based on spherical harmonics."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກໃນການຮອງຮັບ directional lighting ໂດຍອີງຕາມ spherical harmonics."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:299
msgid ""
"Optionally supports baking a shadowmask for distant static directional "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການ baking shadowmask ສຳລັບເງົາ directional ແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:300
msgid ""
"Optional supersampling at bake-time to improve quality and reduce light "
"leaking at the cost of increased bake times and memory usage during baking."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ supersampling ໃນຂະນະທີ່ bake ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ຫຼຸດບັນຫາແສງຮົ່ວ "
"(light leaking) ແຕ່ຈະຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບເວລາໃນການ bake ທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:302
msgid ""
"Lightmaps are baked on the GPU using compute shaders (much faster than CPU "
"lightmapping). Baking can only be performed from the editor, not in exported "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Lightmaps ຈະຖືກ bake ເທິງ GPU ໂດຍໃຊ້ compute shaders (ເຊິ່ງໄວກວ່າການໃຊ້ CPU ຫຼາຍ). ກາ"
"ນ baking ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກໃນເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປແລ້ວໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:305
msgid ""
"Supports GPU-based :ref:`denoising <doc_using_lightmap_gi_denoising>` with "
"JNLM out of the box, or higher-quality CPU/GPU-based denoising with OIDN "
"(requires downloading OIDN separately)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບ (denoising) <doc_using_lightmap_gi_denoising>` ເທິງ "
"GPU ດ້ວຍ JNLM ຫຼື ການ denoising ຄຸນນະພາບສູງເທິງ CPU/GPU ດ້ວຍ OIDN (ຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດ OIDN ແຍ"
"ກຕ່າງຫາກ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:308
msgid ""
"Lightmaps are rendered with bicubic filtering to reduce scaling artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Lightmaps ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີດ້ວຍ bicubic filtering ເພື່ອຫຼຸດບັນຫາພາບແຕກ ຫຼື ພາບບໍ່ແຈ້ງໃນເວລາປັບຂະໜ"
"າດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:310
msgid ""
":ref:`Voxel-based GI probes <doc_using_voxel_gi>`. Supports dynamic lights "
"*and* dynamic occluders, while also supporting reflections. Requires a fast "
"baking step which can be performed in the editor or at runtime (including "
"from an exported project)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Voxel-based GI probes <doc_using_voxel_gi>`. ຮອງຮັບທັງໄຟ ແລະ ວັດຖຸບັງແສງ "
"(occluders) ທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້, ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບການສະທ້ອນ (reflections). ຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການ bake ທີ່"
"ໄວ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ທັງໃນເອດິເຕີ ຫຼື ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ (ລວມທັງໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:314
msgid ""
":ref:`Signed-distance field GI <doc_using_sdfgi>` designed for large open "
"worlds. Supports dynamic lights, but not dynamic occluders. Supports "
"reflections. No baking required."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Signed-distance field GI <doc_using_sdfgi>` ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບໂລກທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາ"
"ງ (open worlds). ຮອງຮັບໄຟທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບວັດຖຸບັງແສງທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້. ຮອງຮັບການສະທ້ອນ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການ bake."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:317
msgid ""
":ref:`Screen-space indirect lighting (SSIL) "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_ssil>` at half or full resolution. "
"Fully real-time and supports any kind of emissive light source (including "
"decals)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Screen-space indirect lighting (SSIL) "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_ssil>` ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ເຕັມ. ເປັນແບບ "
"real-time ຢ່າງສົມບູນ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງແບບ emissive ທຸກປະເພດ (ລວມທັງ decals)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:320
msgid ""
"VoxelGI and SDFGI use a deferred pass to allow for rendering GI at half "
"resolution to improve performance (while still having functional MSAA "
"support)."
msgstr ""
"VoxelGI ແລະ SDFGI ໃຊ້ deferred pass ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຣນເດີ GI ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປ"
"ະສິດທິພາບ (ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮອງຮັບ MSAA ຢູ່)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:323
msgid "**Reflections:**"
msgstr "**ການສະທ້ອນ (Reflections):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:325
msgid ""
"Voxel-based reflections (when using GI probes) and SDF-based reflections "
"(when using signed distance field GI). Voxel-based reflections are visible "
"on transparent surfaces, while rough SDF-based reflections are visible on "
"transparent surfaces."
msgstr ""
"ການສະທ້ອນແບບ Voxel-based (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ GI probes) ແລະ SDF-based (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ signed "
"distance field GI). ການສະທ້ອນແບບ Voxel-based ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການສ"
"ະທ້ອນແບບ SDF-based ທີ່ມີຄວາມຂຸ່ນກໍເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:329
msgid ""
"Fast baked reflections or slow real-time reflections using ReflectionProbe. "
"Parallax box correction can optionally be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ການສະທ້ອນແບບ baked ທີ່ໄວ ຫຼື ແບບ real-time ທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ ReflectionProbe. ທາງເລືອ"
"ກໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ Parallax box correction."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:331
msgid "Screen-space reflections with support for material roughness."
msgstr "Screen-space reflections ທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມຂຸ່ນ (roughness) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:332
msgid ""
"Reflection techniques can be mixed together for greater accuracy or "
"scalability."
msgstr ""
"ເຕັກນິກການສະທ້ອນຕ່າງໆສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ເພື່ອຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳ ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບກັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີຄວາມແຮງຕ່"
"າງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:333
msgid ""
"When using the Forward+ renderer (default on desktop), reflection probes are "
"rendered with clustered forward optimizations to decrease their individual "
"cost. Clustered rendering also lifts any limits on the number of reflection "
"probes that can be used on a mesh."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ renderer, reflection probes ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີດ້ວຍ clustered forward "
"optimizations ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະອັນ. ການເຣນເດີແບບ Clustered ຍັງຊ່ວຍປົດລັອກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ"
"ຈຳນວນ reflection probes ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເທິງ mesh ໄດ້ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:337
msgid ""
"When using the Mobile renderer, up to 8 reflection probes can be displayed "
"per mesh resource. When using the Compatibility renderer, up to 2 reflection "
"probes can be displayed per mesh resource."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile renderer, ສາມາດສະແດງ reflection probes ໄດ້ 8 ອັນ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ mesh. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Compatibility renderer, ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ 2 ອັນ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ mesh."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:341
msgid "**Decals:**"
msgstr "**Decals:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:343
msgid ""
":ref:`Supports albedo <doc_using_decals>`, emissive, :abbr:`ORM (Occlusion "
"Roughness Metallic)`, and normal mapping."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ຮອງຮັບ albedo <doc_using_decals>`, emissive, :abbr:`ORM (Occlusion "
"Roughness Metallic)`, ແລະ normal mapping."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:345
msgid ""
"Texture channels are smoothly overlaid on top of the underlying material, "
"with support for normal/ORM-only decals."
msgstr ""
"Texture channels ຈະຖືກວາງທັບເທິງວັດສະດຸພື້ນຫຼັງຢ່າງລຽບນຽນ, ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບ decals ທີ່ເປັນແບບ "
"normal/ORM ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:347
msgid ""
"Support for normal fade to fade the decal depending on its incidence angle."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ normal fade ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ decal ຈາງຫາຍໄປຕາມມຸມທີ່ມັນຕົກກະທົບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:348
msgid ""
"Does not rely on runtime mesh generation. This means decals can be used on "
"complex skinned meshes with no performance penalty, even if the decal moves "
"every frame."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ເພິ່ງພາການສ້າງ mesh ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນຢູ່. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ສາມາດໃຊ້ເທິງ skinned meshes ທີ່"
"ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ decal ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ທຸກໆເຟຣມກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:350
msgid ""
"Support for nearest, bilinear, trilinear or anisotropic texture filtering "
"(configured globally)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ texture filtering ແບບ nearest, bilinear, trilinear ຫຼື anisotropic (ກຳນົດຄ່"
"າໄດ້ທົ່ວໂລກ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:351
msgid ""
"Optional distance fade system to fade distant decals, improving performance."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ລະບົບ distance fade ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ decals ທີ່ຢູ່ໄກຈາງຫາຍໄປ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:352
msgid ""
"When using the Forward+ renderer (default on desktop), decals are rendered "
"with clustered forward optimizations to decrease their individual cost. "
"Clustered rendering also lifts any limits on the number of decals that can "
"be used on a mesh."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ renderer, decals ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີດ້ວຍ clustered forward optimizations "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະອັນ. ການເຣນເດີແບບ Clustered ຍັງຊ່ວຍປົດລັອກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຈຳນວນ decals ທີ່"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເທິງ mesh ໄດ້ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:355
msgid ""
"When using the Mobile renderer, up to 8 decals can be displayed per mesh "
"resource."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile renderer, ສາມາດສະແດງ decals ໄດ້ 8 ອັນ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ mesh."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:358
msgid "**Sky:**"
msgstr "**ທ້ອງຟ້າ (Sky):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:360
msgid "Panorama sky (using an HDRI)."
msgstr "ທ້ອງຟ້າແບບພາໂນຣາມາ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ HDRI)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:361
msgid ""
"Procedural sky and Physically-based sky that respond to the "
"DirectionalLights in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ທ້ອງຟ້າແບບ Procedural ແລະ ແບບ Physically-based ທີ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ DirectionalLights ໃນຊີ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:362
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`custom sky shaders <doc_sky_shader>`, which can be "
"animated."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`custom sky shaders <doc_sky_shader>` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສ້າງແອນິເມຊັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:363
msgid ""
"The radiance map used for ambient and specular light can be updated in real-"
"time depending on the quality settings chosen."
msgstr ""
"Radiance map ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ ambient ແລະ specular light ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ແບບ real-time ໂດຍ"
"ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ເລືອກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:366
msgid "**Fog:**"
msgstr "**ໝອກ (Fog):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:368
msgid "Exponential depth fog."
msgstr "ໝອກຕາມຄວາມເລິກແບບ Exponential."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:369
msgid "Exponential height fog."
msgstr "ໝອກຕາມຄວາມສູງແບບ Exponential."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:370
msgid ""
"Support for automatic fog color depending on the sky color (aerial "
"perspective)."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການປັບສີໝອກອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມສີຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າ (aerial perspective)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:371
msgid "Support for sun scattering in the fog."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການກະຈາຍຂອງແສງຕາເວັນໃນໝອກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:372
msgid ""
"Support for controlling how much fog rendering should affect the sky, with "
"separate controls for traditional and volumetric fog."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການຄວບຄຸມວ່າການເຣນເດີໝອກຄວນມີຜົນຕໍ່ທ້ອງຟ້າຫຼາຍປານໃດ, ໂດຍມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມແຍກກັນສຳລັບໝອກແບບດັ້ງເ"
"ດີມ ແລະ volumetric fog."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:374
msgid "Support for making specific materials ignore fog."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸບາງຢ່າງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກໝອກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:376
msgid "**Volumetric fog:**"
msgstr "**Volumetric fog:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:378
msgid ""
"Global :ref:`volumetric fog <doc_volumetric_fog>` that reacts to lights and "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Volumetric fog <doc_volumetric_fog>` ແບບທົ່ວໂລກ ທີ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:379
msgid ""
"Volumetric fog can take indirect light into account when using VoxelGI or "
"SDFGI."
msgstr ""
"Volumetric fog ສາມາດນຳເອົາແສງທາງອ້ອມ (indirect light) ມາຄຳນວນນຳໄດ້ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"VoxelGI ຫຼື SDFGI."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:380
msgid ""
"Fog volume nodes that can be placed to add fog to specific areas (or remove "
"fog from specific areas). Supported shapes include box, ellipse, cone, "
"cylinder, and 3D texture-based density maps."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ Fog volume ທີ່ສາມາດວາງເພື່ອເພີ່ມໝອກໃນບາງພື້ນທີ່ (ຫຼື ເອົາໝອກອອກຈາກບາງພື້ນທີ່). ຮູບຊົງທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"
"ມີ: ກ່ອງ, ຮູບວົງມົນ, ກວຍ, ຊົງກະບອກ, ແລະ ແຜນຜັງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນແບບ 3D texture."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:382
msgid "Each fog volume can have its own custom shader."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ fog volume ສາມາດມີ custom shader ຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:383
msgid "Can be used together with traditional fog."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບໝອກແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:385
msgid "**Particles:**"
msgstr "**ອະນຸພາກ (Particles):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:387
msgid ""
"GPU-based particles with support for subemitters (2D + 3D), trails (2D + "
"3D), attractors (3D only) and collision (2D + 3D)."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸພາກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ GPU ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບ subemitters (2D + 3D), ເສັ້ນຫາງ (trails) (2D "
"+ 3D), ຕົວດຶງດູດ (attractors) (ສະເພາະ 3D) ແລະ ການຕຳ (collision) (2D + 3D)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:390
msgid ""
"3D particle attractor shapes supported: box, sphere and 3D vector fields."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກ 3D ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: ກ່ອງ, ຊົງກົມ ແລະ 3D vector fields."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:391
msgid ""
"3D particle collision shapes supported: box, sphere, baked signed distance "
"field and real-time heightmap (suited for open world weather effects)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງສຳລັບການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ 3D ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: ກ່ອງ, ຊົງກົມ, baked signed distance field ແລະ "
"real-time heightmap (ເໝາະສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສະພາບອາກາດໃນ open world)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:393
msgid ""
"2D particle collision is handled using a signed distance field generated in "
"real-time based on :ref:`class_LightOccluder2D` nodes in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ 2D ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍໃຊ້ signed distance field ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບ real-time ໂ"
"ດຍອີງຕາມໂນດ :ref:`class_LightOccluder2D` ໃນຊີ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:395
msgid ""
"Trails can use the built-in ribbon trail and tube trail meshes, or custom "
"meshes with skeletons."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຫາງ (Trails) ສາມາດໃຊ້ mesh ແບບ ribbon trail ແລະ tube trail ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ, ຫຼື "
"mesh ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງພ້ອມກັບ skeletons ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:397
msgid "Support for custom particle shaders with manual emission."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ custom particle shaders ພ້ອມກັບການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (emission) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:401
msgid "**Post-processing:**"
msgstr "**ຂັ້ນຕອນຫຼັງການເຣນເດີ (Post-processing):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:403
msgid "Tonemapping (Linear, Reinhard, Filmic, ACES, AgX)."
msgstr "Tonemapping (Linear, Reinhard, Filmic, ACES, AgX)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:404
msgid ""
"Automatic exposure adjustments based on viewport brightness (and manual "
"exposure override)."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຄ່າແສງ (exposure) ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງ viewport (ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງເອງ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:405
msgid ""
"Near and far depth of field with adjustable bokeh simulation (box, hexagon, "
"circle)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຊັດຕື້ນຊັດເລິກ (Depth of field) ທັງໄລຍະໃກ້ ແລະ ໄກ ພ້ອມທັງການຈຳລອງ bokeh ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ "
"(ກ່ອງ, ຫົກຫຼ່ຽມ, ວົງມົນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:406
msgid "Screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) at half or full resolution."
msgstr "Screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ເຕັມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:407
msgid ""
"Glow/bloom with optional bicubic upscaling and several blend modes "
"available: Screen, Soft Light, Add, Replace, Mix."
msgstr ""
"Glow/bloom ພ້ອມທາງເລືອກ bicubic upscaling ແລະ blend modes ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ: Screen, "
"Soft Light, Add, Replace, Mix."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:409
msgid "Glow can have a colored dirt map texture, acting as a lens dirt effect."
msgstr ""
"Glow ສາມາດໃສ່ colored dirt map texture ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຄືກັບເອັບເຟັກເລນເປື້ອນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:410
msgid ""
"Glow can be :ref:`used as a screen-space blur effect "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_using_glow_to_blur_the_screen>`."
msgstr ""
"Glow ສາມາດ :ref:`ໃຊ້ເປັນເອັບເຟັກ screen-space blur "
"<doc_environment_and_post_processing_using_glow_to_blur_the_screen>` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:411
msgid "Color correction using a one-dimensional ramp or a 3D LUT texture."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແຕ່ງສີ (Color correction) ໂດຍໃຊ້ one-dimensional ramp ຫຼື 3D LUT texture."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:412
msgid "Roughness limiter to reduce the impact of specular aliasing."
msgstr "Roughness limiter ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຈາກ specular aliasing."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:413
msgid "Brightness, contrast and saturation adjustments."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (Brightness), ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (Contrast) ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ "
"(Saturation)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:415
msgid "**Texture filtering:**"
msgstr "**ການກັ່ນຕອງລວດລາຍ (Texture filtering):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:417
msgid "Nearest, bilinear, trilinear or anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ Nearest, bilinear, trilinear ຫຼື anisotropic."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:418
msgid ""
"Filtering options are defined on a per-use basis, not a per-texture basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການກັ່ນຕອງຈະຖືກກຳນົດຕາມການໃຊ້ງານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນກຳນົດໄວ້ທີ່ຕົວ texture ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:420
msgid "**Texture VRAM compression:**"
msgstr "**ການບີບອັດ Texture VRAM:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:422
msgid "BPTC (for high-quality compression targeting desktop platforms)."
msgstr "BPTC (ສຳລັບການບີບອັດຄຸນນະພາບສູງ ທີ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:423
msgid "ASTC (for high-quality compression targeting mobile platforms)."
msgstr "ASTC (ສຳລັບການບີບອັດຄຸນນະພາບສູງ ທີ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ແພລັດຟອມມືຖື)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:424
msgid "ETC2 (for fast compression targeting mobile platforms)."
msgstr "ETC2 (ສຳລັບການບີບອັດທີ່ໄວ ທີ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ແພລັດຟອມມືຖື)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:425
msgid "S3TC (for fast compression targeting desktop platforms)."
msgstr "S3TC (ສຳລັບການບີບອັດທີ່ໄວ ທີ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:426
msgid ""
"Basis Universal (slow, but only requires one encoding for all platforms)."
msgstr "Basis Universal (ຊ້າ, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດພຽງແບບດຽວສຳລັບທຸກແພລັດຟອມ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:428
msgid "**Antialiasing:**"
msgstr "**ການຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກ (Antialiasing):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:430
msgid "Temporal :ref:`antialiasing <doc_3d_antialiasing>` (TAA)."
msgstr "Temporal :ref:`antialiasing <doc_3d_antialiasing>` (TAA)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:431
msgid ""
"AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 2.2 :ref:`antialiasing "
"<doc_3d_antialiasing>` (FSR2), which can be used at native resolution as a "
"form of high-quality temporal antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 2.2 :ref:`antialiasing <doc_3d_antialiasing>"
"` (FSR2), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຄວາມລະອຽດ native ເພື່ອເປັນ temporal antialiasing ຄຸນນະພາບສູ"
"ງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:433
msgid ""
"Multi-sample antialiasing (MSAA), for both :ref:`doc_2d_antialiasing` "
"and :ref:`doc_3d_antialiasing`."
msgstr ""
"Multi-sample antialiasing (MSAA), ທັງສຳລັບ :ref:`doc_2d_antialiasing` ແລະ "
":ref:`doc_3d_antialiasing`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:434
msgid "Fast approximate antialiasing (FXAA)."
msgstr "Fast approximate antialiasing (FXAA)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:435
msgid ""
"Super-sample antialiasing (SSAA) using bilinear 3D scaling and a 3D "
"resolution scale above 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Super-sample antialiasing (SSAA) ໂດຍໃຊ້ bilinear 3D scaling ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ 3D "
"resolution scale ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ 1.0."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:436
msgid ""
"Alpha antialiasing, MSAA alpha to coverage and alpha hashing on a per-"
"material basis."
msgstr ""
"Alpha antialiasing, MSAA alpha to coverage ແລະ alpha hashing ໂດຍກຳນົດໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະວັ"
"ດສະດຸ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:438
msgid "**Resolution scaling:**"
msgstr "**ການປັບສະເກລຄວາມລະອຽດ (Resolution scaling):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:440
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`rendering 3D at a lower resolution "
"<doc_resolution_scaling>` while keeping 2D rendering at the original scale. "
"This can be used to improve performance on low-end systems or improve "
"visuals on high-end systems."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການເຣນເດີ 3D ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳລົງ <doc_resolution_scaling>` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສ"
"າການເຣນເດີ 2D ໄວ້ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເດີມ. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນເຄື່ອງສະເປັກຕ່ຳ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄວາມສວ"
"ຍງາມໃນເຄື່ອງສະເປັກສູງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:443
msgid ""
"Resolution scaling uses nearest-neighbor filtering, bilinear filtering, AMD "
"FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FSR1), or AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution "
"2.2.1 (FSR2)."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບສະເກລຄວາມລະອຽດສາມາດໃຊ້ nearest-neighbor filtering, bilinear filtering, "
"AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FSR1), ຫຼື AMD FidelityFX Super "
"Resolution 2.2.1 (FSR2)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:446
msgid ""
"Texture mipmap LOD bias is adjusted automatically to improve quality at "
"lower resolution scales. It can also be modified with a manual offset."
msgstr ""
"Texture mipmap LOD bias ຈະຖືກປັບອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ "
"ຍັງສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເອງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າ offset."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:449
msgid ""
"Most effects listed above can be adjusted for better performance or to "
"further improve quality. This can be helpful when :ref:`using Godot for "
"offline rendering <doc_creating_movies>`."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ"
"ໄປອີກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເມື່ອ :ref:`ໃຊ້ Godot ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີແບບອອຟລາຍ "
"<doc_creating_movies>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:454
msgid "3D tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື 3D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:456
msgid ""
"Built-in meshes: cube, cylinder/cone, (hemi)sphere, prism, plane, quad, "
"torus, ribbon, tube."
msgstr ""
"Mesh ສຳເລັດຮູບ: ກ່ອງ, ຊົງກະບອກ/ກວຍ, (ເຄິ່ງ)ຊົງກົມ, ປຣິຊຶມ, ແຜ່ນພຽງ, ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ, ວົງແຫວນ (torus)"
", ລິບບິ້ນ, ທໍ່."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:457
msgid ":ref:`GridMaps <doc_using_gridmaps>` for 3D tile-based level design."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GridMaps <doc_using_gridmaps>` ສຳລັບການອອກແບບດ່ານ 3D ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນໄທລ໌."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:458
msgid ""
":ref:`Constructive solid geometry <doc_csg_tools>` (intended for "
"prototyping)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Constructive solid geometry <doc_csg_tools>` (ສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບວັດຖຸ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:459
msgid ""
"Tools for :ref:`procedural geometry generation <doc_procedural_geometry>`."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບ :ref:`ການສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດ (procedural geometry generation) "
"<doc_procedural_geometry>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:460
msgid "Path3D node to represent a path in 3D space."
msgstr "ໂນດ Path3D ສຳລັບກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:463
msgid "PathFollow3D node to make nodes follow a Path3D."
msgstr "ໂນດ PathFollow3D ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດຕ່າງໆເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຕາມ Path3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:465
msgid ":ref:`3D geometry helper class <class_Geometry3D>`."
msgstr ":ref:`ຄລາດຊ່ວຍຈັດການເລຂາຄະນິດ 3D <class_Geometry3D>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:466
msgid ""
"Support for exporting the current scene as a glTF 2.0 file, both from the "
"editor and at runtime from an exported project."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກຊີ້ນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນໄຟລ໌ glTF 2.0, ທັງຈາກໃນເອດິເຕີ ແລະ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນຢູ່ຈາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອ"
"ອກແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:470
msgid "3D physics"
msgstr "ລະບົບຟີຊິກ 3D"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:478
msgid "Vehicle bodies (intended for arcade physics, not simulation)."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຍານພາຫະນະ (ສຳລັບຟີຊິກແບບອາເຄດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບຈຳລອງຄວາມຈິງ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:480
msgid ":ref:`Soft bodies <doc_soft_body>`."
msgstr ":ref:`ວັດຖຸອ່ອນ (Soft bodies) <doc_soft_body>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:481
msgid ":ref:`Ragdolls <doc_ragdoll_system>`."
msgstr ":ref:`ລະບົບ Ragdolls <doc_ragdoll_system>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:487
msgid ""
"Built-in shapes: cuboid, sphere, capsule, cylinder, world boundary (infinite "
"plane)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງສຳເລັດຮູບ: ກ່ອງ, ຊົງກົມ, ແຄບຊູນ, ຊົງກະບອກ, ຂອບເຂດໂລກ (ແຜ່ນພຽງບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:488
msgid "Generate triangle collision shapes for any mesh from the editor."
msgstr "ສ້າງ triangle collision shapes ສຳລັບ mesh ໃດກໍໄດ້ຈາກໃນເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:489
msgid ""
"Generate one or several convex collision shapes for any mesh from the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ convex collision shapes ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນສຳລັບ mesh ໃດກໍໄດ້ຈາກໃນເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:492
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:128
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:281
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:384
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/index.rst:4
msgid "Shaders"
msgstr "ເລເຊີ (Shaders)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:494
msgid "*2D:* Custom vertex, fragment, and light shaders."
msgstr "*2D:* Custom vertex, fragment, ແລະ light shaders."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:495
msgid "*3D:* Custom vertex, fragment, light, sky, and fog shaders."
msgstr "*3D:* Custom vertex, fragment, light, sky, ແລະ fog shaders."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:496
msgid ""
"Custom shaders can procedurally generate and modify textures in real-time "
"using :ref:`class_DrawableTexture2D`."
msgstr ""
"Custom shaders ສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງ textures ແບບ real-time ໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
":ref:`class_DrawableTexture2D`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:498
msgid ""
"Text-based shaders using a :ref:`shader language inspired by GLSL "
"<doc_shading_language>`."
msgstr ""
"ການຂຽນ Shaders ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`ພາສາ shader ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈມາຈາກ GLSL "
"<doc_shading_language>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:499
msgid ""
"Syntax highlighting is provided on GitHub by using ``gdshader`` as the "
"language name in a Markdown code block."
msgstr ""
"ມີການຮອງຮັບການເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ (Syntax highlighting) ເທິງ GitHub ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"``gdshader`` ເປັນຊື່ພາສາໃນ Markdown code block."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:501
msgid "Visual shader editor."
msgstr "ເອດິເຕີສ້າງ shader ແບບພາບ (Visual shader editor)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:503
msgid "Support for :ref:`visual shader plugins <doc_visual_shader_plugins>`."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ປລັກອິນສຳລັບ visual shader <doc_visual_shader_plugins>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:506
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:51
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:75
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:273
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:389
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:495
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:4
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "ການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ (Scripting)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:508
msgid "**General:**"
msgstr "**ທົ່ວໄປ:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:510
msgid "Object-oriented design pattern with scripts extending nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການອອກແບບແບບເນັ້ນວັດຖຸ (Object-oriented) ໂດຍໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບເຮັດການສືບທອດ (extending) ຈ"
"າກໂນດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:511
msgid "Signals and groups for communicating between scripts."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ສັນຍານ (Signals) ແລະ ກຸ່ມ (groups) ເພື່ອສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:512
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`cross-language scripting <doc_cross_language_scripting>`."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການຂຽນສະຄຣິບແບບຂ້າມພາສາ <doc_cross_language_scripting>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:513
msgid ""
"Many 2D, 3D and 4D linear algebra data types such as vectors and transforms."
msgstr ""
"ມີປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນພຶດຊະຄະນິດເຊີງເສັ້ນ (linear algebra) ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທັງ 2D, 3D ແລະ 4D ເຊັ່ນ "
"vectors ແລະ transforms."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:515
msgid ":ref:`GDScript: <doc_gdscript>`"
msgstr ":ref:`GDScript: <doc_gdscript>`"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:517
msgid ""
":ref:`High-level interpreted language <doc_gdscript_reference>` "
"with :ref:`optional static typing <doc_gdscript_static_typing>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ພາສາລະດັບສູງແບບ interpreted <doc_gdscript_reference>` ພ້ອມທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ "
":ref:`static typing <doc_gdscript_static_typing>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:519
msgid ""
"Syntax inspired by Python. However, GDScript is **not** based on Python."
msgstr ""
"ໄວຍາກອນໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈມາຈາກ Python. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, GDScript **ບໍ່ໄດ້** ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາຈາກ "
"Python."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:520
msgid ""
"Syntax highlighting is provided on GitHub by using ``gdscript`` as the "
"language name in a Markdown code block."
msgstr ""
"ມີການຮອງຮັບການເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ (Syntax highlighting) ເທິງ GitHub ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"``gdscript`` ເປັນຊື່ພາສາໃນ Markdown code block."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:522
msgid ""
":ref:`Use threads <doc_using_multiple_threads>` to perform asynchronous "
"actions or make use of multiple processor cores."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການໃຊ້ເທີຣດ (threads) <doc_using_multiple_threads>` ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກແບບ "
"asynchronous ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ CPU ຫຼາຍຄໍ (cores)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:525
msgid ":ref:`C#: <doc_c_sharp>`"
msgstr ":ref:`C#: <doc_c_sharp>`"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:527
msgid "Packaged in a separate binary to keep file sizes and dependencies down."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກແຍກອອກມາເປັນໄຟລ໌ binary ຕ່າງຫາກ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງ dependencies."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:528
msgid "Supports .NET 8 and higher."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ .NET 8 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ສູງກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:530
msgid "Full support for the C# 12.0 syntax and features."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບໄວຍາກອນ ແລະ ຟີເຈີຂອງ C# 12.0 ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:532
msgid ""
"Supports Windows, Linux, and macOS. Since Godot 4.2, experimental support "
"for Android and iOS is also available."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ Windows, Linux, ແລະ macOS. ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.2 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ຍັງມີການຮອງຮັບແບບທົດລອ"
"ງສຳລັບ Android ແລະ iOS."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:535
msgid "On the iOS platform only some architectures are supported: ``arm64``."
msgstr "ເທິງແພລັດຟອມ iOS ຈະຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ບາງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເທົ່ານັ້ນ: ``arm64``."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:536
msgid ""
"The web platform is currently unsupported. To use C# on that platform, "
"consider Godot 3 instead."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບແພລັດຟອມເວັບ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ C# ເທິງເວັບ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Godot 3 ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:539
msgid ""
"Using an external editor is recommended to benefit from IDE functionality."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເອດິເຕີພາຍນອກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນປະໂຫຍດຈາກຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆຂອງ IDE."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:541
msgid "**GDExtension (C, C++, Rust, D, ...):**"
msgstr "**GDExtension (C, C++, Rust, D, ...):**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:543
msgid ""
"When you need it, link to native libraries for higher performance and third-"
"party integrations."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ native libraries ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັ"
"ບຊອບແວພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:546
msgid ""
"For scripting game logic, GDScript or C# are recommended if their "
"performance is suitable."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຂຽນໂລຈິກຂອງເກມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ GDScript ຫຼື C# ຫາກປະສິດທິພາບຂອງພວກມັນພຽງພໍຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ງາ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:549
msgid ""
"Official GDExtension bindings for `C <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"headers>`__ and `C++ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"GDExtension bindings ທາງການສຳລັບ `C <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"headers>`__ ແລະ `C++ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:552
msgid "Use any build system and language features you wish."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ build system ແລະ ຟີເຈີຂອງພາສາໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:554
msgid ""
"Actively developed GDExtension bindings for `D <https://github.com/godot-"
"dlang/godot-dlang>`__, `Swift <https://github.com/migueldeicaza/"
"SwiftGodot>`__, and `Rust <https://github.com/godot-rust/gdextension>`__ "
"bindings provided by the community. (Some of these bindings may be "
"experimental and not production-ready)."
msgstr ""
"ມີ GDExtension bindings ທີ່ກຳລັງພັດທະນາຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງສຳລັບ `D <https://github.com/godot-"
"dlang/godot-dlang>`__, `Swift <https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftGodot>"
"`__, ແລະ `Rust <https://github.com/godot-rust/gdextension>`__ ໂດຍການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ"
"ຊຸມຊົນ. (ບາງອັນອາດຈະຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:559
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:416
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:150
#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/index.rst:4
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:275
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "ລະບົບສຽງ (Audio)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:563
msgid "Mono, stereo, 5.1 and 7.1 output."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກສຽງແບບ Mono, stereo, 5.1 ແລະ 7.1."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:564
msgid "Non-positional and positional playback in 2D and 3D."
msgstr "ການຫຼິ້ນສຽງແບບກຳນົດທິດທາງ ແລະ ບໍ່ກຳນົດທິດທາງ ທັງໃນ 2D ແລະ 3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:566
msgid "Optional Doppler effect in 2D and 3D."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກໃນການໃຊ້ Doppler effect ໃນ 2D ແລະ 3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:568
msgid ""
"Support for re-routable :ref:`audio buses <doc_audio_buses>` and effects "
"with dozens of effects included."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`audio buses <doc_audio_buses>` ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄດ້ ພ້ອມທັງມີເອັບເຟັກສຽງໃ"
"ຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ຫຼາຍສິບແບບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:570
msgid ""
"Support for polyphony (playing several sounds from a "
"single :ref:`class_AudioStreamPlayer` node)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ polyphony (ການຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍສຽງພ້ອມກັນຈາກໂນດ :ref:`class_AudioStreamPlayer` ພຽງອັນດ"
"ຽວ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:572
msgid "Support for random volume and pitch."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການສຸ່ມຄວາມແຮງຂອງສຽງ (volume) ແລະ ລະດັບສຽງ (pitch)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:573
msgid "Support for real-time pitch scaling."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການປັບລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ແບບ real-time."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:574
msgid ""
"Support for sequential/random sample selection, including repetition "
"prevention when using random sample selection."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງສຽງແບບຕາມລຳດັບ ຫຼື ແບບສຸ່ມ, ລວມທັງລະບົບປ້ອງກັນການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຊ້ຳເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:576
msgid ""
":ref:`class_AudioListener2D` and :ref:`class_AudioListener3D` nodes to "
"listen from a position different from the camera."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ :ref:`class_AudioListener2D` ແລະ :ref:`class_AudioListener3D` ເພື່ອຮັບຟັງສຽງຈ"
"າກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:578
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`procedural audio generation <class_AudioStreamGenerator>`."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການສ້າງສຽງດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດ (procedural audio generation) "
"<class_AudioStreamGenerator>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:579
msgid "Audio input to record microphones."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າສຽງເພື່ອບັນທຶກຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:580
msgid ""
":ref:`Text to speech <doc_text_to_speech>` using platform-provided TTS "
"engines."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງ (Text to speech) <doc_text_to_speech>` ໂດຍໃຊ້ TTS "
"engines ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນແພລັດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:581
msgid "MIDI input."
msgstr "MIDI input."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:583
msgid "No support for MIDI output yet."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ MIDI output."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:585
msgid "**APIs used:**"
msgstr "**APIs ທີ່ໃຊ້:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:587
msgid "*Windows:* WASAPI."
msgstr "*Windows:* WASAPI."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:588
msgid "*macOS:* CoreAudio."
msgstr "*macOS:* CoreAudio."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:589
msgid "*Linux:* PulseAudio or ALSA."
msgstr "*Linux:* PulseAudio ຫຼື ALSA."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:592
msgid "Import"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າ (Import)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:594
msgid "Support for :ref:`custom import plugins <doc_import_plugins>`."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ປລັກອິນການນຳເຂົ້າແບບກຳນົດເອງ <doc_import_plugins>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:596
msgid "**Formats:**"
msgstr "**ຟໍແມັດ:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:598
msgid "*Images:* See :ref:`doc_importing_images`."
msgstr "*ຮູບພາບ:* ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_importing_images`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:599
msgid "*Audio:*"
msgstr "*ສຽງ:*"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:601
msgid ""
"WAV with optional :abbr:`QOA (Quite OK Audio)` or IMA-ADPCM compression."
msgstr ""
"WAV ພ້ອມທາງເລືອກໃນການບີບອັດແບບ :abbr:`QOA (Quite OK Audio)` ຫຼື IMA-ADPCM."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:602
msgid "Ogg Vorbis."
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:603
msgid "MP3."
msgstr "MP3."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:605
msgid "*3D scenes:* See :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes`."
msgstr "*ຊີ້ນ 3D:* ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:607
msgid "glTF 2.0 *(recommended)*."
msgstr "glTF 2.0 *(ແນະນຳ)*."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:608
msgid ""
"``.blend`` (by calling Blender's glTF export functionality transparently)."
msgstr "``.blend`` (ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ glTF export ຂອງ Blender ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:609
msgid ""
"FBX (by calling `FBX2glTF <https://github.com/godotengine/FBX2glTF>`__ "
"transparently)."
msgstr ""
"FBX (ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ `FBX2glTF <https://github.com/godotengine/FBX2glTF>`__ ແບບອັດ"
"ຕະໂນມັດ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:610
msgid "Collada (.dae)."
msgstr "Collada (.dae)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:611
msgid ""
"Wavefront OBJ (static scenes only, can be loaded directly as a mesh or "
"imported as a 3D scene)."
msgstr ""
"Wavefront OBJ (ສະເພາະຊີ້ນແບບຄົງທີ່, ສາມາດໂຫຼດເປັນ mesh ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າເປັນຊີ້ນ 3D ກໍໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:613
msgid ""
"Support for loading glTF 2.0 scenes at runtime, including from an exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການໂຫຼດຊີ້ນ glTF 2.0 ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງລັນຢູ່, ລວມທັງໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:614
msgid ""
"3D meshes use `Mikktspace <http://www.mikktspace.com/>`__ to generate "
"tangents on import, which ensures consistency with other 3D applications "
"such as Blender."
msgstr ""
"3D meshes ໃຊ້ `Mikktspace <http://www.mikktspace.com/>`__ ເພື່ອສ້າງ tangents ໃນເວ"
"ລານຳເຂົ້າ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຈະມີຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັບຊອບແວ 3D ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ Blender."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:618
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:35
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:362
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:38
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/custom_gui_controls.rst:114
msgid "Input"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນ (Input)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:620
msgid ""
":ref:`Input mapping system <doc_input_examples>` using hardcoded input "
"events or remappable input actions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ລະບົບການກຳນົດປຸ່ມ (Input mapping) <doc_input_examples>` ໂດຍໃຊ້ input events "
"ຫຼື ການກຳນົດ input actions ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:623
msgid ""
"Axis values can be mapped to two different actions with a configurable "
"deadzone."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແກນ (Axis values) ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບສອງ actions ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ພ້ອມທັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ deadzone ໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:624
msgid "Use the same code to support both keyboards and gamepads."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດດຽວກັນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບທັງຄີບອດ ແລະ ເກມແພັດ (gamepads)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:626
msgid "Keyboard input."
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຄີບອດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:628
msgid ""
"Keys can be mapped in \"physical\" mode to be independent of the keyboard "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆສາມາດກຳນົດໃນໂໝດ \"physical\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນເອກະລາດຈາກຮູບແບບການວາງປຸ່ມ (layout) ຂອ"
"ງຄີບອດ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:630
msgid "Mouse input."
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເມົາສ໌."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:632
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor can be visible, hidden, captured or confined within the "
"window."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ (Mouse cursor) ສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສະແດງ, ເຊື່ອງ, ຈັບໄວ້ (captured) ຫຼື ຈຳກັດໄວ້ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່"
"າງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:633
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor's appearance can be changed to a custom image or one of the "
"system cursors."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ສາມາດປ່ຽນເປັນຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ຕົວຊີ້ຂອງລະບົບໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:635
msgid ""
"When captured, raw input is used on Windows and Linux to sidestep the OS' "
"mouse acceleration settings."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຖືກຈັບ, ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນດິບ (raw input) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ Windows ແລະ Linux ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວ"
"າມເລັ່ງຂອງເມົາສ໌ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:638
msgid ""
":ref:`Gamepad input <doc_controllers_gamepads_joysticks>` (up to 8 "
"simultaneous controllers)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເກມແພັດ <doc_controllers_gamepads_joysticks>` (ຮອງຮັບຈອຍຄອນໂທ"
"ຣລເລີສູງສຸດ 8 ອັນພ້ອມກັນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:641
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`changing the LED color "
"<doc_controller_features_led_color>` on supported controllers."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການປ່ຽນສີໄຟ LED <doc_controller_features_led_color>` ໃນຈອຍຄອນໂທຣລເລີ"
"ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:643
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`reading motion sensors "
"<doc_controller_features_motion_sensors>` on supported controllers (used to "
"implement gyro aiming)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການອ່ານເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ <doc_controller_features_motion_sensors>` ໃ"
"ນຈອຍຄອນໂທຣລເລີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ (ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດລະບົບເລັງດ້ວຍໄຈໂຣ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:646
msgid "Pen/tablet input with pressure and tilt support."
msgstr "ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍປາກກາ/ແທັບເລັດ ພ້ອມຮອງຮັບແຮງກົດ ແລະ ການອຽງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:649
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:136
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:160
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:140
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:257
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:243
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilemaps.rst:78
#: ../../docs/tutorials/navigation/index.rst:4
#: ../../docs/tutorials/performance/thread_safe_apis.rst:113
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "ການນຳທາງ"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:651
msgid ""
"A* algorithm in :ref:`2D <class_AStar2D>` and :ref:`3D <class_AStar3D>`."
msgstr ""
"ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ A* ໃນ :ref:`2D <class_AStar2D>` ແລະ :ref:`3D <class_AStar3D>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:652
msgid ""
"Navigation meshes with dynamic obstacle avoidance in :ref:`2D "
"<doc_navigation_overview_2d>` and :ref:`3D <doc_navigation_overview_3d>`."
msgstr ""
"ເນັດການນຳທາງ (Navigation meshes) ພ້ອມການຫຼົບຫຼີກສິ່ງກີດຂວາງແບບໄດນາມິກໃນ :ref:`2D "
"<doc_navigation_overview_2d>` ແລະ :ref:`3D <doc_navigation_overview_3d>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:654
msgid ""
"Generate navigation meshes from the editor or at runtime (including from an "
"exported project)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເນັດການນຳທາງຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ຫຼື ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແລ່ນ (runtime) (ລວມທັງຈາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເອັກສະ"
"ປອດອອກໄປແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:657
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:448
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:166
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:95
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:301
#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/index.rst:4
msgid "Networking"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:659
msgid ""
"Low-level TCP networking using :ref:`class_StreamPeer` "
"and :ref:`class_TCPServer`."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ TCP ລະດັບຕ່ຳໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`class_StreamPeer` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_TCPServer`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:660
msgid ""
"Low-level UDP networking using :ref:`class_PacketPeer` "
"and :ref:`class_UDPServer`."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ UDP ລະດັບຕ່ຳໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`class_PacketPeer` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_UDPServer`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:661
msgid "Low-level HTTP requests using :ref:`class_HTTPClient`."
msgstr "ການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ລະດັບຕ່ຳໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`class_HTTPClient`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:662
msgid "High-level HTTP requests using :ref:`class_HTTPRequest`."
msgstr "ການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ລະດັບສູງໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`class_HTTPRequest`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:664
msgid "Supports HTTPS out of the box using bundled certificates."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ HTTPS ໃນຕົວໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຮັບຮອງທີ່ມາກັບເຄື່ອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:666
msgid ""
":ref:`High-level multiplayer <doc_high_level_multiplayer>` API using UDP and "
"ENet."
msgstr ""
"API :ref:`ລະບົບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນລະດັບສູງ <doc_high_level_multiplayer>` ໂດຍໃຊ້ UDP ແລະ "
"ENet."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:668
msgid "Automatic replication using remote procedure calls (RPCs)."
msgstr "ການຈຳລອງຂໍ້ມູນອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນຂັ້ນຕອນໄລຍະໄກ (RPCs)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:669
msgid "Supports unreliable, reliable and ordered transfers."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແບບບໍ່ຄົງທີ່ (unreliable), ແບບຄົງທີ່ (reliable) ແລະ ແບບລຽງລຳດັບ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:671
msgid ""
":ref:`WebSocket <doc_websocket>` client and server, available on all "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
":ref:`WebSocket <doc_websocket>` ທັງຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ (client) ແລະ ເຊີເວີ (server), ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃ"
"ນທຸກແພລັດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:672
msgid ""
":ref:`WebRTC <doc_webrtc>` client and server, available on all platforms."
msgstr ""
":ref:`WebRTC <doc_webrtc>` ທັງຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ, ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນທຸກແພລັດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:673
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`UPnP <class_UPNP>` to sidestep the requirement to forward "
"ports when hosting a server behind a NAT."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`UPnP <class_UPNP>` ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການຟໍເວີດພອດ (forward ports) "
"ເມື່ອເປີດເຊີເວີພາຍໃຕ້ NAT."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:677
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:433
#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/index.rst:4
msgid "Internationalization"
msgstr "ສາກົນວິວັດ (ການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍພາສາ)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:679
msgid "Full support for Unicode including emoji."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ Unicode ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ ລວມທັງອີໂມຈິ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:680
msgid "Support for loading system fonts on Windows, macOS, and Linux."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການໂຫຼດຟອນຂອງລະບົບໃນ Windows, macOS ແລະ Linux."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:682
msgid ""
"By default, system fonts are used as a fallback to display unsupported "
"characters. This allows proper display of multilingual text without having "
"to bundle large font files with a project."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ຟອນຂອງລະບົບຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງເພື່ອສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະແດງຂໍ້"
"ຄວາມຫຼາຍພາສາໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມໄຟລ໌ຟອນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄວ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:686
msgid ""
"Store localization strings using :ref:`CSV <doc_internationalizing_games>` "
"or :ref:`gettext <doc_localization_using_gettext>`."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມການແປພາສາໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`CSV <doc_internationalizing_games>` ຫຼື "
":ref:`gettext <doc_localization_using_gettext>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:689
msgid "Support for generating gettext POT and PO files from the editor."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ gettext POT ແລະ PO ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:691
msgid ""
"Use localized strings in your project automatically in GUI elements or by "
"using the ``tr()`` function."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນສ່ວນປະກອບ GUI ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``tr()``."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:693
msgid "Support for pluralization and translation contexts."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການຜັນປ່ຽນຕາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (pluralization) ແລະ ບໍລິບົດຂອງການແປ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:694
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`bidirectional typesetting "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_bidi>`, text shaping and OpenType localized "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການຈັດພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມສອງທິດທາງ <doc_internationalizing_games_bidi>`, ການຈັດຮູ"
"ບຮ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text shaping) ແລະ ຮູບແບບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ OpenType."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:696
msgid "Automatic UI mirroring for right-to-left locales."
msgstr "ການສະທ້ອນ UI ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ຂຽນຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ (RTL)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:697
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`pseudolocalization <doc_pseudolocalization>` to test your "
"project for i18n-friendliness."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`ການແປທຽມ (pseudolocalization) <doc_pseudolocalization>` ເພື່ອທົດສອບຄ"
"ວາມພ້ອມຂອງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບ i18n."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:701
msgid "Windowing and OS integration"
msgstr "ການຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:703
msgid "Spawn multiple independent windows within a single process."
msgstr "ສ້າງຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະພາຍໃນໂປຣເຊສດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:704
msgid "Move, resize, minimize, and maximize windows spawned by the project."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍ, ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ, ພັບລົງ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:705
msgid "Change the window title and icon."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ໄອຄອນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:706
msgid ""
"Create transparent windows to use as overlays, with polygon-based mouse "
"passthrough support."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງແບບໂປ່ງໃສເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຊ້ອນທັບ (overlays), ພ້ອມຮອງຮັບການຄລິກທະລຸ (mouse "
"passthrough) ແບບຮູບຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:708
msgid ""
"Request attention (will cause the title bar to blink on most platforms)."
msgstr "ການຮ້ອງຂໍຄວາມສົນໃຈ (ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ກະພິບໃນເກືອບທຸກແພລັດຟອມ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:709
msgid "Fullscreen mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:711
msgid ""
"Uses borderless fullscreen by default on Windows for fast alt-tabbing, but "
"can optionally use exclusive fullscreen to reduce input lag."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບບໍ່ມີຂອບ (borderless fullscreen) ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານໃນ Windows ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະຫຼັບໜ້າຕ່າ"
"ງ (alt-tab) ໄດ້ໄວ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ exclusive fullscreen ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການດີເລຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:714
msgid "Borderless windows (fullscreen or non-fullscreen)."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບບໍ່ມີຂອບ (ເຕັມຈໍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເຕັມຈໍ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:715
msgid "Keep a window always on top."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:716
msgid "Make a window ignore focus (useful for overlays)."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງບໍ່ຮັບໂຟກັດ (ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ overlays)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:717
msgid ""
"Declare a window as a popup (hidden from task switcher) or exclusive "
"(prevents interacting with other windows from the same process)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໜ້າຕ່າງເປັນແບບປັອບອັບ (ເຊື່ອງຈາກ task switcher) ຫຼື ແບບ exclusive (ປ້ອງກັນການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ"
"ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໃນໂປຣເຊສດຽວກັນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:719
msgid "Native file dialog support on Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌ (file dialog) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມໃນ Windows, macOS, Linux ແລະ Android."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:720
msgid "Tray icon support on Windows and macOS."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບໄອຄອນໃນຖາດລະບົບ (tray icon) ໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:721
msgid "Global menu integration on macOS."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເມນູຫຼັກ (global menu) ໃນ macOS."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:722
msgid "Client-side decorations on macOS."
msgstr "ການຕົກແຕ່ງຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ (Client-side decorations) ໃນ macOS."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:723
msgid ""
"Execute commands in a blocking or non-blocking manner (including running "
"multiple instances of the same project)."
msgstr ""
"ສັ່ງແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງແບບລໍຖ້າ (blocking) ຫຼື ບໍ່ລໍຖ້າ (non-blocking) (ລວມທັງການແລ່ນຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງໂປຣເຈັ"
"ກດຽວກັນ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:725
msgid ""
"Open file paths and URLs using default or custom protocol handlers (if "
"registered on the system)."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ URL ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໂປຣໂຕຄໍມາດຕະຖານ ຫຼື ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (ຖ້າຖືກລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນລະບົບ)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:726
msgid "Parse custom command line arguments."
msgstr "ວິເຄາະຫາອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໄລນ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:727
msgid "Support for screen readers on Windows, macOS, and Linux."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບຕົວອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (screen readers) ໃນ Windows, macOS ແລະ Linux."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:728
msgid ""
"Any Godot binary (editor or exported project) can be :ref:`used as a "
"headless server <doc_exporting_for_dedicated_servers>` by starting it with "
"the ``--headless`` command line argument. This allows running the engine "
"without a GPU or display server."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີຂອງ Godot (ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເອັກສະປອດອອກໄປ) ສາມາດ :ref:`ໃຊ້ເປັນເຊີເວີແບບ"
"ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (headless server) <doc_exporting_for_dedicated_servers>` ໄດ້ໂດຍການ"
"ເລີ່ມດ້ວຍອາກິວເມນ ``--headless``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແລ່ນເອນຈິນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີ GPU ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສະແດງຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:735
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_creating_applications` for details on using these features."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_creating_applications` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດການໃຊ້ຟີເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

