#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:742
msgid ""
"In-app purchases on :ref:`Android <doc_android_in_app_purchases>` and `iOS "
"<https://github.com/godot-sdk-integrations/godot-storekit2>`_."
msgstr ""
