msgstr "*ຕົວຢ່າງ: Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD FX-4100, Snapdragon X Elite*"

#: ../../docs/about/system_requirements.rst:30
#: ../../docs/about/system_requirements.rst:120
#: ../../docs/about/system_requirements.rst:216
