#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"This series will introduce you to Godot and give you an overview of its "
"features."
msgstr "ຊຸດບົດຮຽນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ຈັກກັບ Godot ແລະ ພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"In the following pages, you will get answers to questions such as \"Is Godot "
"for me?\" or \"What can I do with Godot?\". We will then introduce the "
"engine's most essential concepts, run you through the editor's interface, "
"and give you tips to make the most of your time learning it."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຕອບສຳລັບຄຳຖາມຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ \"Godot ເໝາະກັບຂ້ອຍບໍ່?\" ຫຼື \"ຂ້ອຍສາມາດເ"
"ຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່ດ້ວຍ Godot?\". ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະແນະນຳແນວຄວາມຄິດທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຂອງເອນຈິນ, ພາທ່ານເບິ່ງສ່"
"ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:4
msgid "Introduction to Godot"
msgstr "ການແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ Godot"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:6
msgid ""
"This article is here to help you figure out whether Godot might be a good "
"fit for you. We will introduce some broad features of the engine to give you "
"a feel for what you can achieve with it and answer questions such as \"what "
"do I need to know to get started?\"."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຄວາມນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າ Godot ອາດຈະເໝາະສົມກັບທ່ານຫຼືບໍ່. ພວກເຮົາຈະແນະນຳບາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກວ້"
"າງຂວາງຂອງເອນຈິນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່ ແລະ ຕອບຄຳຖາມ ເຊັ່ນ \"ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງຮູ້ຫ"
"ຍັງແດ່ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ?\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:11
msgid ""
"This is by no means an exhaustive overview. We will introduce many more "
"features in this getting started series."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນພາບລວມທັງໝົດ. ພວກເຮົາຈະແນະນຳຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນຊຸດບົດຮຽນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:15
msgid "What is Godot?"
msgstr "Godot ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:17
msgid ""
"Godot is a general-purpose 2D and 3D game engine designed to support all "
"sorts of projects. You can use it to create games or applications you can "
"then release on desktop or mobile, as well as on the web."
msgstr ""
"Godot ແມ່ນເອນຈິນສ້າງເກມ 2 ມິຕິ ແລະ 3 ມິຕິ ແບບອະເນກປະສົງ ທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຮອງຮັບໂຄງການທຸກປະເພ"
"ດ. ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເກມ ຫຼື ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ອຍລົງໃນເດັສທັອບ, ມືຖື, ຫຼື ເວັບໄຊໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:21
msgid ""
"You can also create console games with it, although you either need strong "
"programming skills or a developer to port the game for you."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງເກມສຳລັບຄອນໂຊລໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງມີທັກສະການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ເຂັ້ມແຂງ ຫຼື "
"ມີນັກພັດທະນາຊ່ວຍໃນການພອດເກມໃຫ້ທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:27
msgid "What can the engine do?"
msgstr "ເອນຈິນສາມາດເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່?"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:29
msgid ""
"Godot was initially developed in-house by an Argentinian game studio. Its "
"development started in 2001, and the engine was rewritten and improved "
"tremendously since its open source release in 2014."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ Godot ໄດ້ຖືກພັດທະນາໂດຍສະຕູດິໂອເກມໃນປະເທດອາເຈນຕິນາ. ການພັດທະນາເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນປີ 2001 "
"ແລະ ເອນຈິນໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ປັບປຸງຢ່າງມະຫາສານນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການປ່ອຍເປັນໂອເພນຊອດໃນປີ 2014."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:33
msgid ""
"Some examples of games created with Godot include Cassette Beasts, PVKK, and "
"Usagi Shima. As for applications, the open source pixel art drawing program "
"Pixelorama is powered by Godot, and so is the voxel RPG creator RPG in a "
"Box. You can find many more examples in the `Official Showcase <https://"
"godotengine.org/showcase/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງເກມທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ Godot ໄດ້ແກ່ Cassette Beasts, PVKK, ແລະ Usagi Shima. ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເ"
"ຄຊັນ, ໂປຣແກຣມແຕ້ມພາບ Pixel art ທີ່ເປັນໂອເພນຊອດຢ່າງ Pixelorama ກໍຂັບເຄື່ອນດ້ວຍ Godot, ລວມ"
"ທັງ RPG in a Box ເຊິ່ງເປັນເຄື່ອງມືສ້າງເກມ voxel RPG. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ "
"`Official Showcase <https://godotengine.org/showcase/>`_."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:42
msgid "Usagi Shima"
msgstr "Usagi Shima"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:47
msgid "Cassette Beasts"
msgstr "Cassette Beasts"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:52
msgid "PVKK: Planetenverteidigungskanonenkommandant"
msgstr "PVKK: Planetenverteidigungskanonenkommandant"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:57
msgid "RPG in a Box"
msgstr "RPG in a Box"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:60
msgid "How does it work and look?"
msgstr "ມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ ແລະ ມີໜ້າຕາເປັນແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:62
msgid ""
"Godot comes with a fully-fledged game editor with integrated tools to answer "
"the most common needs. It includes a code editor, an animation editor, a "
"tilemap editor, a shader editor, a debugger, a profiler, and more."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂເກມທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືໃນຕົວເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການທົ່ວໄປ. ມັນປະ"
"ກອບມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄ້ດ, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂແອນິເມຊັນ, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄທລ໌ແມັບ (tilemap), ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Shader, ເຄື່ອງມືດີບັ"
"ກ, ເຄື່ອງມືວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:68
msgid ""
"The team strives to offer a feature-rich game editor with a consistent user "
"experience. While there is always room for improvement, the user interface "
"keeps getting refined."
msgstr ""
"ທີມງານພະຍາຍາມສະເໜີຕົວແກ້ໄຂເກມທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຄົບຖ້ວນ ພ້ອມປະສົບການຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຍັງມີບ່ອນ"
"ໃຫ້ປັບປຸງຢູ່ສະເໝີ, ແຕ່ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກໍໄດ້ຮັບການຂັດເກົາຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:72
msgid ""
"Of course, if you prefer, you can work with external programs. We officially "
"support importing 3D scenes designed in Blender_ and maintain plugins to "
"code in VSCode_ and Emacs_ for GDScript and C#. We also support Visual "
"Studio for C# on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກໄດ້. ພວກເຮົາຮອງຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າສາກ "
"3 ມິຕິທີ່ອອກແບບໃນ Blender_ ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ແລະ ມີປລັກອິນສຳລັບຂຽນໂຄ້ດໃນ VSCode_ ແລະ "
"Emacs_ ສຳລັບ GDScript ແລະ C#. ພວກເຮົາຍັງຮອງຮັບ Visual Studio ສຳລັບ C# ໃນ Windows ອີ"
"ກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:80
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:-1
msgid "Programming languages"
msgstr "ພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:82
msgid "Let's talk about the available programming languages."
msgstr "ມາເວົ້າເຖິງພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:84
msgid ""
"You can code your games using :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>`, a Godot-"
"specific and tightly integrated language with a lightweight syntax, "
"or :ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>`, which is popular in the games industry. These "
"are the two main scripting languages we support."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໂຄ້ດເກມໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>` ເຊິ່ງເປັນພາສາສະເພາະຂອງ "
"Godot ທີ່ມີໄວຍາກອນເບົາບາງ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເອນຈິນຢ່າງແໜ້ນແຟ້ນ, ຫຼື :ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>` ເຊິ່"
"ງເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມໃນອຸດສາຫະກຳເກມ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສອງພາສາສະຄຣິບຫຼັກທີ່ພວກເຮົາຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:89
msgid ""
"With the :ref:`GDExtension <doc_what_is_gdextension>` technology, you can "
"also write gameplay or high-performance algorithms in :ref:`C++ "
"<doc_godot_cpp>` or :ref:`other languages <doc_scripting_languages>` without "
"recompiling the engine. You can use this technology to integrate third-party "
"libraries and other Software Development Kits (SDK) in the engine."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ :ref:`GDExtension <doc_what_is_gdextension>`, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຂຽນເກມເພ"
"ລ ຫຼື ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງໃນ :ref:`C++ <doc_godot_cpp>` ຫຼື :ref:`ພາສາອື່ນໆ "
"<doc_scripting_languages>` ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຄອມໄພລເອນຈິນໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄ"
"ລບຣາຣີພາຍນອກ ແລະ SDK ອື່ນໆ ເຂົ້າໃນເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:95
msgid ""
"Of course, you can also directly add modules and features to the engine, as "
"it's completely free and open source."
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມໂມດູນ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຂົ້າໃນເອນຈິນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເປັນໂອເພນຊ"
"ອດ ແລະ ຟຣີທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:101
msgid "What do I need to know to use Godot?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງຮູ້ຫຍັງແດ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Godot?"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:103
msgid ""
"Godot is a feature-packed game engine. With its thousands of features, there "
"is a lot to learn. To make the most of it, you need good programming "
"foundations. While we try to make the engine accessible, you will benefit a "
"lot from knowing how to think like a programmer first."
msgstr ""
"Godot ແມ່ນເອນຈິນເກມທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດເຕັມຮູບແບບ. ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດນັບພັນຢ່າງ, ມັນມີຫຼາຍສິ່ງໃຫ້ຮຽນຮູ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງ"
"ານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີພື້ນຖານການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ດີ. ເຖິງວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະພະຍາຍາມເ"
"ຮັດໃຫ້ເອນຈິນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ງ່າຍ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ຈັກວິທີຄິດແບບນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມມາກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:108
msgid ""
"Godot relies on the object-oriented programming paradigm. Being comfortable "
"with concepts such as classes and objects will help you code efficiently in "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Godot ອີງໃສ່ຮູບແບບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມແບບເຊີງວັດຖຸ (Object-oriented programming). ການເຂົ້າໃຈ"
"ແນວຄວາມຄິດ ເຊັ່ນ ຄລາສ (Classes) ແລະ ວັດຖຸ (Objects) ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຂຽນໂຄ້ດໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:111
msgid ""
"If you are entirely new to programming, GDQuest's *Learn GDScript From Zero* "
"is a free and open source interactive tutorial for absolute beginners to "
"learn to program with Godot's GDScript language. It is available as a "
"`desktop application <https://gdquest.itch.io/learn-godot-gdscript>`__ or "
"`in the browser <https://gdquest.github.io/learn-gdscript>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານເປັນມືໃໝ່ໃນການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ, *Learn GDScript From Zero* ຂອງ GDQuest ແມ່ນບົດຮຽນແ"
"ບບໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ເປັນໂອເພນຊອດ ແລະ ຟຣີ ສຳລັບມືໃໝ່ເພື່ອຮຽນຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມດ້ວຍພາສາ GDScript ຂອງ "
"Godot. ມັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທັງໃນຮູບແບບ `ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເດັສທັອບ <https://gdquest.itch.io/learn-"
"godot-gdscript>`__ ຫຼື `ຜ່ານບຣາວເຊີ <https://gdquest.github.io/learn-gdscript>"
"`__."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:117
msgid ""
"We will provide you with more Godot-specific learning resources "
"in :ref:`doc_learning_new_features`."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະສະໜອງແຫຼ່ງຮຽນຮູ້ສະເພາະຂອງ Godot ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ "
":ref:`doc_learning_new_features`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:120
#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:33
msgid ""
"In the next part, you will get an overview of the engine's essential "
"concepts."
msgstr "ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງແນວຄວາມຄິດທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:4
msgid "Learn to code with GDScript"
msgstr "ຮຽນຂຽນໂຄ້ດດ້ວຍ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:6
msgid ""
"In Godot, you can write code using the GDScript and C# programming languages."
msgstr "ໃນ Godot, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໂຄ້ດໂດຍໃຊ້ພາສາ GDScript ແລະ C#."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:8
msgid ""
"If you are new to programming, we recommend starting with GDScript because "
"we designed it to be simpler than all-purpose languages like C#. It will be "
"both faster and easier to learn."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານເປັນມືໃໝ່ໃນການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ GDScript ເພາະພວກເຮົາອອກແບບມ"
"າໃຫ້ງ່າຍກວ່າພາສາທົ່ວໄປ ເຊັ່ນ C#. ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານຮຽນຮູ້ໄດ້ໄວ ແລະ ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:12
msgid ""
"While GDScript is a language specific to Godot, the techniques you will "
"learn with it will apply to other programming languages."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າ GDScript ຈະເປັນພາສາສະເພາະຂອງ Godot, ແຕ່ເຕັກນິກທີ່ທ່ານຮຽນຮູ້ນຳມັນ ກໍສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບພາ"
"ສາອື່ນໆໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:15
msgid ""
"Note that it is completely normal for a programmer to learn and use multiple "
"languages. Programming languages have more similarities than differences, so "
"once you know one, you can learn another much faster."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມຈະຮຽນຮູ້ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍພາສາ. ພາສາການຂຽນໂປ"
"ຣແກຣມມີສ່ວນທີ່ຄືກັນຫຼາຍກວ່າສ່ວນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານຮູ້ຈັກພາສາໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຮຽນພາສາອື່ນໄດ້ໄວ"
"ຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:20
msgid "Learn in your browser with the GDScript app"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍແອັບ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:22
msgid ""
"To learn GDScript, you can use the app Learn GDScript From Zero. It is a "
"complete beginner course with interactive practices you can do right in your "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ GDScript, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແອັບ Learn GDScript From Zero. ມັນແມ່ນຫຼັກສູດສຳລັບມືໃໝ່ທີ່ສົມ"
"ບູນ ພ້ອມແບບຝຶກຫັດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:28
msgid "Click here to access the app: `Learn GDScript From Zero app`_"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ນີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບ: `Learn GDScript From Zero app`_"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learn_to_code_with_gdscript.rst:30
msgid ""
"This app is an open-source project. To report bugs or contribute, head to "
"the app's source code repository: `GitHub repository`_."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄງການໂອເພນຊອດ. ເພື່ອແຈ້ງບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຮ່ວມພັດທະນາ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ຄັງເກັບໂຄ້ດຂອງແອັບ: `GitHub "
"repository`_."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:8
msgid "Overview of Godot's key concepts"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງແນວຄວາມຄິດຫຼັກຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:10
msgid ""
"Every game engine revolves around abstractions you use to build your "
"applications. In Godot, a game is a **tree** of **nodes** that you group "
"together into **scenes**. You can then wire these nodes so they can "
"communicate using **signals**."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆເອນຈິນເກມຈະເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານສິ່ງທີ່ສົມມຸດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ໃນ Godot, ເກມແມ່ນ **ຕົ້"
"ນໄມ້ (tree)** ຂອງ **ໂນດ (nodes)** ທີ່ທ່ານນຳມາລວມກັນເປັນ **ສາກ (scenes)**. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສ"
"າມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນສື່ສານກັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ **ສັນຍານ (signals)**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:15
msgid ""
"These are the four concepts you will learn here. We're going to look at them "
"briefly to give you a sense of how the engine works. In the getting started "
"series, you will get to use them in practice."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສີ່ແນວຄວາມຄິດທີ່ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ພວກເຮົາຈະມາເບິ່ງພວກມັນສັ້ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກ"
"ຂອງເອນຈິນ. ໃນຊຸດບົດຮຽນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ລົງມືປະຕິບັດຕົວຈິງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:22
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/nodes_and_scenes.rst:40
#: ../../docs/tutorials/best_practices/what_are_godot_classes.rst:49
msgid "Scenes"
msgstr "ສາກ (Scenes)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:24
msgid ""
"In Godot, you break down your game in reusable scenes. A scene can be a "
"character, a weapon, a menu in the user interface, a single house, an entire "
"level, or anything you can think of. Godot's scenes are flexible; they fill "
"the role of both prefabs and scenes in some other game engines."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot, ທ່ານແບ່ງເກມຂອງທ່ານອອກເປັນສາກທີ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ຊໍ້າໄດ້. ສາກອາດຈະເປັນຕົວລະຄອນ, ອາວຸ"
"ດ, ເມນູໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຮືອນຫຼັງໜຶ່ງ, ດ່ານທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ສິ່ງໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານນຶກອອກ. ສາກຂອງ Godot ມີຄວາມຍື"
"ດຍຸ່ນ; ພວກມັນເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ທັງເປັນ prefab ແລະ ເປັນສາກຄືກັບໃນເອນຈິນເກມອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:31
msgid ""
"You can also nest scenes. For example, you can put your character in a "
"level, and drag and drop a scene as a child of it."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຊ້ອນສາກເຂົ້າໄປໃນອີກສາກໜຶ່ງໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາຕົວລະຄອນໃສ່ໄວ້ໃນດ່ານ, ແລະ ລາກ"
"ສາກມາເປັນລູກ (child) ຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:37
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/nodes_and_scenes.rst:14
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:33
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:319
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:306
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/debug/objectdb_profiler.rst:160
#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:47
msgid "Nodes"
msgstr "ໂນດ (Nodes)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:39
msgid ""
"A scene is composed of one or more **nodes**. Nodes are your game's smallest "
"building blocks that you arrange into trees. Here's an example of a "
"character's nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສາກໜຶ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍ **ໂນດ**. ໂນດແມ່ນອົງປະກອບທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດຂອງເກມທີ່ທ່ານນຳມາຈັດລຽງເປັນຕົ້ນໄ"
"ມ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂນດຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:45
msgid ""
"It is made of a ``CharacterBody2D`` node named \"Player\", a ``Camera2D``, a "
"``Sprite2D``, and a ``CollisionShape2D``."
msgstr ""
"ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດ ``CharacterBody2D`` ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ \"Player\", ``Camera2D``, "
"``Sprite2D``, ແລະ ``CollisionShape2D``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:48
msgid ""
"The node names end with \"2D\" because this is a 2D scene. Their 3D "
"counterparts have names that end with \"3D\". Be aware that \"Spatial\" "
"Nodes are now called \"Node3D\" starting with Godot 4."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂນດຈະລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ \"2D\" ເພາະວ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສາກ 2 ມິຕິ. ສ່ວນໂນດ 3 ມິຕິຈະມີຊື່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ \"3D\". ກະລຸ"
"ນາຊາບວ່າ ໂນດ \"Spatial\" ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ \"Node3D\" ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:52
msgid ""
"Notice how nodes and scenes look the same in the editor. When you save a "
"tree of nodes as a scene, it then shows as a single node, with its internal "
"structure hidden in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າໂນດ ແລະ ສາກມີໜ້າຕາຄືກັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອທ່ານບັນທຶກຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງໂນດເປັນສາກ, ມັນຈະສະແດງເ"
"ປັນໂນດດຽວ, ໂດຍທີ່ໂຄງສ້າງພາຍໃນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:56
msgid ""
"Godot provides an extensive library of base node types you can combine and "
"extend to build more powerful ones. 2D, 3D, or user interface, you will do "
"most things with these nodes."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີຫໍສະໝຸດຂອງປະເພດໂນດພື້ນຖານຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດນຳມາລວມກັນ ແລະ ຕໍ່ຍອດເພື່ອສ້າງສິ່ງທີ່ມີ"
"ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ 2 ມິຕິ, 3 ມິຕິ, ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ທ່ານຈະເຮັດທຸກຢ່າງຜ່ານໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:63
#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:97
msgid "The scene tree"
msgstr "ຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ (The scene tree)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:65
msgid ""
"All your game's scenes come together in the **scene tree**, literally a tree "
"of scenes. And as scenes are trees of nodes, the scene tree also is a tree "
"of nodes. But it's easier to think of your game in terms of scenes as they "
"can represent characters, weapons, doors, or your user interface."
msgstr ""
"ສາກທັງໝົດຂອງເກມຈະມາລວມກັນຢູ່ໃນ **ຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ (scene tree)**. ແລະ ເນື່ອງຈາກສາກແມ່ນຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງໂ"
"ນດ, ຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກກໍຄືຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງໂນດນັ້ນເອງ. ແຕ່ມັນຈະງ່າຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະຄິດເຖິງເກມຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບຂອງສາກ ເພາະ"
"ພວກມັນສາມາດແທນຕົວລະຄອນ, ອາວຸດ, ປະຕູ, ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:75
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2661
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:659
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:724
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:554
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/how_to_read_the_godot_api.rst:103
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:220
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "ສັນຍານ (Signals)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:77
msgid ""
"Nodes emit signals when some event occurs. This feature allows you to make "
"nodes communicate without hard-wiring them in code. It gives you a lot of "
"flexibility in how you structure your scenes."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມີເຫດການບາງຢ່າງເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດສື່ສານກັນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອ"
"ງຂຽນໂຄ້ດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນໂດຍກົງ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍໃນການຈັດໂຄງສ້າງສາກຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:83
msgid ""
"Signals are Godot's version of the *observer* pattern. You can read more "
"about it here: https://gameprogrammingpatterns.com/observer.html"
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານແມ່ນຮູບແບບ *observer* ໃນເວີຊັນຂອງ Godot. ທ່ານສາມາດອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: https://"
"gameprogrammingpatterns.com/observer.html"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:87
msgid ""
"For example, buttons emit a signal when pressed. You can connect a piece of "
"code to this signal which will run in reaction to this event, like starting "
"the game or opening a menu."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປຸ່ມຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຖືກກົດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂຄ້ດເຂົ້າກັບສັນຍານນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີເຫດກາ"
"ນເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ການເລີ່ມເກມ ຫຼື ການເປີດເມນູ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:91
msgid ""
"Other built-in signals can tell you when two objects collided, when a "
"character or monster entered a given area, and much more. You can also "
"define new signals tailored to your game."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານໃນຕົວອື່ນໆ ສາມາດບອກທ່ານໄດ້ວ່າເມື່ອໃດວັດຖຸສອງຢ່າງຕຳກັນ, ເມື່ອໃດຕົວລະຄອນ ຫຼື ຜີເຂົ້າໄປໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳ"
"ນົດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດສັນຍານໃໝ່ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບເກມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:96
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/instancing.rst:232
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_languages.rst:154
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_player_input.rst:199
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/signals.rst:549
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:279
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:312
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/global_illumination/introduction_to_global_illumination.rst:328
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/static_typing.rst:671
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:98
msgid ""
"Nodes, scenes, the scene tree, and signals are four core concepts in Godot "
"that you will manipulate all the time."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ, ສາກ, ຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ, ແລະ ສັນຍານ ແມ່ນສີ່ແນວຄວາມຄິດຫຼັກໃນ Godot ທີ່ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:101
msgid ""
"Nodes are your game's smallest building blocks. You combine them to create "
"scenes that you then combine and nest into the scene tree. You can then use "
"signals to make nodes react to events in other nodes or different scene tree "
"branches."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດແມ່ນອົງປະກອບທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດຂອງເກມ. ທ່ານນຳພວກມັນມາລວມກັນເພື່ອສ້າງສາກ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຈະນຳມາລວມກັນ ແລະ "
"ຊ້ອນກັນໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສັນຍານເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ເຫດການໃນໂນດອື່ນ ຫຼື ກິ່ງງ່າອື່"
"ນໆ ຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/key_concepts_overview.rst:105
msgid ""
"After this short breakdown, you probably have many questions. Bear with us "
"as you will get many answers throughout the getting started series."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກການອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆ ນີ້, ທ່ານອາດຈະມີຫຼາຍຄຳຖາມ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕາມພວກເຮົາຕໍ່ໄປ ເພາະທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຕອ"
"ບຕະຫຼອດຊຸດບົດຮຽນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:10
msgid "First look at Godot's interface"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ Godot ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:12
msgid ""
"This page will give you a brief overview of Godot's interface. We're going "
"to look at the different main screens and docks to help you situate yourself."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ຈະໃຫ້ພາບລວມສັ້ນໆ ກ່ຽວກັບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ Godot. ພວກເຮົາຈະມາເບິ່ງໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ ແລະ ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື "
"(docks) ຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:15
msgid ""
"For a comprehensive breakdown of the editor's interface and how to use it, "
"see the :ref:`Editor manual <doc_editor_introduction>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທັງໝົດຂອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`ຄູ່ມືຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"<doc_editor_introduction>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:19
msgid "The Project Manager"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການໂຄງການ (The Project Manager)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:21
msgid ""
"When you launch Godot, the first window you see is the Project Manager. In "
"the default tab **Projects**, you can manage existing projects, import or "
"create new ones, and more."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດ Godot, ໜ້າຕ່າງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນຄື ຕົວຈັດການໂຄງການ. ໃນແຖບ **Projects**, ທ່ານສາມາ"
"ດຈັດການໂຄງການທີ່ມີຢູ່, ນຳເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:27
msgid ""
"At the top of the window, there is another tab named **Asset Library**. The "
"first time you go to this tab you'll see a \"Go Online\" button. For privacy "
"reasons, the Godot project manager does not access the internet by default. "
"To change this click the \"Go Online\" button. You can change this option "
"later in the settings."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ມີອີກແຖບໜຶ່ງຊື່ວ່າ **Asset Library**. ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປໃນແຖບນີ້ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ"
"ປຸ່ມ \"Go Online\". ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ, ຕົວຈັດການໂຄງການຂອງ Godot ຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນ"
"ເຕີເນັດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Go Online\". ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກນີ້ພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ໃນ"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:32
msgid ""
"Once your network mode is set to \"online\", you can search for demo "
"projects in the open source asset library, which includes many projects "
"developed by the community:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໂໝດເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"online\", ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໂຄງການຕົວຢ່າງໃນຫໍສະໝຸດຊັບສິນໂອເພນ"
"ຊອດ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີຫຼາຍໂຄງການທີ່ພັດທະນາໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:37
msgid ""
"The Project Manager's settings can be opened using the **Settings** menu:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຕົວຈັດການໂຄງການສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ **Settings**:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:41
msgid ""
"From here, you can change the editor's language (default is the system "
"language), interface theme, display scale, network mode, and also the "
"directory naming convention."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກທີ່ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພາສາຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນພາສາຂອງລະບົບ), ຮູບແບບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຂະໜາດກ"
"ານສະແດງຜົນ, ໂໝດເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຟນເດີ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:44
msgid ""
"To learn the Project Manager's ins and outs, read :ref:`doc_project_manager`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕົວຈັດການໂຄງການ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ :ref:`doc_project_manager`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:49
msgid "First look at Godot's editor"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງ Godot ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:51
msgid ""
"When you open a new or an existing project, the editor's interface appears. "
"Let's look at its main areas:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໂຄງການໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໂຄງການທີ່ມີຢູ່, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ມາເບິ່ງພື້ນທີ່ຫຼັກໆ ຂອງມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:56
msgid ""
"By default, along the window's top edge, it features **main menu** on the "
"left, **workspace** switching buttons in the center (active workspace is "
"highlighted), and **playtest** buttons and the **Movie Maker Mode** toggle "
"on the right:"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຢູ່ຂອບເທິງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຈະມີ **ເມນູຫຼັກ** ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ **ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ "
"(workspace)** ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ (ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຈະຖືກເນັ້ນ), ແລະ ປຸ່ມ **ທົດສອບ (playtest)** ພ້ອມ"
"ກັບປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ **Movie Maker Mode** ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:62
msgid ""
"Just below the workspace buttons, the opened :ref:`scenes "
"<doc_key_concepts_overview_scenes>` as tabs are seen. The plus (+) button "
"right next to the tabs will add a new scene to the project. With the button "
"on the far right, distraction-free mode can be toggled, which maximizes or "
"restores the **viewport**'s size by hiding **docks** in the interface:"
msgstr ""
"ຖັດມາລຸ່ມປຸ່ມພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ :ref:`ສາກ (scenes) "
"<doc_key_concepts_overview_scenes>` ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ເປັນແຖບ. ປຸ່ມບວກ (+) ຖັດຈາກແຖບຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ"
"ສາກໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງການ. ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາສຸດ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໂໝດບໍ່ມີສິ່ງລົບກວນ (distraction-free "
"mode) ເຊິ່ງຈະຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດຂອງ **ວິວພອດ (viewport)** ໂດຍການເຊື່ອງແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the center, below the scene selector is the **viewport** with its "
"**toolbar** at the top, where you'll find different tools to move, scale, or "
"lock the scene's nodes (currently the 3D workspace is active):"
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ, ລຸ່ມຕົວເລືອກສາກແມ່ນ **ວິວພອດ (viewport)** ພ້ອມກັບ **ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື** ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ, ເຊິ່ງທ່"
"ານຈະພົບກັບເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ, ປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ລັອກໂນດຂອງສາກ (ໃນຂະນະນີ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 3 ມິຕິກຳ"
"ລັງຖືກໃຊ້ງານ):"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:74
msgid ""
"This toolbar changes based on the context and selected node. Here is the 2D "
"toolbar:"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມບໍລິບົດ ແລະ ໂນດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ. ນີ້ແມ່ນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື 2 ມິຕິ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:78
msgid "Below is the 3D one:"
msgstr "ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື 3 ມິຕິ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:82
msgid ""
"To learn more on workspaces, "
"read :ref:`doc_intro_to_the_editor_interface_five_screens`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ "
":ref:`doc_intro_to_the_editor_interface_five_screens`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:84
msgid ""
"To learn more on the 3D viewport and 3D in general, "
"read :ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິວພອດ 3 ມິຕິ ແລະ 3 ມິຕິທົ່ວໄປ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:86
msgid ""
"On either side of the viewport sit the **docks**. And at the bottom of the "
"window lies the **bottom panel**."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ສອງຂ້າງຂອງວິວພອດຈະມີ **ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື (docks)**. ແລະ ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຈະມີ **ແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ "
"(bottom panel)**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:89
msgid ""
"Let's look at the docks. The **FileSystem** dock lists your project files, "
"including scripts, images, audio samples, and more:"
msgstr ""
"ມາເບິ່ງແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆ. ແຖບ **FileSystem** ຈະສະແດງລາຍການໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງສະ"
"ຄຣິບ, ຮູບພາບ, ສຽງ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:94
msgid "The **Scene** dock lists the active scene's nodes:"
msgstr "ແຖບ **Scene** ຈະສະແດງລາຍການໂນດຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:98
msgid "The **Inspector** allows you to edit the properties of a selected node:"
msgstr "ແຖບ **Inspector** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:102
msgid "To read more on inspector, see :ref:`doc_editor_inspector_dock`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Inspector, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_editor_inspector_dock`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:104
msgid ""
"Docks can be customized. Read more "
"on :ref:`doc_customizing_editor_moving_docks`."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້. ອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ :ref:`doc_customizing_editor_moving_docks`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:106
msgid ""
"The **bottom panel**, situated below the viewport, is the host for the debug "
"console, the animation editor, the audio mixer, and more. They can take "
"precious space, that's why they're folded by default:"
msgstr ""
"**ແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ**, ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ລຸ່ມວິວພອດ, ແມ່ນບ່ອນສຳລັບຄອນໂຊລດີບັກ, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂແອນິເມຊັນ, ຕົວປັບແຕ່ງສຽງ ແ"
"ລະ ອື່ນໆ. ພວກມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈຶ່ງຖືກພັບໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:112
msgid ""
"When you click on one, it expands vertically. Below, you can see the "
"animation editor opened:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກໃສ່ອັນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ມັນຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກຕາມແນວຕັ້ງ. ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນຕົວແກ້ໄຂແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ຖືກ"
"ເປີດຢູ່:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:116
msgid ""
"Bottom panels can also be shown or hidden using the shortcuts defined in "
"**Editor Settings > Shortcuts**, under the **Bottom Panels** category."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມຍັງສາມາດສະແດງ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ **Editor Settings > "
"Shortcuts**, ພາຍໃຕ້ໝວດ **Bottom Panels**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:122
msgid "The five main screens"
msgstr "ຫ້າໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:124
msgid ""
"There are five main screen buttons centered at the top of the editor: 2D, "
"3D, Script, Game and Asset Library."
msgstr ""
"ມີຫ້າປຸ່ມໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງດ້ານເທິງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ: 2D, 3D, Script, Game ແລະ Asset Library."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:127
msgid ""
"You'll use the **2D screen** for all types of games. In addition to 2D "
"games, the 2D screen is where you'll build your interfaces."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ **ໜ້າຈໍ 2D** ສຳລັບເກມທຸກປະເພດ. ນອກຈາກເກມ 2 ມິຕິແລ້ວ, ໜ້າຈໍ 2D ຍັງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງສ່"
"ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:132
msgid ""
"In the **3D screen**, you can work with meshes, lights, and design levels "
"for 3D games."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ **ໜ້າຈໍ 3D**, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບເມຊ (meshes), ແສງ ແລະ ອອກແບບດ່ານສຳລັບເກມ 3 ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:137
msgid ""
"Read :ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d` for more detail about the **3D main "
"screen**."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານ :ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ **ໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ 3D**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:140
msgid ""
"The **Game screen** is where your project will appear when running it from "
"the editor. You can go through your project to test it, and pause it and "
"adjust it in real time. Note that this is for testing how adjustments would "
"work, any changes made here are not saved when the game stops running."
msgstr ""
"**ໜ້າຈໍ Game** ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລັນມັນຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບໂຄງກາ"
"ນ, ຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງມັນໄດ້ໃນເວລາຈິງ. ກະລຸນາຊາບວ່າ ນີ້ແມ່ນການທົດສອບເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງຈະເຮັ"
"ດວຽກແນວໃດ, ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ທີ່ເຮັດຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກເມື່ອເກມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:147
msgid ""
"The **Script screen** is a complete code editor with a debugger, rich auto-"
"completion, and built-in code reference."
msgstr ""
"**ໜ້າຈໍ Script** ແມ່ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄ້ດທີ່ສົມບູນ ພ້ອມເຄື່ອງມືດີບັກ, ລະບົບແນະນຳຄຳສັບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ເອກະສ"
"ານອ້າງອີງໂຄ້ດໃນຕົວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:152
msgid ""
"Finally, the **Asset Library** is a library of free and open source add-ons, "
"scripts, and assets to use in your projects."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, **Asset Library** ແມ່ນຫໍສະໝຸດຂອງສ່ວນເສີມ (add-ons), ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຊັບສິນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຟຣີ "
"ແລະ ເປັນໂອເພນຊອດ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:157
msgid ""
"You can learn more about the asset library in :ref:`doc_what_is_assetlib`."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Asset Library ໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`doc_what_is_assetlib`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:163
msgid "Integrated class reference"
msgstr "ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຄລາສໃນຕົວ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:165
msgid "Godot comes with a built-in class reference."
msgstr "Godot ມາພ້ອມກັບເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຄລາສພາຍໃນຕົວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:167
msgid ""
"You can search for information about a class, method, property, constant, or "
"signal by any one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຄລາສ, ເມທອດ (method), ຄຸນສົມບັດ (property), ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ "
"(constant) ຫຼື ສັນຍານ (signal) ໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:170
msgid ""
"Pressing :kbd:`F1` (or :kbd:`Opt + Space` on macOS, or :kbd:`Fn + F1` for "
"laptops with a :kbd:`Fn` key) anywhere in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ :kbd:`F1` (ຫຼື :kbd:`Opt + Space` ໃນ macOS, ຫຼື :kbd:`Fn + F1` ສຳລັບໂນດບຸກທີ່ມີປຸ່ມ "
":kbd:`Fn`) ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:172
msgid ""
"Clicking the \"Search Help\" button in the top-right of the Script main "
"screen."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Search Help\" ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ Script."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:173
msgid "Clicking on the Help menu and Search Help."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ເມນູ Help ແລະ ເລືອກ Search Help."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:174
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Click` (:kbd:`Cmd + Click` on macOS) on a class name, function "
"name, or built-in variable in the script editor."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Click` (:kbd:`Cmd + Click` ໃນ macOS) ໃສ່ຊື່ຄລາສ, ຊື່ຟັງຊັນ ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນໃນຕົວໃ"
"ນໜ້າ Script."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:179
msgid ""
"When you do any of these, a window pops up. Type to search for any item. You "
"can also use it to browse available objects and methods."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ພິມເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເບິ່ງວັດຖຸ "
"ແລະ ເມທອດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:184
msgid ""
"Double-click on an item to open the corresponding page in the script main "
"screen."
msgstr "ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ລາຍການເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນໜ້າຈໍ Script."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:188
msgid "Alternatively,"
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ,"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:190
msgid ""
"Clicking while pressing :kbd:`Ctrl` (:kbd:`Cmd` on macOS) on a class name, "
"function name, or built-in variable in the script editor."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl` (:kbd:`Cmd` ໃນ macOS) ໃສ່ຊື່ຄລາສ, ຊື່ຟັງຊັນ ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນໃນຕົວໃນຕົວ"
"ແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/first_look_at_the_editor.rst:192
msgid ""
"Right-clicking on nodes and choosing **Open Documentation** or choosing "
"**Lookup Symbol** for elements in script editor will directly open their "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"ການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂນດ ແລະ ເລືອກ **Open Documentation** ຫຼື ເລືອກ **Lookup Symbol** ສຳລັບອົ"
"ງປະກອບໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ ຈະເປັນການເປີດເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຂອງພວກມັນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:8
msgid "Learning new features"
msgstr "ການຮຽນຮູ້ຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໆ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:10
msgid ""
"Godot is a feature-rich game engine. There is a lot to learn about it. This "
"page explains how you can use the online manual, built-in code reference, "
"and join online communities to learn new features and techniques."
msgstr ""
"Godot ແມ່ນເອນຈິນເກມທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ມັນມີຫຼາຍສິ່ງໃຫ້ຮຽນຮູ້. ໜ້ານີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຄູ່ມື"
"ອອນໄລນ໌, ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງໂຄ້ດໃນຕົວ ແລະ ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຊຸມຊົນອອນໄລນ໌ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເຕັກນິກໃໝ່ໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:15
msgid "Making the most of this manual"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຄູ່ມືນີ້ໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:17
msgid ""
"What you are reading now is the user manual. It documents each of the "
"engine's concepts and available features. When learning a new topic, you can "
"start by browsing the corresponding section of this website. The left menu "
"allows you to explore broad topics while the search bar will help you find "
"more specific pages. If a page exists for a given theme, it will often link "
"to more related content."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງອ່ານຢູ່ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້. ມັນລວບລວມເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບແນວຄວາມຄິດ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ຂອງເ"
"ອນຈິນ. ເມື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ຫົວຂໍ້ໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການເບິ່ງໝວດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນເວັບໄຊນີ້. ເມນູເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຊ່ວຍໃຫ້"
"ທ່ານສຳຫຼວດຫົວຂໍ້ກວ້າງໆ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຊອກຫາໜ້າສະເພາະໄດ້. ຫາກມີໜ້າສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ນັ້ນໆ, ມັ"
"ນມັກຈະມີລິ້ງໄປຫາເນື້ອຫາອື່ນໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:26
msgid ""
"The manual has a companion class reference that explains each Godot class's "
"available functions and properties when programming. While the manual covers "
"general features, concepts, and how to use the editor, the reference is all "
"about using Godot's scripting API (Application Programming Interface). You "
"can access it both online and offline. We recommend browsing the reference "
"offline, from within the Godot editor. To do so, go to Help -> Search Help "
"or press :kbd:`F1`."
msgstr ""
"ຄູ່ມືນີ້ມີເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຄລາສທີ່ອະທິບາຍຟັງຊັນ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຕ່ລະຄລາສໃນ Godot ເວລາຂຽນໂປຣແກຣ"
"ມ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄູ່ມືຈະກວມເອົາຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປ, ແນວຄວາມຄິດ ແລະ ວິທີການໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຈະເນັ້"
"ນໃສ່ການໃຊ້ scripting API ຂອງ Godot. ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທັງແບບອອນໄລນ໌ ແລະ ອອບໄລນ໌. ພວກ"
"ເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເບິ່ງແບບອອບໄລນ໌ຈາກພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot ໂດຍໄປທີ່ Help -> Search Help ຫຼື ກົດ "
":kbd:`F1`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:36
msgid ""
"To browse it online, head to the manual's :ref:`Class Reference "
"<doc_class_reference>` section."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງແບບອອນໄລນ໌, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໝວດ :ref:`Class Reference <doc_class_reference>` ຂອງຄູ່ມື."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:39
msgid "A class reference's page tells you:"
msgstr "ໜ້າເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຄລາສຈະບອກທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:41
msgid ""
"Where the class exists in the inheritance hierarchy. You can click the top "
"links to jump to parent classes and see the properties and methods a type "
"inherits."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຄລາສໃນລຳດັບການສືບທອດ (inheritance hierarchy). ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກລິ້ງດ້ານເທິງເພື່ອໄປຫ"
"າຄລາສແມ່ (parent classes) ແລະ ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມທອດທີ່ມັນສືບທອດມາ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:47
msgid "A summary of the class's role and use cases."
msgstr "ບົດສະຫຼຸບບົດບາດຂອງຄລາສ ແລະ ກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:49
msgid ""
"An explanation of the class's properties, methods, signals, enums, and "
"constants."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເມທອດ, ສັນຍານ, enum ແລະ ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງຄລາສ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:52
msgid "Links to manual pages further detailing the class."
msgstr "ລິ້ງໄປຫາໜ້າຄູ່ມືທີ່ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄລາສ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:54
msgid ""
"If the manual or class reference is missing or has insufficient information, "
"please open an Issue in the official `godot-docs <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs/issues>`_ GitHub repository to report it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຄູ່ມື ຫຼື ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງຄລາສຂາດຫາຍໄປ ຫຼື ມີຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ພຽງພໍ, ກະລຸນາເປີດ Issue ໃນຄັງເກັບໂຄ້ດ "
"`godot-docs <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues>`_ ໃນ GitHub ເພື່"
"ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຊາບ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:59
msgid ""
"You can hold :kbd:`Ctrl` (macOS :kbd:`Cmd`) and then mouseover text like the "
"name of a class, property, method, signal, or constant to underline it, "
"then :kbd:`Ctrl + Click` (macOS :kbd:`Cmd + Click`) it to jump to it."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl` (macOS :kbd:`Cmd`) ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ຄລາ"
"ສ, ຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເມທອດ, ສັນຍານ ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຂີດກ້ອງ, ຈາກນັ້ນ :kbd:`Ctrl + Click` "
"(:kbd:`Cmd + Click`) ເພື່ອໄປຫາລາຍການນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:63
msgid "Learning to think like a programmer"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ທີ່ຈະຄິດແບບນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:65
msgid ""
"Teaching programming foundations and how to think like a game developer is "
"beyond the scope of Godot's documentation. If you're new to programming, we "
"recommend two excellent free resources to get you started:"
msgstr ""
"ການສອນພື້ນຖານການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ວິທີຄິດແບບນັກພັດທະນາເກມແມ່ນຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງເອກະສານ "
"Godot. ຫາກທ່ານເປັນມືໃໝ່, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳແຫຼ່ງຄວາມຮູ້ທີ່ດີ ແລະ ຟຣີສອງແຫຼ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:69
msgid ""
"GDQuest's *Learn GDScript From Zero* is a free and open source interactive "
"tutorial for absolute beginners to learn to program with Godot's GDScript "
"language. It is available as a `desktop application <https://gdquest.itch.io/"
"learn-godot-gdscript>`__ or `in the browser <https://gdquest.github.io/learn-"
"gdscript>`__."
msgstr ""
"*Learn GDScript From Zero* ຂອງ GDQuest ແມ່ນບົດຮຽນແບບໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ຟຣີ ແລະ ເປັນໂອເພນຊອດ ສຳ"
"ລັບມືໃໝ່ເພື່ອຮຽນຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມດ້ວຍພາສາ GDScript ຂອງ Godot. ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທັງແບບ `ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເດັສທັອບ "
"<https://gdquest.itch.io/learn-godot-gdscript>`__ ຫຼື `ຜ່ານບຣາວເຊີ <https://"
"gdquest.github.io/learn-gdscript>`__."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:75
msgid ""
"If you prefer books, check out the free ebook `Automate The Boring Stuff "
"With Python <https://automatetheboringstuff.com/>`_ by Al Sweigart."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມັກອ່ານປຶ້ມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງອີບຸກຟຣີ `Automate The Boring Stuff With Python <https://"
"automatetheboringstuff.com/>`_ ໂດຍ Al Sweigart."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:79
msgid "Learning with the community"
msgstr "ການຮຽນຮູ້ຮ່ວມກັບຊຸມຊົນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:81
msgid ""
"Godot has a growing community of users. If you're stuck on a problem or need "
"help to better understand how to achieve something, you can ask other users "
"for help on one of the many `active communities <https://godotengine.org/"
"community>`_."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີຊຸມຊົນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກຳລັງເຕີບໃຫຍ່. ຫາກທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດບ"
"າງສິ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆ ໃນ `ຊຸມຊົນຕ່າງໆ <https://godotengine.org/"
"community>`_."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:86
msgid ""
"The best place to ask questions and find already answered ones is the "
"official `Godot Forum <https://forum.godotengine.org/>`_. These responses "
"show up in search engine results and get saved, allowing other users to "
"benefit from discussions on the platform. Once you have asked a question "
"there, you can share its link on other social platforms. Before asking a "
"question, be sure to look for existing answers that might solve your problem "
"on this website or using your preferred search engine."
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການຖາມຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳຕອບແມ່ນ `Godot Forum <https://"
"forum.godotengine.org/>`_ ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ. ຄຳຕອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປະກົດໃນຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຖືກບັນທຶກ"
"ໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຖາມຄຳຖາມຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດແຊຣ໌ລິ້ງໄປຍັງໂຊຊຽວມີເດຍອື່"
"ນໆ ໄດ້. ກ່ອນຈະຖາມ, ກະລຸນາກວດເບິ່ງຄຳຕອບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວທີ່ອາດຈະແກ້ບັນຫາຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:94
msgid ""
"Asking questions well and providing details will help others answer you "
"faster and better. When asking questions, we recommend including the "
"following information:"
msgstr ""
"ການຖາມຄຳຖາມທີ່ດີ ແລະ ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນຕອບທ່ານໄດ້ໄວ ແລະ ດີຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອຖາມຄຳຖາ"
"ມ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Describe your goal**. You want to explain what you are trying to achieve "
"design-wise. If you are having trouble figuring out how to make a solution "
"work, there may be a different, easier solution that accomplishes the same "
"goal."
msgstr ""
"**ອະທິບາຍເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ**. ທ່ານຄວນອະທິບາຍສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃນດ້ານການອອກແບບ. ຫາກທ່າ"
"ນມີບັນຫາໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ວິທີແກ້ໄຂໜຶ່ງເຮັດວຽກ, ອາດຈະມີວິທີອື່ນທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າເພື່ອບັນລຸເປົ້າໝາຍດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:103
msgid ""
"If there is an error involved, **share the exact error message**. You can "
"copy the exact error message in the editor's Debugger bottom panel by "
"clicking the Copy Error icon. Knowing what it says can help community "
"members better identify how you triggered the error."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error), **ໃຫ້ແຊຣ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ**. ທ່ານສາມາດກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ໃນແຖ"
"ບ Debugger ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ການຮູ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກໃນຊຸມຊົນລະບຸສາເຫດໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:108
msgid ""
"If there is code involved, **share a code sample**. Other users won't be "
"able to help you fix a problem without seeing your code. Share the code as "
"text directly. To do so, you can copy and paste a short code snippet in a "
"chat box, or use a website like `Pastebin <https://pastebin.com/>`_ to share "
"long files."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກກ່ຽວກັບໂຄ້ດ, **ໃຫ້ແຊຣ໌ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດ**. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍທ່ານໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ເຫັນໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ແຊຣ໌ໂ"
"ຄ້ດເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍກົງ. ທ່ານສາມາດກັອບປີ້ ແລະ ວາງໂຄ້ດສັ້ນໆ ໃນຊ່ອງແຊັດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເວັບໄຊ ເຊັ່ນ `Pastebin "
"<https://pastebin.com/>`_ ເພື່ອແຊຣ໌ໄຟລ໌ຍາວໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Share a screenshot** of your *Scene* dock along with your written code. "
"Most of the code you write affects nodes in your scenes. As a result, you "
"should think of those scenes as part of your source code."
msgstr ""
"**ແຊຣ໌ພາບໜ້າຈໍ (screenshot)** ຂອງແຖບ *Scene* ພ້ອມກັບໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານ. ໂຄ້ດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ທ່ານຂຽນຈະສົ່"
"ງຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດໃນສາກ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຄວນຖືວ່າສາກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:120
msgid ""
"Also, please don't take a picture with your phone, the low quality and "
"screen reflections can make it hard to understand the image. Your operating "
"system should have a built-in tool to take screenshots with the :kbd:`PrtSc` "
"(Print Screen) key (macOS: use :kbd:`Cmd + Shift + 3` for a full screen "
"shot, `more information here <https://support.apple.com/guide/mac-help/take-"
"a-screenshot-mh26782/mac>`_)."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ກະລຸນາຢ່າຖ່າຍຮູບດ້ວຍມືຖື ເພາະຄຸນນະພາບຕໍ່າ ແລະ ແສງສະທ້ອນຈາກໜ້າຈໍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຍາກ. ລ"
"ະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງທ່ານຄວນມີເຄື່ອງມືໃນຕົວເພື່ອຖ່າຍພາບໜ້າຈໍດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ :kbd:`PrtSc` (macOS: ໃຊ້ "
":kbd:`Cmd + Shift + 3`)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:126
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use a program like `ShareX <https://getsharex.com/>`_ "
"on Windows, or `Flameshot <https://flameshot.org/>`_ on Windows/macOS/Linux."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ ເຊັ່ນ `ShareX <https://getsharex.com/>`_ ໃນ Windows, ຫຼື "
"`Flameshot <https://flameshot.org/>`_ ໃນ Windows/macOS/Linux."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:129
msgid ""
"Sharing a video of your running game can also be really **useful to "
"troubleshoot your game**. You can use programs like `OBS Studio <https://"
"obsproject.com/>`_ and `Screen to GIF <https://www.screentogif.com/>`_ to "
"capture your screen."
msgstr ""
"ການແຊຣ໌ວິດີໂອຂະນະທີ່ເກມກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ກໍ **ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ**. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ ເຊັ່"
"ນ `OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`_ ແລະ `Screen to GIF <https://"
"www.screentogif.com/>`_ ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:134
msgid ""
"You can then use a service like `streamable <https://streamable.com/>`_ or a "
"cloud provider to upload and share your videos for free."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ ເຊັ່ນ `streamable <https://streamable.com/>`_ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລ"
"າວເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດ ແລະ ແຊຣ໌ວິດີໂອຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຟຣີ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:137
msgid ""
"If you're not using the stable version of Godot, please mention the version "
"you're using. The answer can be different as available features and the "
"interface evolve rapidly."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ Godot ເວີຊັນສະເຕໂບ (stable), ກະລຸນາລະບຸເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້. ຄຳຕອບອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ"
"ໄປ ເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີການພັດທະນາຢ່າງໄວວາ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:141
msgid ""
"Following these guidelines will maximize your chances of getting the answer "
"you're looking for. They will save time both for you and the persons helping "
"you."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຕອບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາທັງສຳລັບທ່"
"ານ ແລະ ຜູ້ທີ່ຈະຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:145
msgid "Community tutorials"
msgstr "ບົດຮຽນຈາກຊຸມຊົນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/learning_new_features.rst:147
msgid ""
"This manual aims to provide a comprehensive reference of Godot's features. "
"Aside from the 2D and 3D getting started series, it does not contain "
"tutorials to implement specific game genres. If you're looking for a "
"tutorial about creating a role-playing game, a platformer, or other, please "
"see :ref:`doc_community_tutorials`, which lists content made by the Godot "
"community."
msgstr ""
"ຄູ່ມືນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Godot. ນອກຈາກຊຸດບົດຮຽນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 2D ແ"
"ລະ 3D ແລ້ວ, ມັນບໍ່ມີບົດຮຽນສຳລັບການສ້າງເກມບາງປະເພດໂດຍສະເພາະ. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາບົດຮຽນກ່ຽວກັບ"
"ການສ້າງເກມ RPG, ເກມຜ່ານດ່ານ (platformer) ຫຼື ອື່ນໆ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_community_tutorials` ເຊິ່ງລວບລວມເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:4
msgid "Godot's design philosophy"
msgstr "ປັດຊະຍາການອອກແບບຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:6
msgid "Now that you've gotten your feet wet, let's talk about Godot's design."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານໄດ້ເລີ່ມຄຸ້ນເຄີຍແລ້ວ, ມາເວົ້າກ່ຽວກັບການອອກແບບຂອງ Godot ກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Every game engine is different and fits different needs.** Not only do "
"they offer a range of features, but the design of each engine is unique. "
"This leads to different workflows and different ways to form your games' "
"structures. This all stems from their respective design philosophies."
msgstr ""
"**ເອນຈິນເກມແຕ່ລະອັນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.** ພວກມັນບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ສະເໜີ"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ການອອກແບບຂອງແຕ່ລະເອນຈິນກໍຍັງເປັນເອກະລັກ. ນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽ"
"ກ ແລະ ວິທີການສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງເກມແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປ. ທັງໝົດນີ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກປັດຊະຍາການອອກແບບຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:13
msgid ""
"This page is here to help you understand how Godot works, starting with some "
"of its core pillars. It is not a list of available features, nor is it an "
"engine comparison. To know if any engine can be a good fit for your project, "
"you need to try it out for yourself and understand its design and "
"limitations."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Godot ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກເສົາຫຼັກຂອງມັນ. ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ"
"ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ ກໍບໍ່ແມ່ນການປຽບທຽບເອນຈິນ. ເພື່ອຈະຮູ້ວ່າເອນຈິນໃດເໝາະສົມກັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັ"
"ນຕ້ອງທົດລອງໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໃຈການອອກແບບ ລວມທັງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:19
msgid ""
"Please watch `Godot explained in 7 minutes <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=yS9cuu5o5Ug>`_ if you're looking for an overview of the engine's features."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ `Godot explained in 7 minutes <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=yS9cuu5o5Ug>`_ ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:24
msgid "Object-oriented design and composition"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບແບບເຊີງວັດຖຸ ແລະ ການປະກອບສາກ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:26
msgid ""
"Godot embraces object-oriented design at its core with its flexible scene "
"system and Node hierarchy. It tries to stay away from strict programming "
"patterns to offer an intuitive way to structure your game."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍຶດຖືການອອກແບບແບບເຊີງວັດຖຸ (Object-oriented design) ເປັນຫຼັກ ດ້ວຍລະບົບສາກທີ່ຍືດຍຸ່ນ ແລ"
"ະ ລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂນດ. ມັນພະຍາຍາມຫຼີກລ່ຽງຮູບແບບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດ ເພື່ອສະເໜີວິທີການຈັດໂຄງສ້າງເກ"
"ມທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:30
msgid ""
"For one, Godot lets you **compose or aggregate** scenes. It's like nested "
"prefabs: you can create a BlinkingLight scene and a BrokenLantern scene that "
"uses the BlinkingLight. Then, create a city filled with BrokenLanterns. "
"Change the BlinkingLight's color, save, and all the BrokenLanterns in the "
"city will update instantly."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື Godot ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ **ປະກອບ (compose)** ສາກເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ມັນຄືກັບການຊ້ອນ prefab: ທ່"
"ານສາມາດສ້າງສາກ BlinkingLight (ໄຟກະພິບ) ແລະ ສາກ BrokenLantern (ໂຄມໄຟທີ່ເພ) ເຊິ່ງນຳໃ"
"ຊ້ BlinkingLight ນັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ສ້າງເມືອງທີ່ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍ BrokenLanterns. ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນສີຂອງ "
"BlinkingLight ແລ້ວບັນທຶກ, BrokenLanterns ທັງໝົດໃນເມືອງກໍຈະຖືກອັບເດດທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:37
msgid "On top of that, you can **inherit** from any scene."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ **ສືບທອດ (inherit)** ຈາກສາກໃດກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:39
msgid ""
"A Godot scene could be a Weapon, a Character, an Item, a Door, a Level, part "
"of a level… anything you'd like. It works like a class in pure code, except "
"you're free to design it by using the editor, using only the code, or mixing "
"and matching the two."
msgstr ""
"ສາກຂອງ Godot ອາດຈະເປັນ ອາວຸດ, ຕົວລະຄອນ, ໄອເທັມ, ປະຕູ, ດ່ານ, ຫຼື ສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງດ່ານ... ສິ່ງໃດ"
"ກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບຄລາສໃນການຂຽນໂຄ້ດ, ແຕ່ທ່ານມີອິດສະຫຼະໃນການອອກແບບໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ, ໃຊ້ແຕ່ໂໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ປະສົມປະສານທັງສອງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/godot_design_philosophy.rst:44
msgid ""
"It's different from prefabs you find in several 3D engines, as you can then "
"inherit from and extend those scenes. You may create a Magician that extends "
"your Character. Modify the Character in the editor and the Magician will "
"update as well. It helps you build your projects so that their structure "
"matches the game's design."
msgstr ""
"ມັນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ prefab ທີ່ພົບໃນເອນຈິນ 3 ມິຕິອື່ນໆ, ເພາະທ່ານສາມາດສືບທອດ ແລະ ຕໍ່ຍອດສາກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະສ້າງ Magician (ນັກມາຍາກົນ) ທີ່ຕໍ່ຍອດມາຈາກ Character. ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂ Character ໃນຕົວແ"
"ກ້ໄຂ, Magician ກໍຈະຖືກອັບເດດຄືກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໂຄງການໂດຍໃຫ້ໂຄງສ້າງສອດຄ່ອງກັບການອອກແບບ"
"ເກມ."

