msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງໂຄງການທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວໄດ້ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"`Dodge the Creeps source code (GDScript) <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__"
msgstr ""
"`ຊອດໂຄ້ດ (Source code) Dodge the Creeps (GDScript) <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__"

