#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"This step-by-step tutorial is intended for beginners who followed the "
"complete :ref:`doc_step_by_step`."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຮຽນແບບເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕາມບົດຮຽນ :ref:`doc_step_by_step` ມາແລ້"
"ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you're an experienced programmer, you can find the complete demo's source "
"code here: `Dodge the Creeps source code <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເປັນນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ມີປະສົບການແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສົມບູນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: `ຊອດໂຄ້"
"ດ Dodge the Creeps <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:58
msgid ""
"We prepared some game assets you'll need to download so we can jump straight "
"to the code."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ກຽມຊັບພະຍາກອນ (assets) ບາງຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຂ້າມໄປຂຽນໂຄ້ດ"
"ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:61
msgid "You can download them by clicking the link below."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:63
