msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:4
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:28
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:22
msgid "Setting up the project"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:6
msgid "In this short first part, we'll set up and organize the project."
msgstr "ໃນພາກທຳອິດສັ້ນໆນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຈັດລະບຽບໂຄງການ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:8
msgid "Launch Godot and create a new project."
msgstr "ເປີດ Godot ແລະ ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:12
msgid ""
"When creating the new project, you only need to choose a valid *Project "
"Path*. You can leave the other default settings alone."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່, ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງເລືອກ *Project Path* ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະຄ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອື່"
"ນໆໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:17
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:24
msgid ""
"Download `dodge_the_creeps_2d_assets.zip <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"dodge_the_creeps_2d_assets.zip>`_. The archive contains the images and "
"sounds you'll be using to make the game. Extract the archive and move the "
"``art/`` and ``fonts/`` directories to your project's directory."
msgstr ""
"ດາວໂຫຼດ `dodge_the_creeps_2d_assets.zip <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"dodge_the_creeps_2d_assets.zip>`_. ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດນີ້ບັນຈຸຮູບພາບ ແລະ ສຽງທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງເກ"
"ມ. ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ ແລະ ຍ້າຍໂຟນເດີ ``art/`` ແລະ ``fonts/`` ໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:29
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have the required dependencies to use C# in Godot. You need "
"the latest stable .NET SDK, and an editor such as VS Code. "
"See :ref:`doc_c_sharp_setup`."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າມີສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການໃຊ້ C# ໃນ Godot. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ .NET SDK ເວີຊັນທີ່"
"ໝັ້ນຄົງລ້າສຸດ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືຂຽນໂຄ້ດ ເຊັ່ນ VS Code. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_c_sharp_setup`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:33
#: ../../docs/tutorials/performance/cpu_optimization.rst:195
msgid "C++"
msgstr "C++"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:35
msgid ""
"The C++ part of this tutorial wasn't rewritten for the new GDExtension "
"system yet."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອໃນພາກ C++ ຂອງບົດຮຽນນີ້ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນຄືນໃໝ່ສຳລັບລະບົບ GDExtension ໃໝ່ເທື່ອ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:37
msgid "Your project folder should look like this."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:41
msgid ""
"This game is designed for portrait mode, so we need to adjust the size of "
"the game window. Click on *Project -> Project Settings* to open the project "
"settings window, in the left column open the *Display -> Window* tab. There, "
"set \"Viewport Width\" to ``480`` and \"Viewport Height\" to ``720``. You "
"can see the \"Project\" menu on the upper left corner."
msgstr ""
"ເກມນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບແນວຕັ້ງ (portrait mode), ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງປັບຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ. ຄ"
"ລິກທີ່ *Project -> Project Settings* ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ, ໃນຖັນເບື້ອງຊ້າຍໃຫ້ເປີດແ"
"ຖບ *Display -> Window*. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Viewport Width\" ເປັນ ``480`` ແລະ "
"\"Viewport Height\" ເປັນ ``720``. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນເມນູ \"Project\" ໄດ້ທີ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:49
msgid ""
"Also, under the **Stretch** options, set **Mode** to ``canvas_items`` and "
"**Aspect** to ``keep``. This ensures that the game scales consistently on "
"different sized screens."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ພາຍໃຕ້ຕົວເລືອກ **Stretch**, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Mode** ເປັນ ``canvas_items`` ແລະ "
"**Aspect** ເປັນ ``keep``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເກມປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມສ່ວນໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຂະໜາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:55
msgid "Organizing the project"
msgstr "ການຈັດລະບຽບໂຄງການ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:57
msgid ""
"In this project, we will make 3 independent scenes: ``Player``, ``Mob``, and "
"``HUD``, which we will combine into the game's ``Main`` scene."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຄງການນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ 3 ຊີນ (scenes) ທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຕໍ່ກັນ ຄື: ``Player``, ``Mob``, ແລ"
"ະ ``HUD``, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະນຳມາລວມກັນໃນຊີນ ``Main`` ຂອງເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:60
msgid ""
"In a larger project, it might be useful to create folders to hold the "
"various scenes and their scripts, but for this relatively small game, you "
"can save your scenes and scripts in the project's root folder, identified by "
"``res://``. You can see your project folders in the FileSystem dock in the "
"lower left corner:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ, ການສ້າງໂຟນເດີເພື່ອເກັບຊີນ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບຕ່າງໆ ອາດຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບເກມທີ່"
"ມີຂະໜາດຂ້ອນຂ້າງນ້ອຍນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັນທຶກຊີນ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບຂອງເຈົ້າໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂຄງການ ເຊິ່ງລະບຸດ້ວ"
"ຍ ``res://``. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນໂຟນເດີໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ FileSystem ທີ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/01.project_setup.rst:67
msgid ""
"With the project in place, we're ready to design the player scene in the "
"next lesson."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະອອກແບບຊີນຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໃນບົດຮຽນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:4
msgid "Creating the player scene"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຊີນຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ (Player scene)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:6
msgid ""
"With the project settings in place, we can start working on the player-"
"controlled character."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກັບຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:9
msgid ""
"The first scene will define the ``Player`` object. One of the benefits of "
"creating a separate Player scene is that we can test it separately, even "
"before we've created other parts of the game."
msgstr ""
"ຊີນທຳອິດຈະກຳນົດວັດຖຸ ``Player``. ປະໂຫຍດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຂອງການສ້າງຊີນຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກແມ່ນພວກເຮົາສາມາດທົ"
"ດສອບມັນໄດ້ແຍກກັນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ສ້າງສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງເກມເທື່ອກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:14
msgid "Node structure"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງໂນດ (Node structure)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:16
msgid ""
"To begin, we need to choose a root node for the player object. As a general "
"rule, a scene's root node should reflect the object's desired functionality "
"- what the object *is*. In the upper-left corner, in the \"Scene\" tab, "
"click the \"Other Node\" button and add an :ref:`Area2D <class_Area2D>` node "
"to the scene."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເລືອກໂນດຫຼັກ (root node) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ຕາມກົດທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ໂນດຫຼັກຂອງຊີນ"
"ຄວນສະທ້ອນເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນ - ວ່າວັດຖຸນັ້ນ *ແມ່ນຫຍັງ*. ທີ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ, ໃນແຖບ "
"\"Scene\", ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Other Node\" ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດ :ref:`Area2D <class_Area2D>` ເຂົ້າ"
"ໄປໃນຊີນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:23
msgid ""
"Godot also provides the :ref:`CharacterBody2D <class_CharacterBody2D>` node, "
"specifically designed for 2D characters, which includes built-in support for "
"some of the processes explained in this tutorial. In many real world "
"projects, CharacterBody2D would be a better choice for players and enemies. "
"However, this tutorial focuses on core concepts that apply to a wider range "
"of nodes and use cases."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍັງມີໂນດ :ref:`CharacterBody2D <class_CharacterBody2D>` ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາສະເພາະ"
"ສຳລັບຕົວລະຄອນ 2 ມິຕິ, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນຂະບວນການບາງຢ່າງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນບົດຮຽນນີ້. ໃນຫຼາຍໆໂຄງກ"
"ານຕົວຈິງ, CharacterBody2D ອາດຈະເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີກວ່າສຳລັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ສັດຕູ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ບົດຮຽນ"
"ນີ້ຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ແນວຄວາມຄິດຫຼັກທີ່ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບໂນດ ແລະ ກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:31
msgid ""
"When you add the ``Area2D`` node, Godot will display the following **warning "
"icon** next to it in the scene tree:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມໂນດ ``Area2D``, Godot ຈະສະແດງ **ໄອຄອນຄຳເຕືອນ** ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆມັນໃນລາຍການຊີນ "
"(scene tree):"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:36
msgid ""
"This warning tells us that the ``Area2D`` node requires a shape to detect "
"collisions or overlaps. We can **ignore the warning temporarily** because we "
"will first set up the player's visuals (using an animated sprite). Once the "
"visuals are ready, we will add a collision shape as a child node. This will "
"allow us to accurately size and position the shape based on the sprite's "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳເຕືອນນີ້ບອກພວກເຮົາວ່າໂນດ ``Area2D`` ຕ້ອງການຮູບຊົງ (shape) ເພື່ອກວດຈັບການຕຳ "
"(collision) ຫຼື ການຊ້ອນທັບ (overlap). ພວກເຮົາສາມາດ **ເມີນເສີຍຄຳເຕືອນນີ້ໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ** ເພາະວ່າ"
"ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກ່ອນ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ animated sprite). ເມື່ອຮູບລັກສະນະພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ພວກ"
"ເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມຮູບຊົງການຕຳເປັນໂນດລູກ (child node). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອ"
"ງຮູບຊົງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງສະໄປຣ໌."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:42
msgid ""
"With ``Area2D`` we can detect objects that overlap or run into the player. "
"Change the node's name to ``Player`` by double-clicking on it. Now that "
"we've set the scene's root node, we can add additional nodes to give it more "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍ ``Area2D`` ພວກເຮົາສາມາດກວດຈັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບ ຫຼື ແລ່ນມາຕຳຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້. ປ່ຽນຊື່ຂອງໂນດເປັນ "
"``Player`` ໂດຍການດັບເບິ້ລຄລິກໃສ່ມັນ. ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງໂນດຫຼັກຂອງຊີນຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເພີ່ມ"
"ໂນດເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນມີຄວາມສາມາດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:47
msgid ""
"Before we add any children to the ``Player`` node, we want to make sure we "
"don't accidentally move or resize them by clicking on them. Select the node "
"and click the icon to the right of the lock. Its tooltip says \"Groups the "
"selected node with its children. This causes the parent to be selected when "
"any child node is clicked in 2D and 3D view.\""
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມໂນດລູກໃດໆໃຫ້ກັບໂນດ ``Player``, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ໄປເຄື່ອ"
"ນຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດພວກມັນໂດຍບັງເອີນເມື່ອຄລິກໃສ່. ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດນັ້ນແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຮູບແມ່"
"ກະແຈ. ຄຳແນະນຳຂອງມັນບອກວ່າ \"Groups the selected node with its children. This "
"causes the parent to be selected when any child node is clicked in 2D and 3D "
"view.\""

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:55
msgid ""
"Save the scene as ``player.tscn``. Click **Scene > Save**, or "
"press :kbd:`Ctrl + S` on Windows/Linux or :kbd:`Cmd + S` on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກຊີນເປັນ ``player.tscn``. ຄລິກ **Scene > Save**, ຫຼື ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + S` ເທິງ "
"Windows/Linux ຫຼື :kbd:`Cmd + S` ເທິງ macOS."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:71
msgid "Sprite animation"
msgstr "ແອນິເມຊັນຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ (Sprite animation)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:73
msgid ""
"Click on the ``Player`` node and add (:kbd:`Ctrl + A` on Windows/Linux "
"or :kbd:`Cmd + A` on macOS) a child node :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D "
"<class_AnimatedSprite2D>`. The ``AnimatedSprite2D`` will handle the "
"appearance and animations for our player. Notice that there is a warning "
"symbol next to the node. An ``AnimatedSprite2D`` requires "
"a :ref:`SpriteFrames <class_SpriteFrames>` resource, which is a list of the "
"animations it can display. Make sure ``AnimatedSprite2D`` is selected and "
"then find the ``Sprite Frames`` property under the ``Animation`` section in "
"the Inspector and click \"[empty]\" -> \"New SpriteFrames\":"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ໂນດ ``Player`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ (:kbd:`Ctrl + A` ເທິງ Windows/Linux ຫຼື :kbd:`Cmd + "
"A` ເທິງ macOS) ໂນດລູກ :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>`. "
"``AnimatedSprite2D`` ຈະຈັດການເລື່ອງຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ແອນິເມຊັນສຳລັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ສັງເກດເຫັ"
"ນວ່າມີສັນຍະລັກຄຳເຕືອນຢູ່ຂ້າງໆໂນດ. ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
":ref:`SpriteFrames <class_SpriteFrames>`, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນລາຍການຂອງແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ມັນສາມາດສະແດງ"
"ໄດ້. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ແລ້ວ ຈາກນັ້ນຊອກຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Sprite "
"Frames`` ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ ``Animation`` ໃນ Inspector ແລ້ວຄລິກ \"[empty]\" -> \"New "
"SpriteFrames\":"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:84
msgid ""
"Click on the ``SpriteFrames`` you just created to open the \"SpriteFrames\" "
"panel:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ ``SpriteFrames`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າຫາກໍ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເປີດແຜງ \"SpriteFrames\":"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:88
msgid ""
"On the left is a list of animations. Click the ``default`` one and rename it "
"to ``walk``. Then click the **Add Animation** button to create a second "
"animation named ``up``."
msgstr ""
"ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍແມ່ນລາຍການຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ. ຄລິກທີ່ອັນທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``default`` ແລ້ວປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ ``walk``. ຈາກ"
"ນັ້ນຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Add Animation** ເພື່ອສ້າງແອນິເມຊັນທີສອງທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``up``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:92
msgid ""
"Find the player images in the FileSystem dock - they're in the ``art`` "
"folder you unzipped earlier. Drag the two images for each animation, into "
"the **Animation Frames** side of the panel for the corresponding animation:"
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຮູບພາບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ FileSystem - ພວກມັນຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``art`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກມາກ່ອນໜ້"
"ານີ້. ລາກຮູບພາບທັງສອງຮູບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແອນິເມຊັນ ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສ່ວນ **Animation Frames** ຂອງແຜງສຳລັບ"
"ແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:96
msgid ""
"``playerGrey_walk1`` and ``playerGrey_walk2`` for the ``walk`` animation"
msgstr "``playerGrey_walk1`` ແລະ ``playerGrey_walk2`` ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ ``walk``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:97
msgid "``playerGrey_up1`` and ``playerGrey_up2`` for the ``up`` animation"
msgstr "``playerGrey_up1`` ແລະ ``playerGrey_up2`` ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ ``up``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:101
msgid ""
"The player images are a bit too large for the game window, so we need to "
"scale them down. Click on the ``AnimatedSprite2D`` node and set the "
"``Scale`` property to ``(0.5, 0.5)``. You can find it in the Inspector under "
"the ``Node2D`` heading."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປເລັກນ້ອຍສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງປັບຂະໜາດພວກມັນລົງ. ຄລິກທີ່"
"ໂນດ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Scale`` ເປັນ ``(0.5, 0.5)``. ເຈົ້າສາມາ"
"ດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໃນ Inspector ພາຍໃຕ້ຫົວຂໍ້ ``Node2D``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:108
msgid ""
"Finally, add a :ref:`CollisionShape2D <class_CollisionShape2D>` as a child "
"of ``Player``. This will determine the player's \"hitbox\", or the bounds of "
"its collision area. For this character, a ``CapsuleShape2D`` node gives the "
"best fit, so next to \"Shape\" in the Inspector, click \"[empty]\" -> \"New "
"CapsuleShape2D\". Using the two size handles, resize the shape to cover the "
"sprite:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເພີ່ມ :ref:`CollisionShape2D <class_CollisionShape2D>` ເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງ "
"``Player``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດ \"hitbox\" ຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ຫຼື ຂອບເຂດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ການຕຳ. ສຳລັບຕົວລະຄອນນີ້, ໂ"
"ນດ ``CapsuleShape2D`` ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ \"Shape\" ໃນ Inspector, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ "
"\"[empty]\" -> \"New CapsuleShape2D\". ໃຊ້ຈຸດປັບຂະໜາດທັງສອງ, ປັບຂະໜາດຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກວມເອົາສ"
"ະໄປຣ໌:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:117
msgid "When you're finished, your ``Player`` scene should look like this:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຊີນ ``Player`` ຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:121
msgid ""
"Once this is done, the warning on the ``Area2D`` node will disappear, as it "
"now has a shape assigned and can interact with other objects."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຄຳເຕືອນໃນໂນດ ``Area2D`` ຈະຫາຍໄປ, ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າມັນໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດຮູ"
"ບຊົງແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດຕອບໂຕ້ກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນໆໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:124
msgid "Make sure to save the scene again after these changes."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມບັນທຶກຊີນອີກຄັ້ງຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:126
msgid ""
"In the next part, we'll add a script to the player node to move and animate "
"it. Then, we'll set up collision detection to know when the player got hit "
"by something."
msgstr ""
"ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ກັບໂນດຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ມີແອນິເມຊັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈ"
"ະຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດຈັບການຕຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າເມື່ອໃດຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຖືກຕຳໂດຍບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:4
msgid "Coding the player"
msgstr "ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this lesson, we'll add player movement, animation, and set it up to "
"detect collisions."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບົດຮຽນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ແອນິເມຊັນຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນກວດຈັບການຕຳໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:9
msgid ""
"To do so, we need to add some functionality that we can't get from a built-"
"in node, so we'll add a script. Click the ``Player`` node and click the "
"\"Attach Script\" button:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໂນດມາດຕະຖານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມສະຄ"
"ຣິບ. ຄລິກທີ່ໂນດ ``Player`` ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Attach Script\":"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:15
msgid ""
"In the script settings window, you can leave the default settings alone. "
"Just click \"Create\":"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຄຣິບ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້ໄດ້ເລີຍ. ພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກ \"Create\":"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you're creating a C# script or other languages, select the language from "
"the `language` drop down menu before hitting create."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງສ້າງສະຄຣິບ C# ຫຼື ພາສາອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພາສາຈາກເມນູ `language` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກົດສ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:23
msgid ""
"If this is your first time encountering GDScript, please "
"read :ref:`doc_scripting` before continuing."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກນີ້ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮູ້ຈັກກັບ GDScript, ກະລຸນາອ່ານ :ref:`doc_scripting` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນກ"
"ານຕໍ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:26
msgid "Start by declaring the member variables this object will need:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນ (member variables) ທີ່ວັດຖຸນີ້ນຳໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:48
msgid ""
"Using the ``export`` keyword on the first variable ``speed`` allows us to "
"set its value in the Inspector. This can be handy for values that you want "
"to be able to adjust just like a node's built-in properties. Click on the "
"``Player`` node and you'll see the property now appears in the Inspector in "
"a new section with the name of the script. Remember, if you change the value "
"here, it will override the default value specified in the script (the script "
"won't be modified)."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັບ ``export`` (ຫຼື ``@export`` ໃນ Godot 4) ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທຳອິດ ``speed`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້"
"ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນໄດ້ໃນ Inspector. ສິ່ງນີ້ສະດວກຫຼາຍສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບຄຸນ"
"ສົມບັດພື້ນຖານຂອງໂນດ. ຄລິກທີ່ໂນດ ``Player`` ແລ້ວເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນ Inspector ໃນສ່"
"ວນໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຊື່ຕາມສະຄຣິບ. ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ, ຫາກເຈົ້າປ່ຽນຄ່າຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ມັນຈະໄປຂຽນທັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສະຄຣິບ (ແ"
"ຕ່ຕົວສະຄຣິບຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:57
msgid ""
"If you're using C#, you need to (re)build the project assemblies whenever "
"you want to see new export variables or signals. This build can be manually "
"triggered by clicking the **Build** button at the top right of the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ C#, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງ (re)build ໂຄງການທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຫັນຕົວປ່ຽນ export ຫຼື ສັນຍານ "
"(signals) ໃໝ່. ການ build ນີ້ສາມາດກົດເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Build** ທີ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງ "
"editor."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:66
msgid ""
"Your ``player.gd`` script should already contain a ``_ready()`` and a "
"``_process()`` function. If you didn't select the default template shown "
"above, create these functions while following the lesson."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບ ``player.gd`` ຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນມີຟັງຊັນ ``_ready()`` ແລະ ``_process()`` ຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກເ"
"ຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກແມ່ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສະແດງໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕາມບົດຮຽນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:71
msgid ""
"The ``_ready()`` function is called when a node enters the scene tree, which "
"is a good time to find the size of the game window:"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``_ready()`` ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂນດເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree, ເຊິ່ງເປັນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນການຫາຂະໜ"
"າດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:87
msgid ""
"Now we can use the ``_process()`` function to define what the player will "
"do. ``_process()`` is called every frame, so we'll use it to update elements "
"of our game, which we expect will change often. For the player, we need to "
"do the following:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``_process()`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຈະເຮັດຫຍັງ. ``_process()`` ຈະຖື"
"ກຮຽກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ (frame), ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອອັບເດດອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆຂອງເກມທີ່ພວກເຮົາຄາດວ່"
"າຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງເລື້ອຍໆ. ສຳລັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຮັດສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:92
msgid "Check for input."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ (input)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:93
msgid "Move in the given direction."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:94
msgid "Play the appropriate animation."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:96
msgid ""
"First, we need to check for input - is the player pressing a key? For this "
"game, we have 4 direction inputs to check. Input actions are defined in the "
"Project Settings under \"Input Map\". Here, you can define custom events and "
"assign different keys, mouse events, or other inputs to them. For this game, "
"we will map the arrow keys to the four directions."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກວດສອບການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ - ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່? ສຳລັບເກມນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີ 4 ທິດທາງທີ່ຕ້ອ"
"ງກວດສອບ. Input actions ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ Project Settings ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Input Map\". ບ່ອນ"
"ນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດເຫດການທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ ແລະ ກຳນົດປຸ່ມກົດຕ່າງໆ, ເຫດການຂອງເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆໃຫ້ກັບພວ"
"ກມັນໄດ້. ສຳລັບເກມນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດປຸ່ມລູກສອນໃຫ້ກັບທັງສີ່ທິດທາງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:102
msgid ""
"Click on *Project -> Project Settings* to open the project settings window "
"and click on the *Input Map* tab at the top. Type \"move_right\" in the top "
"bar and click the \"Add\" button to add the ``move_right`` action."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ *Project -> Project Settings* ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ "
"*Input Map* ທາງດ້ານເທິງ. ພິມ \"move_right\" ໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Add\" ເພື່ອເພີ່"
"ມ action ``move_right``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:108
msgid ""
"We need to assign a key to this action. Click the \"+\" icon on the right, "
"to open the event manager window."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກຳນົດປຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບ action ນີ້. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ \"+\" ທາງດ້ານຂວາ ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງຈັດການເຫດກາ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:113
msgid ""
"The \"Listening for Input...\" field should automatically be selected. Press "
"the \"right\" key on your keyboard, and the menu should look like this now."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງ \"Listening for Input...\" ຄວນຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ \"ລູກສອນຂວາ\" ເທິ"
"ງຄີບອດຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ ເມນູຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:118
msgid ""
"Select the \"ok\" button. The \"right\" key is now associated with the "
"``move_right`` action."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກປຸ່ມ \"ok\". ຕອນນີ້ປຸ່ມ \"ລູກສອນຂວາ\" ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ action ``move_right`` ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:120
msgid "Repeat these steps to add three more mappings:"
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການເຊື່ອມໂຍງອີກສາມຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:122
msgid "``move_left`` mapped to the left arrow key."
msgstr "``move_left`` ເຊື່ອມກັບປຸ່ມລູກສອນຊ້າຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:123
msgid "``move_up`` mapped to the up arrow key."
msgstr "``move_up`` ເຊື່ອມກັບປຸ່ມລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:124
msgid "And ``move_down`` mapped to the down arrow key."
msgstr "ແລະ ``move_down`` ເຊື່ອມກັບປຸ່ມລູກສອນລົງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:126
msgid "Your input map tab should look like this:"
msgstr "ແຖບ input map ຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:130
msgid "Click the \"Close\" button to close the project settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Close\" ເພື່ອປິດໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:134
msgid ""
"We only mapped one key to each input action, but you can map multiple keys, "
"joystick buttons, or mouse buttons to the same input action."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ກຳນົດພຽງແຕ່ປຸ່ມດຽວໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະ action, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຫຼາຍປຸ່ມ, ປຸ່ມຈອຍສະຕິກ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມເມົາ"
"ສ໌ໃຫ້ກັບ input action ດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:137
msgid ""
"You can detect whether a key is pressed using ``Input.is_action_pressed()``, "
"which returns ``true`` if it's pressed or ``false`` if it isn't."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມຖືກກົດຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``Input.is_action_pressed()``, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"``true`` ຫາກຖືກກົດ ຫຼື ``false`` ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກົດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:199
msgid ""
"We start by setting the ``velocity`` to ``(0, 0)`` - by default, the player "
"should not be moving. Then we check each input and add/subtract from the "
"``velocity`` to obtain a total direction. For example, if you hold ``right`` "
"and ``down`` at the same time, the resulting ``velocity`` vector will be "
"``(1, 1)``. In this case, since we're adding a horizontal and a vertical "
"movement, the player would move *faster* diagonally than if it just moved "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``velocity`` (ຄວາມໄວ) ເປັນ ``(0, 0)`` - ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຄວນ"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່. ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາກວດສອບແຕ່ລະ input ແລະ ບວກ/ລົບ ຈາກ ``velocity`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້"
"ທິດທາງລວມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກເຈົ້າກົດປຸ່ມ ``ຂວາ`` ແລະ ``ລົງ`` ພ້ອມກັນ, ເວກເຕີ (vector) ຂອງ "
"``velocity`` ຈະເປັນ ``(1, 1)``. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາບວກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທັງແນວນອນ ແລ"
"ະ ແນວຕັ້ງເຂົ້າກັນ, ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ *ໄວກວ່າ* ໃນແນວສະຫຼຽງ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ພຽງແຕ່ແນວນອນຢ່າງດຽ"
"ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:206
msgid ""
"We can prevent that if we *normalize* the velocity, which means we set its "
"*length* to ``1``, then multiply by the desired speed. This means no more "
"fast diagonal movement."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາສາມາດປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການ *normalize* ຄວາມໄວ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງຄ່າ *ຄວາມ"
"ຍາວ* ຂອງມັນໃຫ້ເປັນ ``1``, ແລ້ວຄູນດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແນວສະຫຼຽງທີ່ໄວ"
"ເກີນໄປອີກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:210
msgid ""
"If you've never used vector math before, or need a refresher, you can see an "
"explanation of vector usage in Godot at :ref:`doc_vector_math`. It's good to "
"know but won't be necessary for the rest of this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ຄະນິດສາດເວກເຕີມາກ່ອນ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການທົບທວນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ເວກ"
"ເຕີໃນ Godot ໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_vector_math`. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ດີທີ່ຄວນຮູ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງບົ"
"ດຮຽນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:214
msgid ""
"We also check whether the player is moving so we can call ``play()`` or "
"``stop()`` on the AnimatedSprite2D."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງກວດສອບນຳວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ ``play()`` ຫຼື ``stop()"
"`` ໃນ AnimatedSprite2D."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:217
msgid ""
"``$`` is shorthand for ``get_node()``. So in the code above, "
"``$AnimatedSprite2D.play()`` is the same as "
"``get_node(\"AnimatedSprite2D\").play()``."
msgstr ""
"``$`` ແມ່ນຕົວຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບ ``get_node()``. ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃນໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງ, ``$AnimatedSprite2D.play()"
"`` ກໍຄືກັນກັບ ``get_node(\"AnimatedSprite2D\").play()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:221
msgid ""
"In GDScript, ``$`` returns the node at the relative path from the current "
"node, or returns ``null`` if the node is not found. Since AnimatedSprite2D "
"is a child of the current node, we can use ``$AnimatedSprite2D``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ GDScript, ``$`` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈາກໂນດປັດຈຸບັນ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄ່າ ``null`` ຫາກບໍ່"
"ພົບໂນດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ AnimatedSprite2D ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດປັດຈຸບັນ, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"``$AnimatedSprite2D`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:226
msgid ""
"Now that we have a movement direction, we can update the player's position. "
"We can also use ``clamp()`` to prevent it from leaving the screen. "
"*Clamping* a value means restricting it to a given range. Add the following "
"to the bottom of the ``_process`` function (make sure it's not indented "
"under the `else`):"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາມີທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດອັບເດດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"``clamp()`` ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍ. ການ *Clamping* ຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງໝາຍເຖິງການຈຳກັດຄ່າ"
"ນັ້ນໄວ້ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງຟັງຊັນ ``_process`` (ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຫຍໍ້ໜ້"
"າຢູ່ກຸ່ມດຽວກັບ `else`):"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:245
msgid ""
"The `delta` parameter in the `_process()` function refers to the *frame "
"length* - the amount of time that the previous frame took to complete. Using "
"this value ensures that your movement will remain consistent even if the "
"frame rate changes."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແປ `delta` ໃນຟັງຊັນ `_process()` ໝາຍເຖິງ *ໄລຍະເວລາຂອງເຟຣມ* - ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ເຟ"
"ຣມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃຊ້ໃນການເຮັດວຽກຈົນສຳເລັດ. ການໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງເຈົ້າຄົງທີ່ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອັດຕາເຟ"
"ຣມ (frame rate) ຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:250
msgid ""
"Click \"Run Current Scene\" (:kbd:`F6`, :kbd:`Cmd + R` on macOS) and confirm "
"you can move the player around the screen in all directions."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ \"Run Current Scene\" (:kbd:`F6`, :kbd:`Cmd + R` ເທິງ macOS) ແລະ ຢືນຢັນວ່າເຈົ້າ"
"ສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄປມາໄດ້ທົ່ວໜ້າຈໍໃນທຸກທິດທາງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:253
msgid "If you get an error in the \"Debugger\" panel that says"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນແຜງ \"Debugger\" ທີ່ບອກວ່າ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:255
msgid ""
"``Attempt to call function 'play' in base 'null instance' on a null "
"instance``"
msgstr ""
"``Attempt to call function 'play' in base 'null instance' on a null "
"instance``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:258
msgid ""
"this likely means you spelled the name of the AnimatedSprite2D node wrong. "
"Node names are case-sensitive and ``$NodeName`` must match the name you see "
"in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າພິມຊື່ໂນດ AnimatedSprite2D ຜິດ. ຊື່ໂນດນັ້ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອ"
"ນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ນ້ອຍ (case-sensitive) ແລະ ``$NodeName`` ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ທີ່ເຈົ້າເຫັນໃນ scene tree."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:263
msgid "Choosing animations"
msgstr "ການເລືອກແອນິເມຊັນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:265
msgid ""
"Now that the player can move, we need to change which animation the "
"AnimatedSprite2D is playing based on its direction. We have the \"walk\" "
"animation, which shows the player walking to the right. This animation "
"should be flipped horizontally using the ``flip_h`` property for left "
"movement. We also have the \"up\" animation, which should be flipped "
"vertically with ``flip_v`` for downward movement. Let's place this code at "
"the end of the ``_process()`` function:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ AnimatedSprite2D ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຕາມທິດທາງຂອງມັ"
"ນ. ພວກເຮົາມີແອນິເມຊັນ \"walk\", ເຊິ່ງສະແດງພາບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຍ່າງໄປທາງຂວາ. ແອນິເມຊັນນີ້ຄວນຖືກພິກທາງແນວນ"
"ອນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``flip_h`` ສຳລັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປທາງຊ້າຍ. ພວກເຮົາຍັງມີແອນິເມຊັນ \"up\", ເຊິ່ງຄວ"
"ນຖືກພິກທາງແນວຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ ``flip_v`` ສຳລັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ລົງລຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ວາງໂຄ້ດນີ້ໄວ້ທີ່ທ້າຍຟັງຊັນ ``_process"
"()``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:299
msgid ""
"The boolean assignments in the code above are a common shorthand for "
"programmers. Since we're doing a comparison test (boolean) and also "
"*assigning* a boolean value, we can do both at the same time. Consider this "
"code versus the one-line boolean assignment above:"
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບບູລີນ (boolean assignments) ໃນໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນແມ່ນຕົວຫຍໍ້ທີ່ນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມມັກໃຊ້. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາກຳລັງທົດສອບການປຽບທຽບ (boolean) ແລະ ຍັງ *ກຳນົດ* ຄ່າບູລີນໄປພ້ອມໆກັນ, ພວກເຮົາ"
"ສາມາດເຮັດທັງສອງຢ່າງໄດ້ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ລອງພິຈາລະນາໂຄ້ດນີ້ປຽບທຽບກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າບູລີນແບບແຖວດຽວຂ້າງ"
"ເທິງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:323
msgid ""
"Play the scene again and check that the animations are correct in each of "
"the directions."
msgstr "ລອງຫຼິ້ນຊີນອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າແອນິເມຊັນຖືກຕ້ອງໃນແຕ່ລະທິດທາງຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:326
msgid ""
"A common mistake here is to type the names of the animations wrong. The "
"animation names in the SpriteFrames panel must match what you type in the "
"code. If you named the animation ``\"Walk\"``, you must also use a capital "
"\"W\" in the code."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນການພິມຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນຜິດ. ຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນໃນແຜງ SpriteFrames ຕ້ອງກົງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າພິມໃນ"
"ໂຄ້ດ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນວ່າ ``\"Walk\"``, ເຈົ້າກໍຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ \"W\" ໃຫຍ່ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:331
msgid ""
"When you're sure the movement is working correctly, add this line to "
"``_ready()``, so the player will be hidden when the game starts:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນ ``_ready()`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຖືກ"
"ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ເມື່ອເກມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:344
msgid "Preparing for collisions"
msgstr "ການກຽມພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕຳ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:346
msgid ""
"We want ``Player`` to detect when it's hit by an enemy, but we haven't made "
"any enemies yet! That's OK, because we're going to use Godot's *signal* "
"functionality to make it work."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ ``Player`` ກວດຈັບໄດ້ເມື່ອຖືກສັດຕູຕຳ, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງສັດຕູເທື່ອ! ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັ"
"ງ, ເພາະວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສາມາດ *ສັນຍານ* (signal) ຂອງ Godot ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:350
msgid ""
"Add the following at the top of the script. If you're using GDScript, add it "
"after ``extends Area2D``. If you're using C#, add it after ``public partial "
"class Player : Area2D``:"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງສະຄຣິບ. ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ GDScript, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນຫຼັງຈາກ ``extends "
"Area2D``. ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ C#, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນຫຼັງຈາກ ``public partial class Player : Area2D``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:365
msgid ""
"This defines a custom signal called \"hit\" that we will have our player "
"emit (send out) when it collides with an enemy. We will use ``Area2D`` to "
"detect the collision. Select the ``Player`` node and click the :ui:`Signals` "
"tab next to the Inspector tab to see the list of signals the player can emit:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ກຳນົດສັນຍານທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ \"hit\" ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສົ່ງ (emit) ອອກມາເມື່ອມັນຕຳກັບສັດ"
"ຕູ. ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ ``Area2D`` ເພື່ອກວດຈັບການຕຳ. ເລືອກໂນດ ``Player`` ແລະ ຄລິກແຖບ "
":ui:`Signals` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງແຖບ Inspector ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການສັນຍານທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:372
msgid ""
"Notice our custom \"hit\" signal is there as well! Since our enemies are "
"going to be ``RigidBody2D`` nodes, we want the ``body_entered(body: "
"Node2D)`` signal. This signal will be emitted when a body contacts the "
"player. Click \"Connect..\" and the \"Connect a Signal\" window appears."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າສັນຍານ \"hit\" ທີ່ພວກເຮົາສ້າງຂຶ້ນກໍຢູ່ນີ້ຄືກັນ! ເນື່ອງຈາກສັດຕູຂອງພວກເຮົາຈະເປັນໂນດ "
"``RigidBody2D``, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງການສັນຍານ ``body_entered(body: Node2D)``. ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະ"
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອມີວັດຖຸ (body) ມາສຳຜັດກັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ຄລິກ \"Connect..\" ແລ້ວໜ້າຕ່າງ \"Connect a "
"Signal\" ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:377
msgid ""
"Godot will create a function with that exact name directly in script for "
"you. You don't need to change the default settings right now."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະສ້າງຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຊື່ຄືກັນນັ້ນໃນສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໂດຍກົງ. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຕອນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:384
msgid ""
"If you're using an external text editor (for example, Visual Studio Code), a "
"bug currently prevents Godot from doing so. You'll be sent to your external "
"editor, but the new function won't be there."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມພາຍນອກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: Visual Studio Code), ມີບັກ (bug) ທີ່ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃ"
"ຫ້ Godot ເຮັດແບບນັ້ນໄດ້ໃນຕອນນີ້. ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ editor ພາຍນອກຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແຕ່ຟັງຊັນໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດຢູ່"
"ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:388
msgid ""
"In this case, you'll need to write the function yourself into the Player's "
"script file."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນຟັງຊັນນັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບຂອງ Player."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:393
msgid ""
"Note the green icon indicating that a signal is connected to this function; "
"this does not mean the function exists, only that the signal will attempt to "
"connect to a function with that name, so double-check that the spelling of "
"the function matches exactly!"
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນໄອຄອນສີຂຽວທີ່ບົ່ງບອກວ່າສັນຍານໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຟັງຊັນນີ້ແລ້ວ; ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຟັງຊັນນັ້ນມີຢູ່ແລ້"
"ວ, ແຕ່ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສັນຍານຈະພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຊື່ນັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການສະກົດຊື່ຟັງຊັນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"
"ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:397
msgid "Next, add this code to the function:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດນີ້ລົງໃນຟັງຊັນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:419
msgid ""
"Each time an enemy hits the player, the signal is going to be emitted. We "
"need to disable the player's collision so that we don't trigger the ``hit`` "
"signal more than once."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ສັດຕູຕຳຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ. ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດການທຳງານຂອງການຕຳຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ເພື່ອບໍ່"
"ໃຫ້ມັນໄປກະຕຸ້ນສັນຍານ ``hit`` ຊ້ຳກັນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:423
msgid ""
"Disabling the area's collision shape can cause an error if it happens in the "
"middle of the engine's collision processing. Using ``set_deferred()`` tells "
"Godot to wait to disable the shape until it's safe to do so."
msgstr ""
"ການປິດການທຳງານ collision shape ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ (area) ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້ ຫາກມັນເກີດຂຶ້ນໃ"
"ນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ engine ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນການຕຳ. ການໃຊ້ ``set_deferred()`` ເປັນການບອກໃຫ້ Godot "
"ລໍຖ້າເພື່ອປິດຮູບຊົງນັ້ນ ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດເວລາທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ຈະເຮັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:428
msgid ""
"The last piece is to add a function we can call to reset the player when "
"starting a new game."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນການເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນທີ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໃໝ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມເກມໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:448
msgid "With the player working, we'll work on the enemy in the next lesson."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຈະໄປເຮັດວຽກກັບສັດຕູໃນບົດຮຽນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:4
msgid "Creating the enemy"
msgstr "ການສ້າງສັດຕູ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:6
msgid ""
"Now it's time to make the enemies our player will have to dodge. Their "
"behavior will not be very complex: mobs will spawn randomly at the edges of "
"the screen, choose a random direction, and move in a straight line."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ຮອດເວລາສ້າງສັດຕູທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງໄດ້ຫຼົບຫຼີກແລ້ວ. ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ: ສັດຕູ "
"(mobs) ຈະປະກົດຕົວແບບສຸ່ມຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບໜ້າຈໍ, ເລືອກທິດທາງແບບສຸ່ມ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອນທີ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:10
msgid ""
"We'll create a ``Mob`` scene, which we can then *instance* to create any "
"number of independent mobs in the game."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງຊີນ ``Mob``, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາສາມາດນຳມາ *instance* ເພື່ອສ້າງສັດຕູຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເ"
"ປັນອິດສະຫຼະຕໍ່ກັນໃນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:14
msgid "Node setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:16
msgid "Click Scene -> New Scene from the top menu and add the following nodes:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ Scene -> New Scene ຈາກເມນູດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:18
msgid ":ref:`RigidBody2D <class_RigidBody2D>` (named ``Mob``)"
msgstr ":ref:`RigidBody2D <class_RigidBody2D>` (ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``Mob``)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:20
msgid ":ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>`"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`CollisionShape2D <class_CollisionShape2D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`CollisionShape2D <class_CollisionShape2D>`"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:22
msgid ":ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D>`"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:24
msgid ""
"Don't forget to set the children so they can't be selected, like you did "
"with the Player scene. This is done by selecting the parent node "
"(``RigidBody2D``) in the Scene tree dock, then using the :button:`Group` "
"button at the top of the 2D editor (:kbd:`Ctrl + G` or :kbd:`Cmd + G` on "
"macOS)."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດລູກເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພວກມັນຖືກເລືອກໄດ້, ຄືກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດໃນຊີນ Player. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໂນ"
"ດຫຼັກ (``RigidBody2D``) ໃນ Scene tree dock, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ :button:`Group` ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂ"
"ອງ 2D editor (:kbd:`Ctrl + G` ຫຼື :kbd:`Cmd + G` ເທິງ macOS)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select the ``Mob`` node and set its ``Gravity Scale`` property in "
"the :ref:`RigidBody2D <class_RigidBody2D>` section of the inspector to "
"``0``. This will prevent the mob from falling downwards."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໂນດ ``Mob`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Gravity Scale`` ໃນສ່ວນ :ref:`RigidBody2D "
"<class_RigidBody2D>` ຂອງ inspector ໃຫ້ເປັນ ``0``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສັດຕູຕົກລົງມາທາງລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:34
msgid ""
"In addition, in the ``Mob`` node inspector, under "
"the :ref:`CollisionObject2D <class_CollisionObject2D>` section, expand the "
"**Collision** group and uncheck the ``1`` inside the ``Mask`` property. This "
"will ensure the mobs do not collide with each other."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃນ inspector ຂອງໂນດ ``Mob``, ພາຍໃຕ້ສ່ວນ :ref:`CollisionObject2D "
"<class_CollisionObject2D>`, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມ **Collision** ແລະ ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ ``1`` ໃ"
"ນຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Mask``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າສັດຕູຈະບໍ່ຕຳກັນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:42
msgid ""
"Set up the :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>` like you did for "
"the player. This time, we have 3 animations: ``fly``, ``swim``, and "
"``walk``. There are two images for each animation in the art folder."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>` ຄືກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳລັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ເທື່ອ"
"ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີ 3 ແອນິເມຊັນ: ``fly``, ``swim``, ແລະ ``walk``. ມີສອງຮູບພາບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແອນິເມ"
"ຊັນໃນໂຟນເດີ art."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:46
msgid ""
"The ``Animation Speed`` property has to be set for each individual "
"animation. Adjust it to ``3`` for all 3 animations."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Animation Speed`` ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແອນິເມຊັນແຍກກັນ. ໃຫ້ປັບເປັນ ``3`` ສຳລັບທັ"
"ງ 3 ແອນິເມຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:50
msgid ""
"You can use the \"Play Animation\" buttons on the right of the ``Animation "
"Speed`` input field to preview your animations."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"Play Animation\" ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງປ້ອນຄ່າ ``Animation Speed`` ເພື່ອເ"
"ບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງແອນິເມຊັນຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:52
msgid ""
"We'll select one of these animations randomly so that the mobs will have "
"some variety."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນແອນິເມຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແບບສຸ່ມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັດຕູມີຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:55
msgid ""
"Like the player images, these mob images need to be scaled down. Set the "
"``AnimatedSprite2D``'s ``Scale`` property to ``(0.75, 0.75)``."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບຮູບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ຮູບສັດຕູເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກປັບຂະໜາດລົງ. ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Scale`` ຂອງ "
"``AnimatedSprite2D`` ເປັນ ``(0.75, 0.75)``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:58
msgid ""
"As in the ``Player`` scene, add a ``CapsuleShape2D`` for the collision. To "
"align the shape with the image, you'll need to set the ``Rotation`` property "
"to ``90`` (under \"Transform\" in the Inspector)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບໃນຊີນ ``Player``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``CapsuleShape2D`` ສຳລັບການຕຳ. ເພື່ອຈັດວາງຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຮູ"
"ບພາບ, ເເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Rotation`` ເປັນ ``90`` (ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Transform\" ໃນ "
"Inspector)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:62
msgid "Save the scene."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຊີນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:65
msgid "Enemy script"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຂອງສັດຕູ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:67
msgid "Add a script to the ``Mob`` like this:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ກັບ ``Mob`` ແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:83
msgid ""
"Now let's look at the rest of the script. In ``_ready()`` we play the "
"animation and randomly choose one of the three animation types:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ມາເບິ່ງສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງສະຄຣິບ. ໃນ ``_ready()`` ພວກເຮົາຈະຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນ ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງແ"
"ອນິເມຊັນແບບສຸ່ມຈາກສາມຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:103
msgid ""
"First, we get the list of animation names from the AnimatedSprite2D's "
"``sprite_frames`` property. This returns an Array containing all three "
"animation names: ``[\"walk\", \"swim\", \"fly\"]``."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະດຶງເອົາລາຍຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ ``sprite_frames`` ຂອງ "
"AnimatedSprite2D. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ Array ທີ່ບັນຈຸຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນທັງສາມ: ``[\"walk\", \"swim\", "
"\"fly\"]``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:107
msgid ""
"In the GDScript code, we use the :ref:`Array.pick_random "
"<class_Array_method_pick_random>` method to select one of these animation "
"names at random. Meanwhile, in the C# code, we pick a random number between "
"``0`` and ``2`` to select one of these names from the list (array indices "
"start at ``0``). The expression ``GD.Randi() % n`` selects a random integer "
"between ``0`` and ``n-1``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຄ້ດ GDScript, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ເມທອດ :ref:`Array.pick_random "
"<class_Array_method_pick_random>` ເພື່ອເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແບບສຸ່ມ. ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, "
"ໃນໂຄ້ດ C#, ພວກເຮົາຈະເລືອກຕົວເລກແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ ``0`` ຫາ ``2`` ເພື່ອເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈາກລາຍກ"
"ານ (array index ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ ``0``). ສຳນວນ ``GD.Randi() % n`` ຈະເລືອກຕົວເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນແບ"
"ບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ ``0`` ຫາ ``n-1``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:112
msgid "Finally, we call ``play()`` to start playing the chosen animation."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາຮຽກໃຊ້ ``play()`` ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:114
msgid ""
"The last piece is to make the mobs delete themselves when they leave the "
"screen. Connect the ``screen_exited()`` signal of the "
"``VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D`` node to the ``Mob`` and add this code:"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ສັດຕູລຶບຕົນເອງອອກເມື່ອພວກມັນອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍ. ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``screen_exited"
"()`` ຂອງໂນດ ``VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D`` ເຂົ້າກັບ ``Mob`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:132
msgid ""
"``queue_free()`` is a function that essentially 'frees', or deletes, the "
"node at the end of the frame."
msgstr "``queue_free()`` ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະ 'ປ່ອຍ' ຫຼື ລຶບໂນດອອກໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:134
msgid "This completes the `Mob` scene."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຊີນ `Mob` ສົມບູນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:136
msgid ""
"With the player and enemies ready, in the next part, we'll bring them "
"together in a new scene. We'll make enemies spawn randomly around the game "
"board and move forward, turning our project into a playable game."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ສັດຕູພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ ພວກເຮົາຈະນຳພວກມັນມາລວມກັນໃນຊີນໃໝ່. ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງສັດຕູແບ"
"ບສຸ່ມອ້ອມຮອບກະດານເກມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຂ້າງໜ້າ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນໂຄງການຂອງພວກເຮົາໃຫ້ເປັນເກມທີ່ສາ"
"ມາດຫຼິ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:4
msgid "The main game scene"
msgstr "ຊີນເກມຫຼັກ (The main game scene)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:6
msgid ""
"Now it's time to bring everything we did together into a playable game scene."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເຖິງເວລານຳເອົາທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຮັດມາລວມກັນໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຊີນເກມທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:8
msgid ""
"Create a new scene and add a :ref:`Node <class_Node>` named ``Main``. (The "
"reason we are using Node instead of Node2D is because this node will be a "
"container for handling game logic. It does not require 2D functionality "
"itself.)"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຊີນໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ :ref:`Node <class_Node>` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``Main``. (ເຫດຜົນທີ່ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ "
"Node ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ Node2D ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າໂນດນີ້ຈະເປັນບ່ອນເກັບສຳລັບຈັດການຕັກກະຂອງເກມ. ມັນບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຄວ"
"າມສາມາດດ້ານ 2 ມິຕິດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ.)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:12
msgid ""
"Click the **Instance** button (represented by a chain link icon) and select "
"your saved ``player.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Instance** (ທີ່ສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນຮູບຂໍ້ໂສ້) ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ``player.tscn`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າບັນທຶກ"
"ໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:17
msgid ""
"Now, add the following nodes as children of ``Main``, and name them as shown:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂນດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນລູກຂອງ ``Main``, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ຕາມທີ່ສະແດງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:19
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``MobTimer``) - to control how often mobs "
"spawn"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (ຊື່ວ່າ ``MobTimer``) - ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການເກີດຂອງສັດຕູ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``ScoreTimer``) - to increment the score "
"every second"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (ຊື່ວ່າ ``ScoreTimer``) - ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄະແນນໃນທຸກໆວິນາທີ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``StartTimer``) - to give a delay before "
"starting"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (ຊື່ວ່າ ``StartTimer``) - ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`Marker2D <class_Marker2D>` (named ``StartPosition``) - to indicate the "
"player's start position"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Marker2D <class_Marker2D>` (ຊື່ວ່າ ``StartPosition``) - ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອ"
"ງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:28
msgid ""
"Set the ``Wait Time`` property of each of the ``Timer`` nodes as follows "
"(values are in seconds):"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Wait Time`` ຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ ``Timer`` ດັ່ງນີ້ (ຄ່າແມ່ນເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:30
msgid "``MobTimer``: ``0.5``"
msgstr "``MobTimer``: ``0.5``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:31
msgid "``ScoreTimer``: ``1``"
msgstr "``ScoreTimer``: ``1``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:32
msgid "``StartTimer``: ``2``"
msgstr "``StartTimer``: ``2``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:34
msgid ""
"In addition, set the ``One Shot`` property of ``StartTimer`` to \"On\" and "
"set ``Position`` of the ``StartPosition`` node to ``(240, 450)``."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``One Shot`` ຂອງ ``StartTimer`` ເປັນ \"On\" ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"``Position`` ຂອງໂນດ ``StartPosition`` ເປັນ ``(240, 450)``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:38
msgid "Spawning mobs"
msgstr "ການສ້າງສັດຕູ (Spawning mobs)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:40
msgid ""
"The Main node will be spawning new mobs, and we want them to appear at a "
"random location on the edge of the screen. Click the ``Main`` node in the "
"Scene dock, then add a child :ref:`Path2D <class_Path2D>` node named "
"``MobPath``. When you select ``Path2D``, you will see some new buttons at "
"the top of the editor:"
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ Main ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສ້າງສັດຕູໃໝ່, ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພວກມັນປະກົດຕົວຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງແບບສຸ່ມທີ່ຂອບໜ້າຈໍ. ຄ"
"ລິກທີ່ໂນດ ``Main`` ໃນ Scene dock, ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມໂນດລູກ :ref:`Path2D <class_Path2D>` ທີ່ຕັ້ງ"
"ຊື່ວ່າ ``MobPath``. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກ ``Path2D``, ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນປຸ່ມໃໝ່ບາງຢ່າງປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ "
"editor:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select the middle one (\"Add Point\") and draw the path by clicking to add "
"the points at the corners shown. To have the points snap to the grid, make "
"sure \"Use Grid Snap\" and \"Use Smart Snap\" are both selected. These "
"options can be found to the left of the \"Lock\" button, appearing as a "
"magnet next to some dots and intersecting lines, respectively."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກປຸ່ມກາງ (\"Add Point\") ແລະ ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທາງໂດຍການຄລິກເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດຕ່າງໆຕາມມຸມທີ່ສະແດງ. ເພື່ອໃ"
"ຫ້ຈຸດຕ່າງໆຍຶດຕິດກັບເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ (grid), ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ \"Use Grid Snap\" ແລະ \"Use Smart "
"Snap\" ຖືກເລືອກທັງສອງ. ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ທີ່ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງປຸ່ມ \"Lock\", ໂດຍຈະປະກົດເປັນ"
"ຮູບແມ່ເຫຼັກຢູ່ຂ້າງຈຸດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຕັດກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:55
msgid ""
"Draw the path in *clockwise* order, or your mobs will spawn pointing "
"*outwards* instead of *inwards*!"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທາງຕາມເຂັມໂມງ (*clockwise*), ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນສັດຕູຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຫັນໜ້າໄປທາງ *ຂ້າງນອກ* ແທນທີ່ຈະ"
"ຫັນເຂົ້າ *ຂ້າງໃນ*!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:60
msgid ""
"After placing point ``4`` in the image, click the \"Close Curve\" button and "
"your curve will be complete."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກວາງຈຸດທີ ``4`` ໃນຮູບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Close Curve\" ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງເຈົ້າກໍຈະສົມບູນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:63
msgid ""
"Now that the path is defined, add a :ref:`PathFollow2D <class_PathFollow2D>` "
"node as a child of ``MobPath`` and name it ``MobSpawnLocation``. This node "
"will automatically rotate and follow the path as it moves, so we can use it "
"to select a random position and direction along the path."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂນດ :ref:`PathFollow2D <class_PathFollow2D>` ເປັນລູກຂອງ "
"``MobPath`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``MobSpawnLocation``. ໂນດນີ້ຈະໝູນ ແລະ ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຕາມເສັ້ນທາງໂດຍອັ"
"ດຕະໂນມັດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ທິດທາງແບບສຸ່ມຕາມເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:68
msgid "Your scene should look like this:"
msgstr "ຊີນຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:73
msgid "Main script"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຫຼັກ (Main script)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:75
msgid ""
"Add a script to ``Main``. At the top of the script, we use ``@export var "
"mob_scene: PackedScene`` to allow us to choose the Mob scene we want to "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ກັບ ``Main``. ຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງສະຄຣິບ, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ ``@export var mob_scene: "
"PackedScene`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລືອກຊີນ Mob ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຈະ instance."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:101
msgid ""
"Click the ``Main`` node and you will see the ``Mob Scene`` property in the "
"Inspector under \"Main.gd\"."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ໂນດ ``Main`` ແລ້ວເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Mob Scene`` ໃນ Inspector ພາຍໃຕ້ "
"\"Main.gd\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:104
msgid "You can assign this property's value in two ways:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄດ້ສອງວິທີ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:106
msgid ""
"Drag ``mob.tscn`` from the \"FileSystem\" dock and drop it in the **Mob "
"Scene** property."
msgstr ""
"ລາກ ``mob.tscn`` ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງ \"FileSystem\" ແລະ ເອົາມາວາງໃສ່ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ **Mob "
"Scene**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:108
msgid ""
"Click the down arrow next to \"[empty]\" and choose \"Load\". Select "
"``mob.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ລູກສອນລົງຂ້າງໆ \"[empty]\" ແລະ ເລືອກ \"Load\". ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ ``mob.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:110
msgid ""
"Next, select the instance of the ``Player`` scene under ``Main`` node in the "
"Scene dock, and access the Signals dock on the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ instance ຂອງຊີນ ``Player`` ພາຍໃຕ້ໂນດ ``Main`` ໃນ Scene dock, ແລະ ເຂົ້"
"າໄປທີ່ແຖບ Signals ຢູ່ແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:113
msgid ""
"You should see a list of the signals for the ``Player`` node. Find and "
"double-click the ``hit`` signal in the list (or right-click it and select "
"\"Connect...\"). This will open the signal connection dialog. We want to "
"make a new function named ``game_over``, which will handle what needs to "
"happen when a game ends. Type \"game_over\" in the \"Receiver Method\" box "
"at the bottom of the signal connection dialog and click \"Connect\". You are "
"aiming to have the ``hit`` signal emitted from ``Player`` and handled in the "
"``Main`` script. Add the following code to the new function, as well as a "
"``new_game`` function that will set everything up for a new game:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຄວນຈະເຫັນລາຍການສັນຍານສຳລັບໂນດ ``Player``. ຊອກຫາ ແລະ ດັບເບິ້ລຄລິກໃສ່ສັນຍານ ``hit`` ໃ"
"ນລາຍການ (ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາແລ້ວເລືອກ \"Connect...\"). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ. ພວກເຮົາຕ້"
"ອງການສ້າງຟັງຊັນໃໝ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``game_over``, ເຊິ່ງຈະຈັດການກັບສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເກມຈົບລົງ. ພິມ "
"\"game_over\" ໃນຊ່ອງ \"Receiver Method\" ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ແລະ ຄລິກ "
"\"Connect\". ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງເຈົ້າແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັນຍານ ``hit`` ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຈາກ ``Player`` ແລະ ຖືກຈັດ"
"ການໃນສະຄຣິບ ``Main``. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໃນຟັງຊັນໃໝ່, ລວມທັງຟັງຊັນ ``new_game`` ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸ"
"ກຢ່າງສຳລັບເກມໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:154
msgid ""
"Now we'll connect the ``timeout()`` signal of each Timer node "
"(``StartTimer``, ``ScoreTimer``, and ``MobTimer``) to the main script. For "
"each of the three timers, select the timer in the Scene dock, open the "
"Signals tab of the Node dock, then double-click the ``timeout()`` signal in "
"the list. This will open a new signal connection dialog. The default "
"settings in this dialog should be fine, so select **Connect** to create a "
"new signal connection."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``timeout()`` ຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ Timer (``StartTimer``, "
"``ScoreTimer``, ແລະ ``MobTimer``) ເຂົ້າກັບສະຄຣິບຫຼັກ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕົວຈັບເວລາທັງສາມ, ໃຫ້ເລືອ"
"ກ Timer ໃນ Scene dock, ເປີດແຖບ Signals ຂອງ Node dock, ຈາກນັ້ນດັບເບິ້ລຄລິກສັນຍານ "
"``timeout()`` ໃນລາຍການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານໃໝ່. ຄ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນໃ"
"ຊ້ໄດ້ເລີຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Connect** ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:161
msgid ""
"Once all three timers have this set up, you should be able to see each timer "
"have a Signal connection for their respective ``timeout()`` signal, showing "
"in green, within their respective Signals tabs:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Timer ທັງສາມຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຄວນຈະເຫັນແຕ່ລະ Timer ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານສຳລັບສັນຍານ "
"``timeout()`` ຂອງພວກມັນ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເປັນສີຂຽວ ຢູ່ໃນແຖບ Signals ຂອງແຕ່ລະອັນ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:165
msgid "(For MobTimer): ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(ສຳລັບ MobTimer): ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:166
msgid "(For ScoreTimer): ``_on_score_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(ສຳລັບ ScoreTimer): ``_on_score_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:167
msgid "(For StartTimer): ``_on_start_timer_timeout()``"
msgstr "(ສຳລັບ StartTimer): ``_on_start_timer_timeout()``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:169
msgid ""
"Now we define how each of these timers operate by adding the code below. "
"Notice that ``StartTimer`` will start the other two timers, and that "
"``ScoreTimer`` will increment the score by 1."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Timer ແຕ່ລະຕົວໂດຍການເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າ "
"``StartTimer`` ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Timer ອີກສອງຕົວທີ່ເຫຼືອ, ແລະ ``ScoreTimer`` ຈະເພີ່ມຄ"
"ະແນນຂຶ້ນເທື່ອລະ 1."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:198
msgid ""
"In ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``, we will create a mob instance, pick a random "
"starting location along the ``Path2D``, and set the mob in motion. The "
"``PathFollow2D`` node will automatically rotate as it follows the path, so "
"we will use that to select the mob's direction as well as its position. When "
"we spawn a mob, we'll pick a random value between ``150.0`` and ``250.0`` "
"for how fast each mob will move (it would be boring if they were all moving "
"at the same speed)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ ``_on_mob_timer_timeout()``, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ instance ຂອງສັດຕູ, ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແບ"
"ບສຸ່ມຕາມ ``Path2D``, ແລະ ໃຫ້ສັດຕູເລີ່ມເຄື່ອນທີ່. ໂນດ ``PathFollow2D`` ຈະໝູນຕົວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃ"
"ນຂະນະທີ່ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເລືອກທິດທາງ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງສັດຕູ. ເມື່ອພວ"
"ກເຮົາສ້າງສັດຕູ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເລືອກຄ່າແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ ``150.0`` ແລະ ``250.0`` ສຳລັບຄວາມໄວຂອງສັດ"
"ຕູແຕ່ລະຕົວ (ມັນຄົງຈະໜ້າເບື່ອຫາກພວກມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າກັນໝົດ)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:206
msgid ""
"Note that a new instance must be added to the scene using ``add_child()``."
msgstr "ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ instance ໃໝ່ຕ້ອງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊີນໂດຍໃຊ້ ``add_child()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:266
msgid ""
"Why ``PI``? In functions requiring angles, Godot uses *radians*, not "
"degrees. Pi represents a half turn in radians, about ``3.1415`` (there is "
"also ``TAU`` which is equal to ``2 * PI``). If you're more comfortable "
"working with degrees, you'll need to use the ``deg_to_rad()`` and "
"``rad_to_deg()`` functions to convert between the two."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນຫຍັງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ ``PI``? ໃນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄ່າມຸມ, Godot ຈະໃຊ້ *ເຣດຽນ* (radians), ບໍ່ແມ່ນ ອົງສ"
"າ. Pi ແທນເຄິ່ງຮອບຂອງວົງມົນໃນໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ, ເຊິ່ງມີຄ່າປະມານ ``3.1415`` (ຍັງມີ ``TAU`` ເຊິ່ງມີຄ່າເ"
"ທົ່າກັບ ``2 * PI``). ຫາກເຈົ້າຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບການເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍອົງສາຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"``deg_to_rad()`` ແລະ ``rad_to_deg()`` ເພື່ອແປງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງສອງໜ່ວຍນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:274
msgid "Testing the scene"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບຊີນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:276
msgid ""
"Let's test the scene to make sure everything is working. Add this "
"``new_game`` call to ``_ready()``:"
msgstr ""
"ລອງທົດສອບຊີນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``new_game`` ໃນ ``_ready()"
"``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:292
msgid ""
"Let's also assign ``Main`` as our \"Main Scene\" - the one that runs "
"automatically when the game launches. Press the \"Play\" button and select "
"``main.tscn`` when prompted."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ ``Main`` ເປັນ \"Main Scene\" ຂອງພວກເຮົາ - ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຊີນທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດ"
"ຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເກມຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ. ກົດປຸ່ມ \"Play\" ແລະ ເລືອກ ``main.tscn`` ເມື່ອມີການຖາມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:296
msgid ""
"If you had already set another scene as the \"Main Scene\", you can right "
"click ``main.tscn`` in the FileSystem dock and select \"Set As Main Scene\"."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເຄີຍກຳນົດຊີນອື່ນເປັນ \"Main Scene\" ໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກຂວາທີ່ ``main.tscn`` ໃນ "
"FileSystem dock ແລະ ເລືອກ \"Set As Main Scene\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:299
msgid ""
"You should be able to move the player around, see mobs spawning, and see the "
"player disappear when hit by a mob."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຄວນຈະສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄປມາໄດ້, ເຫັນສັດຕູເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ເຫັນຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫາຍໄປເມື່ອຖືກສັດຕູຕຳ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:302
msgid ""
"When you're sure everything is working, remove the call to ``new_game()`` "
"from ``_ready()`` and replace it with ``pass``."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``new_game()`` ອອກຈາກ "
"``_ready()`` ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ ``pass``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:305
msgid ""
"What's our game lacking? Some user interface. In the next lesson, we'll add "
"a title screen and display the player's score."
msgstr ""
"ເກມຂອງພວກເຮົາຍັງຂາດຫຍັງອີກ? ນັ້ນກໍຄື ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (user interface). ໃນບົດຮຽນຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະ"
"ເພີ່ມໜ້າຈໍຫົວຂໍ້ເກມ ແລະ ສະແດງຄະແນນຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:4
msgid "Heads up display"
msgstr "ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຂໍ້ມູນ (Heads up display)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:6
msgid ""
"The final piece our game needs is a User Interface (UI) to display things "
"like score, a \"game over\" message, and a restart button."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ເກມຂອງພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຄື ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI) ເພື່ອສະແດງສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄະແນນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"\"game over\", ແລະ ປຸ່ມເລີ່ມໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:9
msgid ""
"Create a new scene, click the \"Other Node\" button and add "
"a :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` node named ``HUD``. \"HUD\" stands "
"for \"heads-up display\", an informational display that appears as an "
"overlay on top of the game view."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຊີນໃໝ່, ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Other Node\" ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດ :ref:`CanvasLayer "
"<class_CanvasLayer>` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``HUD``. \"HUD\" ຫຍໍ້ມາຈາກ \"heads-up display\", ເຊິ່"
"ງແມ່ນການສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນຊ້ອນຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງມຸມມອງເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:13
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` node lets us draw our UI elements "
"on a layer above the rest of the game, so that the information it displays "
"isn't covered up by any game elements like the player or mobs."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດແຕ້ມອົງປະກອບ UI ໄວ້ເທິ"
"ງເລເຢີ (layer) ທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອກວ່າພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງເກມ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມັນສະແດງບໍ່ຖືກປິດບັງໂດຍອົງປະກອບຂອງເກ"
"ມ ເຊັ່ນ ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ຫຼື ສັດຕູ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:17
msgid "The HUD needs to display the following information:"
msgstr "HUD ຕ້ອງສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:19
msgid "Score, changed by ``ScoreTimer``."
msgstr "ຄະແນນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍ ``ScoreTimer``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:20
msgid "A message, such as \"Game Over\" or \"Get Ready!\""
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເຊັ່ນ \"Game Over\" ຫຼື \"Get Ready!\""

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:21
msgid "A \"Start\" button to begin the game."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ \"Start\" ເພື່ອເລີ່ມເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:23
msgid ""
"The basic node for UI elements is :ref:`Control <class_Control>`. To create "
"our UI, we'll use two types of :ref:`Control <class_Control>` "
"nodes: :ref:`Label <class_Label>` and :ref:`Button <class_Button>`."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ UI ແມ່ນ :ref:`Control <class_Control>`. ໃນການສ້າງ UI ຂອງພວກ"
"ເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`Control <class_Control>` ສອງປະເພດ ຄື: :ref:`Label "
"<class_Label>` ແລະ :ref:`Button <class_Button>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:27
msgid "Create the following as children of the ``HUD`` node:"
msgstr "ສ້າງສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດ ``HUD``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` named ``ScoreLabel``."
msgstr ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` ຊື່ວ່າ ``ScoreLabel``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` named ``Message``."
msgstr ":ref:`Label <class_Label>` ຊື່ວ່າ ``Message``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:31
msgid ":ref:`Button <class_Button>` named ``StartButton``."
msgstr ":ref:`Button <class_Button>` ຊື່ວ່າ ``StartButton``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:32
msgid ":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` named ``MessageTimer``."
msgstr ":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` ຊື່ວ່າ ``MessageTimer``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:34
msgid ""
"Click on the ``ScoreLabel`` and type a number into the ``Text`` field in the "
"Inspector. The default font for ``Control`` nodes is small and doesn't scale "
"well. There is a font file included in the game assets called \"Xolonium-"
"Regular.ttf\". To use this font, do the following:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ ``ScoreLabel`` ແລະ ພິມຕົວເລກໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Text`` ໃນ Inspector. ຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂນ"
"ດ ``Control`` ຈະມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດບໍ່ໄດ້ດີ. ມີໄຟລ໌ຟອນທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງເກມທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່"
"າ \"Xolonium-Regular.ttf\". ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ເຮັດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:39
msgid ""
"Under \"Theme Overrides > Fonts\", choose \"Load\" and select the \"Xolonium-"
"Regular.ttf\" file."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Theme Overrides > Fonts\", ໃຫ້ເລືອກ \"Load\" ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ \"Xolonium-"
"Regular.ttf\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:43
msgid ""
"The font size is still too small, increase it to ``64`` under \"Theme "
"Overrides > Font Sizes\". Once you've done this with the ``ScoreLabel``, "
"repeat the changes for the ``Message`` and ``StartButton`` nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຟອນຍັງນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເປັນ ``64`` ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Theme Overrides > Font Sizes\". ເ"
"ມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ກັບ ``ScoreLabel`` ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຊ້ຳການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ກັບໂນດ ``Message`` ແລະ "
"``StartButton``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Anchors:** ``Control`` nodes have a position and size, but they also have "
"anchors. Anchors define the origin - the reference point for the edges of "
"the node."
msgstr ""
"**Anchors:** ໂນດ ``Control`` ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຍັງມີ ສະມໍ (anchors). "
"Anchors ຈະກຳນົດຈຸດກຳເນີດ - ເຊິ່ງເປັນຈຸດອ້າງອີງສຳລັບຂອບຂອງໂນດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:52
msgid ""
"Arrange the nodes as shown below. You can drag the nodes to place them "
"manually, or for more precise placement, use \"Anchor Presets\"."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດວາງໂນດຕາມທີ່ສະແດງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. ເເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກໂນດເພື່ອວາງພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ຫຼື ເພື່ອການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ"
"ທີ່ຊັດເຈນກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ \"Anchor Presets\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:59
msgid "ScoreLabel"
msgstr "ScoreLabel"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:61
msgid "Add the text ``0``."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``0``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:62
#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:69
msgid ""
"Set the \"Horizontal Alignment\" and \"Vertical Alignment\" to ``Center``."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Horizontal Alignment\" ແລະ \"Vertical Alignment\" ເປັນ ``Center``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:63
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center Top``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ \"Anchor Preset\" ເປັນ ``Center Top``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:66
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Message"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:68
msgid "Add the text ``Dodge the Creeps!``."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Dodge the Creeps!``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:70
msgid ""
"Set the \"Autowrap Mode\" to ``Word``, otherwise the label will stay on one "
"line."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Autowrap Mode\" ເປັນ ``Word``, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະສະແດງພຽງແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:71
msgid ""
"Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\" set \"Size X\"  to ``480`` to use the "
"entire width of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Control - Layout/Transform\" ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Size X\" ເປັນ ``480`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄວາ"
"ມກວ້າງທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:72
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ \"Anchor Preset\" ເປັນ ``Center``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:75
msgid "StartButton"
msgstr "StartButton"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:77
msgid "Add the text ``Start``."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Start``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:78
msgid ""
"Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\", set \"Size X\" to ``200`` and \"Size "
"Y\" to ``100`` to add a little bit more padding between the border and text."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Control - Layout/Transform\", ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Size X\" ເປັນ ``200`` ແລະ "
"\"Size Y\" ເປັນ ``100`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂອບ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:80
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center Bottom``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ \"Anchor Preset\" ເປັນ ``Center Bottom``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:81
msgid "Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\", set \"Position Y\" to ``580``."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ \"Control - Layout/Transform\", ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Position Y\" ເປັນ ``580``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:83
msgid ""
"On the ``MessageTimer``, set the ``Wait Time`` to ``2`` and set the ``One "
"Shot`` property to \"On\"."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ ``MessageTimer``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Wait Time`` ເປັນ ``2`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດ ``One "
"Shot`` ເປັນ \"On\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:86
msgid "Now add this script to ``HUD``:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນ ``HUD``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:108
msgid ""
"We now want to display a message temporarily, such as \"Get Ready\", so we "
"add the following code"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຊົ່ວຄາວ ເຊັ່ນ \"Get Ready\", ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:130
msgid ""
"We also need to process what happens when the player loses. The code below "
"will show \"Game Over\" for 2 seconds, then return to the title screen and, "
"after a brief pause, show the \"Start\" button."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງຕ້ອງປະມວນຜົນສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເສຍ. ໂຄ້ດຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Game Over\" ເປັ"
"ນເວລາ 2 ວິນາທີ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈະກັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກຢຸດພັກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ, ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມ \"Start\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:163
msgid ""
"When you need to pause for a brief time, an alternative to using a Timer "
"node is to use the SceneTree's ``create_timer()`` function. This can be very "
"useful to add delays such as in the above code, where we want to wait some "
"time before showing the \"Start\" button."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຢຸດພັກເປັນເວລາສັ້ນໆ, ທາງເລືອກອື່ນນອກຈາກການໃຊ້ໂນດ Timer ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"``create_timer()`` ຂອງ SceneTree. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການເພີ່ມການລໍຖ້າ ເຊັ່ນໃນໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງ "
"ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການລໍຖ້າໄລຍະໜຶ່ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມ \"Start\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:168
msgid "Add the code below to ``HUD`` to update the score"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ໃສ່ໃນ ``HUD`` ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄະແນນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:183
msgid ""
"Connect the ``pressed()`` signal of ``StartButton`` and the ``timeout()`` "
"signal of ``MessageTimer`` to the ``HUD`` node, and add the following code "
"to the new functions:"
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``pressed()`` ຂອງ ``StartButton`` ແລະ ສັນຍານ ``timeout()`` ຂອງ "
"``MessageTimer`` ເຂົ້າກັບໂນດ ``HUD``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໃນຟັງຊັນໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:212
msgid "Connecting HUD to Main"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HUD ເຂົ້າກັບ Main"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:214
msgid ""
"Now that we're done creating the ``HUD`` scene, go back to ``Main``. "
"Instance the ``HUD`` scene in ``Main`` like you did the ``Player`` scene. "
"The scene tree should look like this, so make sure you didn't miss anything:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາສ້າງຊີນ ``HUD`` ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກັບໄປທີ່ ``Main``. ໃຫ້ instance ຊີນ ``HUD`` ໃ"
"ນ ``Main`` ຄືກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດໃນຊີນ ``Player``. Scene tree ຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່"
"ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ພາດຫຍັງໄປ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:220
msgid ""
"Now we need to connect the ``HUD`` functionality to our ``Main`` script. "
"This requires a few additions to the ``Main`` scene:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ ``HUD`` ເຂົ້າກັບສະຄຣິບ ``Main`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງກ"
"ານການເພີ່ມບາງຢ່າງເຂົ້າໃນຊີນ ``Main``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:223
msgid ""
"In the Signals tab, connect the HUD's ``start_game`` signal to the "
"``new_game()`` function of the Main node by clicking the \"Pick\" button in "
"the \"Connect a Signal\" window and selecting the ``new_game()`` method or "
"type \"new_game\" below \"Receiver Method\" in the window. Verify that the "
"green connection icon now appears next to ``func new_game()`` in the script."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖບ Signals, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``start_game`` ຂອງ HUD ເຂົ້າກັບຟັງຊັນ ``new_game()`` ຂ"
"ອງໂນດ Main ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Pick\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ \"Connect a Signal\" ແລະ ເລືອກເມທອດ "
"``new_game()`` ຫຼື ພິມ \"new_game\" ໃສ່ລຸ່ມ \"Receiver Method\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນ. ກວດສອບວ່າ"
"ໄອຄອນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສີຂຽວປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ຂ້າງ ``func new_game()`` ໃນສະຄຣິບແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:229
msgid ""
"In ``new_game()``, update the score display and show the \"Get Ready\" "
"message:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນ ``new_game()``, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດການສະແດງຜົນຄະແນນ ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Get Ready\":"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:243
msgid "In ``game_over()`` we need to call the corresponding ``HUD`` function:"
msgstr "ໃນ ``game_over()`` ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຮຽກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``HUD`` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:254
msgid ""
"Finally, add this to ``_on_score_timer_timeout()`` to keep the display in "
"sync with the changing score:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ໃສ່ໃນ ``_on_score_timer_timeout()`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄະແນ"
"ນທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງ:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:268
msgid ""
"Remember to remove the call to ``new_game()`` from ``_ready()`` if you "
"haven't already, otherwise your game will start automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມລຶບການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``new_game()`` ອອກຈາກ ``_ready()`` ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ລຶບ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເກມຂອງເ"
"ຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:272
msgid "Now you're ready to play! Click the \"Play the Project\" button."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວ! ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Play the Project\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:275
msgid "Removing old creeps"
msgstr "ການລຶບສັດຕູຕົວເກົ່າອອກ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:277
msgid ""
"If you play until \"Game Over\" and then start a new game right away, the "
"creeps from the previous game may still be on the screen. It would be better "
"if they all disappeared at the start of a new game. We just need a way to "
"tell *all* the mobs to remove themselves. We can do this with the \"group\" "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຫຼິ້ນຈົນຮອດ \"Game Over\" ແລ້ວເລີ່ມເກມໃໝ່ທັນທີ, ສັດຕູຈາກເກມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອາດຈະຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ. "
"ມັນຈະດີກວ່າຫາກພວກມັນທັງໝົດຫາຍໄປເມື່ອເລີ່ມເກມໃໝ່. ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການວິທີບອກໃຫ້ສັດຕູ *ທັງໝົດ* ລຶບຕົນ"
"ເອງອອກ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ \"group\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:282
msgid ""
"In the ``Mob`` scene, select the root node and click the :ui:`Groups` tab "
"next to the :ui:`Signals` tab and the \"+\" button to open the \"Create New "
"Group\" dialog."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຊີນ ``Mob``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດຫຼັກ ແລະ ຄລິກແຖບ :ui:`Groups` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງແຖບ :ui:`Signals` ແລະ "
"ກົດປຸ່ມ \"+\" ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງ \"Create New Group\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:287
msgid "Name the group ``mobs`` and click \"ok\" to add a new scene group."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ກຸ່ມວ່າ ``mobs`` ແລະ ຄລິກ \"ok\" ເພື່ອເພີ່ມກຸ່ມຊີນໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:291
msgid "Now all mobs will be in the \"mobs\" group."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສັດຕູທັງໝົດຈະຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ \"mobs\"."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:295
msgid ""
"We can then add the following line to the ``new_game()`` function in "
"``Main``:"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເພີ່ມແຖວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``new_game()`` ໃນ ``Main``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:308
msgid ""
"The ``call_group()`` function calls the named function on every node in a "
"group - in this case we are telling every mob to delete itself."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``call_group()`` ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດຊື່ໄວ້ໃນທຸກໆໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ - ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງ"
"ບອກໃຫ້ສັດຕູທຸກຕົວລຶບຕົນເອງອອກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:311
msgid ""
"The game's mostly done at this point. In the next and last part, we'll "
"polish it a bit by adding a background, looping music, and some keyboard "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"ເກມເກືອບຈະສົມບູນແລ້ວໃນຕອນນີ້. ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ເປັນພາກສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາຈະປັບແຕ່ງມັນຕື່ມອີກເລັກນ້ອຍໂດ"
"ຍການເພີ່ມພື້ນຫຼັງ, ເພງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນວົນຊ້ຳ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:4
msgid "Finishing up"
msgstr "ການຕົບແຕ່ງສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:6
msgid ""
"We have now completed all the functionality for our game. Below are some "
"remaining steps to add a bit more \"juice\" to improve the game experience."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເຮັດທຸກການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເກມໃຫ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນບາງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ເຫຼືອເພື່ອເພີ່ມ \"ຄວາ"
"ມໜ້າສົນໃຈ\" ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສົບການການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:9
msgid "Feel free to expand the gameplay with your own ideas."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຮູບແບບການຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ຕາມໄອເດຍຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:12
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/environment_and_post_processing.rst:133
msgid "Background"
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:14
msgid ""
"The default gray background is not very appealing, so let's change its "
"color. One way to do this is to use a :ref:`ColorRect <class_ColorRect>` "
"node. Make it the first node under ``Main`` so that it will be drawn behind "
"the other nodes. ``ColorRect`` only has one property: ``Color``. Choose a "
"color you like and select \"Layout\" -> \"Anchors Preset\" -> \"Full Rect\" "
"either in the toolbar at the top of the viewport or in the inspector so that "
"it covers the screen."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງສີເທົາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນັ້ນບໍ່ຄ່ອຍໜ້າສົນໃຈປານໃດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນລອງປ່ຽນສີຂອງມັນເບິ່ງ. ວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ຄືການໃຊ້ໂນ"
"ດ :ref:`ColorRect <class_ColorRect>`. ໃຫ້ມັນເປັນໂນດທຳອິດພາຍໃຕ້ ``Main`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຖືກແ"
"ຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງໂນດອື່ນໆ. ``ColorRect`` ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດຽວຄື: ``Color``. ໃຫ້ເລືອກສີທີ່ເຈົ້າມັກ ແລະ ເລືອ"
"ກ \"Layout\" -> \"Anchors Preset\" -> \"Full Rect\" ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນ toolbar ດ້ານເທິງຂອ"
"ງ viewport ຫຼື ໃນ inspector ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນກວມເອົາທັງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:20
msgid ""
"You could also add a background image, if you have one, by using "
"a :ref:`TextureRect <class_TextureRect>` node instead."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມຮູບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງໄດ້, ຫາກເຈົ້າມີ, ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`TextureRect "
"<class_TextureRect>` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:24
msgid "Sound effects"
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກສຽງ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:26
msgid ""
"Sound and music can be the single most effective way to add appeal to the "
"game experience. In your game's **art** folder, you have two sound files: "
"\"House In a Forest Loop.ogg\" for background music, and \"gameover.wav\" "
"for when the player loses."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງ ແລະ ເພງ ສາມາດເປັນວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສຸດໃນການເພີ່ມຄວາມໜ້າສົນໃຈໃຫ້ກັບປະສົບການການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ໃນໂ"
"ຟນເດີ **art** ຂອງເກມ, ເຈົ້າມີໄຟລ໌ສຽງສອງໄຟລ໌: \"House In a Forest Loop.ogg\" ສຳລັບເພງ"
"ພື້ນຫຼັງ, ແລະ \"gameover.wav\" ສຳລັບຕອນທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເສຍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:31
msgid ""
"Add two :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer <class_AudioStreamPlayer>` nodes as children "
"of ``Main``. Name one of them ``Music`` and the other ``DeathSound``. On "
"each one, click on the ``Stream`` property, select \"Load\", and choose the "
"corresponding audio file."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂນດ :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer <class_AudioStreamPlayer>` ສອງຕົວເປັນລູກຂອງ "
"``Main``. ຕັ້ງຊື່ອັນໜຶ່ງວ່າ ``Music`` ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງວ່າ ``DeathSound``. ໃນແຕ່ລະອັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຄຸນ"
"ສົມບັດ ``Stream``, ເລືອກ \"Load\", ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ສຽງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:36
msgid ""
"All audio is automatically imported with the ``Loop`` setting disabled. If "
"you want the music to loop seamlessly, click on the Stream file arrow, "
"select ``Make Unique``, then click on the Stream file and check the ``Loop`` "
"box."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍປິດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Loop``. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເພງຫຼິ້ນວົນຊ້ຳຢ່າງຕໍ່"
"ເນື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ລູກສອນຂອງໄຟລ໌ Stream, ເລືອກ ``Make Unique``, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ໄຟລ໌ Stream ແລ"
"ະ ໝາຍຕິກໃນຊ່ອງ ``Loop``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:42
msgid ""
"To play the music, add ``$Music.play()`` in the ``new_game()`` function and "
"``$Music.stop()`` in the ``game_over()`` function."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນເພງ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``$Music.play()`` ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``new_game()`` ແລະ ``$Music.stop()"
"`` ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``game_over()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:45
msgid "Finally, add ``$DeathSound.play()`` in the ``game_over()`` function."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``$DeathSound.play()`` ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``game_over()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:76
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:78
msgid ""
"Since the game is played with keyboard controls, it would be convenient if "
"we could also start the game by pressing a key on the keyboard. We can do "
"this with the \"Shortcut\" property of the ``Button`` node."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເກມຖືກຫຼິ້ນດ້ວຍການຄວບຄຸມຈາກຄີບອດ, ມັນຄົງຈະສະດວກຫາກພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລີ່ມເກມໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ"
"ໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງຄີບອດ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ \"Shortcut\" ຂອງໂນດ ``Button``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:82
msgid ""
"In a previous lesson, we created four input actions to move the character. "
"We will create a similar input action to map to the start button."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ສ້າງ input action ສີ່ຢ່າງເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນ. ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ "
"input action ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບປຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:85
msgid ""
"Select \"Project\" -> \"Project Settings\" and then click on the \"Input "
"Map\" tab. In the same way you created the movement input actions, create a "
"new input action called ``start_game`` and add a key mapping for "
"the :kbd:`Enter` key."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ \"Project\" -> \"Project Settings\" ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ \"Input Map\". ໃນລັກສະນະ"
"ດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງ input action ສຳລັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ input action ໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"``start_game`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມການກຳນົດປຸ່ມສຳລັບປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Enter`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:92
msgid ""
"Now would be a good time to add controller support if you have one "
"available. Attach or pair your controller and then under each input action "
"that you wish to add controller support for, click on the \"+\" button and "
"press the corresponding button, d-pad, or stick direction that you want to "
"map to the respective input action."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເປັນເວລາທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມການສະໜັບສະໜູນຄອນໂທຣນເລີ (controller) ຫາກເຈົ້າມີ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຈັບຄູ່ຄອ"
"ນໂທຣນເລີຂອງເຈົ້າ ຈາກນັ້ນພາຍໃຕ້ແຕ່ລະ input action ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມການສະໜັບສະໜູນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ "
"\"+\" ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ, d-pad, ຫຼື ທິດທາງຂອງສະຕິກທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ input action ນັ້ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:97
msgid ""
"In the ``HUD`` scene, select the ``StartButton`` and find its **Shortcut** "
"property in the Inspector. Create a new :ref:`Shortcut <class_Shortcut>` "
"resource by clicking within the box, open the **Events** array and add a new "
"array element to it by clicking on **Array[InputEvent] (size 0)**."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຊີນ ``HUD``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``StartButton`` ແລະ ຊອກຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ **Shortcut** ຂອງມັນໃນ "
"Inspector. ສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ :ref:`Shortcut <class_Shortcut>` ໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄລິກພາຍໃນຊ່ອ"
"ງ, ເປີດ array **Events** ແລະ ເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບ array ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ "
"**Array[InputEvent] (size 0)**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:104
msgid ""
"Create a new :ref:`InputEventAction <class_InputEventAction>` and select the "
"``start_game`` action."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ :ref:`InputEventAction <class_InputEventAction>` ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລືອກ action "
"``start_game``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:108
msgid ""
"Now when the start button appears, you can either click it or "
"press :kbd:`Enter` to start the game."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເມື່ອປຸ່ມ start ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ມັນ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Enter` ເພື່ອເລີ່ມເກມໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:111
msgid "And with that, you completed your first 2D game in Godot."
msgstr "ແລະ ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ເຈົ້າກໍໄດ້ເຮັດເກມ 2 ມິຕິທຳອິດໃນ Godot ຈົນສຳເລັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:115
msgid ""
"You got to make a player-controlled character, enemies that spawn randomly "
"around the game board, count the score, implement a game over and replay, "
"user interface, sounds, and more. Congratulations!"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ສັດຕູທີ່ເກີດແບບສຸ່ມອ້ອມຮອບກະດານເກມ, ການນັບຄະແນນ, ການສ້າງລະ"
"ບົບ game over ແລະ ການເລີ່ມໃໝ່, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ສຽງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ຂໍສະແດງຄວາມຍິນດີດ້ວຍ!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:119
msgid ""
"There's still much to learn, but you can take a moment to appreciate what "
"you achieved."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງຮຽນຮູ້, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເວລາຄາວໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຊື່ນຊົມກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດສຳເລັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:122
msgid ""
"And when you're ready, you can move on to :ref:`doc_your_first_3d_game` to "
"learn to create a complete 3D game from scratch, in Godot."
msgstr ""
"ແລະ ເມື່ອເຈົ້າພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໄປຕໍ່ທີ່ :ref:`doc_your_first_3d_game` ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ການສ້າງເກ"
"ມ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ສົມບູນຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:126
msgid "Sharing the finished game with others"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງປັນເກມທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວໃຫ້ກັບຄົນອື່ນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:128
msgid ""
"If you want people to try out your game without having to install Godot, "
"you'll need to export the project for each operating system you want the "
"game to be playable on. See :ref:`doc_exporting_projects` for instructions."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນທົດລອງຫຼິ້ນເກມຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Godot, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງອອກ (export) ໂ"
"ຄງການສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເກມຫຼິ້ນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_exporting_projects` ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/07.finishing-up.rst:132
msgid ""
"After exporting the project, compress the exported executable and PCK file "
"(not the raw project files) to a ZIP file, then upload this ZIP file to a "
"file sharing website."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງອອກໂຄງການແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ບີບອັດໄຟລ໌ executable ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ PCK ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກມາ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ໂຄງການ"
"ດິບ) ໃຫ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ ZIP, ຈາກນັ້ນອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ ZIP ນີ້ໄປຫາເວັບໄຊແບ່ງປັນໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:6
msgid "Your first 3D game"
msgstr "ເກມ 3 ມິຕິທຳອິດຂອງເຈົ້າ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"In this step-by-step tutorial series, you will create your first complete 3D "
"game with Godot. By the end of the series, you will have a simple yet "
"finished project of your own like the animated gif below."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຊຸດບົດຮຽນແບບເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ສ້າງເກມ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ສົມບູນທຳອິດຂອງເຈົ້າດ້ວຍ Godot. ເມື່ອຈົບບົດຮ"
"ຽນຊຸດນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະມີໂຄງການທີ່ງ່າຍດາຍແຕ່ສົມບູນເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ ຄືກັບພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວ gif ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"The game we'll code here is similar to :ref:`doc_your_first_2d_game`, with a "
"twist: you can now jump and your goal is to squash the creeps. This way, you "
"will both **recognize patterns** you learned in the previous tutorial and "
"**build upon them** with new code and features."
msgstr ""
"ເກມທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບ :ref:`doc_your_first_2d_game`, ແຕ່ມີຈຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"
"ຄື: ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຕັ້ນໄດ້ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງເຈົ້າຄືການຢຽບສັດຕູ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະທັງ **ຈື່ຈຳຮູບແບ"
"ບ** ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ໃນບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ **ສ້າງຕໍ່ຍອດຈາກພວກມັນ** ດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:21
msgid "Work with 3D coordinates with a jumping mechanic."
msgstr "ເຮັດວຽກກັບພິກັດ 3 ມິຕິ ພ້ອມກັບລະບົບການເຕັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Use kinematic bodies to move 3D characters and detect when and how they "
"collide."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ kinematic bodies ເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນ 3 ມິຕິ ແລະ ກວດຈັບວ່າພວກມັນຕຳກັນເມື່ອໃດ ແລະ ແນວໃ"
"ດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use physics layers and a group to detect interactions with specific entities."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ physics layers ແລະ ກຸ່ມ ເພື່ອກວດຈັບການຕອບໂຕ້ກັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"Code basic procedural gameplay by instancing monsters at regular time "
"intervals."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນໂຄ້ດລະບົບການຫຼິ້ນແບບ procedural ພື້ນຖານ ໂດຍການ instance ມອນສະເຕີຕາມໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:27
msgid "Design a movement animation and change its speed at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ອອກແບບແອນິເມຊັນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນຄວາມໄວຂອງມັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:28
msgid "Draw a user interface on a 3D game."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (user interface) ໃນເກມ 3 ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"This tutorial is for beginners who followed the complete getting started "
"series. We'll start slow with detailed instructions and shorten them as we "
"do similar steps. If you're an experienced programmer, you can browse the "
"complete demo's source code here:"
msgstr ""
"ບົດຮຽນນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕາມຊຸດບົດຮຽນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສົມບູນມາແລ້ວ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງຊ້າໆດ້ວຍຄ"
"ຳແນະນຳທີ່ລະອຽດ ແລະ ຈະຫຍໍ້ພວກມັນລົງເມື່ອພວກເຮົາເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າເປັນນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ມີ"
"ປະສົບການ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສົມບູນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"`Squash the Creeps source code (GDScript) <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/squash_the_creeps>`__"
msgstr ""
"`ຊອດໂຄດ Squash the Creeps (GDScript) <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"demo-projects/tree/master/3d/squash_the_creeps>`__"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Squash the Creeps source code (C#) <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"demo-projects/tree/master/mono/squash_the_creeps>`__"
msgstr ""
"`ຊອດໂຄດ Squash the Creeps (C#) <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/mono/squash_the_creeps>`__"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"You can follow this series without having done the 2D one. However, if "
"you're new to game development, we recommend you to start with 2D. 3D game "
"code is always more complex and the 2D series will give you foundations to "
"follow along more comfortably."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມບົດຮຽນຊຸດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຜ່ານຊຸດ 2D ມາກ່ອນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກທ່ານຍັງໃໝ່ຕໍ່ກັ"
"ບການພັດທະນາເກມ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເລີ່ມຈາກ 2D ກ່ອນ. ໂຄດຂອງເກມ 3D ມັກຈະມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ "
"ແລະ ຊຸດບົດຮຽນ 2D ຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມໄດ້ສະດວກກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:47
msgid ""
"We prepared some game assets so we can jump straight to the code. You can "
"download them here: `Squash the Creeps assets <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"3d_squash_the_creeps_starter.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ກຽມຊັບພະຍາກອນ (assets) ຂອງເກມບາງຢ່າງໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລີ່ມຂຽນໂຄດໄດ້ທັນທີ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: `ຊັບພະຍາກອນ Squash the Creeps <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"3d_squash_the_creeps_starter.zip>`__."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"We will first work on a basic prototype for the player's movement. We will "
"then add the monsters that we'll spawn randomly around the screen. After "
"that, we'll implement the jump and squashing mechanic before refining the "
"game with some nice animation. We'll wrap up with the score and the retry "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງຕົວແບບພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມມອນສະເຕີທີ່ຈະປະກົດຕົວ"
"ແບບສຸ່ມອ້ອມໜ້າຈໍ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຂຽນລະບົບການໂດດ ແລະ ການຢຽບ (squashing) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປັບປຸງ"
"ເກມດ້ວຍແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ສວຍງາມ. ພວກເຮົາຈະປິດທ້າຍດ້ວຍຄະແນນ ແລະ ໜ້າຈໍລອງໃໝ່ (retry)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:4
msgid "Setting up the game area"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ເກມ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this first part, we're going to set up the game area. Let's get started "
"by importing the start assets and setting up the game scene."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສ່ວນທຳອິດນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ເກມ. ມາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສາກ "
"(scene) ຂອງເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:9
msgid ""
"We've prepared a Godot project with the 3D models and sounds we'll use for "
"this tutorial, linked in the index page. If you haven't done so yet, you can "
"download the archive here: `Squash the Creeps assets <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"3d_squash_the_creeps_starter.zip>`_."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ກຽມໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ທີ່ມີໂມເດລ 3D ແລະ ສຽງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບບົດຮຽນນີ້ໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເຊິ່ງມີລິ້ງຢູ່"
"ໃນໜ້າດັດສະນີ. ຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: `ຊັບພະຍາກອນ Squash the "
"Creeps <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/"
"download/latest-4.x/3d_squash_the_creeps_starter.zip>`_."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:13
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded it, extract the .zip archive on your computer. Open "
"the Godot Project Manager and click the *Import* button."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານດາວໂຫລດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແຕກໄຟລ໌ .zip ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ. ເປີດ Godot Project Manager ແລ"
"ະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ *Import*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:18
msgid ""
"In the import popup, enter the full path to the freshly created directory "
"``3d_squash_the_creeps_starter/``. You can click the *Browse* button on the "
"right to open a file browser and navigate to the ``project.godot`` file the "
"folder contains."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປ໊ອບອັບການນຳເຂົ້າ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ທັງໝົດໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ "
"``3d_squash_the_creeps_starter/`` ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ສ້າງໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກປຸ່ມ *Browse* ທາງດ້ານຂວາ"
"ເພື່ອເປີດຕົວທ່ອງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ``project.godot`` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:25
msgid "Click *Import* to open the project in the editor."
msgstr "ຄລິກ *Import* ເພື່ອເປີດໂປຣເຈັກໃນເອດິເຕີ (editor)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:29
msgid ""
"A window notifying you that the project was generated by an older Godot "
"version may appear. Click *OK* to convert the project to your current Godot "
"version."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ Godot ເວີຊັນເກົ່າອາດຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ຄລິກ *OK* ເພື່ອແປງໂປຣ"
"ເຈັກໃຫ້ເປັນເວີຊັນ Godot ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:34
msgid ""
"If it doesn't open immediately, open the project from your project list."
msgstr "ຫາກມັນບໍ່ເປີດທັນທີ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໂປຣເຈັກຈາກລາຍຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:36
msgid ""
"The start project contains an icon and two folders: ``art/`` and ``fonts/``. "
"There, you will find the art assets and music we'll use in the game."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣເຈັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະກອບມີໄອຄອນໜຶ່ງອັນ ແລະ ສອງໂຟນເດີ: ``art/`` ແລະ ``fonts/``. ໃນນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະ"
"ພົບກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ເພງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ໃນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:41
msgid ""
"There are two 3D models, ``player.glb`` and ``mob.glb``, some materials that "
"belong to these models, and a music track."
msgstr ""
"ມີໂມເດລ 3D ສອງອັນຄື ``player.glb`` ແລະ ``mob.glb``, ວັດສະດຸ (materials) ບາງຢ່າງທີ່ເປັນ"
"ຂອງໂມເດລເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແລະ ແທຣັກເພງໜຶ່ງເພງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:45
msgid "Setting up the playable area"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:47
msgid ""
"We're going to create our main scene with a plain :ref:`Node <class_Node>` "
"as its root. In the *Scene* dock, click the *Add Child Node* button "
"represented by a \"+\" icon in the top-left and double-click on *Node*. Name "
"the node ``Main``. An alternate method to rename the node is to right-click "
"on *Node* and choose *Rename* (or :kbd:`F2`). Alternatively, to add a node "
"to the scene, you can press :kbd:`Ctrl + A` (:kbd:`Cmd + A` on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງສາກຫຼັກ (main scene) ຂອງພວກເຮົາໂດຍມີ :ref:`Node <class_Node>` ທຳມະດາເປັ"
"ນຮາກ (root) ຂອງມັນ. ໃນດັອກ *Scene*, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ *Add Child Node* ທີ່ສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ "
"\"+\" ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ ແລະ ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ *Node*. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໂນດວ່າ ``Main``. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດແມ່"
"ນການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ *Node* ແລ້ວເລືອກ *Rename* (ຫຼື ກົດ :kbd:`F2`). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂນດໃສ່ສ"
"າກ, ທ່ານສາມາດກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + A` (:kbd:`Cmd + A` ໃນ macOS)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:54
msgid ""
"Save the scene as ``main.tscn`` by pressing :kbd:`Ctrl + S` (:kbd:`Cmd + S` "
"on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກສາກເປັນ ``main.tscn`` ໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + S` (:kbd:`Cmd + S` ໃນ macOS)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:56
msgid ""
"We'll start by adding a floor that'll prevent the characters from falling. "
"To create static colliders like the floor, walls, or ceilings, you can "
"use :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>` nodes. They "
"require :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>` child nodes to "
"define the collision area. With the ``Main`` node selected, add "
"a :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>` node, then "
"a :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`. Rename "
"the :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>` to ``Ground``."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມດ້ວຍການເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕົວລະຄອນຕົກລົງໄປ. ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວປະທະຄົງທີ່ (static "
"colliders) ເຊັ່ນ: ພື້ນ, ຝາ, ຫຼື ເພດານ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`StaticBody3D "
"<class_StaticBody3D>`. ພວກມັນຕ້ອງການໂນດລູກ :ref:`CollisionShape3D "
"<class_CollisionShape3D>` ເພື່ອກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ການປະທະ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລືອກໂນດ ``Main``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂນ"
"ດ :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>`, ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມ :ref:`CollisionShape3D "
"<class_CollisionShape3D>`. ປ່ຽນຊື່ :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>` ເປັນ "
"``Ground``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:63
msgid "Your scene tree should look like this"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງສາກ (scene tree) ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແບບນີ້"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:67
msgid ""
"A warning sign next to the :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>` "
"appears because we haven't defined its shape. If you click the icon, a popup "
"appears to give you more information."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຕືອນຂ້າງໆ :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>` ປະກົດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າພ"
"ວກເຮົາຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ກຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງ (shape) ໃຫ້ມັນ. ຫາກທ່ານຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນນັ້ນ, ປ໊ອບອັບຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມແກ່ທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:72
msgid ""
"To create a shape, select the :ref:`CollisionShape3D "
"<class_CollisionShape3D>` node, head to the *Inspector* and click the "
"*<empty>* field next to the *Shape* property. Create a new *BoxShape3D*."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດ :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`, ໄປທີ່ "
"*Inspector* ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງ *<empty>* ຂ້າງໆຄຸນສົມບັດ *Shape*. ສ້າງ *BoxShape3D* ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:77
msgid ""
"The box shape is perfect for flat ground and walls. Its thickness makes it "
"reliable to block even fast-moving objects."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຮ່າງກ່ອງ (box shape) ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ຮາບພຽງ ແລະ ຝາ. ຄວາມໜາຂອງມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຊື່ອຖື"
"ໄດ້ໃນການກັ້ນແມ່ນແຕ່ສິ່ງຂອງທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:80
msgid ""
"A box's wireframe appears in the viewport with three orange dots. You can "
"click and drag these to edit the shape's extents interactively. We can also "
"precisely set the size in the inspector. Click on the :ref:`BoxShape3D "
"<class_BoxShape3D>` to expand the resource. Set its *Size* to ``60`` on the "
"X-axis, ``2`` for the Y-axis, and ``60`` for the Z-axis."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຮ່າງ (wireframe) ຂອງກ່ອງຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນວິວພອດ (viewport) ພ້ອມກັບຈຸດສີສົ້ມສາມຈຸດ. ທ່ານສາມາດ"
"ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຮ່າງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ພວກເຮົາທັງຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນໃນ "
"inspector ໄດ້. ຄລິກທີ່ :ref:`BoxShape3D <class_BoxShape3D>` ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນອອ"
"ກ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ *Size* ຂອງມັນເປັນ ``60`` ໃນແກນ X, ``2`` ສຳລັບແກນ Y, ແລະ ``60`` ສຳລັບແກນ "
"Z."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:89
msgid ""
"Collision shapes are invisible. We need to add a visual floor that goes "
"along with it. Select the ``Ground`` node and add a :ref:`MeshInstance3D "
"<class_MeshInstance3D>` as its child."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຮ່າງການປະທະ (collision shapes) ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ. ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໄປພ້ອມກັ"
"ນ. ເລືອກໂນດ ``Ground`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>` ເປັ"
"ນໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:94
msgid ""
"In the *Inspector*, click on the field next to *Mesh* and create "
"a :ref:`BoxMesh <class_BoxMesh>` resource to create a visible box."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ *Inspector*, ຄລິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງຂ້າງໆ *Mesh* ແລະ ສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ :ref:`BoxMesh "
"<class_BoxMesh>` ເພື່ອສ້າງກ່ອງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:99
msgid ""
"Once again, it's too small by default. Click the box icon to expand the "
"resource and set its *Size* to ``60``, ``2``, and ``60``."
msgstr ""
"ອີກເທື່ອໜຶ່ງ, ມັນມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍເກີນໄປໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນກ່ອງເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"*Size* ເປັນ ``60``, ``2``, ແລະ ``60``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:104
msgid ""
"You should see a wide grey slab that covers the grid and blue and red axes "
"in the viewport."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນແຜ່ນສີເທົາກວ້າງໆທີ່ປົກຄຸມຕາໜ່າງ (grid) ແລະ ແກນສີຟ້າ ແລະ ສີແດງໃນວິວພອດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:107
msgid ""
"We're going to move the ground down so we can see the floor grid. To do "
"this, the grid snapping feature can be used. Grid snapping can be activated "
"2 ways in the 3D editor. The first is by pressing the *Use Snap* button (or "
"pressing the :kbd:`Y` key). The second is by selecting a node, dragging a "
"handle on the gizmo **then** holding :kbd:`Ctrl` (:kbd:`Cmd` on macOS) while "
"holding the selected node."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະຍ້າຍພື້ນລົງລຸ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາເຫັນຕາໜ່າງພື້ນ (floor grid). ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີການ"
"ຍຶດຕິດ (grid snapping). ການຍຶດຕິດສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ 2 ວິທີໃນເອດິເຕີ 3D. ວິທີທຳອິດແມ່ນການກົດປຸ່ມ "
"*Use Snap* (ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Y`). ວິທີທີສອງແມ່ນການເລືອກໂນດ, ລາກຕົວຈັບ (handle) ເທິງກິສໂມ "
"(gizmo) **ຈາກນັ້ນ** ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl` (:kbd:`Cmd` ໃນ macOS) ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຈັບໂນດທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:114
msgid ""
"Start by setting snapping with your preferred method. Then move the "
"``Ground`` node using the Y-axis (the green arrow on the gizmo)."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຍຶດຕິດດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ທ່ານມັກ. ຈາກນັ້ນຍ້າຍໂນດ ``Ground`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ແກນ Y (ລູກສອນສີຂ"
"ຽວເທິງກິສໂມ)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:120
msgid ""
"If you can't see the 3D object manipulator like on the image above, ensure "
"the *Transform Mode* is active in the toolbar above the view."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນຕົວຈັດການວັດຖຸ 3D (manipulator) ຄືໃນຮູບຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ *Transform Mode* "
"ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືເທິງວິດີໂອ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:125
msgid ""
"Move the ground down ``1`` meter, in order to have a visible editor grid. A "
"label in the bottom-left corner of the viewport tells you how much you're "
"translating the node."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍພື້ນລົງລຸ່ມ ``1`` ແມັດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຕາໜ່າງເອດິເຕີໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ. ປ້າຍບອກຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມຂອງວິວພອດຈະບອກທ່າ"
"ນວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງຍ້າຍໂນດໄປເທົ່າໃດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:132
msgid ""
"Moving the *Ground* node down moves both children along with it. Ensure you "
"move the *Ground* node, **not** the *MeshInstance3D* or the "
"*CollisionShape3D*."
msgstr ""
"ການຍ້າຍໂນດ *Ground* ລົງລຸ່ມຈະຍ້າຍທັງໂນດລູກໄປນຳ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຍ້າຍໂນດ *Ground*, **ບໍ່ແມ່"
"ນ** *MeshInstance3D* ຫຼື *CollisionShape3D*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:136
msgid "Ultimately, ``Ground``'s transform.position.y should be -1"
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ສຸດ, transform.position.y ຂອງ ``Ground`` ຄວນຈະເປັນ -1"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:140
msgid ""
"Let's add a directional light so our scene isn't all grey. Select the "
"``Main`` node and add a child node :ref:`DirectionalLight3D "
"<class_DirectionalLight3D>`."
msgstr ""
"ມາເພີ່ມແສງສະຫວ່າງແບບມີທິດທາງ (directional light) ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ສາກຂອງພວກເຮົາມີແຕ່ສີເທົາ. ເລືອກໂນ"
"ດ ``Main`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດລູກ :ref:`DirectionalLight3D <class_DirectionalLight3D>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:145
msgid ""
"We need to move and rotate the :ref:`DirectionalLight3D "
"<class_DirectionalLight3D>` node. Move it up by clicking and dragging on the "
"manipulator's green arrow and click and drag on the red arc to rotate it "
"around the X-axis, until the ground is lit."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍ້າຍ ແລະ ໝູນໂນດ :ref:`DirectionalLight3D "
"<class_DirectionalLight3D>`. ຍ້າຍມັນຂຶ້ນໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກລູກສອນສີຂຽວຂອງຕົວຈັດການ ແລະ "
"ຄລິກແລ້ວລາກສ່ວນໂຄ້ງສີແດງເພື່ອໝູນມັນອ້ອມແກນ X ຈົນກວ່າພື້ນຈະມີແສງສະຫວ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:150
msgid "In the *Inspector*, turn on *Shadow* by clicking the checkbox."
msgstr "ໃນ *Inspector*, ເປີດໃຊ້ *Shadow* ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:154
msgid "At this point, your project should look like this."
msgstr "ມາຮອດຈຸດນີ້, ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/01.game_setup.rst:158
msgid ""
"That's our starting point. In the next part, we will work on the player "
"scene and base movement."
msgstr ""
"ນັ້ນແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ໃນສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບສາກຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ພື້ນຖ"
"ານ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:4
msgid "Player scene and input actions"
msgstr "ສາກຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:6
msgid ""
"In the next two lessons, we will design the player scene, register custom "
"input actions, and code player movement. By the end, you'll have a playable "
"character that moves in eight directions."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສອງບົດຮຽນຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະອອກແບບສາກຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ລົງທະບຽນການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຂ"
"ຽນໂຄດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດ, ທ່ານຈະມີຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ ແລະ ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ແປດທິດທາງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:10
msgid ""
"Create a new scene by going to the **Scene** menu in the top-left and "
"clicking **New Scene**."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສາກໃໝ່ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ **Scene** ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ ແລະ ຄລິກ **New Scene**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click the **Other Node** button and select the ``CharacterBody3D`` node type "
"to create a :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>` as the root node."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ **Other Node** ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດໂນດ ``CharacterBody3D`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ "
":ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>` ເປັນໂນດຮາກ (root node)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:20
msgid ""
"Rename the :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>` to ``Player``. "
"Character bodies are complementary to the area and rigid bodies used in the "
"2D game tutorial. Like rigid bodies, they can move and collide with the "
"environment, but instead of being controlled by the physics engine, **you** "
"dictate their movement. You will see how we use the node's unique features "
"when we code the jump and squash mechanics."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຊື່ :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>` ເປັນ ``Player``. "
"Character bodies ແມ່ນສ່ວນເສີມຂອງ area ແລະ rigid bodies ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນບົດຮຽນເກມ 2D. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັ"
"ບ rigid bodies, ພວກມັນສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ຕຳກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້, ແຕ່ແທນທີ່ຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຟິຊິກເ"
"ອັນຈິນ, **ທ່ານ** ເປັນຜູ້ກຳນົດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງພວກມັນເອງ. ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ເຫັນວິທີທີ່ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດພິເສດຂອງ"
"ໂນດນີ້ ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາຂຽນໂຄ້ດກົນໄກການໂດດ ແລະ ການຢຽບ (squash)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:29
msgid ""
"To learn more about the different physics node types, see "
"the :ref:`doc_physics_introduction`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບປະເພດໂນດຟິຊິກຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_physics_introduction`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:32
msgid ""
"For now, we're going to create a basic rig for our character's 3D model. "
"This will allow us to rotate the model later via code while it plays an "
"animation."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕອນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງໂຄງຮ່າງ (rig) ພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ກັບໂມເດວ 3D ຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກ"
"ເຮົາສາມາດໝຸນໂມເດວຜ່ານໂຄ້ດໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:35
msgid ""
"Add a :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` node as a child of ``Player``. Select the "
"``Player`` node in the **Scene** tree and click the \"**+**\" button to add "
"a child node. Rename it to ``Pivot``."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂນດ :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` ເປັນໂນດລູກ (child) ຂອງ ``Player``. ເເລືອກໂນ"
"ດ ``Player`` ໃນແຖບ **Scene** ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"**+**\" ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂນດລູກ. ປ່ຽນຊື່ມັນເປັນ "
"``Pivot``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:41
msgid ""
"Then, in the FileSystem dock, expand the ``art/`` folder by double-clicking "
"it and drag and drop ``player.glb`` onto ``Pivot``."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນແຖບ FileSystem, ຂະຫຍາຍໂຟນເດີ ``art/`` ໂດຍການດັບເບິນຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກແລ້ວວາງ "
"``player.glb`` ໃສ່ ``Pivot``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:47
msgid ""
"This should instantiate the model as a child of ``Pivot``. You can rename it "
"to ``Character``."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instantiate) ຂອງໂມເດວເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງ ``Pivot``. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ມັນເ"
"ປັນ ``Character``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:54
msgid ""
"The ``.glb`` files contain 3D scene data based on the open source glTF 2.0 "
"specification. They're a modern and powerful alternative to a proprietary "
"format like FBX, which Godot also supports. To produce these files, we "
"designed the model in `Blender 3D <https://www.blender.org/>`__ and exported "
"it to glTF."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ ``.glb`` ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສາກ 3D ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF 2.0 ແບບໂອເພນຊອດ. ພວກມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກ"
"ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ ແລະ ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າຮູບແບບທີ່ມີລິຂະສິດຄື FBX, ເຊິ່ງ Godot ກໍຮອງຮັບເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ອອກແບບໂມເດວໃນ `Blender 3D <https://www.blender.org/>`__ ແລະ ສົ່ງອ"
"ອກ (export) ເປັນ glTF."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:59
msgid ""
"As with all kinds of physics nodes, we need a collision shape for our "
"character to collide with the environment. Select the ``Player`` node again "
"and add a child node :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`. In "
"the **Inspector**, on the **Shape** property, add a new :ref:`SphereShape3D "
"<class_SphereShape3D>`."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບໂນດຟິຊິກທຸກປະເພດ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ (collision shape) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວລະຄອນຕ"
"ຳກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້. ເລືອກໂນດ ``Player`` ອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດລູກ "
":ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`. ໃນແຖບ **Inspector**, ທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັ"
"ດ **Shape**, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ :ref:`SphereShape3D <class_SphereShape3D>` ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:66
msgid "The sphere's wireframe appears below the character."
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງ (wireframe) ຂອງຮູບຊົງກົມຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ລຸ່ມຕົວລະຄອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:70
msgid ""
"It will be the shape the physics engine uses to collide with the "
"environment, so we want it to better fit the 3D model. Make it a bit larger "
"by dragging the orange dot in the viewport. My sphere has a radius of about "
"``0.8`` meters."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຈະເປັນຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ຟິຊິກເອັນຈິນໃຊ້ໃນການຕຳກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມກັບໂມ"
"ເດວ 3D ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໂດຍການລາກຈຸດສີສົ້ມໃນວິວພອດ. ຮູບຊົງກົມຂອງຂ້ອຍມີລັດສະໝີປະມາ"
"ນ ``0.8`` ແມັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:74
msgid ""
"Then, move the collision shape up so its bottom roughly aligns with the "
"grid's plane."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍ້າຍຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳຂຶ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງມັນຢູ່ລະດັບດຽວກັນກັບເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ (grid)."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:78
msgid ""
"To make moving the shape easier, you can toggle the model's visibility by "
"clicking the **eye icon** next to the ``Character`` or the ``Pivot`` nodes."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຍ້າຍຮູບຮ່າງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດ-ເປີດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງໂມເດວໄດ້ ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ **ໄອຄອນຮູບ"
"ຕາ** ທາງຂ້າງໂນດ ``Character`` ຫຼື ``Pivot``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:83
msgid "Save the scene as ``player.tscn``."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສາກເປັນ ``player.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:85
msgid ""
"With the nodes ready, we can almost get coding. But first, we need to define "
"some input actions."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໂນດພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາເກືອບຈະໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຽນໂຄ້ດແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກຳນົດການຕອບສະໜອງຂອ"
"ງອິນພຸດ (input actions) ບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:91
msgid "Creating input actions"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການຕອບສະໜອງຂອງອິນພຸດ (input actions)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:93
msgid ""
"To move the character, we will listen to the player's input, like pressing "
"the arrow keys. In Godot, while we could write all the key bindings in code, "
"there's a powerful system that allows you to assign a label to a set of keys "
"and buttons. This simplifies our scripts and makes them more readable."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະກວດສອບອິນພຸດຈາກຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ການກົດປຸ່ມລູກສອນ. ໃນ Godot, ເຖິງ"
"ແມ່ນວ່າພວກເຮົາສາມາດຂຽນການກຳນົດປຸ່ມທັງໝົດໃນໂຄ້ດໄດ້, ແຕ່ກໍມີລະບົບທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດ"
"ຊື່ (label) ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມຂອງປຸ່ມກົດຕ່າງໆໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບຂອງພວກເຮົານັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ອ່ານງ່າຍກວ່າເກົ່"
"າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:98
msgid ""
"This system is the Input Map. To access its editor, head to the **Project** "
"menu and select **Project Settings...**."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບນີ້ຄື Input Map. ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ **Project** ແລະ ເລືອກ "
"**Project Settings...**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:103
msgid ""
"At the top, there are multiple tabs. Click on **Input Map**. This window "
"allows you to add new actions at the top; they are your labels. In the "
"bottom part, you can bind keys to these actions."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ທາງດ້ານເທິງ, ຈະມີຫຼາຍແຖບໃຫ້ເລືອກ. ຄລິກທີ່ **Input Map**. ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເພີ່ມ action ໃ"
"ໝ່ໆໄດ້ຢູ່ທາງເທິງ; ເຊິ່ງພວກມັນກໍຄືຊື່ (label) ຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນສ່ວນລຸ່ມ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດປຸ່ມກົດໃຫ້ກັບ "
"action ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:109
msgid ""
"Godot projects come with some predefined actions designed for user interface "
"design (see above screenshot). These will become visible if you enable the "
"**Show Built-in Actions** toggle. We could use these here, but instead we're "
"defining our own to support gamepads. Leave **Show Built-in Actions** "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຈະມາພ້ອມກັບ action ບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບການອອກແບບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ເບິ່ງ"
"ຮູບໜ້າຈໍຂ້າງເທິງ). ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນຖ້າທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ງານ **Show Built-in Actions**. ພວກເຮົ"
"າສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດຂອງພວກເຮົາເອງເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຈອຍເກມ (gamepads). ໃ"
"ຫ້ປິດ **Show Built-in Actions** ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:114
msgid ""
"We're going to name our actions ``move_left``, ``move_right``, "
"``move_forward``, ``move_back``, and ``jump``."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ action ຂອງພວກເຮົາວ່າ ``move_left``, ``move_right``, "
"``move_forward``, ``move_back``, ແລະ ``jump``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:117
msgid ""
"To add an action, write its name in the bar at the top and press Enter or "
"click the **Add** button."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ action, ໃຫ້ຂຽນຊື່ຂອງມັນລົງໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ກົດ Enter ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Add**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:121
msgid "Create the following five actions:"
msgstr "ສ້າງຫ້າ action ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:125
msgid ""
"To bind a key or button to an action, click the \"**+**\" button to its "
"right. Do this for ``move_left``. Press the left arrow key and click **OK**."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຜູກປຸ່ມກົດເຂົ້າກັບ action, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"**+**\" ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງມັນ. ເຮັດແບບນີ້ສຳລັບ "
"``move_left``. ກົດປຸ່ມລູກສອນຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຄລິກ **OK**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:130
msgid "Bind also the :kbd:`A` key, onto the action ``move_left``."
msgstr "ຜູກປຸ່ມ :kbd:`A` ເຂົ້າກັບ action ``move_left`` ຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:134
msgid ""
"Let's now add support for a gamepad's left joystick. Click the \"**+**\" "
"button again but this time, select the input within the input tree yourself. "
"Select the negative X axis of the left joystick under **Joypad Axes**."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຈອຍສະຕິກດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຈອຍເກມ. ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"**+**\" ອີກຄັ້ງ ແຕ່ເທື່ອນີ້ໃຫ້ເລືອ"
"ກອິນພຸດໃນຜັງອິນພຸດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເເລືອກແກນ X ຄ່າລົບ (negative X axis) ຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກດ້ານຊ້າຍ ພາຍ"
"ໃຕ້ **Joypad Axes**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:140
msgid "Leave the other values as default and press **OK**."
msgstr "ປະຄ່າອື່ນໆໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default) ແລະ ກົດ **OK**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:144
msgid ""
"If you want controllers to have different input actions, you should use the "
"Devices option in Additional Options. Device 0 corresponds to the first "
"plugged gamepad, Device 1 corresponds to the second plugged gamepad, and so "
"on."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມແຕ່ລະອັນມີ action ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ Devices ໃນ "
"Additional Options. Device 0 ໝາຍເຖິງຈອຍເກມອັນທຳອິດທີ່ສຽບເຂົ້າ, Device 1 ໝາຍເຖິງຈອຍເກມ"
"ອັນທີສອງ, ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:146
msgid ""
"Do the same for the other input actions. For example, bind the right arrow, "
"D, and the left joystick's positive axis to ``move_right``. After binding "
"all keys, your interface should look like this."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບ action ອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຜູກປຸ່ມລູກສອນຂວາ, ປຸ່ມ D, ແລະ ແກນຄ່າບວກຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກດ້າ"
"ນຊ້າຍເຂົ້າກັບ ``move_right``. ຫຼັງຈາກຜູກປຸ່ມທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:152
msgid ""
"The final action to set up is the ``jump`` action. Bind the Space key and "
"the gamepad's A button located under **Joypad Buttons**."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າແມ່ນການກະທຳ ``jump``. ກຳນົດປຸ່ມ Space ແລະ ປຸ່ມ A ຂອງຈອຍເກມ ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍ"
"ໃຕ້ **Joypad Buttons**."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:157
msgid "Your jump input action should look like this."
msgstr "ການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນການກະໂດດຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະມີລັກສະນະແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:161
msgid ""
"That's all the actions we need for this game. You can use this menu to label "
"any groups of keys and buttons in your projects."
msgstr ""
"ນັ້ນຄື action ທັງໝົດທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການສຳລັບເກມນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເມນູນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມຂອງປຸ່ມກົດຕ່າງໆໃນ"
"ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/02.player_input.rst:164
msgid "In the next part, we'll code and test the player's movement."
msgstr "ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ທົດສອບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:4
msgid "Moving the player with code"
msgstr "ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:6
msgid ""
"It's time to code! We're going to use the input actions we created in the "
"last part to move the character."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ເວລາຂຽນໂຄ້ດແລ້ວ! ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ action ທີ່ພວກເຮົາສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນພາກກ່ອນເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:20
msgid ""
"Right-click the ``Player`` node and select *Attach Script* to add a new "
"script to it. In the popup, set the *Template* to *Empty* before pressing "
"the *Create* button. We set it to *Empty* because we want to write our own "
"code for player movement."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໂນດ ``Player`` ແລະ ເລືອກ *Attach Script* ເພື່ອເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ໃຫ້ມັນ. ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ປະກົ"
"ດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ *Template* ເປັນ *Empty* ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກົດປຸ່ມ *Create*. ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງເປັນ *Empty* "
"ກໍຍ້ອນວ່າພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຂຽນໂຄ້ດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຕົວລະຄອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:27
msgid ""
"Let's start with the class's properties. We're going to define a movement "
"speed, a fall acceleration representing gravity, and a velocity we'll use to "
"move the character."
msgstr ""
"ມາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ຂອງຄລາສ. ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດຄວາມໄວໃນການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ອັດຕາເລັ່ງຂ"
"ອງການຕົກທີ່ແທນຄ່າແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ, ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ (velocity) ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:62
msgid ""
"These are common properties for a moving body. The ``target_velocity`` is "
"a :ref:`3D vector <class_Vector3>` combining a speed with a direction. Here, "
"we define it as a property because we want to update and reuse its value "
"across frames."
msgstr ""
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄືຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່. ``target_velocity`` ຄື :ref:`3D vector "
"<class_Vector3>` ທີ່ລວມເອົາຄວາມໄວ ແລະ ທິດທາງເຂົ້າດ້ວຍກັນ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນຄຸນສົມ"
"ບັດເພາະພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການອັບເດດ ແລະ ນຳຄ່າຂອງມັນມາໃຊ້ຄືນໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:68
msgid ""
"The values are quite different from 2D code because distances are in meters. "
"While in 2D, a thousand units (pixels) may only correspond to half of your "
"screen's width, in 3D, it's a kilometer."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໂຄ້ດ 2D ຫຼາຍ ເພາະໄລຍະທາງຖືກນັບເປັນແມັດ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃນ 2D, ໜຶ່ງພັນໜ່ວຍ "
"(pixels) ອາດຈະເທົ່າກັບເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ໃນ 3D, ມັນຄືໜຶ່ງກິໂລແມັດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:72
msgid ""
"Let's code the movement. We start by calculating the input direction vector "
"using the global ``Input`` object, in ``_physics_process()``."
msgstr ""
"ມາຂຽນໂຄ້ດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ກັນ. ພວກເຮົາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຄຳນວນ vector ທິດທາງຂອງອິນພຸດໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດຖຸ "
"``Input`` ແບບໂກລບອນ (global), ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``_physics_process()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:122
msgid ""
"Here, instead of ``_process()``, we're going to make all calculations using "
"the ``_physics_process()`` virtual function. It's designed specifically for "
"physics-related code like moving a kinematic or rigid body. It updates the "
"node using fixed time intervals."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ``_process()``, ພວກເຮົາຈະຄຳນວນທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນສະເໝືອນ (virtual "
"function) ``_physics_process()``. ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບໂຄ້ດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຟິຊິກ ເຊັ່"
"ນ: ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ kinematic body ຫຼື rigid body. ມັນຈະອັບເດດໂນດໂດຍໃຊ້ຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:128
msgid ""
"To learn more about the difference between ``_process()`` and "
"``_physics_process()``, see :ref:`doc_idle_and_physics_processing`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ ``_process()`` ແລະ ``_physics_process()"
"``, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_idle_and_physics_processing`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:131
msgid ""
"We start by initializing a ``direction`` variable to ``Vector3.ZERO``. Then, "
"we check if the player is pressing one or more of the ``move_*`` inputs and "
"update the vector's ``x`` and ``z`` components accordingly. These correspond "
"to the ground plane's axes."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນ ``direction`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ ``Vector3.ZERO``. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົ"
"າກວດສອບວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກຳລັງກົດອິນພຸດ ``move_*`` ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ອັບເດດສ່ວນປະກອບ ``x`` "
"ແລະ ``z`` ຂອງ vector ຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກົງກັບແກນຂອງລະດັບພື້ນດິນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:136
msgid ""
"These four conditions give us eight possibilities and eight possible "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"ເງື່ອນໄຂທັງສີ່ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາມີແປດຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ແປດທິດທາງທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:138
msgid ""
"In case the player presses, say, both W and D simultaneously, the vector "
"will have a length of about ``1.4``. But if they press a single key, it will "
"have a length of ``1``. We want the vector's length to be consistent, and "
"not move faster diagonally. To do so, we can call its ``normalized()`` "
"method."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກົດທັງປຸ່ມ W ແລະ D ພ້ອມກັນ, vector ຈະມີຄວາມຍາວປະມານ ``1.4``. ແຕ່ຖ້າພວກເຂົາກົດປຸ່"
"ມດຽວ, ມັນຈະມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັບ ``1``. ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄວາມຍາວຂອງ vector ຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອ"
"ນທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນແນວສະແຢງ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ເມທອດ (method) ``normalized()`` ຂອງ"
"ມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:168
msgid ""
"Here, we only normalize the vector if the direction has a length greater "
"than zero, which means the player is pressing a direction key."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ vector ເປັນນໍມໍໄລຊ໌ (normalize) ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທິດທາງມີຄວາມຍາວຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມທິດທາງຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:171
msgid ""
"We compute the direction the ``$Pivot`` is looking by creating a :ref:`Basis "
"<class_Basis>` that looks in the ``direction`` direction."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຄຳນວນທິດທາງທີ່ ``$Pivot`` ກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໂດຍການສ້າງ :ref:`Basis <class_Basis>` ທີ່ເບິ່"
"ງໄປຕາມທິດທາງ ``direction``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:174
msgid ""
"Then, we update the velocity. We have to calculate the ground velocity and "
"the fall speed separately. Be sure to go back one tab so the lines are "
"inside the ``_physics_process()`` function but outside the condition we just "
"wrote above."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາອັບເດດຄວາມໄວ (velocity). ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຄຳນວນຄວາມໄວເທິງພື້ນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງກ"
"ານຕົກແຍກກັນ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຍັບຍໍ້ໜ້າກັບຄືນໜຶ່ງແຖບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຖວໂຄ້ດຢູ່ພາຍໃນຟັງຊັນ ``_physics_process"
"()`` ແຕ່ຢູ່ນອກເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ພວກເຮົາຫາກໍ່ຂຽນໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:223
msgid ""
"The ``CharacterBody3D.is_on_floor()`` function returns ``true`` if the body "
"collided with the floor in this frame. That's why we apply gravity to the "
"``Player`` only while it is in the air."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``CharacterBody3D.is_on_floor()`` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ ``true`` ຖ້າວັດຖຸມີການຕຳກັບພື້ນ"
"ໃນເຟຣມນີ້. ນັ້ນແມ່ນເຫດຜົນທີ່ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງກັບ ``Player`` ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ມັນຢູ່ກາງອາກາດເທົ່ານັ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:226
msgid ""
"For the vertical velocity, we subtract the fall acceleration multiplied by "
"the delta time every frame. This line of code will cause our character to "
"fall in every frame, as long as it is not on or colliding with the floor."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄວາມໄວໃນແນວຕັ້ງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົບອອກດ້ວຍອັດຕາເລັ່ງຂອງການຕົກ ຄູນກັບເວລາເດວຕ້າ (delta "
"time) ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ. ແຖວໂຄ້ດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວລະຄອນຂອງພວກເຮົາຕົກລົງໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ ຕາບໃດທີ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ເທິງພື້"
"ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕຳກັບພື້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:230
msgid ""
"The physics engine can only detect interactions with walls, the floor, or "
"other bodies during a given frame if movement and collisions happen. We will "
"use this property later to code the jump."
msgstr ""
"ຟິຊິກເອັນຈິນສາມາດກວດຈັບການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບຝາ, ພື້ນ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸອື່ນໆໃນເຟຣມນັ້ນໆໄດ້ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ການ"
"ຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງເພື່ອຂຽນໂຄ້ດການໂດດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:234
msgid ""
"On the last line, we call ``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()`` which is a "
"powerful method of the ``CharacterBody3D`` class that allows you to move a "
"character smoothly. If it hits a wall midway through a motion, the engine "
"will try to smooth it out for you. It uses the *velocity* value native to "
"the :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>`"
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖວສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນເມທອດທີ່ມີປະສິ"
"ດທິພາບຂອງຄລາສ ``CharacterBody3D`` ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນໄດ້ຢ່າງຄ່ອງຕົວ. ຖ້າມັນ"
"ໄປຕຳກັບຝາໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ເອັນຈິນຈະພະຍາຍາມປັບໃຫ້ມັນລື່ນໄຫຼໄປຕາມຝາໃຫ້ທ່ານເອງ. ມັນໃຊ້ຄ່າ "
"*velocity* ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>`"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:246
msgid "And that's all the code you need to move the character on the floor."
msgstr "ແລະ ນັ້ນຄືໂຄ້ດທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພື່ອເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນເທິງພື້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:248
msgid "Here is the complete ``player.gd`` code for reference."
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືໂຄ້ດ ``player.gd`` ທີ່ສົມບູນເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການອ້າງອີງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:352
msgid "Testing our player's movement"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຕົວລະຄອນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:354
msgid ""
"We're going to put our player in the ``Main`` scene to test it. To do so, we "
"need to instantiate the player and then add a camera. Unlike in 2D, in 3D, "
"you won't see anything if your viewport doesn't have a camera pointing at "
"something."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະນຳເອົາຕົວລະຄອນຂອງພວກເຮົາໄປໃສ່ໃນສາກ ``Main`` ເພື່ອທົດສອບມັນ. ໃນການເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ພວ"
"ກເຮົາຕ້ອງສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ (camera) ເຂົ້າໄປ. ຕ່າງຈາກໃນ 2D, ໃນ "
"3D ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ເຫັນຫຍັງເລີຍ ຖ້າຫາກວິວພອດຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ມີກ້ອງທີ່ກຳລັງສ່ອງໄປຫາສິ່ງໃດສິ່ງໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:358
msgid ""
"Save your ``Player`` scene and open the ``Main`` scene. You can click on the "
"*Main* tab at the top of the editor to do so."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກສາກ ``Player`` ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເປີດສາກ ``Main``. ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ *Main* ຢູ່ທາງເທິງ"
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:363
msgid ""
"If you closed the scene before, head to the *FileSystem* dock and double-"
"click ``main.tscn`` to re-open it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານປິດສາກນັ້ນໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ *FileSystem* ແລະ ດັບເບິນຄລິກ ``main.tscn`` ເພື່ອເປີດ"
"ມັນຄືນໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:366
msgid ""
"To instantiate the ``Player``, right-click on the ``Main`` node and select "
"*Instantiate Child Scene*."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ ``Player``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂນດ ``Main`` ແລະ ເລືອກ *Instantiate "
"Child Scene*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:371
msgid ""
"In the popup, double-click ``player.tscn``. The character should appear in "
"the center of the viewport."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກ ``player.tscn``. ຕົວລະຄອນຄວນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ໃຈກາງຂອງວິວພອດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:375
msgid "Adding a camera"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:377
msgid ""
"Let's add the camera next. Like we did with our *Player*\\ 's *Pivot*, we're "
"going to create a basic rig. Right-click on the ``Main`` node again and "
"select *Add Child Node*. Create a new :ref:`Marker3D <class_Marker3D>`, and "
"name it ``CameraPivot``. Select ``CameraPivot`` and add a child "
"node :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` to it. Your scene tree should look "
"similar to this."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປມາເພີ່ມກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເຮັດກັບ *Pivot* ຂອງ *Player*, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງໂຄງ"
"ຮ່າງພື້ນຖານຂຶ້ນມາ. ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂນດ ``Main`` ອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ເລືອກ *Add Child Node*. ສ້າງ "
":ref:`Marker3D <class_Marker3D>` ໃໝ່, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ມັນວ່າ ``CameraPivot``. ເລືອກ "
"``CameraPivot`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດລູກ :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` ໃສ່ໃນນັ້ນ. ຜັງໂນດ "
"(scene tree) ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືກັບຮູບນີ້."

