#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:390
msgid ""
"We're going to use the *Pivot* to rotate the camera as if it was on a crane. "
"Let's first split the 3D view to be able to freely navigate the scene and "
"see what the camera sees."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ *Pivot* ເພື່ອໝຸນກ້ອງ ຄືກັບວ່າມັນຕິດຢູ່ກັບເຄນ (crane). ກ່ອນອື່ນ ໃຫ້ແຍກມຸມມອງ 3D ອອກເ"
"ພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສຳຫຼວດສາກໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ ແລະ ເຫັນສິ່ງທີ່ກ້ອງເຫັນໄປພ້ອມໆກັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:394
