#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:446
msgid ""
"Test your scene and you should be able to move in all 8 directions and not "
"glitch through the floor!"
msgstr ""
"ທົດລອງສາກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ທ່ານຄວນຈະສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ທັງ 8 ທິດທາງ ແລະ ບໍ່ຫຼຸດທະລຸພື້ນ!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/03.player_movement_code.rst:448
msgid ""
"Ultimately, we have both player movement and the view in place. Next, we "
"will work on the monsters."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ສຸດ, ພວກເຮົາກໍມີທັງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ມຸມມອງທີ່ພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະມາຈັດການກັບພວກສັດ"
"ປະຫຼາດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:4
msgid "Designing the mob scene"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບສາກມັອບ (mob)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this part, you're going to code the monsters, which we'll call mobs. In "
"the next lesson, we'll spawn them randomly around the playable area."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສ່ວນນີ້, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຂຽນໂຄ້ດໃຫ້ກັບພວກສັດປະຫຼາດ, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນພວກມັນວ່າ ມັອບ (mobs). ໃນບົດຮຽ"
"ນຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສຸ່ມໃຫ້ພວກມັນປາກົດຕົວ (spawn) ອ້ອມຮອບພື້ນທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:9
msgid ""
"Let's design the monsters themselves in a new scene. The node structure is "
"going to be similar to the ``player.tscn`` scene."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະມາອອກແບບຕົວສັດປະຫຼາດໃນສາກໃໝ່. ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງ Node ຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບສາກ "
"``player.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:12
msgid ""
"Create a scene with, once again, a :ref:`CharacterBody3D "
"<class_CharacterBody3D>` node as its root. Name it ``Mob``. Add a child "
"node :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>`, name it ``Pivot``. And drag and drop the "
"file ``mob.glb`` from the *FileSystem* dock onto the ``Pivot`` to add the "
"monster's 3D model to the scene."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສາກໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ Node :ref:`CharacterBody3D <class_CharacterBody3D>` ເປັນ root ຄືເ"
"ກົ່າ. ຕັ້ງຊື່ມັນວ່າ ``Mob``. ເເພີ່ມ Node ລູກ :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>`, ຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ "
"``Pivot``. ແລ້ວລາກໄຟລ໌ ``mob.glb`` ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ (FileSystem) ມາໃສ່ ``Pivot`` ເພື່ອ"
"ເພີ່ມໂມເດວ 3D ຂອງສັດປະຫຼາດເຂົ້າໃນສາກ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:19
msgid "You can rename the newly created ``mob`` node into ``Character``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ Node ``mob`` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເປັນ ``Character`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:24
msgid ""
"We need a collision shape for our body to work. Right-click on the ``Mob`` "
"node, the scene's root, and click *Add Child Node*."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງມີຮູບຊົງການຕຳ (collision shape) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວລະຄອນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ Node "
"``Mob``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນ root ຂອງສາກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ *Add Child Node*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:29
msgid "Add a :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:34
msgid "In the *Inspector*, assign a *BoxShape3D* to the *Shape* property."
msgstr "ໃນ *Inspector*, ກໍານົດໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ *Shape* ເປັນ *BoxShape3D*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:38
msgid ""
"We should change its size to fit the 3D model better. You can do so "
"interactively by clicking and dragging on the orange dots."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຄວນປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງມັນໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໂມເດວ 3D. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກຈຸດສີສົ້ມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:41
msgid ""
"The box should touch the floor and be a little thinner than the model. "
"Physics engines work in such a way that if the player's sphere touches even "
"the box's corner, a collision will occur. If the box is a little too big "
"compared to the 3D model, you may die at a distance from the monster, and "
"the game will feel unfair to the players."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຄວນຈະແຕະພື້ນ ແລະ ໃຫ້ແຄບກວ່າໂມເດວເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະບົບຟີຊິກເຮັດວຽກໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ວ່າ ຖ້າວົງມົນຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໄ"
"ປແຕະຖືກແມ່ນແຕ່ມຸມຂອງກ່ອງ, ການຕຳກໍຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າກ່ອງມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂມເດວ 3D, ທ່ານອ"
"າດຈະຕາຍທັງໆທີ່ຍັງຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກສັດປະຫຼາດ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຮູ້ສຶກວ່າເກມບໍ່ຍຸດຕິທຳ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:49
msgid ""
"Notice that my box is taller than the monster. It is okay in this game "
"because we're looking at the scene from above and using a fixed perspective. "
"Collision shapes don't have to match the model exactly. It's the way the "
"game feels when you test it that should dictate their form and size."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າກ່ອງຂອງຂ້ອຍສູງກວ່າຕົວສັດປະຫຼາດ. ມັນບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງສໍາລັບເກມນີ້ ເພາະວ່າພວກເຮົາເບິ່ງສາກຈາກທາງ"
"ເທິງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ມຸມມອງທີ່ຄົງທີ່. ຮູບຊົງການຕຳບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕົງກັບໂມເດວແບບເປະໆ. ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກເວລາທົດລອງຫຼິ້ນເກ"
"ມຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ຈະເປັນຕົວບອກວ່າຮູບຊົງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຄວນເປັນແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:55
msgid "Removing monsters off-screen"
msgstr "ການລຶບສັດປະຫຼາດທີ່ອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:57
msgid ""
"We're going to spawn monsters at regular time intervals in the game level. "
"If we're not careful, their count could increase to infinity, and we don't "
"want that. Each mob instance has both a memory and a processing cost, and we "
"don't want to pay for it when the mob is outside the screen."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດປາກົດຕົວເປັນໄລຍະໆໃນດ່ານເກມ. ຖ້າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ລະວັງ, ຈຳນວນຂອງພວກມັນອາດຈະ"
"ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆຈົນນັບບໍ່ຖ້ວນ, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບນັ້ນ. ມັອບແຕ່ລະຕົວໃຊ້ທັງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ກຳລັງການ"
"ປະມວນຜົນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາບໍ່ຄວນປ່ອຍໃຫ້ມັນກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນຢູ່ນອກໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:62
msgid ""
"Once a monster leaves the screen, we don't need it anymore, so we should "
"delete it. Godot has a node that detects when objects leave the "
"screen, :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`, "
"and we're going to use it to destroy our mobs."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສັດປະຫຼາດອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍໄປແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ຕ້ອງການມັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຄວນລຶບມັນຖິ້ມ. Godot ມີ "
"Node ທີ່ກວດຈັບເມື່ອວັດຖຸອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ, ນັ້ນຄື :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`, ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອທຳລາຍມັອບຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:68
msgid ""
"When you keep instancing an object, there's a technique you can use to avoid "
"the cost of creating and destroying instances all the time called pooling. "
"It consists of pre-creating an array of objects and reusing them over and "
"over."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ Object ຂຶ້ນມາເລື້ອຍໆ, ມັນມີເຕັກນິກທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ pooling ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການສ້າ"
"ງ ແລະ ທຳລາຍ Object ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ. ມັນຄືການສ້າງ Object ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເປັນຊຸດ ແລ້ວນຳພວກມັນກັບມາໃຊ້ໃ"
"ໝ່ຊ້ຳໆ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:73
msgid ""
"When working with GDScript, this usually isn't needed. The main reason to "
"use pools is to avoid freezes with garbage-collected languages like C# or "
"Lua. GDScript uses a different technique to manage memory, reference "
"counting, which doesn't have that caveat. You can learn more about that "
"here: :ref:`doc_gdscript_basics_memory_management`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ GDScript, ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກນີ້. ເຫດຜົນຫຼັກໃນການໃຊ້ pools ແມ່ນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນກາ"
"ນຄ້າງໃນພາສາທີ່ມີລະບົບ garbage-collected ເຊັ່ນ C# ຫຼື Lua. ແຕ່ GDScript ໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກການຈັດການໜ່"
"ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ ນັ້ນຄື reference counting, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີບັນຫາຄືກັບພາສາອື່ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສຶກສາເພີ່ມ"
"ເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: :ref:`doc_gdscript_basics_memory_management`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:79
msgid ""
"Select the ``Mob`` node and add a child node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`. Another box, pink this time, appears. "
"When this box completely leaves the screen, the node will emit a signal."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ Node ``Mob`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ Node ລູກ :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>`. ຈະມີກ່ອງອີກອັນໜຶ່ງປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງເທື່ອນີ້ເປັນສີບົວ. ເມື່ອກ່ອງນີ້"
"ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍໄປທັງໝົດ, Node ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ (signal) ອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:85
msgid "Resize it using the orange dots until it covers the entire 3D model."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍໃຊ້ຈຸດສີສົ້ມຈົນກວ່າມັນຈະຄອບຄຸມໂມເດວ 3D ທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:90
msgid "Coding the mob's movement"
msgstr "ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງມັອບ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:92
msgid ""
"Let's implement the monster's motion. We're going to do this in two steps. "
"First, we'll write a script on the ``Mob`` that defines a function to "
"initialize the monster. We'll then code the randomized spawn mechanism in "
"the ``main.tscn`` scene and call the function from there."
msgstr ""
"ມາເລີ່ມສ້າງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດກັນເລີຍ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດເປັນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ. ຂັ້ນທຳອິດ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຂຽ"
"ນ Script ໃຫ້ກັບ ``Mob`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຟັງຊັນສຳລັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (initialize) ສັດປະຫຼາດ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົ"
"າຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດລະບົບສຸ່ມການປາກົດຕົວໃນສາກ ``main.tscn`` ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນັ້ນຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:97
msgid "Attach a script to the ``Mob``."
msgstr "ໃສ່ Script ໃຫ້ກັບ ``Mob``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:101
msgid ""
"Here's the movement code to start with. We define two properties, "
"``min_speed`` and ``max_speed``, to define a random speed range, which we "
"will later use to define ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄ້ດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດສອງຄຸນສົມບັດຄື ``min_speed`` ແລະ ``max_speed`` ເ"
"ພື່ອກຳນົດຊ່ວງຄວາມໄວແບບສຸ່ມ, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ກຳນົດ ``CharacterBody3D.velocity`` ໃນພາ"
"ຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:139
msgid ""
"Similarly to the player, we move the mob every frame by calling the function "
"``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()``. This time, we don't update the "
"``velocity`` every frame; we want the monster to move at a constant speed "
"and leave the screen, even if it were to hit an obstacle."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບຕົວຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາເຮັດໃຫ້ມັອບເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"``CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide()``. ແຕ່ເທື່ອນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດ ``velocity`` ໃນທຸກ"
"ໆເຟຣມ; ເພາະພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍໄປເລີຍ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ"
"ມັນຈະໄປຕຳກັບສິ່ງກີດຂວາງກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:144
msgid ""
"We need to define another function to calculate the "
"``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. This function will turn the monster towards "
"the player and randomize both its angle of motion and its velocity."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກຳນົດອີກຟັງຊັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຄຳນວນ ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນທິດທາງໃຫ້"
"ສັດປະຫຼາດຫັນໄປຫາຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ສຸ່ມທັງມຸມການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:148
msgid ""
"The function will take a ``start_position``,the mob's spawn position, and "
"the ``player_position`` as its arguments."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຮັບຄ່າ ``start_position`` (ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ມັອບປາກົດຕົວ) ແລະ ``player_position`` ເປັນ "
"Parameter."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:151
msgid ""
"We position the mob at ``start_position`` and turn it towards the player "
"using the ``look_at_from_position()`` method, and randomize the angle by "
"rotating a random amount around the Y axis. Below, ``randf_range()`` outputs "
"a random value between ``-PI / 4`` radians and ``PI / 4`` radians."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງມັອບໄວ້ທີ່ ``start_position`` ແລະ ຫັນມັນໄປຫາຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ Method "
"``look_at_from_position()``, ຈາກນັ້ນກໍສຸ່ມມຸມໂດຍການໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Y. ໃນໂຄ້ດລຸ່ມນີ້, "
"``randf_range()`` ຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ ``-PI / 4`` ເຣດຽນ (radians) ຫາ ``PI / 4`` ເຣ"
"ດຽນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:181
msgid ""
"We got a random position, now we need a ``random_speed``. ``randi_range()`` "
"will be useful as it gives random int values, and we will use ``min_speed`` "
"and ``max_speed``. ``random_speed`` is just an integer, and we just use it "
"to multiply our ``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. After ``random_speed`` is "
"applied, we rotate ``CharacterBody3D.velocity`` Vector3 towards the player."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕຳແໜ່ງສຸ່ມແລ້ວ, ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການ ``random_speed``. ``randi_range()`` ຈະມີປ"
"ະໂຫຍດເພາະມັນໃຫ້ຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ (int) ແບບສຸ່ມ, ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ ``min_speed`` ແລະ "
"``max_speed``. ``random_speed`` ເປັນພຽງຕົວເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ເຮົາໃຊ້ໄປຄູນກັບ "
"``CharacterBody3D.velocity``. ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ ``random_speed`` ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາກໍຈະໝຸນ "
"Vector3 ຂອງ ``CharacterBody3D.velocity`` ໄປຫາທິດທາງທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:214
msgid "Leaving the screen"
msgstr "ການອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:216
msgid ""
"We still have to destroy the mobs when they leave the screen. To do so, "
"we'll connect our :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` node's ``screen_exited`` signal to the "
"``Mob``."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງທຳລາຍມັອບເມື່ອມັນອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍ. ເພື່ອເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ "
"``screen_exited`` ຂອງ Node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` ເຂົ້າກັບ ``Mob``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:219
msgid ""
"Select the :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D "
"<class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` node and on the right side of the "
"interface, navigate to the *Signals* dock. Double-click the "
"``screen_exited()`` signal."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ Node :ref:`VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D <class_VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D>` "
"ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແຖບ *Signals* ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ຈາກນັ້ນດັບເບິລຄລິກທີ່ສັນຍານ ``screen_exited()``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:224
msgid "Connect the signal to the ``Mob``"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານເຂົ້າກັບ ``Mob``"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:228
msgid ""
"This will add a new function for you in your mob script, "
"``_on_visible_on_screen_notifier_3d_screen_exited()``. From it, call the "
"``queue_free()`` method. This function destroys the instance it's called on."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນໃໝ່ໃນ Script ຂອງມັອບໃຫ້ທ່ານ, ນັ້ນຄື "
"``_on_visible_on_screen_notifier_3d_screen_exited()``. ພາຍໃນຟັງຊັນນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"Method ``queue_free()``. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະທຳລາຍ Object Instance ທີ່ມັນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:247
msgid ""
"Our monster is ready to enter the game! In the next part, you will spawn "
"monsters in the game level."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ສັດປະຫຼາດຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ເກມແລ້ວ! ໃນສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ສ້າງໃຫ້ພວກມັນປາກົດຕົວໃນດ່ານເ"
"ກມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/04.mob_scene.rst:250
msgid "Here is the complete ``mob.gd`` script for reference."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນ Script ``mob.gd`` ທີ່ສົມບູນເພື່ອໄວ້ອ້າງອີງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:4
msgid "Spawning monsters"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດປາກົດຕົວ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this part, we're going to spawn monsters along a path randomly. By the "
"end, you will have monsters roaming the game board."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສ່ວນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດປາກົດຕົວແບບສຸ່ມໄປຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ. ເມື່ອຈົບສ່ວນນີ້, ທ່ານຈະມີສັດປະຫຼາດແ"
"ລ່ນໄປມາທົ່ວພື້ນທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:11
msgid ""
"Double-click on ``main.tscn`` in the *FileSystem* dock to open the ``Main`` "
"scene."
msgstr "ດັບເບິລຄລິກທີ່ ``main.tscn`` ໃນແຖບ *FileSystem* ເພື່ອເປີດສາກ ``Main``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:13
msgid ""
"Before drawing the path, we're going to change the game resolution. Our game "
"has a default window size of ``1152x648``. We're going to set it to "
"``720x540``, a nice little box."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທາງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງເກມກ່ອນ. ເກມຂອງພວກເຮົາມີຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແ"
"ມ່ນ ``1152x648``. ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງມັນເປັນ ``720x540`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂະໜາດກ່ອງນ້ອຍໆທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:17
msgid "Go to *Project -> Project Settings*."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ *Project -> Project Settings*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:21
msgid "If you still have *Input Map* open, switch to the *General* tab."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງເປີດ *Input Map* ຢູ່, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແຖບ *General*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:23
msgid ""
"In the left menu, navigate down to *Display -> Window*. On the right, set "
"the *Viewport Width* to ``720`` and the *Viewport Height* to ``540``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເມນູເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ເລື່ອນລົງໄປທີ່ *Display -> Window*. ທາງດ້ານຂວາ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ *Viewport "
"Width* ເປັນ ``720`` ແລະ *Viewport Height* ເປັນ ``540``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:29
msgid "Creating the spawn path"
msgstr "ການສ້າງເສັ້ນທາງປາກົດຕົວ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:31
msgid ""
"Like you did in the 2D game tutorial, you're going to design a path and use "
"a :ref:`PathFollow3D <class_PathFollow3D>` node to sample random locations "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍເຮັດໃນບົດຮຽນເກມ 2D, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ອອກແບບເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ Node "
":ref:`PathFollow3D <class_PathFollow3D>` ເພື່ອສຸ່ມຫາຕຳແໜ່ງຕ່າງໆເທິງເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:34
msgid ""
"In 3D though, it's a bit more complicated to draw the path. We want it to be "
"around the game view so monsters appear right outside the screen. But if we "
"draw a path, we won't see it from the camera preview."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ໃນຮູບແບບ 3D, ການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທາງຈະມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັນຢູ່ອ້ອມຮອບມຸມມອງ"
"ເກມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດປາກົດຕົວຢູ່ຂອບນອກຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ແຕ່ຖ້າພວກເຮົາແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທາງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນມັນຈາ"
"ກໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview) ຂອງກ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:38
msgid ""
"To find the view's limits, we can use some placeholder meshes. Your viewport "
"should still be split into two parts, with the camera preview at the bottom. "
"If that isn't the case, press :kbd:`Ctrl + 2` (:kbd:`Cmd + 2` on macOS) to "
"split the view into two. Select the :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` node "
"and click the *Preview* checkbox in the bottom viewport."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫາຂອບເຂດຂອງມຸມມອງ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ Mesh ມາເປັນບ່ອນໝາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ. ໜ້າຈໍ Viewport ຂ"
"ອງທ່ານຄວນຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງສ່ວນ ໂດຍມີຕົວຢ່າງຈາກກ້ອງຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ເປັນແບບນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກົດ "
":kbd:`Ctrl + 2` (:kbd:`Cmd + 2` ໃນ macOS) ເພື່ອແບ່ງໜ້າຈໍ. ເລືອກ Node "
":ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງ *Preview* ໃນ Viewport ດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:47
msgid "Adding placeholder cylinders"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຮູບຊົງກະບອກເພື່ອໝາຍຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:49
msgid ""
"Let's add the placeholder meshes. Add a new :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` as "
"a child of the ``Main`` node and name it ``Cylinders``. We'll use it to "
"group the cylinders. Select ``Cylinders`` and add a child "
"node :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>`"
msgstr ""
"ມາເພີ່ມ Mesh ສຳລັບໝາຍຕຳແໜ່ງກັນ. ເພີ່ມ :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` ໃໝ່ເປັນ Node ລູກຂອງ "
"``Main`` ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``Cylinders``. ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອລວມກຸ່ມຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ເລືອກ "
"``Cylinders`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ Node ລູກ :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:54
msgid "In the *Inspector*, assign a *CylinderMesh* to the *Mesh* property."
msgstr "ໃນ *Inspector*, ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ *Mesh* ເປັນ *CylinderMesh*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:58
msgid ""
"Set the top viewport to the top orthogonal view using the menu in the "
"viewport's top-left corner. Alternatively, you can press the keypad's 7 key."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ Viewport ດ້ານເທິງໃຫ້ເປັນມຸມມອງດ້ານເທິງ (top orthogonal) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງ "
"Viewport. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດກົດປຸ່ມເລກ 7 ຢູ່ແຖບຕົວເລກກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:63
msgid ""
"The grid may be distracting. You can toggle it by going to the *View* menu "
"in the toolbar and clicking *View Grid*."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຕາຕະຫຼາງ (grid) ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍຕາ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ *View* ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື "
"ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ *View Grid*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:68
msgid ""
"You now want to move the cylinder along the ground plane, looking at the "
"camera preview in the bottom viewport. I recommend using grid snap to do so. "
"You can toggle it by clicking the magnet icon in the toolbar or pressing Y."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍຮູບຊົງກະບອກໄປຕາມພື້ນ ໂດຍເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຈາກກ້ອງໃນ Viewport ດ້ານລຸ່ມໄປນຳ. ຂ້ອຍແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ Grid Snap ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຍ້າຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຮູບແມ່ເຫຼັກໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື ຫຼື ກົດ"
"ປຸ່ມ Y."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:74
msgid ""
"Move the cylinder so it's right outside the camera's view in the top-left "
"corner."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຮູບຊົງກະບອກໄປໄວ້ທີ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ ໃຫ້ຢູ່ນອກມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງພໍດີ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:79
msgid ""
"We're going to create copies of the mesh and place them around the game "
"area. Press :kbd:`Ctrl + D` (:kbd:`Cmd + D` on macOS) to duplicate the node. "
"You can also right-click the node in the *Scene* dock and select "
"*Duplicate*. Move the copy down along the blue Z axis until it's right "
"outside the camera's preview."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງ Mesh ນີ້ແລ້ວວາງໄວ້ອ້ອມພື້ນທີ່ເກມ. ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + D` (:kbd:`Cmd + "
"D` ໃນ macOS) ເພື່ອສຳເນົາ Node. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ Node ໃນແຖບ *Scene* ແລ້ວເລືອກ "
"*Duplicate*. ຍ້າຍຕົວສຳເນົາລົງມາຕາມແກນ Z ສີຟ້າ ຈົນກວ່າມັນຈະຢູ່ນອກມຸມມອງກ້ອງດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:84
msgid ""
"Select both cylinders by pressing the :kbd:`Shift` key and clicking on the "
"unselected one and duplicate them."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຮູບຊົງກະບອກທັງສອງໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Shift` ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວຄລິກເລືອກອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍສຳເນົາພ"
"ວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:89
msgid "Move them to the right by dragging the red X axis."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍພວກມັນໄປທາງຂວາໂດຍການລາກແກນ X ສີແດງ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:93
msgid ""
"They're a bit hard to see in white, aren't they? Let's make them stand out "
"by giving them a new material."
msgstr ""
"ພວກມັນເບິ່ງຍາກເລັກນ້ອຍເພາະເປັນສີຂາວແມ່ນບໍ່? ມາເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຫັນແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການໃສ່ວັດສະດຸ "
"(material) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:96
msgid ""
"In 3D, materials define a surface's visual properties like its color, how it "
"reflects light, and more. We can use them to change the color of a mesh."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະບົບ 3D, material ຈະກຳນົດລັກສະນະທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງພື້ນຜິວ ເຊັ່ນ ສີ, ການສະທ້ອນແສງ ແລະ ອື່ນ"
"ໆ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອປ່ຽນສີຂອງ Mesh ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:99
msgid ""
"We can update all four cylinders at once. Select all the mesh instances in "
"the *Scene* dock. To do so, you can click on the first one and Shift click "
"on the last one."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາສາມາດອັບເດດຮູບຊົງກະບອກທັງສີ່ອັນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ເລືອກ Mesh Instance ທັງໝົດໃນແຖບ *Scene*. "
"ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ອັນທຳອິດ ແລ້ວກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ອັນສຸດທ້າຍ."

