#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:151
msgid "With that, we're ready to code the spawn mechanism."
msgstr "ພຽງເທົ່ານີ້, ພວກເຮົາກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດລະບົບການປາກົດຕົວແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:154
msgid "Spawning monsters randomly"
msgstr "ການສຸ່ມເຮັດໃຫ້ສັດປະຫຼາດປາກົດຕົວ"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:156
msgid "Right-click on the ``Main`` node and attach a new script to it."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ Node ``Main`` ແລ້ວໃສ່ Script ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບມັນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:158
msgid ""
"We first export a variable to the *Inspector* so that we can assign "
"``mob.tscn`` or any other monster to it."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນອື່ນ ພວກເຮົາຈະ Export ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variable) ອອກໄປຫາແຖບ *Inspector* ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາ"
"ດກຳນົດໄຟລ໌ ``mob.tscn`` ຫຼື ສັດປະຫຼາດຕົວອື່ນໆໃຫ້ກັບມັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:180
msgid ""
"We want to spawn mobs at regular time intervals. To do this, we need to go "
"back to the scene and add a timer. Before that, though, we need to assign "
"the ``mob.tscn`` file to the ``mob_scene`` property above (otherwise it's "
"null!)"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັອບປາກົດຕົວເປັນໄລຍະໆ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກັບໄປທີ່ສາກແລ້ວເພີ່ມ Timer. ແຕ່"
"ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກຳນົດໄຟລ໌ ``mob.tscn`` ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ ``mob_scene`` ທາງເທິງກ່ອນ (ບໍ່ດັ່"
"ງນັ້ນມັນຈະເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ ຫຼື null!)"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:184
msgid ""
"Head back to the 3D screen and select the ``Main`` node. Drag ``mob.tscn`` "
"from the *FileSystem* dock to the *Mob Scene* slot in the *Inspector*."
msgstr ""
"ກັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ 3D ແລ້ວເລືອກ Node ``Main``. ລາກໄຟລ໌ ``mob.tscn`` ຈາກແຖບ *FileSystem* ໄປ"
