msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:220
msgid ""
"Call the mob's ``initialize()`` method, passing it the random position and "
"the player's position."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Method ``initialize()`` ຂອງມັອບ ໂດຍສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງສຸ່ມ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເຂົ້າໄປ."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:222
msgid "Add the mob as a child of the *Main* node."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມມັອບເຂົ້າເປັນ Node ລູກຂອງ Node *Main*."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:264
msgid ""
"Above, ``randf()`` produces a random value between ``0`` and ``1``, which is "
"what the *PathFollow* node's ``progress_ratio`` expects: 0 is the start of "
"the path, 1 is the end of the path. The path we have set is around the "
"camera's viewport, so any random value between 0 and 1 is a random position "
"alongside the edges of the viewport!"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງ, ``randf()`` ຈະສ້າງຄ່າສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ ``0`` ຫາ ``1``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ "
"``progress_ratio`` ຂອງ Node *PathFollow* ຕ້ອງການ: 0 ຄືຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ 1 ຄືຈຸ"
"ດສິ້ນສຸດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ພວກເຮົາສ້າງໄວ້ແມ່ນຢູ່ອ້ອມຂອບມຸມມອງກ້ອງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທຸກຄ່າສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1 ກໍ"
"ຄືຕຳແໜ່ງສຸ່ມຕາມຂອບຂອງໜ້າຈໍນັ້ນເອງ!"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:270
