msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກ editor ພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້: **Editor > "
"Editor Settings > Text Editor > Behavior > Auto Reload Scripts on External "
"Change**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:86
