#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:372
msgid ""
"Due to how the project upgrade tool works, not all :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)` renames can be performed automatically. The list "
"below contains all renames that must be performed manually using the script "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເຄື່ອງມືອັບເກຣດໂປຣເຈັກ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆການປ່ຽນຊື່ :abbr:`API "
"(Application Programming Interface)` ຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ລາຍການລຸ່ມນີ້ປະກອບມີ"
"ການປ່ຽນຊື່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ script editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:376
msgid ""
"If you cannot find a node or resource in the list below, refer to the above "
"table to find its new name."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ພົບ node ຫຼື resource ໃນລາຍການລຸ່ມນີ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຂ້າງເທິງເພື່ອຊອກຫາຊື່ໃໝ່ຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:381
msgid ""
"You can use the **Replace in Files** dialog to speed up replacement by "
"pressing :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + R` while the script editor is open. However, "
"be careful as the Replace in Files dialog doesn't offer any way to undo a "
"replacement. Use version control to commit your upgrade work regularly. "
"Command line tools such as `sd <https://github.com/chmln/sd>`__ can also be "
"used if you need something more flexible than the editor's Replace in Files "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ **Replace in Files** ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການແທນທີ່ໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + "
"Shift + R` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດ script editor ຢູ່. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງເນື່ອງຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"Replace in Files ບໍ່ມີວິທີການຍົກເລີກ (undo) ການແທນທີ່. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ version control ເພື່ອ "
"commit ວຽກງານການອັບເກຣດຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳ. ເຄື່ອງມື command line ເຊັ່ນ `sd <https://"
"github.com/chmln/sd>`__ ກໍສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການສິ່ງທີ່ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນກວ່າ "
"Replace in Files ຂອງ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:388
msgid ""
"If using C#, remember to search for outdated API usage with PascalCase "
"notation in the project (and perform the replacement with PascalCase "
"notation)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ C#, ຢ່າລືມຄົ້ນຫາການໃຊ້ API ເກົ່າດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ PascalCase ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ (ແລະ ເຮັດການແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ"
"ຮູບແບບ PascalCase)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:392
msgid "**Methods**"
msgstr "**ວິທີການ (Methods)**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:394
msgid ""
"File and Directory classes were replaced by :ref:`class_FileAccess` "
"and :ref:`class_DirAccess`, which have an entirely different API. Several "
"methods are now static, which means you can call them directly on FileAccess "
"or DirAccess without having to create an instance of that class."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສ File ແລະ Directory ຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ :ref:`class_FileAccess` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_DirAccess`, ເຊິ່ງມີ API ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ. ຫຼາຍໆວິທີການໃນຕອນນີ້ເປັນແບບ "
"static, ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານ FileAccess ຫຼື DirAccess ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳ"
"ເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ instance ຂອງຄລາສນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:398
msgid ""
"Screen and window-related methods from the :ref:`class_OS` singleton (such "
"as ``OS.get_screen_size()``) were moved to the :ref:`class_DisplayServer` "
"singleton. Method naming was also changed to use the ``DisplayServer."
"<object>_<get/set>_property()`` form instead. For example, "
"``OS.get_screen_size()`` becomes ``DisplayServer.screen_get_size()``."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງຈາກ singleton :ref:`class_OS` (ເຊັ່ນ "
"``OS.get_screen_size()``) ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ singleton :ref:`class_DisplayServer`. ການຕັ້"
"ງຊື່ວິທີການກໍຖືກປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ ``DisplayServer.<object>_<get/set>_property()`` ແທນ. ຕົ"
"ວຢ່າງ: ``OS.get_screen_size()`` ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``DisplayServer.screen_get_size()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:403
msgid ""
"Time and date methods from the :ref:`class_OS` singleton were moved to "
"the :ref:`class_Time` singleton. (The Time singleton is also available in "
"Godot 3.5 and later.)"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການກ່ຽວກັບເວລາ ແລະ ວັນທີຈາກ singleton :ref:`class_OS` ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ singleton "
":ref:`class_Time`. (Time singleton ຍັງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Godot 3.5 ແລະ ລຸ້ນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:406
msgid ""
"You may have to replace some ``instance()`` calls with ``instantiate()``. "
"The converter *should* handle this automatically, but this relies on custom "
"code that may not work in 100% of situations."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``instance()`` ບາງບ່ອນເປັນ ``instantiate()``. ຕົວແປງ "
"(converter) *ຄວນຈະ* ຈັດການເລື່ອງນີ້ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ມັນອາໄສ code ພິເສດເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນໃ"
"ນທຸກໆສະຖານະການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:409
msgid "AcceptDialog's ``set_autowrap()`` is now ``set_autowrap_mode()``."
msgstr "``set_autowrap()`` ຂອງ AcceptDialog ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``set_autowrap_mode()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:410
msgid ""
"AnimationNode's ``process()`` is now ``_process()`` (note the leading "
"underscore, which denotes a virtual method)."
msgstr ""
"``process()`` ຂອງ AnimationNode ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``_process()`` (ສັງເກດເຄື່ອງໝາຍ "
"underscore ທາງໜ້າ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງ virtual method)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:412
msgid ""
"AnimationPlayer's ``add_animation()`` is now ``add_animation_library()`` and "
"now uses an :ref:`class_AnimationLibrary`."
msgstr ""
"``add_animation()`` ຂອງ AnimationPlayer ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``add_animation_library()`` ແລ"
"ະ ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`class_AnimationLibrary`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:413
msgid ""
"AnimationTree's ``set_process_mode()`` is now ``set_process_callback()``."
msgstr ""
"``set_process_mode()`` ຂອງ AnimationTree ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``set_process_callback()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:414
msgid "Array's ``empty()`` is now ``is_empty()``."
msgstr "``empty()`` ຂອງ Array ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``is_empty()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:415
msgid "Array's ``invert()`` is now ``reverse()``."
msgstr "``invert()`` ຂອງ Array ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``reverse()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:416
msgid "Array's ``remove()`` is now ``remove_at()``."
msgstr "``remove()`` ຂອງ Array ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``remove_at()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:417
msgid "AStar2D and AStar3D's ``get_points()`` is now ``get_points_id()``."
msgstr "``get_points()`` ຂອງ AStar2D ແລະ AStar3D ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``get_points_id()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:418
msgid "BaseButton's ``set_event()`` is now ``set_shortcut()``."
msgstr "``set_event()`` ຂອງ BaseButton ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``set_shortcut()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:419
msgid "Camera2D's ``get_h_offset()`` is now ``get_drag_horizontal_offset()``."
msgstr ""
"``get_h_offset()`` ຂອງ Camera2D ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``get_drag_horizontal_offset()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:420
msgid "Camera2D's ``get_v_offset()`` is now ``get_drag_vertical_offset()``."
msgstr ""
"``get_v_offset()`` ຂອງ Camera2D ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``get_drag_vertical_offset()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:421
msgid "Camera2D's ``set_h_offset()`` is now ``set_drag_horizontal_offset()``."
msgstr ""
"``set_h_offset()`` ຂອງ Camera2D ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``set_drag_horizontal_offset()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:422
msgid "Camera2D's ``set_v_offset()`` is now ``set_drag_vertical_offset()``."
msgstr ""
"``set_v_offset()`` ຂອງ Camera2D ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``set_drag_vertical_offset()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:423
msgid "CanvasItem's ``raise()`` is now ``move_to_front()``."
msgstr "``raise()`` ຂອງ CanvasItem ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``move_to_front()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:424
msgid "CanvasItem's ``update()`` is now ``queue_redraw()``."
msgstr "``update()`` ຂອງ CanvasItem ປ່ຽນເປັນ ``queue_redraw()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:425
