msgid ""
"The ``extents`` property on CSG nodes and VoxelGI will have to be replaced "
"with ``size``, with the set value halved (as they're no longer half-"
"extents). This also affects its setter/getter methods ``set_extents()`` and "
"``get_extents()``."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``extents`` ໃນ CSG node ແລະ VoxelGI ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ ``size``, ໂດຍຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄ"
"ວ້ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຫານສອງ (ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນ half-extents ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ). ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວິທີການ "
"setter/getter ``set_extents()`` ແລະ ``get_extents()`` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:499
msgid ""
"The ``Engine.editor_hint`` property was removed in favor of the "
"``Engine.is_editor_hint()`` *method*. This is because it's read-only, and "
"properties in Godot are not used for read-only values."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Engine.editor_hint`` ຖືກຖອນອອກ ແລະ ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ *ວິທີການ* "
"``Engine.is_editor_hint()`` ແທນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າມັນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only), ແລ"
"ະ ຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ Godot ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນ read-only."

