#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:123
msgid ""
"While the values of the enum fields in ``RenderingDevice.InitialAction`` and "
"``RenderingDevice.FinalAction`` changed, the only method that consumed them "
"(``draw_list_begin``) added a compatibility method which supports the old "
"values. So in practice it doesn't break compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຄ່າຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ enum ໃນ ``RenderingDevice.InitialAction`` ແລະ "
"``RenderingDevice.FinalAction`` ຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແຕ່ວິທີການດຽວທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ "
"(``draw_list_begin``) ໄດ້ເພີ່ມວິທີການເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບຄ່າເກົ່າ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.3.rst:129
msgid ""
"In C#, the enum ``RenderingDevice.DriverResource`` breaks compatibility "
"because of the way the bindings generator detects the enum prefix. New "
"members were added in `GH-83452`_ to the enum that caused the enum members "
"to be renamed."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ C#, enum ``RenderingDevice.DriverResource`` ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີ"
"ທີ່ຕົວສ້າງ bindings ກວດສອບຄຳນຳໜ້າຂອງ enum. ສະມາຊິກໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ `GH-83452`_ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້"
"ສະມາຊິກຂອງ enum ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່."

