"າມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເສຍໄປ ເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ມີທາງທີ່ຈະອາໄສສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງເອັນຈິນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:180
msgid ""
"The ``Curve`` resource now enforces its value range, so ``min_value`` and "
"``max_value`` need to be changed if any of the points fall outside of the "
"default ``[0, 1]`` range."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ``Curve`` ຕອນນີ້ມີການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ``min_value`` ແລະ "
"``max_value`` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫາກມີຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``[0, 1]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:188
msgid ""
"The ``VisualShaderNodeVec4Constant`` shader node had its input type changed "
"to ``Vector4``. Users need to recreate the values in their constants."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ shader ``VisualShaderNodeVec4Constant`` ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນປະເພດ input ເປັນ "
"``Vector4``. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຄ່າໃນຄົງທີ່ (constants) ຂອງພວກເຂົາໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:192
msgid "CSG"
msgstr "CSG"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:196
msgid ""
"The CSG implementation now uses Emmett Lalish's `Manifold <https://"
"github.com/elalish/manifold>`_ library (`GH-94321`_). The new implementation "
"is more consistent with manifold definitions and fixes a number of bugs and "
"stability issues. As a result, non-manifold meshes are no longer supported. "
"You can use ``MeshInstance3D`` for rendering non-manifold geometry, such as "
"quads or planes."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ CSG ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ `Manifold <https://github.com/elalish/manifold>`_ ຂອ"
"ງ Emmett Lalish (`GH-94321`_). ການນຳໃຊ້ໃໝ່ນີ້ມີຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັບນິຍາມຂອງ manifold ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂບັກລວມເຖິງບັນຫາຄວາມສະຖຽນຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາແມ່ນ ເມຊ (meshes) ແບບ non-"
"manifold ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ``MeshInstance3D`` ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີເລຂາຄະນິດແ"
"ບບ non-manifold ເຊັ່ນ quads ຫຼື planes ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:206
msgid ""
"Android sensor events are no longer enabled by default (`GH-94799`_). "
"Projects that use sensor events can enable them as needed in Project "
"Settings under **Input Devices > Sensors**."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດການເຊັນເຊີ (sensor events) ໃນ Android ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (`GH-94799`_)"
". ໂຄງການທີ່ໃຊ້ເຫດການເຊັນເຊີສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການໃນ Project Settings ພາຍໃຕ້ "
"**Input Devices > Sensors**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading from Godot 4.4 to Godot 4.5"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຈາກ Godot 4.4 ເປັນ Godot 4.5"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"For most games and apps made with 4.4 it should be relatively safe to "
"migrate to 4.5. This page intends to cover everything you need to pay "
"attention to when migrating your project."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມ ແລະ ແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍເວີຊັນ 4.4 ຖືວ່າຂ້ອນຂ້າງປອດໄພທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍມາເປັນ 4.5. ໜ້ານີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົ"
"ງເພື່ອລວມເອົາທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງໃນເວລາການຍ້າຍໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you are migrating from 4.4 to 4.5, the breaking changes listed here might "
"affect you. Changes are grouped by areas/systems."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງຍ້າຍຈາກ 4.4 ເປັນ 4.5, ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບເກົ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ອາດຈະມີຜົນກັບເຈົ້"
"າ. ການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມພາກສ່ວນ/ລະບົບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"In order to support `new Google Play requirements`_ Android now requires "
"targeting .NET 9 when exporting C# projects to Android, other platforms "
"continue to use .NET 8 as the minimum required version but newer versions "
"are supported and encouraged."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ `ຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃໝ່ຂອງ Google Play`_, ຕອນນີ້ Android ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍເປັນ .NET "
"9 ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂຄງການ C# ໄປຍັງ Android, ສ່ວນແພລດຟອມອື່ນໆຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ .NET 8 ເປັນເວີຊັນຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງກ"
"ານ ແຕ່ກໍຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you are using C# in your project and want to export to Android, you will "
"need to upgrade your project to .NET 9 (see `Upgrading to a new .NET "
"version`_ for instructions)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ C# ໃນໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງ Android, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດໂຄງການຂອ"
"ງເຈົ້າເປັນ .NET 9 (ເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳໃນ `Upgrading to a new .NET version`_)."

