#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:194
msgid "TileMapLayer"
msgstr "TileMapLayer"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:196
msgid ""
":ref:`TileMapLayer.get_coords_for_body_rid() "
"<class_TileMapLayer_method_get_coords_for_body_rid>` will return different "
"values in 4.5 compared to 4.4, as TileMapLayer physics chunking is enabled "
"by default. Higher values of :ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` will make this function "
"less precise. To get the exact cell coordinates like in 4.4 and prior "
"versions, you need to set :ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` to ``1``, which "
"disables physics chunking."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TileMapLayer.get_coords_for_body_rid() "
"<class_TileMapLayer_method_get_coords_for_body_rid>` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນເວີຊັນ "
"4.5 ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ 4.4, ເນື່ອງຈາກການແບ່ງສ່ວນຟິສິກ (physics chunking) ຂອງ TileMapLayer ຖືກເ"
"ປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂອງ :ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນໜ້ອ"
"ຍລົງ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພິກັດເຊລທີ່ຊັດເຈນຄືກັບໃນເວີຊັນ 4.4 ແລະ ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
":ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` ເປັນ ``1`` ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນການປິດກ"
"ານແບ່ງສ່ວນຟິສິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:206
msgid "3D Model Import"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າໂມເດວ 3D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:208
msgid ""
"A fix has been made to the 3D model importers to correctly handle non-joint "
"nodes within a skeleton hierarchy (`GH-104184`_). To preserve compatibility, "
"the default behavior is to import existing files with the same behavior as "
"before (`GH-107352`_). New ``.gltf``, ``.glb``, ``.blend``, and ``.fbx`` "
"files (without a corresponding ``.import`` file) will be imported with the "
"new behavior. However, for existing files, if you want to use the new "
"behavior, you must change the \"Naming Version\" option at the bottom of the "
"Import dock:"
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ມີການແກ້ໄຂຕົວນຳເຂົ້າໂມເດວ 3D ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຈັດການກັບໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (non-joint nodes) ພາຍໃນລໍາດັບຊັ້"
"ນຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງ (skeleton hierarchy) ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ (`GH-104184`_). ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄ"
"ດ້, ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວດ້ວຍພຶດຕິກຳດຽວກັນກັບແຕ່ກ່ອນ (`GH-107352`_). ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ແບ"
"ບ ``.gltf``, ``.glb``, ``.blend``, ແລະ ``.fbx`` (ທີ່ບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ ``.import`` ຄູ່ກັນ) ຈະຖືກ"
"ນຳເຂົ້າດ້ວຍພຶດຕິກຳໃໝ່. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ພຶດຕິກຳໃໝ່, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຕົວເ"
"ລືອກ \"Naming Version\" ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບ Import:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:221
msgid ""
":ref:`Resource.duplicate(true) <class_Resource_method_duplicate>` (which "
"performs deep duplication) now only duplicates resources internal to the "
"resource file it's called on. In 4.4, this duplicated everything instead, "
"including external resources. If you were deep-duplicating a resource that "
"contained references to other external resources, those external resources "
"aren't duplicated anymore. You must "
"call :ref:`Resource.duplicate_deep(DEEP_DUPLICATE_ALL) "
"<class_Resource_method_duplicate_deep>` instead to keep the old behavior."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Resource.duplicate(true) <class_Resource_method_duplicate>` (ເຊິ່ງເຮັດການສ"
"ຳເນົາແບບເລິກ ຫຼື deep duplication) ຕອນນີ້ຈະສຳເນົາສະເພາະຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່"
"ມັນຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນເວີຊັນ 4.4, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສຳເນົາທຸກຢ່າງລວມທັງຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກນຳ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຄີຍເຮັ"
"ດການສຳເນົາແບບເລິກກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກອື່ນໆ, ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກເຫຼົ່າ"
"ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສຳເນົາອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຮຽກໃຊ້ :ref:`Resource.duplicate_deep"
"(DEEP_DUPLICATE_ALL) <class_Resource_method_duplicate_deep>` ແທນເພື່ອຮັກສາພຶດຕິກຳເ"
"ກົ່າໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:231
msgid ""
":ref:`ProjectSettings.add_property_info() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_add_property_info>` now prints a warning when "
"the dictionary parameter has missing keys or invalid keys. Most importantly, "
"it will now warn when a ``usage`` key is passed, as this key is not used. "
"This was also the case before 4.5, but it was silently ignored instead. As a "
"reminder, to set property usage information correctly, you must "
"use :ref:`ProjectSettings.set_as_basic() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_as_basic>`, :ref:`ProjectSettings.set_restart_if_changed() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_restart_if_changed>`, "
"or :ref:`ProjectSettings.set_as_internal() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_as_internal>` instead."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ProjectSettings.add_property_info() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_add_property_info>` ຕອນນີ້ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນເມື່ອພາຣາມິເ"
"ຕີ dictionary ມີຄີ (keys) ທີ່ຫາຍໄປ ຫຼື ຄີທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ ຕອນນີ້ມັນຈະເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງຄີ "
"``usage`` ເຂົ້າໄປ ເພາະຄີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ກໍເຄີຍເປັນແບບນີ້ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 4.5 ແຕ່ມັນຖືກເມີນເສີຍໄປໂດຍບໍ່"
"ມີການເຕືອນ. ເພື່ອເປັນການເຕືອນຄວາມຈຳ, ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ "
":ref:`ProjectSettings.set_as_basic() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_as_basic>`, "
":ref:`ProjectSettings.set_restart_if_changed() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_restart_if_changed>`, ຫຼື "
":ref:`ProjectSettings.set_as_internal() "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_set_as_internal>` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:242
msgid ""
"In C#, ``StringExtensions.PathJoin`` now avoids adding an extra path "
"separator when the original string is empty, or when the appended path "
"starts with a path separator (`GH-105281`_)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ C#, ``StringExtensions.PathJoin`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເພີ່ມຕົວຂັ້ນເສັ້ນທາງ (path "
"separator) ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເມື່ອສະຕຣິງເດີມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ນຳມາຕໍ່ນັ້ນຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວຂັ້ນເສັ້ນທາງຢູ່ແລ້"
"ວ (`GH-105281`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:247
msgid ""
"In C#, ``StringExtensions.GetExtension`` now returns an empty string instead "
"of the original string when the original string does not contain an "
"extension (`GH-108041`_)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ C#, ``StringExtensions.GetExtension`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນສ"
"ະຕຣິງເດີມ ເມື່ອສະຕຣິງເດີມນັ້ນບໍ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ (extension) (`GH-108041`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:252
msgid ""
"In C#, the ``Quaternion(Vector3, Vector3)`` constructor now correctly "
"creates a quaternion representing the shortest arc between the two input "
"vectors. Previously, it would return incorrect values for certain inputs "
"(`GH-107618`_)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ C#, ຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ (constructor) ``Quaternion(Vector3, Vector3)`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະສ້າງ "
"quaternion ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງສ່ວນໂຄ້ງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງ input vectors ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ມັ"
"ນອາດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບບາງ input (`GH-107618`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:261
msgid ""
"By default, the regions in a NavigationServer map now update asynchronously "
"using threads to improve performance. This can cause additional delay in the "
"update due to thread synchronisation. The asynchronous region update can be "
"toggled with the ``navigation/world/region_use_async_iterations`` project "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ (regions) ໃນແຜນທີ່ຂອງ NavigationServer ຕອນນີ້ຈະອັບເດດແບບບໍ່ພ້ອມກັນ "
"(asynchronously) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເທຣດ (threads) ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຊ້າເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການອັບເດດເນື່ອງຈາກການປະສານງານຂອງເທຣດ. ການອັບເດດເຂດພື້ນທີ່ແບບບໍ່ພ້ອມກັນສາມາດເປີດ-ປິດໄ"
"ດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ ``navigation/world/region_use_async_iterations``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:266
msgid ""
"The merging of navmeshes in the NavigationServer has changed processing "
"order. Regions now merge and cache internal navmeshes first, then the "
"remaining free edges are merged by the navigation map. If a project had "
"navigation map synchronisation errors before, it might now have shifted "
"affected edges, making already existing errors in a layout more noticeable "
"in the pathfinding. The ``navigation/2d_or_3d/merge_rasterizer_cell_scale`` "
"project setting can be set to a lower value to increase the detail of the "
"rasterization grid (with `0.01` being the smallest cell size possible). If "
"edge merge errors still persist with the lowest possible rasterization scale "
"value, the error may be caused by overlap: two navmeshes are stacked on top "
"of each other, causing geometry conflict."
msgstr ""
"ການລວມ navmeshes ໃນ NavigationServer ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນລໍາດັບການປະມວນຜົນ. ຕອນນີ້ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ "
"(regions) ຈະລວມ ແລະ ແຄຊ໌ navmeshes ພາຍໃນກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຂອບທີ່ເຫຼືອຈຶ່ງຈະຖືກລວມໂດຍແຜນທີ່ນຳທາ"
"ງ. ຖ້າໂຄງການເຄີຍມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການປະສານງານແຜນທີ່ນຳທາງມາກ່ອນ, ຕອນນີ້ມັນອາດຈະມີການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຂອງຂອ"
"ບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນເລເອົາ (layout) ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນໃນການຫາເສັ້ນທາງ "
"(pathfinding). ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ ``navigation/2d_or_3d/"
"merge_rasterizer_cell_scale`` ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າລົງເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕາໜ່າງ "
"rasterization (ໂດຍທີ່ `0.01` ແມ່ນຂະໜາດເຊລທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້). ຖ້າຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການລວມຂອບຍັງ"
"ຄົງມີຢູ່ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ rasterization scale ທີ່ຕໍ່າທີ່ສຸດແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນັ້ນອາດຈະເກີດຈາກການຊ້ອນທັບ"
"ກັນ: navmeshes ສອງອັນວາງຊ້ອນກັນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຂັດແຍ້ງຂອງເລຂາຄະນິດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:280
msgid ""
"When the 3D physics engine is set to Jolt Physics, you will now always have "
"overlaps between ``Area3D`` and static bodies reported by default, as the "
"``physics/jolt_physics_3d/simulation/areas_detect_static_bodies`` project "
"setting has been removed (`GH-105746`_). If you still want such overlaps to "
"be ignored, you will need to change the collision mask or layer of either "
"the ``Area3D`` or the static body instead."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັນຈິນຟິສິກ 3D ເປັນ Jolt Physics, ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າຈະມີການລາຍງານການຊ້ອນທັບກັນລະຫວ່າງ "
"``Area3D`` ແລະ static bodies ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະເໝີ, ເນື່ອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ ``physics/"
"jolt_physics_3d/simulation/areas_detect_static_bodies`` ໄດ້ຖືກລຶບອອກແລ້ວ (`GH-"
"105746`_). ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການຊ້ອນທັບດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກເມີນເສີຍ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນ collision mask "
"ຫຼື layer ຂອງ ``Area3D`` ຫຼື static body ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:290
msgid ""
"In GDScript, calls to functions ``RichTextLabel::add_image`` and "
"``RichTextLabel::update_image`` will continue to work, but the "
"``size_in_percent`` argument will now be used as the value for "
"``width_in_percent`` and ``height_in_percent`` will default to ``false`` "
"(`GH-107347`_). To restore the previous behavior, you can explicitly set "
"``height_in_percent`` to the same value you were passing as "
"``size_in_percent``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ GDScript, ການຮຽກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``RichTextLabel::add_image`` ແລະ "
"``RichTextLabel::update_image`` ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ແຕ່ອາກິວເມັນ (argument) "
"``size_in_percent`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າສຳລັບ ``width_in_percent`` ແລະ "
"``height_in_percent`` ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ ``false`` (`GH-107347`_). ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ພຶດຕິກຳກັບ"
"ມາເປັນຄືເກົ່າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``height_in_percent`` ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າເຄີຍສົ່ງໃຫ້ "
"``size_in_percent`` ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading from Godot 4.5 to Godot 4.6"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຈາກ Godot 4.5 ເປັນ Godot 4.6"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:6
msgid ""
"For most games and apps made with 4.5 it should be relatively safe to "
"migrate to 4.6. This page intends to cover everything you need to pay "
"attention to when migrating your project."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມ ແລະ ແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍເວີຊັນ 4.5 ຖືວ່າຂ້ອນຂ້າງປອດໄພທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍມາເປັນ 4.6. ໜ້ານີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົ"
"ງເພື່ອລວມເອົາທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງໃນເວລາການຍ້າຍໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you are migrating from 4.5 to 4.6, the breaking changes listed here might "
"affect you. Changes are grouped by areas/systems."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງຍ້າຍຈາກ 4.5 ເປັນ 4.6, ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບເກົ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ອາດຈະມີຜົນກັບເຈົ້"
"າ. ການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມພາກສ່ວນ/ລະບົບ."

