msgid "Signal ``files_selected`` moved to base class ``FileDialog``"
msgstr "ສັນຍານ ``files_selected`` ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ຄລາດພື້ນຖານ ``FileDialog``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:176
msgid ""
"The source sets configuration for Android export templates has been updated "
"to match the default Android Studio project structure (`GH-110829`_). This "
"affects the directory layout of the Android project:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ source sets ສຳລັບ Android export templates ໄດ້ຖືກອັບເດດໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂຄງສ້າງໂຄງການ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Android Studio (`GH-110829`_). ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການຈັດວາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງໂຄງການ "
"Android:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:180
msgid ""
"Files previously in ``[Project root]/android/build/src/`` are now in "
"``[Project root]/android/build/src/main/java/``."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄີຍຢູ່ໃນ ``[Project root]/android/build/src/`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະຢູ່ໃນ ``[Project root]/"
"android/build/src/main/java/``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:181
msgid ""
"Android manifest file and assets directory have been moved to ``src/main/`` "
"subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Android manifest ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ assets ໄດ້ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ ``src/main/``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:183
msgid ""
"For example, ``GodotApp.java`` moved from ``src/com/godot/game/"
"GodotApp.java`` to ``src/main/java/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ``GodotApp.java`` ໄດ້ຍ້າຍຈາກ ``src/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java`` ໄປ"
"ທີ່ ``src/main/java/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:191
msgid "The :ref:`doc_tscn_file_format` has changed in two ways in Godot 4.6:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ :ref:`doc_tscn_file_format` ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງສອງຢ່າງໃນ Godot 4.6:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:193
msgid ""
"``load_steps`` is no longer written in scene files (`GH-103352`_). This "
"attribute wasn't used by the editor."
msgstr ""
"``load_steps`` ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ສາກອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (`GH-103352`_). ຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attribute) ນີ້"
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ editor ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:195
msgid ""
"Unique node IDs are now saved to scene files to help track nodes when they "
"are moved or renamed (`GH-106837`_). This makes scene refactoring "
"significantly more robust."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ Node ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ (Unique node IDs) ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ສາກ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຕິດຕາມໂນດໃນເວລາ"
"ທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຊື່ (`GH-106837`_). ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປັບປຸງໂຄງສ້າງສາກ (scene "
"refactoring) ມີຄວາມໝັ້ນຄົງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:198
msgid ""
"The changes are backwards-compatible and forwards-compatible, which means "
"scenes saved in Godot 4.5 can still be loaded in Godot 4.6 and vice-versa "
"(notwithstanding other incompatible changes performed in the scene itself)."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ທັງແບບຍ້ອນຫຼັງ ແລະ ໄປທາງໜ້າ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສາກທີ່ບັນທຶກໃນ "
"Godot 4.5 ຍັງສາມາດໂຫຼດໃນ Godot 4.6 ໄດ້ ແລະ ໃນທາງກັບກັນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການປ່ຽນແປງອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ເ"
"ຂົ້າກັນເຊິ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຕົວສາກເອງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:202
msgid ""
"As a result, when saving a scene that was last edited in Godot 4.5 in Godot "
"4.6, significant diffs will occur in version control programs. These diffs "
"are expected."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາແມ່ນ ເມື່ອບັນທຶກສາກທີ່ເຄີຍແກ້ໄຂຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍໃນ Godot 4.5 ດ້ວຍ Godot 4.6, ຈະເຫັນຄວາມແຕກ"
"ຕ່າງ (diffs) ທີ່ຊັດເຈນໃນໂປຣແກຣມຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control). ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຄ"
"າດໄວ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:206
msgid ""
"As a reminder, you can upgrade all files in a project to the latest format "
"using :menu:`Project > Tools > Upgrade Project Files...` in the editor, then "
"committing the changes to version control. This allows you to avoid large "
"diffs later on when editing scenes."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປັນການເຕືອນຄວາມຈຳ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດອັບເກຣດທຸກໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຄງການໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບແບບລ້າສຸດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
":menu:`Project > Tools > Upgrade Project Files...` ໃນ editor, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຄອມມິດ "
"(commit) ການປ່ຽນແປງລົງໃນ version control. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຫຼີກລ່ຽງ diffs ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໃນພາ"
"ຍຫຼັງເວລາແກ້ໄຂສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:216
msgid ""
"The default blend mode for Glow is now Screen, which looks more correct but "
"is significantly brighter than the previous Soft Light mode (`GH-110671`_)."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Glow ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນ Screen, ເຊິ່ງເບິ່ງຄືຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າ ແຕ່ກໍຈ"
"ະແຈ້ງກວ່າໂໝດ Soft Light ແບບເກົ່າຫຼາຍ (`GH-110671`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:219
msgid ""
"Several other glow defaults were changed to ensure the glow didn't become "
"too strong, but you will likely need to tweak glow properties in Environment "
"after upgrading."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອື່ນໆຂອງ Glow ຫຼາຍອັນໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າແສງ Glow ຈະບໍ່ແຮງເກີນໄປ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະ"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ປັບແຕ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Glow ໃນ Environment ຫຼັງຈາກອັບເກຣດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:223
msgid ""
"In addition, glow's Soft Light blend mode now always behaves as it did "
"previously with ``use_hdr_2d``, regardless of the Viewport's ``use_hdr_2d`` "
"setting (`GH-109971`_)."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໂໝດການປະສົມ Soft Light ຂອງ Glow ຕອນນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບທີ່ເຄີຍເປັນມາກ່ອນດ້ວຍ "
"``use_hdr_2d`` ສະເໝີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``use_hdr_2d`` ຂອງ Viewport (`GH-"
"109971`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:227
msgid ""
"When using the Mobile renderer, the rewritten glow effect will look "
"significantly different to the previous one for performance reasons "
"(`GH-110077`_). You may need to further adjust glow settings in Environment "
"to achieve a similar look to before."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣັນເດີແບບ Mobile, ເອັບເຟັກ Glow ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ຈະເບິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກແບບເກົ່າຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຍ້ອນເຫ"
"ດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ (`GH-110077`_). ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Glow ໃນ Environment ເພີ່ມເຕີ"
"ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບຂອງເກົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:234
msgid ""
"Volumetric fog blending has been changed to be more physically accurate "
"(`GH-112494`_). This will cause volumetric fog to appear brighter in most "
"scenes."
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມໝອກແບບ Volumetric ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟິສິກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (`GH-"
"112494`_). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝອກ volumetric ເບິ່ງແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນໃນສາກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:238
msgid ""
"To compensate for this, you will need to decrease volumetric fog density or "
"brightness in Environment, or decrease the **Volumetric Fog Energy** "
"property on specific lights."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ (density) ຫຼື ຄວາມແຈ້ງຂອງໝອກ volumetric ໃນ "
"Environment ລົງ, ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄຸນສົມບັດ **Volumetric Fog Energy** ໃນດວງໄຟບາງອັນລົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:247
msgid ""
"``AStar2D.get_point_path``, ``AStar3D.get_point_path``, "
"``AStarGrid2D.get_id_path`` and ``AStarGrid2D.get_point_path`` will now "
"return an empty path when ``from_id`` is a disabled/solid point "
"(`GH-113988`_)."
msgstr ""
"``AStar2D.get_point_path``, ``AStar3D.get_point_path``, "
"``AStarGrid2D.get_id_path`` ແລະ ``AStarGrid2D.get_point_path`` ຕອນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນເ"
"ສັ້ນທາງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ເມື່ອ ``from_id`` ເປັນຈຸດທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ເປັນຈຸດແຂງ (solid point) (`GH-"
"113988`_)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:251
msgid "Changed defaults"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:253
msgid ""
"The following default values have been changed. If your project relies on "
"the previous defaults, you may need to explicitly set them to the old values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າອາໄສຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເກົ່າ, ເເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເ"
"ກົ່າໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:258
msgid ""
"The default rendering driver on Windows for **newly created** projects is "
"now :abbr:`D3D12 (Direct3D 12)` (`GH-113213`_). This can be changed in "
"Project Settings under ``rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຂັບການເຣັນເດີ (rendering driver) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ Windows ສຳລັບໂຄງການທີ່ **ສ້າງໃໝ່** ຕອນນີ້ແມ່"
"ນ :abbr:`D3D12 (Direct3D 12)` (`GH-113213`_). ສາມາດປ່ຽນສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ Project "
"Settings ພາຍໃຕ້ ``rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:263
msgid ""
"The default 3D physics engine for **newly created** projects is now Jolt "
"Physics (`GH-105737`_). This can be changed in Project Settings under "
"``physics/3d/physics_engine``."
msgstr ""
"ເອັນຈິນຟິສິກ 3D ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຄງການທີ່ **ສ້າງໃໝ່** ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນ Jolt Physics (`GH-105737`_). ສ"
"າມາດປ່ຽນສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ Project Settings ພາຍໃຕ້ ``physics/3d/physics_engine``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:270
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:285
msgid "Member"
msgstr "ສະມາຊິກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:270
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:285
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:304
msgid "Old Value"
msgstr "ຄ່າເກົ່າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:270
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:285
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:304
msgid "New Value"
msgstr "ຄ່າໃໝ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:273
msgid "Property ``skeleton``"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``skeleton``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:273
msgid "NodePath(\"..\")"
msgstr "NodePath(\"..\")"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:273
msgid "NodePath(\"\")"
msgstr "NodePath(\"\")"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:273
msgid "`GH-112267`_"
msgstr "`GH-112267`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:278
msgid ""
"The default value of ``skeleton`` has changed. Enable ``animation/"
"compatibility/default_parent_skeleton_in_mesh_instance_3d`` in Project "
"Settings if the old behavior is needed for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ ``skeleton`` ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ``animation/compatibility/"
"default_parent_skeleton_in_mesh_instance_3d`` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ (Project "
