#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:4
msgid "Introduction to 2D"
msgstr "ແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:6
msgid ""
"Godot's 2D game development tools include a dedicated 2D rendering engine, "
"physics system, and features tailored specifically for creating 2D "
"experiences. You can efficiently design levels with the TileMap system, "
"animate characters with 2D sprite or Cutout animation, and leverage 2D "
"lighting for dynamic scene illumination. The built-in 2D particle system "
"allows you to create complex visual effects, and Godot also supports custom "
"shaders to enhance your graphics. These features, combined with Godot's "
"accessibility and flexibility, provide a solid foundation for creating "
"engaging 2D games."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືພັດທະນາເກມ 2D ຂອງ Godot ປະກອບມີ ເຄື່ອງຈັກການສະແດງຜົນ 2D, ລະບົບຟີຊິກ, ແລະ ຟີເຈີຕ່າງໆທີ່"
"ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອສ້າງປະສົບການ 2D ໂດຍສະເພາະ. ທ່ານສາມາດອອກແບບດ່ານເກມໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍລະບົ"
"ບ TileMap, ເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນໃຫ້ຕົວລະຄອນດ້ວຍ 2D sprite ຫຼື Cutout animation, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ແສງ "
"2D ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ສາກແບບໄດນາມິກ. ລະບົບພາກທິເຄິລ 2D ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ນັ້ນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງເອັບເຟັກພາ"
"ບທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້, ແລະ Godot ຍັງຮອງຮັບ custom shaders ເພື່ອປັບປຸງກຣາຟິກຂອງທ່ານ. ຟີເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເມື່ອລ"
"ວມເຂົ້າກັບຄວາມງ່າຍໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນຂອງ Godot, ຈະກາຍເປັນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງສຳລັບການສ້າງ"
"ເກມ 2D ທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:16
msgid "2D Platformer Demo available on the Asset Library."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເກມ 2D Platformer ມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດໃນ Asset Library."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:18
msgid ""
"This page will show you the 2D workspace and how you can get to know it."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 2D (2D workspace) ແລະ ວິທີການເຮັດຄວາມຮູ້ຈັກກັບມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you would like to get an introduction to 3D, "
"see :ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການບົດແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ 3D, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_introduction_to_3d`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:23
msgid "2D workspace"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:25
msgid ""
"You will use the 2D workspace to work with 2D scenes, design levels, or "
"create user interfaces. To switch to the 2D workspace, you can either select "
"a 2D node from the scene tree, or use the workspace selector located at the "
"top edge of the editor:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 2D ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບສາກ 2D, ອອກແບບດ່ານເກມ, ຫຼື ສ້າງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI). ເພື່ອ"
"ສະຫຼັບໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 2D, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໂນດ 2D ຈາກ scene tree ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຢູ່"
"ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ editor:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:32
msgid ""
"Similar to 3D, you can use the tabs below the workspace selector to change "
"between currently opened scenes or create a new one using the plus (+) "
"button. The left and right docks should be familiar from :ref:`editor "
"introduction <toc-editor-interface>`."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບ 3D, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແທັບທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມຕົວເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງສາກທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງສາກໃໝ່ໂ"
"ດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມບວກ (+). ສ່ວນຈັດການ (docks) ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ ຄວນຈະຄຸ້ນເຄີຍດີຈາກ :ref:`ບົດແນະນຳ "
"editor <toc-editor-interface>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:36
msgid ""
"Below the scene selector is the main toolbar, and beneath the main toolbar "
"is the 2D viewport."
msgstr ""
"ຖັດຈາກສ່ວນເລືອກສາກລົງມາແມ່ນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກ (main toolbar), ແລະ ຖັດຈາກແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກລົງມາແມ່ນ "
"2D viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:39
msgid ""
"You can drag and drop compatible nodes from the FileSystem dock to add them "
"to the viewport as nodes. Dragging and dropping adds the dragged node as a "
"sibling of the selected node (if the root node is selected, adds as a "
"child). Keeping :kbd:`Shift` pressed when dropping adds the node as a child "
"of the selected node. Holding :kbd:`Alt` when dropping adds the node as a "
"child of the root node. If :kbd:`Alt + Shift` is held when dropping, the "
"node type can be selected if applicable."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງໂນດທີ່ຮອງຮັບຈາກ FileSystem dock ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ viewport ເປັນ"
"ໂນດໄດ້. ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຈະເພີ່ມໂນດທີ່ລາກມາເປັນ sibling (ໂນດລະດັບດຽວກັນ) ຂອງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ "
"(ຖ້າເລືອກໂນດຮາກ, ຈະເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກ). ການກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ຄ້າງໄວ້ຂະນະວາງ ຈະເພີ່ມໂນດເປັນລູກຂ"
"ອງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ. ການກົດ :kbd:`Alt` ຄ້າງໄວ້ຂະນະວາງ ຈະເພີ່ມໂນດເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດຮາກ. ຫາກກົດ "
":kbd:`Alt + Shift` ຄ້າງໄວ້ຂະນະວາງ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກປະເພດຂອງໂນດໄດ້ ຫາກມີໃຫ້ເລືອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:50
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/introduction_to_3d.rst:43
msgid "Main toolbar"
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:52
msgid ""
"Some buttons in the main toolbar are the same as those in the 3D workspace. "
"A brief explanation is given with the shortcut if the mouse cursor is "
"hovered over a button for one second. Some buttons may have additional "
"functionality if another keypress is performed. A recap of main "
"functionality of each button with its default shortcut is provided below "
"from left to right:"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມບາງອັນໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບປຸ່ມໃນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 3D. ຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆພ້ອມກັບຄີລັດຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນຫາກທ່"
"ານວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງປຸ່ມເປັນເວລາ 1 ວິນາທີ. ປຸ່ມບາງອັນອາດມີຟັງຊັນເພີ່ມເຕີມຫາກມີການກົດປຸ່ມອື່ນຮ່ວມດ້ວຍ. ລາຍ"
"ລະອຽດຟັງຊັນຫຼັກຂອງແຕ່ລະປຸ່ມພ້ອມຄີລັດມາດຕະຖານມີດັ່ງນີ້ ໂດຍລຽງຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Select Mode** (:kbd:`Q`): Allows selection of nodes in the viewport. Left "
"clicking on a node in the viewport selects it. Left clicking and dragging a "
"rectangle selects all nodes within the rectangle's boundaries, once "
"released. Holding :kbd:`Shift` while selecting adds more nodes to the "
"selection. Clicking on a selected node while holding :kbd:`Shift` deselects "
"the node. In this mode, you can drag the selected node(s) to move, "
"press :kbd:`Ctrl` to switch to the rotation mode temporarily, or use the red "
"circles to scale it. If multiple nodes are selected, only movement and "
"rotation are possible. In this mode, rotation and scaling will not use the "
"snapping options if snapping is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດເລືອກ (Select Mode)** (:kbd:`Q`): ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດໃນ viewport ໄດ້. ການຄລິກຊ້າຍໃສ່"
"ໂນດຈະເປັນການເລືອກມັນ. ການຄລິກຊ້າຍແລ້ວລາກເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈຈະເລືອກໂນດທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດສີ່ແຈນັ້ນເມື່ອປ່"
"ອຍເມົາສ໌. ການກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ຄ້າງໄວ້ຂະນະເລືອກຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມໂນດເຂົ້າໃນການເລືອກ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ໂ"
"ນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ແລ້ວຂະນະກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ຈະເປັນການຍົກເລີກການເລືອກໂນດນັ້ນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດລາ"
"ກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກເພື່ອຍ້າຍ, ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl` ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບໄປໂໝດໝູນຊົ່ວຄາວ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ວົງມົນສີແດງເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດ. "
"ຫາກເລືອກຫຼາຍໂນດ, ຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ການຍ້າຍ ແລະ ການໝູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ການໝູນ ແລະ ການປັ"
"ບຂະໜາດຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ snapping ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ snapping ຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Move Mode** (:kbd:`W`): Enables move (or translate) mode for the selected "
"nodes. See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` for more details."
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດຍ້າຍ (Move Mode)** (:kbd:`W`): ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຍ້າຍສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"
"ໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Rotate Mode** (:kbd:`E`): Enables rotation mode for the selected nodes. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` for more details."
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດໝູນ (Rotate Mode)** (:kbd:`E`): ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດໝູນສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"
"ໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Scale Mode** (:kbd:`S`): Enables scaling and displays scaling gizmos in "
"both axes for the selected node(s). "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` for more details."
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດປັບຂະໜາດ (Scale Mode)** (:kbd:`S`): ເປີດໃຊ້ການປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສະແດງ gizmos ການປັ"
"ບຂະໜາດທັງສອງແກນສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Show list of selectable nodes at position clicked**: As the description "
"suggests, this provides a list of selectable nodes at the clicked position "
"as a context menu, if there is more than one node in the clicked area."
msgstr ""
"**ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຄລິກ**: ຕາມຄຳອະທິບາຍ, ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂນດທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກ"
"ໄດ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຄລິກເປັນ context menu ຫາກມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງໂນດໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ຄລິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Rotation pivot**: Sets the rotation pivot to rotate node(s) around. An "
"added node has its rotation pivot at ``x: 0``, ``y: 0``, by default, with "
"exceptions. For example, the default pivot for a :ref:`Sprite2D "
"<class_Sprite2D>` is its center if the ``centered`` property is set to "
"``true``. If you would like to change the rotation pivot of a node, click "
"this button and choose a new location by left clicking. The node rotates "
"considering this point. If you have multiple nodes selected, this icon will "
"add a temporary pivot to be used commonly by all selected nodes. "
"Pressing :kbd:`Shift` and clicking this button will create the pivot at the "
"center of selected nodes. If any of the snap options are enabled, the pivot "
"will also snap to them when dragged."
msgstr ""
"**ຈຸດໝູນ (Rotation pivot)**: ກຳນົດຈຸດໝູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດໝູນອ້ອມຈຸດນັ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໂນດທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ"
"ໃໝ່ຈະມີຈຸດໝູນຢູ່ທີ່ ``x: 0``, ``y: 0`` ແຕ່ກໍມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຈຸດໝູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ "
":ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>` ແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງມັນຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດ ``centered`` ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັ"
"ນ ``true``. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນຈຸດໝູນຂອງໂນດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ແລ້ວເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍ. ໂນ"
"ດຈະໝູນໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຸດນີ້. ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກຫຼາຍໂນດ, ໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຈຸດໝູນຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນທຸກໂນດທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກ. ການກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສ້າງຈຸດໝູນໄວ້ທີ່ໃຈກາງຂອງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"snap ໃດໆຢູ່, ຈຸດໝູນກໍຈະ snap ໄປຕາມນັ້ນຂະນະທີ່ລາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Pan Mode** (:kbd:`G`): Allows you to navigate in the viewport without "
"accidentally selecting any nodes. In other modes, you can also "
"hold :kbd:`Space` and drag with the left mouse button to do the same."
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດເລື່ອນ (Pan Mode)** (:kbd:`G`): ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລື່ອນເບິ່ງໃນ viewport ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນວ່າ"
"ຈະໄປເລືອກໂນດໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ໃນໂໝດອື່ນໆ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກົດ :kbd:`Space` ຄ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວລາກດ້ວຍເມົ"
"າສ໌ຊ້າຍເພື່ອເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Ruler Mode**: After enabling, click on the viewport to display the current "
"global x and y coordinates. Dragging from a position to another one measures "
"the distance in pixels. If you drag diagonally, it will draw a triangle and "
"show the separate distances in terms of x, y, and total distance to the "
"target, including the angles to the axes in degrees. The :kbd:`R` key "
"activates the ruler. If snapping is enabled, it also displays the "
"measurements in terms of grid count:"
msgstr ""
"**ໂໝດບັນທັດ (Ruler Mode)**: ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ viewport ເພື່ອສະແດງພິກັດ x ແລະ "
"y ແບບ global. ການລາກຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງໜຶ່ງໄປອີກຕຳແໜ່ງໜຶ່ງຈະເປັນການແທກໄລຍະທາງເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຫາກທ່ານລາ"
"ກແບບເສັ້ນເນັ່ງ, ມັນຈະແຕ້ມຮູບສາມແຈ ແລະ ສະແດງໄລຍະທາງແຍກຕາມ x, y, ແລະ ໄລຍະທາງທັງໝົດໄປຫາເປົ້"
"າໝາຍ, ລວມທັງມຸມທຽບກັບແກນເປັນອົງສາ. ປຸ່ມ :kbd:`R` ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດບັນທັດ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ snapping ຢູ່, "
"ມັນຈະສະແດງຄ່າການແທກເປັນຈຳນວນຊ່ອງກຣິດນຳອີກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:99
msgid "Using ruler with snapping enabled."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ບັນທັດເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ snapping."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Use Smart Snap**: Toggles smart snapping for move, rotate, and scale "
"modes; and the rotation pivot. Customize it using the three-dot menu next to "
"the snap tools."
msgstr ""
"**ໃຊ້ Smart Snap**: ເປີດ/ປິດ smart snapping ສຳລັບໂໝດຍ້າຍ, ໝູນ, ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດ; ລວມທັງຈຸດ"
"ໝູນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູສາມຈຸດທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງເຄື່ອງມື snap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Use Grid Snap**: Toggles snapping to grid for move and scale mode, "
"rotation pivot, and the ruler. Customize it using the three-dot menu next to "
"the snap tools."
msgstr ""
"**ໃຊ້ Grid Snap**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການ snap ເຂົ້າກັບກຣິດ ສຳລັບໂໝດຍ້າຍ, ປັບຂະໜາດ, ຈຸດໝູນ, ແລະ ບັນທັ"
"ດ. ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູສາມຈຸດຂ້າງເຄື່ອງມື snap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:106
msgid ""
"You can customize the grid settings so that move mode, rotate mode, scale "
"mode, ruler, and rotation pivot uses snapping. Use the three-dot menu for "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຣິດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂໝດຍ້າຍ, ໝູນ, ປັບຂະໜາດ, ບັນທັດ, ແລະ ຈຸດໝູນ ໃຊ້ການ snap ໄ"
"ດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມນູສາມຈຸດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Use Rotation Snap**: Toggles snapping using the configured rotation "
"setting."
msgstr "**ໃຊ້ Rotation Snap**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການ snap ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າການໝູນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Use Scale Snap**: Toggles snapping using the configured scaling step "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"**ໃຊ້ Scale Snap**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການ snap ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Snap Relative**: Toggles the usage of snapping based on the selected "
"node's current transform values. For example, if the grids are set to 32x32 "
"pixels and if the selected node is located at ``x: 1, y: 1``, then, enabling "
"this option will temporarily shift the grids by ``x: 1, y: 1``."
msgstr ""
"**Snap Relative**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການໃຊ້ snapping ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າ transform ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂນດທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກກຣິດຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 32x32 ພິກເຊວ ແລະ ໂນດທີ່ເລືອກຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ ``x: 1, y: 1``, ການເປີດຕົວ"
"ເລືອກນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກຣິດເລື່ອນໄປທີ່ ``x: 1, y: 1`` ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Use Pixel Snap**: Toggles the use of subpixels for snapping. If enabled, "
"the position values will be integers, disabling will enable subpixel "
"movement as decimal values. For the runtime property, consider checking "
"`Project Settings > Rendering > 2D > Snapping` property for Node2D nodes, "
"and `Project Settings > GUI > General > Snap Controls to Pixels` for Control "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"**ໃຊ້ Pixel Snap**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການໃຊ້ subpixels ໃນການ snap. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຈະເປັນເ"
"ລກຖ້ວນ, ຫາກປິດຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຍ້າຍແບບ subpixel ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໄດ້. ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດຕອນລັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ກວດ"
"ເບິ່ງ `Project Settings > Rendering > 2D > Snapping` ສຳລັບໂນດ Node2D, ແລະ "
"`Project Settings > GUI > General > Snap Controls to Pixels` ສຳລັບໂນດ Control."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Smart Snapping**: Provides a set of options to snap to specific positions "
"if they are enabled:"
msgstr ""
"**Smart Snapping**: ໃຫ້ຊຸດຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອ snap ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງສະເພາະຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:125
msgid ""
"Snap to Parent: Snaps to parent's edges. For example, scaling a child "
"control node while this is enabled will snap to the boundaries of the parent."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Parent: snap ເຂົ້າກັບຂອບຂອງໂນດແມ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການປັບຂະໜາດໂນດ control ລູກຂະນະທີ່ເປີ"
"ດໃຊ້ນີ້ ຈະ snap ເຂົ້າກັບຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດແມ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:127
msgid ""
"Snap to Node Anchor: Snaps to the node's anchor. For example, if anchors of "
"a control node is positioned at different positions, enabling this will snap "
"to the sides and corners of the anchor."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Node Anchor: snap ເຂົ້າກັບຈຸດຢຶດ (anchor) ຂອງໂນດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກຈຸດຢຶດຂອງໂນດ "
"control ຕັ້ງຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຕ່າງກັນ, ການເປີດໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະ snap ເຂົ້າກັບດ້ານ ແລະ ມຸມຂອງຈຸດຢຶດນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:130
msgid ""
"Snap to Node Sides: Snaps to the node's sides, such as for the rotation "
"pivot or anchor positioning."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Node Sides: snap ເຂົ້າກັບດ້ານຂ້າງຂອງໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບການວາງຈຸດໝູນ ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຢຶດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:132
msgid ""
"Snap to Node Center: Snaps to the node's center, such as for the rotation "
"pivot or anchor positioning."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Node Center: snap ເຂົ້າກັບໃຈກາງຂອງໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບການວາງຈຸດໝູນ ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຢຶດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:134
msgid ""
"Snap to Other Nodes: Snaps to other nodes while moving or scaling. Useful to "
"align nodes in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Other Nodes: snap ເຂົ້າກັບໂນດອື່ນໆຂະນະຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປັບຂະໜາດ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຽງໂນດໃ"
"ຫ້ຊື່ກັນໃນ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:136
msgid ""
"Snap to Guides: Snaps to custom guides drawn using the horizontal or "
"vertical ruler. More on the ruler and guides below."
msgstr ""
"Snap to Guides: snap ເຂົ້າກັບເສັ້ນກາຍ (guides) ທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ບັນທັດແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ. ເບິ່ງລາຍ"
"ລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບບັນທັດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນກາຍໄດ້ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:141
msgid ""
"**Configure Snap**: Opens the window shown above, offering a set of snapping "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"**ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Snap (Configure Snap)**: ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ສະແດງຂ້າງເທິງ, ເຊິ່ງມີພາລາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆສຳລັບການ "
"snap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:143
msgid ""
"Grid Offset: Allows you to shift grids with respect to the origin. ``x`` and "
"``y`` can be adjusted separately."
msgstr ""
"Grid Offset: ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລື່ອນກຣິດທຽບກັບຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin). ສາມາດປັບ ``x`` ແລະ ``y`` ແຍ"
"ກກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:145
msgid ""
"Grid Step: The distance between each grid in pixels. ``x`` and ``y`` can be "
"adjusted separately."
msgstr ""
"Grid Step: ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະກຣິດເປັນພິກເຊວ. ສາມາດປັບ ``x`` ແລະ ``y`` ແຍກກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:146
msgid ""
"Primary Line Every: The number of grids in-between to draw infinite lines as "
"indication of main lines."
msgstr ""
"Primary Line Every: ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງກຣິດລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນຫຼັກທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມເປັນເສັ້ນຍາວບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດເພື່ອບອກແນວເສັ້ນຫຼັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:148
msgid "Rotation Offset: Sets the offset to shift rotational snapping."
msgstr "Rotation Offset: ກຳນົດຄ່າ offset ເພື່ອເລື່ອນການ snap ການໝູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:149
msgid ""
"Rotation Step: Defines the snapping degree. E.g., 15 means the node will "
"rotate and snap at multiples of 15 degrees if rotation snap is enabled and "
"the rotate mode is used."
msgstr ""
"Rotation Step: ກຳນົດອົງສາໃນການ snap. ຕົວຢ່າງ: 15 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໂນດຈະໝູນ ແລະ snap ຢູ່ທີ່ທະວີຄູ"
"ນຂອງ 15 ອົງສາ ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ rotation snap ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂໝດໝູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:151
msgid ""
"Scale Step: Determines the scaling increment factor. For example, if it is "
"0.1, it will change the scaling at 0.1 steps if scaling snap is enabled and "
"the scaling mode is used."
msgstr ""
"Scale Step: ກຳນົດຕົວຄູນການເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຂອງການປັບຂະໜາດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກເປັນ 0.1, ມັນຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດເທື່ອ"
"ລະ 0.1 ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ scaling snap ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂໝດປັບຂະໜາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:154
msgid ""
"**Lock selected nodes** (:kbd:`Ctrl + L`). Locks the selected nodes, "
"preventing selection and movement in the viewport. Clicking the button again "
"(or using :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + L`) unlocks the selected nodes. Locked nodes "
"can only be selected in the scene tree. They can easily be identified by a "
"padlock next to their node names in the scene tree. Clicking on this padlock "
"also unlocks the nodes."
msgstr ""
"**ລັອກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ (Lock selected nodes)** (:kbd:`Ctrl + L`): ລັອກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ເພື່ອປ້ອງ"
"ກັນການເລືອກ ແລະ ການຍ້າຍໃນ viewport. ການຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ອີກຄັ້ງ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + "
"L`) ຈະເປັນການປົດລັອກ. ໂນດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ scene tree ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສັ"
"ງເກດໂນດທີ່ຖືກລັອກໄດ້ຈາກໄອຄອນກະແຈທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງຊື່ໂນດໃນ scene tree. ການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນກະແຈນີ້ກໍເປັນການປົ"
"ດລັອກໂນດໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:159
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/introduction_to_3d.rst:75
msgid ""
"**Group selected nodes** (:kbd:`Ctrl + G`). This allows selection of the "
"root node if any of the children are selected. Using :kbd:`Ctrl + G` "
"ungroups them. Additionally, clicking the ungroup button in the scene tree "
"performs the same action."
msgstr ""
"**ຈັດກຸ່ມໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ (Group selected nodes)** (:kbd:`Ctrl + G`): ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລື"
"ອກໂນດຮາກໄດ້ຫາກມີໂນດລູກໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເລືອກ. ການໃຊ້ :kbd:`Ctrl + G` ຈະເປັນການຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມ. ນອ"
"ກຈາກນີ້, ການຄລິກປຸ່ມຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມໃນ scene tree ກໍຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Skeleton Options**: Provides options to work with Skeleton2D and Bone2D."
msgstr ""
"**ຕົວເລືອກໂຄງກະດູກ (Skeleton Options)**: ໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບ Skeleton2D ແລ"
"ະ Bone2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:164
msgid "Show Bones: Toggles the visibility of bones for the selected node."
msgstr "Show Bones: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນກະດູກສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:165
msgid ""
"Make Bone2D Node(s) from Node(s): Converts selected node(s) into Bone2D."
msgstr "Make Bone2D Node(s) from Node(s): ແປງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໃຫ້ເປັນ Bone2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:167
msgid "To learn more about Skeletons, see :ref:`doc_cutout_animation`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Skeletons, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_cutout_animation`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:169
msgid ""
"**View** menu: Provides options to control the viewport view. Since its "
"options depend heavily on the viewport, it is covered in "
"the :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` section."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູ **ມຸມເບິ່ງ (View)**: ໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກໃນການຄວບຄຸມມຸມເບິ່ງຂອງ viewport. ເນື່ອງຈາກຕົວເລືອກຂອງມັນ"
"ຂຶ້ນກັບ viewport ເປັນຫຼັກ, ຈຶ່ງໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:173
msgid ""
"Next to the View menu, additional buttons may be visible. In the toolbar "
"image at the beginning of this chapter, an additional *Sprite2D* button "
"appears because a Sprite2D is selected. This menu provides some quick "
"actions and tools to work on a specific node or selection. For example, "
"while drawing a polygon, it provides buttons to add, modify, or remove "
"points."
msgstr ""
"ຂ້າງເມນູ View ອາດຈະມີປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ໃນຮູບແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຕອນຕົ້ນບົດນີ້, ຈະເຫັນປຸ່ມ *Sprite2D* ເພີ່"
"ມຂຶ້ນມາເພາະມີການເລືອກ Sprite2D ຢູ່. ເມນູນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງດ່ວນ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບໂນດນັ້ນໆໂດຍ"
"ສະເພາະ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຂະນະທີ່ແຕ້ມ polygon, ມັນຈະມີປຸ່ມໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ, ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບຈຸດຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:181
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/introduction_to_3d.rst:147
msgid "Coordinate system"
msgstr "ລະບົບພິກັດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:183
msgid ""
"In the 2D editor, unlike 3D, there are only two axes: ``x`` and ``y``. Also, "
"the viewing angle is fixed."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ editor 2D, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ 3D, ຈະມີພຽງສອງແກນຄື: ``x`` ແລະ ``y``. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ມຸມເບິ່ງຍັງຖື"
"ກຄົງທີ່ໄວ້ນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:186
msgid ""
"In the viewport, you will see two lines in two colors going across the "
"screen infinitely: red for the x-axis, and green for the y-axis. In Godot, "
"going right and down are positive directions. Where these two lines "
"intersect is the origin: ``x: 0, y: 0``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ viewport, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນເສັ້ນສອງສີທີ່ລາກຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ: ສີແດງສຳລັບແກນ x, ແລະ ສີຂຽວສຳລັບແກ"
"ນ y. ໃນ Godot, ການໄປທາງຂວາ ແລະ ທາງລຸ່ມແມ່ນທິດທາງບວກ. ຈຸດທີ່ເສັ້ນທັງສອງຕັດກັນແມ່ນຈຸດກຳເນີດ "
"(origin): ``x: 0, y: 0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:191
msgid ""
"A root node will have its origin at this position once added. Switching to "
"the `move` or `scale` modes after selecting a node will display the gizmos "
"at the node's offset position. The gizmos will point to the positive "
"directions of the x and y axes. In the move mode, you can drag the green "
"line to move only in the ``y`` axis. Similarly, you can hold the red line to "
"move only in the ``x`` axis."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຮາກຈະມີຈຸດກຳເນີດຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ. ການສະຫຼັບໄປໂໝດ `ຍ້າຍ (move)` ຫຼື `ປັບຂະໜາດ "
"(scale)` ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກໂນດ ຈະສະແດງ gizmos ຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ offset ຂອງໂນດ. gizmos ຈະຊີ້ໄປທາງທິດ"
"ທາງບວກຂອງແກນ x ແລະ y. ໃນໂໝດຍ້າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດລາກເສັ້ນສີຂຽວເພື່ອຍ້າຍສະເພາະແກນ ``y``. ໃນທຳ"
"ນອງດຽວກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຈັບເສັ້ນສີແດງເພື່ອຍ້າຍສະເພາະແກນ ``x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:198
msgid ""
"In the scale mode, the gizmos will have a square shape. You can hold and "
"drag the green and red squares to scale the nodes in the ``y`` or ``x`` "
"axes. Dragging in a negative direction flips the node horizontally or "
"vertically."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂໝດປັບຂະໜາດ, gizmos ຈະມີຮູບຮ່າງເປັນສີ່ແຈ. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັບ ແລະ ລາກຮູບສີ່ແຈສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີແດງ ເພື່ອ"
"ປັບຂະໜາດໂນດໃນແກນ ``y`` ຫຼື ``x``. ການລາກໄປໃນທິດທາງລົບຈະເປັນການກັບດ້ານ (flip) ໂນດໃນແນວ"
"ນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:205
msgid "2D Viewport"
msgstr "2D Viewport"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:207
msgid ""
"The viewport will be the area you spend the most time if you plan to design "
"levels or user interfaces visually:"
msgstr ""
"Viewport ຈະເປັນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ ຫາກທ່ານວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະອອກແບບດ່ານເກມ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບເ"
"ບິ່ງເຫັນພາບ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:212
msgid ""
"Middle-clicking and dragging the mouse will pan the view. The scrollbars on "
"the right or bottom of the viewport also move the view. Alternatively, "
"the :kbd:`G` or :kbd:`Space` keys can be used. If you enable `Editor "
"Settings > Editors > Panning > Simple Panning`, you can activate panning "
"directly with :kbd:`Space` only, without requiring dragging."
msgstr ""
"ການຄລິກເມົາສ໌ກາງແລ້ວລາກຈະເປັນການເລື່ອນມຸມເບິ່ງ (pan). ແຖບເລື່ອນ (scrollbars) ດ້ານຂວາ ຫຼື ດ້ານ"
"ລຸ່ມຂອງ viewport ກໍໃຊ້ເລື່ອນມຸມເບິ່ງໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ :kbd:`G` ຫຼື "
":kbd:`Space` ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ `Editor Settings > Editors > Panning > Simple "
"Panning`, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລື່ອນມຸມເບິ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`Space` ໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລາກເມົາສ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:218
msgid ""
"The viewport has buttons on the top-left. **Center View** centers the "
"selected node(s) in the screen. Useful if you have a large scene with many "
"nodes, and want to see the node selected in the scene tree. Next to it are "
"the zoom controls. **-** zooms out, **+** zooms in, and clicking on the "
"number with percentage defaults to 100%. Alternatively, you can use middle-"
"mouse scrolling to zoom in (scroll up) and out (scroll down)."
msgstr ""
"Viewport ມີປຸ່ມຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ. **ຈັດກາງມຸມເບິ່ງ (Center View)** ຈະຈັດໃຫ້ໂນດທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງໜ້າ"
"ຈໍ. ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຫາກທ່ານມີສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີຫຼາຍໂນດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນ scene "
"tree. ຖັດມາແມ່ນຕົວຄວບຄຸມການຊູມ. **-** ຊູມອອກ, **+** ຊູມເຂົ້າ, ແລະ ການຄລິກໃສ່ຕົວເລກເປີເຊັນຈະ"
"ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ 100%. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ກາງເພື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າ (ເລື່ອນຂຶ້ນ) "
"ແລະ ຊູມອອກ (ເລື່ອນລົງ) ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:225
msgid ""
"The black bars at the viewport's left and top edges are the **rulers**. You "
"can use them to orient yourself in the viewport. By default, the rulers will "
"display the pixel coordinates of the viewport, numbered at 100 pixel steps. "
"Changing the zoom factor will change the shown values. Enabling `Grid Snap` "
"or changing the snapping options will update the ruler's scaling and the "
"shown values."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບສີດຳທີ່ຂອບດ້ານຊ້າຍ ແລະ ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ viewport ແມ່ນ **ບັນທັດ (rulers)**. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ພວກມັ"
"ນເພື່ອບອກຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ viewport. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ບັນທັດຈະສະແດງພິກັດພິກເຊວຂອງ viewport ໂດຍມີຕົວເ"
"ລກບອກທຸກໆ 100 ພິກເຊວ. ການປ່ຽນລະດັບການຊູມຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ສະແດງປ່ຽນໄປ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ `Grid "
"Snap` ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກ snapping ຈະປັບປຸງມາດຕາສ່ວນຂອງບັນທັດ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:232
msgid ""
"You can also create multiple custom guides to help you make measurements or "
"align nodes with them:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງເສັ້ນກາຍ (guides) ຫຼາຍເສັ້ນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການແທກ ຫຼື ຈັດລຽງໂນດໃຫ້ຕົງກັນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:237
msgid ""
"If you have at least one node in the scene, you can create guides by "
"dragging from the horizontal or vertical ruler towards the viewport. A "
"purple guide will appear, showing its position, and will remain there when "
"you release the mouse. You can create both horizontal and vertical guides "
"simultaneously by dragging from the gray square at the rulers' intersection. "
"Guides can be repositioned by dragging them back to their respective rulers, "
"and they can be removed by dragging them all the way back to the ruler."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໂນດໃນສາກ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງເສັ້ນກາຍໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກຈາກບັນທັດແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ ເຂົ້"
"າຫາ viewport. ຈະມີເສັ້ນກາຍສີມ່ວງປະກົດຂຶ້ນພ້ອມບອກຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ມັນຈະຢູ່ຫັ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ອຍເມົາສ໌. ທ່ານສາມ"
"າດສ້າງທັງເສັ້ນກາຍແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັນ ໂດຍການລາກຈາກຮູບສີ່ແຈສີເທົາທີ່ຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງບັນທັດ. ເສັ້ນກາ"
"ຍສາມາດປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກພວກມັນກັບໄປຫາບັນທັດ, ແລະ ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກພວກມັນກັບຄືນໄ"
"ປຫາບັນທັດຈົນສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:244
msgid ""
"You can also enable snapping to the created guides using the `Smart Snap` "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການ snap ເຂົ້າກັບເສັ້ນກາຍທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ `Smart Snap`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:246
msgid ""
"If you cannot create a line, or do not see previously created guides, make "
"sure that they are visible by checking the `View` menu of the "
"viewport. :kbd:`Y` toggles their visibility, by default. Also, make sure you "
"have at least one node in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງເສັ້ນໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເຫັນເສັ້ນກາຍທີ່ເຄີຍສ້າງໄວ້, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າພວກມັນຖືກເປີດໃຫ້ເຫັນຫຼືບໍ່ໃນເມນູ "
"`View` ຂອງ viewport. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Y` ຈະໃຊ້ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຕ້"
"ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໂນດຢູ່ໃນສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:250
msgid ""
"Depending on the tool chosen in the toolbar, left-clicking will have a "
"primary action in the viewport. For example, the `Select Mode` will select "
"the left-clicked node in the viewport. Sometimes, left-clicking can be "
"combined with a modifier (e.g., :kbd:`Ctrl`, or :kbd:`Shift`) to perform "
"secondary actions. For example, keeping :kbd:`Shift` pressed while dragging "
"a node in the Select or Move modes will try to snap the node in a single "
"axis while moving."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເລືອກໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື, ການຄລິກຊ້າຍຈະເປັນການກະທຳຫຼັກໃນ viewport. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `ໂໝດເລືອ"
"ກ` ຈະເລືອກໂນດທີ່ຖືກຄລິກຊ້າຍໃນ viewport. ບາງຄັ້ງ, ການຄລິກຊ້າຍສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບປຸ່ມເສີມ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
":kbd:`Ctrl`, ຫຼື :kbd:`Shift`) ເພື່ອເຮັດການກະທຳຮອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ຄ້າງໄ"
"ວ້ຂະນະທີ່ລາກໂນດໃນໂໝດເລືອກ ຫຼື ໂໝດຍ້າຍ ຈະເປັນການພະຍາຍາມ snap ໂນດໃຫ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນແກນດຽວຂະນະຍ້າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:258
msgid ""
"Right clicking in the viewport provides two options to create a node or "
"instantiate a scene at the chosen position. If at least one node is "
"selected, right clicking also provides the option to move the selected "
"node(s) to this position."
msgstr ""
"ການຄລິກຂວາໃນ viewport ຈະໃຫ້ສອງຕົວເລືອກໃນການສ້າງໂນດ ຫຼື ດຶງສາກ (instantiate a scene) ມ"
"າໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ. ຫາກມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໂນດຖືກເລືອກຢູ່, ການຄລິກຂວາຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການຍ້າຍໂນດທີ່ເລືອກມາ"
"ຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:264
msgid ""
"Viewport has a **View** menu which provides several options to change the "
"look of the viewport:"
msgstr ""
"Viewport ມີເມນູ **View** ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກໃນການປ່ຽນຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງ viewport:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:266
msgid ""
"**Grid**: Allows you to show grids all the time, only when using snapping, "
"or not at all. You can also toggle them with the provided option."
msgstr ""
"**Grid**: ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສະແດງກຣິດຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ສະແດງສະເພາະຕອນໃຊ້ snapping, ຫຼື ບໍ່ສະແດງເລີຍ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດພວກມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:268
msgid ""
"**Show Helpers**: Toggles the temporary display of an outline of the node, "
"with the previous transform properties (position, scaling, or rotation) if a "
"transform operation has been initiated. For `Control` nodes, it also shows "
"the sizing parameters. Useful to see the deltas."
msgstr ""
"**Show Helpers**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງໂນດຊົ່ວຄາວ ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ transform ກ່ອນໜ້າ (ຕ"
"ຳແໜ່ງ, ການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ການໝູນ) ຫາກມີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ transform. ສຳລັບໂນດ `Control`, ມັນຍັງສະ"
"ແດງພາລາມິເຕີການກຳນົດຂະໜາດນຳອີກ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເບິ່ງຄ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ (deltas)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:271
msgid ""
"**Show Rulers**: Toggles the visibility of horizontal and vertical rulers. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` more on rulers."
msgstr ""
"**Show Rulers**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນບັນທັດແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບບັນທັດໄດ້"
"ທີ່ :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:273
msgid ""
"**Show Guides**: Toggles the visibility of created guides. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport` for on how to create them."
msgstr ""
"**Show Guides**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນເສັ້ນກາຍທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງວິທີການສ້າງໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_2d_the_viewport`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:275
msgid ""
"**Show Origin**: Toggles the display of the green and red origin lines drawn "
"at ``x: 0, y: 0``."
msgstr ""
"**Show Origin**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງເສັ້ນຈຸດກຳເນີດສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີແດງ ທີ່ແຕ້ມຢູ່ທີ່ ``x: 0, y: "
"0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:276
msgid ""
"**Show Viewport**: Toggles the visibility of the game's default viewport, "
"indicated by an indigo-colored rectangle. It is also the default window size "
"on desktop platforms, which can be changed by going to `Project Settings > "
"Display > Window > Size` and setting `Viewport Width` and `Viewport Height`."
msgstr ""
"**Show Viewport**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ viewport ມາດຕະຖານຂອງເກມ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສີ່ແຈ"
"ສີຄາມ. ມັນຍັງເປັນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງມາດຕະຖານໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ `Project "
"Settings > Display > Window > Size` ແລ້ວກຳນົດຄ່າ `Viewport Width` ແລະ `Viewport "
"Height`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:280
msgid ""
"**Gizmos**: Toggles the visibility of `Position` (shown with cross icon), "
"`Lock` (shown with padlock), `Groups` (shown with two squares), and "
"`Transformation` (shown with green and red lines) indicators."
msgstr ""
"**Gizmos**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ `ຕຳແໜ່ງ (Position)` (ສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນຮູບກາກບາດ)"
", `ລັອກ (Lock)` (ສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນກະແຈ), `ກຸ່ມ (Groups)` (ສະແດງດ້ວຍສີ່ແຈສອງອັນ), ແລະ `ກາ"
"ນປ່ຽນແປງ (Transformation)` (ສະແດງດ້ວຍເສັ້ນສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີແດງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:283
msgid ""
"**Center Selection**: The same as the **Center View** button inside the "
"viewport. Centers the selected node(s) in the view. :kbd:`F` is the default "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"**ຈັດກາງສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ (Center Selection)**: ຄືກັນກັບປຸ່ມ **Center View** ໃນ viewport. ຈະຈັ"
"ດໃຫ້ໂນດທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງມຸມເບິ່ງ. ຄີລັດມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ :kbd:`F`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Frame to Selection**: Similar to `Center Selection`, but also changes the "
"zoom factor to fit the contents in the screen. :kbd:`Shift + F` is the "
"default shortcut."
msgstr ""
"**ປັບມຸມເບິ່ງໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ (Frame to Selection)**: ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ `Center Selection`, ແຕ່ຈ"
"ະປ່ຽນລະດັບການຊູມໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກໃນໜ້າຈໍນຳອີກ. ຄີລັດມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ :kbd:`Shift + F`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:287
msgid ""
"**Clear Guides**: Deletes all guides from the screen. You will need to "
"recreate them if you plan to use them later."
msgstr ""
"**ລ້າງເສັ້ນກາຍ (Clear Guides)**: ລຶບເສັ້ນກາຍທັງໝົດອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງພວກມັນໃໝ່ຫາກຕ້ອງ"
"ການໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:289
msgid ""
"**Preview Canvas Scale**: Toggles the preview for scaling of canvas in the "
"editor when the zoom factor or view of the viewport changes. Useful to see "
"how the controls will look like after scaling and moving, without running "
"the game."
msgstr ""
"**ຕົວຢ່າງມາດຕາສ່ວນແຄນວາສ (Preview Canvas Scale)**: ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງການປັບຂະໜາ"
"ດຂອງແຄນວາສໃນ editor ເມື່ອລະດັບການຊູມ ຫຼື ມຸມເບິ່ງຂອງ viewport ປ່ຽນແປງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເບິ່ງວ່"
"າປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມຕ່າງໆຈະມີໜ້າຕາເປັນແນວໃດຫຼັງຈາກປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຍ້າຍ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລັນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:292
msgid ""
"**Preview Theme**: Allows to choose from the available themes to change the "
"look of control items in the editor, without requiring to run the game."
msgstr ""
"**ຕົວຢ່າງຮູບແບບ (Preview Theme)**: ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບ (theme) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໜ້າຕາຂອງປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸ"
"ມຕ່າງໆໃນ editor ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລັນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:297
msgid "Node2D and Control node"
msgstr "ໂນດ Node2D ແລະ Control"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:299
msgid ""
":ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>` is the base node for 2D. :ref:`Node2D "
"<class_Node2D>` is the base node for 2D game objects, and :ref:`Control "
"<class_Control>` is the base node for everything GUI. For 3D, Godot uses "
"the :ref:`Node3D <class_Node3D>` node."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>` ແມ່ນໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ 2D. :ref:`Node2D "
"<class_Node2D>` ແມ່ນໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບວັດຖຸໃນເກມ 2D, ແລະ :ref:`Control <class_Control>"
"` ແມ່ນໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບ GUI. ສຳລັບ 3D, Godot ຈະໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`Node3D "
"<class_Node3D>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:304
msgid "Displaying 3D nodes in 2D"
msgstr "ການສະແດງໂນດ 3D ໃນ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:306
msgid ""
"It is possible to display 3D nodes in a 2D scene by using "
"a :ref:`SubViewport<class_SubViewport>`. You can see this in the demo `3D in "
"2D Viewport <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/2804>`__."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງໂນດ 3D ໃນສາກ 2D ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>"
"`. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ໃນ `3D in 2D Viewport <https://godotengine.org/asset-"
"library/asset/2804>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:4
msgid "Canvas layers"
msgstr "ຊັ້ນແຄນວາສ (Canvas layers)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:7
msgid "Viewport and Canvas items"
msgstr "Viewport ແລະ ວັດຖຸແຄນວາສ (Canvas items)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:9
msgid ""
":ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>` is the base for all 2D nodes, be it "
"regular 2D nodes, such as :ref:`Node2D <class_Node2D>`, or :ref:`Control "
"<class_Control>`. Both inherit from :ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>`. "
"You can arrange canvas items in trees. Each item will inherit its parent's "
"transform: when the parent moves, its children move too."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>` ແມ່ນພື້ນຖານຂອງທຸກໂນດ 2D, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນໂນດ 2D ທົ່ວໄປ"
"ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`Node2D <class_Node2D>` ຫຼື :ref:`Control <class_Control>`. ທັງສອງຢ່າງນີ້ສື"
"ບທອດມາຈາກ :ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>`. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດວາງ canvas items ເປັ"
"ນລຳດັບຊັ້ນ (trees) ໄດ້. ແຕ່ລະວັດຖຸຈະສືບທອດຄ່າ transform ຈາກໂນດແມ່: ເມື່ອໂນດແມ່ຍ້າຍ, ໂນດລູກກໍຈ"
"ະຍ້າຍໄປນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:15
msgid ""
"CanvasItem nodes, and nodes inheriting from them, are direct or indirect "
"children of a :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`, that displays them."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ CanvasItem ແລະ ໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກພວກມັນ ແມ່ນເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ທາງອ້ອມຂອງ "
":ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Viewport's property :ref:`Viewport.canvas_transform "
"<class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>`, allows to apply a "
"custom :ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` transform to the CanvasItem "
"hierarchy it contains. Nodes such as :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` work "
"by changing that transform."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`Viewport.canvas_transform "
"<class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>` ຂອງ Viewport ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າ "
":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກັບລຳດັບຊັ້ນ CanvasItem ທີ່ມັນບັນຈຸຢູ່. ໂ"
"ນດຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການປ່ຽນຄ່າ transform ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:24
msgid ""
"To achieve effects like scrolling, manipulating the canvas transform "
"property is more efficient than moving the root canvas item and the entire "
"scene with it."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເອັບເຟັກຄືກັບການເລື່ອນ (scrolling), ການປັບຄຸນສົມບັດ canvas transform ຈະມີປະສິດ"
"ທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າການຍ້າຍໂນດ canvas ຮາກ ແລະ ທັງສາກໄປພ້ອມກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:27
msgid ""
"Usually though, we don't want *everything* in the game or app to be subject "
"to the canvas transform. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ໄດ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ *ທຸກຢ່າງ* ໃນເກມ ຫຼື ແອັບ ຖືກກະທົບໂດຍ canvas "
"transform. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Parallax Backgrounds**: Backgrounds that move slower than the rest of the "
"stage."
msgstr "**Parallax Backgrounds**: ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:32
msgid ""
"**UI**: Think of a user interface (UI) or head-up display (HUD) superimposed "
"on our view of the game world. We want a life counter, score display and "
"other elements to retain their screen positions even when our view of the "
"game world changes."
msgstr ""
"**UI**: ໃຫ້ນຶກເຖິງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI) ຫຼື head-up display (HUD) ທີ່ຊ້ອນຢູ່ເທິງມຸມເບິ່ງໂລກຂອງເກ"
"ມ. ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕົວນັບເລືອດ, ການສະແດງຄະແນນ ແລະ ອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆ ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ເຖິງວ່າ"
"ມຸມເບິ່ງໃນເກມຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Transitions**: We may want visual effects used for transitions (fades, "
"blends) to remain at a fixed screen location."
msgstr ""
"**Transitions**: ພວກເຮົາອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນສາກ (fades, "
"blends) ຢູ່ຄົງທີ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:35
msgid "How to solve these problems in a single scene tree?"
msgstr "ຈະແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ scene tree ດຽວໄດ້ແນວໃວ?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:38
msgid "CanvasLayers"
msgstr "CanvasLayers"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:40
msgid ""
"The answer is :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>`, which is a node that "
"adds a separate 2D rendering layer for all its children and grand-children. "
"Viewport children will draw by default at layer \"0\", while a CanvasLayer "
"will draw at any numeric layer. Layers with a greater number will be drawn "
"above those with a smaller number. CanvasLayers also have their own "
"transform and do not depend on the transform of other layers. This allows "
"the UI to be fixed in screen-space while our view on the game world changes."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳຕອບຄື :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>`, ເຊິ່ງເປັນໂນດທີ່ເພີ່ມຊັ້ນການສະແດງຜົນ 2D ແ"
"ຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບລູກ ແລະ ຫຼານທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ໂນດລູກຂອງ Viewport ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ທີ່ຊັ້ນ "
"(layer) \"0\", ໃນຂະນະທີ່ CanvasLayer ສາມາດແຕ້ມຢູ່ຊັ້ນໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມຕົວເລກທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຊັ້ນທີ່ມີຕົວເລກຫຼາ"
"ຍກວ່າຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັບຊັ້ນທີ່ມີຕົວເລກນ້ອຍກວ່າ. CanvasLayers ຍັງມີຄ່າ transform ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ຂຶ້"
"ນກັບ transform ຂອງຊັ້ນອື່ນໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ UI ສາມາດຢູ່ຄົງທີ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມຸມເບິ່ງໂລກໃນເກມຂອງ"
"ພວກເຮົາປ່ຽນແປງໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:49
msgid ""
"An example of this is creating a parallax background. This can be done with "
"a CanvasLayer at layer \"-1\". The screen with the points, life counter and "
"pause button can also be created at layer \"1\"."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ຄືການສ້າງ parallax background. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ CanvasLayer ຢູ່ຊັ້ນ \"-"
"1\". ສ່ວນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ສະແດງຄະແນນ, ຕົວນັບເລືອດ ແລະ ປຸ່ມຢຸດເກມ ກໍສາມາດສ້າງໄວ້ຢູ່ຊັ້ນ \"1\" ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:53
msgid "Here's a diagram of how it looks:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນແຜນວາດສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:57
msgid ""
"CanvasLayers are independent of tree order, and they only depend on their "
"layer number, so they can be instantiated when needed."
msgstr ""
"CanvasLayers ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບລຳດັບໃນ scene tree, ແຕ່ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບຕົວເລກຊັ້ນຂອງພວກມັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈຶ່"
"ງສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/canvas_layers.rst:60
msgid ""
"CanvasLayers aren't necessary to control the drawing order of nodes. The "
"standard way to ensuring that a node is correctly drawn 'in front' or "
"'behind' others is to manipulate the order of the nodes in the scene panel. "
"Perhaps counterintuitively, the topmost nodes in the scene panel are drawn "
"on *behind* lower ones in the viewport. 2D nodes also have "
"the :ref:`CanvasItem.z_index <class_CanvasItem_property_z_index>` property "
"for controlling their drawing order."
msgstr ""
"CanvasLayers ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສະເໝີໄປໃນການຄວບຄຸມລຳດັບການແຕ້ມໂນດ. ວິທີມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂ"
"ນດຖືກແຕ້ມ 'ທາງໜ້າ' ຫຼື 'ທາງຫຼັງ' ອັນອື່ນ ຄືການຈັດລຳດັບໂນດໃນ scene panel. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຟັງເບິ່ງແປກໆ"
"ຄື: ໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດໃນ scene panel ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ *ໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງ* ໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມກວ່າໃນ viewport. ໂນດ 2D ຍັ"
"ງມີຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`CanvasItem.z_index <class_CanvasItem_property_z_index>` ເພື່ອຄວບ"
"ຄຸມລຳດັບການແຕ້ມຂອງພວກມັນນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:4
msgid "Viewport and canvas transforms"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າ Viewport ແລະ canvas (transforms)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:9
msgid ""
"This is an overview of the 2D transforms going on for nodes from the moment "
"they draw their content locally to the time they are drawn onto the screen. "
"This overview discusses very low-level details of the engine."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນພາບລວມຂອງການແປງຄ່າ (transforms) 2D ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບໂນດ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນທີ່ພວກມັນແຕ້ມເນື້ອຫາໃນລະດັ"
"ບ local ຈົນເຖິງຕອນທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກແຕ້ມລົງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ພາບລວມນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດລະດັບເລິກ (low-"
"level) ຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:13
msgid ""
"The goal of this tutorial is to teach a way for feeding input events to the "
"Input with a position in the correct coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງບົດຮຽນນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອສອນວິທີການສົ່ງເຫດການ input (input events) ໄປຍັງ Input ດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່"
"ງໃນລະບົບພິກັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:16
msgid ""
"A more extensive description of all coordinate systems and 2d transforms is "
"available in :ref:`doc_2d_coordinate_systems`."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບພິກັດທັງໝົດ ແລະ ການແປງຄ່າ 2D ມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_2d_coordinate_systems`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:20
msgid "Canvas transform"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າ Canvas (Canvas transform)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:22
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the previous tutorial, :ref:`doc_canvas_layers`, every "
"CanvasItem node (remember that Node2D and Control based nodes use CanvasItem "
"as their common root) will reside in a *Canvas Layer*. Every canvas layer "
"has a transform (translation, rotation, scale, etc.) that can be accessed as "
"a :ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>`."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມທີ່ກ່າວໄວ້ໃນບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້າ, :ref:`doc_canvas_layers`, ທຸກໆໂນດ CanvasItem (ຢ່າລືມວ່າໂນ"
"ດ Node2D ແລະ Control ໃຊ້ CanvasItem ເປັນຮາກຮ່ວມກັນ) ຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນ *Canvas Layer*. ທຸກໆ "
"canvas layer ມີຄ່າ transform (ການຍ້າຍ, ການໝູນ, ການປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ"
"ໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບ :ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:28
msgid ""
"Also covered in the previous tutorial, nodes are drawn by default in Layer "
"0, in the built-in canvas. To put nodes in a different layer, "
"a :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` node can be used."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ໃນບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້າ, ໂນດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ Layer 0 ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ ໃນ canvas ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້. ເພື່"
"ອເອົາໂນດໄປໄວ້ໃນຊັ້ນອື່ນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`CanvasLayer <class_CanvasLayer>` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:33
msgid "Global canvas transform"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າ Canvas ແບບ Global"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:35
msgid ""
"Viewports also have a Global Canvas transform (also a :ref:`Transform2D "
"<class_Transform2D>`). This is the master transform and affects all "
"individual *Canvas Layer* transforms. Generally, this is primarily used in "
"Godot's CanvasItem Editor."
msgstr ""
"Viewports ຍັງມີຄ່າ Global Canvas transform (ເປັນ :ref:`Transform2D "
"<class_Transform2D>` ຄືກັນ). ນີ້ແມ່ນ transform ຫຼັກ ແລະ ມີຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກໆ *Canvas Layer* "
"transform ແຍກຍ່ອຍ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຫຼັກໃນ CanvasItem Editor ຂອງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:41
msgid "Stretch transform"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າແບບຢືດ (Stretch transform)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:43
msgid ""
"Finally, viewports have a *Stretch Transform*, which is used when resizing "
"or stretching the screen. This transform is used internally (as described "
"in :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`), but can also be manually set on each "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, viewports ຍັງມີ *Stretch Transform*, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຢືດໜ້າຈໍ. "
"transform ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ (ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`), ແຕ່ກໍສາມາດ"
"ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະ viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:48
msgid ""
"Input events are multiplied by this transform, but lack the ones above. To "
"convert InputEvent coordinates to local CanvasItem coordinates, "
"the :ref:`CanvasItem.make_input_local() "
"<class_CanvasItem_method_make_input_local>` function was added for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດການ Input ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ transform ນີ້, ແຕ່ຈະຂາດອັນທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ. ເພື່ອແປງພິກັດ "
"InputEvent ໃຫ້ເປັນພິກັດ local ຂອງ CanvasItem, ຟັງຊັນ "
":ref:`CanvasItem.make_input_local() "
"<class_CanvasItem_method_make_input_local>` ຈຶ່ງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:54
msgid "Window transform"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າໜ້າຕ່າງ (Window transform)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:56
msgid ""
"The root viewport is a :ref:`Window <class_Window>`. In order to scale and "
"position the *Window's* content as described "
"in :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, each :ref:`Window <class_Window>` "
"contains a *window transform*. It is for example responsible for the black "
"bars at the *Window's* sides so that the *Viewport* is displayed with a "
"fixed aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"Viewport ຮາກແມ່ນ :ref:`Window <class_Window>`. ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ວາງຕຳແໜ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອ"
"ງ *Window* ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, ແຕ່ລະ :ref:`Window "
"<class_Window>` ຈະມີ *window transform*. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການສ້າງແຖບສີດຳທີ່ຂ້າ"
"ງໜ້າຕ່າງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ *Viewport* ສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect ratio) ທີ່ຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:63
msgid "Transform order"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການແປງຄ່າ (Transform order)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:65
msgid ""
"To convert a CanvasItem local coordinate to an actual screen coordinate, the "
"following chain of transforms must be applied:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແປງພິກັດ local ຂອງ CanvasItem ໃຫ້ເປັນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍຕົວຈິງ, ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລຳດັບການແປງຄ່າດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:71
msgid "Transform functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການແປງຄ່າ (Transform functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:73
msgid ""
"The above graphic shows some available transform functions. All transforms "
"are directed from right to left, this means multiplying a transform with a "
"coordinate results in a coordinate system further to the left, multiplying "
"the :ref:`affine inverse <class_Transform2D_method_affine_inverse>` of a "
"transform results in a coordinate system further to the right:"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບກຣາຟິກຂ້າງເທິງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນບາງຟັງຊັນ transform ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ທຸກໆ transform ຈະມີທິດທາງຈາກຂວາ"
"ໄປຊ້າຍ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຄູນ transform ກັບພິກັດ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ລະບົບພິກັດທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດໄປທາງຊ້າຍ, ການຄູນ "
":ref:`affine inverse <class_Transform2D_method_affine_inverse>` ຂອງ "
"transform ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ລະບົບພິກັດທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດໄປທາງຂວາ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:91
msgid ""
"Finally, then, to convert a CanvasItem local coordinates to screen "
"coordinates, just multiply in the following order:"
msgstr ""
"ສະນັ້ນ, ສຸດທ້າຍແລ້ວ ເພື່ອແປງພິກັດ local ຂອງ CanvasItem ໃຫ້ເປັນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ, ໃຫ້ຄູນຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:103
msgid ""
"Keep in mind, however, that it is generally not desired to work with screen "
"coordinates. The recommended approach is to simply work in Canvas "
"coordinates (``CanvasItem.get_global_transform()``), to allow automatic "
"screen resolution resizing to work properly."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄວນຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວພວກເຮົາບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຢາກເຮັດວຽກກັບພິກັດໜ້າຈໍປານໃດ. ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳຄືໃຫ້ເຮັ"
"ດວຽກໃນພິກັດ Canvas (``CanvasItem.get_global_transform()``), ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຄວາ"
"ມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍອັດຕະໂນມັດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:109
msgid "Feeding custom input events"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງເຫດການ input ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.rst:111
msgid ""
"It is often desired to feed custom input events to the game. With the above "
"knowledge, to correctly do this in the focused window, it must be done the "
"following way:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການສົ່ງເຫດການ input ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໄປໃນເກມ. ດ້ວຍຄວາມຮູ້ຂ້າງເທິງ, ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້"
"ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັສຢູ່, ຕ້ອງເຮັດຕາມວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:4
msgid "2D lights and shadows"
msgstr "ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ ໃນ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:9
msgid ""
"By default, 2D scenes in Godot are unshaded, with no lights and shadows "
"visible. While this is fast to render, unshaded scenes can look bland. Godot "
"provides the ability to use real-time 2D lighting and shadows, which can "
"greatly enhance the sense of depth in your project."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ສາກ 2D ໃນ Godot ຈະເປັນແບບບໍ່ມີແສງ (unshaded), ໂດຍຈະບໍ່ເຫັນທັງແສງ ແລະ ເງົ"
"າ. ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໄວ, ແຕ່ສາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີແສງອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ມີມິຕິ. Godot ຈຶ່ງມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ແ"
"ສງ ແລະ ເງົາ 2D ແບບ real-time, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກເຖິງຄວາມເລິກໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງ"
"ຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:14
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:18
msgid "No 2D lights or shadows, scene is unshaded"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແສງ ຫຼື ເງົາ 2D, ສາກເປັນແບບ unshaded"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:20
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:24
msgid "2D lights enabled (without shadows)"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ແສງ 2D (ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:26
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:30
msgid "2D lights and shadows enabled"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ທັງແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:35
msgid "There are several nodes involved in a complete 2D lighting setup:"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍໂນດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແສງ 2D ທີ່ສົມບູນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:37
msgid ""
":ref:`CanvasModulate <class_CanvasModulate>` (to darken the rest of the "
"scene)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CanvasModulate <class_CanvasModulate>` (ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງສາກມືດລົງ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:38
msgid ""
":ref:`PointLight2D <class_PointLight2D>` (for omnidirectional or spot lights)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PointLight2D <class_PointLight2D>` (ສຳລັບແສງຮອບທິດທາງ ຫຼື ແສງສະປອດໄລ້)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:39
msgid ""
":ref:`DirectionalLight2D <class_DirectionalLight2D>` (for sunlight or "
"moonlight)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`DirectionalLight2D <class_DirectionalLight2D>` (ສຳລັບແສງຕາເວັນ ຫຼື ແສງເດືອນ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`LightOccluder2D <class_LightOccluder2D>` (for light shadow casters)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LightOccluder2D <class_LightOccluder2D>` (ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຂວາງແສງໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:41
msgid "Other 2D nodes that receive lighting, such as Sprite2D or TileMapLayer."
msgstr "ໂນດ 2D ອື່ນໆທີ່ຮັບແສງ ເຊັ່ນ Sprite2D ຫຼື TileMapLayer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:43
msgid ""
":ref:`CanvasModulate <class_CanvasModulate>` is used to darken the scene by "
"specifying a color that will act as the base \"ambient\" color. This is the "
"final lighting color in areas that are *not* reached by any 2D light. "
"Without a CanvasModulate node, the final scene would look too bright as 2D "
"lights would only brighten the existing unshaded appearance (which appears "
"fully lit)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CanvasModulate <class_CanvasModulate>` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສາກມືດລົງໂດຍການກຳນົດສີທີ່ຈ"
"ະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນສີ \"ambient\" ພື້ນຖານ. ນີ້ຈະເປັນສີແສງສຸດທ້າຍໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ແສງ 2D ສ່ອງໄປ *ບໍ່ຮອດ*. ຫາ"
"ກບໍ່ມີໂນດ CanvasModulate, ສາກສຸດທ້າຍຈະເບິ່ງຄືແຈ້ງເກີນໄປ ເພາະແສງ 2D ຈະໄປເພີ່ມຄວາມແຈ້ງໃຫ້ກັບພາ"
"ບແບບ unshaded ເດີມ (ເຊິ່ງມັນແຈ້ງເຕັມທີ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:49
msgid ""
":ref:`Sprite2Ds <class_Sprite2D>` are used to display the textures for the "
"light blobs, the background, and for the shadow casters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Sprite2Ds <class_Sprite2D>` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງ texture ສຳລັບດວງແສງ, ພື້ນຫຼັງ, ແລະ "
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:52
msgid ""
":ref:`PointLight2Ds <class_PointLight2D>` are used to light the scene. The "
"way a light typically works is by adding a selected texture over the rest of "
"the scene to simulate lighting."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PointLight2Ds <class_PointLight2D>` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ່ອງແສງໃຫ້ສາກ. ວິທີທີ່ແສງເຮັດວຽກໂດຍ"
"ທົ່ວໄປຄືການເພີ່ມ texture ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ທັບລົງໄປເທິງສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງສາກເພື່ອຈຳລອງການສ່ອງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:56
msgid ""
":ref:`LightOccluder2Ds <class_LightOccluder2D>` are used to tell the shader "
"which parts of the scene cast shadows. These occluders can be placed as "
"independent nodes or can be part of a TileMapLayer node."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LightOccluder2Ds <class_LightOccluder2D>` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກ shader ວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງສ"
"າກທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ. occluders ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດວາງເປັນໂນດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer ກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:60
msgid ""
"The shadows appear only on areas covered by the :ref:`PointLight2D "
"<class_PointLight2D>` and their direction is based on the center of "
"the :ref:`Light <class_PointLight2D>`."
msgstr ""
"ເງົາຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ :ref:`PointLight2D <class_PointLight2D>` ສ່ອງໄປຮອດ ແ"
"ລະ ທິດທາງຂອງເງົາຈະອີງຕາມຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງ :ref:`Light <class_PointLight2D>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:66
msgid ""
"The background color does **not** receive any lighting. If you want light to "
"be cast on the background, you need to add a visual representation for the "
"background, such as a Sprite2D."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຈະ **ບໍ່** ຮັບແສງໃດໆ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແສງສ່ອງໃສ່ພື້ນຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມວັດຖຸທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄ"
"ດ້ສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງ ເຊັ່ນ Sprite2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:70
msgid ""
"The Sprite2D's **Region** properties can be helpful to quickly create a "
"repeating background texture, but remember to also set **Texture > Repeat** "
"to **Enabled** in the Sprite2D's properties."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ **Region** ຂອງ Sprite2D ສາມາດຊ່ວຍສ້າງ texture ພື້ນຫຼັງແບບຊ້ຳກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແຕ່ຢ່າ"
"ລືມຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Texture > Repeat** ເປັນ **Enabled** ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Sprite2D ນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:75
msgid "Point lights"
msgstr "ແສງແບບຈຸດ (Point lights)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:77
msgid ""
"Point lights (also called positional lights) are the most common element in "
"2D lighting. Point lights can be used to represent light from torches, fire, "
"projectiles, etc."
msgstr ""
"ແສງແບບຈຸດ (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າແສງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ) ແມ່ນອົງປະກອບທີ່ພົບເຫັນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການຈັດແສງ 2D. ແສງແບບຈຸດສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ແທນແສງຈາກ ກະບອງ, ໄຟ, ລູກກະສຸນ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:81
msgid "PointLight2D offers the following properties to tweak in the inspector:"
msgstr "PointLight2D ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງໃນ inspector:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Texture:** The texture to use as a light source. The texture's size "
"determines the size of the light. The texture may have an alpha channel, "
"which is useful when using Light2D's **Mix** blend mode, but it is not "
"required if using the **Add** (default) or **Subtract** blend modes."
msgstr ""
"**Texture:** Texture ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ຂະໜາດຂອງ texture ຈະກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງແສ"
"ງ. texture ອາດມີ alpha channel ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໃຊ້ blend mode ແບບ **Mix** ຂອງ "
"Light2D, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຫາກໃຊ້ blend mode ແບບ **Add** (ມາດຕະຖານ) ຫຼື **Subtract**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Offset:** The offset for the light texture. Unlike when you move the light "
"node, changing the offset does *not* cause shadows to move."
msgstr ""
"**Offset:** ຄ່າເຍື່ອງ (offset) ສຳລັບ texture ຂອງແສງ. ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກການຍ້າຍໂນດແສງ, ການປ່ຽ"
"ນ offset ຈະ **ບໍ່** ເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາຍ້າຍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Texture Scale:** The multiplier for the light's size. Higher values will "
"make the light extend out further. Larger lights have a higher performance "
"cost as they affect more pixels on screen, so consider this before "
"increasing a light's size."
msgstr ""
"**Texture Scale:** ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບຂະໜາດຂອງແສງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສ່ອງອອກໄປໄກກວ່າ. ແສງຂະ"
"ໜາດໃຫຍ່ຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ ເພາະມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນພິຈາລະນາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມ"
"ຂະໜາດແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Height:** The light's virtual height with regards to normal mapping. By "
"default, the light is very close to surfaces receiving lights. This will "
"make lighting hardly visible if normal mapping is used, so consider "
"increasing this value. Adjusting the light's height only makes a visible "
"difference on surfaces that use normal mapping."
msgstr ""
"**Height:** ຄວາມສູງຈຳລອງຂອງແສງທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບ normal mapping. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ແສງຈະຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບພື້ນ"
"ຜິວທີ່ຮັບແສງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແສງໄດ້ຍາກຫາກມີການໃຊ້ normal mapping, ສະນັ້ນຄວນພິຈາລະນາເພີ່ມ"
"ຄ່ານີ້. ການປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງຈະເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໄດ້ສະເພາະເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ normal mapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you don't have a pre-made texture to use in a light, you can use this "
"\"neutral\" point light texture (right-click > **Save Image As…**):"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ມີ texture ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນແສງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ texture ແສງແບບຈຸດແບບ "
"\"neutral\" ນີ້ໄດ້ (ຄລິກຂວາ > **Save Image As…**):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:102
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:106
msgid "Neutral point light texture"
msgstr "Texture ແສງແບບຈຸດແບບ Neutral"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:108
msgid ""
"If you need different falloff, you can procedurally create a texture by "
"assigning a **New GradientTexture2D** on the light's **Texture** property. "
"After creating the resource, expand its **Fill** section and set the fill "
"mode to **Radial**. You will then have to adjust the gradient itself to "
"start from opaque white to transparent white, and move its starting location "
"to be in the center."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການການກະຈາຍແສງ (falloff) ທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ texture ຂຶ້ນມາເອງໄດ້ໂດຍ"
"ການກຳນົດ **New GradientTexture2D** ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ **Texture** ຂອງແສງ. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ "
"resource ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນ **Fill** ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ fill mode ເປັນ **Radial**. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່າ"
"ນຈະຕ້ອງປັບຄ່າ gradient ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຈາກສີຂາວທຶບໄປຫາສີຂາວໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:115
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.rst:176
msgid "Directional light"
msgstr "ແສງແບບມີທິດທາງ (Directional light)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:117
msgid ""
"Directional lighting is used to represent sunlight or moonlight. Light rays "
"are casted parallel to each other, as if the sun or moon was infinitely far "
"away from the surface that is receiving the light."
msgstr ""
"ແສງແບບມີທິດທາງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນແສງຕາເວັນ ຫຼື ແສງເດືອນ. ລັງສີຂອງແສງຈະສ່ອງອອກມາຂະໜານກັນ, ຄືກັບວ່າດວ"
"ງຕາເວັນ ຫຼື ດວງເດືອນຢູ່ໄກຫຼາຍຈາກພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຮັບແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:121
msgid "DirectionalLight2D offers the following properties:"
msgstr "DirectionalLight2D ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Height:** The light's virtual height with regards to normal mapping "
"(``0.0`` = parallel to surfaces, ``1.0`` = perpendicular to surfaces). By "
"default, the light is fully parallel with the surfaces receiving lights. "
"This will make lighting hardly visible if normal mapping is used, so "
"consider increasing this value. Adjusting the light's height only makes a "
"visual difference on surfaces that use normal mapping. **Height** does not "
"affect shadows' appearance."
msgstr ""
"**Height:** ຄວາມສູງຈຳລອງຂອງແສງທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບ normal mapping (``0.0`` = ຂະໜານກັບພື້ນຜິວ, "
"``1.0`` = ຕັ້ງສາກກັບພື້ນຜິວ). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ແສງຈະຂະໜານກັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຮັບແສງທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັ"
"ນແສງໄດ້ຍາກຫາກມີການໃຊ້ normal mapping, ສະນັ້ນຄວນພິຈາລະນາເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້. ການປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງຈະເ"
"ຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໄດ້ສະເພາະເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ normal mapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. **Height** ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບລັກສະ"
"ນະຂອງເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Max Distance:** The maximum distance from the camera center objects can be "
"before their shadows are culled (in pixels). Decreasing this value can "
"prevent objects located outside the camera from casting shadows (while also "
"improving performance). Camera2D zoom is not taken into account by **Max "
"Distance**, which means that at higher zoom values, shadows will appear to "
"fade out sooner when zooming onto a given point."
msgstr ""
"**Max Distance:** ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດຈາກໃຈກາງກ້ອງທີ່ວັດຖຸສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້ກ່ອນທີ່ເງົາຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ "
"(ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກ້ອງເກີດເງົາ (ພ້ອມທັງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ). ການ"
"ຊູມຂອງ Camera2D ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນ **Max Distance**, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອຊູມຫຼາຍໆ, ເງົາຈະເບິ່ງ"
"ຄືຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປໄວຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າໄປຫາຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:138
msgid ""
"Directional shadows will always appear to be infinitely long, regardless of "
"the value of the **Height** property. This is a limitation of the shadow "
"rendering method used for 2D lights in Godot."
msgstr ""
"ເງົາແບບມີທິດທາງ (Directional shadows) ຈະເບິ່ງຄືຍາວບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດສະເໝີ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Height** ເ"
"ປັນເທົ່າໃດກໍຕາມ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງວິທີການສະແດງຜົນເງົາທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງ 2D ໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:142
msgid ""
"To have directional shadows that are not infinitely long, you should disable "
"shadows in the DirectionalLight2D and use a custom shader that reads from "
"the 2D signed distance field instead. This distance field is automatically "
"generated from LightOccluder2D nodes present in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເງົາແບບມີທິດທາງບໍ່ຍາວເກີນໄປ, ທ່ານຄວນປິດການໃຊ້ເງົາໃນ DirectionalLight2D ແລ້ວໃ"
"ຊ້ custom shader ທີ່ອ່ານຄ່າຈາກ 2D signed distance field (SDF) ແທນ. distance field "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກໂນດ LightOccluder2D ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:148
msgid "Common light properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປຂອງແສງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:150
msgid ""
"Both PointLight2D and DirectionalLight2D offer common properties, which are "
"part of the Light2D base class:"
msgstr ""
"ທັງ PointLight2D ແລະ DirectionalLight2D ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຮ່ວມກັນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຄລາສພື້ນຖານ "
"Light2D:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Enabled:** Allows toggling the light's visibility. Unlike hiding the light "
"node, disabling this property will not hide the light's children."
msgstr ""
"**Enabled:** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເປີດ/ປິດ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງແສງ. ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກການເຊື່ອງໂນດແສງ, ການປິດຄຸນສົມບັດ"
"ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອງໂນດລູກຂອງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:155
msgid ""
"**Editor Only:** If enabled, the light is only visible within the editor. It "
"will be automatically disabled in the running project."
msgstr ""
"**Editor Only:** ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ແສງຈະເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຈະຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນ"
"ມັດເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:157
msgid "**Color:** The light's color."
msgstr "**Color:** ສີຂອງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Energy:** The light's intensity multiplier. Higher values result in a "
"brighter light."
msgstr "**Energy:** ຕົວຄູນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Blend Mode:** The blending formula used for light computations. The "
"default **Add** is suited for most use cases. **Subtract** can be used for "
"negative lights, which are not physically accurate but can be used for "
"special effects. The **Mix** blend mode mixes the value of pixels "
"corresponding to the light's texture with the values of pixels under it by "
"linear interpolation."
msgstr ""
"**Blend Mode:** ສູດການປະສົມສີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄິດໄລ່ແສງ. ຄ່າ **Add** ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນເໝາະສົມກັບການໃ"
"ຊ້ງານສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. **Subtract** ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງແບບລົບ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຄືແສງຈິງແຕ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກພິເສດໄ"
"ດ້. ສ່ວນ **Mix** ຈະປະສົມຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງ texture ແສງ ກັບຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງມັນດ້ວຍວິທີ linear "
"interpolation."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:164
msgid "**Range > Z Min:** The lowest Z index affected by the light."
msgstr "**Range > Z Min:** ຄ່າ Z index ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:165
msgid "**Range > Z Max:** The highest Z index affected by the light."
msgstr "**Range > Z Max:** ຄ່າ Z index ສູງສຸດທີ່ຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:166
msgid "**Range > Layer Min:** The lowest visual layer affected by the light."
msgstr "**Range > Layer Min:** ຊັ້ນການສະແດງຜົນຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:167
msgid "**Range > Layer Max:** The highest visual layer affected by the light."
msgstr "**Range > Layer Max:** ຊັ້ນການສະແດງຜົນສູງສຸດທີ່ຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Range > Item Cull Mask:** Controls which nodes receive light from this "
"node, depending on the other nodes' enabled visual layers **Occluder Light "
"Mask**. This can be used to prevent certain objects from receiving light."
msgstr ""
"**Range > Item Cull Mask:** ຄວບຄຸມວ່າໂນດໃດຈະຮັບແສງຈາກໂນດນີ້, ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຊັ້ນການສະແດງຜົນ "
"**Occluder Light Mask** ຂອງໂນດອື່ນໆ. ສ່ວນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸບາງຢ່າງຮັບແສງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:175
msgid "Setting up shadows"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເງົາ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:177
msgid ""
"After enabling the **Shadow > Enabled** property on a PointLight2D or "
"DirectionalLight2D node, you will not see any visual difference initially. "
"This is because no nodes in your scene have any *occluders* yet, which are "
"used as a basis for shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ **Shadow > Enabled** ໃນໂນດ PointLight2D ຫຼື "
"DirectionalLight2D, ໃນຕອນທຳອິດທ່ານຈະຍັງບໍ່ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໃດໆ. ນັ້ນກໍເພາະຍັງບໍ່ມີໂນດໃດໃນສາກຂ"
"ອງທ່ານທີ່ມີ *occluders*, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:182
msgid ""
"For shadows to appear in the scene, LightOccluder2D nodes must be added to "
"the scene. These nodes must also have occluder polygons that are designed to "
"match the sprite's outline."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເງົາປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນສາກ, ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂນດ LightOccluder2D ເຂົ້າໄປ. ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຕ້ອງມີ occluder "
"polygons ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂອບຂອງ sprite."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:186
msgid ""
"Along with their polygon resource (which must be set to have any visual "
"effect), LightOccluder2D nodes have 2 properties:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກ polygon resource (ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງກຳນົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ), ໂນດ LightOccluder2D ຍັງມີ 2 ຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:189
msgid ""
"**SDF Collision:** If enabled, the occluder will be part of a real-time "
"generated *signed distance field* that can be used in custom shaders. When "
"not using custom shaders that read from this SDF, enabling this makes no "
"visual difference and has no performance cost, so this is enabled by default "
"for convenience."
msgstr ""
"**SDF Collision:** ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, occluder ຈະເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ *signed distance field* "
"(SDF) ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບ real-time ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນ custom shaders ໄດ້. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ "
"custom shader ທີ່ອ່ານຈາກ SDF ນີ້, ການເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຈະບໍ່ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ບໍ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ດັ່ງນັ້"
"ນມັນຈຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໄວ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:194
msgid ""
"**Occluder Light Mask:** This is used in tandem with PointLight2D and "
"DirectionalLight2D's **Shadow > Item Cull Mask** property to control which "
"objects cast shadows for each light. This can be used to prevent specific "
"objects from casting shadows."
msgstr ""
"**Occluder Light Mask:** ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ **Shadow > Item Cull Mask** ຂອງ "
"PointLight2D ແລະ DirectionalLight2D ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າວັດຖຸໃດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາສຳລັບແສງແຕ່ລະດວ"
"ງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸບາງຢ່າງເກີດເງົາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:199
msgid "There are two ways to create light occluders:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງ light occluders:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:202
msgid "Automatically generating a light occluder"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ light occluder ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:204
msgid ""
"Occluders can be created automatically from Sprite2D nodes by selecting the "
"node, clicking the **Sprite2D** menu at the top of the 2D editor then "
"choosing **Create LightOccluder2D Sibling**."
msgstr ""
"Occluders ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກໂນດ Sprite2D ໂດຍການເລືອກໂນດນັ້ນ, ຄລິກທີ່ເມນູ "
"**Sprite2D** ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ 2D editor ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Create LightOccluder2D Sibling**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:208
msgid ""
"In the dialog that appears, an outline will surround your sprite's edges. If "
"the outline matches the sprite's edges closely, you can click **OK**. If the "
"outline is too far away from the sprite's edges (or is \"eating\" into the "
"sprite's edges), adjust **Grow (pixels)** and **Shrink (pixels)**, then "
"click **Update Preview**. Repeat this operation until you get satisfactory "
"results."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ຈະມີເສັ້ນຂອບອ້ອມຮອບ sprite ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກເສັ້ນຂອບນັ້ນພໍດີກັບ sprite ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້"
"ຄລິກ **OK**. ຫາກເສັ້ນຂອບຢູ່ຫ່າງເກີນໄປ (ຫຼື ກິນເຂົ້າໄປໃນເນື້ອ sprite), ໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າ **Grow "
"(pixels)** ແລະ **Shrink (pixels)**, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ **Update Preview**. ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈົ"
"ນກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຜົນທີ່ພໍໃຈ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:215
msgid "Manually drawing a light occluder"
msgstr "ການແຕ້ມ light occluder ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:217
msgid ""
"Create a LightOccluder2D node, then select the node and click the \"+\" "
"button at the top of the 2D editor. When asked to create a polygon resource, "
"answer **Yes**. You can then start drawing an occluder polygon by clicking "
"to create new points. You can remove existing points by right-clicking them, "
"and you can create new points from the existing line by clicking on the line "
"then dragging."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໂນດ LightOccluder2D, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກໂນດນັ້ນແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"+\" ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ 2D editor. ເມື່ອ"
"ມີຖາມໃຫ້ສ້າງ polygon resource, ໃຫ້ຕອບ **Yes**. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມແຕ້ມ occluder "
"polygon ໂດຍການຄລິກເພື່ອສ້າງຈຸດໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຈຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພວກມັນ, ແລະ ສາມາດສ້"
"າງຈຸດໃໝ່ຈາກເສັ້ນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ເສັ້ນແລ້ວລາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:223
msgid ""
"The following properties can be adjusted on 2D lights that have shadows "
"enabled:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນແສງ 2D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຢູ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:225
msgid ""
"**Color:** The color of shaded areas. By default, shaded areas are fully "
"black, but this can be changed for artistic purposes. The color's alpha "
"channel controls how much the shadow is tinted by the specified color."
msgstr ""
"**Color:** ສີຂອງບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີເງົາ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ບໍລິເວນເງົາຈະເປັນສີດຳສະນິດ, ແຕ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ເພື່ອ"
"ຄວາມສວຍງາມ. ຄ່າ alpha ຂອງສີຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າເງົານັ້ນຈະຖືກຍ້ອມດ້ວຍສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຫຼາຍປານໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:228
msgid ""
"**Filter:** The filter mode to use for shadows. The default **None** is the "
"fastest to render, and is well suited for games with a pixel art aesthetic "
"(due to its \"blocky\" visuals). If you want a soft shadow, use **PCF5** "
"instead. **PCF13** is even softer, but is the most demanding to render. "
"PCF13 should only be used for a few lights at once due to its high rendering "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"**Filter:** ໂໝດຟິວເຕີ (filter) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເງົາ. ຄ່າ **None** ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸ"
"ດ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບເກມແບບ pixel art (ເພາະເງົາຈະເບິ່ງເປັນກ້ອນໆ). ຫາກຕ້ອງການເງົາທີ່ນຸ່ມນວນ, ໃຫ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ **PCF5** ແທນ. **PCF13** ຈະນຸ່ມນວນກວ່າ, ແຕ່ກໍກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ຄວນໃຊ້ PCF13 ກັບແສງ"
"ພຽງບໍ່ກີ່ດວງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:233
msgid ""
"**Filter Smooth:** Controls how much softening is applied to shadows when "
"**Filter** is set to **PCF5** or **PCF13**. Higher values result in a softer "
"shadow, but may cause banding artifacts to be visible (especially with PCF5)."
msgstr ""
"**Filter Smooth:** ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນຂອງເງົາເມື່ອຕັ້ງ **Filter** ເປັນ **PCF5** ຫຼື "
"**PCF13**. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົານຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍແຍກຂອງສີ (banding) ໄດ້ (ໂດຍສະ"
"ເພາະກັບ PCF5)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:236
msgid ""
"**Item Cull Mask:** Controls which LightOccluder2D nodes cast shadows, "
"depending on their respective **Occluder Light Mask** properties."
msgstr ""
"**Item Cull Mask:** ຄວບຄຸມວ່າໂນດ LightOccluder2D ໃດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ, ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄຸນສົມບັ"
"ດ **Occluder Light Mask** ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:241
msgid "**Lighting and shadow resolution in pixel-art games**"
msgstr "**ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ ໃນເກມແບບ pixel-art**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:243
msgid ""
"The engine computes 2D lighting and shadows at the **Viewport's pixel "
"resolution**, not at the source texture's texel resolution. The appearance "
"of lights and shadows depends on your window or Viewport resolution, not on "
"the resolution of individual sprite textures."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງຈັກຈະຄິດໄລ່ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ 2D ຕາມ **ຄວາມລະອຽດພິກເຊວຂອງ Viewport**, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມຄວາມລະອ"
"ຽດຂອງ texture ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື "
"Viewport ຂອງທ່ານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ sprite ແຕ່ລະອັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:248
msgid ""
"If you create a pixel-art game and want pixelated or blocky lighting and "
"shadows that match your art style, **Nearest** texture filtering will "
"**not** achieve this effect. Nearest filtering affects only how the engine "
"samples textures — it does not change how the engine renders lighting and "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງເກມແບບ pixel-art ແລະ ຕ້ອງການແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ ທີ່ເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວ ຫຼື ເປັນກ້ອນໆໃຫ້ເຂົ້"
"າກັບຮູບແບບເກມ, ການໃຊ້ **Nearest** texture filtering ຈະ **ບໍ່** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເກີດເອັບເຟັກນີ້. "
"Nearest filtering ມີຜົນສະເພາະວິທີທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ texture ເທົ່ານັ້ນ — ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກ"
"ສະແດງຜົນແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:253
msgid ""
"To achieve pixelated lighting and shadows, use a custom shader to modify "
"``LIGHT_VERTEX`` and ``SHADOW_VERTEX`` to snap light sampling to a pixel "
"grid. The following shader snaps lighting to a grid using the ``floor()`` "
"function:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ ແບບພິກເຊວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ custom shader ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ``LIGHT_VERTEX`` ແລະ "
"``SHADOW_VERTEX`` ເພື່ອ snap ການສຸ່ມແສງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບກຣິດພິກເຊວ. shader ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະ snap ແສງເຂົ້າ"
"ກັບກຣິດໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``floor()``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:272
msgid ""
"This works by dividing the position by ``pixel_size`` to convert to grid "
"space, using ``floor()`` to round down to the nearest grid point, then "
"multiplying back to convert to screen space. The result forces the engine to "
"sample lighting from discrete grid positions, which creates the pixelated "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການຫານຕຳແໜ່ງດ້ວຍ ``pixel_size`` ເພື່ອແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ກຣິດ, ໃຊ້ ``floor()`` ເພື່ອ"
"ປັດຄ່າລົງຫາຈຸດກຣິດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ, ຈາກນັ້ນຄູນກັບຄືນເພື່ອແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກສຸ່ມແສງຈາກຕ"
"ຳແໜ່ງກຣິດທີ່ແຍກກັນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບພິກເຊວຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:277
