#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:298
msgid "Normal and specular maps"
msgstr "Normal ແລະ specular maps"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:300
msgid ""
"Normal maps and specular maps can greatly enhance the sense of depth of your "
"2D lighting. Similar to how these work in 3D rendering, normal maps can help "
"make lighting look less flat by varying its intensity depending on the "
"direction of the surface receiving light (on a per-pixel basis). Specular "
"maps further help improve visuals by making some of the light reflect back "
"to the viewer."
msgstr ""
"Normal maps ແລະ specular maps ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກເຖິງຄວາມເລິກຂອງການຈັດແສງ 2D ໄດ້ຢ່າ"
"ງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີທີ່ພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນ 3D, normal maps ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແສງເບິ່ງບໍ່ແປ (flat) ໂດຍກາ"
"ນປ່ຽນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງ ຕາມທິດທາງຂອງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຮັບແສງ (ໃນລະດັບພິກເຊວ). Specular maps ຈະຊ່ວຍປັບປຸ"
"ງພາບໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງບາງສ່ວນສະທ້ອນກັບມາຫາຜູ້ເບິ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:306
msgid ""
"Both PointLight2D and DirectionalLight2D support normal mapping and specular "
"mapping. Normal and specular maps can be assigned to any 2D element, "
"including nodes that inherit from Node2D or Control."
msgstr ""
"ທັງ PointLight2D ແລະ DirectionalLight2D ຮອງຮັບທັງ normal mapping ແລະ specular "
"mapping. normal ແລະ specular maps ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບທຸກອົງປະກອບ 2D, ລວມທັງໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາ"
"ຈາກ Node2D ຫຼື Control."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:310
msgid ""
"A normal map represents the direction in which each pixel is \"pointing\" "
"towards. This information is then used by the engine to correctly apply "
"lighting to 2D surfaces in a physically plausible way. Normal maps are "
"typically created from hand-painted height maps, but they can also be "
"automatically generated from other textures."
msgstr ""
"Normal map ຈະບອກທິດທາງທີ່ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ \"ຊີ້\" ໄປຫາ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກເຄື່ອງຈັກນຳໄປໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃສ່ແສງໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິ"
"ວ 2D ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກການຟີຊິກທີ່ສົມຈິງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ normal maps ຈະຖືກສ້າງມາຈາກ height "
"maps ທີ່ແຕ້ມດ້ວຍມື, ແຕ່ກໍສາມາດສ້າງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ texture ອື່ນໆໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:316
msgid ""
"A specular map defines how much each pixel should reflect light (and in "
"which color, if the specular map contains color). Brighter values will "
"result in a brighter reflection at that given spot on the texture. Specular "
"maps are typically created with manual editing, using the diffuse texture as "
"a base."
msgstr ""
"Specular map ກຳນົດວ່າແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຄວນສະທ້ອນແສງຫຼາຍປານໃດ (ແລະ ເປັນສີໃດ, ຫາກ specular "
"map ນັ້ນມີສີ). ຄ່າທີ່ແຈ້ງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການສະທ້ອນທີ່ແຈ້ງກວ່າໃນຈຸດນັ້ນໆຂອງ texture. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"specular maps ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ດ້ວຍການປັບແຕ່ງເອງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ diffuse texture ເປັນພື້ນຖານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:323
msgid ""
"If you don't have normal or specular maps for your sprites, you can generate "
"them using the free and open source `Laigter <https://azagaya.itch.io/"
"laigter>`__ tool."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ມີ normal ຫຼື specular maps ສຳລັບ sprite ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່"
"ອງມື ຟຣີ ແລະ open source ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `Laigter <https://azagaya.itch.io/laigter>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:327
msgid ""
"To set up normal maps and/or specular maps on a 2D node, create a new "
"CanvasTexture resource for the property that draws the node's texture. For "
"example, on a Sprite2D:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ normal maps ແລະ/ຫຼື specular maps ໃນໂນດ 2D, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ CanvasTexture "
"resource ໃໝ່ ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ແຕ້ມ texture ຂອງໂນດນັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ ໃນ Sprite2D:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:331
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:335
msgid "Creating a CanvasTexture resource for a Sprite2D node"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ CanvasTexture resource ສຳລັບໂນດ Sprite2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:337
msgid ""
"Expand the newly created resource. You can find several properties you will "
"need to adjust:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ resource ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຫຼາຍຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:340
msgid ""
"**Diffuse > Texture:** The base color texture. In this property, load the "
"texture you're using for the sprite itself."
msgstr ""
"**Diffuse > Texture:** Texture ສີພື້ນຖານ. ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ texture ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ສຳລັບ "
"sprite ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:342
msgid ""
"**Normal Map > Texture:** The normal map texture. In this property, load a "
"normal map texture you've generated from a height map (see the tip above)."
msgstr ""
"**Normal Map > Texture:** Texture ຂອງ normal map. ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ normal "
"map texture ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ height map (ເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳຂ້າງເທິງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:344
msgid ""
"**Specular > Texture:** The specular map texture, which controls the "
"specular intensity of each pixel on the diffuse texture. The specular map is "
"usually grayscale, but it can also contain color to multiply the color of "
"reflections accordingly. In this property, load a specular map texture "
"you've created (see the tip above)."
msgstr ""
"**Specular > Texture:** Texture ຂອງ specular map, ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການສະທ້ອນຂ"
"ອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ ເທິງ diffuse texture. specular map ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະເປັນສີຂາວດຳ (grayscale)"
", ແຕ່ກໍສາມາດມີສີເພື່ອຄູນສີຂອງການສະທ້ອນໄດ້. ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ specular map texture ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າ"
"ງຂຶ້ນ (ເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳຂ້າງເທິງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:349
msgid "**Specular > Color:** The color multiplier for specular reflections."
msgstr "**Specular > Color:** ຕົວຄູນສີສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:350
msgid ""
"**Specular > Shininess:** The specular exponent to use for reflections. "
"Lower values will increase the brightness of reflections and make them more "
"diffuse, while higher values will make reflections more localized. High "
"values are more suited for wet-looking surfaces."
msgstr ""
"**Specular > Shininess:** ຄ່າກຳລັງຂອງ specular ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການສະທ້ອນ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເພີ່ມຄວ"
"າມແຈ້ງຂອງການສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເບິ່ງກະຈາຍຕົວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນເບິ່"
"ງເປັນຈຸດສະເພາະຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເໝາະສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືປຽກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:354
msgid ""
"**Texture > Filter:** Can be set to override the texture filtering mode, "
"regardless of what the node's property is set to (or the **Rendering > "
"Textures > Canvas Textures > Default Texture Filter** project setting)."
msgstr ""
"**Texture > Filter:** ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອທັບ (override) ໂໝດ texture filtering, ບໍ່ວ່າໂນດ"
"ນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແນວໃດ (ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ **Rendering > Textures > Canvas "
"Textures > Default Texture Filter**)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:358
msgid ""
"**Texture > Repeat:** Can be set to override the texture filtering mode, "
"regardless of what the node's property is set to (or the **Rendering > "
"Textures > Canvas Textures > Default Texture Repeat** project setting)."
msgstr ""
"**Texture > Repeat:** ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອທັບ ໂໝດ texture repeat, ບໍ່ວ່າໂນດນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແນ"
"ວໃດ (ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ **Rendering > Textures > Canvas Textures > Default "
"Texture Repeat**)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:363
msgid ""
"After enabling normal mapping, you may notice that your lights appear to be "
"weaker. To resolve this, increase the **Height** property on your "
"PointLight2D and DirectionalLight2D nodes. You may also want to increase the "
"lights's **Energy** property slightly to get closer to how your lighting's "
"intensity looked prior to enabling normal mapping."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ normal mapping, ທ່ານອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າແສງເບິ່ງຄືຈະອ່ອນລົງ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່"
"ມຄ່າ **Height** ໃນໂນດ PointLight2D ແລະ DirectionalLight2D. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າ "
"**Energy** ຂອງແສງຂຶ້ນໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບຕອນກ່ອນຈະເປີດໃຊ້ normal "
"mapping."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:370
msgid "Using additive sprites as a faster alternative to 2D lights"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ additive sprites ເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ໄວກວ່າແສງ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:372
msgid ""
"If you run into performance issues when using 2D lights, it may be worth "
"replacing some of them with Sprite2D nodes that use additive blending. This "
"is particularly suited for short-lived dynamic effects, such as bullets or "
"explosions."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫາເລື່ອງປະສິດທິພາບເມື່ອໃຊ້ແສງ 2D, ມັນອາດຈະຄຸ້ມຄ່າທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແສງບາງອັນ ມາເປັນໂນດ "
"Sprite2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ additive blending ແທນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເໝາະສົມເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄລຍະສັ້ນ ເຊັ່"
"ນ ລູກກະສຸນ ຫຼື ການລະເບີດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:376
msgid ""
"Additive sprites are much faster to render, since they don't need to go "
"through a separate rendering pipeline. Additionally, it is possible to use "
"this approach with AnimatedSprite2D (or Sprite2D + AnimationPlayer), which "
"allows for animated 2D \"lights\" to be created."
msgstr ""
"Additive sprites ຈະສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໄວກວ່າຫຼາຍ, ເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ຕ້ອງຜ່ານຂະບວນການສະແດງຜົນ "
"(pipeline) ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ກັບ AnimatedSprite2D (ຫຼື Sprite2D "
"+ AnimationPlayer) ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ້າງ \"ແສງ\" 2D ແບບເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:381
msgid "However, additive sprites have a few downsides compared to 2D lights:"
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, additive sprites ຍັງມີຂໍ້ເສຍບາງຢ່າງເມື່ອທຽບກັບແສງ 2D:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:383
msgid ""
"The blending formula is inaccurate compared to \"actual\" 2D lighting. This "
"is usually not a problem in sufficiently lit areas, but this prevents "
"additive sprites from correctly lighting up areas that are fully dark."
msgstr ""
"ສູດການປະສົມ (blending formula) ແມ່ນບໍ່ຊັດເຈນເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໃຫ້ແສງ 2D \"ຕົວຈິງ\". ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້"
"ວນີີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີແສງສະຫວ່າງພຽງພໍ, ແຕ່ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ສະໄພຣທ໌ແບບບວກແສງ (additive sprites) ບໍ່"
"ສາມາດໃຫ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມືດສະໜິດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:386
msgid "Additive sprites cannot cast shadows, since they are not lights."
msgstr "Additive sprites ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາໄດ້, ເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:387
msgid "Additive sprites ignore normal and specular maps used on other sprites."
msgstr ""
"Additive sprites ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈ normal ແລະ specular maps ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ sprite ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_lights_and_shadows.rst:389
msgid ""
"To display a sprite with additive blending, create a Sprite2D node and "
"assign a texture to it. In the inspector, scroll down to the **CanvasItem > "
"Material** section, unfold it and click the dropdown next to the "
"**Material** property. Choose **New CanvasItemMaterial**, click the newly "
"created material to edit it, then set **Blend Mode** to **Add**."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງ sprite ດ້ວຍ additive blending, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂນດ Sprite2D ແລະ ກຳນົດ texture ໃຫ້ມັ"
"ນ. ໃນ inspector, ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນລົງໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ **CanvasItem > Material**, ຂະຫຍາຍມັນອອກແລ້ວຄລິກ"
"ທີ່ dropdown ຂ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດ **Material**. ເລືອກ **New CanvasItemMaterial**, ຄລິກໃສ່ "
"material ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Blend Mode** ເປັນ **Add**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:6
msgid "2D meshes"
msgstr "ເມຊ 2D (2D meshes)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:11
msgid ""
"In 3D, meshes are used to display the world. In 2D, they are rare as images "
"are used more often. Godot's 2D engine is a pure two-dimensional engine, so "
"it can't really display 3D meshes directly (although it can be done via "
"``Viewport`` and ``ViewportTexture``)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ 3D, ເມຊ (meshes) ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໂລກ. ໃນ 2D, ພວກມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າເພາະຮູບພາບຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຫຼ"
"າຍກວ່າ. ເຄື່ອງຈັກ 2D ຂອງ Godot ເປັນເຄື່ອງຈັກແບບສອງມິຕິແທ້ໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນເມຊ 3D "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ (ເຖິງວ່າຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ ``Viewport`` ແລະ ``ViewportTexture`` ກໍຕາມ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you are interested in displaying 3D meshes on a 2D viewport, see "
"the :ref:`doc_viewport_as_texture` tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານສົນໃຈທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມຊ 3D ໃນ viewport 2D, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນ "
":ref:`doc_viewport_as_texture`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:17
msgid ""
"2D meshes are meshes that contain two-dimensional geometry (Z can be omitted "
"or ignored) instead of 3D. You can experiment creating them yourself using "
"``SurfaceTool`` from code and displaying them in a ``MeshInstance2D`` node."
msgstr ""
"ເມຊ 2D ຄືເມຊທີ່ບັນຈຸເລຂາຄະນິດແບບສອງມິຕິ (ສາມາດລະເວັ້ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າ Z ໄດ້) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ 3D. ທ່ານ"
"ສາມາດທົດລອງສ້າງພວກມັນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``SurfaceTool`` ຈາກໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນພວກມັນໃນໂນດ "
"``MeshInstance2D``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:20
msgid ""
"Currently, the only way to generate a 2D mesh within the editor is by either "
"importing an OBJ file as a mesh, or converting it from a Sprite2D."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະສ້າງເມຊ 2D ພາຍໃນ editor ຄືການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ OBJ ເປັນເມຊ, ຫຼື ປ່ຽນມັນມາຈາ"
"ກ Sprite2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:23
msgid "Optimizing pixels drawn"
msgstr "ການປັບປຸງການແຕ້ມພິກເຊວໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:25
msgid ""
"This workflow is useful for optimizing 2D drawing in some situations. When "
"drawing large images with transparency, Godot will draw the whole quad to "
"the screen. The large transparent areas will still be drawn."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປັບປຸງການແຕ້ມ 2D ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ເມື່ອແຕ້ມຮູບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີຄວ"
"າມໂປ່ງໃສ, Godot ຈະແຕ້ມທັງໝົດຂອງສີ່ແຈ (quad) ລົງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ເຊິ່ງບໍລິເວນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກໍຍັງຄົງຖືກ"
"ແຕ້ມຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:27
msgid ""
"This can affect performance, especially on mobile devices, when drawing very "
"large images (generally screen sized), or layering multiple images on top of "
"each other with large transparent areas (for example, when using "
"``ParallaxBackground``)."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນອຸປະກອນມືຖື, ເມື່ອແຕ້ມຮູບທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄ"
"ປແມ່ນເທົ່າຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ), ຫຼື ການວາງຮູບຊ້ອນກັນຫຼາຍຊັ້ນທີ່ມີບໍລິເວນໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"``ParallaxBackground``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:30
msgid ""
"Converting to a mesh will ensure that only the opaque parts will be drawn "
"and the rest will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນເມຊຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະມີສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ທຶບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ ແລະ ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກຂ້າມ"
"ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:33
msgid "Converting Sprite2Ds to 2D meshes"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນ Sprite2Ds ໃຫ້ເປັນເມຊ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can take advantage of this optimization by converting a ``Sprite2D`` to "
"a ``MeshInstance2D``. Start with an image that contains large amounts of "
"transparency on the edges, like this tree:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການປັບປຸງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ ``Sprite2D`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"``MeshInstance2D``. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຫຼາຍຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຂອບ, ເຊັ່ນຮູບຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:40
msgid ""
"Put it in a ``Sprite2D`` and select \"Convert to MeshInstance2D\" from the "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"ເອົາມັນໃສ່ໃນ ``Sprite2D`` ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"Convert to MeshInstance2D\" ຈາກເມນູ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:44
msgid ""
"A dialog will appear, showing a preview of how the 2D mesh will be created:"
msgstr "ຈະມີໜ້າຕ່າງປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງວ່າເມຊ 2D ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແນວໃດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:48
msgid ""
"The default values are good enough for many cases, but you can change growth "
"and simplification according to your needs:"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນພຽງພໍສຳລັບຫຼາຍໆກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າການຂະຫຍາຍ (growth) ແລະ ການເຮັດໃຫ້"
"ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ (simplification) ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_meshes.rst:52
msgid ""
"Finally, push the :button:`Convert 2D Mesh` button and your Sprite2D will be "
"replaced:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ກົດປຸ່ມ :button:`Convert 2D Mesh` ແລະ Sprite2D ຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:4
msgid "2D sprite animation"
msgstr "ການເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນສະໄປຣ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:9
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, you'll learn how to create 2D animated characters with the "
"AnimatedSprite2D class and the AnimationPlayer. Typically, when you create "
"or download an animated character, it will come in one of two ways: as "
"individual images or as a single sprite sheet containing all the animation's "
"frames. Both can be animated in Godot with the AnimatedSprite2D class."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບົດຮຽນນີ້, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ່ວິທີການສ້າງຕົວລະຄອນເຄື່ອນໄຫວ 2D ດ້ວຍຄລາສ AnimatedSprite2D ແລະ "
"AnimationPlayer. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ ຫຼື ດາວໂຫຼດຕົວລະຄອນເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, ມັນຈະມາໃນສອງຮູບ"
"ແບບ: ເປັນຮູບແຍກແຕ່ລະອັນ ຫຼື ເປັນແຜ່ນສະໄປຣ (sprite sheet) ທີ່ລວມທຸກເຟຣມຂອງແອນິເມຊັນໄວ້ໃນຮູບດຽ"
"ວ. ທັງສອງຮູບແບບສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ໃນ Godot ດ້ວຍຄລາສ AnimatedSprite2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:16
msgid ""
"First, we'll use :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>` to animate "
"a collection of individual images. Then we will animate a sprite sheet using "
"this class. Finally, we will learn another way to animate a sprite sheet "
"with :ref:`AnimationPlayer <class_AnimationPlayer>` and the *Animation* "
"property of :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>`."
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ :ref:`AnimatedSprite2D <class_AnimatedSprite2D>` ເພື່ອເຮັດແອນິເມ"
"ຊັນຈາກກຸ່ມຮູບພາບແຍກ. ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຈາກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣໂດຍໃຊ້ຄລາສນີ້. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາຈ"
"ະຮຽນຮູ້ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຈາກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣດ້ວຍ :ref:`AnimationPlayer "
"<class_AnimationPlayer>` ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດ *Animation* ຂອງ :ref:`Sprite2D "
"<class_Sprite2D>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:23
msgid ""
"Art for the following examples by https://opengameart.org/users/ansimuz and "
"tgfcoder."
msgstr ""
"ພາບປະກອບສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍ https://opengameart.org/users/ansimuz ແລະ tgfcoder."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:26
msgid "Individual images with AnimatedSprite2D"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຮູບພາບແຍກດ້ວຍ AnimatedSprite2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:28
msgid ""
"In this scenario, you have a collection of images, each containing one of "
"your character's animation frames. For this example, we'll use the following "
"animation:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານມີກຸ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ແຕ່ລະຮູບຄືໜຶ່ງເຟຣມແອນິເມຊັນຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ແອ"
"ນິເມຊັນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:34
msgid ""
"You can download the images here: `2d_sprite_animation_assets.zip <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/"
"latest-4.x/2d_sprite_animation_assets.zip>`_"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດຮູບພາບໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: `2d_sprite_animation_assets.zip <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"2d_sprite_animation_assets.zip>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:37
msgid ""
"Unzip the images and place them in your project folder. Set up your scene "
"tree with the following nodes:"
msgstr ""
"ແຕກໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບແລ້ວນຳໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ. ຈັດວາງ scene tree ດ້ວຍໂນດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:42
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:182
msgid ""
"The root node could also be :ref:`Area2D <class_Area2D>` "
"or :ref:`RigidBody2D <class_RigidBody2D>`. The animation will still be made "
"in the same way. Once the animation is completed, you can assign a shape to "
"the CollisionShape2D. See :ref:`Physics Introduction "
"<doc_physics_introduction>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຮາກອາດຈະເປັນ :ref:`Area2D <class_Area2D>` ຫຼື :ref:`RigidBody2D "
"<class_RigidBody2D>` ກໍໄດ້. ການສ້າງແອນິເມຊັນກໍຍັງຄືເກົ່າ. ເມື່ອແອນິເມຊັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກ"
"ຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງ (shape) ໃຫ້ກັບ CollisionShape2D ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ບົດແນະນຳຟີຊິກ "
"<doc_physics_introduction>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:49
msgid ""
"Now select the ``AnimatedSprite2D`` and in its *SpriteFrames* property, "
"select \"New SpriteFrames\"."
msgstr ""
"ບາດນີ້ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ແລະ ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ *SpriteFrames*, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ \"New "
"SpriteFrames\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:54
msgid ""
"Click on the new SpriteFrames resource and you'll see a new panel appear at "
"the bottom of the editor window:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ SpriteFrames resource ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ ແລ້ວທ່ານຈະເຫັນແຜງຄວບຄຸມປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງ "
"editor:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:59
msgid ""
"From the FileSystem dock on the left side, drag the 8 individual images into "
"the center part of the SpriteFrames panel. On the left side, change the name "
"of the animation from \"default\" to \"run\"."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກ FileSystem dock ດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ລາກຮູບທັງ 8 ຮູບ ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສ່ວນກາງຂອງແຜງ SpriteFrames. "
"ຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນຈາກ \"default\" ເປັນ \"run\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:65
msgid ""
"Use the \"Play\" buttons on the top-right of the *Filter Animations* input "
"to preview the animation. You should now see the animation playing in the "
"viewport. However, it is a bit slow. To fix this, change the *Speed (FPS)* "
"setting in the SpriteFrames panel to 10."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"Play\" ຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງ *Filter Animations* ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງແອນິເມຊັນ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານ"
"ຄວນຈະເຫັນແອນິເມຊັນຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນ viewport. ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະຊ້າໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າ *Speed "
"(FPS)* ໃນແຜງ SpriteFrames ເປັນ 10."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:70
msgid ""
"You can add additional animations by clicking the \"Add Animation\" button "
"and adding additional images."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແອນິເມຊັນອື່ນໆໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Add Animation\" ແລະ ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:74
msgid "Controlling the animation"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມແອນິເມຊັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:76
msgid ""
"Once the animation is complete, you can control the animation via code using "
"the ``play()`` and ``stop()`` methods. Here is a brief example to play the "
"animation while the right arrow key is held, and stop it when the key is "
"released."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແອນິເມຊັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມມັນຜ່ານໂຄ້ດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``play()`` ແລະ ``stop()"
"``. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງສັ້ນໆໃນການຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມລູກສອນຂວາຄ້າງໄວ້, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຢຸດເມື່ອປ່ອຍປຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:122
msgid "Sprite sheet with AnimatedSprite2D"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ແຜ່ນສະໄປຣດ້ວຍ AnimatedSprite2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:124
msgid ""
"You can also easily animate from a sprite sheet with the class "
"``AnimatedSprite2D``. We will use this public domain sprite sheet:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຈາກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍດ້ວຍຄລາສ ``AnimatedSprite2D``. ພວກເຮົ"
"າຈະໃຊ້ແຜ່ນສະໄປຣແບບສາທາລະນະ (public domain) ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:129
msgid ""
"Right-click the image and choose \"Save Image As\" to download it, and then "
"copy the image into your project folder."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບແລ້ວເລືອກ \"Save Image As\" ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດ, ຈາກນັ້ນກັອບປີ້ຮູບໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກຂອ"
"ງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:132
msgid ""
"Set up your scene tree the same way you did previously when using individual "
"images. Select the ``AnimatedSprite2D`` and in its *SpriteFrames* property, "
"select \"New SpriteFrames\"."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດວາງ scene tree ແບບດຽວກັນກັບຕອນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບພາບແຍກ. ເລືອກ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ແລະ ໃນຄຸນ"
"ສົມບັດ *SpriteFrames*, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ \"New SpriteFrames\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:135
msgid ""
"Click on the new SpriteFrames resource. This time, when the bottom panel "
"appears, select \"Add frames from a Sprite Sheet\"."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ SpriteFrames resource ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່. ເທື່ອນີ້, ເມື່ອແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ \"Add "
"frames from a Sprite Sheet\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:140
msgid "You will be prompted to open a file. Select your sprite sheet."
msgstr "ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຖາມໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌. ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:142
msgid ""
"A new window will open, showing your sprite sheet. The first thing you will "
"need to do is to change the number of vertical and horizontal images in your "
"sprite sheet. In this sprite sheet, we have four images horizontally and two "
"images vertically."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງໃໝ່ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນມາສະແດງແຜ່ນສະໄປຣຂອງທ່ານ. ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຄືປ່ຽນຈຳນວນຮູບ ໃນແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນ"
"ວຕັ້ງ. ໃນແຜ່ນສະໄປຣນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີ 4 ຮູບໃນແນວນອນ ແລະ 2 ຮູບໃນແນວຕັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:148
msgid ""
"Next, select the frames from the sprite sheet that you want to include in "
"your animation. We will select the top four, then click \"Add 4 frames\" to "
"create the animation."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຟຣມຈາກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລວມໄວ້ໃນແອນິເມຊັນ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເລືອກ 4 ຮູບດ້ານເທິ"
"ງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ \"Add 4 frames\" ເພື່ອສ້າງແອນິເມຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:153
msgid ""
"You will now see your animation under the list of animations in the bottom "
"panel. Double click on default to change the name of the animation to jump."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນແອນິເມຊັນຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ default ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ"
"ຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນເປັນ jump."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:158
msgid ""
"Finally, check the play button on the SpriteFrames editor to see your frog "
"jump!"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ play ໃນ SpriteFrames editor ເພື່ອເບິ່ງກົບຂອງທ່ານເຕັ້ນ!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:164
msgid "Sprite sheet with AnimationPlayer"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ແຜ່ນສະໄປຣດ້ວຍ AnimationPlayer"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:166
msgid ""
"Another way that you can animate when using a sprite sheet is to use a "
"standard :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>` node to display the texture, and "
"then animating the change from texture to texture with :ref:`AnimationPlayer "
"<class_AnimationPlayer>`."
msgstr ""
"ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນເມື່ອໃຊ້ແຜ່ນສະໄປຣ ຄືການໃຊ້ໂນດ :ref:`Sprite2D "
"<class_Sprite2D>` ມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອສະແດງ texture, ແລ້ວເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນການປ່ຽນ texture ແຕ່ລະອັ"
"ນດ້ວຍ :ref:`AnimationPlayer <class_AnimationPlayer>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:170
msgid "Consider this sprite sheet, which contains 6 frames of animation:"
msgstr "ລອງເບິ່ງແຜ່ນສະໄປຣນີ້, ເຊິ່ງມີແອນິເມຊັນ 6 ເຟຣມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:174
msgid ""
"Right-click the image and choose \"Save Image As\" to download, then copy "
"the image into your project folder."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບແລ້ວເລືອກ \"Save Image As\" ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດ, ຈາກນັ້ນກັອບປີ້ຮູບໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກຂອ"
"ງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:177
msgid ""
"Our goal is to display these images one after another in a loop. Start by "
"setting up your scene tree:"
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງພວກເຮົາຄືການສະແດງຮູບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລຽງຕໍ່ກັນແບບວົນລູບ (loop). ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຈັດ scene tree "
"ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:189
msgid ""
"Drag the spritesheet into the Sprite's *Texture* property, and you'll see "
"the whole sheet displayed on the screen. To slice it up into individual "
"frames, expand the *Animation* section in the Inspector and set the "
"*Hframes* to ``6``. *Hframes* and *Vframes* are the number of horizontal and "
"vertical frames in your sprite sheet."
msgstr ""
"ລາກແຜ່ນສະໄປຣໃສ່ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ *Texture* ຂອງ Sprite, ແລ້ວທ່ານຈະເຫັນແຜ່ນສະໄປຣທັງໝົດສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງໜ້"
"າຈໍ. ເພື່ອແບ່ງມັນອອກເປັນເຟຣມແຍກ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນ *Animation* ໃນ Inspector ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"*Hframes* ເປັນ ``6``. *Hframes* ແລະ *Vframes* ແມ່ນຈຳນວນເຟຣມໃນແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ ໃ"
"ນແຜ່ນສະໄປຣຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:197
msgid ""
"Now try changing the value of the *Frame* property. You'll see that it "
"ranges from ``0`` to ``5`` and the image displayed by the Sprite2D changes "
"accordingly. This is the property we'll be animating."
msgstr ""
"ບາດນີ້ລອງປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ *Frame*. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມັນມີຄ່າແຕ່ ``0`` ຫາ ``5`` ແລະ ຮູບທີ່ສະແດງໂ"
"ດຍ Sprite2D ກໍຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມນັ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະນຳມາເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:201
msgid ""
"Select the ``AnimationPlayer`` and click the \"Animation\" button followed "
"by \"New\". Name the new animation \"walk\". Set the animation length to "
"``0.6`` and click the \"Loop\" button so that our animation will repeat."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ ``AnimationPlayer`` ແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Animation\" ຕາມດ້ວຍ \"New\". ຕັ້ງຊື່ແອນິເມຊັນໃໝ່ວ່"
"າ \"walk\". ຕັ້ງຄວາມຍາວແອນິເມຊັນເປັນ ``0.6`` ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"Loop\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:207
msgid ""
"Now select the ``Sprite2D`` node and click the key icon to add a new track."
msgstr ""
"ບາດນີ້ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດ ``Sprite2D`` ແລ້ວຄລິກໄອຄອນຮູບກະແຈເພື່ອເພີ່ມແທຣັກ (track) ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:211
msgid ""
"Continue adding frames at each point in the timeline (``0.1`` seconds by "
"default), until you have all the frames from 0 to 5. You'll see the frames "
"actually appearing in the animation track:"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເຟຣມໃນແຕ່ລະຈຸດຂອງໄທມລາຍ (timeline) ຕໍ່ໄປ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນທຸກໆ ``0.1`` ວິນາທີ), ຈົນກວ່າຈະຄົບ"
"ທຸກເຟຣມແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 5. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນເຟຣມປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:217
msgid "Press \"Play\" on the animation to see how it looks."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ \"Play\" ໃນແອນິເມຊັນເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນທີ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:222
msgid "Controlling an AnimationPlayer animation"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມແອນິເມຊັນຂອງ AnimationPlayer"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:224
msgid ""
"Like with AnimatedSprite2D, you can control the animation via code using the "
"``play()`` and ``stop()`` methods. Again, here is an example to play the "
"animation while the right arrow key is held, and stop it when the key is "
"released."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ AnimatedSprite2D, ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມແອນິເມຊັນຜ່ານໂຄ້ດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``play()"
"`` ແລະ ``stop()``. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງການຫຼິ້ນແອນິເມຊັນເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມລູກສອນຂວາຄ້າງໄວ້, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຢຸດເມື່ອປ່ອຍປຸ່"
"ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:268
msgid ""
"If updating both an animation and a separate property at once (for example, "
"a platformer may update the sprite's ``h_flip``/``v_flip`` properties when a "
"character turns while starting a 'turning' animation), it's important to "
"keep in mind that ``play()`` isn't applied instantly. Instead, it's applied "
"the next time the :ref:`AnimationPlayer <class_AnimationPlayer>` is "
"processed. This may end up being on the next frame, causing a 'glitch' "
"frame, where the property change was applied, but the animation was not. If "
"this turns out to be a problem, after calling ``play()``, you can call "
"``advance(0)`` to update the animation immediately."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການອັບເດດທັງແອນິເມຊັນ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນພ້ອມກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເກມແນວ platformer ອາດຈະອັບເດດຄຸ"
"ນສົມບັດ ``h_flip``/``v_flip`` ຂອງ sprite ເມື່ອຕົວລະຄອນກັບຫຼັງ ພ້ອມກັບເລີ່ມແອນິເມຊັນ 'ກັບຕົວ')"
", ສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຕ້ອງຈື່ຄື ``play()`` ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທັນທີ. ແຕ່ມັນຈະມີຜົນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ :ref:`AnimationPlayer "
"<class_AnimationPlayer>` ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໄປເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເຟຣມທີ່ເ"
"ບິ່ງຄື 'ຜິດພາດ' (glitch), ບ່ອນທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກປ່ຽນແລ້ວ ແຕ່ແອນິເມຊັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນປ່ຽນ. ຫາກພົບບັນຫານີ້, ຫຼັງຈາກ"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``play()``, ທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``advance(0)`` ເພື່ອອັບເດດແອນິເມຊັນໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_sprite_animation.rst:281
msgid ""
"These examples illustrate the two classes you can use in Godot for 2D "
"animation. ``AnimationPlayer`` is a bit more complex than "
"``AnimatedSprite2D``, but it provides additional functionality, since you "
"can also animate other properties like position or scale. The class "
"``AnimationPlayer`` can also be used with an ``AnimatedSprite2D``. "
"Experiment to see what works best for your needs."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນສອງຄລາສທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ Godot ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ 2D. "
"``AnimationPlayer`` ຈະມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ມັນມີຟັງຊັນເພີ່ມເ"
"ຕີມ ເພາະທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆໄດ້ນຳ ເຊັ່ນ ຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດ. ຄລາສ "
"``AnimationPlayer`` ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ ``AnimatedSprite2D`` ໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ລອງທົດລອງເບິ່ງວ່າແ"
"ບບໃດເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:6
msgid "2D particle systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບພາກທິເຄິລ 2D (2D particle systems)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:9
msgid "Intro"
msgstr "ບົດແນະນຳ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:11
msgid ""
"Particle systems are used to simulate complex physical effects, such as "
"sparks, fire, magic particles, smoke, mist, etc."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບພາກທິເຄິລ (Particle systems) ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງເອັບເຟັກທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເຊັ່ນ ປະກາຍໄຟ, ກອ"
"ງໄຟ, ພາກທິເຄິລມົນວິເສດ, ຄວັນ, ໝອກ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:14
msgid ""
"The idea is that a \"particle\" is emitted at a fixed interval and with a "
"fixed lifetime. During its lifetime, every particle will have the same base "
"behavior. What makes each particle different from the rest and provides a "
"more organic look is the \"randomness\" associated with each parameter. In "
"essence, creating a particle system means setting base physics parameters "
"and then adding randomness to them."
msgstr ""
"ແນວຄິດຄື \"ພາກທິເຄິລ\" ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ມີອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ແນ່ນອນ. ຕະຫຼອດໄລ"
"ຍະເວລາຂອງມັນ, ທຸກໆພາກທິເຄິລຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳພື້ນຖານຄືກັນ. ສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພາກທິເຄິລແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງເ"
"ປັນທຳມະຊາດ ຄື \"ຄວາມສຸ່ມ\" (randomness) ທີ່ໃສ່ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະພາລາມິເຕີ. ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ, ການສ້າງລະ"
"ບົບພາກທິເຄິລຄືການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີຟີຊິກພື້ນຖານ ແລ້ວຕື່ມຄວາມສຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:22
msgid "Particle nodes"
msgstr "ໂນດພາກທິເຄິລ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:24
msgid ""
"Godot provides two different nodes for 2D "
"particles, :ref:`class_GPUParticles2D` and :ref:`class_CPUParticles2D`. "
"GPUParticles2D is more advanced and uses the GPU to process particle "
"effects. CPUParticles2D is a CPU-driven option with near-feature parity with "
"GPUParticles2D, but lower performance when using large amounts of particles. "
"On the other hand, CPUParticles2D may perform better on low-end systems or "
"in GPU-bottlenecked situations."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີສອງໂນດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບພາກທິເຄິລ 2D ຄື :ref:`class_GPUParticles2D` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_CPUParticles2D`. GPUParticles2D ຈະມີຄວາມກ້າວໜ້າກວ່າ ແລະ ໃຊ້ GPU ໃນການປ"
"ະມວນຜົນເອັບເຟັກພາກທິເຄິລ. CPUParticles2D ເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ເຊິ່ງມີຟີເຈີເກືອບຄືກັບ "
"GPUParticles2D, ແຕ່ຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຕ່ຳກວ່າເມື່ອໃຊ້ພາກທິເຄິລຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, "
"CPUParticles2D ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າໃນລະບົບທີ່ສະເປັກຕ່ຳ ຫຼື ໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ GPU ເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນ"
"ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:31
msgid ""
"While GPUParticles2D is configured via "
"a :ref:`class_ParticleProcessMaterial` (and optionally with a custom "
"shader), the matching options are provided via node properties in "
"CPUParticles2D (with the exception of the trail settings)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ GPUParticles2D ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ :ref:`class_ParticleProcessMaterial` (ແລະ ອາ"
"ດຈະໃຊ້ custom shader ເສີມ), ແຕ່ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຄ້າຍກັນໃນ CPUParticles2D ຈະມີໃຫ້ປັບຜ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ"
"ໂນດໂດຍກົງ (ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ trail)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:35
msgid ""
"Going forward there are no plans to add new features to CPUParticles2D, "
"though pull requests to add features already in GPUParticles2D will be "
"accepted. For that reason we recommend using GPUParticles2D unless you have "
"an explicit reason not to."
msgstr ""
"ໃນອະນາຄົດ ຈະບໍ່ມີການເພີ່ມຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບ CPUParticles2D, ແຕ່ຈະຍັງຮັບພິຈາລະນາ pull requests ເພື່"
"ອເພີ່ມຟີເຈີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນ GPUParticles2D. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ GPUParticles2D ນ"
"ອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ຊັດເຈນທີ່ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can convert a CPUParticles2D node into a GPUParticles2D node by clicking "
"on the node in the scene tree, selecting the 2D workspace, and selecting "
"**CPUParticles2D > Convert to GPUParticles2D** in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໂນດ CPUParticles2D ໃຫ້ເປັນ GPUParticles2D ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໂນດໃນ scene "
"tree, ເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ 2D, ແລ້ວເລືອກ **CPUParticles2D > Convert to "
"GPUParticles2D** ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:46
msgid ""
"It is also possible to convert a GPUParticles2D node to a CPUParticles2D "
"node, however there may be issues if you use GPU-only features."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນໂນດ GPUParticles2D ເປັນ CPUParticles2D ໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາຫາກ"
"ທ່ານໃຊ້ຟີເຈີທີ່ມີສະເພາະໃນ GPU ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:49
msgid ""
"The rest of this tutorial is going to use the GPUParticles2D node. First, "
"add a GPUParticles2D node to your scene. After creating that node you will "
"notice that only a white dot was created, and that there is a warning icon "
"next to your GPUParticles2D node in the scene dock. This is because the node "
"needs a ParticleProcessMaterial to function."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງບົດຮຽນນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໂນດ GPUParticles2D. ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂນດ GPUParticles2D ເຂົ້າໃນສາ"
"ກຂອງທ່ານ. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງໂນດແລ້ວ ທ່ານຈະສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າມີພຽງຈຸດສີຂາວປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ມີໄອຄອນຄຳເຕືອນຂ້າງໂ"
"ນດ GPUParticles2D ໃນ scene dock. ນັ້ນກໍເພາະວ່າໂນດນີ້ຕ້ອງການ ParticleProcessMaterial "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:57
msgid ""
"To add a process material to your particles node, go to ``Process Material`` "
"in your inspector panel. Click on the box next to ``Material``, and from the "
"dropdown menu select ``New ParticleProcessMaterial``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ process material ໃສ່ node particles ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ``Process Material`` "
"ໃນ panel inspector ຂອງທ່ານ. ຄລິກໃສ່ກ່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງ ``Material``, ແລະ ຈາກເມນູ dropdown ໃຫ້"
"ເລືອກ ``New ParticleProcessMaterial``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:63
msgid "Your GPUParticles2D node should now be emitting white points downward."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ node GPUParticles2D ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະປ່ອຍຈຸດສີຂາວລົງລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:69
msgid "Texture"
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (Texture)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:71
msgid ""
"A particle system can use a single texture or an animation *flipbook*. A "
"flipbook is a texture that contains several frames of animation that can be "
"played back, or chosen at random during emission. This is equivalent to a "
"spritesheet for particles."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບ particle ສາມາດໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວແບບດ່ຽວ ຫຼື animation *flipbook*. flipbook ແມ່ນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຫຼາຍ"
"ເຟຣມຂອງ animation ທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນຄືນໄດ້, ຫຼື ເລືອກແບບສຸ່ມໃນລະຫວ່າງການປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"spritesheet ສໍາລັບ particles."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:76
msgid "The texture is set via the **Texture** property:"
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວຖືກກຳນົດຜ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດ **Texture**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:83
msgid "Using an animation flipbook"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ animation flipbook"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:85
msgid ""
"Particle flipbooks are suited to reproduce complex effects such as smoke, "
"fire, explosions. They can also be used to introduce random texture "
"variation, by making every particle use a different texture. You can find "
"existing particle flipbook images online, or pre-render them using external "
"tools such as `Blender <https://www.blender.org/>`__ or `EmberGen <https://"
"jangafx.com/software/embergen/>`__."
msgstr ""
"Particle flipbooks ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເເຊ່ນ: ຄວັນ, ໄຟ, ການລະເບີດ. ພ"
"ວກມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍຂອງພື້ນຜິວແບບສຸ່ມ, ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ທຸກໆ particle ໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ແຕກ"
"ຕ່າງກັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາຮູບພາບ particle flipbook ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວທາງອອນໄລນ໌, ຫຼື pre-render ພວກ"
"ມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່ນ: `Blender <https://www.blender.org/>`__ ຫຼື `EmberGen "
"<https://jangafx.com/software/embergen/>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:91
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:95
msgid "Example of a particle system that uses a flipbook texture"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງລະບົບ particle ທີ່ໃຊ້ flipbook texture"

