#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:615
msgid ""
"While using the :ref:`Label <class_Label>` Node is the most common way to "
"add text to your application, the low-level `_draw` function includes "
"functionality to add text to your custom Node drawing. We will use it to add "
"the name \"GODOT\" under the robot head."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການໃຊ້ Node :ref:`Label <class_Label>` ຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດໃນການເພີ່ມ ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ແ"
"ອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ຟັງຊັນ `_draw` ລະດັບຕ່ຳກໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນສຳລັບເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໃສ່ການແຕ້ມ Node ແບບກຳນົດ"
"ເອງຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊື່ \"GODOT\" ໄວ້ລຸ່ມຫົວຫຸ່ນຍົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:620
msgid ""
"We will use the :ref:`draw_string <class_CanvasItem_method_draw_string>` "
"method to do it, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ເມທອດ :ref:`draw_string <class_CanvasItem_method_draw_string>` ເພື່ອເ"
"ຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ຄືດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:669
msgid ""
"Here we first load into the defaultFont variable the configured default "
"theme font (a custom one can be set instead) and then we pass the following "
"parameters: font, position, text, horizontal alignment, width, and font size."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້ທຳອິດພວກເຮົາຈະໂຫຼດ font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ theme ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ເຂົ້າໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ defaultFont (ຫຼື ສາມາ"
"ດກຳນົດ font ແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້) ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະສົ່ງພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: font, ຕຳແໜ່ງ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ກາ"
"ນຈັດວາງລວງນອນ, ຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດ font."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/custom_drawing_in_2d.rst:673
