"The video below displays how these values affect scrolling while in-game:"
msgstr ""
"ວິດີໂອຂ້າງລຸ່ມສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຜົນແນວໃດຕໍ່ການເລື່ອນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼິ້ນເກມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:60
msgid "Infinite repeat"
msgstr "ການວົນຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (Infinite repeat)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:62
msgid ""
":ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>` provides a bonus effect that gives "
"textures the illusion of repeating "
"infinitely. :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` tells "
"the node to snap its position forward or back when the camera scrolls by the "
"set value. This effect is achieved by adding a single repeat to all the "
"child canvas items offset by the value. While the camera scrolls between the "
"image and its repeat, it invisibly snaps back giving the appearance of a "
"looping image."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>` ມີເອັບເຟັກເສີມທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ textures ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ ມີການວົນຊ້ຳ"
"ແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ. :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` ຈະບອກໃຫ້ "
"node ກະໂດດຕຳແໜ່ງໄປທາງໜ້າ ຫຼື ຖອຍຫຼັງ ເມື່ອກ້ອງເລື່ອນໄປຕາມຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່"
"ມການວົນຊ້ຳໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບທຸກ canvas items ທີ່ເປັນ node ລູກ ເຊິ່ງຖືກ offset ດ້ວຍຄ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກ້ອງ"
"ເລື່ອນໄປລະຫວ່າງຮູບ ແລະ ຮູບທີ່ວົນຊ້ຳ, ມັນຈະກະໂດດກັບຄືນໂດຍທີ່ເຮົາເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຮູບພາບວົນ"
"ຊ້ຳໄປເລື້ອຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:70
msgid ""
"Being a delicate effect, it's easy for unfamiliar users to make mistakes "
"with their setup. Let's go over the \"how\" and \"why\" of a few common "
"problems users encounter."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນເອັບເຟັກທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງງ່າຍສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍທີ່ຈະເຮັດ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ມາເບິ່"
"ງ \"ວິທີ\" ແລະ \"ເຫດຜົນ\" ຂອງບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງ ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມັກພົບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:74
msgid "Poor sizing"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຂະໜາດທີ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:76
msgid ""
"The infinite repeat effect is easiest to work with when you have an image "
"designed to repeat seamlessly and is the same size or larger than your "
"viewport **before** setting "
"the :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`. If you aren't "
"able to obtain assets that are designed for this task, there are some other "
"things you can do to better prepare your image in regards to size."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກການວົນຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອທ່ານມີຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກ ອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ວົນຊ້ຳໄດ້ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອ"
"ງ (seamless) ແລະ ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ viewport ຂອງທ່ານ **ກ່ອນ** ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດ "
":ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຫາ "
"asset ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບວຽກນີ້ໄດ້, ຍັງມີບາງຢ່າງທີ່ ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ເພື່ອຈັດກຽມຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ"
"ໃນເລື່ອງຂອງຂະໜາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:81
msgid "Here is an example of a texture that is too small for its viewport:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ texture ທີ່ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປສຳລັບ viewport ຂອງມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:85
msgid ""
"We can see that the viewport size is 500x300 but the texture is 288x208. If "
"we set the :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` to the "
"size of our image, the infinite repeat effect doesn't scroll properly "
"because the original texture doesn't cover the viewport. If we set "
"the :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` to the size of "
"the viewport, we have a large gap. What can we do?"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເຫັນວ່າຂະໜາດ viewport ແມ່ນ 500x300 ແຕ່ texture ແມ່ນ 288x208. ຖ້າພວກເຮົາກຳນົດ "
":ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` ຕາມ ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບພາບ, "
"ເອັບເຟັກການວົນຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດຈະເລື່ອນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພາະວ່າ texture ເດີມບໍ່ປົກຄຸມທົ່ວ viewport. ຖ້າພວກເຮົ"
"າກຳນົດ :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` ຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງ "
"viewport, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນຊ່ອງວ່າງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດແນວໃດໄດ້ແດ່?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:92
msgid "Make the viewport smaller"
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ນ້ອຍລົງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:94
msgid ""
"The simplest answer is to make the viewport the same size or smaller than "
"your textures. In **Project Settings > Display > Window**, change "
"the :ref:`Viewport Width<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"viewport_width>` and :ref:`Viewport "
"Height<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/viewport_height>` "
"settings to match your background."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳຕອບທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດຄືເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ textures ຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນ "
"**Project Settings > Display > Window**, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`Viewport "
"Width<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/viewport_width>` ແລ"
"ະ :ref:`Viewport Height<class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/size/"
"viewport_height>` ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:103
msgid "Scale the Parallax2D"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດ (Scale) Parallax2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:105
msgid ""
"If you're not aiming for a pixel-perfect style, or don't mind a little "
"blurriness, you may opt to scale the textures larger to fit your screen. Set "
"the :ref:`scale<class_node2d_property_scale>` of "
"the :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>`, and all child textures scale with "
"it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເນັ້ນສະໄຕລ໌ pixel-perfect, ຫຼື ບໍ່ມາຍກັບຄວາມມົວເລັກນ້ອຍ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເລືອກປັບຂະໜາດ "
"textures ໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຈໍ. ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ :ref:`scale<class_node2d_property_scale>"
"` ຂອງ :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>`, ແລະ textures ທີ່ເປັນ node ລູກທັງໝົດ ກໍ່ຈະຖື"
"ກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມໄປນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:110
msgid "Scale the child nodes"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດ node ລູກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:112
msgid ""
"Similar to scaling the :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>`, you can scale "
"your :ref:`Sprite2D<class_sprite2d>` nodes to be large enough to cover the "
"screen. Keep in mind that some settings "
"like :ref:`Parallax2D.repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` "
"and :ref:`Sprite2D.region_rect<class_sprite2d_property_region_rect>` do not "
"take scaling into account, so it's necessary to adjust these values based on "
"the scale."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການປັບຂະໜາດ :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>`, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດ node "
":ref:`Sprite2D<class_sprite2d>` ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະປົກຄຸມໜ້າຈໍໄດ້. ຢ່າລືມວ່າບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊັ່"
"ນ :ref:`Parallax2D.repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` ແລະ "
":ref:`Sprite2D.region_rect<class_sprite2d_property_region_rect>` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນວນເລື່ອງ"
"ການປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ເຂົ້ານຳ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບຄ່າ ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ scale."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:121
msgid "Repeat the textures"
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ textures ວົນຊ້ຳ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:123
msgid ""
"You can also start off on the right foot by preparing child nodes earlier in "
"the process. If you have a :ref:`Sprite2D<class_sprite2d>` you'd like to "
"repeat, but is too small, you can do the following to repeat it:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການຈັດກຽມ node ລູກແຕ່ຫົວທີ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີ "
":ref:`Sprite2D<class_sprite2d>` ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ວົນຊ້ຳ, ແຕ່ມັນນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້"
"ດັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນວົນຊ້ຳ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:126
msgid ""
"set :ref:`texture_repeat<class_canvasitem_property_texture_repeat>` "
"to :ref:`CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED<class_canvasitem_constant_TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED>`"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ :ref:`texture_repeat<class_canvasitem_property_texture_repeat>` ເປັນ "
":ref:`CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED<class_canvasitem_constant_TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED>"
"`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:127
msgid ""
"set :ref:`region_enabled<class_sprite2d_property_region_enabled>` to ``true``"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ :ref:`region_enabled<class_sprite2d_property_region_enabled>` ເປັນ "
"``true``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:128
msgid ""
"set the :ref:`region_rect<class_sprite2d_property_region_rect>` to a "
"multiple of the size of your texture large enough to cover the viewport."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ :ref:`region_rect<class_sprite2d_property_region_rect>` ໃຫ້ເປັນຈຳນວນເທົ່າ ຂອ"
"ງຂະໜາດ texture ຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະປົກຄຸມ viewport ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:130
msgid ""
"Below, you can see that repeating the image twice makes it large enough to "
"cover the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ວ່າການເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບວົນຊ້ຳສອງຄັ້ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະປົກຄຸມໜ້າຈໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:137
msgid "Poor positioning"
msgstr "ການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:139
msgid ""
"It's common to see users mistakenly set all of their textures to be centered "
"at ``(0,0)``:"
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ເຫັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ textures ທັງໝົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ກາງທີ່ຈຸດ ``(0,0)`` ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:143
msgid ""
"This creates problems with the infinite repeat effect and should be avoided. "
"The \"infinite repeat canvas\" starts at ``(0,0)`` and expands down and to "
"the right to the size of "
"the :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` value."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງບັນຫາກັບເອັບເຟັກການວົນຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ ຄວນຫຼີກລ່ຽງ. \"infinite repeat canvas\" "
"ຈະເລີ່ມທີ່ຈຸດ ``(0,0)`` ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍລົງລຸ່ມ ແລະ ໄປທາງຂວາຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງຄ່າ "
":ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:149
msgid ""
"If the textures are centered on the ``(0,0)`` crossing, the infinite repeat "
"canvas is only partly covered, so it only partly repeats."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ textures ຢູ່ກາງທີ່ຈຸດຕັດ ``(0,0)``, infinite repeat canvas ຈະຖືກປົກຄຸມ ພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນເ"
"ທົ່ານັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງວົນຊ້ຳພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:153
msgid "Would increasing ``repeat_times`` fix this?"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມ ``repeat_times`` ຈະຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ບໍ?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:155
msgid ""
"Increasing :ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` "
"technically *would* work in some scenarios, but is a brute force solution "
"and not the problem it is designed to solve (we'll go over this in a bit). A "
"better fix is to understand how the repeat effect works and set up the "
"parallax textures appropriately to begin with."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມ :ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` ໃນທາງເຕັກນິກ"
"ແລ້ວ *ອາດຈະ* ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ວ່າມັນເປັນການແກ້ໄຂ ແບບບັງຄັບ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່"
"ອແກ້ໄຂ (ພວກເຮົາຈະເວົ້າເຖິງເລື່ອງນີ້ໃນອີກບຶດໜຶ່ງ). ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ດີກວ່າຄືການເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າເອັບເຟັກການວົນຊ້ຳເຮັດວ"
"ຽກແນວໃດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ parallax textures ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:159
msgid ""
"First, check to see if any textures are spilling over onto the negative "
"parts of the canvas. Make sure the textures used in the parallax nodes fit "
"inside the \"infinite repeat canvas\" starting at ``(0,0)``. That way, "
"if :ref:`Parallax2D.repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` is "
"set correctly, it should look something like this, with one single loop of "
"the image the same size or larger than the viewport:"
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີ textures ໃດທີ່ລົ້ນອອກໄປໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນຄ່າລົບຂອງ canvas ບໍ. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່"
"າ textures ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ node parallax ນັ້ນພໍດີກັບພາຍໃນ \"infinite repeat canvas\" ທີ່ເລີ່ມທີ່ຈຸ"
"ດ ``(0,0)``. ດ້ວຍວິທີນັ້ນ, ຖ້າ "
":ref:`Parallax2D.repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>` ຖືກກຳນົດ ຢ່"
"າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ມັນຄວນຈະເບິ່ງຄືບາງຢ່າງດັ່ງນີ້, ໂດຍມີຮູບພາບທີ່ວົນຊ້ຳຮອບດຽວ ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"viewport:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:166
msgid ""
"If you think of how the image scrolls across the screen, it starts by "
"displaying what's inside the red rectangle (determined "
"by :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`), and when it "
"reaches what's inside the yellow rectangle it zips the image forward to give "
"the illusion of scrolling forever."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຄິດເຖິງວິທີທີ່ຮູບພາບເລື່ອນຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍ, ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການສະແດງສິ່ງທີ່ ຢູ່ໃນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີແດງ (ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
":ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`), ແລະ ເມື່ອມັນໄປຮອດສິ່ງທີ່"
"ຢູ່ໃນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີເຫຼືອງ ມັນຈະກະໂດດຮູບພາບໄປທາງໜ້າ ເພື່ອສ້າງພາບລວງຕາຂອງການເລື່ອນໄປເລື້ອຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:172
msgid ""
"If you have the image positioned away from the \"infinite repeat canvas\", "
"when the camera reaches the yellow rectangle, half of the image is cut off "
"before it jumps forward like in the image below:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານວາງຕຳແໜ່ງຮູບພາບໄວ້ຫ່າງຈາກ \"infinite repeat canvas\", ເມື່ອກ້ອງໄປຮອດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີເຫຼືອງ, "
"ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບພາບຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະກະໂດດໄປທາງໜ້າ ຄືດັ່ງໃນຮູບຂ້າງລຸ່ມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:178
msgid "Scroll offset"
msgstr "Scroll offset"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:180
msgid ""
"If your parallax textures are already working correctly, but you prefer it "
"to start at a different point, :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>` comes "
"with a :ref:`scroll_offset<class_parallax2d_property_scroll_offset>` "
"property used to offset where the infinite repeat canvas starts. As an "
"example, if your image is 288x208, setting "
"the :ref:`scroll_offset<class_parallax2d_property_scroll_offset>` to "
"``(-144,0)`` or ``(144,0)`` allows it to begin halfway across the image."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ parallax textures ຂອງທ່ານເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ໃຫ້ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຈຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າ"
"ງກັນ, :ref:`Parallax2D<class_parallax2d>` ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`scroll_offset<class_parallax2d_property_scroll_offset>` ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອ offset ຈຸ"
"ດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ infinite repeat canvas. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານມີຂະໜາດ 288x208, ການກຳນົ"
"ດ :ref:`scroll_offset<class_parallax2d_property_scroll_offset>` ເປັນ ``(-"
"144,0)`` ຫຼື ``(144,0)`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບພາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:187
msgid "Repeat times"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການວົນຊ້ຳ (Repeat times)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:189
msgid ""
"Ideally, following this guide, your parallax textures are large enough to "
"cover the screen even when zoomed out. Until now, we have had a perfectly "
"fitting 288x208 texture inside of a 288x208 viewport. However, problems "
"occur when we zoom out by setting "
"the :ref:`Camera2D.zoom<class_camera2d_property_zoom>` to ``(0.5, 0.5)``:"
msgstr ""
"ຕາມທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ, ຖ້າປະຕິບັດຕາມຄູ່ມືນີ້, parallax textures ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະ ໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະປົກຄຸມໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ ເ"
"ຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຊູມອອກກໍ່ຕາມ. ຈົນຮອດຕອນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີ texture ຂະໜາດ 288x208 ທີ່ພໍດີກັບ viewport ຂ"
"ະໜາດ 288x208. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ບັນຫາຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອພວກເຮົາຊູມອອກໂດຍການກຳນົດ "
":ref:`Camera2D.zoom<class_camera2d_property_zoom>` ເປັນ ``(0.5, 0.5)``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:195
msgid ""
"Even though everything is correctly set for the viewport at the default zoom "
"level, zooming out makes it smaller than the viewport, breaking the infinite "
"repeat effect. This is "
"where :ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` can help "
"out. Setting a value of ``3`` (one extra repeat behind and in front), it is "
"now large enough to accommodate the infinite repeat effect."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທຸກຢ່າງຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບວິວພອດໃນລະດັບການຊູມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ການຊູມອອກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນ"
"ນ້ອຍກວ່າວິວພອດ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົນກະທົບການເຮັດຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດນັ້ນຂາດໄປ. ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ "
":ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງ"
"ຄ່າຄ່າເປັນ ``3`` (ເພີ່ມການເຮັດຊ້ຳພິເສດທາງຫຼັງ ແລະ ທາງໜ້າ), ຕອນນີ້ມັນໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບຜົນກະທົບການເຮັ"
"ດຊ້ຳແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:202
msgid ""
"If these textures were meant to be repeated vertically, we would have "
"specified a ``y`` value for "
"the :ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`. "
"The :ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` would "
"automatically add a repeat above and below as well. This is only a "
"horizontal parallax, so it leaves an empty block above and below the image. "
"How do we solve this? We need to get creative! In this example, we stretch "
"the sky higher, and grass sprite lower. The textures now support the normal "
"zoom level and zooming out to half size."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເທັກເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຮັດຊ້ຳໃນແນວຕັ້ງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄ່າ ``y`` ສຳລັບ "
":ref:`repeat_size<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_size>`. ໂດຍທີ່ "
":ref:`repeat_times<class_parallax2d_property_repeat_times>` ຈະເພີ່ມການເຮັດຊ້ຳທາງເ"
"ທິງ ແລະ ທາງລຸ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາຣາແລັກແນວນອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມີບ່ອນວ່າງຢູ່ທາງເທິ"
"ງ ແລະ ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງພາບ. ພວກເຮົາຈະແກ້ໄຂແນວໃດ? ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄວາມຄິດສ້າງສັນ! ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົ"
"າຢືດທ້ອງຟ້າໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ຢືດສະໄປຣ໌ຫຍ້າໃຫ້ຕ່ຳລົງ. ຕອນນີ້ເທັກເຈີຈຶ່ງຮອງຮັບທັງລະດັບການຊູມປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ກາ"
"ນຊູມອອກເຫຼືອເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:212
msgid "Split screen"
msgstr "ແບ່ງໜ້າຈໍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:214
msgid ""
"Most tutorials for making a split screen game in Godot begin by writing a "
"small script to assign "
"the :ref:`Viewport.world_2d<class_viewport_property_world_2d>` of the first "
"SubViewport to the second, so they have a shared display. Questions often "
"pop up about how to share a parallax effect between both screens."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຮຽນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນການສ້າງເກມແບ່ງໜ້າຈໍໃນ Godot ແມ່ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຂຽນສະຄຣິບສັ້ນໆ ເພື່ອກຳນົດ "
":ref:`Viewport.world_2d<class_viewport_property_world_2d>` ຂອງ SubViewport ທຳ"
"ອິດໃຫ້ກັບອັນທີສອງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນຮ່ວມກັນ. ມັກຈະມີຄຳຖາມເກີດຂຶ້ນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການແບ່ງປັນຜົນກະ"
"ທົບພາຣາແລັກລະຫວ່າງທັງສອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:218
msgid ""
"The parallax effect fakes a perspective by moving the positions of different "
"textures in relation to the camera. This is understandably problematic if "
"you have multiple cameras, because your textures can't be in two places at "
"once!"
msgstr ""
"ຜົນກະທົບພາຣາແລັກຈະຈຳລອງມິຕິພາບ ໂດຍການຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເທັກເຈີຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ສຳພັນກັບກ້ອງ. ນີ້ຄືບັນຫາທີ່ເຂົ້າໃ"
"ຈໄດ້ຖ້າຫາກເຈົ້າມີຫຼາຍກ້ອງ, ເພາະວ່າເທັກເຈີຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຢູ່ໃນສອງບ່ອນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:221
msgid ""
"This is still achievable by cloning the parallax nodes into the second (or "
"third or fourth) :ref:`SubViewport<class_subviewport>`. Here's how a setup "
"looks for a two player game:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໂຄລນ (cloning) ໂນດພາຣາແລັກລົງໃນ "
":ref:`SubViewport<class_subviewport>` ທີສອງ (ຫຼື ສາມ ຫຼື ສີ່). ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເກມ"
"ສອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:226
msgid ""
"Of course, now both backgrounds show in both SubViewports. What we want is "
"for each parallax to only show in their corresponding viewport. We can "
"achieve this by doing the following:"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ຕອນນີ້ທັງສອງພື້ນຫຼັງຈະສະແດງໃນທັງສອງ SubViewport. ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຄື ໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພາຣາແລັ"
"ກສະແດງສະເພາະໃນວິວພອດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:229
msgid ""
"Leave all parallax nodes at their "
"default :ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` "
"of 1."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ໂນດພາຣາແລັກທັງໝົດຢູ່ໃນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
":ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` ເປັນ 1."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:230
msgid ""
"Set the first "
"SubViewport's :ref:`canvas_cull_mask<class_viewport_property_canvas_cull_mask>` "
"to only layers 1 and 2."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`canvas_cull_mask<class_viewport_property_canvas_cull_mask>` ຂອງ "
"SubViewport ທຳອິດໃຫ້ສະແດງສະເພາະເລເຍີ 1 ແລະ 2."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:231
msgid "Do the same for the second SubViewport but use layers 1 and 3."
msgstr "ເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບ SubViewport ທີສອງ ແຕ່ໃຊ້ເລເຍີ 1 ແລະ 3."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:232
msgid ""
"Give your parallax nodes in the first SubViewport a common parent and set "
"its :ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` to 2."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມໂນດພາຣາແລັກໃນ SubViewport ທຳອິດໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ Parent ດຽວກັນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
":ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` ຂອງມັນເປັນ "
"2."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:233
msgid ""
"Do the same for the second SubViewport's parallax nodes, but use a layer of "
"3."
msgstr "ເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບໂນດພາຣາແລັກຂອງ SubViewport ທີສອງ, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ເລເຍີ 3."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:235
msgid ""
"How does this work? If a canvas item has "
"a :ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` that "
"doesn't match the "
"SubViewport's :ref:`canvas_cull_mask<class_viewport_property_canvas_cull_mask>`, "
"it will hide all children, even if they do. We use this to our advantage, "
"letting the SubViewports cut off rendering of parallax nodes whose parent "
"doesn't have a "
"supported :ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>`."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ? ຖ້າ canvas item ມີ "
":ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` ທີ່ບໍ່ຕົງກັບ "
":ref:`canvas_cull_mask<class_viewport_property_canvas_cull_mask>` ຂອງ "
"SubViewport, ມັນຈະເຊື່ອງ Node ລູກທັງໝົດ ເຖິງວ່າ Node ລູກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຕົງກໍຕາມ. ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈ"
"າກຈຸດນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ SubViewport ຕັດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງໂນດພາຣາແລັກທີ່ Parent ຂອງມັນບໍ່ມີ "
":ref:`visibility_layer<class_canvasitem_property_visibility_layer>` ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:241
msgid "Previewing in the editor"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໃນ editor"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:243
msgid ""
"Prior to 4.3, the recommendation was to place every layer in their "
"own :ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_parallaxbackground>`, enable "
"the :ref:`follow_viewport_enabled<class_canvaslayer_property_follow_viewport_enabled>` "
"property, and scale the individual layer. This method has always been tricky "
"to get right, but is still achievable by using "
"a :ref:`CanvasLayer<class_canvaslayer>` instead of "
"a :ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_parallaxbackground>`."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 4.3, ຄຳແນະນຳແມ່ນໃຫ້ວາງແຕ່ລະເລເຍີໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_parallaxbackground>` ຂອງໃຜລາວ, ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`follow_viewport_enabled<class_canvaslayer_property_follow_viewport_enabled>"
"`, ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດແຕ່ລະເລເຍີແຍກກັນ. ວິທີນີ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຍາກທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການ"
"ໃຊ້ :ref:`CanvasLayer<class_canvaslayer>` ແທນ "
":ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_parallaxbackground>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_parallax.rst:250
msgid ""
"Another recommendation is `KoBeWi's \"Parallax2D Preview\" addon <https://"
"github.com/KoBeWi/Godot-Parallax2D-Preview>`_. It provides a few different "
"preview modes and is very handy!"
msgstr ""
"ອີກຄຳແນະນຳໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ `KoBeWi's \"Parallax2D Preview\" addon <https://github.com/"
"KoBeWi/Godot-Parallax2D-Preview>`_. ມັນມີໂໝດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ສະດວກຫຼາຍ!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:4
msgid "2D movement overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແບບ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:9
msgid ""
"Every beginner has been there: \"How do I move my character?\" Depending on "
"the style of game you're making, you may have special requirements, but in "
"general the movement in most 2D games is based on a small number of designs."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທຸກຄົນເຄີຍຜ່ານມາກ່ອນ: \"ຂ້ອຍຈະຍ້າຍຕົວລະຄອນຂອງຂ້ອຍໄດ້ແນວໃດ?\" ອີງຕາມຮູບແບບເກມທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັ"
"ງສ້າງ, ເເຈົ້າອາດຈະມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການພິເສດບາງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນເກມ 2D ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈ"
"ະອີງຕາມຮູບແບບການອອກແບບພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:13
msgid ""
"We'll use :ref:`CharacterBody2D <class_CharacterBody2D>` for these examples, "
"but the principles will apply to other node types (Area2D, RigidBody2D) as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ :ref:`CharacterBody2D <class_CharacterBody2D>` ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ຫຼັກ"
"ການນີ້ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບໂນດປະເພດອື່ນໆ (Area2D, RigidBody2D) ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:19
#: ../../docs/tutorials/animation/2d_skeletons.rst:31
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_windows.rst:77
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/customizing_html5_shell.rst:44
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/your_first_shader/your_first_2d_shader.rst:23
#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/deploying_to_android.rst:7
#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:26
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each example below uses the same scene setup. Start with a "
"``CharacterBody2D`` with two children: ``Sprite2D`` and "
"``CollisionShape2D``. You can use the Godot icon (``icon.svg``) for the "
"Sprite2D's texture or use any other 2D image you have."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ scene ດຽວກັນ. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ``CharacterBody2D`` ທີ່ມີ Node ລູກສອງ"
"ອັນ: ``Sprite2D`` ແລະ ``CollisionShape2D``. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໄອຄອນ Godot "
"(``icon.svg``) ເປັນເທັກເຈີຂອງ Sprite2D ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮູບ 2D ອື່ນໆທີ່ເຈົ້າມີກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:25
msgid ""
"Open ``Project -> Project Settings`` and select the \"Input Map\" tab. Add "
"the following input actions (see :ref:`InputEvent <doc_inputevent>` for "
"details):"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ``Project -> Project Settings`` ແລະ ເລືອກແຖບ \"Input Map\". ເພີ່ມ input "
"actions ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`InputEvent <doc_inputevent>` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:31
msgid "8-way movement"
msgstr "ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ 8 ທິດທາງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:33
msgid ""
"In this scenario, you want the user to press the four directional keys (up/"
"left/down/right or W/A/S/D) and move in the selected direction. The name \"8-"
"way movement\" comes from the fact that the player can move diagonally by "
"pressing two keys at the same time."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສະຖານະການນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມສີ່ທິດທາງ (ຂຶ້ນ/ຊ້າຍ/ລົງ/ຂວາ ຫຼື W/A/S/D) ແລະ ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃ"
"ນທິດທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ຊື່ \"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ 8 ທິດທາງ\" ມາຈາກການທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແນວສະຫຼຽງໄດ້ ໂດຍກ"
"ານກົດສອງປຸ່ມພ້ອມກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:45
msgid "Add a script to the character body and add the following code:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ກັບ character body ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the ``get_input()`` function, we use :ref:`Input <class_Input>` "
"``get_vector()`` to check for the four key events and sum return a direction "
"vector."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``get_input()``, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ :ref:`Input <class_Input>` ``get_vector()`` "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບເຫດການການກົດປຸ່ມທັງສີ່ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າເວັກເຕີທິດທາງກັບຄືນມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:88
msgid ""
"We can then set our velocity by multiplying this direction vector, which has "
"a length of ``1``, by our desired speed."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາສາມາດກຳນົດຄວາມໄວ (velocity) ໂດຍການຄູນເວັກເຕີທິດທາງນີ້ (ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັບ "
"``1``) ກັບຄວາມໄວທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:91
msgid ""
"If you've never used vector math before, or need a refresher, you can see an "
"explanation of vector usage in Godot at :ref:`doc_vector_math`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ຄະນິດສາດເວັກເຕີມາກ່ອນ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການທົບທວນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຄຳອະທິບາຍການໃຊ້ເວັກເຕີໃນ "
"Godot ໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_vector_math`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:96
msgid ""
"If the code above does nothing when you press the keys, double-check that "
"you've set up input actions correctly as described in "
"the :ref:`doc_2d_movement_setup` part of this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເລີຍເມື່ອເຈົ້າກົດປຸ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຄືນວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ input actions ຖືກຕ້ອງ"
"ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ :ref:`doc_2d_movement_setup` ຂອງບົດຮຽນນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:101
msgid "Rotation + movement"
msgstr "ການໝຸນ + ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:103
msgid ""
"This type of movement is sometimes called \"Asteroids-style\" because it "
"resembles how that classic arcade game worked. Pressing left/right rotates "
"the character, while up/down moves it forward or backward in whatever "
"direction it's facing."
msgstr ""
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວປະເພດນີ້ບາງຄັ້ງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ຮູບແບບ Asteroids\" ເພາະວ່າມັນຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ"
"ເກມອາເຄດຄລາສສິກນັ້ນ. ການກົດ ຊ້າຍ/ຂວາ ຈະໝຸນຕົວລະຄອນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ຈະຍ້າຍມັນໄປທາງໜ້າ ຫຼື ທ"
"າງຫຼັງ ຕາມທິດທາງທີ່ມັນຫັນໜ້າໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:162
msgid ""
"Here we've added two variables to track our rotation direction and speed. "
"The rotation is applied directly to the body's ``rotation`` property."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມສອງຕົວປ່ຽນເພື່ອຕິດຕາມທິດທາງການໝຸນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ. ການໝຸນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງກັບຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດ ``rotation`` ຂອງ body."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:165
msgid ""
"To set the velocity, we use the body's ``transform.x`` which is a vector "
"pointing in the body's \"forward\" direction, and multiply that by the speed."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວ (velocity), ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ ``transform.x`` ຂອງ body ເຊິ່ງເປັນເວັກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ໄປໃນ"
"ທິດທາງ \"ທາງໜ້າ\" ຂອງ body, ແລະ ຄູນມັນກັບຄວາມໄວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:169
msgid "Rotation + movement (mouse)"
msgstr "ການໝຸນ + ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (ເມົ້າ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:171
msgid ""
"This style of movement is a variation of the previous one. This time, the "
"direction is set by the mouse position instead of the keyboard. The "
"character will always \"look at\" the mouse pointer. The forward/back inputs "
"remain the same, however."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວນີ້ແມ່ນການດັດແປງຈາກແບບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ເທື່ອນີ້, ທິດທາງຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົ້າແທນ"
"ຄີບອດ. ຕົວລະຄອນຈະ \"ເບິ່ງໄປທີ່\" (look at) ຕົວຊີ້ເມົ້າສະເໝີ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, input ໄປທາງໜ້າ/ຫຼັງ "
"ຍັງຄືເກົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:220
msgid ""
"Here we're using the :ref:`Node2D <class_Node2D>` ``look_at()`` method to "
"point the player towards the mouse's position. Without this function, you "
"could get the same effect by setting the angle like this:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``look_at()`` ຂອງ :ref:`Node2D <class_Node2D>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫັນໄປ"
"ທາງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົ້າ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນແບບດຽວກັນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:235
msgid "Click-and-move"
msgstr "ຄລິກເພື່ອເຄື່ອນທີ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:237
msgid ""
"This last example uses only the mouse to control the character. Clicking on "
"the screen will cause the player to move to the target location."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງສຸດທ້າຍນີ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເມົ້າເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຕົວລະຄອນ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝ"
"າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:300
msgid ""
"Note the ``distance_to()`` check we make prior to movement. Without this "
"test, the body would \"jitter\" upon reaching the target position, as it "
"moves slightly past the position and tries to move back, only to move too "
"far and repeat."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດການກວດສອບ ``distance_to()`` ທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຮັດກ່ອນການເຄື່ອນທີ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການທົດສອບນີ້, body ຈ"
"ະມີອາການ \"ສັ່ນ\" (jitter) ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເພາະມັນຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ກາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໄປໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງແລ້ວພ"
"ະຍາຍາມເຄື່ອນທີ່ກັບຄືນມາ, ແຕ່ກໍກາຍໄປອີກ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳໄປມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:305
msgid ""
"Uncommenting the ``look_at()`` line will also turn the body to point in its "
"direction of motion if you prefer."
msgstr ""
"ການເອົາຄອມເມັ້ນອອກຈາກແຖວ ``look_at()`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ body ຫັນໄປຕາມທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ນຳ ຖ້າເຈົ້າ"
"ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:308
msgid ""
"This technique can also be used as the basis of a \"following\" character. "
"The ``target`` position can be that of any object you want to move to."
msgstr ""
"ເຕັກນິກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ \"ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມ\". ຕຳແໜ່ງ ``target`` ສາມາດເປັນຕຳ"
"ແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:314
msgid ""
"You may find these code samples useful as starting points for your own "
"projects. Feel free to use them and experiment with them to see what you can "
"make."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ. ເຊີນນຳໄປໃຊ້ ແລະ ທົດລອງ"
"ກັບພວກມັນເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/2d_movement.rst:317
msgid ""
"You can download this sample project here: `2d_movement_starter.zip <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/"
"latest-4.x/2d_movement_starter.zip>`_"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: `2d_movement_starter.zip <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/"
"2d_movement_starter.zip>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:4
msgid "Using TileSets"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ TileSets"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:9
msgid ""
"A tilemap is a grid of tiles used to create a game's layout. There are "
"several benefits to using :ref:`TileMapLayer <class_TileMapLayer>` nodes to "
"design your levels. First, they let you draw a layout by \"painting\" tiles "
"onto a grid, which is much faster than placing individual :ref:`Sprite2D "
"<class_Sprite2D>` nodes one by one. Second, they allow for larger levels "
"because they are optimized for drawing large numbers of tiles. Finally, they "
"allow you to add greater functionality to your tiles with collision, "
"occlusion, and navigation shapes."
msgstr ""
"ໄທລ໌ແມັບ (tilemap) ແມ່ນຕາໜ່າງຂອງໄທລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງຜັງຂອງເກມ. ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນການໃຊ້ໂນດ "
":ref:`TileMapLayer <class_TileMapLayer>` ເພື່ອອອກແບບດ່ານຂອງເຈົ້າ. ທຳອິດ, ພວກມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້"
"ເຈົ້າແຕ້ມຜັງໂດຍການ \"ລະບາຍ\" ໄທລ໌ລົງໃນຕາໜ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງໄວກວ່າການວາງໂນດ :ref:`Sprite2D "
"<class_Sprite2D>` ແຕ່ລະອັນຫຼາຍ. ທີສອງ, ພວກມັນຮອງຮັບດ່ານທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ເພາະຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາເພື່ອກາ"
"ນແຕ້ມໄທລ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ກັບໄທລ໌ໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ "
"(collision), ການບັງແສງ (occlusion), ແລະ ການນຳທາງ (navigation)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:18
msgid ""
"To use TileMapLayer nodes, you will need to create a TileSet first. A "
"TileSet is a collection of tiles that can be placed in a TileMapLayer node. "
"After creating a TileSet, you will be able to place them :ref:`using the "
"TileMap editor <doc_using_tilemaps>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການໃຊ້ໂນດ TileMapLayer, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ TileSet ກ່ອນ. TileSet ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງໄທລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດວາ"
"ງລົງໃນໂນດ TileMapLayer ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ TileSet ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດວາງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍ "
":ref:`ການໃຊ້ TileMap editor <doc_using_tilemaps>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:23
msgid ""
"To follow this guide, you will need an image containing your tiles where "
"every tile has the same size (large objects can be split into several "
"tiles). This image is called a *tilesheet*. Tiles do not have to be square: "
"they can be rectangular, hexagonal, or isometric (pseudo-3D perspective)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດຕາມຄູ່ມືນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງມີຮູບພາບທີ່ມີໄທລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າ ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັນ (ວັດຖຸໃຫຍ່ໆສາມາດແ"
"ບ່ງອອກເປັນຫຼາຍໄທລ໌ໄດ້). ຮູບພາບນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ *tilesheet*. ໄທລ໌ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຮູບຈະຕຸລັດສະເໝີໄປ: ມັນສ"
"າມາດເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ, ຮູບຫົກແຈ, ຫຼື ແບບໄອໂຊເມທຣິກ (ມຸມມອງ 3D ຈຳລອງ) ກໍໄດ້."

