msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໂນດ **TileMapLayer** ໃໝ່, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກມັນ ແລະ ສ້າງ Resource TileSet ໃໝ່ໃນ "
"inspector:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:48
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:52
msgid "Creating a new TileSet resource within the TileMapLayer node"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ Resource TileSet ໃໝ່ພາຍໃນໂນດ TileMapLayer"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:54
msgid ""
"After creating the TileSet resource, click the value to unfold it in the "
"inspector. The default tile shape is Square, but you can also choose "
"Isometric, Half-Offset Square or Hexagon (depending on the shape of your "
"tile images). If using a tile shape other than Square, you may also need to "
"adjust the **Tile Layout** and **Tile Offset Axis** properties. Lastly, "
"enabling the **Rendering > UV Clipping** property may be useful if you wish "
"tiles to be clipped by their tile coordinates. This ensures tiles cannot "
"draw outside their allocated area on the tilesheet."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ Resource TileSet ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຄ່າເພື່ອເປີດມັນອອກໃນ inspector. ຮູບຮ່າງໄທລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນແມ່ນ Square (ຈະຕຸລັດ), ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເລືອກ Isometric, Half-Offset Square ຫຼື "
"Hexagon (ຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບຮ່າງຂອງພາບໄທລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າ). ຖ້າໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Square, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດ **Tile Layout** ແລະ **Tile Offset Axis** ນຳ. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"**Rendering > UV Clipping** ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໄທລ໌ຖືກຕັດຕາມພິກັດຂອງມັນ. ນີ້ຊ່ວ"
"ຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄທລ໌ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນເກີນຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ tilesheet."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:63
msgid ""
"Set the tile size to 64×64 in the inspector to match the example tilesheet:"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດໄທລ໌ (tile size) ເປັນ 64×64 ໃນ inspector ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ tilesheet ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:65
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:69
msgid "Setting the tile size to 64×64 to match the example tilesheet"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດໄທລ໌ເປັນ 64×64 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ tilesheet ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:71
msgid ""
"If relying on automatic tiles creation (like we're about to do here), you "
"must set the tile size **before** creating the *atlas*. The atlas will "
"determine which tiles from the tilesheet can be added to a TileMapLayer node "
"(as not every part of the image may be a valid tile)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ການສ້າງໄທລ໌ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຄືກັບທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງຈະເຮັດ), ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກຳນົດຂະໜາດໄທລ໌ **ກ່ອນ** ທີ່ຈ"
"ະສ້າງ *atlas*. atlas ຈະເປັນຕົວບອກວ່າໄທລ໌ໃດຈາກ tilesheet ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer ໄດ້ (ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບຈະເປັນໄທລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:76
msgid ""
"Open the **TileSet** panel at the bottom of the editor, then click and drag "
"the tilesheet image onto the panel. You will be asked whether to create "
"tiles automatically. Answer **Yes**:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແຜງ **TileSet** ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງ editor, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຮູບ tilesheet ລົງໃນແຜງ. ຈະ"
"ມີຄຳຖາມຖາມວ່າຕ້ອງການສ້າງໄທລ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່. ໃຫ້ຕອບ **Yes**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:80
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:84
msgid "Automatically creating tiles based on tilesheet image content"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄທລ໌ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມເນື້ອໃນຂອງຮູບພາບ tilesheet"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:86
msgid ""
"This will automatically create tiles according to the tile size you "
"specified earlier in the TileSet resource. This greatly speeds up initial "
"tile setup."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຈະສ້າງໄທລ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນ Resource TileSet. ວິທີນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກາ"
"ນຕັ້ງຄ່າໄທລ໌ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:91
msgid ""
"When using automatic tile generation based on image contents, parts of the "
"tilesheet that are *fully* transparent will not have tiles generated."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສ້າງໄທລ໌ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມເນື້ອໃນຮູບພາບ, ພາກສ່ວນຂອງ tilesheet ທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ *ທັງໝົດ* ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້"
"າງເປັນໄທລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:94
msgid ""
"If there are tiles from the tilesheet you do not wish to be present in "
"atlas, choose the Eraser tool at the top of the tileset preview, then click "
"the tiles you wish to remove:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີໄທລ໌ໃດໃນ tilesheet ທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີຢູ່ໃນ atlas, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຄື່ອງມື Eraser (ຢ່າງລຶບ) ຢູ່ທາງ"
"ເທິງຂອງການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ tileset, ແລ້ວຄລິກໃສ່ໄທລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລຶບອອກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:98
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:102
msgid "Using the Eraser tool to remove unwanted tiles from the TileSet atlas"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Eraser ເພື່ອລຶບໄທລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການອອກຈາກ TileSet atlas"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:104
msgid ""
"You can also right-click a tile and choose **Delete**, as an alternative to "
"the Eraser tool."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄທລ໌ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Delete** ເພື່ອເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Eraser ກໍໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:109
msgid ""
"Like in the 2D and TileMap editors, you can pan across the TileSet panel "
"using the middle or right mouse buttons, and zoom using the mouse wheel or "
"buttons in the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບໃນ 2D ແລະ TileMap editors, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນ (pan) ໄປມາໃນແຜງ TileSet ໄດ້ໂດຍການ"
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມກາງ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມຂວາຂອງເມົ້າ, ແລະ ຊູມໂດຍການໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົ້າ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:113
msgid ""
"If you wish to source tiles from several tilesheet images for a single "
"TileSet, create additional atlases and assign textures to each of them "
"before continuing. It is also possible to use one image per tile this way "
"(although using tilesheets is recommended for better usability)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄທລ໌ຈາກຮູບ tilesheet ຫຼາຍຮູບສຳລັບ TileSet ດຽວ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ atlas ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລ"
"ະ ກຳນົດເທັກເຈີໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະອັນກ່ອນຈະເຮັດຕໍ່. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງຮູບຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໄທລ໌ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ໄດ້ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການ"
"ໃຊ້ tilesheets ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳຫຼາຍກວ່າເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກໃນການໃຊ້ງານ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:118
msgid "You can adjust properties for the atlas in the middle column:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ atlas ໄດ້ໃນຖັນກາງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:120
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:124
msgid ""
"Adjusting TileSet atlas properties in the dedicated inspector (part of the "
"TileSet panel)"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ TileSet atlas ໃນ inspector ສະເພາະ (ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແຜງ TileSet)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:126
msgid "The following properties can be adjusted on the atlas:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນ atlas:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:128
msgid "**ID:** The identifier (unique within this TileSet), used for sorting."
msgstr ""
"**ID:** ລະຫັດລະບຸຕົວຕົນ (ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນພາຍໃນ TileSet ນີ້), ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈັດລຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Name:** The human-readable name for the atlas. Use a descriptive name here "
"for organizational purposes (such as \"terrain\", \"decoration\", etc)."
msgstr ""
"**Name:** ຊື່ຂອງ atlas ທີ່ອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້. ຄວນໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄດ້ຊັດເຈນເພື່ອຄວາມເປັນລະບຽບ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"\"ພື້ນຜິວ\", \"ຂອງຕົກແຕ່ງ\", ແລະອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:131
msgid ""
"**Margins:** The margins on the image's edges that should not be selectable "
"as tiles (in pixels). Increasing this can be useful if you download a "
"tilesheet image that has margins on the edges (e.g. for attribution)."
msgstr ""
"**Margins:** ຂອບຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກເລືອກເປັນໄທລ໌ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນພິກເຊລ). ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າ"
"ເຈົ້າດາວໂຫຼດຮູບ tilesheet ທີ່ມີຂອບຢູ່ອ້ອມໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຂອບສຳລັບໃຫ້ເຄຣດິດ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Separation:** The separation between each tile on the atlas in pixels. "
"Increasing this can be useful if the tilesheet image you're using contains "
"guides (such as outlines between every tile)."
msgstr ""
"**Separation:** ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ໃນ atlas ເປັນພິກເຊລ. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າຮູບ "
"tilesheet ທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ມີເສັ້ນນຳທາງ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເສັ້ນຂອບລະຫວ່າງໄທລ໌)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Texture Region Size:** The size of each tile on the atlas in pixels. In "
"most cases, this should match the tile size defined in the TileMapLayer "
"property (although this is not strictly necessary)."
msgstr ""
"**Texture Region Size:** ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ໃນ atlas ເປັນພິກເຊລ. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວ, ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຈ"
"ະກົງກັບຂະໜາດໄທລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ TileMapLayer (ເຖິງວ່າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ບັງຄັບກໍຕາມ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:140
msgid ""
"**Use Texture Padding:** If checked, adds a 1-pixel transparent edge around "
"each tile to prevent texture bleeding when filtering is enabled. It's "
"recommended to leave this enabled unless you're running into rendering "
"issues due to texture padding."
msgstr ""
"**Use Texture Padding:** ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຈະເພີ່ມຂອບໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດ 1 ພິກເຊລອ້ອມແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັ"
"ນບັນຫາພາບແຕກ ຫຼື ສີເຫຼື້ອມ (texture bleeding) ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ filtering. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໄວ້ ນອກ"
"ຈາກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະພົບບັນຫາການສະແດງຜົນຍ້ອນ texture padding ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:145
msgid ""
"Note that changing texture margin, separation and region size may cause "
"tiles to be lost (as some of them would be located outside the atlas image's "
"coordinates). To regenerate tiles automatically from the tilesheet, use the "
"three vertical dots menu button at the top of the TileSet editor and choose "
"**Create Tiles in Non-Transparent Texture Regions**:"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການປ່ຽນ texture margin, separation ແລະ region size ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄທລ໌ບາງອັນຫາຍ"
"ໄປ (ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງອັນອາດຈະຢູ່ນອກພິກັດຂອງຮູບ atlas). ເພື່ອສ້າງໄທລ໌ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ "
"tilesheet, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູສາມເມັດແນວຕັ້ງຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງ TileSet editor ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Create "
"Tiles in Non-Transparent Texture Regions**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:151
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:155
msgid "Recreating tiles automatically after changing atlas properties"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄທລ໌ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ atlas"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:158
msgid "Using a collection of scenes"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄໍເລັກຊັນຂອງ scenes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:160
msgid ""
"You can also place actual *scenes* as tiles. This allows you to use any "
"collection of nodes as a tile. For example, you could use scene tiles to "
"place gameplay elements, such as shops the player may be able to interact "
"with. You could also use scene tiles to place AudioStreamPlayer2Ds (for "
"ambient sounds), particle effects, and more."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງ *scenes* ຕົວຈິງໃຫ້ເປັນໄທລ໌ໄດ້ນຳ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ກຸ່ມຂອງໂນດໃດໆກໍໄດ້ໃຫ້ເປັນໄທລ໌. ຕົວຢ່"
"າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ scene tiles ເພື່ອວາງອົງປະກອບຂອງເກມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮ້ານຄ້າທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້. ຫຼື "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ scene tiles ເພື່ອວາງ AudioStreamPlayer2Ds (ສຳລັບສຽງປະກອບ), ຜົນກະທົບພາກທິ"
"ເຄິລ (particles), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:168
msgid ""
"Scene tiles come with a greater performance overhead compared to atlases, as "
"every scene is instanced individually for every placed tile."
msgstr ""
"Scene tiles ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນເຄື່ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ atlases, ເພາະວ່າທຸກໆ scene ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້"
"ນ (instanced) ແຍກກັນສຳລັບທຸກໆໄທລ໌ທີ່ວາງລົງໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:171
msgid ""
"It's recommended to only use scene tiles when necessary. To draw sprites in "
"a tile without any kind of advanced manipulation, :ref:`use atlases instead "
"<doc_creating_tilesets_using_tilesheet>`."
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ scene tiles ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມສະໄປຣ໌ໃນໄທລ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈັດການທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອ"
"ນ, ໃຫ້ :ref:`ໃຊ້ atlases ແທນ <doc_creating_tilesets_using_tilesheet>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:175
msgid ""
"For this example, we'll create a scene containing a CPUParticles2D root "
"node. Save this scene to a scene file (separate from the scene containing "
"the TileMapLayer), then switch to the scene containing the TileMapLayer "
"node. Open the TileSet editor, and create a new **Scenes Collection** in the "
"left column:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ scene ທີ່ມີ root node ເປັນ CPUParticles2D. ບັນທຶກ scene ນີ້ໄວ້"
"ເປັນໄຟລ໌ scene (ແຍກຈາກ scene ທີ່ມີ TileMapLayer), ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນໄປຫາ scene ທີ່ມີໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer. ເປີດ TileSet editor, ແລະ ສ້າງ **Scenes Collection** ໃໝ່ໃນຖັນທາງຊ້າຍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:180
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:184
msgid "Creating a scenes collection in the TileSet editor"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ scenes collection ໃນ TileSet editor"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:186
msgid ""
"After creating a scenes collection, you can enter a descriptive name for the "
"scenes collection in the middle column if you wish. Select this scenes "
"collection then create a new scene slot:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ scenes collection ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄດ້ໃນຖັນກາງຖ້າຕ້ອງການ. ເລືອກ "
"scenes collection ນີ້ ແລ້ວສ້າງ scene slot ໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:190
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:194
msgid ""
"Creating a scene tile after selecting the scenes collection in the TileSet "
"editor"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ scene tile ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ scenes collection ໃນ TileSet editor"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:196
msgid ""
"Select this scene slot in the right column, then use **Quick Load** (or "
"**Load**) to load the scene file containing the particles:"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ scene slot ນີ້ໃນຖັນທາງຂວາ, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ **Quick Load** (ຫຼື **Load**) ເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ "
"scene ທີ່ມີ particles ນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:199
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:203
msgid ""
"Creating a scene slot, then loading a scene file into it in the TileSet "
"editor"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ scene slot, ຈາກນັ້ນໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ scene ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ TileSet editor"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:205
msgid ""
"You now have a scene tile in your TileSet. Once you switch to the TileMap "
"editor, you'll be able to select it from the scenes collection and paint it "
"like any other tile."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າມີ scene tile ໃນ TileSet ຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປ່ຽນໄປຫາ TileMap editor, ເຈົ້າຈະ"
"ສາມາດເລືອກມັນຈາກ scenes collection ແລະ ລະບາຍມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບໄທລ໌ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:210
msgid "Merging several atlases into a single atlas"
msgstr "ການຮວມ atlases ຫຼາຍອັນເຂົ້າເປັນ atlas ດຽວ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:212
msgid ""
"Using multiple atlases within a single TileSet resource can sometimes be "
"useful, but it can also be cumbersome in certain situations (especially if "
"you're using one image per tile). Godot allows you to merge several atlases "
"into a single atlas for easier organization."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ atlases ພາຍໃນ Resource TileSet ດຽວບາງຄັ້ງກໍມີປະໂຫຍດ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍອາດຈະຫຍຸ້ງຍາກໃນບ"
"າງສະຖານະການ (ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງຮູບຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໄທລ໌). Godot ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຮວມ atlases ຫຼາຍອັນເຂົ້າເ"
"ປັນ atlas ດຽວເພື່ອໃຫ້ຈັດລະບຽບໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:217
msgid ""
"To do so, you must have more than one atlas created in the TileSet resource. "
"Use the \"three vertical dots\" menu button located at the bottom of the "
"list of atlases, then choose **Open Atlas Merging Tool**:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນການເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ atlas ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ Resource TileSet. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູ "
"\"ສາມເມັດແນວຕັ້ງ\" ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງລາຍການ atlases, ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Open Atlas Merging "
"Tool**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:221
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:225
msgid "Opening the atlas merging tool after creating multiple atlases"
msgstr "ການເປີດເຄື່ອງມືຮວມ atlas ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງຫຼາຍ atlases"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:227
msgid ""
"This will open a dialog, in which you can select several atlases by "
"holding :kbd:`Shift` or :kbd:`Ctrl` then clicking on multiple elements:"
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ atlases ຫຼາຍອັນໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`Shift` ຫຼື "
":kbd:`Ctrl` ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວຄລິກໃສ່ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:230
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:234
msgid "Using the atlas merging tool dialog"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງເຄື່ອງມືຮວມ atlas"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:236
msgid ""
"Choose **Merge** to merge the selected atlases into a single atlas image "
"(which translates to a single atlas within the TileSet). The unmerged "
"atlases will be removed within the TileSet, but *the original tilesheet "
"images will be kept on the filesystem*. If you don't want the unmerged "
"atlases to be removed from the TileSet resource, choose **Merge (Keep "
"Original Atlases)** instead."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ **Merge** ເພື່ອຮວມ atlases ທີ່ເລືອກເຂົ້າເປັນຮູບ atlas ດຽວ (ເຊິ່ງຈະກາຍເປັນ atlas ດຽວພ"
"າຍໃນ TileSet). atlases ທີ່ຖືກຮວມແລ້ວຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ TileSet, ແຕ່ *ຮູບ tilesheet ຕົ້ນສະບັບ"
"ຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌*. ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ atlases ຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ Resource TileSet, "
"ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Merge (Keep Original Atlases)** ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:244
msgid ""
"TileSet features a system of *tile proxies*. Tile proxies are a mapping "
"table that allows notifying the TileMap using a given TileSet that a given "
"set of tile identifiers should be replaced by another one."
msgstr ""
"TileSet ມີລະບົບທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ *tile proxies*. Tile proxies ແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງການຈັບຄູ່ (mapping "
"table) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍບອກໃຫ້ TileMap ທີ່ໃຊ້ TileSet ນັ້ນຮູ້ວ່າ ກຸ່ມຂອງລະຫັດໄທລ໌ (tile identifiers) ໃດ"
"ໜຶ່ງ ຄວນຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:248
msgid ""
"Tile proxies are automatically set up when merging different atlases, but "
"they can also be set manually thanks to the **Manage Tile Proxies** dialog "
"you can access using the \"three vertical dots\" menu mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"Tile proxies ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຮວມ atlases ຕ່າງໆ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເອ"
"ງໄດ້ຜ່ານໜ້າຕ່າງ **Manage Tile Proxies** ທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ \"ສາມເມັດແນວຕັ້ງ\" ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງ"
"ເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:252
msgid ""
"Manually creating tile proxies may be useful when you changed an atlas ID or "
"want to replace all tiles from an atlas by the ones from another atlas. Note "
"that when editing a TileMap, you can replace all cells by their "
"corresponding mapped value."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ tile proxies ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຈົ້າປ່ຽນ ID ຂອງ atlas ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການແທນທີ່ໄທ"
"ລ໌ທັງໝົດຈາກ atlas ໜຶ່ງດ້ວຍໄທລ໌ຈາກອີກ atlas ໜຶ່ງ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂ TileMap, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແທນທີ່ທຸ"
"ກໆ cell ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຈັບຄູ່ໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:258
msgid "Adding collision, navigation and occlusion to the TileSet"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມ collision, navigation ແລະ occlusion ໃຫ້ກັບ TileSet"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:260
msgid ""
"We've now successfully created a basic TileSet. We could start using it in "
"the TileMapLayer node now, but it currently lacks any form of collision "
"detection. This means the player and other objects could walk straight "
"through the floor or walls."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາສ້າງ TileSet ພື້ນຖານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລີ່ມໃຊ້ມັນໃນໂນດ TileMapLayer ໄດ້ເ"
"ລີຍ, ແຕ່ຕອນນີ້ມັນຍັງຂາດການກວດສອບການຕຳ (collision). ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ຈະສາມາ"
"ດຍ່າງທະລຸພື້ນ ຫຼື ກຳແພງໄປໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:265
msgid ""
"If you use :ref:`2D navigation <doc_navigation_overview_2d>`, you'll also "
"need to define navigation polygons for tiles to generate a navigation mesh "
"that agents can use for pathfinding."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ :ref:`2D navigation <doc_navigation_overview_2d>`, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດ "
"navigation polygons ໃຫ້ກັບໄທລ໌ ເພື່ອສ້າງ navigation mesh ທີ່ຕົວລະຄອນ (agents) ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃ"
"ນການຊອກຫາເສັ້ນທາງ (pathfinding) ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:269
msgid ""
"Lastly, if you use :ref:`doc_2d_lights_and_shadows` or GPUParticles2D, you "
"may also want your TileSet to be able to cast shadows and collide with "
"particles. This requires defining occluder polygons for \"solid\" tiles on "
"the TileSet."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ :ref:`doc_2d_lights_and_shadows` ຫຼື GPUParticles2D, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງ"
"ການໃຫ້ TileSet ຂອງເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງເງົາ ແລະ ຕຳກັບ particles ໄດ້. ນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດ occluder "
"polygons ສຳລັບໄທລ໌ທີ່ເປັນ \"ວັດຖຸແຂງ\" ໃນ TileSet."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:273
msgid ""
"To be able to define collision, navigation and occlusion shapes for each "
"tile, you will need to create a physics, navigation or occlusion layer for "
"the TileSet resource first. To do so, select the TileMapLayer node, click "
"the TileSet property value in the inspector to edit it then unfold **Physics "
"Layers** and choose **Add Element**:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງ collision, navigation ແລະ occlusion ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ "
"physics, navigation ຫຼື occlusion layer ໃຫ້ກັບ Resource TileSet ກ່ອນ. ວິທີເຮັດຄື: ເລືອກ"
"ໂນດ TileMapLayer, ຄລິກໃສ່ຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ TileSet ໃນ inspector ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດສ່ວນ "
"**Physics Layers** ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Add Element**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:279
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:283
msgid ""
"Creating a physics layer in the TileSet resource inspector (within the "
"TileMapLayer node)"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ physics layer ໃນ inspector ຂອງ Resource TileSet (ພາຍໃນໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:285
msgid ""
"If you also need navigation support, now is a good time to create a "
"navigation layer:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບ navigation ນຳ, ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນເວລາທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະສ້າງ navigation layer:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:287
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:291
msgid ""
"Creating a navigation layer in the TileSet resource inspector (within the "
"TileMapLayer node)"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ navigation layer ໃນ inspector ຂອງ Resource TileSet (ພາຍໃນໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:293
msgid ""
"If you need support for light polygon occluders, now is a good time to "
"create an occlusion layer:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບ light polygon occluders, ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນເວລາທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະສ້າງ occlusion "
"layer:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:295
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:299
msgid ""
"Creating an occlusion layer in the TileSet resource inspector (within the "
"TileMapLayer node)"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ occlusion layer ໃນ inspector ຂອງ Resource TileSet (ພາຍໃນໂນດ "
"TileMapLayer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:303
msgid ""
"Future steps in this tutorial are tailored to creating collision polygons, "
"but the procedure for navigation and occlusion is very similar. Their "
"respective polygon editors behave in the same way, so these steps are not "
"repeated for brevity."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປໃນບົດຮຽນນີ້ແມ່ນເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງ collision polygons, ແຕ່ວິທີການສຳລັບ navigation ແລ"
"ະ occlusion ກໍຄ້າຍຄືກັນຫຼາຍ. ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ polygon ຂອງພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາ"
"ຈະບໍ່ເວົ້າຊ້ຳເພື່ອຄວາມກະທັດຮັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:308
msgid ""
"The only caveat is that the tile's occlusion polygon property is part of a "
"**Rendering** subsection in the atlas inspector. Make sure to unfold this "
"section so you can edit the polygon."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງພຽງຢ່າງດຽວຄື ຄຸນສົມບັດ occlusion polygon ຂອງໄທລ໌ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໝວດຍ່ອຍ "
"**Rendering** ໃນ atlas inspector. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດໝວດນີ້ອອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ "
"polygon ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:312
msgid ""
"After creating a physics layer, you have access to the **Physics Layer** "
"section in the TileSet atlas inspector:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ physics layer ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນ **Physics Layer** ໃນ TileSet "
"atlas inspector ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:315
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:319
msgid "Opening the collision editor while in Select mode"
msgstr "ການເປີດເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂ collision ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ Select"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:321
msgid ""
"You can quickly create a rectangle collision shape by pressing :kbd:`F` "
"while the TileSet editor is focused. If the keyboard shortcut doesn't work, "
"try clicking in the empty area around the polygon editor to focus it:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ collision ແບບສີ່ແຈສາກໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`F` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ "
"TileSet editor ຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່. ຖ້າປຸ່ມລັດບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ລອງຄລິກໃສ່ບ່ອນວ່າງອ້ອມໆ polygon editor ເພື່"
"ອໂຟກັສມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:325
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:329
msgid "Using default rectangle collision shape by pressing :kbd:`F`"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງ collision ສີ່ແຈສາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການກົດ :kbd:`F`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:331
msgid ""
"In this tile collision editor, you have access to all the 2D polygon editing "
"tools:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂ collision ໄທລ໌ນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂ 2D polygon ທັງໝົດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:333
msgid ""
"Use the toolbar above the polygon to toggle between creating a new polygon, "
"editing an existing polygon and removing points on the polygon. The \"three "
"vertical dots\" menu button offers additional options, such as rotating and "
"flipping the polygon."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືເໜືອ polygon ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ polygon ໃໝ່, ການແກ້ໄຂ polygon ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລ"
"ະ ການລຶບຈຸດໃນ polygon. ປຸ່ມເມນູ \"ສາມເມັດແນວຕັ້ງ\" ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: ການໝຸນ ແລະ ການ"
"ພິກ polygon."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:336
msgid "Create new points by clicking and dragging a line between two points."
msgstr "ສ້າງຈຸດໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເສັ້ນລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:337
msgid ""
"Remove a point by right-clicking it (or using the Remove tool described "
"above and left-clicking)."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຈຸດອອກໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ມັນ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Remove ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງແລ້ວຄລິກຊ້າຍ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:339
msgid ""
"Pan in the editor by middle-clicking or right-clicking. (Right-click panning "
"can only be used in areas where there is no point nearby.)"
msgstr ""
"ເລື່ອນ (Pan) ໃນ editor ໂດຍການຄລິກກາງ ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາ. (ການເລື່ອນດ້ວຍຄລິກຂວາສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃ"
"ນບ່ອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຈຸດຢູ່ໃກ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ.)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:342
msgid ""
"You can use the default rectangle shape to quickly create a triangle-shaped "
"collision shape by removing one of the points:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ collision ແບບສາມແຈໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາໂດຍການລຶບຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງອ"
"ອກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:345
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:349
msgid ""
"Creating a triangle collision shape by right-clicking one of the corners to "
"remove it"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ collision ສາມແຈໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແຈໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:351
msgid ""
"You can also use the rectangle as a base for more complex shapes by adding "
"more points:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຈຸດເຂົ້າໄປ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:353
#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:357
msgid "Drawing a custom collision for a complex tile shape"
msgstr "ການແຕ້ມ collision ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງໄທລ໌ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:361
msgid ""
"If you have a large tileset, specifying the collision for each tile "
"individually could take a lot of time. This is especially true as TileMaps "
"tend to have many tiles with common collision patterns (such as solid blocks "
"or 45-degree slopes). To apply a similar collision shape to several tiles "
"quickly, use functionality to :ref:`assign properties to multiple tiles at "
"once <doc_using_tilemaps_assigning_properties_to_multiple_tiles>`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີ tileset ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ການກຳນົດ collision ໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ແຍກກັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍ. ໂດ"
"ຍສະເພາະຢ່າງຍິ່ງເມື່ອ TileMaps ມັກຈະມີຫຼາຍໄທລ໌ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບ collision ຄືກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ບລັອກແຂງ ຫຼື ທາງ"
"ຄ້ອຍ 45 ອົງສາ). ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງ collision ທີ່ຄືກັນໃຫ້ກັບຫຼາຍໆໄທລ໌ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ :ref:`ກ"
"ານກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍໄທລ໌ພ້ອມກັນ "
"<doc_using_tilemaps_assigning_properties_to_multiple_tiles>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:369
msgid "Assigning custom metadata to the TileSet's tiles"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດ metadata ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບໄທລ໌ຂອງ TileSet"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:371
msgid ""
"You can assign custom data on a per-tile basis using *custom data layers*. "
"This can be useful to store information specific to your game, such as the "
"damage that a tile should deal when the player touches it, or whether a tile "
"can be destroyed using a weapon."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະໄທລ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ *custom data layers*. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດ"
"ໃນການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງເກມເຈົ້າ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄ່າຄວາມເສຍຫາຍ (damage) ທີ່ໄທລ໌ຈະສ້າງເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນມາແຕະ, "
"ຫຼື ໄທລ໌ນັ້ນສາມາດຖືກທຳລາຍດ້ວຍອາວຸດໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.rst:376
msgid ""
"The data is associated with the tile in the TileSet: all instances of the "
"placed tile will use the same custom data. If you need to create a variant "
"of a tile that has different custom data, this can be done by :ref:`creating "
"an alternative tile <doc_using_tilesets_creating_alternative_tiles>` and "
"changing the custom data for the alternative tile only."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຜູກໄວ້ກັບໄທລ໌ໃນ TileSet: ທຸກໆອັນຂອງໄທລ໌ນັ້ນທີ່ວາງລົງໄປຈະໃຊ້ custom data ອັນດຽວກັນ. ຖ້າ"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງໄທລ໌ລຸ້ນອື່ນທີ່ມີ custom data ຕ່າງອອກໄປ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍ :ref:`ການສ້າງ "
"alternative tile <doc_using_tilesets_creating_alternative_tiles>` ແລະ ປ່ຽນ "
"custom data ສະເພາະສຳລັບໄທລ໌ນັ້ນ."

