msgstr ""
"ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Godot (demo projects repository) ມີ `3D decals demo "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/decals>"
"`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/using_decals.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you're looking to write arbitrary 3D text on top of a surface, "
"use :ref:`doc_3d_text` placed close to a surface instead of a Decal node."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ 3D ໃດໆລົງເທິງພື້ນຜິວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`doc_3d_text` ວາງໄວ້ໃກ້ກັບພື້ນຜິວແທນ"
"ການໃຊ້ໂນດ Decal."

