#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:4
msgid "Importing images"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:7
msgid "Supported image formats"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:9
msgid "Godot can import the following image formats:"
msgstr "Godot ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:11
msgid "**Raster:**"
msgstr "**ແບບຣາສເຕີ (Raster):**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:13
msgid ""
"BMP (``.bmp``) - All pixel formats are supported, but :abbr:`RLE (Run-Length "
"Encoding)` compression is not supported."
msgstr ""
"BMP (``.bmp``) - ຮອງຮັບທຸກຮູບແບບພິກເຊວ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການບີບອັດແບບ :abbr:`RLE (Run-"
"Length Encoding)`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:16
msgid ""
"DirectDraw Surface (``.dds``) - If mipmaps are present in the texture, they "
"will be loaded directly. This can be used to achieve effects using custom "
"mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"DirectDraw Surface (``.dds``) - ຫາກມີ mipmaps ໃນເທັກເຈີ (texture), ມັນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດມາໂດ"
"ຍກົງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກໂດຍໃຊ້ mipmaps ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:19
msgid ""
"Khronos Texture (``.ktx``) - Decoding is done using `libktx <https://"
"github.com/KhronosGroup/KTX-Software>`__. Only supports 2D images. Cubemaps, "
"texture arrays, and de-padding are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Khronos Texture (``.ktx``) - ຖອດລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ `libktx <https://github.com/"
"KhronosGroup/KTX-Software>`__. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຮູບພາບ 2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Cubemaps, "
"texture arrays ແລະ de-padding."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:23
msgid ""
"OpenEXR (``.exr``) - Supports HDR (highly recommended for panorama skies)."
msgstr "OpenEXR (``.exr``) - ຮອງຮັບ HDR (ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບທ້ອງຟ້າແບບພາໂນຣາມາ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:25
msgid ""
"Radiance HDR (``.hdr``) - Supports HDR (highly recommended for panorama "
"skies)."
msgstr ""
"Radiance HDR (``.hdr``) - ຮອງຮັບ HDR (ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບທ້ອງຟ້າແບບພາໂນຣາມາ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:27
msgid ""
"JPEG (``.jpg``, ``.jpeg``) - Doesn't support transparency per the format's "
"limitations."
msgstr ""
"JPEG (``.jpg``, ``.jpeg``) - ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:29
msgid ""
"PNG (``.png``) - Precision is limited to 8 bits per channel upon importing "
"(no HDR images)."
msgstr ""
"PNG (``.png``) - ຄວາມລະອຽດຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 8 bits ຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ (ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຮູບ HDR)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:31
msgid "Truevision Targa (``.tga``)"
msgstr "Truevision Targa (``.tga``)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:33
msgid ""
"WebP (``.webp``) - WebP files support transparency and can be compressed "
"lossily or losslessly. The precision is limited to 8 bits per channel."
msgstr ""
"WebP (``.webp``) - ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ສາມາດບີບອັດໄດ້ທັງແບບສູນເສຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽ"
"ດ. ຄວາມລະອຽດຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 8 bits ຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:36
msgid "**Vector:**"
msgstr "**ແບບເວັກເຕີ (Vector):**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:38
msgid "SVG (``.svg``)"
msgstr "SVG (``.svg``)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:40
msgid "By default, SVGs are rasterized at import-time."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໄຟລ໌ SVG ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນຣາສເຕີ (rasterized) ໃນຕອນນຳເຂົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:42
msgid ""
"SVG is the only image format that can be imported as DPITexture, which "
"allows for run-time rasterization to match the current oversampling factor. "
"See :ref:`doc_importing_images_changing_import_type` for details."
msgstr ""
"SVG ແມ່ນຮູບແບບຮູບພາບດຽວທີ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ DPITexture ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແປງເປັນຣາສເຕີໃນຂະນະທີ່"
"ເກມເຮັດວຽກ (run-time) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄ່າ oversampling ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_importing_images_changing_import_type`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:46
msgid ""
"Godot uses the `ThorVG <https://www.thorvg.org/>`__ library for SVG "
"rendering. `SVG feature support is limited <https://www.thorvg.org/"
"about#:~:text=certain%20features%20remain%20unsupported%20within%20the%20current%20framework>`__; "
"complex vectors may not render correctly. :ref:`Text must be converted to "
"paths <doc_importing_images_svg_text>`; otherwise, it won't appear in the "
"rasterized image. For complex vectors, rendering them to PNGs using "
"`Inkscape <https://inkscape.org/>`__ is often a better solution. This can be "
"automated thanks to its `command-line interface <https://wiki.inkscape.org/"
"wiki/index.php/Using_the_Command_Line#Export_files>`__."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ `ThorVG <https://www.thorvg.org/>`__ ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີ SVG. `ການຮອງ"
"ຮັບຟີເຈີ SVG ແມ່ນມີຈຳກັດ <https://www.thorvg.org/"
"about#:~:text=certain%20features%20remain%20unsupported%20within%20the%20current%20framework>"
"`__; ເວັກເຕີທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. :ref:`ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (Text) ຕ້ອງຖືກແປງເປັນພາທ "
"(path) ກ່ອນ <doc_importing_images_svg_text>`; ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນຮູບ. ສຳລັບເວັກເຕີທີ່ຊັ"
"ບຊ້ອນ, ການເຣນເດີໃຫ້ເປັນ PNG ໂດຍໃຊ້ `Inkscape <https://inkscape.org/>`__ ມັກຈະເປັນທາງ"
"ອອກທີ່ດີກວ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ `command-line interface <https://"
"wiki.inkscape.org/wiki/index.php/Using_the_Command_Line#Export_files>`__ ຂອງມັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can check whether ThorVG can render a certain vector correctly using its "
"`web-based viewer <https://www.thorvg.org/viewer>`__."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າ ThorVG ສາມາດເຣນເດີເວັກເຕີໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ `ເຄື່ອງມືເບິ່ງຜ່ານເວັບ "
"<https://www.thorvg.org/viewer>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:59
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_audio_samples.rst:26
msgid ""
"If you've compiled the Godot editor from source with specific modules "
"disabled, some formats may not be available."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຄອມໄພລ໌ (compile) Godot editor ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source) ໂດຍປິດບາງໂມດູນໄວ້, ບາງຮູບແ"
"ບບໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:63
msgid "Importing textures"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີ (Textures)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:65
msgid ""
"The default action in Godot is to import images as textures. Textures are "
"stored in video memory. Their pixel data can't be accessed directly from the "
"CPU without converting them back to an :ref:`class_Image` in a script. This "
"is what makes drawing them efficient."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນເທັກເຈີ. ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳວິດີ"
"ໂອ (VRAM). ຂໍ້ມູນພິກເຊວຂອງມັນບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ CPU ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແປງກັບຄືນເປັນ "
":ref:`class_Image` ໃນສະຄຣິບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ການແຕ້ມຮູບມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:70
msgid ""
"There are over a dozen import options that can be adjusted after selecting "
"an image in the FileSystem dock:"
msgstr ""
"ມີຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າສິບຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຮູບໃນແຖບ FileSystem:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:73
msgid ""
"Import options in the Import dock after selecting an image in the FileSystem "
"dock"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າໃນແຖບ Import ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຮູບພາບໃນແຖບ FileSystem"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:77
msgid ""
"Import options in the Import dock after selecting an image in the FileSystem "
"dock. Some of these options are only visible with certain compression modes."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າໃນແຖບ Import ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຮູບໃນແຖບ FileSystem. ບາງຕົວເລືອກຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ"
"ສະເພາະກັບບາງໂໝດການບີບອັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:83
msgid "Changing import type"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນປະເພດການນຳເຂົ້າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:85
msgid ""
"It is possible to choose other types of imported resources in the Import "
"dock:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພດອື່ນໆໃນແຖບ Import ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:87
msgid ""
"**BitMap:** 1-bit monochrome texture (intended to be used as a click mask "
"in :ref:`class_TextureButton` and :ref:`class_TouchScreenButton`). This "
"resource type cannot be displayed directly onto 2D or 3D nodes, but the "
"pixel values can be queried from a script using :ref:`get_bit "
"<class_BitMap_method_get_bit>`."
msgstr ""
"**BitMap:** ເທັກເຈີຂາວດຳແບບ 1-bit (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເປັນໜ້າກາກການຄລິກ ຫຼື click mask ໃນ "
":ref:`class_TextureButton` ແລະ :ref:`class_TouchScreenButton`). ຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພ"
"ດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໂດຍກົງໃນໂນດ 2D ຫຼື 3D ໄດ້, ແຕ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຄ່າພິກເຊວໄດ້ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບໂດຍໃຊ້ "
":ref:`get_bit <class_BitMap_method_get_bit>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Cubemap:** Import the texture as a 6-sided cubemap, with interpolation "
"between the cubemap's sides (seamless cubemaps), which can be sampled in "
"custom shaders."
msgstr ""
"**Cubemap:** ນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີເປັນຄິວບ໌ແມັບ (cubemap) 6 ດ້ານ, ໂດຍມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງດ້ານ "
"(seamless cubemaps), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນເຮດເດີ (shader) ທີ່ຂຽນເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:95
msgid ""
"**CubemapArray:** Import the texture as a collection of 6-sided cubemaps, "
"which can be sampled in custom shaders. This resource type can only be "
"displayed when using the Forward+ or Mobile renderers, not the Compatibility "
"renderer."
msgstr ""
"**CubemapArray:** ນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີເປັນຊຸດຂອງ cubemap 6 ດ້ານ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນເຮດເດີທີ່ຂຽນເອງໄ"
"ດ້. ປະເພດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຕົວເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:99
msgid ""
"**DPITexture:** Only available for SVG images. Similar to Texture2D, but can "
"be re-rasterized at different scales in the editor and at runtime without "
"needing to be reimported. "
"See :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_font_and_image_oversampling` for details."
msgstr ""
"**DPITexture:** ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຮູບ SVG ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ Texture2D ແຕ່ສາມາດແປງເປັນຣາສເຕີໃ"
"ໝ່ຕາມຂະໜາດຕ່າງໆໄດ້ທັງໃນ editor ແລະ ຕອນລັນເກມ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_font_and_image_oversampling`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Font Data (Monospace Image Font):** Import the image as a bitmap font "
"where all characters have the same width. See :ref:`doc_gui_using_fonts`."
msgstr ""
"**Font Data (Monospace Image Font):** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນບິດແມັບຟອນ (bitmap font) ທີ່ທຸກ"
"ຕົວອັກສອນມີຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັນ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_gui_using_fonts`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Image:** Import the image as-is. This resource type cannot be displayed "
"directly onto 2D or 3D nodes, but the pixel values can be queried from a "
"script using :ref:`get_pixel<class_Image_method_get_pixel>`."
msgstr ""
"**Image:** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຕາມສະພາບເດີມ. ປະເພດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໃນໂນດ 2D ຫຼື 3D ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແ"
"ຕ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຄ່າພິກເຊວໄດ້ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`get_pixel "
"<class_Image_method_get_pixel>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Texture2D:** Import the image as a 2-dimensional texture, suited for "
"display on 2D and 3D surfaces. This is the default import mode."
msgstr ""
"**Texture2D:** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບເປັນເທັກເຈີ 2 ມິຕິ, ເໝາະສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນເທິງພື້ນຜິວ 2D ແລະ 3D. ນີ້ແມ່"
"ນໂໝດການນຳເຂົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Texture2DArray:** Import the image as a collection of 2-dimensional "
"textures. Texture2DArray is similar to a 3-dimensional texture, but without "
"interpolation between layers. Built-in 2D and 3D shaders cannot display "
"texture arrays, so you must create a custom shader in :ref:`2D "
"<doc_canvas_item_shader>` or :ref:`3D <doc_spatial_shader>` to display a "
"texture from a texture array."
msgstr ""
"**Texture2DArray:** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນຊຸດຂອງເທັກເຈີ 2 ມິຕິ. Texture2DArray ຄ້າຍຄືກັບເທັກເຈີ "
"3 ມິຕິ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງຊັ້ນ. ເຮດເດີມາດຕະຖານຂອງ 2D ແລະ 3D ບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງ texture "
"array ໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງເຮດເດີເອງໃນ :ref:`2D <doc_canvas_item_shader>` ຫຼື "
":ref:`3D <doc_spatial_shader>` ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:115
msgid ""
"**Texture3D:** Import the image as a 3-dimensional texture. This is *not* a "
"2D texture applied onto a 3D surface. Texture3D is similar to a texture "
"array, but with interpolation between layers. Texture3D is typically used "
"for :ref:`class_FogMaterial` density maps in :ref:`volumetric fog "
"<doc_volumetric_fog>`, :ref:`particle attractor "
"<doc_3d_particles_attractors>` vector fields, :ref:`class_Environment` 3D "
"LUT color correction, and custom shaders."
msgstr ""
"**Texture3D:** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບເປັນເທັກເຈີ 3 ມິຕິ. ນີ້ *ບໍ່ແມ່ນ* ການເອົາເທັກເຈີ 2D ໄປແປະໃສ່ພື້ນຜິວ 3D. "
"Texture3D ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ texture array ແຕ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງຊັ້ນ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຜນຜັງຄວາມ"
"ໜາແໜ້ນ (density maps) ໃນ :ref:`ໝອກ (volumetric fog) <doc_volumetric_fog>`, "
":ref:`particle attractor <doc_3d_particles_attractors>`, ການປັບສີ 3D LUT ໃນ "
":ref:`class_Environment`, ແລະ ເຮດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:121
msgid ""
"**TextureAtlas:** Import the image as an *atlas* of different textures. Can "
"be used to reduce memory usage for animated 2D sprites. Only supported in 2D "
"due to missing support in built-in 3D shaders."
msgstr ""
"**TextureAtlas:** ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນ *ອັດລາສ (atlas)* ທີ່ລວມຫຼາຍເທັກເຈີໄວ້ນຳກັນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດກາ"
"ນໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນສະໄປຣທ໌ (sprite) 2D. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ 2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:125
msgid ""
"For **Cubemap**, the expected image order is X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (in "
"Godot's coordinate system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\"). Here are "
"templates you can use for cubemap images (right-click > **Save Link As…**):"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ **Cubemap**, ລຳດັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການແມ່ນ X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (ຕາມລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ "
"Godot, ເຊິ່ງ Y+ ແມ່ນ \"ຂຶ້ນ\" ແລະ Z- ແມ່ນ \"ໄປໜ້າ\"). ນີ້ແມ່ນແມ່ແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ (ຄລິກຂ"
"ວາ > **Save Link As…**):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:129
msgid ""
":download:`2×3 cubemap template (default layout option) <img/"
"cubemap_template_2x3.webp>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`ແມ່ແບບ cubemap ແບບ 2×3 (ຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) <img/"
"cubemap_template_2x3.webp>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:130
msgid ":download:`3×2 cubemap template <img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp>`"
msgstr ":download:`ແມ່ແບບ cubemap ແບບ 3×2 <img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:131
msgid ":download:`1×6 cubemap template <img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp>`"
msgstr ":download:`ແມ່ແບບ cubemap ແບບ 1×6 <img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:132
msgid ":download:`6×1 cubemap template <img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp>`"
msgstr ":download:`ແມ່ແບບ cubemap ແບບ 6×1 <img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:135
msgid "Detect 3D"
msgstr "ການກວດຈັບ 3D (Detect 3D)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:137
msgid ""
"The default import options (no mipmaps and **Lossless** compression) are "
"suited for 2D, but are not ideal for most 3D projects. **Detect 3D** makes "
"Godot aware of when a texture is used in a 3D scene (such as a texture in "
"a :ref:`class_BaseMaterial3D`). If this happens, several import options are "
"changed so the texture flags are friendlier to 3D. Mipmaps are enabled and "
"the compression mode is changed to **VRAM Compressed** "
"unless :ref:`doc_importing_images_detect_3d_compress_to` is changed. The "
"texture is also reimported automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ບໍ່ມີ mipmaps ແລະ ບີບອັດແບບ **Lossless**) ແມ່ນເໝາະສຳລັບ 2D, ແຕ່ບໍ່"
"ດີສຳລັບ 3D. **Detect 3D** ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot ຮູ້ວ່າເທັກເຈີຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສາກ 3D ຫຼື ບໍ່ (ເຊັ່ນ ໃຊ້ໃນ "
":ref:`class_BaseMaterial3D`). ຫາກມີການໃຊ້ໃນ 3D, ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າບາງຢ່າງຈະປ່ຽນໄປເພື່ອໃ"
"ຫ້ເໝາະກັບ 3D ເຊັ່ນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ Mipmaps ແລະ ປ່ຽນໂໝດບີບອັດເປັນ **VRAM Compressed** (ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່"
"ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`doc_importing_images_detect_3d_compress_to` ເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນ). ຈາກນັ້ນເທັກເ"
"ຈີຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:146
msgid ""
"A message is printed to the Output panel when a texture is detected to be "
"used in 3D."
msgstr "ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃນແຖບ Output ເມື່ອກວດພົບວ່າເທັກເຈີຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ 3D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.rst:148
msgid ""
"If you run into quality issues when a texture is detected to be used in 3D "
"(e.g. for pixel art textures), change "
"the :ref:`doc_importing_images_detect_3d_compress_to` option before using "
"the texture in 3D, or change :ref:`doc_importing_images_compress_mode` to "
"**Lossless** after using the texture in 3D. This is preferable to disabling "
"**Detect 3D**, as mipmap generation remains enabled to prevent textures from "
"looking grainy at a distance."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາດ້ານຄຸນນະພາບເມື່ອເທັກເຈີຖືກກວດພົບວ່າໃຊ້ໃນ 3D (ເຊັ່ນ ເທັກເຈີແບບ pixel art), ໃຫ້"
"ປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກ :ref:`doc_importing_images_detect_3d_compress_to` ກ່ອນຈະເອົາໄປໃຊ້ໃນ "
"3D, ຫຼື ປ່ຽນ :ref:`doc_importing_images_compress_mode` ເປັນ **Lossless** ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ໃ"
"ນ 3D ແລ້ວ. ວິທີນີ້ດີກວ່າການປິດ **Detect 3D**, ເພາະການສ້າງ mipmap ຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເທັກ"
"ເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດໆ (grainy) ເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

