#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:49
msgid "This exposes several per-node import options:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າຫຼາຍຢ່າງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂນດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Skip Import:** If checked, the node will not be present in the final "
"imported scene. Enabling this disables all other options."
msgstr ""
"**Skip Import:** ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ, ໂນດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດກາ"
"ນໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Generate > Physics:** If checked, generates a PhysicsBody3D *parent* node "
"with collision shapes that are *siblings* to the MeshInstance3D node."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > Physics:** ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ, ຈະສ້າງໂນດ *ຫຼັກ* ເປັນ PhysicsBody3D ພ້ອມກັບຮູບຮ່າງ"
"ການຕຳ (collision shapes) ທີ່ເປັນ *ລະດັບດຽວກັນ* ກັບໂນດ MeshInstance3D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Generate > NavMesh:** If checked, generates a NavigationRegion3D *child* "
"node for :ref:`navigation <doc_navigation_overview_3d>`. **Mesh + NavMesh** "
"will keep the original mesh visible, while **NavMesh Only** will only import "
"the navigation mesh (without a visual representation). **NavMesh Only** is "
"meant to be used when you've manually authored a simplified mesh for "
"navigation."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > NavMesh:** ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ, ຈະສ້າງໂນດ *ລູກ* ເປັນ NavigationRegion3D ສຳລັບ "
":ref:`ການນຳທາງ <doc_navigation_overview_3d>`. **Mesh + NavMesh** ຈະເກັບຮັກສາເມ"
"ຊ (mesh) ຕົ້ນສະບັບໃຫ້ເຫັນຢູ່, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **NavMesh Only** ຈະນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະເມຊການນຳທາງເທົ່ານັ້"
"ນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນ). **NavMesh Only** ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງເມຊແບບງ່າຍໆສຳລັບກ"
"ານນຳທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Generate > Occluder:** If checked, generates an OccluderInstance3D "
"*sibling* node for :ref:`occlusion culling <doc_occlusion_culling>` using "
"the mesh's geometry as a basis for the occluder's shape. **Mesh + Occluder** "
"will keep the original mesh visible, while **Occluder Only** will only "
"import the occluder (without a visual representation). **Occluder Only** is "
"meant to be used when you've manually authored a simplified mesh for "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > Occluder:** ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ, ຈະສ້າງໂນດ *ລະດັບດຽວກັນ* ເປັນ "
"OccluderInstance3D ສຳລັບ :ref:`occlusion culling <doc_occlusion_culling>` ໂດຍໃ"
"ຊ້ເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງເມຊເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຕົວບັງ (occluder). **Mesh + Occluder** ຈະເກັບ"
"ຮັກສາເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບໃຫ້ເຫັນຢູ່, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **Occluder Only** ຈະນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະຕົວບັງເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີກ"
"ານສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນ). **Occluder Only** ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງເມຊແບບງ່າຍໆສຳລັບ "
"occlusion culling ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:67
msgid ""
"These options are only visible if some of the above options are enabled:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ບາງຕົວເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Physics > Body Type:** Only visible if **Generate > Physics** is enabled. "
"Controls the PhysicsBody3D that should be created. **Static** creates a "
"StaticBody3D, **Dynamic** creates a RigidBody3D, **Area** creates an Area3D."
msgstr ""
"**Physics > Body Type:** ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ **Generate > Physics**. ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ "
"PhysicsBody3D ທີ່ຈະສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. **Static** ຈະສ້າງ StaticBody3D, **Dynamic** ຈະສ້າງ "
"RigidBody3D, **Area** ຈະສ້າງ Area3D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Physics > Shape Type:** Only visible if **Generate > Physics** is enabled. "
"**Trimesh** allows for precise per-triangle collision, but it can only be "
"used with a **Static** body type. Other types are less precise and may "
"require manual configuration, but can be used with any body type. For static "
"level geometry, use **Trimesh**. For dynamic geometry, use primitive shapes "
"if possible for better performance, or use one of the convex decomposition "
"modes if the shape is large and complex."
msgstr ""
"**Physics > Shape Type:** ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ **Generate > Physics**. "
"**Trimesh** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີການຕຳທີ່ຊັດເຈນຕາມຮູບສາມລ່ຽມ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບປະເພດ body ແບບ "
"**Static** ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ປະເພດອື່ນໆຈະມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ແລະ ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ body ທຸກປະເພດ. ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງສາກທີ່ຄົງທີ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ **Trimesh**. ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິ"
"ດທີ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (dynamic), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງພື້ນຖານ (primitive shapes) ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພ"
"າບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໂໝດການແຍກສ່ວນແບບນູນ (convex decomposition) ຖ້າຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Decomposition > Advanced:** Only visible if **Physics > Shape Type** is "
"**Decompose Convex**. If checked, allows adjusting advanced decomposition "
"options. If disabled, only a preset **Precision** can be adjusted (which is "
"usually sufficient)."
msgstr ""
"**Decomposition > Advanced:** ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ **Physics > Shape Type** ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"**Decompose Convex**. ຖ້າໝາຍເລືອກ, ຈະສາມາດປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຍກສ່ວນແບບຂັ້ນສູງໄດ້. ຖ້າປິດໄວ້, "
"ຈະສາມາດປັບໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ **Precision** ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ (ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Decomposition > Precision:** Only visible if **Physics > Shape Type** is "
"**Decompose Convex**. Controls the precision to use for convex "
"decomposition. Higher values result in more detailed collision, at the cost "
"of slower generation and increased CPU usage during physics simulation. To "
"improve performance, it's recommended to keep this value as low as possible "
"for your use cases."
msgstr ""
"**Decomposition > Precision:** ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ **Physics > Shape Type** ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"**Decompose Convex**. ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນການແຍກສ່ວນແບບນູນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕຳມີລ"
"າຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການສ້າງທີ່ຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ CPU ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈຳລອງຟີຊິ"
"ກ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມຂອງງານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Occluder > Simplification Distance:** Only visible if **Generate > "
"Occluder** is set to **Mesh + Occluder** or **Occluder Only**. Higher values "
"result in an occluder mesh with fewer vertices (resulting in decreased CPU "
"utilization), at the cost of more occlusion culling issues (such as false "
"positives or false negatives). If you run into objects disappearing when "
"they shouldn't when the camera is near a certain mesh, try decreasing this "
"value."
msgstr ""
"**Occluder > Simplification Distance:** ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ **Generate > Occluder** "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ **Mesh + Occluder** ຫຼື **Occluder Only**. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເມຊຕົວບັງມີຈຸດ "
"(vertices) ໜ້ອຍລົງ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU ເຮັດວຽກໜ້ອຍລົງ), ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ occlusion "
"culling ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ວັດຖຸຫາຍໄປທັງທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນຫາຍ). ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບວ່າວັດຖຸຫາຍໄປໃນເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນເປັນເມື່ອຖືກ້ອ"
"ງເຂົ້າໃກ້ເມຊບາງຢ່າງ, ໃຫ້ລອງຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ລົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:97
msgid "Configuring mesh and material import options"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າເມຊ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ (material)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:99
msgid ""
"In the Advanced Import Settings dialog, there are 2 ways to select "
"individual meshes or materials:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ, ມີ 2 ວິທີໃນການເລືອກແຕ່ລະເມຊ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:102
msgid ""
"Switch to the **Meshes** or **Materials** tab in the top-left corner of the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແທັບ **Meshes** ຫຼື **Materials** ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:103
msgid ""
"Stay in the **Scene** tab, but unfold the options on the tree view on the "
"left. After choosing a mesh or material, this presents the same information "
"as the **Meshes** and **Materials** tabs, but in a tree view instead of a "
"list."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ໃນແທັບ **Scene** ຕໍ່ໄປ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຕົວເລືອກໃນລາຍການແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກເມຊ "
"ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນຄືກັນກັບແທັບ **Meshes** ແລະ **Materials**, ແຕ່ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້"
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນລາຍການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:107
msgid ""
"If you select a mesh, different options will appear in the panel on the "
"right:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກເມຊ, ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນແຜງທາງດ້ານຂວາ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:109
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:113
msgid "Advanced Import Settings dialog (Meshes tab)"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ (ແທັບ Meshes)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:115
msgid "The options are as follows:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Save to File:** Saves the :ref:`class_Mesh` *resource* to an external file "
"(this isn't a scene file). You generally don't need to use this for placing "
"the mesh in a 3D scene – instead, you should instance the 3D scene directly. "
"However, having direct access to the Mesh resource is useful for specific "
"nodes, such "
"as :ref:`class_MeshInstance3D`, :ref:`class_MultiMeshInstance3D`, :ref:`class_GPUParticles3D` "
"or :ref:`class_CPUParticles3D`. - You will also need to specify an output "
"file path using the option that appears after enabling **Save to File**. "
"It's recommended to use the ``.res`` output file extension for smaller file "
"sizes and faster loading speeds, as ``.tres`` is inefficient for writing "
"large amounts of data."
msgstr ""
"**Save to File:** ບັນທຶກ *ຊັບພະຍາກອນ* :ref:`class_Mesh` ເປັນໄຟລ໌ພາຍນອກ (ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ສາ"
"ກ). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອວາງເມຊໃນສາກ 3D – ແຕ່ຄວນໃຊ້ການ instance ສາກ "
"3D ໂດຍກົງແທນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນ Mesh ໂດຍກົງແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂນດສະເພາະບ"
"າງຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`class_MeshInstance3D`, :ref:`class_MultiMeshInstance3D`, "
":ref:`class_GPUParticles3D` ຫຼື :ref:`class_CPUParticles3D`. - ເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງລະບຸເສັ້ນທາ"
"ງໄຟລ໌ຜົນອອກ (output file path) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ **Save to "
"File**. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໄຟລ໌ ``.res`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ເພາະ"
"ວ່າ ``.tres`` ບໍ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນການຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນມະຫາສານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Generate > Shadow Meshes:** Per-mesh override for the **Meshes > Create "
"Shadow Meshes** scene-wide import option described "
"in :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** will "
"use the scene-wide import option, while **Enable** or **Disable** can "
"forcibly enable or disable this behavior on a specific mesh."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > Shadow Meshes:** ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເມຊ ແທນທີ່ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າທົ່ວ"
"ທັງສາກ **Meshes > Create Shadow Meshes** ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ທົ່ວສາກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **Enable** ຫຼື **Disable** ສາມາດບັງຄັບເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໃນເມຊສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່"
"ງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Generate > Lightmap UV:** Per-mesh override for the **Meshes > Light "
"Baking** scene-wide import option described "
"in :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** will "
"use the scene-wide import option, while **Enable** or **Disable** can "
"forcibly enable or disable this behavior on a specific mesh. - Setting this "
"to **Enable** on a scene with the **Static** light baking mode is equivalent "
"to configuring this mesh to use **Static Lightmaps**. Setting this to "
"**Disable** on a scene with the **Static Lightmaps** light baking mode is "
"equivalent to configuring this mesh to use **Static** instead."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > Lightmap UV:** ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເມຊ ແທນທີ່ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າທົ່ວທັງ"
"ສາກ **Meshes > Light Baking** ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ທົ່ວສາກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **Enable** ຫຼື **Disable** ສາມາດບັງຄັບເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໃນເມຊສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່"
"ງໄດ້. - ການຕັ້ງສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນ **Enable** ໃນສາກທີ່ມີໂໝດການ bake ແສງແບບ **Static** ແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບກາ"
"ນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເມຊນີ້ໃຊ້ **Static Lightmaps**. ການຕັ້ງສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນ **Disable** ໃນສາກທີ່ມີໂໝດການ "
"bake ແສງແບບ **Static Lightmaps** ແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເມຊນີ້ໃຊ້ແບບ **Static** ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:141
msgid ""
"**Generate > LODs:** Per-mesh override for the **Meshes > Generate LODs** "
"scene-wide import option described "
"in :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** will "
"use the scene-wide import option, while **Enable** or **Disable** can "
"forcibly enable or disable this behavior on a specific mesh."
msgstr ""
"**Generate > LODs:** ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເມຊ ແທນທີ່ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າທົ່ວທັງສາກ "
"**Meshes > Generate LODs** ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_using_the_import_dock`. **Default** ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ທົ່ວສາກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **Enable** ຫຼື **Disable** ສາມາດບັງຄັບເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໃນເມຊສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່"
"ງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:146
msgid ""
"**LODs > Normal Merge Angle:** The minimum angle difference between two "
"vertices required to preserve a geometry edge in mesh LOD generation. If "
"running into visual issues with LOD generation, decreasing this value may "
"help (at the cost of less efficient LOD generation)."
msgstr ""
"**LODs > Normal Merge Angle:** ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງມຸມຕ່ຳສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດ (vertices) ທີ່ຈຳເ"
"ປັນເພື່ອຮັກສາຂອບຂອງເລຂາຄະນິດໃນການສ້າງ LOD ຂອງເມຊ. ຖ້າພົບບັນຫາດ້ານການສະແດງຜົນໃນການສ້າງ "
"LOD, ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ລົງອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໄດ້ (ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງ LOD ມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍລົງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:151
msgid ""
"If you select a material, only one option will appear in the panel on the "
"right:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກວັດສະດຸ, ຈະມີພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນແຜງທາງດ້ານຂວາ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:153
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:157
msgid "Advanced Import Settings dialog (Materials tab)"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ (ແທັບ Materials)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:159
msgid ""
"When **Use External** is checked and an output path is specified, this lets "
"you use an external material instead of the material that is included in the "
"original 3D scene file; see the section below."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໝາຍເລືອກ **Use External** ແລະ ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງຜົນອອກແລ້ວ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸພ"
"າຍນອກ ແທນທີ່ວັດສະດຸທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ສາກ 3D ຕົ້ນສະບັບ; ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນພາກສ່ວນລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:164
msgid "Extracting materials to separate files"
msgstr "ການແຍກວັດສະດຸອອກເປັນໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງຫາກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:166
msgid ""
"While Godot can import materials authored in 3D modeling software, the "
"default configuration may not be suitable for your needs. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ Godot ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າວັດສະດຸທີ່ສ້າງຈາກຊອບແວສ້າງໂມເດວ 3D ໄດ້, ແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອາດຈະ"
"ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:169
msgid ""
"You want to configure material features not supported by your 3D application."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງວັດສະດຸທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ 3D ຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:170
msgid ""
"You want to use a different texture filtering mode, as this option is "
"configured in the material (and not in the image)."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໂໝດການກອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filtering) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເພາະວ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃ"
"ນວັດສະດຸ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຮູບພາບ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:172
msgid ""
"You want to replace one of the materials with an entirely different "
"material, such as a custom shader."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນວັດສະດຸອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງດ້ວຍວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ ເຊັ່ນ shader ທີ່ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:175
msgid ""
"To be able to modify the 3D scene's materials in the Godot editor, you need "
"to use *external* material resources."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂວັດສະດຸຂອງສາກ 3D ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງ Godot ໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນວັດສະ"
"ດຸ *ພາຍນອກ*."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:178
msgid ""
"In the top-left corner of the Advanced Import Settings dialog, choose "
"**Actions… > Extract Materials**:"
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Actions… > Extract "
"Materials**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:181
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:185
msgid ""
"Extracting all built-in materials to external resources in the Advanced "
"Import Settings dialog"
msgstr ""
"ການແຍກວັດສະດຸທີ່ຝັງມາທັງໝົດອອກເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:187
msgid ""
"After choosing this option, select a folder to extract material ``.tres`` "
"files to, then confirm the extraction:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂຟນເດີເພື່ອແຍກໄຟລ໌ວັດສະດຸ ``.tres`` ໄປໄວ້, ຈາກນັ້ນຢືນຢັນການແຍ"
"ກໄຟລ໌:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:190
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:194
msgid ""
"Confirming material extraction in the Advanced Import Settings subdialog"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນການແຍກວັດສະດຸໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:198
msgid ""
"After extracting materials, the 3D scene will automatically be configured to "
"use external material references. As a result, you don't need to manually "
"enable **Use External** on every material to make the external ``.tres`` "
"material effective."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກແຍກວັດສະດຸແລ້ວ, ສາກ 3D ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການອ້າງອີງວັດສະດຸພາຍນອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ດ້ວຍເຫດ"
"ນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄປເປີດໃຊ້ **Use External** ໃນທຸກໆວັດສະດຸດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸ "
"``.tres`` ພາຍນອກມີຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:203
msgid ""
"When **Use External** is enabled, remember that the Advanced Import Settings "
"dialog will keep displaying the mesh's original materials (the ones designed "
"in the 3D modeling software). This means your customizations to the "
"materials won't be visible within this dialog. To preview your modified "
"materials, you need to place the imported 3D scene in another scene using "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ **Use External**, ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງວັດສະດຸ"
"ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງເມຊ (ອັນທີ່ອອກແບບໃນຊອບແວ 3D). ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງວັດສະດຸຂອງເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ເຫັນຢູ່ໃນກ່ອງ"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງວັດສະດຸທີ່ເຈົ້າແກ້ໄຂ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອົາສາກ 3D ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມານັ້ນໄປວາງໄວ້ໃນສາກອື່ນໂດຍ"
"ໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:209
msgid ""
"Godot will not overwrite changes made to extracted materials when the source "
"3D scene is reimported. However, if the material name is changed in the "
"source 3D file, the link between the original material and the extracted "
"material will be lost. As a result, you'll need to use the Advanced Import "
"Settings dialog to associate the renamed material to the existing extracted "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະບໍ່ຂຽນທັບການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຍກອອກມາເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສາກ 3D ຕົ້ນສະບັບຄືນໝາກ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍ"
"ຕາມ, ຖ້າຊື່ວັດສະດຸໃນໄຟລ໌ 3D ຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກປ່ຽນ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງວັດສະດຸດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຍກອອກມ"
"າຈະຫາຍໄປ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຂັ້ນສູງເພື່ອເຊື່ອມໂຍງວັດສະດຸທີ່ປ່ຽນຊື່ໃ"
"ໝ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຍກອອກມາທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:215
msgid ""
"The above can be done in the dialog's **Materials** tab by selecting the "
"material, enabling **Save to File**, then specifying the save path using the "
"**Path** option that appears after enabling **Save to File**."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງຂ້າງເທິງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນແທັບ **Materials** ຂອງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໂດຍການເລືອກວັດສະດຸ, ເປີດໃຊ້ "
"**Save to File**, ຈາກນັ້ນລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງການບັນທຶກໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ **Path** ທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກເປີດ"
"ໃຊ້ **Save to File**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:220
msgid "Animation options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກແອນິເມຊັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:222
msgid ""
"Several extra options are available for the "
"generated :ref:`class_AnimationPlayer` nodes, as well as their individual "
"animations when they're selected in the **Scene** tab."
msgstr ""
"ມີຕົວເລືອກເສີມຫຼາຍຢ່າງສຳລັບໂນດ :ref:`class_AnimationPlayer` ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ລວມທັງແອນິເມຊັນແຕ່"
"ລະອັນຂອງພວກມັນເມື່ອຖືກເລືອກໃນແທັບ **Scene**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:227
msgid "Optimizer"
msgstr "ຕົວເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ (Optimizer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:229
msgid ""
"When animations are imported, an optimizer is run, which reduces the size of "
"the animation considerably. In general, this should always be turned on "
"unless you suspect that an animation might be broken due to it being enabled."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າແອນິເມຊັນ, ຕົວເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຈະເຮັດວຽກ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວ້ສະເໝີ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າເຈົ້າສົງໄສວ່າແອນິເມຊັນອາດຈະເພ (broken) ຍ້ອນກ"
"ານເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:234
msgid "Save to file"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:236
msgid ""
"By default, animations are saved as built-in. It is possible to save them to "
"a file instead. This allows adding custom tracks to the animations and "
"keeping them after a reimport."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແອນິເມຊັນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກແບບຝັງຕົວ (built-in). ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັນທຶກພວກມັນເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫ"
"າກໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມແທຣັກທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງເຂົ້າໃນແອນິເມຊັນ ແລະ ເກັບຮັກສາພວກມັນໄວ້ໄດ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່"
"າຈະມີການນຳເຂົ້າຄືນໃໝ່ກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:241
msgid "Slices"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (Slices)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/advanced_import_settings.rst:243
msgid ""
"It is possible to specify multiple animations from a single timeline as "
"slices. For this to work, the model must have only one animation that is "
"named ``default``. To create slices, change the slice amount to something "
"greater than zero. You can then name a slice, specify which frames it starts "
"and stops on, and choose whether the animation loops or not."
msgstr ""
"ເຮົາສາມາດລະບຸຫຼາຍແອນິເມຊັນຈາກໄທມ໌ລາຍ (timeline) ອັນດຽວເປັນສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (slices) ໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ໂມເດວຕ້ອງມີແອນິເມຊັນພຽງອັນດຽວທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``default``. ເພື່ອສ້າງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຈຳນວ"
"ນ slice ໃຫ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ. ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ slice, ລະບຸເຟຣມທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ, ແລະ ເລືອກວ່"
"າຈະໃຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນວົນຊ້ຳ (loop) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:4
msgid "Retargeting 3D Skeletons"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍໂຄງຮ່າງ 3D (Retargeting 3D Skeletons)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:7
msgid "To share animations among multiple Skeletons"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນແອນິເມຊັນລະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໂຄງຮ່າງ (Skeletons)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:9
msgid ""
"Godot has Position/Rotation/Scale 3D tracks (which this document calls "
"\"Transform\" tracks) with Nodepaths to bones for Skeleton bone animation. "
"This means you can't share animations between multiple Skeletons just by "
"using the same bone names."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີແທຣັກ 3D ສຳລັບ ຕຳແໜ່ງ/ການໝູນ/ຂະໜາດ (ເຊິ່ງເອກະສານນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າແທຣັກ \"Transform\") ພ້ອ"
"ມກັບ Nodepaths ໄປຫາແຕ່ລະກະດູກສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນໂຄງຮ່າງ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນແອນິເມຊັນລ"
"ະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໂຄງຮ່າງໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ການໃຊ້ຊື່ກະດູກດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:14
msgid ""
"Godot allows each bone to have a parent-child relationship and can have "
"rotation and scale as well as position, which means that bones that share a "
"name can still have different Transform values."
msgstr ""
"Godot ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະກະດູກມີຄວາມສຳພັນແບບ ຫຼັກ-ຍ່ອຍ (parent-child) ແລະ ສາມາດມີການໝູນ, ຂະໜ"
"າດ ລວມທັງຕຳແໜ່ງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າກະດູກທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກໍຍັງສາມາດມີຄ່າ Transform ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Skeleton stores the Transform values necessary for the default pose as "
"Bone Rest. If Bone Pose is equal to Bone Rest, it means that the Skeleton is "
"in the default pose."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຮ່າງ (Skeleton) ຈະເກັບຄ່າ Transform ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບທ່າທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້ເປັນ Bone Rest. ຖ້າ "
"Bone Pose ເທົ່າກັບ Bone Rest, ມັນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໂຄງຮ່າງນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນທ່າທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:21
msgid ""
"Godot 3 and Godot 4 have different Bone Pose behaviors. In Godot 3, Bone "
"Pose is relative to Bone Rest, but in Godot 4, it includes Bone Rest. See "
"this `article <https://godotengine.org/article/animation-data-"
"redesign-40>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"Godot 3 ແລະ Godot 4 ມີພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ Bone Pose ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໃນ Godot 3, Bone Pose ຈະທຽ"
"ບກັບ Bone Rest, ແຕ່ໃນ Godot 4 ມັນຈະລວມເອົາ Bone Rest ເຂົ້າໄປນຳ. ເບິ່ງ `ບົດຄວາມນີ້ "
"<https://godotengine.org/article/animation-data-redesign-40>`__ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີ"
"ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:27
msgid ""
"Skeletal models have different Bone Rests depending on the environment from "
"which they were exported. For example, the bones of a glTF model output from "
"Blender have \"Edit Bone Orientation\" as the Bone Rest rotation. However, "
"there are skeletal models without any Bone Rest rotations, such as the glTF "
"model output from Maya."
msgstr ""
"ໂມເດວທີ່ມີໂຄງຮ່າງຈະມີ Bone Rest ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ກ"
"ະດູກຂອງໂມເດວ glTF ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈາກ Blender ຈະມີ \"Edit Bone Orientation\" ເປັນການໝູນຂອງ "
"Bone Rest. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍັງມີໂມເດວໂຄງຮ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີການໝູນ Bone Rest ເລີຍ ເຊັ່ນ ໂມເດວ glTF ທີ່ສົ່ງ"
"ອອກຈາກ Maya."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:32
msgid ""
"To share animations in Godot, it is necessary to match Bone Rests as well as "
"Bone Names to remove unwanted tracks in some cases. You can do that using "
"the scene importer."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນແອນິເມຊັນໃນ Godot, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ Bone Rest ແລະ ຊື່ກະດູກກົງກັນ ເພື່ອລົບແທຣັກທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງ"
"ການອອກໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດແນວນັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າສາກ (scene importer)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:36
msgid "Options for Retargeting"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ (Retargeting)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:39
msgid "Bone Map"
msgstr "ແຜນຜັງກະດູກ (Bone Map)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:41
msgid ""
"When you select the Skeleton3D node in the advanced scene import menu, a "
"menu will appear on the right-hand side containing the \"Retarget\" section. "
"The Retarget section has a single property ``bone_map``."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໂນດ Skeleton3D ໃນເມນູນຳເຂົ້າສາກຂັ້ນສູງ, ເມນູຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ທາງດ້ານຂວາມື ເຊິ່ງມີພາກສ່ວ"
"ນ \"Retarget\". ພາກສ່ວນ Retarget ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດຽວຄື ``bone_map``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:47
msgid ""
"With the Skeleton node selected, first set up a new :ref:`class_bonemap` "
"and :ref:`class_skeletonprofile`. Godot has a preset "
"called :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid` for humanoid models. This "
"tutorial proceeds with the assumption that you are "
"using :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດ Skeleton ແລ້ວ, ທຳອິດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`class_bonemap` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofile` ໃໝ່. Godot ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid` ສຳລັບໂມເດວຮູບຮ່າງຄົນ (humanoid). ຄຳແນະນຳນີ້ຈະດ"
"ຳເນີນການໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:51
msgid ""
"If you need a profile that is different "
"from :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, you can export "
"a :ref:`class_skeletonprofile` from the editor by selecting a Skeleton3D and "
"using the **Skeleton3D** menu in the 3D viewport's toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອ"
"ອກ :ref:`class_skeletonprofile` ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກ Skeleton3D ແລະ ໃຊ້ເມນູ "
"**Skeleton3D** ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຂອງ 3D viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:54
msgid ""
"When you use :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, auto-mapping will be "
"performed when the :ref:`class_skeletonprofile` is set. If the auto-mapping "
"does not work well, you can map bones manually."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ການຈັບຄູ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto-mapping) "
"ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`class_skeletonprofile`. ຖ້າການຈັບຄູ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ດີ, ເ"
"ຈົ້າສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ກະດູກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:59
msgid ""
"Any missing, duplicate or incorrect parent-child relationship mappings will "
"be indicated by a magenta / red button (depending on the editor setting). It "
"does not block the import process, but it warns that animations may not be "
"shared correctly."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ຂາດຫາຍ, ຊ້ຳກັນ ຫຼື ຄວາມສຳພັນແບບ ຫຼັກ-ຍ່ອຍ ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍປຸ່ມສີບົວເຂັ້ມ / ສີແດງ "
"(ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ). ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຂັດຂວາງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຕືອນວ່າແອນິເມຊັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກແບ່ງ"
"ປັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:63
msgid ""
"The auto-mapping uses pattern matching for the bone names. So we recommend "
"to use common English names for bones."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັບຄູ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະໃຊ້ການກວດສອບຮູບແບບຊື່ກະດູກ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ພາສາອັງກິດທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບກະ"
"ດູກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:66
msgid ""
"After you set up the ``bone_map``, several options are available in the "
"sections below."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``bone_map`` ແລ້ວ, ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:71
msgid "Remove Tracks"
msgstr "ລົບແທຣັກອອກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:73
msgid ""
"If you import resources as an :ref:`class_animationlibrary` that will be "
"shared, we recommend to enable these options. However, if you import "
"resources as scenes, these should be disabled in some cases. For example, if "
"you import a character with animated accessories, these options may cause "
"the accessories to not animate."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້ານຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນ :ref:`class_animationlibrary` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃ"
"ຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າເຈົ້ານຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນສາກ, ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກປິດໄວ້ໃນບາງກໍ"
"ລະນີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າເຈົ້ານຳເຂົ້າຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ມີອຸປະກອນເສີມທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້, ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອຸປະກອ"
"ນເສີມນັ້ນບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:79
msgid "Except Bone Transform"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນການປ່ຽນແປງກະດູກ (Bone Transform)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:81
msgid "Removes any tracks except the bone Transform track from the animations."
msgstr "ລົບທຸກແທຣັກອອກຈາກແອນິເມຊັນ ຍົກເວັ້ນແທຣັກ Transform ຂອງກະດູກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:84
msgid "Unimportant Positions"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:86
msgid ""
"Removes Position tracks other than ``root_bone`` and ``scale_base_bone`` "
"defined in :ref:`class_skeletonprofile` from the animations. "
"In :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, this means that to remove Position "
"tracks other than \"Root\" and \"Hips\". Since Godot 4, animations include "
"Bone Rest in the Transform value. If you disable this option, the animation "
"may change the body shape unpredictably."
msgstr ""
"ລົບແທຣັກ Position ອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ ``root_bone`` ແລະ ``scale_base_bone`` ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofile` ອອກຈາກແອນິເມຊັນ. ໃນ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ນັ້ນໝາຍເຖິງການລົບແທຣັກ Position ອື່ນໆ ຍົກເວັ້ນ "
"\"Root\" ແລະ \"Hips\". ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ແອນິເມຊັນຈະລວມເອົາ Bone Rest ໄວ້ໃນຄ່"
"າ Transform. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ແອນິເມຊັນອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຮ່າງກາຍໃນແບບທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:93
msgid "Unmapped Bones"
msgstr "ກະດູກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:95
msgid "Removes unmapped bone Transform tracks from the animations."
msgstr "ລົບແທຣັກ Transform ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ອອກຈາກແອນິເມຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:98
msgid "Bone Renamer"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນຊື່ກະດູກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:101
msgid "Rename Bones"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ກະດູກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:103
msgid "Rename the mapped bones."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຈັບຄູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:106
msgid "Unique Node"
msgstr "ໂນດແບບສະເພາະ (Unique Node)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:108
msgid ""
"Makes Skeleton a unique node with the name specified in the "
"``skeleton_name``. This allows the animation track paths to be unified "
"independent of the scene hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ Skeleton ເປັນໂນດສະເພາະ (unique node) ດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ ``skeleton_name``. ສິ່ງນີ້"
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທາງແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນເປັນອັນໜຶ່ງອັນດຽວກັນ ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:112
msgid "Rest Fixer"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂທ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Rest Fixer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:114
msgid ""
"Reference poses defined in :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid` have the "
"following rules:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid` ມີກົດລະບຽບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:116
msgid "The humanoid is T-pose"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຄົນຢູ່ໃນທ່າ T-pose"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:117
msgid "The humanoid is facing +Z in the Right-Handed Y-UP Coordinate System"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຄົນຫັນໜ້າໄປທາງແກນ +Z ໃນລະບົບພິກັດມືຂວາແບບ Y-UP"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:118
msgid "The humanoid should not have a Transform as Node"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຄົນບໍ່ຄວນມີ Transform ໃນລະດັບໂນດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:119
msgid "Directs the +Y axis from the parent joint to the child joint"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແກນ +Y ຊີ້ຈາກຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຫຼັກໄປຫາຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຍ່ອຍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:120
msgid "+X rotation bends the joint like a muscle contracting"
msgstr "ການໝູນແກນ +X ຈະງໍຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຄືກັບການຫົດຕົວຂອງກ້າມຊີ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:122
msgid ""
"These rules are convenient definitions for blend animation and Inverse "
"Kinematics (IK). If your model does not match this definition, you need to "
"fix it with these options."
msgstr ""
"ກົດລະບຽບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການກຳນົດທີ່ສະດວກສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນແບບປະສົມ (blend animation) ແລະ Inverse "
"Kinematics (IK). ຖ້າໂໂມເດວຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ກົງກັບການກຳນົດນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂມັນດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:126
msgid "Apply Node Transform"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໂນດ (Apply Node Transform)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:128
msgid ""
"If the asset is not exported correctly for sharing, the imported Skeleton "
"may have a Transform as a Node. For example, a glTF exported from Blender "
"with no \"Apply Transform\" executed is one such case. It looks like the "
"model matches the definition, but the internal Transforms are different from "
"the definition. This option fixes such models by applying Transforms on "
"import."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບການແບ່ງປັນ, ໂຄງຮ່າງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາອາດຈະມີ Transform ໃນລ"
"ະດັບໂນດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈາກ Blender ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ \"Apply Transform\" ແມ່ນກໍລ"
"ະນີໜຶ່ງ. ມັນເບິ່ງຄືວ່າໂມເດວກົງກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດ, ແຕ່ Transform ພາຍໃນແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຂໍ້ກຳນົດ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະແ"
"ກ້ໄຂໂມເດວດັ່ງກ່າວໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ Transform ໃນເວລາທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:134
msgid ""
"If the imported scene contains objects other than Skeletons, this option may "
"have a negative effect."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາມີວັດຖຸອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Skeleton, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບທາງລົບໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:137
msgid "Normalize Position Tracks"
msgstr "ປັບແທຣັກຕຳແໜ່ງໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (Normalize Position Tracks)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:139
msgid ""
"Position track is used mostly for model movement, but sharing the moving "
"animation between models with different heights may cause the appearance of "
"slipping due to the difference in stride length. This option normalizes the "
"Position track values based on the ``scale_base_bone`` height. The "
"``scale_base_bone`` height is stored in the Skeleton as the "
"``motion_scale``, and the normalized Position track values is multiplied by "
"that value on playback. If this option is disabled, the Position tracks is "
"not normalized and the Skeleton's ``motion_scale`` is always imported as "
"``1.0``."
msgstr ""
"ແທຣັກຕຳແໜ່ງສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງໂມເດວ, ແຕ່ການແບ່ງປັນແອນິເມຊັນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວລະຫວ່າງ"
"ໂມເດວທີ່ມີຄວາມສູງແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນເລື່ອນ (slipping) ຍ້ອນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງໄລຍະກ"
"ານຍ່າງ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປັບຄ່າແທຣັກຕຳແໜ່ງໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມສູງຂອງ "
"``scale_base_bone``. ຄວາມສູງຂອງ ``scale_base_bone`` ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Skeleton ເປັນ "
"``motion_scale``, ແລະ ຄ່າແທຣັກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກປັບແລ້ວຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່ານັ້ນໃນເວລາຫຼິ້ນ. ຖ້າປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້, "
"ແທຣັກຕຳແໜ່ງຈະບໍ່ຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ``motion_scale`` ຂອງ Skeleton ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າມາເປັ"
"ນ ``1.0`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:147
msgid ""
"With :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ``scale_base_bone`` is \"Hips\", "
"therefore the Hips' height is used as the ``motion_scale``."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ``scale_base_bone`` ແມ່ນ \"Hips\", "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວາມສູງຂອງ Hips ຈຶ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ ``motion_scale``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:150
msgid "Overwrite Axis"
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບແກນ (Overwrite Axis)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:152
msgid ""
"Unifies the models' Bone Rests by overwriting it to match the reference "
"poses defined in the :ref:`class_skeletonprofile`."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ Bone Rests ຂອງໂມເດວເປັນອັນໜຶ່ງອັນດຽວກັນ ໂດຍການຂຽນທັບໃຫ້ກົງກັບທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofile`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:154
msgid ""
"This is the most important option for sharing animations in Godot 4, but be "
"aware that this option can produce horrible results **if the original Bone "
"Rest set externally is important**. If you want to share animations with "
"keeping the original Bone Rest, consider to use the `Realtime Retarget "
"Module <https://github.com/TokageItLab/realtime_retarget>`__."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການແບ່ງປັນແອນິເມຊັນໃນ Godot 4, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ບໍ່"
"ດີຫຼາຍ **ຖ້າຫາກວ່າ Bone Rest ດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ຕັ້ງມາຈາກພາຍນອກນັ້ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນ**. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແບ່ງປັນແອ"
"ນິເມຊັນໂດຍທີ່ຍັງເກັບຮັກສາ Bone Rest ດັ້ງເດີມໄວ້, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ `Realtime Retarget Module "
"<https://github.com/TokageItLab/realtime_retarget>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:160
msgid "Fix Silhouette"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງພາຍນອກ (Fix Silhouette)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:162
msgid ""
"Attempts to make the model's silhouette match that of the reference poses "
"defined in the :ref:`class_skeletonprofile`, such as T-Pose. This cannot fix "
"silhouettes which are too different, and it may not work for fixing bone "
"roll."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຮ່າງພາຍນອກ (silhouette) ຂອງໂມເດວກົງກັບທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofile` ເຊັ່ນ T-Pose. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປໄ"
"ດ້, ແລະ ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນໃນການແກ້ໄຂການບິດຂອງກະດູກ (bone roll)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:165
msgid ""
"With :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, this option does not need to be "
"enabled for T-pose models, but should be enabled for A-pose models. However "
"in that case, the fixed foot results may be bad depending on the heel height "
"of the model, so it may be necessary to add the :ref:`class_skeletonprofile` "
"bone names you do not want fixed in the ``filter`` array, as in the below "
"example."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ :ref:`class_skeletonprofilehumanoid`, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂມເດວທ່າ "
"T-pose, ແຕ່ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂມເດວທ່າ A-pose. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ຜົນຂອງການແກ້ໄຂຕີນອາດຈະ"
"ບໍ່ດີຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມສູງຂອງສົ້ນນ່ອງຂອງໂມເດວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊື່ກະດູກ "
":ref:`class_skeletonprofile` ທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂລົງໃນອາເຣ ``filter``, ດັ່ງຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.rst:172
msgid ""
"Also, for models with bent knees or feet, it may be necessary to adjust the "
"``scale_base_bone`` height. For that, you can use ``base_height_adjustment`` "
"option."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສຳລັບໂມເດວທີ່ມີຫົວເຂົ່າງໍ ຫຼື ຕີນງໍ, ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງ "
"``scale_base_bone``. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``base_height_adjustment`` "
"ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:4
msgid "Exporting 3D scenes"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກສາກ 3D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:7
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/linux/wayland_x11.rst:7
#: ../../docs/community/asset_library/using_assetlib.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Godot, it is possible to export 3D scenes as a glTF 2.0 file. You can "
"export as a glTF binary (``.glb`` file) or glTF embedded with textures "
"(``gltf`` + ``.bin`` + textures). This allows you to create scenes in Godot, "
"such as a CSG mesh blockout for a level, export it to clean it up in a "
"program such as Blender, and then bring it back into Godot."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot, ເຮົາສາມາດສົ່ງອອກສາກ 3D ເປັນໄຟລ໌ glTF 2.0 ໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອອກເປັນ glTF ແບບໄບ"
"ນາຣີ (ໄຟລ໌ ``.glb``) ຫຼື glTF ທີ່ຝັງພື້ນຜິວມາພ້ອມ (``gltf`` + ``.bin`` + ພື້ນຜິວ). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້"
"ເຈົ້າສ້າງສາກໃນ Godot ໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ການເຮັດໂຄງຮ່າງເມຊດ້ວຍ CSG ສຳລັບດ່ານ, ຈາກນັ້ນສົ່ງອອກໄປຕົບແຕ່ງໃນໂ"
"ປຣແກຣມເຊັ່ນ Blender, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງນຳມັນກັບຄືນມາໃຊ້ໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:17
msgid "Only Blender 2.83 and newer can import glTF files exported by Godot."
msgstr ""
"ມີພຽງ Blender ເວີຊັນ 2.83 ແລະ ໃໝ່ກວ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ Godot ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:19
msgid ""
"To export a scene in the editor go to **Scene > Export As... > glTF 2.0 "
"Scene...**"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກສາກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ **Scene > Export As... > glTF 2.0 Scene...**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:26
msgid "There are several limitations with glTF export."
msgstr "ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງໃນການສົ່ງອອກ glTF."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:28
msgid ""
"No support for exporting particles since their implementation varies across "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກພາກທິເຄິລ (particles) ເພາະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະ engine."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:29
msgid "ShaderMaterials cannot be exported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງອອກ ShaderMaterials ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:30
msgid "No support for exporting 2D scenes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກສາກແບບ 2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:34
msgid ""
"3D scenes can be saved at runtime using :ref:`runtime file loading and "
"saving <doc_runtime_file_loading_and_saving_3d_scenes>`, including from an "
"exported project."
msgstr ""
"ສາກ 3D ສາມາດບັນທຶກໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ (runtime) ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`runtime file "
"loading and saving <doc_runtime_file_loading_and_saving_3d_scenes>`, ລວມທັງຈາກ"
"ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/escn_exporter/index.rst:4
msgid "Blender ESCN exporter"
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກ ESCN ສຳລັບ Blender"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/escn_exporter/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"To export from Blender to Godot 4.x, use one of the :ref:`available 3D "
"formats <doc_importing_3d_scenes_available_formats>`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກຈາກ Blender ໄປຍັງ Godot 4.x, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງໃນ :ref:`ຮູບແບບ 3D ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ "
"<doc_importing_3d_scenes_available_formats>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/escn_exporter/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"The plugin `Godot Blender Exporter <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"blender-exporter>`__ is not maintained or supported in Godot 4.x. While not "
"officially supported, the plugin may partially work for some Godot and "
"Blender versions, particularly before Blender version 4.0. For complete docs "
"on the Blender exporter, see the `previous version of this page <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/4.0/tutorials/assets_pipeline/escn_exporter/"
"index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ `Godot Blender Exporter <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-blender-"
"exporter>`__ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບໃນ Godot 4.x ແລ້ວ. ເຖິງວ່າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຢ່າງເປັນທ"
"າງການ, ແຕ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ອາດຈະຍັງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ບາງສ່ວນສຳລັບບາງເວີຊັນຂອງ Godot ແລະ Blender, ໂດຍສະເພາ"
"ະກ່ອນເວີຊັນ Blender 4.0. ສຳລັບເອກະສານຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວສົ່ງອອກ Blender, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ `ໜ້າເວີຊັນກ່ອນ"
"ໜ້ານີ້ <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.0/tutorials/assets_pipeline/"
"escn_exporter/index.html>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:4
#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:48
msgid "Audio buses"
msgstr "ບັສສຽງ (Audio buses)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:9
msgid ""
"Godot's audio processing code has been written with games in mind, with the "
"aim of achieving an optimal balance between performance and sound quality."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດປະມວນຜົນສຽງຂອງ Godot ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງເກມເປັນຫຼັກ, ໂດຍມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມສົມດຸນທີ່ດີ"
"ທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບສຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:12
msgid ""
"Godot's audio engine allows any number of audio buses to be created and any "
"number of effect processors can be added to each bus. Only the hardware of "
"the device running your game will limit the number of buses and effects that "
"can be used before performance starts to suffer."
msgstr ""
"Engine ສຽງຂອງ Godot ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງບັສສຽງໄດ້ບໍ່ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວປະມວນຜົນເອັບເຟັກ "
"(effect processors) ເຂົ້າໃນແຕ່ລະບັສໄດ້ເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້. ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຮາດແວຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ຫຼິ້ນເກມຂອງເຈົ້າ"
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຈຳກັດຈຳນວນບັສ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກ ກ່ອນທີ່ປະສິດທິພາບຈະເລີ່ມຫຼຸດລົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:18
msgid "Decibel scale"
msgstr "ມາດຕາສ່ວນເດຊີເບລ (Decibel scale)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:20
msgid ""
"Godot's sound interface is designed to meet the expectations of sound design "
"professionals. To this end, it primarily uses the decibel scale."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເຕີເຟດສຽງຂອງ Godot ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານການອອກແບບສຽ"
"ງ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ສັນຍະລັກເດຊີເບລເປັນຫຼັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:23
msgid "For those unfamiliar with it, it can be explained with a few facts:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບມັນ, ສາມາດອະທິບາຍໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ເທັດຈິງບາງຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:25
msgid ""
"The decibel (dB) scale is a relative scale. It represents the ratio of sound "
"power by using 20 times the base 10 logarithm of the ratio (20 × "
"log\\ :sub:`10`\\ (P/P\\ :sub:`0`\\ ))."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນເດຊີເບລ (dB) ແມ່ນມາດຕາສ່ວນການປຽບທຽບ. ມັນສະແດງເຖິງອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງກຳລັງສຽງໂດຍການໃ"
"ຊ້ 20 ຄູນກັບລໍກາຣິດພື້ນ 10 ຂອງອັດຕາສ່ວນ (20 × log\\ :sub:`10`\\ (P/P\\ :sub:`0`\\ ))."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:28
msgid ""
"For every 6 dB, sound amplitude doubles or halves. 12 dB represents a factor "
"of 4, 18 dB a factor of 8, 20 dB a factor of 10, 40 dB a factor of 100, etc."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ 6 dB, ຄວາມແຮງຂອງສຽງ (amplitude) ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທົ່າຕົວ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ. 12 dB ໝາຍເຖິງ 4 "
"ເທົ່າ, 18 dB ແມ່ນ 8 ເທົ່າ, 20 dB ແມ່ນ 10 ເທົ່າ, 40 dB ແມ່ນ 100 ເທົ່າ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:30
msgid ""
"Since the scale is logarithmic, true zero (no audio) can't be represented."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມາດຕາສ່ວນເປັນແບບລໍກາຣິດ, ຄ່າສູນທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ (ບໍ່ມີສຽງເລີຍ) ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງອອກມາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:31
msgid ""
"0 dB is the maximum amplitude possible in a digital audio system. This limit "
"is not the human limit, but a limit from the sound hardware. Audio with "
"amplitudes that are too high to be represented properly below 0 dB create a "
"kind of distortion called *clipping*."
msgstr ""
"0 dB ແມ່ນຄວາມແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນລະບົບສຽງດິຈິຕອນ. ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງມະນຸດ, ແຕ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"
"ຈາກຮາດແວສຽງ. ສຽງທີ່ມີຄວາມແຮງສູງເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕໍ່າກວ່າ 0 dB ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມ"
"ຜິດພ້ຽນທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ *clipping*."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:35
msgid ""
"To avoid clipping, your sound mix should be arranged so that the output of "
"the *master bus* (more on that later) never exceeds 0 dB."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການ clipping, ການປະສົມສຽງຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນຖືກຈັດການໃຫ້ຜົນອອກຂອງ *ບັສຫຼັກ (master bus)"
"* ບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີນ 0 dB."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:37
msgid ""
"Every 6 dB below the 0 dB limit, sound energy is *halved*. It means the "
"sound volume at -6 dB is half as loud as 0dB. -12 dB is half as loud as -6 "
"dB and so on."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ 6 dB ທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0 dB, ພະລັງງານສຽງຈະ *ຫຼຸດລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ*. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງທີ່ -6 "
"dB ຈະດັງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 0 dB ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ. -12 dB ຈະດັງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ -6 dB ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:40
msgid ""
"When working with decibels, sound is considered no longer audible between "
"-60 dB and -80 dB. This makes your working range generally between -60 dB "
"and 0 dB."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບເດຊີເບລ, ສຽງຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນແລ້ວໃນຊ່ວງລະຫວ່າງ -60 dB ຫາ -80 dB. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັ"
"ດໃຫ້ໄລຍະການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ -60 dB ຫາ 0 dB."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:44
msgid ""
"This can take a bit getting used to, but it's friendlier in the end and will "
"allow you to communicate better with audio professionals."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເວລາປັບຕົວໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ໃນທີ່ສຸດມັນຈະສະດວກກວ່າ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສື່ສານກັບຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານສ"
"ຽງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:50
msgid "Audio buses can be found in the bottom panel of the Godot editor:"
msgstr "ບັສສຽງສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:54
msgid ""
"An *audio bus* (also called an *audio channel*) can be considered a place "
"that audio is channeled through on the way to playback through a device's "
"speakers. Audio data can be *modified* and *re-routed* by an audio bus. An "
"audio bus has a VU meter (the bars that light up when sound is played) which "
"indicates the amplitude of the signal passing through."
msgstr ""
"*ບັສສຽງ* (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າ *ຊ່ອງສຽງ*) ສາມາດປຽບໄດ້ກັບບ່ອນທີ່ສຽງຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຫາລຳໂພງຂອງອຸປະກອນ. ຂໍ້ມູນສ"
"ຽງສາມາດຖືກ *ປ່ຽນແປງ* ແລະ *ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ* ໂດຍບັສສຽງ. ບັສສຽງຈະມີ VU meter (ແຖບໄຟທີ່ຮຸ່ງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ"
"ຫຼິ້ນສຽງ) ເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຄວາມແຮງຂອງສັນຍານທີ່ກຳລັງຜ່ານໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:60
msgid ""
"The leftmost bus is the *master bus*. This bus outputs the mix to your "
"speakers so, as mentioned in the *Decibel scale* section above, make sure "
"that your mix level doesn't reach 0 dB in this bus. The rest of the audio "
"buses can be flexibly routed. After modifying the sound, they send it to "
"another bus to the left. The destination bus can be specified for each of "
"the non-master audio buses. Routing always passes audio from buses on the "
"right to buses further to the left. This avoids infinite routing loops."
msgstr ""
"ບັສທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍສຸດແມ່ນ *ບັສຫຼັກ (master bus)*. ບັສນີ້ຈະສົ່ງສຽງທີ່ປະສົມແລ້ວອອກໄປຫາລຳໂພງຂອງເຈົ້າ, ດັ່"
"ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວໄວ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ *ມາດຕາສ່ວນເດຊີເບລ* ຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະດັບສຽງຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮອດ 0 dB ໃນບັ"
"ສນີ້. ບັສສຽງອື່ນໆທີ່ເຫຼືອສາມາດປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄດ້ຢ່າງຢືດຢຸ່ນ. ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງສຽງແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະສົ່ງສຽງໄປຫາບັ"
"ສອື່ນທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ເຮົາສາມາດລະບຸບັສປາຍທາງໄດ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບັສທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັສຫຼັກ. ການສົ່ງເສັ້ນທາງຈະສົ່ງສຽງຈາກ"
"ບັສທາງດ້ານຂວາໄປຫາບັສທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍສະເໝີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເກີດການວົນຊ້ຳຂອງເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ບໍ່ມີວັນສິ້ນສຸດ "
"(infinite routing loops)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:70
msgid ""
"In the above image, the output of *Bus 2* has been routed to the *Master* "
"bus."
msgstr "ໃນຮູບຂ້າງເທິງ, ຜົນອອກຂອງ *Bus 2* ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາບັສ *Master*."

