"<doc_exporting_for_web_audio_playback>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:99
msgid ""
"Audio buses can contain all sorts of effects. These effects modify the sound "
"in one way or another and are applied in order."
msgstr ""
"ບັສສຽງສາມາດມີເອັບເຟັກໄດ້ທຸກຮູບແບບ. ເອັບເຟັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງສຽງໃນທາງໃດທາງໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຕາມ"
"ລຳດັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:104
msgid "For information on what each effect does, see :ref:`doc_audio_effects`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນວ່າແຕ່ລະເອັບເຟັກເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_audio_effects`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:107
msgid "Automatic bus disabling"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານບັສໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:109
msgid ""
"There is no need to disable buses manually when not in use. Godot detects "
"that the bus has been silent for a few seconds and disables it (including "
"all effects)."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດບັສດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ. Godot ຈະກວດສອບວ່າບັສນັ້ນບໍ່ມີສຽງເປັນເວລາສອງສາມວິນາທີ "
"ແລະ ຈະປິດມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ລວມທັງເອັບເຟັກທັງໝົດ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:115
msgid "Disabled buses have a dark blue VU meter instead of a red-green one."
msgstr "ບັສທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະມີ VU meter ເປັນສີຟ້າເຂັ້ມ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນສີແດງ-ຂຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:118
msgid "Bus rearrangement"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຽງບັສໃໝ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:120
msgid ""
"Stream Players use bus names to identify a bus, which allows adding, "
"removing and moving buses around while the reference to them is kept. "
"However, if a bus is renamed, the reference will be lost and the Stream "
"Player will output to Master. This system was chosen because rearranging "
"buses is a more common process than renaming them."
msgstr ""
"Stream Players ໃຊ້ຊື່ບັສເພື່ອລະບຸບັສ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ, ລົບ ແລະ ຍ້າຍບັສໄປມາໄດ້ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຄົງການ"
"ອ້າງອີງໄວ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າບັສຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່, ການອ້າງອີງຈະຫາຍໄປ ແລະ Stream Player ຈະສົ່ງສຽງອອກໄ"
"ປຫາ Master ແທນ. ລະບົບນີ້ຖືກເລືອກຍ້ອນວ່າການຈັດລຽງບັສໃໝ່ເປັນຂະບວນການທີ່ພົບໄດ້ເລື້ອຍກວ່າການປ່ຽນຊື່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:127
msgid "Default bus layout"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບບັສເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_buses.rst:129
msgid ""
"The default bus layout is automatically saved to the ``res://"
"default_bus_layout.tres`` file. Custom bus arrangements can be saved and "
"loaded from disk."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບບັສເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``res://default_bus_layout.tres`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ກາ"
"ນຈັດວາງບັສແບບກຳນົດເອງສາມາດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ໂຫຼດຈາກດິສໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:4
msgid "Audio effects"
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກສຽງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:6
msgid ""
"Godot includes several audio effects that can be added to an audio bus to "
"alter every sound that goes through that bus."
msgstr ""
"Godot ລວມເອົາເອັບເຟັກສຽງຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນບັສສຽງ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງທຸກສຽງທີ່ຜ່ານບັສນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:11
msgid ""
"Understanding how each effect works can be difficult, so don't feel "
"discouraged if you have to look things up! If you are new to audio, an "
"understanding of the essential effects can help you in most cases! Those are:"
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າແຕ່ລະເອັບເຟັກເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດອາດຈະເປັນເລື່ອງຍາກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຢ່າຟ້າວທໍ້ໃຈຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ! ຖ້າເຈົ້າເປັນມືໃໝ່ກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງສຽງ, ການເຂົ້າໃຈເອັບເຟັກທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເຈົ້າໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍໆກໍລ"
"ະນີ! ເຊິ່ງມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:15
msgid "Equalizer & Filter"
msgstr "ຕົວປັບແຕ່ງສຽງ (Equalizer) ແລະ ຕົວກອງ (Filter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:16
#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:222
msgid "Limiter"
msgstr "ຕົວຈຳກັດສຽງ (Limiter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:17
msgid "Delay & Reverb"
msgstr "ສຽງສະທ້ອນ (Delay) ແລະ ສຽງກ້ອງ (Reverb)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:19
msgid "Try every effect out to get a sense of how they alter sound."
msgstr "ລອງໃຊ້ທຸກເອັບເຟັກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ສຶກວ່າພວກມັນປ່ຽນແປງສຽງແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:23
msgid ":ref:`AudioSample <class_AudioSample>` does not support these effects."
msgstr ":ref:`AudioSample <class_AudioSample>` ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເອັບເຟັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:25
msgid "Here follows short descriptions of the available effects:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:28
msgid "Amplify"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍສຽງ (Amplify)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:30
msgid ""
"Changes the volume of the sound. Some care needs to be taken, though: "
"setting the volume level too high can digitally clip the sound, which can "
"produce unpleasant crackles and pops. Consider using a :ref:`hard limiter "
"<doc_hard_limiter>` or a :ref:`compressor <doc_compressor>` to prevent "
"clipping, or :ref:`distortion <doc_distortion>` on clip mode if clipping at "
"or below 0 dB is desired."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງ: ການຕັ້ງລະດັບຄວາມດັງສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽ"
"ງແຕກ (clip), ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສຽງດັງແປັກໆທີ່ບໍ່ເພາະຫູ. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ :ref:`hard limiter "
"<doc_hard_limiter>` ຫຼື :ref:`compressor <doc_compressor>` ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສຽງແຕກ, ຫຼື ໃ"
"ຊ້ :ref:`distortion <doc_distortion>` ໃນໂໝດ clip ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກທີ່ລະດັບ 0 dB ຫຼື "
"ຕ່ຳກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:40
msgid "BandLimitFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຈຳກັດຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ (BandLimitFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:42
msgid ""
"A \"band-limit\" filter attenuates the frequencies at the *cutoff* point, "
"and allows frequencies outside of that point to pass unchanged. It is "
"similar to the :ref:`notch filter <doc_notch_filter>`, but weaker. It is the "
"opposite of the :ref:`band-pass filter <doc_band_pass_filter>`. This filter "
"can be used to give more room for other sounds to play at the cutoff point."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"band-limit\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດ *cutoff*, ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຈຸດນັ້"
"ນຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ. ມັນຄ້າຍຄືກັບ :ref:`notch filter <doc_notch_filter>`, ແຕ່ເບົາກວ່"
"າ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ :ref:`band-pass filter <doc_band_pass_filter>`. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບສຽງອື່ນໆໃນຈຸດຄວາມຖີ່ cutoff ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:51
msgid "BandPassFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຜ່ານຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ (BandPassFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:53
msgid ""
"A \"band-pass\" filter allow frequencies at the *cutoff* point to pass "
"unchanged, and attenuates frequencies outside of that point. It is the "
"opposite of the :ref:`band-limit filter <doc_band_limit_filter>` "
"and :ref:`notch filter <doc_notch_filter>`. This filter can be used to "
"simulate sounds passing through an old telephone line or megaphone. "
"Modulating the cutoff point can simulate the sound of a wah-wah guitar "
"pedal, think of the guitar in Jimi Hendrix's *Voodoo Child (Slight Return)*."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"band-pass\" ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດ *cutoff* ຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮ"
"ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຈຸດນັ້ນ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ :ref:`band-limit filter "
"<doc_band_limit_filter>` ແລະ :ref:`notch filter <doc_notch_filter>`. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງສຽງທີ່ຜ່ານສາຍໂທລະສັບເກົ່າ ຫຼື ໂທລະໂຄ່ງ. ການປັບປ່ຽນຈຸດ cutoff ສາມາດຈຳລອງສຽງຂອ"
"ງ pedals wah-wah ຂອງກີຕ້າໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:62
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:145
msgid "Capture"
msgstr "ຈັບສັນຍານ (Capture)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:64
msgid ""
"Copies the audio samples of the audio bus that this effect is attached to "
"into an internal ring buffer. This can be used to capture data from the "
"microphone or to transmit audio over the network in real-time. In general, "
"it can be used to store real-time audio data for playback, and even to "
"create real-time audio visualization, like an oscilloscope. This effect does "
"not alter the audio."
msgstr ""
"ຄັດລອກຕົວຢ່າງສຽງຂອງບັສສຽງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ຕິດຢູ່ ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ ring buffer ພາຍໃນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັບຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ ຫຼື ເພື່ອສົ່ງສຽງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບເວລາຈິງ (real-time). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເ"
"ພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຽງແບບເວລາຈິງສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນຄືນ, ແລະ ແມ່ນແຕ່ສ້າງການສະແດງຜົນສຽງແບບເວລາຈິງ ເຊັ່ນ "
"oscilloscope. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງສຽງແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:72
msgid "Chorus"
msgstr "ຄໍຣັສ (Chorus)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:74
msgid ""
"A \"chorus\" effect duplicates a signal and very slightly alters the timing "
"and pitch of each duplicate, and modulates them over time via an LFO (low-"
"frequency oscillator). The duplicates (also called \"voices\") are then "
"mixed back together with the original signal, giving the impression that the "
"sound comes from multiple sources. In the real world, this kind of effect is "
"found in pianos, choirs, and instrument ensembles. This effect can also be "
"used to widen mono audio and make digital sounds have a more natural or "
"analog quality."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"chorus\" ຈະເຮັດການສຳເນົາສັນຍານ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງເວລາ ແລະ ລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ຂອງແຕ່"
"ລະສຳເນົາພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແລ້ວປັບປ່ຽນພວກມັນຕາມເວລາຜ່ານ LFO. ຈາກນັ້ນສຳເນົາ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"voices\") "
"ຈະຖືກປະສົມກັບຄືນເຂົ້າກັບສັນຍານຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກວ່າສຽງນັ້ນມາຈາກຫຼາຍແຫຼ່ງ. ໃນໂລກແຫ່ງຄວາມເປັ"
"ນຈິງ, ເອັບເຟັກປະເພດນີ້ພົບໄດ້ໃນເປຍໂນ, ຄະນະນັກຮ້ອງປະສານສຽງ, ແລະ ວົງດົນຕີ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເ"
"ພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງແບບໂມໂນ (mono) ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງດິຈິຕອນມີຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ຫຼື ເປັນແບບ"
"ອານາລັອກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:86
msgid "Compressor"
msgstr "ຕົວບີບອັດສຽງ (Compressor)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:88
msgid ""
"A \"compressor\" automatically attenuates (or \"ducks\") the volume of the "
"input signal when its amplitude exceeds a certain volume threshold. The "
"amount of attenuation applied is proportional to how far the input audio "
"exceeds the threshold. The compressor's Ratio parameter controls the degree "
"of attenuation. One of the main uses of a compressor is to reduce the "
"dynamic range of signals with very loud and quiet parts. Reducing the "
"dynamic range of a signal can make it fit more comfortably in a mix."
msgstr ""
"\"compressor\" ຈະຫຼຸດລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສັນຍານຂາເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຄວາມແຮງຂອງມັນເກີນຂີດຈຳກັ"
"ດ (threshold) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຈຳນວນການຫຼຸດສຽງຈະເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບລະດັບທີ່ສຽງນັ້ນເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ພາຣາມີເຕີ "
"Ratio ຂອງຄອມເພຣສເຊີຈະຄວບຄຸມລະດັບການຫຼຸດສຽງ. ຫນຶ່ງໃນການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັກຂອງຄອມເພຣສເຊີຄືການຫຼຸດລະດັບຄວ"
"າມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສຽງ (dynamic range) ທີ່ມີທັງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ດັງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍຫຼາຍ. ການຫຼຸດ dynamic "
"range ຂອງສັນຍານຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນເຂົ້າກັບການປະສົມສຽງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:96
msgid "The compressor has many uses. For example:"
msgstr "ຄອມເພຣສເຊີມີການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:98
msgid ""
"It can be used in the Master bus to compress the whole output before it hits "
"a limiter's ceiling, which makes the effect of the limiter much more subtle."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ Master bus ເພື່ອບີບອັດຜົນອອກທັງໝົດກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະໄປຮອດເພດານຂອງ limiter, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັ"
"ດໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກຂອງ limiter ມີຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:100
msgid "It can be used in voice clips to ensure they sound as even as possible."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຄລິບສຽງເວົ້າເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນມີລະດັບສຽງທີ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:101
msgid ""
"It can be *sidechained* by another sound source. This means it can reduce "
"the volume of one signal by using the volume of another audio bus for "
"threshold detection. This technique is very common in video game mixing to "
"\"duck\" the volume of music or sound effects when in-game or multiplayer "
"voices need to be fully audible."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດເຮັດ *sidechained* ໂດຍແຫຼ່ງສຽງອື່ນໄດ້. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນສາມາດຫຼຸດລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສັນຍາ"
"ນໜຶ່ງໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄວາມດັງຂອງບັສສຽງອື່ນໃນການກວດສອບ threshold. ເຕັກນິກນີ້ພົບເລື້ອຍຫຼາຍໃນການປະສົມສຽງ"
"ເກມເພື່ອ \"ຫຼົບ\" (duck) ຄວາມດັງຂອງເພງ ຫຼື ເອັບເຟັກສຽງ ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງເວົ້າໃນເກມ ຫຼື ສຽ"
"ງເວົ້າຈາກຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຄົນອື່ນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:106
msgid ""
"It can accentuate *transients* by using a slower attack, which lets louder "
"parts go through before they are compressed. This can emphasize the "
"\"punchiness\" of sound effects."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດເນັ້ນ *transients* ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄ່າ attack ທີ່ຊ້າລົງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ດັງກວ່າຜ່ານໄປກ່ອ"
"ນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກບີບອັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເນັ້ນຄວາມ \"ໜັກແໜ້ນ\" ຂອງເອັບເຟັກສຽງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:112
msgid ""
"If your goal is solely to prevent a signal from exceeding a given amplitude "
"altogether, a :ref:`hard limiter <doc_hard_limiter>` is likely a better "
"choice than a compressor for this purpose. However, applying compression "
"before a limiter is still good practice."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງເຈົ້າຄືການປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສັນຍານເກີນຄວາມແຮງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, :ref:`hard limiter "
"<doc_hard_limiter>` ອາດຈະເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີກວ່າຄອມເພຣສເຊີສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການໃຊ້"
"ຄອມເພຣສເຊີກ່ອນ limiter ກໍຍັງເປັນວິທີການທີ່ດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:120
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "ດີເລ/ສຽງສະທ້ອນ (Delay)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:122
msgid ""
"A \"delay\" effect duplicates a signal and repeats it multiple times, with a "
"short period of time between each repetition (also called \"tap\"). Taps "
"decay in volume over time. All of this creates an echo effect. Delay is "
"great to simulate the acoustic space of a canyon or large room, where sound "
"bounces off of surfaces and arrives at the listener after some *delay*. This "
"is similar to :ref:`reverb <doc_reverb>`, which has a more natural and "
"blurred sound to it. Using delay in conjunction with reverb can create very "
"natural sounding environments."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"delay\" ຈະສຳເນົາສັນຍານ ແລະ ຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ, ໂດຍມີໄລຍະເວລາສັ້ນໆລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ (ເອີ້ນ"
"ວ່າ \"tap\"). ສຽງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳຈະຄ່ອຍໆຄ່ອຍລົງຕາມເວລາ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສ້າງເອັບເຟັກສຽງສະທ້ອນ (echo). "
"Delay ເໝາະສຳລັບການຈຳລອງພື້ນທີ່ສຽງຂອງຫຸບເຂົາ ຫຼື ຫ້ອງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ບ່ອນທີ່ສຽງຕົກກະທົບກັບພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ມ"
"າຮອດຜູ້ຟັງຫຼັງຈາກມີການ *delay*. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ :ref:`reverb <doc_reverb>`, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີສຽງທີ່ເປັນ"
"ທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ຟັງເບິ່ງມົວໆກວ່າ. ການໃຊ້ delay ຮ່ວມກັບ reverb ສາມາດສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຽງທີ່ຟັງເບິ່"
"ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:134
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "ສຽງແຕກພ້ຽນ (Distortion)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:136
msgid ""
"A \"distortion\" effect modifies the volume of the sound in a way that "
"changes its waveform, which can result in a \"harsh\" and \"bright\" sound."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"distortion\" ຈະປ່ຽນແປງລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ປ່ຽນຮູບຄື້ນຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດສົ່ງຜົ"
"ນໃຫ້ເກີດສຽງທີ່ \"ແຂງ\" ແລະ \"ສະຫວ່າງ\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:139
msgid "Here are some of the distortion types that Godot offers:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງປະເພດຂອງ distortion ທີ່ Godot ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:141
msgid "*Clip*: clamps the volume of the sound, which makes it sound harsh."
msgstr "*Clip*: ຕັດລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຟັງເບິ່ງແຂງກະດ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:142
msgid "*Overdrive*: sounds like a guitar distortion pedal or megaphone."
msgstr "*Overdrive*: ໃຫ້ສຽງຄືກັບ pedal distortion ຂອງກີຕ້າ ຫຼື ໂທລະໂຄ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:143
msgid "*Lo-fi*: reduces the *bit depth* of the signal, emulating old speakers."
msgstr "*Lo-fi*: ຫຼຸດ *bit depth* ຂອງສັນຍານ, ຈຳລອງລຳໂພງເກົ່າໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:145
msgid ""
"All types of distortion can add higher frequencies to the original sound, "
"which helps it stand out better in a mix."
msgstr ""
"ການບິດເບືອນທຸກປະເພດສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ກັບສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນໂດດເດັ່ນຂຶ້ນໃນການມິກສຽ"
"ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:150
msgid ""
"Be careful with the amount of distortion added, as it can create very harsh "
"and loud sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນລະມັດລະວັງກັບປະລິມານ distortion ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ, ເພາະມັນສາມາດສ້າງສຽງທີ່ແຂງ ແລະ ດັງຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:154
msgid "EQ"
msgstr "ຕົວປັບແຕ່ງສຽງ (EQ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:156
msgid ""
"An \"equalizer\" gives you control over the gain of frequencies in the "
"entire spectrum, through the use of \"bands\" which represent different "
"regions of the spectrum. Equalizers can be essential to achieve a cleaner "
"mix, allowing multiple sounds to play together without frequencies competing "
"with each other. An equalizer on the Master bus can be useful to attenuate "
"low and high frequencies that the device's speakers can't reproduce well. "
"For example, phone and tablet speakers usually don't reproduce low frequency "
"sounds well, and could make a limiter or compressor attenuate the Master "
"volume more than necessary. This effect can be disabled when headphones are "
"plugged in, which gives the user the best of both worlds."
msgstr ""
"\"equalizer\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງ (gain) ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ໃນທຸກຢ່ານ, ຜ່ານການໃຊ້ "
"\"bands\" ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່າງໆ. ອີຄິວໄຊເຊີແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການປະສົມສຽງທີ່ສະອາດ, "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຫຼາຍສຽງຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍທີ່ຄວາມຖີ່ບໍ່ຕີກັນ. EQ ໃນ Master bus ສາມາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່"
"ຳ ແລະ ສູງທີ່ລຳໂພງຂອງອຸປະກອນບໍ່ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ດີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ລຳໂພງໂທລະສັບ ແລະ ແທັບເລັດປົກກະຕິຈ"
"ະຫຼິ້ນສຽງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳໄດ້ບໍ່ດີ, ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ limiter ຫຼື compressor ຫຼຸດຄວາມດັງຂອງ Master ຫຼາຍເກີ"
"ນຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ເມື່ອສຽບຫູຟັງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮັບຄຸນນະພາບສຽງທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນທັງສອງກໍ"
"ລະນີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:169
msgid ""
"This audio effect is what all other equalizers inherit from. It can be "
"extended with custom scripts to create an equalizer with a custom number of "
"bands."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກສຽງນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ອີຄິວໄຊເຊີອື່ນໆທັງໝົດສືບທອດມາ. ມັນສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບເພື່ອສ້າງອີຄິວໄຊເຊີທີ່ມີ"
"ຈຳນວນແບນ (bands) ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:174
msgid "EQ6, EQ10, EQ21"
msgstr "EQ6, EQ10, EQ21"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:176
msgid ""
"Godot provides three equalizers with different numbers of bands, which are "
"represented in the title (6, 10, and 21 bands, respectively)."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີອີຄິວໄຊເຊີໃຫ້ 3 ແບບ ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນແບນແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຊື່ (6, 10, ແລະ 21 ແບນ ຕາ"
"ມລຳດັບ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:182
msgid ""
"A \"filter\" controls the gain of frequencies, through the use of a *cutoff* "
"as a frequency threshold. It differs from an equalizer in that it uses "
"different \"shapes\" to control frequencies; meaning frequencies will have "
"their gain adjusted whether they are lower, higher, at, or outside the "
"cutoff point, depending on the filter type. Filters can help give room to "
"each sound and create interesting effects."
msgstr ""
"\"filter\" ຈະຄວບຄຸມລະດັບ gain ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່, ຜ່ານການໃຊ້ *cutoff* ເປັນຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມຖີ່. ມັນແຕກ"
"ຕ່າງຈາກອີຄິວໄຊເຊີບ່ອນທີ່ມັນໃຊ້ \"ຮູບຮ່າງ\" (shapes) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນການຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຖີ່; ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ"
"ວາມຖີ່ຈະຖືກປັບ gain ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະຕ່ຳກວ່າ, ສູງກວ່າ, ຢູ່ທີ່ ຫຼື ຢູ່ນອກຈຸດ cutoff, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງຕົວກອ"
"ງ. ຕົວກອງສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສຽງ ແລະ ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:191
msgid ""
"This audio effect is what all other filters inherit from. It should not be "
"used directly."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກສຽງນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຕົວກອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດສືບທອດມາ. ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ງານມັນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:197
msgid "HardLimiter"
msgstr "ຕົວຈຳກັດສຽງແບບແຂງ (HardLimiter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:199
msgid ""
"A \"limiter\" disallows audio signals from exceeding a given volume "
"threshold level. Hard limiters predict volume peaks, and will smoothly apply "
"gain reduction when the volume crosses the ceiling threshold level. It works "
"similarly to a compressor, but is designed to not let the volume cross a "
"certain volume level at all. Adding a limiter as the last effect of the "
"Master bus is good practice, as it offers an easy safeguard against "
"clipping. If clipping is desired, consider using the :ref:`distortion "
"<doc_distortion>` effect on clip mode."
msgstr ""
"\"limiter\" ຈະບໍ່ຍອມໃຫ້ສັນຍານສຽງເກີນລະດັບ threshold ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. Hard limiters ຈະຄາດການ"
"ຈຸດສູງສຸດຂອງຄວາມດັງ, ແລະ ຈະຫຼຸດ gain ຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນເມື່ອຄວາມດັງຂ້າມລະດັບເພດານ (ceiling). ມັນເຮັດ"
"ວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບຄອມເພຣສເຊີ, ແຕ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມດັງຂ້າມລະດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເລີຍ. ການເພີ່ມ "
"limiter ເປັນເອັບເຟັກສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ Master bus ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ດີ, ເພາະມັນເປັນການປ້ອງກັນສຽງແຕກ "
"(clipping). ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກ, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ :ref:`distortion <doc_distortion>"
"` ໃນໂໝດ clip."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:209
msgid "HighPassFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຜ່ານ (HighPassFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:211
msgid ""
"A \"high-pass\" filter attenuates frequencies lower than the *cutoff* point "
"and allows higher frequencies to pass unchanged. This filter can be used to "
"remove the bass content of a signal, making it sound \"thinner\"."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"high-pass\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈຸດ *cutoff* ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍ"
"ບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົບສຽງເບສອອກຈາກສັນຍານ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຟັງເບິ່ງ \"ບາງ\" ລົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:216
msgid "HighShelfFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຍົກຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ (HighShelfFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:218
msgid ""
"A \"high-shelf\" filter controls the gain of all frequencies above the "
"*cutoff* point. This filter can be used to increase or decrease clarity of a "
"sound."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"high-shelf\" ຈະຄວບຄຸມ gain ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອຈຸດ *cutoff*. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງສຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:226
msgid ""
"This is the old limiter effect, and it is recommended to use the "
"new :ref:`hard limiter <doc_hard_limiter>` effect instead. This effect is "
"kept to preserve compatibility, however it should be considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເອັບເຟັກ limiter ແບບເກົ່າ, ແລະ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ :ref:`hard limiter "
"<doc_hard_limiter>` ໃໝ່ແທນ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້, ແຕ່ຄວນຖືວ່າມັນລ້າສະໄໝ"
"ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:230
msgid ""
"Here is an example of how this effect works: if the ceiling is set to -12 "
"dB, and the threshold is 0 dB, all samples going through get reduced by 12 "
"dB. This changes the waveform of the sound and introduces distortion."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເອັບເຟັກນີ້: ຖ້າຕັ້ງເພດານ (ceiling) ໄວ້ທີ່ -12 dB, ແລະ threshold ແ"
"ມ່ນ 0 dB, ທຸກສຽງທີ່ຜ່ານໄປຈະຖືກຫຼຸດລົງ 12 dB. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຄື້ນຂອງສຽງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"distortion."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:235
msgid "LowPassFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳຜ່ານ (LowPassFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:237
msgid ""
"A \"low-pass\" filter attenuates frequencies higher than the *cutoff* point "
"and allows lower frequencies to pass unchanged. Low pass filters can be used "
"to simulate \"muffled\" sounds. For instance, underwater sounds, sounds "
"blocked by walls, or distant sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"low-pass\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈຸດ *cutoff* ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່"
"ປ່ຽນແປງ. Low pass filters ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງສຽງທີ່ \"ອູອີ້\". ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ສຽງໃຕ້ນ້ຳ, ສຽງທີ່ຖື"
"ກກຳແພງບັງ, ຫຼື ສຽງທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:243
msgid "LowShelfFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຍົກຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (LowShelfFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:245
msgid ""
"A \"low-shelf\" filter controls the gain of all frequencies below the "
"*cutoff* point. This filter can be used to adjust the \"strength\" of a "
"sound, by increasing or decreasing the gain of the bass range."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"low-shelf\" ຈະຄວບຄຸມ gain ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈຸດ *cutoff*. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສາມາດໃ"
"ຊ້ເພື່ອປັບ \"ຄວາມໜັກແໜ້ນ\" ຂອງສຽງ, ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດ gain ຂອງຢ່ານສຽງເບສ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:252
msgid "NotchFilter"
msgstr "ຕົວກອງຕັດບາງຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ (NotchFilter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:254
msgid ""
"A \"notch\" filter attenuates the frequencies at the *cutoff* point, and "
"allows frequencies outside of that point to pass unchanged. It is the "
"opposite of the :ref:`band-pass filter <doc_band_pass_filter>`. This filter "
"can be used to give more room for other sounds to play at the cutoff point. "
"Because of how much it attenuates frequencies, it can also be used to "
"completely remove very specific and undesired frequencies."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງ \"notch\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດ *cutoff*, ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ນອກຈຸດນັ້ນຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແ"
"ປງ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ :ref:`band-pass filter <doc_band_pass_filter>`. ຕົວກອງນີ້ສ"
"າມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບສຽງອື່ນໆໃນຈຸດ cutoff. ຍ້ອນມັນຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົບຄວາມ"
"ຖີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງອອກໄດ້ທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:262
msgid "Panner"
msgstr "ຕົວແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ (Panner)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:264
msgid ""
"Moves the sound to the left or right. Headphones are recommended when "
"configuring this effect."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍສຽງໄປທາງຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ຂວາ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຫູຟັງໃນເວລາຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:269
msgid ""
"This effect may not be necessary with :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer2D "
"<class_AudioStreamPlayer2D>` and :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer3D "
"<class_AudioStreamPlayer3D>`, since they handle panning automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer2D <class_AudioStreamPlayer2D>"
"` ແລະ :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer3D <class_AudioStreamPlayer3D>`, ເພາະວ່າພວກມັນຈັດກາ"
"ນການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:275
msgid "Phaser"
msgstr "ເຟເຊີ (Phaser)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:277
msgid ""
"A \"phaser\" effect creates a copy that is out-of-phase and mixes back "
"together with the original. The copy is then modulated by an LFO (low-"
"frequency oscillator), which makes some frequencies cancel each other out in "
"interesting ways. The result of that is a series of peaks and troughs that "
"sweep across the spectrum. This effect can be used to create sci-fi effects "
"or Darth Vader-like voices."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"phaser\" ຈະສ້າງສຳເນົາສຽງທີ່ເຟສບໍ່ກົງກັນ ແລະ ປະສົມກັບຄືນເຂົ້າກັບສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຈາກນັ້ນສຳເ"
"ນົາຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍ LFO, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງຄວາມຖີ່ຫັກລ້າງກັນໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຄືຊຸດຂອງສຽງທີ່ສູງ-"
"ຕ່ຳທີ່ກວາດຜ່ານຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສຽງແບບໄຊ-ໄຟ (sci-fi) ຫຼື ສຽງຄືກັບ Darth "
"Vader."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:285
msgid "PitchShift"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ (PitchShift)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:287
msgid ""
"Allows the adjustment of the signal's pitch independently of its speed. All "
"frequencies can be raised or lowered with minimal effect on *transients*. "
"This effect can be useful to create unusually high or deep voices. Do note "
"that altering pitch can sound unnatural when pushed outside of a narrow "
"window."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ຂອງສັນຍານໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວ. ທຸກຄວາມຖີ່ສາມາດຖືກປັບໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນ "
"ຫຼື ຕ່ຳລົງ ໂດຍມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ *transients* ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງສຽງທີ່ສູງຜິດປົກກະຕິ "
"ຫຼື ສຽງທີ່ທຸ້ມເລິກ. ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າການປ່ຽນ pitch ອາດຈະຟັງເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດໄດ້ຖ້າປັບປ່ຽນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:293
msgid "Record"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສຽງ (Record)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:295
msgid ""
"Stores audio data into an :ref:`AudioStreamWAV <class_AudioStreamWAV>`. One "
"usage example of this effect is to record microphone input and save as a WAV "
"file."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຽງລົງໃນ :ref:`AudioStreamWAV <class_AudioStreamWAV>`. ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັ"
"ກນີ້ຄືການບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ WAV."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:302
msgid "Reverb"
msgstr "ຣີເວີບ/ສຽງກ້ອງ (Reverb)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:304
msgid ""
"A \"reverb\" effect plays a copy of the input audio back continuously, which "
"decays over a period of time, and creates a blurry echo effect (or "
"\"reverberation\"). Reverb is great to simulate sounds in different kinds of "
"spaces, which can range from small rooms to big caverns. This is similar "
"to :ref:`delay <doc_delay>`, which has a less blurry sound to it. Using "
"reverb in conjunction with delay can create very natural sounding "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"reverb\" ຈະຫຼິ້ນສຳເນົາຂອງສັນຍານຂາເຂົ້າຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປຕາມເວລາ, ແ"
"ລະ ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກສຽງສະທ້ອນທີ່ມົວໆ (ຫຼື \"reverberation\"). Reverb ເໝາະສຳລັບການຈຳລອງສຽງໃນພື້"
"ນທີ່ຕ່າງໆ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຫ້ອງນ້ອຍໆໄປຈົນຮອດຖ້ຳໃຫຍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ :ref:`delay <doc_delay>`, ແຕ່ຈະມີສຽງ"
"ທີ່ມົວກວ່າ. ການໃຊ້ reverb ຮ່ວມກັບ delay ສາມາດສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຽງທີ່ຟັງເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:311
msgid ""
"Reverb is commonly outputted from :ref:`Area3Ds <class_Area3D>` "
"(see :ref:`Reverb buses <doc_audio_streams_reverb_buses>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reverb ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນມາຈາກ :ref:`Area3Ds <class_Area3D>` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Reverb buses "
"<doc_audio_streams_reverb_buses>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:315
msgid "SpectrumAnalyzer"
msgstr "ຕົວວິເຄາະຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ (SpectrumAnalyzer)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:317
msgid ""
"Plots the amplitude of the audio signal within specified frequency ranges. "
"This would typically be used for real-time audio visualization, like a "
"spectrogram. Visualizing voices can be a great way to draw attention to them "
"without increasing their volume. This effect does not alter audio."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄວາມແຮງ (amplitude) ຂອງສັນຍານສຽງພາຍໃນຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ"
"ານສະແດງຜົນສຽງແບບເວລາຈິງ ເຊັ່ນ spectrogram. ການສະແດງຜົນສຽງເປັນພາບແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການດຶງດູດຄວາ"
"ມສົນໃຈໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄວາມດັງ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງສຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:324
msgid ""
"Accessing :ref:`AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance "
"<class_AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance>` is necessary to make use of "
"this effect. A demo project using this can be found `here <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/audio/spectrum>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງ :ref:`AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance "
"<class_AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance>` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກນີ້. ສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໂປ"
"ຣເຈັກໄດ້ທີ່ `ບ່ອນນີ້ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/audio/spectrum>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:330
msgid "StereoEnhance"
msgstr "ຕົວເສີມສຽງສະເຕີຣິໂອ (StereoEnhance)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_effects.rst:332
msgid ""
"Adjusts the gain of the left and right channels, and makes mono sounds "
"stereo through phase shift. This can be used to widen or narrow a sound. "
"Headphones are recommended when configuring this effect."
msgstr ""
"ປັບ gain ຂອງຊ່ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ, ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງໂມໂນກາຍເປັນສະເຕີຣິໂອຜ່ານການປ່ຽນເຟສ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາ"
"ດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ແຄບລົງ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຫູຟັງໃນເວລາຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:6
msgid "Audio streams"
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມສຽງ (Audio streams)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:11
msgid ""
"As you might have already read in :ref:`doc_audio_buses`, sound is sent to "
"each bus via an AudioStreamPlayer node. There are different kinds of "
"AudioStreamPlayers. Each one loads an AudioStream and plays it back."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຄີຍອ່ານໃນ :ref:`doc_audio_buses` ແລ້ວ, ສຽງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາແຕ່ລະບັສຜ່ານໂນດ "
"AudioStreamPlayer. ມັນມີ AudioStreamPlayer ຫຼາຍປະເພດ. ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະໂຫຼດ AudioStream ແລ"
"ະ ຫຼິ້ນມັນອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:16
msgid "AudioStream"
msgstr "ອໍດິໂອສະຕຣີມ (AudioStream)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:18
msgid ""
"An audio stream is an abstract object that emits sound. The sound can come "
"from many places, but is most commonly loaded from the filesystem. Audio "
"files can be loaded as AudioStreams and placed inside an AudioStreamPlayer. "
"You can find information on supported formats and differences "
"in :ref:`doc_importing_audio_samples`."
msgstr ""
"ອໍດິໂອສະຕຣີມ (audio stream) ແມ່ນວັດຖຸນາມມະທຳທີ່ສົ່ງສຽງອອກມາ. ສຽງສາມາດມາຈາກຫຼາຍບ່ອນ, ແຕ່ສ່ວນ"
"ຫຼາຍແມ່ນໂຫຼດມາຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ໄຟລ໌ສຽງສາມາດຖືກໂຫຼດເປັນ AudioStreams ແລະ ວາງໄວ້ໃນ "
"AudioStreamPlayer. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໄດ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_importing_audio_samples`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:23
msgid ""
"There are other types of AudioStreams, such "
"as :ref:`AudioStreamRandomizer<class_AudioStreamRandomizer>`. This one picks "
"a different audio stream from a list of streams each time it's played back, "
"and applies random pitch and volume shifting. This can be helpful for adding "
"variation to sounds that are played back often."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີ AudioStreams ປະເພດອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
":ref:`AudioStreamRandomizer<class_AudioStreamRandomizer>`. ຕົວນີ້ຈະເລືອກສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່"
"ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຈາກລາຍຊື່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ pitch ແລະ ຄວາມດັງແບບສຸ່ມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນ"
"ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃຫ້ກັບສຽງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳເລື້ອຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:29
msgid "AudioStreamPlayer"
msgstr "AudioStreamPlayer (ຕົວຫຼິ້ນສຽງທົ່ວໄປ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:33
msgid ""
"This is the standard, non-positional stream player. It can play to any bus. "
"In 5.1 sound setups, it can send audio to stereo mix or front speakers."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຫຼິ້ນສຽງມາດຕະຖານແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງ. ມັນສາມາດຫຼິ້ນຜ່ານບັສໃດກໍໄດ້. ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງ 5.1, ມັນສາມ"
"າດສົ່ງສຽງໄປຫາການປະສົມແບບສະເຕີຣິໂອ ຫຼື ລຳໂພງຄູ່ໜ້າໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:39
msgid ""
"Playback Type is an experimental setting, and could change in future "
"versions of Godot. It exists so Web exports use Web Audio-API based samples "
"instead of streaming all sounds to the browser, unlike most platforms. This "
"prevents the audio from being garbled in single-threaded Web exports. By "
"default, only the Web platform will use samples. Changing this setting is "
"not recommended, unless you have an explicit reason to. You can change the "
"default playback type for the web and other platforms in the project "
"settings under **Audio > General** (advanced settings must be turned on to "
"see the setting)."
msgstr ""
"Playback Type ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບທົດລອງ ແລະ ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດຂອງ Godot. ມັນມີໄວ້ເ"
"ພື່ອໃຫ້ການສົ່ງອອກໄປເວັບໃຊ້ samples ທີ່ອີງຕາມ Web Audio-API ແທນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງສຽງທັງໝົດເປັນແບບສະຕຣີມໄປ"
"ຫາບຣາວເຊີ ຄືກັບແພລັດຟອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສຽງຜິດພ້ຽນໃນການສົ່ງອອກໄປເວັບແບບ single-"
"threaded. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ແພລັດຟອມເວັບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ samples. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ນີ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ເຈົ້າມີເຫດຜົນສະເພາະ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນປະເພດການຫຼິ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບເວັບ ແລະ ແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆໄດ້"
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກພາຍໃຕ້ **Audio > General** (ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:49
msgid "AudioStreamPlayer2D"
msgstr "AudioStreamPlayer2D (ຕົວຫຼິ້ນສຽງແບບ 2D)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:53
msgid ""
"This is a variant of AudioStreamPlayer, but emits sound in a 2D positional "
"environment. When close to the left of the screen, the panning will go left. "
"When close to the right side, it will go right."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງ AudioStreamPlayer, ແຕ່ສົ່ງສຽງອອກມາໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ 2D. ເມື່ອ"
"ຢູ່ໃກ້ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ສຽງຈະອອກທາງຊ້າຍ. ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃກ້ທາງດ້ານຂວາ, ສຽງຈະອອກທາງຂວາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:59
msgid ""
"Area2Ds can be used to divert sound from any AudioStreamPlayer2Ds they "
"contain to specific buses. This makes it possible to create buses with "
"different reverb or sound qualities to handle action happening in a "
"particular parts of your game world."
msgstr ""
"Area2D ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງສຽງຈາກ AudioStreamPlayer2D ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນນັ້ນໄປຫາບັສສະເພາະໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້"
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງບັສທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສຽງ ຫຼື ຣີເວີບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບເຫດການທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອ"
"ງໂລກເກມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:67
msgid "AudioStreamPlayer3D"
msgstr "AudioStreamPlayer3D (ຕົວຫຼິ້ນສຽງແບບ 3D)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:71
msgid ""
"This is a variant of AudioStreamPlayer, but emits sound in a 3D positional "
"environment. Depending on the location of the player relative to the screen, "
"it can position sound in stereo, 5.1 or 7.1 depending on the chosen audio "
"setup."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງ AudioStreamPlayer, ແຕ່ສົ່ງສຽງອອກມາໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ 3D. ມັນສ"
"າມາດລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງສຽງເປັນແບບສະເຕີຣິໂອ, 5.1 ຫຼື 7.1 ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນທຽບກັບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າສຽງທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:75
msgid ""
"Similar to AudioStreamPlayer2D, an Area3D can divert the sound to an audio "
"bus."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ AudioStreamPlayer2D, ໂນດ Area3D ສາມາດປ່ຽນທິດທາງສຽງໄປຫາບັສສຽງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:79
msgid ""
"Unlike for 2D, the 3D version of AudioStreamPlayer has a few more advanced "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກແບບ 2D, AudioStreamPlayer ເວີຊັນ 3D ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກຂັ້ນສູງຫຼາຍກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:84
msgid "Reverb buses"
msgstr "ບັສຣີເວີບ (Reverb buses)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:96
msgid ""
"Godot allows for 3D audio streams that enter a specific Area3D node to send "
"dry and wet audio to separate buses. This is useful when you have several "
"reverb configurations for different types of rooms. This is done by enabling "
"this type of reverb in the **Reverb Bus** section of the Area3D's properties:"
msgstr ""
"Godot ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະຕຣີມສຽງ 3D ທີ່ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂນດ Area3D ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ ສາມາດສົ່ງສຽງແບບ dry (ສຽ"
"ງດິບ) ແລະ wet (ສຽງທີ່ໃສ່ເອັບເຟັກແລ້ວ) ໄປຫາບັສທີ່ແຍກກັນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຈົ້າມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຣີເວີບຫຼາ"
"ຍແບບສຳລັບຫ້ອງແຕ່ລະປະເພດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ຣີເວີບປະເພດນີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ **Reverb Bus** ຂອ"
"ງຄຸນສົມບັດ Area3D:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:103
msgid ""
"At the same time, a special bus layout is created where each Area3D receives "
"the reverb info from each Area3D. A Reverb effect needs to be created and "
"configured in each reverb bus to complete the setup for the desired effect:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, ຈະມີການສ້າງຮູບແບບບັສພິເສດບ່ອນທີ່ແຕ່ລະ Area3D ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຣີເວີບຈາກແຕ່ລະ "
"Area3D. ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກ Reverb ໃນແຕ່ລະບັສຣີເວີບເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກທີ່ຕ້ອງກ"
"ານຄົບຖ້ວນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:109
msgid ""
"The Area3D's **Reverb Bus** section also has a parameter named "
"**Uniformity**. Some types of rooms bounce sounds more than others (like a "
"warehouse), so reverberation can be heard almost uniformly across the room "
"even though the source may be far away. Playing around with this parameter "
"can simulate that effect."
msgstr ""
"ພາກສ່ວນ **Reverb Bus** ຂອງ Area3D ຍັງມີພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ **Uniformity**. ຫ້ອງບາງປະເພດຈະ"
"ສະທ້ອນສຽງຫຼາຍກວ່າຫ້ອງອື່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ສາງສິນຄ້າ), ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຣີເວີບສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີທົ່ວທັງຫ້ອງ ເຖິ"
"ງແມ່ນວ່າແຫຼ່ງສຽງຈະຢູ່ໄກກໍຕາມ. ການປັບຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຈຳລອງເອັບເຟັກນັ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:116
msgid "Doppler"
msgstr "ດັອບເປລີ (Doppler)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:128
msgid ""
"When the relative velocity between an emitter and listener changes, this is "
"perceived as an increase or decrease in the pitch of the emitted sound. "
"Godot can track velocity changes in the AudioStreamPlayer3D and Camera "
"nodes. Both nodes have this property, which must be enabled manually:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄວາມໄວສຳພັດລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ສົ່ງສຽງ ແລະ ຜູ້ຟັງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ທີ່ໄດ້ຍິນເພີ່"
"ມຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລົງ. Godot ສາມາດຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມໄວໃນໂນດ AudioStreamPlayer3D ແລະ "
"Camera ໄດ້. ທັງສອງໂນດມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/audio_streams.rst:135
msgid ""
"Enable it by setting it depending on how objects will be moved: use **Idle** "
"for objects moved using ``_process``, or **Physics** for objects moved using "
"``_physics_process``. The tracking will happen automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມວິທີທີ່ວັດຖຸເຄື່ອນທີ່: ໃຊ້ **Idle** ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"``_process``, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ **Physics** ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``_physics_process``. ການຕິດ"
"ຕາມຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:6
msgid "Sync the gameplay with audio and music"
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ (Sync) ການຫຼິ້ນເກມໃຫ້ກົງກັບສຽງ ແລະ ເພງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:11
msgid ""
"In any application or game, sound and music playback will have a slight "
"delay. For games, this delay is often so small that it is negligible. Sound "
"effects will come out a few milliseconds after any play() function is "
"called. For music this does not matter as in most games it does not interact "
"with the gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ເກມໃດກໍຕາມ, ການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ ແລະ ເພງຈະມີຄວາມຊ້າ (delay) ເລັກນ້ອຍ. ສຳລັບເກມ, ຄ"
"ວາມຊ້ານີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍຈົນສາມາດລະເລີຍໄດ້. ເອັບເຟັກສຽງຈະດັງອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນຟັງຊັນ play() ປະ"
"ມານບໍ່ກີ່ມິນລິວິນາທີ. ສຳລັບເພງແລ້ວ ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີບັນຫາ ເພາະໃນເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເພງບໍ່ໄດ້ມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລະບົບກ"
"ານຫຼິ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:13
msgid ""
"Still, for some games (mainly, rhythm games), it may be required to "
"synchronize player actions with something happening in a song (usually in "
"sync with the BPM). For this, having more precise timing information for an "
"exact playback position is useful."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບບາງເກມ (ໂດຍສະເພາະເກມຈັງຫວະດົນຕີ), ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ການກະທຳຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ"
"ກົງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນເພງ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນຊິງຄ໌ຕາມ BPM). ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ການມີຂໍ້ມູນເວລາທີ່ຊັດເຈນສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງກາ"
"ນຫຼິ້ນທີ່ແນ່ນອນຈຶ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:15
msgid ""
"Achieving very low playback timing precision is difficult. This is because "
"many factors are at play during audio playback:"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການຫຼິ້ນມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນສູງນັ້ນແມ່ນເປັນເລື່ອງຍາກ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນມີຫຼາຍປັດໄຈທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນລະຫວ່າ"
"ງການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:17
msgid ""
"Audio is mixed in chunks (not continuously), depending on the size of audio "
"buffers used (check latency in project settings)."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງຖືກປະສົມເປັນຊ່ວງໆ (ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ), ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຂອງ audio buffers ທີ່ໃຊ້ (ກວດສອບຄ່າ "
"latency ໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:18
msgid "Mixed chunks of audio are not played immediately."
msgstr "ສຽງທີ່ຖືກປະສົມແລ້ວບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຫຼິ້ນໃນທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:19
msgid "Graphics APIs display two or three frames late."
msgstr "Graphics APIs ສະແດງຜົນຊ້າກວ່າປົກກະຕິປະມານສອງ ຫຼື ສາມເຟຣມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:20
msgid "When playing on TVs, some delay may be added due to image processing."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນຜ່ານໂທລະທັດ, ອາດຈະມີຄວາມຊ້າເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນພາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:22
msgid ""
"The most common way to reduce latency is to shrink the audio buffers (again, "
"by editing the latency setting in the project settings). The problem is that "
"when latency is too small, sound mixing will require considerably more CPU. "
"This increases the risk of skipping (a crack in sound because a mix callback "
"was lost)."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດໃນການຫຼຸດ latency ຄືການຫຼຸດຂະໜາດ audio buffers (ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"latency ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ). ບັນຫາຄືເມື່ອ latency ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ, ການປະສົມສຽງຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະເກີດສຽງສະດຸດ ຫຼື ສຽງແຕກ ຍ້ອນການປະສົມສຽງເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ທັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:24
msgid ""
"This is a common tradeoff, so Godot ships with sensible defaults that should "
"not need to be altered."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການແລກປ່ຽນທີ່ພົບໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈຶ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປ"
"ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:26
msgid ""
"The problem, in the end, is not this slight delay but synchronizing graphics "
"and audio for games that require it. Some helpers are available to obtain "
"more precise playback timing."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ສຸດແລ້ວ, ບັນຫາບໍ່ແມ່ນຄວາມຊ້າພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍນີ້, ແຕ່ແມ່ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບ ແລະ ສຽງກົງກັນສຳລັບເກມທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"
"ຕ້ອງໃຊ້. ມັນມີຕົວຊ່ວຍບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ເວລາການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:31
msgid "Using the system clock to sync"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໂມງຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອຊິງຄ໌"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:33
msgid ""
"As mentioned before, If you "
"call :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer.play()<class_AudioStreamPlayer_method_play>`, "
"sound will not begin immediately, but when the audio thread processes the "
"next chunk."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເອີ້ນ :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer.play()"
"<class_AudioStreamPlayer_method_play>`, ສຽງຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມທັນທີ, ແຕ່ຈະເລີ່ມເມື່ອ audio "
"thread ປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນຊຸດຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:35
msgid ""
"This delay can't be avoided but it can be estimated by "
"calling :ref:`AudioServer.get_time_to_next_mix()<class_AudioServer_method_get_time_to_next_mix>`."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຊ້ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄດ້ ແຕ່ສາມາດຄາດຄະເນໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ "
":ref:`AudioServer.get_time_to_next_mix()"
"<class_AudioServer_method_get_time_to_next_mix>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:37
msgid ""
"The output latency (what happens after the mix) can also be estimated by "
"calling :ref:`AudioServer.get_output_latency()<class_AudioServer_method_get_output_latency>`."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ latency ຂອງຜົນອອກ (ສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກການປະສົມ) ສາມາດຄາດຄະເນໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ "
":ref:`AudioServer.get_output_latency()"
"<class_AudioServer_method_get_output_latency>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:39
msgid ""
"Add these two and it's possible to guess almost exactly when sound or music "
"will begin playing in the speakers during *_process()*:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເອົາສອງຄ່ານີ້ມາບວກກັນ, ມັນກໍເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະເດົາໄດ້ເກືອບຊັດເຈນວ່າສຽງ ຫຼື ເພງຈະເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນອອກລຳໂພງຕອນ"
"ໃດໃນລະຫວ່າງ *_process()*:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:83
msgid ""
"In the long run, though, as the sound hardware clock is never exactly in "
"sync with the system clock, the timing information will slowly drift away."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມໃນໄລຍະຍາວ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂມງຂອງຮາດແວສຽງບໍ່ເຄີຍກົງກັບໂມງຂອງລະບົບແບບຊັດເຈນ, ຂໍ້ມູນເວລາຈ"
"ະຄ່ອຍໆຄາດເຄື່ອນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:85
msgid ""
"For a rhythm game where a song begins and ends after a few minutes, this "
"approach is fine (and it's the recommended approach). For a game where "
"playback can last a much longer time, the game will eventually go out of "
"sync and a different approach is needed."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມຈັງຫວະດົນຕີທີ່ເພງເລີ່ມ ແລະ ຈົບລົງພາຍໃນສອງສາມວິນາທີ, ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີ (ແລະ ເປັນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳ)"
". ແຕ່ສຳລັບເກມທີ່ການຫຼິ້ນແກ່ຍາວເປັນເວລາດົນຫຼາຍ, ໃນທີ່ສຸດເກມກໍຈະບໍ່ຊິງຄ໌ກັນ ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:88
msgid "Using the sound hardware clock to sync"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໂມງຂອງຮາດແວສຽງເພື່ອຊິງຄ໌"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:90
msgid ""
"Using :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer.get_playback_position()<class_AudioStreamPlayer_method_get_playback_position>` "
"to obtain the current position for the song sounds ideal, but it's not that "
"useful as-is. This value will increment in chunks (every time the audio "
"callback mixed a block of sound), so many calls can return the same value. "
"Added to this, the value will be out of sync with the speakers too because "
"of the previously mentioned reasons."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer.get_playback_position()"
"<class_AudioStreamPlayer_method_get_playback_position>` ເພື່ອຫາຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເພງ"
"ນັ້ນເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຈະດີ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ມີປະໂຫຍດປານໃດໃນຕົວມັນເອງ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເປັນຊ່ວງໆ (ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ລະບົບສຽງປະ"
"ມວນຜົນສຽງຊຸດໃໝ່), ດັ່ງນັ້ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງອາດຈະໄດ້ຄ່າດຽວກັນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄ່ານີ້ກໍຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບລຳໂພງຄືກັນ"
"ຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:92
msgid ""
"To compensate for the \"chunked\" output, there is a function that can "
"help: :ref:`AudioServer.get_time_since_last_mix()<class_AudioServer_method_get_time_since_last_mix>`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍຜົນອອກທີ່ເປັນ \"ຊ່ວງໆ\", ມັນມີຟັງຊັນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໄດ້ຄື: "
":ref:`AudioServer.get_time_since_last_mix()"
"<class_AudioServer_method_get_time_since_last_mix>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:95
msgid ""
"Adding the return value from this function to *get_playback_position()* "
"increases precision:"
msgstr ""
"ການບວກຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ *get_playback_position()* ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຊັດເຈນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:107
msgid ""
"To increase precision, subtract the latency information (how much it takes "
"for the audio to be heard after it was mixed):"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນອີກ, ໃຫ້ລົບຄ່າ latency (ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ສຽງຈະອອກລຳໂພງຫຼັງຈາກຖືກປະສົມແລ້ວ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:118
msgid ""
"The result may be a bit jittery due how multiple threads work. Just check "
"that the value is not less than in the previous frame (discard it if so). "
"This is also a less precise approach than the one before, but it will work "
"for songs of any length, or synchronizing anything (sound effects, as an "
"example) to music."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ອາດຈະມີການສັ່ນໄຫວ (jittery) ເລັກນ້ອຍຍ້ອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຫຼາຍ threads. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຄ່ານັ້"
"ນບໍ່ໄດ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າ (ຖ້າໜ້ອຍກວ່າໃຫ້ຖິ້ມຄ່ານັ້ນໄປ). ວິທີນີ້ອາດຈະມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນໜ້ອຍກວ່າວິທີທຳອິດ, ແຕ່ມັ"
"ນຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເພງທຸກຄວາມຍາວ ຫຼື ການຊິງຄ໌ສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ ເອັບເຟັກສຽງ) ໃຫ້ກົງກັບເພງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/sync_with_audio.rst:120
msgid "Here is the same code as before using this approach:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄ້ດແບບດຽວກັບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:6
msgid "Recording with microphone"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກດ້ວຍໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:8
msgid ""
"Godot supports in-game audio recording for Windows, macOS, Linux, Android "
"and iOS."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຮອງຮັບການບັນທຶກສຽງໃນເກມສຳລັບ Windows, macOS, Linux, Android ແລະ iOS."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:11
msgid ""
"A simple demo is included in the official demo projects and will be used as "
"support for this tutorial: `<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/audio/mic_record>`_."
msgstr ""
"ມີຕົວຢ່າງແບບງ່າຍໆລວມຢູ່ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ແລະ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຊ່ວຍສຳລັບບົດຮຽນນີ້: "
"`<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/audio/"
"mic_record>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:15
msgid ""
"You will need to enable audio input in the :ref:`Audio > Driver > Enable "
"Input<class_ProjectSettings_property_audio/driver/enable_input>` project "
"setting, or you'll just get empty audio files."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ audio input ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ :ref:`Audio > Driver > "
"Enable Input<class_ProjectSettings_property_audio/driver/enable_input>`, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້"
"ນເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ສຽງທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:17
msgid ""
"On iOS and iPadOS, it is also important to set the advanced **Audio > "
"General > iOS > Session Category** setting to include **Record** or **Play "
"and Record**."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ iOS ແລະ iPadOS, ສິ່ງສຳຄັນຄືຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງ **Audio > General > iOS > Session "
"Category** ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາ **Record** ຫຼື **Play and Record**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:20
msgid "The structure of the demo"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງຕົວຢ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:22
msgid ""
"The demo consists of a single scene. This scene includes two major parts: "
"the GUI and the audio."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍສາກດຽວ. ສາກນີ້ລວມມີສອງສ່ວນຫຼັກຄື: GUI ແລະ ສຽງ (audio)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:25
msgid ""
"We will focus on the audio part. In this demo, a bus named ``Record`` with "
"the effect ``Record`` is created to handle the audio recording. An "
"``AudioStreamPlayer`` named ``AudioStreamRecord`` is used for recording."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ສ່ວນຂອງສຽງ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ບັສທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``Record`` ພ້ອມກັບເອັບເຟັກ ``Record`` ຖືກ"
"ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຈັດການການບັນທຶກສຽງ. ໂນດ ``AudioStreamPlayer`` ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"``AudioStreamRecord`` ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:61
msgid ""
"The audio recording is handled by the :ref:`class_AudioEffectRecord` "
"resource which has three methods: :ref:`get_recording() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`, :ref:`is_recording_active() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_is_recording_active>`, "
"and :ref:`set_recording_active() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_set_recording_active>`."
msgstr ""
"ການບັນທຶກສຽງແມ່ນຈັດການໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ :ref:`class_AudioEffectRecord` ເຊິ່ງມີສາມເມທອດ "
"(methods): :ref:`get_recording() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`, :ref:`is_recording_active() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_is_recording_active>`, ແລະ "
":ref:`set_recording_active() "
"<class_AudioEffectRecord_method_set_recording_active>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:108
msgid ""
"At the start of the demo, the recording effect is not active. When the user "
"presses the ``RecordButton``, the effect is enabled with "
"``set_recording_active(true)``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວຢ່າງ, ເອັບເຟັກການບັນທຶກຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກ. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມ ``RecordButton``, "
"ເອັບເຟັກຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ ``set_recording_active(true)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the next button press, as ``effect.is_recording_active()`` is ``true``, "
"the recorded stream can be stored into the ``recording`` variable by calling "
"``effect.get_recording()``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການກົດປຸ່ມຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ ``effect.is_recording_active()`` ເປັນ ``true``, ສະຕຣີມ"
"ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ສາມາດຖືກເກັບລົງໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ ``recording`` ໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``effect.get_recording"
"()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:144
msgid ""
"To playback the recording, you assign the recording as the stream of the "
"``AudioStreamPlayer`` and call ``play()``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຄືນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດການບັນທຶກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນສະຕຣີມຂອງ ``AudioStreamPlayer`` ແລ້ວ"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``play()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:164
msgid ""
"To save the recording, you call ``save_to_wav()`` with the path to a file. "
"In this demo, the path is defined by the user via a ``LineEdit`` input box."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກສຽງທີ່ອັດໄວ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``save_to_wav()`` ພ້ອມກັບກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌. ໃນຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງນີ້, ເສັ້ນທາງແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ຜ່ານຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ``LineEdit``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:4
msgid "Text to speech"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງ (Text to speech)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:7
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:9
msgid "Basic usage of text-to-speech involves the following one-time steps:"
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ ປະກອບມີຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຄັ້ງດຽວດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:11
msgid "Enable TTS in the Godot editor for your project"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ TTS ໃນ Godot editor ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:12
msgid "Query the system for a list of usable voices"
msgstr "ສອບຖາມລະບົບເພື່ອຂໍລາຍຊື່ສຽງທີ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:13
msgid "Store the ID of the voice you want to use"
msgstr "ເກັບກຳ ID ຂອງສຽງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:15
msgid ""
"By default, the Godot project-level setting for text-to-speech is disabled, "
"to avoid unnecessary overhead. To enable it:"
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງໃນລະດັບໂຄງການຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຖືກປິດໄວ້ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງພາລະຂອງ"
"ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ. ວິທີເປີດໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:17
msgid "Go to **Project > Project Settings**"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ **Project > Project Settings**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:18
msgid "Make sure the **Advanced Settings** toggle is enabled"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປຸ່ມ **Advanced Settings** ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:19
msgid "Click on **Audio > General**"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ **Audio > General**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:20
msgid "Ensure the **Text to Speech** option is checked"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຕົວເລືອກ **Text to Speech** ຖືກໝາຍຕິກແລ້ວ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/audio/text_to_speech.rst:21
