msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕົນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Apple ID ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ \"Common Name\") ໃນສ່ວນ ``Code "
"Signing > Identity``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:61
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:85
