"Select ``Xcode notarytool`` in the ``Notarization > Notarization`` option."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ``Xcode notarytool`` ໃນຕົວເລືອກ ``Notarization > Notarization``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:64
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:88
