msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Apple ID / ລະຫັດຜ່ານສະເພາະແອັບ ຫຼື `App Store Connect <https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/appstoreconnectapi>`__ API UUID / Key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອ"
"ງໃນສ່ວນ ``Notarization``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:67
msgid ""
"You can use the ``xcrun notarytool history`` command to check notarization "
