#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:155
msgid "Hardened Runtime Entitlements"
msgstr "ສິດທິການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Hardened Runtime"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:157
msgid ""
"Hardened Runtime entitlements manage security options and resource access "
"policy. See `Hardened Runtime <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"security/hardened_runtime?language=objc>`__ for more info."
msgstr ""
"ສິດທິການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Hardened Runtime ຈັດການຕົວເລືອກຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ນະໂຍບາຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາ"
"ກອນ. ເບິ່ງ `Hardened Runtime <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"security/hardened_runtime?language=objc>`__ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:161
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:204
msgid "Entitlement"
msgstr "ສິດທິການເຂົ້າເຖິງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:163
msgid "Allow JIT Code Execution [4]_"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດການປະມວນຜົນລະຫັດ JIT [4]_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:163
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory for JIT code. If you are "
"using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them "
"according to the add-on documentation."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ສຳລັບລະຫັດ JIT. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ add-ons "
"ທີ່ມີລະຫັດເນທີບ (native) ແບບໄດນາມິກ ຫຼື ປັບປ່ຽນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ add-on ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:165
msgid "Allow Unsigned Executable Memory [4]_"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ແບບບໍ່ລົງນາມ [4]_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:165
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory without JIT restrictions. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ JIT. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ "
"add-ons ທີ່ມີລະຫັດເນທີບແບບໄດນາມິກ ຫຼື ປັບປ່ຽນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ add-on ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:167
msgid "Allow DYLD Environment Variables [4]_"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ DYLD [4]_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:167
msgid ""
"Allows app to uss dynamic linker environment variables to inject code. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ dynamic linker ເພື່ອແຊກລະຫັດ (inject code). ຖ້າທ່ານກ"
"ຳລັງໃຊ້ add-ons ທີ່ມີລະຫັດເນທີບແບບໄດນາມິກ ຫຼື ປັບປ່ຽນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ add-on ນັ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:169
msgid "Disable Library Validation"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານການກວດສອບໄລບຣາຣີ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:169
msgid ""
"Allows app to load arbitrary libraries and frameworks. Enable it if you are "
"using GDExtension add-ons or ad-hoc signing, or want to support user-"
"provided external add-ons."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໂຫຼດໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ເຟຣມເວີກ (frameworks) ໃດກໍໄດ້. ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ "
"GDExtension add-ons ຫຼື ການລົງນາມແບບ ad-hoc, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຮອງຮັບ add-ons ພາຍນອກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈັດຫ"
"າໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:171
msgid "Audio Input"
msgstr "ສັນຍານສຽງເຂົ້າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:171
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the microphone or other audio input sources, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the `privacy/"
"microphone_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງສັນຍານສຽງເຂົ້າອື່ນໆ, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມການໃຊ້"
"ງານໃນຕົວເລືອກ `privacy/microphone_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:173
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "ກ້ອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:173
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the camera, if it's enabled you should also "
"provide usage message in the `privacy/camera_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ກ້ອງ, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມການໃຊ້ງານໃນຕົວເລືອກ `privacy/"
"camera_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:175
#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:91
#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:147
msgid "Location"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:175
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use location information from Location Services, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the `privacy/"
"location_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ຈາກ Location Services, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມການ"
"ໃຊ້ງານໃນຕົວເລືອກ `privacy/location_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:177
msgid "Address Book"
msgstr "ສົມຸດລາຍຊື່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:177
msgid ""
"[5]_ Enable to allow access contacts in the user's address book, if it's "
"enabled you should also provide usage message in the `privacy/"
"address_book_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"[5]_ ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ໃນສົມຸດລາຍຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມກ"
"ານໃຊ້ງານໃນຕົວເລືອກ `privacy/address_book_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:179
msgid "Calendars"
msgstr "ປະຕິທິນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:179
msgid ""
"[5]_ Enable to allow access to the user's calendar, if it's enabled you "
"should also provide usage message in the `privacy/"
"calendar_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"[5]_ ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງປະຕິທິນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມການໃຊ້ງານໃນຕົວເ"
"ລືອກ `privacy/calendar_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:181
msgid "Photo Library"
msgstr "ຄັງຮູບພາບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:181
msgid ""
"[5]_ Enable to allow access to the user's Photos library, if it's enabled "
"you should also provide usage message in the `privacy/"
"photos_library_usage_description` option."
msgstr ""
"[5]_ ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຮູບພາບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ ທ່ານຄວນລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມການໃຊ້ງານໃນຕົ"
"ວເລືອກ `privacy/photos_library_usage_description` ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:183
msgid "Apple Events"
msgstr "Apple Events"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:183
msgid "[5]_ Enable to allow app to send Apple events to other apps."
msgstr "[5]_ ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບສົ່ງ Apple events ໄປຫາແອັບອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:185
msgid ""
"[6]_ You can temporarily enable this entitlement to use native debugger "
"(GDB, LLDB) with the exported app. This entitlement should be disabled for "
"production export."
msgstr ""
"[6]_ ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ສິດທິນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອໃຊ້ native debugger (GDB, LLDB) ກັບແອັບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ສິດທິ"
"ນີ້ຄວນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:188
msgid ""
"The ``Allow JIT Code Execution``, ``Allow Unsigned Executable Memory`` and "
"``Allow DYLD Environment Variables`` entitlements are always enabled for the "
"Godot Mono exports, and are not visible in the export options."
msgstr ""
"ສິດທິ ``Allow JIT Code Execution``, ``Allow Unsigned Executable Memory`` ແລະ "
"``Allow DYLD Environment Variables`` ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສະເໝີສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກ Godot Mono, ແລ"
"ະ ຈະບໍ່ເຫັນໃນຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:189
msgid ""
"These features aren't supported by Godot out of the box, enable them only if "
"you are using add-ons which require them."
msgstr ""
"ຟີເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ Godot ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮອງຮັບມາແຕ່ທຳອິດ, ເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ add-ons ທີ່ຕ້ອງການພວກມັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:190
msgid "To notarize an app, you must disable the ``Debugging`` entitlement."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບຮອງແອັບ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານສິດທິ ``Debugging``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:193
msgid "App Sandbox Entitlement"
msgstr "ສິດທິ App Sandbox"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:195
msgid ""
"The App Sandbox restricts access to user data, networking and devices. "
"Sandboxed apps can't access most of the file system, can't use custom file "
"dialogs and execute binaries (using ``OS.execute`` and "
"``OS.create_process``) outside the ``.app`` bundle. See `App Sandbox "
"<https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/app_sandbox?"
"language=objc>`__ for more info."
msgstr ""
"App Sandbox ຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນ. ແອັບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ Sandbox ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເ"
"ຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້, ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດອະລັອກໄຟລ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄບນາຣີ (ໂດ"
"ຍໃຊ້ ``OS.execute`` ແລະ ``OS.create_process``) ພາຍນອກ ``.app`` bundle ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"`App Sandbox <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/"
"app_sandbox?language=objc>`__ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:201
msgid ""
"To distribute an app through the App Store, you must enable the App Sandbox."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແຈກຢາຍແອັບຜ່ານ App Store, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ App Sandbox."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:206
#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_settings.rst:16
#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:38
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:206
