#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_interface_json_file.rst:196
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_interface_json_file.rst:217
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_interface_json_file.rst:239
