msgid "Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/background_loading.rst:44
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to load a scene in the background. We will "
"have a button spawn an enemy when pressed. The enemy will be ``Enemy.tscn`` "
"which we will load on ``_ready`` and instantiate when pressed. The path will "
"be ``\"Enemy.tscn\"`` which is located at ``res://Enemy.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີການໂຫຼດ scene ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ. ພວກເຮົາຈະມີປຸ່ມສຳລັບສ້າງສັດຕູ (spawn) ເມື່ອຖືກກົດ. "
"ສັດຕູຈະແມ່ນ ``Enemy.tscn`` ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະໂຫຼດໃນ ``_ready`` ແລະ ສ້າງຕົວຕົນ "
"(instantiate) ເມື່ອມີການກົດປຸ່ມ. ເສັ້ນທາງຈະແມ່ນ ``\"Enemy.tscn\"`` ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ ``res://"
"Enemy.tscn``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/background_loading.rst:49
msgid ""
"First, we will start a request to load the resource and connect the button:"
msgstr "ທຳອິດ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມການຮ້ອງຂໍເພື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ປຸ່ມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/background_loading.rst:75
msgid ""
"Now ``_on_button_pressed`` will be called when the button is pressed. This "
"method will be used to spawn an enemy."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ ``_on_button_pressed`` ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສັດຕູ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:4
msgid "File paths in Godot projects"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page explains how file paths work inside Godot projects. You will learn "
"how to access paths in your projects using the ``res://`` and ``user://`` "
"notations, and where Godot stores project and editor files on your and your "
"users' systems."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Godot. ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການເຂົ້າ"
"ເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ສັນຍະລັກ ``res://`` ແລະ ``user://``, ແລະ ຮູ້ວ່າ Godot "
"ເກັບໄຟລ໌ໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ ເອດິເຕີໄວ້ໃສໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:11
msgid "Path separators"
msgstr "ຕົວແຍກເສັ້ນທາງ (Path separators)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:13
msgid ""
"To make supporting multiple platforms easier, Godot uses **UNIX-style path "
"separators** (forward slash ``/``). These work on all platforms, **including "
"Windows**."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, Godot ຈະໃຊ້ **ຕົວແຍກເສັ້ນທາງແບບ UNIX** (forward "
"slash ``/``). ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນທຸກແພລັດຟອມ, **ລວມທັງ Windows**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:17
msgid ""
"Instead of writing paths like ``C:\\Projects\\Game``, in Godot, you should "
"write ``C:/Projects/Game``."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຈະຂຽນເສັ້ນທາງແບບ ``C:\\Projects\\Game``, ໃນ Godot ທ່ານຄວນຂຽນເປັນ ``C:/"
"Projects/Game``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:20
msgid ""
"Windows-style path separators (backward slash ``\\``) are also supported in "
"some path-related methods, but they need to be doubled (``\\\\``), as ``\\`` "
"is normally used as an escape for characters with a special meaning."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແຍກເສັ້ນທາງແບບ Windows (backward slash ``\\``) ກໍຍັງຮອງຮັບໃນບາງເມທອດທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບເສັ້ນທາ"
"ງ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງຂຽນເບິ້ນເປັນ (``\\\\``), ຍ້ອນວ່າ ``\\`` ປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຫຼົບ (escape) ສຳລັບຕົວ"
"ອັກສອນທີ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍພິເສດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/data_paths.rst:24
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to work with paths returned by other Windows "
"applications. We still recommend using only forward slashes in your own code "
"to guarantee that everything will work as intended."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Windows ອື່ນໆ ໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ພວກເ"
"ຮົາກໍຍັງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ forward slashes ໃນໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານເອງເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າທຸກຢ່າງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕ"
"າມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

