#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:305
msgid ""
":ref:`FontFile.load_dynamic_font <class_FontFile_method_load_bitmap_font>` "
"supports the following font file formats: TTF, OTF, WOFF, WOFF2, PFB, PFM"
