"ງຮັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຟອນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: TTF, OTF, WOFF, WOFF2, PFB, PFM"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:308
msgid ""
"On the other hand, :ref:`FontFile.load_bitmap_font "
"<class_FontFile_method_load_bitmap_font>` supports the `BMFont <https://"
"www.angelcode.com/products/bmfont/>`__ format (``.fnt`` or ``.font``)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, :ref:`FontFile.load_bitmap_font "
"<class_FontFile_method_load_bitmap_font>` ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບ `BMFont <https://"
"www.angelcode.com/products/bmfont/>`__ (``.fnt`` ຫຼື ``.font``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:311
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is possible to load any font that is installed on the "
"system using Godot's support for :ref:`doc_using_fonts_system_fonts`."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງສາມາດໂຫຼດຟອນໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໂດຍການໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບຂອງ Godot ສຳລັບ "
":ref:`doc_using_fonts_system_fonts`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:314
msgid ""
"Example of loading a font file automatically according to its file "
"extension, then adding it as a theme override to a :ref:`class_Label` node:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຟອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌, ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າເປັນການຂຽນທັບທິມ "
"(theme override) ໃຫ້ກັບໂນດ :ref:`class_Label`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:373
msgid "ZIP archives"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ ZIP"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:375
msgid ""
"Godot supports reading and writing ZIP archives using "
"the :ref:`class_zipreader` and :ref:`class_zippacker` classes. This supports "
"any ZIP file, including files generated by Godot's \"Export PCK/ZIP\" "
"functionality (although these will contain imported Godot resources rather "
"than the original project files)."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຮອງຮັບການອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ ZIP ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄລາສ :ref:`class_zipreader` ແລະ "
":ref:`class_zippacker`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ໃດກໍໄດ້, ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຟັງຊັນ "
"\"Export PCK/ZIP\" ຂອງ Godot (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບັນຈຸຊັບພະຍາກອນ Godot ທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າແທນທີ່"
"ຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌ໂປຣເຈັກຕົ້ນສະບັບ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:382
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_load_resource_pack>` to load PCK or ZIP files "
"exported by Godot as :ref:`additional data packs <doc_exporting_pcks>`. That "
"approach is preferred for DLCs, as it makes interacting with additional data "
"packs seamless (virtual filesystem)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ :ref:`ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack "
"<class_ProjectSettings_method_load_resource_pack>` ເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ PCK ຫຼື ZIP ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ"
"ໂດຍ Godot ເປັນ :ref:`ແພັກຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ <doc_exporting_pcks>`. ວິທີການນັ້ນເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມສຳລັບ "
"DLC, ເພາະວ່າມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບແພັກຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ມີຮອຍຕໍ່ (ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສະເໝືອນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:387
msgid ""
"This ZIP archive support can be combined with runtime image, 3D scene and "
"audio loading to provide a seamless modding experience without requiring "
"users to go through the Godot editor to generate PCK/ZIP files."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ ZIP ນີ້ສາມາດລວມເຂົ້າກັບການໂຫຼດຮູບພາບ, ສາກ 3 ມິຕິ ແລະ ສຽງໃນເວລາຣັນທາມ ເພື່"
"ອມອບປະສົບການການເຮັດມອດ (modding) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຮອຍຕໍ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຜ່ານຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot ເພື່ອສ້າ"
"ງໄຟລ໌ PCK/ZIP."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:391
msgid ""
"Example that lists files in a ZIP archive in an :ref:`class_ItemList` node, "
"then writes contents read from it to a new ZIP archive (essentially "
"duplicating the archive):"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ ZIP ໃນໂນດ :ref:`class_ItemList`, ຈາກນັ້ນຂຽນເນື້ອຫາທີ່ອ່າ"
"ນມາຈາກນັ້ນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ ZIP ໃໝ່ (ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແມ່ນການສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:6
msgid "Binary serialization API"
msgstr "API ການເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລເຊຊັນແບບບັຍນາຣີ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:11
msgid ""
"Godot has a serialization API based on Variant. It's used for converting "
"data types to an array of bytes efficiently. This API is exposed via the "
"global :ref:`bytes_to_var() <class_@GlobalScope_method_bytes_to_var>` "
"and :ref:`var_to_bytes() <class_@GlobalScope_method_var_to_bytes>` "
"functions, but it is also used in the ``get_var`` and ``store_var`` methods "
"of :ref:`class_FileAccess` as well as the packet APIs "
"for :ref:`class_PacketPeer`. This format is *not* used for binary scenes and "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີ API ການເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລເຊຊັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Variant. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແປງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ເປັນອາເຣຂ"
"ອງໄບຕ໌ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. API ນີ້ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຜ່ານຟັງຊັນທົ່ວໄປ :ref:`bytes_to_var() "
"<class_@GlobalScope_method_bytes_to_var>` ແລະ :ref:`var_to_bytes() "
"<class_@GlobalScope_method_var_to_bytes>`, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດ ``get_var`` ແລະ "
"``store_var`` ຂອງ :ref:`class_FileAccess` ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ packet API ສຳລັບ "
":ref:`class_PacketPeer`. ຮູບແບບນີ້ **ບໍ່** ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບບັຍນາຣີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:20
msgid "Full Objects vs Object instance IDs"
msgstr "ວັດຖຸແບບເຕັມ (Full Objects) ທຽບກັບ ID ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວັດຖຸ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:22
msgid ""
"If a variable is serialized with ``full_objects = true``, then any Objects "
"contained in the variable will be serialized and included in the result. "
"This is recursive."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕົວປ່ຽນຖືກເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລເຊຊັນດ້ວຍ ``full_objects = true``, ແລ້ວທຸກໆວັດຖຸ (Objects) ທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່"
"ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລເຊຊັນ ແລະ ລວມເຂົ້າໃນຜົນລັບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນແບບຣີເຄີຊີບ (recursive)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:26
msgid ""
"If ``full_objects = false``, then only the instance IDs will be serialized "
"for any Objects contained in the variable."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ ``full_objects = false``, ແລ້ວຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ ID ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລເຊ"
"ຊັນສຳລັບທຸກວັດຖຸທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:30
msgid "Packet specification"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສະເພາະຂອງແພັກເກັດ (Packet)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:32
msgid ""
"The packet is designed to be always padded to 4 bytes. All values are little-"
"endian-encoded. All packets have a 4-byte header representing an integer, "
"specifying the type of data."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ມີການເຕີມຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ (padded) ເປັນ 4 ໄບຕ໌ສະເໝີ. ຄ່າທັງໝົດຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ "
"little-endian. ທຸກໆແພັກເກັດຈະມີເຮດເດີ (header) ຂະໜາດ 4 ໄບຕ໌ ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ ເພື່"
"ອລະບຸປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.rst:36
msgid ""
"The lowest value two bytes are used to determine the type, while the highest "
"value two bytes contain flags:"
msgstr ""
"ສອງໄບຕ໌ທີ່ມີຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸປະເພດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສອງໄບຕ໌ທີ່ມີຄ່າສູງສຸດຈະບັນຈຸແຟລັກ (flags):"

