#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/internationalizing_games.rst:410
msgid "Translating the project name"
msgstr "ການແປຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/internationalizing_games.rst:412
msgid ""
"The project name becomes the app name when exporting to different operating "
"systems and platforms. To specify the project name in more than one language "
"go to :menu:`Project > Project Settings > General > Application > Config`. "
"From here click on the :button:`Localizable String (Size 0)` button, then "
"the :button:`Add Translation` button. It will take you to a page where you "
"can choose the language (and country if needed) for your project name "
"translation. After doing that you can now type in the localized name."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກຈະກາຍເປັນຊື່ແອັບເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ແພລດຟອມຕ່າງໆ. ເພື່ອລະບຸຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກຫຼາຍ"
"ກວ່າໜຶ່ງພາສາ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ :menu:`Project > Project Settings > General > Application > "
"Config`. ຈາກບ່ອນນີ້ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ :button:`Localizable String (Size 0)`, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກປຸ່ມ "
":button:`Add Translation`. ມັນຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຍັງໜ້າທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກພາສາ (ແລະ ປະເທດ ຫາກຕ້ອງ"
"ການ) ສຳລັບການແປຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດພິມຊື່ທີ່ຖືກແປແລ້ວລົງໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/internationalizing_games.rst:423
msgid ""
"If you are unsure about the language code to use, refer to the :ref:`list of "
"locale codes <doc_locales>`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈກ່ຽວກັບລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`ລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ <doc_locales>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:4
msgid "Localization using spreadsheets"
msgstr "ການເຮັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນໂດຍໃຊ້ສະເປຣດຊີດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:6
msgid ""
"Spreadsheets are one of the most common formats for localizing games. In "
"Godot, spreadsheets are supported through the CSV format. This guide "
"explains how to work with CSVs."
msgstr ""
"ສະເປຣດຊີດ (Spreadsheets) ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການເຮັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນເກມ. ໃນ Godot, ສະເປ"
"ຣດຊີດໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຜ່ານຮູບແບບ CSV. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດວຽກກັບ CSV."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:10
msgid ""
"The CSV files **must** be saved with UTF-8 encoding without a `byte order "
"mark <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark>`__."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ CSV **ຕ້ອງ** ຖືກບັນທຶກດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ UTF-8 ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ `ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລຳດັບໄບຕ໌ (byte "
"order mark) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:15
msgid ""
"By default, Microsoft Excel will always save CSV files with ANSI encoding "
"rather than UTF-8. There is no built-in way to do this, but there are "
"workarounds as described `here <https://stackoverflow.com/questions/4221176/"
"excel-to-csv-with-utf8-encoding>`__."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Microsoft Excel ຈະບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ CSV ດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ ANSI ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ "
"UTF-8 ສະເໝີ. ມັນບໍ່ມີວິທີການໃນຕົວທີ່ຈະເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ແຕ່ມີວິທີແກ້ໄຂຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ `ທີ່ນີ້ <https://"
"stackoverflow.com/questions/4221176/excel-to-csv-with-utf8-encoding>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:20
msgid ""
"We recommend using `LibreOffice <https://www.libreoffice.org/>`__ or Google "
"Sheets instead."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `LibreOffice <https://www.libreoffice.org/>`__ ຫຼື Google "
"Sheets ແທນ."

