#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:59
msgid ""
"The same example is shown below as a comma-separated plain text file, which "
"should be the result of editing the above in a spreadsheet. When editing the "
"plain text version, be sure to enclose with double quotes any message that "
"contains commas, line breaks or double quotes, so that commas are not parsed "
"as delimiters, line breaks don't create new entries and double quotes are "
"not parsed as enclosing characters. Be sure to escape any double quotes a "
"message may contain by preceding them with another double quote. "
"Alternatively, you can select another delimiter than comma in the import "
"options."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງດຽວກັນນີ້ແມ່ນສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ (comma-separated), ເຊິ່ງຄວນຈະ"
"ເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຂ້າງເທິງໃນສະເປຣດຊີດ (spreadsheet). ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດ"
"າ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າຄູ່ (double quotes) ຄອບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີຈຸດ, ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ "
"ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າຄູ່, ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຈຸດຖືກວິເຄາະເປັນຕົວຂັ້ນ, ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ບໍ່ສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳ"
"ເວົ້າຄູ່ບໍ່ຖືກວິເຄາະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນຄອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ escape character ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້"
"າຄູ່ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍການໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າຄູ່ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກຕົວຂັ້ນອື່ນນອກ"
"ຈາກຈຸດໄດ້ໃນຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:78
msgid "Specifying plural forms"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:80
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.6, it is possible to specify :ref:`plural forms "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_pluralization>` in CSV files."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດ :ref:`ຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດ "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_pluralization>` ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:83
msgid ""
"This is done by adding a column named ``?plural`` anywhere in the table "
"(except on the first column, which is reserved for translation keys). By "
"convention, it's recommended to place it on the second column. Note that in "
"the example below, the key column is the one that contains English "
"localization."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຖັນທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``?plural`` ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງ (ຍົກເວັ້ນຖັນທຳອິດ, ເຊິ່ງສະຫ"
"ງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບຄີການແປ). ຕາມທຳນຽມແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງໄວ້ໃນຖັນທີສອງ. ສັງເກດວ່າໃນຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ຖັນຄີແມ່"
"ນຖັນທີ່ມີການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:99
msgid ""
"Automatic Control translation is not supported when using plural forms. You "
"must translate the string manually "
"using :ref:`tr_n()<class_Object_method_tr_n>`."
msgstr ""
"ການແປຄອນໂທຣລ (Control) ອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແປຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອ"
"ງໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`tr_n() <class_Object_method_tr_n>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:103
msgid "Specifying translation contexts"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດບໍລິບົດການແປ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:105
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.6, it is possible to specify :ref:`translation contexts "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_translation_contexts>` in CSV files. This can "
"be used to disambiguate identical source strings that have different "
"meanings. While this is generally not needed when using translation keys "
"``LIKE_THIS``, it's useful when using plain English text as translation keys."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດ :ref:`ບໍລິບົດການແປ "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_translation_contexts>` ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV ໄດ້. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່"
"ອແຍກຄວາມກຳກວມຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຄືກັນແຕ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍຕ່າງກັນ. ເຖິງວ່າໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄີ"
"ການແປແບບ ``LIKE_THIS``, ແຕ່ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດທຳມະດາເປັນຄີການແປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:111
msgid ""
"This is done by adding a column named ``?context`` column anywhere in the "
"table (except on the first column, which is reserved for translation keys). "
"By convention, it's recommended to place it on the second column, or after "
"``?plural`` if it's also used. Note that in the example below, the key "
"column is the one that contains English localization."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຖັນທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``?context`` ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງ (ຍົກເວັ້ນຖັນທຳອິດ, ເຊິ່ງສະ"
"ຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບຄີການແປ). ຕາມທຳນຽມແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງໄວ້ໃນຖັນທີສອງ, ຫຼື ຖັດຈາກ ``?plural`` ຖ້າມີ"
"ການໃຊ້ຄືກັນ. ສັງເກດວ່າໃນຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ຖັນຄີແມ່ນຖັນທີ່ມີການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:125
msgid ""
"Automatic Control translation is not supported when using context. You must "
"translate the string manually using :ref:`tr() <class_Object_method_tr>` "
"or :ref:`tr_n() <class_Object_method_tr_n>`."
msgstr ""
"ການແປຄອນໂທຣລ (Control) ອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເມື່ອໃຊ້ບໍລິບົດ (context). ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແປຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ"
"ຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`tr() <class_Object_method_tr>` ຫຼື :ref:`tr_n() "
"<class_Object_method_tr_n>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:130
msgid "CSV importer"
msgstr "ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ CSV"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:132
msgid ""
"Godot will treat CSV files as translations by default. It will import them "
"and generate one or more compressed translation resource files next to it."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ CSV ເປັນໄຟລ໌ການແປໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ມັນຈະນຳເຂົ້າພວກມັນ ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກ"
"ອນການແປທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດໄວ້ຂ້າງໆໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:135
msgid ""
"Importing will also add the translation to the list of translations to load "
"when the game runs, specified in project.godot (or the project settings). "
"Godot allows loading and removing translations at runtime as well."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳເຂົ້າຍັງຈະເພີ່ມການແປເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການການແປທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດເມື່ອເກມຣັນ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
"project.godot (ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ). Godot ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ ແລະ ລຶບການແປໃນລະຫວ່າງຣັນໄດ້ເຊັ່ນ"
"ກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:140
msgid ""
"Select the ``.csv`` file and access the :ui:`Import` dock to define import "
"options. You can toggle the compression of the imported translations, and "
"select the delimiter to use when parsing the CSV file."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ``.csv`` ແລະ ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ແຖບ :ui:`ນຳເຂົ້າ (Import)` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເຈົ້"
"າສາມາດເປີດ-ປິດການບີບອັດຂອງການແປທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, ແລະ ເລືອກຕົວຂັ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອວິເຄາະໄຟລ໌ CSV."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:146
msgid "Be sure to click :button:`Reimport` after any change to these options."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມຄລິກ :button:`ນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ (Reimport)` ຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:149
msgid "Loading the CSV file as a translation"
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ CSV ເປັນການແປ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_spreadsheets.rst:151
msgid ""
"Once a CSV file is imported, it is **not** automatically registered as a "
"translation source for the project. Remember to follow the steps described "
"in :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games_configuring_imported_translation` so "
"that the translation is actually used when running the project."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ CSV ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະ **ບໍ່** ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນແຫຼ່ງການແປສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຢ່າ"
"ລືມເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_internationalizing_games_configuring_imported_translation` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການ"
"ແປຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທ້ໆເມື່ອຣັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:4
msgid "Localization using gettext (PO files)"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນໂດຍໃຊ້ gettext (ໄຟລ໌ PO)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:6
msgid ""
"In addition to importing translations in :ref:`CSV format "
"<doc_localization_using_spreadsheets>`, Godot also supports loading "
"translation files written in the GNU gettext format (text-based ``.po`` and "
"compiled ``.mo``)."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າການແປໃນ :ref:`ຮູບແບບ CSV <doc_localization_using_spreadsheets>"
"`, Godot ຍັງຮອງຮັບການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບ GNU gettext (``.po`` ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ "
"``.mo`` ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:11
msgid ""
"For an introduction to gettext, check out `A Quick Gettext Tutorial <https://"
"www.labri.fr/perso/fleury/posts/programming/a-quick-gettext-"
"tutorial.html>`_. It's written with C projects in mind, but much of the "
"advice also applies to Godot (with the exception of ``xgettext``)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບບົດນຳສະເໜີກ່ຽວກັບ gettext, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ `A Quick Gettext Tutorial <https://"
"www.labri.fr/perso/fleury/posts/programming/a-quick-gettext-tutorial.html>"
"`_. ມັນຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ໂປຣເຈັກພາສາ C, ແຕ່ຄຳແນະນຳສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກໍສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບ Godot ໄດ້ (ຍົກເວັ້"
"ນ ``xgettext``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:16
msgid ""
"For the complete documentation, see `GNU Gettext <https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/gettext/manual/gettext.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເອກະສານຄົບຖ້ວນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ `GNU Gettext <https://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/"
"manual/gettext.html>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:21
msgid ""
"gettext is a standard format, which can be edited using any text editor or "
"GUI editors such as `Poedit <https://poedit.net/>`_. This can be significant "
"as it provides a lot of tools for translators, such as marking outdated "
"strings, finding strings that haven't been translated, etc."
msgstr ""
"gettext ແມ່ນຮູບແບບມາດຕະຖານ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text editor) ໃດກໍໄດ້ "
"ຫຼື ຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບ GUI ເຊັ່ນ `Poedit <https://poedit.net/>`_. ນີ້ຖືວ່າສຳຄັນຫຼາຍເພາະມັນມີເຄື່ອງມືຫຼ"
"າຍຢ່າງສຳລັບຜູ້ແປ ເຊັ່ນ: ການໝາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຫຼ້າສະໄໝ, ການຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ແປ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:25
msgid ""
"gettext is supported by translation platforms such as `Transifex <https://"
"www.transifex.com/>`_ and `Weblate <https://weblate.org/>`_, which makes it "
"easier for people to collaborate to localization."
msgstr ""
"gettext ຖືກຮອງຮັບໂດຍແພລັດຟອມການແປພາສາ ເຊັ່ນ `Transifex <https://"
"www.transifex.com/>`_ ແລະ `Weblate <https://weblate.org/>`_, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຄົນຮ່ວມມືກັ"
"ນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:28
msgid ""
"Compared to CSV, gettext files work better with version control systems like "
"Git, as each locale has its own messages file."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ CSV, ໄຟລ໌ gettext ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າກັບລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control) ເຊັ່ນ "
"Git, ເພາະວ່າແຕ່ລະລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:30
msgid ""
"Multiline strings are more convenient to edit in gettext PO files compared "
"to CSV files."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຫຼາຍແຖວແມ່ນແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ສະດວກກວ່າໃນໄຟລ໌ gettext PO ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໄຟລ໌ CSV."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:34
msgid "Disadvantages"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ເສຍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:36
msgid ""
"gettext PO files have a more complex format than CSV and can be harder to "
"grasp for people new to software localization."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ gettext PO ມີຮູບແບບທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ CSV ແລະ ອາດຈະເຂົ້າໃຈຍາກກວ່າສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ໃໝ່ກັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ຊອບແ"
"ວເປັນພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:38
msgid ""
"People who maintain localization files will have to install gettext tools on "
"their system. However, as Godot supports using text-based message files "
"(``.po``), translators can test their work without having to install gettext "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ທີ່ເບິ່ງແຍງໄຟລ໌ການແປຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື gettext ໃນລະບົບຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ "
"Godot ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (``.po``), ຜູ້ແປສາມາດທົດສອບວຽກຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອ"
"ງມື gettext."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:41
msgid ""
"gettext PO files usually use English as the base language. Translators will "
"use this base language to translate to other languages. You could still user "
"other languages as the base language, but this is not common."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ gettext PO ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ພາສາອັງກິດເປັນພາສາຫຼັກ. ຜູ້ແປຈະໃຊ້ພາສາຫຼັກນີ້ເພື່ອແປເປັນພາສາອື່ນໆ. "
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ພາສາອື່ນເປັນພາສາຫຼັກໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ຄ່ອຍເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:46
msgid "Installing gettext tools"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື gettext"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:48
msgid ""
"The command line gettext tools are required to perform maintenance "
"operations, such as updating message files. Therefore, it's strongly "
"recommended to install them."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມື gettext ແບບຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ ເຊັ່ນ: ການອັບເດ"
"ດໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Windows:** Download an installer from `this page <https://"
"mlocati.github.io/articles/gettext-iconv-windows.html>`_. Any architecture "
"and binary type (shared or static) works; if in doubt, choose the 64-bit "
"static installer."
msgstr ""
"**Windows:** ດາວໂຫຼດຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກ `ໜ້ານີ້ <https://mlocati.github.io/articles/"
"gettext-iconv-windows.html>`_. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຸກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ ແລະ ປະເພດໄບນາຣີ "
"(shared ຫຼື static); ຫາກບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ 64-bit static."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:56
msgid ""
"**macOS:** Install gettext either using `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_ with "
"the ``brew install gettext`` command, or using `MacPorts <https://"
"www.macports.org/>`_ with the ``sudo port install gettext`` command."
msgstr ""
"**macOS:** ຕິດຕັ້ງ gettext ໂດຍໃຊ້ `Homebrew <https://brew.sh/>`_ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``brew "
"install gettext``, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ `MacPorts <https://www.macports.org/>`_ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ "
"``sudo port install gettext``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Linux:** On most distributions, install the ``gettext`` package from your "
"distribution's package manager."
msgstr ""
"**Linux:** ໃນລະບົບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ``gettext`` ຈາກຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ເຈົ້າ"
"ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:63
msgid ""
"For a GUI tool you can get Poedit from its `Official website <https://"
"poedit.net/>`_. The basic version is open source and available under the MIT "
"license."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງມືແບບ GUI ເຈົ້າສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດ Poedit ໄດ້ຈາກ `ເວັບໄຊທາງການ <https://"
"poedit.net/>`_. ເວີຊັນພື້ນຖານແມ່ນເປັນໂອເພນຊອດ (open source) ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພາຍໃຕ້ໃບອະນຸ"
"ຍາດ MIT."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:67
msgid "Creating the PO template"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:70
msgid "Automatic generation using the editor"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (Editor)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:72
msgid ""
"The editor can generate a PO template automatically from specified scene and "
"GDScript files. This POT generation also supports translation contexts and "
"pluralization if used in a script, with the optional second argument of "
"``tr()`` and the ``tr_n()`` method."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ສາມາດສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກໄຟລ໌ scene ແລະ GDScript ທີ່ລະບຸໄ"
"ວ້. ການສ້າງ POT ນີ້ຍັງຮອງຮັບບໍລິບົດການແປ ແລະ ຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດຫາກມີການໃຊ້ໃນສະຄຣິບ, ດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ອາກິວເ"
"ມັນທີສອງຂອງ ``tr()`` ແລະ ເມທອດ ``tr_n()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:77
msgid ""
"Open :menu:`Project > Project Settings > Localization > Template "
"Generation`, then use the :button:`Add…` button to specify the path to your "
"project's scenes and scripts that contain localizable strings:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄປທີ່ :menu:`ໂປຣເຈັກ (Project) > ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ (Project Settings) > ການເຮັດເປັນພາສ"
"າທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Localization) > ການສ້າງແມ່ແບບ (Template Generation)`, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ "
":button:`ເພີ່ມ (Add…)` ເພື່ອລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ scenes ແລະ scripts ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງ"
"ການແປ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:81
msgid ""
"Creating a PO template in the Localization > Template Generation tab of the "
"Project Settings"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO ໃນແຖບ Localization > Template Generation ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:85
msgid ""
"Creating a PO template in the :menu:`Localization > Template Generation` tab "
"of the :ui:`Project Settings`"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO ໃນແຖບ :menu:`Localization > Template Generation` ຂອງ :ui:`ການຕັ້"
"ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:87
msgid ""
"After adding at least one scene or script, click :button:`Generate` in the "
"top-right corner, then specify the path to the output file with a ``pot`` "
"file extension. This file can be placed anywhere in the project directory, "
"but it's recommended to keep it in a subdirectory such as ``locale``, as "
"each locale will be defined in its own file."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມ scene ຫຼື script ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ :button:`ສ້າງ (Generate)` ທີ່ມຸມຂວາເ"
"ທິງ, ຈາກນັ້ນລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສ້າງອອກມາດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ ``pot``. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສາມາດວາງໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄ"
"ດ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ເຊັ່ນ ``locale``, ເພາະວ່າແຕ່ລະລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈ"
"ະຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຂອງມັນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:92
msgid ""
"See :ref:`below <doc_localization_using_gettext_gdscript>` for how to add "
"comments for translators or exclude some strings from being added to the PO "
"template for GDScript files."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ດ້ານລຸ່ມ <doc_localization_using_gettext_gdscript>` ສຳລັບວິທີການເພີ່ມຄຳອະທິບ"
"າຍສຳລັບຜູ້ແປ ຫຼື ການຍົກເວັ້ນບາງຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ໃຫ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແມ່ແບບ PO ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:95
msgid ""
"You can then move over to :ref:`creating a messages file from a PO template "
"<doc_localization_using_gettext_messages_file>`."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດໄປທີ່ຂັ້ນຕອນ :ref:`ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກແມ່ແບບ PO "
"<doc_localization_using_gettext_messages_file>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:100
msgid ""
"Remember to regenerate the PO template after making any changes to "
"localizable strings, or after adding new scenes or scripts. Otherwise, newly "
"added strings will not be localizable and translators won't be able to "
"update translations for outdated strings."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການແປ, ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມ scenes ຫຼື "
"scripts ໃໝ່. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ ແລະ ຜູ້ແປຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດການແປສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ"
"ທີ່ຫຼ້າສະໄໝໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:106
msgid "Manual creation"
msgstr "ການສ້າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:108
msgid ""
"If the automatic generation approach doesn't work out for your needs, you "
"can create a PO template by hand in a text editor. This file can be placed "
"anywhere in the project directory, but it's recommended to keep it in a "
"subdirectory, as each locale will be defined in its own file."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການສ້າງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ຕອບໂຈດຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງແມ່ແບບ PO ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຕົວແ"
"ກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສາມາດວາງໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ເພາະວ່"
"າແຕ່ລະລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຂອງມັນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:113
msgid ""
"Create a directory named ``locale`` in the project directory. In this "
"directory, save a file named ``messages.pot`` with the following content:"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໂຟນເດີຊື່ວ່າ ``locale`` ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃນໂຟນເດີນີ້, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ຊື່ ``messages.pot`` ທີ່"
"ມີເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:137
msgid ""
"Messages in gettext are made of ``msgid`` and ``msgstr`` pairs. ``msgid`` is "
"the source string (usually in English), ``msgstr`` will be the translated "
"string."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ gettext ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄູ່ຂອງ ``msgid`` ແລະ ``msgstr``. ``msgid`` ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະ"
"ບັບ (ປົກກະຕິເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ), ສ່ວນ ``msgstr`` ຈະແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:143
msgid ""
"The ``msgstr`` value in PO template files (``.pot``) should **always** be "
"empty. Localization will be done in the generated ``.po`` files instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂອງ ``msgstr`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ PO (``.pot``) ຄວນຈະ **ວ່າງ** ຢູ່ສະເໝີ. ການແປຈະຖືກເຮັດໃນ"
"ໄຟລ໌ ``.po`` ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:149
msgid "Creating a messages file from a PO template"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກແມ່ແບບ PO"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:151
msgid ""
"The ``msginit`` command is used to turn a PO template into a messages file. "
"For instance, to create a French localization file, use the following "
"command while in the ``locale`` directory:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``msginit`` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແມ່ແບບ PO ໃຫ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການແປພາສາຝ"
"ຣັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``locale``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:159
msgid ""
"The command above will create a file named ``fr.po`` in the same directory "
"as the PO template."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຂ້າງເທິງຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ ``fr.po`` ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວກັນກັບແມ່ແບບ PO."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:162
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can do that graphically using Poedit, or by uploading the "
"POT file to your web platform of choice."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດແບບນັ້ນຜ່ານ GUI ໂດຍໃຊ້ Poedit, ຫຼື ໂດຍການອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ POT ໄປທີ່ແ"
"ພລັດຟອມເວັບທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:166
msgid "Loading a messages file in Godot"
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:168
msgid ""
"To register a messages file as a translation in a project, open "
"the :ui:`Project Settings`, then go to :menu:`Localization > Translations`, "
"click :button:`Add…` then choose the ``.po`` or ``.mo`` file in the file "
"dialog. The locale will be inferred from the ``\"Language: <code>\\n\"`` "
"property in the messages file."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນການແປໃນໂປຣເຈັກ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ :ui:`ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ (Project "
"Settings)`, ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ :menu:`ການເຮັດເປັນພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Localization) > ການແປ "
"(Translations)`, ຄລິກ :button:`ເພີ່ມ (Add…)` ແລ້ວເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ``.po`` ຫຼື ``.mo``. ລະຫັດທ້"
"ອງຖິ່ນຈະຖືກກວດສອບຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ ``\"Language: <code>\\n\"`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:174
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games` for more information on importing "
"and testing translations in Godot."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ການທົດສ"
"ອບການແປໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:178
msgid "Updating message files to follow the PO template"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ກົງຕາມແມ່ແບບ PO"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:180
msgid ""
"After updating the PO template, you will have to update message files so "
"that they contain new strings, while removing strings that are no longer "
"present in the PO template. This can be done automatically using the "
"``msgmerge`` tool:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກອັບເດດແມ່ແບບ PO ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນມີຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໆ, ພ້ອມທັງລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່"
"ມີຢູ່ໃນແມ່ແບບ PO ອອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື ``msgmerge``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:190
#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:332
msgid ""
"If you want to keep a backup of the original message file (which would be "
"saved as ``fr.po~`` in this example), remove the ``--backup=none`` argument."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເກັບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໄວ້ສຳຮອງ (ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນ ``fr.po~`` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້), ໃຫ້ເ"
"ອົາອາກິວເມັນ ``--backup=none`` ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:195
msgid ""
"After running ``msgmerge``, strings which were modified in the source "
"language will have a \"fuzzy\" comment added before them in the ``.po`` "
"file. This comment denotes that the translation should be updated to match "
"the new source string, as the translation will most likely be inaccurate "
"until it's updated."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຣັນ ``msgmerge``, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ \"fuzzy\" ເພີ່ມໄວ້ທາງໜ້"
"າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``.po``. ຄຳອະທິບາຍນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າການແປຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໃໝ່, ເ"
"ພາະວ່າການແປນັ້ນມັກຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈົນກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:200
msgid ""
"Strings with \"fuzzy\" comments will **not** be read by Godot until the "
"translation is updated and the \"fuzzy\" comment is removed."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ \"fuzzy\" ຈະ **ບໍ່** ຖືກອ່ານໂດຍ Godot ຈົນກວ່າການແປຈະຖືກອັບເດດ ແລະ ຄຳອ"
"ະທິບາຍ \"fuzzy\" ຖືກເອົາອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:204
msgid "Checking the validity of a PO file or template"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ແມ່ແບບ PO"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:206
msgid "It is possible to check whether a gettext file's syntax is valid."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະກວດສອບວ່າໄວຍາກອນ (syntax) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ gettext ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:208
msgid ""
"If you open with Poeditor, it will display the appropriate warnings if "
"there's some syntax errors. You can also verify by running the gettext "
"command below:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າເປີດດ້ວຍ Poeditor, ມັນຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທາງໄວຍາກອນ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂ"
"ດຍການຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ gettext ດ້ານລຸ່ມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:215
msgid ""
"If there are syntax errors or warnings, they will be displayed in the "
"console. Otherwise, ``msgfmt`` won't output anything."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທາງໄວຍາກອນ ຫຼື ຄຳເຕືອນ, ມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຄອນໂຊນ (console). ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"``msgfmt`` ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນໃດໆອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:219
msgid "Using binary MO files (useful for large projects only)"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ binary MO (ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:221
msgid ""
"For large projects with several thousands of strings to translate or more, "
"it can be worth it to use binary (compiled) MO message files instead of text-"
"based PO files. Binary MO files are smaller and faster to read than the "
"equivalent PO files."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍພັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງແປ, ມັນອາດຈະຄຸ້ມຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ MO ແບບໄບນ"
"າຣີ (ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວ) ແທນໄຟລ໌ PO ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ໄຟລ໌ MO ແບບໄບນາຣີຈະມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໄດ້ໄວ"
"ກວ່າໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:226
msgid "You can generate an MO file with the command below:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ MO ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:232
msgid ""
"If the PO file is valid, this command will create an ``fr.mo`` file besides "
"the PO file. This MO file can then be loaded in Godot as described above."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ PO ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``fr.mo`` ໄວ້ຂ້າງໆໄຟລ໌ PO. ຈາກນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ MO ນີ້ສາມາດຖືກໂຫຼດ"
"ເຂົ້າໃນ Godot ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:235
msgid ""
"The original PO file should be kept in version control so you can update "
"your translation in the future. In case you lose the original PO file and "
"wish to decompile an MO file into a text-based PO file, you can do so with:"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ PO ຕົ້ນສະບັບຄວນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດອັບເດດກາ"
"ນແປໃນອະນາຄົດໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າເສຍໄຟລ໌ PO ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ MO ກັບຄືນເປັນໄຟລ໌ PO ແ"
"ບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:243
msgid ""
"The decompiled file will not include comments or fuzzy strings, as these are "
"never compiled in the MO file in the first place."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນກັບຄືນມາຈະບໍ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments) ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ fuzzy, ເພາະວ່າສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກຄອມໄພ"
"ລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ MO ຕັ້ງແຕ່ທຳອິດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:249
msgid "Extracting localizable strings from GDScript files"
msgstr "ການດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປໄດ້ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:251
msgid ""
"The built-in `editor plugin <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/modules/gdscript/editor/gdscript_translation_parser_plugin.h>`_ "
"recognizes a variety of patterns in source code to extract localizable "
"strings from GDScript files, including but not limited to the following:"
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor plugin) ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ ຈະຮັບຮູ້ຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆໃນຊອດໂຄດ (source code) ເພື່"
"ອດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປໄດ້ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ GDScript, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳກັດພຽງແຕ່ສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:255
msgid "``tr()``, ``tr_n()``, ``atr()``, and ``atr_n()`` calls;"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``tr()``, ``tr_n()``, ``atr()``, ແລະ ``atr_n()``;"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:256
msgid ""
"assigning properties ``text``, ``placeholder_text``, and ``tooltip_text``;"
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ``text``, ``placeholder_text``, ແລະ "
"``tooltip_text``;"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:257
msgid "``add_tab()``, ``add_item()``, ``set_tab_title()``, and other calls;"
msgstr ""
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``add_tab()``, ``add_item()``, ``set_tab_title()``, ແລະ ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ອື່ນໆ;"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:258
msgid "``FileDialog`` filters like ``\"*.png ; PNG Images\"``."
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີ (filters) ຂອງ ``FileDialog`` ເຊັ່ນ ``\"*.png ; PNG Images\"``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:262
msgid ""
"The argument or right operand must be a constant string, otherwise the "
"plugin will not be able to evaluate the expression and will ignore it."
msgstr ""
"ອາກິວເມັນ ຫຼື ຕົວດຳເນີນການດ້ານຂວາຕ້ອງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຄົງທີ່ (constant string), ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ປລັກອິນຈະບໍ່ສາມ"
"າດປະເມີນນິພົດນັ້ນໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະລະເລີຍມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:265
msgid ""
"If the plugin extracts unnecessary strings, you can ignore them with the "
"``NO_TRANSLATE`` comment. You can also provide additional information for "
"translators using the ``TRANSLATORS:`` comment. These comments must be "
"placed either on the same line as the recognized pattern or precede it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າປລັກອິນດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກມາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະເລີຍພວກມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳອະທິບາຍ "
"``NO_TRANSLATE``. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຜູ້ແປໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳອະທິບາຍ "
"``TRANSLATORS:``. ຄຳອະທິບາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ໃນແຖວດຽວກັນກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ລະບຸ ຫຼື ວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:283
msgid "Using context"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ບໍລິບົດ (context)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:285
msgid ""
"The ``context`` parameter can be used to differentiate the situation where a "
"translation is used, or to differentiate polysemic words (words with "
"multiple meanings)."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``context`` ສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກສະຖານະການທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ການແປ, ຫຼື ເພື່ອແຍກຄຳທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຄວາມ"
"ໝາຍ (polysemic words)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:288
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:351
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:48
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:103
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:73
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:157
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:148
#: ../../docs/engine_details/class_reference/index.rst:249
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:297
msgid ""
"In a gettext PO file, a string with a context can be defined as follows:"
