#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:312
msgid "Updating PO files"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:314
msgid ""
"Some time or later, you'll add new content to our game, and there will be "
"new strings that need to be translated. When this happens, you'll need to "
"update the existing PO files to include the new strings."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຊ້າກໍໄວ, ເຈົ້າຈະເພີ່ມເນື້ອຫາໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນເກມ, ແລະ ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໆທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ແປ. ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້"
"ອງອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລວມເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໆນັ້ນນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:318
msgid ""
"First, generate a new POT file containing all the existing strings plus the "
"newly added strings. After that, merge the existing PO files with the new "
"POT file. There are two ways to do this:"
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ POT ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ ລວມທັງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລວມ (merge) "
"ໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ມີຢູ່ກັບໄຟລ໌ POT ໃໝ່. ມີສອງວິທີທີ່ຈະເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:322
msgid ""
"Use a gettext editor, and it should have an option to update a PO file from "
"a POT file."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ gettext, ເຊິ່ງມັນຄວນຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ຈາກໄຟລ໌ POT."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:325
msgid "Use the gettext ``msgmerge`` tool:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື gettext ``msgmerge``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:336
msgid "POT generation custom plugin"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນສຳລັບການສ້າງ POT ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:338
msgid ""
"If you have any extra file format to deal with, you could write a custom "
"plugin to parse and and extract the strings from the custom file. This "
"custom plugin will extract the strings and write into the POT file when you "
"hit **Generate POT**. To learn more about how to create the translation "
"parser plugin, see :ref:`EditorTranslationParserPlugin "
"<class_EditorTranslationParserPlugin>`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນປລັກອິນແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອວິເຄາະ ແລະ ດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"
"ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ. ປລັກອິນນີ້ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ POT ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກົດ **ສ້າງ POT (Generate "
"POT)**. ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງປລັກອິນວິເຄາະການແປ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`EditorTranslationParserPlugin <class_EditorTranslationParserPlugin>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:4
msgid "Locale codes"
msgstr "ລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:8
msgid ""
"Locale code has the following format: ``language_Script_COUNTRY_VARIANT``, "
"where:"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນມີຮູບແບບດັ່ງນີ້: ``language_Script_COUNTRY_VARIANT``, ໂດຍທີ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:10
msgid "``language`` - 2 or 3-letter language code, in lower case."
msgstr "``language`` - ລະຫັດພາສາ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:11
msgid "``Script`` - optional, 4-letter script code, in title case."
msgstr ""
"``Script`` - (ຕົວເລືອກ) ລະຫັດຕົວຂຽນ 4 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:12
msgid "``COUNTRY`` - optional, 2-letter country code, in upper case."
msgstr "``COUNTRY`` - (ຕົວເລືອກ) ລະຫັດປະເທດ 2 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/locales.rst:13
msgid ""
"``VARIANT`` - optional, language variant, region and, sort order. A variant "
"can have any number of underscored keywords."
msgstr ""
"``VARIANT`` - (ຕົວເລືອກ) ຮູບແບບຍ່ອຍຂອງພາສາ, ພາກພື້ນ ແລະ ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ. ຮູບແບບຍ່ອຍສາມາດ"
"ມີຄຳຫຼັກທີ່ເຊື່ອມດ້ວຍຂີດກ້ອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄຳ."

