#: ../../docs/tutorials/math/matrices_and_transforms.rst:546
msgid ""
"The \"affine_inverse\" function returns a transform that \"undoes\" the "
"previous transform. This can be useful in some situations. Let's take a look "
"at a few examples."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ \"affine_inverse\" ຈະຄືນຄ່າ transform ທີ່ \"ຍົກເລີກ\" transform ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະ"
"ໂຫຍດໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ລອງມາເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງບາງອັນ."

