msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຂະຫຍາຍຈາກອັນກ່ອນໜ້າ, ໂດຍການແຍກ peers ອອກເປັນສອງ scene ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`singleton <doc_singletons_autoload>` ເປັນ signaling server."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/webrtc.rst:154
msgid "And now for the local signaling server:"
msgstr "ແລະ ບັດນີ້ສຳລັບ local signaling server:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/webrtc.rst:156
msgid ""
"This local signaling server is supposed to be used as a :ref:`singleton "
