msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/webrtc.rst:215
msgid "This will print something similar to this:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/webrtc.rst:223
msgid "Remote signaling with WebSocket"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Remote Signaling ດ້ວຍ WebSocket"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/webrtc.rst:225
msgid ""
"A more advanced demo using WebSocket for signaling peers "
