msgstr "``floor_stop_on_slope`` - *ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:* ``true``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/using_character_body_2d.rst:104
msgid ""
"This parameter prevents a body from sliding down slopes when standing still."
msgstr ""
"ພາມິເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸສະໄລ້ລົງຈາກທາງລາດຊັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢືນຢູ່ຊື່ໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/using_character_body_2d.rst:106
msgid ""
"``wall_min_slide_angle`` - *default value:* ``0.261799`` (in radians, "
"equivalent to ``15`` degrees)"
msgstr ""
"``wall_min_slide_angle`` - *ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:* ``0.261799`` (ເປັນເຣດຽນ, ເທົ່າກັບ ``15`` ອົງ"
"ສາ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/using_character_body_2d.rst:108
msgid ""
