#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:89
msgid ""
"If using ``gradle``, add the following to the ``dependency`` section of the "
"app's gradle build file. Make sure to update ``<version>`` to the latest "
"version of the Godot Android library:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ ``gradle``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມລຸ່ມນີ້ໃສ່ໃນສ່ວນ ``dependency`` ຂອງໄຟລ໌ gradle. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄ"
"ດ້ປ່ຽນ ``<version>`` ເປັນລຸ້ນລ້າສຸດຂອງ Godot Android library:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:95
msgid ""
"If using ``gradle``, include the following ``aaptOptions`` configuration "
"under the ``android > defaultConfig`` section of the app's gradle build "
"file. Doing so allows ``gradle`` to include Godot's hidden directories when "
"building the app binary."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ ``gradle``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``aaptOptions`` ລຸ່ມນີ້ໃສ່ໃນສ່ວນ ``android > "
"defaultConfig``. ການເຮັດແບບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ``gradle`` ສາມາດລວມເອົາ folder ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຂອ"
"ງ Godot ເຂົ້າໃນການ build ແອັບໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:97
msgid ""
"If your build system does not support including hidden directories, you can "
"configure the Godot project to not use hidden directories by "
"deselecting :ref:`Application > Config > Use Hidden Project Data "
"Directory<class_ProjectSettings_property_application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory>` in the Project Settings."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະບົບ build ຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການລວມ folder ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ project Godot ບໍ່ໃ"
"ຫ້ໃຊ້ folder ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ :ref:`Application > Config > Use "
"Hidden Project Data Directory<class_ProjectSettings_property_application/"
"config/use_hidden_project_data_directory>` ໃນ Project Settings."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:114
msgid ""
"Create / update the application's Activity that will be hosting the Godot "
"Engine instance. For the sample app, this is `MainActivity <https://"
"github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/"
"main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/MainActivity.kt>`_"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດ Activity ຂອງແອັບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວໂຮສ Godot Engine instance. ສຳລັບແອັບຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງ, ມັນຄື `MainActivity <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/"
"master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/"
"MainActivity.kt>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:116
msgid ""
"The host Activity should implement the `GodotHost interface <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/GodotHost.java>`_"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວ Activity ທີ່ເປັນໂຮສຄວນຈະ implement `GodotHost interface <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/"
"godot/GodotHost.java>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:117
msgid ""
"The sample app uses `Fragments <https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"fragments>`_ to organize its UI, so it uses `GodotFragment <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/GodotFragment.java>`_, a fragment component provided by "
"the Godot Android library to automatically host and manage the Godot Engine "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບຕົວຢ່າງໃຊ້ `Fragments <https://developer.android.com/guide/fragments>`_ ໃນການ"
"ຈັດການ UI, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ `GodotFragment <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/"
"GodotFragment.java>`_, ເຊິ່ງເປັນ component ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ Godot Android library ເພື່ອໂຮ"
"ສ ແລະ ຈັດການ Godot Engine instance ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:142
msgid ""
"The Godot Android library also provide `GodotActivity <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/"
"godot/GodotActivity.kt>`_, an Activity component that can be extended to "
"automatically host and manage the Godot Engine instance."
msgstr ""
"Godot Android library ຍັງມີ `GodotActivity <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/"
"GodotActivity.kt>`_, ເຊິ່ງເປັນ Activity component ທີ່ສາມາດນຳໄປຂະຫຍາຍ (extend) ເພື່ອໂ"
"ຮສ ແລະ ຈັດການ Godot Engine instance ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:144
msgid ""
"Alternatively, applications can directly create a `Godot <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/"
"godot/Godot.kt>`_ instance, host and manage it themselves."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ແອັບສາມາດສ້າງ `Godot <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/Godot.kt>`_ "
"instance ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຈັດການມັນດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:146
msgid ""
"Using `GodotHost#getHostPlugins(...) <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Samples/blob/0e3440f357f8be5b4c63a4fe75766793199a99d0/apps/"
"gltf_viewer/src/main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/"
"MainActivity.kt#L55>`_, the sample app creates a `runtime GodotPlugin "
"instance <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/"
"gltf_viewer/src/main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/"
"AppPlugin.kt>`_ that's used to send :ref:`signals <doc_signals>` to the "
"``gdscript`` logic"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ `GodotHost#getHostPlugins(...) <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Samples/blob/0e3440f357f8be5b4c63a4fe75766793199a99d0/apps/"
"gltf_viewer/src/main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/"
"MainActivity.kt#L55>`_, ແອັບຕົວຢ່າງຈະສ້າງ `runtime GodotPlugin instance <https://"
"github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/"
"main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/AppPlugin.kt>`_ ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງ "
":ref:`signals <doc_signals>` ໄປຫາ logic ຂອງ ``gdscript``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:148
msgid ""
"The runtime ``GodotPlugin`` can also be used by ``gdscript`` logic to access "
"JVM methods. For more information, see :ref:`Godot Android plugins "
"<doc_android_plugin>`."
msgstr ""
"Runtime ``GodotPlugin`` ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ ``gdscript`` ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ JVM methods ໄ"
"ດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Godot Android plugins <doc_android_plugin>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:150
msgid "Add any additional logic that will be used by your application"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ logic ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ແອັບຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:152
msgid ""
"For the sample app, this includes adding the `ItemsSelectionFragment "
"fragment <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/"
"gltf_viewer/src/main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/"
"ItemsSelectionFragment.kt>`_ (and related classes), a fragment used to build "
"and show the list of glTF items"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບແອັບຕົວຢ່າງ, ນີ້ລວມເຖິງການເພີ່ມ `ItemsSelectionFragment fragment <https://"
"github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/"
"main/java/fhuyakou/godot/app/android/gltfviewer/ItemsSelectionFragment.kt>`_ "
"(ແລະ class ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ), ເຊິ່ງເປັນ fragment ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ສະແດງລາຍການ glTF"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:154
msgid ""
"Open the ``AndroidManifest.xml`` file, and configure the orientation if "
"needed using the `android:screenOrientation attribute <https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-element#screen>`_"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ``AndroidManifest.xml``, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ orientation ຖ້າຈຳເປັນໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"`android:screenOrientation attribute <https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"topics/manifest/activity-element#screen>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:156
msgid ""
"If needed, disable automatic resizing / orientation configuration changes "
"using the `android:configChanges attribute <https://developer.android.com/"
"guide/topics/manifest/activity-element#config>`_"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ / ປ່ຽນ orientation ອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"`android:configChanges attribute <https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"manifest/activity-element#config>`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:170
msgid "2. Create the Godot project"
msgstr "2. ສ້າງ project Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:174
msgid ""
"On Android, Godot's project files are exported to the ``assets`` directory "
"of the generated ``apk`` binary."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Android, ໄຟລ໌ project ຂອງ Godot ຈະຖືກ export ໄປທີ່ folder ``assets`` ຂອງໄຟລ໌ "
"``apk`` ທີ່ຖືກ build ອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:176
msgid ""
"We leverage that architecture to bind our Android app and Godot project "
"together by creating the Godot project in the Android app's ``assets`` "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງນັ້ນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມໂຍງແອັບ Android ແລະ project Godot ເຂົ້າກັນ ໂດຍການສ້າງ "
"project Godot ໄວ້ໃນ folder ``assets`` ຂອງແອັບ Android."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:178
msgid ""
"Note that it's also possible to create the Godot project in a separate "
"directory and export it as a `PCK or ZIP file <https://docs.godotengine.org/"
"en/stable/tutorials/export/exporting_projects.html#pck-versus-zip-pack-file-"
"formats>`_ to the Android app's ``assets`` directory. Using this approach "
"requires passing the ``--main-pack "
"<pck_or_zip_filepath_relative_to_assets_dir>`` argument to the hosted Godot "
"Engine instance using `GodotHost#getCommandLine() <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/6916349697a4339216469e9bf5899b983d78db07/platform/"
"android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/GodotHost.java#L45>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ project Godot ໃນ folder ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ export ເປັນໄຟລ໌ `PCK "
"ຫຼື ZIP <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/export/"
"exporting_projects.html#pck-versus-zip-pack-file-formats>`_ ໄປທີ່ folder "
"``assets`` ຂອງແອັບ Android ໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ການໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການສົ່ງ argument ``--main-pack "
"<pck_or_zip_filepath_relative_to_assets_dir>`` ໄປຫາ Godot Engine instance ໂດຍ"
"ໃຊ້ `GodotHost#getCommandLine() <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"6916349697a4339216469e9bf5899b983d78db07/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/GodotHost.java#L45>`_."

