#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:46
msgid ""
"Each plugin has an init class extending from the `GodotPlugin <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/"
"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/"
"GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ class which is provided by the :ref:`Godot Android "
"library <doc_android_library>`."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະ plugin ຈະມີ init class ທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍ (extend) ມາຈາກ `GodotPlugin <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/"
"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/"
"GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ :ref:`Godot Android library "
"<doc_android_library>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:49
msgid ""
"The ``GodotPlugin`` class provides APIs to access the running Godot instance "
"and hook into its lifecycle. It is loaded at runtime by the Godot engine."
msgstr ""
"Class ``GodotPlugin`` ມີ API ສຳລັບເຂົ້າເຖິງ Godot instance ທີ່ກຳນົດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັ"
"ບ lifecycle ຂອງມັນ. ມັນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໃນຕອນ runtime ໂດຍ Godot engine."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:52
msgid "v2 Packaging format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການແພັກ (Packaging) v2"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:54
msgid ""
"v1 Android plugins required a custom ``gdap`` configuration file that was "
"used by the Godot Editor to detect and load them. However this approach had "
"several drawbacks, primary ones being that it lacked flexibility and "
"departed from the `existing Godot EditorExportPlugin format, delivery and "
"installation flow <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/"
"editor/installing_plugins.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ Android v1 ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ ``gdap`` ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ Godot Editor ເ"
"ພື່ອກວດຫາ ແລະ ໂຫຼດພວກມັນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີການນີ້ມີຂໍ້ເສຍຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ຂໍ້ເສຍຫຼັກແມ່ນມັນຂາດຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່"
"ນ ແລະ ແຕກຕ່າງໄປຈາກ `ຮູບແບບ, ການສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ EditorExportPlugin ຂອງ "
"Godot ທີ່ມີຢູ່ <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/editor/"
"installing_plugins.html>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:58
msgid ""
"This has been resolved for v2 Android plugins by deprecating the ``gdap`` "
"packaging and configuration mechanism in favor of the existing Godot "
"``EditorExportPlugin`` packaging format. The ``EditorExportPlugin`` API in "
"turn has been extended to properly support Android plugins."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນ Android plugin v2 ໂດຍການຍົກເລີກການແພັກແບບ ``gdap`` ແລະ ປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ຮູບ"
"ແບບ ``EditorExportPlugin`` ແທນ. API ຂອງ ``EditorExportPlugin`` ກໍໄດ້ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍເພື່ອ"
"ໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ Android plugins ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

