msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດ symbolicate crash logs ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `ndk-stack <https://"
"developer.android.com/ndk/guides/ndk-stack>`_ ທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນ Android NDK."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/resolving_crashes_on_android.rst:96
msgid ""
"If you already have the Android SDK installed, you can find the ``ndk-"
