msgstr "ການສ້າງປລັກອິນ iOS"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page explains what iOS plugins can do for you, how to use an existing "
"plugin, and the steps to code a new one."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບສິ່ງທີ່ປລັກອິນ iOS ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້, ວິທີການໃຊ້ປລັກອິນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການຂ"
"ຽນລະຫັດສຳລັບປລັກອິນໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:10
msgid ""
"iOS plugins allow you to use third-party libraries and support iOS-specific "
"features like In-App Purchases, GameCenter integration, ARKit support, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ iOS ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ຈາກພາຍນອກ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະຂອ"
"ງ iOS ເຊັ່ນ: In-App Purchases, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ GameCenter, ການຮອງຮັບ ARKit ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:13
msgid "Loading and using an existing plugin"
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ປລັກອິນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:15
msgid ""
"An iOS plugin requires a ``.gdip`` configuration file, a binary file which "
"can be either ``.a`` static library or ``.xcframework`` containing ``.a`` "
"static libraries, and possibly other dependencies. To use it, you need to:"
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ iOS ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ ``.gdip``, ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນ static library ແບບ "
"``.a`` ຫຼື ``.xcframework`` ທີ່ບັນຈຸ static libraries ແບບ ``.a``, ແລະ ອາດຈະມີ "
"dependencies ອື່ນໆ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ມັນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:17
msgid ""
"Copy the plugin's files to your Godot project's ``res://ios/plugins`` "
"directory. You can also group files in a sub-directory, like ``res://ios/"
"plugins/my_plugin``."
msgstr ""
"ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຂອງປລັກອິນໄປໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``res://ios/plugins`` ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່າ"
"ນຍັງສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມໄຟລ໌ໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ``res://ios/plugins/my_plugin``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Godot editor automatically detects and imports ``.gdip`` files inside "
"``res://ios/plugins`` and its subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ຂອງ Godot ຈະກວດຫາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ ``.gdip`` ພາຍໃນ ``res://ios/"
"plugins`` ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:21
msgid ""
"You can find and activate detected plugins by going to Project -> Export... "
"-> iOS and in the Options tab, scrolling to the Plugins section."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ປລັກອິນທີ່ກວດພົບໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ Project -> Export... -> iOS ແລ"
"ະ ໃນແຖບ Options, ເລື່ອນລົງໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ Plugins."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:25
msgid ""
"When a plugin is active, you can access it in your code using "
"``Engine.get_singleton()``:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອປລັກອິນເປີດໃຊ້ວຽກ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໄດ້ໃນໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ ``Engine.get_singleton()"
"``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:35
msgid ""
"The plugin's files have to be in the ``res://ios/plugins/`` directory or a "
"subdirectory, otherwise the Godot editor will not automatically detect them."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຂອງປລັກອິນຈະຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``res://ios/plugins/`` ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຕົວແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ Godot ຈະບໍ່ກວດພົບພວກມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:38
