msgid ""
"Create a Godot iOS Plugin configuration file to help the system detect and "
"load your plugin:"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ Godot iOS Plugin ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລະບົບກວດຫາ ແລະ ໂຫຼດປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:83
msgid ""
"The configuration file extension must be ``gdip`` (e.g.: ``MyPlugin.gdip``)."
msgstr "ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຈະຕ້ອງເປັນ ``gdip`` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``MyPlugin.gdip``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:85
msgid "The configuration file format is as follow:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:119
msgid "The ``config`` section and fields are required and defined as follow:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ ``config`` ແລະ ຟິວ (fields) ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:121
msgid "**name**: name of the plugin"
msgstr "**name**: ຊື່ຂອງປລັກອິນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:123
msgid ""
"**binary**: this should be the filepath of the plugin library (``a`` or "
"``xcframework``) file."
msgstr ""
"**binary**: ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (filepath) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄລບຣາຣີປລັກອິນ (``a`` ຫຼື "
"``xcframework``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:125
msgid ""
"The filepath can be relative (e.g.: ``MyPlugin.a``, "
"``MyPlugin.xcframework``) in which case it's relative to the directory where "
"the ``gdip`` file is located."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ສາມາດເປັນແບບ relative (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``MyPlugin.a``, "
"``MyPlugin.xcframework``) ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນມັນຈະທຽບກັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ ``gdip`` ຕັ້ງຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:126
msgid ""
"The filepath can be absolute: ``res://some_path/MyPlugin.a`` or ``res://"
"some_path/MyPlugin.xcframework``."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ສາມາດເປັນແບບ absolute: ``res://some_path/MyPlugin.a`` ຫຼື ``res://"
"some_path/MyPlugin.xcframework``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:127
msgid ""
"In case you need multitarget library usage, the filename should be "
"``MyPlugin.a`` and ``.a`` files should be named as ``MyPlugin.release.a`` "
"and ``MyPlugin.debug.a``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີແບບ multitarget, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄວນຈະເປັນ ``MyPlugin.a`` ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ "
"``.a`` ຄວນຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ເປັນ ``MyPlugin.release.a`` ແລະ ``MyPlugin.debug.a``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:128
msgid ""
"In case you use multitarget ``xcframework`` libraries, their filename in the "
"configuration should be ``MyPlugin.xcframework``. The ``.xcframework`` files "
"should be named as ``MyPlugin.release.xcframework`` and "
"``MyPlugin.debug.xcframework``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ ``xcframework`` ແບບ multitarget, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງພວກມັນໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າຄວ"
"ນຈະເປັນ ``MyPlugin.xcframework``. ໄຟລ໌ ``.xcframework`` ຄວນຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ເປັນ "
"``MyPlugin.release.xcframework`` ແລະ ``MyPlugin.debug.xcframework``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:130
msgid ""
"The ``dependencies`` and ``plist`` sections are optional and defined as "
"follow:"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນ ``dependencies`` ແລະ ``plist`` ແມ່ນບໍ່ບັງຄັບ ແລະ ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:132
msgid "**dependencies**:"
msgstr "**dependencies**:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:134
msgid ""
"**linked**: contains a list of iOS frameworks that the iOS application "
"should be linked with."
msgstr ""
"**linked**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງ iOS frameworks ທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ iOS ຄວນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (linked) ນ"
"ຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:136
msgid ""
"**embedded**: contains a list of iOS frameworks or libraries that should be "
"both linked and embedded into the resulting iOS application."
msgstr ""
"**embedded**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງ iOS frameworks ຫຼື ໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກທັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຝັງ "
"(embedded) ເຂົ້າໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ iOS ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:138
msgid ""
"**system**: contains a list of iOS system frameworks that are required for "
"plugin."
msgstr "**system**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງ iOS system frameworks ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບປລັກອິນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:140
msgid ""
"**capabilities**: contains a list of iOS capabilities that is required for "
"plugin. A list of available capabilities can be found at `Apple "
"UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities documentation page <https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/information_property_list/"
"uirequireddevicecapabilities>`_."
msgstr ""
"**capabilities**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄວາມສາມາດ (capabilities) ຂອງ iOS ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບປລັກອິ"
"ນ. ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໄດ້ທີ່ `ໜ້າເອກະສານ Apple "
"UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/information_property_list/uirequireddevicecapabilities>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:142
msgid ""
"**files**: contains a list of files that should be copied on export. This is "
"useful for data files or images."
msgstr ""
"**files**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ຮູບພາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:144
msgid ""
"**linker_flags**: contains a list of linker flags to add to the Xcode "
"project when exporting the plugin."
msgstr ""
"**linker_flags**: ບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງ linker flags ທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກປລັກ"
"ອິນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:146
msgid ""
"**plist**: should have keys and values that should be present in "
"``Info.plist`` file."
msgstr ""
"**plist**: ຄວນມີ keys ແລະ values ທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງປະກົດຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``Info.plist``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:148
msgid "Each line should follow pattern: ``KeyName:KeyType=KeyValue``"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແຖວຄວນເປັນໄປຕາມຮູບແບບ: ``KeyName:KeyType=KeyValue``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:149
msgid ""
"Supported values for ``KeyType`` are ``string``, ``integer``, ``boolean``, "
"``raw``, ``string_input``"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ ``KeyType`` ແມ່ນ ``string``, ``integer``, ``boolean``, ``raw``, "
"``string_input``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:150
msgid ""
"If no type is used (e.g.: ``KeyName=\"KeyValue\"``) ``string`` type will be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ປະເພດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``KeyName=\"KeyValue\"``) ປະເພດ ``string`` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:151
msgid ""
"If ``raw`` type is used value for corresponding key will be stored in "
"``Info.plist`` as is."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກໃຊ້ປະເພດ ``raw`` ຄ່າສຳລັບ key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ``Info.plist`` ຕາມນັ້ນເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/ios_plugin.rst:152
msgid ""
"If ``string_input`` type is used you will be able to modify value in Export "
"window."
msgstr "ຫາກໃຊ້ປະເພດ ``string_input`` ທ່ານຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຄ່າໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Export."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:4
msgid "The JavaScriptBridge singleton"
msgstr "JavaScriptBridge singleton"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:6
msgid ""
"In web builds, the :ref:`JavaScriptBridge <class_JavaScriptBridge>` "
"singleton allows interaction with JavaScript and web browsers, and can be "
"used to implement some functionalities unique to the web platform."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການບິວດ໌ສຳລັບເວັບ, :ref:`JavaScriptBridge <class_JavaScriptBridge>` singleton ຊ່"
"ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ JavaScript ແລະ ເວັບບຣາວເຊີໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງບາງຟັງຊັນທີ່ເປັນເອກ"
"ະລັກສະເພາະຂອງແພລດຟອມເວັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:11
msgid "Interacting with JavaScript"
msgstr "ການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ JavaScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:13
msgid ""
"Sometimes, when exporting Godot for the Web, it might be necessary to "
"interface with external JavaScript code like third-party SDKs, libraries, or "
"simply to access browser features that are not directly exposed by Godot."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ Godot ສຳລັບເວັບ, ມັນອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂຄ້ດ JavaScript ພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່"
"ນ: SDK ຈາກພາຍນອກ, ໄລບຣາຣີ, ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງບຣາວເຊີທີ່ Godot ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງອອກມ"
"າໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:17
msgid ""
"The ``JavaScriptBridge`` singleton provides methods to wrap a native "
"JavaScript object into a Godot :ref:`JavaScriptObject "
"<class_JavaScriptObject>` that tries to feel natural in the context of Godot "
"scripting (e.g. GDScript and C#)."
msgstr ""
"``JavaScriptBridge`` singleton ມອບວິທີການໃນການຫຸ້ມ (wrap) ອອບເຈັກ JavaScript ແບບເນ"
"ທີຟໃຫ້ເປັນ Godot :ref:`JavaScriptObject <class_JavaScriptObject>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ສຶກເປັນທຳມ"
"ະຊາດໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ Godot (ເຊັ່ນ: GDScript ແລະ C#)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:21
msgid ""
"The :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.get_interface() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_get_interface>` method retrieves an object in "
"the global scope."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.get_interface() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_get_interface>` ຈະດຶງເອົາອອບເຈັກໃນຂອບເຂດທົ່ວໂລກ "
"(global scope)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:34
msgid ""
"The :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.create_object() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_create_object>` creates a new object via the "
"JavaScript ``new`` constructor."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.create_object() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_create_object>` ຈະສ້າງອອບເຈັກໃໝ່ຜ່ານ JavaScript "
"``new`` constructor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:53
msgid ""
"As you can see, by wrapping JavaScript objects into ``JavaScriptObject`` you "
"can interact with them like they were native Godot objects, calling their "
"methods, and retrieving (or even setting) their properties."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນ, ໂດຍການຫຸ້ມອອບເຈັກ JavaScript ເຂົ້າໃນ ``JavaScriptObject`` ທ່ານສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບ"
"ກັບພວກມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບວ່າພວກມັນເປັນອອບເຈັກ Godot ແບບເນທີຟ, ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ, ແລະ ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (ຫຼື ແມ່ນ"
"ແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ) ຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:57
msgid ""
"Base types (int, floats, strings, booleans) are automatically converted "
"(floats might lose precision when converted from Godot to JavaScript). "
"Anything else (i.e. objects, arrays, functions) are seen as "
"``JavaScriptObjects`` themselves."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດພື້ນຖານ (int, floats, strings, booleans) ຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (floats ອາດຈະສູ"
"ນເສຍຄວາມລະອຽດເມື່ອແປງຈາກ Godot ເປັນ JavaScript). ສິ່ງອື່ນໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: ອອບເຈັກ, ອາເຣ, ຟັງຊັ"
"ນ) ຈະຖືກເບິ່ງວ່າເປັນ ``JavaScriptObjects`` ໃນຕົວຂອງມັນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:62
msgid "Callbacks"
msgstr "ຄອນແບັກ (Callbacks)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:64
msgid ""
"Calling JavaScript code from Godot is nice, but sometimes you need to call a "
"Godot function from JavaScript instead."
msgstr ""
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດ JavaScript ຈາກ Godot ແມ່ນເປັນເລື່ອງທີ່ດີ, ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"Godot ຈາກ JavaScript ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:67
msgid ""
"This case is a bit more complicated. JavaScript relies on garbage "
"collection, while Godot uses reference counting for memory management. This "
"means you have to explicitly create callbacks (which are returned as "
"``JavaScriptObjects`` themselves) and you have to keep their reference."
msgstr ""
"ກໍລະນີນີ້ນັບວ່າຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ. JavaScript ອາໄສ garbage collection, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Godot ໃຊ້ "
"reference counting ສຳລັບການຈັດການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ callbacks ຢ່າງ"
"ຊັດເຈນ (ເຊິ່ງຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາເປັນ ``JavaScriptObjects`` ໃນຕົວຂອງມັນເອງ) ແລະ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເກັບການອ້າງ"
"ອີງ (reference) ຂອງພວກມັນໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:72
msgid ""
"Arguments passed by JavaScript to the callback will be passed as a single "
"Godot ``Array``."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມນ (Arguments) ທີ່ສົ່ງໂດຍ JavaScript ໄປຍັງ callback ຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Godot "
"``Array`` ອັນດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:98
msgid ""
"Callback methods created via :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.get_interface() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_get_interface>` (``_my_callback`` in the "
"above example) **must** take exactly one :ref:`Array<class_Array>` argument, "
"which is going to be the JavaScript `arguments object <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/"
"arguments>`__ converted to an array. Otherwise, the callback method will not "
"be called."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ callback ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານ :ref:`JavaScriptBridge.get_interface() "
"<class_JavaScriptBridge_method_get_interface>` (``_my_callback`` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິ"
"ງ) **ຈະຕ້ອງ** ຮັບອາຄິວເມນ :ref:`Array<class_Array>` ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນ "
"JavaScript `arguments object <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"JavaScript/Reference/Functions/arguments>`__ ທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນອາເຣ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມທອດ "
"callback ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:103
msgid ""
"Here is another example that asks the user for the `Notification permission "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Notifications_API>`__ and "
"waits asynchronously to deliver a notification if the permission is granted:"
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນອີກຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງທີ່ຂໍອະນຸຍາດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (`Notification permission <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Notifications_API>`__) ຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລໍຖ້"
"າແບບ asynchronously ເພື່ອສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຫາກໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:137
msgid "Can I use my favorite library?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຂ້ອຍມັກໄດ້ບໍ່?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:139
msgid ""
"You most likely can. First, you have to include your library in the page. "
"You can customize the :ref:`Head Include <doc_javascript_export_options>` "
"during export (see below), or even :ref:`write your own template "
"<doc_customizing_html5_shell>`."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານມັກຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ທຳອິດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລວມເອົາໄລບຣາຣີຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນໜ້າເວັບ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ "
":ref:`Head Include <doc_javascript_export_options>` ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່"
"ມ), ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ :ref:`ຂຽນ template ຂອງທ່ານເອງ <doc_customizing_html5_shell>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:144
msgid ""
"In the example below, we customize the ``Head Include`` to add an external "
"library (`axios <https://axios-http.com/>`__) from a content delivery "
"network, and a second ``<script>`` tag to define our own custom function:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ພວກເຮົາປັບແຕ່ງ ``Head Include`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄລບຣາຣີພາຍນອກ (`axios "
"<https://axios-http.com/>`__) ຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍການສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ (CDN), ແລະ ແທັກ ``<script>"
"`` ທີສອງເພື່ອສ້າງຟັງຊັນຂອງພວກເຮົາເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:159
msgid ""
"We can then access both the library and the function from Godot, like we did "
"in previous examples:"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທັງໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນຈາກ Godot ໄດ້, ຄືກັບທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຮັດໃນຕົວຢ່າງກ່ອນໜ້"
"ານີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:185
msgid "The eval interface"
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສ eval"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:187
msgid ""
"The ``eval`` method works similarly to the JavaScript function of the same "
"name. It takes a string as an argument and executes it as JavaScript code. "
"This allows interacting with the browser in ways not possible with script "
"languages integrated into Godot."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ ``eval`` ເຮັດວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບຟັງຊັນ JavaScript ທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ. ມັນຮັບສະຕຣິງ (string) ເປັນອາ"
"ຄິວເມນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນມັນເປັນໂຄ້ດ JavaScript. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບບຣາວເຊີໃນແບບທີ່ພາສາສະຄ"
"ຣິບທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນ Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:205
msgid ""
"The value of the last JavaScript statement is converted to a GDScript value "
"and returned by ``eval()`` under certain circumstances:"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ JavaScript ສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກແປງເປັນຄ່າ GDScript ແລະ ຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນໂດຍ ``eval()`` ພາ"
"ຍໃຕ້ບາງເງື່ອນໄຂ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:208
msgid "JavaScript ``number`` is returned as :ref:`class_float`"
msgstr "JavaScript ``number`` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນເປັນ :ref:`class_float`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:209
msgid "JavaScript ``boolean`` is returned as :ref:`class_bool`"
msgstr "JavaScript ``boolean`` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນເປັນ :ref:`class_bool`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:210
msgid "JavaScript ``string`` is returned as :ref:`class_String`"
msgstr "JavaScript ``string`` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນເປັນ :ref:`class_String`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:211
msgid ""
"JavaScript ``ArrayBuffer``, ``TypedArray``, and ``DataView`` are returned "
"as :ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>`"
msgstr ""
"JavaScript ``ArrayBuffer``, ``TypedArray``, ແລະ ``DataView`` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນເປັນ "
":ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/javascript_bridge.rst:228
