#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/html5_shell_classref.rst:226
msgid ""
"Whether the unload the engine automatically after the instance is "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະຖອນການໂຫຼດ (unload) engine ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່ ຫຼັງຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

