msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ function ``_process()`` ທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:111
msgid "Important information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:113
msgid ""
"The general rule is that **any other GDScript that your tool script uses "
"must *also* be a tool**. The editor is not able to construct instances from "
"GDScript files without ``@tool``, which means you cannot call methods or "
"reference member variables from them otherwise. However, since static "
"methods, constants and enums can be used without creating an instance, it is "
"possible to call them or reference them from a ``@tool`` script onto other "
"non-tool scripts. One exception to this are :ref:`static variables "
"<doc_gdscript_basics_static_variables>`. If you try to read a static "
"variable's value in a script that does not have ``@tool``, it will always "
"return ``null`` but won't print a warning or error when doing so. This "
"restriction does not apply to static methods, which can be called regardless "
"of whether the target script is in tool mode."
msgstr ""
"ກົດທົ່ວໄປຄື **GDScript ອື່ນໆທີ່ສະຄຣິບ tool ຂອງທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ນັ້ນ ຕ້ອງເປັນ tool ຄືກັນ**. editor ບໍ່ສາມ"
"າດສ້າງ instances ຈາກໄຟລ໌ GDScript ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ ``@tool`` ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້"
"ນ methods ຫຼື ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ member variables ຈາກພວກມັນໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ static "
"methods, constants ແລະ enums ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງ instance, ທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ຫຼື "
"ອ້າງອີງເຖິງພວກມັນຈາກສະຄຣິບ ``@tool`` ໄປຫາສະຄຣິບອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ tool ໄດ້. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນໜຶ່ງຄື "
":ref:`static variables <doc_gdscript_basics_static_variables>`. ຖ້າທ່ານພະຍາຍາມອ່"
"ານ ຄ່າຂອງ static variable ໃນສະຄຣິບທີ່ບໍ່ມີ ``@tool``, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ ``null`` ສະເໝີ ແຕ່ຈະ"
"ບໍ່ສະແດງ ຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື error. ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງ static methods, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ບໍ່ວ່າສະຄຣິບເ"
"ປົ້າໝາຍຈະຢູ່ໃນ tool mode ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:125
msgid ""
"Extending a ``@tool`` script does not automatically make the extending "
"script a ``@tool``. Omitting ``@tool`` from the extending script will "
"disable tool behavior from the super class. Therefore, the extending script "
"should also specify the ``@tool`` annotation."
msgstr ""
"ການສືບທອດ (extending) ຈາກສະຄຣິບ ``@tool`` ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດມານັ້ນເປັນ ``@tool`` "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກບໍ່ໃສ່ ``@tool`` ໃນສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດມາ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ tool ຈາກ super "
"class ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດມາກໍຄວນລະບຸ annotation ``@tool`` ຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:130
msgid ""
"Modifications in the editor are permanent, with no undo/redo possible. For "
"example, in the next section when we remove the script, the node will keep "
"its rotation. Be careful to avoid making unwanted modifications. Consider "
"setting up :ref:`version control <doc_version_control_systems>` to avoid "
"losing work in case you make a mistake."
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂໃນ editor ແມ່ນເປັນການແກ້ໄຂແບບຖາວອນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສາມາດ undo/redo ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນສ່ວນຕໍ່"
"ໄປເມື່ອພວກເຮົາລຶບສະຄຣິບອອກ, ໂນດຈະຍັງຄົງຮັກສາຄ່າການໝູນ (rotation) ຂອງມັນໄວ້. ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອ"
"ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`version control "
"<doc_version_control_systems>` ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍວຽກໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:139
msgid ""
"While the debugger and breakpoints cannot be used directly with tool "
"scripts, it is possible to launch a new instance of the editor and debug "
"from there. To do this, navigate to **Debug > Customize Run Instances...** "
"and specify `--editor` in **Main Run Args**."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ debugger ແລະ breakpoints ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງກັບສະຄຣິບ tool ໄດ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານກໍສາມາດ"
"ເປີດ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ editor ແລະ debug ຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນໄດ້. ໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ **Debug > "
"Customize Run Instances...** ແລະ ລະບຸ `--editor` ໃນ **Main Run Args**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:143
msgid "See :ref:`doc_overview_of_debugging_tools` for more information."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_overview_of_debugging_tools` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:145
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can use print statements to display the contents of "
"variables instead."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ print ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອຫາຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນແທນກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:149
msgid "Try ``@tool`` out"
msgstr "ລອງໃຊ້ ``@tool``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:151
msgid ""
"Add a ``Sprite2D`` node to your scene and set the texture to Godot icon. "
"Attach and open a script, and change it to this:"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂນດ ``Sprite2D`` ໃສ່ໃນ scene ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕັ້ງ texture ເປັນໄອຄອນ Godot. ສ້າງ ແລະ "
"ເປີດສະຄຣິບ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນມັນເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:176
msgid ""
"Save the script and return to the editor. You should now see your object "
"rotate. If you run the game, it will also rotate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ກັບໄປທີ່ editor. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຄວນເຫັນວັດຖຸຂອງທ່ານໝູນ. ຖ້າທ່ານ run ເກມ, ມັນກໍຈະໝູນຄື"
"ກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:180
msgid ""
"You may need to restart the editor. This is a known bug found in all Godot 4 "
"versions: `GH-66381 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66381>`_."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ restart editor ໃໝ່. ນີ້ແມ່ນ bug ທີ່ພົບໃນທຸກລຸ້ນຂອງ Godot 4: `GH-66381 "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66381>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:187
msgid ""
"If you don't see the changes, reload the scene (close it and open it again)."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໃຫ້ reload scene ໃໝ່ (ປິດແລ້ວເປີດໃໝ່)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:189
msgid ""
"Now let's choose which code runs when. Modify your ``_process()`` function "
"to look like this:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ມາເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ code ສ່ວນໃດເຮັດວຽກຕອນໃດ. ປັບປຸງ function ``_process()`` ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້"
"ເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:215
msgid ""
"Save the script. Now the object will spin clockwise in the editor, but if "
"you run the game, it will spin counter-clockwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກສະຄຣິບ. ຕອນນີ້ວັດຖຸຈະໝູນຕາມເຂັມໂມງໃນ editor, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານ run ເກມ, ມັນຈະໝູນທວນເຂັມໂມງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:219
msgid "Editing variables"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຕົວປ່ຽນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:221
msgid ""
"Add and export a variable speed to the script. To update the speed and also "
"reset the rotation angle add a setter ``set(new_speed)`` which is executed "
"with the input from the inspector. Modify ``_process()`` to include the "
"rotation speed."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ ແລະ export ຕົວປ່ຽນ speed ໃສ່ໃນສະຄຣິບ. ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄວາມໄວ ແລະ reset ມຸມການໝູນ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ "
"setter ``set(new_speed)`` ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຄ່າຈາກ inspector. ປັບປຸງ "
"``_process()`` ເພື່ອລວມເອົາຄວາມໄວໃນການໝູນເຂົ້າໄປນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:271
msgid ""
"Code from other nodes doesn't run in the editor. Your access to other nodes "
"is limited. You can access the tree and nodes, and their default properties, "
"but you can't access user variables. If you want to do so, other nodes have "
"to run in the editor too."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຈາກໂນດອື່ນໆ ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂນດອື່ນໆຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ"
"ຜັງຕົ້ນໄມ້ ແລະ ໂນດຕ່າງໆ, ລວມທັງຄຸນສົມບັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພວກມັນ, ແຕ່ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄ"
"ດ້. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ໂນດອື່ນໆ ກໍຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:277
msgid "Getting notified when arrays or dictionaries change"
msgstr "ການຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອ arrays ຫຼື dictionaries ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:279
msgid ""
"You can use an Array or Dictionary as an ``@export`` variable. In a "
"``@tool`` script, you can react to any changes to that collection by using a "
"setter. Normally, at runtime, such a setter is only called when you assign "
"to the variable, but when you modify an Array or Dictionary in the "
"inspector, the setter will also be called."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Array ຫຼື Dictionary ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນ ``@export``. ໃນສະຄຣິບ ``@tool``, ທ່ານສາມ"
"າດຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນ collection ນັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ setter. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໃນຕອນ "
"runtime, setter ດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກເອີ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ, ແຕ່ເມື່ອທ່ານແກ້ໄຂ Array ຫຼື "
"Dictionary ໃນ inspector, setter ກໍຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:337
msgid "Getting notified when resources change"
msgstr "ການຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອ resources ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:339
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want your tool to use a resource. However, when you change a "
"property of that resource in the editor, the ``set()`` method of your tool "
"will not be called."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ resource. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນ property ຂອງ "
"resource ນັ້ນໃນ editor, method ``set()`` ຂອງເຄື່ອງມືຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:388
msgid ""
"To get around this problem you first have to make your resource a tool and "
"make it emit the ``changed`` signal whenever a property is set:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ resource ຂອງທ່ານເປັນ tool ແລະ ໃຫ້ມັນສົ່ງ (emit) "
"signal ``changed`` ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ property ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:427
msgid "You then want to connect the signal when a new resource is set:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ signal ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດ resource ໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:476
msgid ""
"Lastly, remember to disconnect the signal as the old resource being used and "
"changed somewhere else would cause unneeded updates."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຢ່າລືມຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (disconnect) signal ເພາະ resource ເກົ່າທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ຖືກປ່ຽນແ"
"ປງຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການອັບເດດທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:513
msgid "Reporting node configuration warnings"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານຄຳເຕືອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ (node configuration warnings)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:515
msgid ""
"Godot uses a *node configuration warning* system to warn users about "
"incorrectly configured nodes. When a node isn't configured correctly, a "
"yellow warning sign appears next to the node's name in the Scene dock. When "
"you hover or click on the icon, a warning message pops up. You can use this "
"feature in your scripts to help you and your team avoid mistakes when "
"setting up scenes."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ລະບົບ *ຄຳເຕືອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ* ເພື່ອເຕືອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ກ່ຽວກັບໂນດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອໂນດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ຖື"
"ກຕ້ອງ, ຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຕືອນສີເຫຼືອງປະກົດຂຶ້ນຖັດຈາກຊື່ຂອງໂນດໃນ Scene dock. ເມື່ອທ່ານເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງ "
"ຫຼື ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ "
"ແລະ ທີມງານຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ scenes."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:521
msgid ""
"When using node configuration warnings, when any value that should affect or "
"remove the warning changes, you need to "
"call :ref:`update_configuration_warnings<class_Node_method_update_configuration_warnings>` . "
"By default, the warning only updates when closing and reopening the scene."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄຳເຕືອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ, ຫາກມີຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຜົນ ຫຼື ລຶບຄຳເຕືອນນັ້ນອອກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ທ່ານຈຳເ"
"ປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ :ref:`update_configuration_warnings "
"<class_Node_method_update_configuration_warnings>`. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຄຳເຕືອນຈະອັບເດ"
"ດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການປິດ ແລະ ເປີດ scene ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:558
msgid "Running one-off scripts using EditorScript"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແບບຄັ້ງດຽວໂດຍໃຊ້ EditorScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:560
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you need to run code just one time to automate a certain task "
"that is not available in the editor out of the box. Some examples might be:"
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ code ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"editor ໂດຍກົງ. ບາງຕົວຢ່າງອາດຈະເປັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:563
msgid ""
"Use as a playground for GDScript or C# scripting without having to run a "
"project. ``print()`` output is displayed in the editor Output panel."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນທົດລອງສຳລັບການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ GDScript ຫຼື C# ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງ run ໂປຣເຈັກ. ຜົນລັດຈາກ "
"``print()`` ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ panel Output ຂອງ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:565
msgid ""
"Scale all light nodes in the currently edited scene, as you noticed your "
"level ends up looking too dark or too bright after placing lights where "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງໂນດແສງສະຫວ່າງທັງໝົດໃນ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່, ເພາະທ່ານສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າ ດ່ານ"
"ຂອງທ່ານເບິ່ງມືດເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ແຈ້ງເກີນໄປ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ວາງໄຟໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:567
msgid ""
"Replace nodes that were copy-pasted with scene instances to make them easier "
"to modify later."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແທນໂນດທີ່ຖືກ copy-paste ດ້ວຍ scene instances ເພື່ອໃຫ້ງ່າຍຕໍ່ການແກ້ໄຂໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:570
msgid ""
"This is available in Godot by extending :ref:`class_EditorScript` in a "
"script. This provides a way to run individual scripts in the editor without "
"having to create an editor plugin."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Godot ໂດຍການສືບທອດຈາກ :ref:`class_EditorScript` ໃນສະຄຣິບ. ນີ້ເປັນວິທີການໃ"
"ຊ້ສະຄຣິບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນ editor ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງປລັກອິນ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:574
msgid ""
"To create an EditorScript, right-click a folder or empty space in the "
"FileSystem dock then choose **New > Script...**. In the script creation "
"dialog, click the tree icon to choose an object to extend from (or enter "
"``EditorScript`` directly in the field on the left, though note this is case-"
"sensitive):"
msgstr ""
"ໃນການສ້າງ EditorScript, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນ FileSystem dock ແລ້ວເລືອກ "
"**New > Script...**. ໃນ dialog ການສ້າງສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ tree ເພື່ອເລືອກວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະສືບທ"
"ອດມາ (ຫຼື ພິມ ``EditorScript`` ລົງໃນຊ່ອງທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງລະວັງຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:579
#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:583
msgid "Creating an editor script in the script editor creation dialog"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ editor script ໃນ dialog ການສ້າງສະຄຣິບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:585
msgid ""
"This will automatically select a script template that is suited for "
"EditorScripts, with a ``_run()`` method already inserted:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເລືອກ template ຂອງສະຄຣິບທີ່ເໝາະສຳລັບ EditorScripts ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີ "
"method ``_run()`` ໃສ່ມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:612
msgid ""
"This ``_run()`` method is executed when you use any of the 4 approaches that "
"can be used to run an EditorScript:"
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ ``_run()`` ນີ້ ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານ ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ 4 ວິທີ ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລັນ (run) "
"EditorScript:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:615
msgid ""
"Use :menu:`File > Run` at the top of the script editor with the EditorScript "
"being the current tab."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ :menu:`File > Run` ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ script editor ໂດຍທີ່ EditorScript ນັ້ນຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"tab ທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:617
msgid ""
"Press the keyboard shortcut :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + X` while the EditorScript "
"is the current tab. This keyboard shortcut is only effective when focused on "
"the script editor."
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມລັດ :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + X` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ EditorScript ເປັນ tab ທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່. ປຸ່ມລັດນີ້ຈ"
"ະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນ script editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:620
msgid "Right-click the script in the FileSystem dock and choose :menu:`Run`."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ສະຄຣິບໃນ FileSystem dock ແລ້ວເລືອກ :menu:`Run`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:621
msgid ""
"Add a ``class_name <name>`` at the top of the script, bring up the command "
"palette by pressing :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P`, and enter the class name to run "
"it. The entry will be named according to the class name, with automatic "
"capitalization applied."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ ``class_name <ຊື່>`` ໄວ້ທີ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງສະຄຣິບ, ເປີດ command palette ໂດຍການກົດ "
":kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P`, ແລ້ວພິມຊື່ class ເພື່ອ run ມັນ. ລາຍການຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ຕາມຊື່ class, ໂດ"
"ຍຈະມີການປັບເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:626
msgid ""
"Scripts that extend EditorScript **must** be ``@tool`` scripts to function."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ EditorScript **ຕ້ອງ** ເປັນສະຄຣິບ ``@tool`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:630
msgid ""
"EditorScripts can only be run from the Godot script editor. If you are using "
"an external editor, use one of the last two approaches to run the script."
msgstr ""
"EditorScripts ສາມາດ run ໄດ້ຈາກ Godot script editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ editor ພາຍນອ"
"ກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງໃນສອງວິທີສຸດທ້າຍເພື່ອ run ສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:635
msgid ""
"C# EditorScripts cannot be run from the script editor as it only supports "
"GDScript. Please refer to the above alternative approaches to run custom C# "
"EditorScripts."
msgstr ""
"C# EditorScripts ບໍ່ສາມາດ run ຈາກ script editor ໄດ້ ເພາະມັນຮອງຮັບແຕ່ GDScript. ກະລຸນ"
"າເບິ່ງວິທີທາງເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງເພື່ອ run custom C# EditorScripts."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:639
msgid ""
"Keep in mind C# tool scripts will only appear in the command palette when "
"denoted by the :ref:`GlobalClass <doc_c_sharp_global_classes>` attribute."
msgstr ""
"ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າສະຄຣິບ tool ຂອງ C# ຈະປາກົດໃນ command palette ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຖືກລະບຸດ້ວຍ attribute "
":ref:`GlobalClass <doc_c_sharp_global_classes>` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:645
msgid ""
"EditorScripts have no undo/redo functionality, so **make sure to save your "
"scene before running one** if the script is designed to modify any data."
msgstr ""
"EditorScripts ບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນ undo/redo, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ **ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ບັນທຶກ scene ຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ run "
"ມັນ** ຫາກສະຄຣິບນັ້ນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:648
msgid ""
"To access nodes in the currently edited scene, use "
"the :ref:`EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_get_edited_scene_root>` method which returns "
"the root Node of the currently edited scene. Here's an example that "
"recursively gets all nodes in the currently edited scene and doubles the "
"range of all OmniLight3D nodes:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໂນດໃນ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ method "
":ref:`EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_get_edited_scene_root>` ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄືນ root Node ຂອ"
"ງ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໂນດໃນ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ເພີ່ມໄລຍະ "
"(range) ຂອງໂນດ OmniLight3D ທັງໝົດເປັນສອງເທົ່າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:701
msgid ""
"In the above example, we also "
"call :ref:`EditorScript.mark_scene_as_unsaved() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_mark_scene_as_unsaved>` after any modification "
"that affects the scene's state. This allows the editor to display the scene "
"as \"unsaved\" (i.e. with an asterisk next to the name). This way, you also "
"get a confirmation when trying to close the scene with unsaved changes."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ພວກເຮົາຍັງໄດ້ເອີ້ນ :ref:`EditorScript.mark_scene_as_unsaved() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_mark_scene_as_unsaved>` ຫຼັງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂໃດໆທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສະ"
"ຖານະຂອງ scene. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ editor ສະແດງ scene ເປັນ \"ບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກ\" (ຄື ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກ"
"ຈັນຢູ່ຂ້າງຊື່). ວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານກໍຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມປິດ scene ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:709
msgid ""
"You can change the currently edited scene at the top of the editor even "
"while the Script view is open. This will affect the return value "
"of :ref:`EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_get_edited_scene_root>`, so make sure you've "
"selected the scene you intend to iterate upon before running the script."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ editor ໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງ Script ກໍຕາ"
"ມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກ :ref:`EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_get_edited_scene_root>`, ສະນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເລືອ"
"ກ scene ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ run ສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:716
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/nodes_and_scene_instances.rst:182
msgid "Instancing scenes"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ instances ຂອງ scenes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:718
msgid ""
"You can instantiate packed scenes normally and add them to the scene "
"currently opened in the editor. By default, nodes or scenes added "
"with :ref:`Node.add_child(node) <class_Node_method_add_child>` are **not** "
"visible in the Scene tree dock and are **not** persisted to disk. If you "
"wish the node or scene to be visible in the scene tree dock and persisted to "
"disk when saving the scene, you need to set the child node's :ref:`owner "
"<class_Node_property_owner>` property to the currently edited scene root."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ instance ຂອງ packed scenes ໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ scene ທີ່ເປີ"
"ດຢູ່ໃນ editor. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໂນດ ຫຼື scenes ທີ່ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍ :ref:`Node.add_child(node) "
"<class_Node_method_add_child>` ຈະ **ບໍ່** ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ Scene tree dock ແລະ "
"**ບໍ່** ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໂນດ ຫຼື scene ນັ້ນປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ scene tree dock ແລ"
"ະ ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິດເມື່ອບັນທຶກ scene, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ property :ref:`owner "
"<class_Node_property_owner>` ຂອງ child node ນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນ root ຂອງ scene ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:726
msgid "If you are using ``@tool``:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ ``@tool``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:751
msgid "If you are using :ref:`EditorScript <class_EditorScript>`:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ :ref:`EditorScript <class_EditorScript>`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:782
msgid ""
"Changes made by tool scripts and EditorScript (such as adding nodes or "
"modifying properties) do **not** automatically mark the scene as unsaved. To "
"show the asterisk ``(*)`` and prevent accidental data loss, "
"call :ref:`EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_mark_scene_as_unsaved>` after modifications, "
"or use :ref:`EditorUndoRedoManager <class_EditorUndoRedoManager>` for undo "
"support."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດໂດຍສະຄຣິບ tool ແລະ EditorScript (ເຊັ່ນ: ການເພີ່ມໂນດ ຫຼື ການແກ້ໄຂ "
"properties) ຈະ **ບໍ່** ໝາຍ scene ວ່າບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກຈັນ "
"``(*)`` ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນ "
":ref:`EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved() "
"<class_EditorInterface_method_mark_scene_as_unsaved>` ຫຼັງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`EditorUndoRedoManager <class_EditorUndoRedoManager>` ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການ undo."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:790
msgid ""
"Using ``@tool`` improperly can yield many errors. It is advised to first "
"write the code how you want it, and only then add the ``@tool`` annotation "
"to the top. Also, make sure to separate code that runs in-editor from code "
"that runs in-game. This way, you can find bugs more easily."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ ``@tool`` ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ error ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຂຽນ code ໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມ"
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຄ່ອຍເພີ່ມ annotation ``@tool`` ໄວ້ທີ່ດ້ານເທິງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ແ"
"ຍກ code ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ editor ອອກຈາກ code ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນເກມ. ວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຊອກຫາ bug ໄ"
"ດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Most rendering topics are covered in :ref:`2D rendering <doc_2d_rendering>` "
"and :ref:`3D rendering <doc_3d_rendering>`."
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກ່ຽວກັບການ rendering ຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`2D rendering "
"<doc_2d_rendering>` ແລະ :ref:`3D rendering <doc_3d_rendering>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:4
msgid "Overview of renderers"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ renderers"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page gives an overview of Godot's renderers, focusing on the "
"differences between their rendering features. For more technical details on "
"the renderers, see :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ໃຫ້ພາບລວມກ່ຽວກັບ renderers ຂອງ Godot, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຄຸນສົມບັດການ "
"rendering ຂອງພວກມັນ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທາງເຕັກນິກເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ renderers, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:29
msgid "Renderers, rendering drivers, and RenderingDevice"
msgstr "Renderers, rendering drivers, ແລະ RenderingDevice"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:31
msgid ""
"Diagram of rendering layers. The Compatibility renderer runs on the OpenGL\n"
"driver. The Forward+ and Mobile renderers run on RenderingDevice, which can "
"use\n"
"Vulkan, Direct3D 12, or Metal as a rendering driver."
msgstr ""
"ແຜນວາດຂອງຊັ້ນການ rendering. Compatibility renderer ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ OpenGL driver. "
"Forward+ ແລະ Mobile renderers ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ RenderingDevice, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ Vulkan, "
"Direct3D 12, ຫຼື Metal ເປັນ rendering driver."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:37
msgid "Godot's rendering abstraction layers."
msgstr "ຊັ້ນ abstraction ຂອງການ rendering ໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:39
msgid ""
"The *renderer*, or *rendering method*, determines which features are "
"available. Most of the time, this is the only thing you need to think about. "
"Godot's renderers are **Forward+**, **Mobile**, and **Compatibility**."
msgstr ""
"*renderer*, ຫຼື *rendering method*, ເປັນຕົວສ້າງຂໍ້ກຳນົດວ່າຈະມີຄຸນສົມບັດໃດແດ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້"
"ວ, ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງດຽວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄິດເຖິງ. Renderers ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນ **Forward+**, **Mobile**, ແ"
"ລະ **Compatibility**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:43
msgid ""
"The *rendering driver* tells the GPU what to do, using a graphics API. Godot "
"can use the **OpenGL**, **Vulkan**, **Direct3D 12**, and **Metal** rendering "
"drivers. Not every GPU supports every rendering driver, and therefore not "
"every GPU supports all renderers. Vulkan, Direct3D 12, and Metal are modern, "
"low-level graphics APIs, and requires newer hardware. OpenGL is an older "
"graphics API that runs on most hardware."
msgstr ""
"*rendering driver* ຈະບອກ GPU ວ່າຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຍັງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ graphics API. Godot ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"rendering drivers **OpenGL**, **Vulkan**, **Direct3D 12**, ແລະ **Metal**. ບໍ່ແມ່"
"ນທຸກໆ GPU ທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບທຸກໆ rendering driver, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆ GPU ຈະຮອງຮັບທຸກໆ "
"renderers. Vulkan, Direct3D 12, ແລະ Metal ແມ່ນ graphics APIs ລະດັບຕ່ຳທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ, ແລ"
"ະ ຕ້ອງການ hardware ທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. OpenGL ແມ່ນ graphics API ລຸ້ນເກົ່າທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ hardware "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:49
msgid ""
"RenderingDevice is a *rendering backend*, an abstraction layer between the "
"renderer and the rendering driver. It is used by the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, and these renderers are sometimes called \"RenderingDevice-based "
"renderers\"."
msgstr ""
"RenderingDevice ແມ່ນ *rendering backend*, ເປັນຊັ້ນ abstraction ລະຫວ່າງ renderer ແລ"
"ະ rendering driver. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile renderers, ແລະ ບາງຄັ້ງ "
"renderers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ \"RenderingDevice-based renderers\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:54
msgid "Choosing a renderer"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ renderer"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:56
msgid ""
"Choosing a renderer is a complex question, and depends on your hardware and "
"the which platforms you are developing for. As a starting point:"
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກ renderer ເປັນຄຳຖາມທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບ hardware ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ແພລດຟອມທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງ"
"ພັດທະນາໃຫ້. ເພື່ອເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:59
msgid "Choose **Forward+** if:"
msgstr "ເລືອກ **Forward+** ຖ້າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:61
msgid "You are developing for desktop."
msgstr "ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາສຳລັບ desktop."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:62
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:69
msgid ""
"You have relatively new hardware which supports Vulkan, Direct3D 12, or "
"Metal."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານມີ hardware ທີ່ຂ້ອນຂ້າງໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບ Vulkan, Direct3D 12, ຫຼື Metal."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:63
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:70
msgid "You are developing a 3D game."
msgstr "ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາເກມ 3D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:64
msgid "You want to use the most advanced rendering features."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການ rendering ທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:66
msgid "Choose **Mobile** if:"
msgstr "ເລືອກ **Mobile** ຖ້າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:68
msgid "You are developing for newer mobile devices, desktop XR, or desktop."
msgstr "ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນມືຖືລຸ້ນໃໝ່, desktop XR, ຫຼື desktop."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:71
msgid ""
"You want to use advanced rendering features, subject to the limitations of "
"mobile hardware."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການ rendering ທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າ, ພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ hardware ມືຖື."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:74
msgid "Choose **Compatibility** if:"
msgstr "ເລືອກ **Compatibility** ຖ້າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:76
msgid ""
"You are developing for older mobile devices, older desktop devices, or "
"standalone XR. The Compatibility renderer supports the widest range of "
"hardware."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນມືຖືລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, ອຸປະກອນ desktop ລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, ຫຼື standalone XR. "
"Compatibility renderer ຮອງຮັບ hardware ທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:78
msgid ""
"You are developing for web. In this case, Compatibility is the only choice."
msgstr "ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາສຳລັບ web. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, Compatibility ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:79
msgid ""
"You have older hardware which does not support Vulkan. In this case, "
"Compatibility is the only choice."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານມີ hardware ລຸ້ນເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, Compatibility ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:81
msgid ""
"You are developing a 2D game, or a 3D game which does not need advanced "
"rendering features."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາເກມ 2D, ຫຼື ເກມ 3D ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຄຸນສົມບັດການ rendering ທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:83
msgid ""
"You want the best performance possible on all devices and don't need "
"advanced rendering features."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນທຸກອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຄຸນສົມບັດການ rendering ທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:86
msgid ""
"Keep in mind every game is unique, and this is only a starting point. For "
"example, you might choose to use the Compatibility renderer even though you "
"have the latest GPU, so you can support the widest range of hardware. Or you "
"might want to use the Forward+ renderer for a 2D game, so you can use "
"advanced features like compute shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າທຸກເກມນັ້ນມີຄວາມເປັນເອກະລັກ, ແລະ ນີ້ເປັນພຽງຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ "
"Compatibility renderer ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະມີ GPU ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ສຸດກໍຕາມ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຮອງຮັບ "
"hardware ໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງທີ່ສຸດ. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ Forward+ renderer ສຳລັບເກມ 2D, ເ"
"ພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າເຊັ່ນ compute shaders ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:92
msgid "Switching between renderers"
msgstr "ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ renderers"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:94
msgid ""
"In the editor, you can always switch between renderers by clicking on the "
"renderer name in the upper-right corner of the editor."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ editor, ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ renderers ໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ renderer ຢູ່ມຸມຂ"
"ວາເທິງຂອງ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:97
msgid ""
"Switching between renderers may require some manual tweaks to your scene, "
"lighting, and environment, since each renderer is different. In general, "
"switching between the Mobile and Forward+ renderers will require fewer "
"adjustments than switching between the Compatibility renderer and the "
"Forward+ or Mobile renderers."
msgstr ""
"ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ renderers ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງ scene, ແສງສະຫວ່າງ, ແລະ environment ດ້"
"ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ renderer ນັ້ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ "
"Mobile ແລະ Forward+ renderers ຈະມີການປັບແຕ່ງໜ້ອຍກວ່າການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ Compatibility "
"renderer ກັບ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile renderers."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:102
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.4, when using Forward+ or Mobile, if Vulkan is not supported, "
"the engine will fall back to Direct3D 12 and vice versa. If the attempted "
"fallback driver is not supported either, the engine will then fall back to "
"Compatibility when the RenderingDevice backend is not supported. This allows "
"the project to run anyway, but it may look different than the intended "
"appearance due to the more limited renderer. This behavior can be disabled "
"in the project settings by unchecking :ref:`Rendering > Rendering Device > "
"Fallback to OpenGL 3<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_opengl3>`."
msgstr ""
"ນັບແຕ່ Godot 4.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile, ຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan, engine ຈະກັ"
"ບໄປໃຊ້ Direct3D 12 (fallback) ແລະ ໃນທາງກັບກັນ. ຫາກ fallback driver ທີ່ພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ນັ້ນກໍ"
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄືກັນ, engine ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ Compatibility ເມື່ອ RenderingDevice backend ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັ"
"ບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໂປຣເຈັກສາມາດ run ໄດ້ຕໍ່ໄປ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະເບິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໄວ້ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອ"
"ງ renderer. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ project settings ໂດຍການຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ "
":ref:`Rendering > Rendering Device > Fallback to OpenGL 3 "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/rendering_device/"
"fallback_to_opengl3>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:111
msgid "Feature comparison"
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບຄຸນສົມບັດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:113
msgid ""
"This is not a complete list of the features of each renderer. If a feature "
"is not listed here, it is available in all renderers, though it may be much "
"faster on some renderers. For a list of *all* features in Godot, "
"see :ref:`doc_list_of_features`."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດຂອງແຕ່ລະ renderer. ຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດໃດບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີໃຫ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ໃນທຸກ renderer, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວກວ່າໃນບາງ renderer ກໍຕາມ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຄຸນສົມ"
"ບັດ *ທັງໝົດ* ໃນ Godot, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_list_of_features`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:117
msgid ""
"Hardware with RenderingDevice support is hardware which can run Vulkan, "
"Direct3D 12, or Metal."
msgstr ""
"Hardware ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ RenderingDevice ແມ່ນ hardware ທີ່ສາມາດ run Vulkan, Direct3D 12, "
"ຫຼື Metal ໄດ້."

