#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:177
msgid "New features"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີໃໝ່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:177
msgid ""
"⚠️ Some new rendering features are added to Compatibility. Features are added "
"after Mobile and Forward+."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ ບາງຟີເຈີການເຣັນເດີໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ Compatibility. ຟີເຈີຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຫຼັງຈາກ Mobile ແລະ "
"Forward+."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:177
msgid ""
"✔️ Most new rendering features are added to Mobile. Mobile usually gets new "
"features as Forward+ does."
msgstr ""
"✔️ ຟີເຈີການເຣັນເດີໃໝ່ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ Mobile. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ Mobile ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຟີເຈີໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບ "
"Forward+."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/renderers.rst:177
msgid ""
"✔️ All new features are added to Forward+. As the focus of new development, "
"Forward+ gets features first."
msgstr ""
"✔️ ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ທັງໝົດຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ Forward+. ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນຈຸດສຸມຂອງການພັດທະນາໃໝ່, Forward+ ຈະໄດ້ຮັ"
"ບຟີເຈີກ່ອນໝູ່."

