"to draw it. That surface is the Root Viewport."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ຄິດວ່າ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຄືກັບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ເກມຖືກສາຍອອກມາ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນເກມໄດ້, "
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງມີພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບແຕ້ມມັນລົງໄປ. ພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນກໍຄື Root Viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:15
msgid ""
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` are a kind of Viewport that can be "
"added to the scene so that there are multiple surfaces to draw on. When we "
"are drawing to a SubViewport, we call it a render target. We can access the "
"contents of a render target by accessing its corresponding :ref:`texture "
"<class_Viewport_method_get_texture>`. By using a SubViewport as render "
"target, we can either render multiple scenes simultaneously or we can render "
"to a :ref:`ViewportTexture <class_ViewportTexture>` which is applied to an "
"object in the scene, for example a dynamic skybox."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` ແມ່ນ Viewport ປະເພດໜຶ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາ"
"ກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນຜິວໃນການແຕ້ມ. ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາແຕ້ມລົງໃນ SubViewport, ພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນມັນວ່າ "
"render target. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເນື້ອຫາຂອງ render target ໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງ "
":ref:`texture <class_Viewport_method_get_texture>` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"SubViewport ເປັນ render target, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຣັນເດີຫຼາຍສາກພ້ອມກັນ ຫຼື ເຣັນເດີລົງໃນ "
":ref:`ViewportTexture <class_ViewportTexture>` ເພື່ອນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບວັດຖຸໃນສາກ ເຊັ່ນ "
"skybox ແບບໄດນາມິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:22
msgid ""
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` have a variety of use cases, "
"including:"
msgstr ":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:24
msgid "Rendering 3D objects within a 2D game"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີວັດຖຸ 3D ພາຍໃນເກມ 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:25
msgid "Rendering 2D elements in a 3D game"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີອົງປະກອບ 2D ໃນເກມ 3D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:26
msgid "Rendering dynamic textures"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີເທັກເຈີແບບໄດນາມິກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:27
msgid "Generating procedural textures at runtime"
msgstr "ການສ້າງເທັກເຈີແບບ procedural ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:28
msgid "Rendering multiple cameras in the same scene"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີກ້ອງຫຼາຍໂຕໃນສາກດຽວກັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:30
msgid ""
"What all these use cases have in common is that you are given the ability to "
"draw objects to a texture as if it were another screen and can then choose "
"what to do with the resulting texture."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ທຸກຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄືກັນແມ່ນ ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດແຕ້ມວັດຖຸລົງໃນເທັກເຈີ ຄືກັບວ່າມັນເປັນໜ້າຈໍອື່ນ "
"ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະເຮັດແນວໃດກັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ໄດ້ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:34
msgid ""
"Another kind of Viewports in Godot are :ref:`Windows <class_Window>`. They "
"allow their content to be projected onto a window. While the Root Viewport "
"is a Window, they are less flexible. If you want to use the texture of a "
"Viewport, you'll be working with :ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` "
"most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Viewport ອີກປະເພດໜຶ່ງໃນ Godot ແມ່ນ :ref:`Windows <class_Window>`. ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເນື້ອຫາ"
"ຂອງມັນຖືກສາຍລົງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ Root Viewport ຈະເປັນ Window, ແຕ່ພວກມັນມີຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນໜ້ອຍ"
"ກວ່າ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີຂອງ Viewport, ສ່ວນຫຼາຍທ່ານຈະໄດ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`SubViewports "
"<class_SubViewport>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`Viewports <class_Viewport>` are also responsible for delivering "
"properly adjusted and scaled input events to their children nodes. By "
"default :ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` don't automatically receive "
"input, unless they receive it from their direct :ref:`SubViewportContainer "
"<class_SubViewportContainer>` parent node. In this case, input can be "
"disabled with the :ref:`Disable Input "
"<class_Viewport_property_gui_disable_input>` property."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Viewports <class_Viewport>` ຍັງມີໜ້າທີ່ໃນການສົ່ງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input "
"events) ທີ່ຖືກປັບ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບໂນດລູກ (children nodes). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ "
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອິນພຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ນອກຈາກຈະໄດ້ຮັບຈ"
"າກໂນດແມ່ :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>` ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນກໍລະ"
"ນີນີ້, ສາມາດປິດການຮັບອິນພຸດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`Disable Input "
"<class_Viewport_property_gui_disable_input>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:48
msgid ""
"For more information on how Godot handles input, please read the :ref:`Input "
"Event Tutorial <doc_inputevent>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ Godot ຈັດການອິນພຸດ, ກະລຸນາອ່ານ :ref:`Input Event Tutorial "
"<doc_inputevent>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:53
msgid ""
"Godot supports 3D sound (in both 2D and 3D nodes). More on this can be found "
"in the :ref:`Audio Streams Tutorial <doc_audio_streams>`. For this type of "
"sound to be audible, the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` needs to be "
"enabled as a listener (for 2D or 3D). If you are using a :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>` to display your :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>` "
"or :ref:`World2D <class_World2D>`, don't forget to enable this!"
msgstr ""
"Godot ຮອງຮັບສຽງ 3D (ທັງໃນໂນດ 2D ແລະ 3D). ສາມາດເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`Audio "
"Streams Tutorial <doc_audio_streams>`. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງປະເພດນີ້, :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>` ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເປັນ listener (ສຳລັບ 2D ຫຼື 3D). ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ "
":ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ເພື່ອສະແດງ :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>"
"` ຫຼື :ref:`World2D <class_World2D>`, ຢ່າລືມເປີດໃຊ້ງານສ່ວນນີ້!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:60
msgid "Cameras (2D & 3D)"
msgstr "ກ້ອງ (2D ແລະ 3D)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:62
msgid ""
"When using a :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` or :ref:`Camera2D "
"<class_Camera2D>`, it will always display on the closest "
"parent :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` (going towards the root). For "
"example, in the following hierarchy:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` ຫຼື :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>`, ມັນ"
"ຈະສະແດງຜົນໃນ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຂອງແມ່ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດສະເໝີ. ຕົວຢ່າງໃນລຳດັບຂັ້ນຕໍ່"
"ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:69
msgid ""
"``CameraA`` will display on the Root :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` and it "
"will draw ``MeshA``. ``CameraB`` will be captured by the :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>` along with ``MeshB``. Even though ``MeshB`` is in the "
"scene hierarchy, it will still not be drawn to the Root Viewport. Similarly, "
"``MeshA`` will not be visible from the SubViewport because SubViewports only "
"capture nodes below them in the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"``CameraA`` ຈະສະແດງໃນ Root :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ແລະ ຈະແຕ້ມ "
"``MeshA``. ສ່ວນ ``CameraB`` ຈະຖືກຈັບໂດຍ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ພ້"
"ອມກັບ ``MeshB``. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ ``MeshB`` ຈະຢູ່ໃນລຳດັບຂອງສາກ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມລົງໃນ Root "
"Viewport. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ``MeshA`` ກໍຈະບໍ່ເຫັນໃນ SubViewport ເພາະ SubViewports ຈະຈັບສະເ"
"ພາະໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ກຸ່ມລູກຂອງມັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:75
msgid ""
"There can only be one active camera per :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`, so "
"if there is more than one, make sure that the desired one has "
"the :ref:`current <class_Camera3D_property_current>` property set, or make "
"it the current camera by calling:"
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດມີກ້ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ພຽງໂຕດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຖ້າມີຫຼາຍກວ່າ"
"ໜຶ່ງໂຕ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າກ້ອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການນັ້ນໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`current "
"<class_Camera3D_property_current>` ໄວ້ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ມັນເປັນກ້ອງປະຈຸບັນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:88
msgid ""
"By default, cameras will render all objects in their world. In 3D, cameras "
"can use their :ref:`cull_mask <class_Camera3D_property_cull_mask>` property "
"combined with the :ref:`VisualInstance3D's "
"<class_VisualInstance3D>` :ref:`layer "
"<class_VisualInstance3D_property_layers>` property to restrict which objects "
"are rendered."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ກ້ອງຈະເຣັນເດີທຸກວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂລກຂອງມັນ. ໃນ 3D, ກ້ອງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`cull_mask <class_Camera3D_property_cull_mask>` ຮ່ວມກັບ :ref:`layer "
"<class_VisualInstance3D_property_layers>` ຂອງ :ref:`VisualInstance3D "
"<class_VisualInstance3D>` ເພື່ອຈຳກັດວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:94
msgid "Scale & stretching"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍ ແລະ ການຍືດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:96
msgid ""
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` have "
"a :ref:`size<class_SubViewport_property_size>` property, which represents "
"the size of the SubViewport in pixels. For SubViewports which are children "
"of :ref:`SubViewportContainers <class_SubViewportContainer>`, these values "
"are overridden, but for all others, this sets their resolution."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SubViewports <class_SubViewport>` ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`size<class_SubViewport_property_size>`, ເຊິ່ງແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ SubViewport ເປັນພິ"
"ກເຊວ (pixels). ສຳລັບ SubViewports ທີ່ເປັນລູກຂອງ :ref:`SubViewportContainers "
"<class_SubViewportContainer>`, ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່, ແຕ່ສຳລັບອັນອື່ນໆ, ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມລະ"
"ອຽດຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:100
msgid ""
"It is also possible to scale the 2D content and make the :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>` resolution different from the one specified in size, by "
"calling:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ຍັງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍເນື້ອຫາ 2D ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>` ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:114
msgid ""
"For information on scaling and stretching with the Root Viewport visit "
"the :ref:`Multiple Resolutions Tutorial <doc_multiple_resolutions>`"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂະຫຍາຍ ແລະ ການຍືດດ້ວຍ Root Viewport ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`Multiple "
"Resolutions Tutorial <doc_multiple_resolutions>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:117
msgid "Worlds"
msgstr "ໂລກ (Worlds)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:119
msgid ""
"For 3D, a :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` will contain a :ref:`World3D "
"<class_World3D>`. This is basically the universe that links physics and "
"rendering together. Node3D-based nodes will register using the World3D of "
"the closest Viewport. By default, newly created Viewports do not contain a "
"World3D but use the same as their parent Viewport. The Root Viewport always "
"contains a World3D, which is the one objects are rendered to by default."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ 3D, :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຈະປະກອບມີ :ref:`World3D "
"<class_World3D>`. ນີ້ຄືຈັກກະວານທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຟີຊິກ ແລະ ການເຣັນເດີເຂົ້າກັນ. ໂນດທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Node3D ຈະລົງທ"
"ະບຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ World3D ຂອງ Viewport ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, Viewports ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ມີ "
"World3D ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ອັນດຽວກັບ Viewport ແມ່. Root Viewport ຈະມີ World3D ສະເໝີ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່"
"ວັດຖຸຖືກເຣັນເດີໂດຍປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:126
msgid ""
"A :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>` can be set in a :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>` using the :ref:`World "
"3D<class_Viewport_property_world_3d>` property, that will separate all "
"children nodes of this :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` and will prevent "
"them from interacting with the parent Viewport's World3D. This is especially "
"useful in scenarios where, for example, you might want to show a separate "
"character in 3D imposed over the game (like in StarCraft)."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>` ໃນ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`World 3D<class_Viewport_property_world_3d>`, ເຊິ່ງຈະແຍກໂນດລູ"
"ກທັງໝົດຂອງ Viewport ນີ້ອອກມາ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີປະຕິສຳພັນກັບ World3D ຂອງ Viewport ແ"
"ມ່. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ເຊັ່ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແດງຕົວລະຄອນ 3D ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຊ້ອນເທິງເກມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:133
msgid ""
"As a helper for situations where you want to create :ref:`Viewports "
"<class_Viewport>` that display single objects and don't want to create "
"a :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>`, Viewport has the option to use "
"its :ref:`Own World3D <class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>`. This is "
"useful when you want to instance 3D characters or objects in :ref:`World2D "
"<class_World2D>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ :ref:`Viewports <class_Viewport>` ເພື່ອສະແດງວັດຖຸດຽວໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນສ້າງ :ref:`World3D <class_World3D>`, Viewport ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`Own World3D "
"<class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>`. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ instance ຂອງ"
"ຕົວລະຄອນ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸ 3D ໃນ :ref:`World2D <class_World2D>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:138
msgid ""
"For 2D, each :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` always contains its "
"own :ref:`World2D <class_World2D>`. This suffices in most cases, but in case "
"sharing them may be desired, it is possible to do so by "
"setting :ref:`world_2d<class_Viewport_property_world_2d>` on the Viewport "
"through code."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ 2D, ແຕ່ລະ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຈະມີ :ref:`World2D "
"<class_World2D>` ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງສະເໝີ. ນີ້ພຽງພໍແລ້ວໃນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ, ກໍສາມາດ"
"ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`world_2d<class_Viewport_property_world_2d>` ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:142
msgid ""
"For an example of how this works, see the demo projects `3D in 2D <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/viewport/3d_in_2d>`_ "
"and `2D in 3D <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/viewport/2d_in_3d>`_ respectively."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ໂປຣເຈັກເດໂມ `3D in 2D <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/viewport/3d_in_2d>`_ ແລະ `2D in "
"3D <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/viewport/"
"2d_in_3d>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:147
msgid ""
"It is possible to query a capture of the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` "
"contents. For the Root Viewport, this is effectively a screen capture. This "
"is done with the following code:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງພາບເນື້ອຫາຂອງ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ອອກມາໄດ້. ສຳລັບ Root "
"Viewport, ນີ້ກໍຄືການແຄັບເຈີໜ້າຈໍ (screen capture). ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:170
msgid ""
"But if you use this in ``_ready()`` or from the first frame of "
"the :ref:`Viewport's <class_Viewport>` initialization, you will get an empty "
"texture because there is nothing to get as texture. You can deal with it "
"using (for example):"
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ ``_ready()`` ຫຼື ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເຟຣມທຳອິດຂອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>`, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ເພາະຍັງບໍ່ມີຫຍັງໃຫ້ດຶງມາເປັນເທັກເຈີ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້"
"ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:188
msgid "Viewport Container"
msgstr "Viewport Container"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:190
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` is a child of "
"a :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>`, it will become "
"active and display anything it has inside. The layout looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ເປັນລູກຂອງ "
":ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>`, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ສະແດ"
"ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. ໂຄງສ້າງຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:194
msgid ""
"The :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` will cover the area of its "
"parent :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>` completely "
"if :ref:`Stretch<class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch>` is set to "
"``true`` in the SubViewportContainer."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ຈະກວມເອົາພື້ນທີ່ຂອງແມ່ "
":ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>` ທັງໝົດ ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
":ref:`Stretch<class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch>` ເປັນ ``true``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:199
msgid ""
"The size of the :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>` "
"cannot be smaller than the size of the :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>`."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>` ບໍ່ສາມາດນ້ອຍກວ່"
"າຂະໜາດຂອງ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:204
msgid ""
"Due to the fact that the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` is an entryway "
"into another rendering surface, it exposes a few rendering properties that "
"can be different from the project settings. You can choose to use a "
"different level of :ref:`MSAA <class_Viewport_property_msaa_2d>` for each "
"Viewport. The default behavior is ``Disabled``."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ເປັນທາງຜ່ານໄປສູ່ພື້ນຜິວການເຣັນເດີອື່ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງມີຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດການເຣັນເດີບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຕ່າງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ລະດັບ "
":ref:`MSAA <class_Viewport_property_msaa_2d>` ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະ Viewport. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແ"
"ມ່ນ ``Disabled``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:208
msgid ""
"If you know that the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` is only going to be "
"used for 2D, you can :ref:`Disable 3D<class_Viewport_property_disable_3d>`. "
"Godot will then restrict how the Viewport is drawn. Disabling 3D is slightly "
"faster and uses less memory compared to enabled 3D. It's a good idea to "
"disable 3D if your viewport doesn't render anything in 3D."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະ 2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດ "
":ref:`Disable 3D<class_Viewport_property_disable_3d>`. Godot ຈະຈຳກັດວິທີການແຕ້ມຂອ"
"ງ Viewport ນັ້ນ. ການປິດ 3D ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍລົງ. ມັນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີທີ່"
"ຈະປິດ 3D ຖ້າ Viewport ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເຣັນເດີຫຍັງໃນ 3D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:214
msgid ""
"If you need to render 3D shadows in the viewport, make sure to set the "
"viewport's :ref:`positional_shadow_atlas_size<class_Viewport_property_positional_shadow_atlas_size>` "
"property to a value higher than ``0``. Otherwise, shadows won't be rendered. "
"By default, the equivalent project setting is set to ``4096`` on desktop "
"platforms and ``2048`` on mobile platforms."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຣັນເດີເງົາ 3D ໃນ Viewport, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
":ref:`positional_shadow_atlas_size<class_Viewport_property_positional_shadow_atlas_size>"
"` ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ ``0``. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເງົາຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຣັນເດີ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກຈະຢູ່ທີ່ "
"``4096`` ສຳລັບເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ``2048`` ສຳລັບມືຖື."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:217
msgid ""
"Godot also provides a way of customizing how everything is drawn "
"inside :ref:`Viewports <class_Viewport>` using :ref:`Debug "
"Draw<class_Viewport_property_debug_draw>`. Debug Draw allows you to specify "
"a mode which determines how the Viewport will display things drawn inside "
"it. Debug Draw is ``Disabled`` by default. Some other options are "
"``Unshaded``, ``Overdraw``, and ``Wireframe``. For a full list, refer to "
"the :ref:`Viewport Documentation<class_Viewport_property_debug_draw>`."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍັງໃຫ້ວິທີປັບແຕ່ງການແຕ້ມທຸກຢ່າງພາຍໃນ :ref:`Viewports <class_Viewport>` ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
":ref:`Debug Draw<class_Viewport_property_debug_draw>`. Debug Draw ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົ"
"ດໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ແຕ້ມພາຍໃນນັ້ນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``Disabled``. ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆມີ "
"``Unshaded``, ``Overdraw``, ແລະ ``Wireframe``. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດ, ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ "
":ref:`Viewport Documentation<class_Viewport_property_debug_draw>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:221
msgid "**Debug Draw = Disabled** (default): The scene is drawn normally."
msgstr "**Debug Draw = Disabled** (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ສາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:225
msgid ""
"**Debug Draw = Unshaded**: Unshaded draws the scene without using lighting "
"information so all the objects appear flatly colored in their albedo color."
msgstr ""
"**Debug Draw = Unshaded**: ແຕ້ມສາກໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນແສງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທັງໝົດປະກົດເປັນສີພຽງໆຕາມສີ "
"albedo ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:229
msgid ""
"**Debug Draw = Overdraw**: Overdraw draws the meshes semi-transparent with "
"an additive blend so you can see how the meshes overlap."
msgstr ""
"**Debug Draw = Overdraw**: ແຕ້ມເມັດຊ໌ (meshes) ແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສດ້ວຍການປະສົມສີແບບບວກ "
"(additive blend) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວ່າເມັດຊ໌ຊ້ອນທັບກັນແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:233
msgid ""
"**Debug Draw = Wireframe**: Wireframe draws the scene using only the edges "
"of triangles in the meshes."
msgstr ""
"**Debug Draw = Wireframe**: ແຕ້ມສາກໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມໃນເມັດຊ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:239
msgid ""
"Debug Draw modes are currently **not** supported when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method. They will appear as regular draw modes."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ Debug Draw ໃນປະຈຸບັນ **ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ** ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Compatibility. ພວກມັນຈະ"
"ປະກົດເປັນໂໝດການແຕ້ມປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:243
msgid "Render target"
msgstr "Render target"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:245
msgid ""
"When rendering to a :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>`, whatever is "
"inside will not be visible in the scene editor. To display the contents, you "
"have to draw the SubViewport's :ref:`ViewportTexture "
"<class_ViewportTexture>` somewhere. This can be requested via code using "
"(for example):"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຣັນເດີລົງໃນ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>`, ສິ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຈະບໍ່ເຫັນໃນ Scene "
"Editor. ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງແຕ້ມ :ref:`ViewportTexture "
"<class_ViewportTexture>` ຂອງ SubViewport ນັ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງ. ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດໄດ້ໂດ"
"ຍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:262
msgid ""
"Or it can be assigned in the editor by selecting \"New ViewportTexture\""
msgstr "ຫຼື ສາມາດກຳນົດໃນ Editor ໂດຍການເລືອກ \"New ViewportTexture\""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:266
msgid ""
"and then selecting the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` you want to use."
msgstr "ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:270
msgid ""
"Every frame, the :ref:`Viewport's <class_Viewport>` texture is cleared away "
"with the default clear color (or a transparent color if :ref:`Transparent "
"BG<class_Viewport_property_transparent_bg>` is set to ``true``). This can be "
"changed by setting :ref:`Clear "
"Mode<class_SubViewport_property_render_target_clear_mode>` to ``Never`` or "
"``Next Frame``. As the name implies, Never means the texture will never be "
"cleared, while next frame will clear the texture on the next frame and then "
"set itself to Never."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ, ເທັກເຈີຂອງ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງ (clear) ດ້ວຍສີເລີ່"
"ມຕົ້ນ (ຫຼື ສີໂປ່ງໃສຖ້າຕັ້ງ :ref:`Transparent "
"BG<class_Viewport_property_transparent_bg>` ເປັນ ``true``). ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍກາ"
"ນຕັ້ງ :ref:`Clear Mode<class_SubViewport_property_render_target_clear_mode>` ເປັ"
"ນ ``Never`` ຫຼື ``Next Frame``. ຕາມຊື່ຂອງມັນ, Never ໝາຍເຖິງເທັກເຈີຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບເລີຍ, ສ່ວນ "
"Next Frame ຈະລຶບໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍຈະປ່ຽນເປັນ Never ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:275
msgid ""
"By default, re-rendering of the :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` "
"happens when its :ref:`ViewportTexture <class_ViewportTexture>` has been "
"drawn in a frame. If visible, it will be rendered, otherwise, it will not. "
"This behavior can be changed by setting :ref:`Update "
"Mode<class_SubViewport_property_render_target_update_mode>` to ``Never``, "
"``Once``, ``Always``, or ``When Parent Visible``. Never and Always will "
"never or always re-render respectively. Once will re-render the next frame "
"and change to Never afterwards. This can be used to manually update the "
"Viewport. This flexibility allows users to render an image once and then use "
"the texture without incurring the cost of rendering every frame."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ການເຣັນເດີໃໝ່ຂອງ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ "
":ref:`ViewportTexture <class_ViewportTexture>` ຂອງມັນຖືກແຕ້ມໃນເຟຣມນັ້ນ. ຖ້າເຫັນຜົນ, ມັ"
"ນຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນກໍຈະບໍ່ເຣັນເດີ. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ :ref:`Update "
"Mode<class_SubViewport_property_render_target_update_mode>` ເປັນ ``Never``, "
"``Once``, ``Always``, ຫຼື ``When Parent Visible``. Never ແລະ Always ຈະບໍ່ເຣັນເດີເລີ"
"ຍ ຫຼື ເຣັນເດີຕະຫຼອດຕາມລຳດັບ. Once ຈະເຣັນເດີໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປແລ້ວປ່ຽນເປັນ Never. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາ"
"ດເຣັນເດີພາບພຽງເທື່ອດຽວ ແລ້ວນຳເທັກເຈີນັ້ນໄປໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເສຍຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການເຣັນເດີທຸກເຟຣມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/viewports.rst:283
msgid ""
"Make sure to check the Viewport demos. They are available in the viewport "
"folder of the demos archive, or at https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/viewport."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມກວດເບິ່ງເດໂມຂອງ Viewport. ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ viewport ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບເດໂມ ຫຼື ທີ່ https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:4
msgid "Multiple resolutions"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:7
msgid "The problem of multiple resolutions"
msgstr "ບັນຫາຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:9
msgid ""
"Developers often have trouble understanding how to best support multiple "
"resolutions in their games. For desktop and console games, this is more or "
"less straightforward, as most screen aspect ratios are 16:9 and resolutions "
"are standard (720p, 1080p, 1440p, 4K, …)."
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາສ່ວນຫຼາຍມັກຈະມີບັນຫາໃນການເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີຮອງຮັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃນເກມ. ສຳລັບເກມເດັສທັອບ "
"ແລະ ຄອນໂຊນ, ບັນຫານີ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ ເພາະອັດຕາສ່ວນໜ້າຈໍສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນ 16:9 ແລະ ມີຄວາມລະອຽດມາ"
"ດຕະຖານ (720p, 1080p, 1440p, 4K, …)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:14
msgid ""
"For mobile games, at first, it was easy. For many years, the iPhone and iPad "
"used the same resolution. When *Retina* was implemented, they just doubled "
"the pixel density; most developers had to supply assets in default and "
"double resolutions."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມມືຖື, ໃນໄລຍະທຳອິດມັນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ. ເປັນເວລາຫຼາຍປີທີ່ iPhone ແລະ iPad ໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດດຽ"
"ວກັນ. ເມື່ອມີການນຳໃຊ້ *Retina*, ພວກເຂົາພຽງແຕ່ເພີ່ມຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງພິກເຊວເປັນສອງເທົ່າ; ນັກພັດທະນາ"
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງກຽມ asset ໃນຄວາມລະອຽດປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ແບບສອງເທົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:19
msgid ""
"Nowadays, this is no longer the case, as there are plenty of different "
"screen sizes, densities, and aspect ratios. Non-conventional sizes are also "
"becoming increasingly popular, such as ultrawide displays."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນນີ້ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບນັ້ນອີກແລ້ວ, ເພາະມີຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ, ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ ແລະ ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາ"
"ຍ. ຂະໜາດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທົ່ວໄປກໍກຳລັງເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ໜ້າຈໍແບບ ultrawide."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:23
msgid ""
"For 3D rendering, there is not much of a need to support multiple "
"resolutions. Thanks to its vector-based nature, 3D geometry will just fill "
"the screen based on the viewport size. For 2D and game UIs, this is a "
"different matter, as art needs to be created using specific pixel sizes in "
"software such as Photoshop, GIMP or Krita."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ 3D, ບໍ່ມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ຍ້ອນລັກສະນະທີ່ອີງໃສ່ "
"vector, ເລຂາຄະນິດ 3D ຈະເຕັມໜ້າຈໍຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງ Viewport ເອງ. ແຕ່ສຳລັບ 2D ແລະ UI ຂອງເກ"
"ມ, ມັນເປັນອີກເລື່ອງໜຶ່ງ ເພາະພາບຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຂະໜາດພິກເຊວທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນຊອບແວ ເຊັ່ນ Photoshop, "
"GIMP ຫຼື Krita."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:29
msgid ""
"Since layouts, aspect ratios, resolutions, and pixel densities can change so "
"much, it is no longer possible to design UIs for every specific screen. "
"Another method must be used."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເລເອົາ (layouts), ອັດຕາສ່ວນ, ຄວາມລະອຽດ ແລະ ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງພິກເຊວປ່ຽນແປງໄປຫຼາຍ, "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດອອກແບບ UI ສຳລັບທຸກໆໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ວິທີອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:34
msgid "One size fits all"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດຽວໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກຢ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:36
msgid ""
"The most common approach is to use a single *base* resolution and then fit "
"it to everything else. This resolution is how most players are expected to "
"play the game (given their hardware). For mobile, Google has useful `stats "
"<https://developer.android.com/about/dashboards>`_ online, and for desktop, "
"Steam `also does <https://store.steampowered.com/hwsurvey/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດ *ພື້ນຖານ* (base resolution) ພຽງອັນດຽວ ແລ້ວປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບທຸກຢ່"
"າງ. ຄວາມລະອຽດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຄາດຫວັງວ່າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ອີງຕາມຮາດແວ). ສຳລັບມືຖື, Google ມີ `ສະຖິ"
"ຕິ <https://developer.android.com/about/dashboards>`_ ທີ່ເປັນປະໂຫຍດ, ແລະ ສຳລັບເດັສທັ"
"ອບ, Steam ກໍ `ມີຄືກັນ <https://store.steampowered.com/hwsurvey/>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:42
msgid ""
"As an example, Steam shows that the most common *primary display resolution* "
"is 1920×1080, so a sensible approach is to develop a game for this "
"resolution, then handle scaling for different sizes and aspect ratios."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, Steam ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າ *ຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ* ທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ 1920×1080, ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີທີ່ເໝາະສົ"
"ມແມ່ນພັດທະນາເກມສຳລັບຄວາມລະອຽດນີ້, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຈັດການການຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) ສຳລັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ອັດຕາ"
"ສ່ວນອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:46
msgid "Godot provides several useful tools to do this easily."
msgstr "Godot ມີເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຢ່າງເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:50
msgid ""
"You can see how Godot's support for multiple resolutions works in action "
"using the `Multiple Resolutions and Aspect Ratios demo project <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/"
"multiple_resolutions>`__."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງການເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງຂອງການຮອງຮັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃນ Godot ໄດ້ທີ່ `Multiple "
"Resolutions and Aspect Ratios demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/multiple_resolutions>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:54
msgid "Base size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ (Base size)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:56
msgid ""
"A base size for the window can be specified in the Project Settings under "
"**Display → Window**."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດລະບຸຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ໃນ Project Settings ພາຍໃຕ້ **Display → Window**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:61
msgid ""
"However, what it does is not completely obvious; the engine will *not* "
"attempt to switch the monitor to this resolution. Rather, think of this "
"setting as the \"design size\", i.e. the size of the area that you work with "
"in the editor. This setting corresponds directly to the size of the blue "
"rectangle in the 2D editor."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສິ່ງທີ່ມັນເຮັດອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນປານໃດ; ເອັນຈິນ (engine) ຈະ *ບໍ່* ພະຍາຍາມປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽ"
"ດຂອງຈໍພາບໃຫ້ເປັນຄວາມລະອຽດນີ້. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຄິດວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄື \"ຂະໜາດການອອກແບບ\" (design size), "
"ນັ້ນກໍຄືຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດວຽກໃນ Editor. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີນ້ຳເງິນໃນ 2D "
"Editor ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:67
msgid ""
"There is often a need to support devices with screen and window sizes that "
"are different from this base size. Godot offers many ways to control how the "
"viewport will be resized and stretched to different screen sizes."
msgstr ""
"ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ເຮົາຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານນີ້. Godot ມີຫຼາຍວິ"
"ທີໃນການຄວບຄຸມວ່າ Viewport ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຍືດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍຕ່າງໆແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:74
msgid ""
"On this page, *window* refers to the screen area allotted to your game by "
"the system, while *viewport* refers to the root object (accessible from "
"``get_tree().root``) which the game controls to fill this screen area. This "
"viewport is a :ref:`Window <class_Window>` instance. Recall from "
"the :ref:`introduction <doc_viewports>` that *all* Window objects are "
"viewports."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້ານີ້, *window* ໝາຍເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບົບມອບໃຫ້ເກມຂອງທ່ານ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ *viewport* ໝາຍເຖິງ "
"root object (ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ ``get_tree().root``) ທີ່ເກມຄວບຄຸມເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍນີ້. "
"Viewport ນີ້ຄື instance ຂອງ :ref:`Window <class_Window>`. ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າວັດຖຸ Window *ທັງໝົ"
"ດ* ກໍຄື Viewports."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:80
msgid ""
"To configure the stretch base size at runtime from a script, use the "
"``get_tree().root.content_scale_size`` property "
"(see :ref:`Window.content_scale_size "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_size>`). Changing this value can "
"indirectly change the size of 2D elements. However, to provide a user-"
"accessible scaling option, "
"using :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_stretch_scale` is recommended as it's "
"easier to adjust."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານສະຄຣິບ (script), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``get_tree()"
".root.content_scale_size`` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Window.content_scale_size "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_size>`). ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນທາງອ້ອມຕໍ່ຂະໜາດຂອງ"
"ອົງປະກອບ 2D. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_stretch_scale` ເພາະມັນປັບໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:90
msgid ""
"Godot follows a modern approach to multiple resolutions. The engine will "
"never change the monitor's resolution on its own. While changing the "
"monitor's resolution is the most efficient approach, it's also the least "
"reliable approach as it can leave the monitor stuck on a low resolution if "
"the game crashes. This is especially common on macOS or Linux which don't "
"handle resolution changes as well as Windows."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ທັນສະໄໝໃນການຈັດການຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ເອັນຈິນຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຈໍພາບດ້ວ"
"ຍຕົວມັນເອງ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຈໍພາບຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອ"
"ຖືໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ເພາະມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຈໍພາບຄ້າງຢູ່ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳຖ້າເກມຄຣັຊ (crash). ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ "
"macOS ຫຼື Linux ເຊິ່ງຈັດການການປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດໄດ້ບໍ່ດີເທົ່າ Windows."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:97
msgid ""
"Changing the monitor's resolution also removes any control from the game "
"developer over filtering and aspect ratio stretching, which can be important "
"to ensure correct display for pixel art games."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຈໍພາບຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາເກມສູນເສຍການຄວບຄຸມໃນການກັ່ນຕອງ (filtering) ແ"
"ລະ ການຍືດອັດຕາສ່ວນ, ເຊິ່ງສຳຄັນຫຼາຍໃນການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບເກມແບບ pixel art."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:101
msgid ""
"On top of that, changing the monitor's resolution makes alt-tabbing in and "
"out of a game much slower since the monitor has to change resolutions every "
"time this is done."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຈໍພາບຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະຫຼັບໜ້າຈໍ (alt-tab) ເຂົ້າອອກເກມຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ "
"ເພາະຈໍພາບຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:106
msgid "Resizing"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ (Resizing)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:108
msgid ""
"There are several types of devices, with several types of screens, which in "
"turn have different pixel density and resolutions. Handling all of them can "
"be a lot of work, so Godot tries to make the developer's life a little "
"easier. The :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` node has several functions to "
"handle resizing, and the root node of the scene tree is always a viewport "
"(scenes loaded are instanced as a child of it, and it can always be accessed "
"by calling ``get_tree().root`` or ``get_node(\"/root\")``)."
msgstr ""
"ມີອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ໜ້າຈໍຫຼາຍປະເພດ ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງພິກເຊວ ແລະ ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ການຈັດການທັງ"
"ໝົດນັ້ນອາດເປັນວຽກທີ່ໜັກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈຶ່ງພະຍາຍາມຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ໂນດ :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>` ມີຟັງຊັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງເພື່ອຈັດການການປັບຂະໜາດ, ແລະ ໂນດຮາກ (root node) ຂອງ "
"Scene Tree ຈະເປັນ Viewport ສະເໝີ (ສາກທີ່ໂຫຼດມາຈະຖືກສ້າງເປັນລູກຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້"
"ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ ``get_tree().root`` ຫຼື ``get_node(\"/root\")``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:117
msgid ""
"In any case, while changing the root Viewport params is probably the most "
"flexible way to deal with the problem, it can be a lot of work, code and "
"guessing, so Godot provides a set of parameters in the project settings to "
"handle multiple resolutions."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າການປ່ຽນຄ່າ Root Viewport ຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ຍືດຍຸ່ນທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ຄາດເດົາຫຼາ"
"ຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈຶ່ງມີຊຸດພາຣາມິເຕີໃນ Project Settings ເພື່ອຈັດການຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:124
msgid ""
"To render 3D at a lower resolution than 2D elements (without needing "
"separate viewports), you can use Godot's :ref:`resolution scaling "
"<doc_resolution_scaling>` support. This is a good way to improve performance "
"significantly in GPU-bottlenecked scenarios. This works with any stretch "
"mode and stretch aspect combination."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຣັນເດີ 3D ໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າອົງປະກອບ 2D (ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແຍກ Viewport), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
":ref:`resolution scaling <doc_resolution_scaling>` ຂອງ Godot ໄດ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນກາ"
"ນເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບເມື່ອ GPU ເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນໄປ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກໂໝດການຍືດ ແລະ ທຸກອັດຕາສ່ວນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:131
msgid "Stretch settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຍືດ (Stretch settings)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:135
msgid ""
"When testing different stretch modes and stretch aspect settings, make "
"sure :ref:`game embedding <doc_game_embedding>` is configured to use "
"the :ui:`Stretch to Fit` scaling option:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທົດສອບໂໝດການຍືດ ແລະ ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ :ref:`game embedding "
"<doc_game_embedding>` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ :ui:`Stretch to Fit`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:142
msgid ""
"This ensures the viewport size always matches the window size, like when "
"game embedding is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະໜາດຂອງ Viewport ກົງກັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງສະເໝີ, ຄືກັບຕອນທີ່ປິດ game embedding."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:145
msgid ""
"Stretch settings are located in the project settings and provide several "
"options:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຍືດຢູ່ໃນ Project Settings ແລະ ມີຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:150
msgid "Stretch Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຍືດ (Stretch Mode)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:152
msgid ""
"The **Stretch Mode** setting defines how the base size is stretched to fit "
"the resolution of the window or screen. The animations below use a \"base "
"size\" of just 16×9 pixels to demonstrate the effect of different stretch "
"modes. A single sprite, also 16×9 pixels in size, covers the entire "
"viewport, and a diagonal :ref:`Line2D <class_Line2D>` is added on top of it:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Stretch Mode** ກຳນົດວິທີທີ່ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານຈະຖືກຍືດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ໜ້າ"
"ຈໍ. ພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າງລຸ່ມໃຊ້ \"ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ\" ພຽງແຕ່ 16x9 ພິກເຊວເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນຂອງໂໝດຕ່າງໆ. ມີສະ"
"ໄປຣ໌ (sprite) ໜຶ່ງໂຕຂະໜາດ 16x9 ພິກເຊວປົກຄຸມທົ່ວ Viewport ແລະ ມີເສັ້ນ :ref:`Line2D "
"<class_Line2D>` ແວງຢູ່ທາງເທິງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:163
msgid ""
"**Stretch Mode = Disabled** (default): No stretching happens. One unit in "
"the scene corresponds to one pixel on the screen. In this mode, the "
"**Stretch Aspect** setting has no effect."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Mode = Disabled** (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ຈະບໍ່ມີການຍືດໃດໆ. ໜຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍໃນສາກຈະກົງກັບໜຶ່ງພິກເຊ"
"ວເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Stretch Aspect** ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:169
msgid ""
"**Stretch Mode = Canvas Items**: In this mode, the base size specified in "
"width and height in the project settings is stretched to cover the whole "
"screen (taking the **Stretch Aspect** setting into account). This means that "
"everything is rendered directly at the target resolution. 3D is unaffected, "
"while in 2D, there is no longer a 1:1 correspondence between sprite pixels "
"and screen pixels, which may result in scaling artifacts."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Mode = Canvas Items**: ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ລະບຸໃນ Project Settings ຈະ"
"ຖືກຍືດໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຈໍ (ໂດຍອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Stretch Aspect**). ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກຢ່າງຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີທີ່ຄ"
"ວາມລະອຽດເປົ້າໝາຍໂດຍກົງ. 3D ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ແຕ່ໃນ 2D, ພິກເຊວຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບພິກເຊວໜ້າຈໍແ"
"ບບ 1:1 ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍຢັກຈາກການຂະຫຍາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:179
msgid ""
"**Stretch Mode = Viewport**: Viewport scaling means that the size of the "
"root :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` is set precisely to the base size "
"specified in the Project Settings' **Display** section. The scene is "
"rendered to this viewport first. Finally, this viewport is scaled to fit the "
"screen (taking the **Stretch Aspect** setting into account)."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Mode = Viewport**: ການຂະຫຍາຍແບບ Viewport ໝາຍເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ root "
":ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ລະບຸໃນສ່ວນ "
"**Display** ຂອງ Project Settings. ສາກຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີລົງໃນ Viewport ນີ້ກ່ອນ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ "
"Viewport ນີ້ຈຶ່ງຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຈໍ (ໂດຍອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Stretch Aspect**)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:188
msgid ""
"To configure the stretch mode at runtime from a script, use the "
"``get_tree().root.content_scale_mode`` property "
"(see :ref:`Window.content_scale_mode "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_mode>` and the :ref:`ContentScaleMode "
"<enum_Window_ContentScaleMode>` enum)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການຍືດຜ່ານສະຄຣິບໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``get_tree()"
".root.content_scale_mode`` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Window.content_scale_mode "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_mode>` ແລະ enum :ref:`ContentScaleMode "
"<enum_Window_ContentScaleMode>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:194
msgid "Stretch Aspect"
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນການຍືດ (Stretch Aspect)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:196
msgid ""
"The second setting is the stretch aspect. Note that this only takes effect "
"if **Stretch Mode** is set to something other than **Disabled**."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີສອງຄືອັດຕາສ່ວນການຍືດ. ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ **Stretch Mode** ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຢ່າງອື່"
"ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ **Disabled**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:199
msgid ""
"In the animations below, you will notice gray and black areas. The black "
"areas are added by the engine and cannot be drawn into. The gray areas are "
"part of your scene, and can be drawn to. The gray areas correspond to the "
"region outside the blue frame you see in the 2D editor."
msgstr ""
"ໃນພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວລຸ່ມນີ້, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນພື້ນທີ່ສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີດຳ. ພື້ນທີ່ສີດຳແມ່ນສ່ວນທີ່ເອັນຈິນເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມ"
"າດແຕ້ມຫຍັງລົງໄປໄດ້. ສ່ວນພື້ນທີ່ສີເທົາແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງສາກຂອງທ່ານ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຕ້ມລົງໄປໄດ້. ພື້ນທີ່ສີເທົານີ້ກົງກັ"
"ບສ່ວນທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກອບສີນ້ຳເງິນທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນໃນ 2D Editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:204
msgid ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Ignore**: Ignore the aspect ratio when stretching the "
"screen. This means that the original resolution will be stretched to exactly "
"fill the screen, even if it's wider or narrower. This may result in "
"nonuniform stretching: things looking wider or taller than designed."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Ignore**: ບໍ່ສົນໃຈອັດຕາສ່ວນເມື່ອມີການຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດເດີມ"
"ຈະຖືກຍືດໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຈໍພໍດີ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະກວ້າງ ຫຼື ແຄບກວ່າກໍຕາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຍືດທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເ"
"ໝີ ເຊັ່ນ ພາບເບິ່ງກວ້າງ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າທີ່ອອກແບບໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:212
msgid ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep**: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"This means that the viewport retains its original size regardless of the "
"screen resolution, and black bars will be added to the top/bottom of the "
"screen (\"letterboxing\") or the sides (\"pillarboxing\")."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep**: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້ເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Viewport ຈະຮັກສາຂ"
"ະໜາດເດີມໄວ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບສີດຳເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາທີ່ທາງເທິງ/ລຸ່ມ "
"(\"letterboxing\") ຫຼື ດ້ານຂ້າງ (\"pillarboxing\")."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:218
msgid ""
"This is a good option if you know the aspect ratio of your target devices in "
"advance, or if you don't want to handle different aspect ratios."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງອຸປະກອນເປົ້າໝາຍລ່ວງໜ້າ, ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຫຼ"
"າກຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:224
msgid ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep Width**: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the "
"screen. If the screen is wider than the base size, black bars are added at "
"the left and right (pillarboxing). But if the screen is taller than the base "
"resolution, the viewport will be grown in the vertical direction (and more "
"content will be visible to the bottom). You can also think of this as "
"\"Expand Vertically\"."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep Width**: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້. ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, ຈະມີແຖ"
"ບສີດຳຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ. ແຕ່ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍສູງກວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານ, Viewport ຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວຕັ້"
"ງ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເນື້ອຫາທາງລຸ່ມຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ). ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດວ່າມັນຄື \"ການຂະຫຍາຍໃນແນວຕັ້ງ\" (Expand "
"Vertically)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:231
msgid ""
"This is usually the best option for creating GUIs or HUDs that scale, so "
"some controls can be anchored to the bottom (:ref:`doc_size_and_anchors`)."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການສ້າງ GUI ຫຼື HUD ທີ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບາງປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມສ"
"າມາດຍຶດ (anchor) ໄວ້ທີ່ທາງລຸ່ມໄດ້ (:ref:`doc_size_and_anchors`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:237
msgid ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep Height**: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the "
"screen. If the screen is taller than the base size, black bars are added at "
"the top and bottom (letterboxing). But if the screen is wider than the base "
"resolution, the viewport will be grown in the horizontal direction (and more "
"content will be visible to the right). You can also think of this as "
"\"Expand Horizontally\"."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Keep Height**: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້. ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍສູງກວ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, ຈະມີແຖບ"
"ສີດຳຢູ່ທາງເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ. ແຕ່ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານ, Viewport ຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວນອ"
"ນ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເນື້ອຫາທາງຂວາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ). ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດວ່າມັນຄື \"ການຂະຫຍາຍໃນແນວນອນ\" (Expand "
"Horizontally)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:244
msgid ""
"This is usually the best option for 2D games that scroll horizontally (like "
"runners or platformers)."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບເກມ 2D ທີ່ເລື່ອນໄປໃນແນວນອນ (ເຊັ່ນ ເກມແລ່ນ ຫຼື ເກມເກັບດ່ານ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:249
msgid ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Expand**: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen, "
"but keep neither the base width nor height. Depending on the screen aspect "
"ratio, the viewport will either be larger in the horizontal direction (if "
"the screen is wider than the base size) or in the vertical direction (if the "
"screen is taller than the original size)."
msgstr ""
"**Stretch Aspect = Expand**: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຍຶດຕາມຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງພື້ນຖານ. "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນໜ້າຈໍ, Viewport ຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວນອນ (ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າ) ຫຼື ໃນແນວຕັ້ງ (ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍ"
"ສູງກວ່າ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:260
msgid ""
"To support both portrait and landscape mode with a similar automatically "
"determined scale factor, set your project's base resolution to be a *square* "
"(1:1 aspect ratio) instead of a rectangle. For instance, if you wish to "
"design for 1280×720 as the base resolution but wish to support both portrait "
"and landscape mode, use 720×720 as the project's base window size in the "
"Project Settings."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບທັງແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແນວນອນ ດ້ວຍຄ່າການຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ"
"ເປັນ *ຮູບຈະຕຸລັດ* (ອັດຕາສ່ວນ 1:1). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອອກແບບທີ່ 1280x720 ແຕ່ຢາກຮອງຮັບທັງສ"
"ອງແນວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 720x720 ເປັນຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານໃນ Project Settings."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:267
msgid ""
"To allow the user to choose their preferred screen orientation at runtime, "
"remember to set **Display > Window > Handheld > Orientation** to ``sensor``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກແນວຕັ້ງ/ນອນໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ, ຢ່າລືມຕັ້ງ **Display > Window > Handheld > "
"Orientation** ເປັນ ``sensor``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:270
msgid ""
"To configure the stretch aspect at runtime from a script, use the "
"``get_tree().root.content_scale_aspect`` property "
"(see :ref:`Window.content_scale_aspect "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_aspect>` and "
"the :ref:`ContentScaleAspect <enum_Window_ContentScaleAspect>` enum)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນການຍືດຜ່ານສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``get_tree()"
".root.content_scale_aspect`` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Window.content_scale_aspect "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_aspect>` ແລະ enum "
":ref:`ContentScaleAspect <enum_Window_ContentScaleAspect>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:278
msgid "Stretch Scale"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍການຍືດ (Stretch Scale)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:280
msgid ""
"The **Scale** setting allows you to add an extra scaling factor on top of "
"what the **Stretch** options above already provide. The default value of "
"``1.0`` means that no additional scaling occurs."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Scale** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເພີ່ມຕົວຄູນການຂະຫຍາຍນອກເໜືອຈາກຕົວເລືອກ **Stretch** ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່າ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``1.0`` ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການຂະຫຍາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:284
msgid ""
"For example, if you set **Scale** to ``2.0`` and leave **Stretch Mode** on "
"**Disabled**, each unit in your scene will correspond to 2×2 pixels on the "
"screen. This is a good way to provide scaling options for non-game "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງ **Scale** ເປັນ ``2.0`` ແລະ ປິດ **Stretch Mode**, ແຕ່ລະຫົວໜ່ວຍໃນສາກຈ"
"ະກົງກັບ 2x2 ພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ນີ້ເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກການຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເກມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:288
msgid ""
"If **Stretch Mode** is set to **canvas_items**, 2D elements will be scaled "
"relative to the base window size, then multiplied by the **Scale** setting. "
"This can be exposed to players to allow them to adjust the automatically "
"determined scale to their liking, for better accessibility."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ **Stretch Mode** ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ **canvas_items**, ອົງປະກອບ 2D ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຕາມຂະໜາດໜ້າ"
"ຕ່າງພື້ນຖານ, ແລ້ວຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າ **Scale**. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຄວາມສະ"
"ດວກໃນການໃຊ້ງານ (accessibility)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:293
msgid ""
"If **Stretch Mode** is set to **viewport**, the viewport's resolution is "
"divided by **Scale**. This makes pixels look larger and reduces rendering "
"resolution (with a given window size), which can improve performance."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ **Stretch Mode** ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ **viewport**, ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ Viewport ຈະຖືກຫານດ້ວຍ "
"**Scale**. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວເບິ່ງໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມລະອຽດການເຣັນເດີລົງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເກມເຮັດວຽກ"
"ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:297
msgid ""
"To configure the stretch scale at runtime from a script, use the "
"``get_tree().root.content_scale_factor`` property "
"(see :ref:`Window.content_scale_factor "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_factor>`)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Stretch Scale ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``get_tree()"
".root.content_scale_factor`` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Window.content_scale_factor "
"<class_Window_property_content_scale_factor>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:301
msgid ""
"You can also adjust the scale at which the default project theme is "
"generated using the **GUI > Theme > Default Theme Scale** project setting. "
"This can be used to create more logically-sized UIs at base resolutions that "
"are significantly higher or lower than the default. However, this project "
"setting cannot be changed at runtime, as its value is only read once when "
"the project starts."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຂອງທີມ (theme) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ **GUI > Theme > Default "
"Theme Scale**. ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ UI ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເໝາະສົມໃນຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານທີ່ສູງ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕ"
"າມ, ຄ່ານີ້ປ່ຽນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ ເພາະມັນຈະຖືກອ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:310
msgid "Stretch Scale Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍການຍືດ (Stretch Scale Mode)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:312
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.2, the **Stretch Scale Mode** setting allows you to constrain "
"the automatically determined scale factor (as well as the manually specified "
"**Stretch Scale** setting) to integer values. By default, this setting is "
"set to ``fractional``, which allows any scale factor to be applied "
"(including fractional values such as ``2.5``). When set to ``integer``, the "
"value is rounded down to the nearest integer. For example, instead of using "
"a scale factor of ``2.5``, it would be rounded down to ``2.0``. This is "
"useful to prevent distortion when displaying pixel art."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.2 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, **Stretch Scale Mode** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈຳກັດຕົວຄູນການຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເປັນ"
"ຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``fractional`` ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທົດສະນິຍົມໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"``2.5``). ແຕ່ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ ``integer``, ຄ່າຈະຖືກປັດລົງເປັນເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ ຈາກ "
"``2.5`` ຈະເປັນ ``2.0``). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປ້ອງກັນພາບເພ້ຽນເມື່ອສະແດງ pixel art."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:321
msgid ""
"Compare this pixel art which is displayed with the ``viewport`` stretch "
"mode, with the stretch scale mode set to ``fractional``:"
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບພາບ pixel art ທີ່ສະແດງດ້ວຍໂໝດຍືດ ``viewport`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງ Scale Mode ເປັນ "
"``fractional``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:324
msgid "Fractional scaling example (incorrect pixel art appearance)"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຂະຫຍາຍແບບທົດສະນິຍົມ (ພາບ pixel art ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:328
msgid ""
"Checkerboard doesn't look \"even\". Line widths in the logo and text varies "
"wildly."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຕາໝາກຮຸກເບິ່ງບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ. ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເສັ້ນໃນໂລໂກ້ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:330
msgid ""
"This pixel art is also displayed with the ``viewport`` stretch mode, but the "
"stretch scale mode is set to ``integer`` this time:"
msgstr ""
"ພາບ pixel art ນີ້ກໍສະແດງດ້ວຍໂໝດຍືດ ``viewport`` ຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ເທື່ອນີ້ຕັ້ງ Scale Mode ເປັນ "
"``integer``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:333
msgid "Integer scaling example (correct pixel art appearance)"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຂະຫຍາຍແບບເລກຖ້ວນ (ພາບ pixel art ຈະຖືກຕ້ອງ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:337
msgid "Checkerboard looks perfectly even. Line widths are consistent."
msgstr "ລາຍຕາໝາກຮຸກເບິ່ງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີດີ. ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເສັ້ນມີຄວາມຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:339
msgid ""
"For example, if your viewport base size is 640×360 and the window size is "
"1366×768:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ Viewport ແມ່ນ 640x360 ແລະ ຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ນ 1366x768:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:341
msgid ""
"When using ``fractional``, the viewport is displayed at a resolution of "
"1366×768 (scale factor is roughly 2.133×). The entire window space is used. "
"Each pixel in the viewport corresponds to 2.133×2.133 pixels in the "
"displayed area. However, since displays can only display \"whole\" pixels, "
"this will lead to uneven pixel scaling which results in incorrect appearance "
"of pixel art."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``fractional``, Viewport ຈະສະແດງທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດ 1366x768 (ຕົວຄູນປະມານ 2.133x)"
". ພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກໃຊ້. ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວໃນ Viewport ຈະກົງກັບ 2.133x2.133 ພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ແນ"
"ວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໜ້າຈໍສະແດງໄດ້ແຕ່ພິກເຊວທີ່ເປັນ \"ເລກຖ້ວນ\", ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການຂະຫຍາຍບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເ"
"ໝີ ແລະ ພາບ pixel art ກໍຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:346
msgid ""
"When using ``integer``, the viewport is displayed at a resolution of "
"1280×720 (scale factor is 2×). The remaining space is filled with black bars "
"on all four sides, so that each pixel in the viewport corresponds to 2×2 "
"pixels in the displayed area."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``integer``, Viewport ຈະສະແດງທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດ 1280x720 (ຕົວຄູນແມ່ນ 2x). ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເຫຼືອຈ"
"ະຖືກແທນດ້ວຍແຖບສີດຳທັງສີ່ດ້ານ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວໃນ Viewport ກົງກັບ 2x2 ພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍພໍດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:351
msgid ""
"This setting is effective with any stretch mode. However, when using the "
"``disabled`` stretch mode, it will only affect the **Stretch Scale** setting "
"by rounding it *down* to the nearest integer value. This can be used for 3D "
"games that have a pixel art UI, so that the visible area in the 3D viewport "
"doesn't reduce in size (which occurs when using ``canvas_items`` or "
"``viewport`` stretch mode with the ``integer`` scale mode)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນກັບທຸກໂໝດການຍືດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ ``disabled``, ມັນຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຄ່າ "
"**Stretch Scale** ໂດຍການປັດຄ່າລົງເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບເກມ 3D ທີ່ມີ UI ເປັນ pixel "
"art, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເຫັນໃນ 3D Viewport ບໍ່ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດລົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:360
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:140
msgid ""
"Games should use the **Exclusive Fullscreen** window mode, as opposed to "
"**Fullscreen** which is designed to prevent Windows from automatically "
"treating the window as if it was exclusive fullscreen."
msgstr ""
"ເກມຄວນໃຊ້ໂໝດ **Exclusive Fullscreen**, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ **Fullscreen** ເຊິ່ງຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່"
"ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Windows ຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງແບບ Exclusive ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:364
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:144
msgid ""
"**Fullscreen** is meant to be used by GUI applications that want to use per-"
"pixel transparency without a risk of having it disabled by the OS. It "
"achieves this by leaving a 1-pixel line at the bottom of the screen. By "
"contrast, **Exclusive Fullscreen** uses the actual screen size and allows "
"Windows to reduce jitter and input lag for fullscreen games."
msgstr ""
"**Fullscreen** ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບແອັບ GUI ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສລະດັບພິກເຊວ. ມັນຈະເຫຼືອພື້ນທີ່ 1 ພິກເຊວ"
"ໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ກົງກັນຂ້າມ, **Exclusive Fullscreen** ຈະໃຊ້ຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍຕົວຈິງ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ "
"Windows ຫຼຸດອາການພາບກະຕຸກ ແລະ input lag ສຳລັບເກມແບບເຕັມຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:370
msgid ""
"When using integer scaling, this is particularly important as the 1-pixel "
"height reduction from the **Fullscreen** mode can cause integer scaling to "
"use a smaller scale factor than expected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຂະຫຍາຍແບບເລກຖ້ວນ (integer scaling), ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ ເພາະຄວາມສູງທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ 1 ພິກເຊວ"
"ໃນໂໝດ **Fullscreen** ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຂະຫຍາຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:375
msgid "Common use case scenarios"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:377
msgid ""
"The following settings are recommended to support multiple resolutions and "
"aspect ratios well."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບຄວາມລະອຽດ ແລະ ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍໄດ້ດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:381
msgid "Desktop game"
msgstr "ເກມເດັສທັອບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:383
msgid "**Non-pixel art:**"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art:**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:385
msgid ""
"Set the base window width to ``1920`` and window height to ``1080``. If you "
"have a display smaller than 1920×1080, set **Window Width Override** and "
"**Window Height Override** to lower values to make the window smaller when "
"the project starts."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງພື້ນຖານເປັນ ``1920`` ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເປັນ ``1080``. ຖ້າທ່ານມີໜ້າຈໍນ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"1920x1080, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ **Window Width Override** ແລະ **Window Height Override** ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳ"
"ລົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງນ້ອຍລົງຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:388
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you're targeting high-end devices primarily, set the base "
"window width to ``3840`` and window height to ``2160``. This allows you to "
"provide higher resolution 2D assets, resulting in crisper visuals at the "
"cost of higher memory usage and file sizes. You'll also want to increase "
"**GUI > Theme > Default Theme Scale** to a value between ``2.0`` and ``3.0`` "
"to ensure UI elements remain readable."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານເນັ້ນອຸປະກອນສະເປັກສູງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``3840`` ແລະ ``2160``. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ asset 2D "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງຂຶ້ນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບຄົມຊັດ ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານຄວນເພີ່ມ **GUI > Theme > Default Theme Scale** ເປັນລະຫວ່າງ ``2.0`` ຫາ ``3.0`` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ UI ອ່ານງ່າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:395
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:448
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:478
msgid ""
"Note that this will make non-mipmapped textures grainy on low resolution "
"devices, so make sure to follow the instructions described "
"in :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_reducing_aliasing_on_downsampling`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ບໍ່ມີ mipmapped ເບິ່ງແຕກໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕ"
"າມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ "
":ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions_reducing_aliasing_on_downsampling`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:399
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:452
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:483
msgid "Set the stretch mode to ``canvas_items``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ Stretch Mode ເປັນ ``canvas_items``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:400
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:453
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:484
msgid ""
"Set the stretch aspect to ``expand``. This allows for supporting multiple "
"aspect ratios and makes better use of tall smartphone displays (such as 18:9 "
"or 19:9 aspect ratios)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ Stretch Aspect ເປັນ ``expand``. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍມືຖືທີ່ຍາວ (ເ"
"ຊັ່ນ 18:9 ຫຼື 19:9) ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:402
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:455
#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:486
msgid ""
"Configure Control nodes' anchors to snap to the correct corners using the "
"**Layout** menu."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຍຶດ (anchors) ຂອງໂນດ Control ໃຫ້ກົງກັບມຸມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ **Layout**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:403
msgid ""
"For 3D games, consider exposing :ref:`doc_resolution_scaling` in the game's "
"options menu to allow players to adjust the 3D rendering resolution "
"separately from UI elements. This is useful for performance tuning, "
"especially on lower-end hardware."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມ 3D, ຄວນເປີດໃຫ້ປັບ :ref:`doc_resolution_scaling` ໃນເມນູຕັ້ງຄ່າເກມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບຄ"
"ວາມລະອຽດ 3D ແຍກຈາກ UI ໄດ້. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບ ສຳລັບຮາດແວທີ່ຕ່ຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:407
msgid "**Pixel art:**"
msgstr "**Pixel art:**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:409
msgid ""
"Set the base window size to the viewport size you intend to use. Most pixel "
"art games use viewport sizes between 256×224 and 640×480. 640×360 is a good "
"baseline, as it scales to 1280×720, 1920×1080, 2560×1440, and 3840×2160 "
"without any black bars when using integer scaling. Higher viewport sizes "
"will require using higher resolution artwork, unless you intend to show more "
"of the game world at a given time."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດ Viewport ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ເກມ pixel art ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດລະຫ"
"ວ່າງ 256x224 ຫາ 640x480. 640x360 ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ ເພາະມັນຂະຫຍາຍເປັນ 720p, 1080p, "
"1440p ແລະ 4K ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີແຖບສີດຳເມື່ອໃຊ້ integer scaling."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:415
msgid "Set the stretch mode to ``viewport``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ Stretch Mode ເປັນ ``viewport``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:416
msgid ""
"Set the stretch aspect to ``keep`` to enforce a single aspect ratio (with "
"black bars). As an alternative, you can set the stretch aspect to ``expand`` "
"to support multiple aspect ratios."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ Stretch Aspect ເປັນ ``keep`` ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນດຽວ (ມີແຖບສີດຳ). ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"``expand`` ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:419
msgid ""
"If using the ``expand`` stretch aspect, Configure Control nodes' anchors to "
"snap to the correct corners using the **Layout** menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ ``expand``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຍຶດ (anchors) ຂອງໂນດ Control ໃຫ້ກົງກັບມຸມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ "
"**Layout**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:421
msgid ""
"Set the stretch scale mode to ``integer``. This prevents uneven pixel "
"scaling from occurring, which makes pixel art not display as intended."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ Stretch Scale Mode ເປັນ ``integer``. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການຂະຫຍາຍພິກເຊວທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ ເຊິ່ງເ"
"ຮັດໃຫ້ pixel art ເບິ່ງບໍ່ສວຍງາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:426
msgid ""
"The ``viewport`` stretch mode provides low-resolution rendering that is then "
"stretched to the final window size. If you are OK with sprites being able to "
"move or rotate in \"sub-pixel\" positions or wish to have a high resolution "
"3D viewport, you should use the ``canvas_items`` stretch mode instead of the "
"``viewport`` stretch mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ ``viewport`` ຈະເຣັນເດີທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຍືດໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຕ່າງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະໄປຣ໌ເຄື່ອນ"
"ທີ່ ຫຼື ໝຸນໄດ້ແບບລະອຽດ (sub-pixel) ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການ Viewport 3D ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ໂໝດ "
"``canvas_items`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:433
msgid "Mobile game in landscape mode"
msgstr "ເກມມືຖືໃນແນວນອນ (Landscape)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:435
msgid ""
"Godot is configured to use landscape mode by default. This means you don't "
"need to change the display orientation project setting."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແນວນອນໂດຍປົກກະຕິຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການວາງແນວ"
"ໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:438
msgid "Set the base window width to ``1280`` and window height to ``720``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງພື້ນຖານເປັນ ``1280`` ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເປັນ ``720``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:439
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you're targeting high-end devices primarily, set the base "
"window width to ``1920`` and window height to ``1080``. This allows you to "
"provide higher resolution 2D assets, resulting in crisper visuals at the "
"cost of higher memory usage and file sizes. Many devices have even higher "
"resolution displays (1440p), but the difference with 1080p is barely visible "
"given the small size of smartphone displays. You'll also want to increase "
"**GUI > Theme > Default Theme Scale** to a value between ``1.5`` and ``2.0`` "
"to ensure UI elements remain readable."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``1920`` ແລະ ``1080`` ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກສູງ. ເຖິງວ່າຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນຈະມີຄວາມລະອຽດຮອ"
"ດ 1440p ແຕ່ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັບ 1080p ແມ່ນເຫັນໄດ້ຍາກໃນໜ້າຈໍມືຖືທີ່ນ້ອຍ. ທ່ານຄວນເພີ່ມ **GUI > "
"Theme > Default Theme Scale** ເປັນລະຫວ່າງ ``1.5`` ຫາ ``2.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:459
msgid ""
"To better support tablets and foldable phones (which frequently feature "
"displays with aspect ratios close to 4:3), consider using a base resolution "
"that has a 4:3 aspect ratio while following the rest of the instructions "
"here. For instance, you can set the base window width to ``1280`` and the "
"base window height to ``960``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບແທັບເລັດ ແລະ ມືຖືພັບໄດ້ (ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະມີອັດຕາສ່ວນໃກ້ຄຽງ 4:3), ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖ"
"ານແບບ 4:3. ຕົວຢ່າງ ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``1280`` x ``960``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:466
msgid "Mobile game in portrait mode"
msgstr "ເກມມືຖືໃນແນວຕັ້ງ (Portrait)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:468
msgid "Set the base window width to ``720`` and window height to ``1280``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງພື້ນຖານເປັນ ``720`` ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເປັນ ``1280``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:469
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you're targeting high-end devices primarily, set the base "
"window width to ``1080`` and window height to ``1920``. This allows you to "
"provide higher resolution 2D assets, resulting in crisper visuals at the "
"cost of higher memory usage and file sizes. Many devices have even higher "
"resolution displays (1440p), but the difference with 1080p is barely visible "
"given the small size of smartphone displays. You'll also want to increase "
"**GUI > Theme > Default Theme Scale** to a value between ``1.5`` and ``2.0`` "
"to ensure UI elements remain readable."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``1080`` ແລະ ``1920`` ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກສູງ. ທ່ານຄວນເພີ່ມ **GUI > Theme > "
"Default Theme Scale** ເປັນລະຫວ່າງ ``1.5`` ຫາ ``2.0`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ UI ອ່ານງ່າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:482
msgid "Set **Display > Window > Handheld > Orientation** to ``portrait``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ **Display > Window > Handheld > Orientation** ເປັນ ``portrait``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:490
msgid ""
"To better support tablets and foldable phones (which frequently feature "
"displays with aspect ratios close to 4:3), consider using a base resolution "
"that has a 3:4 aspect ratio while following the rest of the instructions "
"here. For instance, you can set the base window width to ``960`` and the "
"base window height to ``1280``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບແທັບເລັດ ແລະ ມືຖືພັບໄດ້, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານແບບ 3:4. ຕົວຢ່າງ ຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"``960`` x ``1280``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:499
msgid "Non-game application"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເກມ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:501
msgid ""
"Set the base window width and height to the smallest window size that you "
"intend to target. This is not required, but this ensures that you design "
"your UI with small window sizes in mind."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮອງຮັບ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອ"
"ອກແບບ UI ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງໜ້າຕ່າງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:503
msgid "Keep the stretch mode to its default value, ``disabled``."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍ Stretch Mode ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຄື ``disabled``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:504
msgid ""
"Keep the stretch aspect to its default value, ``keep`` (its value won't be "
"used since the stretch mode is ``disabled``)."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍ Stretch Aspect ໄວ້ທີ່ ``keep`` (ຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເພາະໂໝດຍືດຖືກປິດ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:506
msgid ""
"You can define a minimum window size by setting ``get_window().min_size`` in "
"a script's ``_ready()`` function. This prevents the user from resizing the "
"application below a certain size, which could break the UI layout."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງຂັ້ນຕ່ຳໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ ``get_window().min_size`` ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"``_ready()``. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບຂະໜາດແອັບໃຫ້ໃຫ້ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປຈົນ UI ເພ້ຽນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:509
msgid ""
"Add a setting in the application's settings to change the root "
"viewport's :ref:`stretch scale <doc_multiple_resolutions_stretch_scale>`, so "
"that the UI can be made larger to account for hiDPI displays. See also the "
"section on hiDPI support below."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນແອັບເພື່ອໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ :ref:`stretch scale "
"<doc_multiple_resolutions_stretch_scale>` ຂອງ root viewport ໄດ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ UI ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້"
"ນສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍ hiDPI. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນການຮອງຮັບ hiDPI ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:515
msgid "hiDPI support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ hiDPI"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:517
msgid ""
"By default, Godot projects are considered DPI-aware by the operating system. "
"This is controlled by the **Display > Window > DPI > Allow hiDPI** project "
"setting, which should be left enabled whenever possible. Disabling DPI "
"awareness can break fullscreen behavior on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຈະຖືກຮັບຮູ້ວ່າຮອງຮັບ DPI ໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍ "
"**Display > Window > DPI > Allow hiDPI**, ເຊິ່ງຄວນເປີດໄວ້ສະເໝີ. ການປິດມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການ"
"ສະແດງຜົນເຕັມຈໍໃນ Windows ມີບັນຫາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:522
msgid ""
"Since Godot projects are DPI-aware, they may appear at a very small window "
"size when launching on an hiDPI display (proportionally to the screen "
"resolution). For a game, the most common way to work around this issue is to "
"make them fullscreen by default. Alternatively, you could set the window "
"size in an :ref:`autoload <doc_singletons_autoload>`'s ``_ready()`` function "
"according to the screen size."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຮອງຮັບ DPI, ໜ້າຕ່າງອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່ານ້ອຍຫຼາຍເມື່ອເປີດໃນໜ້າຈໍ hiDPI. ສຳລັບເ"
"ກມ, ວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເປັນແບບເຕັມຈໍ (fullscreen) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມ. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່"
"າງໃນຟັງຊັນ ``_ready()`` ຂອງ :ref:`autoload <doc_singletons_autoload>` ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂ"
"ະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:529
msgid "To ensure 2D elements don't appear too small on hiDPI displays:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອົງປະກອບ 2D ບໍ່ເບິ່ງນ້ອຍເກີນໄປໃນໜ້າຈໍ hiDPI:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:531
msgid ""
"For games, use the ``canvas_items`` or ``viewport`` stretch modes so that 2D "
"elements are automatically resized according to the current window size."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ ``canvas_items`` ຫຼື ``viewport`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ອົງປະກອບ 2D ປັບຂະໜາດຕາມໜ້າ"
"ຕ່າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:533
msgid ""
"For non-game applications, use the ``disabled`` stretch mode and set the "
"stretch scale to a value corresponding to the display scale factor in "
"an :ref:`autoload <doc_singletons_autoload>`'s ``_ready()`` function. The "
"display scale factor is set in the operating system's settings and can be "
"queried using :ref:`screen_get_scale "
"<class_DisplayServer_method_screen_get_scale>`. This method is currently "
"implemented on Android, iOS, Linux (Wayland only), macOS and Web. On other "
"platforms, you'll have to implement a method to guess the display scale "
"factor based on the screen resolution (with a setting to let the user "
"override this if needed). This is the approach currently used by the Godot "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ ``disabled`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງ stretch scale ຕາມຄ່າ scale "
"factor ຂອງລະບົບໃນຟັງຊັນ ``_ready()``. ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
":ref:`screen_get_scale <class_DisplayServer_method_screen_get_scale>`. ວິທີນີ້ຮອງ"
"ຮັບແລ້ວໃນ Android, iOS, Linux (Wayland), macOS ແລະ Web. ສຳລັບແພລດຟອມອື່ນ, ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອ"
"ງຄາດເດົາຈາກຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:543
msgid ""
"The **Allow hiDPI** setting is only effective on Windows and macOS. It's "
"ignored on all other platforms."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Allow hiDPI** ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ Windows ແລະ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປໃນແພລ"
"ດຟອມອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:548
msgid ""
"The Godot editor itself is always marked as DPI-aware. Running the project "
"from the editor will only be DPI-aware if **Allow hiDPI** is enabled in the "
"Project Settings."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວ Godot Editor ເອງຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ DPI ຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ການລັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກ Editor ຈະຮອງຮັບ DPI "
"ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປີດ **Allow hiDPI** ໃນ Project Settings."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:555
msgid "Font and image oversampling"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Oversampling ໃຫ້ກັບຟອນ ແລະ ຮູບພາບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:557
msgid ""
"Godot supports a process called *oversampling*, which refers to "
"automatically re-rendering textures from their original vector source when "
"the viewport scale factor changes. This ensures font and image textures "
"remain crisp at any resolution."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຮອງຮັບຂະບວນການທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ *oversampling*, ເຊິ່ງຄືການເຣັນເດີເທັກເຈີໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກແຫຼ່"
"ງ vector ເດີມເມື່ອຕົວຄູນການຂະຫຍາຍປ່ຽນແປງ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຟອນ ແລະ ເທັກເຈີຮູບພາບຍັງຄົມຊັດໃນທຸກຄວາມລະອ"
"ຽດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:562
msgid ""
"Font oversampling is enabled by default, but it can be disabled by "
"unchecking **GUI > Fonts > Dynamic Fonts > Use Oversampling** in the Project "
"Settings."
msgstr ""
"Font oversampling ຈະຖືກເປີດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໃນ Project Settings ທີ່ "
"**GUI > Fonts > Dynamic Fonts > Use Oversampling**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:565
msgid ""
"Image oversampling is disabled by default, and can be enabled for specific "
"images in SVG format by changing their import type "
"to :ref:`class_DPITexture` in the Import dock. Other image formats do not "
"support oversampling, as they store bitmap data instead of vectors."
msgstr ""
"Image oversampling ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ກັບຮູບແບບ SVG ໂດຍການປ່ຽນປະເ"
"ພດການນຳເຂົ້າ (import type) ເປັນ :ref:`class_DPITexture`. ຮູບແບບອື່ນໆບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"oversampling ເພາະເປັນຂໍ້ມູນແບບ bitmap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:570
msgid ""
"The editor automatically performs oversampling when zooming in the 2D "
"editor, which allows you to preview how oversampling will look at specific "
"scale factors. This can be disabled by unchecking **View > Auto Resample "
"CanvasItems** at the top of the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"Editor ຈະເຮັດ oversampling ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຊູມ (zoom) ໃນ 2D editor. ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂ"
"ດຍການຍົກເລີກ **View > Auto Resample CanvasItems** ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ 2D editor "
"viewport."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:575
msgid ""
"Oversampling can also be applied according to the Node2D or Control's Scale "
"property. This *scale-based oversampling* behavior is disabled by default, "
"but it can be enabled by setting **Oversampling with Scale** in the "
"inspector to **Enabled** on the desired node. This is useful for nodes that "
"may have their scale changed at runtime, such as custom scale factors for "
"certain UI elements like crosshairs. However, keep in mind this can be "
"demanding on the CPU if the scale changes frequently, as the texture has to "
"be re-rendered each time."
msgstr ""
"Oversampling ຍັງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດ Scale ຂອງ Node2D ຫຼື Control ໄດ້. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະຖືກປິດ"
"ໄວ້ ແຕ່ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ **Oversampling with Scale** ໃນ Inspector. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດກັບໂ"
"ນດທີ່ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ ເຊັ່ນ ເປົ້າປືນ (crosshairs). ແຕ່ຕ້ອງລະວັງວ່າມັນອາດຈະກິນ CPU "
"ຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດເລື້ອຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:583
msgid ""
"For best results, the node should use uniform scaling. Non-uniform scaling "
"will work, but may result in aliasing on the shorter axis as oversampling is "
"always applied uniformly."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຜົນລັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ໂນດຄວນໃຊ້ການຂະຫຍາຍແບບສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ (uniform scaling). ການຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳ"
"ສະເໝີກໍໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີຮອຍຢັກໃນແກນທີ່ສັ້ນກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:589
msgid ""
"Control's :ref:`offset_transform_enabled "
"<class_Control_property_offset_transform_enabled>` property is taken into "
"account by scale-based oversampling, but only "
"if :ref:`offset_transform_visual_only "
"<class_Control_property_offset_transform_visual_only>` is *disabled*. "
"When :ref:`offset_transform_visual_only "
"<class_Control_property_offset_transform_visual_only>` is enabled, it does "
"not affect the node's actual scale (as used for input coordinates), but only "
"its visual representation. Therefore, it is ignored by oversampling."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`offset_transform_enabled "
"<class_Control_property_offset_transform_enabled>` ຂອງ Control ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃ"
"ນ scale-based oversampling ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ :ref:`offset_transform_visual_only "
"<class_Control_property_offset_transform_visual_only>` ຖືກປິດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:599
msgid "Reducing aliasing on downsampling"
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກເມື່ອມີການຫຼຸດຂະໜາດ (Downsampling)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:601
msgid ""
"If the game has a very high base resolution (e.g. 3840×2160), aliasing might "
"appear when downsampling to something considerably lower like 1280×720."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເກມມີຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານສູງຫຼາຍ (ເຊັ່ນ 4K), ອາດຈະມີຮອຍຢັກປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມລະອຽດລົງມາຕ່ຳ ເຊັ່"
"ນ 720p."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:604
msgid ""
"To resolve this, you can :ref:`enable mipmaps "
"<doc_importing_images_mipmaps>` on all your 2D textures. However, enabling "
"mipmaps will increase memory usage which can be an issue on low-end mobile "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດ :ref:`ເປີດ mipmaps <doc_importing_images_mipmaps>` ໃນທຸກ"
"ເທັກເຈີ 2D. ແຕ່ການເປີດ mipmaps ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງອາດເປັນບັນຫາກັບມືຖືສະເປັກຕ່ຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:608
msgid ""
"For SVG images, you can also change their import type "
"to :ref:`class_DPITexture` in the Import dock to benefit from automatic "
"oversampling as described above. This avoids aliasing by re-rasterizing the "
"texture when the scale factor changes."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຮູບ SVG, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປະເພດການນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ :ref:`class_DPITexture` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາ"
"ກ oversampling ອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງຮອຍຢັກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:613
msgid "Handling aspect ratios"
msgstr "ການຈັດການອັດຕາສ່ວນ (Aspect ratios)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:615
msgid ""
"Once scaling for different resolutions is accounted for, make sure that your "
"*user interface* also scales for different aspect ratios. This can be done "
"using :ref:`anchors <doc_size_and_anchors>` and/or :ref:`containers "
"<doc_gui_containers>`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຈັດການການຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່າງໆແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ *UI* ຂອງທ່ານກໍປັບຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຕ່າງກັ"
"ນນຳ. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`anchors <doc_size_and_anchors>` ແລະ/ຫຼື "
":ref:`containers <doc_gui_containers>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:621
msgid "Field of view scaling"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງ (Field of view scaling)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:623
msgid ""
"The 3D Camera node's **Keep Aspect** property defaults to the **Keep "
"Height** scaling mode (also called *Hor+*). This is usually the best value "
"for desktop games and mobile games in landscape mode, as widescreen displays "
"will automatically use a wider field of view."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ **Keep Aspect** ຂອງກ້ອງ 3D ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ **Keep Height** (ຫຼືເອີ້ນວ່າ *Hor+*) ໂດ"
"ຍປົກກະຕິ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບເກມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ເກມມືຖືແນວນອນ ເພາະໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງຈະໃຊ້ຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງ "
"(FOV) ທີ່ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:628
msgid ""
"However, if your 3D game is intended to be played in portrait mode, it may "
"make more sense to use **Keep Width** instead (also called *Vert-*). This "
"way, smartphones with an aspect ratio taller than 16:9 (e.g. 19:9) will use "
"a *taller* field of view, which is more logical here."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າເກມ 3D ຂອງທ່ານຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ຫຼິ້ນໃນແນວຕັ້ງ, ມັນອາດຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ "
"**Keep Width** (ຫຼືເອີ້ນວ່າ *Vert-*). ວິທີນີ້, ມືຖືທີ່ມີໜ້າຈໍຍາວຈະໃຊ້ຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງທີ່ *ສູງຂຶ້ນ* ເຊິ່ງເ"
"ບິ່ງແລ້ວເປັນທຳມະຊາດກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:634
msgid "Scaling 2D and 3D elements differently"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດອົງປະກອບ 2D ແລະ 3D ແບບຕ່າງກັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:636
msgid ""
"To render 3D at a different resolution from 2D elements (such as the UI), "
"use Godot's :ref:`resolution scaling <doc_resolution_scaling>` "
"functionality. This allows you to control the resolution scale factor used "
"for 3D without needing to use a separate Viewport node. This can either be "
"used to improve performance by rendering 3D at a lower resolution, or "
"improve quality via supersampling."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ 3D ໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງຈາກອົງປະກອບ 2D (ເຊັ່ນ UI), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
":ref:`resolution scaling <doc_resolution_scaling>` ຂອງ Godot. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາ"
"ມາດຄວບຄຸມຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ 3D ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂນດ Viewport ແຍກຕ່າງ"
"ຫາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ, ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບ"
"ຜ່ານ supersampling."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:4
msgid "Fixing jitter, stutter and input lag"
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂອາການສັ່ນ (jitter), ອາການກະຕຸກ (stutter) ແລະ ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input "
"lag)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:7
msgid "What is jitter, stutter and input lag?"
msgstr "ອາການສັ່ນ, ອາການກະຕຸກ ແລະ ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:9
msgid ""
"*Jitter* and *stutter* are two different alterations to visible motion of "
"objects on screen that may affect a game, even when running at full speed. "
"These effects are mostly visible in games where the world moves at a "
"constant speed in a fixed direction, like runners or platformers."
msgstr ""
"*Jitter* (ອາການສັ່ນ) ແລະ *stutter* (ອາການກະຕຸກ) ແມ່ນສອງຄວາມຜິດປົກກະຕິທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂອງການ"
"ເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນ ຂອງວັດຖຸເທິງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເກມ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເຕັມທີ່ກໍ"
"ຕາມ. ຜົນກະທົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະເຫັນໄດ້ໃນເກມທີ່ໂລກເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວຄົງທີ່ໃນທິດທາງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ, ເຊັ່ນເກມແລ່"
"ນ ຫຼື ເກມແພລັດຟອມມັດ (platformers)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:14
msgid ""
"*Input lag* is unrelated to jitter and stutter, but is sometimes discussed "
"alongside. Input lag refers to visible on-screen delay when performing "
"actions with the mouse, keyboard, controller or touchscreen. It can be "
"related to game code, engine code or external factors (such as hardware). "
"Input lag is most noticeable in games that use the mouse to aim, such as "
"first-person games. Input lag can't be completely eliminated, but it can be "
"reduced in several ways."
msgstr ""
"*Input lag* (ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ) ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ jitter ແລະ stutter, ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງກໍຖືກເວົ້າ"
"ເຖິງຮ່ວມກັນ. Input lag ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມຊັກຊ້າທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍເມື່ອເຮັດການກະທຳດ້ວຍເມົ້າ, ຄີບອດ, ຈໍ"
"ຍ ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ. ມັນສາມາດກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຄ້ດເກມ, ໂຄ້ດຂອງເອັນຈິນ ຫຼື ປັດໄຈພາຍນອກ (ເຊັ່ນ ຮາດແວ). "
"Input lag ຈະສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນທີ່ສຸດໃນເກມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມົ້າເພື່ອເລັງ, ເຊັ່ນເກມມຸມມອງບຸກຄົນທີໜຶ່ງ. Input "
"lag ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳຈັດອອກໄປໄດ້ທັງໝົດ, ແຕ່ສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:22
msgid "Distinguishing between jitter and stutter"
msgstr "ການຈຳແນກລະຫວ່າງອາການສັ່ນ (jitter) ແລະ ອາການກະຕຸກ (stutter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:24
msgid ""
"A game running at a normal framerate without exhibiting any effect will "
"appear smooth:"
msgstr ""
"ເກມທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍເຟຣມເຣດປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆ ຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:28
msgid "A game exhibiting *jitter* will shake constantly in a very subtle way:"
msgstr "ເກມທີ່ມີອາການ *jitter* ຈະມີການສັ່ນຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາໃນແບບທີ່ເບິ່ງອອກໄດ້ຍາກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:32
msgid ""
"Finally, a game exhibiting *stutter* will appear smooth, but appear to "
"*stop* or *roll back a frame* every few seconds:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເກມທີ່ມີອາການ *stutter* ຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ແຕ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຈະ *ຢຸດ* ຫຼື *ຍ້ອນກັບໄປ"
"ໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ* ໃນທຸກໆ ສອງສາມວິນາທີ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:38
msgid "Jitter"
msgstr "ອາການສັ່ນ (Jitter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:40
msgid ""
"There can be many causes of jitter. The most typical one happens when the "
"game *physics frequency* (usually 60 Hz) runs at a different resolution than "
"the monitor refresh rate. Check whether your monitor refresh rate is "
"different from 60 Hz."
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍສາເຫດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ jitter. ສາເຫດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ *ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງຟີຊິກ* ຂອງເກມ (ປົ"
"ກກະຕິແມ່ນ 60 Hz) ເຮັດວຽກໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງຈາກອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍ. ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣ"
"ຊໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຈົ້າຕ່າງຈາກ 60 Hz ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:45
msgid ""
"Sometimes, only some objects appear to jitter (character or background). "
"This happens when they are processed in different time sources (one is "
"processed in the physics step while another is processed in the idle step)."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ວັດຖຸບາງຢ່າງທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີອາການສັ່ນ (ຕົວລະຄອນ ຫຼື ສາກຫຼັງ). ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກປະ"
"ມວນຜົນໃນແຫຼ່ງເວລາທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ (ອັນໜຶ່ງຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນວ່າ"
"ງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:49
msgid ""
"This cause of jitter can be alleviated by enabling :ref:`physics "
"interpolation <doc_physics_interpolation_quick_start_guide>` in the Project "
"Settings. Physics interpolation will smooth out physics updates by "
"interpolating the transforms of physics objects between physics frames. This "
"way, the visual representation of physics objects will always look smooth no "
"matter the framerate and physics tick rate."
msgstr ""
"ສາເຫດຂອງ jitter ນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`physics interpolation "
"<doc_physics_interpolation_quick_start_guide>` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ. Physics "
"interpolation ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອັບເດດຟີຊິກມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີຂຶ້ນໂດຍການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນການປ່ຽນແປງ "
"(transforms) ຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມຟີຊິກ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ການສະແດງຜົນທາງສາຍຕາຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກຈະເບິ່ງ"
"ຄືວ່າມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີສະເໝີ ບໍ່ວ່າເຟຣມເຣດ ແລະ ອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟີຊິກຈະເປັນແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:56
msgid ""
"Enabling physics interpolation has some caveats you should be aware of. For "
"example, care should be taken when teleporting objects so that they don't "
"visibly interpolate between the old position and new position when it's not "
"intended. See the :ref:`doc_physics_interpolation` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ physics interpolation ມີຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງບາງຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າຄວນຮູ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຄວນລະມັດລະວັງໃນເ"
"ວລາຍ້າຍວັດຖຸແບບທັນທີ (teleporting) ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງຕ"
"ຳແໜ່ງເກົ່າ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ເມື່ອບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນເອກະສານ "
":ref:`doc_physics_interpolation`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:64
msgid ""
"Enabling physics interpolation will increase input lag for behavior that "
"depends on the physics tick, such as player movement. In most games, this is "
"generally preferable to jitter, but consider this carefully for games that "
"operate on a fixed framerate (like fighting or rhythm games). This increase "
"in input lag can be compensated by increasing the physics tick rate as "
"described in the :ref:`doc_jitter_stutter_input_lag` section."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ physics interpolation ຈະເພີ່ມ input lag ສຳລັບພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟີຊິ"
"ກ, ເຊັ່ນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ. ໃນເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະດີກວ່າການມີ jitter, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຢ່າງລະ"
"ອຽດສຳລັບເກມທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍເຟຣມເຣດຄົງທີ່ (ເຊັ່ນເກມຕໍ່ສູ້ ຫຼື ເກມຈັງຫວະດົນຕີ). ການເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຂອງ input "
"lag ນີ້ສາມາດຊົດເຊີຍໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟີຊິກ (physics tick rate) ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາ"
"ຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ :ref:`doc_jitter_stutter_input_lag`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:72
msgid "Stutter"
msgstr "ອາການກະຕຸກ (Stutter)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:74
msgid ""
"Stutter may happen due to several different reasons. One reason is the game "
"not being able to keep full framerate performance due to a CPU or GPU "
"bottleneck. Solving this is game-specific and will "
"require :ref:`optimization <doc_general_optimization>`."
msgstr ""
"ອາການກະຕຸກອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຈາກຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ສາເຫດໜຶ່ງແມ່ນເກມບໍ່ສາມາດຮັກສາປະສິດທິພາບເຟຣມເຣດໄດ້ເຕັມທີ່ເ"
"ນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (bottleneck) ຂອງ CPU ຫຼື GPU. ການແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະເກມ ແລະ ຈະຕ້ອງມີກາ"
"ນ :ref:`ເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ (optimization) <doc_general_optimization>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:79
msgid ""
"Another common reason for stuttering is *shader compilation stutter*. This "
"occurs when a shader needs to be compiled when a new material or particle "
"effect is spawned for the first time in a game. This kind of stuttering "
"generally only happens on the first playthrough, or after a graphics driver "
"update when the shader cache is invalidated."
msgstr ""
"ອີກສາເຫດໜຶ່ງທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍຂອງອາການກະຕຸກແມ່ນ *shader compilation stutter* (ການກະຕຸກຈາກການປະ"
"ມວນຜົນເຊດເດີ). ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຊດເດີ (shader) ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກປະມວນຜົນເມື່ອມີວັດສະດຸໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເອັບເຟັກພ"
"າກຕິໂຄ (particle) ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນເກມ. ການກະຕຸກປະເພດນີ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນການຫຼິ້ນ"
"ຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກເມື່ອແຄຊຂອງເຊດເດີຖືກລ້າງອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:84
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.4, when using the Forward+ or Mobile renderers, the engine "
"tries to avoid shader compilation stutter using an ubershader approach. For "
"this approach to be most effective, care must be taken when designing scenes "
"and resources so that Godot can gather as much information as possible when "
"the scene/resource is loaded, as opposed as to when it's being drawn for the "
"first time. See :ref:`doc_pipeline_compilations` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile, ເອັນຈິນຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼີກລ່ຽງ"
"ການກະຕຸກຈາກການປະມວນຜົນເຊດເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ ubershader. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ວິທີນີ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ, ຕ້ອງລະມັດລະ"
"ວັງໃນການອອກແບບສາກ (scenes) ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resources) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ສາມາດຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນເວລາທີ່ໂຫຼດສາກ/ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຕອນທີ່ມັນຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເ"
"ຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_pipeline_compilations`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:91
msgid ""
"However, when using the Compatibility renderer, it is not possible to use "
"this ubershader approach due to technical limitations in OpenGL. Therefore, "
"to avoid shader compilation stutter in the Compatibility renderer, you need "
"to spawn every mesh and visual effect in front of the camera for a single "
"frame when the level is loading. This will ensure the shader is compiled "
"when the level is loaded, as opposed to occurring during gameplay. This can "
"be done behind solid 2D UI (such as a fullscreen :ref:`class_ColorRect` "
"node) so that it's not visible to the player."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ Compatibility, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ວິທີ ubershader ນີ້ໄດ້ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈ"
"ຳກັດທາງເຕັກນິກໃນ OpenGL. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການກະຕຸກຈາກການປະມວນຜົນເຊດເດີໃນຕົວປະມວນຜົນ "
"Compatibility, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງທຸກໆ ເມັດ (mesh) ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກສາຍຕາ ໄວ້ຕໍ່ໜ້າກ້ອງເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງ"
"ເຟຣມໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໂຫຼດດ່ານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຊດເດີຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວເມື່ອດ່ານຖືກໂຫຼດ, ແທນທີ່ຈະມາ"
"ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ UI 2D (ເຊັ່ນ ໂນດ "
":ref:`class_ColorRect` ແບບເຕັມຈໍ) ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເບິ່ງເຫັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:101
msgid ""
"On platforms that support disabling V-Sync, stuttering can be made less "
"noticeable by disabling V-Sync in the project settings. This will however "
"cause tearing to appear, especially on monitors with low refresh rates. If "
"your monitor supports it, consider enabling variable refresh rate (G-Sync/"
"FreeSync) while leaving V-Sync enabled. This allows mitigating some forms of "
"stuttering without introducing tearing. However, it will not help with large "
"stutters, such as the ones caused by shader compilation stutter."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບການປິດ V-Sync, ອາການກະຕຸກສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງໂດຍການປິດ V-"
"Sync ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ. ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພາບຂາດ (tearing), ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີອັດຕາກາ"
"ນຣີເຟຣຊຕ່ຳ. ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຈົ້າຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ variable refresh rate (G-Sync/"
"FreeSync) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດ V-Sync ໄວ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍບັນເທົາອາການກະຕຸກບາງຮູບແບບໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພາບ"
"ຂາດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຊ່ວຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການກະຕຸກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ເຊັ່ນອາການທີ່ເກີດຈາກການປະມວນຜົນເຊດ"
"ເດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:109
msgid ""
"Forcing your graphics card to use the maximum performance profile can also "
"help reduce stuttering, at the cost of increased GPU power draw."
msgstr ""
"ການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ກາດກຣາຟິກຂອງເຈົ້າໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ (maximum performance) ກໍສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ"
"ອາການກະຕຸກໄດ້, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານ GPU ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:112
msgid ""
"Additionally, stutter may be induced by the underlying operating system. "
"Here is some information regarding stutter on different OSes:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ອາການກະຕຸກອາດເກີດຈາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບອາການກະຕຸກໃນລະບົ"
"ບປະຕິບັດການຕ່າງໆ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:118
msgid ""
"Windows is known to cause stutter in windowed games. This mostly depends on "
"the hardware installed, drivers version and processes running in parallel "
"(e.g. having many browser tabs open may cause stutter in a running game). To "
"avoid this, Godot raises the game priority to \"Above Normal\". This helps "
"considerably, but may not completely eliminate stutter."
msgstr ""
"Windows ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນດີວ່າເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດອາການກະຕຸກໃນເກມທີ່ຫຼິ້ນແບບໜ້າຕ່າງ (windowed). ສິ່ງນີ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຂຶ້"
"ນກັບຮາດແວທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເວີຊັນຂອງໄດຣເວີ ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂະໜານກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ການເປີດແທັບບຣາວເ"
"ຊີຫຼາຍເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດອາການກະຕຸກໃນເກມທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່). ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນີ້, Godot ຈະເພີ່ມລຳດັບຄວາມ"
"ສຳຄັນ (priority) ຂອງເກມເປັນ \"Above Normal\". ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳຈັດອາກ"
"ານກະຕຸກໄດ້ທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:124
msgid ""
"Eliminating this completely requires giving your game full privileges to "
"become \"Time Critical\", which is not advised. Some games may do it, but it "
"is advised to learn to live with this problem, as it is common for Windows "
"games and most users won't play games windowed (games that are played in a "
"window, e.g. puzzle games, will usually not exhibit this problem anyway)."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳຈັດສິ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ໝົດໄປຢ່າງສົມບູນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ສິດເກມຂອງເຈົ້າເປັນ \"Time Critical\", ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃ"
"ຫ້ເຮັດ. ເກມບາງເກມອາດຈະເຮັດ, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮຽນຮູ້ທີ່ຈະຢູ່ກັບບັນຫານີ້, ເພາະວ່າມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິສຳລັບເກ"
"ມໃນ Windows ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະບໍ່ຫຼິ້ນເກມແບບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ເກມທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ ເຊັ່ນເກມປິດສະໜາ, ມັກຈະບໍ່ສ"
"ະແດງບັນຫານີ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:130
msgid ""
"For fullscreen, Windows gives special priority to the game so stutter is no "
"longer visible and very rare. This is how most games are played."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນແບບເຕັມຈໍ, Windows ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນພິເສດແກ່ເກມ ດັ່ງນັ້ນອາການກະຕຸກຈະບໍ່ສັງເກດເຫັນອີກ ແລ"
"ະ ພົບໄດ້ໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ. ນີ້ຄືວິທີທີ່ເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຖືກຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:133
msgid ""
"When using a mouse with a polling rate of 1,000 Hz or more, consider using a "
"fully up-to-date Windows 11 installation which comes with fixes related to "
"high CPU utilization with high polling rate mice. These fixes are not "
"available in Windows 10 and older versions."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເມົ້າທີ່ມີອັດຕາການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (polling rate) 1,000 Hz ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ Windows "
"11 ທີ່ອັບເດດລ່າສຸດ ເຊິ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໃຊ້ CPU ສູງກັບເມົ້າທີ່ມີອັດຕາການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສູງ. ການແກ້ໄຂ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີໃນ Windows 10 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:153
msgid ""
"Stutter may be visible on desktop Linux, but this is usually associated with "
"different video drivers and compositors. Some compositors may also trigger "
"this problem (e.g. KWin), so it is advised to try using a different one to "
"rule it out as the cause. Some window managers such as KWin and Xfwm allow "
"you to manually disable compositing, which can improve performance (at the "
"cost of tearing)."
msgstr ""
"ອາການກະຕຸກອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນ Linux ເດັສທອບ, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໄດຣເວີວິດີໂອ ແລະ ຕົວຈັດກ"
"ານໜ້າຈໍ (compositors) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຈໍບາງອັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫານີ້ (ເຊັ່ນ KWin), ດັ່ງນັ້"
"ນຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ອັນອື່ນເພື່ອຕັດສາເຫດອອກໄປ. ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງບາງອັນເຊັ່ນ KWin ແລະ Xfwm ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເ"
"ຈົ້າສາມາດປິດ compositing ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ (ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບພາບຂາດ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:160
msgid ""
"There is no workaround for driver or compositor stuttering, other than "
"reporting it as an issue to the driver or compositor developers. Stutter may "
"be more present when playing in windowed mode as opposed to fullscreen, even "
"with compositing disabled."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີວິທີແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບອາການກະຕຸກຈາກໄດຣເວີ ຫຼື ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຈໍ, ນອກຈາກການລາຍງານບັນຫາໄປຫາຜູ້ພັດທະນາໄດຣ"
"ເວີ ຫຼື ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຈໍນັ້ນໆ. ອາການກະຕຸກອາດຈະພົບໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນໃນໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແບບເຕັມຈໍ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະປິດ compositing ແລ້ວກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:165
msgid ""
"`Feral GameMode <https://github.com/FeralInteractive/gamemode>`__ can be "
"used to automatically apply optimizations (such as forcing the GPU "
"performance profile) when running specific processes."
msgstr ""
"`Feral GameMode <https://github.com/FeralInteractive/gamemode>`__ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັ"
"ບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເຊັ່ນ ການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ປະສິດທິພາບ GPU) ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣແກຣມທີ່"
"ລະບຸໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:172
msgid ""
"Generally, macOS is stutter-free, although recently some bugs were reported "
"when running on fullscreen (this is a macOS bug). If you have a machine "
"exhibiting this behavior, please let us know."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, macOS ຈະບໍ່ມີອາການກະຕຸກ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້ຈະມີການລາຍງານບັກບາງຢ່າງເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນແບ"
"ບເຕັມຈໍ (ນີ້ແມ່ນບັກຂອງ macOS). ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບອາການນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ, ກະລຸນາແຈ້ງໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຊາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:179
msgid ""
"Generally, Android is stutter and jitter-free because the running activity "
"gets all the priority. That said, there may be problematic devices (older "
"Kindle Fire is known to be one). If you see this problem on Android, please "
"let us know."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, Android ຈະບໍ່ມີອາການກະຕຸກ ແລະ ອາການສັ່ນ ເພາະວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຈະໄດ້"
"ຮັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ອາດຈະມີອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີບັນຫາ (Kindle Fire ລຸ້ນເກົ່າເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນດີວ່າມີບັນ"
"ຫານີ້). ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຫັນບັນຫານີ້ໃນ Android, ກະລຸນາແຈ້ງໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຊາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:186
msgid ""
"iOS devices are generally stutter-free, but older devices running newer "
"versions of the operating system may exhibit problems. This is generally "
"unavoidable."
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນ iOS ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ມີອາການກະຕຸກ, ແຕ່ອຸປະກອນລຸ້ນເກົ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເວີຊັນໃໝ່ອາດຈະພົບ"
"ບັນຫາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນຫຼີກລ່ຽງບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:192
msgid "Input lag"
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (Input lag)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:195
msgid "Project configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:197
msgid ""
"On platforms that support disabling V-Sync, input lag can be made less "
"noticeable by disabling V-Sync in the project settings. This will however "
"cause tearing to appear, especially on monitors with low refresh rates. It's "
"suggested to make V-Sync available as an option for players to toggle."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບການປິດ V-Sync, ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງໂດຍກ"
"ານປິດ V-Sync ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ. ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພາບຂາດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີອັດຕາການຣີເ"
"ຟຣຊຕ່ຳ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ V-Sync ເປັນຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດເປີດ-ປິດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:202
msgid ""
"When using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering methods, another way to reduce "
"visual latency when V-Sync is enabled is to use double-buffered V-Sync "
"instead of the default triple-buffered V-Sync. Since Godot 4.3, this can be "
"achieved by reducing the **Display > Window > V-Sync > Swapchain Image "
"Count** project setting to ``2``.  The downside of using double buffering is "
"that framerate will be less stable if the display refresh rate can't be "
"reached due to a CPU or GPU bottleneck. For instance, on a 60 Hz display, if "
"the framerate would normally drop to 55 FPS during gameplay with triple "
"buffering, it will have to drop down to 30 FPS momentarily with double "
"buffering (and then go back to 60 FPS when possible). As a result, double-"
"buffered V-Sync is only recommended if you can *consistently* reach the "
"display refresh rate on the target hardware."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile, ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມຊັກຊ້າຂອງພາບ (visual "
"latency) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດ V-Sync ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ double-buffered V-Sync ແທນ triple-"
"buffered V-Sync ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.3 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຫຼຸດການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າໂປຣເຈັກ **Display > Window > V-Sync > Swapchain Image Count** ໃຫ້ເປັນ ``2``. ຂໍ້ເ"
"ສຍຂອງການໃຊ້ double buffering ແມ່ນເຟຣມເຣດຈະມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີໜ້ອຍລົງ ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຮັກສາອັດຕາກາ"
"ນຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ CPU ຫຼື GPU. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນໜ້າຈໍ 60 Hz, ຖ້າປົກກະຕິເຟຣມເຣດຕົກໄປຢູ່"
"ທີ່ 55 FPS ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນດ້ວຍ triple buffering, ມັນຈະຕ້ອງຕົກລົງໄປທີ່ 30 FPS ຊົ່ວຄາວຫາກໃຊ້ "
"double buffering (ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງກັບມາທີ່ 60 FPS ເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, double-buffered V-"
"Sync ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດເຟຣມເຣດໃຫ້ເຖິງອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ *ຢ່າງສະໝ່"
"ຳສະເໝີ* ໃນຮາດແວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:214
msgid ""
"Increasing the number of physics iterations per second can also reduce "
"physics-induced input latency. This is especially noticeable when using "
"physics interpolation (which improves smoothness but increases latency). To "
"do so, set **Physics > Common > Physics Ticks Per Second** to a value higher "
"than the default ``60``, or set ``Engine.physics_ticks_per_second`` at "
"runtime in a script. Values that are a multiple of the monitor refresh rate "
"(typically ``60``) work best when physics interpolation is disabled, as they "
"will avoid jitter. This means values such as ``120``, ``180`` and ``240`` "
"are good starting points. As a bonus, higher physics FPSes make tunneling "
"and physics instability issues less likely to occur."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຈຳນວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟີຊິກຕໍ່ວິນາທີກໍສາມາດຫຼຸດຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກີດຈາກຟີຊິກໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ"
"ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ physics interpolation (ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີຂຶ້ນແຕ່ເພີ່ມຄວາ"
"ມໜ່ວງ). ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Physics > Common > Physics Ticks Per Second** ໃຫ້ສູງ"
"ກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``60``, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Engine.physics_ticks_per_second`` ໃນສະຄຣິບລະຫວ່າງກາ"
"ນເຮັດວຽກ. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ ``60``) ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອປິດ "
"physics interpolation ເພາະຈະຫຼີກລ່ຽງ jitter ໄດ້. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າເຊັ່ນ ``120``, ``180`` "
"ແລະ ``240`` ແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຟີຊິກ FPS ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຍັງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດໂອກາດທີ່ຈະເກີດບັນຫາ "
"tunneling (ວັດຖຸທະລຸຜ່ານກັນ) ແລະ ຄວາມບໍ່ສະຖຽນຂອງຟີຊິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:225
msgid ""
"The downside of increasing physics FPS is that CPU usage will increase, "
"which can lead to performance bottlenecks in games that have heavy physics "
"simulation code. This can be alleviated by increasing physics FPS only in "
"situations where low latency is critical, or by letting players adjust "
"physics FPS to match their hardware. However, different physics FPS will "
"lead to different outcomes in physics simulation, even when ``delta`` is "
"consistently used in your game logic. This can give certain players an "
"advantage over others. Therefore, allowing the player to change the physics "
"FPS themselves should be avoided for competitive multiplayer games."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງການເພີ່ມຟີຊິກ FPS ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ CPU ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບໃນ"
"ເກມທີ່ມີການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດບັນເທົາໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຟີຊິກ FPS ສະເພາະໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ຄວາ"
"ມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບຟີຊິກ FPS ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຮາດແວຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ແນວໃດ"
"ກໍຕາມ, ຟີຊິກ FPS ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຜົນການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ ``delta`` ຢ່າງສະໝ່"
"ຳສະເໝີໃນໂລຈິກເກມຂອງເຈົ້າກໍຕາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນບາງຄົນໄດ້ປຽບກວ່າຜູ້ອື່ນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້"
"ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປ່ຽນຟີຊິກ FPS ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຄວນຫຼີກລ່ຽງສຳລັບເກມທີ່ມີການແຂ່ງຂັນແບບຫຼາຍຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:235
msgid ""
"Lastly, you can disable input buffering on a per-rendered frame basis by "
"calling ``Input.set_use_accumulated_input(false)`` in a script. This will "
"make it so the ``_input()`` and ``_unhandled_input()`` functions in your "
"scripts are called on every input, rather than accumulating inputs and "
"waiting for a frame to be rendered. Disabling input accumulation will "
"increase CPU usage, so it should be done with caution."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input buffering) ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍ"
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``Input.set_use_accumulated_input(false)`` ໃນສະຄຣິບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"``_input()`` ແລະ ``_unhandled_input()`` ໃນສະຄຣິບຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆ ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ເຟຣມຖືກປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນ. ການປິດການສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈະເພີ່ມການໃ"
"ຊ້ CPU, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນເຮັດດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:244
msgid ""
"On any Godot project, you can use the ``--disable-vsync`` :ref:`command line "
"argument <doc_command_line_tutorial>` to forcibly disable V-Sync. Since "
"Godot 4.2, ``--max-fps <fps>`` can also be used to set an FPS limit (``0`` "
"is unlimited). These arguments can be used at the same time."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທຸກໆ ໂປຣເຈັກ Godot, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ argument ຜ່ານ command line ``--disable-vsync`` "
":ref:` <doc_command_line_tutorial>` ເພື່ອບັງຄັບປິດ V-Sync. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.2 ເປັນຕົ້ນມ"
"າ, ``--max-fps <fps>`` ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳກັດ FPS (``0`` ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳກັດ). argument ເຫຼົ່"
"ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:250
msgid "Hardware/OS-specific"
msgstr "ສະເພາະຮາດແວ/ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:252
msgid ""
"If your monitor supports it, consider enabling variable refresh rate (G-Sync/"
"FreeSync) while leaving V-Sync enabled, then cap the framerate in the "
"project settings to a slightly lower value than your monitor's maximum "
"refresh rate as per `this page <https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-"
"on/>`__. For example, on a 144 Hz monitor, you can set the project's "
"framerate cap to ``141``. This may be counterintuitive at first, but capping "
"the FPS below the maximum refresh rate range ensures that the OS never has "
"to wait for vertical blanking to finish. This leads to *similar* input lag "
"as V-Sync disabled with the same framerate cap (usually less than 1 ms "
"greater), but without any tearing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຈົ້າຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ variable refresh rate (G-Sync/FreeSync) ໃນຂະ"
"ນະທີ່ເປີດ V-Sync ໄວ້, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຳກັດເຟຣມເຣດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າ"
"ຈໍເລັກນ້ອຍ ຕາມທີ່ແນະນຳໃນ `ໜ້ານີ້ <https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/>"
"`__. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນໜ້າຈໍ 144 Hz, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຈຳກັດເຟຣມເຣດຂອງໂປຣເຈັກເປັນ ``141``. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາ"
"ດຈະຟັງເບິ່ງແປກໆ ໃນຕອນທຳອິດ, ແຕ່ການຈຳກັດ FPS ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າຊ່ວງອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊສູງສຸດ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່"
"າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການສ້າງພາບແນວຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີ input lag *ໃກ້ຄຽງ* ກັບກ"
"ານປິດ V-Sync ທີ່ມີການຈຳກັດເຟຣມເຣດຄືກັນ (ປົກກະຕິຈະຫຼາຍກວ່າບໍ່ເກີນ 1 ms), ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີພາບຂາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:263
msgid ""
"This can be done by changing the **Application > Run > Max FPS** project "
"setting or assigning ``Engine.max_fps`` at runtime in a script."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ **Application > Run > Max FPS** ຫຼື ກຳນົດຄ່າ "
"``Engine.max_fps`` ໃນສະຄຣິບລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:266
msgid ""
"On some platforms, you can also opt into a low-latency mode in the graphics "
"driver options (such as the NVIDIA Control Panel on Windows). The **Ultra** "
"setting will give you the lowest possible latency, at the cost of slightly "
"lower average framerates. Forcing the GPU to use the maximum performance "
"profile can also further reduce input lag, at the cost of higher power "
"consumption (and resulting heat/fan noise)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງແພລັດຟອມ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ໂໝດຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳ (low-latency mode) ໃນຕົວເລືອກໄດຣເວີກຣ"
"າຟິກ (ເຊັ່ນ NVIDIA Control Panel ໃນ Windows). ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Ultra** ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ"
"ເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບເຟຣມເຣດສະເລ່ຍທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງເລັກນ້ອຍ. ການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ GPU ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ປະສິ"
"ດທິພາບສູງສຸດຍັງສາມາດຫຼຸດ input lag ໄດ້ຕື່ມອີກ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ພະລັງງານຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຮ້ອນ/"
"ສຽງພັດລົມ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:273
msgid ""
"Finally, make sure your monitor is running at its highest possible refresh "
"rate in the OS' display settings."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊສູງສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າກາ"
"ນສະແດງຜົນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:276
msgid ""
"Also, ensure that your mouse is configured to use its highest polling rate "
"(typically 1,000 Hz for gaming mice, sometimes more). High USB polling rates "
"can however result in high CPU usage, so 500 Hz may be a safer bet on low-"
"end CPUs. If your mouse offers multiple :abbr:`DPI (Dots Per Inch)` "
"settings, consider also `using the highest possible setting and reducing in-"
"game sensitivity to reduce mouse latency <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=6AoRfv9W110>`__."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເມົ້າຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ polling rate ສູງສຸດ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 1,000 Hz ສຳລັ"
"ບເມົ້າເກມມິ່ງ, ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, polling rate ຂອງ USB ທີ່ສູງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້"
"ມີການໃຊ້ CPU ສູງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ 500 Hz ອາດຈະເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ປອດໄພກວ່າສຳລັບ CPU ລຸ້ນຕ່ຳ. ຖ້າເມົ້າຂອງເຈົ້າ"
"ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :abbr:`DPI (Dots Per Inch)` ຫຼາຍລະດັບ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາ `ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສູງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈ"
"ະເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມໄວ (sensitivity) ໃນເກມລົງເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງເມົ້າ <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=6AoRfv9W110>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:282
msgid ""
"On Linux when using X11, disabling compositing in window managers that allow "
"it (such as KWin or Xfwm) can reduce input lag significantly."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Linux ເມື່ອໃຊ້ X11, ການປິດ compositing ໃນຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ (ເຊັ່ນ KWin ຫຼື "
"Xfwm) ສາມາດຫຼຸດ input lag ໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:286
msgid "Reporting jitter, stutter or input lag problems"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານບັນຫາອາການສັ່ນ, ອາການກະຕຸກ ຫຼື ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:288
msgid ""
"If you are reporting a stutter or jitter problem (opening an issue) not "
"caused by any of the above reasons, please specify very clearly all the "
"information possible about device, operating system, driver versions, etc. "
"This may help to better troubleshoot it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງລາຍງານບັນຫາອາການກະຕຸກ ຫຼື ອາການສັ່ນ (ເປີດ issue) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເກີດຈາກສາເຫດໃດໆ ຂ້າງເທິ"
"ງ, ກະລຸນາລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນທີ່ສຸດ ກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນຂອງໄດຣເ"
"ວີ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຮັດໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:293
msgid ""
"If you are reporting input lag problems, please include a capture made with "
"a high speed camera (such as your phone's slow motion video mode). The "
"capture **must** have both the screen and the input device visible so that "
"the number of frames between an input and the on-screen result can be "
"counted. Also, make sure to mention your monitor's refresh rate and your "
"input device's polling rate (especially for mice)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງລາຍງານບັນຫາ input lag, ກະລຸນາແນບວິດີໂອທີ່ຖ່າຍດ້ວຍກ້ອງຄວາມໄວສູງ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂໝດ slow "
"motion ໃນໂທລະສັບ). ໃນວິດີໂອ **ຕ້ອງ** ເຫັນທັງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດນັບຈຳນວນເ"
"ຟຣມລະຫວ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຜົນລັດເທິງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຢ່າລືມລະບຸອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ "
"polling rate ຂອງອຸປະກອນປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຈົ້າ (ໂດຍສະເພາະເມົ້າ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/jitter_stutter.rst:300
msgid ""
"Also, make sure to use the correct term (jitter, stutter, input lag) based "
"on the exhibited behavior. This will help understand your issue much faster. "
"Provide a project that can be used to reproduce the issue, and if possible, "
"include a screen capture demonstrating the bug."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຄຳສັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (jitter, stutter, input lag) ໂດຍອີງຕາມອາການທີ່ເ"
"ກີດຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈບັນຫາຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ. ກະລຸນາແນບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບບັນຫາໄ"
"ດ້, ແລະ ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ແນບວິດີໂອບັນທຶກໜ້າຈໍທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນບັກນັ້ນນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:4
msgid "The Compositor"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ (The Compositor)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:6
msgid ""
"The compositor is a new feature in Godot 4 that allows control over the "
"rendering pipeline when rendering the contents of a :ref:`Viewport "
"<class_Viewport>`."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ (compositor) ແມ່ນຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໃນ Godot 4 ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົ"
"ນ ໃນເວລາທີ່ປະມວນຜົນເນື້ອໃນຂອງ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:9
msgid ""
"It can be configured on a :ref:`WorldEnvironment <class_WorldEnvironment>` "
"node where it applies to all Viewports, or it can be configured on "
"a :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` and apply only to the Viewport using that "
"camera."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂນດ :ref:`WorldEnvironment <class_WorldEnvironment>` ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຜົນກັ"
"ບທຸກໆ Viewports, ຫຼື ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະ"
"ກັບ Viewport ທີ່ໃຊ້ກ້ອງນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:14
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Compositor <class_Compositor>` resource is used to configure the "
"compositor. To get started, create a new compositor on the appropriate node:"
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ :ref:`Compositor <class_Compositor>` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ. ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຄອມໂພຊິເຕີໃໝ່ໃນໂນດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:21
msgid ""
"The compositor is currently a feature that is only supported by the Mobile "
"and Forward+ renderers."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ ຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ ແມ່ນຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຕົວປະມວນຜົນ Mobile ແລະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:25
msgid "Compositor effects"
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:27
msgid ""
"Compositor effects allow you to insert additional logic into the rendering "
"pipeline at various stages. This is an advanced feature that requires a high "
"level of understanding of the rendering pipeline to use to its best "
"advantage."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແຊກໂລຈິກເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໄປໃນ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງ"
"ໆ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຟີເຈີລະດັບສູງທີ່ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈຢ່າງເລິກເຊິ່ງກ່ຽວກັບ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້"
"ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:32
msgid ""
"As the core logic of the compositor effect is called from the rendering "
"pipeline it is important to note that this logic will thus run within the "
"thread on which rendering takes place. Care needs to be taken to ensure we "
"don't run into threading issues."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກໂລຈິກຫຼັກຂອງເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົນ, ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້"
"ອງຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ໂລຈິກນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນ thread ດຽວກັນກັບການປະມວນຜົນພາບ. ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອໃ"
"ຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ພົບບັນຫາເລື່ອງ threading."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:37
msgid ""
"To illustrate how to use compositor effects we'll create a simple post "
"processing effect that allows you to write your own shader code and apply "
"this full screen through a compute shader. You can find the finished demo "
"project `here <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/compute/post_shader>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງວິທີການໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ (post-"
"processing) ແບບງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຂຽນໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີຂອງຕົວເອງ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບທັງໝົດໜ້າຈໍຜ່ານ "
"compute shader. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊອກຫາໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວໄດ້ `ທີ່ນີ້ <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/compute/post_shader>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:42
msgid ""
"We start by creating a new script called ``post_process_shader.gd``. We'll "
"make this a tool script so we can see the compositor effect work in the "
"editor. We need to extend our node from :ref:`CompositorEffect "
"<class_CompositorEffect>`. We must also give our script a class name."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການສ້າງສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``post_process_shader.gd``. ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເ"
"ປັນ tool script ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຫັນເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor). ພວກເຮົາຈຳ"
"ເປັນຕ້ອງສືບທອດ (extend) ໂນດຈາກ :ref:`CompositorEffect <class_CompositorEffect>"
"`. ນອກຈາກນີ້ພວກເຮົາຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຊື່ຄລາດ (class name) ໃຫ້ກັບສະຄຣິບນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:47
msgid "post_process_shader.gd"
msgstr "post_process_shader.gd"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:54
msgid ""
"Next we're going to define a constant for our shader template code. This is "
"the boilerplate code that makes our compute shader work."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant) ສຳລັບໂຄ້ດແມ່ແບບເຊດເດີຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄ້ດມາດຕະຖານ "
"(boilerplate) ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ compute shader ຂອງພວກເຮົາເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:90
msgid ""
"For more information on how compute shaders work, please check :ref:`Using "
"compute shaders <doc_compute_shaders>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ compute shaders, ກະລຸນາກວດເບິ່ງ :ref:`Using "
"compute shaders <doc_compute_shaders>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:93
msgid ""
"The important bit here is that for every pixel on our screen, our ``main`` "
"function is executed and inside of this we load the current color value of "
"our pixel, execute our user code, and write our modified color back to our "
"color image."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສຳຄັນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນ ສຳລັບທຸກໆ ພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ຟັງຊັນ ``main`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ແລະ ພາຍໃ"
"ນຟັງຊັນນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຈະໂຫຼດຄ່າສີປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພິກເຊວ, ເຮັດວຽກຕາມໂຄ້ດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນ, ແລະ ຂຽນຄ່າສີທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງແ"
"ລ້ວກັບຄືນໄປຍັງພາບສີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:98
msgid "``#COMPUTE_CODE`` gets replaced by our user code."
msgstr "``#COMPUTE_CODE`` ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍໂໂຄ້ດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:100
msgid ""
"In order to set our user code, we need an export variable. We'll also define "
"a few script variables we'll be using:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຕົວປ່ຽນ export. ນອກຈາກນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນໃນສະຄຣິ"
"ບບາງຢ່າງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:120
msgid ""
"Note the use of a :ref:`Mutex <class_Mutex>` in our code. Most of our "
"implementation gets called from the rendering engine and thus runs within "
"our rendering thread."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດການໃຊ້ :ref:`Mutex <class_Mutex>` ໃນໂຄ້ດຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງການເຮັດວຽກ ຈະຖືກ"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກເອັນຈິນການປະມວນຜົນພາບ ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນ thread ການປະມວນຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:124
msgid ""
"We need to ensure that we set our new shader code, and mark our shader code "
"as dirty, without our render thread accessing this data at the same time."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີໃໝ່ ແລະ ໝາຍໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີວ່າ dirty (ຕ້ອງມີການອັບເດດ) "
"ໂດຍທີ່ thread ການປະມວນຜົນຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:128
msgid "Next we initialize our effect."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອັບເຟັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ (initialize)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:138
msgid ""
"The main thing here is setting our ``effect_callback_type`` which tells the "
"rendering engine at what stage of the render pipeline to call our code."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຫຼັກຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``effect_callback_type`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນການບອກເອັນຈິນການປະມວນຜົນວ່າ ຈະໃຫ້"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດຂອງພວກເຮົາໃນຂັ້ນຕອນໃດຂອງ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:143
msgid ""
"Currently we only have access to the stages of the 3D rendering pipeline!"
msgstr ""
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນ ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງ pipeline ການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:145
msgid ""
"We also get a reference to our rendering device, which will come in very "
"handy."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງໄດ້ຮັບການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ rendering device ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:147
msgid ""
"We also need to clean up after ourselves, for this we react to the "
"``NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE`` notification:"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງທຳຄວາມສະອາດຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ການຕອບສະໜ"
"ອງຕໍ່ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ``NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:160
msgid ""
"Note that we do not use our mutex here even though we create our shader "
"inside of our render thread. The methods on our rendering server are thread "
"safe and ``free_rid`` will be postponed cleaning up the shader until after "
"any frames currently being rendered are finished."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດວ່າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ mutex ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງເຊດເດີພາຍໃນ thread ການປະມວນຜົ"
"ນກໍຕາມ. ເມັດທອດ (methods) ໃນ rendering server ແມ່ນປອດໄພຕໍ່ thread (thread safe) ແລ"
"ະ ``free_rid`` ຈະເລື່ອນການທຳຄວາມສະອາດເຊດເດີອອກໄປ ຈົນກວ່າເຟຣມທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນຈະ"
"ສຳເລັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:166
msgid ""
"Also note that we are not freeing our pipeline. The rendering device does "
"dependency tracking and as the pipeline is dependent on the shader, it will "
"be automatically freed when the shader is destructed."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ໄດ້ທຳລາຍ pipeline ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. rendering device ຈະມີການຕິດຕ"
"າມຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ (dependency tracking) ແລະ ເນື່ອງຈາກ pipeline ຂຶ້ນກັບເຊດເດີ, ມັນຈະຖືກທຳ"
"ລາຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເຊດເດີຖືກທຳລາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:170
msgid "From this point onwards our code will run on the rendering thread."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຈຸດນີ້ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ ໂຄ້ດຂອງພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ thread ການປະມວນຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:172
msgid ""
"Our next step is a helper function that will recompile the shader if the "
"user code was changed."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນການສ້າງຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນເຊດເດີໃໝ່ (recompile) ຖ້າໂຄ້ດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີກາ"
"ນປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:222
msgid ""
"At the top of this method we again use our mutex to protect accessing our "
"user shader code and our is dirty flag. We make a local copy of the user "
"shader code if our user shader code is dirty."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງເມັດທອດນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ mutex ອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"flag ທີ່ບອກວ່າມັນ dirty. ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງສຳເນົາໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄວ້ພາຍໃນ ຖ້າໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້"
"ນ dirty."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:226
msgid ""
"If we don't have a new code fragment, we return true if we already have a "
"valid pipeline."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດໃໝ່, ພວກເຮົາຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ true ກັບຄືນ ຖ້າພວກເຮົາມີ pipeline ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢູ່ແລ້"
"ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:229
msgid ""
"If we do have a new code fragment we embed it in our template code and then "
"compile it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າພວກເຮົາມີສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດໃໝ່ ພວກເຮົາຈະຝັງມັນໄວ້ໃນໂຄ້ດແມ່ແບບຂອງພວກເຮົາແລ້ວຈຶ່ງປະມວນຜົນມັນ "
"(compile)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:233
msgid ""
"The code shown here compiles our new code in runtime. This is great for "
"prototyping as we can immediately see the effect of the changed shader."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້ຈະປະມວນຜົນໂຄ້ດໃໝ່ຂອງພວກເຮົາໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ (runtime). ສິ່ງນີ້ດີຫຼາຍສຳລັບການ"
"ສ້າງຕົວແບບ (prototyping) ເພາະພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຫັນຜົນຂອງເຊດເດີທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:237
msgid ""
"This prevents precompiling and caching this shader which may be an issues on "
"some platforms such as consoles. Note that the demo project comes with an "
"alternative example where a ``glsl`` file contains the entire compute shader "
"and this is used. Godot is able to precompile and cache the shader with this "
"approach."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນການຄອມໄພລ໌ລ່ວງໜ້າ (precompiling) ແລະ ການເກັບແຄຊ (caching) ຂອງເຊດເດີນີ້ ເຊິ່ງອາ"
"ດຈະເປັນບັນຫາໃນບາງແພລັດຟອມ ເຊັ່ນ: ເຄື່ອງເກມຄອນໂຊລ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວຢ່າງທາ"
"ງເລືອກອື່ນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ ``glsl`` ບັນຈຸຄອມພິວເຊດເດີ (compute shader) ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ. "
"Godot ສາມາດຄອມໄພລ໌ລ່ວງໜ້າ ແລະ ເກັບແຄຊເຊດເດີດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:243
msgid ""
"Finally we need to implement our effect callback, the rendering engine will "
"call this at the right stage of rendering."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ callback ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເອັນຈິນການປະມວນຜົນຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການປະມວນຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:294
msgid ""
"At the start of this method we check if we have a rendering device, if our "
"callback type is the correct one, and check if we have our shader."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມັດທອດນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະກວດເບິ່ງວ່າພວກເຮົາມີ rendering device ຫຼື ບໍ່, ປະເພດ callback "
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າພວກເຮົາມີເຊດເດີຂອງພວກເຮົາຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:299
msgid ""
"The check for the effect type is only a safety mechanism. We've set this in "
"our ``_init`` function, however it is possible for the user to change this "
"in the UI."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບປະເພດເອັບເຟັກເປັນພຽງກົນໄກຄວາມປອດໄພເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"``_init`` ແລ້ວ, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ UI."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:303
msgid ""
"Our ``p_render_data`` parameter gives us access to an object that holds data "
"specific to the frame we're currently rendering. We're currently only "
"interested in our render scene buffers, which provide us access to all the "
"internal buffers used by the rendering engine. Note that we cast this "
"to :ref:`RenderSceneBuffersRD <class_RenderSceneBuffersRD>` to expose the "
"full API to this data."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``p_render_data`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງວັດຖຸທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງເຟຣມທີ່ພວກເຮົາກ"
"ຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຢູ່. ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາມີຄວາມສົນໃຈສະເພາະບັບເຟີການປະມວນຜົນສາກ (render scene "
"buffers), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາເຂົ້າເຖິງ ບັບເຟີພາຍໃນທັງໝົດທີ່ເອັນຈິນການປະມວນຜົນໃຊ້. ສັງເກດວ່າພວກເຮົາ"
"ຈະແປງ (cast) ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນ :ref:`RenderSceneBuffersRD <class_RenderSceneBuffersRD>` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ API ທັງໝົດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:310
msgid ""
"Next we obtain our ``internal size`` which is the resolution of our 3D "
"render buffers before they are upscaled (if applicable), upscaling happens "
"after our post processes have run."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປພວກເຮົາຈະດຶງຄ່າ ``internal size`` ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງບັບເຟີການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກ"
"ມັນຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍ (upscaled) (ຖ້າມີ), ການຂະຫຍາຍຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກຂະບວນການຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ "
"(post processes) ຂອງພວກເຮົາເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:314
msgid ""
"From our internal size we calculate our group size, see our local size in "
"our template shader."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກຂະໜາດພາຍໃນ ພວກເຮົາຈະຄຳນວນຂະໜາດກຸ່ມ (group size) ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເບິ່ງຂະໜາດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"(local size) ໃນແມ່ແບບເຊດເດີຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:320
msgid ""
"We also populate our push constant so our shader knows our size. Godot does "
"not support structs here **yet** so we use a ``PackedFloat32Array`` to store "
"this data into. Note that we have to pad this array with a 16 byte "
"alignment. In other words, the length of our array needs to be a multiple of "
"4."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງຈະໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ push constant ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊດເດີຂອງພວກເຮົາຮູ້ຂະໜາດຂອງພວກເຮົາ. Godot **ຍັ"
"ງ** ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ structs ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ ``PackedFloat32Array`` ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້. ສັງ"
"ເກດວ່າພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ (pad) ໃສ່ອາເຣນີ້ໃຫ້ມີການຈັດລຽງລະດັບ 16 ໄບຕ໌. ເວົ້າງ່າຍໆ ກໍຄື ຄວາມຍາວຂອ"
"ງອາເຣຂອງພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຫານດ້ວຍ 4 ລົງຕົວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:326
msgid ""
"Now we loop through our views, this is in case we're using multiview "
"rendering which is applicable for stereo rendering (XR). In most cases we "
"will only have one view."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະວົນລູບ (loop) ຜ່ານວິວ (views) ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ສິ່ງນີ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນ"
"ແບບ multiview ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ກັບການປະມວນຜົນພາບແບບສະເຕຣິໂອ (XR). ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ພວກເຮົາຈະມີພຽງແ"
"ຕ່ວິວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:332
msgid ""
"There is no performance benefit to use multiview for post processing here, "
"handling the views separately like this will still enable the GPU to use "
"parallelism if beneficial."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນປະໂຫຍດດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບໃນການໃຊ້ multiview ສຳລັບການຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, ການຈັດການວິວແຍກກັ"
"ນແບບນີ້ຈະຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ GPU ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານ (parallelism) ໄດ້ ຖ້າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:336
msgid ""
"Next we obtain the color buffer for this view. This is the buffer into which "
"our 3D scene has been rendered."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປພວກເຮົາຈະດຶງຄ່າບັບເຟີສີສຳລັບວິວນີ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນບັບເຟີທີ່ສາກ 3D ຂອງພວກເຮົາຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃສ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:339
msgid ""
"We then prepare a uniform set so we can communicate the color buffer to our "
"shader."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະກຽມ uniform set ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນບັບເຟີສີໄປຍັງເຊດເດີຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:342
msgid ""
"Note the use of our :ref:`UniformSetCacheRD <class_UniformSetCacheRD>` cache "
"which ensures we can check for our uniform set each frame. As our color "
"buffer can change from frame to frame and our uniform cache will "
"automatically clean up uniform sets when buffers are freed, this is the safe "
"way to ensure we do not leak memory or use an outdated set."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດການໃຊ້ແຄຊ :ref:`UniformSetCacheRD <class_UniformSetCacheRD>` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ເຊິ່"
"ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ພວກເຮົາສາມາດກວດສອບ uniform set ຂອງພວກເຮົາໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ. ເນື່ອງຈາກບັບເຟີສີຂ"
"ອງພວກເຮົາສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ ແລະ uniform cache ຈະທຳຄວາມສະອາດ uniform sets "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອບັບເຟີຖືກປ່ອຍ, ນີ້ຈຶ່ງເປັນວິທີທີ່ປອດໄພເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ມີບັນຫາໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຮົ່ວໄ"
"ຫຼ (memory leak) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊຸດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:348
msgid ""
"Finally we build our compute list by binding our pipeline, binding our "
"uniform set, pushing our push constant data, and calling dispatch for our "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ compute list ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມ (binding) pipeline ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເຊື່ອມ "
"uniform set, ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ push constant, ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ dispatch ສຳລັບກຸ່ມຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:352
msgid ""
"With our compositor effect completed, we now need to add it to our "
"compositor."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຂອງພວກເຮົາສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໄປໃນຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຂອງ"
"ພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:354
msgid ""
"On our compositor we expand the compositor effects property and press ``Add "
"Element``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຂອງພວກເຮົາ ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຄຸນສົມບັດ compositor effects ແລະ ກົດ ``Add Element``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:357
msgid "Now we can add our compositor effect:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ແລ້ວ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:361
msgid ""
"After selecting our ``PostProcessShader`` we need to set our user shader "
"code:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ ``PostProcessShader`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາແລ້ວ ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີຂອງຜູ້ໃ"
"ຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:368
msgid "With that all done, our output is in grayscale."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສຳເລັດທຸກຢ່າງແລ້ວ, ຜົນລັດ (output) ຂອງພວກເຮົາຈະກາຍເປັນສີຂາວດຳ (grayscale)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/compositor.rst:374
msgid ""
"For a more advanced example of post effects, check out the `Radial blur "
"based sky rays <https://github.com/BastiaanOlij/RERadialSunRays>`_ example "
"project created by Bastiaan Olij."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າກວ່າຂອງເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ (post effects), ກວດເບິ່ງໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງ "
"`Radial blur based sky rays <https://github.com/BastiaanOlij/RERadialSunRays>"
"`_ ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Bastiaan Olij."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:6
msgid ""
"HDR output is a feature that enables presentation of High Dynamic Range "
"(HDR) visuals on HDR-capable screens. HDR **output** is not to be confused "
"with the internal HDR rendering that is used by Godot for both Standard "
"Dynamic Range (SDR) output and HDR output modes."
msgstr ""
"ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ແມ່ນຟີເຈີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງພາບແບບ High Dynamic Range (HDR) ໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຮອ"
"ງຮັບ HDR. **ການສະແດງຜົນ** HDR ນີ້ ບໍ່ຄວນສັບສົນກັບການປະມວນຜົນ HDR ພາຍໃນ ທີ່ Godot ໃຊ້ສຳລັບທັງ"
"ການສະແດງຜົນ Standard Dynamic Range (SDR) ແລະ ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:10
msgid ""
"HDR output is supported on iOS, Linux (Wayland), macOS, visionOS, and "
"Windows. It is not supported on Android, Linux (X11), or web."
msgstr ""
"ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, Linux (Wayland), macOS, visionOS, ແລະ Windows. ມັນ"
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Android, Linux (X11), ຫຼື ເວັບ."

