#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:44
msgid ""
"Some of these settings may already be configured correctly for HDR output in "
"your project. For example, the Windows Rendering Device Driver is set to "
"``d3d12`` in projects created in Godot 4.6 onwards, but will need to be "
"changed if the project was created with an older version of Godot."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ແລ້ວ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, Windows Rendering Device Driver ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``d3d12`` ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ "
"Godot 4.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ແຕ່ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຖ້າໂປຣເຈັກນັ້ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ Godot ເວີຊັນທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:50
msgid "Using HDR output in Godot"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໃນ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:52
msgid ""
"Try out the `HDR output demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"demo-projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ as a first step to using HDR "
"output in Godot. This demo contains examples of the concepts described on "
"this page and will help you ensure that your development environment is "
"correctly configured for HDR output."
msgstr ""
"ລອງໃຊ້ `ໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງການສະແດງຜົນ HDR <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດໃນການໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໃ"
"ນ Godot. ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍແນວຄວາມຄິດທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແນ່ໃຈວ່າສະພາບແວດ"
"ລ້ອມການພັດທະນາຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:58
msgid "HDR output in the Godot editor"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Godot editor will use HDR output for its main window when "
"the :ref:`Request HDR Output <class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/"
"hdr/request_hdr_output>` project setting has been enabled. You can tell if "
"your game is running in SDR or HDR output mode based on the text on the "
"right side of game view toolbar: Your game is running in HDR mode when the "
"text \"HDR\" appears next to the window size."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot ຈະໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ :ref:`Request "
"HDR Output <class_ProjectSettings_property_display/window/hdr/"
"request_hdr_output>` ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດບອກໄດ້ວ່າເກມຂອງເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດການສະແດງ"
"ຜົນ SDR ຫຼື HDR ໂດຍເບິ່ງຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງ ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືມຸມມອງເກມ: ເກມຂອງເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກໃ"
"ນໂໝດ HDR ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"HDR\" ປະກົດຂຶ້ນຂ້າງໆ ກັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:68
msgid ""
"The number in parentheses next to the \"HDR\" text is the "
"current :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` which is described "
"in the following sections. You can toggle the "
"game's :ref:`Window.hdr_output_requested<class_Window_property_hdr_output_requested>` "
"property in the game window options menu:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລກໃນວົງເລັບຂ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"HDR\" ແມ່ນຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ປັດຈຸບັນ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍໃນ"
"ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດ-ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`Window.hdr_output_requested<class_Window_property_hdr_output_requested>"
"` ຂອງເກມໄດ້ໃນເມນູຕົວເລືອກໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:76
msgid "HDR output fundamentals"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານການສະແດງຜົນ HDR"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:78
msgid ""
"Godot uses the `Extended Dynamic Range (EDR) <https://developer.apple.com/"
"videos/play/wwdc2021/10161/>`__ paradigm for HDR output. While SDR output "
"allows color component values between ``0.0`` and ``1.0`` to be displayed, "
"HDR output allows values higher than ``1.0``. The maximum value that can be "
"displayed is provided "
"by :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` "
"and this method is valid when using SDR or HDR."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ `Extended Dynamic Range (EDR) <https://developer.apple.com/"
"videos/play/wwdc2021/10161/>`__ ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ HDR. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການສະແດງຜົນ SDR ອະນຸ"
"ຍາດໃຫ້ສະແດງຄ່າອົງປະກອບສີລະຫວ່າງ ``0.0`` ຫາ ``1.0``, ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຄ່າສູງກວ່"
"າ ``1.0``. ຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
":ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value() "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ແລະ ເມັດທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນ "
"SDR ແລະ HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:89
msgid ""
"These graphs are presented as SDR images that do not contain any HDR color. "
"To compensate for this limitation, the grayscale bars along each axis have a "
"glow effect applied to represent values that are outside of the SDR range. "
"The \"output max value\" in this graph represents the maximum linear color "
"component value returned "
"by :ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value()<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."
msgstr ""
"ກຣາຟເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສະແດງເປັນພາບ SDR ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີ HDR ແທ້ໆ. ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້, ແຖບສີຂາວດຳຕາມແກນຕ່າງໆ ຈ"
"ະມີການໃຊ້ glow effect ເພື່ອສະແດງເຖິງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ SDR. \"output max value\" ໃນກຣາຟນີ້ ໝ"
"າຍເຖິງຄ່າອົງປະກອບສີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ສູງສຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ "
":ref:`Window.get_output_max_linear_value() "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:96
msgid "Designing for HDR output"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ HDR"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:98
msgid ""
"There are two primary approaches to make the most of HDR output: using "
"the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` and using "
"tonemapping."
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງວິທີຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດຈາກການສະແດງຜົນ HDR: ການໃຊ້ :ref:`output max linear "
"value <class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ແລະ ການໃຊ້ "
"tonemapping."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:102
msgid ""
"While both approaches can be used in the same project, tonemapping should be "
"used to produce HDR output from a :ref:`Viewport<class_Viewport>` that uses "
"lighting that exceeds the capabilities of an SDR screen, indirect lighting, "
"global illumination, emissive materials, post-processing effects, or any "
"other techniques that make use of the colors values in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທັງສອງວິທີສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນໂປຣເຈັກດຽວກັນໄດ້, ແຕ່ tonemapping ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການສະ"
"ແດງຜົນ HDR ຈາກ :ref:`Viewport<class_Viewport>` ທີ່ໃຊ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງເກີນຂີດຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າ"
"ຈໍ SDR, ແສງສະທ້ອນ (indirect lighting), global illumination, ວັດສະດຸທີ່ເຮືອງແສງ "
"(emissive materials), ເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ, ຫຼື ເຕັກນິກອື່ນໆ ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄ່າສີໃນສາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:107
msgid ""
"The :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` should only be used "
"to present colors directly to the screen without tonemapping and without "
"influencing lighting, post-processing effects, or surrounding color. This "
"makes the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` well suited "
"for :ref:`CanvasItems<class_CanvasItem>` or unshaded materials in a scene "
"that has no lighting or basic lighting that otherwise does not exceed the "
"capabilities of an SDR screen."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງສີໄປຍັງໜ້າຈໍໂດຍ"
"ກົງໂດຍບໍ່ຜ່ານ tonemapping ແລະ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ແສງ, ເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ, ຫຼື ສີທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ສິ່"
"ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ເໝາະສົມຫຼາຍສຳລັບ "
":ref:`CanvasItems<class_CanvasItem>` ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ (unshaded materials) ໃນສາ"
"ກ ທີ່ບໍ່ມີແສງ ຫຼື ມີແສງພື້ນຖານທີ່ບໍ່ເກີນຂີດຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ SDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:114
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Viewport.own_world_3d<class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>` "
"property can be used to separate which :ref:`Viewports<class_Viewport>` are "
"affected by tonemapping and other :ref:`class_WorldEnvironment` effects."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`Viewport.own_world_3d <class_Viewport_property_own_world_3d>` ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກວ່າ :ref:`Viewports<class_Viewport>` ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ tonemapping "
"ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກ :ref:`class_WorldEnvironment` ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:119
msgid "Using output max linear value"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄ່າ output max linear value"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:121
msgid ""
"In a traditional SDR-only game, the brightest presentation of a color is "
"limited by either the red, green, or blue component of the color reaching a "
"maximum of ``1.0``. When using a modern HDR screen this limitation no longer "
"applies and color components above ``1.0`` can be accurately presented. "
"Godot provides the maximum color component value that can be presented by "
"the screen through the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. This value can be "
"used in both SDR and HDR, which makes it easy to build your game for both "
"output modes without needing to change behavior based on whether or not HDR "
"output is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເກມແບບ SDR ດັ້ງເດີມ, ການສະແດງສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍອົງປະກອບສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ຫຼື ຟ້າ ທີ່ໃຫ້ຄ່າ"
"ສູງສຸດພຽງ ``1.0``. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍ HDR ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ອົງປະກອບສີທີ່ສູງກວ່າ "
"``1.0`` ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. Godot ໃຫ້ຄ່າອົງປະກອບສີສູງສຸດ ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ຜ່ານ "
":ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນ SDR ແລະ "
"HDR, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງເກມສຳລັບທັງສອງໂໝດເປັນໄປໄດ້ງ່າຍ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງພຶດຕິກຳໂດຍອີງຕາມວ່"
"າການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:129
msgid ""
"The :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` may change often as "
"the player adjusts their device brightness, enables or disables HDR output "
"on their device, or moves the game window between screens, so it's important "
"to retrieve this value every frame or use the :ref:`output max linear value "
"changed<class_Window_signal_output_max_linear_value_changed>` signal. The "
"value will always equal ``1.0`` in SDR mode and may also equal ``1.0`` when "
"HDR output is enabled and the player has adjusted their screen to its "
"maximum brightness."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງເລື້ອຍໆ ເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບຄ"
"ວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນ, ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໃນອຸປະກອນ, ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໜ້າຕ່າງເກມລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງດຶງຄ່ານີ້ໃນທຸກໆ ເຟຣມ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ສັນຍານ :ref:`output max linear value "
"changed <class_Window_signal_output_max_linear_value_changed>`. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເທົ່າກັບ "
"``1.0`` ສະເໝີໃນໂໝດ SDR ແລະ ອາດຈະເທົ່າກັບ ``1.0`` ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ແລ້ວຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບໜ້"
"າຈໍຂອງພວກເຂົາໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:136
msgid ""
"It is best to use this :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` with \"highlights\" "
"and special effects that are either brief or involve a small portion of the "
"screen; if the majority of the screen is presented at this maximum "
"brightness for more than a short time, it will cause the game to appear "
"uncomfortably bright, as if the game is ignoring the device brightness "
"setting. You may also find that some effects look best when limited to a "
"maximum linear value that is greater than ``1.0``, but less than "
"the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. You can read more "
"about how it is sometimes desirable to limit the maximum HDR value in the "
"`HDR and User Interfaces <https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2025/09/"
"hdr-and-user-interfaces.html>`__ post of the Android Developers Blog."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນການດີທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ນີ້ ກັບ \"ຈຸດເດັ່ນ\" "
"(highlights) ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກພິເສດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນພຽງໄລຍະສັ້ນ ຫຼື ກວມເອົາພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນນ້ອຍຂອງໜ້າຈໍ; ຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນໃ"
"ຫຍ່ຂອງໜ້າຈໍສະແດງດ້ວຍຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດນີ້ເປັນເວລານານ, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກມເບິ່ງສະຫວ່າງຈົນບໍ່ສະບາຍຕາ, ຄື"
"ກັບວ່າເກມກຳລັງເມີນເສີຍຕໍ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນ. ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າເອັບເຟັກບາງຢ່າງເບິ່ງດີທີ່ສຸ"
"ດ ເມື່ອຖືກຈຳກັດຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ສູງສຸດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ``1.0`` ແຕ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. ເຈົ້າສາມາດອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາ"
"ມຕ້ອງການໃນການຈຳກັດຄ່າ HDR ສູງສຸດໄດ້ໃນບົດຄວາມ `HDR and User Interfaces <https://"
"android-developers.googleblog.com/2025/09/hdr-and-user-interfaces.html>`__ ຂອ"
"ງບລັອກ Android Developers."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:147
msgid ""
"Transforming a color to be the brightest the screen can present can be done "
"with a script. When working with :ref:`class_CanvasItem`, it may be "
"convenient to apply the resulting modified color to "
"the :ref:`modulate<class_canvasitem_property_modulate>` "
"or :ref:`self_modulate<class_canvasitem_property_self_modulate>` property "
"with the base color of the :ref:`class_CanvasItem` set "
"to :ref:`white<class_color_constant_white>`. The following script "
"demonstrates this:"
msgstr ""
"ການແປງສີໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະສະແດງໄດ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ. ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບ "
":ref:`class_CanvasItem`, ມັນອາດຈະສະດວກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ສີທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວໄປທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
":ref:`modulate <class_canvasitem_property_modulate>` ຫຼື :ref:`self_modulate "
"<class_canvasitem_property_self_modulate>` ໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່າສີພື້ນຖານຂອງ "
":ref:`class_CanvasItem` ໃຫ້ເປັນ :ref:`white <class_color_constant_white>`. ສະຄຣິ"
"ບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິທີເຮັດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:196
msgid ""
"The `HDR output demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ includes more advanced versions of "
"this script and examples of how this approach can be used in your project."
msgstr ""
"`ໂປຣເຈັກຕົວຢ່າງການສະແດງຜົນ HDR <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/misc/hdr_output>`__ ປະກອບດ້ວຍເວີຊັນທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າກວ່າຂອງສະຄຣິບນີ້ ແລະ ຕົ"
"ວຢ່າງວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:200
msgid "Using Tonemapping"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Tonemapping"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:202
msgid ""
"To produce HDR output without using the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` your scenes will "
"need color values that exceed what an SDR screen can present, so it is "
"important to use a tonemapper "
"like :ref:`Reinhard<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` "
"or :ref:`AgX<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_agx>` to handle display "
"of these bright scene values on both SDR and HDR screens."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງການສະແດງຜົນ HDR ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`, ສາກຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງມີຄ່າສີທີ່ເກີນກວ່າ"
"ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ SDR ຈະສະແດງໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ tonemapper ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`Reinhard "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` ຫຼື :ref:`AgX "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_agx>` ເພື່ອຈັດການການສະແດງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງ"
"ສາກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ທັງໃນໜ້າຈໍ SDR ແລະ HDR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:209
msgid "**Tonemapping and HDR**"
msgstr "**Tonemapping ແລະ HDR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:211
msgid ""
"The primary role of a tonemapper is to reduce the dynamic range of a natural "
"scene with a very high dynamic range of brightness to a smaller dynamic "
"range that can be presented on a screen. Tonemappers in Godot use "
"the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` to determine the "
"output range that the screen is capable of presenting. For example, with "
"the :ref:`Reinhard<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` "
"tonemapper in Godot, linear scene values in the range of ``0.0`` "
"to :ref:`tonemap white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` are mapped "
"to an output range of ``0.0`` to :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຫຼັກຂອງ tonemapper ແມ່ນການຫຼຸດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ (dynamic range) ຂອງສາກທຳມະຊາດທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່"
"າງສູງຫຼາຍ ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງເທິງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້. Tonemappers ໃນ Godot ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ເພື່ອບອກຊ່ວງການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍສາມ"
"າດຮອງຮັບໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ດ້ວຍ :ref:`Reinhard "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` tonemapper ໃນ Godot, ຄ່າເສັ້"
"ນຊື່ໃນສາກໃນຊ່ວງ ``0.0`` ຫາ :ref:`tonemap white "
"<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` ຈະຖືກແປງໄປເປັນຊ່ວງການສະແດງຜົນ "
"``0.0`` ຫາ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:222
msgid ""
"With this approach, you can adjust :ref:`tonemap "
"white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` to be sure that any linear "
"scene value below :ref:`tonemap "
"white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` will be shown without "
"clipping. This ensures that details are not lost when presenting the image "
"on a screen with a lower dynamic range than the original scene."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບ :ref:`tonemap white "
"<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນສາກທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ "
":ref:`tonemap white <class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` ຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍບໍ່"
"ມີການຕັດສີ (clipping). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຈະບໍ່ສູນຫາຍເມື່ອສະແດງພາບ ເທິງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາ"
"ມິກຕ່ຳກວ່າສາກຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:229
msgid ""
"While this behavior is perfectly stable in SDR, where the :ref:`output max "
"linear value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` is fixed at "
"``1.0``, this behavior is dynamic with HDR based on the capabilities of the "
"screen:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນຫຼາຍໃນ SDR, ເຊິ່ງຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ທີ່ ``1.0``, ແຕ່ໃນ "
"HDR ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:234
msgid ""
"As shown in the graphs above, "
"the :ref:`Reinhard<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` "
"tonemapper will behave the same as "
"the :ref:`Linear<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_linear>` tonemapper "
"when :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` is equal to or "
"higher than :ref:`tonemap white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>`. "
"This allows for accurate color reproduction on HDR screens that are capable "
"of reproducing the original brighter scene values. When :ref:`output max "
"linear value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` has increased "
"to be higher than :ref:`tonemap "
"white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>`, tonemap white will be "
"adjusted to match this output max linear value."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນກຣາຟຂ້າງເທິງ, :ref:`Reinhard "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` tonemapper ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ "
":ref:`Linear <class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_linear>` tonemapper ເມື່ອ "
":ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ "
":ref:`tonemap white <class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ"
"ະແດງສີມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໜ້າຈໍ HDR ທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກຕົ້ນສະບັບໄດ້. ເມື່ອ "
":ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສູງກວ່າ :ref:`tonemap "
"white <class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>`, ຄ່າ tonemap white ຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ກົ"
"ງກັບຄ່າ output max linear value ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:244
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AgX<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_agx>` tonemapper "
"behaves similar "
"to :ref:`Reinhard<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` in this "
"way, but its :ref:`tonemap "
"white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_agx_white>` is always multiplied "
"by :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`. "
"The :ref:`Linear<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_linear>` tonemapper "
"applies no tonemapping at all; its :ref:`tonemap "
"white<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` equals :ref:`output max "
"linear value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` in all "
"scenarios. The :ref:`Filmic<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_filmic>` "
"and :ref:`ACES<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_aces>` tonemappers "
"ignore :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` entirely and always "
"produce an image in the SDR range."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AgX <class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_agx>` tonemapper ຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳຄ້າ"
"ຍຄືກັບ :ref:`Reinhard <class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_reinhardt>` ໃນຮູບແ"
"ບບນີ້, ແຕ່ :ref:`tonemap white <class_Environment_property_tonemap_agx_white>` ຂ"
"ອງມັນຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ສະເໝີ. :ref:`Linear "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_linear>` tonemapper ຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ "
"tonemapping ເລີຍ; ຄ່າ :ref:`tonemap white "
"<class_Environment_property_tonemap_white>` ຂອງມັນຈະເທົ່າກັບ :ref:`output max "
"linear value <class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ. "
":ref:`Filmic <class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_filmic>` ແລະ :ref:`ACES "
"<class_Environment_constant_tone_mapper_aces>` tonemappers ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າ "
":ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ເລີຍ ແລະ ຈະສ້າງພາບໃນຊ່ວງ SDR "
"ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:257
msgid "Why not mix output max linear value with other techniques?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຄວນປະສົມຄ່າ output max linear value ກັບເຕັກນິກອື່ນໆ?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:259
msgid ""
"Tonemapping, indirect lighting, global illumination, and post-processing "
"effects all depend on stable scene color values to produce consistent and "
"predictable results in both SDR and HDR modes. If a developer uses these "
"types of techniques with a scene that has color values that change based "
"on :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`, the results will no "
"longer be similar for screens with different capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tonemapping, ແສງສະທ້ອນ, global illumination, ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການປະມວນຜົນ ທັງໝົດລ້ວນແຕ່ຂຶ້"
"ນກັບຄ່າສີໃນສາກທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ ແລະ ຄາດເດົາໄດ້ທັງໃນໂໝດ SDR ແລະ HDR. ຫາກຜູ້ພັດ"
"ທະນາໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບສາກ ທີ່ມີຄ່າສີທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`, ຜົນລັດຈະບໍ່ຄືກັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຄວາ"
"ມສາມາດຕ່າງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:265
msgid ""
"For example, the strength of the glow effect is directly influenced by the "
"brightness of the scene. If the scene brightness changes based "
"on :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`, then the glow "
"strength will change as well: a larger :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` will produce a "
"stronger glow effect, which is generally an undesirable behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ glow effect ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບໂດຍກົງຈາກຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ. ຖ້າຄວາມສະຫ"
"ວ່າງຂອງສາກປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>`, ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ glow ກໍຈະປ່ຽນແປງ"
"ຄືກັນ: ຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ຈະສ້າງ glow effect ທີ່"
"ເຂັ້ມກວ່າ, ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:273
msgid "Absolute luminance values"
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳບູນ (Absolute luminance values)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:275
msgid ""
"When using HDR output, :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` is calculated based "
"on the reference white luminance and the maximum luminance of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນ HDR, :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ"
"ສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ (reference white luminance) ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:279
msgid "Reference white luminance"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:281
msgid ""
"The reference white luminance, or reference luminance for short, represents "
"the brightest possible SDR white value. When a user changes the brightness "
"setting of the device that is producing the video signal, such as a desktop "
"computer, laptop, or smartphone, they are simply adjusting their reference "
"luminance. On a smartphone this change may happen automatically via the "
"smartphone's automatic screen brightness feature and also happens when the "
"user manually adjusts their screen brightness. On desktop or laptop "
"computers, there are different ways to adjust this reference luminance "
"depending on the operating system."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ ຫຼື ເອີ້ນສັ້ນໆ ວ່າ reference luminance, ໝາຍເຖິງຄ່າສີຂາວ SDR ທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ"
"ທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານວິດີໂອ ເຊັ່ນ ຄອມພິວເຕີ"
"ເດັສທອບ, ແລັບທັອບ ຫຼື ສະມາດໂຟນ, ພວກເຂົາກຳລັງປັບ reference luminance ຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ໃນສະມາ"
"ດໂຟນ ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຜ່ານຟີເຈີ ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຍັງເກີດຂຶ້"
"ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີເດັສທອບ ຫຼື ແລັບທັອບ, ຈະມີວິທີປັບ reference "
"luminance ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:289
msgid ""
"This value is typically around 100 to 300 nits and is always represented by "
"an :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` of exactly ``1.0``. "
"This value may also be referred to as \"paper white\" or the \"SDR white "
"level\"."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຢູ່ທີ່ປະມານ 100 ຫາ 300 nits ແລະ ຈະຖືກແທນດ້ວຍຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear "
"value <class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ``1.0`` ພໍດີ. ຄ່"
"ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ \"paper white\" ຫຼື \"SDR white level\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:295
msgid ""
"When using an external screen on Windows, the *SDR content brightness* HDR "
"display setting directly controls the reference luminance value and is the "
"primary way to adjust the brightness of the Windows desktop and Godot. When "
"using a built-in HDR screen on Windows, changing *HDR content brightness* "
"also directly controls the reference luminance, but has no effect on the "
"brightness of the Windows desktop or Godot because a separate brightness "
"implementation negates any effect of changes to the reference luminance."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍແຍກໃນ Windows, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນ HDR *SDR content brightness* ຈະຄວບຄຸມ"
"ຄ່າ reference luminance ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ເປັນວິທີຫຼັກໃນການປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງເດັສທອບ Windows ແລ"
"ະ Godot. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍ HDR ໃນຕົວ (built-in) ໃນ Windows, ການປ່ຽນ *HDR content "
"brightness* ກໍຈະຄວບຄຸມ reference luminance ໂດຍກົງຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ຂອງເດັສ"
"ທອບ Windows ຫຼື Godot ເພາະມີການຈັດການຄວາມສະຫວ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ "
"reference luminance ບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:303
msgid "Maximum luminance"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:305
msgid ""
"The maximum luminance is a property of an HDR screen. This value may be "
"anywhere from 250 to 2,000 nits or beyond. It is common for external screens "
"to report a maximum luminance value that is higher than the physical "
"capabilities of the screen that results in visible tonemapping applied by "
"the screen. Some desktop or laptop operating systems provide a way to "
"calibrate the maximum luminance value that is used for each external screen."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ HDR. ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຢູ່ທີ່ 250 ຫາ 2,000 nits ຫຼື ສູງກວ່ານັ້ນ. ເປັ"
"ນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ໜ້າຈໍແຍກຈະລາຍງານຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ສູງກວ່າຄວາມສາມາດທາງຮາດແວແທ້ໆ ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ເຊິ່"
"ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການໃຊ້ tonemapping ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໂດຍໜ້າຈໍເອງ. ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເດັສທອບ ຫຼື ແລັບທັອບບາງ"
"ອັນ ມີວິທີການປັບແຕ່ງ (calibrate) ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໜ້າຈໍແຍກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:313
msgid ""
"When using a built-in screen on Windows, the reported maximum luminance will "
"change as the user adjusts their laptop screen brightness while the reported "
"reference luminance remains constant. This behavior is opposite from using "
"an external display on Windows and adjusting the *SDR content brightness* "
"HDR display setting and also opposite of other platforms."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍໃນຕົວໃນ Windows, ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ລາຍງານຈະປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍແ"
"ລັບທັອບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ reference luminance ທີ່ລາຍງານຍັງຄົງທີ່. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບການໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍແຍກໃ"
"ນ Windows ແລະ ການປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HDR *SDR content brightness* ແລະ ຍັງກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບແພລັດຟອ"
"ມອື່ນໆ ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:319
msgid "Output max linear value in practice"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄ່າ Output max linear value ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:321
msgid ""
"When in HDR mode, the :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` will increase as the "
"user decreases their reference luminance because more HDR headroom becomes "
"available. Similarly, as the user increases their reference luminance, they "
"will have less HDR headroom available and :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` will decrease. In "
"some cases when using HDR mode with the highest reference "
"luminance, :ref:`output max linear "
"value<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` will equal ``1.0``, "
"matching SDR behavior, because no HDR headroom is available."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ HDR, ຄ່າ :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼຸດ reference "
"luminance ຂອງພວກເຂົາລົງ ເພາະຈະມີພື້ນທີ່ HDR (headroom) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພີ່ມ "
"reference luminance, ພວກເຂົາຈະມີພື້ນທີ່ HDR ໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ :ref:`output max linear "
"value <class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ກໍຈະຫຼຸດລົງ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່"
"ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ HDR ດ້ວຍ reference luminance ສູງສຸດ, :ref:`output max linear value "
"<class_Window_method_get_output_max_linear_value>` ຈະເທົ່າກັບ ``1.0``, ເຊິ່ງຄືກັບພຶດຕິ"
"ກຳຂອງ SDR ເພາະບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ HDR ເຫຼືອຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:331
msgid "Not all screens are equal"
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈະຄືກັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:333
msgid ""
"SDR standards were designed to match the capabilities of existing screens "
"that were commonly used around the world. HDR standards have been "
"intentionally written with the opposite approach: they are designed to "
"utilize the capabilities of an ideal screen that is not yet widely available."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕະຖານ SDR ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັນທົ່ວໂລກ. ມາດຕະຖາ"
"ນ HDR ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຈຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມ: ພວກມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິ ທີ່"
"ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຢ່າງແຜ່ຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.rst:337
msgid ""
"In practice, this means that common HDR screens may perform their own "
"internal tonemapping, gamut mapping, or dynamic tonemapping (DTM) to support "
"content that extends to a wider gamut and luminance range than what the "
"physical hardware can achieve. Some screens are not capable of presenting "
"very bright color values that fill more than a small (1% to 10%) portion of "
"the screen and will dim the entire image or part of the image temporarily "
"when this happens. These features may produce colors that are not "
"representative of other screens so it's best to disable them, if possible, "
"when developing your HDR game. You may be able to disable some or all of "
"these features by enabling the HGiG mode on your screen or setting the "
"screen's mode to \"clip\" and/or \"stable\". Some HDR screens may present "
"dark or saturated colors differently than others; this difference in "
"appearance is often the result of the screen technologies."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໜ້າຈໍ HDR ທົ່ວໄປອາດຈະເຮັດການປັບໂທນສີ (tonemapping) ພາຍໃນຂອງຕົນເ"
"ອງ, ການຈັບຄູ່ຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut mapping), ຫຼື ການປັບໂທນສີແບບໄດນາມິກ (DTM) ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີ"
"ຂອບເຂດສີ ແລະ ຊ່ວງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກວ້າງກວ່າສິ່ງທີ່ຮາດແວຈິງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ໜ້າຈໍບາງອັນບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຄ່າສີ"
"ທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍເຊິ່ງກວມເອົາຫຼາຍກວ່າສ່ວນນ້ອຍໆ (1% ຫາ 10%) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ບາງສ່"
"ວນຂອງພາບມືດລົງຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການນີ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສີທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັບໜ້າຈໍອື່ນໆ ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງ"
"ດີທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານພວກມັນ, ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ເມື່ອພັດທະນາເກມ HDR ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານອາດຈະສາມາດປິດບາ"
"ງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດໂໝດ HGiG ໃນໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງໂໝດຂອງໜ້າຈໍເປັນ "
"\"clip\" ແລະ/ຫຼື \"stable\". ໜ້າຈໍ HDR ບາງອັນອາດຈະສະແດງສີທີ່ມືດ ຫຼື ອີ່ມຕົວແຕກຕ່າງຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນ; "
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຮູບລັກສະນະນີ້ມັກຈະເປັນຜົນມາຈາກເຕັກໂນໂລຊີຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section covers programming languages and core features to code your "
"games in Godot."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ຟີເຈີຫຼັກໆ ໃນການຂຽນໂຄ້ດເກມຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"Here, you will find information that is not already covered in more specific "
"sections. For instance, to learn about inputs, we recommend you to "
"read :ref:`Inputs <toc-learn-features-inputs>`."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະພົບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ກວມເອົາໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບ "
"inputs, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າອ່ານ :ref:`Inputs <toc-learn-features-inputs>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:16
msgid "The sections below each focus on a given programming language."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:30
msgid "Core features"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີຫຼັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Some features are specific to the engine and are available in all supported "
"languages. Whether you code in GDScript, C#, or another language, the pages "
"below will help you make the most of Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຟີເຈີບາງຢ່າງແມ່ນສະເພາະສຳລັບເອັນຈິນ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນທຸກພາສາທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ບໍ່ວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດດ້ວຍ "
"GDScript, C#, ຫຼື ພາສາອື່ນໆ, ໜ້າຕ່າງໆ ຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດຈາກ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:4
msgid "GDScript reference"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືອ້າງອີງ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:6
msgid ""
":ref:`GDScript<doc_gdscript>` is a high-level, `object-oriented <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Object-oriented_programming>`_, `imperative <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imperative_programming>`_, and `gradually typed "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gradual_typing>`_ programming language built "
"for Godot. It uses an indentation-based syntax similar to languages like "
"`Python <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Python_%28programming_language%29>`_. "
"Its goal is to be optimized for and tightly integrated with Godot Engine, "
"allowing great flexibility for content creation and integration."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>` ແມ່ນພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມລະດັບສູງ, `ເນັ້ນວັດຖຸ (object-"
"oriented) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Object-oriented_programming>`_, `ແບບ"
"ສັ່ງການ (imperative) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imperative_programming>`_, "
"ແລະ `ແບບກວດສອບຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນ (gradually typed) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Gradual_typing>`_ ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອ Godot ໂດຍສະເພາະ. ມັນໃຊ້ syntax ທີ່ອີງຕາມການຍໍ້ໜ້າ "
"(indentation) ຄ້າຍຄືກັບພາສາ `Python <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Python_%28programming_language%29>`_. ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງມັນຄືການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວ"
"ມກັບ Godot Engine ໄດ້ຢ່າງແໜ້ນແຟ້ນ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນສູງໃນການສ້າງເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:15
msgid "GDScript is entirely independent from Python and is not based on it."
msgstr "GDScript ແມ່ນເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຈາກ Python ຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ອີງຕາມມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:18
msgid "History"
msgstr "ປະຫວັດຄວາມເປັນມາ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:22
msgid ""
"Documentation about GDScript's history has been moved to "
"the :ref:`Frequently Asked Questions <doc_faq_what_is_gdscript>`."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບປະຫວັດຂອງ GDScript ໄດ້ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ :ref:`ຄຳຖາມທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ (FAQ) "
"<doc_faq_what_is_gdscript>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:26
msgid "Example of GDScript"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:28
msgid ""
"Some people can learn better by taking a look at the syntax, so here's an "
"example of how GDScript looks."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄົນອາດຈະຮຽນຮູ້ໄດ້ດີກວ່າໂດຍການເບິ່ງ syntax, ດັ່ງນັ້ນນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບແບບຂອງ GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:117
msgid ""
"If you have previous experience with statically typed languages such as C, C+"
"+, or C# but never used a dynamically typed one before, it is advised you "
"read this tutorial: :ref:`doc_gdscript_more_efficiently`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເຄີຍມີປະສົບການມາກ່ອນກັບພາສາແບບ statically typed ເຊັ່ນ C, C++, ຫຼື C# ແຕ່ບໍ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ພາສ"
"າແບບ dynamically typed ມາກ່ອນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າອ່ານບົດຮຽນນີ້: "
":ref:`doc_gdscript_more_efficiently`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:122
msgid "Identifiers"
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸ (Identifiers)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:124
msgid ""
"Any string that restricts itself to alphabetic characters (``a`` to ``z`` "
"and ``A`` to ``Z``), digits (``0`` to ``9``) and ``_`` qualifies as an "
"identifier. Additionally, identifiers must not begin with a digit. "
"Identifiers are case-sensitive (``foo`` is different from ``FOO``)."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) ໃດໆ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ (``a`` ຫາ ``z`` ແລະ ``A`` ຫາ ``Z``), ຕົວເລ"
"ກ (``0`` ຫາ ``9``) ແລະ ``_`` ຖືວ່າເປັນຕົວລະບຸ (identifier). ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຕົວລະບຸ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້"
"ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ. ຕົວລະບຸມີການຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ (``foo`` ຈະຕ່າງຈາກ ``FOO``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:129
msgid ""
"Identifiers may also contain most Unicode characters part of `UAX#31 "
"<https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/>`__. This allows you to use "
"identifier names written in languages other than English. Unicode characters "
"that are considered \"confusable\" for ASCII characters and emoji are not "
"allowed in identifiers."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸອາດຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ `UAX#31 <https://"
"www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/>`__. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຊື່ຕົວລະບຸທີ່ຂຽນໃນພາສາອື່ນນອກຈາກ"
"ພາສາອັງກິດໄດ້. ຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ຖືວ່າ \"ໜ້າສັບສົນ\" (confusable) ກັບຕົວອັກສອນ ASCII ແລະ "
"ອີໂມຈິ ແມ່ນບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຕົວລະບຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:136
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "ຄຳສະຫງວນ (Keywords)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:138
msgid ""
"The following is the list of keywords supported by the language. Since "
"keywords are reserved words (tokens), they can't be used as identifiers. "
"Operators (like ``in``, ``not``, ``and`` or ``or``) and names of built-in "
"types as listed in the following sections are also reserved."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄຳສະຫງວນທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍພາສານີ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳສະຫງວນເປັນຄຳທີ່ຖືກຈອງໄວ້ (tokens), "
"ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວລະບຸໄດ້. ຕົວດຳເນີນການ (ເຊັ່ນ ``in``, ``not``, ``and`` ຫຼື "
"``or``) ແລະ ຊື່ຂອງຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວ (built-in types) ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນຕໍ່ໆ ໄປ ກໍຖືເປັນຄຳສ"
"ະຫງວນຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:143
msgid ""
"Keywords are defined in the `GDScript tokenizer <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp>`_ in "
"case you want to take a look under the hood."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສະຫງວນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ `GDScript tokenizer <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/master/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp>`_ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າໄປເ"
"ບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:147
msgid "Keyword"
msgstr "ຄຳສະຫງວນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:149
msgid "if"
msgstr "if"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:149
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:151
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:153
msgid "See `if/else/elif`_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ `if/else/elif`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:151
msgid "elif"
msgstr "elif"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:153
msgid "else"
msgstr "else"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:155
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1828
msgid "for"
msgstr "for"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:155
msgid "See for_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ for_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:157
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1816
msgid "while"
msgstr "while"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:157
msgid "See while_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ while_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:159
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1891
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:451
msgid "match"
msgstr "match"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:159
msgid "See match_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ match_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:161
msgid "when"
msgstr "when"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:161
msgid "Used by `pattern guards <Pattern guards_>`_ in ``match`` statements."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ `pattern guards <Pattern guards_>`_ ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``match``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:163
msgid "break"
msgstr "break"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:163
msgid "Exits the execution of the current ``for`` or ``while`` loop."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລູບ ``for`` ຫຼື ``while`` ປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:165
msgid "continue"
msgstr "continue"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:165
msgid ""
"Immediately skips to the next iteration of the ``for`` or ``while`` loop."
msgstr "ຂ້າມໄປຍັງຮອບຖັດໄປຂອງລູບ ``for`` ຫຼື ``while`` ທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:167
msgid "pass"
msgstr "pass"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:167
msgid ""
"Used where a statement is required syntactically but execution of code is "
"undesired, e.g. in empty functions."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄຳສັ່ງຕາມ syntax ແຕ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂຄ້ດ, ເຊັ່ນ ໃນຟັງຊັນວ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:169
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:0
msgid "return"
msgstr "return"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:169
msgid "Returns a value from a function."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຄືນມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:171
msgid "class"
msgstr "class"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:171
msgid "Defines an inner class. See `Inner classes`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄລາດພາຍໃນ (inner class). ເບິ່ງ `Inner classes`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:173
msgid "class_name"
msgstr "class_name"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:173
msgid ""
"Defines the script as a globally accessible class with the specified name. "
"See `Registering named classes`_."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບເປັນຄລາດທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທົ່ວໂລກດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ `Registering named classes`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:175
msgid "extends"
msgstr "extends"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:175
msgid "Defines what class to extend with the current class."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະສືບທອດ (extend) ຈາກຄລາດໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:177
msgid ""
"Tests whether a variable extends a given class, or is of a given built-in "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວປ່ຽນສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດ ຫຼື ບໍ່, ຫຼື ເປັນຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນ built-in ທີ່ກຳນົດ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:179
msgid "in"
msgstr "in"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:179
msgid ""
"Tests whether a value is within a string, array, range, dictionary, or node. "
"When used with ``for``, it iterates through them instead of testing."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ອາເຣ, ຊ່ວງ, ດິກຊັນນາຣີ ຫຼື ໂນດ ຫຼື ບໍ່. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ ``for``, ມັນຈະເຮັ"
"ດການວົນລູບຜ່ານສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແທນການກວດສອບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:181
msgid "Cast the value to a given type if possible."
msgstr "ແປງ (cast) ຄ່າໄປເປັນຊະນິດທີ່ກຳນົດຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:183
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1712
msgid "self"
msgstr "self"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:183
msgid "Refers to current class instance. See `self`_."
msgstr "ອ້າງອີງເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງຄລາດປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ `self`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:185
msgid "super"
msgstr "super"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:185
msgid "Resolves the scope of the parent method. See `Inheritance`_."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອບເຂດຂອງເມັດທອດໃນຄລາດແມ່. ເບິ່ງ `Inheritance`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:187
msgid "signal"
msgstr "signal"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:187
msgid "Defines a signal. See `Signals`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສັນຍານ (signal). ເບິ່ງ `Signals`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:189
msgid "func"
msgstr "func"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:189
msgid "Defines a function.  See `Functions`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ. ເບິ່ງ `Functions`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:191
msgid "static"
msgstr "static"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:191
msgid "Defines a static function or a static member variable."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຟັງຊັນແບບຄົງທີ່ (static function) ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກແບບຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:193
msgid "const"
msgstr "const"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:193
msgid "Defines a constant. See `Constants`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant). ເບິ່ງ `Constants`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:195
msgid "enum"
msgstr "enum"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:195
msgid "Defines an enum. See `Enums`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດອີນຳ (enum). ເບິ່ງ `Enums`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:197
msgid "var"
msgstr "var"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:197
msgid "Defines a variable. See `Variables`_."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນ. ເບິ່ງ `Variables`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:199
msgid "breakpoint"
msgstr "breakpoint"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:199
msgid ""
"Editor helper for debugger breakpoints. Unlike breakpoints created by "
"clicking in the gutter, ``breakpoint`` is stored in the script itself. This "
"makes it persistent across different machines when using version control."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊ່ວຍໃນ editor ສຳລັບຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ໃນການດີບັກ. ຕ່າງຈາກຈຸດຢຸດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍການຄລິກ, "
"``breakpoint`` ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນສະຄຣິບເອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຄົງຢູ່ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຍ້າຍໄປໃຊ້ໃນເຄື່ອງອື່ນເມື່ອ"
"ໃຊ້ລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:202
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:263
msgid "preload"
msgstr "preload"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:202
msgid "Preloads a class or variable. See `Classes as resources`_."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດຄລາດ ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ເບິ່ງ `Classes as resources`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:204
msgid "await"
msgstr "await"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:204
msgid ""
"Waits for a signal or a coroutine to finish. See `Awaiting signals or "
"coroutines`_."
msgstr ""
"ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ສັນຍານ ຫຼື ໂຄຣູທິນ (coroutine) ເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ. ເບິ່ງ `Awaiting signals or "
"coroutines`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:206
msgid "yield"
msgstr "yield"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:206
msgid "Previously used for coroutines. Kept as keyword for transition."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂຄຣູທິນໃນເມື່ອກ່ອນ. ຍັງຄົງໄວ້ເປັນຄຳສະຫງວນເພື່ອການປ່ຽນຜ່ານເວີຊັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:208
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:255
msgid "assert"
msgstr "assert"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:208
msgid ""
"Asserts a condition, logs error on failure. Ignored in non-debug builds. See "
"`Assert keyword`_."
msgstr ""
"ຢືນຢັນເງື່ອນໄຂ, ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກເງື່ອນໄຂບໍ່ເປັນຈິງ. ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນບິວທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ debug. ເບິ່ງ `Assert "
"keyword`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:210
msgid "Used to represent that a function does not return any value."
