#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:423
msgid ""
"Also, using ``\\`` followed by a newline inside a string will allow you to "
"continue it in the next line, without inserting a newline character in the "
"string itself."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ການໃຊ້ ``\\`` ຕາມດ້ວຍການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ພາຍໃນສະຕຣິງ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນຕໍ່ໃນແຖວຖັດໄປ"
"ໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການແຊກຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ລົງໃນຕົວສະຕຣິງແທ້ໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:426
msgid ""
"A string enclosed in quotes of one type (for example ``\"``) can contain "
"quotes of another type (for example ``'``) without escaping. Triple-quoted "
"strings allow you to avoid escaping up to two consecutive quotes of the same "
"type (unless they are adjacent to the string edges)."
msgstr ""
"ສະຕຣິງທີ່ຄອບດ້ວຍອັນຍະປະກາດປະເພດໜຶ່ງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ ``\"``) ສາມາດມີອັນຍະປະກາດອີກປະເພດໜຶ່ງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"``'``) ຢູ່ຂ້າງໃນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການຫຼີກ (escape). ສ່ວນສະຕຣິງທີ່ໃຊ້ສາມອັນຍະປະກາດ (Triple-"
"quoted) ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຫຼີກລ່ຽງການ escape ອັນຍະປະກາດປະເພດດຽວກັນທີ່ລຽງກັນໄດ້ສູງສຸດສອງຕົວ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ"
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມັນຢູ່ຕິດກັບຂອບຂອງສະຕຣິງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:430
msgid ""
"**Raw string literals** always encode the string as it appears in the source "
"code. This is especially useful for regular expressions. A raw string "
"literal doesn't process escape sequences, however it does recognize ``\\\\`` "
"and ``\\\"`` (``\\'``) and replaces them with themselves. Thus, a string can "
"have a quote that matches the opening one, but only if it's preceded by a "
"backslash."
msgstr ""
"**ຄ່າສະຕຣິງແບບດິບ (Raw string literals)** ຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດສະຕຣິງຕາມທີ່ມັນປາກົດຢູ່ໃນຊອດໂຄ້ດ "
"(source code) ສະເໝີ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບນິພົດປົກກະຕິ (regular expressions). ຄ່າສະຕຣິງແບບ"
"ດິບຈະບໍ່ປະມວນຜົນລຳດັບການຫຼີກ (escape sequences), ແຕ່ມັນຈະຈື່ຈຳ ``\\\\`` ແລະ ``\\\"`` "
"(``\\'``) ແລະ ແທນທີ່ພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສະຕຣິງສາມາດມີອັນຍະປະກາດທີ່ກົງກັບຕົວເປີດໄດ້, ແຕ່"
"ຕ້ອງມີແບັກສະແລັຊຢູ່ທາງໜ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:442
msgid ""
"Some strings cannot be represented using raw string literals: you cannot "
"have an odd number of backslashes at the end of a string or have an "
"unescaped opening quote inside the string. However, in practice this doesn't "
"matter since you can use a different quote type or use concatenation with a "
"regular string literal."
msgstr ""
"ບາງສະຕຣິງບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງໂດຍໃຊ້ Raw string literals ໄດ້: ເຊັ່ນ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດມີແບັກສະແລັຊເປັນຈຳນ"
"ວນຄີກຢູ່ທ້າຍສະຕຣິງ ຫຼື ມີອັນຍະປະກາດເປີດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ escape ຢູ່ພາຍໃນສະຕຣິງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດແລ້"
"ວເລື່ອງນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາ ເພາະທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ປະເພດອັນຍະປະກາດອື່ນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມສະຕຣິງ "
"(concatenation) ກັບສະຕຣິງແບບປົກກະຕິແທນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:447
msgid "GDScript also supports :ref:`format strings <doc_gdscript_printf>`."
msgstr "GDScript ຍັງຮອງຮັບ :ref:`format strings <doc_gdscript_printf>` ນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:450
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "Annotations (ການໝາຍກຳກັບ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:452
msgid ""
"Annotations are special tokens in GDScript that act as modifiers to an "
"entire script, a declaration, a statement, or a location in the source code. "
"Annotations may affect how the script is treated by the Godot editor and the "
"GDScript compiler."
msgstr ""
"Annotations ແມ່ນໂທເຄັນ (tokens) ພິເສດໃນ GDScript ທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວດັດແກ້ (modifiers) ໃຫ້"
"ກັບສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດ, ການປະກາດ, ຄຳສັ່ງ, ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຊອດໂຄ້ດ. Annotations ອາດມີຜົນຕໍ່ວິທີທີ່ Godot "
"editor ແລະ ຕົວຄອມໄພເລີ (compiler) ຂອງ GDScript ຈັດການກັບສະຄຣິບນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:456
msgid ""
"Every annotation starts with the ``@`` character and is specified by a name. "
"A detailed description and example for each annotation can be found inside "
"the :ref:`GDScript class reference <class_@GDScript>`."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ annotation ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ ``@`` ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຕົ"
"ວຢ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະ annotation ໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`GDScript class reference <class_@GDScript>"
"`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:460
msgid "For instance, you can use it to export a value to the editor:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ (export) ຄ່າໄປຍັງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:467
msgid ""
"For more information about exporting properties, read the :ref:`GDScript "
"exports <doc_gdscript_exports>` article."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການ export ຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties), ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ບົດຄວາມ "
":ref:`GDScript exports <doc_gdscript_exports>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:470
msgid ""
"Any constant expression compatible with the required argument type can be "
"passed as an annotation argument value:"
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant expression) ໃດໆ ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບປະເພດພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ສາມາດສົ່ງເປັນຄ່າ"
"ພາລາມິເຕີຂອງ annotation ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:479
msgid ""
"Annotations can be specified one per line or all in the same line. They "
"affect the next statement that isn't an annotation. Annotations can have "
"arguments sent between parentheses and separated by commas."
msgstr ""
"Annotations ສາມາດຂຽນແຍກແຖວລະອັນ ຫຼື ຂຽນລວມກັນໃນແຖວດຽວກັນກໍໄດ້. ພວກມັນຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄຳສັ່ງຖັດໄປທີ່ບໍ່"
"ແມ່ນ annotation. Annotations ສາມາດຮັບພາລາມິເຕີໄດ້ ໂດຍໃສ່ໄວ້ໃນວົງເລັບ ແລະ ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸ"
"ດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:483
msgid "Both of these are the same:"
msgstr "ທັງສອງແບບນີ້ແມ່ນມີຜົນຄືກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:496
msgid "``@onready`` annotation"
msgstr "annotation ``@onready``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:498
msgid ""
"When using nodes, it's common to desire to keep references to parts of the "
"scene in a variable. As scenes are only warranted to be configured when "
"entering the active scene tree, the sub-nodes can only be obtained when a "
"call to ``Node._ready()`` is made."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານໂນດ (nodes), ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ເຮົາຕ້ອງການເກັບການອ້າງອີງ (references) ຂອງສ່ວນຕ່"
"າງໆໃນສາກ (scene) ໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກສາກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree ທີ່"
"ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂນດລູກ (sub-nodes) ຈະສາມາດດຶງມາໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``Node._ready()`` ແ"
"ລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:511
msgid ""
"This can get a little cumbersome, especially when nodes and external "
"references pile up. For this, GDScript has the ``@onready`` annotation, that "
"defers initialization of a member variable until ``_ready()`` is called. It "
"can replace the above code with a single line:"
msgstr ""
"ເລື່ອງນີ້ອາດຈະຫຍຸ້ງຍາກເລັກນ້ອຍ ເມື່ອມີໂນດ ແລະ ການອ້າງອີງພາຍນອກຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, GDScript "
"ຈຶ່ງມີ annotation ``@onready`` ເພື່ອເລື່ອນການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ ຈົນກວ່າ "
"``_ready()`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້. ມັນສາມາດປ່ຽນໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງໃຫ້ເຫຼືອພຽງແຖວດຽວໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:522
msgid ""
"Applying ``@onready`` and any ``@export`` annotation to the same variable "
"doesn't work as you might expect. The ``@onready`` annotation will cause the "
"default value to be set after the ``@export`` takes effect and will override "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ ``@onready`` ຮ່ວມກັບ ``@export`` ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນດຽວກັນ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຄິດ. ເພາະ "
"``@onready`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ ``@export`` ມີຜົນ ແລະ ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບຄ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:542
msgid ""
"Therefore, the ``ONREADY_WITH_EXPORT`` warning is generated, which is "
"treated as an error by default. We do not recommend disabling or ignoring it."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະເກີດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ``ONREADY_WITH_EXPORT``, ເຊິ່ງໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພ"
"າດ (error). ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດ ຫຼື ເມີນເສີຍຕໍ່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:546
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:107
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (Comments)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:548
msgid ""
"Anything from a ``#`` to the end of the line is ignored and is considered a "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``#`` ໄປຈົນຈົບແຖວ ຈະຖືກເມີນເສີຍ ແລະ ຖືວ່າເປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comment)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:557
msgid ""
"In the Godot script editor, special keywords are highlighted within comments "
"to bring the user's attention to specific comments:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot script editor, ຄຳສຳຄັນ (keywords) ບາງຢ່າງຈະຖືກເນັ້ນສີພາຍໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍ ເພື່ອດຶງດູດ"
"ຄວາມສົນໃຈຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕໍ່ກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍນັ້ນໆ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:560
msgid ""
"**Critical** *(appears in red)*: ``ALERT``, ``ATTENTION``, ``CAUTION``, "
"``CRITICAL``, ``DANGER``, ``SECURITY``"
msgstr ""
"**ວິກິດ (Critical)** *(ສະແດງເປັນສີແດງ)*: ``ALERT``, ``ATTENTION``, ``CAUTION``, "
"``CRITICAL``, ``DANGER``, ``SECURITY``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:562
msgid ""
"**Warning** *(appears in yellow)*: ``BUG``, ``DEPRECATED``, ``FIXME``, "
"``HACK``, ``TASK``, ``TBD``, ``TODO``, ``WARNING``"
msgstr ""
"**ຄຳເຕືອນ (Warning)** *(ສະແດງເປັນສີເຫຼືອງ)*: ``BUG``, ``DEPRECATED``, ``FIXME``, "
"``HACK``, ``TASK``, ``TBD``, ``TODO``, ``WARNING``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:564
msgid ""
"**Notice** *(appears in green)*: ``INFO``, ``NOTE``, ``NOTICE``, ``TEST``, "
"``TESTING``"
msgstr ""
"**ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຊາບ (Notice)** *(ສະແດງເປັນສີຂຽວ)*: ``INFO``, ``NOTE``, ``NOTICE``, "
"``TEST``, ``TESTING``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:567
msgid ""
"These keywords are case-sensitive, so they must be written in uppercase for "
"them to be recognized:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນແຍກຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ (case-sensitive), ດັ່ງນັ້ນຕ້ອງຂຽນເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລ"
"ະບົບຮັບຮູ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:577
msgid ""
"The list of highlighted keywords and their colors can be changed in the "
"**Text Editor > Theme > Comment Markers** section of the Editor Settings."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄຳສຳຄັນທີ່ຖືກເນັ້ນສີ ແລະ ສີຂອງພວກມັນ ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ **Text Editor > Theme > "
"Comment Markers** ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Editor Settings."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:580
msgid ""
"Use two hash symbols (``##``) instead of one (``#``) to add a *documentation "
"comment*, which will appear in the script documentation and in the inspector "
"description of an exported variable. Documentation comments must be placed "
"directly *above* a documentable item (such as a member variable), or at the "
"top of a file. Dedicated formatting options are also available. "
"See :ref:`doc_gdscript_documentation_comments` for details."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash ສອງອັນ (``##``) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນອັນດຽວ (``#``) ເພື່ອສ້າງ *ຄຳອະທິບາຍເອກະສານ "
"(documentation comment)*, ເຊິ່ງຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນເອກະສານຂອງສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ໃນລາຍລະອຽດ "
"inspector ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຖືກ export. ຄຳອະທິບາຍເອກະສານຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ *ຂ້າງເທິງ* ລາຍການທີ່ຕ້ອງການອ"
"ະທິບາຍໂດຍກົງ (ເຊັ່ນ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ), ຫຼື ໄວ້ສ່ວນເທິງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກການຈັດຮູບແບບສ"
"ະເພາະໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານອີກດ້ວຍ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ :ref:`doc_gdscript_documentation_comments`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:596
msgid "Code regions"
msgstr "Code regions (ສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:598
msgid ""
"Code regions are special types of comments that the script editor "
"understands as *foldable regions*. This means that after writing code region "
"comments, you can collapse and expand the region by clicking the arrow that "
"appears at the left of the comment. This arrow appears within a purple "
"square to be distinguishable from standard code folding."
msgstr ""
"Code regions ແມ່ນຄຳອະທິບາຍປະເພດພິເສດທີ່ script editor ເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າເປັນ *ສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດພັບໄດ້*. "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຫຼັງຈາກຂຽນຄຳອະທິບາຍ code region ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຫຍໍ້ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນນັ້ນໄດ້ ໂດຍກາ"
"ນຄລິກທີ່ລູກສອນທີ່ປາກົດຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍຂອງຄຳອະທິບາຍ. ລູກສອນນີ້ຈະຢູ່ໃນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີມ່ວງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການພັບໂຄ້ດ"
"ແບບປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:604
msgid "The syntax is as follows:"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:622
msgid ""
"To create a code region quickly, select several lines in the script editor, "
"right-click the selection then choose **Create Code Region**. The region "
"description will be selected automatically for editing."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ code region ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂຄ້ດຫຼາຍໆແຖວໃນ script editor, ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກ ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Create Code Region**. ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງສ່ວນນັ້ນຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານ"
"ແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:626
msgid "It is possible to nest code regions within other code regions."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ code regions ຊ້ອນກັນພາຍໃນ code regions ອື່ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:628
msgid "Here's a concrete usage example of code regions:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້ງານ code regions ຕົວຈິງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:650
msgid ""
"This can be useful to organize large chunks of code into easier to "
"understand sections. However, remember that external editors generally don't "
"support this feature, so make sure your code is easy to follow even when not "
"relying on folding code regions."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລະບຽບໂຄ້ດກ້ອນໃຫຍ່ໆ ໃຫ້ເປັນສ່ວນທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ"
"ພາຍນອກ (external editors) ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຟີເຈີນີ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານອ່ານງ່າ"
"ຍ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ການພັບ code regions ກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:657
msgid ""
"Individual functions and indented sections (such as ``if`` and ``for``) can "
"*always* be collapsed in the script editor. This means you should avoid "
"using a code region to contain a single function or indented section, as it "
"won't bring much of a benefit. Code regions work best when they're used to "
"group multiple elements together."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນແຕ່ລະອັນ ແລະ ສ່ວນທີ່ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ ``if`` ແລະ ``for``) ສາມາດພັບໄດ້ *ສະເໝີ* ໃນ script "
"editor. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຄວນຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ code region ເພື່ອຄອບພຽງຟັງຊັນດຽວ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຫຍໍ້ໜ້າດຽວ, "
"ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຍັງຫຼາຍ. Code regions ຈະໄດ້ຜົນດີທີ່ສຸດ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອລວມຫຼາຍໆອົງປະກອບເຂົ້າກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:664
msgid "Line continuation"
msgstr "ການຂຽນຕໍ່ແຖວ (Line continuation)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:666
msgid ""
"A line of code in GDScript can be continued on the next line by using a "
"backslash (``\\``). Add one at the end of a line and the code on the next "
"line will act like it's where the backslash is. Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"ແຖວໂຄ້ດໃນ GDScript ສາມາດຂຽນຕໍ່ໃນແຖວຖັດໄປໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແບັກສະແລັຊ (``\\``). ໃຫ້ຕື່ມມັນໃສ່ທ້າຍແ"
"ຖວ ແລ້ວໂຄ້ດໃນແຖວຖັດໄປຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບວ່າມັນຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັບແບັກສະແລັຊນັ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:675
msgid "A line can be continued multiple times like this:"
msgstr "ແຖວດຽວສາມາດຂຽນຕໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:687
msgid "Built-in types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ (Built-in types)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:689
msgid ""
"Built-in types are stack-allocated. They are passed as values. This means a "
"copy is created on each assignment or when passing them as arguments to "
"functions. The exceptions are ``Object``, ``Array``, ``Dictionary``, and "
"packed arrays (such as ``PackedByteArray``), which are passed by reference "
"so they are shared. All arrays, ``Dictionary``, and some objects (``Node``, "
"``Resource``) have a ``duplicate()`` method that allows you to make a copy."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ (Built-in types) ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດສັນໃນ stack ແລະ ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຄ່າ "
"(values). ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະມີການສ້າງຕົວສຳເນົາຂຶ້ນມາທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ ຫຼື ສົ່ງເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັ"
"ນ. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນຄື ``Object``, ``Array``, ``Dictionary``, ແລະ packed arrays (ເຊັ່ນ "
"``PackedByteArray``), ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ແບບການອ້າງອີງ (reference) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຮ່ວມກັນ. "
"Array ທັງໝົດ, ``Dictionary``, ແລະ ວັດຖຸ (objects) ບາງຢ່າງ (ເຊັ່ນ ``Node``, "
"``Resource``) ຈະມີເມັດທອດ ``duplicate()`` ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງຕົວສຳເນົາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:697
msgid "Basic built-in types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:699
msgid "A variable in GDScript can be assigned to several built-in types."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນໃນ GDScript ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:704
msgid ""
"``null`` is an empty data type that contains no information and can not be "
"assigned any other value."
msgstr ""
"``null`` ແມ່ນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າອື່ນໃຫ້ມັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:707
msgid ""
"Only types that inherit from Object can have a ``null`` value (Object is "
"therefore called a \"nullable\" type). :ref:`Variant types "
"<doc_variant_class>` must have a valid value at all times, and therefore "
"cannot have a ``null`` value."
msgstr ""
"ສະເພາະປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Object ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດມີຄ່າເປັນ ``null`` ໄດ້ (ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Object ຈຶ່ງຖືກ"
"ເອີ້ນວ່າ ປະເພດທີ່ເປັນ \"nullable\"). ສ່ວນ :ref:`Variant types <doc_variant_class>` ຈ"
"ະຕ້ອງມີຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່ສະເໝີ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດມີຄ່າເປັນ ``null`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:713
msgid ":ref:`bool <class_bool>`"
msgstr ":ref:`bool <class_bool>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:715
msgid "Short for \"boolean\", it can only contain ``true`` or ``false``."
msgstr ""
"ຫຍໍ້ມາຈາກ \"boolean\", ມັນສາມາດເກັບໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າ ``true`` (ຈິງ) ຫຼື ``false`` (ເທັດ) ເທົ່ານັ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:718
msgid ":ref:`int <class_int>`"
msgstr ":ref:`int <class_int>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:720
msgid ""
"Short for \"integer\", it stores whole numbers (positive and negative). It "
"is stored as a 64-bit value, equivalent to ``int64_t`` in C++."
msgstr ""
"ຫຍໍ້ມາຈາກ \"integer\", ມັນໃຊ້ເກັບເລກຖ້ວນ (ທັງບວກ ແລະ ລົບ). ມັນຖືກເກັບເປັນຄ່າຂະໜາດ 64 ບິດ, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບ ``int64_t`` ໃນ C++."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:724
msgid ":ref:`float <class_float>`"
msgstr ":ref:`float <class_float>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:726
msgid ""
"Stores real numbers, including decimals, using floating-point values. It is "
"stored as a 64-bit value, equivalent to ``double`` in C++. Note: Currently, "
"data structures such as ``Vector2``, ``Vector3``, and ``PackedFloat32Array`` "
"store 32-bit single-precision ``float`` values."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເກັບເລກຈິງ, ລວມທັງເລກເສດທົດສະນິຍົມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ floating-point. ມັນຖືກເກັບເປັນຄ່າຂະໜາດ 64 ບິ"
"ດ, ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບ ``double`` ໃນ C++. ໝາຍເຫດ: ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນເຊັ່ນ ``Vector2``, "
"``Vector3``, ແລະ ``PackedFloat32Array`` ຈະເກັບຄ່າ ``float`` ແບບຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ 32 "
"ບິດ (single-precision)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:732
msgid ":ref:`String <class_String>`"
msgstr ":ref:`String <class_String>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:734
msgid ""
"A sequence of characters in `Unicode format <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Unicode>`_."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນໃນຮູບແບບ `Unicode <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicode>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:739
msgid ""
"An immutable string that allows only one instance of each name. They are "
"slower to create and may result in waiting for locks when multithreading. In "
"exchange, they're very fast to compare, which makes them good candidates for "
"dictionary keys."
msgstr ""
"ສະຕຣິງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ (immutable) ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພຽງອັນດຽວສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊື່. ພວກມັນຈະສ້າງໄດ້ຊ້"
"າກວ່າ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການລໍຖ້າ (waiting for locks) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານແບບ multithreading. ແຕ່"
"ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, ມັນຈະປຽບທຽບໄດ້ໄວຫຼາຍ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສຳລັບການນຳມາໃຊ້ເປັນ key ຂອງ "
"dictionary."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:746
msgid ""
"A pre-parsed path to a node or a node property.  It can be easily assigned "
"to, and from, a String. They are useful to interact with the tree to get a "
"node, or affecting properties like with :ref:`Tweens <class_Tween>`."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອໄປຫາໂນດ ຫຼື ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ. ມັນສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄປມາລະຫວ່າງ "
"String ໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ. ພວກມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ scene tree ເພື່ອດຶງໂນດມາໃຊ້ ຫຼື ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ"
"ຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນໃນການໃຊ້ :ref:`Tweens <class_Tween>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:751
msgid "Vector built-in types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນເວັກເຕີ (Vector types)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:754
msgid ":ref:`Vector2 <class_Vector2>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Vector2 <class_Vector2>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:756
msgid ""
"2D vector type containing ``x`` and ``y`` fields. Can also be accessed as an "
"array."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວ (fields) ``x`` ແລະ ``y``. ຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂ"
"ອງ array."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:760
msgid ":ref:`Vector2i <class_Vector2i>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Vector2i <class_Vector2i>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:762
msgid ""
"Same as a Vector2 but the components are integers. Useful for representing "
"items in a 2D grid."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ Vector2 ແຕ່ອົງປະກອບພາຍໃນເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ (integers). ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຕາຕ"
"ະລາງ 2 ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:766
msgid ":ref:`Rect2 <class_Rect2>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Rect2 <class_Rect2>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:768
msgid ""
"2D Rectangle type containing two vectors fields: ``position`` and ``size``. "
"Also contains an ``end`` field which is ``position + size``."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງຟິວເວັກເຕີ: ``position`` (ຕຳແໜ່ງ) ແລະ ``size`` (ຂະໜາ"
"ດ). ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີຟິວ ``end`` ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ ``position + size``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:772
msgid ":ref:`Vector3 <class_Vector3>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Vector3 <class_Vector3>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:774
msgid ""
"3D vector type containing ``x``, ``y`` and ``z`` fields. This can also be "
"accessed as an array."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວ ``x``, ``y`` ແລະ ``z``. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ "
"array ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:778
msgid ":ref:`Vector3i <class_Vector3i>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Vector3i <class_Vector3i>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:780
msgid ""
"Same as Vector3 but the components are integers. Can be use for indexing "
"items in a 3D grid."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ Vector3 ແຕ່ອົງປະກອບພາຍໃນເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລະບຸ index ຂອງລາຍການໃນຕາຕ"
"ະລາງ 3 ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:784
msgid ":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:786
msgid "3×2 matrix used for 2D transforms."
msgstr ""
"ເມທຣິກຊ໌ (matrix) ຂະໜາດ 3×2 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transforms) ໃນ 2 ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:789
msgid ":ref:`Plane <class_Plane>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Plane <class_Plane>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:791
msgid ""
"3D Plane type in normalized form that contains a ``normal`` vector field and "
"a ``d`` scalar distance."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດລະນັບ (Plane) 3 ມິຕິ ໃນຮູບແບບປົກກະຕິ (normalized) ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວເວັກເຕີ ``normal`` "
"ແລະ ໄລຍະທາງສະກາລາ (scalar distance) ``d``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:795
msgid ":ref:`Quaternion <class_Quaternion>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Quaternion <class_Quaternion>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:797
msgid ""
"Quaternion is a datatype used for representing a 3D rotation. It's useful "
"for interpolating rotations."
msgstr ""
"Quaternion ແມ່ນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແທນການໝູນ (rotation) ໃນ 3 ມິຕິ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການເຮັ"
"ດອິນເຕີໂພເລຊັນ (interpolating) ຂອງການໝູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:801
msgid ":ref:`AABB <class_AABB>`"
msgstr ":ref:`AABB <class_AABB>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:803
msgid ""
"Axis-aligned bounding box (or 3D box) contains 2 vectors fields: "
"``position`` and ``size``. Also contains an ``end`` field which is "
"``position + size``."
msgstr ""
"Axis-aligned bounding box (ຫຼື ກ່ອງ 3 ມິຕິ) ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງຟິວເວັກເຕີ: ``position`` ແລະ "
"``size``. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີຟິວ ``end`` ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ ``position + size``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:808
msgid ":ref:`Basis <class_Basis>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Basis <class_Basis>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:810
msgid ""
"3x3 matrix used for 3D rotation and scale. It contains 3 vector fields "
"(``x``, ``y`` and ``z``) and can also be accessed as an array of 3D vectors."
msgstr ""
"ເມທຣິກຊ໌ ຂະໜາດ 3x3 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໝູນ ແລະ ການຂະຫຍາຍ (scale) ໃນ 3 ມິຕິ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍ 3 ຟິວເ"
"ວັກເຕີ (``x``, ``y`` ແລະ ``z``) ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ array ຂອງເວັກເຕີ 3 "
"ມິຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:815
msgid ":ref:`Transform3D <class_Transform3D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Transform3D <class_Transform3D>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:817
msgid ""
"3D Transform contains a Basis field ``basis`` and a Vector3 field ``origin``."
msgstr ""
"Transform3D ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວ Basis ``basis`` ແລະ ຟິວ Vector3 ``origin`` (ຈຸດກຳເນີດ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:821
msgid "Engine built-in types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ນຳເອນຈິນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:824
msgid ":ref:`Color <class_Color>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Color <class_Color>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:826
msgid ""
"Color data type contains ``r``, ``g``, ``b``, and ``a`` fields. It can also "
"be accessed as ``h``, ``s``, and ``v`` for hue/saturation/value."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນສີ (Color) ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວ ``r``, ``g``, ``b``, ແລະ ``a``. ຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃ"
"ນຮູບແບບ ``h``, ``s``, ແລະ ``v`` (hue/saturation/value) ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:830
msgid ":ref:`RID <class_RID>`"
msgstr ":ref:`RID <class_RID>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:832
msgid "Resource ID (RID). Servers use generic RIDs to reference opaque data."
msgstr ""
"Resource ID (RID). ພວກເຊີບເວີ (Servers) ໃຊ້ RID ທົ່ວໄປເພື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ເປີດເຜີຍລາຍລະອ"
"ຽດ (opaque data)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:835
msgid ":ref:`Object <class_Object>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Object <class_Object>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:837
msgid "Base class for anything that is not a built-in type."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານ (Base class) ສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ (built-in type)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:840
msgid "Container built-in types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວເກັບ (Container types)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:843
msgid ":ref:`Array <class_Array>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Array <class_Array>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:845
msgid ""
"Generic sequence of arbitrary object types, including other arrays or "
"dictionaries (see below). The array can resize dynamically. Arrays are "
"indexed starting from index ``0``. Negative indices count from the end."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບທົ່ວໄປຂອງວັດຖຸປະເພດຕ່າງໆ, ລວມທັງ array ຫຼື dictionary ອື່ນໆ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ). array ສາມາດ"
"ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໄດ້ແບບໄດນາມິກ. array ຈະເລີ່ມນັບ index ຈາກ ``0``. ສ່ວນ index ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າລົບຈະນັບຖອຍ"
"ຫຼັງຈາກທ້າຍສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:860
msgid "Typed arrays"
msgstr "Typed arrays (Array ແບບລະບຸປະເພດ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:862
msgid ""
"Godot also features support for typed arrays. On write operations, Godot "
"checks that element values match the specified type, so the array cannot "
"contain invalid values. The GDScript static analyzer takes typed arrays into "
"account, however array methods like ``front()`` and ``back()`` still have "
"the ``Variant`` return type."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍັງຮອງຮັບ typed arrays. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີການຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ, Godot ຈະກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າຂອງອົງປະກອບ ກົ"
"ງກັບປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ array ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດມີຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້. ຕົວວິເຄາະສະແຕຕິກ (static "
"analyzer) ຂອງ GDScript ຈະນຳເອົາ typed arrays ມາພິຈາລະນາ, ແຕ່ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ຟັງຊັນຂອງ "
"array ເຊັ່ນ ``front()`` ແລະ ``back()`` ຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຄ່າກັບເປັນປະເພດ ``Variant`` ຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:867
msgid ""
"Typed arrays have the syntax ``Array[Type]``, where ``Type`` can be any "
"``Variant`` type, native or user class, or enum. Nested array types (like "
"``Array[Array[int]]``) are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Typed arrays ມີໄວຍາກອນແມ່ນ ``Array[Type]``, ເຊິ່ງ ``Type`` ສາມາດເປັນປະເພດ "
"``Variant`` ໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຄລາສພື້ນຖານ, ຄລາສທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ, ຫຼື enum. ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຊ້"
"ອນກັນຂອງ array (ເຊັ່ນ ``Array[Array[int]]``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:878
msgid "``Array`` and ``Array[Variant]`` are the same thing."
msgstr "``Array`` ແລະ ``Array[Variant]`` ແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:882
msgid ""
"Arrays are passed by reference, so the array element type is also an "
"attribute of the in-memory structure referenced by a variable in runtime. "
"The static type of a variable restricts the structures that it can reference "
"to. Therefore, you **cannot** assign an array with a different element type, "
"even if the type is a subtype of the required type."
msgstr ""
"Array ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ແບບການອ້າງອີງ (reference), ດັ່ງນັ້ນປະເພດອົງປະກອບຂອງ array ຈຶ່ງເປັນຄຸນລັກສະນະ ຂ"
"ອງໂຄງສ້າງໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຕົວປ່ຽນອ້າງອີງເຖິງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ. ປະເພດສະແຕຕິກ (static type) ຂອງ"
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ ຈະຈຳກັດໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ມັນສາມາດອ້າງອີງເຖິງໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານ **ບໍ່ສາມາດ** ກຳນົດ array ທີ່ມີປະເພດ"
"ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງກັນໄດ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າປະເພດນັ້ນຈະເປັນປະເພດຍ່ອຍ (subtype) ຂອງປະເພດທີ່ຕ້ອງການກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:887
msgid ""
"If you want to *convert* a typed array, you can create a new array and use "
"the :ref:`Array.assign() <class_Array_method_assign>` method:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ *ແປງ* typed array, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ array ໃໝ່ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເມັດທອດ "
":ref:`Array.assign() <class_Array_method_assign>` ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:904
msgid ""
"The only exception was made for the ``Array`` (``Array[Variant]``) type, for "
"user convenience and compatibility with old code. However, operations on "
"untyped arrays are considered unsafe."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນພຽງຢ່າງດຽວສຳລັບປະເພດ ``Array`` (``Array[Variant]``), ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບໂຄ້ດເກົ່າ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການຈັດການກັບ array ທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸປະເພດ (untyped "
"arrays) ແມ່ນຖືວ່າບໍ່ປອດໄພ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:910
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/core_types.rst:30
msgid "Packed arrays"
msgstr "Packed arrays (Array ແບບບີບອັດ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:912
msgid ""
"PackedArrays are generally faster to iterate on and modify compared to a "
"typed Array of the same type (e.g. PackedInt64Array versus Array[int]) and "
"consume less memory. In the worst case, they are expected to be as fast as "
"an untyped Array. Conversely, non-Packed Arrays (typed or not) have extra "
"convenience methods such as :ref:`Array.map <class_Array_method_map>` that "
"PackedArrays lack. Consult the :ref:`class reference "
"<class_PackedFloat32Array>` for details on the methods available. Typed "
"Arrays are generally faster to iterate on and modify than untyped Arrays."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ PackedArrays ຈະປະມວນຜົນແບບວົນຊ້ຳ (iterate) ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"Typed Array ທີ່ມີປະເພດດຽວກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ PackedInt64Array ທຽບກັບ Array[int]) ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາ"
"ມຈຳໜ້ອຍກວ່າ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ພວກມັນກໍຍັງໄວເທົ່າກັບ Untyped Array. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, array ທີ່"
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Packed (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະລະບຸປະເພດຫຼືບໍ່) ຈະມີເມັດທອດທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`Array.map "
"<class_Array_method_map>` ເຊິ່ງ PackedArrays ບໍ່ມີ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເມັດທອດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໄ"
"ດ້ທີ່ :ref:`class reference <class_PackedFloat32Array>`. ທັງນີ້, Typed Arrays ໂດຍທົ່ວ"
"ໄປແລ້ວກໍຍັງໄວກວ່າ Untyped Arrays."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:921
msgid ""
"While all Arrays can cause memory fragmentation when they become large "
"enough, if memory usage and performance (iteration and modification speed) "
"is a concern and the type of data you're storing is compatible with one of "
"the ``Packed`` Array types, then using those may yield improvements. "
"However, if you do not have such concerns (e.g. the size of your array does "
"not reach the tens of thousands of elements) it is likely more helpful to "
"use regular or typed Arrays, as they provide convenience methods that can "
"make your code easier to write and maintain (and potentially faster if your "
"data requires such operations a lot). If the data you will store is of a "
"known type (including your own defined classes), prefer to use a typed Array "
"as it may yield better performance in iteration and modification compared to "
"an untyped Array."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າ Array ທັງໝົດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການແຕກແຍກຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (memory fragmentation) ເມື່ອມີຂ"
"ະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານກັງວົນເລື່ອງການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບ (ຄວາມໄວໃນການວົນຊ້ຳ ແລະ ແ"
"ກ້ໄຂ) ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບປະເພດ ``Packed`` Array, ການໃຊ້ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕ"
"າມ, ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ກັງວົນເລື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ array ມີຂະໜາດບໍ່ເຖິງຫຼັກໝື່ນ) ການໃຊ້ Array ປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື "
"Typed Array ອາດຈະດີກວ່າ ເພາະພວກມັນມີເມັດທອດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂຽນ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂຄ້ດໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ. ຖ້າທ່າ"
"ນຮູ້ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະເກັບຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ລວມທັງຄລາສທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງເອງ), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Typed Array ເພາະມັນຈະໃຫ້ປ"
"ະສິດທິພາບດີກວ່າ Untyped Array."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:933
msgid ""
