#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:945
msgid ":ref:`Dictionary <class_Dictionary>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Dictionary <class_Dictionary>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:947
msgid "Associative container which contains values referenced by unique keys."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເກັບແບບເຊື່ອມໂຍງ (Associative container) ທີ່ເກັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆ ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຜ່ານຄີ (keys) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:960
msgid ""
"Lua-style table syntax is also supported. Lua-style uses ``=`` instead of "
"``:`` and doesn't use quotes to mark string keys (making for slightly less "
"to write). However, keys written in this form can't start with a digit (like "
"any GDScript identifier), and must be string literals."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຮອງຮັບໄວຍາກອນແບບຕາຕະລາງຂອງພາສາ Lua (Lua-style). ແບບ Lua ຈະໃຊ້ ``=`` ແທ"
"ນ ``:`` ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ອັນຍະປະກາດສຳລັບ string keys (ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂຽນໜ້ອຍລົງເລັກນ້ອຍ). ແນວໃດກໍຕາ"
"ມ, ຄີທີ່ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລກໄດ້ (ຄືກັບຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ GDScript ທົ່ວໄປ), ແລະ ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"string literals ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:974
msgid ""
"To add a key to an existing dictionary, access it like an existing key and "
"assign to it:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄີໃໝ່ລົງໃນ dictionary ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນຄືກັບຄີປົກກະຕິ ແລ້ວກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:992
msgid ""
"The bracket syntax can be used to access properties of "
"any :ref:`class_Object`, not just Dictionaries. Keep in mind it will cause a "
"script error when attempting to index a non-existing property. To avoid "
"this, use the :ref:`Object.get() <class_Object_method_get>` "
"and :ref:`Object.set() <class_Object_method_set>` methods instead."
msgstr ""
"ໄວຍາກອນແບບວົງເລັບຫຼ່ຽມ (bracket syntax) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ "
":ref:`class_Object` ໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແຕ່ Dictionary ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ມັນຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"(script error) ຖ້າທ່ານພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມັດທອດ "
":ref:`Object.get() <class_Object_method_get>` ແລະ :ref:`Object.set() "
"<class_Object_method_set>` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:999
msgid "Typed dictionaries"
msgstr "Typed dictionaries (Dictionary ແບບລະບຸປະເພດ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Godot 4.4 added support for typed dictionaries. On write operations, Godot "
"checks that element keys and values match the specified type, so the "
"dictionary cannot contain invalid keys or values. The GDScript static "
"analyzer takes typed dictionaries into account. However, dictionary methods "
"that return values still have the ``Variant`` return type."
msgstr ""
"Godot 4.4 ໄດ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບ typed dictionaries. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີການຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ, Godot ຈະກວດສອບ"
"ວ່າ ຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າຂອງອົງປະກອບກົງກັບປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ dictionary ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດມີຄີ ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອ"
"ງໄດ້. ຕົວວິເຄາະສະແຕຕິກຂອງ GDScript ຈະນຳເອົາ typed dictionaries ມາພິຈາລະນາ. ແຕ່ເມັດທອດ"
"ຂອງ dictionary ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ ຍັງຄົງເປັນປະເພດ ``Variant`` ຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1006
msgid ""
"Typed dictionaries have the syntax ``Dictionary[KeyType, ValueType]``, where "
"``KeyType`` and ``ValueType`` can be any ``Variant`` type, native or user "
"class, or enum. Both the key and value type **must** be specified, but you "
"can use ``Variant`` to make either of them untyped. Nested typed collections "
"(like ``Dictionary[String, Dictionary[String, int]]``) are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Typed dictionaries ມີໄວຍາກອນແມ່ນ ``Dictionary[KeyType, ValueType]``, ເຊິ່ງ "
"``KeyType`` ແລະ ``ValueType`` ສາມາດເປັນປະເພດ ``Variant`` ໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຄລາສພື້"
"ນຖານ, ຄລາສທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ, ຫຼື enum. ທ່ານ **ຕ້ອງ** ລະບຸທັງປະເພດຂອງຄີ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງຄ່າ, ແຕ່ສາ"
"ມາດໃຊ້ ``Variant`` ໄດ້ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການລະບຸປະເພດໃດໜຶ່ງ. ທັງນີ້, ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຊ້ອນກັນຂອງຄອນເລັກຊັນ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ ``Dictionary[String, Dictionary[String, int]]``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1023
msgid "``Dictionary`` and ``Dictionary[Variant, Variant]`` are the same thing."
msgstr "``Dictionary`` ແລະ ``Dictionary[Variant, Variant]`` ແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1026
msgid ":ref:`Signal <class_Signal>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Signal <class_Signal>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1028
msgid ""
"A signal is a message that can be emitted by an object to those who want to "
"listen to it. The Signal type can be used for passing the emitter around."
msgstr ""
"Signal ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ວັດຖຸສາມາດສົ່ງ (emit) ອອກໄປຫາຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລໍຖ້າຟັງ. ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ Signal ສາມາດ"
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕົວສົ່ງສັນຍານໄປມາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1031
msgid ""
"Signals are better used by getting them from actual objects, e.g. "
"``$Button.button_up``."
msgstr ""
"Signal ຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອດຶງມາຈາກວັດຖຸຕົວຈິງ, ເຊັ່ນ ``$Button.button_up``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1034
msgid ":ref:`Callable <class_Callable>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Callable <class_Callable>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1036
msgid ""
"Contains an object and a function, which is useful for passing functions as "
"values (e.g. when connecting to signals)."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສົ່ງຟັງຊັນໄປໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຄ່າ (ເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ "
"signals)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1039
msgid ""
"Getting a method as a member returns a callable. ``var x = "
"$Sprite2D.rotate`` will set the value of ``x`` to a callable with "
"``$Sprite2D`` as the object and ``rotate`` as the method."
msgstr ""
"ການດຶງເມັດທອດອອກມາເປັນສະມາຊິກ ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບເປັນ callable. ເຊັ່ນ ``var x = "
"$Sprite2D.rotate`` ຈະກຳນົດຄ່າ ``x`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ callable ທີ່ມີວັດຖຸແມ່ນ ``$Sprite2D`` ແລະ ເ"
"ມັດທອດແມ່ນ ``rotate``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1043
msgid "You can call it using the ``call`` method: ``x.call(PI)``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມັດທອດ ``call``: ``x.call(PI)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1046
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:657
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/converting_glsl_to_godot_shaders.rst:85
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/converting_glsl_to_godot_shaders.rst:152
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/converting_glsl_to_godot_shaders.rst:223
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ (Variables)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1048
msgid ""
"Variables can exist as class members or local to functions. They are created "
"with the ``var`` keyword and may, optionally, be assigned a value upon "
"initialization."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາສ (class members) ຫຼື ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນຟັງຊັນ (local "
"variables). ພວກມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຄຳສຳຄັນ ``var`` ແລະ ອາດຈະກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ເລີຍກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1059
msgid ""
"Variables can optionally have a type specification. When a type is "
"specified, the variable will be forced to have always that same type, and "
"trying to assign an incompatible value will raise an error."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນສາມາດລະບຸປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type specification) ໄດ້. ເມື່ອມີການລະບຸປະເພດ, ຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນຈະຖືກບັງ"
"ຄັບໃຫ້ມີປະເພດເດີມສະເໝີ, ແລະ ຖ້າພະຍາຍາມກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ ກໍຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1063
msgid ""
"Types are specified in the variable declaration using a ``:`` (colon) symbol "
"after the variable name, followed by the type."
msgstr ""
"ການລະບຸປະເພດແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``:`` (colon) ຕາມຫຼັງຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລ້ວຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1071
msgid ""
"If the variable is initialized within the declaration, the type can be "
"inferred, so it's possible to omit the type name:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວປ່ຽນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຕອນປະກາດເລີຍ, ລະບົບສາມາດຄາດເດົາປະເພດ (inferred type) ໄດ້ເອ"
"ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດເວັ້ນຊື່ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1079
msgid ""
"Type inference is only possible if the assigned value has a defined type, "
"otherwise it will raise an error."
msgstr ""
"ການຄາດເດົາປະເພດຈະເຮັດໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີປະເພດທີ່ຊັດເຈນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1082
msgid "Valid types are:"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ແມ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1084
msgid "Built-in types (Array, Vector2, int, String, etc.)."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ (Array, Vector2, int, String, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1085
msgid "Engine classes (Node, Resource, RefCounted, etc.)."
msgstr "ຄລາສຂອງເອນຈິນ (Node, Resource, RefCounted, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1086
msgid ""
"Constant names if they contain a script resource (``MyScript`` if you "
"declared ``const MyScript = preload(\"res://my_script.gd\")``)."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ຖ້າມັນເກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນສະຄຣິບ (ເຊັ່ນ ``MyScript`` ຖ້າທ່ານປະກາດ ``const MyScript = "
"preload(\"res://my_script.gd\")``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1087
msgid ""
"Other classes in the same script, respecting scope "
"(``InnerClass.NestedClass`` if you declared ``class NestedClass`` inside the "
"``class InnerClass`` in the same scope)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສອື່ນໆໃນສະຄຣິບດຽວກັນ, ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຕາມຂອບເຂດ (scope) (ເຊັ່ນ "
"``InnerClass.NestedClass`` ຖ້າທ່ານປະກາດ ``class NestedClass`` ໄວ້ໃນ ``class "
"InnerClass``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1088
msgid "Script classes declared with the ``class_name`` keyword."
msgstr "ຄລາສສະຄຣິບທີ່ປະກາດດ້ວຍຄຳສຳຄັນ ``class_name``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1089
msgid "Autoloads registered as singletons."
msgstr "Autoloads ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ singletons."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1093
msgid ""
"While ``Variant`` is a valid type specification, it's not an actual type. It "
"only means there's no set type and is equivalent to not having a static type "
"at all. Therefore, inference is not allowed by default for ``Variant``, "
"since it's likely a mistake."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າ ``Variant`` ຈະສາມາດລະບຸເປັນປະເພດໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ. ມັນພຽງແຕ່ໝາຍຄວາມ"
"ວ່າບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດປະເພດທີ່ຕາຍຕົວ ແລະ ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ static type ເລີຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້"
"ວລະບົບຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄາດເດົາປະເພດເປັນ ``Variant`` ເພາະອາດເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1098
msgid ""
"You can turn off this check, or make it only a warning, by changing it in "
"the project settings. See :ref:`doc_gdscript_warning_system` for details."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການກວດສອບນີ້ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນພຽງແຕ່ຄຳເຕືອນໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_gdscript_warning_system`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1102
msgid "Initialization order"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Initialization order)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1104
msgid "Member variables are initialized in the following order:"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1106
msgid ""
"Depending on the variable's static type, the variable is either ``null`` "
"(untyped variables and objects) or has a default value of the type (``0`` "
"for ``int``, ``false`` for ``bool``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ static type ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ, ຕົວປ່ຽນຈະເປັນ ``null`` (ສຳລັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸປະເພດ ແລະ ວັດ"
"ຖຸ) ຫຼື ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕາມປະເພດນັ້ນໆ (ເຊັ່ນ ``0`` ສຳລັບ ``int``, ``false`` ສຳລັບ ``bool``, ແລ"
"ະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1109
msgid ""
"The specified values are assigned in the order of the variables in the "
"script, from top to bottom."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຈະຖືກກຳນົດຕາມລຳດັບຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນໃນສະຄຣິບ, ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1112
msgid ""
"(Only for ``Node``-derived classes) If the ``@onready`` annotation is "
"applied to a variable, its initialization is deferred to step 5."
msgstr ""
"(ສະເພາະຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ ``Node``) ຖ້າໃຊ້ annotation ``@onready`` ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ, ການເລີ່ມ"
"ຕົ້ນຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະຖືກເລື່ອນໄປຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 5."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1115
msgid "If defined, the ``_init()`` method is called."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດໄວ້, ເມັດທອດ ``_init()`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1116
msgid ""
"When instantiating scenes and resources, the exported values are assigned."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ instance ຂອງສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ຄ່າທີ່ export ໄວ້ຈະຖືກກຳນົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1117
msgid ""
"(Only for ``Node``-derived classes) ``@onready`` variables are initialized."
msgstr ""
"(ສະເພາະຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ ``Node``) ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເປັນ ``@onready`` ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1118
msgid ""
"(Only for ``Node``-derived classes) If defined, the ``_ready()`` method is "
"called."
msgstr ""
"(ສະເພາະຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ ``Node``) ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດໄວ້, ເມັດທອດ ``_ready()`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1122
msgid ""
"You can specify a complex expression as a variable initializer, including "
"function calls. Make sure the variables are initialized in the correct "
"order, otherwise your values may be overwritten. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ນິພົດທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນໄດ້, ລວມທັງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ. ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າຕົ"
"ວປ່ຽນຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄ່າຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1140
msgid "Will print:"
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງຜົນ (print):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1148
msgid ""
"To fix this, move the ``_data`` variable definition above the ``a`` "
"definition or remove the empty dictionary assignment (``= {}``)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນ ``_data`` ໄປໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງການປະກາດ ``a`` ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກກາ"
"ນກຳນົດຄ່າ dictionary ວ່າງ (``= {}``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1154
msgid "Static variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະແຕຕິກ (Static variables)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1156
msgid "A class member variable can be declared static:"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາສສາມາດປະກາດເປັນ static ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1162
msgid ""
"Static variables belong to the class, not instances. This means that static "
"variables share values between multiple instances, unlike regular member "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ static ເປັນຂອງຄລາສ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ instance. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວປ່ຽນ static ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າຮ່ວມກັນ "
"ລະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໆ instances, ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກທົ່ວໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1165
msgid ""
"From inside a class, you can access static variables from any function, both "
"static and non-static. From outside the class, you can access static "
"variables using the class or an instance (the second is not recommended as "
"it is less readable)."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກພາຍໃນຄລາສ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນ static ໄດ້ຈາກຟັງຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້, ທັງແບບ static ແລະ "
"non-static. ສ່ວນພາຍນອກຄລາສ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຄລາສ ຫຼື ຜ່ານ instance (ແຕ່ແບບທີສ"
"ອງບໍ່ແນະນຳເພາະອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈຍາກກວ່າ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1171
msgid ""
"The ``@export`` and ``@onready`` annotations cannot be applied to a static "
"variable. Local variables cannot be static."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ annotation ``@export`` ແລະ ``@onready`` ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ static ໄດ້. ແລະ ຕົວປ່ຽນ"
"ພາຍໃນຟັງຊັນ (local variables) ກໍບໍ່ສາມາດເປັນ static ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1174
msgid ""
"The following example defines a ``Person`` class with a static variable "
"named ``max_id``. We increment the ``max_id`` in the ``_init()`` function. "
"This makes it easy to keep track of the number of ``Person`` instances in "
"our game."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄລາສ ``Person`` ທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນ static ຊື່ວ່າ ``max_id``. ພວກເຮົາຈະເພີ່ມຄ່າ "
"``max_id`` ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``_init()``. ວິທີນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມຈຳນວນ instance ຂອງ ``Person`` ໃນເ"
"ກມໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1193
msgid ""
"In this code, we create two instances of our ``Person`` class and check that "
"the class and every instance have the same ``max_id`` value, because the "
"variable is static and accessible to every instance."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຄ້ດນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສ້າງສອງ instances ຂອງຄລາສ ``Person`` ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າ ທັງຄລາສ ແລະ ແຕ່ລ"
"ະ instance ມີຄ່າ ``max_id`` ຄືກັນ, ເພາະມັນເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນ static ທີ່ທຸກ instance ເຂົ້າເຖິງຮ່ວມກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1212
msgid "Static variables can have type hints, setters and getters:"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ static ສາມາດລະບຸປະເພດ (type hints) ແລະ ໃຊ້ setter/getter ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1224
msgid "A base class static variable can also be accessed via a child class:"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ static ຂອງຄລາສພື້ນຖານ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານຄລາສລູກໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1243
msgid ""
"When referencing a static variable from a tool script, the other script "
"containing the static variable **must** also be a tool script. "
"See :ref:`Running code in the editor "
"<doc_running_code_in_the_editor_important_information>` for details."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນ static ຈາກ tool script, ສະຄຣິບອື່ນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນ static ນັ້ນ **ຕ້ອ"
"ງ** ເປັນ tool script ຄືກັນ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ :ref:`Running code in the editor "
"<doc_running_code_in_the_editor_important_information>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1249
msgid "``@static_unload`` annotation"
msgstr "annotation ``@static_unload``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1251
msgid ""
"Since GDScript classes are resources, having static variables in a script "
"prevents it from being unloaded even if there are no more instances of that "
"class and no other references left. This can be important if static "
"variables store large amounts of data or hold references to other project "
"resources, such as scenes. You should clean up this data manually, or use "
"the :ref:`@static_unload <class_@GDScript_annotation_@static_unload>` "
"annotation if static variables don't store important data and can be reset."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄລາສ GDScript ແມ່ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resources), ການມີຕົວປ່ຽນ static ໃນສະຄຣິບ ຈະເຮັດ"
"ໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບນັ້ນບໍ່ຖືກຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ (unloaded) ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີ instance ຫຼື ການອ້າງອີງອື່ນເຫຼືອຢູ່ແລ້ວກໍຕ"
"າມ. ເລື່ອງນີ້ອາດສຳຄັນຖ້າຕົວປ່ຽນ static ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ສາ"
"ກ. ທ່ານຄວນລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ annotation :ref:`@static_unload "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@static_unload>` ຖ້າຕົວປ່ຽນ static ບໍ່ໄດ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນ ແລ"
"ະ ສາມາດຣີເຊັດ (reset) ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1259
msgid ""
"Currently, due to a bug, scripts are never freed, even if ``@static_unload`` "
"annotation is used."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມີບັກ (bug), ສະຄຣິບຈຶ່ງບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freed) ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ "
"annotation ``@static_unload`` ກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1261
msgid ""
"Note that ``@static_unload`` applies to the entire script (including inner "
"classes) and must be placed at the top of the script, before ``class_name`` "
"and ``extends``:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າ ``@static_unload`` ຈະມີຜົນກັບສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດ (ລວມທັງ inner classes) ແລະ ຕ້ອງວາ"
"ງໄວ້ສ່ວນເທິງສຸດຂອງສະຄຣິບ, ກ່ອນຄຳສັ່ງ ``class_name`` ແລະ ``extends``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1270
msgid "See also `Static functions`_ and `Static constructor`_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ `Static functions`_ ແລະ `Static constructor`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1273
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:149
msgid "Casting"
msgstr "ການແປງປະເພດ (Casting)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1275
msgid ""
"Values assigned to typed variables must have a compatible type. If it's "
"needed to coerce a value to be of a certain type, in particular for object "
"types, you can use the casting operator ``as``."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ລະບຸປະເພດ ຈະຕ້ອງມີປະເພດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງບັງຄັບຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນປະເພດໃດໜຶ່"
"ງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະປະເພດວັດຖຸ (object types), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການແປງປະເພດ ``as`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1279
msgid ""
"Casting between object types results in the same object if the value is of "
"the same type or a subtype of the cast type."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງປະເພດລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸ ຈະໄດ້ວັດຖຸເດີມ ຖ້າຄ່ານັ້ນເປັນປະເພດດຽວກັນ ຫຼື ເປັນປະເພດຍ່ອຍ (subtype) ຂ"
"ອງປະເພດທີ່ຕ້ອງການແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1287
msgid ""
"If the value is not a subtype, the casting operation will result in a "
"``null`` value."
msgstr "ຖ້າຄ່ານັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນປະເພດຍ່ອຍ, ຜົນຂອງການແປງປະເພດຈະອອກມາເປັນ ``null``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1294
msgid ""
"For built-in types, they will be forcibly converted if possible, otherwise "
"the engine will raise an error."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ (built-in types), ພວກມັນຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍບັງຄັບຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເອນຈິນ"
"ຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1303
msgid ""
"Casting is also useful to have better type-safe variables when interacting "
"with the scene tree:"
msgstr ""
"ການແປງປະເພດຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນມີຄວາມປອດໄພທາງປະເພດ (type-safe) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເມື່ອມີກ"
"ານໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ scene tree:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1315
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:661
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:36
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/how_to_read_the_godot_api.rst:129
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:361
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shaders_style_guide.rst:332
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:117
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (Constants)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1317
msgid ""
"Constants are values you cannot change when the game is running. Their value "
"must be known at compile-time. Using the ``const`` keyword allows you to "
"give a constant value a name. Trying to assign a value to a constant after "
"it's declared will give you an error."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ຄ່າຂອງມັນຕ້ອງເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຕອນ "
"compile-time. ການໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ ``const`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນັ້ນໆ. ຫາກພະຍາຍາມກຳນົ"
"ດຄ່າໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ປະກາດໄປແລ້ວ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1322
msgid "We recommend using constants whenever a value is not meant to change."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຄ່ານັ້ນບໍ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1335
msgid ""
"Although the type of constants is inferred from the assigned value, it's "
"also possible to add explicit type specification:"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າປະເພດຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈະຖືກຄາດເດົາຈາກຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານກໍຍັງສາມາດ ລະບຸປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນໄດ້ຄື"
"ກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1343
msgid "Assigning a value of an incompatible type will raise an error."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີປະເພດບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1345
msgid ""
"You can also create constants inside a function, which is useful to name "
"local magic values."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ພາຍໃນຟັງຊັນໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບ ຄ່າສະເພາະ (magic "
"values) ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1349
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_interface_json_file.rst:132
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "Enums (ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນແບບລະບຸຄ່າ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1351
msgid ""
"Enums are basically a shorthand for constants, and are pretty useful if you "
"want to assign consecutive integers to some constant."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ Enums ແມ່ນວິທີຂຽນຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່, ແລະ ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດເລກຖ້ວນ"
"ທີ່ລຽງລໍາດັບກັນໃຫ້ກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1365
msgid ""
"If you pass a name to the enum, it will put all the keys inside a "
"constant :ref:`Dictionary <class_Dictionary>` of that name. This means all "
"constant methods of a dictionary can also be used with a named enum. This "
"only works for GDScript enums, not for enums from built-in classes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບ enum, ມັນຈະເອົາ keys ທັງໝົດໄປໄວ້ໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ :ref:`Dictionary "
"<class_Dictionary>` ຕາມຊື່ນັ້ນ. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເມັດທອດຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງ dictionary ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ກັ"
"ບ enum ທີ່ມີຊື່ໄດ້. ແຕ່ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ enum ຂອງ GDScript ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງ enum ຈາກຄລ"
"າສພື້ນຖານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1370
msgid ""
"Keys in a named enum are not registered as global constants. They should be "
"accessed prefixed by the enum's name (``Name.KEY``)."
msgstr ""
"Keys ໃນ enum ທີ່ມີຊື່ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທົ່ວໂລກ (global constants). ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງພວ"
"ກມັນໂດຍການໃສ່ຊື່ enum ທາງໜ້າ (``Name.KEY``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1393
msgid ""
"If not assigning a value to a key of an enum it will be assigned the "
"previous value plus one, or ``0`` if it is the first entry in the enum. "
"Multiple keys with the same value are allowed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ key ຂອງ enum, ມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄ່າຈາກລຳດັບກ່ອນໜ້າບວກໜຶ່ງ, ຫຼື ເປັນ ``0`` ຖ້າມັນເປັ"
"ນລາຍການທຳອິດ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍ keys ທີ່ມີຄ່າດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1398
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:655
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:662
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_interface_json_file.rst:263
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ (Functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1400
msgid ""
"Functions always belong to a `class <Classes_>`_. The scope priority for "
"variable look-up is: local → class member → global. The ``self`` variable is "
"always available and is provided as an option for accessing class members "
"(see `self`_), but is not always required (and should *not* be sent as the "
"function's first argument, unlike Python)."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນຈະຕ້ອງເປັນຂອງ `ຄລາສ (class) <Classes_>`_ ສະເໝີ. ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງຂອບເຂດໃນການຊອ"
"ກຫາຕົວປ່ຽນຄື: ຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນ (local) → ສະມາຊິກຄລາສ (class member) → ຕົວປ່ຽນທົ່ວໂລກ "
"(global). ຕົວປ່ຽນ ``self`` ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ ເພື່ອເປັນທາງເລືອກໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາ"
"ສ (ເບິ່ງ `self`_), ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕະຫຼອດ (ແລະ *ບໍ່ຄວນ* ສົ່ງມັນເປັນພາລາມິເຕີທຳອິດຂອງຟັງຊັນ ຄືກັບ"
"ໃນພາສາ Python)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1413
msgid ""
"A function can ``return`` at any point. The default return value is ``null``."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ (``return``) ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ຄ່າສົ່ງກັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``null``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1415
msgid ""
"By default, all function parameters are required. You can make one or more "
"parameters at the end optional by assigning a default value to them:"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດຂອງຟັງຊັນແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີ ໂຕທ້າຍໆ ເປັນພ"
"າລາມິເຕີທາງເລືອກໄດ້ ໂດຍການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ພວກມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1429
msgid ""
"If a function contains only one line of code, it can be written on one line:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຟັງຊັນມີໂຄ້ດພຽງແຖວດຽວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນລວມກັນໃນແຖວດຽວໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1439
msgid ""
"Functions can also have type specification for the arguments and for the "
"return value. Types for arguments can be added in a similar way to variables:"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນຍັງສາມາດລະບຸປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີ ແລະ ຄ່າສົ່ງກັບໄດ້. ການລະບຸປະເພດຂອງພາລາມິເຕີແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້"
"ຄືກັນກັບການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1447
msgid ""
"If a function argument has a default value, it's possible to infer the type:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າພາລາມິເຕີຂອງຟັງຊັນມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລະບົບສາມາດຄາດເດົາປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1454
msgid ""
"The return type of the function can be specified after the arguments list "
"using the arrow token (``->``):"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງຄ່າສົ່ງກັບຈາກຟັງຊັນ ສາມາດລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກລາຍການພາລາມິເຕີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລູກສອນ (``->``)"
":"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1462
msgid ""
"Functions that have a return type **must** return a proper value. Setting "
"the type as ``void`` means the function doesn't return anything. Void "
"functions can return early with the ``return`` keyword, but they can't "
"return any value."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີການລະບຸປະເພດຄ່າສົ່ງກັບ **ຕ້ອງ** ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບໄປສະເໝີ. ການຕັ້ງປະເພດເປັນ ``void`` ໝາ"
"ຍຄວາມວ່າຟັງຊັນນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງຄ່າໃດໆກັບໄປ. ຟັງຊັນແບບ void ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ ``return`` ເພື່ອຢຸດການເຮັ"
"ດວຽກກ່ອນກຳນົດໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າໃດໆອອກມາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1471
msgid ""
"Non-void functions must **always** return a value, so if your code has "
"branching statements (such as an ``if``/``else`` construct), all the "
"possible paths must have a return. E.g., if you have a ``return`` inside an "
"``if`` block but not after it, the editor will raise an error because if the "
"block is not executed, the function won't have a valid value to return."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ void ຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ **ສະເໝີ**, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຖ້າໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານມີການແຍກເງື່ອນໄຂ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂຄງສ້າ"
"ງ ``if``/``else``), ທຸກໆເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຕ້ອງມີການ return. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານມີ "
"``return`` ພາຍໃນບລັອກ ``if`` ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີ return ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເພາະຖ້າເງື່ອນ"
"ໄຂບໍ່ເປັນຈິງ, ຟັງຊັນຈະບໍ່ມີຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຈະສົ່ງກັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1479
msgid "Referencing functions"
msgstr "ການອ້າງອີງຟັງຊັນ (Referencing functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1481
msgid ""
"Functions are first-class values in terms of the :ref:`Callable "
"<class_Callable>` object. Referencing a function by name without calling it "
"will automatically generate the proper callable. This can be used to pass "
"functions as arguments."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຄ່າລະດັບເຟີສຄລາສ (first-class values) ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງວັດຖຸ :ref:`Callable "
"<class_Callable>`. ການອ້າງອີງເຖິງຟັງຊັນດ້ວຍຊື່ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ (ບໍ່ມີວົງເລັບ) ຈະສ້າງ callable ທີ່"
"ເໝາະສົມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຟັງຊັນເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນອື່ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1503
msgid ""
"Callables **must** be called with the :ref:`call() "
"<class_Callable_method_call>` method. You cannot use the ``()`` operator "
"directly. This behavior is implemented to avoid performance issues on direct "
"function calls."
msgstr ""
"Callable **ຕ້ອງ** ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຜ່ານເມັດທອດ :ref:`call() <class_Callable_method_call>"
"`. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``()`` ໂດຍກົງໄດ້. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງ ບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1508
msgid "Lambda functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນແລມດາ (Lambda functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1510
msgid ""
"Lambda functions allow you to declare functions that do not belong to a "
"class. Instead, a :ref:`Callable <class_Callable>` object is created and "
"assigned to a variable directly. This can be useful to create callables to "
"pass around without polluting the class scope."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນແລມດາ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປະກາດຟັງຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບຄລາສໃດໆ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະສ້າງວັດຖຸ "
":ref:`Callable <class_Callable>` ຂຶ້ນມາ ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນໂດຍກົງ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າ"
"ງ callable ເພື່ອສົ່ງໄປໃຊ້ງານ ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບເຂດຂອງຄລາສ (class scope) ຫຍຸ້ງເຫຍີງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1519
msgid ""
"To call the created lambda you can use the :ref:`call() "
"<class_Callable_method_call>` method:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແລມດາທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເມັດທອດ :ref:`call() "
"<class_Callable_method_call>` ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1525
msgid ""
"Lambda functions can be named for debugging purposes (the name is displayed "
"in the Debugger):"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນແລມດາສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໄດ້ເພື່ອປະໂຫຍດໃນການດີບັກ (debugging) (ຊື່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ Debugger):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1532
msgid ""
"You can specify type hints for lambda functions in the same way as for "
"regular ones:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸປະເພດ (type hints) ໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນແລມດາໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບຟັງຊັນປົກກະຕິ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1539
msgid ""
"Note that if you want to return a value from a lambda function, an explicit "
"``return`` is required (you can't omit ``return``):"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຈາກຟັງຊັນແລມດາ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນ ``return`` ໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນ (ບໍ່ສາມ"
"າດເວັ້ນ ``return`` ໄດ້):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1547
msgid "Lambda functions capture the local environment:"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນແລມດາສາມາດດຶງເອົາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local environment) ມາໃຊ້ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1558
msgid ""
"Local variables are captured by value once, when the lambda is created. So "
"they won't be updated in the lambda if reassigned in the outer function:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະຖືກເກັບຄ່າ (capture) ໄວ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນທີ່ສ້າງແລມດາ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເດດໃນແລມດ"
"າ ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ໃນຟັງຊັນພາຍນອກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1569
msgid ""
"Also, a lambda cannot reassign an outer local variable. After exiting the "
"lambda, the variable will be unchanged, because the lambda capture "
"implicitly shadows it:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ແລມດາບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນພາຍນອກໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກອອກຈາກແລມດາແລ້ວ, ຕົວປ່ຽ"
"ນຈະຄືເກົ່າ ເພາະການ capture ຂອງແລມດາຈະບັງ (shadow) ຄ່າເດີມໄວ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1582
msgid ""
"However, if you use pass-by-reference data types (arrays, dictionaries, and "
"objects), then the content changes are shared until you reassign the "
"variable:"
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າແບບອ້າງອີງ (arrays, dictionaries, ແລະ objects), "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນຂ້າງໃນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1597
msgid "Static functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສະແຕຕິກ (Static functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1599
msgid ""
"A function can be declared static. When a function is static, it has no "
"access to the instance member variables or ``self``. A static function has "
"access to static variables. Also static functions are useful to make "
"libraries of helper functions:"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນສາມາດປະກາດເປັນ static ໄດ້. ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນເປັນ static, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂ"
"ອງ instance ຫຼື ``self`` ໄດ້. ແຕ່ຟັງຊັນ static ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນ static ໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ "
"ຟັງຊັນ static ຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງຫ້ອງສະໝຸດຂອງຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (helper functions):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1607
msgid "Lambda functions cannot be declared static."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນແລມດາບໍ່ສາມາດປະກາດເປັນ static ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1609
msgid "See also `Static variables`_ and `Static constructor`_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ `Static variables`_ ແລະ `Static constructor`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1612
msgid "Variadic functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນວາຣີອາດິກ (Variadic functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1614
msgid ""
"A variadic function is a function that can take a variable number of "
"arguments. Since Godot 4.5, GDScript supports variadic functions. To declare "
"a variadic function, you need to use the *rest parameter*, which collects "
"all the excess arguments into an array."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນວາຣີອາດິກ ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ສາມາດຮັບພາລາມິເຕີໃນຈຳນວນທີ່ບໍ່ແນ່ນອນໄດ້. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.5 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, "
"GDScript ໄດ້ຮອງຮັບຟັງຊັນວາຣີອາດິກ. ໃນການປະກາດຟັງຊັນປະເພດນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ *rest parameter* "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະລວບລວມພາລາມິເຕີສ່ວນເກີນທັງໝົດ ໄວ້ໃນ array ດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1630
msgid ""
"A function can have at most one rest parameter, which must be the last one "
"in the parameter list. The rest parameter cannot have a default value. "
"Static and lambda functions can also be variadic."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນໜຶ່ງສາມາດມີ rest parameter ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໂຕສຸດທ້າຍໃນລາຍການ. "
"rest parameter ບໍ່ສາມາດມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້. ທັງຟັງຊັນ static ແລະ ແລມດາ ກໍສາມາດເປັນວາຣີອາດິກໄດ້ຄືກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1633
msgid ""
"Static typing works for variadic functions too. However, typed arrays are "
"currently not supported as a static type of the rest parameter:"
msgstr ""
"ການລະບຸປະເພດແບບສະແຕຕິກ (Static typing) ກໍໃຊ້ງານກັບຟັງຊັນວາຣີອາດິກໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັ"
"ດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ typed arrays ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນປະເພດຂອງ rest parameter:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1648
msgid ""
"Although you can declare functions as variadic using the rest parameter, "
"unpacking parameters when calling a function using *spread syntax* that "
"exists in some languages ​​(JavaScript, PHP) is currently not supported in "
"GDScript. However, you can use ``callv()`` to call a function with an array "
"of arguments:"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າທ່ານຈະສາມາດປະກາດຟັງຊັນເປັນວາຣີອາດິກໄດ້, ແຕ່ການແຍກພາລາມິເຕີ (unpacking) ໃນຕອນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັ"
"ງຊັນໂດຍໃຊ້ *spread syntax* ຄືໃນບາງພາສາ (JavaScript, PHP) ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"GDScript. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ``callv()`` ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ດ້ວຍ array ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ"
"ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1670
msgid "Abstract functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນນາມມະທຳ (Abstract functions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1672
msgid "See `Abstract classes and methods`_."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທີ່ `Abstract classes and methods`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1675
msgid "Statements and control flow"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ການຄວບຄຸມທິດທາງ (Statements and control flow)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1677
msgid ""
"Statements are standard and can be assignments, function calls, control flow "
"structures, etc (see below). ``;`` as a statement separator is entirely "
"optional."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນເປັນໄປຕາມມາດຕະຖານ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງການກຳນົດຄ່າ, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ, ໂຄງສ້າງຄວບຄຸມທິ"
"ດທາງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ). ການໃຊ້ ``;`` ເພື່ອແຍກຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມສະໝັກໃຈ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1682
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "ນິພົດ (Expressions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1684
msgid ""
"Expressions are sequences of operators and their operands in orderly "
"fashion. An expression by itself can be a statement too, though only calls "
"are reasonable to use as statements since other expressions don't have side "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດ ແມ່ນລຳດັບຂອງຕົວດຳເນີນການ (operators) ແລະ ຕົວຖືກດຳເນີນການ (operands) ທີ່ຮຽງກັນຢ່າງມີລະ"
"ບຽບ. ນິພົດຕົວມັນເອງກໍສາມາດເປັນຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້, ແຕ່ມີພຽງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ (calls) ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນຄ"
"ຳສັ່ງ ເພາະນິພົດອື່ນໆ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງ (side effects) ໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1687
msgid ""
"Expressions return values that can be assigned to valid targets. Operands to "
"some operator can be another expression. An assignment is not an expression "
"and thus does not return any value."
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນໄດ້. ຕົວຖືກດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງ ກໍອາດຈະເປັນນິພົດອື່ນໄດ້ອີ"
"ກ. ການກຳນົດຄ່າ (assignment) ບໍ່ຖືວ່າເປັນນິພົດ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີຄ່າສົ່ງກັບອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1690
msgid "Here are some examples of expressions:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງນິພົດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1708
msgid ""
"Identifiers, attributes, and subscripts are valid assignment targets. Other "
"expressions cannot be on the left side of an assignment."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ (Identifiers), ຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attributes), ແລະ ຕົວລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງ (subscripts) ແມ່ນເ"
"ປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ນິພົດອື່ນໆ ບໍ່ສາມາດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1714
msgid ""
"``self`` can be used to refer to the current instance and is often "
"equivalent to directly referring to symbols available in the current script. "
"However, ``self`` also allows you to access properties, methods, and other "
"names that are defined dynamically (i.e. are expected to exist in subtypes "
"of the current class, or are provided using :ref:`_set() "
"<class_Object_private_method__set>` and/or :ref:`_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`)."
msgstr ""
"``self`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງ instance ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ມັກຈະມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການອ້າງອີງ ເຖິງສັນຍະລັກ"
"ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນສະຄຣິບປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍກົງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ``self`` ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງ ຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເມັດທອດ, ແລ"
"ະ ຊື່ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດແບບໄດນາມິກ (ເຊັ່ນ ສິ່ງທີ່ຄາດວ່າມີໃນປະເພດຍ່ອຍ ຫຼື ຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ :ref:`_set() "
"<class_Object_private_method__set>` ແລະ/ຫຼື :ref:`_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1738
msgid ""
"Beware that accessing members of child classes in the base class is often "
"considered a bad practice, because this blurs the area of responsibility of "
"any given piece of code, making the overall relationship between parts of "
"your game harder to reason about. Besides that, one can simply forget that "
"the parent class had some expectations about it's descendants."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນລະວັງວ່າ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາສລູກຈາກພາຍໃນຄລາສພື້ນຖານ ມັກຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນວິທີທີ່ບໍ່ດີ, ເພາະມັນ"
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບເຂດຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຂອງໂຄ້ດບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການວິເຄາະຄວາມສຳພັນ ລະຫວ່າງພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ"
"ຂອງເກມເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກຂຶ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຫຼົງລືມໄປວ່າ ຄລາສແມ່ໄດ້ມີການຄາດຫວັງບາງຢ່າງໄວ້ກັບຄລາສ"
"ລູກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1745
msgid "if/else/elif"
msgstr "if/else/elif (ການກວດສອບເງື່ອນໄຂ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1747
msgid ""
"Simple conditions are created by using the ``if``/``else``/``elif`` syntax. "
"Parenthesis around conditions are allowed, but not required. Given the "
"nature of the tab-based indentation, ``elif`` can be used instead of "
"``else``/``if`` to maintain a level of indentation."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບເງື່ອນໄຂແບບງ່າຍໆ ແມ່ນສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນ ``if``/``else``/``elif``. ທ່ານສາມາ"
"ດໃສ່ວົງເລັບຄອບເງື່ອນໄຂໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນ. ດ້ວຍຮູບແບບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ Tab, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"``elif`` ແທນ ``else``/``if`` ເພື່ອຮັກສາລະດັບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃຫ້ສວຍງາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1761
msgid "Short statements can be written on the same line as the condition:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງສັ້ນໆ ສາມາດຂຽນລວມໃນແຖວດຽວກັນກັບເງື່ອນໄຂໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1770
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you might want to assign a different initial value based on a "
"boolean expression. In this case, ternary-if expressions come in handy:"
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ໂດຍອີງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂບູລີນ (boolean). ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, "
"ນິພົດ ternary-if ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1778
msgid ""
"Ternary-if expressions can be nested to handle more than 2 cases. When "
"nesting ternary-if expressions, it is recommended to wrap the complete "
"expression over multiple lines to preserve readability:"
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດ Ternary-if ສາມາດຂຽນຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າ 2 ກໍລະນີ. ເມື່ອມີການຂຽນຊ້ອນກັນ, ແນະນຳ"
"ໃຫ້ແຍກນິພົດອອກເປັນຫຼາຍແຖວເພື່ອໃຫ້ອ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1803
msgid ""
"You may also wish to check if a value is contained within something. You can "
"use an ``if`` statement combined with the ``in`` operator to accomplish this:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງ ຢູ່ໃນບາງສິ່ງຫຼືບໍ່. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``if`` ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວດຳເນີນກາ"
"ນ ``in`` ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1818
msgid ""
"Simple loops are created by using ``while`` syntax. Loops can be broken "
"using ``break`` or continued using ``continue`` (which skips to the next "
"iteration of the loop without executing any further code in the current "
"iteration):"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດວຽກແບບວົນຊ້ຳ (loop) ງ່າຍໆ ແມ່ນສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ ``while``. ທ່ານສາມາດຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ "
"loop ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ ``break`` ຫຼື ໃຊ້ ``continue`` (ເຊິ່ງຈະຂ້າມໄປຍັງຮອບຖັດໄປຂອງ loop ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດວຽ"
"ກໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຮອບປັດຈຸບັນ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1830
msgid ""
"To iterate through a range, such as an array or table, a *for* loop is used. "
"When iterating over an array, the current array element is stored in the "
"loop variable. When iterating over a dictionary, the *key* is stored in the "
"loop variable."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອວົນຊ້ຳຜ່ານຂໍ້ມູນເປັນຊຸດ ເຊັ່ນ array ຫຼື ຕາຕະລາງ, ເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ loop ແບບ *for*. ເມື່ອວົນຊ້ຳຜ່ານ "
"array, ອົງປະກອບປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ loop. ແຕ່ຖ້າວົນຊ້ຳຜ່ານ dictionary, *ຄີ (key)* ຈ"
"ະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ loop ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1869
msgid ""
"If you want to assign values on an array as it is being iterated through, it "
"is best to use ``for i in array.size()``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບ array ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງວົນຊ້ຳຢູ່, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໃຊ້ ``for i in "
"array.size()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1878
msgid ""
"The loop variable is local to the for-loop and assigning to it will not "
"change the value on the array. Objects passed by reference (such as nodes) "
"can still be manipulated by calling methods on the loop variable."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ loop ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນຂອງ for-loop ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ມັນຈະບໍ່ ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າໃນ "
"array. ແຕ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າແບບອ້າງອີງ (ເຊັ່ນ nodes) ຍັງສາມາດຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດຜ່ານຕົວປ່"
"ຽນ loop ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1893
msgid ""
"A ``match`` statement is used to branch execution of a program. It's the "
"equivalent of the ``switch`` statement found in many other languages, but "
"offers some additional features."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``match`` ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຍກທິດທາງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣແກຣມ. ມັນທຽບເທົ່າກັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``switch`` ໃ"
"ນຫຼາຍໆພາສາອື່ນ, ແຕ່ມີຟີເຈີເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1898
msgid ""
"``match`` is more type strict than the ``==`` operator. For example ``1`` "
"will **not** match ``1.0``. The only exception is ``String`` vs "
"``StringName`` matching: for example, the String ``\"hello\"`` is considered "
"equal to the StringName ``&\"hello\"``."
msgstr ""
"``match`` ມີການກວດສອບປະເພດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າຕົວດຳເນີນການ ``==``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``1`` ຈະ **ບໍ່** ກົ"
"ງກັບ ``1.0``. ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນພຽງແຕ່ການປຽບທຽບລະຫວ່າງ ``String`` ແລະ ``StringName`` ເຊັ່ນ: "
"String ``\"hello\"`` ຈະຖືວ່າເທົ່າກັບ StringName ``&\"hello\"``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1902
msgid "Basic syntax"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນພື້ນຖານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1914
msgid "Crash-course for people who are familiar with switch statements"
msgstr "ບົດສະຫຼຸບສັ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບຄຳສັ່ງ switch"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1916
msgid "Replace ``switch`` with ``match``."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``switch`` ເປັນ ``match``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1917
msgid "Remove ``case``."
msgstr "ເອົາ ``case`` ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1918
msgid "Remove any ``break``\\ s."
msgstr "ເອົາ ``break`` ທັງໝົດອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1919
msgid "Change ``default`` to a single underscore."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``default`` ເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງອັນດຽວ (``_``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1922
msgid "Control flow"
msgstr "ທິດທາງການເຮັດວຽກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1924
msgid ""
"The patterns are matched from top to bottom. If a pattern matches, the first "
"corresponding block will be executed. After that, the execution continues "
"below the ``match`` statement."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ (patterns) ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ. ຖ້າມີຮູບແບບທີ່ກົງກັນ, ບລັອກທຳອິດທີ່ກົງນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽ"
"ກ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໂປຣແກຣມຈະຂ້າມໄປເຮັດວຽກ ຕໍ່ທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ ``match``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1929
msgid ""
"The special ``continue`` behavior in ``match`` supported in 3.x was removed "
"in Godot 4.0."
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳພິເສດຂອງ ``continue`` ໃນ ``match`` ທີ່ເຄີຍຮອງຮັບໃນເວີຊັນ 3.x ໄດ້ຖືກເອົາອອກໃນ "
"Godot 4.0."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1931
msgid "The following pattern types are available:"
msgstr "ມີຮູບແບບປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1933
msgid "Literal pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (Literal pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1934
msgid "Matches a `literal <Literals_>`_:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ກົງກັບ `ຄ່າລິເທີຣໍ (literal) <Literals_>`_:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1946
msgid "Expression pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບນິພົດ (Expression pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1947
msgid ""
"Matches a constant expression, an identifier, or an attribute access "
"(``A.B``):"
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບໃຫ້ກົງກັບນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່, ຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ຫຼື ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນລັກສະນະ (``A.B``):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1959
msgid "Wildcard pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄວຄາດ (Wildcard pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1960
msgid "This pattern matches everything. It's written as a single underscore."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບນີ້ຈະກົງກັບທຸກໆຢ່າງ. ຂຽນແທນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ (underscore) ອັນດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1962
msgid ""
"It can be used as the equivalent of the ``default`` in a ``switch`` "
"statement in other languages:"
msgstr "ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ ``default`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``switch`` ຂອງພາສາອື່ນໆ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1974
msgid "Binding pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຜູກຕົວປ່ຽນ (Binding pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1975
msgid ""
"A binding pattern introduces a new variable. Like the wildcard pattern, it "
"matches everything - and also gives that value a name. It's especially "
"useful in array and dictionary patterns:"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການຜູກຕົວປ່ຽນ ຈະສ້າງຕົວປ່ຽນໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາ. ມັນຈະກົງກັບທຸກຢ່າງຄືກັບ wildcard ແຕ່ຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບຄ່ານັ້ນນ"
"ຳ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນຮູບແບບ array ແລະ dictionary:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1988
msgid "Array pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Array (Array pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1989
msgid ""
"Matches an array. Every single element of the array pattern is a pattern "
"itself, so you can nest them."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບໃຫ້ກົງກັບ array. ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບພາຍໃນ array ກໍຄືຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດຂຽນຊ້ອນກັນໄ"
"ດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1991
msgid ""
"The length of the array is tested first, it has to be the same size as the "
"pattern, otherwise the pattern doesn't match."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບຈະກວດສອບຄວາມຍາວຂອງ array ກ່ອນ, ມັນຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຖືວ່າບໍ່ກົງກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1993
msgid ""
"**Open-ended array**: An array can be bigger than the pattern by making the "
"last subpattern ``..``."
msgstr ""
"**Array ແບບປາຍເປີດ**: array ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຮູບແບບໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ ``..`` ເປັນຮູບແບບຍ່"
"ອຍສຸດທ້າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:1995
msgid "Every subpattern has to be comma-separated."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຮູບແບບຍ່ອຍຕ້ອງແຍກກັນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2009
msgid "Dictionary pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Dictionary (Dictionary pattern)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2010
msgid ""
"Works in the same way as the array pattern. Every key has to be a constant "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບຮູບແບບ array. ທຸກໆ key ຕ້ອງເປັນຮູບແບບຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2012
msgid ""
"The size of the dictionary is tested first, it has to be the same size as "
"the pattern, otherwise the pattern doesn't match."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ dictionary ຈະຖືກກວດສອບກ່ອນ, ມັນຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບຮູບແບບ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຖືວ່າບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2014
msgid ""
"**Open-ended dictionary**: A dictionary can be bigger than the pattern by "
"making the last subpattern ``..``."
msgstr ""
"**Dictionary ແບບປາຍເປີດ**: dictionary ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຮູບແບບໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"``..`` ເປັນຮູບແບບຍ່ອຍສຸດທ້າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2016
msgid "Every subpattern has to be comma separated."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຮູບແບບຍ່ອຍຕ້ອງແຍກກັນດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2018
msgid ""
"If you don't specify a value, then only the existence of the key is checked."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ລະບຸຄ່າ, ລະບົບຈະກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່ວ່າມີ key ນັ້ນຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2020
msgid "A value pattern is separated from the key pattern with a ``:``."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຂອງຄ່າ (value) ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກຮູບແບບຂອງຄີ (key) ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``:``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2036
msgid "Multiple patterns"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບຮ່ວມກັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2037
msgid ""
"You can also specify multiple patterns separated by a comma. These patterns "
"aren't allowed to have any bindings in them."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຫຼາຍຮູບແບບພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍໝາຍຈຸດ. ແຕ່ຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຜູກຕົວປ່ຽນ "
"(bindings) ຢູ່ຂ້າງໃນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2048
msgid "Pattern guards"
msgstr "ຕົວຄັດກອງຮູບແບບ (Pattern guards)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2050
msgid ""
"A *pattern guard* is an optional condition that follows the pattern list and "
"allows you to make additional checks before choosing a ``match`` branch. "
"Unlike a pattern, a pattern guard can be an arbitrary expression."
msgstr ""
"*Pattern guard* ແມ່ນເງື່ອນໄຂທາງເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງລາຍການຮູບແບບ, ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ ກວດສອບເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ອນທີ່ຈ"
"ະເລືອກສາຂາ (branch) ຂອງ ``match``. Pattern guard ສາມາດເປັນນິພົດໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກຮູບ"
"ແບບທົ່ວໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2054
msgid ""
"Only one branch can be executed per ``match``. Once a branch is chosen, the "
"rest are not checked. If you want to use the same pattern for multiple "
"branches or to prevent choosing a branch with too general pattern, you can "
"specify a pattern guard after the list of patterns with the ``when`` keyword:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຕ່ລະ ``match`` ຈະມີພຽງສາຂາດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກເຮັດວຽກ. ເມື່ອເລືອກສາຂາໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ສາຂາທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະບໍ່"
"ຖືກກວດສອບ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບຫຼາຍສາຂາ ຫຼື ປ້ອງກັນການເລືອກສາຂາທີ່ມີຮູບແບບກວ້າງເກີນໄ"
"ປ, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ pattern guard ຫຼັງຈາກລາຍການຮູບແບບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ ``when``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2074
msgid ""
"If there is no matching pattern for the current branch, the pattern guard is "
"**not** evaluated and the patterns of the next branch are checked."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບທີ່ກົງກັນໃນສາຂາປັດຈຸບັນ, pattern guard ຈະ **ບໍ່** ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ລະບົບຈະຂ້າມໄປກວ"
"ດສອບຮູບແບບໃນສາຂາຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2076
msgid "If a matching pattern is found, the pattern guard is evaluated."
msgstr "ຖ້າພົບຮູບແບບທີ່ກົງກັນ, pattern guard ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2078
msgid ""
"If it's true, then the body of the branch is executed and ``match`` ends."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເງື່ອນໄຂເປັນຈິງ, ສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຂອງສາຂານັ້ນຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ຈົບຄຳສັ່ງ ``match``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2079
msgid "If it's false, then the patterns of the next branch are checked."
msgstr "ຖ້າເງື່ອນໄຂເປັນເທັດ, ລະບົບຈະຂ້າມໄປກວດສອບຮູບແບບໃນສາຂາຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2082
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/debug/objectdb_profiler.rst:95
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "ຄລາດ (Classes)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2084
msgid ""
"By default, all script files are unnamed classes. In this case, you can only "
"reference them using the file's path, using either a relative or an absolute "
"path. For example, if you name a script file ``character.gd``:"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດແມ່ນຄລາດທີ່ບໍ່ມີຊື່. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດ ອ້າງອີງເຖິງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃ"
"ຊ້ຜາດ (path) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຜາດສຳພັດ ຫຼື ຜາດສົມບູນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບວ່"
"າ ``character.gd``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2102
msgid "Registering named classes"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຄລາດທີ່ມີຊື່"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2104
msgid ""
"You can give your class a name to register it as a new type in Godot's "
"editor. For that, you use the ``class_name`` keyword. You can optionally use "
"the ``@icon`` annotation with a path to an image, to use it as an icon. Your "
"class will then appear with its new icon in the editor:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ຄລາດຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນມັນເປັນປະເພດໃໝ່ໃນເອດິເຕີ (editor) ຂອງ Godot. ສຳລັບ"
"ການເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ ``class_name``. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ ``@icon`` ພ້ອມກັບຜາດຂອ"
"ງຮູບພາບເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນໄອຄອນໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນ ຄລາດຂອງເຈົ້າ ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນພ້ອມກັບໄອຄອນໃໝ່ໃນເອດິເຕີ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2121
msgid ""
"SVG images that are used as custom node icons should have the **Editor > "
"Scale With Editor Scale** and **Editor > Convert Icons With Editor "
"Theme** :ref:`import options <doc_importing_images_editor_import_options>` "
"enabled. This allows icons to follow the editor's scale and theming settings "
"if the icons are designed with the same color palette as Godot's own icons."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບ SVG ທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນໄອຄອນໂນດແບບກຳນົດເອງ ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ງານ :ref:`ຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າ "
"<doc_importing_images_editor_import_options>` **Editor > Scale With Editor "
"Scale** ແລະ **Editor > Convert Icons With Editor Theme**. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄອຄອນປັບຕາ"
"ມ ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທິມ (theme) ຂອງເອດິເຕີ ຫາກໄອຄອນນັ້ນຖືກອອກແບບດ້ວຍໂທນສີດຽວກັນກັບໄອຄອນຂ"
"ອງ Godot ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2127
msgid "Here's a class file example:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ຄລາດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2148
msgid "If you want to use ``extends`` too, you can keep both on the same line:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ ``extends`` ນຳ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນທັງສອງໄວ້ໃນແຖວດຽວກັນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2154
msgid ""
"Named classes are globally registered, which means they become available to "
"use in other scripts without the need to ``load`` or ``preload`` them:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ມີຊື່ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນແບບໂກລບອນ (globally), ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນສາມາດ ນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນສະຄຣິບອື່"
"ນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ ``load`` ຫຼື ``preload``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2166
msgid ""
"Godot initializes non-static variables every time you create an instance, "
"and this includes arrays and dictionaries. This is in the spirit of thread "
"safety, since scripts can be initialized in separate threads without the "
"user knowing."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ static ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance), ເຊິ່ງລ"
"ວມເຖິງອາເຣ (arrays) ແລະ ດິກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionaries). ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງເທຣດ "
"(thread safety), ເນື່ອງຈາກສະຄຣິບສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນເທຣດທີ່ແຍກກັນໄດ້ໂດຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຮູ້ຕົວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2172
msgid ""
"The Godot editor will hide these custom classes with names that begin with "
"the prefix \"Editor\" in the 'Create New Node' or 'Create New Scene' dialog "
"windows. The classes are available for instantiation at runtime via their "
"class names, but are automatically hidden by the editor windows along with "
"the built-in editor nodes used by the Godot editor."
msgstr ""
"ເອດິເຕີຂອງ Godot ຈະເຊື່ອງຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ທີ່ມີຊື່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄຳວ່າ \"Editor\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"'Create New Node' ຫຼື 'Create New Scene'. ຄລາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງສາມາດ ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ໃນຕອນລັນ "
"(runtime) ຜ່ານຊື່ຄລາດ, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເອດິເຕີ ພ້ອມກັບໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເ"
"ອດິເຕີຂອງ Godot ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2181
msgid "Abstract classes and methods"
msgstr "ຄລາດ ແລະ ເມທອດນາມມະທຳ (Abstract classes and methods)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2183
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.5, you can define abstract classes and methods using the "
"``@abstract`` annotation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.5 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄລາດ ແລະ ເມທອດນາມມະທຳໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ "
"(annotation) ``@abstract``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2186
msgid ""
"An abstract class is a class that cannot be instantiated directly. Instead, "
"it is meant to be inherited by other classes. Attempting to instantiate an "
"abstract class will result in an error."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດນາມມະທຳ (Abstract class) ຄືຄລາດທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ແຕ່ມັນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄລາດ"
"ອື່ນມາສືບທອດ (inherit). ການພະຍາຍາມສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈາກຄລາດນາມມະທຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2190
msgid ""
"An abstract method is a method that has no implementation. Therefore, a "
"newline or a semicolon is expected after the function header. This defines a "
"contract that inheriting classes must conform to, because the method "
"signature must be compatible when overriding."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນາມມະທຳ (Abstract method) ຄືເມທອດທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງພາຍໃນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງມີການຂຶ້ນແຖວ"
"ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ semicolon ຫຼັງຈາກສ່ວນຫົວຂອງຟັງຊັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນການກຳນົດຂໍ້ຕົກລົງທີ່ຄລາດສືບທອດຕ້ອງປະຕິບັ"
"ດຕາມ, ເພາະວ່າ ຮູບແບບຂອງເມທອດ (method signature) ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເມື່ອມີການ override."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2195
msgid ""
"Inheriting classes must either provide implementations for all abstract "
"methods, or the inheriting class must be marked as abstract. If a class has "
"at least one abstract method (either its own or an unimplemented inherited "
"one), then it must also be marked as abstract. However, the reverse is not "
"true: an abstract class is allowed to have no abstract methods."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດໄປນັ້ນ ຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງ (implement) ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໆເມທອດນາມມະທຳ, ຫຼື ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຄລາດທີ່ສືບທ"
"ອດກໍຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນນາມມະທຳຄືກັນ. ຖ້າຄລາດໃດໜຶ່ງ ມີເມທອດນາມມະທຳຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເມທອດ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຂ"
"ອງມັນເອງ ຫຼື ສືບທອດມາແລ້ວຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງ), ຄລາດນັ້ນກໍຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ abstract ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ແນວໃ"
"ດກໍຕາມ, ໃນທາງກັບກັນ ຄລາດນາມມະທຳອາດຈະບໍ່ມີເມທອດນາມມະທຳເລີຍກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2203
msgid ""
"If you want to declare a method as optional to be overridden, you should use "
"a non-abstract method and provide a default implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປະກາດເມທອດທີ່ໃຫ້ເລືອກ override ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ ເມທອດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ abstract ແ"
"ລະ ຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້ໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2206
msgid ""
"For example, you could have an abstract class called ``Shape`` that defines "
"an abstract method called ``draw()``. You can then create subclasses like "
"``Circle`` and ``Square`` that implement the ``draw()`` method in their own "
"way. This allows you to define a common *interface* for all shapes without "
"having to implement all the details in the abstract class itself:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະມີຄລາດນາມມະທຳຊື່ວ່າ ``Shape`` ທີ່ກຳນົດເມທອດນາມມະທຳຊື່ວ່າ ``draw()``. ຈາກ"
"ນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຄລາດຍ່ອຍ (subclasses) ເຊັ່ນ ``Circle`` ແລະ ``Square`` ທີ່ຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງໃນເມ"
"ທອດ ``draw()`` ຕາມແບບຂອງພວກມັນເອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດ *ອິນເຕີເຟດ (interface)* ຮ່ວມກັນ"
"ສຳລັບທຸກໆຮູບຊົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນລາຍລະອຽດທັງໝົດ ໄວ້ໃນຄລາດນາມມະທຳເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2227
msgid ""
"Both inner classes and classes created using ``class_name`` can be abstract. "
"This example creates two abstract classes, one of which is a subclass of "
"another abstract class:"
msgstr ""
"ທັງຄລາດພາຍໃນ (inner classes) ແລະ ຄລາດທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ ``class_name`` ສາມາດເປັນ abstract "
"ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສ້າງຄລາດນາມມະທຳສອງຄລາດ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄລາດໜຶ່ງເປັນຄລາດຍ່ອຍຂອງອີກຄລາດນາມມະທຳໜຶ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2250
msgid ""
"Since an abstract class cannot be instantiated, it is not possible to attach "
"an abstract class to a node. If you attempt to do so, the engine will print "
"an error when running the scene:"
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄລາດນາມມະທຳບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເອົາໄປແນບ (attach) ໃສ່ກັບໂນດໄ"
"ດ້. ຖ້າເຈົ້າພະຍາຍາມເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ເອັນຈິນ (engine) ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເມື່ອລັນສາກ (scene):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2258
msgid ""
"Unnamed classes can also be defined as abstract, the ``@abstract`` "
"annotation must precede ``extends``:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ບໍ່ມີຊື່ກໍສາມາດກຳນົດເປັນ abstract ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ໂດຍແອນໂນເທຊັນ ``@abstract`` ຕ້ອງຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້າ "
"``extends``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2267
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/how_to_read_the_godot_api.rst:13
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cross_language_scripting.rst:254
msgid "Inheritance"
msgstr "ການສືບທອດ (Inheritance)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2269
msgid "A class (stored as a file) can inherit from:"
msgstr "ຄລາດ (ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌) ສາມາດສືບທອດມາຈາກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2271
msgid "A global class."
msgstr "ຄລາດແບບໂກລບອນ (global class)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2272
msgid "Another class file."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄລາດອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2273
msgid "An inner class inside another class file."
msgstr "ຄລາດພາຍໃນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຄລາດອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2275
msgid "Multiple inheritance is not allowed."
msgstr "ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການສືບທອດຫຼາຍສາຍ (Multiple inheritance)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2277
msgid "Inheritance uses the ``extends`` keyword:"
msgstr "ການສືບທອດຈະໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ ``extends``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2292
msgid ""
"If inheritance is not explicitly defined, the class will default to "
"inheriting :ref:`class_RefCounted`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດການສືບທອດຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ, ຄລາດນັ້ນຈະສືບທອດມາຈາກ :ref:`class_RefCounted` ໂດຍອັດ"
"ຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2295
msgid ""
"To check if a given instance inherits from a given class, the ``is`` keyword "
"can be used:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອວັດແທກວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ ``is`` ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2309
msgid ""
"To call a function in a *super class* (i.e. one ``extend``-ed in your "
"current class), use the ``super`` keyword:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນໃນ *ຄລາດແມ່ (super class)* (ຄືຄລາດທີ່ຖືກສືບທອດມາໃນຄລາດປັດຈຸບັນ), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ "
"``super``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2316
msgid ""
"This is especially useful because functions in extending classes replace "
"functions with the same name in their super classes. If you still want to "
"call them, you can use ``super``:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ ເພາະວ່າຟັງຊັນໃນຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈະແທນທີ່ຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ ໃນຄລາດແມ່. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງ"
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຢູ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ``super`` ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2325
msgid ""
"If you need to call a different function from the super class, you can "
"specify the function name with the attribute operator:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນອື່ນຈາກຄລາດແມ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ຟັງຊັນດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ attribute:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2338
msgid ""
"One of the common misconceptions is trying to override *non-virtual* engine "
"methods such as ``get_class()``, ``queue_free()``, etc. This is not "
"supported for technical reasons."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈຜິດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນການພະຍາຍາມ override ເມທອດຂອງເອັນຈິນ ທີ່ *ບໍ່ແມ່ນ virtual* ເ"
"ຊັ່ນ ``get_class()``, ``queue_free()``, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນທາງເຕັກ"
"ນິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2341
msgid ""
"In Godot 3, you can *shadow* engine methods in GDScript, and it will work if "
"you call this method in GDScript. However, the engine will **not** execute "
"your code if the method is called inside the engine on some event."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot 3, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດ *shadow* ເມທອດຂອງເອັນຈິນໃນ GDScript ໄດ້, ແລະ ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຖ້"
"າເຈົ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນັ້ນໃນ GDScript. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເອັນຈິນ ຈະ **ບໍ່** ປະມວນຜົນໂຄ້ດຂອງເຈົ້າ ຖ້າເມທ"
"ອດນັ້ນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນເອັນຈິນໃນບາງເຫດການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2344
msgid ""
"In Godot 4, even shadowing may not always work, as GDScript optimizes native "
"method calls. Therefore, we added the ``NATIVE_METHOD_OVERRIDE`` warning, "
"which is treated as an error by default. We strongly advise against "
"disabling or ignoring the warning."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot 4, ແມ່ນແຕ່ການເຮັດ shadowing ກໍອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກສະເໝີໄປ, ເພາະວ່າ GDScript ມີການປັບ"
"ແຕ່ງ (optimize) ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດພື້ນຖານ (native). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມ ຄຳເຕືອນ "
"``NATIVE_METHOD_OVERRIDE``, ເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດ"
"ຂາດວ່າບໍ່ໃຫ້ປິດ ຫຼື ເມີນເສີຍຕໍ່ຄຳເຕືອນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2348
msgid ""
"Note that this does not apply to virtual methods such as ``_ready()``, "
"``_process()`` and others (marked with the ``virtual`` qualifier in the "
"documentation and the names start with an underscore). These methods are "
"specifically for customizing engine behavior and can be overridden in "
"GDScript. Signals and notifications can also be useful for these purposes."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບເມທອດ virtual ເຊັ່ນ ``_ready()``, ``_process()`` ແລະ ອື່ນໆ (ເຊິ່ງ"
"ຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍ ``virtual`` ໃນເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ ແລະ ຊື່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຂີດກ້ອງ). ເມທອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະ"
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງເອັນຈິນ ແລະ ສາມາດ override ໄດ້ ໃນ GDScript. ສັນຍານ (Signals) ແລະ "
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (notifications) ກໍມີປະໂຫຍດ ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2354
msgid "Class constructor"
msgstr "ຕົວສ້າງຄລາດ (Class constructor)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2356
msgid ""
"The class constructor, called on class instantiation, is named ``_init``. If "
"you want to call the base class constructor, you can also use the ``super`` "
"syntax. Note that every class has an implicit constructor that is always "
"called (defining the default values of class variables). ``super`` is used "
"to call the explicit constructor:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສ້າງຄລາດ (constructor) ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາດ ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``_init``. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້"
"ອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຕົວສ້າງຂອງຄລາດພື້ນຖານ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນ ``super`` ໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ: ທຸກໆຄລາດ"
"ມີຕົວສ້າງແບບແຝງ (implicit constructor) ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະເໝີ (ເພື່ອການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນໃນ"
"ຄລາດ). ``super`` ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເອີ້ນ ຕົວສ້າງທີ່ເຮົາຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ (explicit constructor):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2367
msgid "This is better explained through examples. Consider this scenario:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນຜ່ານຕົວຢ່າງ. ລອງເບິ່ງສະຖານະການນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2393
msgid "There are a few things to keep in mind here:"
msgstr "ມີບາງສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນຈື່ໄວ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2395
msgid ""
"If the inherited class (``state.gd``) defines an ``_init`` constructor that "
"takes arguments (``e`` in this case), then the inheriting class "
"(``idle.gd``) *must* define ``_init`` as well and pass appropriate "
"parameters to ``_init`` from ``state.gd``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຄລາດທີ່ຖືກສືບທອດ (``state.gd``) ມີການກຳນົດຕົວສ້າງ ``_init`` ທີ່ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ (ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ "
"``e``), ຄລາດທີ່ໄປສືບທອດມາ (``idle.gd``) *ຈະຕ້ອງ* ກຳນົດ ``_init`` ເຊັ່ນກັນ ແລະ ສົ່ງພາຣາມິ"
"ເຕີທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄປໃຫ້ ``_init`` ຂອງ ``state.gd``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2398
msgid ""
"``idle.gd`` can have a different number of arguments than the base class "
"``state.gd``."
msgstr ""
"``idle.gd`` ສາມາດມີຈຳນວນພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄລາດພື້ນຖານ ``state.gd`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2399
msgid ""
"In the example above, ``e`` passed to the ``state.gd`` constructor is the "
"same ``e`` passed in to ``idle.gd``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ``e`` ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ຕົວສ້າງຂອງ ``state.gd`` ແມ່ນ ``e`` ໂຕດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ"
"ໃນ ``idle.gd``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2401
msgid ""
"If ``idle.gd``'s ``_init`` constructor takes 0 arguments, it still needs to "
"pass some value to the ``state.gd`` base class, even if it does nothing. "
"This brings us to the fact that you can pass expressions to the base "
"constructor as well, not just variables, e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວສ້າງ ``_init`` ຂອງ ``idle.gd`` ບໍ່ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີເລີຍ, ມັນກໍຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ ສົ່ງບາງຄ່າໄປໃຫ້ຄລາ"
"ດພື້ນຖານ ``state.gd`` ຢູ່ດີ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຈົ້າສາມາດ ສົ່ງນິພົດ (expressions) ໄປໃຫ້ຕົວສ້າງພື້ນຖ"
"ານໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແຕ່ຕົວປ່ຽນຢ່າງດຽວ, ເຊັ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2413
msgid "Static constructor"
msgstr "ຕົວສ້າງແບບ Static"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2415
msgid ""
"A static constructor is a static function ``_static_init`` that is called "
"automatically when the class is loaded, after the static variables have been "
"initialized:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສ້າງແບບ static ຄືຟັງຊັນ static ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``_static_init`` ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່"
"ອຄລາດຖືກໂຫຼດ, ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຕົວປ່ຽນ static ທັງໝົດຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າແລ້ວ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2425
msgid ""
"A static constructor cannot take arguments and must not return any value."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສ້າງແບບ static ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີໄດ້ ແລະ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2430
msgid "Inner classes"
msgstr "ຄລາດພາຍໃນ (Inner classes)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2432
msgid ""
"A class file can contain inner classes. Inner classes are defined using the "
"``class`` keyword. They are instanced using the ``ClassName.new()`` function."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຄລາດສາມາດມີຄລາດພາຍໃນໄດ້. ຄລາດພາຍໃນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ ``class``. ພວກມັນຖືກສ້າງອິນສະແ"
"ຕນຊ໌ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``ClassName.new()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2457
msgid "Classes as resources"
msgstr "ຄລາດໃນຖານະຊັບພະຍາກອນ (Resources)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2459
msgid ""
"Classes stored as files are treated as :ref:`GDScripts <class_GDScript>`. "
"They must be loaded from disk to access them in other classes. This is done "
"using either the ``load`` or ``preload`` functions (see below). Instancing "
"of a loaded class resource is done by calling the ``new`` function on the "
"class object:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບ :ref:`GDScripts <class_GDScript>`. ພວກມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກໂ"
"ຫຼດຈາກດິສກ໌ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນຄລາດອື່ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ ຟັງຊັນ ``load`` ຫຼື ``preload`` (ເບິ່ງຂ້"
"າງລຸ່ມ). ການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຄລາດທີ່ໂຫຼດມາແລ້ວ ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"``new`` ໃນອັອບເຈັກຄລາດນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2478
msgid "Exports"
msgstr "ການເອັກສະປອດ (Exports)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2482
msgid ""
"Documentation about exports has been moved to :ref:`doc_gdscript_exports`."
msgstr "ເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບການເອັກສະປອດ ໄດ້ຍ້າຍໄປຢູ່ທີ່ :ref:`doc_gdscript_exports`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2488
msgid "Properties (setters and getters)"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ (setters ແລະ getters)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2490
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you want a class' member variable to do more than just hold data "
"and actually perform some validation or computation whenever its value "
"changes. It may also be desired to encapsulate its access in some way."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາດ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການກວດສ"
"ອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ການຄິດໄລ່ບາງຢ່າງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຄ່າຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມການ"
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງ (encapsulate) ມັນໃນບາງຮູບແບບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2494
msgid ""
"For this, GDScript provides a special syntax to define properties using the "
"``set`` and ``get`` keywords after a variable declaration. Then you can "
"define a code block that will be executed when the variable is accessed or "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເລື່ອງນີ້, GDScript ໄດ້ກຽມໄວຍາກອນພິເສດເພື່ອປະກາດຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ "
"``set`` ແລະ ``get`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນ. ຈາກນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າສາມາດ ກຳນົດບລັອກຂອງໂຄ້ດທີ່ຈະຖືກປະມວ"
"ນຜົນເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນຖືກເຂົ້າເຖິງ ຫຼື ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2511
msgid ""
"Unlike ``setget`` in previous Godot versions, ``set`` and ``get`` methods "
"are **always** called (except as noted below), even when accessed inside the "
"same class (with or without prefixing with ``self.``). This makes the "
"behavior consistent. If you need direct access to the value, use another "
"variable for direct access and make the property code use that name."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຄືກັບ ``setget`` ໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ Godot, ເມທອດ ``set`` ແລະ ``get`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ **ສ"
"ະເໝີ** (ຍົກເວັ້ນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ), ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຖືກ ເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກພາຍໃນຄລາດດຽວກັນ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີ "
"``self.`` ຫຼື ບໍ່ກໍຕາມ). ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ ພຶດຕິກຳມີຄວາມສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄ່າໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້"
"ໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນອື່ນ ແລ້ວຂຽນໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນໃຊ້ຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2517
msgid "Alternative syntax"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນທາງເລືອກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2519
msgid ""
"Also there is another notation to use existing class functions if you want "
"to split the code from the variable declaration or you need to reuse the "
"code across multiple properties (but you can't distinguish which property "
"the setter/getter is being called for):"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງມີອີກຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງໃນການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຄລາດ ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ ແຍກໂຄ້ດອອກຈາກການປະກາດ"
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດຊໍ້າກັນໃນຫຼາຍໆຄຸນສົມບັດ (ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແຍກໄດ້ວ່າ setter/getter ນັ້ນຖືກເ"
"ອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃດ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2527
msgid "This can also be done in the same line:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຂຽນໃນແຖວດຽວກັນໄດ້ຄືກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2533
msgid ""
"The setter and getter must use the same notation, mixing styles for the same "
"variable is not allowed."
msgstr ""
"Setter ແລະ getter ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຂຽນດຽວກັນ, ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະສົມຮູບແບບ ສຳລັບຕົວປ່ຽນດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2537
msgid ""
"You cannot specify type hints for *inline* setters and getters. This is done "
"on purpose to reduce the boilerplate. If the variable is typed, then the "
"setter's argument is automatically of the same type, and the getter's return "
"value must match it. Separated setter/getter functions can have type hints, "
"and the type must match the variable's type or be a wider type."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸ type hints ສຳລັບ setter ແລະ getter ແບບ *inline* ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຫຼຸດ"
"ຜ່ອນຄວາມຊໍ້າຊ້ອນຂອງໂຄ້ດ. ຖ້າຕົວປ່ຽນມີການກຳນົດປະເພດ (typed), ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງ setter ຈະເປັນປະເພ"
"ດດຽວກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ ຄ່າຄືນຂອງ getter ກໍຕ້ອງກົງກັນ. ແຕ່ສຳລັບຟັງຊັນ setter/getter ທີ່ແຍກ"
"ຕ່າງຫາກ ແມ່ນສາມາດມີ type hints ໄດ້, ແລະ ປະເພດນັ້ນຕ້ອງກົງກັບປະເພດຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ເປັນປະເພດທີ່ກວ້"
"າງກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2542
msgid "When setter/getter is not called"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃດທີ່ setter/getter ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2544
msgid ""
"When a variable is initialized, the value of the initializer will be written "
"directly to the variable. Including if the ``@onready`` annotation is "
"applied to the variable."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂດຍກົງ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ "
"``@onready`` ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2547
msgid ""
"Using the variable's name to set it inside its own setter or to get it "
"inside its own getter will directly access the underlying member, so it "
"won't generate infinite recursion and saves you from explicitly declaring "
"another variable:"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນ setter ຂອງມັນເອງ ຫຼື ເພື່ອດຶງຄ່າພາຍໃນ getter ຂອງມັນເອງ ຈະເປັນກ"
"ານເຂົ້າເຖິງສະມາຊິກພື້ນຖານໂດຍກົງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ມັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການເຮັດວຽກວົນລູບບໍ່ຮູ້ຈົບ (infinite "
"recursion) ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນອື່ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2560
msgid "This also applies to the alternative syntax:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄວຍາກອນທາງເລືອກເຊັ່ນກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2571
msgid ""
"The exception does **not** propagate to other functions called in the setter/"
"getter. For example, the following code **will** cause an infinite recursion:"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນນີ້ **ບໍ່** ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຟັງຊັນອື່ນທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃນ setter/getter. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ **ຈະ** ເຮັດໃຫ້ເ"
"ກີດການເຮັດວຽກວົນລູບບໍ່ຮູ້ຈົບ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2586
msgid "Tool mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດເຄື່ອງມື (Tool mode)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2588
msgid ""
"By default, scripts don't run inside the editor and only the exported "
"properties can be changed. In some cases, it is desired that they do run "
"inside the editor (as long as they don't execute game code or manually avoid "
"doing so). For this, the ``@tool`` annotation exists and must be placed at "
"the top of the file:"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສະຄຣິບຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນເອດິເຕີ ແລະ ມີພຽງແຕ່ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນ"
"ແປງໄດ້. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຮົາອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກ ພາຍໃນເອດິເຕີ (ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ປະມວນ"
"ຜົນໂຄ້ດຂອງເກມ ຫຼື ມີການປ້ອງກັນໄວ້). ສຳລັບເລື່ອງນີ້, ຈຶ່ງມີແອນໂນເທຊັນ ``@tool`` ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນ"
"ເທິງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2603
msgid "See :ref:`doc_running_code_in_the_editor` for more information."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_running_code_in_the_editor` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2605
msgid ""
"Be cautious when freeing nodes with ``queue_free()`` or ``free()`` in a tool "
"script (especially the script's owner itself). As tool scripts run their "
"code in the editor, misusing them may lead to crashing the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນລະມັດລະວັງໃນການລຶບໂນດດ້ວຍ ``queue_free()`` ຫຼື ``free()`` ໃນສະຄຣິບ ແບບ tool (ໂດຍສ"
"ະເພາະເຈົ້າຂອງສະຄຣິບນັ້ນເອງ). ເນື່ອງຈາກສະຄຣິບແບບ tool ຈະປະມວນຜົນໂຄ້ດໃນເອດິເຕີ, ການໃຊ້ງານຜິດພ"
"າດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເອດິເຕີຄ້າງ ຫຼື ມອດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2613
msgid "Memory management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (Memory management)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2615
msgid ""
"Godot implements reference counting to free certain instances that are no "
"longer used, instead of a garbage collector, or requiring purely manual "
"management. Any instance of the :ref:`class_RefCounted` class (or any class "
"that inherits it, such as :ref:`class_Resource`) will be freed automatically "
"when no longer in use. For an instance of any class that is not "
"a :ref:`class_RefCounted` (such as :ref:`class_Node` or the "
"base :ref:`class_Object` type), it will remain in memory until it is deleted "
"with ``free()`` (or ``queue_free()`` for Nodes)."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ລະບົບການນັບການອ້າງອີງ (reference counting) ເພື່ອຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ໃຫ້ກັບບາງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ garbage collector ຫຼື ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈັດການເອງທັງໝົດ. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃດໆຂອງຄ"
"ລາດ :ref:`class_RefCounted` (ຫຼື ຄລາດໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ສືບທອດມັນມາ ເຊັ່ນ "
":ref:`class_Resource`) ຈະຖືກລຶບ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາດທີ່ບໍ່"
"ແມ່ນ :ref:`class_RefCounted` (ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`class_Node` ຫຼື ປະເພດ "
":ref:`class_Object` ພື້ນຖານ), ມັນຈະຍັງຢູ່ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈົນກວ່າຈະຖືກລຶບດ້ວຍ ``free()`` (ຫຼື "
"``queue_free()`` ສຳລັບ Nodes)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2626
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`class_Node` is deleted via ``free()`` or ``queue_free()``, all of "
"its children will also recursively be deleted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ :ref:`class_Node` ຖືກລຶບຜ່ານ ``free()`` ຫຼື ``queue_free()``, ລູກ (children) ທັງໝົ"
"ດຂອງມັນກໍຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໄປນຳທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2629
msgid ""
"To avoid reference cycles that can't be freed, a :ref:`class_WeakRef` "
"function is provided for creating weak references, which allow access to the "
"object without preventing a :ref:`class_RefCounted` from freeing. Here is an "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງວົງຈອນການອ້າງອີງ (reference cycles) ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໄດ້, ຈຶ່ງມີຟັງຊັນ "
":ref:`class_WeakRef` ເພື່ອສ້າງການອ້າງອີງແບບອ່ອນ (weak references), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອັອ"
"ບເຈັກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄປຂັດຂວາງການຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ :ref:`class_RefCounted`. ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2654
msgid ""
"Alternatively, when not using references, the "
"``is_instance_valid(instance)`` can be used to check if an object has been "
"freed."
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ການອ້າງອີງ (references), ສາມາດໃຊ້ ``is_instance_valid"
"(instance)`` ເພື່ອວັດແທກວ່າອັອບເຈັກຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2663
msgid ""
"Signals are a tool to emit messages from an object that other objects can "
"react to. To create custom signals for a class, use the ``signal`` keyword."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານ (Signals) ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືໃນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກອັອບເຈັກໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ອັອບເຈັກ ອື່ນໆສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງໄ"
"ດ້. ເພື່ອສ້າງສັນຍານແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຄລາດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ ``signal``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2676
msgid ""
"Signals are a `Callback <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Callback_(computer_programming)>`_ mechanism. They also fill the role of "
"Observers, a common programming pattern. For more information, read the "
"`Observer tutorial <https://gameprogrammingpatterns.com/observer.html>`_ in "
"the Game Programming Patterns ebook."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານແມ່ນກົນໄກແບບ `Callback <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Callback_"
"(computer_programming)>`_. ພວກມັນຍັງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ Observer ເຊິ່ງເປັນຮູບແບບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ"
"ທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ `Observer tutorial <https://"
"gameprogrammingpatterns.com/observer.html>`_ ໃນອີບຸກ Game Programming Patterns."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2683
msgid ""
"You can connect these signals to methods the same way you connect built-in "
"signals of nodes like :ref:`class_Button` or :ref:`class_RigidBody3D`."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າກັບເມທອດ ໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ສັນຍານພາຍໃນຂອງໂນດ ເຊັ່"
"ນ :ref:`class_Button` ຫຼື :ref:`class_RigidBody3D`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2686
msgid ""
"In the example below, we connect the ``health_depleted`` signal from a "
"``Character`` node to a ``Game`` node. When the ``Character`` node emits the "
"signal, the game node's ``_on_character_health_depleted`` is called:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``health_depleted`` ຈາກໂນດ ``Character`` ໄປຍັງ"
"ໂນດ ``Game``. ເມື່ອໂນດ ``Character`` ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາ, ຟັງຊັນ "
"``_on_character_health_depleted`` ຂອງໂນດເກມຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2702
msgid "You can emit as many arguments as you want along with a signal."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີໄປນຳສັນຍານໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2704
msgid ""
"Here is an example where this is useful. Let's say we want a life bar on "
"screen to react to health changes with an animation, but we want to keep the "
"user interface separate from the player in our scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດ. ສົມມຸດວ່າເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຖບພະລັງ (life bar) ຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍ ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການປ່ຽນແ"
"ປງຂອງເລືອດດ້ວຍແອນິເມຊັນ, ແຕ່ເຮົາຕ້ອງການແຍກສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI) ອອກຈາກຕົວລະຄອນໃນໂຄງສ້າງສາກ "
"(scene tree)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2708
msgid ""
"In our ``character.gd`` script, we define a ``health_changed`` signal and "
"emit it with :ref:`Signal.emit() <class_Signal_method_emit>`, and from a "
"``Game`` node higher up our scene tree, we connect it to the ``Lifebar`` "
"using the :ref:`Signal.connect() <class_Signal_method_connect>` method:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນສະຄຣິບ ``character.gd``, ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດສັນຍານ ``health_changed`` ແລະ ສົ່ງມັນອອກມາ ດ້ວ"
"ຍ :ref:`Signal.emit() <class_Signal_method_emit>`, ແລະ ຈາກໂນດ ``Game`` ທີ່ຢູ່ສູງກວ່"
"າໃນ scene tree, ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນເຂົ້າກັບ ``Lifebar`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ ເມທອດ "
":ref:`Signal.connect() <class_Signal_method_connect>`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2749
msgid ""
"In the ``Game`` node, we get both the ``Character`` and ``Lifebar`` nodes, "
"then connect the character, that emits the signal, to the receiver, the "
"``Lifebar`` node in this case."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂນດ ``Game``, ພວກເຮົາເຂົ້າເຖິງທັງໂນດ ``Character`` ແລະ ``Lifebar``, ຈາກນັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວ"
"ລະຄອນທີ່ເປັນຜູ້ສົ່ງສັນຍານ ເຂົ້າກັບຜູ້ຮັບ ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ແມ່ນໂນດ ``Lifebar``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2763
msgid ""
"This allows the ``Lifebar`` to react to health changes without coupling it "
"to the ``Character`` node."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ``Lifebar`` ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເລືອດໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຜູກມັດ "
"(coupling) ກັບໂນດ ``Character`` ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2766
msgid ""
"You can write optional argument names in parentheses after the signal's "
"definition:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນຊື່ພາຣາມິເຕີ (ເປັນທາງເລືອກ) ໄວ້ໃນວົງເລັບຫຼັງຈາກການກຳນົດສັນຍານ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2773
msgid ""
"These arguments show up in the editor's Signals dock, and Godot can use them "
"to generate callback functions for you. However, you can still emit any "
"number of arguments when you emit signals; it's up to you to emit the "
"correct values."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນແຖບ Signals ຂອງເອດິເຕີ, ແລະ Godot ສາມາດໃຊ້ພວກມັນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຟັງຊັນ "
"callback ໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສົ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ ຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງສັນຍານ; ມັນຂຶ້"
"ນກັບເຈົ້າເອງທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອອກໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2779
msgid ""
"You can also create copies of GDScript Callable objects which accept "
"additional arguments using :ref:`Callable.bind() "
"<class_Callable_method_bind>`. This allows you to add extra information to "
"the connection if the emitted signal itself doesn't give you access to all "
"the data that you need."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງອັອບເຈັກ Callable ໃນ GDScript ທີ່ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
":ref:`Callable.bind() <class_Callable_method_bind>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນພິເ"
"ສດເຂົ້າໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ ຫາກສັນຍານ ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກມານັ້ນ ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2784
msgid ""
"When the signal is emitted, the callback method receives the bound values, "
"in addition to those provided by the signal."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສັນຍານຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ, ເມທອດ callback ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຖືກ bind ໄວ້, ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສັນຍານນັ້ນສົ່ງມ"
"າໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2787
msgid ""
"Building on the example above, let's say we want to display a log of the "
"damage taken by each character on the screen, like ``Player1 took 22 "
"damage.``. The ``health_changed`` signal doesn't give us the name of the "
"character that took damage. So when we connect the signal to the in-game "
"console, we can add the character's name using the bind method:"
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ຈາກຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ສົມມຸດວ່າເຮົາຕ້ອງການສະແດງບັນທຶກ (log) ຂອງການບາດເຈັບ ທີ່ແຕ່ລະຕົວລະຄອນໄດ້ຮັບ"
"ຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍ ເຊັ່ນ ``Player1 took 22 damage.``. ສັນຍານ ``health_changed`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ບອກຊື່ຂອງຕົວລະ"
"ຄອນທີ່ບາດເຈັບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເມື່ອເຮົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ສັນຍານເຂົ້າກັບຄອນໂຊນໃນເກມ, ເຮົາສາມາດເພີ່ມຊື່ຕົວລະຄອນໄດ້ໂດຍໃ"
"ຊ້ເມທອດ bind:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2803
msgid ""
"Our ``BattleLog`` node receives each bound element as an extra argument:"
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ ``BattleLog`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາຈະໄດ້ຮັບແຕ່ລະຄ່າທີ່ bind ໄວ້ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2818
msgid "Awaiting signals or coroutines"
msgstr "ການລໍຖ້າສັນຍານ ຫຼື ຄໍຣູທີນ (Awaiting signals or coroutines)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2820
msgid ""
"The ``await`` keyword can be used to create `coroutines <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coroutine>`_ which wait until a signal is emitted "
"before continuing execution. Using the ``await`` keyword with a signal or a "
"call to a function that is also a coroutine will immediately return the "
"control to the caller. When the signal is emitted (or the called coroutine "
"finishes), it will resume execution from the point on where it stopped."
msgstr ""
"ຄີເວີດ ``await`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ `ຄໍຣູທີນ (coroutines) <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Coroutine>`_ ເຊິ່ງຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາກ່ອນຈະເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່. ການໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ "
"``await`` ກັບສັນຍານ ຫຼື ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ເປັນຄໍຣູທີນ ຈະເປັນການຄືນການຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ເອີ້ນ (caller) "
"ທັນທີ. ເມື່ອສັນຍານຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ (ຫຼື ຄໍຣູທີນທີ່ເອີ້ນນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກຈົບ), ມັນຈະກັບມາເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ຈາກຈຸດທີ່ມັນຢຸດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2825
msgid ""
"For example, to stop execution until the user presses a button, you can do "
"something like this:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະກົດປຸ່ມ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ປະມານນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2835
msgid ""
"In this case, the ``wait_confirmation`` becomes a coroutine, which means "
"that the caller also needs to await it:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ``wait_confirmation`` ຈະກາຍເປັນຄໍຣູທີນ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຜູ້ເອີ້ນກໍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ "
"await ມັນຄືກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2847
msgid ""
"Note that requesting a coroutine's return value without ``await`` will "
"trigger an error:"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການຂໍຄ່າຄືນຈາກຄໍຣູທີນໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ ``await`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2854
msgid ""
"However, if you don't depend on the result, you can just call it "
"asynchronously, which won't stop execution and won't make the current "
"function a coroutine:"
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຫວັງຜົນລັດຈາກມັນ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວຽກແບບ asynchronously ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈ"
"ະບໍ່ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນປັດຈຸບັນກາຍເປັນຄໍຣູທີນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2863
msgid ""
"If you use await with an expression that isn't a signal nor a coroutine, the "
"value will be returned immediately and the function won't give the control "
"back to the caller:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ await ກັບນິພົດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສັນຍານ ຫຼື ຄໍຣູທີນ, ຄ່າຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນ ທັນທີ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນຈະບໍ່ຄືນການຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ກັ"
"ບຜູ້ເອີ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2875
msgid ""
"This also means that returning a signal from a function that isn't a "
"coroutine will make the caller await that signal:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ການສົ່ງສັນຍານຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄໍຣູທີນ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ເອີ້ນຕ້ອງ await ສັນຍານນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2886
msgid ""
"Unlike ``yield`` in previous Godot versions, you cannot obtain the function "
"state object. This is done to ensure type safety. With this type safety in "
"place, a function cannot say that it returns an ``int`` while it actually "
"returns a function state object during runtime."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຄືກັບ ``yield`` ໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ Godot, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງອັອບເຈັກ ສະຖານະຟັງຊັນ (function "
"state object) ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດ (type safety). ດ້ວຍລະບົບນີ້, ຟັງຊັນຈະບໍ່"
"ສາມາດບອກວ່າສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ ``int`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ ມັນສົ່ງຄືນອັອບເຈັກສະຖານະຟັງຊັນໃນຕອນລັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2891
msgid ""
"You can store the arguments passed to the signal's parameters. If there is "
"only one parameter, the awaited value will have the same type as the "
"argument:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເກັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບສັນຍານໄດ້. ຖ້າມີພຽງແຕ່ພາຣາມິເຕີດຽວ, ຄ່າທີ່ await ໄດ້ຈະມີປະເພດ"
"ດຽວກັນກັບພາຣາມິເຕີນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2899
msgid ""
"If there is more than one parameter, the awaited value will be of type "
"``Array``:"
msgstr "ຖ້າມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ, ຄ່າທີ່ await ໄດ້ຈະເປັນປະເພດ ``Array``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2907
msgid "Otherwise, the awaited value will be ``null``:"
msgstr "ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່າທີ່ await ໄດ້ຈະເປັນ ``null``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2916
msgid "Assert keyword"
msgstr "ຄີເວີດ Assert"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2918
msgid ""
"The ``assert`` keyword can be used to check conditions in debug builds. "
"These assertions are ignored in non-debug builds. This means that the "
"expression passed as argument won't be evaluated in a project exported in "
"release mode. Due to this, assertions must **not** contain expressions that "
"have side effects. Otherwise, the behavior of the script would vary "
"depending on whether the project is run in a debug build."
msgstr ""
"ຄີເວີດ ``assert`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອວັດແທກເງື່ອນໄຂໃນເວີຊັນດີບັກ (debug builds). ການ assert ເຫຼົ່າ"
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກເມີນເສີຍໃນເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນດີບັກ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ນິພົດທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າໄປຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເອັກສະປ"
"ອດໃນໂໝດ release. ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ການ assert ຕ້ອງ **ບໍ່** ມີນິພົດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຜົນກະທົບຂ້າງຄຽງ "
"(side effects). ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງສະຄຣິບອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຖືກລັນ ໃນເວີຊັນດີບັກ"
"ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2930
msgid ""
"When running a project from the editor, the project will be paused if an "
"assertion error occurs."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກເອດິເຕີ, ໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (paused) ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຈາກການ assert ເກີດຂຶ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:2933
msgid ""
"You can optionally pass a custom error message to be shown if the assertion "
"fails:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງເມື່ອການ assert ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:4
msgid "GDScript: An introduction to dynamic languages"
msgstr "GDScript: ບົດນຳສູ່ພາສາແບບໄດນາມິກ (Dynamic languages)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:9
msgid ""
"This tutorial aims to be a quick reference for how to use GDScript more "
"efficiently. It focuses on common cases specific to the language, but also "
"covers a lot of information on dynamically typed languages."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຮຽນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເປັນຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງໄວ ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ GDScript ໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ມັນເນັ້ນໃສ່ກໍລະ"
"ນີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ເປັນລັກສະນະສະເພາະຂອງພາສາ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງລວມເຖິງ ຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບພາສາທີ່ມີການກຳນົດປະເພດແບບ"
"ໄດນາມິກ (dynamically typed languages)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:13
msgid ""
"It's meant to be especially useful for programmers with little or no "
"previous experience with dynamically typed languages."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ບໍ່ທັນມີປະສົບການ ຫຼື ມີໜ້ອຍ ກ່ຽວກັບພາສາທີ່ມີການກຳນົດປະເພດ"
"ແບບໄດນາມິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:17
msgid "Dynamic nature"
msgstr "ລັກສະນະແບບໄດນາມິກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:20
msgid "Pros & cons of dynamic typing"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງການກຳນົດປະເພດແບບໄດນາມິກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:22
msgid ""
"GDScript is a Dynamically Typed language. As such, its main advantages are "
"that:"
msgstr ""
"GDScript ເປັນພາສາທີ່ມີການກຳນົດປະເພດແບບໄດນາມິກ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ດີຫຼັກໆຂອງມັນຄື:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:25
msgid "The language is easy to get started with."
msgstr "ເປັນພາສາທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຮຽນຮູ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:26
msgid "Most code can be written and changed quickly and without hassle."
msgstr "ໂຄ້ດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໄວ ໂດຍບໍ່ຫຍຸ້ງຍາກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:27
msgid "The code is easy to read (little clutter)."
msgstr "ໂຄ້ດອ່ານງ່າຍ (ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຮົກ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:28
msgid "No compilation is required to test."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຄອມໄພລ໌ (compile) ເພື່ອທົດສອບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:29
msgid "Runtime is tiny."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະມວນຜົນ (runtime) ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:30
msgid "It has duck-typing and polymorphism by nature."
msgstr "ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ duck-typing ແລະ polymorphism ໂດຍທຳມະຊາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:32
msgid "While the main disadvantages are:"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂໍ້ເສຍຫຼັກໆຄື:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:34
msgid "Less performance than statically typed languages."
msgstr ""
"ປະສິດທິພາບຕໍ່າກວ່າພາສາທີ່ມີການກຳນົດປະເພດແບບສະແຕຕິກ (statically typed languages)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:35
msgid "More difficult to refactor (symbols can't be traced)."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບປຸງໂຄ້ດ (refactor) ເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກກວ່າ (ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕາມສັນຍາລັກຕ່າງໆໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:36
msgid ""
"Some errors that would typically be detected at compile time in statically "
"typed languages only appear while running the code (because expression "
"parsing is more strict)."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ມັກຈະຖືກກວດພົບໃນຕອນ compile ໃນພາສາແບບສະແຕຕິກ ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຕອນລັນໂຄ້ດເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເ"
"ພາະການວິເຄາະນິພົດມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:39
msgid ""
"Less flexibility for code-completion (some variable types are only known at "
"runtime)."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນການແນະນຳໂຄ້ດ (code-completion) ມີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ (ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງປະເພດຕົວປ່ຽນຈະຮູ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເ"
"ມື່ອລັນໂຄ້ດເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:42
msgid ""
"This, translated to reality, means that Godot used with GDScript is a "
"combination designed to create games quickly and efficiently. For games that "
"are very computationally intensive and can't benefit from the engine built-"
"in tools (such as the Vector types, Physics Engine, Math library, etc), the "
"possibility of using C++ is present too. This allows you to still create "
"most of the game in GDScript and add small bits of C++ in the areas that "
"need a performance boost."
msgstr ""
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Godot ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ GDScript ເປັນການລວມຕົວທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອ ສ້າງເກມໄດ້ໄວ ແລະ ມີປະສິ"
"ດທິພາບ. ສຳລັບເກມທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການຄິດໄລ່ໜັກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກເຄື່ອງມືພາຍໃນເອັນຈິນ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"ປະເພດ Vector, Physics Engine, Math library, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ), ເຈົ້າກໍຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ C++ ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນ"
"ກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າ ຍັງຄົງສ້າງເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ດ້ວຍ GDScript ແລະ ເພີ່ມ C++ ເຂົ້າໄປໃນບາງສ່ວນ ທີ່ຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນຄວາມໄວເປັນພິເສດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:51
msgid "Variables & assignment"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:53
msgid ""
"All variables in a dynamically typed language are \"variant\"-like. This "
"means that their type is not fixed, and is only modified through assignment. "
"Example:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນທັງໝົດໃນພາສາແບບໄດນາມິກຈະມີລັກສະນະຄື \"variant\". ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ປະເພດຂອງພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຄົ"
"ງທີ່ໄວ້, ແລະ ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຜ່ານການກຳນົດຄ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

