#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:419
msgid "Custom iterators"
msgstr "ຕົວວົນລູບແບບກຳນົດເອງ (Custom iterators)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:420
msgid ""
"You can create custom iterators in case the default ones don't quite meet "
"your needs by overriding ``_iter_init()``, ``_iter_next()``, and "
"``_iter_get()`` functions in your script. An example implementation of a "
"forward iterator follows:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຕົວວົນລູບແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕົວວົນລູບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍ່ຕອບໂຈດ ໂດຍການ override ຟັງຊັນ "
"``_iter_init()``, ``_iter_next()``, ແລະ ``_iter_get()`` ໃນສະຄຣິບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງການສ້າງຕົວວົນລູບແບບໄປຂ້າງໜ້າ (forward iterator):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:453
msgid "And it can be used like any other iterator:"
msgstr "ແລະ ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຄືກັບຕົວວົນລູບອື່ນໆ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:461
msgid ""
"It is possible but discouraged to store the state in a member variable. "
"Multiple states are necessary in cases such as nested loops where the same "
"iterator instance is used simultaneously. The ``iter`` parameter in "
"``_iter_init()`` and ``_iter_next()`` is a single-element array so that "
"updates can persist. Whereas in ``_iter_get()``, the state is is not wrapped "
"because it is supposed to be read-only."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບສະຖານະ (state) ໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ. ສະຖານະຫຼາຍຮູບແບບມີຄວາມຈຳເ"
"ປັນໃນກໍລະນີເຊັ່ນ ລູບຊ້ອນລູບ ບ່ອນທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຕົວວົນລູບດຽວກັນພ້ອມໆກັນ. ພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``iter`` ໃນ ``_iter_init()`` ແລະ ``_iter_next()`` ເປັນອາເຣທີ່ມີສະມາຊິກດຽວ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການ"
"ອັບເດດສາມາດ ຄົງຢູ່ໄດ້. ສ່ວນໃນ ``_iter_get()``, ສະຖານະຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຫຸ້ມ (wrapped) ໄວ້ ເພາະວ່າມັ"
"ນມີໄວ້ສຳລັບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:468
msgid ""
"Returning ``true`` from ``_iter_init()`` and ``_iter_next()`` indicates that "
"the iterator is valid. Returning ``false`` will terminate the loop."
msgstr ""
"ການສົ່ງຄ່າ ``true`` ຈາກ ``_iter_init()`` ແລະ ``_iter_next()`` ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຕົວວົນລູບຍັງ"
"ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ການສົ່ງຄ່າ ``false`` ຈະເປັນການຢຸດການວົນລູບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:471
msgid ""
"For more details see :ref:`_iter_init() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_init>`, :ref:`_iter_next() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_next>`, and :ref:`_iter_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_get>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`_iter_init() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_init>`, :ref:`_iter_next() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_next>`, ແລະ :ref:`_iter_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__iter_get>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:476
msgid "Duck typing"
msgstr "Duck typing"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:478
msgid ""
"One of the most difficult concepts to grasp when moving from a statically "
"typed language to a dynamic one is duck typing. Duck typing makes overall "
"code design much simpler and straightforward to write, but it's not obvious "
"how it works."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນແນວຄິດທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈຍາກທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກພາສາແບບສະແຕຕິກ ມາເປັນແບບໄດນາມິກ ຄື Duck typing. "
"Duck typing ເຮັດໃຫ້ການອອກແບບໂຄ້ດໂດຍລວມງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຂຽນໄດ້ກົງໄປກົງມາ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນປາ"
"ນໃດວ່າເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:483
msgid ""
"As an example, imagine a situation where a big rock is falling down a "
"tunnel, smashing everything on its way. The code for the rock, in a "
"statically typed language would be something like:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ລອງນຶກພາບສະຖານະການທີ່ມີກ້ອນຫີນໃຫຍ່ຕົກລົງມາໃນອຸມົງ ແລະ ທັບທຸກຢ່າງ ທີ່ຂວາງທາງ. ໂຄ້ດສຳລັບກ້ອ"
"ນຫີນ ໃນພາສາແບບສະແຕຕິກ ອາດຈະເປັນປະມານນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:494
msgid ""
"This way, everything that can be smashed by a rock would have to inherit "
"Smashable. If a character, enemy, piece of furniture, small rock were all "
"smashable, they would need to inherit from the class Smashable, possibly "
"requiring multiple inheritance. If multiple inheritance was undesired, then "
"they would have to inherit a common class like Entity. Yet, it would not be "
"very elegant to add a virtual method ``smash()`` to Entity only if a few of "
"them can be smashed."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດຖືກທັບມ້າງໂດຍກ້ອນຫີນ ຈະຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ Smashable. ຖ້າຕົວລະຄອນ, ສັດ"
"ຕູ, ເຄື່ອງເຟີນີເຈີ, ຫຼື ກ້ອນຫີນນ້ອຍໆ ລ້ວນແຕ່ສາມາດຖືກທັບມ້າງໄດ້, ພວກມັນກໍຕ້ອງສືບທອດຈາກຄລາດ "
"Smashable, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການສືບທອດ ຫຼາຍສາຍ (multiple inheritance). ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການສື"
"ບທອດຫຼາຍສາຍ, ພວກມັນກໍຕ້ອງ ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາດກາງເຊັ່ນ Entity. ແຕ່ວ່າມັນກໍເບິ່ງບໍ່ຄ່ອຍດີປານໃດທີ່ຈະເພີ່"
"ມ ເມທອດ virtual ``smash()`` ໃຫ້ກັບ Entity ພຽງເພາະມີບາງອັນທີ່ຖືກທັບມ້າງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:502
msgid ""
"With dynamically typed languages, this is not a problem. Duck typing makes "
"sure you only have to define a ``smash()`` function where required and "
"that's it. No need to consider inheritance, base classes, etc."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບພາສາແບບໄດນາມິກ, ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາ. Duck typing ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າ ພຽງແຕ່ກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ ``smash()"
"`` ບ່ອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການກໍພໍແລ້ວ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມາຄິດ ເລື່ອງການສືບທອດ ຫຼື ຄລາດພື້ນຖານຫຍັງເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:511
msgid ""
"And that's it. If the object that hit the big rock has a smash() method, it "
"will be called. No need for inheritance or polymorphism. Dynamically typed "
"languages only care about the instance having the desired method or member, "
"not what it inherits or the class type. The definition of Duck Typing should "
"make this clearer:"
msgstr ""
"ພຽງເທົ່ານັ້ນເລີຍ. ຖ້າອັອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກກ້ອນຫີນໃຫຍ່ຕຳມີເມທອດ smash(), ມັນກໍຈະຖືກ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີກາ"
"ນສືບທອດ ຫຼື polymorphism. ພາສາແບບໄດນາມິກ ສົນໃຈພຽງແຕ່ວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນັ້ນມີເມທອດ ຫຼື ສະມາຊິກທີ່ຕ້ອງ"
"ການຫຼືບໍ່, ບໍ່ໄດ້ສົນໃຈວ່າ ມັນສືບທອດມາຈາກໃສ ຫຼື ເປັນຄລາດປະເພດໃດ. ຄຳນິຍາມຂອງ Duck Typing ໜ້າຈະຊ່"
"ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:517
msgid ""
"*\"When I see a bird that walks like a duck and swims like a duck and quacks "
"like a duck, I call that bird a duck\"*"
msgstr ""
"*\"ເມື່ອຂ້ອຍເຫັນນົກທີ່ຍ່າງຄືເປັດ, ລອຍນໍ້າຄືເປັດ ແລະ ຮ້ອງກາບໆຄືເປັດ, ຂ້ອຍກໍເອີ້ນນົກໂຕນັ້ນວ່າເປັດ\"*"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:520
msgid "In this case, it translates to:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ມັນແປວ່າ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:522
msgid ""
"*\"If the object can be smashed, don't care what it is, just smash it.\"*"
msgstr ""
"*\"ຖ້າອັອບເຈັກນັ້ນຖືກທັບມ້າງໄດ້, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງສົນວ່າມັນແມ່ນຫຍັງ, ກໍທັບມ້າງມັນເລີຍ.\"*"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:524
msgid "Yes, we should call it Hulk typing instead."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ເຮົາຄວນເອີ້ນມັນວ່າ Hulk typing ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:526
msgid ""
"It's possible that the object being hit doesn't have a smash() function. "
"Some dynamically typed languages simply ignore a method call when it doesn't "
"exist, but GDScript is stricter, so checking if the function exists is "
"desirable:"
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າອັອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກຕຳອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນ smash(). ບາງພາສາແບບໄດນາມິກ ຈະເມີນເສີຍຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້"
"ເມທອດທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ແຕ່ GDScript ຈະເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ການວັດແທກວ່າຟັງຊັນນັ້ນມີຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ ຈຶ່ງເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນເຮັດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:537
msgid "Then, define that method and anything the rock touches can be smashed."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ພຽງແຕ່ກຳນົດເມທອດນັ້ນ ແລ້ວທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ກ້ອນຫີນຕຳກໍຈະຖືກທັບມ້າງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:4
msgid "GDScript exported properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອັກສະປອດໃນ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:6
msgid ""
"In Godot, class members can be exported. This means their value gets saved "
"along with the resource (such as the :ref:`scene <class_PackedScene>`) "
"they're attached to, and get transferred over when using :ref:`RPCs "
"<doc_high_level_multiplayer_rpcs>`. They will also be available for editing "
"in the property editor. Exporting is done by using the ``@export`` "
"annotation."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot, ສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາດສາມາດເອັກສະປອດ (export) ໄດ້. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶ"
"ກໄວ້ພ້ອມກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ (ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`scene <class_PackedScene>`) ທີ່ພວກມັນແນບຢູ່, ແລະ ຈະຖືກ"
"ສົ່ງຜ່ານເມື່ອໃຊ້ :ref:`RPCs <doc_high_level_multiplayer_rpcs>`. ພວກມັນຍັງຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄ"
"ດ້ໃນເອດິເຕີຄຸນສົມບັດ (property editor). ການເອັກສະປອດແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ "
"``@export``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:16
msgid ""
"In that example the value ``5`` will be saved and visible in the property "
"editor."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນ ຄ່າ ``5`` ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະ ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນເອດິເຕີຄຸນສົມບັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:18
msgid ""
"An exported variable must be initialized to a constant expression or have a "
"type specifier in the variable. Some of the export annotations have a "
"specific type and don't need the variable to be typed (see the *Examples* "
"section below)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດຈະຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant expression) ຫຼື ມີການລະບຸປະ"
"ເພດໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ. ແອນໂນເທຊັນການເອັກສະປອດບາງອັນ ມີການລະບຸ ປະເພດສະເພາະຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະ"
"ບຸປະເພດໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ (ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ *ຕົວຢ່າງ* ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:22
msgid ""
"One of the fundamental benefits of exporting member variables is to have "
"them visible and editable in the editor. This way, artists and game "
"designers can modify values that later influence how the program runs. For "
"this, a special export syntax is provided. Additionally, :ref:`documentation "
"comments <doc_gdscript_documentation_comments>` can be used for tooltip "
"descriptions, visible on mouse over."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຂອງການເອັກສະປອດຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນປະກົດ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນເອດິເ"
"ຕີ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ນັກອອກແບບ ແລະ ຄົນເຮັດເກມສາມາດ ປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າຕ່າງໆ ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເກມໃນ"
"ພາຍຫຼັງ. ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້, ຈຶ່ງມີໄວຍາກອນການເອັກສະປອດແບບພິເສດກຽມໄວ້ໃຫ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້, :ref:`ຄຳອະທິບາຍ "
"(documentation comments) <doc_gdscript_documentation_comments>` ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ"
"ະແດງ tooltip ເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:30
msgid ""
"Exporting properties can also be done in other languages such as C#. The "
"syntax varies depending on the language. See :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports` for "
"information on C# exports."
msgstr ""
"ການເອັກສະປອດຄຸນສົມບັດກໍສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນພາສາອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ C#. ໄວຍາກອນຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ກັນໄປຕາມພາສາ. ເບິ່"
"ງ :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການເອັກສະປອດໃນ C#."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:35
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:37
msgid "Basic use"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານພື້ນຖານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:37
msgid ""
"If the exported value assigns a constant or constant expression, the type "
"will be inferred and used in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຄ່າທີ່ເອັກສະປອດຖືກກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ຫຼື ນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່, ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ ຈະຖືກຄາດເດົາ (inferred) ແລະ ນຳ"
"ໄປໃຊ້ໃນເອດິເຕີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:44
msgid "If there's no default value, you can add a type to the variable."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມປະເພດໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:50
msgid "Resources and nodes can be exported."
msgstr "Resources ແລະ Nodes ສາມາດເອັກສະປອດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:57
msgid ""
"Even if a script is not executed in the editor, exported properties can "
"still be edited. However, getters and setters will only be used if the "
"script is in :ref:`doc_gdscript_tool_mode`."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າສະຄຣິບຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລັນໃນເອດິເຕີ, ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອັກສະປອດກໍຍັງ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"getters ແລະ setters ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ ສະຄຣິບນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນ :ref:`ໂໝດເຄື່ອງມື (tool mode) "
"<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:62
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:128
msgid "Grouping exports"
msgstr "ການຈັດກຸ່ມການເອັກສະປອດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:64
msgid ""
"It is possible to group your exported properties inside the Inspector with "
"the :ref:`@export_group <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_group>` "
"annotation. Every exported property after this annotation will be added to "
"the group. Start a new group or use ``@export_group(\"\")`` to break out."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອັກສະປອດໄວ້ໃນ Inspector ໄດ້ດ້ວຍແອນໂນເທຊັນ :ref:`@export_group "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_group>`. ທຸກໆຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອັກສະປອດຫຼັງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນ"
"ນີ້ ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມດຽວກັນ. ເລີ່ມກຸ່ມໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ ``@export_group(\"\")`` ເພື່ອອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:74
msgid ""
"The second argument of the annotation can be used to only group properties "
"with the specified prefix."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີໂຕທີສອງຂອງແອນໂນເທຊັນ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດ ທີ່ມີຄຳຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນ (prefix) ທີ່ລະບຸໄ"
"ວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:77
msgid ""
"Groups cannot be nested, use :ref:`@export_subgroup "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_subgroup>` to create subgroups within a "
"group."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມບໍ່ສາມາດຊ້ອນກຸ່ມໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`@export_subgroup "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_subgroup>` ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:86
msgid ""
"You can also change the name of your main category, or create additional "
"categories in the property list with the :ref:`@export_category "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_category>` annotation."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໝວດໝູ່ຫຼັກ, ຫຼື ສ້າງໝວດໝູ່ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ ໄດ້ດ້ວຍແອນໂນເທຊັນ "
":ref:`@export_category <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_category>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:101
msgid ""
"The list of properties is organized based on the class inheritance and new "
"categories break that expectation. Use them carefully, especially when "
"creating projects for public use."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມການສືບທອດຂອງຄລາດ ແລະ ໝວດໝູ່ໃໝ່ອາດຈະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດລຽງນັ້ນປ່ຽນໄ"
"ປ. ຄວນໃຊ້ພວກມັນຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະ ເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:106
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:173
msgid "Strings as paths"
msgstr "String ໃນຖານະຜາດ (Paths)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:108
msgid ""
"String as a path to a file. See :ref:`@export_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະຜາດໄປຫາໄຟລ໌. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:114
msgid ""
"String as a path to a directory. See :ref:`@export_dir "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_dir>`."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະຜາດໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_dir "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_dir>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:120
msgid ""
"String as a path to a file, custom filter provided as hint. See "
"again :ref:`@export_file <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະຜາດໄປຫາໄຟລ໌, ພ້ອມຕົວກອງແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>` ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:126
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:198
msgid ""
"Using paths in the global filesystem is also possible, but only in scripts "
"in tool mode."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຜາດໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂກລບອນ (global filesystem) ກໍເປັນໄປໄດ້, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຄຣິບໂໝດ "
"tool ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:129
msgid ""
"String as a path to a PNG file in the global filesystem. "
"See :ref:`@export_global_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_global_file>`."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະຜາດໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ PNG ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂກລບອນ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_global_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_global_file>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:135
msgid ""
"String as a path to a directory in the global filesystem. "
"See :ref:`@export_global_dir "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_global_dir>`."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະຜາດໄປຫາໂຟນເດີໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂກລບອນ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_global_dir "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_global_dir>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:141
msgid ""
"The multiline annotation tells the editor to show a large input field for "
"editing over multiple lines. See :ref:`@export_multiline "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_multiline>`."
msgstr ""
"ແອນໂນເທຊັນ multiline ຈະບອກໃຫ້ເອດິເຕີສະແດງຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍແຖວ. ເບິ່"
"ງ :ref:`@export_multiline <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_multiline>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:149
msgid "Strings as input actions"
msgstr "Strings ໃນຖານະການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (Input actions)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:151
msgid "String as an input action defined in the project's input map."
msgstr "String ໃນຖານະການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ Input Map ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:157
msgid ""
"String as an input action defined in the project's input map, plus default "
"built-in values such as ``ui_accept`` and ``ui_cancel``."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ໃນ Input Map ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ບວກກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພາຍໃນ ເຊັ່ນ "
"``ui_accept`` ແລະ ``ui_cancel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:164
msgid ""
"String as an input action defined in the project's input map, plus arbitrary "
"values that can manually be entered."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ໃນ Input Map ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ບວກກັບຄ່າໃດໆ ທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າ"
"ໄປເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:171
msgid ""
"String as an input action defined in the project's input map, plus default "
"built-in values such as ``ui_accept`` and ``ui_cancel`` and arbitrary values "
"that can manually be entered."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນຖານະການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ໃນ Input Map ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ລວມທັງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພາຍໃນ ແລະ ຄ່"
"າໃດໆ ທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄປເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:180
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:224
msgid "Limiting editor input ranges"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດຊ່ວງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນເອດິເຕີ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:182
msgid ""
"See :ref:`@export_range <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_range>` for all "
"of the following."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_range <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_range>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງ"
"ໝົດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:184
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:229
msgid "Allow integer values from 0 to 20."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດຄ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (int) ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 20."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:190
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:236
msgid "Allow integer values from -10 to 20."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດຄ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (int) ແຕ່ -10 ຫາ 20."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:196
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:243
msgid "Allow floats from -10 to 20 and snap the value to multiples of 0.2."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floats) ແຕ່ -10 ຫາ 20 ແລະ ປັບຄ່າ (snap) ໃຫ້ເປັນເທົ່າຕົວຂອງ 0.2."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:202
msgid ""
"The limits can be made to affect only the slider if you add the hints "
"``\"or_less\"`` and/or ``\"or_greater\"``. If either these hints are used, "
"it will be possible for the user to enter any value or drag the value with "
"the mouse when not using the slider, even if outside the specified range."
msgstr ""
"ການຈຳກັດສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນສະເພາະແຖບເລື່ອນ (slider) ໄດ້ ຫາກເຈົ້າເພີ່ມ hints ``\"or_less\"`` ແລ"
"ະ/ຫຼື ``\"or_greater\"``. ຫາກໃຊ້ hints ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະ ສາມາດປ້ອນຄ່າໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ລາກເ"
"ພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ກໍຕາມ (ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:211
msgid ""
"The ``\"exp\"`` hint can be used to make a value have an exponential slider "
"instead of a linear slider. This means that when dragging the slider towards "
"the right, changes will become progressively faster when dragging the mouse. "
"This is useful to make editing values that can be either very small or very "
"large easier, at the cost of being less intuitive."
msgstr ""
"Hint ``\"exp\"`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ແຖບເລື່ອນເປັນແບບ exponential ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ "
"(linear). ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອລາກແຖບເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາ, ຄ່າຈະປ່ຽນແປງ ໄວຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກ"
"ານແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ມີທັງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ ໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູ້ສຶກບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຄຸ້ນເຄີຍປານໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:221
msgid ""
"For values that are meant to represent an easing factor, "
"use :ref:`doc_gdscript_exports_floats_with_easing_hint` instead."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ easing factor, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`doc_gdscript_exports_floats_with_easing_hint` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:224
msgid ""
"The ``\"hide_slider\"`` hint can be used to hide the horizontal bar that "
"appears below ``float`` properties, or the up/down arrows that appear "
"besides ``int`` properties:"
msgstr ""
"Hint ``\"hide_slider\"`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງແຖບລາກແນວນອນທີ່ປະກົດຢູ່ກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດ ``float``, "
"ຫຼື ເຊື່ອງລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ທີ່ປະກົດຢູ່ຂ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດ ``int``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the other hand, the ``\"prefer_slider\"`` hint can be used to show a "
"horizontal bar below ``int`` properties instead of up/down arrows:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, hint ``\"prefer_slider\"`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງແຖບລາກແນວນອນ ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມ"
"ບັດ ``int`` ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:240
msgid "Adding suffixes and handling degrees/radians"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ ແລະ ການຈັດການອົງສາ/ເຣດຽນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:242
msgid ""
"A suffix can also be defined to make the value more self-explanatory in the "
"inspector. For example, to define a value that is meant to be configured as "
"\"meters\" (``m``) by the user:"
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດກຳນົດຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄ່ານັ້ນເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນ inspector. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"ແມັດ\" (``m``):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:250
msgid ""
"For angles that are stored in radians but displayed as degrees to the user, "
"use the `\"radians_as_degrees\"` hint:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບມຸມທີ່ເກັບເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians) ແຕ່ໃຫ້ສະແດງເປັນອົງສາ (degrees) ຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hint "
"`\"radians_as_degrees\"`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:257
msgid ""
"This performs automatic conversion when the value is displayed or modified "
"in the inspector and also displays a degree (``°``) suffix. This approach is "
"used by Godot's own `rotation` properties throughout the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດການແປງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອສະແດງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໃນ inspector ແລະ ຍັງສະແດງສັນຍາລັກອົງສາ "
"(``°``) ຕໍ່ທ້າຍນຳ. ວິທີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ `rotation` ຂອງ Godot ເອງທົ່ວທັງເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:261
msgid ""
"If the angle is stored in degrees instead, use the `\"degrees\"` hint to "
"display the degree symbol while disabling the automatic degrees-to-radians "
"conversion when the value is modified from the inspector."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມຸມນັ້ນຖືກເກັບເປັນອົງສາຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hint `\"degrees\"` ເພື່ອສະແດງ ສັນຍາລັກອົງສາ ໂດຍທີ່ຈະປິດກ"
"ານແປງຄ່າຈາກອົງສາເປັນເຣດຽນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:266
msgid "Linking vector values together"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄ່າ vector ເຂົ້າກັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:268
msgid ""
"It is possible to link vector values together. When the user adjusts one of "
"the vector's components, the other components are automatically adjusted "
"proportionally. For example, this is useful to maintain the aspect ratio of "
"a 2D sprite when adjusting its scale. This feature can be temporarily "
"disabled by the user by clicking the link icon to the right of the property."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄ່າ vector ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບສ່ວນປະກອບໜຶ່ງຂອງ vector, ສ່ວນປະກອບອື່ນໆຈະ"
"ຖືກປັບຕາມໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ເທົ່າກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect "
"ratio) ຂອງສະໄປຣທ໌ 2D ເມື່ອປັບຂະໜາດ (scale). ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ ໂດຍກ"
"ານຄລິກໄອຄອນຮູບໂສ້ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:279
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:646
msgid "Results in:"
msgstr "ຜົນລັດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:281
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:285
msgid "Linked Vector2i property with the \"px\" suffix"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ Vector2i ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ ພ້ອມກັບຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ \"px\""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:287
msgid ""
":ref:`This hint <class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_HINT_LINK>` is "
"effective on Vector2, Vector2i, Vector3, Vector3i, Vector4, and Vector4i. It "
"can be used at the same time as a property suffix, as seen in the example "
"above."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Hint ນີ້ <class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_HINT_LINK>` ສົ່ງຜົນກັບ "
"Vector2, Vector2i, Vector3, Vector3i, Vector4, ແລະ Vector4i. ມັນສາມາດ ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຄ"
"ຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍຄຸນສົມບັດໄດ້ ດັ່ງທີ່ເຫັນໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:294
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:260
msgid "Floats with easing hint"
msgstr "Floats ພ້ອມກັບ easing hint"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:296
msgid ""
"Display a visual representation of the ``ease()`` function when editing. "
"See :ref:`@export_exp_easing "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_exp_easing>`."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຮູບພາບຈຳລອງຂອງຟັງຊັນ ``ease()`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_exp_easing "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_exp_easing>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:304
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:287
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "ສີ (Colors)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:306
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:289
msgid "Regular color given as red-green-blue-alpha value."
msgstr "ສີປົກກະຕິທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າ red-green-blue-alpha (RGBA)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:312
msgid ""
"Color given as red-green-blue value (alpha will always be 1). "
"See :ref:`@export_color_no_alpha "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_color_no_alpha>`."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າ red-green-blue (ຄ່າ alpha ຈະເປັນ 1 ສະເໝີ). ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`@export_color_no_alpha "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_color_no_alpha>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:321
msgid ""
"Nodes can also be directly exported as properties in a script without having "
"to use NodePaths:"
msgstr ""
"Nodes ສາມາດເອັກສະປອດເປັນຄຸນສົມບັດໃນສະຄຣິບໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ NodePaths:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:333
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:328
msgid ""
"Exporting NodePaths like in Godot 3.x is still possible, in case you need it:"
msgstr ""
"ການເອັກສະປອດ NodePaths ຄືກັບໃນ Godot 3.x ຍັງຄົງເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:340
msgid ""
"If you want to limit the types of nodes for NodePaths, you can use "
"the :ref:`@export_node_path<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_node_path>` "
"annotation:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດປະເພດຂອງໂນດສຳລັບ NodePaths, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ "
":ref:`@export_node_path <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_node_path>`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:355
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:348
msgid ""
"In the Inspector, you can then drag and drop a resource file from the "
"FileSystem dock into the variable slot."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Inspector, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈາກ FileSystem dock ລົງໃນຊ່ອງຂອງຕົວ"
"ປ່ຽນໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:358
msgid ""
"Opening the inspector dropdown may result in an extremely long list of "
"possible classes to create, however. Therefore, if you specify an extension "
"of Resource such as:"
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການເປີດລາຍການເລືອກໃນ inspector ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍຊື່ຄລາດ ທີ່ຍາວຫຼາຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າລະບຸຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ Resource ເຊັ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:366
msgid ""
"The drop-down menu will be limited to AnimationNode and all its derived "
"classes."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການເລືອກກໍຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ AnimationNode ແລະ ທຸກໆຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:371
msgid ""
"Using ``@export`` variables for :ref:`Resource <class_Resource>` objects "
"makes them a dependency of the instance, meaning that all the resources "
"referenced by ``@export`` variables are loaded when the scene containing the "
"script is loaded. If you want to reference a :ref:`Resource "
"<class_Resource>` object but load it manually when you need it (which, for "
"example, is often the case for :ref:`PackedScenes <class_PackedScene>` "
"containing a whole level), use ``@export_file`` or ``@export_file_path`` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ ``@export`` ສຳລັບອັອບເຈັກ :ref:`Resource <class_Resource>` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກ"
"ມັນກາຍເປັນຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (dependency) ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງໂ"
"ດຍຕົວປ່ຽນ ``@export`` ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນມາທັນທີ ເມື່ອສາກ (scene) ທີ່ບັນຈຸສະຄຣິບນັ້ນຖືກໂຫຼດ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງ"
"ການອ້າງອີງເຖິງອັອບເຈັກ :ref:`Resource <class_Resource>` ແຕ່ຢາກໂຫຼດມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນເວລາທີ່ຕ້"
"ອງການ (ເຊັ່ນ ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ :ref:`PackedScenes <class_PackedScene>` ທີ່ເກັບດ່ານທັງໝົດ), ໃຫ້"
"ໃຊ້ ``@export_file`` ຫຼື ``@export_file_path`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:383
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:369
msgid "Exporting bit flags"
msgstr "ການເອັກສະປອດ bit flags"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:385
msgid "See :ref:`@export_flags <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_flags>`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_flags <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_flags>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:387
msgid ""
"Integers used as bit flags can store multiple ``true``/``false`` (boolean) "
"values in one property. By using the ``@export_flags`` annotation, they can "
"be set from the editor:"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນ bit flags ສາມາດເກັບຄ່າ ``true``/``false`` (boolean) ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄ່າໃນຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດດຽວ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ ``@export_flags``, ພວກມັນຈະສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຈາກເອດິເຕີ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:396
msgid ""
"You must provide a string description for each flag. In this example, "
"``Fire`` has value 1, ``Water`` has value 2, ``Earth`` has value 4 and "
"``Wind`` corresponds to value 8. Usually, constants should be defined "
"accordingly (e.g. ``const ELEMENT_WIND = 8`` and so on)."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸຄຳອະທິບາຍ (string) ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ flag. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ``Fire`` ມີຄ່າ 1, "
"``Water`` ມີຄ່າ 2, ``Earth`` ມີຄ່າ 4 ແລະ ``Wind`` ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 8. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຄວນກຳນົດຄ່າ"
"ຄົງທີ່ໄວ້ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ``const ELEMENT_WIND = 8`` ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:401
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:454
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:409
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:471
msgid "You can add explicit values using a colon:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈໍ້າສອງເມັດ (colon):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:407
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:416
msgid ""
"Only power of 2 values are valid as bit flags options. The lowest allowed "
"value is 1, as 0 means that nothing is selected. You can also add options "
"that are a combination of other flags:"
msgstr ""
"ມີພຽງຄ່າທີ່ເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2 ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເປັນຕົວເລືອກ bit flags. ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຄື 1, ເພາະວ່"
"າ 0 ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການເລືອກໃດໆ. ເຈົ້າຍັງ ສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນການລວມກັນຂອງ flag ອື່ນໆໄດ້ນຳ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:416
msgid ""
"Export annotations are also provided for the physics, render, and navigation "
"layers defined in the project settings:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງມີແອນໂນເທຊັນການເອັກສະປອດສຳລັບເລເຢີ (layers) ຂອງ physics, render, ແລະ "
"navigation ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:427
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:438
msgid ""
"Using bit flags requires some understanding of bitwise operations. If in "
"doubt, use boolean variables instead."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ bit flags ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈກ່ຽວກັບການດຳເນີນການທາງບິດ (bitwise operations). ຫາກບໍ່"
"ໝັ້ນໃຈ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ boolean ແຍກກັນແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:431
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:442
msgid "Exporting enums"
msgstr "ການເອັກສະປອດຕົວເລືອກ (Enums)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:433
msgid "See :ref:`@export_enum <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_enum>`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_enum <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_enum>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:435
msgid ""
"Properties can be exported with a type hint referencing an enum to limit "
"their values to the values of the enumeration. The editor will create a "
"widget in the Inspector, enumerating the following as \"Thing 1\", \"Thing "
"2\", \"Another Thing\". The value will be stored as an integer."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດເອັກສະປອດໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບ type hint ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ enum ເພື່ອຈຳກັດ ຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຕົວ"
"ເລືອກທີ່ກຳນົດ. ເອດິເຕີຈະສ້າງວິດເຈັດ (widget) ໃນ Inspector ທີ່ສະແດງຕົວເລືອກເປັນ \"Thing "
"1\", \"Thing 2\", \"Another Thing\". ຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ຈະເປັນຕົວເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (integer)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:444
msgid ""
"Integer and string properties can also be limited to a specific list of "
"values using the :ref:`@export_enum "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_enum>` annotation. The editor will "
"create a widget in the Inspector, enumerating the following as Warrior, "
"Magician, Thief. The value will be stored as an integer, corresponding to "
"the index of the selected option (i.e. ``0``, ``1``,  or ``2``)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດປະເພດ integer ແລະ string ສາມາດຈຳກັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການຕົວເລືອກສະເພາະ ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແອນໂນເ"
"ທຊັນ :ref:`@export_enum <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_enum>`. ເອດິເຕີຈະສ້າງ"
"ວິດເຈັດໃນ Inspector ທີ່ສະແດງຕົວເລືອກເປັນ Warrior, Magician, Thief. ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບເປັນຕົວເລກ"
"ຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງຕົວເລືອກນັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ``0``, ``1``, ຫຼື ``2``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:460
msgid "If the type is String, the value will be stored as a string."
msgstr "ຖ້າປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນເປັນ String, ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ string."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:466
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:485
msgid "If you want to set an initial value, you must specify it explicitly:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸມັນໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:473
msgid "Exporting arrays"
msgstr "ການເອັກສະປອດອາເຣ (Arrays)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:475
msgid ""
"Exported arrays can have initializers, but they must be constant expressions."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣທີ່ເອັກສະປອດສາມາດມີການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງເປັນນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:477
msgid ""
"If the exported array specifies a type which inherits from Resource, the "
"array values can be set in the inspector by dragging and dropping multiple "
"files from the FileSystem dock at once."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າອາເຣທີ່ເອັກສະປອດມີການລະບຸປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Resource, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າອາເຣໄດ້ໃນ "
"inspector ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຫຼາຍໆໄຟລ໌ ຈາກ FileSystem dock ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:481
msgid "The default value **must** be a constant expression."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ **ຈະຕ້ອງ** ເປັນນິພົດຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:490
msgid "Exported arrays can specify type (using the same hints as before)."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣທີ່ເອັກສະປອດສາມາດລະບຸປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ hints ແບບດຽວກັບທີ່ຜ່ານມາ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:499
msgid ""
"You can omit the default value, but it would then be ``null`` if not "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດບໍ່ໃສ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກໍໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນຈະກາຍເປັນ ``null`` ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:506
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:561
msgid ""
"Arrays with specified types which inherit from resource can be set by drag-"
"and-dropping multiple files from the FileSystem dock."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣທີ່ມີການລະບຸປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Resource ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການ ລາກ ແລະ ວາງຫຼາຍໆໄຟລ໌ຈາ"
"ກ FileSystem dock."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:514
msgid "Packed type arrays also work, but only initialized empty:"
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣປະເພດ Packed (Packed type arrays) ກໍໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນອາເຣວ່"
"າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:521
msgid "Other export variants can also be used when exporting arrays:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການເອັກສະປອດອື່ນໆ ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບອາເຣໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:531
msgid "``@export_storage``"
msgstr "``@export_storage``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:533
msgid ""
"See :ref:`@export_storage <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_storage>`."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`@export_storage <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_storage>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:535
msgid "By default, exporting a property has two effects:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການເອັກສະປອດຄຸນສົມບັດຈະມີຜົນສອງຢ່າງຄື:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:537
msgid ""
"makes the property stored in the scene/resource file "
"(:ref:`PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE "
"<class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE>`);"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ scene/resource (:ref:`PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE "
"<class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE>`);"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:538
msgid ""
"adds a field to the Inspector (:ref:`PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR "
"<class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR>`)."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າໃນ Inspector (:ref:`PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR "
"<class_@GlobalScope_constant_PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR>`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:540
msgid ""
"However, sometimes you may want to make a property serializable, but not "
"display it in the editor to prevent unintentional changes and cluttering the "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ບາງຄັ້ງເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນສາມາດບັນທຶກໄດ້ (serializable), ແຕ່ບໍ່ຢາກໃຫ້ສ"
"ະແດງໃນເອດິເຕີ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ ແລະ ບໍ່ໃຫ້ ໜ້າຈໍເບິ່ງຮົກເກີນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:543
msgid ""
"To do this you can use :ref:`@export_storage "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_storage>`. This can be useful "
"for :ref:`@tool <class_@GDScript_annotation_@tool>` scripts. Also the "
"property value is copied when :ref:`Resource.duplicate() "
"<class_Resource_method_duplicate>` or :ref:`Node.duplicate() "
"<class_Node_method_duplicate>` is called, unlike non-exported variables."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດແບບນີ້ ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`@export_storage "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_storage>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບສະຄຣິບແບບ "
":ref:`@tool <class_@GDScript_annotation_@tool>`. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້"
"ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ :ref:`Resource.duplicate() <class_Resource_method_duplicate>` ຫຼື "
":ref:`Node.duplicate() <class_Node_method_duplicate>`, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເອັກ"
"ສະປອດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:555
msgid "``@export_custom``"
msgstr "``@export_custom``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:557
msgid ""
"If you need more control than what's exposed with the built-in ``@export`` "
"annotations, you can use ``@export_custom`` instead. This allows defining "
"any property hint, hint string and usage flags, with a syntax similar to the "
"one used by the editor for built-in nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າສິ່ງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນແອນໂນເທຊັນ ``@export`` ແບບສຳເລັດຮູບ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດ"
"ໃຊ້ ``@export_custom`` ແທນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດ property hint, hint string ແລະ "
"usage flags ໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບທີ່ ເອດິເຕີໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດພາຍໃນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:562
msgid ""
"For example, this exposes the ``altitude`` property with no range limits but "
"an ``m`` (meter) suffix defined:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ນີ້ຄືການສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດ ``altitude`` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຊ່ວງ ແຕ່ມີການກຳນົດຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍເປັນ "
"``m`` (ແມັດ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:569
msgid ""
"The above is normally not feasible with the standard ``@export_range`` "
"syntax, since it requires defining a range."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍໄວຍາກອນ ``@export_range`` ມາດຕະຖານ, ເນື່ອງຈ"
"າກມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດຊ່ວງ (range) ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:572
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`class reference <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_custom>` "
"for a list of parameters and their allowed values."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`class reference <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_custom>` ສຳລັບລາ"
"ຍການພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:577
msgid ""
"When using ``@export_custom``, GDScript does not perform any validation on "
"the syntax. Invalid syntax may have unexpected behavior in the inspector."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``@export_custom``, GDScript ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ຂອງໄວຍາກອນ. ໄວຍ"
"າກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດໃນ inspector."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:581
msgid "``@export_tool_button``"
msgstr "``@export_tool_button``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:583
msgid ""
"If you need to create a clickable inspector button, you can use "
"``@export_tool_button``. This exports a ``Callable`` property as a clickable "
"button. When the button is pressed, the callable is called."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງປຸ່ມທີ່ກົດໄດ້ໃນ inspector, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ``@export_tool_button``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ"
"ເອັກສະປອດຄຸນສົມບັດ ``Callable`` ເປັນປຸ່ມທີ່ກົດໄດ້. ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ, ຟັງຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ (callable) ຈະຖື"
"ກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:586
msgid ""
"You can specify a custom icon name, which must match one of the icon file "
"names from the `editor/icons <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/"
"master/editor/icons>`__ folder of the Godot source repository (case-"
"sensitive). You can also browse the editor icons using the `Godot editor "
"icons <https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/>`__ website."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ໄອຄອນແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນ ໃນໂຟນເດີ `editor/icons "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/editor/icons>`__ ຂອງ Godot "
"(ຕ້ອງກົງທັງຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ພິມນ້ອຍ). ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເບິ່ງໄອຄອນທັງໝົດ ໄດ້ທີ່ເວັບໄຊ `Godot editor "
"icons <https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:593
msgid ""
"For example, if you wish to use ``Node2D.svg`` from that folder, you must "
"specify ``\"Node2D\"`` as the second parameter of ``@export_tool_button``. "
"It is not currently possible to use custom icons from the project folder; "
"only built-in editor icons can be used."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ ``Node2D.svg`` ຈາກໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸ ``\"Node2D\"`` ເປັນ"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີໂຕທີສອງຂອງ ``@export_tool_button``. ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄອຄອນຈາກໂຟນເດີຂອງໂປ"
"ຣເຈັກໄດ້; ໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ໄອຄອນ ທີ່ມີມາກັບເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:598
msgid ""
"This exports a button with label ``\"Hello\"`` and icon ``\"Callable\"`` "
"(which is the default if no icon is specified). When you press it, it will "
"print ``\"Hello world!\"``."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເອັກສະປອດປຸ່ມທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່ວ່າ ``\"Hello\"`` ແລະ ໄອຄອນ ``\"Callable\"`` (ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມ"
"ຕົ້ນຖ້າບໍ່ລະບຸໄອຄອນ). ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກົດປຸ່ມ, ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``\"Hello world!\"``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:613
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:625
msgid "Setting exported variables from a tool script"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ ຈາກສະຄຣິບແບບ tool"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:615
msgid ""
"When changing an exported variable's value from a script "
"in :ref:`doc_gdscript_tool_mode`, the value in the inspector won't be "
"updated automatically. To update it, "
"call :ref:`notify_property_list_changed() "
"<class_Object_method_notify_property_list_changed>` after setting the "
"exported variable's value."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ ຈາກສະຄຣິບໃນ :ref:`ໂໝດ tool "
"<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>`, ຄ່າໃນ inspector ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອອັບເດດມັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ :ref:`notify_property_list_changed() "
"<class_Object_method_notify_property_list_changed>` ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:622
msgid "Reading an exported variable's value early on"
msgstr "ການອ່ານຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:624
msgid ""
"If you read an exported variable's value in :ref:`_init() "
"<class_Object_private_method__init>`, it will return the default value "
"specified in the export annotation instead of the value that was set in the "
"inspector. This is because assigning values from the saved scene/resource "
"file occurs *after* object initialization; until then, the default value is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າອ່ານຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດໃນ :ref:`_init() <class_Object_private_method__init>"
"`, ມັນຈະໄດ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນແອນໂນເທຊັນ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ inspector. ເນື່ອງຈາກການກຳນົ"
"ດຄ່າຈາກໄຟລ໌ scene/resource ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ *ຫຼັງຈາກ* ການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອັອບເຈັກ; ໃນຊ່"
"ວງເວລານັ້ນ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈຶ່ງຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:629
msgid ""
"To get the value that was set in the inspector (and therefore saved in the "
"scene/resource file), you need to read it *after* the object is constructed, "
"such as in :ref:`Node._ready() <class_Node_private_method__ready>`. You can "
"also read the value in a setter that's defined on the exported property, "
"which is useful in custom resources where ``_ready()`` is not available:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ inspector (ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌), ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງອ່ານ ມັນ *ຫຼັງຈາກ* ທີ່ອັອບເຈັກຖືກສ້"
"າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ເຊັ່ນໃນ :ref:`Node._ready() <class_Node_private_method__ready>`. ນອກຈາກ"
"ນີ້ ເຈົ້າກໍຍັງສາມາດອ່ານຄ່ານັ້ນໃນ setter ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນ custom "
"resources ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ ``_ready()`` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:654
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:634
msgid "Advanced exports"
msgstr "ການເອັກສະປອດແບບຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:656
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:636
msgid ""
"Not every type of export can be provided on the level of the language itself "
"to avoid unnecessary design complexity. The following describes some more or "
"less common exporting features which can be implemented with a low-level API."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆຮູບແບບການເອັກສະປອດທີ່ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃນລະດັບຕົວພາສາເອງ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງ ຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໃນການອອກແບບທີ່ບໍ່ຈ"
"ຳເປັນ. ຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ ການເອັກສະປອດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ພົບໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ດ້ວ"
"ຍ API ລະດັບຕໍ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:660
msgid ""
"Before reading further, you should get familiar with the way properties are "
"handled and how they can be customized with :ref:`_set() "
"<class_Object_private_method__set>`, :ref:`_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`, and :ref:`_get_property_list() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get_property_list>` methods as described "
"in :ref:`doc_accessing_data_or_logic_from_object`."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນຈະອ່ານຕໍ່, ເຈົ້າຄວນເຮັດຄວາມຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບວິທີການຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ວິທີປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນດ້ວຍເມທອດ "
":ref:`_set() <class_Object_private_method__set>`, :ref:`_get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`, ແລະ :ref:`_get_property_list() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get_property_list>` ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_accessing_data_or_logic_from_object`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:667
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:647
msgid ""
"For binding properties using the above methods in C++, "
"see :ref:`doc_binding_properties_using_set_get_property_list`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຜູກ (binding) ຄຸນສົມບັດໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດຂ້າງເທິງໃນ C++, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_binding_properties_using_set_get_property_list`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:670
msgid ""
"The script must operate in the ``@tool`` mode so the above methods can work "
"from within the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ ``@tool`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເມທອດຂ້າງເທິງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກ ໄດ້ຈາກພາຍໃນເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:4
msgid "GDScript documentation comments"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (Documentation comments) ໃນ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:6
msgid ""
"In GDScript, comments can be used to document your code and add descriptions "
"to the members of a script. There are two differences between a normal "
"comment and a documentation comment. Firstly, a documentation comment should "
"start with double hash symbols ``##``. Secondly, it must immediately precede "
"a script member, or for script descriptions, be placed at the top of the "
"script. If an exported variable is documented, its description is used as a "
"tooltip in the editor. This documentation can be generated as XML files by "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ GDScript, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຳບັນຍາຍໃ"
"ຫ້ກັບສະມາຊິກຕ່າງໆຂອງສະຄຣິບ. ມີສອງຈຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ ລະຫວ່າງຄຳອະທິບາຍທົ່ວໄປ ກັບ ຄຳອະທິບາຍແບບ "
"documentation. ຢ່າງທຳອິດຄື: ຄຳອະທິບາຍແບບ documentation ຈະຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash ສ"
"ອງໂຕ ``##``. ຢ່າງທີສອງຄື: ມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້າສະມາຊິກຂອງສະຄຣິບທັນທີ, ຫຼື ຖ້າເປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຂອງສະຄຣິບ"
"ເອງ, ກໍຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງສຸດຂອງສະຄຣິບ. ຖ້າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍກຳກັບໄວ້, ຄຳບັນຍາຍນັ້ນຈ"
"ະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ tooltip ໃນເອດິເຕີ. ເອກະສານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຖືກສ້າງ (generate) ອອກມາເປັນໄຟລ໌ XML ໄດ້"
"ໂດຍເອດິເຕີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:15
msgid "Documenting a script"
msgstr "ການເຮັດເອກະສານອະທິບາຍສະຄຣິບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:17
msgid ""
"Comments documenting a script must come before any member documentation. A "
"suggested format for script documentation can be divided into three parts."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບສະຄຣິບ ຈະຕ້ອງມາກ່ອນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງສະມາຊິກໃດໆ. ຮູບແບບ ທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບການເຮັດເອກະສ"
"ານສະຄຣິບ ສາມາດແບ່ງອອກເປັນສາມສ່ວນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:20
msgid "A brief description of the script."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:21
msgid "Detailed description."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍລາຍລະອຽດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:22
msgid "Tutorials and deprecated/experimental marks."
msgstr "ບົດຮຽນ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທີ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້/ຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:24
msgid ""
"To separate these from each other, the documentation comments use special "
"tags. The tag must be at the beginning of a line (ignoring preceding white "
"space) and must have the format ``@``, followed by the keyword."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແຍກສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກຈາກກັນ, ຄຳເຫັນປະກອບເອກະສານຈະໃຊ້ແທັກພິເສດ. ແທັກຕ້ອງຢູ່ຕົ້ນແຖວ (ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຍະຫ"
"ວ່າງທາງໜ້າ) ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຮູບແບບ ``@``, ຕາມດ້ວຍຄຳສັບຫຼັກ (keyword)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:29
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:91
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "ແທັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:32
msgid "Brief description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:32
msgid "No tag. Lives at the very beginning of the documentation section."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແທັກ. ຢູ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພາກສ່ວນເອກະສານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:35
msgid "No tag. Use one blank line to separate the description from the brief."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແທັກ. ໃຊ້ແຖວຫວ່າງໜຶ່ງແຖວເພື່ອແຍກຄຳອະທິບາຍອອກຈາກຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:38
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "ບົດຮຽນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@tutorial: https://example.com``"
msgstr "``@tutorial: https://example.com``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@tutorial(The Title Here): https://example.com``"
msgstr "``@tutorial(The Title Here): https://example.com``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:41
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:96
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ (Deprecated)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@deprecated``"
msgstr "``@deprecated``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@deprecated: Use [AnotherClass] instead.``"
msgstr "``@deprecated: ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [AnotherClass] ແທນ.``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:44
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:99
msgid "Experimental"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ (Experimental)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@experimental``"
msgstr "``@experimental``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:0
msgid "``@experimental: This class is unstable.``"
msgstr "``@experimental: ຄລາສນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ຄົງທີ່.``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:64
msgid ""
"If there is any space in between the tag name and colon, for example "
"``@tutorial  :``, it won't be treated as a valid tag and will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີຍະຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງຊື່ແທັກ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``@tutorial  :``, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖືວ່າເ"
"ປັນແທັກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.rst:69
msgid ""
"When the description spans multiple lines, the preceding and trailing white "
"spaces will be stripped and joined with a single space. To preserve the line "
"break use ``[br]``. See also `BBCode and class reference`_ below."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄຳອະທິບາຍມີຫຼາຍແຖວ, ຍະຫວ່າງທາງໜ້າ ແລະ ທາງຫຼັງຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງດຽວ. ເ"
"ພື່ອຄົງການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໄວ້ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``[br]``. ເບິ່ງ `BBCode and class reference`_ ທາງລຸ່ມ."

