#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:515
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:365
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:84
