msgid ""
"Note that while some specifics change, most concepts work the same when "
"using C# for scripting. If you're new to Godot, you may want to follow the "
"tutorials on :ref:`doc_scripting` at this point. While some documentation "
"pages still lack C# examples, most notions can be transferred from GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ເຖິງວ່າລາຍລະອຽດບາງຢ່າງຈະປ່ຽນແປງ, ແຕ່ແນວຄິດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກໍຍັງເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນເມື່ອໃຊ້ C# ໃນການຂ"
"ຽນສະຄຣິບ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເປັນມືໃໝ່ໃນ Godot, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຕິດຕາມບົດຮຽນໃນ "
":ref:`doc_scripting` ໃນຕອນນີ້. ເຖິງວ່າເອກະສານບາງໜ້າຈະຍັງຂາດຕົວຢ່າງ C#, ແຕ່ແນວຄິດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກໍ"
"ສາມາດນຳມາຈາກ GDScript ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:209
msgid "Project setup and workflow"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:211
msgid ""
"When you create the first C# script, Godot initializes the C# project files "
"for your Godot project. This includes generating a C# solution (``.sln``) "
"and a project file (``.csproj``), as well as some utility files and folders "
"(``.godot/mono``). All of these but ``.godot/mono`` are important and should "
"be committed to your version control system. Everything under ``.godot`` can "
"be safely added to the ignore list of your VCS. When troubleshooting, it can "
"sometimes help to delete the ``.godot/mono`` folder and let it regenerate."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງສະຄຣິບ C# ຕົວທຳອິດ, Godot ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໂປຣເຈັກ C# ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ລວມມີການສ້າງ C# solution (``.sln``) ແລະ project file (``.csproj``), ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ ແ"
"ລະ ໂຟນເດີຊ່ວຍບາງຢ່າງ (``.godot/mono``). ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນ ``.godot/mono`` ແມ່ນມີຄວ"
"າມສຳຄັນ ແລະ ຄວນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (VCS). ທຸກຢ່າງພາຍໃຕ້ ``.godot`` ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ"
"ໃນລາຍການລະເວັ້ນ (ignore list) ຂອງ VCS ໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ. ເມື່ອເກີດບັນຫາ, ບາງຄັ້ງການລຶບໂຟນເດີ "
"``.godot/mono`` ແລ້ວປ່ອຍໃຫ້ມັນສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ກໍສາມາດຊ່ວຍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:224
msgid ""
"Here's a blank C# script with some comments to demonstrate how it works."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບ C# ເປົ່າໆ ພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments) ເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:250
msgid ""
"As you can see, functions normally in global scope in GDScript like Godot's "
"``print`` function are available in the ``GD`` static class which is part of "
"the ``Godot`` namespace. For a full list of methods in the ``GD`` class, see "
"the class reference pages for :ref:`@GDScript <class_@gdscript>` "
"and :ref:`@GlobalScope <class_@globalscope>`."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າເຫັນ, ຟັງຊັນທີ່ປົກກະຕິຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທົ່ວໂລກໃນ GDScript ເຊັ່ນຟັງຊັນ ``print`` ຂອງ Godot ຈະ"
"ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຄຼາສ static ``GD`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ namespace ``Godot``. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ເມທອດທັງໝົ"
"ດໃນຄຼາສ ``GD``, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໜ້າອ້າງອີງຄຼາສສຳລັບ :ref:`@GDScript <class_@gdscript>` ແລະ "
":ref:`@GlobalScope <class_@globalscope>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:258
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the class you wish to attach to your node should have the "
"same name as the ``.cs`` file. Otherwise, you will get the following error:"
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມວ່າຄຼາສທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕິດໃສ່ໂນດຄວນມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ ``.cs``. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄ"
"ປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:261
msgid "*\"Cannot find class XXX for script res://XXX.cs\"*"
msgstr "*\"Cannot find class XXX for script res://XXX.cs\"*"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:266
msgid "General differences between C# and GDScript"
msgstr "ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທົ່ວໄປລະຫວ່າງ C# ແລະ GDScript"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:268
msgid ""
"The C# API uses ``PascalCase`` instead of ``snake_case`` in GDScript/C++. "
"Where possible, fields and getters/setters have been converted to "
"properties. In general, the C# Godot API strives to be as idiomatic as is "
"reasonably possible."
msgstr ""
"API ຂອງ C# ຈະໃຊ້ ``PascalCase`` ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ``snake_case`` ຄືໃນ GDScript/C++. ໃນບ່"
"ອນທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ຟິວ (fields) ແລະ getters/setters ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties). ໂດ"
"ຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, API ຂອງ Godot ໃນ C# ຈະພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທີ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດຂອງພາສາໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈ"
"ະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:272
msgid "For more information, see the :ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences` page."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໜ້າ :ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:276
msgid ""
"You need to (re)build the project assemblies whenever you want to see new "
"exported variables or signals in the editor. This build can be manually "
"triggered by clicking the **Build** button in the top right corner of the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ (build) ແອັສເຊັມບລີ (assemblies) ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຫັນຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ສົ່"
"ງອອກ (exported variables) ຫຼື ສັນຍານໃໝ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ການ build ນີ້ສາມາດກົດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍກ"
"ານຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Build** ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:283
msgid ""
"You will also need to rebuild the project assemblies to apply changes in "
"\"tool\" scripts."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າກໍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ rebuild ແອັສເຊັມບລີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນສະຄຣິບ \"tool\" ມີຜົນນຳໃ"
"ຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:287
msgid "Current gotchas and known issues"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ ແລະ ບັນຫາທີ່ພົບໃນປະຈຸບັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:289
msgid ""
"As C# support is quite new in Godot, there are some growing pains and things "
"that need to be ironed out. Below is a list of the most important issues you "
"should be aware of when diving into C# in Godot, but if in doubt, also take "
"a look over the official `issue tracker for .NET issues <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/labels/topic%3Adotnet>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການຮອງຮັບ C# ໃນ Godot ຍັງຂ້ອນຂ້າງໃໝ່, ຈຶ່ງຍັງມີບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງ. ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນ"
"ລາຍຊື່ບັນຫາທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຄວນຮັບຮູ້ເມື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ C# ໃນ Godot, ແຕ່ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ສົງໄສ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ `issue "
"tracker ທາງການສຳລັບບັນຫາ .NET <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/labels/"
"topic%3Adotnet>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:295
msgid ""
"Writing editor plugins is possible, but it is currently quite convoluted."
msgstr ""
"ການຂຽນປລັກອິນສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor plugins) ແມ່ນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້, ແຕ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນແມ່ນຍັງຂ້ອນຂ້າງຊັບຊ້"
"ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:296
msgid ""
"State is currently not saved and restored when hot-reloading, with the "
"exception of exported variables."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນ ສະຖານະ (state) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນເມື່ອມີການ hot-reloading, ຍົກເວັ້ນຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຖືກສົ່"
"ງອອກ (exported variables)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:298
msgid ""
"Attached C# scripts should refer to a class that has a class name that "
"matches the file name."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ C# ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ຄວນອ້າງອີງເຖິງຄຼາສທີ່ມີຊື່ຄຼາສກົງກັບຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:300
msgid ""
"There are some methods such as ``Get()``/``Set()``, ``Call()``/"
"``CallDeferred()`` and signal connection method ``Connect()`` that rely on "
"Godot's ``snake_case`` API naming conventions. So when using e.g. "
"``CallDeferred(\"AddChild\")``, ``AddChild`` will not work because the API "
"is expecting the original ``snake_case`` version ``add_child``. However, you "
"can use any custom properties or methods without this limitation. Prefer "
"using the exposed ``StringName`` in the ``PropertyName``, ``MethodName`` and "
"``SignalName`` to avoid extra ``StringName`` allocations and worrying about "
"snake_case naming."
msgstr ""
"ມີບາງເມທອດເຊັ່ນ ``Get()``/``Set()``, ``Call()``/``CallDeferred()`` ແລະ ເມທອດການເ"
"ຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``Connect()`` ທີ່ຍັງຄົງອີງໃສ່ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ API ແບບ ``snake_case`` ຂອງ "
"Godot. ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ``CallDeferred(\"AddChild\")``, ``AddChild`` ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວ"
"ຽກ ເພາະວ່າ API ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນ ``snake_case`` ດັ້ງເດີມຄື ``add_child``. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າສ"
"າມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ຫຼື ເມທອດທີ່ສ້າງເອງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``StringName`` ທີ່ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍໃ"
"ນ ``PropertyName``, ``MethodName`` ແລະ ``SignalName`` ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຈອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈ"
"ຳ ``StringName`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຊື່ແບບ snake_case."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:310
msgid ""
"As of Godot 4.0, exporting .NET projects is supported for desktop platforms "
"(Linux, Windows and macOS). Other platforms will gain support in future 4.x "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ .NET ແມ່ນຮອງຮັບສຳລັບແພລດຟອມເດັສທັອບ "
"(Linux, Windows ແລະ macOS). ແພລດຟອມອື່ນໆ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນເວີຊັນ 4.x ໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:315
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:317
msgid ""
"You might encounter the following error when trying to modify some values in "
"Godot objects, e.g. when trying to change the X coordinate of a ``Node2D``:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂຄ່າບາງຢ່າງໃນອັອບເຈັກຂອງ Godot, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອພະຍາ"
"ຍາມປ່ຽນພິກັດ X ຂອງ ``Node2D``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:333
msgid ""
"This is perfectly normal. Structs (in this example, a ``Vector2``) in C# are "
"copied on assignment, meaning that when you retrieve such an object from a "
"property or an indexer, you get a copy of it, not the object itself. "
"Modifying said copy without reassigning it afterwards won't achieve anything."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິ. ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ (Structs) ໃນ C# (ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຄື ``Vector2``) ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາ "
"(copied) ເມື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອເຈົ້າດຶງອັອບເຈັກດັ່ງກ່າວມາຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ ຫຼື ດັດຊະນີ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັ"
"ບພຽງແຕ່ສຳເນົາຂອງມັນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວອັອບເຈັກເອງ. ການແກ້ໄຂສຳເນົາດັ່ງກ່າວໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່ໃນພາຍຫຼັ"
"ງ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:338
msgid ""
"The workaround is simple: retrieve the entire struct, modify the value you "
"want to modify, and reassign the property."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແມ່ນງ່າຍໆ: ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ struct ທັງໝົດອອກມາ, ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ຄຸນສົ"
"ມບັດນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:347
msgid ""
"Since C# 10, it is also possible to use `with expressions <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/operators/with-"
"expression>`_ on structs, allowing you to do the same thing in a single line."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ C# 10 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ `with expressions <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/operators/with-"
"expression>`_ ກັບ structs ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຮັດສິ່ງດຽວກັນໄດ້ໃນແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:354
msgid ""
"You can read more about this error on the `C# language reference <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/compiler-messages/"
"cs1612>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ທີ່ `C# language reference <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/compiler-messages/"
"cs1612>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:357
msgid "Performance of C# in Godot"
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ C# ໃນ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:361
msgid ""
"For a performance comparison of the languages Godot supports, "
"see :ref:`doc_faq_which_programming_language_is_fastest`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບປະສິດທິພາບຂອງພາສາຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ Godot ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_faq_which_programming_language_is_fastest`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:364
msgid ""
"Most properties of Godot C# objects that are based on ``GodotObject`` (e.g. "
"any ``Node`` like ``Control`` or ``Node3D`` like ``Camera3D``) require "
"native (interop) calls as they talk to Godot's C++ core. Consider assigning "
"values of such properties into a local variable if you need to modify or "
"read them multiple times at a single code location:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງອັອບເຈັກ C# ໃນ Godot ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ ``GodotObject`` (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ``Node`` ໃດ"
"ໆ ຄື ``Control`` ຫຼື ``Node3D`` ຄື ``Camera3D``) ຕ້ອງການການຮຽກໃຊ້ແບບ native "
"(interop) ເພາະວ່າພວກມັນຕິດຕໍ່ກັບສ່ວນຫຼັກ C++ ຂອງ Godot. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່າ"
"ນັ້ນໃສ່ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນ (local variable) ຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ອ່ານພວກມັນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນບ່ອນດຽວກັ"
"ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:400
msgid ""
"Passing raw arrays (such as ``byte[]``) or ``string`` to Godot's C# API "
"requires marshalling which is comparatively pricey."
msgstr ""
"ການສົ່ງອາເຣດິບ (ເຊັ່ນ ``byte[]``) ຫຼື ``string`` ໄປຍັງ API ຂອງ C# ໃນ Godot ຕ້ອງການການເ"
"ຮັດ marshalling ເຊິ່ງມີລາຄາຂ້ອນຂ້າງສູງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:403
msgid ""
"The implicit conversion from ``string`` to ``NodePath`` or ``StringName`` "
"incur both the native interop and marshalling costs as the ``string`` has to "
"be marshalled and passed to the respective native constructor."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງແບບໂດຍນັບຈາກ ``string`` ເປັນ ``NodePath`` ຫຼື ``StringName`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄ່"
"າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທັງໃນສ່ວນ native interop ແລະ marshalling ເພາະວ່າ ``string`` ຕ້ອງຖືກ "
"marshalled ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຍັງຕົວສ້າງ (constructor) native ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:407
msgid "Using NuGet packages in Godot"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດ NuGet ໃນ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:409
msgid ""
"`NuGet <https://www.nuget.org/>`_ packages can be installed and used with "
"Godot, as with any C# project. Many IDEs are able to add packages directly. "
"They can also be added manually by adding the package reference in the "
"``.csproj`` file located in the project root:"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດ `NuGet <https://www.nuget.org/>`_ ສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ Godot ໄດ້, ຄືກັນ"
"ກັບໂປຣເຈັກ C# ທົ່ວໄປ. IDE ຫຼາຍຕົວສາມາດເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດເພີ່ມພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້"
"ໂດຍການເພີ່ມການອ້າງອີງແພັກເກັດໃນໄຟລ໌ ``.csproj`` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:423
msgid ""
"Godot automatically downloads and sets up newly added NuGet packages the "
"next time it builds the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າແພັກເກັດ NuGet ທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຄັ້ງຖັດໄປທີ່ມັນ build ໂປຣເຈັ"
"ກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:427
msgid "Profiling your C# code"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Profiling ໂຄ້ດ C# ຂອງເຈົ້າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:429
msgid ""
"The following tools may be used for performance and memory profiling of your "
"managed code:"
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດ profiling ດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງໂຄ້ດທີ່ເຈົ້າຈັດການ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:431
msgid "JetBrains Rider with dotTrace/dotMemory plugin."
msgstr "JetBrains Rider ພ້ອມກັບປລັກອິນ dotTrace/dotMemory."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:432
msgid "Standalone JetBrains dotTrace/dotMemory."
msgstr "JetBrains dotTrace/dotMemory ແບບສະແຕນອາໂລນ (Standalone)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:433
msgid "Visual Studio."
msgstr "Visual Studio."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:435
msgid ""
"Profiling managed and unmanaged code at once is possible with both JetBrains "
"tools and Visual Studio, but limited to Windows."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດ Profiling ໂຄ້ດທັງແບບ managed ແລະ unmanaged ພ້ອມກັນແມ່ນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍທັງເຄື່ອງມືຂ"
"ອງ JetBrains ແລະ Visual Studio, ແຕ່ຈະຈຳກັດສະເພາະໃນ Windows."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:4
msgid "C# language features"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີຂອງພາສາ C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of the commonly used features of both C# and "
"Godot and how they are used together."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ຈະໃຫ້ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆ ທັງຂອງ C# ແລະ Godot ແລະ ວິທີທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:12
msgid "Type conversion and casting"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການ Cast"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:14
msgid ""
"C# is a statically typed language. Therefore, you can't do the following:"
msgstr ""
"C# ແມ່ນພາສາແບບ statically typed. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:21
msgid ""
"The method ``GetNode()`` returns a ``Node`` instance. You must explicitly "
"convert it to the desired derived type, ``Sprite2D`` in this case."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ ``GetNode()`` ຈະສົ່ງອິນສະແຕນ (instance) ຂອງ ``Node`` ກັບຄືນມາ. ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນມັນ"
"ໃຫ້ເປັນຊະນິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນັ້ນຄື ``Sprite2D``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:24
msgid "For this, you have various options in C#."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າມີທາງເລືອກຕ່າງໆ ໃນ C#."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:26
msgid "**Casting and Type Checking**"
msgstr "**ການ Cast ແລະ ການກວດສອບຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:28
msgid ""
"Throws ``InvalidCastException`` if the returned node cannot be cast to "
"Sprite2D. You would use it instead of the ``as`` operator if you are pretty "
"sure it won't fail."
msgstr ""
"ຈະແຈ້ງ ``InvalidCastException`` ຖ້າໂນດທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາບໍ່ສາມາດ cast ເປັນ Sprite2D ໄດ້. ເ"
"ຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ມັນແທນໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``as`` ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:36
msgid "**Using the AS operator**"
msgstr "**ການໃຊ້ໂອເປເຣເຕີ AS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:38
msgid ""
"The ``as`` operator returns ``null`` if the node cannot be cast to Sprite2D, "
"and for that reason, it cannot be used with value types."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``as`` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ ``null`` ກັບຄືນມາຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ສາມາດ cast ເປັນ Sprite2D ໄດ້, ແລະ ດ້"
"ວຍເຫດຜົນນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄ່າ (value types) ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:47
msgid "**Using the generic methods**"
msgstr "**ການໃຊ້ເມທອດແບບ Generic**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:49
msgid ""
"Generic methods are also provided to make this type conversion transparent."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີການສະໜອງເມທອດແບບ Generic ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:51
msgid ""
"``GetNode<T>()`` casts the node before returning it. It will throw an "
"``InvalidCastException`` if the node cannot be cast to the desired type."
msgstr ""
"``GetNode<T>()`` ຈະ cast ໂນດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງມັນກັບຄືນມາ. ມັນຈະແຈ້ງ "
"``InvalidCastException`` ຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ສາມາດ cast ເປັນຊະນິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:58
msgid ""
"``GetNodeOrNull<T>()`` uses the ``as`` operator and will return ``null`` if "
"the node cannot be cast to the desired type."
msgstr ""
"``GetNodeOrNull<T>()`` ຈະໃຊ້ໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``as`` ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ ``null`` ຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ສາມາດ "
"cast ເປັນຊະນິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:66
msgid "**Type checking using the IS operator**"
msgstr "**ການກວດສອບຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍໂອເປເຣເຕີ IS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:68
msgid ""
"To check if the node can be cast to Sprite2D, you can use the ``is`` "
"operator. The ``is`` operator returns false if the node cannot be cast to "
"Sprite2D, otherwise it returns true. Note that when the ``is`` operator is "
"used against ``null`` the result is always going to be ``false``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອການກວດສອບວ່າໂນດສາມາດ cast ເປັນ Sprite2D ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``is``. ໂອເ"
"ປເຣເຕີ ``is`` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ false ຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ສາມາດ cast ເປັນ Sprite2D ໄດ້, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"true. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``is`` ກັບ ``null`` ຜົນລັດຈະເປັນ ``false`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:85
msgid ""
"You can also declare a new variable to conditionally store the result of the "
"cast if the ``is`` operator returns ``true``."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເກັບຜົນລັດຂອງການ cast ຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ ຖ້າໂອເປເຣເຕີ ``is`` ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັ"
"ນ ``true``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:96
msgid ""
"For more advanced type checking, you can look into `Pattern Matching "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/pattern-matching>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການກວດສອບຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂັ້ນສູງກວ່າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ `Pattern Matching <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/pattern-matching>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:100
msgid "Preprocessor defines"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Preprocessor (Preprocessor defines)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:102
msgid ""
"Godot has a set of defines that allow you to change your C# code depending "
"on the environment you are compiling to."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີຊຸດຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າ (defines) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໂຄ້ດ C# ຂອງເຈົ້າ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບສະພາ"
"ບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງຄອມໄພລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:108
msgid "For example, you can change code based on the platform:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນໂຄ້ດຕາມແພລດຟອມໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:122
msgid ""
"Or you can detect which engine your code is in, useful for making cross-"
"engine libraries:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ໃນເອັນຈິນໃດ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍເອັນຈິ"
"ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:137
msgid ""
"Or you can write scripts that target multiple Godot versions and take "
"advantage of features that are only available on some of those versions:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນສະຄຣິບທີ່ແນໃສ່ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນຂອງ Godot ແລະ ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຟີເຈີທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສະເພາະໃນບາງເວີຊັນ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:152
msgid "Full list of defines"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Defines)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:154
msgid "``GODOT`` is always defined for Godot projects."
msgstr "``GODOT`` ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເໝີສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:156
msgid ""
"``TOOLS`` is defined when building with the Debug configuration (editor and "
"editor player)."
msgstr ""
"``TOOLS`` ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເມື່ອສ້າງດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Debug (ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຕົວຣັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:158
msgid ""
"``GODOT_REAL_T_IS_DOUBLE`` is defined when the ``GodotFloat64`` property is "
"set to ``true``."
msgstr ""
"``GODOT_REAL_T_IS_DOUBLE`` ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດ ``GodotFloat64`` ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"``true``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:160
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_OSX``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the OS. These "
"names may change in the future. These are created from the ``get_name()`` "
"method of the :ref:`OS <class_OS>` singleton, but not every possible OS the "
"method returns is an OS that Godot with .NET runs on."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_OSX``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, ``GODOT_WEB`` ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດ"
"ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນອະນາຄົດ. ພວກມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາຈາກເມທອດ ``get_name()`` ຂອງ :ref:`OS "
"<class_OS>` singleton, ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ເມທອດນັ້ນສົ່ງຄ່າກັບຄືນມາ ຈະເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດກ"
"ານທີ່ Godot ພ້ອມກັບ .NET ສາມາດຣັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:167
msgid ""
"``GODOTX``, ``GODOTX_Y``, ``GODOTX_Y_Z``, ``GODOTx_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOTX_y_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOTX_Y_z_OR_GREATER``, where ``X``, ``Y``, "
"and ``Z`` are replaced by the current major, minor and patch version of "
"Godot. ``x``, ``y``, and ``z`` are replaced by all values from 0 to the "
"current version number for that component."
msgstr ""
"``GODOTX``, ``GODOTX_Y``, ``GODOTX_Y_Z``, ``GODOTx_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOTX_y_OR_GREATER``, ແລະ ``GODOTX_Y_z_OR_GREATER``, ໂດຍທີ່ ``X``, ``Y``, ແລ"
"ະ ``Z`` ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍເວີຊັນຫຼັກ (major), ເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ (minor) ແລະ patch version ປັດຈຸບັນຂອ"
"ງ Godot. ສ່ວນ ``x``, ``y``, ແລະ ``z`` ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍທຸກຄ່າຕັ້ງແຕ່ 0 ຈົນຮອດເລກເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂ"
"ອງສ່ວນປະກອບນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:175
msgid ""
"These defines were first added in Godot 4.0.4 and 4.1. Version defines for "
"prior versions do not exist, regardless of the current Godot version."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນ Godot 4.0.4 ແລະ 4.1. ການກຳນົດຄ່າເວີຊັນສຳລັບເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ"
"ນັ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ Godot ຈະແມ່ນຫຍັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:178
msgid ""
"For example: Godot 4.0.5 defines ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_0``, ``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_0_5``, "
"``GODOT4_0_4_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOT4_0_5_OR_GREATER``. Godot 4.3.2 "
"defines ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3``, "
"``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_1_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_2_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3_2``, ``GODOT4_3_0_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_1_OR_GREATER``, and ``GODOT4_3_2_OR_GREATER``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: Godot 4.0.5 ກຳນົດ ``GODOT4``, ``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_0``, "
"``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_0_5``, ``GODOT4_0_4_OR_GREATER``, ແລະ "
"``GODOT4_0_5_OR_GREATER``. Godot 4.3.2 ກຳນົດ ``GODOT4``, "
"``GODOT4_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3``, ``GODOT4_0_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_1_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_2_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3_OR_GREATER``, "
"``GODOT4_3_2``, ``GODOT4_3_0_OR_GREATER``, ``GODOT4_3_1_OR_GREATER``, ແລະ "
"``GODOT4_3_2_OR_GREATER``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:186
msgid ""
"When **exporting**, the following may also be defined depending on the "
"export features:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ **ສົ່ງອອກ (exporting)**, ສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກກຳນົດນຳອີກ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຟີເຈີຂອງການສົ່ງອອກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:188
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_PC``, ``GODOT_MOBILE``, or ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the "
"platform type."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ ``GODOT_PC``, ``GODOT_MOBILE``, ຫຼື ``GODOT_WEB`` ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງແພລດຟ"
"ອມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:190
msgid ""
"One of ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_MACOS``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, or ``GODOT_WEB`` depending on the platform."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ ``GODOT_WINDOWS``, ``GODOT_LINUXBSD``, ``GODOT_MACOS``, "
"``GODOT_ANDROID``, ``GODOT_IOS``, ຫຼື ``GODOT_WEB`` ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບແພລດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_features.rst:192
msgid ""
"To see an example project, see the OS testing demo: https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/os_test"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໂປຣເຈັກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ເດໂມການທົດສອບ OS: https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/os_test"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:4
msgid "C# style guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືຮູບແບບການຂຽນ C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:6
msgid ""
"Having well-defined and consistent coding conventions is important for every "
"project, and Godot is no exception to this rule."
msgstr ""
"ການມີຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນການຂຽນໂຄ້ດ (coding conventions) ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີແມ່ນສຳຄັນສຳລັບທຸກໆ ໂ"
"ປຣເຈັກ, ແລະ Godot ກໍບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:9
msgid ""
"This page contains a coding style guide, which is followed by developers of "
"and contributors to Godot itself. As such, it is mainly intended for those "
"who want to contribute to the project, but since the conventions and "
"guidelines mentioned in this article are those most widely adopted by the "
"users of the language, we encourage you to do the same, especially if you do "
"not have such a guide yet."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄູ່ມືຮູບແບບການຂຽນໂຄ້ດ, ເຊິ່ງນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ທີ່ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນ Godot ປະຕິບັດຕາມ. ດັ່ງນັ້"
"ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງເນັ້ນໃສ່ຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປະກອບສ່ວນເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຫຼັກ, ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ແນວທາງທີ່ລະບຸໃນ"
"ບົດຄວາມນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາສານີ້ນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງແຜ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, ເຮົາຈຶ່ງຢາກແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຮັດຄືກັນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເຈົ້"
"າຍັງບໍ່ມີຄູ່ມືແບບນີ້ເທື່ອ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:14
msgid ""
"This article is by no means an exhaustive guide on how to follow the "
"standard coding conventions or best practices. If you feel unsure of an "
"aspect which is not covered here, please refer to more comprehensive "
"documentation, such as `C# Coding Conventions <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/dotnet/csharp/programming-guide/inside-a-program/coding-conventions>`_ or "
"`Framework Design Guidelines <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"standard/design-guidelines/naming-guidelines>`_."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຄວາມນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄູ່ມືທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນທຸກຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດການຂຽນໂຄ້ດມາດຕະຖານ ຫຼື ວິທີການທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໝັ້ນໃຈໃນສ່ວນໃດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່າວໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ `C# Coding "
"Conventions <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/programming-"
"guide/inside-a-program/coding-conventions>`_ ຫຼື `Framework Design Guidelines "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/design-guidelines/naming-"
"guidelines>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:21
msgid "Language specification"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສະເພາະຂອງພາສາ (Language specification)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:23
msgid ""
"Godot currently uses **C# version 12.0** in its engine and example source "
"code, as this is the version supported by .NET 8.0 (the current baseline "
"requirement). So, before we move to a newer version, care must be taken to "
"avoid mixing language features only available in C# 13.0 or later."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນ Godot ໃຊ້ **C# ເວີຊັນ 12.0** ໃນເອັນຈິນ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງຊອດໂຄ້ດ, ເພາະວ່ານີ້ແມ່ນເວີຊັນທີ່ຮອງ"
"ຮັບໂດຍ .NET 8.0 (ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳໃນປະຈຸບັນ). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ກ່ອນທີ່ເຮົາຈະຍ້າຍໄປໃຊ້ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່"
"າ, ຈະຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟີເຈີຂອງພາສາທີ່ມີສະເພາະໃນ C# 13.0 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:28
msgid ""
"For detailed information on C# features in different versions, please see "
"`What's New in C# <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/whats-new/"
">`_."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຟີເຈີຂອງ C# ໃນເວີຊັນຕ່າງໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ `What's New in C# <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/whats-new/>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:35
msgid "General guidelines"
msgstr "ແນວທາງທົ່ວໄປ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:37
msgid "Use line feed (**LF**) characters to break lines, not CRLF or CR."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ line feed (**LF**) ໃນການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ CRLF ຫຼື CR."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:38
msgid ""
"Use one line feed character at the end of each file, except for `csproj` "
"files."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ line feed ຕົວດຽວຢູ່ທ້າຍແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌, ຍົກເວັ້ນໄຟລ໌ `csproj`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:39
msgid ""
"Use **UTF-8** encoding without a `byte order mark <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Byte_order_mark>`_."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ **UTF-8** ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ `byte order mark <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Byte_order_mark>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:40
msgid ""
"Use **4 spaces** instead of tabs for indentation (which is referred to as "
"\"soft tabs\")."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ **4 ຊ່ອງວ່າງ (spaces)** ແທນການໃຊ້ tabs ໃນການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ເຊິ່ງເອີ້ນວ່າ \"soft tabs\")."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:41
msgid ""
"Consider breaking a line into several if it's longer than 100 characters."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການແບ່ງແຖວອອກເປັນຫຼາຍແຖວ ຖ້າມັນຍາວກວ່າ 100 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:45
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shaders_style_guide.rst:103
msgid "Line breaks and blank lines"
msgstr "ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ແລະ ແຖວວ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:47
msgid ""
"For a general indentation rule, follow `the \"Allman Style\" <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indentation_style#Allman_style>`_ which recommends "
"placing the brace associated with a control statement on the next line, "
"indented to the same level:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບກົດເກນການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າທົ່ວໄປ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມ `\"Allman Style\" <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Indentation_style#Allman_style>`_ ເຊິ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງວົງເລັບປິກກາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຳສັ່ງຄວບ"
"ຄຸມໄວ້ໃນແຖວຖັດໄປ, ໂດຍຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນລະດັບດຽວກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:64
msgid "However, you may choose to omit line breaks inside brackets:"
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເລືອກລະເວັ້ນການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ພາຍໃນວົງເລັບໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:66
msgid "For simple property accessors."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດ (property accessors) ແບບງ່າຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:67
msgid "For simple object, array, or collection initializers."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອັອບເຈັກ, ອາເຣ, ຫຼື ຄໍເລັກຊັນແບບງ່າຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:68
msgid "For abstract auto property, indexer, or event declarations."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການປະກາດ abstract auto property, indexer, ຫຼື event."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:90
msgid "Insert a blank line:"
msgstr "ແຊກແຖວວ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:92
msgid "After a list of ``using`` statements."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລາຍການຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ ``using``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:93
msgid "Between method, properties, and inner type declarations."
msgstr "ລະຫວ່າງການປະກາດ method, properties ແລະ ປະເພດພາຍໃນ (inner type)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:94
msgid "At the end of each file."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທ້າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:96
msgid ""
"Field and constant declarations can be grouped together according to "
"relevance. In that case, consider inserting a blank line between the groups "
"for easier reading."
msgstr ""
"ການປະກາດ Field ແລະ ຄົງທີ່ (constant) ສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້"
"ພິຈາລະນາແຊກແຖວວ່າງລະຫວ່າງກຸ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ອ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:99
msgid "Avoid inserting a blank line:"
msgstr "ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການແຊກແຖວວ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:101
msgid "After ``{``, the opening brace."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ ``{``, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນວົງຂໍເປີດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:102
msgid "Before ``}``, the closing brace."
msgstr "ກ່ອນ ``}``, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນວົງຂໍອັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:103
msgid "After a comment block or a single-line comment."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກບລັອກຄຳເຫັນ (comment) ຫຼື ຄຳເຫັນແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:104
msgid "Adjacent to another blank line."
msgstr "ຕິດກັບແຖວວ່າງອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:143
msgid "Using spaces"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:145
msgid "Insert a space:"
msgstr "ແຊກຍະຫວ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:147
msgid "Around a binary and ternary operator."
msgstr "ອ້ອມຮອບຕົວດຳເນີນການ binary ແລະ ternary."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:148
msgid ""
"Between an opening parenthesis and ``if``, ``for``, ``foreach``, ``catch``, "
"``while``, ``lock`` or ``using`` keywords."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫວ່າງວົງເລັບເປີດ ແລະ ຄຳສັບຫຼັກ (keywords) ``if``, ``for``, ``foreach``, "
"``catch``, ``while``, ``lock`` ຫຼື ``using``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:149
msgid "Before and within a single line accessor block."
msgstr "ກ່ອນ ແລະ ພາຍໃນບລັອກຕົວເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessor block) ແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:150
msgid "Between accessors in a single line accessor block."
msgstr "ລະຫວ່າງຕົວເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນບລັອກຕົວເຂົ້າເຖິງແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:151
msgid "After a comma which is not at the end of a line."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈຸດ (comma) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ທ້າຍແຖວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:152
msgid "After a semicolon in a ``for`` statement."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈຸດຈ້າມ (semicolon) ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``for``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:153
msgid "After a colon in a single line ``case`` statement."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈ້າມ (colon) ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``case`` ແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:154
msgid "Around a colon in a type declaration."
msgstr "ອ້ອມຮອບຈ້າມໃນການປະກາດປະເພດ (type declaration)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:155
msgid "Around a lambda arrow."
msgstr "ອ້ອມຮອບລູກສອນ lambda."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:156
msgid ""
"After a single-line comment symbol (``//``), and before it if used at the "
"end of a line."
msgstr "ຫຼັງສັນຍະລັກຄຳເຫັນແຖວດຽວ (``//``), ແລະ ກ່ອນໜ້າມັນຖ້ານຳໃຊ້ຢູ່ທ້າຍແຖວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:157
msgid ""
"After the opening brace, and before the closing brace in a single line "
"initializer."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງວົງຂໍເປີດ, ແລະ ກ່ອນວົງຂໍອັດໃນຕົວຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (initializer) ແຖວດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:159
msgid "Do not use a space:"
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:161
msgid "After type cast parentheses."
msgstr "ຫຼັງວົງເລັບການແປງປະເພດ (type cast)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:163
msgid ""
"The following example shows a proper use of spaces, according to some of the "
"above mentioned conventions:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງການໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ຕາມບາງຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:200
msgid ""
"Use **PascalCase** for all namespaces, type names and member level "
"identifiers (i.e. methods, properties, constants, events), except for "
"private fields:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ **PascalCase** ສຳລັບ namespace, ຊື່ປະເພດ ແລະ ຕົວລະບຸລະດັບສະມາຊິກທັງໝົດ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"methods, properties, constants, events), ຍົກເວັ້ນ field ທີ່ເປັນ private:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:221
msgid ""
"Use **camelCase** for all other identifiers (i.e. local variables, method "
"arguments), and use an underscore (``_``) as a prefix for private fields "
"(but not for methods or properties, as explained above):"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ **camelCase** ສຳລັບຕົວລະບຸອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, argument ຂອງ method), ແລ"
"ະ ໃຊ້ຂີດກ້ອງ (``_``) ເປັນຕົວນຳໜ້າສຳລັບ private field (ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບ method ຫຼື property, "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:235
msgid ""
"There's an exception with acronyms which consist of two letters, like "
"``UI``, which should be written in uppercase letters where PascalCase would "
"be expected, and in lowercase letters otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນຫຍໍ້ທີ່ມີສອງຕົວອັກສອນ ເຊັ່ນ ``UI``, ເຊິ່ງຄວນຂຽນເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ "
"PascalCase, ແລະ ຂຽນເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:238
msgid ""
"Note that ``id`` is **not** an acronym, so it should be treated as a normal "
"identifier:"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ``id`` **ບໍ່ແມ່ນ** ຕົວອັກສອນຫຍໍ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຄວນຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບຕົວລະບຸປົກກະຕິ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:249
msgid ""
"It is generally discouraged to use a type name as a prefix of an identifier, "
"like ``string strText`` or ``float fPower``, for example. An exception is "
"made, however, for interfaces, which **should**, in fact, have an uppercase "
"letter ``I`` prefixed to their names, like ``IInventoryHolder`` or "
"``IDamageable``."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ປະເພດເປັນຕົວນຳໜ້າຂອງຕົວລະບຸ, ເຊັ່ນ ``string strText`` ຫຼື "
"``float fPower``. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບ interface, ເຊິ່ງ **ຄວນ** ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນພິ"
"ມໃຫຍ່ ``I`` ນຳໜ້າຊື່, ເຊັ່ນ ``IInventoryHolder`` ຫຼື ``IDamageable``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:253
msgid ""
"Lastly, consider choosing descriptive names and do not try to shorten them "
"too much if it affects readability."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເລືອກຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຄວາມໝາຍໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ຢ່າພະຍາຍາມຫຍໍ້ຊື່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ຖ້າມັນສົ່ງຜົນກ"
"ະທົບຕໍ່ການອ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:256
msgid ""
"For instance, if you want to write code to find a nearby enemy and hit it "
"with a weapon, prefer:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຂຽນໂຄ້ດເພື່ອຊອກຫາສັດຕູທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງ ແລະ ໂຈມຕີດ້ວຍອາວຸດ, ຄວນໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:262
msgid "Rather than:"
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:283
msgid "Implicitly typed local variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ກຳນົດປະເພດໂດຍນັບໄນ (Implicitly typed local variables)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:285
msgid ""
"Consider using implicitly typing (``var``) for declaration of a local "
"variable, but do so **only when the type is evident** from the right side of "
"the assignment:"
msgstr ""
"ພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ການກຳນົດປະເພດໂດຍນັບໄນ (``var``) ສຳລັບການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຮັດ **ສ"
"ະເພາະເມື່ອປະເພດນັ້ນຊັດເຈນ** ຈາກເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:315
msgid "Other considerations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ພິຈາລະນາອື່ນໆ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:317
msgid "Use explicit access modifiers."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວດັດແກ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (access modifiers) ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:318
msgid "Use properties instead of non-private fields."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ property ແທນ field ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ private."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:319
msgid ""
"Use modifiers in this order: ``public``/``protected``/``private``/"
"``internal``/``virtual``/``override``/``abstract``/``new``/``static``/"
"``readonly``."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວດັດແກ້ຕາມລຳດັບນີ້: ``public``/``protected``/``private``/``internal``/"
"``virtual``/``override``/``abstract``/``new``/``static``/``readonly``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:321
msgid ""
"Avoid using fully-qualified names or ``this.`` prefix for members when it's "
"not necessary."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ຊື່ແບບເຕັມ (fully-qualified names) ຫຼື ຄຳນຳໜ້າ ``this.`` ສຳລັບສະມາຊິກເມື່ອບໍ່ຈຳ"
"ເປັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:322
msgid "Remove unused ``using`` statements and unnecessary parentheses."
msgstr "ລຶບຄຳສັ່ງ ``using`` ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ວົງເລັບທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:323
msgid "Consider omitting the default initial value for a type."
msgstr "ພິຈາລະນາການລະເວັ້ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:324
msgid ""
"Consider using null-conditional operators or type initializers to make the "
"code more compact."
msgstr ""
"ພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ null-conditional operators ຫຼື type initializers ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄ້ດກະທັດຮັດ"
"ຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide.rst:325
msgid ""
"Use safe cast when there is a possibility of the value being a different "
"type, and use direct cast otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ safe cast (as) ເມື່ອມີຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະເປັນປະເພດອື່ນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ direct cast ໃນກໍລະນີ"
"ອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/index.rst:6
msgid "C# diagnostics"
msgstr "ການວິນິດໄສ C#"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Godot includes analyzers that inspect your C# source code to check for "
"invalid or unsupported code and let you know that something is wrong during "
"build time."
msgstr ""
"Godot ລວມມີຕົວວິເຄາະທີ່ຈະກວດສອບຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) C# ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອກວດຫາໂຄ້ດທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"ຫຼື ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າມີບາງຢ່າງຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການ build."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/index.rst:-1
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0001.rst:2
msgid ""
"GD0001: Missing partial modifier on declaration of type that derives from "
"GodotObject"
msgstr "GD0001: ຂາດຕົວດັດແກ້ partial ໃນການປະກາດປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ GodotObject"

