msgstr "``GodotObject.IsInstanceValid(obj)``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:98
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:100
msgid ""
"Sometimes it can be useful to use the ``using static`` directive. This "
"directive allows to access the members and nested types of a class without "
"specifying the class name."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``using static`` ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດ. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງສະມາຊິກ ແລ"
"ະ ປະເພດຊ້ອນຂອງຄລາສໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ຄລາສ."

