"``preload`` ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ GDScript ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ C#. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``GD.Load`` ຫຼື "
"``ResourceLoader.Load`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:278
msgid "``@export`` annotation"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (annotation) ``@export``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:280
msgid ""
"Use the ``[Export]`` attribute instead of the GDScript ``@export`` "
"annotation. This attribute can also be provided with "
"optional :ref:`PropertyHint<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>` and "
"``hintString`` parameters. Default values can be set by assigning a value."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະ ``[Export]`` ແທນຄຳອະທິບາຍ ``@export`` ຂອງ GDScript. ຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ຍັງສາມາ"
"ດກຳນົດຄ່າເສີມຢ່າງ :ref:`PropertyHint<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>` ແລະ "
"``hintString`` ໄດ້ນຳ. ສ່ວນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:305
msgid "See also: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_exports`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:308
msgid "``signal`` keyword"
msgstr "ຄຳສັບຫຼັກ (keyword) ``signal``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:310
msgid ""
"Use the ``[Signal]`` attribute to declare a signal instead of the GDScript "
"``signal`` keyword. This attribute should be used on a `delegate`, whose "
"name signature will be used to define the signal. The `delegate` must have "
"the ``EventHandler`` suffix, an `event` will be generated in the class with "
"the same name but without the suffix, use that event's name with "
"``EmitSignal``."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະ ``[Signal]`` ເພື່ອປະກາດຊິກແນວ (signal) ແທນຄຳສັບຫຼັກ ``signal`` ຂອງ "
"GDScript. ຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ກັບ `delegate` ຊຶ່ງຊື່ຂອງມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊິກແນວ. `delegate` "
"ດັ່ງກ່າວຕ້ອງມີນາມສະກຸນ ``EventHandler`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ `event` ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຄລາດດ້ວຍຊື່ດຽ"
"ວກັນແຕ່ບໍ່ມີນາມສະກຸນຕໍ່ທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ event ນັ້ນກັບ ``EmitSignal``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:319
msgid "See also: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_signals`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ: :ref:`doc_c_sharp_signals`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:322
msgid "`@onready` annotation"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (annotation) `@onready`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:324
msgid ""
"GDScript has the ability to defer the initialization of a member variable "
"until the ready function is called with `@onready` "
"(cf. :ref:`doc_gdscript_onready_annotation`). For example:"
msgstr ""
"GDScript ສາມາດເລື່ອນການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກໄປຈົນກວ່າຟັງຊັນ ready ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ "
"`@onready` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_gdscript_onready_annotation`). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:332
msgid ""
"However C# does not have this ability. To achieve the same effect you need "
"to do this."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ C# ບໍ່ມີຄວາມສາມາດນີ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດແບບດຽວກັນ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຮັດແບບນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:344
msgid "Singletons"
msgstr "Singletons"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:346
msgid ""
"Singletons are available as static classes rather than using the singleton "
"pattern. This is to make code less verbose than it would be with an "
"``Instance`` property."
msgstr ""
"Singletons ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ static classes ແທນການໃຊ້ singleton pattern. ນີ້ແມ່ນເ"
"ພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄ້ດບໍ່ຍາວເກີນຄວາມຈຳເປັນເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໃຊ້ພຣັອບເພີຕີ ``Instance``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:355
msgid ""
"However, in some very rare cases this is not enough. For example, you may "
"want to access a member from the base class ``GodotObject``, like "
"``Connect``. For such use cases we provide a static property named "
"``Singleton`` that returns the singleton instance. The type of this instance "
"is ``GodotObject``."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ໃນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ຫາຍາກ ນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະມາຊິກຈາກ base "
"class ``GodotObject`` ເຊັ່ນ ``Connect``. ສຳລັບກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຈັດຕຽມ static "
"property ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``Singleton`` ຊຶ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ instance ຂອງ singleton ກັບມາ. ປະເພດ "
"(type) ຂອງ instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ ``GodotObject``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:366
msgid ""
"If you are developing main screen plugins, it is essential to note that "
"``EditorInterface`` is not a static class in C#, unlike in GDScript. "
"Therefore, you must use the singleton pattern to obtain an instance of the "
"``EditorInterface``:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງພັດທະນາປລັກອິນ (plugin) ໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ວ່າ ``EditorInterface`` ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"static class ໃນ C# ຄືກັບໃນ GDScript. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ singleton pattern ເພື່ອຂໍ "
"instance ຂອງ ``EditorInterface``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:374
msgid "``EditorInterface``"
msgstr "``EditorInterface``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:374
msgid "``EditorInterface.Singleton``"
msgstr "``EditorInterface.Singleton``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:380
msgid ""
"Use ``System.String`` (``string``). Most of Godot's String methods have an "
"equivalent in ``System.String`` or are provided by the ``StringExtensions`` "
"class as extension methods."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ ``System.String`` (``string``). ເມັດທອດ String ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ Godot ຈະມີສິ່ງທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າ"
"ໃນ ``System.String`` ຫຼື ຖືກຈັດຕຽມໄວ້ໃນຄລາດ ``StringExtensions`` ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ "
"extension methods."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:384
msgid ""
"Note that C# strings use UTF-16 encoding, while Godot Strings use UTF-32 "
"encoding."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: string ໃນ C# ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-16, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ String ຂອງ Godot ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະ"
"ຫັດ UTF-32."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:393
msgid ""
"Strings are immutable in .NET, so all methods that manipulate a string don't "
"modify the original string and return a newly created string with the "
"modifications applied. To avoid creating multiple string allocations "
"consider using a `StringBuilder`_."
msgstr ""
"String ໃນ .NET ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າໄດ້ (immutable), ດັ່ງນັ້ນທຸກເມັດທອດທີ່ຈັດການກັບ string ຈ"
"ະບໍ່ໄປແກ້ໄຂ string ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງ string ໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວກັບມາແທນ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຈອງພື້ນທີ່ໜ່ວ"
"ຍຄວາມຈຳສຳລັບ string ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ `StringBuilder`_."

