#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:138
msgid ""
"Godot uses 64-bit integers and floats in Variant. Smaller integer and float "
"types such as ``int``, ``short`` and ``float`` are supported since they can "
"fit in the bigger type. Be aware that when a conversion is performed, using "
"the wrong type will result in potential precision loss."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ເລກຖ້ວນ ແລະ ເລກທົດສະນິຍົມແບບ 64-bit ໃນ Variant. ປະເພດເລກຖ້ວນ ແລະ ທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ນ້"
"ອຍກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ ``int``, ``short`` ແລະ ``float`` ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ ເພາະພວກມັນສາມາດບັນຈຸເ"
"ຂົ້າໃນປະເພດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າເມື່ອມີການແປງ, ການໃຊ້ປະເພດທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເ"
"ກີດການສູນເສຍຄວາມຊັດເຈນ (precision loss) ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:145
msgid ""
"Enums are supported by ``Godot.Variant`` since their underlying type is an "
"integer type which are all compatible. However, implicit conversions don't "
"exist, enums must be manually converted to their underlying integer type "
"before they can converted to/from ``Godot.Variant`` or use the generic "
"``Variant.As<T>`` and ``Variant.From<T>`` methods to convert them."
msgstr ""
"Enums ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ ``Godot.Variant`` ເນື່ອງຈາກປະເພດພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກມັນແມ່ນເລກຖ້ວນ"
"ເຊິ່ງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນບໍ່ມີການແປງແບບ implicit, enums ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກແປງເປັນປະເພດເລ"
"ກຖ້ວນພື້ນຖານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະແປງໄປ-ມາຈາກ ``Godot.Variant`` ຫຼື ໃຊ້ generic methods "
"``Variant.As<T>`` ແລະ ``Variant.From<T>`` ເພື່ອແປງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:162
msgid "Using Variant in a generic context"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Variant ໃນບໍລິບົດ generic"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:164
msgid ""
"When using generics, you may be interested in restricting the generic ``T`` "
"type to be only one of the Variant-compatible types. This can be achieved "
"using the ``[MustBeVariant]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ generics, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດປະເພດ generic ``T`` ໃຫ້ເປັນພຽງແຕ່ປະເພດໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ເຂົ້າ"
"ກັນໄດ້ກັບ Variant. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ attribute ``[MustBeVariant]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:175
msgid ""
"Combined with the generic ``Variant.From<T>`` allows you to obtain an "
"instance of ``Godot.Variant`` from an instance of a generic ``T`` type. Then "
"it can be used in any API that only supports the ``Godot.Variant`` struct."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ generic ``Variant.From<T>`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບ instance ຂອງ "
"``Godot.Variant`` ຈາກ instance ຂອງປະເພດ generic ``T``. ຈາກນັ້ນມັນສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ "
"API ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ struct ``Godot.Variant``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_variant.rst:192
msgid ""
"In order to invoke a method with a generic parameter annotated with the "
"``[MustBeVariant]`` attribute, the value must be a Variant-compatible type "
"or a generic ``T`` type annotated with the ``[MustBeVariant]`` attribute as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ method ທີ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີ generic ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍ attribute ``[MustBeVariant]``, "
"ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Variant ຫຼື ເປັນປະເພດ generic ``T`` ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍ "
"attribute ``[MustBeVariant]`` ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:4
msgid "C# signals"
msgstr "C# signals"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:6
msgid ""
"For a detailed explanation of signals in general, see the :ref:`doc_signals` "
"section in the step by step tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບສັນຍານ (signals) ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ :ref:`doc_signals` ໃນ"
"ບົດຮຽນແບບແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ (step by step)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:9
msgid ""
"Signals are implemented using C# events, the idiomatic way to "
"represent :ref:`the observer pattern<doc_key_concepts_signals>` in C#. This "
"is the recommended way to use signals in C# and the focus of this page."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານຖືກຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດໂດຍໃຊ້ C# events, ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີມາດຕະຖານໃນການສະແດງເຖິງ :ref:`the "
"observer pattern<doc_key_concepts_signals>` ໃນ C#. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສັນຍານໃນ "
"C# ແລະ ເປັນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກຂອງໜ້ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:13
msgid ""
"In some cases it's necessary to use the "
"older :ref:`Connect()<class_object_method_connect>` "
"and :ref:`Disconnect()<class_object_method_disconnect>` APIs. "
"See :ref:`using_connect_and_disconnect` for more details."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ API ແບບເກົ່າຄື :ref:`Connect() "
"<class_object_method_connect>` ແລະ :ref:`Disconnect() "
"<class_object_method_disconnect>`. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`using_connect_and_disconnect` ສຳ"
"ລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you encounter a ``System.ObjectDisposedException`` while handling a "
"signal, you might be missing a signal disconnection. "
"See :ref:`disconnecting_automatically_when_the_receiver_is_freed` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``System.ObjectDisposedException`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຈັດການສັນຍານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະລື"
"ມຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ (signal disconnection). ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`disconnecting_automatically_when_the_receiver_is_freed` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມ"
"ເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:23
msgid "Signals as C# events"
msgstr "ສັນຍານໃນຮູບແບບ C# events"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:25
msgid ""
"To provide more type-safety, Godot signals are also all available through "
"`events <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/events-overview>`_. "
"You can handle these events, as any other event, with the ``+=`` and ``-=`` "
"operators."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ທຸກສັນຍານຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຜ່ານ `events <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/events-overview>`_. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການ "
"events ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຄືກັບ event ອື່ນໆ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ ``+=`` ແລະ ``-=``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:33
msgid ""
"In addition, you can always access signal names associated with a node type "
"through its nested ``SignalName`` class. This is useful when, for example, "
"you want to await on a signal (see :ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences_await`)."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊື່ສັນຍານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບປະເພດຂອງ node ຜ່ານຄລາດຊ້ອນ "
"``SignalName``. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີເຊັ່ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ await ຖ້າສັນຍານ (ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_c_sharp_differences_await`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:41
msgid "Custom signals as C# events"
msgstr "ສັນຍານກຳນົດເອງໃນຮູບແບບ C# events"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:43
msgid ""
"To declare a custom event in your C# script, use the ``[Signal]`` attribute "
"on a public delegate type. Note that the name of this delegate needs to end "
"with ``EventHandler``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປະກາດ event ກຳນົດເອງໃນ C# script ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ attribute ``[Signal]`` ໃນປະເພ"
"ດ public delegate. ສັງເກດວ່າຊື່ຂອງ delegate ນີ້ຕ້ອງລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ ``EventHandler``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:54
msgid ""
"Once this is done, Godot will create the appropriate events automatically "
"behind the scenes. You can then use said events as you'd do for any other "
"Godot signal. Note that events are named using your delegate's name minus "
"the final ``EventHandler`` part."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ແລ້ວ, Godot ຈະສ້າງ events ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໃ"
"ຊ້ events ດັ່ງກ່າວຄືກັບສັນຍານ Godot ອື່ນໆ. ສັງເກດວ່າ events ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ delegate ຂອງທ່າ"
"ນແລ້ວຕັດສ່ວນ ``EventHandler`` ທ້າຍຊື່ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:73
msgid ""
"If you want to connect to these signals in the editor, you will need to "
"(re)build the project to see them appear."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ editor, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ (re)build ໂປຣເຈັກເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນປະກົດຂຶ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:76
msgid ""
"You can click the **Build** button in the upper-right corner of the editor "
"to do so."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກົດປຸ່ມ **Build** ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງ editor ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:79
msgid "Signal emission"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງສັນຍານ (Signal emission)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:81
msgid ""
"To emit signals, use the ``EmitSignal`` method. Note that, as for signals "
"defined by the engine, your custom signal names are listed under the nested "
"``SignalName`` class."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງສັນຍານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ method ``EmitSignal``. ສັງເກດວ່າ ສຳລັບສັນຍານທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ engine, ຊື່ສັນ"
"ຍານກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກລວມໄວ້ໃນຄລາດຊ້ອນ ``SignalName``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:92
msgid ""
"In contrast with other C# events, you cannot use ``Invoke`` to raise events "
"tied to Godot signals."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ C# events ອື່ນໆ, ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ ``Invoke`` ເພື່ອສົ່ງ events ທີ່ຜູກກັບສັນຍານຂອງ "
"Godot ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:94
msgid ""
"Signals support arguments of any :ref:`Variant-compatible type "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານຮອງຮັບ argument ຂອງ :ref:`ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Variant "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:96
msgid ""
"Consequently, any ``Node`` or ``RefCounted`` will be compatible "
"automatically, but custom data objects will need to inherit from "
"``GodotObject`` or one of its subclasses."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທຸກໆ ``Node`` ຫຼື ``RefCounted`` ຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ object ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເ"
"ອງຈະຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ ``GodotObject`` ຫຼື subclass ຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:110
msgid "Bound values"
msgstr "ການຜູກຄ່າ (Bound values)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:112
msgid ""
"Sometimes you'll want to bind values to a signal when the connection is "
"established, rather than (or in addition to) when the signal is emitted. To "
"do so, you can use an anonymous function like in the following example."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຜູກຄ່າ (bind values) ເຂົ້າກັບສັນຍານຕອນທີ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ (ຫຼື ເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກ) ຕອນທີ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ anonymous function ຄືກັບໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປ"
"ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:116
msgid ""
"Here, the :ref:`Button.Pressed <class_BaseButton_signal_pressed>` signal "
"does not take any argument. But we want to use the same ``ModifyValue`` for "
"both the \"plus\" and \"minus\" buttons. So we bind the modifier value at "
"the time we're connecting the signals."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ສັນຍານ :ref:`Button.Pressed <class_BaseButton_signal_pressed>` ບໍ່ມີ "
"argument ໃດໆ. ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ ``ModifyValue`` ອັນດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງປຸ່ມ \"ບວກ\" ແລະ "
"\"ລົບ\". ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຜູກຄ່າ modifier ໃນຕອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:139
msgid "Signal creation at runtime"
msgstr "ການສ້າງສັນຍານໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ (runtime)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:141
msgid ""
"Finally, you can create custom signals directly while your game is running. "
"Use the ``AddUserSignal`` method for that. Be aware that it should be "
"executed before any use of said signals (either connecting to them or "
"emitting them). Also, note that signals created this way won't be visible "
"through the ``SignalName`` nested class."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສັນຍານກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຊ້ method "
"``AddUserSignal`` ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າມັນຄວນຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການໃຊ້ສັນຍານດັ່ງກ່າວ (ບໍ່ວ່າ"
"ຈະເປັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ການສົ່ງສັນຍານ). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ສັນຍານທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ຜ່ານຄລາດຊ້"
"ອນ ``SignalName``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:157
msgid "Using Connect and Disconnect"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Connect ແລະ Disconnect"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:159
msgid ""
"In general, it isn't recommended to "
"use :ref:`Connect()<class_object_method_connect>` "
"and :ref:`Disconnect()<class_object_method_disconnect>`. These APIs don't "
"provide as much type safety as the events. However, they're necessary "
"for :ref:`connecting to signals defined by GDScript "
"<connecting_to_signals_cross_language>` and "
"passing :ref:`ConnectFlags<enum_Object_ConnectFlags>`."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`Connect() <class_object_method_connect>` ແລະ "
":ref:`Disconnect() <class_object_method_disconnect>`. API ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປ"
"ະເພດຫຼາຍເທົ່າກັບ events. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ພວກມັນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ :ref:`ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"GDScript <connecting_to_signals_cross_language>` ແລະ ການສົ່ງ "
":ref:`ConnectFlags <enum_Object_ConnectFlags>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:166
msgid ""
"In the following example, pressing the button for the first time prints "
"``Greetings!``. ``OneShot`` disconnects the signal, so pressing the button "
"again does nothing."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ການກົດປຸ່ມເທື່ອທຳອິດຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Greetings!``. ``OneShot`` ຈະຕັດການເຊື່"
"ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການກົດປຸ່ມອີກຄັ້ງຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:186
msgid "Disconnecting automatically when the receiver is freed"
msgstr "ການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຕົວຮັບຖືກປ່ອຍ (freed)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:188
msgid ""
"Normally, when any ``GodotObject`` is freed (such as any ``Node``), Godot "
"automatically disconnects all connections associated with that object. This "
"happens for both signal emitters and signal receivers."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອ ``GodotObject`` ໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກປ່ອຍ (ເຊັ່ນ ``Node`` ໃດໜຶ່ງ), Godot ຈະຕັດການ"
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ object ນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບທັງຕົວສົ່ງສັນຍານ ແລະ ຕົວຮັບສັນຍານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:192
msgid ""
"For example, a node with this code will print \"Hello!\" when the button is "
"pressed, then free itself. Freeing the node disconnects the signal, so "
"pressing the button again doesn't do anything:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, node ທີ່ມີ code ນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Hello!\" ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ, ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະປ່ອຍຕົວເອງ "
"(free itself). ການປ່ອຍ node ຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການກົດປຸ່ມອີກຄັ້ງຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:210
msgid ""
"When a signal receiver is freed while the signal emitter is still alive, in "
"some cases automatic disconnection won't happen:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕົວຮັບສັນຍານຖືກປ່ອຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວສົ່ງສັນຍານຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ໃນບາງກໍລະນີການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະບໍ່"
"ເກີດຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:213
msgid ""
"The signal is connected to a lambda expression that captures a variable."
msgstr "ສັນຍານຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ lambda expression ທີ່ມີການ capture ຕົວປ່ຽນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:214
msgid "The signal is a custom signal."
msgstr "ສັນຍານນັ້ນເປັນສັນຍານທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:216
msgid ""
"The following sections explain these cases in more detail and include "
"suggestions for how to disconnect manually."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ ແລະ ລວມທັງຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:221
msgid ""
"Automatic disconnection is totally reliable if a signal emitter is freed "
"before any of its receivers are freed. With a project style that prefers "
"this pattern, the above limits may not be a concern."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ ຖ້າຕົວສົ່ງສັນຍານຖືກປ່ອຍກ່ອນຕົວຮັບໃດໆ. ຖ້າຮູບແບບໂປຣເ"
"ຈັກຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂ້າງເທິງອາດຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:226
msgid ""
"No automatic disconnection: a lambda expression that captures a variable"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ: lambda expression ທີ່ມີການ capture ຕົວປ່ຽນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:228
msgid ""
"If you connect to a lambda expression that captures variables, Godot can't "
"tell that the lambda is associated with the instance that created it. This "
"causes this example to have potentially unexpected behavior:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ lambda expression ທີ່ມີການ capture ຕົວປ່ຽນ, Godot ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຮູ້ໄດ້ວ່າ "
"lambda ນັ້ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ທີ່ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ອາດຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄາດຫວັງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:255
msgid ""
"On tick 4, the lambda expression tries to access the ``Name`` property of "
"the node, but the node has already been freed. This causes the exception."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ tick ທີ 4, lambda expression ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງ property ``Name`` ຂອງ node, ແຕ່ "
"node ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ອຍ (freed) ໄປແລ້ວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (exception)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:258
msgid ""
"To disconnect, keep a reference to the delegate created by the lambda "
"expression and pass that to ``-=``. For example, this node connects and "
"disconnects using the ``_EnterTree`` and ``_ExitTree`` lifecycle methods:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ເກັບຕົວອ້າງອີງ (reference) ຂອງ delegate ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ lambda "
"expression ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່ານັ້ນໄປຫາ ``-=``. ຕົວຢ່າງ, node ນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"lifecycle methods ``_EnterTree`` ແລະ ``_ExitTree``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:290
msgid ""
"In this example, ``Free`` causes the node to leave the tree, which calls "
"``_ExitTree``. ``_ExitTree`` disconnects the signal, so ``_tick`` is never "
"called again."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ``Free`` ເຮັດໃຫ້ node ອອກຈາກ tree, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``_ExitTree``. "
"``_ExitTree`` ຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ``_tick`` ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອີກເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:294
msgid ""
"The lifecycle methods to use depend on what the node does. Another option is "
"to connect to signals in ``_Ready`` and disconnect in ``Dispose``."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າໂນດນັ້ນເຮັດຫຍັງ. ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາສັນຍານໃນ "
"``_Ready`` ແລະ ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນ ``Dispose``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:299
msgid ""
"Godot uses `Delegate.Target <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/"
"system.delegate.target>`_ to determine what instance a delegate is "
"associated with. When a lambda expression doesn't capture a variable, the "
"generated delegate's ``Target`` is the instance that created the delegate. "
"When a variable is captured, the ``Target`` instead points at a generated "
"type that stores the captured variable. This is what breaks the association. "
"If you want to see if a delegate will be automatically cleaned up, try "
"checking its ``Target``."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ `Delegate.Target <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/"
"system.delegate.target>`_ ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າ instance ໃດທີ່ delegate ນັ້ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນຳ. ເມື່ອ "
"lambda expression ບໍ່ໄດ້ capture ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ``Target`` ຂອງ delegate ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະເປັນ "
"instance ທີ່ສ້າງ delegate ນັ້ນ. ແຕ່ເມື່ອມີການ capture ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ``Target`` ຈະໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ປະເພດທີ່ຖື"
"ກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຖືກ capture ນັ້ນແທນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຂາດອອກ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງກ"
"ານເບິ່ງວ່າ delegate ຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ລອງກວດສອບ ``Target`` ຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:307
msgid ""
"``Callable.From`` doesn't affect the ``Delegate.Target``, so connecting a "
"lambda that captures variables using ``Connect`` doesn't work any better "
"than ``+=``."
msgstr ""
"``Callable.From`` ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ ``Delegate.Target``, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ lambda ທີ່ມີການ "
"capture ຕົວປ່ຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ ``Connect`` ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນດີໄປກວ່າການໃຊ້ ``+=``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:312
msgid "No automatic disconnection: a custom signal"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ: ສັນຍານກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:314
msgid ""
"Connecting to a custom signal using ``+=`` doesn't disconnect automatically "
"when the receiving node is freed."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານກຳນົດເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ ``+=`` ຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ node ຕົວຮັບຖືກປ່ອ"
"ຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:317
msgid "To disconnect, use ``-=`` at an appropriate time. For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``-=`` ໃນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_signals.rst:334
msgid ""
"Another solution is to use ``Connect``, which does disconnect automatically "
"with custom signals:"
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການໃຊ້ ``Connect``, ເຊິ່ງຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບສັນຍານກຳນົດເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:4
msgid "C# exported properties"
msgstr "C# exported properties"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:6
msgid ""
"In Godot, class members can be exported. This means their value gets saved "
"along with the resource (such as the :ref:`scene <class_PackedScene>`) "
"they're attached to. They will also be available for editing in the property "
"editor. Exporting is done by using the ``[Export]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot, ສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາດສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຮ່ວມກັ"
"ບ resource (ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`scene <class_PackedScene>`) ທີ່ພວກມັນຕິດຢູ່. ພວກມັນຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ"
"ໄດ້ໃນ property editor. ການ export ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ attribute ``[Export]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:21
msgid ""
"In that example the value ``5`` will be saved, and after building the "
"current project it will be visible in the property editor."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນ ຄ່າ ``5`` ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ, ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກ build ໂປຣເຈັກແລ້ວ ມັນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ "
"property editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:24
msgid ""
"One of the fundamental benefits of exporting member variables is to have "
"them visible and editable in the editor. This way, artists and game "
"designers can modify values that later influence how the program runs. For "
"this, a special export syntax is provided."
msgstr ""
"ປະໂຫຍດພື້ນຖານຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຂອງການ export ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃ"
"ນ editor. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ນັກອອກແບບເກມ ແລະ ສິລະປິນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າຕ່າງໆທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂ"
"ປຣແກຣມໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງມີ syntax ພິເສດສຳລັບການ export ມາໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:29
msgid ""
"Exporting can only be done with :ref:`c_sharp_variant_compatible_types`."
msgstr ""
"ການ export ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບ :ref:`c_sharp_variant_compatible_types` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:33
msgid ""
"Exporting properties can also be done in GDScript, for information on that "
"see :ref:`doc_gdscript_exports`."
msgstr ""
"ການ export properties ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ GDScript ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_gdscript_exports`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:39
msgid ""
"Exporting works with fields and properties. They can have any access "
"modifier."
msgstr ""
"ການ export ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງ fields ແລະ properties. ພວກມັນສາມາດມີ access modifier ໃ"
"ດກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:49
msgid ""
"Exported members can specify a default value; otherwise, the `default value "
"of the type <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-"
"reference/builtin-types/default-values>`_ is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ສະມາຊິກທີ່ຖືກ export ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້; ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ `ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປະເພດ "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/builtin-"
"types/default-values>`_ ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:51
msgid ""
"An ``int`` like ``Number`` defaults to ``0``. ``Text`` defaults to null "
"because ``string`` is a reference type."
msgstr ""
"``int`` ເຊັ່ນ ``Number`` ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ ``0``. ``Text`` ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ null ເພາະວ່"
"າ ``string`` ເປັນ reference type."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:62
msgid "Default values can be specified for fields and properties."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບທັງ fields ແລະ properties ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:72
msgid ""
"Properties with a backing field use the default value of the backing field."
msgstr "Properties ທີ່ມີ backing field ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ backing field ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:87
msgid ""
"A property's ``get`` is not actually executed to determine the default "
"value. Instead, Godot analyzes the C# source code. This works fine for most "
"cases, such as the examples on this page. However, some properties are too "
"complex for the analyzer to understand."
msgstr ""
"ການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``get`` ຂອງ property ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປະຕິບັດແທ້ໆເພື່ອຫາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແຕ່ Godot ຈະວິເຄາະ C# "
"source code ແທນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຄືກັບຕົວຢ່າງໃນໜ້ານີ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ບາງ "
"property ກໍຊັບຊ້ອນເກີນໄປທີ່ຕົວວິເຄາະຈະເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:92
msgid ""
"For example, the following property attempts to use math to display the "
"default value as ``5`` in the property editor, but it doesn't work:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, property ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ຄະນິດສາດເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ ``5`` ໃນ property "
"editor, ແຕ່ມັນເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:106
msgid ""
"The analyzer doesn't understand this code and falls back to the default "
"value for ``int``, ``0``. However, when running the scene or inspecting a "
"node with an attached tool script, ``_number`` will be ``2``, and "
"``NumberWithBackingField`` will return ``5``. This difference may cause "
"confusing behavior. To avoid this, don't use complex properties. "
"Alternatively, if the default value can be explicitly specified, it can be "
"overridden with the :ref:`_PropertyCanRevert() "
"<class_Object_private_method__property_can_revert>` "
"and :ref:`_PropertyGetRevert() "
"<class_Object_private_method__property_get_revert>` methods."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວວິເຄາະບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈ code ນີ້ ແລະ ຈຶ່ງກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ ``int`` ນັ້ນຄື ``0``. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່"
"ອ run scene ຫຼື ກວດສອບ node ທີ່ມີ tool script ຕິດຢູ່, ``_number`` ຈະເປັນ ``2``, ແລະ "
"``NumberWithBackingField`` ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ ``5``. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ສັບສົນ. ເພື່"
"ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນີ້, ຢ່າໃຊ້ property ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ. ຫຼື ຖ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ກໍສາມາດຂຽນທັບ "
"(override) ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ method :ref:`_PropertyCanRevert() "
"<class_Object_private_method__property_can_revert>` ແລະ "
":ref:`_PropertyGetRevert() <class_Object_private_method__property_get_revert>"
"`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:115
msgid ""
"Any type of ``Resource`` or ``Node`` can be exported. The property editor "
"shows a user-friendly assignment dialog for these types. This can be used "
"instead of ``GD.Load`` and ``GetNode``. See :ref:`Nodes and Resources "
"<doc_c_sharp_exports_nodes>`."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆປະເພດຂອງ ``Resource`` ຫຼື ``Node`` ສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້. property editor ຈະສະແດ"
"ງໜ້າຕ່າງການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ງ່າຍສຳລັບປະເພດເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທນ ``GD.Load`` ແລະ "
"``GetNode`` ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Nodes and Resources <doc_c_sharp_exports_nodes>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:130
msgid ""
"It is possible to group your exported properties inside the Inspector with "
"the ``[ExportGroup]`` attribute. Every exported property after this "
"attribute will be added to the group. Start a new group or use "
"``[ExportGroup(\"\")]`` to break out."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຈັດກຸ່ມ properties ທີ່ export ຂອງທ່ານໃນ Inspector ໂດຍໃຊ້ attribute "
"``[ExportGroup]``. ທຸກໆ property ທີ່ export ຫຼັງຈາກ attribute ນີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ເ"
"ລີ່ມກຸ່ມໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ ``[ExportGroup(\"\")]`` ເພື່ອອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:140
msgid ""
"The second argument of the attribute can be used to only group properties "
"with the specified prefix."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມນທີສອງຂອງແອດທຣິບິວສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:142
msgid ""
"Groups cannot be nested, use ``[ExportSubgroup]`` to create subgroups within "
"a group."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມບໍ່ສາມາດຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``[ExportSubgroup]`` ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:152
msgid ""
"You can also change the name of your main category, or create additional "
"categories in the property list with the ``[ExportCategory]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໝວດໝູ່ຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ສ້າງໝວດໝູ່ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລາຍການ property ດ້ວຍ attribute "
"``[ExportCategory]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:169
msgid ""
"The list of properties is organized based on the class inheritance, and new "
"categories break that expectation. Use them carefully, especially when "
"creating projects for public use."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການ properties ຖືກຈັດລະບຽບຕາມການສືບທອດຂອງຄລາດ, ແລະ ໝວດໝູ່ໃໝ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບຽບນັ້ນປ່ຽນ"
"ໄປ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພວກມັນຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:175
msgid "Property hints can be used to export strings as paths"
msgstr "Property hints ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ export strings ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ (paths)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:177
msgid "String as a path to a file."
msgstr "String ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:184
msgid "String as a path to a directory."
msgstr "String ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ (directory)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:191
msgid "String as a path to a file, custom filter provided as hint."
msgstr ""
"String ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌, ໂດຍມີການກຳນົດຕົວຕອງ (filter) ກຳນົດເອງເປັນ hint."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:201
msgid "String as a path to a PNG file in the global filesystem."
msgstr "String ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ PNG ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສາກົນ (global filesystem)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:208
msgid "String as a path to a directory in the global filesystem."
msgstr "String ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສາກົນ (global filesystem)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:215
msgid ""
"The multiline annotation tells the editor to show a large input field for "
"editing over multiple lines."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (annotation) multiline ຈະບອກໃຫ້ editor ສະແດງຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບການແ"
"ກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍບັນທັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:226
msgid ""
"Using the range property hint allows you to limit what can be input as a "
"value using the editor."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ range property hint ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈຳກັດຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄດ້ໃນ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:250
msgid ""
"If you add the hints \"or_greater\" and/or \"or_less\" you can go above or "
"below the limits when adjusting the value by typing it instead of using the "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເພີ່ມ hint \"or_greater\" ແລະ/ຫຼື \"or_less\", ທ່ານຈະສາມາດໃສ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳກວ່າຂີ"
"ດຈຳກັດໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມຄ່າແທນການໃຊ້ slider."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:262
msgid ""
"Display a visual representation of "
"the :ref:`ease<class_@GlobalScope_method_ease>` function when editing."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຮູບພາບຂອງຟັງຊັນ :ref:`ease <class_@GlobalScope_method_ease>` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:271
msgid "Export with suffix hint"
msgstr "Export ພ້ອມກັບ suffix hint"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:273
msgid ""
"Display a unit hint suffix for exported variables. Works with numeric types, "
"such as floats or vectors:"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix) ໜ່ວຍວັດແທກສຳລັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ export. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບປະເພດຕົວເລກ ເຊັ່ນ "
"floats ຫຼື vectors:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:283
msgid ""
"In the above example, ``\\u00b2`` is used to write the \"squared\" character "
"(``²``)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ``\\u00b2`` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂຽນຕົວອັກສອນ \"ກຳລັງສອງ\" (``²``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:296
msgid "Color given as red-green-blue value (alpha will always be 1)."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າ red-green-blue (ຄ່າ alpha ຈະເປັນ 1 ສະເໝີ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:308
msgid "Nodes can also be directly exported without having to use NodePaths."
msgstr "Nodes ຍັງສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ NodePaths."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:315
msgid ""
"A specific type of node can also be directly exported. The list of nodes "
"shown after pressing \"Assign\" in the inspector is filtered to the "
"specified type, and only a correct node can be assigned."
msgstr ""
"Node ປະເພດສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງກໍສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ລາຍການຂອງ nodes ທີ່ສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກກົດ "
"\"Assign\" ໃນ inspector ຈະຖືກຕອງໃຫ້ເຫຼືອແຕ່ປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແລະ ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ສະເພາະ "
"node ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:324
msgid ""
"Custom node classes can also be exported directly. The filtering behavior "
"depends on whether the custom class is a :ref:`global class "
"<doc_c_sharp_global_classes>`."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດ node ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກໍສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ພຶດຕິກຳການຕອງຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າຄລາດນັ້ນເປັນ "
":ref:`global class <doc_c_sharp_global_classes>` ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:351
msgid ""
"Opening the inspector dropdown may result in an extremely long list of "
"possible classes to create, however. Therefore, if you specify a type "
"derived from Resource such as:"
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການເປີດ dropdown ໃນ inspector ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍການຄລາດທີ່ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ຍາວ"
"ຫຼາຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຖ້າທ່ານລະບຸປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Resource ເຊັ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:360
msgid ""
"The drop-down menu will be limited to AnimationNode and all its derived "
"classes. Custom resource classes can also be used, "
"see :ref:`doc_c_sharp_global_classes`."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູ drop-down ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເຫຼືອແຕ່ AnimationNode ແລະ ຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກມັນທັງໝົດ. ຄລາດ "
"resource ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_c_sharp_global_classes`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:364
msgid ""
"It must be noted that even if the script is not being run while in the "
"editor, the exported properties are still editable. This can be used in "
"conjunction with a :ref:`script in \"tool\" mode <doc_gdscript_tool_mode>`."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງສັງເກດວ່າເຖິງແມ່ນ script ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ run ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ editor, properties ທີ່ export ໄວ້"
"ກໍຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ :ref:`script ໃນໂໝດ \"tool\" "
"<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:371
msgid ""
"Members whose type is an enum with the ``[Flags]`` attribute can be exported "
"and their values are limited to the members of the enum type. The editor "
"will create a widget in the Inspector, allowing to select none, one, or "
"multiple of the enum members. The value will be stored as an integer."
msgstr ""
"ສະມາຊິກທີ່ມີປະເພດເປັນ enum ພ້ອມກັບ attribute ``[Flags]`` ສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້ ແລະ ຄ່າຂອງ"
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະມາຊິກຂອງປະເພດ enum ນັ້ນ. editor ຈະສ້າງ widget ໃນ Inspector ເຊິ່"
"ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກບໍ່ເອົາເລີຍ, ເອົາໜຶ່ງຢ່າງ, ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຢ່າງຈາກສະມາຊິກ enum ໄດ້. ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບເປັນເລກຖ້ວ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:376
msgid ""
"A flags enum uses powers of 2 for the values of the enum members. Members "
"that combine multiple flags using logical OR (``|``) are also possible."
msgstr ""
"flags enum ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2 ສຳລັບຄ່າຂອງສະມາຊິກ enum. ສະມາຊິກທີ່ລວມຫຼາຍ flags ເຂົ້າກັນ"
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ logical OR (``|``) ກໍສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:395
msgid ""
"Integers used as bit flags can store multiple ``true``/``false`` (boolean) "
"values in one property. By using the ``Flags`` property hint, any of the "
"given flags can be set from the editor."
msgstr ""
"ເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນ bit flags ສາມາດເກັບຫຼາຍຄ່າ ``true``/``false`` (boolean) ໄວ້ໃນ "
"property ດຽວ. ໂດຍການໃຊ້ ``Flags`` property hint, ທຸກໆ flags ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄ"
"ດ້ຈາກ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:404
msgid ""
"You must provide a string description for each flag. In this example, "
"``Fire`` has value 1, ``Water`` has value 2, ``Earth`` has value 4 and "
"``Wind`` corresponds to value 8. Usually, constants should be defined "
"accordingly (e.g. ``private const int ElementWind = 8`` and so on)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄຳອະທິບາຍເປັນ string ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ flag. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ``Fire`` ມີຄ່າ 1, "
"``Water`` ມີຄ່າ 2, ``Earth`` ມີຄ່າ 4 ແລະ ``Wind`` ກົງກັບຄ່າ 8. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຄວນກຳນົດຄ່"
"າຄົງທີ່ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ``private const int ElementWind = 8`` ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:425
msgid ""
"Export annotations are also provided for the physics and render layers "
"defined in the project settings."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງມີ export annotations ສຳລັບ physics ແລະ render layers ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:444
msgid ""
"Members whose type is an enum can be exported and their values are limited "
"to the members of the enum type. The editor will create a widget in the "
"Inspector, enumerating the following as \"Thing 1\", \"Thing 2\", \"Another "
"Thing\". The value will be stored as an integer."
msgstr ""
"ສະມາຊິກທີ່ມີປະເພດເປັນ enum ສາມາດຖືກ export ໄດ້ ແລະ ຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະມາຊິກຂອງປ"
"ະເພດ enum ນັ້ນ. editor ຈະສ້າງ widget ໃນ Inspector ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງລາຍການເຊັ່ນ \"Thing "
"1\", \"Thing 2\", \"Another Thing\". ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:460
msgid ""
"Integer and string members can also be limited to a specific list of values "
"using the ``[Export]`` annotation with the ``PropertyHint.Enum`` hint. The "
"editor will create a widget in the Inspector, enumerating the following as "
"Warrior, Magician, Thief. The value will be stored as an integer, "
"corresponding to the index of the selected option (i.e. ``0``, ``1``, or "
"``2``)."
msgstr ""
"ສະມາຊິກທີ່ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ ແລະ string ກໍສາມາດຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເປັນລາຍການຄ່າສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"annotation ``[Export]`` ຮ່ວມກັບ hint ``PropertyHint.Enum``. editor ຈະສ້າງ "
"widget ໃນ Inspector ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງລາຍການເປັນ Warrior, Magician, Thief. ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບເປັ"
"ນເລກຖ້ວນ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ index ຂອງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (ເຊັ່ນ ``0``, ``1``, ຫຼື ``2``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:478
msgid "If the type is ``string``, the value will be stored as a string."
msgstr "ຖ້າປະເພດເປັນ ``string``, ຄ່າຈະຖືກເກັບເປັນ string."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:494
msgid "Exporting inspector buttons with ``[ExportToolButton]``"
msgstr "ການ export ປຸ່ມໃນ inspector ດ້ວຍ ``[ExportToolButton]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:496
msgid ""
"If you want to create a clickable button in the inspector, you can use the "
"``[ExportToolButton]`` attribute.  This exports a Callable property or field "
"as a clickable button. Since this runs in the editor, usage of "
"the :ref:`[Tool] <doc_running_code_in_the_editor>` attribute is required. "
"When the button is pressed, the callable is called:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງປຸ່ມທີ່ກົດໄດ້ໃນ inspector, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ attribute "
"``[ExportToolButton]``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ export property ຫຼື field ປະເພດ Callable ໃຫ້ເປັນປຸ່ມທີ່"
"ກົດໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນ editor, ຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ attribute :ref:`[Tool] "
"<doc_running_code_in_the_editor>`. ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ, callable ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:516
msgid ""
"You can also set an icon for the button with a second argument. If "
"specified, an icon will be fetched via :ref:`GetThemeIcon() "
"<class_Control_method_get_theme_icon>`, from the ``\"EditorIcons\"`` theme "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງ icon ສຳລັບປຸ່ມໄດ້ດ້ວຍ argument ທີສອງ. ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້, icon ຈະຖືກດຶງຜ່ານ "
":ref:`GetThemeIcon() <class_Control_method_get_theme_icon>` ຈາກປະເພດ theme "
"``\"EditorIcons\"``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:526
msgid "Exporting collections"
msgstr "ການ export collections"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:528
msgid ""
"As explained in the :ref:`C# Variant <doc_c_sharp_variant>` documentation, "
"only certain C# arrays and the collection types defined in the "
"``Godot.Collections`` namespace are Variant-compatible, therefore, only "
"those types can be exported."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ :ref:`C# Variant <doc_c_sharp_variant>`, ມີພຽງແຕ່ບາງອາເ"
"ຣຂອງ C# ແລະ ປະເພດ collection ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ namespace ``Godot.Collections`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່"
"ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ Variant, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພຽງແຕ່ປະເພດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດ export ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:533
msgid "Exporting Godot arrays"
msgstr "ການ export Godot arrays"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:540
msgid ""
"Using the generic ``Godot.Collections.Array<T>`` allows specifying the type "
"of the array elements, which will be used as a hint for the editor. The "
"Inspector will restrict the elements to the specified type."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ generic ``Godot.Collections.Array<T>`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງອົງປະກອບອາເ"
"ຣໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ hint ສຳລັບ editor. Inspector ຈະຈຳກັດອົງປະກອບໃຫ້ເປັນປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:549
msgid ""
"The default value of Godot arrays is null. A different default can be "
"specified:"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot arrays ແມ່ນ null. ແຕ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອື່ນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:573
msgid "Exporting Godot dictionaries"
msgstr "ການ export Godot dictionaries"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:580
msgid ""
"Using the generic ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>`` allows "
"specifying the types of the key and value elements of the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ generic ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດປະ"
"ເພດຂອງຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າ ຂອງ dictionary ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:588
msgid ""
"The default value of Godot dictionaries is null. A different default can be "
"specified:"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot dictionaries ແມ່ນ null. ແຕ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອື່ນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:601
msgid "Exporting C# arrays"
msgstr "ການ export C# arrays"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:603
msgid ""
"C# arrays can exported as long as the element type is a :ref:`Variant-"
"compatible type <c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງ C# ສາມາດ export ໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ປະເພດອົງປະກອບນັ້ນເປັນ :ref:`ປະເພດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ "
"Variant <c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:613
msgid ""
"The default value of C# arrays is null. A different default can be specified:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອາເຣ C# ແມ່ນ null. ແຕ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອື່ນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:627
msgid ""
"When changing an exported variable's value from a script "
"in :ref:`doc_gdscript_tool_mode`, the value in the inspector won't be "
"updated automatically. To update it, call :ref:`NotifyPropertyListChanged() "
"<class_Object_method_notify_property_list_changed>` after setting the "
"exported variable's value."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ export ຈາກ script ໃນ :ref:`ໂໝດ tool "
"<doc_gdscript_tool_mode>`, ຄ່າໃນ inspector ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອອັບເດດມັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ :ref:`NotifyPropertyListChanged() "
"<class_Object_method_notify_property_list_changed>` ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:640
msgid ""
"Before reading further, you should get familiar with the way properties are "
"handled and how they can be customized with :ref:`_Set() "
"<class_Object_private_method__set>`, :ref:`_Get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`, and :ref:`_GetPropertyList() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get_property_list>` methods as described "
"in :ref:`doc_accessing_data_or_logic_from_object`."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອ່ານຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຄວນທຳຄວາມຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບວິທີການຈັດການ properties ແລະ ວິທີປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນດ້ວຍ "
"method :ref:`_Set() <class_Object_private_method__set>`, :ref:`_Get() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get>`, ແລະ :ref:`_GetPropertyList() "
"<class_Object_private_method__get_property_list>` ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
":ref:`doc_accessing_data_or_logic_from_object`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:650
msgid ""
"The script must operate in the ``tool`` mode so the above methods can work "
"from within the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ ``tool`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ວິທີການຂ້າງເທິງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຈາກພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:4
msgid "C# global classes"
msgstr "C# global classes"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:6
msgid ""
"Global classes (also known as named scripts) are types registered in Godot's "
"editor so they can be used more conveniently. :ref:`In GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript_basics_class_name>`, this is achieved using the ``class_name`` "
"keyword at the top of a script. This page describes how to achieve the same "
"effect in C#."
msgstr ""
"Global classes (ຫຼື ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ scripts ທີ່ມີຊື່) ແມ່ນປະເພດທີ່ຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ editor ຂອງ "
"Godot ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະດວກກວ່າ. :ref:`ໃນ GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript_basics_class_name>`, ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ keyword ``class_name`` ຢູ່ເ"
"ທິງສຸດຂອງ script. ໜ້ານີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນແບບດຽວກັນໃນ C#."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:12
msgid "Global classes show up in the *Add Node* and *Create Resource* dialogs."
msgstr ""
"Global classes ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ *Add Node* (ເພີ່ມ Node) ແລະ *Create Resource* (ສ້"
"າງ Resource)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:13
msgid ""
"If an :ref:`exported property <doc_c_sharp_exports>` is a global class, the "
"inspector restricts assignment, allowing only instances of that global class "
"or any derived classes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ :ref:`exported property <doc_c_sharp_exports>` ເປັນ global class, "
"inspector ຈະຈຳກັດການກຳນົດຄ່າ ໂດຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະ instance ຂອງ global class ນັ້ນ ຫຼື ຄລ"
"າດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ສືບທອດມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:17
msgid "Global classes are registered with the ``[GlobalClass]`` attribute."
msgstr "Global classes ຖືກລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ attribute ``[GlobalClass]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:30
msgid ""
"The file name must match the class name in **case-sensitive** fashion. For "
"example, a global class named \"MyNode\" must have a file name of "
"``MyNode.cs``, not ``myNode.cs``."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຄລາດໃນຮູບແບບ **case-sensitive** (ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍຕ່າງກັນ). ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"global class ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ \"MyNode\" ຈະຕ້ອງມີຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເປັນ ``MyNode.cs``, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"``myNode.cs``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:34
msgid ""
"The ``MyNode`` type will be registered as a global class with the same name "
"as the type's name."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ ``MyNode`` ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ global class ທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຊື່ຂອງປະເພດນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:38
msgid ""
"The *Select a Node* window for the ``MyNode`` exported property filters the "
"list of nodes in the scene to match the assignment restriction."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງ *Select a Node* (ເລືອກ Node) ສຳລັບ exported property ``MyNode`` ຈະຕອງລາຍກ"
"ານ nodes ໃນ scene ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດການກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:51
msgid ""
"If a custom type isn't registered as a global class, the assignment is "
"restricted to the Godot type the custom type is based on. For example, "
"inspector assignments to an export of the type ``MySimpleSprite2D`` are "
"restricted to ``Sprite2D`` and derived types."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າປະເພດກຳນົດເອງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ global class, ການກຳນົດຄ່າຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເປັນປະເພດ "
"Godot ທີ່ປະເພດກຳນົດເອງນັ້ນອີງໃສ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ inspector ໃຫ້ກັບ export ຂອງປະເພດ "
"``MySimpleSprite2D`` ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເປັນ ``Sprite2D`` ແລະ ປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:62
msgid ""
"When combined with the ``[GlobalClass]`` attribute, the ``[Icon]`` attribute "
"allows providing a path to an icon to show when the class is displayed in "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ attribute ``[GlobalClass]``, attribute ``[Icon]`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດ"
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ icon ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອຄລາດນັ້ນປະກົດໃນ editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:85
msgid ""
"The ``Stats`` class is a custom resource registered as a global "
"class. :ref:`Exporting properties <doc_c_sharp_exports>` of the type "
"``Stats`` will only allow instances of this resource type to be assigned, "
"and the inspector will let you create and load instances of this type easily."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດ ``Stats`` ເປັນ resource ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ global class. :ref:`ການ "
"export properties <doc_c_sharp_exports>` ຂອງປະເພດ ``Stats`` ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກຳນົດໄດ້ສ"
"ະເພາະ instance ຂອງ resource ປະເພດນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ inspector ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ໂຫຼດ "
"instance ຂອງປະເພດນີ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_global_classes.rst:95
msgid ""
"The Godot editor will hide these custom classes with names that begin with "
"the prefix \"Editor\" in the \"Create New Node\" or \"Create New Scene\" "
"dialog windows. The classes are available for instantiation at runtime via "
"their class names, but are automatically hidden by the editor windows along "
"with the built-in editor nodes used by the Godot editor."
msgstr ""
"Editor ຂອງ Godot ຈະເຊື່ອງຄລາດກຳນົດເອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທີ່ມີຊື່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄຳນຳໜ້າ \"Editor\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"\"Create New Node\" (ສ້າງ Node ໃໝ່) ຫຼື \"Create New Scene\" (ສ້າງ Scene ໃໝ່). ຄລາດ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດສ້າງ instance ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະ runtime ຜ່ານຊື່ຄລາດ, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນໜ້າຕ່າ"
"ງ editor ຄືກັບ editor nodes ພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Godot editor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/index.rst:6
msgid "C++ (godot-cpp)"
msgstr "C++ (godot-cpp)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"This section documents `godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"cpp>`__, the official C++ GDExtension bindings maintained as part of the "
"Godot project."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນເອກະສານຂອງ `godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (bindings) C++ GDExtension ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການທີ່ຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງໂດຍໂປຣເຈັກ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:4
msgid "About godot-cpp"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ godot-cpp"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:6
msgid ""
"`godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ are the official C+"
"+ GDExtension bindings, maintained as part of the Godot project."
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ ແມ່ນຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ C++ "
"GDExtension ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ, ຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງໂດຍໂປຣເຈັກ Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:9
msgid ""
"godot-cpp is built with the :ref:`GDExtension system <doc_gdextension>`, "
"which allows access to Godot in almost the same way as :ref:`modules "
"<doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>`: A lot of `engine code <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot>`__ can be used in your godot-cpp project almost exactly "
"as it is."
msgstr ""
"godot-cpp ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ :ref:`ລະບົບ GDExtension <doc_gdextension>`, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິ"
"ງ Godot ໄດ້ເກືອບຄືກັນກັບ :ref:`modules <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>`: `engine code "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot>`__ ຫຼາຍສ່ວນສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ godot-cpp ຂ"
"ອງທ່ານໄດ້ເກືອບຄືກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:13
msgid ""
"In particular, godot-cpp has access to all functions that :ref:`GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript>` and :ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>` have, and additional access to a "
"few more for fast low-level access of data, or deeper integration with Godot."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍສະເພາະ, godot-cpp ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກຟັງຊັນທີ່ :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>` ແລະ "
":ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>` ມີ, ແລະ ຍັງເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນອື່ນໆເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ "
"(low-level) ທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ Godot ທີ່ເລິກເຊິ່ງກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:17
msgid "Differences between godot-cpp and C++ modules"
msgstr "ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ godot-cpp ແລະ C++ modules"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:19
msgid ""
"You can use both `godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ "
"and :ref:`C++ modules <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` to run C or C++ code in a "
"Godot project."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງ `godot-cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ ແລະ "
":ref:`C++ modules <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` ເພື່ອ run code C ຫຼື C++ ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:22
msgid ""
"They also both allow you to integrate third-party libraries into Godot. The "
"one you should choose depends on your needs."
msgstr ""
"ທັງສອງຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ libraries ຈາກພາຍນອກ (third-party) ເຂົ້າໃນ Godot ໄດ້. ສິ່ງ"
"ທີ່ທ່ານຄວນເລືອກນັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:26
msgid "Advantages of godot-cpp"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ດີຂອງ godot-cpp"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:28
msgid ""
"Unlike modules, godot-cpp (and GDExtensions, in general) don't require "
"compiling the engine's source code, making it easier to distribute your "
"work. It gives you access to most of the API available to GDScript and C#, "
"allowing you to code game logic with full control regarding performance. "
"It's ideal if you need high-performance code you'd like to distribute as an "
"add-on in the :ref:`asset library <doc_what_is_assetlib>`."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ modules, godot-cpp (ແລະ GDExtensions ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ) ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ compile "
"source code ຂອງ engine, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການແຈກຢາຍຜົນງານຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງ API "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ GDScript ແລະ C# ມີ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຂຽນ game logic ດ້ວຍການຄວບຄຸມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມ"
"ທີ່. ມັນເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ code ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງທີ່ຢາກແຈກຢາຍເປັນ add-on ໃນ "
":ref:`asset library <doc_what_is_assetlib>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:35
msgid "Also:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:37
msgid ""
"You can use the same compiled godot-cpp library in the editor and exported "
"project. With C++ modules, you have to recompile all the export templates "
"you plan to use if you require its functionality at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ library godot-cpp ທີ່ compile ແລ້ວອັນດຽວກັນໄດ້ທັງໃນ editor ແລະ ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ "
"export ແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ສຳລັບ C++ modules, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ recompile export templates ທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຈ"
"ະໃຊ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນຕອນ runtime."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:40
msgid ""
"godot-cpp only requires you to compile your library, not the whole engine. "
"That's unlike C++ modules, which are statically compiled into the engine. "
"Every time you change a module, you need to recompile the engine. Even with "
"incremental builds, this process is slower than using godot-cpp."
msgstr ""
"godot-cpp ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານ compile ສະເພາະ library ຂອງທ່ານເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງໝົດ engine. ນີ້ຕ່"
"າງຈາກ C++ modules ທີ່ຖືກ compile ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ engine ແບບ static. ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງ "
"module, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ recompile engine ໃໝ່. ເຖິງແມ່ນຈະມີການ build ແບບ incremental, ຂັ້ນຕ"
"ອນນີ້ກໍຍັງຊ້າກວ່າການໃຊ້ godot-cpp."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:46
msgid "Advantages of C++ modules"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ດີຂອງ C++ modules"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:48
msgid ""
"We recommend :ref:`C++ modules <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` in cases where "
"godot-cpp (or another GDExtension system) isn't enough:"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`C++ modules <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ godot-"
"cpp (ຫຼື ລະບົບ GDExtension ອື່ນໆ) ຍັງບໍ່ພຽງພໍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:51
msgid ""
"C++ modules provide deeper integration into the engine. GDExtension's access "
"is not as deep as static modules."
msgstr ""
"C++ modules ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງທີ່ເລິກເຊິ່ງກວ່າເຂົ້າໃນ engine. ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງ GDExtension ແມ່ນບໍ່"
"ເລິກເທົ່າກັບ static modules."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:53
msgid ""
"You can use C++ modules to provide additional features in a project without "
"carrying native library files around. This extends to exported projects."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ C++ modules ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຟີເຈີຕ່າງໆໃນໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງພົກພາໄຟລ໌ native library ໄປນ"
"ຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມໄປເຖິງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ export ແລ້ວນຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:58
msgid ""
"If you notice that specific systems are not accessible via godot-cpp but are "
"via custom modules, feel free to open an issue on the `godot-cpp repository "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ to discuss implementation "
"options for exposing the missing functionality."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າລະບົບສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ godot-cpp ແຕ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ "
"custom modules, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ issue ໃນ `godot-cpp repository <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__ ເພື່ອປຶກສາຫາລືກ່ຽວກັບທາງເລືອກໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຂາດ"
"ຫາຍໄປນັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:66
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:20
msgid "Version compatibility"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຂອງເວີຊັນ (Version compatibility)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:68
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:56
msgid ""
"GDExtensions targeting an earlier version of Godot should work in later "
"minor versions, but not vice-versa. For example, a GDExtension targeting "
"Godot 4.2 should work just fine in Godot 4.3, but one targeting Godot 4.3 "
"won't work in Godot 4.2."
msgstr ""
"GDExtensions ທີ່ສ້າງມາສຳລັບເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ Godot ຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ (minor "
"versions) ຕໍ່ມາ, ແຕ່ໃນທາງກັບກັນແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, GDExtension ທີ່ສ້າງມາສຳລັບ Godot 4.2 ຄວນ"
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ປົກກະຕິໃນ Godot 4.3, ແຕ່ໂຕທີ່ສ້າງມາສຳລັບ Godot 4.3 ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ Godot 4.2."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:72
msgid ""
"For this reason, when creating GDExtensions, you may want to target the "
"lowest version of Godot that has the features you need, *not* the most "
"recent version of Godot. This can save you from needing to create multiple "
"builds for different versions of Godot."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, ເມື່ອສ້າງ GDExtensions, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເລືອກເວີຊັນຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ Godot ທີ່ມີຟີເຈີທີ່ທ່ານ"
"ຕ້ອງການ, *ບໍ່ແມ່ນ* ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງ build ຫຼາຍອັນສຳລັບເວີຊັນຕ່າງໆຂອງ "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:76
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:60
msgid ""
"There is one exception to this: extensions targeting Godot 4.0 will **not** "
"work with Godot 4.1 and later "
"(see :ref:`updating_your_gdextension_for_godot_4_1`)."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື: extensions ທີ່ສ້າງມາສຳລັບ Godot 4.0 ຈະ **ບໍ່** ເຮັດວຽກກັບ Godot 4.1 ແລ"
"ະ ເວີຊັນຕໍ່ໆມາ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`updating_your_gdextension_for_godot_4_1`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:79
msgid ""
"GDExtensions are also only compatible with engine builds that use the same "
"level of floating-point precision the extension was compiled for. This means "
"that if you use an engine build with double-precision floats, the extension "
"must also be compiled for double-precision floats and use an "
"``extension_api.json`` file generated by your custom engine build. "
"See :ref:`doc_large_world_coordinates` for details."
msgstr ""
"GDExtensions ຍັງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ engine build ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະດັບຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ "
"(floating-point precision) ອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ extension ຖືກ compile ມາ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າທ່າ"
"ນໃຊ້ engine build ແບບ double-precision floats, extension ກໍຈະຕ້ອງຖືກ compile ສຳລັ"
"ບ double-precision floats ເຊັ່ນກັນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ ``extension_api.json`` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ "
"custom engine build ຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_large_world_coordinates` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອ"
"ຽດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/about_godot_cpp.rst:86
msgid ""
"Generally speaking, if you build a custom version of Godot, you should "
"generate an ``extension_api.json`` from it for your GDExtensions, because it "
"may have some differences from official Godot builds. You can learn more "
"about the process of using custom ``extension_api.json`` files in "
"the :ref:`build system section <doc_godot_cpp_build_system>`."
msgstr ""
"ເວົ້າລວມແລ້ວ, ຖ້າທ່ານ build Godot ເວີຊັນກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານຄວນສ້າງ ``extension_api.json`` ຈາ"
"ກໂຕນັ້ນສຳລັບ GDExtensions ຂອງທ່ານ, ເພາະວ່າມັນອາດຈະມີບາງຈຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ Godot build ຢ່າງເ"
"ປັນທາງການ. ທ່ານສາມາດຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການໃຊ້ custom ``extension_api.json`` ໃນ "
":ref:`build system section <doc_godot_cpp_build_system>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:7
msgid "Workflow overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ (Workflow overview)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:9
msgid ""
"As a GDExtension, godot-cpp is more complicated to use than :ref:`GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript>` and :ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>`. If you decide to work with it, "
"here's what to expect your workflow to look like:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຖານະ GDExtension, godot-cpp ແມ່ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໃນການໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍກວ່າ :ref:`GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript>` ແລະ :ref:`C# <doc_c_sharp>`. ຖ້າທ່ານຕັດສິນໃຈໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ນີ້ຄືສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຄວນຄ"
"າດຫວັງວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຈະເປັນແນວໃດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:12
msgid ""
"Create a new godot-cpp project (from the `template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__, or from scratch, as explained below)."
