"A copy of the `godot-cpp repository <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາຂອງ `godot-cpp repository <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:37
