#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:98
msgid "This will initialize the repository in your project folder."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ repository ໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:101
msgid "Creating a simple plugin"
msgstr "ການສ້າງປລັກອິນ (plugin) ແບບງ່າຍໆ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:103
msgid ""
"Now it's time to build an actual plugin. We'll start by creating an empty "
"Godot project in which we'll place a few files."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເຖິງເວລາສ້າງປລັກອິນແທ້ໆແລ້ວ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມຈາກການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາ"
"ຈະວາງໄຟລ໌ບາງຢ່າງລົງໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:106
msgid ""
"Open Godot and create a new project. For this example, we will place it in a "
"folder called ``project`` inside our GDExtension's folder structure."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ Godot ແລະ ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະວາງມັນໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"``project`` ພາຍໃນໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີ GDExtension ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:109
msgid ""
"In our project, we'll create a scene containing a Node called \"Main\" and "
"we'll save it as ``main.tscn``. We'll come back to that later."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ scene ທີ່ມີ Node ຊື່ວ່າ \"Main\" ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນ "
"``main.tscn``. ພວກເຮົາຈະກັບມາຫາໂຕນີ້ອີກໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:112
msgid ""
"Back in the top-level GDExtension module folder, we're also going to create "
"a subfolder called ``src`` in which we'll place our source files."
msgstr ""
"ກັບມາທີ່ໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ GDExtension module, ພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``src`` ເພື່ອວາງໄຟ"
"ລ໌ source code ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:115
msgid ""
"You should now have ``project``, ``godot-cpp``, and ``src`` directories in "
"your GDExtension module."
msgstr ""
"ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານຄວນມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``project``, ``godot-cpp``, ແລະ ``src`` ໃນໂມດູນ "
"GDExtension ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:118
msgid "Your folder structure should now look like this:"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:130
msgid ""
"In the ``src`` folder, we'll start with creating our header file for the "
"GDExtension node we'll be creating. We will name it ``gdexample.h``:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``src``, ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີ (header file) ສໍາລັບໂນດ "
"GDExtension ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກໍາລັງຈະສ້າງ. ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ມັນວ່າ ``gdexample.h``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:133
msgid "gdextension_cpp_example/src/gdexample.h"
msgstr "gdextension_cpp_example/src/gdexample.h"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:160
msgid ""
"There are a few things of note to the above. We include ``sprite2d.hpp`` "
"which contains bindings to the Sprite2D class. We'll be extending this class "
"in our module."
msgstr ""
"ມີບາງຈຸດທີ່ຄວນສັງເກດຈາກຂ້າງເທິງ. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ລວມເອົາ ``sprite2d.hpp`` ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ "
"(bindings) ກັບຄລາສ Sprite2D. ພວກເຮົາຈະທຳການຂະຫຍາຍ (extending) ຄລາສນີ້ໃນໂມດູນຂອງພວກ"
"ເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:164
msgid ""
"We're using the namespace ``godot``, since everything in GDExtension is "
"defined within this namespace."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາກໍາລັງໃຊ້ namespace ``godot``, ເນື່ອງຈາກທຸກຢ່າງໃນ GDExtension ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ພາຍໃນ "
"namespace ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:167
msgid ""
"Then we have our class definition, which inherits from our Sprite2D through "
"a container class. We'll see a few side effects of this later on. The "
"``GDCLASS`` macro sets up a few internal things for us."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາກໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄລາສ, ເຊິ່ງສືບທອດມາຈາກ Sprite2D ຜ່ານຄລາສຄອນເທນເນີ. ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນ"
"ຜົນກະທົບບາງຢ່າງຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ມາໂຄຣ ``GDCLASS`` ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງພາຍໃນໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:171
msgid "After that, we declare a single member variable called ``time_passed``."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຕົວດຽວທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``time_passed``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:173
msgid ""
"In the next block we're defining our methods, we have our constructor and "
"destructor defined, but there are two other functions that will likely look "
"familiar to some, and one new method."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບລັອກຖັດໄປ ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງກຳນົດເມັດທອດ (methods) ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາມີການກຳນົດ "
"constructor ແລະ destructor, ແຕ່ຍັງມີອີກສອງຟັງຊັນທີ່ອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືຄຸ້ນເຄີຍສຳລັບບາງຄົນ, ແລະ ອີກໜຶ່ງເ"
"ມັດທອດໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:177
msgid ""
"The first is ``_bind_methods``, which is a static function that Godot will "
"call to find out which methods can be called and which properties it "
"exposes. The second is our ``_process`` function, which will work exactly "
"the same as the ``_process`` function you're used to in GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ອັນທຳອິດແມ່ນ ``_bind_methods``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຟັງຊັນ static ທີ່ Godot ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາວ່າເມັດທອ"
"ດໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ໃດແດ່ທີ່ມັນສະແດງອອກມາ. ອັນທີສອງແມ່ນຟັງຊັນ "
"``_process`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບຟັງຊັນ ``_process`` ທີ່ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍໃນ "
"GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:182
msgid "Let's implement our functions by creating our ``gdexample.cpp`` file:"
msgstr "ລອງມາເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນຂອງພວກເຮົາໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``gdexample.cpp``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:184
msgid "gdextension_cpp_example/src/gdexample.cpp"
msgstr "gdextension_cpp_example/src/gdexample.cpp"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:212
msgid ""
"This one should be straightforward. We're implementing each method of our "
"class that we defined in our header file."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຄວນຈະເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ. ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງຂຽນການເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະເມັດທອດຂອງຄລາສທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້"
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:215
msgid ""
"Note our ``_process`` function, which keeps track of how much time has "
"passed and calculates a new position for our sprite using a sine and cosine "
"function."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດຟັງຊັນ ``_process`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຕິດຕາມວ່າເວລາຜ່ານໄປເທົ່າໃດ ແລະ ຄິດໄລ່ຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ສ"
"ຳລັບສະໄປຣຕ໌ (sprite) ຂອງພວກເຮົາໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ sine ແລະ cosine."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:218
msgid ""
"There is one more C++ file we need; we'll name it ``register_types.cpp``. "
"Our GDExtension plugin can contain multiple classes, each with their own "
"header and source file like we've implemented ``GDExample`` up above. What "
"we need now is a small bit of code that tells Godot about all the classes in "
"our GDExtension plugin."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີໄຟລ໌ C++ ອີກໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການ; ພວກເຮົາຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ມັນວ່າ ``register_types.cpp``. ປລັ"
"ກອິນ GDExtension ຂອງພວກເຮົາສາມາດປະກອບມີຫຼາຍຄລາສ, ແຕ່ລະຄລາສກໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຊອດ "
"(source file) ຂອງຕົນເອງ ຄືກັນກັບທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຂຽນ ``GDExample`` ໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ. ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງ"
"ການດຽວນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄ້ດເລັກນ້ອຍເພື່ອບອກ Godot ກ່ຽວກັບຄລາສທັງໝົດໃນປລັກອິນ GDExtension ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:224
msgid "gdextension_cpp_example/src/register_types.cpp"
msgstr "gdextension_cpp_example/src/register_types.cpp"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:264
msgid ""
"The ``initialize_example_module`` and ``uninitialize_example_module`` "
"functions get called respectively when Godot loads our plugin and when it "
"unloads it. All we're doing here is parse through the functions in our "
"bindings module to initialize them, but you might have to set up more things "
"depending on your needs. We call the ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` macro for each of "
"our classes in our library."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``initialize_example_module`` ແລະ ``uninitialize_example_module`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້"
"ນໃຊ້ຕາມລຳດັບ ເມື່ອ Godot ໂຫຼດປລັກອິນຂອງພວກເຮົາ ແລະ ເມື່ອມັນຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງອອກ. ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຮັດຢູ່ນີ້"
"ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການກວດສອບຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆໃນໂມດູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງພວກມັນ, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້"
"ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງອື່ນໆເພີ່ມເຕີມຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກເຮົາເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ມາໂຄຣ "
"``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄລາສໃນໄລບຣາຣີຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:272
msgid ""
"You can find information about ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` (and alternatives) "
"at :ref:`doc_object_class`."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` (ແລະ ທາງເລືອກອື່ນໆ) ໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_object_class`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:274
msgid ""
"The important function is the third function called "
"``example_library_init``. We first call a function in our bindings library "
"that creates an initialization object. This object registers the "
"initialization and termination functions of the GDExtension. Furthermore, it "
"sets the level of initialization (core, servers, scene, editor, level)."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນທີ່ສຳຄັນແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີສາມທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``example_library_init``. ທຳອິດພວກເຮົາເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນໃນ "
"bindings library ຂອງພວກເຮົາເພື່ອສ້າງວັດຖຸການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (initialization object). ວັດຖຸນີ້ນໍາໃຊ້"
"ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຟັງຊັນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ GDExtension. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຍັງກຳນົດລ"
"ະດັບຂອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (core, servers, scene, editor, level)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:279
msgid ""
"At last, we need the header file for the ``register_types.cpp`` named "
"``register_types.h``."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີສຳລັບ ``register_types.cpp`` ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"``register_types.h``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:282
msgid "gdextension_cpp_example/src/register_types.h"
msgstr "gdextension_cpp_example/src/register_types.h"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:295
msgid "Compiling the plugin"
msgstr "ການຄອມພາຍ (Compile) ປລັກອິນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:297
msgid ""
"To compile the project we need to define how SCons using should compile it "
"using an ``SConstruct`` file which references the one in ``godot-cpp``. "
"Writing it from scratch is outside the scope of this tutorial, but you "
"can :download:`the SConstruct file we prepared <files/cpp_example/"
"SConstruct>`. We'll cover a more customizable, detailed example on how to "
"use these build files in a subsequent tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍໂປຣເຈັກ ພວກເຮົາຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດວ່າ SCons ຄວນຄອມພາຍມັນແນວໃດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ "
"``SConstruct`` ເຊິ່ງອ້າງອີງເຖິງໄຟລ໌ໃນ ``godot-cpp``. ການຂຽນມັນຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ"
"ຂອງບົດຮຽນນີ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດ :download:`ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ SConstruct ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຽມໄວ້ໃຫ້ <files/"
"cpp_example/SConstruct>`. ພວກເຮົາຈະອະທິບາຍຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ"
"ກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ build files ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນບົດຮຽນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:306
msgid ""
"This ``SConstruct`` file was written to be used with the latest ``godot-"
"cpp`` master, you may need to make small changes using it with older "
"versions or refer to the ``SConstruct`` file in the Godot 4.x documentation."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ ``SConstruct`` ນີ້ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ ``godot-cpp`` ເວີຊັນ master ຫຼ້າສຸດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອ"
"ງເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງເລັກນ້ອຍຫາກໃຊ້ກັບເວີຊັນເກົ່າ ຫຼື ອ້າງອີງໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ``SConstruct`` ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ "
"Godot 4.x."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:310
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded the ``SConstruct`` file, place it in your GDExtension "
"folder structure alongside ``godot-cpp``, ``src``, and ``project``, then run:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ ``SConstruct`` ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ວາງມັນໄວ້ໃນໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີ GDExtension ຂອງທ່ານ"
"ຄຽງຄູ່ກັບ ``godot-cpp``, ``src``, ແລະ ``project``, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ລັນ (run):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:317
msgid ""
"You can omit the ``platform`` option if you are compiling for the platform "
"you are currently using. The list of available ``platform`` options depends "
"on which platform dependencies are set up (use ``platform=list`` to see all "
"available platforms). See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມຕົວເລືອກ ``platform`` ໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຄອມພາຍສຳລັບແພລດຟອມທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່. ລາຍຊື່"
"ຂອງຕົວເລືອກ ``platform`` ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ platform dependencies ໃດໄວ້ແດ່ (ໃຊ້ "
"``platform=list`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງແພລດຟອມທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ). ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:322
msgid ""
"You should now be able to find the compiled library in ``project/bin/``."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານຄວນຈະສາມາດຊອກຫາໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຄອມພາຍແລ້ວໃນ ``project/bin/``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:326
msgid ""
"Here, we've compiled both godot-cpp and our gdexample library as debug "
"builds, which is the default. For optimized builds, you should compile them "
"using the ``target=template_release`` option."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຄອມພາຍທັງ godot-cpp ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີ gdexample ຂອງພວກເຮົາເປັນແບບ debug "
"build, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບ build ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ (optimized), ທ່ານຄວນຄອມ"
"ພາຍພວກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``target=template_release``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:331
msgid "Using the GDExtension module"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໂມດູນ GDExtension"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:333
msgid ""
"Before we jump back into Godot, we need to create one more file in ``project/"
"bin/``."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະກັບໄປຫາ Godot, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມອີກໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ໃນ ``project/bin/``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:336
msgid ""
"This file lets Godot know what dynamic libraries should be loaded for each "
"platform and the entry function for the module. It is called "
"``gdexample.gdextension``."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Godot ຮູ້ວ່າຄວນໂຫຼດ dynamic libraries ໃດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລດຟອມ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ (entry function) ສຳລັບໂມດູນແມ່ນຫຍັງ. ມັນຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ``gdexample.gdextension``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:362
msgid ""
"This file contains a ``configuration`` section that controls the entry "
"function of the module. You should also set the minimum compatible Godot "
"version with ``compatibility_minimum``, which prevents older version of "
"Godot from trying to load your extension. The ``reloadable`` flag enables "
"automatic reloading of your extension by the editor every time you recompile "
"it, without needing to restart the editor. This only works if you compile "
"your extension in debug mode (default)."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ປະກອບມີສ່ວນ ``configuration`` ທີ່ຄວບຄຸມຟັງຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນ. ທ່ານຄວນກຳນົດເວີຊັນ Godot "
"ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ ``compatibility_minimum``, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Godot ເວີຊັນເກົ່າພະຍາຍາມ"
"ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ແຟລັກ (flag) ``reloadable`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ສາມາດໂຫຼດສ່"
"ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງທ່ານຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານຄອມພາຍມັນໃໝ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່. ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານຄອມພາຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງທ່ານໃນໂໝດ debug (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:368
msgid ""
"The ``libraries`` section is the important bit: it tells Godot the location "
"of the dynamic library in the project's filesystem for each supported "
"platform. It will also result in *just* that file being exported when you "
"export the project, which means the data pack won't contain libraries that "
"are incompatible with the target platform."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນ ``libraries`` ແມ່ນສ່ວນທີ່ສຳຄັນ: ມັນບອກ Godot ເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ dynamic library ໃນລະບົບ"
"ໄຟລ໌ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ມັນຍັງຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີ *ພຽງແຕ່* ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຖືກສົ່ງອອກ "
"(exported) ເມື່ອທ່ານສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແພັກເກັດຂໍ້ມູນ (data pack) ຈະບໍ່ມີໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ບໍ່ເ"
"ຂົ້າກັນກັບແພລດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:374
msgid ""
"You can learn more about ``.gdextension`` files "
"at :ref:`doc_gdextension_file`."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ ``.gdextension`` ໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`doc_gdextension_file`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:376
msgid "Here is another overview to check the correct file structure:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືພາບລວມອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອສັງເກດໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:399
msgid ""
"Time to jump back into Godot. We load up the main scene we created way back "
"in the beginning and now add a newly available GDExample node to the scene:"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງເວລາທີ່ຈະກັບໄປຫາ Godot ແລ້ວ. ພວກເຮົາໂຫຼດສາກຫຼັກ (main scene) ທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ສ້າງໄວ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕອນນີ້ກໍ່ເພີ່ມໂນດ GDExample ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນສາກ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:404
msgid ""
"We're going to assign the Godot logo to this node as our texture, disable "
"the ``centered`` property:"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງຈະກຳນົດໂລໂກ້ Godot ໃຫ້ກັບໂນດນີ້ເປັນ texture ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ແລະ ປິດ (disable) ຄຸນ"
"ສົມບັດ ``centered``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:409
msgid "We're finally ready to run the project:"
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ສຸດພວກເຮົາກໍ່ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະລັນໂປຣເຈັກແລ້ວ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:419
msgid "Adding properties"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດ (Properties)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:421
msgid ""
"GDScript allows you to add properties to your script using the ``export`` "
"keyword. In GDExtension you have to register the properties with a getter "
"and setter function or directly implement the ``_get_property_list``, "
"``_get`` and ``_set`` methods of an object (but that goes far beyond the "
"scope of this tutorial)."
msgstr ""
"GDScript ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃຫ້ກັບສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ ``export``. ໃນ "
"GDExtension ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນຄຸນສົມບັດດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນ getter ແລະ setter ຫຼື ຂຽນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເມັດ"
"ທອດ ``_get_property_list``, ``_get`` ແລະ ``_set`` ຂອງວັດຖຸໂດຍກົງ (ແຕ່ນັ້ນເກີນຂອບເຂດຂ"
"ອງບົດຮຽນນີ້)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:427
msgid ""
"Lets add a property that allows us to control the amplitude of our wave."
msgstr ""
"ລອງມາເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຄວບຄຸມຄວາມກວ້າງ (amplitude) ຂອງຄື້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:429
msgid ""
"In our ``gdexample.h`` file we need to add a member variable and getter and "
"setter functions:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``gdexample.h`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນ "
"getter ແລະ setter:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:444
msgid ""
"In our ``gdexample.cpp`` file we need to make a number of changes, we will "
"only show the methods we end up changing, don't remove the lines we're "
"omitting:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``gdexample.cpp`` ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສະແດງສະເພາະ"
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ເຮົາປ່ຽນແປງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຫ້າມລຶບແຖວທີ່ພວກເຮົາລະໄວ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:481
msgid ""
"Once you compile the module with these changes in place, you will see that a "
"property has been added to our interface. You can now change this property "
"and when you run your project, you will see that our Godot icon travels "
"along a larger figure."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຄອມພາຍໂມດູນດ້ວຍການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມີຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອິນເຕີເຟດ "
"(interface) ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ເມື່ອທ່ານລັນໂປຣເຈັກ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່"
"າໄອຄອນ Godot ຂອງພວກເຮົາເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:486
msgid ""
"Let's do the same but for the speed of our animation and use a setter and "
"getter function. Our ``gdexample.h`` header file again only needs a few more "
"lines of code:"
msgstr ""
"ລອງເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນແຕ່ສຳລັບຄວາມໄວຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ (animation speed) ແລະ ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ setter ແລະ "
"getter. ໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີ ``gdexample.h`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໂຄ້ດເພີ່ມອີກພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດແຖວ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:501
msgid ""
"This requires a few more changes to our ``gdexample.cpp`` file, again we're "
"only showing the methods that have changed so don't remove anything we're "
"omitting:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການການປ່ຽນແປງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນໄຟລ໌ ``gdexample.cpp`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ອີກຄັ້ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະສະແດງ"
"ສະເພາະເມັດທອດທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງເທົ່ານັ້ນ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຫ້າມລຶບສິ່ງໃດທີ່ພວກເຮົາລະໄວ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:541
msgid ""
"Now when the project is compiled, we'll see another property called speed. "
"Changing its value will make the animation go faster or slower. Furthermore, "
"we added a property range which describes in which range the value can be. "
"The first two arguments are the minimum and maximum value and the third is "
"the step size."
msgstr ""
"ດຽວນີ້ເມື່ອໂປຣເຈັກຖືກຄອມພາຍ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນຄຸນສົມບັດອີກອັນໜຶ່ງທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ speed. ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະເຮັດໃ"
"ຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນໄວຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຊ້າລົງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ວງຄຸນສົມບັດ (property range) ເຊິ່ງອະທິບາ"
"ຍວ່າຄ່າສາມາດຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງໃດໄດ້ແດ່. ສອງອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (arguments) ທຳອິດແມ່ນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ ແລະ ອັນທີ"
"ສາມແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງການເພີ່ມ (step size)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:548
msgid ""
"For simplicity, we've only used the hint_range of the property method. There "
"are a lot more options to choose from. These can be used to further "
"configure how properties are displayed and set on the Godot side. You can "
"find more information on property hints "
"here :ref:`@GlobalScope<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄວາມງ່າຍດາຍ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ hint_range ຂອງເມັດທອດ property. ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆອີກຫຼ"
"າຍຢ່າງໃຫ້ເລືອກ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການສະແດງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດໃນຝັ່ງຂອ"
"ງ Godot. ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ property hints ໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ "
":ref:`@GlobalScope<enum_@GlobalScope_PropertyHint>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:556
msgid ""
"Last but not least, signals fully work in GDExtension as well. Having your "
"extension react to a signal given out by another object requires you to call "
"``connect`` on that object. We can't think of a good example for our "
"wobbling Godot icon, we would need to showcase a far more complete example."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍແຕ່ບໍ່ທ້າຍສຸດ, ສັນຍານ (signals) ກໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບໃນ GDExtension ເຊັ່ນກັ"
"ນ. ການທີ່ໃຫ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງທ່ານຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ສັນຍານທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກວັດຖຸອື່ນນັ້ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"``connect`` ໃນວັດຖຸນັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດຄິດຫາຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ດີສຳລັບໄອຄອນ Godot ທີ່ສັ່ນໄປມາຂອງພວກເຮົາໄ"
"ດ້, ພວກເຮົາຄົງຈະຕ້ອງນຳສະເໜີຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສົມບູນກວ່ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:561
msgid "This is the required syntax:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືໄວຍາກອນ (syntax) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:567
msgid ""
"To connect our signal ``the_signal`` from some other node with our method "
"``my_method``, we need to provide the ``connect`` method with the name of "
"the signal and a ``Callable``. The ``Callable`` holds information about an "
"object on which a method can be called. In our case, it associates our "
"current object instance ``this`` with the method ``my_method`` of the "
"object. Then the ``connect`` method will add this to the observers of "
"``the_signal``. Whenever ``the_signal`` is now emitted, Godot knows which "
"method of which object it needs to call."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ``the_signal`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາຈາກໂນດອື່ນໆ ດ້ວຍເມັດທອດ ``my_method`` ຂອງພວ"
"ກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ເມັດທອດ ``connect`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ຂອງສັນຍານ ແລະ ``Callable``. ຕົວ "
"``Callable`` ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ມັນຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍ"
"ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງວັດຖຸປະຈຸບັນ ``this`` ກັບເມັດທອດ ``my_method`` ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ຈາກນັ້"
"ນເມັດທອດ ``connect`` ຈະເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນຜູ້ສັງເກດການ (observers) ຂອງ ``the_signal``. ທຸກ"
"ຄັ້ງທີ່ ``the_signal`` ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ (emitted), Godot ຈະຮູ້ວ່າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດໃດຂອງວັດຖຸໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:575
msgid ""
"Note that you can only call ``my_method`` if you've previously registered it "
"in your ``_bind_methods`` method. Otherwise Godot will not know about the "
"existence of ``my_method``."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``my_method`` ໄດ້ກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນມັນໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນເມັດທອດ "
"``_bind_methods`` ຂອງທ່ານ. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈະບໍ່ຮູ້ເຖິງການມີຢູ່ຂອງ ``my_method``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:579
msgid ""
"To learn more about ``Callable``, check out the class reference "
"here: :ref:`Callable <class_Callable>`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ ``Callable``, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງການອ້າງອີງຄລາສໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້: :ref:`Callable "
"<class_Callable>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:581
msgid ""
"Having your object sending out signals is more common. For our wobbling "
"Godot icon, we'll do something silly just to show how it works. We're going "
"to emit a signal every time a second has passed and pass the new location "
"along."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຂອງທ່ານສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາແມ່ນເປັນເລື່ອງທີ່ພົບເຫັນໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປກວ່າ. ສຳລັບໄອຄອນ Godot ທີ່ສັ່ນໄປມາຂ"
"ອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຮັດບາງຢ່າງງ່າຍໆພຽງເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ. ພວກເຮົາຈະສົ່ງສັນຍ"
"ານອອກມາທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ເວລາຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງວິນາທີ ແລະ ສົ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ໄປພ້ອມກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:585
msgid ""
"In our ``gdexample.h`` header file, we need to define a new member "
"``time_emit``:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ເຮດເດີ ``gdexample.h`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດສະມາຊິກໃໝ່ "
"``time_emit``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:595
msgid ""
"This time, the changes in ``gdexample.cpp`` are more elaborate. First, "
"you'll need to set ``time_emit = 0.0;`` in either our ``_init`` method or in "
"our constructor. We'll look at the other 2 needed changes one by one."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄັ້ງນີ້, ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ ``gdexample.cpp`` ຈະມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ທຳອິດ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດ "
"``time_emit = 0.0;`` ໃນເມັດທອດ ``_init`` ຫຼື ໃນ constructor ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ພວກເຮົາຈະມ"
"າເບິ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງອີກ 2 ຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເທື່ອລະອັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:599
msgid ""
"In our ``_bind_methods`` method, we need to declare our signal. This is done "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນເມັດທອດ ``_bind_methods`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປະກາດສັນຍານຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ເຊິ່ງເ"
"ຮັດໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:611
msgid ""
"Here, our ``ADD_SIGNAL`` macro can be a single call with a ``MethodInfo`` "
"argument. ``MethodInfo``'s first parameter will be the signal's name, and "
"its remaining parameters are ``PropertyInfo`` types which describe the "
"essentials of each of the method's parameters. ``PropertyInfo`` parameters "
"are defined with the data type of the parameter, and then the name that the "
"parameter will have by default."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ນີ້, ມາໂຄຣ ``ADD_SIGNAL`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາສາມາດເປັນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວດ້ວຍອາຄິວເມັ້ນ "
"``MethodInfo``. ພາຣາມີເຕີທຳອິດຂອງ ``MethodInfo`` ຈະເປັນຊື່ຂອງສັນຍານ, ແລະ ພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ເຫຼືອ"
"ແມ່ນປະເພດ ``PropertyInfo`` ເຊິ່ງອະທິບາຍສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຂອງແຕ່ລະພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງເມັດທອດ. ພາຣາມີເຕີ "
"``PropertyInfo`` ຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີ, ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ພາຣາມີເຕີນັ້ນຈະມີໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່"
"ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:617
msgid ""
"So here, we add a signal, with a ``MethodInfo`` which names the signal "
"\"position_changed\". The ``PropertyInfo`` parameters describe two essential "
"arguments, one of type ``Object``, the other of type ``Vector2``, "
"respectively named \"node\" and \"new_pos\"."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຢູ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາເພີ່ມສັນຍານ, ດ້ວຍ ``MethodInfo`` ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຊື່ສັນຍານວ່າ "
"\"position_changed\". ພາຣາມີເຕີ ``PropertyInfo`` ອະທິບາຍອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ສຳຄັນສອງຢ່າງ, ອັນໜຶ່ງ"
"ແມ່ນປະເພດ ``Object``, ອີກອັນແມ່ນປະເພດ ``Vector2``, ເຊິ່ງມີຊື່ຕາມລຳດັບວ່າ \"node\" ແລະ "
"\"new_pos\"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:621
msgid "Next, we'll need to change our ``_process`` method:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນເມັດທອດ ``_process`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:643
msgid ""
"After a second has passed, we emit our signal and reset our counter. We can "
"add our parameter values directly to ``emit_signal``."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງວິນາທີ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວນັບຄືນໃໝ່. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເພີ່ມຄ່າ"
"ພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງພວກເຮົາເຂົ້າໃນ ``emit_signal`` ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:646
msgid ""
"Once the GDExtension library is compiled, we can go into Godot and select "
"our sprite node. In the **Node** dock, we can find our new signal and link "
"it up by pressing the **Connect** button or double-clicking the signal. "
"We've added a script on our main node and implemented our signal like this:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄລບຣາຣີ GDExtension ຖືກຄອມພາຍແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຂົ້າໄປໃນ Godot ແລະ ເລືອກໂນດສະໄປຣຕ໌"
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ໃນແຖບ **Node**, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຊອກຫາສັນຍານໃໝ່ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນໂດຍການ"
"ກົດປຸ່ມ **Connect** ຫຼື ຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງທີ່ສັນຍານ. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບໃສ່ໂນດຫຼັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ ແລະ ຂຽນກາ"
"ນເຮັດວຽກຂອງສັນຍານດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:658
msgid "Every second, we output our position to the console."
msgstr "ທຸກໆວິນາທີ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພວກເຮົາອອກທາງຄອນໂຊນ (console)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:663
msgid ""
"We hope the above example showed you the basics. You can build upon this "
"example to create full-fledged scripts to control nodes in Godot using C++!"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຫວັງວ່າຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນເຖິງພື້ນຖານຕ່າງໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດນໍາໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສະ"
"ຄຣິບທີ່ສົມບູນແບບເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມໂນດໃນ Godot ໂດຍໃຊ້ C++!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:666
msgid ""
"Instead of basing your project off the above example setup, we recommend to "
"restart now by cloning the `godot-cpp template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__, and base your project off of that. It "
"has better coverage of features, such as a GitHub build action and "
"additional useful ``SConstruct`` boilerplate."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຈາກຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍການໂຄລນ "
"(clone) `godot-cpp template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-"
"template>`__, ແລະ ພັດທະນາໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຈາກສິ່ງນັ້ນ. ມັນມີການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ເຊັ່ນ "
"GitHub build action ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງມາດຕະຖານ (boilerplate) ຂອງ ``SConstruct`` ທີ່ເປັນປ"
"ະໂຫຍດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

