"ໄດ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/scons.rst:51
msgid "Loading your GDExtension in Godot"
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດ GDExtension ຂອງທ່ານໃນ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/scons.rst:53
msgid ""
"Godot loads GDExtensions by finding :ref:`.gdextension "
"<doc_gdextension_file>` files in the project directory. ``.gdextension`` "
"files are used to select and load a binary compatible with the current "
"computer / operating system."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໂຫຼດ GDExtensions ໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ :ref:`.gdextension "
"<doc_gdextension_file>` ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ໄຟລ໌ ``.gdextension`` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກ "
"ແລະ ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ (binary) ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຄອມພິວເຕີ / ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/scons.rst:56
msgid ""
"The `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-"
"template>`__, as well as the :ref:`Getting Started section "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`, provide example ``.gdextension`` files for "
"GDExtensions that are widely compatible to many different systems."
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__, ລ"
"ວມທັງ :ref:`ສ່ວນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ <doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`, ໄດ້ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ "
"``.gdextension`` ສຳລັບ GDExtensions ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງກັບຫຼາຍລະບົບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/scons.rst:61
msgid "Building for multiple platforms"
msgstr "ການ Build ສຳລັບຫຼາຍແພລດຟອມ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/scons.rst:63
msgid ""
"GDExtensions are expected to run on many different systems, each with "
"separate binaries and build configurations. If you are planning to publish "
"your GDExtension, we recommend you provide binaries for all configurations "
"that are mentioned in the `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ `.gdextension file <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template/blob/main/demo/bin/example.gdextension>`__."
msgstr ""
"GDExtensions ຖືກຄາດຫວັງໃຫ້ລັນໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍລະບົບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະລະບົບກໍ່ມີໄບນາຣີ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າ build ທີ່ແຍກກັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະເຜີຍແຜ່ GDExtension ຂອງທ່ານ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານກ"
"ຽມໄບນາຣີສຳລັບທຸກໆການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ `godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template>`__ `ໄຟລ໌ .gdextension <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-cpp-template/blob/main/demo/bin/example.gdextension>`__."

