#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:4
msgid "Secondary build system: Working with CMake"
msgstr "ລະບົບ build ສຳຮອງ: ການເຮັດວຽກກັບ CMake"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:11
msgid ""
"Beside the SCons_ based build system, godot-cpp also provides a "
"CMakeLists.txt_ file to support users that prefer using CMake_ over SCons "
"for their build system."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກລະບົບ build ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SCons_, godot-cpp ຍັງໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ CMakeLists.txt_ ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່"
"ມັກໃຊ້ CMake_ ຫຼາຍກວ່າ SCons ສຳລັບລະບົບ build ຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:15
msgid ""
"While actively supported, the CMake system is considered secondary to the "
"SCons build system. This means it may lack some features that are available "
"to projects using SCons."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຢ່າງຈິງຈັງ, ແຕ່ລະບົບ CMake ຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນລະບົບສຳຮອງຕໍ່ຈາກລະບົບ build ຂ"
"ອງ SCons. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນອາດຈະຂາດບາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ SCons."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:26
msgid ""
"Compiling godot-cpp independently of an extension project is mainly for "
"godot-cpp developers, package maintainers, and CI/CD."
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມພາຍ godot-cpp ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ ແມ່ນສຳລັບນັກພັດທະນາ godot-cpp, ຜູ້ເ"
"ບິ່ງແຍງແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ CI/CD ເປັນຫຼັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:29
msgid ""
"Examples of how to use CMake to consume the godot-cpp library as part of an "
"extension project:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ CMake ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານໄລບຣາຣີ godot-cpp ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:32
msgid ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`godot-cpp-template <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp-template/>`__"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:33
msgid "`godot_roguelite <https://github.com/vorlac/godot-roguelite/>`__"
msgstr "`godot_roguelite <https://github.com/vorlac/godot-roguelite/>`__"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:34
msgid ""
"`godot-orchestrator <https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`godot-orchestrator <https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator/>`__"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:36
msgid ""
"Examples for configuring godot-cpp are listed at the bottom of the page, "
"many of which may help with configuring your project."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ godot-cpp ແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ອຍູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າ, ເຊິ່ງຫຼາຍອັນອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣ"
"ເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:40
msgid "CMake's ``Debug`` vs Godot's ``template_debug``"
msgstr "``Debug`` ຂອງ CMake ທຽບກັບ ``template_debug`` ຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:42
msgid ""
"Something that has come up during many discussions is the conflation of a "
"compilation of C++ source code with debug symbols enabled, and compiling a "
"Godot extension with debug features enabled. The two concepts are not "
"mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ມັກຖືກນຳມາສົນທະນາເລື້ອຍໆແມ່ນຄວາມສັບສົນລະຫວ່າງການຄອມພາຍຊອດໂຄ້ດ C++ ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ debug "
"symbols, ກັບການຄອມພາຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງ Godot ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ debug features. ທັງສອງແນວຄວາມ"
"ຄິດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:48
msgid "Debug Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ Debug (Debug Features)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:50
msgid ""
"Enables a pre-processor definition to selectively compile code to help users "
"of a Godot extension with their own project."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກຳນົດຄ່າ pre-processor ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍໂຄ້ດສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອ"
"ງ Godot ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງພວກເຂົາເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:53
msgid ""
"Debug features are enabled in ``editor`` and ``template_debug`` builds, "
"which can be specified during the configure phase like so:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ Debug ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ build ແບບ ``editor`` ແລະ ``template_debug``, ເຊິ່ງສາມາ"
"ດລະບຸໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configure) ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sets compiler flags so that debug symbols are generated to help godot "
"extension developers debug their extension."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ compiler flags ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງ debug symbols ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍນັກພັດທະນາສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງ "
"Godot ໃນການ debug ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:66
msgid ""
"``Debug`` is the default build type for CMake projects, the way to select "
"another depends on the generator used:"
msgstr ""
"``Debug`` ແມ່ນປະເພດ build ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກ CMake, ວິທີການເລືອກແບບອື່ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ "
"generator ທີ່ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:69
msgid ""
"For single configuration generators, add ``-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=<type>`` to "
"the configure command."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ generator ແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=<type>`` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ "
"configure."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:71
msgid ""
"For multi-config generators, add ``--config <type>`` to the build command."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ generator ແບບຫຼາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``--config <type>`` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ build."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:73
msgid ""
"Where ``<type>`` is one of ``Debug``, ``Release``, ``RelWithDebInfo``, and "
"``MinSizeRel``."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທີ່ ``<type>`` ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນ ``Debug``, ``Release``, ``RelWithDebInfo``, ແລະ "
"``MinSizeRel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:77
msgid "SCons Deviations"
msgstr "ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ SCons"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:79
msgid ""
"Not all code from the SCons system can be perfectly represented in CMake, "
"here are the notable differences:"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆໂຄ້ດຈາກລະບົບ SCons ຈະສາມາດຖືກສະແດງອອກມາໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນແບບໃນ CMake, ນີ້ຄືຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ"
"ທີ່ໜ້າສັງເກດ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:82
msgid "``debug_symbols``"
msgstr "``debug_symbols``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:84
msgid ""
"Is no longer an explicit option, and is enabled when using CMake build "
"configurations; ``Debug``, ``RelWithDebInfo``."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຊັດເຈນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ build ຂອງ CMake ເຊັ່ນ: "
"``Debug``, ``RelWithDebInfo``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:87
msgid "``dev_build``"
msgstr "``dev_build``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:89
msgid ""
"Does not define ``NDEBUG`` when disabled, ``NDEBUG`` is set when using CMake "
"build configurations; ``Release``, ``MinSizeRel``."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ ``NDEBUG`` ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ``NDEBUG`` ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ build ຂອງ "
"CMake ເຊັ່ນ: ``Release``, ``MinSizeRel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:92
msgid "``arch``"
msgstr "``arch``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:94
msgid ""
"CMake sets the architecture via the toolchain files, macOS universal is "
"controlled via the ``CMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES`` property which is copied to "
"targets when they are defined."
msgstr ""
"CMake ກຳນົດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ toolchain, macOS universal ແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມຜ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"``CMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES`` ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຄັດລອກໄປຍັງ targets ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:98
msgid "``debug_crt``"
msgstr "``debug_crt``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:100
msgid ""
"CMake controls linking to Windows runtime libraries by copying the value of "
"``CMAKE_MSVC_RUNTIME_LIBRARIES`` to targets as they are defined. godot-cpp "
"will set this variable if it isn't already set. So, include it before other "
"dependencies to have the value propagate across the projects."
msgstr ""
"CMake ຄວບຄຸມການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ Windows runtime libraries ໂດຍການຄັດລອກຄ່າຂອງ "
"``CMAKE_MSVC_RUNTIME_LIBRARIES`` ໄປຍັງ targets ຕາມທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດ. godot-cpp ຈະຕັ້ງ"
"ຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນນີ້ຖ້າມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລວມມັນໄວ້ກ່ອນ dependencies ອື່ນໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄ່ານັ້ນແຜ່ກະຈາ"
"ຍໄປທົ່ວໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:106
msgid "Basic Walk-Through"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກພື້ນຖານ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:109
msgid "Clone the git repository"
msgstr "Clone git repository"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:118
msgid "Configure the build"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການ Build (Configure)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:124
msgid "``-S`` Specifies the source directory as ``godot-cpp``"
msgstr "``-S`` ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊອດໂຄ້ດເປັນ ``godot-cpp``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:125
msgid "``-B`` Specifies the build directory as ``cmake-build``"
msgstr "``-B`` ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຳລັບ build ເປັນ ``cmake-build``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:126
msgid "``-G`` Specifies the Generator as ``Ninja``"
msgstr "``-G`` ລະບຸ Generator ເປັນ ``Ninja``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:128
msgid ""
"The source directory in this example is the source root for the freshly "
"cloned godot-cpp. CMake will also interpret the first path in the command as "
"the source path, or if an existing build path is specified it will deduce "
"the source path from the build cache."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊອດໂຄ້ດໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນ root ຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດສຳລັບ godot-cpp ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ໂຄລນມາໃໝ່. CMake ຈະຕີ"
"ຄວາມໝາຍເສັ້ນທາງທຳອິດໃນຄຳສັ່ງເປັນເສັ້ນທາງຊອດໂຄ້ດ, ຫຼື ຖ້າເສັ້ນທາງ build ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຖືກລະບຸ ມັນຈະຄາດຄ"
"ະເນເສັ້ນທາງຊອດໂຄ້ດຈາກ build cache."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:133
msgid "The following three commands are equivalent:"
msgstr "ສາມຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີຜົນຄືກັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:146
msgid ""
"The build directory is specified so that generated files do not clutter the "
"source tree with build artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ build ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄງສ້າງຊອດໂຄ້ດສັບສົນດ້ວຍ build "
"artifacts."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:149
msgid ""
"CMake doesn't build the code, it generates the files that a build tool uses, "
"in this case the ``Ninja`` generator creates Ninja_ build files."
msgstr ""
"CMake ບໍ່ໄດ້ build ໂຄ້ດໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ມັນສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄື່ອງມື build ໃຊ້ງານ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ``Ninja`` "
"generator ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ build ຂອງ Ninja_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:152
msgid "To see the list of generators run ``cmake --help``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ generators ໃຫ້ລັນ ``cmake --help``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:157
msgid "Build Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການ Build"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:159
msgid ""
"To list the available options use the ``-L[AH]`` command flags. ``A`` is for "
"advanced, and ``H`` is for help strings:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຟລັກຄຳສັ່ງ ``-L[AH]``. ``A`` ແມ່ນສຳລັບຂັ້ນສູງ, ແລະ ``H`` ແມ່"
"ນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:166
msgid ""
"Options are specified on the command line when configuring, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກລະບຸໃນບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ເມື່ອທຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:174
msgid ""
"See setting-build-variables_ and build-configurations_ for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ setting-build-variables_ ແລະ build-configurations_ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:180
msgid "A non-exhaustive list of options:"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກບາງສ່ວນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:205
msgid ""
"Tell CMake to invoke the build system it generated in the specified "
"directory. The default target is ``template_debug`` and the default build "
"configuration is Debug."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ CMake ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ລະບົບ build ທີ່ມັນສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ລະບຸ. target ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ "
"``template_debug`` ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ build ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Debug."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:216
msgid ""
"These examples, while intended for godot-cpp developers, package "
"maintainers, and CI/CD may help you configure your own extension project."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີຈຸດປະສົງສຳລັບນັກພັດທະນາ godot-cpp, ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ CI/CD "
"ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍ່ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:219
msgid ""
"Practical examples for how to consume the godot-cpp library as part of an "
"extension project are listed in the `Introduction`_."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຈິງສຳລັບວິທີການໃຊ້ງານໄລບຣາຣີ godot-cpp ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ ແມ່ນມີ"
"ລາຍຊື່ຢູູ່ໃນ `Introduction`_."

