"ສັ່ງຈະເບິ່ງຄືປະມານນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:237
msgid "Windows and MSVC - Release"
msgstr "Windows ແລະ MSVC - Release"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:239
msgid ""
"So long as CMake is installed from the `CMake Downloads`_ page and in the "
"PATH, and Microsoft Visual Studio is installed with C++ support, CMake will "
"detect the MSVC compiler."
msgstr ""
"ຕາບໃດທີ່ CMake ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກໜ້າ `CMake Downloads`_ ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນ PATH, ແລະ Microsoft "
"Visual Studio ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັບການຮອງຮັບ C++, CMake ຈະກວດພົບ compiler ຂອງ MSVC ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:243
msgid ""
"Note that Visual Studio is a Multi-Config Generator so the build "
"configuration needs to be specified at build time, for example, ``--config "
"Release``."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດວ່າ Visual Studio ແມ່ນ Multi-Config Generator ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ build ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການ"
"ລະບຸໃນເວລາ build, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``--config Release``."

