msgstr "Clone ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື Emscripten ຫຼ້າສຸດໄປຍັງ ``c:\\emsdk``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:291
msgid ""
"Use ``C:\\emsdk\\emsdk.ps1 activate latest`` to enable the environment from "
"powershell in the current shell."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ ``C:\\emsdk\\emsdk.ps1 activate latest`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ environment ຈາກ "
"powershell ໃນ shell ປະຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:293
msgid ""
"The ``emcmake.bat`` utility adds the emscripten toolchain to the CMake "
"command. It can also be added manually; the location is listed inside the "
"``emcmake.bat`` file"
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມື ``emcmake.bat`` ຈະເພີ່ມ emscripten toolchain ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ CMake. ມັນຍັງສາມາດເພີ່"
"ມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້; ຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ນຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``emcmake.bat``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:304
msgid "Android Cross Compile from Windows"
msgstr "Android Cross Compile ຈາກ Windows"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:306
msgid ""
"There are two separate paths you can choose when configuring for android."
msgstr "ມີສອງເສັ້ນທາງແຍກກັນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ android."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:308
msgid ""
"Use the ``CMAKE_ANDROID_*`` variables specified on the command line or in "
"your own toolchain file as listed in the cmake-toolchains_ documentation."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ ``CMAKE_ANDROID_*`` ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ command line ຫຼື ໃນໄຟລ໌ toolchain ຂອງທ່ານເອ"
"ງ ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ cmake-toolchains_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/build_system/cmake.rst:313
msgid ""
"Or use the toolchain and scripts provided by the Android SDK and make "
"changes using the ``ANDROID_*`` variables listed there. Where ``<version>`` "
"is whatever NDK version you have installed (tested with `28.1.13356709`) and "
"``<platform>`` is for the Android sdk platform, (tested with ``android-29``)."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ໃຊ້ toolchain ແລະ ສະຄຣິບທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ Android SDK ແລະ ທຳການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ "
"``ANDROID_*`` ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ນັ້ນ. ໂດຍທີ່ ``<version>`` ແມ່ນເວີຊັນ NDK ໃດກໍ່ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ (ທົດສ"
"ອບກັບ `28.1.13356709`) ແລະ ``<platform>`` ແມ່ນສຳລັບ Android sdk platform, (ທົດສອບ"
"ກັບ ``android-29``)."

