msgstr "ປະເພດພື້ນຖານ (base type) ທີ່ສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ສືບທອດມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:213
msgid "``_TS_``"
msgstr "``_TS_``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:213
msgid ""
"Indentation placeholder. The exact type and number of whitespace characters "
"used for indentation is determined by the ``text_editor/indent/type`` and "
"``text_editor/indent/size`` settings in the :ref:`EditorSettings "
"<class_EditorSettings>` respectively. Can be overridden by the ``meta-space-"
"indent`` header on the template."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສຳຮອງສຳລັບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ. ປະເພດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຂອງຕົວອັກສອນຍະຫວ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍກາ"
"ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``text_editor/indent/type`` ແລະ ``text_editor/indent/size`` ໃນ "
":ref:`EditorSettings <class_EditorSettings>` ຕາມລຳດັບ. ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ header "
"``meta-space-indent`` ໃນແມ່ແບບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:223
msgid "Type placeholders"
msgstr "ຕົວສຳຮອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:225
msgid ""
"There used to be, in Godot 3.x, placeholders for GDScript type hints that "
"would get replaced whenever a template was used to create a new script, such "
"as: ``%INT_TYPE%``, ``%STRING_TYPE%``, ``%FLOAT_TYPE%`` or ``%VOID_RETURN%``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Godot 3.x ເຄີຍມີຕົວສຳຮອງສຳລັບ GDScript type hints ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ"
"ເພື່ອສ້າງສະຄຣິບໃໝ່, ເຊັ່ນ: ``%INT_TYPE%``, ``%STRING_TYPE%``, ``%FLOAT_TYPE%`` ຫຼື "
"``%VOID_RETURN%``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:229
msgid ""
"The placeholders no longer work for Godot 4.x, but if the setting "
"``text_editor/completion/add_type_hints`` from :ref:`EditorSettings "
"<class_EditorSettings>` is disabled, type hints for parameters and return "
"types will be automatically removed for a few base types:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສຳຮອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວໃນ Godot 4.x, ແຕ່ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``text_editor/completion/"
"add_type_hints`` ຈາກ :ref:`EditorSettings <class_EditorSettings>` ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"type hints ສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ປະເພດການສົ່ງຄືນ (return types) ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳ"
"ລັບບາງປະເພດພື້ນຖານ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:235
msgid "``int``"
msgstr "``int``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/creating_script_templates.rst:237
