"Setting a per-instance uniform's value in the GeometryInstance3D section of "
"the inspector"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ per-instance uniform ໃນສ່ວນ GeometryInstance3D ຂອງ inspector"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1109
msgid ""
"Per-instance uniform values can also be set at runtime "
"using :ref:`set_instance_shader_parameter "
"<class_GeometryInstance3D_method_set_instance_shader_parameter>` method on a "
"node that inherits from :ref:`class_GeometryInstance3D`:"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Per-instance uniform ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ runtime ໂດຍການໃຊ້ວິທີ "
":ref:`set_instance_shader_parameter "
"<class_GeometryInstance3D_method_set_instance_shader_parameter>`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1117
msgid ""
"When using per-instance uniforms, there are some restrictions you should be "
"aware of:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ per-instance uniforms, ຍັງມີບາງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ທ່ານຄວນຮູ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1119
msgid ""
"**Per-instance uniforms do not support textures or arrays**, only regular "
"scalar and vector types. As a workaround, you can pass a texture array as a "
"regular uniform, then pass the index of the texture to be drawn using a per-"
"instance uniform."
msgstr ""
"**Per-instance uniforms ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ textures ຫຼື arrays**, ຮອງຮັບແຕ່ປະເພດ scalar ແລະ "
"vector ປົກກະຕິເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1125
msgid ""
"In GLSL versions before 4.0 (i.e. GLSL 3.3 and lower), you cannot directly "
"index a texture array using a per-instance uniform, as sampler arrays can "
"only be indexed by compile-time constant expressions. This affects shaders "
"compiled with the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ GLSL ເວີຊັນກ່ອນ 4.0, ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃສ່ດັດຊະນີໃຫ້ກັບ texture array ໂດຍໃຊ້ per-instance "
"uniform ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1130
msgid ""
"If you are affected, use the ``switch`` statement to select the texture:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``switch`` ເພື່ອເລືອກ texture:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1151
msgid "There is a practical maximum limit of 16 instance uniforms per shader."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດສູງສຸດໃນການໃຊ້ງານຕົວຈິງຢູ່ທີ່ 16 instance uniforms ຕໍ່ shader."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1152
msgid ""
"If your mesh uses multiple materials, the parameters for the first mesh "
"material found will \"win\" over the subsequent ones, unless they have the "
"same name, index *and* type. In this case, all parameters are affected "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ mesh ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ materials, parameters ສຳລັບ material ທຳອິດທີ່ພົບຈະ \"ຊະນະ\" ອັນ"
"ຖັດໆມາ, ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະມີຊື່, index ແລະ ປະເພດດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1155
msgid ""
"If you run into the above situation, you can avoid clashes by manually "
"specifying the index (0-15) of the instance uniform by using the "
"``instance_index`` hint:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼີກລ່ຽງການທັບຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸດັດຊະນີ (0-15) ຂອງ instance uniform ດ້ວຍຕົວເອງໂ"
"ດຍການໃຊ້ ``instance_index`` hint:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1166
msgid "Setting uniforms from code"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ uniforms ຈາກໂຄ້ດ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1168
msgid ""
"You can set uniforms from GDScript using the :ref:`set_shader_parameter() "
"<class_ShaderMaterial_method_set_shader_parameter>` method:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ uniforms ຈາກ GDScript ໂດຍການໃຊ້ວິທີ :ref:`set_shader_parameter() "
"<class_ShaderMaterial_method_set_shader_parameter>`:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1178
msgid ""
"The first argument to ``set_shader_parameter()`` is the name of the uniform "
"in the shader. It must match *exactly* to the name of the uniform in the "
"shader or else it will not be recognized."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມນທຳອິດຂອງ ``set_shader_parameter()`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງຢູນີຟອມໃນເຊດເດີ. ມັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງຢູ"
"ນີຟອມໃນເຊດເດີ *ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ* ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້."

