#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1271
msgid ""
"Be careful when setting shader uniforms from GDScript, since no error will "
"be thrown if the type does not match. Your shader will just exhibit "
"undefined behavior. Specifically, this includes setting a GDScript int/float "
"(64 bit) into a Godot shader language int/float (32 bit). This may lead to "
"unintended consequences in cases where high precision is required."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນລະວັງເມື່ອກຳນົດ shader uniforms ຈາກ GDScript, ເນື່ອງຈາກຈະບໍ່ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກປະ"
"ເພດຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ກົງກັນ. Shader ຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ (undefined behavior). ໂດຍສ"
"ະເພາະ, ນີ້ລວມເຖິງການກຳນົດ int/float (64 bit) ຂອງ GDScript ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ int/float (32 "
"bit) ຂອງພາສາ shader ຂອງ Godot. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊັດເຈນສູງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1279
msgid "Uniform limits"
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງ Uniform"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1281
msgid ""
"There is a limit to the total size of shader uniforms that you can use in a "
"single shader. On most desktop platforms, this limit is ``65536`` bytes, or "
"4096 ``vec4`` uniforms. On mobile platforms, the limit is typically "
"``16384`` bytes, or 1024 ``vec4`` uniforms. Vector uniforms smaller than a "
"``vec4``, such as ``vec2`` or ``vec3``, are padded to the size of a "
"``vec4``. Scalar uniforms such as ``int`` or ``float`` are not padded, and "
"``bool`` is padded to the size of an ``int``."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂີດຈຳກັດສຳລັບຂະໜາດລວມຂອງ shader uniforms ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ shader ດຽວ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມເດັສ"
"ທັອບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ແມ່ນ ``65536`` ໄບຕ໌, ຫຼື 4096 ``vec4`` uniforms. ໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖື, ຂີ"
"ດຈຳກັດໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ ``16384`` ໄບຕ໌, ຫຼື 1024 ``vec4`` uniforms. Vector uniforms ທີ່ມີຂະ"
"ໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ ``vec4`` ເຊັ່ນ ``vec2`` ຫຼື ``vec3``, ຈະຖືກ padded ໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ "
"``vec4``. ສ່ວນ scalar uniforms ເຊັ່ນ ``int`` ຫຼື ``float`` ຈະບໍ່ຖືກ padded, ແລະ "
"``bool`` ຈະຖືກ padded ໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ ``int``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1289
msgid ""
"Arrays count as the total size of their contents. If you need a uniform "
"array that is larger than this limit, consider packing the data into a "
"texture instead, since the *contents* of a texture do not count towards this "
"limit, only the size of the sampler uniform."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣ (Arrays) ຈະຖືກນັບຕາມຂະໜາດລວມຂອງເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ uniform array ທີ່ມີຂະ"
"ໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ texture ແທນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ *ເນື້ອໃນ* ຂອງ "
"texture ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນັບລວມໃນຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້, ຈະນັບພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງ sampler uniform ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1295
msgid "Built-in variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ Built-in"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1297
msgid ""
"A large number of built-in variables are available, like ``UV``, ``COLOR`` "
"and ``VERTEX``. What variables are available depends on the type of shader "
"(``spatial``, ``canvas_item``, ``particle``, etc) and the function used "
"(``vertex``, ``fragment``, ``light``, ``start``, ``process``, ``sky``, or "
"``fog``). For a list of the built-in variables that are available, please "
"see the corresponding pages:"
msgstr ""
"ມີຕົວປ່ຽນ built-in ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ ເຊັ່ນ ``UV``, ``COLOR`` ແລະ ``VERTEX``. ຕົວປ່ຽນໃດ"
"ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ shader (``spatial``, ``canvas_item``, "
"``particle``, ແລະອື່ນໆ) ແລະຟັງຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ (``vertex``, ``fragment``, ``light``, "
