#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:256
msgid ""
"Arc sine, or inverse sine. Calculates the angle whose sine is ``x`` and is "
"in the range ``[-PI/2, PI/2]``. The result is undefined if ``x < -1`` or ``x "
"> 1``."
msgstr ""
"ອາກຊາຍ (Arc sine), ຫຼື ອິນເວີດຊາຍ. ຄຳນວນຫາຄ່າມຸມທີ່ຄ່າຊາຍເທົ່າກັບ ``x`` ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ ``[-"
"PI/2, PI/2]``. ຜົນລັດຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດ (undefined) ຫາກ ``x < -1`` ຫຼື ``x > 1``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:0
msgid "param x"
msgstr "param x"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:261
msgid "The value whose arc sine to return."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການຫາຄ່າອາກຊາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:263
msgid "The angle whose trigonometric sine is ``x``."
msgstr "ມຸມທີ່ຄ່າຕີໂກນມິຕິຊາຍເທົ່າກັບ ``x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:265
msgid "https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/asin.xhtml"
msgstr "https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/asin.xhtml"

