msgstr "|vec_type| **acos**\\ (\\ |vec_type| x) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_acos>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:280
msgid ""
"Arc cosine, or inverse cosine. Calculates the angle whose cosine is ``x`` "
"and is in the range ``[0, PI]``."
msgstr ""
"ອາກໂຄຊາຍ (Arc cosine), ຫຼື ອິນເວີດໂຄຊາຍ. ຄຳນວນຫາຄ່າມຸມທີ່ຄ່າໂຄຊາຍເທົ່າກັບ ``x`` ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວ"
"ງ ``[0, PI]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:283
msgid "The result is undefined if ``x < -1`` or ``x > 1``."
msgstr "ຜົນລັດຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດຫາກ ``x < -1`` ຫຼື ``x > 1``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:286
msgid "The value whose arc cosine to return."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການຫາຄ່າອາກໂຄຊາຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:289
msgid "The angle whose trigonometric cosine is ``x``."
msgstr "ມຸມທີ່ຄ່າຕີໂກນມິຕິໂຄຊາຍເທົ່າກັບ ``x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:291
