msgstr "https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/acos.xhtml"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:302
msgid ""
"|vec_type| **atan**\\ (\\ |vec_type| y_over_x) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_atan>`"
msgstr ""
"|vec_type| **atan**\\ (\\ |vec_type| y_over_x) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_atan>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:306
msgid "Calculates the arc tangent given a tangent value of ``y/x``."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຫາຄ່າອາກຕັງຊັງ ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກຄ່າຕັງຊັງຂອງ ``y/x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:309
msgid ""
"Because of the sign ambiguity, the function cannot determine with certainty "
"in which quadrant the angle falls only by its tangent value. If you need to "
"know the quadrant, use :ref:`atan(vec_type y, vec_type "
"x)<shader_func_atan2>`."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມບໍ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ, ຟັງຊັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນວ່າຄ່າມຸມຕົກຢູ່ໃນຈຕຸພາກ "
"(quadrant) ໃດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າຕັງຊັງຂອງມັນ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮູ້ຈຕຸພາກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`atan"
"(vec_type y, vec_type x)<shader_func_atan2>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:0
msgid "param y_over_x"
msgstr "param y_over_x"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:314
msgid "The fraction whose arc tangent to return."
msgstr "ຄ່າເສດສ່ວນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຫາຄ່າອາກຕັງຊັງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:317
msgid ""
"The trigonometric arc-tangent of ``y_over_x`` and is in the range ``[-PI/2, "
"PI/2]``."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕີໂກນມິຕິອາກຕັງຊັງຂອງ ``y_over_x`` ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ ``[-PI/2, PI/2]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:320
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:351
