#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1205
msgid ""
"Performs a linear interpolation between ``a`` and ``b`` using ``c`` to "
"weight between them."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການແທນຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນ (linear interpolation) ລະຫວ່າງ ``a`` ແລະ ``b`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ "
"``c`` ເປັນນໍ້າໜັກໃນການປັບປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງທັງສອງຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1207
msgid "Computed as ``a * (1 - c) + b * c``."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນໄດ້ຈາກ ``a * (1 - c) + b * c``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1209
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :ref:`lerp() <class_@GlobalScope_method_lerp>` in GDScript."
msgstr "ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ :ref:`lerp() <class_@GlobalScope_method_lerp>` ໃນ GDScript."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1212
msgid "The start of the range in which to interpolate."
msgstr "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຊ່ວງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແທນຄ່າ."

