#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1234
msgid ""
"Selects either value ``a`` or value ``b`` based on the value of ``c``. For a "
"component of ``c`` that is false, the corresponding component of ``a`` is "
"returned. For a component of ``c`` that is true, the corresponding component "
"of ``b`` is returned. Components of ``a`` and ``b`` that are not selected "
"are allowed to be invalid floating-point values and will have no effect on "
"the results."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກລະຫວ່າງຄ່າ ``a`` ຫຼື ຄ່າ ``b`` ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງ ``c``. ສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບ (component) ຂ"
"ອງ ``c`` ທີ່ເປັນ false, ມັນຈະສົ່ງສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງ ``a`` ກັບຄືນມາ. ສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ "
"``c`` ທີ່ເປັນ true, ມັນຈະສົ່ງສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງ ``b`` ກັບຄືນມາ. ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ ``a`` ແລະ "
"``b`` ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກອາດຈະເປັນຄ່າ floating-point ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (invalid) ໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຜົ"
"ນລັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1239
msgid ""
"If ``a``, ``b``, and ``c`` are vector types the operation is "
"performed :ref:`component-wise <shading_componentwise>`. ie. ``mix(vec2(42, "
"314), vec2(9.8, 6e23), bvec2(true, false)))`` will return ``vec2(9.8, 314)``."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ ``a``, ``b``, ແລະ ``c`` ເປັນປະເພດ vector, ການປະຕິບັດການຈະເຮັດແບບ :ref:`ແຍກແຕ່ລ"
"ະສ່ວນປະກອບ (component-wise) <shading_componentwise>`. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``mix(vec2(42, "
"314), vec2(9.8, 6e23), bvec2(true, false)))`` ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ ``vec2(9.8, 314)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1243
msgid "Value returned when ``c`` is false."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຈະສົ່ງກັບເມື່ອ ``c`` ເປັນ false."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1246
msgid "Value returned when ``c`` is true."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຈະສົ່ງກັບເມື່ອ ``c`` ເປັນ true."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1249
msgid "The value used to select between ``a`` and ``b``."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເລືອກລະຫວ່າງ ``a`` ແລະ ``b``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1265
msgid ""
"|vec_type| **fma**\\ (\\ |vec_type| a, |vec_type| b, |vec_type| "
"c) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_fma>`"
msgstr ""
"|vec_type| **fma**\\ (\\ |vec_type| a, |vec_type| b, |vec_type| c) "
":ref:`🔗<shader_func_fma>`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1269
msgid ""
"Performs, where possible, a fused multiply-add operation, returning ``a * b "
"+ c``. In use cases where the return value is eventually consumed by a "
"variable declared as precise:"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການຄູນແລ້ວບວກ (fused multiply-add) ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໂດຍສົ່ງຄ່າ ``a * b + c``. ໃນກໍລ"
"ະນີທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ປະກາດວ່າ precise:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1272
msgid ""
"``fma()`` is considered a single operation, whereas the expression ``a * b + "
"c`` consumed by a variable declared as precise is considered two operations."
msgstr ""
"``fma()`` ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນການປະຕິບັດການດຽວ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ນິພົດ ``a * b + c`` ທີ່ຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວປ່ຽ"
"ນ precise ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນສອງການປະຕິບັດການ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1274
msgid ""
"The precision of ``fma()`` can differ from the precision of the expression "
"``a * b + c``."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງ ``fma()`` ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງນິພົດ ``a * b + c``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1276
msgid ""
"``fma()`` will be computed with the same precision as any other ``fma()`` "
"consumed by a precise variable, giving invariant results for the same input "
"values of a, b and c."
msgstr ""
"``fma()`` ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນດ້ວຍຄວາມຊັດເຈນດຽວກັນກັບ ``fma()`` ອື່ນໆທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວປ່ຽນ precise, ເຊິ່ງຈ"
"ະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ (invariant) ສຳລັບຄ່າ input a, b ແລະ c ດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1279
msgid ""
"Otherwise, in the absence of precise consumption, there are no special "
"constraints on the number of operations or difference in precision between "
"``fma()`` and the expression ``a * b + c``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຫາກບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ precise, ຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດພິເສດກ່ຽວກັບຈຳນວນການປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື ຄວາມແຕ"
"ກຕ່າງຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນລະຫວ່າງ ``fma()`` ແລະ ນິພົດ ``a * b + c``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1283
msgid "The first value to be multiplied."
msgstr "ຄ່າທຳອິດທີ່ຈະນຳມາຄູນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1286
