#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1313
msgid "Generates a step function by comparing b to a."
msgstr "ສ້າງຟັງຊັນຂັ້ນໄດ (Step function) ໂດຍການປຽບທຽບ b ກັບ a."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1315
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``if (b < a) { return 0.0; } else { return 1.0; }``. For "
"element i of the return value, 0.0 is returned if b[i] < a[i], and 1.0 is "
"returned otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ ``if (b < a) { return 0.0; } else { return 1.0; }``. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອ"
"ບ i ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ 0.0 ຖ້າ b[i] < a[i], ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ 1.0 ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1319
msgid "The location of the edge of the step function."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂອບຂອງຟັງຊັນຂັ້ນໄດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1322
msgid "The value to be used to generate the step function."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຟັງຊັນຂັ້ນໄດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1325
msgid "``0.0`` or ``1.0``."
msgstr "``0.0`` ຫຼື ``1.0``."

