#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1346
msgid ""
"Performs smooth Hermite interpolation between ``0`` and ``1`` when a < c < "
"b. This is useful in cases where a threshold function with a smooth "
"transition is desired."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (Interpolation) ແບບ Hermite ທີ່ລຽບກ້ຽງລະຫວ່າງ ``0`` ແລະ ``1`` ເມື່ອ "
"a < c < b. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຟັງຊັນເກນ (Threshold) ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງແບບລຽບກ້ຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1349
msgid "Smoothstep is equivalent to:"
msgstr "Smoothstep ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1357
msgid "Results are undefined if ``a >= b``."
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າ (Undefined) ຖ້າ ``a >= b``."

