#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2423
msgid ""
"The mipmap array(s) that would be accessed is returned in the x component of "
"the return value. The computed level-of-detail relative to the base level is "
"returned in the y component of the return value."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣ mipmap ທີ່ຈະຖືກເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາໃນສ່ວນປະກອບ x ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ. ລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດ "
"(Level-of-detail) ທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ເມື່ອທຽບກັບລະດັບພື້ນຖານ (Base level) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາໃນສ່ວນປະກອ"
"ບ y ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2427
msgid ""
"If called on an incomplete texture, the result of the operation is undefined."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ບໍ່ສົມບູນ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການເຮັດວຽກຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າ (Undefined)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2430
msgid ""
"The sampler to which the texture whose level-of-detail will be queried is "
"bound."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (Sampler) ທີ່ເທັກເຈີເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດນັ້ນຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

