#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2510
msgid "Retrieves texels from a texture."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຊວ (Texels) ຈາກເທັກເຈີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2512
msgid ""
"Samples texels from the texture bound to ``s`` at texture coordinate ``p``. "
"An optional bias, specified in ``bias`` is included in the level-of-detail "
"computation that is used to choose mipmap(s) from which to sample."
msgstr ""
"ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຊວ (Sample texels) ຈາກເທັກເຈີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ ``s`` ທີ່ພິກັດເທັກເຈີ ``p``. ສາມາດລະ"
"ບຸ bias ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ ``bias`` ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການຄຳນວນລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດ (Level-of-"
"detail) ເພື່ອເລືອກ mipmap ທີ່ຈະນຳມາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2515
msgid ""
"For shadow forms, the last component of ``p`` is used as Dsub and the array "
"layer is specified in the second to last component of ``p``. (The second "
"component of ``p`` is unused for 1D shadow lookups.)"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບເງົາ (Shadow forms), ສ່ວນປະກອບສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ ``p`` ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ Dsub ແລະ ເລເຢີຂອ"
"ງອາເຣ (Array layer) ແມ່ນຈະຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນປະກອບຮອງສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ ``p``. (ສ່ວນປະກອບທີສອງຂອ"
"ງ ``p`` ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາເງົາແບບ 1D.)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:2518
msgid ""
"For non-shadow variants, the array layer comes from the last component of P."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເງົາ (Non-shadow variants), ເລເຢີຂອງອາເຣ (Array layer) ແມ່ນມາຈາກສ່ວນປ"
"ະກອບສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ P."

