"which calculation to perform based upon factors such as performance or the "
"value of the API ``GL_FRAGMENT_SHADER_DERIVATIVE_HINT`` hint."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ :ref:`dFdxCoarse<shader_func_dFdxCoarse>` ຫຼື "
":ref:`dFdxFine<shader_func_dfdxFine>`. ລະບົບອາດຈະເລືອກວິທີການຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ປັດໄຈຕ່າງໆ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ຄ່າຂອງ API ``GL_FRAGMENT_SHADER_DERIVATIVE_HINT``."

