#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3978
msgid ""
"Extracts ``x`` into a floating-point significand in the range ``[0.5, 1.0)`` "
"and in integral exponent of two, such that:"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກ ``x`` ອອກເປັນສ່ວນສຳຄັນທົດສະນິຍົມໃນຊ່ວງ ``[0.5, 1.0)`` ແລະ ເລກກຳລັງຖານສອງ, ໂດຍທີ່:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3984
msgid ""
"For a floating-point value of zero, the significand and exponent are both "
"zero."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄ່າທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ເປັນສູນ, ທັງສ່ວນສຳຄັນ ແລະ ເລກກຳລັງຈະເປັນສູນທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3986
msgid ""
"For a floating-point value that is an infinity or a floating-point NaN, the "
"results are undefined."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ເປັນອະສົງໄຂ (infinity) ຫຼື NaN, ຜົນລັບຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3989
msgid "The value from which significand and exponent are to be extracted."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການແຍກສ່ວນສຳຄັນ ແລະ ເລກກຳລັງອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3992
msgid "The variable into which to place the exponent of ``x``."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເກັບເລກກຳລັງຂອງ ``x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3995
msgid "The significand of ``x``."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສຳຄັນ (significand) ຂອງ ``x``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:3997
msgid "https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/frexp.xhtml"
msgstr "https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/frexp.xhtml"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:4
msgid "Shader preprocessor"
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນ (preprocessor) ຂອງ Shader"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:7
msgid "Why use a shader preprocessor?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຂອງ shader?"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:9
msgid ""
"In programming languages, a *preprocessor* allows changing the code before "
"the compiler reads it. Unlike the compiler, the preprocessor does not care "
"about whether the syntax of the preprocessed code is valid. The preprocessor "
"always performs what the *directives* tell it to do. A directive is a "
"statement starting with a hash symbol (``#``). It is not a *keyword* of the "
"shader language (such as ``if`` or ``for``), but a special kind of token "
"within the language."
msgstr ""
"ໃນພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ, *ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນ* (preprocessor) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໂຄ້ດກ່ອນທີ່ "
"compiler ຈະອ່ານມັນ. ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ compiler ບ່ອນທີ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ສົນໃຈວ່າໄວຍາກອນຂອງໂ"
"ຄ້ດທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່. ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ *ຄຳສັ່ງ* (directives) ບອກໃຫ້ເຮັດສ"
"ະເໝີ. ຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash (``#``). ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນ *ຄຳສະຫງວນ* (keyword) ຂ"
"ອງພາສາ shader (ເຊັ່ນ ``if`` ຫຼື ``for``), ແຕ່ແມ່ນ token ຊະນິດພິເສດພາຍໃນພາສາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:17
msgid ""
"To avoid repetition and improve code reuse, you can use a shader "
"preprocessor within text-based shaders. The syntax is similar to what most "
"GLSL shader compilers support (which in turn is similar to the C/C++ "
"preprocessor)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂຽນຊ້ຳ ແລະ ປັບປຸງການນຳໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດຄືນໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຂອງ shader ພາຍ"
"ໃນ shader ທີ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້. ໄວຍາກອນແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບທີ່ compiler ຂອງ GLSL ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຮອງຮັບ (ເຊິ່ງຄ້າ"
"ຍຄືກັບຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຂອງ C/C++)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:23
msgid ""
"The shader preprocessor is not available in :ref:`visual shaders "
"<doc_visual_shaders>`. If you need to introduce preprocessor statements to a "
"visual shader, you can convert it to a text-based shader using the **Convert "
"to Shader** option in the VisualShader inspector resource dropdown. This "
"conversion is a one-way operation; text shaders cannot be converted back to "
"visual shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນຂອງ shader ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ :ref:`visual shaders <doc_visual_shaders>`. ຖ້"
"າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor ໃນ visual shader, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນມັນເປັນ shader ແບບຂໍ້ຄ"
"ວາມໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ **Convert to Shader** ໃນລາຍການ resource ຂອງ VisualShader "
"inspector. ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ແມ່ນການເຮັດວຽກແບບທາງດຽວ; shader ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນກັບມາເປັນ "
"visual shader ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:30
msgid "Directives"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ (Directives)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:33
msgid "General syntax"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນທົ່ວໄປ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:35
msgid ""
"Preprocessor directives do not use brackets (``{}``), but can use "
"parentheses."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor ບໍ່ໃຊ້ວົງຂໍ (``{}``), ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ວົງເລັບໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:36
msgid ""
"Preprocessor directives **never** end with semicolons (with the exception of "
"``#define``, where this is allowed but potentially dangerous)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor **ບໍ່ເຄີຍ** ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ semicolon (ຍົກເວັ້ນ ``#define``, ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້"
"ໃຊ້ແຕ່ອາດຈະເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:38
msgid ""
"Preprocessor directives can span several lines by ending each line with a "
"backslash (``\\``). The first line break *not* featuring a backslash will "
"end the preprocessor statement."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor ສາມາດຂຽນຕໍ່ກັນຫຼາຍບັນທັດໄດ້ໂດຍການລົງທ້າຍແຕ່ລະບັນທັດດ້ວຍ backslash (``\\"
"``). ການຂຶ້ນບັນທັດໃໝ່ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ *ບໍ່ມີ* backslash ຈະຖືວ່າສິ້ນສຸດຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:43
msgid "#define"
msgstr "#define"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:45
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#define <identifier> [replacement_code]``."
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#define <ຕົວລະບຸ> [ໂຄ້ດທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:47
msgid ""
"Defines the identifier after that directive as a macro, and replaces all "
"successive occurrences of it with the replacement code given in the shader. "
"Replacement is performed on a \"whole words\" basis, which means no "
"replacement is performed if the string is part of another string (without "
"any spaces or operators separating it)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວລະບຸຫຼັງຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນມາໂຄຣ (macro), ແລະ ແທນທີ່ທຸກບ່ອນທີ່ມັນປາກົດດ້ວຍໂຄ້ດທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃ"
"ນ shader. ການແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃນລັກສະນະ \"ໝົດຄຳສັບ\", ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການແທນທີ່ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນເປັ"
"ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຕົວດຳເນີນການແຍກມັນອອກ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:53
msgid ""
"Defines with replacements may also have one or more *arguments*, which can "
"then be passed when referencing the define (similar to a function call)."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດດ້ວຍການແທນທີ່ອາດຈະມີ *ອາກິວເມັນ* ຕັ້ງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງຕົວຂຶ້ນໄປ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າໄປໄດ້ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງກາ"
"ນກຳນົດນັ້ນ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the replacement code is not defined, the identifier may only be used with "
"``#ifdef`` or ``#ifndef`` directives."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໂຄ້ດທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ, ຕົວລະບຸນັ້ນອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``#ifdef`` ຫຼື ``#ifndef`` ເ"
"ທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:59
msgid ""
"If the *concatenation* symbol (``##``) is present in the replacement code "
"then it will be removed upon macro insertion, together with any space "
"surrounding it, and join the surrounding words and arguments into a new "
"token."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໝາຍ *ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່* (``##``) ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນໂຄ້ດທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ, ມັນຈະຖືກລົບອອກເມື່ອມີການແຊກມາໂຄຣ, ພ້"
"ອມກັບຍະຫວ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຮອບມັນ, ແລະ ຈະເຊື່ອມຄຳສັບ ແລະ ອາກິວເມັນທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຮອບເຂົ້າເປັນ token ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:74
msgid ""
"Compared to constants (``const CONSTANT = value;``), ``#define`` can be used "
"anywhere within the shader (including in uniform hints). ``#define`` can "
"also be used to insert arbitrary shader code at any location, while "
"constants can't do that."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (``const CONSTANT = value;``), ``#define`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຸກບ່ອນພາຍໃນ "
"shader (ລວມທັງໃນ uniform hints). ນອກຈາກນີ້ ``#define`` ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຊກໂຄ້ດ "
"shader ໃດໆ ກໍຕາມໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໃດກໍໄດ້, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:109
msgid ""
"Defining a ``#define`` for an identifier that is already defined results in "
"an error. To prevent this, use ``#undef <identifier>``."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດ ``#define`` ສຳລັບຕົວລະບຸທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"``#undef <ຕົວລະບຸ>``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:113
msgid "#undef"
msgstr "#undef"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:115
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#undef identifier``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#undef ຕົວລະບຸ``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:117
msgid ""
"The ``#undef`` directive may be used to cancel a previously defined "
"``#define`` directive:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#undef`` ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກຄຳສັ່ງ ``#define`` ທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:138
msgid ""
"Without ``#undef`` in the above example, there would be a macro redefinition "
"error."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ ``#undef`` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກຳນົດມາໂຄຣຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:141
msgid "#if"
msgstr "#if"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:143
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#if <condition>``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#if <ເງື່ອນໄຂ>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:145
msgid ""
"The ``#if`` directive checks whether the ``condition`` passed. If it "
"evaluates to a non-zero value, the code block is included, otherwise it is "
"skipped."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#if`` ຈະກວດສອບວ່າ ``ເງື່ອນໄຂ`` ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປນັ້ນຜ່ານຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າມັນມີຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, ບລັອກໂຄ້ດນັ້ນຈະຖື"
"ກລວມເຂົ້າໄປ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:148
msgid ""
"To evaluate correctly, the condition must be an expression giving a simple "
"floating-point, integer or boolean result. There may be multiple condition "
"blocks connected by ``&&`` (AND) or ``||`` (OR) operators. It may be "
"continued by an ``#else`` block, but **must** be ended with the ``#endif`` "
"directive."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປະເມີນຜົນຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເງື່ອນໄຂຕ້ອງເປັນສຳນວນທີ່ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບເປັນທົດສະນິຍົມ, ເລກຖ້ວນ ຫຼື ບູລີນແບບງ່າຍ"
"ໆ. ອາດຈະມີຫຼາຍບລັອກເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ ``&&`` (AND) ຫຼື ``||`` (OR). ມັນອາດ"
"ຈະມີບລັອກ ``#else`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ, ແຕ່ **ຕ້ອງ** ສິ້ນສຸດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``#endif``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:163
msgid ""
"Using the ``defined()`` *preprocessor function*, you can check whether the "
"passed identifier is defined a by ``#define`` placed above that directive. "
"This is useful for creating multiple shader versions in the same file. It "
"may be continued by an ``#else`` block, but must be ended with the "
"``#endif`` directive."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ *ຟັງຊັນ preprocessor* ``defined()``, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຕົວລະບຸທີ່ສົ່ງໄປນັ້ນຖືກກ"
"ຳນົດໂດຍ ``#define`` ທີ່ຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້າຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງ shader ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວ"
"ກັນ. ມັນອາດຈະມີບລັອກ ``#else`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງສິ້ນສຸດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``#endif``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:168
msgid ""
"The ``defined()`` function's result can be negated by using the ``!`` "
"(boolean NOT) symbol in front of it. This can be used to check whether a "
"define is *not* set."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນລັບຂອງຟັງຊັນ ``defined()`` ສາມາດຖືກປະຕິເສດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``!`` (ບູລີນ NOT) ໄວ້ທາ"
"ງໜ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າ define ນັ້ນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:181
msgid ""
"Be careful, as ``defined()`` must only wrap a single identifier within "
"parentheses, never more:"
msgstr ""
"ຄວນລະວັງ, ເພາະວ່າ ``defined()`` ຕ້ອງຄຸມຕົວລະບຸພຽງຕົວດຽວພາຍໃນວົງເລັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຫ້າມຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:192
msgid ""
"In the shader editor, preprocessor branches that evaluate to ``false`` (and "
"are therefore excluded from the final compiled shader) will appear grayed "
"out. This does not apply to runtime ``if`` statements."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ shader, ສ່ວນຂອງ preprocessor ທີ່ຖືກປະເມີນເປັນ ``false`` (ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຄັດອອກຈາກ "
"shader ທີ່ compile ສຸດທ້າຍ) ຈະປາກົດເປັນສີເທົາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງຄຳສັ່ງ ``if`` ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຕອນ "
"runtime."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:196
msgid "**#if preprocessor versus if statement: Performance caveats**"
msgstr "**#if preprocessor ທຽບກັບ ຄຳສັ່ງ if: ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:198
msgid ""
"The :ref:`shading language <doc_shading_language>` supports runtime ``if`` "
"statements:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ພາສາ shading <doc_shading_language>` ຮອງຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``if`` ແບບ runtime:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:210
msgid ""
"If the uniform is never changed, this behaves identical to the following "
"usage of the ``#if`` preprocessor statement:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ uniform ບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ preprocessor ``#if`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:223
msgid ""
"However, the ``#if`` variant can be faster in certain scenarios. This is "
"because all runtime branches in a shader are still compiled and variables "
"within those branches may still take up register space, even if they are "
"never run in practice."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຮູບແບບ ``#if`` ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວກວ່າໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າທຸກໆການແຍກ"
"ສາຂາໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (runtime branches) ໃນເຊດເດີຍັງຄົງຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ ແລະ ຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນສາຂາເຫຼົ່"
"ານັ້ນອາດຈະຍັງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຣີຈິດສະເຕີ (register space), ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກໃຊ້ງານຈິງກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:228
msgid ""
"Modern GPUs are `quite effective <https://medium.com/@jasonbooth_86226/"
"branching-on-a-gpu-18bfc83694f2>`__ at performing \"static\" branching. "
"\"Static\" branching refers to ``if`` statements where *all* pixels/vertices "
"evaluate to the same result in a given shader invocation. However, high "
"amounts of :abbr:`VGPRs (Vector General-Purpose Register)` (which can be "
"caused by having too many branches) can still slow down shader execution "
"significantly."
msgstr ""
"GPU ສະໄໝໃໝ່ແມ່ນ `ມີປະສິດທິພາບພໍສົມຄວນ <https://medium.com/@jasonbooth_86226/"
"branching-on-a-gpu-18bfc83694f2>`__ ໃນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ \"static\" branching. "
"\"Static\" branching ໝາຍເຖິງຄຳສັ່ງ ``if`` ທີ່ *ທຸກໆ* pixel/vertex ປະເມີນຜົນອອກມາເປັນຜົນ"
"ລັບດຽວກັນໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ shader ນັ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຈຳນວນ :abbr:`VGPRs (Vector "
"General-Purpose Register)` ທີ່ສູງ (ເຊິ່ງອາດເກີດຈາກການມີ branch ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ) ກໍຍັງສາມາດເຮັດ"
"ໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ shader ຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:235
msgid "#elif"
msgstr "#elif"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:237
msgid ""
"The ``#elif`` directive stands for \"else if\" and checks the condition "
"passed if the above ``#if`` evaluated to ``false``. ``#elif`` can only be "
"used within an ``#if`` block. It is possible to use several ``#elif`` "
"statements after an ``#if`` statement."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#elif`` ຫຍໍ້ມາຈາກ \"else if\" ແລະ ຈະກວດສອບເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ສົ່ງໄປ ຖ້າຫາກ ``#if`` ກ່ອນໜ້"
"ານັ້ນຖືກປະເມີນເປັນ ``false``. ``#elif`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພາຍໃນບລັອກ ``#if`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ"
"ຳສັ່ງ ``#elif`` ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ``#if`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:255
msgid "Like with ``#if``, the ``defined()`` preprocessor function can be used:"
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ ``#if``, ຟັງຊັນ preprocessor ``defined()`` ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:270
msgid "#ifdef"
msgstr "#ifdef"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:272
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#ifdef <identifier>``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#ifdef <ຕົວລະບຸ>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:274
msgid ""
"This is a shorthand for ``#if defined(...)``. Checks whether the passed "
"identifier is defined by ``#define`` placed above that directive. This is "
"useful for creating multiple shader versions in the same file. It may be "
"continued by an ``#else`` block, but must be ended with the ``#endif`` "
"directive."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບ ``#if defined(...)``. ໃຊ້ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວລະບຸທີ່ສົ່ງໄປນັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"``#define`` ທີ່ຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້າຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງ shader ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ. ມັນອ"
"າດຈະມີບລັອກ ``#else`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງສິ້ນສຸດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``#endif``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:287
msgid ""
"The processor does *not* support ``#elifdef`` as a shortcut for ``#elif "
"defined(...)``. Instead, use the following series of ``#ifdef`` and "
"``#else`` when you need more than two branches:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ *ບໍ່* ຮອງຮັບ ``#elifdef`` ເພື່ອເປັນທາງລັດສຳລັບ ``#elif defined(...)``. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້"
"ຊຸດຂອງ ``#ifdef`` ແລະ ``#else`` ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແທນ ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່າສອງ branch:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:306
msgid "#ifndef"
msgstr "#ifndef"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:308
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#ifndef <identifier>``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#ifndef <ຕົວລະບຸ>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:310
msgid ""
"This is a shorthand for ``#if !defined(...)``. Similar to ``#ifdef``, but "
"checks whether the passed identifier is **not** defined by ``#define`` "
"before that directive."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບ ``#if !defined(...)``. ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ ``#ifdef``, ແຕ່ຈະກວດສອບວ່າຕົວລະບຸທີ່ສົ່ງໄປ"
"ນັ້ນ **ບໍ່ໄດ້** ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ ``#define`` ກ່ອນໜ້າຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:314
msgid ""
"This is the exact opposite of ``#ifdef``; it will always match in situations "
"where ``#ifdef`` would never match, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ ``#ifdef``; ມັນຈະກົງກັນສະເໝີໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ ``#ifdef`` ບໍ່ມີທາງກົງກັນ, ແລ"
"ະ ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:330
msgid "#else"
msgstr "#else"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:332
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#else``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#else``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:334
msgid ""
"Defines the optional block which is included when the previously defined "
"``#if``, ``#elif``, ``#ifdef`` or ``#ifndef`` directive evaluates to false."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດບລັອກທາງເລືອກທີ່ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າເມື່ອຄຳສັ່ງ ``#if``, ``#elif``, ``#ifdef`` ຫຼື "
"``#ifndef`` ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນຖືກປະເມີນເປັນ false."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:352
msgid "#endif"
msgstr "#endif"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:354
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#endif``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#endif``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:356
msgid ""
"Used as terminator for the ``#if``, ``#ifdef``, ``#ifndef`` or subsequent "
"``#else`` directives."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວປິດທ້າຍສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``#if``, ``#ifdef``, ``#ifndef`` ຫຼື ``#else`` ທີ່ຕາມມາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:359
msgid "#error"
msgstr "#error"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:361
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#error <message>``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#error <ຂໍ້ຄວາມ>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:363
msgid ""
"The ``#error`` directive forces the preprocessor to emit an error with "
"optional message. For example, it's useful when used within ``#if`` block to "
"provide a strict limitation of the defined value."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#error`` ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ preprocessor ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ຖ້າລະບຸ). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັ"
"ນມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໃຊ້ພາຍໃນບລັອກ ``#if`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດຂອງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:377
msgid "#include"
msgstr "#include"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:379
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#include \"path\"``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#include \"ເສັ້ນທາງ (path)\"``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:381
msgid ""
"The ``#include`` directive includes the *entire* content of a shader include "
"file in a shader. ``\"path\"`` can be an absolute ``res://`` path or "
"relative to the current shader file. Relative paths are only allowed in "
"shaders that are saved to ``.gdshader`` or ``.gdshaderinc`` files, while "
"absolute paths can be used in shaders that are built into a scene/resource "
"file."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#include`` ຈະລວມເອົາເນື້ອຫາ *ທັງໝົດ* ຂອງໄຟລ໌ shader include ເຂົ້າໃນ shader. "
"``\"path\"`` ສາມາດເປັນເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມ ``res://`` ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ທຽບກັບໄຟລ໌ shader ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ເສັ້ນທາງແບບທຽບ (relative path) ແມ່ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ shader ທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ "
"``.gdshader`` ຫຼື ``.gdshaderinc`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ shader ທີ່"
"ຖືກສ້າງໄວ້ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ scene/resource."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:387
msgid ""
"You can create new shader includes by using the **File > Create Shader "
"Include** menu option of the shader editor, or by creating a "
"new :ref:`ShaderInclude<class_ShaderInclude>` resource in the FileSystem "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ shader includes ໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເມນູ **File > Create Shader Include** "
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ shader, ຫຼື ໂດຍການສ້າງ resource "
":ref:`ShaderInclude<class_ShaderInclude>` ໃໝ່ໃນ FileSystem dock."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:391
msgid ""
"Shader includes can be included from within any shader, or other shader "
"include, at any point in the file."
msgstr ""
"Shader includes ສາມາດຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຈາກພາຍໃນ shader ໃດໆ ກໍຕາມ, ຫຼື ຈາກ shader include ອື່"
"ນ, ໃນຈຸດໃດກໍໄດ້ຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:394
msgid ""
"When including shader includes in the global scope of a shader, it is "
"recommended to do this after the initial ``shader_type`` statement."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລວມ shader includes ໃນຂອບເຂດທົ່ວໄປ (global scope) ຂອງ shader, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ຫຼັ"
"ງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ``shader_type`` ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:397
msgid ""
"You can also include shader includes from within the body a function. Please "
"note that the shader editor is likely going to report errors for your shader "
"include's code, as it may not be valid outside of the context that it was "
"written for. You can either choose to ignore these errors (the shader will "
"still compile fine), or you can wrap the include in an ``#ifdef`` block that "
"checks for a define from your shader."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລວມ shader includes ຈາກພາຍໃນເນື້ອຫາຂອງຟັງຊັນໄດ້. ກະລຸນາສັງເກດວ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"shader ອາດຈະລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດສຳລັບໂຄ້ດໃນ shader include ຂອງທ່ານ, ເພາະວ່າມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຫ"
"າກຢູ່ນອກບໍລິບົດທີ່ມັນຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນມາ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະລະເລີຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ (shader ຈະຍັງຄົງ "
"compile ໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ), ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸມການ include ນັ້ນໄວ້ໃນບລັອກ ``#ifdef`` ທີ່ກວດສອບ "
"define ຈາກ shader ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:403
msgid ""
"``#include`` is useful for creating libraries of helper functions (or "
"macros) and reducing code duplication. When using ``#include``, be careful "
"about naming collisions, as redefining functions or macros is not allowed."
msgstr ""
"``#include`` ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງຄັງຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍ (helper functions) ຫຼື ມາໂຄຣ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການ"
"ຂຽນໂຄ້ດຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``#include``, ໃຫ້ລະວັງກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຊື່ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ, ເພາະວ່າການກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ ຫຼື "
"ມາໂຄຣຊ້ຳຊ້ອນແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:407
msgid "``#include`` is subject to several restrictions:"
msgstr "``#include`` ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:409
msgid ""
"Only shader include resources (ending with ``.gdshaderinc``) can be "
"included. ``.gdshader`` files cannot be included by another shader, but a "
"``.gdshaderinc`` file can include other ``.gdshaderinc`` files."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດລວມໄດ້ສະເພາະ shader include resources (ທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ ``.gdshaderinc``) ເທົ່ານັ້"
"ນ. ໄຟລ໌ ``.gdshader`` ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກລວມໂດຍ shader ອື່ນໄດ້, ແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ ``.gdshaderinc`` ສາມາດ"
"ລວມໄຟລ໌ ``.gdshaderinc`` ອື່ນໆ ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:412
msgid "Cyclic dependencies are **not** allowed and will result in an error."
msgstr ""
"ການອ້າງອີງແບບເປັນວົງຈອນ (Cyclic dependencies) ແມ່ນ **ບໍ່** ອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພ"
"າດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:413
msgid "To avoid infinite recursion, include depth is limited to 25 steps."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເຮັດວຽກແບບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (infinite recursion), ຄວາມເລິກຂອງການ include ຖືກຈຳກັດໄ"
"ວ້ທີ່ 25 ຂັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:415
msgid "Example shader include file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ shader include:"

