msgid "Example base shader (using the include file we created above):"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ base shader (ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ include ທີ່ພວກເຮົາສ້າງຂ້າງເທິງ):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:443
msgid "#pragma"
msgstr "#pragma"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:445
msgid "**Syntax:** ``#pragma value``"
msgstr "**ໄວຍາກອນ:** ``#pragma ຄ່າ``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:447
msgid ""
"The ``#pragma`` directive provides additional information to the "
"preprocessor or compiler."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ``#pragma`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແກ່ preprocessor ຫຼື compiler."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:449
msgid ""
"Currently, it may have only one value: ``disable_preprocessor``. If you "
"don't need the preprocessor, use that directive to speed up shader "
"compilation by excluding the preprocessor step."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ມັນອາດຈະມີຄ່າດຽວຄື: ``disable_preprocessor``. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ "
"preprocessor, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນເພື່ອເລັ່ງການ compile shader ໂດຍການຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງ "
"preprocessor."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:463
msgid "Built-in defines"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ (Built-in defines)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:466
msgid "Current renderer"
msgstr "ຕົວສະແດງຜົນ (renderer) ປັດຈຸບັນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:468
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.4, you can check which renderer is currently used with the "
"built-in defines ``CURRENT_RENDERER``, ``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY``, "
"``RENDERER_MOBILE``, and ``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS``:"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຕົວສະແດງຜົນໃດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍຕົວແປທີ່ກຳ"
"ນົດມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວຄື ``CURRENT_RENDERER``, ``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY``, "
"``RENDERER_MOBILE``, ແລະ ``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:472
msgid ""
"``CURRENT_RENDERER`` is set to either ``0``, ``1``, or ``2`` depending on "
"the current renderer."
msgstr ""
"``CURRENT_RENDERER`` ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``0``, ``1``, ຫຼື ``2`` ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຕົວສະແດງຜົນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:474
msgid "``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY`` is always ``0``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY`` ແມ່ນເປັນ ``0`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:475
msgid "``RENDERER_MOBILE`` is always ``1``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_MOBILE`` ແມ່ນເປັນ ``1`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:476
msgid "``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS`` is always ``2``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS`` ແມ່ນເປັນ ``2`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.rst:478
msgid ""
"As an example, this shader sets ``ALBEDO`` to a different color in each "
"renderer:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, shader ນີ້ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``ALBEDO`` ເປັນສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະ renderer:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:4
msgid "Spatial shaders"
msgstr "ສະເປຊຽວເຊດເດີ (Spatial shaders)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:6
msgid ""
"Spatial shaders are used for shading 3D objects. They are the most complex "
"type of shader Godot offers. Spatial shaders are highly configurable with "
"different render modes and different rendering options (e.g. Subsurface "
"Scattering, Transmission, Ambient Occlusion, Rim lighting, etc.). Users can "
"optionally write vertex, fragment, and light processor functions to affect "
"how objects are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Spatial shaders ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການສີ ແລະ ແສງຂອງວັດຖຸ 3D. ພວກມັນເປັນປະເພດ shader ທີ່ມີຄວາມ"
"ຊັບຊ້ອນທີ່ສຸດທີ່ Godot ມີໃຫ້. Spatial shaders ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງດ້ວຍຮູບແບບການສະແດງຜົນ "
"(render modes) ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການສະແດງຜົນຕ່າງໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: Subsurface Scattering, "
"Transmission, Ambient Occlusion, Rim lighting, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກຂຽນຟັງຊັນປ"
"ະມວນຜົນ vertex, fragment, ແລະ light ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:14
msgid ""
"For visual examples of these render modes, see :ref:`Standard Material 3D "
"and ORM Material 3D<doc_standard_material_3d>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ render modes ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`Standard Material 3D ແລ"
"ະ ORM Material 3D<doc_standard_material_3d>`."

