msgid "Only draw depth for opaque geometry (not transparent)."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຄວາມເລິກ (depth) ສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ທຶບແສງ (opaque geometry) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:31
msgid "**depth_draw_always**"
msgstr "**depth_draw_always**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:31
msgid "Always draw depth (opaque and transparent)."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມຄວາມເລິກສະເໝີ (ທັງແບບທຶບແສງ ແລະ ໂປ່ງໃສ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:33
msgid "**depth_draw_never**"
msgstr "**depth_draw_never**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:33
msgid "Never draw depth."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແຕ້ມຄວາມເລິກຈັກເທື່ອ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:35
msgid "**depth_prepass_alpha**"
msgstr "**depth_prepass_alpha**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:35
msgid "Do opaque depth pre-pass for transparent geometry."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການປະມວນຜົນຄວາມເລິກແບບທຶບແສງລ່ວງໜ້າ (pre-pass) ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດແບບໂປ່ງໃສ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:37
msgid "**depth_test_disabled**"
msgstr "**depth_test_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:37
msgid "Disable depth testing."
msgstr "ປິດການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:39
msgid "**depth_test_default**"
msgstr "**depth_test_default**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:39
msgid ""
"Depth test will discard the pixel if it is behind other pixels. In Forward+ "
"only, the pixel is also discarded if it's at the exact same depth as another "
"pixel."
msgstr ""
"ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກຈະຖິ້ມພິກເຊວຖ້າມັນຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງພິກເຊວອື່ນ. ໃນ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຖິ້ມຄືກັນຖ້"
"າມັນຢູ່ທີ່ຄວາມເລິກດຽວກັນກັບພິກເຊວອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:42
msgid "**depth_test_inverted**"
msgstr "**depth_test_inverted**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:42
msgid ""
"Depth test will discard the pixel if it is in front of other pixels. Useful "
"for stencil effects."
msgstr ""
"ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກຈະຖິ້ມພິກເຊວຖ້າມັນຢູ່ທາງໜ້າພິກເຊວອື່ນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ stencil."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:44
msgid "**sss_mode_skin**"
msgstr "**sss_mode_skin**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:44
msgid ""
"Subsurface Scattering mode for skin (optimizes visuals for human skin, e.g. "
"boosted red channel)."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ (Subsurface Scattering) ສຳລັບຜິວໜັງ (ປັບແຕ່ງການສະແດງຜົນສຳລັບຜິວໜັງມ"
"ະນຸດ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງສີແດງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:46
msgid "**cull_back**"
msgstr "**cull_back**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:46
msgid "Cull back-faces (default)."
msgstr "ຄັດໃບໜ້າດ້ານຫຼັງອອກ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:48
msgid "**cull_front**"
msgstr "**cull_front**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:48
msgid "Cull front-faces."
msgstr "ຄັດໃບໜ້າດ້ານໜ້າອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:50
msgid "**cull_disabled**"
msgstr "**cull_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:50
msgid "Culling disabled (double sided)."
msgstr "ປິດການຄັດອອກ (ສະແດງທັງສອງດ້ານ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:52
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:31
msgid "**unshaded**"
msgstr "**unshaded**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:52
msgid ""
"Result is just albedo. No lighting/shading happens in material, making it "
"faster to render."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ albedo. ບໍ່ມີການໃຫ້ແສງ/ເງົາເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນວັດສະດຸ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:54
msgid "**wireframe**"
msgstr "**wireframe**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:54
msgid ""
"Geometry draws using lines (useful for troubleshooting). When using the "
"Compatibility renderer, you must call "
"``RenderingServer.set_debug_generate_wireframes(true)`` *before* the mesh is "
"loaded for wireframe rendering to work. In the Compatibility renderer, "
"backface culling is always disabled in wireframe mode, while in the Forward+ "
"and Mobile renderers, the cull mode is respected."
msgstr ""
"ເລຂາຄະນິດຈະແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນ (ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວສະແດງຜົນ "
"Compatibility, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ ``RenderingServer.set_debug_generate_wireframes"
"(true)`` *ກ່ອນ* ທີ່ເມດຊ໌ (mesh) ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນແບບໂຄງເສັ້ນ (wireframe) ເຮັດວ"
"ຽກໄດ້. ໃນຕົວສະແດງຜົນ Compatibility, ການຄັດໃບໜ້າດ້ານຫຼັງຈະຖືກປິດຕະຫຼອດໃນໂໝດ wireframe, ໃນ"
"ຂະນະທີ່ຕົວສະແດງຜົນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ໂໝດການຄັດອອກຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:60
msgid "**debug_shadow_splits**"
msgstr "**debug_shadow_splits**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:60
msgid ""
"Directional shadows are drawn using different colors for each split (useful "
"for troubleshooting)."
msgstr ""
"ເງົາແບບມີທິດທາງ (Directional shadows) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ (ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳ"
"ລັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:62
msgid "**diffuse_burley**"
msgstr "**diffuse_burley**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:62
msgid "Burley (Disney PBS) for diffuse (default)."
msgstr "Burley (Disney PBS) ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍແສງ (diffuse) (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:64
msgid "**diffuse_lambert**"
msgstr "**diffuse_lambert**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:64
msgid "Lambert shading for diffuse."
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ເງົາແບບ Lambert ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:66
msgid "**diffuse_lambert_wrap**"
msgstr "**diffuse_lambert_wrap**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:66
msgid "Lambert-wrap shading (roughness-dependent) for diffuse."
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ເງົາແບບ Lambert-wrap (ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມຂຸຂະ) ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:68
msgid "**diffuse_toon**"
msgstr "**diffuse_toon**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:68
msgid "Toon shading for diffuse."
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ເງົາແບບກາຕູນ (Toon shading) ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:70
msgid "**specular_schlick_ggx**"
msgstr "**specular_schlick_ggx**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:70
msgid "Schlick-GGX for direct light specular lobes (default)."
msgstr ""
"Schlick-GGX ສຳລັບລັດສະໝີແສງສະທ້ອນໂດຍກົງ (direct light specular lobes) (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:72
msgid "**specular_toon**"
msgstr "**specular_toon**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:72
msgid "Toon for direct light specular lobes."
msgstr "ກາຕູນ (Toon) ສຳລັບລັດສະໝີແສງສະທ້ອນໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:74
msgid "**specular_disabled**"
msgstr "**specular_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:74
msgid ""
"Disable direct light specular lobes. Doesn't affect reflected light (use "
"``SPECULAR = 0.0`` instead)."
msgstr ""
"ປິດລັດສະໝີແສງສະທ້ອນໂດຍກົງ. ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ແສງສະທ້ອນ (ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``SPECULAR = 0.0`` ແທນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:76
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:35
msgid "**skip_vertex_transform**"
msgstr "**skip_vertex_transform**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:76
msgid ""
"``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, and ``BITANGENT`` need to be "
"transformed manually in the ``vertex()`` function."
msgstr ""
"``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, ແລະ ``BITANGENT`` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແປງຄ່າດ້ວ"
"ຍຕົນເອງໃນຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:79
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:38
msgid "**world_vertex_coords**"
msgstr "**world_vertex_coords**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:79
msgid ""
"``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, and ``BITANGENT`` are modified in world "
"space instead of model space."
msgstr ""
"``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, ແລະ ``BITANGENT`` ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ "
"(world space) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໂມເດລ (model space)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:82
msgid "**ensure_correct_normals**"
msgstr "**ensure_correct_normals**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:82
msgid ""
"Use when non-uniform scale is applied to mesh *(note: currently "
"unimplemented)*."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການປັບຂະໜາດທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີກັບເມດຊ໌ (mesh) *(ໝາຍເຫດ: ປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດ)*."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:84
msgid "**shadows_disabled**"
msgstr "**shadows_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:84
msgid ""
"Disable computing shadows in shader. The shader will not receive shadows, "
"but can still cast them."
msgstr "ປິດການຄິດໄລ່ເງົາໃນເຊດເດີ. ເຊດເດີຈະບໍ່ຮັບເງົາ, ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດສ້າງເງົາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:86
msgid "**ambient_light_disabled**"
msgstr "**ambient_light_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:86
msgid "Disable contribution from ambient light and radiance map."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການຮັບແສງຈາກແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light) ແລະ ແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີ (radiance map)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:88
msgid "**shadow_to_opacity**"
msgstr "**shadow_to_opacity**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:92
msgid "**vertex_lighting**"
msgstr "**vertex_lighting**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:92
msgid "Use vertex-based lighting instead of per-pixel lighting."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການໃຫ້ແສງແບບອີງຕາມເວີເທັກຊ໌ (vertex-based) ແທນການໃຫ້ແສງແບບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ (per-pixel)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:94
msgid "**particle_trails**"
msgstr "**particle_trails**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:94
msgid "Enables the trails when used on particle geometry."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫາງ (trails) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບເລຂາຄະນິດພາກທິເຄິນ (particle geometry)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:96
msgid "**alpha_to_coverage**"
msgstr "**alpha_to_coverage**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:96
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:98
msgid ""
"Alpha antialiasing mode, see `here <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"pull/40364>`_ for more."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຕ້ານຮອຍຢັກຂອງອາວຟາ (Alpha antialiasing), ເບິ່ງ `ທີ່ນີ້ <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/pull/40364>`_ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:98
msgid "**alpha_to_coverage_and_one**"
msgstr "**alpha_to_coverage_and_one**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:100
msgid "**fog_disabled**"
msgstr "**fog_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:100
msgid ""
"Disable receiving depth-based or volumetric fog. Useful for ``blend_add`` "
"materials like particles."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການຮັບໝອກແບບອີງຕາມຄວາມເລິກ ຫຼື ໝອກແບບມີບໍລິມາດ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດສະດຸ ``blend_add`` ເຊັ່ນ "
"ພາກທິເຄິນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:104
msgid "Stencil modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດສະເຕນຊິນ (Stencil modes)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:108
msgid ""
"Stencil support is experimental, use at your own risk. We will try to not "
"break compatibility as much as possible, but if significant flaws are found "
"in the API, it may change in the next minor version."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບ Stencil ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທົດລອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງທ່ານເອງ. ພວກເຮົາຈະພະຍາຍາມບໍ່ໃ"
"ຫ້ມັນມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, ແຕ່ຫາກພົບຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງທີ່ສຳຄັນໃນ API, ມັນອາດຈະມີການ"
"ປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:113
msgid ""
"Stencil operations are a set of operations that allow writing to an "
"efficient buffer in an hardware-accelerated manner. This is generally used "
"to mask in or out parts of the scene."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການ Stencil ແມ່ນຊຸດການດຳເນີນການທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂຽນລົງໃນບັບເຟີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນລັກສະນະເລັ່ງ"
"ດ້ວຍຮາດແວ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອມາກຊ໌ (mask) ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງສາກເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:117
msgid "Some of the most well-known uses are:"
msgstr "ບາງການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:119
msgid ""
"Outlines: Mask out the inner mesh that is being outlined to avoid inner "
"outlines."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຂອບ: ມາກຊ໌ (Mask) ເມດຊ໌ດ້ານໃນທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບອອກ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນເສັ້ນຂອບດ້ານໃນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:120
msgid "X-Ray: Display a mesh behind other objects."
msgstr "ເອັກຊ໌ເຣ (X-Ray): ສະແດງເມດຊ໌ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງວັດຖຸອື່ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:121
msgid ""
"Portals: Draw geometry that is normally \"impossible\" (non-Euclidian) by "
"masking objects."
msgstr ""
"ພໍທັລ (Portals): ແຕ້ມເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ປົກກະຕິ \"ເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້\" (ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບຢູຄຼິດ) ໂດຍການມາກຊ໌ວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:125
msgid ""
"You can only read from the stencil buffer in the transparent pass. Any "
"attempt to read in the opaque pass will fail, as it's currently not "
"supported behavior."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດອ່ານຈາກ Stencil buffer ໄດ້ໃນການຜ່ານແບບໂປ່ງໃສ (transparent pass) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກາ"
"ນພະຍາຍາມອ່ານໃນການຜ່ານແບບທຶບແສງ (opaque pass) ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ເນື່ອງຈາກປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບພຶດຕິກ"
"ຳດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:128
msgid ""
"Note that for compositor effects, the main renderer's stencil buffer can't "
"be copied to a custom texture."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຄອມໂພຊິເຕີ (compositor effects), Stencil buffer ຂອງຕົວສະແດງຜົນຫຼັ"
"ກບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກກັອບປີ້ໄປຍັງເທັກເຈີແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:132
msgid "Stencil mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດສະເຕນຊິນ (Stencil mode)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:134
msgid "**read**"
msgstr "**read**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:134
msgid "Read from the stencil buffer."
msgstr "ອ່ານຈາກ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:136
msgid "**write**"
msgstr "**write**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:136
msgid "Write reference value to the stencil buffer."
msgstr "ຂຽນຄ່າອ້າງອີງລົງໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:138
msgid "**write_if_depth_fail**"
msgstr "**write_if_depth_fail**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:138
msgid "Write reference value to the stencil buffer if the depth test fails."
msgstr "ຂຽນຄ່າອ້າງອີງລົງໃນ Stencil buffer ຫາກການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:140
msgid "**compare_always**"
msgstr "**compare_always**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:140
msgid "Always pass stencil test."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:142
msgid "**compare_equal**"
msgstr "**compare_equal**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:142
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is equal to the stencil buffer "
"value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງເທົ່າກັບຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:144
msgid "**compare_not_equal**"
msgstr "**compare_not_equal**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:144
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is not equal to the stencil buffer "
"value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:146
msgid "**compare_less**"
msgstr "**compare_less**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:146
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is less than the stencil buffer "
"value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງໜ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:148
msgid "**compare_less_or_equal**"
msgstr "**compare_less_or_equal**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:148
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is less than or equal to the "
"stencil buffer value."
msgstr ""
"ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:150
msgid "**compare_greater**"
msgstr "**compare_greater**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:150
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is greater than the stencil buffer "
"value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:152
msgid "**compare_greater_or_equal**"
msgstr "**compare_greater_or_equal**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:152
msgid ""
"Pass stencil test if the reference value is greater than or equal to the "
"stencil buffer value."
msgstr ""
"ຜ່ານການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິນຫາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າໃນ Stencil buffer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:156
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:42
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:46
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:140
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:22
msgid "Built-ins"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນ (Built-ins)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:158
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:44
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:48
msgid ""
"Values marked as ``in`` are read-only. Values marked as ``out`` can "
"optionally be written to and will not necessarily contain sensible values. "
"Values marked as ``inout`` provide a sensible default value, and can "
"optionally be written to. Samplers cannot be written to so they are not "
"marked."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ໝາຍວ່າ ``in`` ແມ່ນໃຫ້ອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ. ຄ່າທີ່ໝາຍວ່າ ``out`` ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລ"
"ະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ໝາຍວ່າ ``inout`` ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃຫ້ ແລະ ສາມາ"
"ດຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ສຳລັບ Samplers ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍໃດໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:162
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:48
msgid ""
"Not all built-ins are available in all processing functions. To access a "
"vertex built-in from the ``fragment()`` function, you can use "
"a :ref:`varying <doc_shading_language_varyings>`. The same applies for "
"accessing fragment built-ins from the ``light()`` function."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວແປພາຍໃນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນທຸກຟັງຊັນການປະມວນຜົນ. ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວແປພາຍໃນຂອງ vertex ຈາກຟັ"
"ງຊັນ ``fragment()``, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`varying <doc_shading_language_varyings>"
"`. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວແປພາຍໃນຂອງ fragment ຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``light()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:167
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:53
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:53
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:147
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:29
msgid "Global built-ins"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນແບບສາກົນ (Global built-ins)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:169
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:55
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:55
msgid "Global built-ins are available everywhere, including custom functions."
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນແບບສາກົນແມ່ນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຸກບ່ອນ, ລວມທັງໃນຟັງຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:172
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:245
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:368
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:575
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:58
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:108
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:218
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:305
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:58
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:139
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:156
