msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:174
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:60
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:60
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:157
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:36
msgid "in float **TIME**"
msgstr "in float **TIME**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:174
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:60
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:60
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:157
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:36
msgid ""
"Global time since the engine has started, in seconds. It repeats after every "
"``3,600`` seconds (which can be changed with "
"the :ref:`rollover<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/limits/time/"
"time_rollover_secs>` setting). It's affected "
"by :ref:`time_scale<class_Engine_property_time_scale>` but not by pausing. "
"If you need a ``TIME`` variable that is not affected by time scale, add your "
"own :ref:`global shader uniform<doc_shading_language_global_uniforms>` and "
"update it each frame."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາສາກົນນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ເອນຈິນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ເປັນວິນາທີ. ມັນຈະເລີ່ມຄືນໃໝ່ທຸກໆ ``3,600`` ວິນາທີ (ເຊິ່ງສາມາ"
"ດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`rollover<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/"
"limits/time/time_rollover_secs>`). ມັນໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ "
":ref:`time_scale<class_Engine_property_time_scale>` ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາ"
"ວ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕົວແປ ``TIME`` ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ time scale, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ :ref:`global "
"shader uniform<doc_shading_language_global_uniforms>` ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ແລະ ອັບເດດມັນໃນ"
"ແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:182
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:69
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:69
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:186
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:45
msgid "in float **PI**"
msgstr "in float **PI**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:182
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:69
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:69
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:186
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:45
msgid ""
"A ``PI`` constant (``3.141592``). The ratio of a circle's circumference to "
"its diameter and the number of radians in a half turn."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ``PI`` (``3.141592``). ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຮອບວົງຕໍ່ກັບເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຂອງມັນ ແລະ ຈຳນວນເ"
"ຣດຽນໃນເຄິ່ງຮອບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:185
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:72
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:72
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:189
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:48
msgid "in float **TAU**"
msgstr "in float **TAU**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:185
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:72
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:72
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:189
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:48
msgid ""
"A ``TAU`` constant (``6.283185``). Equivalent to ``PI * 2`` and the number "
"of radians in a full turn."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ``TAU`` (``6.283185``). ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ ``PI * 2`` ແລະ ຈຳນວນເຣດຽນໃນໜຶ່ງຮອບເຕັມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:188
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:75
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:75
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:192
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:51
msgid "in float **E**"
msgstr "in float **E**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:188
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:75
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:75
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:192
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:51
msgid ""
"An ``E`` constant (``2.718281``). Euler's number, the base of the natural "
"logarithm."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ``E`` (``2.718281``). ເລກຂອງອອຍເລີ (Euler), ເຊິ່ງເປັນຖານຂອງລໍກາຣິດທຳທຳມະຊາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:190
msgid "in bool **OUTPUT_IS_SRGB**"
msgstr "in bool **OUTPUT_IS_SRGB**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:190
msgid ""
"``true`` when output is in sRGB color space (this is ``true`` in the "
"Compatibility renderer, ``false`` in Forward+ and Mobile)."
msgstr ""
"ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``true`` ເມື່ອຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ sRGB (ເປັນ ``true`` ໃນຕົວສະແດງຜົນ "
"Compatibility, ແລະ ເປັນ ``false`` ໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:193
msgid "in float **CLIP_SPACE_FAR**"
msgstr "in float **CLIP_SPACE_FAR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:193
msgid ""
"Clip space far ``z`` value. In the Forward+ or Mobile renderers, it's "
"``0.0``. In the Compatibility renderer, it's ``-1.0``."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ ``z`` ດ້ານໄກຂອງ Clip space. ໃນຕົວສະແດງຜົນ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile, ມັນຄື ``0.0``. ໃນຕົ"
"ວສະແດງຜົນ Compatibility, ມັນຄື ``-1.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:197
msgid "in bool **IS_MULTIVIEW**"
msgstr "in bool **IS_MULTIVIEW**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:197
msgid ""
"``true`` when output is stereoscopic (XR), ``false`` when output is "
"monoscopic."
msgstr ""
"ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``true`` ເມື່ອຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເປັນແບບສະເຕຣິໂອສະໂກປິກ (XR), ແລະ ເປັນ ``false`` ເມື່ອຜົນໄດ້ຮັ"
"ບເປັນແບບໂມໂນສະໂກປິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:199
msgid "in bool **IN_SHADOW_PASS**"
msgstr "in bool **IN_SHADOW_PASS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:199
msgid ""
"``true`` when the shader is being rendered in a shadow mapping pass, "
"``false`` otherwise. This can be used to render objects differently in "
"shadow maps compared to their regular rendering."
msgstr ""
"ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``true`` ເມື່ອເຊດເດີກຳລັງຖືກສະແດງຜົນໃນການຜ່ານແບບແຜນຜັງເງົາ (shadow mapping "
"pass), ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ ``false``. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນວັດຖຸໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ ເມື່"
"ອທຽບກັບການສະແດງຜົນປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:204
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:80
msgid "Vertex built-ins"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນຂອງ Vertex"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:206
msgid ""
"Vertex data (``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, and ``BITANGENT``) are "
"presented in model space (also called local space). If not written to, these "
"values will not be modified and be passed through as they came, then "
"transformed into view space to be used in ``fragment()``."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນ Vertex (``VERTEX``, ``NORMAL``, ``TANGENT``, ແລະ ``BITANGENT``) ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃ"
"ນພື້ນທີ່ໂມເດລ (model space) (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າ ພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ local space). ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຂຽນທັບ, ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້"
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຕາມເດີມ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ (view space) ເພື່ອໃຊ້"
"ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:210
msgid ""
"They can optionally be presented in world space by using the "
"``world_vertex_coords`` render mode."
msgstr ""
"ພວກມັນສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ (world space) ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ "
"``world_vertex_coords``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:212
msgid ""
"Users can disable the built-in modelview transform (projection will still "
"happen later) and do it manually with the following code:"
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດການແປງຄ່າ modelview ພາຍໃນ (ການສາຍພາບ projection ຈະຍັງຄົງເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍຫຼັງ) ແລ"
"ະ ເຮັດມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍລະຫັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:227
msgid ""
"Other built-ins, such as ``UV``, ``UV2``, and ``COLOR``, are also passed "
"through to the ``fragment()`` function if not modified."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແປພາຍໃນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ``UV``, ``UV2``, ແລະ ``COLOR`` ກໍ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຍັງຟັງຊັນ ``fragment"
"()`` ເຊັ່ນກັນຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:229
msgid ""
"Users can override the modelview and projection transforms using the "
"``POSITION`` built-in. If ``POSITION`` is written to anywhere in the shader, "
"it will always be used, so the user becomes responsible for ensuring that it "
"always has an acceptable value. When ``POSITION`` is used, the value from "
"``VERTEX`` is ignored and projection does not happen. However, the value "
"passed to the fragment shader still comes from ``VERTEX``."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຂຽນທັບການແປງຄ່າ modelview ແລະ projection ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວແປພາຍໃນ "
"``POSITION``. ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນ ``POSITION`` ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍ່ຕາມໃນເຊດເດີ, ມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເໝີ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການກວດສອບວ່າມັນມີຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມຢູ່ສະເໝີ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``POSITION``, ຄ່າຈາກ "
"``VERTEX`` ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ການສາຍພາບ projection ຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໄປ"
"ຍັງ fragment shader ຍັງຄົງມາຈາກ ``VERTEX``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:234
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:100
msgid ""
"For instancing, the ``INSTANCE_CUSTOM`` variable contains the instance "
"custom data. When using particles, this information is usually:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການເຮັດສຳເນົາ (instancing), ຕົວແປ ``INSTANCE_CUSTOM`` ຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຂອງອິນສະແຕ"
"ນຊ໌ (instance). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ພາກທິເຄິນ (particles), ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມັກຈະເປັນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:237
