"ລະ ``zw`` ແມ່ນ UV4."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:336
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:149
msgid "in vec4 **CUSTOM1**"
msgstr "in vec4 **CUSTOM1**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:336
msgid ""
"Custom value from vertex primitive. When using extra UVs, ``xy`` is UV5 and "
"``zw`` is UV6."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າກຳນົດເອງຈາກເວີເທັກຊ໌ພຣິມິທີບ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ UV ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ``xy`` ແມ່ນ UV5 ແລະ ``zw`` ແມ່ນ UV6."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:339
msgid "in vec4 **CUSTOM2**"
msgstr "in vec4 **CUSTOM2**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:339
msgid ""
"Custom value from vertex primitive. When using extra UVs, ``xy`` is UV7 and "
"``zw`` is UV8."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າກຳນົດເອງຈາກເວີເທັກຊ໌ພຣິມິທີບ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ UV ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ``xy`` ແມ່ນ UV7 ແລະ ``zw`` ແມ່ນ UV8."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:342
msgid "in vec4 **CUSTOM3**"
msgstr "in vec4 **CUSTOM3**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:342
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:147
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:149
msgid "Custom value from vertex primitive."
msgstr "ຄ່າກຳນົດເອງຈາກເວີເທັກຊ໌ພຣິມິທີບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:344
msgid "out float **Z_CLIP_SCALE**"
msgstr "out float **Z_CLIP_SCALE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:344
msgid ""
"If written to on any branch, scales the vertex towards the camera to avoid "
"clipping into things like walls. Lighting and shadows will continue to work "
"correctly when this is written to, but screen-space effects like SSAO and "
"SSR may break with lower scales. Try to keep this value as close to ``1.0`` "
"as possible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຈະປັບຂະໜາດເວີເທັກຊ໌ເຂົ້າຫາກ້ອງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຕັດ (clipping) ເຂົ້າໄ"
"ປໃນສິ່ງຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນຝາ. ການໃຫ້ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນນີ້, ແຕ່ເ"
"ອັບເຟັກ Screen-space ເຊັ່ນ SSAO ແລະ SSR ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາຫາກໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳ. ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄ"
"ຽງກັບ ``1.0`` ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:354
msgid ""
"``MODELVIEW_MATRIX`` combines both the ``MODEL_MATRIX`` and ``VIEW_MATRIX`` "
"and is better suited when floating point issues may arise. For example, if "
"the object is very far away from the world origin, you may run into floating "
"point issues when using the separated ``MODEL_MATRIX`` and ``VIEW_MATRIX``."
msgstr ""
"``MODELVIEW_MATRIX`` ຮວມທັງ ``MODEL_MATRIX`` ແລະ ``VIEW_MATRIX`` ເຂົ້າກັນ ແລະ ເໝາ"
"ະສົມກວ່າເມື່ອອາດຈະເກີດບັນຫາເລກເສດສ່ວນ (floating point). ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ຫາກວັດຖຸຢູ່ໄກຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີ"
"ດຂອງໂລກຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາເລກເສດສ່ວນເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``MODEL_MATRIX`` ແລະ "
"``VIEW_MATRIX`` ແຍກກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:358
msgid ""
"``INV_VIEW_MATRIX`` is the matrix used for rendering the object in that "
"pass, unlike ``MAIN_CAM_INV_VIEW_MATRIX``, which is the matrix of the camera "
"in the scene. In the shadow pass, ``INV_VIEW_MATRIX``'s view is based on the "
"camera that is located at the position of the light."
msgstr ""
"``INV_VIEW_MATRIX`` ແມ່ນມາຕຣິກຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນວັດຖຸໃນການຜ່ານນັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ "
"``MAIN_CAM_INV_VIEW_MATRIX`` ທີ່ເປັນມາຕຣິກຊ໌ຂອງກ້ອງໃນສາກ. ໃນການຜ່ານແບບເງົາ (shadow "
"pass), ມຸມມອງຂອງ ``INV_VIEW_MATRIX`` ຈະອີງຕາມກ້ອງທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:361
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:155
msgid "Fragment built-ins"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນຂອງ Fragment"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:363
msgid ""
"The default use of a Godot fragment processor function is to set up the "
"material properties of your object and to let the built-in renderer handle "
"the final shading. However, you are not required to use all these "
"properties, and if you don't write to them, Godot will optimize away the "
"corresponding functionality."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການປະມວນຜົນ fragment ຂອງ Godot ຕາມປົກກະຕິແມ່ນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດວັດສະດຸຂອງວັດຖຸຂ"
"ອງທ່ານ ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຕົວສະແດງຜົນພາຍໃນຈັດການກັບການໃຫ້ເງົາຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້"
"ອງໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແລະ ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຂຽນໃສ່ພວກມັນ, Godot ຈະປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍການຕັດການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ກ່ຽວ"
"ຂ້ອງອອກໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:372
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:579
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:220
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:307
msgid "in vec4 **FRAGCOORD**"
msgstr "in vec4 **FRAGCOORD**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:372
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:579
msgid ""
"Coordinate of pixel center in screen space. ``xy`` specifies position in "
"window. Upper-left of the viewport is the origin, ``(0.0, 0.0)``. Bottom-"
"right of the viewport is ``(1.0, 1.0)``. ``z`` specifies fragment depth. It "
"is also used as the output value for the fragment depth unless ``DEPTH`` is "
"written to."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດຂອງຈຸດສູນກາງພິກເຊວໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (screen space). ``xy`` ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ. ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອ"
"ງວິວພອດແມ່ນຈຸດກຳເນີດ ``(0.0, 0.0)``. ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມຂອງວິວພອດແມ່ນ ``(1.0, 1.0)``. ``z`` ລະບຸ"
"ຄວາມເລິກຂອງ fragment. ມັນຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຳລັບຄວາມເລິກຂອງ fragment ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າມີກາ"
"ນຂຽນລົງໃນ ``DEPTH``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:377
msgid "in bool **FRONT_FACING**"
msgstr "in bool **FRONT_FACING**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:377
msgid "``true`` if current face is front facing, ``false`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``true`` ຫາກໃບໜ້າປະຈຸບັນຫັນໄປທາງໜ້າ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ ``false``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:379
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:603
msgid "in vec3 **VIEW**"
msgstr "in vec3 **VIEW**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:379
msgid ""
"Normalized vector from fragment position to camera (in view space). This is "
"the same for both perspective and orthogonal cameras."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ (normalized vector) ຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງ fragment ໄປຫາ ກ້ອງ (ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ view "
"space). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຄືກັນທັງກ້ອງແບບ perspective ແລະ orthogonal."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:382
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:599
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:250
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:315
msgid "in vec2 **UV**"
msgstr "in vec2 **UV**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:382
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:599
msgid "UV that comes from the ``vertex()`` function."
msgstr "ຄ່າ UV ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:384
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:601
msgid "in vec2 **UV2**"
msgstr "in vec2 **UV2**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:384
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:601
msgid "UV2 that comes from the ``vertex()`` function."
msgstr "ຄ່າ UV2 ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:386
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:313
msgid "in vec4 **COLOR**"
msgstr "in vec4 **COLOR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:386
msgid "COLOR that comes from the ``vertex()`` function."
msgstr "ຄ່າ COLOR ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:388
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:236
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:326
msgid "in vec2 **POINT_COORD**"
msgstr "in vec2 **POINT_COORD**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:388
msgid "Point coordinate for drawing points with ``POINT_SIZE``."
msgstr "ພິກັດຈຸດສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຈຸດດ້ວຍ ``POINT_SIZE``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:392
msgid ""
"Model/local space to world space transform for normals. This is the same as "
"``MODEL_MATRIX`` by default unless the object is scaled non-uniformly, in "
"which case this is set to ``transpose(inverse(mat3(MODEL_MATRIX)))``."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຄ່າຈາກພື້ນທີ່ໂມເດລ/ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກສຳລັບຄ່ານໍມໍ (normals). ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຄືກັນກັບ "
"``MODEL_MATRIX`` ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າວັດຖຸຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"``transpose(inverse(mat3(MODEL_MATRIX)))``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:400
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:591
msgid "in mat4 **PROJECTION_MATRIX**"
msgstr "in mat4 **PROJECTION_MATRIX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:415
msgid "in vec3 **VERTEX**"
msgstr "in vec3 **VERTEX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:415
msgid ""
"Position of the fragment (pixel), in view space. It is the ``VERTEX`` value "
"from ``vertex()`` interpolated between the face's vertices and transformed "
"into view space. If ``skip_vertex_transform`` is enabled, it may not be in "
"view space."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ fragment (ພິກເຊວ), ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ (view space). ມັນແມ່ນຄ່າ ``VERTEX`` ຈາກ "
"``vertex()`` ທີ່ຖືກແຊກຄ່າ (interpolated) ລະຫວ່າງເວີເທັກຊ໌ຂອງໃບໜ້າ ແລະ ຖືກແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອ"
"ງ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ ``skip_vertex_transform``, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:419
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:273
msgid "inout vec3 **LIGHT_VERTEX**"
msgstr "inout vec3 **LIGHT_VERTEX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:419
msgid ""
"A writable version of ``VERTEX`` that can be used to alter light and "
"shadows. Writing to this will not change the position of the fragment."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຂອງ ``VERTEX`` ທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ. ການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນນີ້"
"ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ fragment."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:422
msgid ""
"The view that we are rendering. Used to distinguish between views in "
"multiview/stereo rendering. ``VIEW_MONO_LEFT`` (``0``) for Mono (not "
"multiview) or left eye, ``VIEW_RIGHT`` (``1``) for right eye."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກແຍະລະຫວ່າງມຸມມອງໃນການສະແດງຜົນແບບ multiview/"
"stereo. ``VIEW_MONO_LEFT`` (``0``) ສຳລັບແບບ Mono (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ multiview) ຫຼື ຕາເບື້ອງຊ້າ"
"ຍ, ``VIEW_RIGHT`` (``1``) ສຳລັບຕາເບື້ອງຂວາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:433
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:257
msgid "sampler2D **SCREEN_TEXTURE**"
msgstr "sampler2D **SCREEN_TEXTURE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:433
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:257
msgid ""
"Removed in Godot 4. Use a ``sampler2D`` with ``hint_screen_texture`` instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນ Godot 4. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``sampler2D`` ພ້ອມກັບ ``hint_screen_texture`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:435
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:597
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:255
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:324
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:204
msgid "in vec2 **SCREEN_UV**"
msgstr "in vec2 **SCREEN_UV**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:435
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:597
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:255
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:324
msgid "Screen UV coordinate for the current pixel."
msgstr "ພິກັດ Screen UV ສຳລັບພິກເຊວປະຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:437
msgid "sampler2D **DEPTH_TEXTURE**"
msgstr "sampler2D **DEPTH_TEXTURE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:437
msgid ""
"Removed in Godot 4. Use a ``sampler2D`` with ``hint_depth_texture`` instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນ Godot 4. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``sampler2D`` ພ້ອມກັບ ``hint_depth_texture`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:439
msgid "out float **DEPTH**"
msgstr "out float **DEPTH**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:439
msgid ""
"Custom depth value (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``). If ``DEPTH`` is written to in any "
"shader branch, then you are responsible for setting ``DEPTH`` for **all** "
"other branches. Otherwise, the graphics API will leave them uninitialized."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມເລິກກຳນົດເອງ (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``). ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນ ``DEPTH`` ໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມຂອ"
"ງເຊດເດີ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``DEPTH`` ສຳລັບສ່ວນອື່ນໆ **ທັງໝົດ**. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"graphics API ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ພວກມັນບໍ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (uninitialized)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:443
msgid ""
"Normal that comes from the ``vertex()`` function, in view space. If "
"``skip_vertex_transform`` is enabled, it may not be in view space."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່ານໍມໍ (Normal) ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``, ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"``skip_vertex_transform``, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:446
msgid ""
"Tangent that comes from the ``vertex()`` function, in view space. If "
"``skip_vertex_transform`` is enabled, it may not be in view space."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທນເຈັນ (Tangent) ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``, ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"``skip_vertex_transform``, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:449
msgid ""
"Binormal that comes from the ``vertex()`` function, in view space. If "
"``skip_vertex_transform`` is enabled, it may not be in view space."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າໄບນໍມໍ (Binormal) ທີ່ມາຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``, ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"``skip_vertex_transform``, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:452
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:264
msgid "out vec3 **NORMAL_MAP**"
msgstr "out vec3 **NORMAL_MAP**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:452
msgid ""
"Set normal here in tangent space if reading normal from a texture instead of "
"``NORMAL``. The blue channel is ignored, as it's reconstructed in the engine "
"instead. This allows normal maps with :abbr:`RGTC (Red-Green Texture "
"Compression)` compression to work."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່ານໍມໍຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແທນເຈັນ (tangent space) ຫາກອ່ານຄ່ານໍມໍຈາກເທັກເຈີແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ "
"``NORMAL``. ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ໃນເອນຈິນແທນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແຜນຜັງນໍມໍ "
"(normal maps) ທີ່ມີການບີບອັດແບບ :abbr:`RGTC (Red-Green Texture Compression)` ສາມາດ"
"ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:456
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:267
msgid "out float **NORMAL_MAP_DEPTH**"
msgstr "out float **NORMAL_MAP_DEPTH**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:456
msgid "Depth from ``NORMAL_MAP``. Defaults to ``1.0``."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລິກຈາກ ``NORMAL_MAP``. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``1.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:458
msgid "out vec3 **BENT_NORMAL_MAP**"
msgstr "out vec3 **BENT_NORMAL_MAP**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:458
msgid ""
"Set bent normal map here in tangent space to enable :ref:`bent normals "
"<doc_standard_material_3d_bent_normal_map>`. This is used to improve "
"specular occlusion, and requires a specially authored bent normal map. The "
"blue channel is ignored, as it's reconstructed in the engine instead. This "
"allows bent normal maps with :abbr:`RGTC (Red-Green Texture Compression)` "
"compression to work."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜນຜັງ bent normal ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແທນເຈັນ ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`bent normals "
"<doc_standard_material_3d_bent_normal_map>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການບັງແສງສະທ້ອນ "
"(specular occlusion), ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຜນຜັງ bent normal ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນພິເສດ. ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ"
"ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ໃນເອນຈິນແທນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແຜນຜັງ bent normal ທີ່ມີການບີບອັ"
"ດແບບ :abbr:`RGTC (Red-Green Texture Compression)` ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:464
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:77
msgid "out vec3 **ALBEDO**"
msgstr "out vec3 **ALBEDO**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:464
msgid "Albedo (default white). Base color."
msgstr "Albedo (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີຂາວ). ສີພື້ນຖານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:466
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:633
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:214
msgid "out float **ALPHA**"
msgstr "out float **ALPHA**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:466
msgid ""
"Alpha (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``). If read from or written to, the material will "
"go to the transparent pipeline."
msgstr ""
"ອາວຟາ (Alpha) (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``). ຫາກມີການອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນລົງໄປ, ວັດສະດຸຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ຂະບວນການ"
"ສະແດງຜົນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ (transparent pipeline)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:469
msgid "out float **ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD**"
msgstr "out float **ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:469
msgid ""
"If written to on any branch, values below a certain amount of alpha are "
"discarded."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າລະດັບອາວຟາທີ່ກຳນົດຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:471
msgid "out float **ALPHA_HASH_SCALE**"
msgstr "out float **ALPHA_HASH_SCALE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:471
msgid ""
"Alpha hash scale when using the alpha hash transparency mode. Defaults to "
"``1.0``. Higher values result in more visible pixels in the dithering "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດອາວຟາແຮຊ (Alpha hash scale) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບ alpha hash. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ "
"``1.0``. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນພິກເຊວໃນຮູບແບບການກະຈາຍຈຸດ (dithering pattern) ໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:474
msgid "out float **ALPHA_ANTIALIASING_EDGE**"
msgstr "out float **ALPHA_ANTIALIASING_EDGE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:474
msgid ""
"The threshold below which alpha to coverage antialiasing should be used. "
"Defaults to ``0.0``. Requires the ``alpha_to_coverage`` render mode. Should "
"be set to a value lower than ``ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD`` to be effective."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ ຄວນຈະໃຊ້ການຕ້ານຮອຍຢັກແບບ alpha to coverage. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``0.0``. ຈຳ"
"ເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ ``alpha_to_coverage``. ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ "
"``ALPHA_SCISSOR_THRESHOLD`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:478
msgid "out vec2 **ALPHA_TEXTURE_COORDINATE**"
msgstr "out vec2 **ALPHA_TEXTURE_COORDINATE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:478
msgid ""
"The texture coordinate to use for alpha-to-coverge antialiasing. Requires "
"the ``alpha_to_coverage`` render mode. Typically set to ``UV * "
"vec2(albedo_texture_size)`` where ``albedo_texture_size`` is the size of the "
"albedo texture in pixels."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດເທັກເຈີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕ້ານຮອຍຢັກແບບ alpha-to-coverage. ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ "
"``alpha_to_coverage``. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ ``UV * vec2(albedo_texture_size)`` ເ"
"ຊິ່ງ ``albedo_texture_size`` ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງເທັກເຈີ albedo ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:482
msgid "out float **PREMUL_ALPHA_FACTOR**"
msgstr "out float **PREMUL_ALPHA_FACTOR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:482
msgid ""
"Premultiplied alpha factor. Only effective if ``render_mode "
"blend_premul_alpha;`` is used. This should be written to when using a "
"*shaded* material with premultiplied alpha blending for interaction with "
"lighting. This is not required for unshaded materials."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຕົວຄູນອາວຟາແບບຄິດໄລ່ລ່ວງໜ້າ (Premultiplied alpha factor). ຈະມີຜົນກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"``render_mode blend_premul_alpha;``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກຂຽນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸແບບ *ມີເງົາ (shaded)"
"* ພ້ອມກັບການປະສົມອາວຟາແບບຄິດໄລ່ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີປະຕິກິລິຍາກັບການໃຫ້ແສງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວັດສະດຸແບ"
"ບບໍ່ມີເງົາ (unshaded)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:486
msgid "out float **METALLIC**"
msgstr "out float **METALLIC**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:486
msgid "Metallic (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``)."
msgstr "ຄວາມເປັນໂລຫະ (Metallic) (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:488
msgid "out float **SPECULAR**"
msgstr "out float **SPECULAR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:488
msgid ""
"Specular (not physically accurate to change). Defaults to ``0.5``. ``0.0`` "
"disables reflections."
msgstr ""
"ແສງສະທ້ອນ (Specular) (ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``0.5``. ຄ່"
"າ ``0.0`` ຈະປິດການສະທ້ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:490
msgid "Roughness (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``)."
msgstr "ຄວາມຂຸຂະ (Roughness) (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:492
msgid "out float **RIM**"
msgstr "out float **RIM**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:492
msgid ""
"Rim (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``). If used, Godot calculates rim lighting. Rim size "
"depends on ``ROUGHNESS``."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຂອບ (Rim) (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``). ຫາກໃຊ້, Godot ຈະຄິດໄລ່ການໃຫ້ແສງຂອບ. ຂະໜາດຂອງແສ"
"ງຂອບຈະຂຶ້ນກັບ ``ROUGHNESS``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:495
msgid "out float **RIM_TINT**"
msgstr "out float **RIM_TINT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:495
msgid ""
"Rim Tint, range from ``0.0`` (white) to ``1.0`` (albedo). If used, Godot "
"calculates rim lighting."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງແສງຂອບ (Rim Tint), ຊ່ວງຈາກ ``0.0`` (ສີຂາວ) ຫາ ``1.0`` (ສີ albedo). ຫາກໃຊ້, "
"Godot ຈະຄິດໄລ່ການໃຫ້ແສງຂອບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:497
msgid "out float **CLEARCOAT**"
msgstr "out float **CLEARCOAT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:497
msgid ""
"Small specular blob added on top of the existing one. If used, Godot "
"calculates clearcoat."
msgstr ""
"ແສງສະທ້ອນຈຸດນ້ອຍໆທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທິງແສງສະທ້ອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກໃຊ້, Godot ຈະຄິດໄລ່ clearcoat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:499
msgid "out float **CLEARCOAT_GLOSS**"
msgstr "out float **CLEARCOAT_GLOSS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:499
msgid "Gloss of clearcoat. If used, Godot calculates clearcoat."
msgstr "ຄວາມເງົາຂອງ clearcoat. ຫາກໃຊ້, Godot ຈະຄິດໄລ່ clearcoat."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:501
msgid "out float **ANISOTROPY**"
msgstr "out float **ANISOTROPY**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:501
msgid "For distorting the specular blob according to tangent space."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການບິດເບືອນຈຸດແສງສະທ້ອນຕາມພື້ນທີ່ແທນເຈັນ (tangent space)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:503
msgid "out vec2 **ANISOTROPY_FLOW**"
msgstr "out vec2 **ANISOTROPY_FLOW**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:503
msgid "Distortion direction, use with flowmaps."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການບິດເບືອນ, ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ flowmaps."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:505
msgid "out float **SSS_STRENGTH**"
msgstr "out float **SSS_STRENGTH**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:505
msgid ""
"Strength of subsurface scattering. If used, subsurface scattering will be "
"applied to the object."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ (subsurface scattering). ຫາກໃຊ້, ການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວຈະຖືກ"
"ນຳໃຊ້ກັບວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:507
msgid "out vec4 **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_COLOR**"
msgstr "out vec4 **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_COLOR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:507
msgid ""
"Color of subsurface scattering transmittance. If used, subsurface scattering "
"transmittance will be applied to the object."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງການສ່ອງຜ່ານຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ຫາກໃຊ້, ການສ່ອງຜ່ານຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ"
"ວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:510
msgid "out float **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_DEPTH**"
msgstr "out float **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_DEPTH**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:510
msgid ""
"Depth of subsurface scattering transmittance. Higher values allow the effect "
"to reach deeper into the object."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລິກຂອງການສ່ອງຜ່ານຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້ເລິກຂຶ້ນໃນວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:513
msgid "out float **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_BOOST**"
msgstr "out float **SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_BOOST**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:513
msgid ""
"Boosts the subsurface scattering transmittance if set above ``0.0``. This "
"makes the effect show up even on directly lit surfaces"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການສ່ອງຜ່ານຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິວຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງກວ່າ ``0.0``. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເອັບເຟັກໄດ້ແມ້ແຕ່ຢູ່ເ"
"ທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:516
msgid "inout vec3 **BACKLIGHT**"
msgstr "inout vec3 **BACKLIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:516
msgid ""
"Color of backlighting (works like direct light, but it's received even if "
"the normal is slightly facing away from the light). If used, backlighting "
"will be applied to the object. Can be used as a cheaper approximation of "
"subsurface scattering."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງແສງຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງ (ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບແສງໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບແມ້ວ່າຄ່ານໍມໍຈະຫັນອອກຈາກແສງເລັກນ້ອຍ). ຫ"
"າກໃຊ້, ແສງຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບວັດຖຸ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນການປະມານຄ່າທີ່ປະຢັດກວ່າຂອງການກະຈາຍແສງໃຕ້ຜິ"
"ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:520
msgid "out float **AO**"
msgstr "out float **AO**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:520
msgid "Strength of ambient occlusion. For use with pre-baked AO."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງ Ambient Occlusion (AO). ສຳລັບໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ AO ທີ່ຖືກຄຳນວນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (pre-baked)"
"."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:522
msgid "out float **AO_LIGHT_AFFECT**"
msgstr "out float **AO_LIGHT_AFFECT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:522
msgid ""
"How much ambient occlusion affects direct light (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``, "
"default ``0.0``)."
msgstr ""
"Ambient occlusion ມີຜົນຕໍ່ແສງໂດຍກົງຫຼາຍປານໃດ (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``0.0``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:524
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.rst:83
msgid "out vec3 **EMISSION**"
msgstr "out vec3 **EMISSION**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:524
msgid "Emission color (can go over ``(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`` for HDR)."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງການແຜ່ລັງສີ (Emission) (ສາມາດສູງກວ່າ ``(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`` ສຳລັບ HDR)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:526
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:216
msgid "out vec4 **FOG**"
msgstr "out vec4 **FOG**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:526
msgid ""
"If written to on any branch, blends final pixel color with ``FOG.rgb`` based "
"on ``FOG.a``."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຈະປະສົມສີພິກເຊວສຸດທ້າຍກັບ ``FOG.rgb`` ໂດຍອີງຕາມ ``FOG.a``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:528
msgid "out vec4 **RADIANCE**"
msgstr "out vec4 **RADIANCE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:528
msgid ""
"If written to on any branch, blends environment map radiance with "
"``RADIANCE.rgb`` based on ``RADIANCE.a``."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຈະປະສົມລັດສະໝີ (radiance) ຂອງແຜນຜັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກັບ "
"``RADIANCE.rgb`` ໂດຍອີງຕາມ ``RADIANCE.a``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:531
msgid "out vec4 **IRRADIANCE**"
msgstr "out vec4 **IRRADIANCE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:531
msgid ""
"If written to on any branch, blends environment map irradiance with "
"``IRRADIANCE.rgb`` based on ``IRRADIANCE.a``."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຈະປະສົມການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງ (irradiance) ຂອງແຜນຜັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກັ"
"ບ ``IRRADIANCE.rgb`` ໂດຍອີງຕາມ ``IRRADIANCE.a``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:537
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:639
msgid ""
"Shaders going through the transparent pipeline when ``ALPHA`` is written to "
"may exhibit transparency sorting issues. Read the :ref:`transparency sorting "
"section in the 3D rendering limitations page "
"<doc_3d_rendering_limitations_transparency_sorting>` for more information "
"and ways to avoid issues."
msgstr ""
"ເຊດເດີທີ່ຜ່ານຂະບວນການສະແດງຜົນແບບໂປ່ງໃສເມື່ອມີການຂຽນລົງໃນ ``ALPHA`` ອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາການຈັດລໍາດັບ"
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ. ໃຫ້ອ່ານ :ref:`ພາກສ່ວນການຈັດລໍາດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໃນໜ້າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດການສະແດງຜົນ 3D "
"<doc_3d_rendering_limitations_transparency_sorting>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ວິທີການຫຼີ"
"ກເວັ້ນບັນຫາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:543
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:281
msgid "Light built-ins"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນຂອງ Light"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:545
msgid ""
"Writing light processor functions is completely optional. You can skip the "
"``light()`` function by using the ``unshaded`` render mode. If no light "
"function is written, Godot will use the material properties written to in "
"the ``fragment()`` function to calculate the lighting for you (subject to "
"the render mode)."
msgstr ""
"ການຂຽນຟັງຊັນການປະມວນຜົນແສງ (light processor) ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມຟັງຊັນ "
"``light()`` ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ ``unshaded``. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຂຽນຟັງຊັນແສງ, Godot ຈ"
"ະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດວັດສະດຸທີ່ຂຽນໄວ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()`` ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ການໃຫ້ແສງໃຫ້ທ່ານ (ຂຶ້ນກັບໂໝດການສະແ"
"ດງຜົນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:549
msgid ""
"The ``light()`` function is called for every light in every pixel. It is "
"called within a loop for each light type."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``light()`` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກໆແສງໃນທຸກໆພິກເຊວ. ມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນພາຍໃນລູບ (loop) ສຳລັບແ"
"ຕ່ລະປະເພດແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:551
msgid ""
"Below is an example of a custom ``light()`` function using a Lambertian "
"lighting model:"
msgstr ""
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຟັງຊັນ ``light()`` ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການໃຫ້ແສງ Lambertian:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:566
msgid ""
"If you want the lights to add together, add the light contribution to "
"``DIFFUSE_LIGHT`` using ``+=``, rather than overwriting it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແສງຮວມເຂົ້າກັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຜົນຂອງແສງເຂົ້າໃນ ``DIFFUSE_LIGHT`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``+=`` "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຂຽນທັບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:570
msgid ""
"The ``light()`` function won't be run if the ``vertex_lighting`` render mode "
"is enabled, or if :ref:`Rendering > Quality > Shading > Force Vertex "
"Shading<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_vertex_shading>` is enabled in the Project Settings. (It's enabled by "
"default on mobile platforms.)"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``light()`` ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ ``vertex_lighting``, ຫຼື ຫາກເປີດ"
"ໃຊ້ :ref:`Rendering > Quality > Shading > Force Vertex "
"Shading<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_vertex_shading>` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ. (ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນເວທີໂທລະສັບມືຖື.)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:595
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:311
msgid "in vec3 **NORMAL**"
msgstr "in vec3 **NORMAL**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:595
msgid "Normal vector, in view space."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີນໍມໍ (Normal vector), ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ (view space)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:603
msgid "View vector, in view space."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີມຸມມອງ (View vector), ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:605
msgid "in vec3 **LIGHT**"
msgstr "in vec3 **LIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:605
msgid "Light vector, in view space."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີແສງ (Light vector), ໃນພື້ນທີ່ມຸມມອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:607
msgid "in vec3 **LIGHT_COLOR**"
msgstr "in vec3 **LIGHT_COLOR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:607
msgid ""
":ref:`Light color<class_Light3D_property_light_color>` multiplied "
"by :ref:`light energy<class_Light3D_property_light_energy>` multiplied by "
"``PI``. The ``PI`` multiplication is present because physically-based "
"lighting models include a division by ``PI``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ສີຂອງແສງ (Light color)<class_Light3D_property_light_color>` ຄູນດ້ວຍ "
":ref:`ພະລັງງານແສງ (light energy)<class_Light3D_property_light_energy>` ຄູນດ້ວຍ "
"``PI``. ການຄູນດ້ວຍ ``PI`` ກໍ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບແບບການໃຫ້ແສງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກມີການຫານດ້ວຍ ``PI`` ເຂົ້ານຳ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:612
msgid "in float **SPECULAR_AMOUNT**"
msgstr "in float **SPECULAR_AMOUNT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:612
msgid ""
"For :ref:`class_OmniLight3D` and :ref:`class_SpotLight3D`, ``2.0`` "
"multiplied by :ref:`light_specular<class_Light3D_property_light_specular>`. "
"For :ref:`class_DirectionalLight3D`, ``1.0``."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ :ref:`class_OmniLight3D` ແລະ :ref:`class_SpotLight3D`, ແມ່ນ ``2.0`` ຄູນດ້ວ"
"ຍ :ref:`light_specular<class_Light3D_property_light_specular>`. ສຳລັບ "
":ref:`class_DirectionalLight3D`, ແມ່ນ ``1.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:617
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:340
msgid "in bool **LIGHT_IS_DIRECTIONAL**"
msgstr "in bool **LIGHT_IS_DIRECTIONAL**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:617
msgid "``true`` if this pass is a :ref:`class_DirectionalLight3D`."
msgstr "ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``true`` ຫາກການຜ່ານນີ້ແມ່ນ :ref:`class_DirectionalLight3D`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:619
msgid "in float **ATTENUATION**"
msgstr "in float **ATTENUATION**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:619
msgid "Attenuation based on distance or shadow."
msgstr "ການຫລຸດຜ່ອນແສງ (Attenuation) ໂດຍອີງຕາມໄລຍະທາງ ຫຼື ເງົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:621
msgid "in vec3 **ALBEDO**"
msgstr "in vec3 **ALBEDO**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:621
msgid "Base albedo."
msgstr "ຄ່າ albedo ພື້ນຖານ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:623
msgid "in vec3 **BACKLIGHT**"
msgstr "in vec3 **BACKLIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:625
msgid "in float **METALLIC**"
msgstr "in float **METALLIC**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:625
msgid "Metallic."
msgstr "ຄວາມເປັນໂລຫະ (Metallic)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:627
msgid "in float **ROUGHNESS**"
msgstr "in float **ROUGHNESS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:627
msgid "Roughness."
msgstr "ຄວາມຂຸຂະ (Roughness)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:629
msgid "out vec3 **DIFFUSE_LIGHT**"
msgstr "out vec3 **DIFFUSE_LIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:629
msgid "Diffuse light result."
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງແສງກະຈາຍ (Diffuse light)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:631
msgid "out vec3 **SPECULAR_LIGHT**"
msgstr "out vec3 **SPECULAR_LIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:631
msgid "Specular light result."
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງແສງສະທ້ອນ (Specular light)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:633
msgid ""
"Alpha (range ``[0.0, 1.0]``). If written to on any branch, the material will "
"go through the transparent pipeline."
msgstr ""
"ອາວຟາ (Alpha) (ຊ່ວງ ``[0.0, 1.0]``). ຫາກມີການຂຽນລົງໃນສ່ວນໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ວັດສະດຸຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ຂະບວນ"
"ການສະແດງຜົນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:644
msgid ""
"Transparent materials also cannot cast shadows or appear in "
"``hint_screen_texture`` and ``hint_depth_texture`` uniforms. This in turn "
"prevents those materials from appearing in screen-space reflections or "
"refraction. :ref:`SDFGI <doc_using_sdfgi>` sharp reflections are not visible "
"on transparent materials (only rough reflections are visible on transparent "
"materials)."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃສຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງເງົາ ຫຼື ປະກົດໃນ ``hint_screen_texture`` ແລະ "
"``hint_depth_texture`` ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນປະກົດຢູ່ໃນການສະທ້ອນ ຫຼື ການຫັກເຫແບ"
"ບ Screen-space. :ref:`SDFGI <doc_using_sdfgi>` ການສະທ້ອນທີ່ຄົມຊັດຈະບໍ່ເຫັນໃນວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃ"
"ສ (ເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ການສະທ້ອນແບບມົວໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:4
msgid "CanvasItem shaders"
msgstr "ເຊດເດີ CanvasItem"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:6
msgid ""
"CanvasItem shaders are used to draw all 2D elements in Godot. These include "
"all nodes that inherit from CanvasItems, and all GUI elements."
msgstr ""
"ເຊດເດີ CanvasItem ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມທຸກອົງປະກອບ 2D ໃນ Godot. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີທຸກໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"CanvasItems, ແລະ ທຸກອົງປະກອບ GUI."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:9
msgid ""
"CanvasItem shaders contain fewer built-in variables and functionality "
"than :ref:`Spatial shaders<doc_spatial_shader>`, but they maintain the same "
"basic structure with vertex, fragment, and light processor functions."
msgstr ""
"ເຊດເດີ CanvasItem ມີຕົວແປພາຍໃນ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກໜ້ອຍກວ່າ :ref:`Spatial "
"shaders<doc_spatial_shader>`, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຍັງຄົງຮັກສາໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານດຽວກັນກັບຟັງຊັນການປະມວນຜົ"
"ນ vertex, fragment, ແລະ light."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:27
msgid "Pre-multiplied alpha blend mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມອາວຟາແບບຄິດໄລ່ລ່ວງໜ້າ (Pre-multiplied alpha)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:29
msgid "**blend_disabled**"
msgstr "**blend_disabled**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:29
msgid "Disable blending, values (including alpha) are written as-is."
msgstr "ປິດການປະສົມສີ, ຄ່າຕ່າງໆ (ລວມທັງອາວຟາ) ຈະຖືກຂຽນຕາມເດີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:31
msgid "Result is just albedo. No lighting/shading happens in material."
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ albedo. ບໍ່ມີການໃຫ້ແສງ/ເງົາເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນວັດສະດຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:33
msgid "**light_only**"
msgstr "**light_only**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:33
msgid "Only draw in the light pass."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມສະເພາະໃນການຜ່ານແສງ (light pass) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:35
msgid ""
"``VERTEX`` needs to be transformed manually in the ``vertex()`` function."
msgstr "``VERTEX`` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແປງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:38
msgid "``VERTEX`` is modified in world coordinates instead of local."
msgstr ""
"``VERTEX`` ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໃນພິກັດໂລກ (world coordinates) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:82
msgid ""
"Vertex data (``VERTEX``) is presented in local space (pixel coordinates, "
"relative to the Node2D's origin). If not written to, these values will not "
"be modified and be passed through as they came."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນ Vertex (``VERTEX``) ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ພິກັດພິກເຊວ, ທຽບກັບຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງ Node2D)"
". ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຂຽນທັບ, ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຕາມເດີມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:85
msgid ""
"The user can disable the built-in model to world transform (world to screen "
"and projection will still happen later) and do it manually with the "
"following code:"
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດການແປງຄ່າຈາກໂມເດລເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກພາຍໃນ (ການແປງຈາກໂລກເປັນໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ການສາຍພາບ "
"projection ຈະຍັງຄົງເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍຫຼັງ) ແລະ ເຮັດມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍລະຫັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:98
msgid ""
"Other built-ins, such as ``UV`` and ``COLOR``, are also passed through to "
"the ``fragment()`` function if not modified."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແປພາຍໃນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ``UV`` ແລະ ``COLOR`` ກໍ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຍັງຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()`` ເຊັ່ນກັນ"
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:110
msgid ""
"Local space to world space transform. World space is the coordinates you "
"normally use in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຄ່າຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ (world space). ພື້ນທີ່ໂລກແມ່ນພິກັດທີ່ທ່ານມັກ"
"ໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:113
msgid "in mat4 **CANVAS_MATRIX**"
msgstr "in mat4 **CANVAS_MATRIX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:113
msgid ""
"World space to canvas space transform. In canvas space the origin is the "
"upper-left corner of the screen and coordinates range from ``(0.0, 0.0)`` to "
"viewport size."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຄ່າຈາກພື້ນທີ່ໂລກເປັນພື້ນທີ່ແຄນວາສ (canvas space). ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແຄນວາສ ຈຸດກຳເນີດແມ່ນມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂ"
"ອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ພິກັດຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງຈາກ ``(0.0, 0.0)`` ຫາ ຂະໜາດວິວພອດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:118
msgid "in mat4 **SCREEN_MATRIX**"
msgstr "in mat4 **SCREEN_MATRIX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:118
msgid ""
"Canvas space to clip space transform. In clip space coordinates range from "
"``(-1.0, -1.0)`` to ``(1.0, 1.0).``"
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຄ່າຈາກພື້ນທີ່ແຄນວາສເປັນ Clip space. ໃນ Clip space ພິກັດຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງຈາກ ``(-1.0, -"
"1.0)`` ຫາ ``(1.0, 1.0)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:122
msgid "in int  **INSTANCE_ID**"
msgstr "in int **INSTANCE_ID**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:124
msgid "Instance custom data."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:126
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:244
msgid "in bool **AT_LIGHT_PASS**"
msgstr "in bool **AT_LIGHT_PASS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:126
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:244
msgid "Always ``false``."
msgstr "ມີຄ່າເປັນ ``false`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:128
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:240
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:320
msgid "in vec2 **TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE**"
msgstr "in vec2 **TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:128
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:240
msgid ""
"Normalized pixel size of the default 2D texture. For a Sprite2D with a "
"texture of size 64×32 pixels, ``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, "
"1.0 / 32.0)``."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພິກເຊວປົກກະຕິຂອງເທັກເຈີ 2D ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບ Sprite2D ທີ່ມີເທັກເຈີຂະໜາດ 64×32 ພິກເຊວ, "
"``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, 1.0 / 32.0)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:132
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:269
msgid "inout vec2 **VERTEX**"
msgstr "inout vec2 **VERTEX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:132
msgid "Vertex position, in local space."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເວີເທັກຊ໌ ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:137
msgid "Normalized texture coordinates. Range from ``0.0`` to ``1.0``."
msgstr "ພິກັດເທັກເຈີປົກກະຕິ. ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງຈາກ ``0.0`` ຫາ ``1.0``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:140
msgid ""
"Color from vertex primitive multiplied by the "
"CanvasItem's :ref:`modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_modulate>` multiplied "
"by "
"CanvasItem's :ref:`self_modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_self_modulate>`."
msgstr ""
"ສີຈາກເວີເທັກຊ໌ພຣິມິທີບ ຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າ :ref:`modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_modulate>` ຂ"
"ອງ CanvasItem ແລະ ຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າ "
":ref:`self_modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_self_modulate>` ຂອງ CanvasItem."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:145
msgid "Point size for point drawing."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຈຸດສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຈຸດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:158
msgid "COLOR and TEXTURE"
msgstr "COLOR ແລະ TEXTURE"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:160
msgid "The built-in variable ``COLOR`` is used for a few things:"
msgstr "ຕົວແປພາຍໃນ ``COLOR`` ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບບາງສິ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:162
msgid ""
"In the ``vertex()`` function, ``COLOR`` contains the color from the vertex "
"primitive multiplied by the "
"CanvasItem's :ref:`modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_modulate>` multiplied "
"by the "
"CanvasItem's :ref:`self_modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_self_modulate>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``, ``COLOR`` ຈະມີສີຈາກເວີເທັກຊ໌ພຣິມິທີບ ຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າ "
":ref:`modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_modulate>` ຂອງ CanvasItem ແລະ ຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່"
"າ :ref:`self_modulate<class_CanvasItem_property_self_modulate>` ຂອງ "
"CanvasItem."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:166
msgid ""
"In the ``fragment()`` function, the input value ``COLOR`` is that same value "
"multiplied by the color from the default ``TEXTURE`` (if present)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ ``COLOR`` ແມ່ນຄ່າດຽວກັນນັ້ນ ຄູນດ້ວຍສີຈາກ "
"``TEXTURE`` ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ຫາກມີ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:168
msgid "In the ``fragment()`` function, ``COLOR`` is also the final output."
msgstr "ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``, ``COLOR`` ຍັງເປັນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:170
msgid ""
"Certain nodes (for example, :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>`) display a "
"texture by default, for example :ref:`texture "
"<class_Sprite2D_property_texture>`. When using a custom ``fragment()`` "
"function, you have a few options on how to sample this texture."
msgstr ""
"ບາງໂນດ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ :ref:`Sprite2D <class_Sprite2D>`) ຈະສະແດງເທັກເຈີໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕົວ"
"ຢ່າງ :ref:`texture <class_Sprite2D_property_texture>`. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()"
"`` ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານມີທາງເລືອກໃນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sample) ເທັກເຈີນີ້ດັ່ງນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:175
msgid ""
"To read only the contents of the default texture, ignoring the vertex "
"``COLOR``:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອອ່ານສະເພາະເນື້ອໃນຂອງເທັກເຈີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າ ``COLOR`` ຂອງເວີເທັກຊ໌:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:183
msgid ""
"To read the contents of the default texture multiplied by vertex ``COLOR``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອອ່ານເນື້ອໃນຂອງເທັກເຈີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າ ``COLOR`` ຂອງເວີເທັກຊ໌:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:192
msgid ""
"To read only the vertex ``COLOR`` in ``fragment()``, ignoring the main "
"texture, you must pass ``COLOR`` as a varying, then read it in "
"``fragment()``:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອອ່ານສະເພາະຄ່າ ``COLOR`` ຂອງເວີເທັກຊ໌ໃນ ``fragment()``, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈເທັກເຈີຫຼັກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສົ່"
"ງຄ່າ ``COLOR`` ເປັນແບບ varying, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງອ່ານມັນໃນ ``fragment()``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:206
msgid "NORMAL"
msgstr "NORMAL"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:208
msgid ""
"Similarly, if a normal map is used in the :ref:`CanvasTexture "
"<class_CanvasTexture>`, Godot uses it by default and assigns its value to "
"the built-in ``NORMAL`` variable. If you are using a normal map meant for "
"use in 3D, it will appear inverted. In order to use it in your shader, you "
"must assign it to the ``NORMAL_MAP`` property. Godot will handle converting "
"it for use in 2D and overwriting ``NORMAL``."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ normal map ໃນ :ref:`CanvasTexture "
"<class_CanvasTexture>`, Godot ຈະໃຊ້ມັນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງມັນໃຫ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນ "
"``NORMAL`` ທີ່ຕິດຕາມາ. ຖ້າຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ normal map ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນ 3D, ມັນຈະປະກົດອ"
"ອກມາເປັນແບບກັບດ້ານ. ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ມັນໃນ shader ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດມັນໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"``NORMAL_MAP``. Godot ຈະຈັດການແປງມັນເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ 2D ແລະ ຂຽນທັບ ``NORMAL`` ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:220
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:307
msgid ""
"Coordinate of pixel center. In screen space. ``xy`` specifies position in "
"viewport. Upper-left of the viewport is the origin, ``(0.0, 0.0)``. Bottom-"
"right of the viewport is ``(1.0, 1.0)``."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດຂອງຈຸດໃຈກາງພິກເຊວ. ໃນ screen space. ``xy`` ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ viewport. ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງ "
"viewport ແມ່ນຈຸດກຳເນີດ, ``(0.0, 0.0)``. ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມຂອງ viewport ແມ່ນ ``(1.0, 1.0)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:225
msgid "in vec2 **SCREEN_PIXEL_SIZE**"
msgstr "in vec2 **SCREEN_PIXEL_SIZE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:225
msgid "Size of individual pixels. Equal to the inverse of resolution."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ. ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບສ່ວນກັບຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:227
msgid "in vec4 **REGION_RECT**"
msgstr "in vec4 **REGION_RECT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:227
msgid ""
"Visible area of the sprite region in format ``(x, y, width, height)``. "
"Varies according to Sprite2D's ``region_enabled`` property. Values are "
"normalized; for example, a 600×400 region on a 1000×800 texture with a "
"100×100 offset would be ``vec4(0.1, 0.125, 0.6, 0.5)``. Values may exceed "
"the 0.0 to 1.0 range if the X/Y offset is negative, or if the size exceeds "
"the texture's size."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຂອງ sprite region ໃນຮູບແບບ ``(x, y, width, height)``. ປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມຄຸ"
"ນສົມບັດ ``region_enabled`` ຂອງ Sprite2D. ຄ່າຕ່າງໆແມ່ນຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ "
"(normalized); ຕົວຢ່າງ, ພື້ນທີ່ 600×400 ເທິງ texture ຂະໜາດ 1000×800 ທີ່ມີຄ່າ offset 100×"
"100 ຈະເທົ່າກັບ ``vec4(0.1, 0.125, 0.6, 0.5)``. ຄ່າອາດຈະເກີນຊ່ວງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0 ຖ້າຫາກ "
"offset X/Y ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຫຼື ຖ້າຂະໜາດເກີນກວ່າຂະໜາດຂອງ texture."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:236
msgid "Coordinate for drawing points in the 0.0 to 1.0 range."
msgstr "ພິກັດສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຈຸດໃນຊ່ວງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:238
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:318
msgid "sampler2D **TEXTURE**"
msgstr "sampler2D **TEXTURE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:238
msgid "Default 2D texture."
msgstr "Texture 2D ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:246
msgid "sampler2D **SPECULAR_SHININESS_TEXTURE**"
msgstr "sampler2D **SPECULAR_SHININESS_TEXTURE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:246
msgid "Specular shininess texture of this object."
msgstr "Specular shininess texture ຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:248
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:346
msgid "in vec4 **SPECULAR_SHININESS**"
msgstr "in vec4 **SPECULAR_SHININESS**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:248
msgid "Specular shininess color, as sampled from the texture."
msgstr "ສີຂອງ specular shininess, ຕາມທີ່ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງມາຈາກ texture."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:250
msgid ""
"UV from the ``vertex()`` function. For a Sprite2D with region enabled, this "
"will sample the entire texture. Use ``REGION_RECT`` instead to sample only "
"the region defined in the Sprite2D's properties."
msgstr ""
"UV ຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``. ສຳລັບ Sprite2D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ region, ອັນນີ້ຈະສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈາກ "
"texture ທັງໝົດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``REGION_RECT`` ແທນເພື່ອສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ "
"Sprite2D."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:260
msgid "Normal read from ``NORMAL_TEXTURE``. Writable."
msgstr "Normal ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຈາກ ``NORMAL_TEXTURE``. ສາມາດຂຽນໃສ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:262
msgid "sampler2D **NORMAL_TEXTURE**"
msgstr "sampler2D **NORMAL_TEXTURE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:262
msgid "Default 2D normal texture."
msgstr "Normal texture 2D ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:264
msgid ""
"Configures normal maps meant for 3D for use in 2D. If used, overrides "
"``NORMAL``."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ normal map ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບ 3D ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ 2D. ຖ້າຖືກໃຊ້, ຈະຂຽນທັບ ``NORMAL``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:267
msgid "Normal map depth for scaling."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລິກຂອງ normal map ສຳລັບການປັບຂະໜາດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:269
msgid "Pixel position in screen space."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງພິກເຊວໃນ screen space."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:271
msgid "inout vec2 **SHADOW_VERTEX**"
msgstr "inout vec2 **SHADOW_VERTEX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:271
msgid "Same as ``VERTEX`` but can be written to alter shadows."
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບ ``VERTEX`` ແຕ່ສາມາດຂຽນໃສ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງເງົາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:273
msgid ""
"Same as ``VERTEX`` but can be written to alter lighting. Z component "
"represents height."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ ``VERTEX`` ແຕ່ສາມາດຂຽນໃສ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງແສງສະຫວ່າງໄດ້. ສ່ວນປະກອບ Z ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມສູງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:276
msgid ""
"``COLOR`` from the ``vertex()`` function multiplied by the ``TEXTURE`` "
"color. Also output color value."
msgstr ""
"``COLOR`` ຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()`` ຄູນກັບສີຂອງ ``TEXTURE``. ຍັງເປັນຄ່າສີທີ່ສົ່ງອອກອີກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:283
msgid ""
"Light processor functions work differently in Godot 4.x than they did in "
"Godot 3.x. In Godot 4.x all lighting is done during the regular draw pass. "
"In other words, Godot no longer draws the object again for each light."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນປະມວນຜົນແສງເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງຈາກໃນ Godot 3.x. ໃນ Godot 4.x ການປະມວນຜົນແສງທັງໝົດແມ່ນເຮັດໃ"
"ນລະຫວ່າງການແຕ້ມປົກກະຕິ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື Godot ຈະບໍ່ແຕ້ມວັດຖຸຊ້ຳອີກສຳລັບແສງແຕ່ລະດວງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:287
msgid ""
"Use the ``unshaded`` render mode if you do not want the ``light()`` function "
"to run. Use the ``light_only`` render mode if you only want to see the "
"impact of lighting on an object; this can be useful when you only want the "
"object visible where it is covered by light."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ render ແບບ ``unshaded`` ຖ້າຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນ ``light()`` ເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ໂໝດ render ແບບ ``light_only`` ຖ້າຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຫັນແຕ່ຜົນກະທົບຂອງແສງເທິງວັດຖຸເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ອັນ"
"ນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ວັດຖຸເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະບ່ອນທີ່ມີແສງສ່ອງເຖິງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:292
msgid ""
"If you define a ``light()`` function it will replace the built-in light "
"function, even if your light function is empty."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ ``light()`` ມັນຈະເຂົ້າໄປແທນທີ່ຟັງຊັນແສງທີ່ຕິດຕາມາ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຟັງຊັນແສງຂອງເຈົ້າຈ"
"ະວ່າງເປົ່າກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:295
msgid ""
"Below is an example of a light shader that takes a CanvasItem's normal map "
"into account:"
msgstr ""
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ light shader ທີ່ມີການນຳເອົາ normal map ຂອງ CanvasItem ມາຄິດໄລ່ນຳ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:311
msgid "Input normal."
msgstr "Input normal."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:313
msgid "Input color. This is the output of the ``fragment()`` function."
msgstr "Input color. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນ output ຂອງຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:315
msgid ""
"UV from the ``vertex()`` function, equivalent to the UV in the "
"``fragment()`` function."
msgstr "UV ຈາກຟັງຊັນ ``vertex()``, ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບ UV ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:318
msgid "Current texture in use for the CanvasItem."
msgstr "Texture ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ CanvasItem."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:320
msgid ""
"Normalized pixel size of ``TEXTURE``. For a Sprite2D with a ``TEXTURE`` of "
"size 64×32 pixels, ``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, 1.0 / 32.0)``."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິຂອງ ``TEXTURE``. ສຳລັບ Sprite2D ທີ່ມີ ``TEXTURE`` ຂະໜ"
"າດ 64×32 ພິກເຊວ, ``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, 1.0 / 32.0)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:326
msgid "UV for Point Sprite."
msgstr "UV ສຳລັບ Point Sprite."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:328
msgid "in vec4 **LIGHT_COLOR**"
msgstr "in vec4 **LIGHT_COLOR**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:328
msgid ""
":ref:`Color<class_Light2D_property_color>` of the :ref:`class_Light2D`. If "
"the light is a :ref:`class_PointLight2D`, multiplied by the "
"light's :ref:`texture<class_PointLight2D_property_texture>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ສີ<class_Light2D_property_color>` ຂອງ :ref:`class_Light2D`. ຖ້າຫາກແສງແມ່ນ "
":ref:`class_PointLight2D`, ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ "
":ref:`texture<class_PointLight2D_property_texture>` ຂອງແສງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:332
msgid "in float **LIGHT_ENERGY**"
msgstr "in float **LIGHT_ENERGY**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:332
msgid ""
":ref:`Energy multiplier<class_Light2D_property_energy>` of "
"the :ref:`class_Light2D`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານ<class_Light2D_property_energy>` ຂອງ :ref:`class_Light2D`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:335
msgid "in vec3 **LIGHT_POSITION**"
msgstr "in vec3 **LIGHT_POSITION**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:335
msgid ""
"Position of the :ref:`class_Light2D` in screen space. If using "
"a :ref:`class_DirectionalLight2D` this is always ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ :ref:`class_Light2D` ໃນ screen space. ຖ້າໃຊ້ "
":ref:`class_DirectionalLight2D` ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນ ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:338
msgid "in vec3 **LIGHT_DIRECTION**"
msgstr "in vec3 **LIGHT_DIRECTION**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:338
msgid "Direction of the :ref:`class_Light2D` in screen space."
msgstr "ທິດທາງຂອງ :ref:`class_Light2D` ໃນ screen space."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:340
msgid "``true`` if this pass is a :ref:`class_DirectionalLight2D`."
msgstr "ເປັນ ``true`` ຖ້າຫາກ pass ນີ້ແມ່ນ :ref:`class_DirectionalLight2D`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:342
msgid "in vec3 **LIGHT_VERTEX**"
msgstr "in vec3 **LIGHT_VERTEX**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:342
msgid ""
"Pixel position, in screen space as modified in the ``fragment()`` function."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງພິກເຊວ, ໃນ screen space ຕາມທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນຟັງຊັນ ``fragment()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:344
msgid "inout vec4 **LIGHT**"
msgstr "inout vec4 **LIGHT**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:344
msgid "Output color for this :ref:`class_Light2D`."
msgstr "Output ສີສຳລັບ :ref:`class_Light2D` ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:346
msgid "Specular shininess, as set in the object's texture."
msgstr "Specular shininess, ຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ texture ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:348
msgid "out vec4 **SHADOW_MODULATE**"
msgstr "out vec4 **SHADOW_MODULATE**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.rst:348
msgid "Multiply shadows cast at this point by this color."
