#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:172
msgid ""
"``emit_subparticle()`` is currently the only custom function supported by "
"particle shaders. It allows users to add a new particle with specified "
"parameters from a sub-emitter. The newly created particle will only use the "
"properties that match the ``flags`` parameter. For example, the following "
"code will emit a particle with a specified position, velocity, and color, "
"but unspecified rotation, scale, and custom value:"
msgstr ""
"``emit_subparticle()`` ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນດຽວໃນຕອນນີ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ particle shader. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ"
"າມາດເພີ່ມອະນຸພາກໃໝ່ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈາກ sub-emitter. ອະນຸພາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມ"
"ບັດທີ່ກົງກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ ``flags`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ, ຄວາມໄວ ແລະ "
"ສີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸການໝູນ, ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:188
msgid ""
"bool **emit_subparticle** (mat4 xform, vec3 velocity, vec4 color, vec4 "
"custom, uint flags)"
msgstr ""
"bool **emit_subparticle** (mat4 xform, vec3 velocity, vec4 color, vec4 "
"custom, uint flags)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/particle_shader.rst:188
msgid "Emits a particle from a sub-emitter."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກຈາກ sub-emitter."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:4
msgid "Sky shaders"
msgstr "Sky shaders"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:6
msgid ""
"Sky shaders are a special type of shader used for drawing sky backgrounds "
"and for updating radiance cubemaps which are used for image-based lighting "
"(IBL). Sky shaders only have one processing function, the ``sky()`` function."
msgstr ""
"Sky shader ແມ່ນ shader ປະເພດພິເສດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ້ມພື້ນຫຼັງທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ສຳລັບອັບເດດ radiance "
"cubemaps ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບ image-based lighting (IBL). Sky shader ມີຟັງຊັນປະມວນຜົນດຽວຄື ຟັງ"
"ຊັນ ``sky()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:11
msgid "There are three places the sky shader is used."
msgstr "ມີ 3 ບ່ອນທີ່ Sky shader ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:13
msgid ""
"First the sky shader is used to draw the sky when you have selected to use a "
"Sky as the background in your scene."
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, Sky shader ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມທ້ອງຟ້າ ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໃຊ້ Sky ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງໃນ scene ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:15
msgid ""
"Second, the sky shader is used to update the radiance cubemap when using the "
"Sky for ambient color or reflections."
msgstr ""
"ທີສອງ, Sky shader ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດ radiance cubemap ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Sky ສຳລັບສີ ambient ຫຼື ກ"
"ານສະທ້ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:17
msgid ""
"Third, the sky shader is used to draw the lower res subpasses which can be "
"used in the high-res background or cubemap pass."
msgstr ""
"ທີສາມ, Sky shader ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມ subpasses ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳກວ່າ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນ "
"background ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ ຫຼື cubemap pass ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:20
msgid ""
"In total, this means the sky shader can run up to six times per frame, "
"however, in practice it will be much less than that because the radiance "
"cubemap does not need to be updated every frame, and not all subpasses will "
"be used. You can change the behavior of the shader based on where it is "
"called by checking the ``AT_*_PASS`` booleans. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍລວມແລ້ວ, ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Sky shader ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສູງສຸດເຖິງ 6 ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ເຟຣມ, ແຕ່ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິ"
"ງແລ້ວ ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໜ້ອຍກວ່ານັ້ນຫຼາຍ ເພາະວ່າ radiance cubemap ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດທຸກເຟຣມ, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກ subpasses ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ shader ຕາມບ່ອນທີ່ມັນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍກາ"
"ນກວດສອບຄ່າ boolean ``AT_*_PASS``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:43
msgid ""
"When using the sky shader to draw a background, the shader will be called "
"for all non-occluded fragments on the screen. However, for the background's "
"subpasses, the shader will be called for every pixel of the subpass."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Sky shader ເພື່ອແຕ້ມພື້ນຫຼັງ, shader ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກໆ fragments ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າ"
"ຈໍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບ subpasses ຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງ, shader ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກໆພິກເຊວຂອງ "
"subpass."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:47
msgid ""
"When using the sky shader to update the radiance cubemap, the sky shader "
"will be called for every pixel in the cubemap. On the other hand, the shader "
"will only be called when the radiance cubemap needs to be updated. The "
"radiance cubemap needs to be updated when any of the shader parameters are "
"updated. For example, if ``TIME`` is used in the shader, then the radiance "
"cubemap will update every frame. The following list of changes force an "
"update of the radiance cubemap:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Sky shader ເພື່ອອັບເດດ radiance cubemap, Sky shader ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກໆພິກເຊວໃ"
"ນ cubemap. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, shader ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ radiance cubemap ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄ"
"ດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. Radiance cubemap ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດເມື່ອມີພາຣາມິເຕີໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ shader ຖືກອັ"
"ບເດດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າໃຊ້ ``TIME`` ໃນ shader, radiance cubemap ຈະອັບເດດທຸກໆເຟຣມ. ລາຍການ"
"ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດ radiance cubemap:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:55
msgid "``TIME`` is used."
msgstr "ມີການໃຊ້ ``TIME``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:56
msgid "``POSITION`` is used and the camera position changes."
msgstr "ມີການໃຊ້ ``POSITION`` ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງກ້ອງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:57
msgid ""
"If any ``LIGHTX_*`` properties are used and any :ref:`DirectionalLight3D "
"<class_DirectionalLight3D>` changes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``LIGHTX_*`` ໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລະ :ref:`DirectionalLight3D "
"<class_DirectionalLight3D>` ໃດໜຶ່ງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:59
msgid "If any uniform is changed in the shader."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນແປງ uniform ໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ shader."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:60
msgid "If the screen is resized and either of the subpasses are used."
msgstr "ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ແລະ ມີການໃຊ້ subpass ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:62
msgid ""
"Try to avoid updating the radiance cubemap needlessly. If you do need to "
"update the radiance cubemap each frame, make sure your :ref:`Sky process "
"mode <class_Sky_property_process_mode>` is set "
"to :ref:`PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME <class_Sky_constant_PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME>`."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຫຼີກເວັ້ນການອັບເດດ radiance cubemap ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດ radiance "
"cubemap ທຸກເຟຣມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ :ref:`Sky process mode "
"<class_Sky_property_process_mode>` ຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ :ref:`PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME "
"<class_Sky_constant_PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:67
msgid ""
"Note that the :ref:`process mode <class_Sky_property_process_mode>` only "
"affects the rendering of the radiance cubemap. The visible sky is always "
"rendered by calling the fragment shader for every pixel. With complex "
"fragment shaders, this can result in a high rendering overhead. If the sky "
"is static (the conditions listed above are met) or changes slowly, running "
"the full fragment shader every frame is not needed. This can be avoided by "
"rendering the full sky into the radiance cubemap, and reading from this "
"cubemap when rendering the visible sky. With a completely static sky, this "
"means that it needs to be rendered only once."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າ :ref:`process mode <class_Sky_property_process_mode>` ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບກາ"
"ນ render ຂອງ radiance cubemap ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ແມ່ນຖືກ render ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"fragment shader ສຳລັບທຸກໆພິກເຊວສະເໝີ. ດ້ວຍ fragment shader ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີ"
"ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການ render ສູງ. ຖ້າທ້ອງຟ້າຄົງທີ່ (ເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ) ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແປງຊ້າໆ, "
"ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ fragment shader ເຕັມຮູບແບບທຸກໆເຟຣມແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການ "
"render ທ້ອງຟ້າທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນ radiance cubemap, ແລະ ອ່ານຈາກ cubemap ນີ້ເມື່ອ render ທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່"
"ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ດ້ວຍທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດ, ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ render ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:77
msgid ""
"The following code renders the full sky into the radiance cubemap and reads "
"from that cubemap for displaying the visible sky:"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ render ທ້ອງຟ້າທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນ radiance cubemap ແລະ ອ່ານຈາກ cubemap ນັ້ນເພື່ອສະແດງທ້"
"ອງຟ້າທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:99
msgid ""
"This way, the complex calculations happen only in the cubemap pass, which "
"can be optimized by setting the sky's :ref:`process mode "
"<class_Sky_property_process_mode>` and the :ref:`radiance size "
"<class_Sky_property_radiance_size>` to get the desired balance between "
"performance and visual fidelity."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ການຄິດໄລ່ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະໃນ cubemap pass ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມໄດ້"
"ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`process mode <class_Sky_property_process_mode>` ຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລ"
"ະ :ref:`radiance size <class_Sky_property_radiance_size>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມສົມດຸນທີ່ຕ້ອງ"
"ການລະຫວ່າງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມສວຍງາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/sky_shader.rst:107
msgid ""
"Subpasses allow you to do more expensive calculations at a lower resolution "
