#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.rst:156
msgid ""
"All of the types are used in the calculations of vertices, fragments, and "
"lights in the shader. For example: matrix multiplication, vector addition, "
"or scalar division."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆປະເພດທີ່ກ່າວມາແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນຂອງ vertices, fragments, ແລະ lights ໃນເຊເດີ. ຕົວ"
"ຢ່າງ: ການຄູນ matrix, ການບວກ vector, ຫຼື ການຫານ scalar."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.rst:159
