#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:826
msgid ""
"On Android, Roboto is used for Latin/Cyrillic text and Noto Sans is used for "
"other languages' glyphs such as CJK. On third-party Android distributions, "
"the exact font selection may differ."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Android, Roboto ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ Latin/Cyrillic ແລະ Noto Sans ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາສາອື່"
"ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ CJK. ທັງນີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຜູ້ຜະລິດມືຖືແຕ່ລະຍີ່ຫໍ້ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ Font ໃດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:830
msgid ""
"If specifying more than one font, the first font that is found on the system "
"will be used (from top to bottom). Font names and aliases are case-"
"insensitive on all platforms."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດຫຼາຍ Font, ລະບົບຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ Font ທຳອິດທີ່ພົບ (ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ). ຊື່ Font ແລະ Alias ຈະບໍ່ແ"
"ຍກຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ (Case-insensitive) ໃນທຸກແພລັດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:834
msgid ""
"Like for font variations, you can save the SystemFont arrangement to a "
"resource file to reuse it in other places."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ Font Variation, ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SystemFont ເປັນໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນເພື່ອນຳໄ"
"ປໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນອື່ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:837
msgid ""
"Remember that different system fonts have different metrics, which means "
"that text that can fit within a rectangle on one platform may not be doing "
"so on another platform. Always reserve some additional space during "
"development so that labels can extend further if needed."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມວ່າ System Font ແຕ່ລະຕົວມີຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສັດສ່ວນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ພໍດີໃນແພລັດຟອ"
"ມໜຶ່ງ ອາດຈະບໍ່ພໍດີໃນອີກແພລັດຟອມໜຶ່ງ. ຄວນປະພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໄວ້ສະເໝີເພື່ອໃຫ້ Label ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄດ້ຖ້າຈຳເ"
"ປັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:844
msgid ""
"Unlike Windows and macOS/iOS, the set of default fonts shipped on Linux "
"depends on the distribution. This means that on different Linux "
"distributions, different fonts may be displayed for a given system font name "
"or alias."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ Windows ແລະ macOS/iOS, Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ Linux ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແຕ່ລະ Distribution "
"(Distro). ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໃນ Linux Distro ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ອາດຈະສະແດງ Font ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເຖິງແມ່ນຈະໃຊ້"
"ຊື່ ຫຼື Alias ດຽວກັນກໍຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:849
msgid ""
"It is also possible to load fonts at runtime even if they aren't installed "
"on the system. See :ref:`Runtime loading and saving "
"<doc_runtime_file_loading_and_saving_fonts>` for details."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງສາມາດໂຫຼດ Font ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແອັບຯເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ເຖິງວ່າ Font ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບກໍຕາ"
"ມ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ :ref:`Runtime loading and saving "
"<doc_runtime_file_loading_and_saving_fonts>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:856
msgid "Font prerendering"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີ Font ລ່ວງໜ້າ (Prerendering)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:858
msgid ""
"When using traditional rasterized fonts, Godot caches glyphs on a per-font "
"and per-size basis. This reduces stuttering, but it can still occur the "
"first time a glyph is displayed when running the project. This can be "
"especially noticeable at higher font sizes or on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Font ແບບປົກກະຕິ, Godot ຈະເກັບຕົວອັກສອນໄວ້ໃນ Cache ແຍກຕາມແຕ່ລະ Font ແລະ ແຕ່ລະຂະໜ"
"າດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການກະຕຸກ ແຕ່ກໍອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນ. ເຊິ່ງຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃ"
"ນ Font ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ໃນອຸປະກອນມືຖື."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:863
msgid ""
"When using MSDF fonts, they only need to be rasterized once to a special "
"signed distance field texture. This means caching can be done purely on a "
"per-font basis, without taking the font size into consideration. However, "
"the initial rendering of MSDF fonts is slower compared to a traditional "
"rasterized font at a medium size."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ MSDF Font, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເຂົ້າໃນ Texture ພິເສດ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການເຮັດ "
"Cache ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະ Font ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂະໜາດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການເຣັນເດີ MSDF Font ໃນຕອ"
"ນທຳອິດຈະຊ້າກວ່າ Font ແບບປົກກະຕິໃນຂະໜາດປານກາງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:869
msgid ""
"To avoid stuttering issues related to font rendering, it is possible to "
"*prerender* certain glyphs. This can be done for all glyphs you intend to "
"use (for optimal results), or only for common glyphs that are most likely to "
"appear during gameplay (to reduce file size). Glyphs that aren't pre-"
"rendered will be rasterized on-the-fly as usual."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາການກະຕຸກ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດ *ເຣັນເດີລ່ວງໜ້າ* (Prerender) ຕົວອັກສອນບາງຕົວໄດ້. ສາມາດເ"
"ຮັດໄດ້ກັບທຸກຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ເພື່ອຜົນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ) ຫຼື ສະເພາະຕົວທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ (ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌). ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່"
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຣັນເດີລ່ວງໜ້າ ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໃນຂະນະທີ່ແອັບຯເຮັດວຽກຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:877
msgid ""
"In both cases (traditional and MSDF), font rasterization is done on the CPU. "
"This means that the GPU performance doesn't affect how long it takes for "
"fonts to be rasterized."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທັງສອງກໍລະນີ (ແບບປົກກະຕິ ແລະ MSDF), ການເຣັນເດີ Font ແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ທີ່ CPU. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າປະສິດທິ"
"ພາບຂອງ GPU ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມໄວໃນການເຣັນເດີ Font."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:890
msgid ""
"Move to the **Pre-render Configurations** tab of the Advanced Import "
"Settings dialog, then add a configuration by clicking the \"plus\" symbol:"
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ແຖບ **Pre-render Configurations** ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Advanced Import Settings, ຈາກນັ້ນເ"
"ພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍການຄລິກເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"ບວກ\":"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:893
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:897
msgid ""
"Adding a new prerendering configuration in the Advanced Import Settings "
"dialog"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prerendering ໃໝ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Advanced Import Settings"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:899
msgid ""
"After adding a configuration, make sure it is selected by clicking its name "
"once. You can also rename the configuration by double-clicking it."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງມັນເພື່ອເລືອກ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບີລຄລິກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:902
msgid ""
"There are 2 ways to add glyphs to be prerendered to a given configuration. "
"It is possible to use both approaches in a cumulative manner:"
msgstr ""
"ມີ 2 ວິທີໃນການເພີ່ມຕົວອັກສອນເພື່ອເຣັນເດີລ່ວງໜ້າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ທັງສອງວິທີຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:905
msgid "**Using text from translations**"
msgstr "**ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກໄຟລ໌ແປພາສາ (Translations)**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:907
msgid ""
"For most projects, this approach is the most convenient to use, as it "
"automatically sources text from your language translations. The downside is "
"that it can only be used if your project supports :ref:`internationalization "
"<doc_internationalizing_games>`. Otherwise, stick to the \"Using custom "
"text\" approach described below."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີນີ້ສະດວກທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເພາະມັນຈະດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກໄຟລ໌ແປພາສາຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຂໍ້ເສ"
"ຍຄືມັນໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`internationalization "
"<doc_internationalizing_games>` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີ \"Using custom text\" ດ້"
"ານລຸ່ມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:913
