"Enabling prerendering in the Advanced Import Settings dialog, Glyphs from "
"the Text tab"
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ Prerendering ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Advanced Import Settings ຜ່ານແຖບ Glyphs from "
"the Text"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:945
msgid ""
"Enabling prerendering in the Advanced Import Settings dialog with the "
"**Glyphs from the Text** tab"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ Prerendering ຜ່ານແຖບ **Glyphs from the Text**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:949
msgid ""
"If your project supports :ref:`internationalization "
"<doc_internationalizing_games>`, you can paste the contents of your CSV or "
"PO files in the above box to quickly prerender all possible characters that "
"may be rendered during gameplay (excluding user-provided or non-translatable "
"strings)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ :ref:`internationalization <doc_internationalizing_games>"
"`, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄັດລອກເນື້ອໃນຈາກໄຟລ໌ CSV ຫຼື PO ມາຜ່ານວາງໃນຊ່ອງດັ່ງກ່າວເພື່ອເຣັນເດີຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ອາ"
"ດຈະປາກົດໃນເກມໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:954
msgid "**By enabling character sets**"
msgstr "**ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນ (Character sets)**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:956
msgid ""
"The second method requires less configuration and fewer updates if your "
"game's text changes, and is more suited to text-heavy games or multiplayer "
"games with chat. On the other hand, it may cause glyphs that never show up "
"in the game to be prerendered, which is less efficient in terms of file size."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີສອງນີ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງອັບເດດເລື້ອຍໆຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນເກມປ່ຽນແປງ, ເໝາະສຳລັບເກມທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວ"
"າມຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ເກມມັລຕິເພລເຍີທີ່ມີລະບົບແຊັດ. ແຕ່ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືມັນອາດຈະເຣັນເດີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ເຄີຍປາກົດໃນເກມເລີຍ ເຊິ່ງ"
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ເກີນຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:961
msgid ""
"To use existing text as a baseline for prerendering, go to the **Glyphs from "
"the Character Map** sub-tab of the Advanced Import Settings dialog, then "
"*double-click* character sets to be enabled on the right:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນໃນການເຣັນເດີລ່ວງໜ້າ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ **Glyphs from the Character Map**, ຈາ"
"ກນັ້ນ *ດັບເບີລຄລິກ* ເລືອກຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ທາງຂວາມື:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:965
msgid ""
"Enabling prerendering in the Advanced Import Settings dialog, Glyphs from "
"the Character Map tab"
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ Prerendering ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Advanced Import Settings ຜ່ານແຖບ Glyphs from "
"the Character Map"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:969
msgid ""
"Enabling prerendering in the Advanced Import Settings dialog with the "
"**Glyphs from the Character Map** tab"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ Prerendering ຜ່ານແຖບ **Glyphs from the Character Map**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:971
msgid ""
"To ensure full prerendering, the character sets you need to enable depend on "
"which languages are supported in your game. For English, only **Basic "
"Latin** needs to be enabled. Enabling **Latin-1 Supplement** as well allows "
"fully covering many more languages, such as French, German and Spanish. For "
"Russian, **Cyrillic** needs to be enabled, and so on."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Prerendering ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເລືອກຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນຕາມພາສາທີ່ເກມຮອງຮັບ. ສຳລັບພາສາອັງກິດ ໃ"
"ຫ້ເລືອກ **Basic Latin**. ການເລືອກ **Latin-1 Supplement** ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບພາສາຝຣັ່ງ, ເຢ"
"ຍລະມັນ ແລະ ແອດສະປາຍ. ສຳລັບພາສາຣັດເຊຍ ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ **Cyrillic**, ແລະ ພາສາອື່ນໆກໍເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:978
msgid "Default project font properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:980
msgid ""
"In the **GUI > Theme** section of the advanced Project Settings, you can "
"choose how the default font should be rendered:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນສ່ວນ **GUI > Theme** ຂອງ Project Settings ແບບຂັ້ນສູງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກວິທີເຣັນເດີ Font "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:983
msgid ""
"**Default Font Antialiasing:** Controls the :ref:`antialiasing "
"<doc_using_fonts_antialiasing>` method used for the default project font."
msgstr ""
"**Default Font Antialiasing:** ຄວບຄຸມວິທີ :ref:`antialiasing "
"<doc_using_fonts_antialiasing>` ສຳລັບ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:986
msgid ""
"**Default Font Hinting:** Controls the :ref:`hinting "
"<doc_using_fonts_hinting>` method used for the default project font."
msgstr ""
"**Default Font Hinting:** ຄວບຄຸມວິທີ :ref:`hinting <doc_using_fonts_hinting>` ສຳ"
"ລັບ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:989
msgid ""
"**Default Font Subpixel Positioning:** Controls the :ref:`subpixel "
"positioning <doc_using_fonts_subpixel_positioning>` method for the default "
"project font."
msgstr ""
"**Default Font Subpixel Positioning:** ຄວບຄຸມວິທີ :ref:`subpixel positioning "
"<doc_using_fonts_subpixel_positioning>` ສຳລັບ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:992
msgid ""
"**Default Font Multichannel Signed Distance Field:** If ``true``, makes the "
"default project font use :ref:`MSDF font rendering <doc_using_fonts_msdf>` "
"instead of traditional rasterization."
msgstr ""
"**Default Font Multichannel Signed Distance Field:** ຖ້າເປັນ ``true``, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ "
"Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ :ref:`MSDF font rendering <doc_using_fonts_msdf>` ແທນການເຣັນເດີແບບ"
"ປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:995
msgid ""
"**Default Font Generate Mipmaps:** If ``true``, enables :ref:`mipmap "
"<doc_using_fonts_mipmaps>` generation and usage for the default project font."
msgstr ""
"**Default Font Generate Mipmaps:** ຖ້າເປັນ ``true``, ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການສ້າງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານ "
":ref:`mipmap <doc_using_fonts_mipmaps>` ສຳລັບ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:1001
msgid ""
"These project settings *only* affect the default project font (the one that "
"is hardcoded in the engine binary)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນ *ສະເພາະ* ກັບ Font ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ (ຕົວທີ່ຖືກຝັງໄວ້ໃນ Engine) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:1004
msgid ""
"Custom fonts' properties are governed by their respective import options "
"instead. You can use the **Import Defaults** section of the Project Settings "
"dialog to override default import options for custom fonts."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Custom Font ຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າຂອງໃຜລາວ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສ່ວນ "
"**Import Defaults** ໃນ Project Settings ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບ Custom Font ທັງໝົ"
"ດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:4
msgid "BBCode in RichTextLabel"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ BBCode ໃນ RichTextLabel"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:9
msgid ""
":ref:`class_Label` nodes are great for displaying basic text, but they have "
"limitations. If you want to change the color of the text, or its alignment, "
"you can only do that to the entire label. You can't make a part of the text "
"have another color, or have a part of the text centered. To get around these "
"limitations, you would use a :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ :ref:`class_Label` ນັ້ນເໝາະສຳລັບການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປ, ແຕ່ມັນມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽ"
"ນສີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ປັບການວາງແນວ (Alignment), ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບທັງ Label ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັ"
"ດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສີອື່ນ ຫຼື ໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຢູ່ກາງໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ "
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel` allows for complex formatting of text using a "
"markup syntax or the built-in API. It uses BBCodes for the markup syntax, a "
"system of tags that designate formatting rules for a part of the text. You "
"may be familiar with them if you ever used forums (also known as `bulletin "
"boards`, hence the \"BB\" in \"BBCode\")."
msgstr ""
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Markup Syntax ຫຼື "
"API ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້. ມັນໃຊ້ BBCode ເປັນພາສາ Markup, ເຊິ່ງເປັນລະບົບແທັກ (Tags) ທີ່ກຳນົດຮູບແບບໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະ"
"ສ່ວນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບມັນຖ້າເຄີຍໃຊ້ເວັບບອດ (Bulletin Boards, ເຊິ່ງເປັນທີ່ມາຂອງຕົວອັ"
"ກສອນ \"BB\" ໃນ \"BBCode\")."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:19
msgid ""
"Unlike Label, RichTextLabel also comes with its own vertical scrollbar. This "
"scrollbar is automatically displayed if the text does not fit within the "
"control's size. The scrollbar can be disabled by unchecking the **Scroll "
"Active** property in the RichTextLabel inspector."
msgstr ""
"RichTextLabel ຍັງມີແຖບເລື່ອນ (Scrollbar) ໃນແນວຕັ້ງມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ Label. ແຖບເລື່ອນ"
"ນີ້ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມຍາວເກີນຂະໜາດຂອງ Control. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດແຖບເລື່ອນໄດ້ໂດຍການຕິກອອ"
"ກຢູ່ທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ **Scroll Active** ໃນ Inspector."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:24
msgid ""
"Note that the BBCode tags can also be used to some extent for other use "
"cases:"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ແທັກ BBCode ຍັງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນໆໄດ້ບາງສ່ວນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:26
msgid ""
"BBCode can be used to :ref:`format comments in the XML source of the class "
"reference <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ BBCode ເພື່ອ :ref:`ຈັດຮູບແບບຄຳອະທິບາຍ (Comments) ໃນ XML source ຂອງ Class "
"Reference <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:27
msgid ""
"BBCode can be used in :ref:`GDScript documentation comments "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ BBCode ໃນ :ref:`ຄຳອະທິບາຍເອກະສານຂອງ GDScript "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:28
msgid ""
"BBCode can be used when :ref:`printing rich text to the Output bottom panel "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ BBCode ເວລາ :ref:`ພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບ Rich Text ອອກທາງ Output panel "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:32
msgid ""
"You can see how BBCode in RichTextLabel works in action using the `Rich Text "
"Label with BBCode demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ BBCode ໃນ RichTextLabel ໄດ້ທີ່ `Rich Text Label "
"with BBCode demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/"
"tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:36
msgid "Using BBCode"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ BBCode"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:38
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` functions like a "
"normal :ref:`class_Label`. It has the :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property, which you can edit to have "
"uniformly formatted text. To be able to use BBCode for rich text formatting, "
"you need to turn on the BBCode mode by setting :ref:`bbcode_enabled "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>`. After that, you can edit "
"the :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property using available "
"tags. Both properties are located at the top of the inspector after "
"selecting a RichTextLabel node."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ :ref:`class_Label` ທົ່ວໄປ. ມັນມີ"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` ເພື່ອໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບປົກກະຕິ. ເພື່"
"ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ BBCode ໃນການຈັດຮູບແບບໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເປີດໂໝດ BBCode ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
":ref:`bbcode_enabled <class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>`. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້"
"ນ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດໃສ່ແທັກຕ່າງໆລົງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` ໄດ້. ທັງສອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງ Inspector ເ"
"ມື່ອເລືອກໂນດ RichTextLabel."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:48
msgid ""
"For example, ``BBCode [color=green]test[/color]`` would render the word "
"\"test\" with a green color."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``BBCode [color=green]test[/color]`` ຈະສະແດງຄຳວ່າ \"test\" ເປັນສີຂຽວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:53
msgid ""
"Most BBCodes consist of 3 parts: the opening tag, the content and the "
"closing tag. The opening tag delimits the start of the formatted part, and "
"can also carry some configuration options. Some opening tags, like the "
"``color`` one shown above, also require a value to work. Other opening tags "
"may accept multiple options (separated by spaces within the opening tag). "
"The closing tag delimits the end of the formatted part. In some cases, both "
"the closing tag and the content can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"BBCode ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ປະກອບມີ 3 ສ່ວນ: ແທັກເປີດ, ເນື້ອໃນ ແລະ ແທັກປິດ. ແທັກເປີດຈະກຳນົດຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຮູບແ"
"ບບ ແລະ ສາມາດໃສ່ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ບາງແທັກເຊັ່ນ ``color`` ຕ້ອງລະບຸຄ່າ (Value) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວ"
"ຽກໄດ້. ບາງແທັກອາດຈະຮັບໄດ້ຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກ (ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍຊ່ອງວ່າງ). ສ່ວນແທັກປິດຈະກຳນົດຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ. ໃນບາງກໍ"
"ລະນີ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂ້າມແທັກປິດ ຫຼື ເນື້ອໃນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:61
msgid ""
"Unlike BBCode in HTML, leading/trailing whitespace is not removed by a "
"RichTextLabel upon display. Duplicate spaces are also displayed as-is in the "
"final output. This means that when displaying a code block in a "
"RichTextLabel, you don't need to use a preformatted text tag."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ BBCode ໃນ HTML, RichTextLabel ຈະບໍ່ຕັດຊ່ອງວ່າງທາງໜ້າ ຫຼື ທາງຫຼັງອອກ. ຊ່ອງວ່າງທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ"
"ກໍຈະສະແດງຜົນຕາມນັ້ນເລີຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເວລາເຈົ້າສະແດງ Code Block ໃນ RichTextLabel, ເຈົ້າ"
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແທັກພິເສດສຳລັບ Preformatted Text."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:76
msgid ""
"RichTextLabel doesn't support entangled BBCode tags. For example, instead of "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"RichTextLabel ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບແທັກ BBCode ທີ່ວາງຊ້ອນກັນແບບບໍ່ຖືກລຳດັບ (Entangled tags). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ແ"
"ທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:83
msgid "Use:"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແບບນີ້ແທນ:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:92
msgid "Handling user input safely"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:94
msgid ""
"In a scenario where users may freely input text (such as chat in a "
"multiplayer game), you should make sure users cannot use arbitrary BBCode "
"tags that will be parsed by RichTextLabel. This is to avoid inappropriate "
"use of formatting, which can be problematic if ``[url]`` tags are handled by "
"your RichTextLabel (as players may be able to create clickable links to "
"phishing sites or similar)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ (ເຊັ່ນ ລະບົບແຊັດໃນເກມມັລຕິເພລເຍີ), ເຈົ້າຄວນກວດສອບໃຫ້ແ"
"ນ່ໃຈວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທັກ BBCode ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຈັດຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງອາດກາ"
"ຍເປັນບັນຫາໄດ້ ໂດຍສະເພາະແທັກ ``[url]`` (ເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ອາດຈະສ້າງລິ້ງທີ່ພາໄປຫາເວັບໄຊຕ໌ອັນຕະລາຍໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:100
msgid ""
"Using RichTextLabel's ``[lb]`` and/or ``[rb]`` tags, we can replace the "
"opening and/or closing brackets of any BBCode tag in a message with those "
"escaped tags. This prevents users from using BBCode that will be parsed as "
"tags – instead, the BBCode will be displayed as text."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແທັກ ``[lb]`` (ວົງຂໍເປີດ) ແລະ/ຫຼື ``[rb]`` (ວົງຂໍປິດ) ຂອງ RichTextLabel, ເຮົາສາ"
"ມາດປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຂໍຂອງແທັກ BBCode ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວອັກສອນທຳມະດາ (Escaped). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນ"
"ບໍ່ໃຫ້ BBCode ຖືກເຣັນເດີເປັນແທັກ – ແຕ່ມັນຈະສະແດງຜົນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:105
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:109
msgid ""
"Example of unescaped user input resulting in BBCode injection (2nd line) and "
"escaped user input (3rd line)"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກວດສອບ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ BBCode Injection (ແຖວທີ 2) ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກ "
"Escaped ແລ້ວ (ແຖວທີ 3)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:111
msgid "The above image was created using the following script:"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບດ້ານເທິງສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:140
msgid "Stripping BBCode tags"
msgstr "ການຕັດແທັກ BBCode ອອກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:142
msgid ""
"For certain use cases, it can be desired to remove BBCode tags from the "
"string. This is useful when displaying the RichTextLabel's text in another "
"Control that does not support BBCode (such as a tooltip):"
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລຶບແທັກ BBCode ອອກຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດເວລາເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາ"
"ກ RichTextLabel ໄປສະແດງໃນ Control ອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ BBCode (ເຊັ່ນ Tooltip):"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:158
msgid ""
"Removing BBCode tags entirely isn't advised for user input, as it can modify "
"the displayed text without users understanding why part of their message was "
"removed. :ref:`Escaping user input "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>` should be "
"preferred instead."
msgstr ""
"ການລຶບແທັກ BBCode ອອກທັງໝົດບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ ເພາະມັນຈະປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈວ່"
"າເປັນຫຍັງບາງສ່ວນຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປ. ຄວນໃຊ້ວິທີ :ref:`Escaping user input "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:167
msgid ""
"In most cases, you can use BBCode directly as-is since text formatting is "
"rarely a heavy task. However, with particularly large RichTextLabels (such "
"as console logs spanning thousands of lines), you may encounter stuttering "
"during gameplay when the RichTextLabel's text is updated."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ BBCode ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ເພາະການຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ຄ່ອຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ. ແຕ່ຖ້"
"າ RichTextLabel ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມມະຫາສານ (ເຊັ່ນ Console Log ທີ່ມີເປັນພັນໆບັນທັດ), ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບອາການ"
"ກະຕຸກໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກອັບເດດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:172
msgid "There are several ways to alleviate this:"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:174
msgid ""
"Use the ``append_text()`` function instead of appending to the ``text`` "
"property. This function will only parse BBCode for the added text, rather "
"than parsing BBCode from the entire ``text`` property."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``append_text()`` ແທນການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ ``text`` ໂດຍກົງ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະປະມວນຜົ"
"ນ BBCode ສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:177
msgid ""
"Use ``push_[tag]()`` and ``pop()`` functions to add tags to RichTextLabel "
"instead of using BBCode."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ``push_[tag]()`` ແລະ ``pop()`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແທັກໃຫ້ກັບ RichTextLabel ແທນການໃຊ້ "
"BBCode."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:179
msgid ""
"Enable the **Threading > Threaded** property in RichTextLabel. This won't "
"speed up processing, but it will prevent the main thread from blocking, "
"which avoids stuttering during gameplay. Only enable threading if it's "
"actually needed in your project, as threading has some overhead."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ **Threading > Threaded** ໃນ RichTextLabel. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນໄວຂຶ້"
"ນ ແຕ່ມັນຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Main Thread ຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະ, ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດອາການກະຕຸກ. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ Threading ກໍຕໍ່ເ"
"ມື່ອຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆ ເພາະມັນມີການໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ (Overhead)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:187
msgid "Using push_[tag]() and pop() functions instead of BBCode"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ push_[tag]() ແລະ pop() ແທນ BBCode"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:189
msgid ""
"If you don't want to use BBCode for performance reasons, you can use "
"functions provided by RichTextLabel to create formatting tags without "
"writing BBCode in the text."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ BBCode ຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ RichTextLabel ມີໃຫ້ເ"
"ພື່ອສ້າງແທັກຈັດຮູບແບບໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງພິມ BBCode ລົງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:193
msgid ""
"Every BBCode tag (including effects) has a ``push_[tag]()`` function (where "
"``[tag]`` is the tag's name). There are also a few convenience functions "
"available, such as ``push_bold_italics()`` that combines both "
"``push_bold()`` and ``push_italics()`` into a single tag. See "
"the :ref:`RichTextLabel class reference <class_RichTextLabel>` for a "
"complete list of ``push_[tag]()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆແທັກ BBCode (ລວມເຖິງ Effects) ຈະມີຟັງຊັນ ``push_[tag]()`` (ໂດຍ ``[tag]`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອ"
"ງແທັກ). ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີຟັງຊັນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະດວກຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ``push_bold_italics()`` ທີ່ລວມທັງຕົວໜາ ແລ"
"ະ ຕົວອຽງເຂົ້າໃນແທັກດຽວ. ເບິ່ງລາຍການຟັງຊັນ ``push_[tag]()`` ທັງໝົດໄດ້ທີ່ "
":ref:`RichTextLabel class reference <class_RichTextLabel>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:200
msgid ""
"The ``pop()`` function is used to end *any* tag. Since BBCode is a tag "
"*stack*, using ``pop()`` will close the most recently started tags first."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``pop()`` ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດແທັກ *ໃດກໍໄດ້*. ເນື່ອງຈາກ BBCode ເຮັດວຽກແບບ Stack, ການໃຊ້ "
"``pop()`` ຈະປິດແທັກຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຫາກໍເປີດໄປກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:203
msgid ""
"The following script will result in the same visual output as using ``BBCode "
"[color=green]test [i]example[/i][/color]``:"
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນຄືກັນກັບການໃຊ້ ``BBCode [color=green]test [i]example[/i][/"
"color]``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:221
msgid ""
"Do **not** set the ``text`` property directly when using formatting "
"functions. Appending to the ``text`` property will erase all modifications "
"made to the RichTextLabel using the ``append_text()``, ``push_[tag]()`` and "
"``pop()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"**ຫ້າມ** ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ ``text`` ໂດຍກົງເມື່ອໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນຈັດຮູບແບບ. ການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ ``text`` ຈະລຶ"
"ບການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດທີ່ເຮັດຜ່ານຟັງຊັນ ``append_text()``, ``push_[tag]()`` ແລະ ``pop()``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:227
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/inheritance_class_tree.rst:10
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:231
msgid ""
"*Some* of these BBCode tags can be used in tooltips for ``@export`` script "
"variables as well as in the XML source of the class reference. For more "
"information, see :ref:`Class reference BBCode <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ BBCode *ບາງສ່ວນ* ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ Tooltips ສຳລັບຕົວປ່ຽນ ``@export`` ແລະ ໃນ XML "
"source ຂອງ Class Reference ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ :ref:`Class reference BBCode "
"<doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:240
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "ແທັກ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**b**"
msgstr "**b**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the bold (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ໃຊ້ Font ຕົວໜາ (ຫຼື ຕົວໜາອຽງ) ຂອງ ``RichTextLabel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:246
msgid "``[b]{text}[/b]``"
msgstr "``[b]{text}[/b]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**i**"
msgstr "**i**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the italics (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ໃຊ້ Font ຕົວອຽງ (ຫຼື ຕົວໜາອຽງ) ຂອງ ``RichTextLabel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:251
msgid "``[i]{text}[/i]``"
msgstr "``[i]{text}[/i]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**u**"
msgstr "**u**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` underlined."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ມີເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:256
msgid "``[u]{text}[/u]`` ``[u color={color}]{text}[/u]``"
msgstr "``[u]{text}[/u]`` ``[u color={color}]{text}[/u]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**s**"
msgstr "**s**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` strikethrough."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ມີເສັ້ນຂີດຂ້າ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:262
msgid "``[s]{text}[/s]`` ``[s color={color}]{text}[/s]``"
msgstr "``[s]{text}[/s]`` ``[s color={color}]{text}[/s]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**code**"
msgstr "**code**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use the mono font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ໃຊ້ Font ແບບ Mono (ຕົວອັກສອນຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັນ) ຂອງ "
"``RichTextLabel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:268
msgid "``[code]{text}[/code]``"
msgstr "``[code]{text}[/code]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**char**"
msgstr "**char**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Adds Unicode character with hexadecimal UTF-32 ``{codepoint}``."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ດ້ວຍລະຫັດເລກຖານສິບຫົກ UTF-32 ``{codepoint}``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:273
msgid "``[char={codepoint}]``"
msgstr "``[char={codepoint}]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**p**"
msgstr "**p**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Adds new paragraph with ``{text}``. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ ``{text}``. ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[p]{text}[/p]``"
msgstr "``[p]{text}[/p]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[p {options}]{text}[/p]``"
msgstr "``[p {options}]{text}[/p]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**br**"
msgstr "**br**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Adds line break in a text, without adding a new paragraph. If used within a "
"list, this won't create a new list item, but will add a line break within "
"the current item instead."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນບັນທັດໃໝ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍບໍ່ເພີ່ມຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃໝ່. ຖ້າໃຊ້ພາຍໃນລາຍການ (List), ມັນຈະບໍ່ສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຈະຂຶ້ນ"
"ບັນທັດໃໝ່ພາຍໃນລາຍການນັ້ນແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**hr**"
msgstr "**hr**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Adds new a horizontal rule to separate content. Supports configuration "
"options, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options`."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນຂີດແບ່ງແນວນອນ. ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[hr]``"
msgstr "``[hr]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[hr {options}]``"
msgstr "``[hr {options}]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**center**"
msgstr "**center**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally centered."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງແນວນອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Same as ``[p align=center]``."
msgstr "ມີຜົນຄືກັບ ``[p align=center]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:300
msgid "``[center]{text}[/center]``"
msgstr "``[center]{text}[/center]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**left**"
msgstr "**left**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally left-aligned."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ຊິດຊ້າຍແນວນອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Same as ``[p align=left]``."
msgstr "ມີຜົນຄືກັບ ``[p align=left]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:306
msgid "``[left]{text}[/left]``"
msgstr "``[left]{text}[/left]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**right**"
msgstr "**right**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally right-aligned."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ຊິດຂວາແນວນອນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Same as ``[p align=right]``."
msgstr "ມີຜົນຄືກັບ ``[p align=right]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:312
msgid "``[right]{text}[/right]``"
msgstr "``[right]{text}[/right]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**fill**"
msgstr "**fill**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` fill the full width of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ສະແດງຜົນເຕັມຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ ``RichTextLabel``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Same as ``[p align=fill]``."
msgstr "ມີຜົນຄືກັບ ``[p align=fill]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:318
msgid "``[fill]{text}[/fill]``"
msgstr "``[fill]{text}[/fill]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**indent**"
msgstr "**indent**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Indents ``{text}`` once. The indentation width is the same as with ``[ul]`` "
"or ``[ol]``, but without a bullet point."
msgstr ""
"ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ ``{text}`` ເຂົ້າໄປໜຶ່ງລະດັບ. ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຈະເທົ່າກັບ ``[ul]`` ຫຼື ``[ol]`` ແຕ່"
"ບໍ່ມີຈຸດ Bullet."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:324
msgid "``[indent]{text}[/indent]``"
msgstr "``[indent]{text}[/indent]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**url**"
msgstr "**url**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Creates a hyperlink (underlined and clickable text). Can contain optional "
"``{text}`` or display ``{link}`` as is. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options`."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຮເປີລິ້ງ (ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງ ແລະ ຄລິກໄດ້). ສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``{text}`` ໄດ້ ຫຼື ສະແດງ "
"``{link}`` ໂດຍກົງ. ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"**Must be handled with the \"meta_clicked\" signal to have an effect,** "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks`."
msgstr ""
"**ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການຜ່ານສັນຍະລັກ \"meta_clicked\" ຈຶ່ງຈະມີຜົນ,** ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[url]{link}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url]{link}[/url]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[url={link}]{text}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url={link}]{text}[/url]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[url {options}]{text}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url {options}]{text}[/url]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**hint**"
msgstr "**hint**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Creates a tooltip hint that is displayed when hovering the text with the "
"mouse. While not required, it's recommended to put tooltip text between "
"double or single quotes. Note that it is not possible to escape quotes using "
"``\\\"`` or ``\\'``. To use single quotes for apostrophes in the hint "
"string, you must use double quotes to surround the string."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຄຳແນະນຳ (Tooltip) ທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"Tooltip ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ ``\\\"`` ຫຼື ``\\'`` ເພື່ອ Escaped ໄ"
"ດ້. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າຄູ່ລ້ອມຮອບຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດແທນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]``"
msgstr "``[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**img**"
msgstr "**img**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Inserts an image from the ``{path}`` (can be any "
"valid :ref:`class_Texture2D` resource)."
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ຮູບພາບຈາກ ``{path}`` (ສາມາດໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ :ref:`class_Texture2D` ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If ``{width}`` is provided, the image will try to fit that width maintaining "
"the aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະບຸ ``{width}`` (ຄວາມກວ້າງ), ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຄວາມກວ້າງນັ້ນໂດຍຮັກສາສັດສ່ວນເດີມໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If both ``{width}`` and ``{height}`` are provided, the image will be scaled "
"to that size."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະບຸທັງ ``{width}`` ແລະ ``{height}`` (ຄວາມສູງ), ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມນັ້ນເລີຍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``%`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າ ``{width}`` ຫຼື ``{height}`` ເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ "
"control ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"a ratio of the current font size. For example, ``height=1em`` will make the "
"image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``em`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າ ``{width}`` ຫຼື ``{height}`` ເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດຟອນປະຈຸບັ"
"ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``height=1em`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບມີຄວາມສູງເທົ່າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the image will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ ``{valign}``, ຮູບພາບຈະພະຍາຍາມຈັດວາງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ, ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[img]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img]{path}[/img]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[img={width}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img={width}]{path}[/img]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[img={width}x{height}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img={width}x{height}]{path}[/img]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[img={valign}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img={valign}]{path}[/img]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[img {options}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img {options}]{path}[/img]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**font**"
msgstr "**ຟອນ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use a font resource from the ``{path}``."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ ``{text}`` ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຟອນຈາກ ``{path}``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[font={path}]{text}[/font]``"
msgstr "``[font={path}]{text}[/font]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[font {options}]{text}[/font]``"
msgstr "``[font {options}]{text}[/font]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**font_size**"
msgstr "**font_size**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Use custom font size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດຟອນແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ ``{text}``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:372
msgid "``[font_size={size}]{text}[/font_size]``"
msgstr "``[font_size={size}]{text}[/font_size]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**dropcap**"
msgstr "**dropcap**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Use a different font size and color for ``{text}``, while making the tag's "
"contents span multiple lines if it's large enough."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດຟອນ ແລະ ສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງສຳລັບ ``{text}``, ໂດຍເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອໃນຂອງແທັກກວມເອົາຫຼາຍບັນທັດຫາກມັນ"
"ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"A `drop cap <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/dropcap.htm>`__ is "
"typically one uppercase character, but ``[dropcap]`` supports containing "
"multiple characters. ``margins`` values are comma-separated and can be "
"positive, zero or negative. Values must **not** be separated by spaces; "
"otherwise, the values won't be parsed correctly. Negative top and bottom "
"margins are particularly useful to allow the rest of the paragraph to "
"display below the dropcap."
msgstr ""
"`drop cap <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/dropcap.htm>`__ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຕົວ"
"ອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ຕົວດຽວ, ແຕ່ ``[dropcap]`` ຮອງຮັບການມີຫຼາຍຕົວອັກສອນ. ຄ່າ ``margins`` ຕ້ອງຂັ້ນດ້ວ"
"ຍຈຸດ ແລະ ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ສູນ ຫຼື ຄ່າລົບ. ຄ່າຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງ **ບໍ່** ຍະຫວ່າງ; ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່າຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມ"
"ວນຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຂອບ (margins) ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ດ້ານລຸ່ມທີ່ເປັນຄ່າລົບ ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວ"
"ນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຫຍໍ້ໜ້າສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມ dropcap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:384
msgid ""
"``[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} outline_size={size} "
"outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},{bottom}]{text}[/"
"dropcap]``"
msgstr ""
"``[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} outline_size={size} "
"outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},{bottom}]{text}[/"
"dropcap]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**opentype_features**"
msgstr "**opentype_features**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Enables custom OpenType font features for ``{text}``. Features must be "
"provided as a comma-separated ``{list}``. Values must **not** be separated "
"by spaces; otherwise, the list won't be parsed correctly."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຟອນ OpenType ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ ``{text}``. ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງລະບຸເປັນລາຍການ "
"``{list}`` ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ຄ່າຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງ **ບໍ່** ຍະຫວ່າງ; ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ລາຍການຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນຢ່າງຖືກ"
"ຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[opentype_features={list}]``"
msgstr "``[opentype_features={list}]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``{text}``"
msgstr "``{text}``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[/opentype_features]``"
msgstr "``[/opentype_features]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**lang**"
msgstr "**ພາສາ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Overrides the language for ``{text}`` that is set by the **BiDi > Language** "
"property in :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`. ``{code}`` must be an "
"ISO :ref:`language code <doc_locales>`. This can be used to enforce the use "
"of a specific script for a language without starting a new paragraph. Some "
"font files may contain script-specific substitutes, in which case they will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບພາສາສຳລັບ ``{text}`` ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍຄຸນສົມບັດ **BiDi > Language** ໃນ "
":ref:`class_RichTextLabel`. ``{code}`` ຕ້ອງເປັນ :ref:`ລະຫັດພາສາ ISO "
"<doc_locales>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັງຄັບການໃຊ້ຕົວຂຽນ (script) ສະເພາະສຳລັບພາສາໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອ"
"ງເລີ່ມຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃໝ່. ໄຟລ໌ຟອນບາງຢ່າງອາດມີຕົວອັກສອນທົດແທນສະເພາະຕົວຂຽນ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວພວກມັນຈະຖືກນ"
"ຳໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:402
msgid "``[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]``"
msgstr "``[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:625
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:707
msgid "**color**"
msgstr "**ສີ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Changes the color of ``{text}``. Color must be provided by a common name "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`) or using the HEX "
"format (e.g. ``#ff00ff``, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`)."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສີຂອງ ``{text}``. ສີຕ້ອງລະບຸດ້ວຍຊື່ສີທົ່ວໄປ (ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ HEX (ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"``#ff00ff``, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:409
msgid "``[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]``"
msgstr "``[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**bgcolor**"
msgstr "**bgcolor**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Draws the color behind ``{text}``. This can be used to highlight text. "
"Accepts same values as the ``color`` tag. By default, there is a slight "
"padding which is controlled by the ``text_highlight_h_padding`` and "
"``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in the RichTextLabel node. Set "
"padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping issues when there are "
"background colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສີໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງ ``{text}``. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄຮໄລ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຮອງຮັບຄ່າດຽວກັບແທັກ ``color``. ໂດ"
"ຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະມີການຍັບຂອບ (padding) ເລັກນ້ອຍເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມໂດຍລາຍການທີມ "
"``text_highlight_h_padding`` ແລະ ``text_highlight_v_padding`` ໃນໂນດ "
"RichTextLabel. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ padding ເປັນ ``0`` ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາການຊ້ອນທັບທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີສີພື້ນຫຼັງໃ"
"ນບັນທັດ ຫຼື ຖັນຂ້າງຄຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:419
msgid "``[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]``"
msgstr "``[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**fgcolor**"
msgstr "**fgcolor**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Draws the color in front of ``{text}``. This can be used to \"redact\" text "
"by using an opaque foreground color. Accepts same values as the ``color`` "
"tag. By default, there is a slight padding which is controlled by the "
"``text_highlight_h_padding`` and ``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in "
"the RichTextLabel node. Set padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping "
"issues when there are foreground colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສີໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ ``{text}``. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ \"ປົກປິດ\" ຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍການໃຊ້ສີພື້ນໜ້າແບບທຶບແສງ. ຮອ"
"ງຮັບຄ່າດຽວກັບແທັກ ``color``. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະມີການຍັບຂອບ (padding) ເລັກນ້ອຍເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມໂດຍລາຍ"
"ການທີມ ``text_highlight_h_padding`` ແລະ ``text_highlight_v_padding`` ໃນໂນດ "
"RichTextLabel. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ padding ເປັນ ``0`` ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາການຊ້ອນທັບທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີສີພື້ນໜ້າໃ"
"ນບັນທັດ ຫຼື ຖັນຂ້າງຄຽງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:429
msgid "``[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]``"
msgstr "``[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**outline_size**"
msgstr "**outline_size**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Use custom font outline size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ ``{text}``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[outline_size={size}]``"
msgstr "``[outline_size={size}]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[/outline_size]``"
msgstr "``[/outline_size]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**outline_color**"
msgstr "**outline_color**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Use custom outline color for ``{text}``. Accepts same values as the "
"``color`` tag."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສີເສັ້ນຂອບແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ ``{text}``. ຮອງຮັບຄ່າດຽວກັບແທັກ ``color``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[outline_color={code/name}]``"
msgstr "``[outline_color={code/name}]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[/outline_color]``"
msgstr "``[/outline_color]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**table**"
msgstr "**ຕາຕະລາງ**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Creates a table with the ``{number}`` of columns. Use the ``cell`` tag to "
"define table cells."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕາຕະລາງທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຖັນຕາມ ``{number}``. ໃຊ້ແທັກ ``cell`` ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍຫ້ອງໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the table will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ ``{valign}``, ຕາຕະລາງຈະພະຍາຍາມຈັດວາງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ, ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If baseline alignment is used, the table is aligned to the baseline of the "
"row with index ``{alignment_row}`` (zero-based)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກໃຊ້ການຈັດວາງແບບ baseline, ຕາຕະລາງຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ (baseline) ຂອງແຖວທີ່"
"ມີອິນເດັກ (index) ``{alignment_row}`` (ເລີ່ມນັບຈາກສູນ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``{name}`` is a table name for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "``{name}`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (ເຄື່ອງອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[table={number}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number}]{cells}[/table]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr ""
"``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/table]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**cell**"
msgstr "**cell**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Adds a cell with ``{text}`` to the table."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຫ້ອງທີ່ມີ ``{text}`` ເຂົ້າໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"If ``{ratio}`` is provided, the cell will try to expand to that value "
"proportionally to other cells and their ratio values."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກມີການລະບຸ ``{ratio}``, ຫ້ອງຈະພະຍາຍາມຂະຫຍາຍຕາມຄ່ານັ້ນໂດຍສົມທຽບກັບຫ້ອງອື່ນໆ ແລະ ຄ່າອັດຕາສ່"
"ວນຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options`."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[cell]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell]{text}[/cell]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**ul**"
msgstr "**ລາຍການແບບບໍ່ມີລຳດັບ (ul)**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Adds an unordered list. List ``{items}`` must be provided by putting one "
"item per line of text."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການແບບບໍ່ມີລຳດັບ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍການ ``{items}`` ໂດຍການໃສ່ໜຶ່ງລາຍການຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງບັນທັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"The bullet point can be customized using the ``{bullet}`` parameter, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`."
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍ (bullet) ສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມີເຕີ ``{bullet}``, ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[ul]{items}[/ul]``"
msgstr "``[ul]{items}[/ul]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]``"
msgstr "``[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**ol**"
msgstr "**ລາຍການແບບມີລຳດັບ (ol)**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Adds an ordered (numbered) list of the given ``{type}`` "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`). List ``{items}`` must "
"be provided by putting one item per line of text."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການແບບມີລຳດັບ (ຕົວເລກ) ຕາມ ``{type}`` ທີ່ລະບຸ (ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`). ຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍການ ``{items}`` ໂດຍກ"
"ານໃສ່ໜຶ່ງລາຍການຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງບັນທັດ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:481
msgid "``[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]``"
msgstr "``[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "**lb**, **rb**"
msgstr "**lb**, **rb**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "Adds ``[`` and ``]`` respectively. Allows escaping BBCode markup."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ ``[`` ແລະ ``]`` ຕາມລຳດັບ. ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ BBCode ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກ "
"(escaping)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"These are self-closing tags, which means you do not need to close them (and "
"there is no ``[/lb]`` or ``[/rb]`` closing tag)."
msgstr ""
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນແທັກທີ່ປິດໃນຕົວ (self-closing), ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດພວກມັນ (ແລະ ບໍ່ມີແທັກປິດ "
"``[/lb]`` ຫຼື ``[/rb]``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]`` will display as ``[b]text[/b]``."
msgstr "``[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]`` ຈະສະແດງຜົນເປັນ ``[b]text[/b]``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"Several Unicode control characters can be added using their own self-closing "
"tags."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມ Unicode ຫຼາຍຕົວສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແທັກປິດໃນຕົວຂອງພວກມັນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "This can result in easier maintenance compared to pasting those"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທຽບກັບການວາງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "control characters directly in the text."
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນລົງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[lrm]`` (left-to-right mark), ``[rlm]`` (right-to-left mark), ``[lre]`` "
"(left-to-right embedding),"
msgstr ""
"``[lrm]`` (ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ), ``[rlm]`` (ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ), ``[lre]`` (ການຝັງ "
"ຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ),"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[rle]`` (right-to-left embedding), ``[lro]`` (left-to-right override), "
"``[rlo]`` (right-to-left override),"
msgstr ""
"``[rle]`` (ການຝັງ ຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ), ``[lro]`` (ການຂຽນທັບ ຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ), ``[rlo]`` (ການຂຽນທັ"
"ບ ຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ),"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[pdf]`` (pop directional formatting), ``[alm]`` (Arabic letter mark), "
"``[lri]`` (left-to-right isolate),"
msgstr ""
"``[pdf]`` (pop directional formatting), ``[alm]`` (ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕົວອັກສອນອາຣັບ), "
"``[lri]`` (ການແຍກ ຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ),"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[rli]`` (right-to-left isolate), ``[fsi]`` (first strong isolate), "
"``[pdi]`` (pop directional isolate),"
msgstr ""
"``[rli]`` (ການແຍກ ຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ), ``[fsi]`` (first strong isolate), ``[pdi]`` "
"(pop directional isolate),"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid ""
"``[zwj]`` (zero-width joiner), ``[zwnj]`` (zero-width non-joiner), ``[wj]`` "
"(word joiner),"
msgstr ""
"``[zwj]`` (ຕົວເຊື່ອມຄວາມກວ້າງສູນ), ``[zwnj]`` (ຕົວແຍກຄວາມກວ້າງສູນ), ``[wj]`` (ຕົວເຊື່ອມຄ"
"ຳ),"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:0
msgid "``[shy]`` (soft hyphen)"
msgstr "``[shy]`` (ຍະຫວ່າງຕັດຄຳ)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:503
msgid ""
"Tags for bold (``[b]``) and italics (``[i]``) formatting work best if the "
"appropriate custom fonts are set up in the RichTextLabelNode's theme "
"overrides. If no custom bold or italic fonts are defined, `faux bold and "
"italic fonts <https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/"
"faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__ will be generated by Godot. These fonts "
"rarely look good in comparison to hand-made bold/italic font variants."
msgstr ""
"ແທັກສຳລັບຕົວໜາ (``[b]``) ແລະ ຕົວເນີ້ງ (``[i]``) ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟອນແບບກຳນົດ"
"ເອງທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ theme overrides ຂອງ RichTextLabelNode. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຟອນຕົວໜາ ຫຼື ຕົວເນີ້ງ"
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, Godot ຈະສ້າງ `ຟອນຕົວໜາ ແລະ ຕົວເນີ້ງແບບຈຳລອງ (faux) <https://"
"fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__ ຂຶ້ນມາເອ"
"ງ. ຟອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍສວຍງາມເມື່ອທຽບກັບຟອນຕົວໜາ/ຕົວເນີ້ງແທ້ໆ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:509
msgid ""
"The monospaced (``[code]``) tag **only** works if a custom font is set up in "
"the RichTextLabel node's theme overrides. Otherwise, monospaced text will "
"use the regular font."
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ monospaced (``[code]``) ຈະເຮັດວຽກ **ກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອ** ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟອນແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ theme "
"overrides ຂອງໂນດ RichTextLabel ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ monospaced ຈະໃຊ້ຟອນປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:512
msgid "There are no BBCode tags to control vertical centering of text yet."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ມີແທັກ BBCode ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ເຄິ່ງກາງໃນແນວຕັ້ງເທື່ອ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:514
msgid "Options can be skipped for all tags."
msgstr "ສາມາດຂ້າມຕົວເລືອກ (options) ໄດ້ສຳລັບທຸກແທັກ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:519
msgid "Paragraph options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:521
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:655
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:783
msgid "**align**"
msgstr "**align**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:524
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:534
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:545
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:557
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:567
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:577
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:628
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:638
