msgstr "ຄວາມສູງເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຮູບພາບເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:727
#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:745
msgid "Alternative units to pixels can be specified:"
msgstr "ສາມາດລະບຸຫົວໜ່ວຍທາງເລືອກອື່ນແທນພິກເຊວໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:729
msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``height=50%`` will make the "
"image half as tall as the control is wide."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``%`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ control ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"``height=50%`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບມີຄວາມສູງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ control."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:732
msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``height=1em`` will "
"make the image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``em`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດຟອນອ້ອມຂ້າງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"``height=1em`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບມີຄວາມສູງເທົ່າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:743
msgid "Target width of the image in pixels."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຮູບພາບເປັນພິກເຊວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:747
msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``width=50%`` will make the "
"image take up half of the control width."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``%`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ control ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"``width=50%`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບມີຄວາມກວ້າງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ control."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:750
msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``width=1em`` will "
"make the image as wide as the surrounding text is tall."
msgstr ""
"ຕື່ມ ``em`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍຄ່າເພື່ອລະບຸເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດຟອນອ້ອມຂ້າງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"``width=1em`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບກວ້າງເທົ່າກັບຄວາມສູງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:753
msgid "**region**"
msgstr "**region**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:756
msgid "x,y,width,height in pixels"
msgstr "x,y,width,height ເປັນພິກເຊວ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:761
msgid ""
"Region rect of the image. This can be used to display a single image from a "
"spritesheet."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ (Region rect) ຂອງຮູບພາບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບພາບດຽວຈາກ spritesheet."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:763
msgid "**pad**"
msgstr "**pad**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:768
msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:771
msgid ""
"If set to ``true``, and the image is smaller than the size specified by "
"``width`` and ``height``, the image padding is added to match the size "
"instead of upscaling."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``true``, ແລະ ຮູບພາບມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ ``width`` ແລະ "
"``height``, ຈະມີການເພີ່ມ padding ໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂະໜາດຕາມນັ້ນ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຂະຫຍາຍຮູບ "
"(upscaling)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:781
msgid "Image tooltip."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (tooltip) ຂອງຮູບພາບ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:786
msgid "see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:788
msgid "``center,center``"
msgstr "``center,center``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:791
msgid "Image alignment to the surrounding text."
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:793
msgid "**alt**"
msgstr "**alt**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:801
msgid "Image description for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍຮູບພາບສຳລັບແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (ເຄື່ອງອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:806
msgid "Image and table vertical alignment"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງໃນແນວຕັ້ງ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:808
msgid ""
"When a vertical alignment value is provided with the ``[img]`` or "
"``[table]`` tag the image/table will try to align itself against the "
"surrounding text. Alignment is performed using a vertical point of the image "
"and a vertical point of the text. There are 3 possible points on the image "
"(``top``, ``center``, and ``bottom``) and 4 possible points on the text and "
"table (``top``, ``center``, ``baseline``, and ``bottom``), which can be used "
"in any combination."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການລະບຸຄ່າການຈັດວາງແນວຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບແທັກ ``[img]`` ຫຼື ``[table]``, ຮູບພາບ/ຕາຕະລາງຈະພະຍາ"
"ຍາມຈັດວາງຕົວເອງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ການຈັດວາງແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍໃຊ້ຈຸດໃນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຈຸດໃ"
"ນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ມີ 3 ຈຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນຮູບພາບ (``top``, ``center``, ແລະ ``bottom``) ແ"
"ລະ 4 ຈຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງ (``top``, ``center``, ``baseline``, ແລະ "
"``bottom``), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນຮູບແບບໃດກໍ່ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:815
msgid ""
"To specify both points, use their full or short names as a value of the "
"image/table tag:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລະບຸທັງສອງຈຸດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ເຕັມ ຫຼື ຊື່ຫຍໍ້ຂອງພວກມັນເປັນຄ່າຂອງແທັກ image/table:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:832
msgid ""
"You can also specify just one value (``top``, ``center``, or ``bottom``) to "
"make use of a corresponding preset (``top-top``, ``center-center``, and "
"``bottom-bottom`` respectively)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າດຽວ (``top``, ``center``, ຫຼື ``bottom``) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້"
"າ (presets) ທີ່ກົງກັນ (``top-top``, ``center-center``, ແລະ ``bottom-bottom`` ຕາມລ"
"ຳດັບ)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:836
msgid ""
"Short names for the values are ``t`` (``top``), ``c`` (``center``), ``l`` "
"(``baseline``), and ``b`` (``bottom``)."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆແມ່ນ ``t`` (``top``), ``c`` (``center``), ``l`` (``baseline``), ແ"
"ລະ ``b`` (``bottom``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:843
msgid "Font options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຟອນ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.rst:845
