#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1192
msgid ""
"Finally we can process our snapshot. Note that we are "
"using :ref:`OpenXRAnchorTracker<class_OpenXRAnchorTracker>` as our tracker "
"class as this already has all the support for anchors built in."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍພວກເຮົາສາມາດປະມວນຜົນສະນັບຊອດຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງໃຊ້ "
":ref:`OpenXRAnchorTracker<class_OpenXRAnchorTracker>` ເປັນຄລາດຕົວຕິດຕາມຂອງພວກເຮົ"
"າ ເພາະມັນມີການຮອງຮັບແອງເຄີທັງໝົດມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1264
msgid "Plane tracking capability"
msgstr "ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕິດຕາມລະນັບ"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1266
msgid ""
"Plane tracking is handled by "
"the :ref:`OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability<class_OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability>` "
"singleton class."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕາມລະນັບຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຄລາດຊິງເກິລຕັນ "
":ref:`OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability<class_OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability>"
"`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1270
msgid ""
"After the OpenXR session has been created you can call "
"``OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.is_supported`` to check if the plane "
"tracking feature is supported on your hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງເຊດຊັນ OpenXR ແລ້ວ ເເຈົ້າສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"``OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.is_supported`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຮາດແວຂອງເຈົ້າຮ"
"ອງຮັບຟີເຈີການຕິດຕາມລະນັບຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1273
msgid ""
"While we've provided most of the code for plane tracking up above, we'll "
"present the full implementation below as it has a few small tweaks. There is "
"no need to update snapshots here, we just do our discovery snapshot and "
"implement our process function."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພວກເຮົາໄດ້ໃຫ້ໂຄ້ດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມລະນັບໄປຂ້າງເທິງແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຈະສະແດງການນຳໃຊ້ແ"
"ບບເຕັມຮູບແບບດ້ານລຸ່ມ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການປັບປ່ຽນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດສະນັບຊອດຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາພຽງ"
"ແຕ່ສ້າງສະນັບຊອດການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການປະມວນຜົນຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_spatial_entities.rst:1277
msgid ""
"Plane tracking gives access to two components that are guaranteed to be "
"supported, and three optional components."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕາມລະນັບໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນປະກອບສອງຢ່າງທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບປະກັນວ່າຮອງຮັບ, ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບເສີມອີກ"
"ສາມຢ່າງ."

