#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:39
msgid "Registering Object classes"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຄລາດ Object"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:41
msgid ""
"Most ``Object`` subclasses are registered by calling ``GDREGISTER_CLASS``."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດຍ່ອຍຂອງ ``Object`` ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຖືກລົງທະບຽນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ``GDREGISTER_CLASS``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:47
msgid ""
"This will register it as a named, public class in the ``ClassDB``, which "
"will allow the class to be instantiated by scripts, code, or by "
"deserialization. Note that classes registered as ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` should "
"expect to be instantiated or freed automatically, for example by the editor "
"or the documentation system."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລົງທະບຽນມັນເປັນຄລາດສາທາລະນະທີ່ມີຊື່ໃນ ``ClassDB``, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄລາດນັ້ນສາມາດຖືກສ້າງ "
"(instantiated) ໂດຍສະຄຣິບ, ໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ໂດຍການຖອດລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນ (deserialization). ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ຄ"
"ລາດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` ຄວນຈະຖືກສ້າງ ຫຼື ຖືກລຶບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊັ່ນໂດຍ "
"editor ຫຼື ລະບົບເອກະສານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:51
msgid ""
"Besides ``GDREGISTER_CLASS``, there are a few other modes of privateness:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກ ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` ແລ້ວ, ຍັງມີຮູບແບບການກຳນົດສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງອື່ນໆອີກ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:71
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use ``GDSOFTCLASS(MyCustomClass, SuperClass)`` "
"instead of ``GDCLASS(MyCustomClass, SuperClass)``. Classes defined this way "
"are not registered in the ``ClassDB`` at all. This is sometimes used for "
"platform-specific subclasses."
msgstr ""
"ນອກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ ``GDSOFTCLASS(MyCustomClass, SuperClass)`` ແທນ ``GDCLASS"
"(MyCustomClass, SuperClass)`` ໄດ້. ຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ ``ClassDB`` ເ"
"ລີຍ. ບາງຄັ້ງວິທີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄລາດຍ່ອຍທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະແພລດຟອມໂດຍສະເພາະ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:76
msgid "Registering bindings"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (bindings)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:78
msgid ""
"Object-derived classes can override the static function ``static void "
"_bind_methods()``. When the class is registered, this static function is "
"called to register all the object methods, properties, constants, etc. It's "
"only called once."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Object ສາມາດຂຽນທັບ (override) ຟັງຊັນ static ``static void "
"_bind_methods()`` ໄດ້. ເມື່ອຄລາດຖືກລົງທະບຽນ, ຟັງຊັນ static ນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນທຸກໆ ເ"
"ມັດທອດ, ຄຸນສົມບັດ, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ຂອງ object ນັ້ນ. ມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:83
msgid ""
"Inside ``_bind_methods``, there are a couple of things that can be done. "
"Registering functions is one:"
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃນ ``_bind_methods``, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ການລົງທະບຽນຟັງຊັນແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:90
msgid "Default values for arguments can be passed as parameters at the end:"
msgstr "ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບອາຣ໌ກິວເມັນສາມາດສົ່ງເຂົ້າໄປເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີຢູ່ທາງທ້າຍໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:96
msgid ""
"Default values must be provided in the same order as they are declared, "
"skipping required arguments and then providing default values for the "
"optional ones. This matches the syntax for declaring methods in C++."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ຕາມລຳດັບດຽວກັບທີ່ປະກາດໄວ້, ໂດຍຂ້າມອາຣ໌ກິວເມັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄປກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງໃຫ້ຄ່າມ"
"າດຕະຖານສຳລັບຕົວທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກ (optional). ສິ່ງນີ້ກົງກັບໄວຍາກອນການປະກາດເມັດທອດໃນ C++."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:100
msgid ""
"``D_METHOD`` is a macro that converts \"methodname\" to a StringName for "
"more efficiency. Argument names are used for introspection, but when "
"compiling on release, the macro ignores them, so the strings are unused and "
"optimized away."
msgstr ""
