"`core/io/resource_loader.h <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"core/io/resource_loader.h>`__"
msgstr ""
"`core/io/resource_loader.h <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"core/io/resource_loader.h>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:386
msgid "Resource saving"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກ Resource"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:388
msgid "Saving a resource can be done with the resource saver API:"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກ resource ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ resource saver API:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:394
msgid ""
"The instance will be saved, and sub resources that have a path to a file "
"will be saved as a reference to that resource. Sub resources without a path "
"will be bundled with the saved resource and assigned sub-IDs, like ``res://"
"someresource.res::1``. This also helps to cache them when loaded."
msgstr ""
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ, ແລະ resource ຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນການອ້າງອີງ. ສ່ວນ "
"resource ຍ່ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບ resource ທີ່ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ຖືກກຳນົດ sub-ID ໃຫ້, ເຊັ່ນ "
"``res://someresource.res::1``. ນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃນການເຮັດແຄຊ໌ (cache) ເມື່ອຖືກໂຫຼດຄືນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/object_class.rst:402
msgid ""
"`core/io/resource_saver.h <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"core/io/resource_saver.h>`__"
msgstr ""
"`core/io/resource_saver.h <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"core/io/resource_saver.h>`__"

