#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:4
msgid "Internal rendering architecture"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງລະບົບການເຣັນເດີພາຍໃນ (Internal rendering architecture)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page is a high-level overview of Godot 4's internal renderer design. It "
"does not apply to previous Godot versions."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນພາບລວມລະດັບສູງຂອງການອອກແບບຕົວເຣັນເດີພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot 4. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ Godot ເວີຊັ"
"ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:9
msgid ""
"The goal of this page is to document design decisions taken to best suit "
"`Godot's design philosophy <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/"
"engine/guidelines/best_practices.html>`__, while providing a starting point "
"for new rendering contributors."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັດສິນໃຈໃນການອອກແບບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ `ປັດຊະຍາການອອກແບບຂອງ "
"Godot <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/"
"best_practices.html>`__, ພ້ອມທັງເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ທີ່ ຕ້ອງການປະກອບສ່ວນໃນການພັດທະນາລະບົບກ"
"ານເຣັນເດີໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you have questions about rendering internals not answered here, feel free "
"to ask in the ``#rendering`` channel of the `Godot Contributors Chat "
"<https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/rendering>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມີຄຳຖາມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການເຣັນເດີພາຍໃນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຳຕອບຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, ສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ໃນ ຊ່ອງ "
"``#rendering`` ຂອງ `Godot Contributors Chat <https://chat.godotengine.org/"
"channel/rendering>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:19
msgid ""
"If you have difficulty understanding concepts on this page, it is "
"recommended to go through an OpenGL tutorial such as `LearnOpenGL <https://"
"learnopengl.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມີຄວາມຫຍຸ້ງຍາກໃນການເຂົ້າໃຈແນວຄິດໃນໜ້ານີ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລອງສຶກສາບົດຮຽນ OpenGL ເຊັ່ນ "
"`LearnOpenGL <https://learnopengl.com/>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:23
msgid ""
"Modern low-level APIs (Vulkan/Direct3D 12/Metal) require intermediate "
"knowledge of higher-level APIs (OpenGL/Direct3D 11) to be used effectively. "
"Thankfully, contributors rarely need to work directly with low-level APIs. "
"Godot's renderers are built entirely on OpenGL and RenderingDevice, which is "
"our abstraction over Vulkan/Direct3D 12/Metal."
msgstr ""
"API ລະດັບຕ່ຳສະໄໝໃໝ່ (Vulkan/Direct3D 12/Metal) ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຮູ້ພື້ນຖານກ່ຽວກັບ API ລະດັບສູງ "
"(OpenGL/Direct3D 11) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ແຕ່ໂຊກດີທີ່ຜູ້ຮ່ວມພັດທະນາບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເ"
"ຮັດວຽກກັບ API ລະດັບຕ່ຳໂດຍກົງ. ຕົວເຣັນເດີຂອງ Godot ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນທັງໝົດເທິງ OpenGL ແລະ "
"RenderingDevice, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (abstraction) ຂອງພວກເຮົາເທິງ Vulkan/Direct3D 12/"
"Metal."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:32
msgid "Rendering methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຣັນເດີ (Rendering methods)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:37
msgid ""
"This is a forward renderer that uses a *clustered* approach to lighting."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເຣັນເດີແບບ forward ທີ່ໃຊ້ວິທີການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ *clustered* (ແບບກຸ່ມ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:39
msgid ""
"Clustered lighting uses a compute shader to group lights into a 3D frustum "
"aligned grid. Then, at render time, pixels can lookup what lights affect the "
"grid cell they are in and only run light calculations for lights that might "
"affect that pixel."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ Clustered ໃຊ້ compute shader ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມຂອງແສງເຂົ້າໃນຕາຕະລາງ 3D ທີ່ຈັດລຽງຕາ"
"ມ frustum. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນເວລາເຣັນເດີ, ພິກເຊວ (pixel) ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າ ມີແສງໃດແດ່ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຫ້ອ"
"ງຕາຕະລາງທີ່ມັນຢູ່ ແລະ ຄຳນວນສະເພາະແສງທີ່ອາດຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ພິກເຊວນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:44
msgid ""
"This approach can greatly speed up rendering performance on desktop "
"hardware, but is substantially less efficient on mobile."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການນີ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການເຣັນເດີໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເທິງຮາດແວຄອມພິວເຕີຕັ້ງໂຕະ (desktop), ແຕ່ຈະ"
"ມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍກວ່າຫຼາຍເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:50
msgid ""
"This is a forward renderer that uses a traditional single-pass approach to "
"lighting. Internally, it is called **Forward Mobile**."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເຣັນເດີແບບ forward ທີ່ໃຊ້ວິທີການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ single-pass ດັ້ງເດີມ. ພາຍໃນຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"**Forward Mobile**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:53
msgid ""
"Intended for mobile platforms, but can also run on desktop platforms. This "
"rendering method is optimized to perform well on mobile GPUs. Mobile GPUs "
"have a very different architecture compared to desktop GPUs due to their "
"unique constraints around battery usage, heat, and overall bandwidth "
"limitations of reading and writing data. Compute shaders also have very "
"limited support or aren't supported at all. As a result, the mobile renderer "
"purely uses raster-based shaders (fragment/vertex)."
msgstr ""
"ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມມືຖື, ແຕ່ກໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານເທິງຄອມພິວເຕີຕັ້ງໂຕະໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ວິທີການເຣັນເດີນີ້ຖືກປັບແຕ່"
"ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີເທິງ GPU ຂອງມືຖື. GPU ມືຖືມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ ຈາກ GPU ຕັ້ງໂຕະ ຍ້ອນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເລື່ອງການ"
"ໃຊ້ແບັດເຕີຣີ, ຄວາມຮ້ອນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ໃນການອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ. "
"Compute shaders ກໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບທີ່ຈຳກັດຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເລີຍ. ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາຄື ຕົວເຣັນເດີມືຖືຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາ"
"ະ raster-based shaders (fragment/vertex) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:61
msgid ""
"Unlike desktop GPUs, mobile GPUs perform *tile-based rendering*. Instead of "
"rendering the whole image as a single unit, the image is divided in smaller "
"tiles that fit within the faster internal memory of the mobile GPU. Each "
"tile is rendered and then written out to the destination texture. This all "
"happens automatically on the graphics driver."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ GPU ຕັ້ງໂຕະ, GPU ມືຖືຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບ *tile-based rendering*. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຣັນເດີ ຮູບພາບ"
"ທັງໝົດເປັນໜ່ວຍດຽວ, ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສ່ວນນ້ອຍໆ (tiles) ທີ່ພໍດີກັບໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳພາຍໃນ ທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດຂອ"
"ງ GPU ມືຖື. ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີແລ້ວຂຽນອອກໄປຍັງ texture ປາຍທາງ. ທັງໝົດນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"
"ໃນກຣາຟິກໄດຣເວີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:67
msgid ""
"The problem is that this introduces bottlenecks in our traditional approach. "
"For desktop rendering, we render all opaque geometry, then handle the "
"background, then transparent geometry, then post-processing. Each pass will "
"need to read the current result into tile memory, perform its operations and "
"then write it out again. We then wait for all tiles to be completed before "
"moving on to the next pass."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາແມ່ນສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄໍຂວດ (bottlenecks) ໃນວິທີການແບບດັ້ງເດີມຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີເທິ"
"ງ desktop, ພວກເຮົາຈະເຣັນເດີວັດຖຸທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈັດການພື້ນຫຼັງ, ຕາມດ້ວຍວັດຖຸໂປ່ງແສງ, ແລະ ສຸດ"
"ທ້າຍແມ່ນ post-processing. ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ (pass) ຈະຕ້ອງອ່ານ ຜົນລັບປັດຈຸບັນເຂົ້າໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ "
"tile, ເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ ແລ້ວຂຽນມັນອອກໄປອີກຄັ້ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຖ້າໃຫ້ທຸກ tiles ເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ ກ່ອນ"
"ຈະໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:74
msgid ""
"The first important change in the mobile renderer is that the mobile "
"renderer does not use the RGBA16F texture formats that the desktop "
"(Forward+) renderer does. Instead, it uses an R10G10B10A2 UNORM texture "
"format unless the :ref:`rendering/viewport/"
"hdr_2d<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/viewport/hdr_2d>` project "
"setting is enabled. This halves the bandwidth required and has further "
"improvements, as mobile hardware often further optimizes for 32-bit formats. "
"The tradeoff is that by default, the mobile renderer has limited HDR "
"capabilities due to the reduced precision and maximum values in the color "
"data."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນທຳອິດໃນຕົວເຣັນເດີມືຖືຄື ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ texture RGBA16F ຄືກັບຕົວເຣັນເດີ "
"desktop (Forward+). ແຕ່ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ R10G10B10A2 UNORM ແທນ ນອກຈາກວ່າຈະມີການເປີດໃຊ້ກາ"
"ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`rendering/viewport/"
"hdr_2d<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/viewport/hdr_2d>`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດແບ"
"ນວິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຍັງມີການປັບປຸງອື່ນໆ ເພາະຮາດແວມືຖືມັກຈະ ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາໃຫ້ດີເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບຮູບ"
"ແບບ 32-bit. ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ຕົວເຣັນເດີມືຖື ຈະມີຄວາມສາມາດ HDR ທີ່ຈຳກັດ ຍ້ອນຄວາມລະອຽດ ແ"
"ລະ ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສີທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:83
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`rendering/viewport/hdr_2d "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/viewport/hdr_2d>` project setting "
"is enabled, the mobile renderer uses the same RGBA16F renderers as Forward+. "
"This allows for full HDR support, but also increases bandwidth usage and can "
"reduce performance on mobile GPUs or integrated graphics."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`rendering/viewport/hdr_2d "
"<class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/viewport/hdr_2d>`, ຕົວເຣັນເດີມືຖືຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແ"
"ບບ RGBA16F ຄືກັນກັບ Forward+. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ HDR ໄດ້ເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ກໍ່ຈະເພີ່ມການໃຊ້ແບນວິດ ແ"
"ລະ ອາດຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບເທິງ GPU ມືຖື ຫຼື ກຣາຟິກແບບອອນບອດ (integrated graphics)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:88
msgid ""
"The second important change is the use of sub-passes whenever possible. Sub-"
"passes allows us to perform the rendering steps end-to-end per tile saving "
"on the overhead introduced by reading from and writing to the tiles between "
"each rendering pass. The ability to use sub-passes is limited by the "
"inability to read neighboring pixels, as we're constrained to working within "
"a single tile."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີສອງຄືການໃຊ້ sub-passes ເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້. Sub-passes ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ພວກເຮົາເຮັດຂັ້ນ"
"ຕອນການເຣັນເດີຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕົ້ນຈົນຈົບໃນແຕ່ລະ tile ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ overhead ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງ"
"ໃນ tile ລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະ pass. ແຕ່ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ sub-passes ແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດຍ້ອນບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານພິ"
"ກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງໄດ້ ເພາະພວກເຮົາຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນ tile ດຽວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:94
msgid ""
"This limitation of subpasses results in not being able to implement features "
"such as glow and depth of field efficiently. Similarly, if there is a "
"requirement to read from the screen texture or depth texture, we must fully "
"write out the rendering result limiting our ability to use sub-passes. When "
"such features are enabled, a mix of sub-passes and normal passes are used, "
"and these features result in a notable performance penalty."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ subpasses ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ (feature) ເຊັ່ນ glow ແລະ depth of field ໄດ້"
"ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຫາກມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ screen texture ຫຼື depth "
"texture, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຂຽນຜົນການເຣັນເດີອອກໄປທັງໝົດກ່ອນ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ sub-passes ໄດ້. ເ"
"ມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ທັງ sub-passes ແລະ normal passes ປະສົມກັນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນ"
"ກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:101
msgid ""
"On desktop platforms, the use of sub-passes won't have any impact on "
"performance. However, this rendering method can still perform better than "
"Forward+ in simple scenes thanks to its lower complexity and lower bandwidth "
"usage. This is especially noticeable on low-end GPUs, integrated graphics or "
"in VR applications."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງແພລັດຟອມ desktop, ການໃຊ້ sub-passes ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ວິທີການເຣັ"
"ນເດີນີ້ຍັງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າ Forward+ ໃນສາກ (scene) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ຍ້ອນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ແລ"
"ະ ໃຊ້ແບນວິດຕ່ຳກວ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນ GPU ລຸ້ນຕ່ຳ, ກຣາຟິກອອນບອດ ຫຼື ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ VR."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:107
msgid ""
"Given its low-end focus, this rendering method does not provide high-end "
"rendering features such as SDFGI and :ref:`doc_volumetric_fog`. Several post-"
"processing effects are also not available."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳ, ວິທີການເຣັນເດີນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີຟີເຈີລະດັບສູງ ເຊັ່ນ SDFGI ແລະ "
":ref:`doc_volumetric_fog`. ເອັບເຟັກ post-processing ຫຼາຍຢ່າງກໍ່ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:118
msgid ""
"This is the only rendering method available when using the OpenGL driver. "
"This rendering method is not available when using Vulkan, Direct3D 12, or "
"Metal."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການເຣັນເດີດຽວທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີ OpenGL. ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Vulkan, "
"Direct3D 12, ຫຼື Metal."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:121
msgid ""
"This is a traditional (non-clustered) forward renderer. Internally, it is "
"called **GL Compatibility**. It's intended for old GPUs that don't have "
"Vulkan support, but still works very efficiently on newer hardware. "
"Specifically, it is optimized for older and lower-end mobile devices. "
"However, many optimizations carry over making it a good choice for older and "
"lower-end desktop as well."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເຣັນເດີແບບ forward ດັ້ງເດີມ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ clustered). ພາຍໃນເອີ້ນວ່າ **GL "
"Compatibility**. ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບ GPU ລຸ້ນເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan, ແຕ່ກໍ່ຍັງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປ"
"ະສິດທິພາບ ເທິງຮາດແວລຸ້ນໃໝ່. ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນການປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນມືຖືລຸ້ນເກົ່າ ແລະ ລະດັບຕ່ຳ. ແນວ"
"ໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼາຍຢ່າງກໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບ desktop ລຸ້ນເກົ່າ ແລະ ລະດັບຕ່ຳຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:127
msgid ""
"Like the Mobile renderer, the Compatibility renderer uses an R10G10B10A2 "
"UNORM texture for 3D rendering. Unlike the mobile renderer, colors are "
"tonemapped and stored in sRGB format so there is no HDR support. This avoids "
"the need for a tonemapping pass and allows us to use the lower bit texture "
"without substantial banding."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບຕົວເຣັນເດີ Mobile, ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Compatibility ໃຊ້ texture R10G10B10A2 UNORM ສຳລັບກ"
"ານເຣັນເດີ 3D. ແຕ່ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວເຣັນເດີ Mobile ບ່ອນທີ່ສີຈະຖືກເຮັດ tonemapped ແລະ ເກັບໃນຮູບແບບ "
"sRGB ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບ HDR. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນ tonemapping ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກ"
"ເຮົາໃຊ້ texture ທີ່ມີບິດ (bit) ຕ່ຳກວ່າໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເກີດບັນຫາ banding ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:133
msgid ""
"The Compatibility renderer uses a traditional forward single-pass approach "
"to drawing objects with lights, but it uses a multi-pass approach to draw "
"lights with shadows. Specifically, in the first pass, it can draw multiple "
"lights without shadows and up to one DirectionalLight3D with shadows. In "
"each subsequent pass, it can draw up to one OmniLight3D, one SpotLight3D and "
"one DirectionalLight3D with shadows. Lights with shadows will affect the "
"scene differently than lights without shadows, as the lighting is blended in "
"sRGB space instead of linear space. This difference in lighting will impact "
"how the scene looks and needs to be kept in mind when designing scenes for "
"the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Compatibility ໃຊ້ວິທີການ forward single-pass ດັ້ງເດີມໃນການແຕ້ມວັດຖຸທີ່ມີແສງ, ແຕ່ມັນ"
"ໃຊ້ວິທີການ multi-pass ໃນການແຕ້ມແສງທີ່ມີເງົາ. ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນ pass ທຳອິດ, ມັນສາມາດແຕ້ມ ຫຼາຍແສງ"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ ແລະ ໄດ້ສູງສຸດໜຶ່ງ DirectionalLight3D ທີ່ມີເງົາ. ໃນແຕ່ລະ pass ຕໍ່ໄປ, ມັນສາມາດແຕ້ມໄດ້ສູງ"
"ສຸດໜຶ່ງ OmniLight3D, ໜຶ່ງ SpotLight3D ແລະ ໜຶ່ງ DirectionalLight3D ທີ່ມີເງົາ. ແສງທີ່ມີເງົາຈະສົ່"
"ງຜົນຕໍ່ສາກແຕກຕ່າງຈາກແສງທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ ເພາະແສງຈະຖືກປະສົມໃນ sRGB space ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ linear "
"space. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງແສງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ລັກສະນະຂອງສາກ ແລະ ຕ້ອງລະວັງ ເມື່ອອອກແບບສາກສຳລັບຕົວເຣັນ"
"ເດີ Compatibility."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:144
msgid ""
"Given its low-end focus, this rendering method does not provide high-end "
"rendering features (even less so compared to Mobile). Most post-processing "
"effects are not available."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳ, ວິທີການເຣັນເດີນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີຟີເຈີລະດັບສູງ (ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ Mobile ອີກ). ເອັບເ"
"ຟັກ post-processing ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:149
msgid "Why not deferred rendering?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໃຊ້ deferred rendering?"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:151
msgid ""
"Forward rendering generally provides a better tradeoff for performance "
"versus flexibility, especially when a clustered approach to lighting is "
"used. While deferred rendering can be faster in some cases, it's also less "
"flexible and requires using hacks to be able to use MSAA. Since games with a "
"less realistic art style can benefit a lot from MSAA, we chose to go with "
"forward rendering for Godot 4 (like Godot 3)."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ Forward rendering ໃຫ້ຄວາມສົມດຸນທີ່ດີກວ່າລະຫວ່າງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ, ໂດຍສ"
"ະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ clustered. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ deferred rendering ອາດຈະໄວກວ່າໃນບາ"
"ງກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍ່ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກພິເສດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ MSAA ໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກເກມທີ່ມີຮູບ"
"ແບບສິລະປະທີ່ບໍ່ເນັ້ນຄວາມສົມຈິງຫຼາຍສາມາດໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ MSAA, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງເລືອກໃຊ້ forward "
"rendering ສຳລັບ Godot 4 (ຄືກັບ Godot 3)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:158
msgid ""
"That said, parts of the forward renderer *are* performed with a deferred "
"approach to allow for some optimizations when possible. This applies to "
"VoxelGI and SDFGI in particular."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວເຣັນເດີ forward *ກໍ່* ຖືກເຮັດດ້ວຍວິທີການແບບ deferred ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມ"
"າດປັບແຕ່ງ (optimization) ບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບ VoxelGI ແລະ SDFGI ໂດຍສະເພາ"
"ະ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:162
msgid ""
"A clustered deferred renderer may be developed in the future. This renderer "
"could be used in situations where performance is favored over flexibility."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີແບບ clustered deferred ອາດຈະຖືກພັດທະນາໃນອະນາຄົດ. ຕົວເຣັນເດີນີ້ ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສະຖາ"
"ນະການທີ່ຕ້ອງການເນັ້ນປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:166
msgid "Rendering drivers"
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີການເຣັນເດີ (Rendering drivers)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:168
msgid "Godot 4 supports the following graphics APIs:"
msgstr "Godot 4 ຮອງຮັບ graphics API ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:171
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/index.rst:4
msgid "Vulkan"
msgstr "Vulkan"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:173
msgid ""
"This is the main driver in Godot 4, with most of the development focus going "
"towards this driver."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໄດຣເວີຫຼັກໃນ Godot 4, ໂດຍການພັດທະນາສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນເນັ້ນໃສ່ໄດຣເວີນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:176
msgid ""
"Vulkan 1.0 is required as a baseline, with optional Vulkan 1.1 and 1.2 "
"features used when available. `volk <https://github.com/zeux/volk>`__ is "
"used as a Vulkan loader, and `Vulkan Memory Allocator <https://github.com/"
"GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/VulkanMemoryAllocator>`__ is used for memory "
"management."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການ Vulkan 1.0 ເປັນພື້ນຖານ, ໂດຍຈະມີການໃຊ້ຟີເຈີຂອງ Vulkan 1.1 ແລະ 1.2 ເສີມ ເມື່ອມີໃຫ້ໃ"
"ຊ້. `volk <https://github.com/zeux/volk>`__ ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວໂຫຼດ Vulkan, ແລະ `Vulkan "
"Memory Allocator <https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/"
"VulkanMemoryAllocator>`__ ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈັດການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:182
msgid ""
"Both the Forward+ and "
"Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` are supported when "
"using the Vulkan driver."
msgstr ""
"ທັງ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` ແມ່ນ"
"ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບເມື່ອໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີ Vulkan."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:186
msgid "**Vulkan context creation:**"
msgstr "**ການສ້າງ Vulkan context:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:188
msgid ""
"`drivers/vulkan/rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/vulkan/"
"rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/vulkan/rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/vulkan/"
"rendering_context_driver_vulkan.cpp>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:190
msgid "**Direct3D 12 context creation:**"
msgstr "**ການສ້າງ Direct3D 12 context:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:192
msgid ""
"`drivers/d3d12/rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/d3d12/"
"rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/d3d12/rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/d3d12/rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp>"
"`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:195
msgid "Direct3D 12"
msgstr "Direct3D 12"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:197
msgid ""
"Like Vulkan, the Direct3D 12 driver targets modern platforms only. It is "
"designed to target both Windows and Xbox (whereas Vulkan can't be used "
"directly on Xbox)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ Vulkan, ໄດຣເວີ Direct3D 12 ເນັ້ນໃສ່ແພລັດຟອມສະໄໝໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ"
"ທັງ Windows ແລະ Xbox (ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Vulkan ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງເທິງ Xbox)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:200
msgid ""
"Both the Forward+ and "
"Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` can be used with "
"Direct3D 12."
msgstr ""
"ທັງ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` ສາມ"
"າດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບ Direct3D 12 ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:203
msgid ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` are shared with the "
"Vulkan renderer. Shaders are transpiled from :abbr:`SPIR-V (Standard "
"Portable Intermediate Representation)` to :abbr:`DXIL (DirectX Intermediate "
"Language)` using Mesa NIR (`more information <https://godotengine.org/"
"article/d3d12-adventures-in-shaderland/>`__)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບຕົວເຣັນເ"
"ດີ Vulkan. Shader ຈະຖືກແປງ (transpiled) ຈາກ :abbr:`SPIR-V (Standard Portable "
"Intermediate Representation)` ໄປເປັນ :abbr:`DXIL (DirectX Intermediate "
"Language)` ໂດຍໃຊ້ Mesa NIR (`ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ <https://godotengine.org/article/d3d12-"
"adventures-in-shaderland/>`__)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:209
msgid ""
"**This driver is still experimental and only available in Godot 4.3 and "
"later.** While Direct3D 12 allows supporting Direct3D-exclusive features on "
"Windows 11 such as windowed optimizations and Auto HDR, Vulkan is still "
"recommended for most projects. See the `pull request that introduced "
"Direct3D 12 support <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/70315>`__ for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"**ໄດຣເວີນີ້ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທົດລອງ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Godot 4.3 ຂຶ້ນໄປ.** ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ "
"Direct3D 12 ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບຟີເຈີສະເພາະຂອງ Direct3D ເທິງ Windows 11 ເຊັ່ນ windowed "
"optimizations ແລະ Auto HDR, ແຕ່ Vulkan ກໍ່ຍັງເປັນໄດຣເວີທີ່ແນະນຳ ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ເບິ່"
"ງ `pull request ທີ່ນຳສະເໜີການຮອງຮັບ Direct3D 12 <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/pull/70315>`__ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:216
msgid "Metal"
msgstr "Metal"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:218
msgid ""
"Godot provides a native Metal driver that works on all Apple Silicon "
"hardware (macOS ARM). Compared to using the MoltenVK translation layer, this "
"is significantly faster, particularly in CPU-bound scenarios."
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີໄດຣເວີ Metal ແບບ native ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເທິງຮາດແວ Apple Silicon ທັງໝົດ (macOS "
"ARM). ເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໃຊ້ MoltenVK, ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນໄວກວ່າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ ມີກາ"
"ນໃຊ້ CPU ຢ່າງໜັກໜ່ວງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:222
msgid ""
"Both the Forward+ and "
"Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` can be used with "
"Metal."
msgstr ""
"ທັງ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_methods` ສາມ"
"າດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບ Metal ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:225
msgid ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` are shared with the "
"Vulkan renderer. Shaders are transpiled from GLSL to :abbr:`MSL (Metal "
"Shading Language)` using SPIRV-Cross."
msgstr ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບຕົວເຣັນເ"
"ດີ Vulkan. Shader ຈະຖືກແປງຈາກ GLSL ໄປເປັນ :abbr:`MSL (Metal Shading Language)` ໂ"
"ດຍໃຊ້ SPIRV-Cross."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:229
msgid ""
"Godot also supports Metal rendering via `MoltenVK <https://github.com/"
"KhronosGroup/MoltenVK>`__, which is used as a fallback when native Metal "
"support is not available (e.g. on x86 macOS)."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍັງຮອງຮັບການເຣັນເດີ Metal ຜ່ານ `MoltenVK <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/"
"MoltenVK>`__, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງ (fallback) ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ Metal ແບບ native ໄດ້ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ ເທິງ x86 macOS)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:232
msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.7, Metal 4 is now used when supported. All Apple Silicon "
"hardware supports Metal 4, but it must be running macOS 26 or later, or iOS "
"26 or later. Metal 3 is automatically used as a fallback on older macOS and "
"iOS versions. See the `pull request that introduced Metal 4 support <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114484>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.7 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ Metal 4 ເມື່ອຮອງຮັບ. ຮາດແວ Apple Silicon ທັງໝົດ ຮ"
"ອງຮັບ Metal 4, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລ່ນເທິງ macOS 26 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, ຫຼື iOS 26 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. Metal 3 ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເ"
"ປັນຕົວສຳຮອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ macOS ແລະ iOS ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ. ເບິ່ງ `pull request ທີ່ນຳສະເໜີການຮອງ"
"ຮັບ Metal 4 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114484>`__ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີ"
"ມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:239
msgid "OpenGL"
msgstr "OpenGL"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:241
msgid ""
"This driver uses OpenGL ES 3.0 and targets legacy and low-end devices that "
"don't support Vulkan. OpenGL 3.3 Core Profile is used on desktop platforms "
"to run this driver, as most graphics drivers on desktop don't support OpenGL "
"ES. WebGL 2.0 is used for web exports."
msgstr ""
"ໄດຣເວີນີ້ໃຊ້ OpenGL ES 3.0 ແລະ ເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນລຸ້ນເກົ່າ ຫຼື ລະດັບຕ່ຳທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan. ມີການໃຊ້ "
"OpenGL 3.3 Core Profile ເທິງ desktop ເພື່ອແລ່ນໄດຣເວີນີ້, ເພາະໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເທິງ "
"desktop ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenGL ES. ສ່ວນ WebGL 2.0 ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງເວັບ (web "
"exports)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:246
msgid ""
"It is possible to use OpenGL ES 3.0 directly on desktop platforms by passing "
"the ``--rendering-driver opengl3_es`` command line argument, although this "
"will only work on graphics drivers that feature native OpenGL ES support "
"(such as Mesa)."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ OpenGL ES 3.0 ໂດຍກົງເທິງ desktop ໂດຍການສົ່ງອາຄິວເມນ (argument) ``--"
"rendering-driver opengl3_es`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ command line, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສະເພາະ ໃນໄດ"
"ຣເວີກຣາຟິກທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenGL ES ແບບ native ເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ Mesa)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:251
msgid ""
"Only the :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_compatibility` rendering "
"method can be used with the OpenGL driver."
msgstr ""
"ມີພຽງວິທີການເຣັນເດີ :ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_compatibility` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"
"ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໄດຣເວີ OpenGL ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:254
msgid ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` are entirely "
"different from the Vulkan renderer."
msgstr ""
":ref:`doc_internal_rendering_architecture_core_shaders` ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ ຕົວເຣັນເດີ "
"Vulkan ຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:257
msgid ""
"Many advanced features are not supported with this driver, as it targets low-"
"end devices first and foremost."
msgstr ""
"ຟີເຈີຂັ້ນສູງຫຼາຍຢ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນໄດຣເວີນີ້, ເພາະມັນເນັ້ນໃສ່ ອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳເປັນຫຼັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:261
msgid "Summary of rendering drivers/methods"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບຂອງໄດຣເວີ ແລະ ວິທີການເຣັນເດີ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:263
msgid ""
"The following rendering API + rendering method combinations are currently "
"possible:"
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມປະສານລະຫວ່າງ rendering API + rendering method ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຄື:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:265
msgid "Vulkan + Forward+ (optionally through MoltenVK on macOS and iOS)"
msgstr "Vulkan + Forward+ (ເລືອກໃຊ້ຜ່ານ MoltenVK ໄດ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ iOS)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:266
msgid "Vulkan + Mobile (optionally through MoltenVK on macOS and iOS)"
msgstr "Vulkan + Mobile (ເລືອກໃຊ້ຜ່ານ MoltenVK ໄດ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ iOS)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:267
msgid "Direct3D 12 + Forward+"
msgstr "Direct3D 12 + Forward+"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:268
msgid "Direct3D 12 + Mobile"
msgstr "Direct3D 12 + Mobile"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:269
msgid "Metal + Forward+"
msgstr "Metal + Forward+"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:270
msgid "Metal + Mobile"
msgstr "Metal + Mobile"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:271
msgid "OpenGL + Compatibility (optionally through ANGLE on Windows and macOS)"
msgstr "OpenGL + Compatibility (ເລືອກໃຊ້ຜ່ານ ANGLE ໄດ້ໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:273
msgid ""
"Each combination has its own limitations and performance characteristics. "
"Make sure to test your changes on all rendering methods if possible before "
"opening a pull request."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະການປະສົມປະສານມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຄຸນລັກສະນະດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄ"
"ດ້ທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານໃນທຸກວິທີການເຣັນເດີ ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດ pull request."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:278
msgid "RenderingDevice abstraction"
msgstr "ຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RenderingDevice (RenderingDevice abstraction)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:282
msgid "The OpenGL driver does not use the RenderingDevice abstraction."
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີ OpenGL ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ RenderingDevice abstraction."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:284
msgid ""
"To make the complexity of modern low-level graphics APIs more manageable, "
"Godot uses its own abstraction called RenderingDevice."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງ API ກຣາຟິກລະດັບຕ່ຳສະໄໝໃໝ່ຈັດການໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, Godot ຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງຕົ"
"ນເອງທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ RenderingDevice."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:287
msgid ""
"This means that when writing code for modern rendering methods, you don't "
"actually use the Vulkan, Direct3D 12, or Metal APIs directly. While this is "
"still lower-level than an API like OpenGL, this makes working on the "
"renderer easier, as RenderingDevice will abstract many API-specific quirks "
"for you. The RenderingDevice presents a similar level of abstraction as "
"WebGPU."
msgstr ""
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອຂຽນໂຄ້ດສຳລັບວິທີການເຣັນເດີສະໄໝໃໝ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ API ຂອງ Vulkan, Direct3D "
"12, ຫຼື Metal ໂດຍກົງ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຍັງເປັນລະດັບຕ່ຳກວ່າ API ເຊັ່ນ OpenGL, ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽ"
"ກກັບຕົວເຣັນເດີງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ເພາະ RenderingDevice ຈະຊ່ວຍຈັດການລາຍລະອຽດສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະ API ໃຫ້ທ່"
"ານ. RenderingDevice ມີລະດັບ abstraction ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ WebGPU."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:293
msgid "**Vulkan RenderingDevice implementation:**"
msgstr "**ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Vulkan RenderingDevice:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:295
msgid ""
"`drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/vulkan/"
"rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp>"
"`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:297
msgid "**Direct3D 12 RenderingDevice implementation:**"
msgstr "**ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Direct3D 12 RenderingDevice:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:299
msgid ""
"`drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/d3d12/"
"rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp>"
"`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:301
msgid "**Metal RenderingDevice implementation:**"
msgstr "**ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Metal RenderingDevice:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:303
msgid ""
"`drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/metal/"
"rendering_device_driver_metal.cpp>`__ - Metal 4"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/metal/"
"rendering_device_driver_metal.cpp>`__ - Metal 4"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:304
msgid ""
"`drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal3.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/metal/"
"rendering_device_driver_metal3.cpp>`__ - Metal 3"
msgstr ""
"`drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal3.cpp <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/metal/"
"rendering_device_driver_metal3.cpp>`__ - Metal 3"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:307
msgid "Core rendering classes architecture"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງຄລາສການເຣັນເດີຫຼັກ (Core rendering classes architecture)"

