#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:434
msgid "2D rendering techniques"
msgstr "ເຕັກນິກການເຣັນເດີ 2D"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:436
msgid ""
"2D light rendering is performed in a single pass to allow for better "
"performance with large amounts of lights."
msgstr ""
"ການເຣັນເດີແສງ 2D ແມ່ນເຮັດໃນ pass ດຽວເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າເມື່ອມີແສງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:439
msgid ""
"All rendering methods feature 2D batching to improve performance, which is "
"especially noticeable with lots of text on screen."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກວິທີການເຣັນເດີມີລະບົບ 2D batching ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນເມື່ອມີຕົວໜັງສືຈຳນວນຫຼາ"
"ຍເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:442
msgid ""
"MSAA can be enabled in 2D to provide \"automatic\" line and polygon "
"antialiasing, but FXAA does not affect 2D rendering as it's calculated "
"before 2D rendering begins. Godot's 2D drawing methods such as the Line2D "
"node or some CanvasItem ``draw_*()`` methods provide their own way of "
"antialiasing based on triangle strips and vertex colors, which don't require "
"MSAA to work."
msgstr ""
"MSAA ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ 2D ເພື່ອເຮັດ antialiasing ໃຫ້ກັບເສັ້ນ ແລະ polygon ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ "
"FXAA ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ 2D ເພາະມັນຖືກຄຳນວນກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ 2D ຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ວິທີການແຕ້ມ 2D ຂອງ Godot "
"ເຊັ່ນ Line2D ຫຼື ເມທອດ ``draw_*()`` ບາງຢ່າງ ມີວິທີເຮັດ antialiasing ຂອງຕົນເອງໂດຍອີງໃສ່ "
"triangle strips ແລະ vertex colors, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ MSAA."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:448
msgid ""
"A 2D signed distance field representing LightOccluder2D nodes in the "
"viewport is automatically generated if a user shader requests it. This can "
"be used for various effects in custom shaders, such as 2D global "
"illumination. It is also used to calculate particle collisions in 2D."
msgstr ""
"2D signed distance field (SDF) ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງໂນດ LightOccluder2D ໃນ viewport ຈະຖືກສ້"
"າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກ user shader ຕ້ອງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ ໃນ custom "
"shaders ເຊັ່ນ 2D global illumination. ມັນຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄຳນວນ ການຕຳກັນຂອງພາກທິເຄິນ "
"(particle collisions) ໃນ 2D ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:453
msgid "**2D SDF generation GLSL shader:**"
msgstr "**GLSL shader ສຳລັບການສ້າງ 2D SDF:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:455
msgid ""
"`servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas_sdf.glsl <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/"
"canvas_sdf.glsl>`__"
msgstr ""
"`servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas_sdf.glsl <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/4.6/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/"
"canvas_sdf.glsl>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:458
msgid "3D rendering techniques"
msgstr "ເຕັກນິກການເຣັນເດີ 3D"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:461
msgid "Reverse Z"
msgstr "Reverse Z"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:463
msgid ""
"All of Godot's renderers use reverse Z. This means that the depth buffer is "
"inverted, with ``1.0`` representing the near plane and ``0.0`` representing "
"the far plane. This allows for `better precision <https://"
"developer.nvidia.com/content/depth-precision-visualized>`__, especially at "
"long distances."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຕົວເຣັນເດີຂອງ Godot ໃຊ້ reverse Z. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ depth buffer ຈະຖືກກັບດ້ານ, ໂດຍຄ່າ "
"``1.0`` ຈະແທນລະນາບໃກ້ (near plane) ແລະ ``0.0`` ແທນລະນາບໄກ (far plane). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃ"
"ຫ້ໄດ້ `ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ດີກວ່າ <https://developer.nvidia.com/content/depth-precision-"
"visualized>`__, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນໄລຍະທາງທີ່ໄກຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:470
msgid "Batching and instancing"
msgstr "Batching ແລະ instancing"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:472
msgid ""
"In the Forward+ renderer, Vulkan instancing is used to group rendering of "
"identical opaque or alpha-tested objects for performance. (Alpha-blended "
"objects are never instanced.) This is not as fast as static mesh merging, "
"but it still allows instances to be culled individually."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຕົວເຣັນເດີ Forward+, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ Vulkan instancing ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມການເຣັນເດີຂອງວັດຖຸ ທີ່ທຶບແສງ "
"ຫຼື ຜ່ານການ alpha-test ທີ່ຄືກັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ (ວັດຖຸແບບ alpha-blended ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຮັດ "
"instanced). ວິທີນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄວເທົ່າກັບ static mesh merging, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະ instance ຖື"
"ກ culling ແຍກກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:478
msgid "Light, decal and reflection probe rendering"
msgstr "ການເຣັນເດີແສງ, decal ແລະ reflection probe"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:482
msgid ""
"Decal rendering is currently not available in the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""
"ການເຣັນເດີ Decal ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຕົວເຣັນເດີ Compatibility ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:484
msgid ""
"The Forward+ renderer uses clustered lighting. This allows using as many "
"lights as you want; performance largely depends on screen coverage. Shadow-"
"less lights can be almost free if they don't occupy much space on screen."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Forward+ ໃຊ້ clustered lighting. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແສງໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການ; ປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ແສງກວມເອົາເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ແສງທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ ແທບຈະບໍ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເລີຍ ຫາກພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ກ"
"ວມເອົາພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:489
msgid ""
"All rendering methods also support rendering up to 8 directional lights at "
"the same time (albeit with lower shadow quality when more than one light has "
"shadows enabled)."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກວິທີການເຣັນເດີຮອງຮັບການສະແດງ directional lights ໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 8 ດວງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ (ແຕ່ຄຸນນະພ"
"າບເງົາຈະຫຼຸດລົງ ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງດວງ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:493
msgid ""
"The Mobile renderer uses a single-pass lighting approach, with a limitation "
"of 8 OmniLights + 8 SpotLights affecting each Mesh *resource* (plus a "
"limitation of 256 OmniLights + 256 SpotLights in the camera view). These "
"limits are hardcoded and can't be adjusted in the project settings."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Mobile ໃຊ້ວິທີການ single-pass lighting, ໂດຍມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຄື OmniLights 8 ດວງ + "
"SpotLights 8 ດວງ ຕໍ່ Mesh *resource* (ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ 256 OmniLights + 256 "
"SpotLights ໃນມຸມມອງກ້ອງ). ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະຫັດ (hardcoded) ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດປັບໃນການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:498
msgid ""
"The Compatibility renderer uses a hybrid single-pass + multi-pass lighting "
"approach. Lights without shadows are rendered in a single pass. Lights with "
"shadows are rendered in multiple passes. This is required for performance "
"reasons on mobile devices. As a result, performance does not scale well with "
"many shadow-casting lights. It is recommended to only have a handful of "
"lights with shadows in the camera frustum at a time and for those lights to "
"be spread apart so that each object is only touched by 1 or 2 shadowed "
"lights at a time. The maximum number of lights visible at once can be "
"adjusted in the project settings."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Compatibility ໃຊ້ວິທີການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ single-pass + multi-pass lighting. ແສ"
"ງທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໃນ pass ດຽວ. ສ່ວນແສງທີ່ມີເງົາຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໃນຫຼາຍ pass. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນ"
"ດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື. ຜົນຄືປະສິດທິພາບຈະຫຼຸດລົງຢ່າງໄວ ຫາກມີແສງທີ່ມີເງົາຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ມີ"
"ແສງທີ່ມີເງົາພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດດວງໃນມຸມມອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ຄວນແຍກແສງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກຈາກກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະວັດຖຸຖືກກະທົບໂ"
"ດຍແສງທີ່ມີເງົາພຽງ 1 ຫຼື 2 ດວງ ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຈຳນວນແສງສູງສຸດທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:511
msgid ""
"In all 3 methods, lights without shadows are much cheaper than lights with "
"shadows. To improve performance, lights are only updated when the light is "
"modified or when objects in its radius are modified. Godot currently doesn't "
"separate static shadow rendering from dynamic shadow rendering, but this is "
"planned in a future release."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທັງ 3 ວິທີ, ແສງທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາແມ່ນກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍກວ່າແສງທີ່ມີເງົາຫຼາຍ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ, ແສງຈະຖືກອັ"
"ບເດດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າຂອງແສງ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລັດສະໝີ ຂອງມັນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ Godot ຍັງບໍ່ທັນ"
"ແຍກການເຣັນເດີເງົາຄົງທີ່ (static) ອອກຈາກເງົາແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamic), ແຕ່ມີແຜນທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃນອະນາຄົ"
"ດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:517
msgid ""
"Clustering is also used for reflection probes and decal rendering in the "
"Forward+ renderer."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບ Clustering ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ reflection probes ແລະ decal ໃນຕົວເຣັນເດີ Forward+."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:520
msgid ""
"Area lights make use of the `Linearly Transformed Cosines <https://"
"eheitzresearch.wordpress.com/757-2/>`__ technique."
msgstr ""
"Area lights ໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກ `Linearly Transformed Cosines <https://"
"eheitzresearch.wordpress.com/757-2/>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:527
msgid ""
"Both Forward+ and Mobile methods use :abbr:`PCF (Percentage Closer "
"Filtering)` to filter shadow maps and create a soft penumbra. Instead of "
"using a fixed PCF pattern, these methods use a vogel disk pattern which "
"allows for changing the number of samples and smoothly changing the quality."
msgstr ""
"ທັງ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ໃຊ້ :abbr:`PCF (Percentage Closer Filtering)` ເພື່ອ "
"filter shadow maps ແລະ ສ້າງເງົາທີ່ຟຸ້ງ (soft penumbra). ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ PCF ທີ່ຕາຍຕົວ, ວິ"
"ທີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ vogel disk pattern ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນຈຳນວນ samples ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນນະພາບໄດ້ຢ່າ"
"ງນຸ່ມນວນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:533
msgid ""
"Godot also supports percentage-closer soft shadows (PCSS) for more realistic "
"shadow penumbra rendering. PCSS shadows are limited to the Forward+ renderer "
"as they're too demanding to be usable in the Mobile renderer. PCSS also uses "
"a vogel-disk shaped kernel."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຍັງຮອງຮັບ percentage-closer soft shadows (PCSS) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເຣັນເດີເງົາ ມີຄວາມສົມຈິ"
"ງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເງົາແບບ PCSS ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ເພາະມັນກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປສຳລັບຕົວ"
"ເຣັນເດີ Mobile. PCSS ກໍ່ໃຊ້ kernel ຮູບຊົງ vogel-disk ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:538
msgid ""
"Additionally, both shadow-mapping techniques rotate the kernel on a per-"
"pixel basis to help soften under-sampling artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທັງສອງເຕັກນິກ shadow-mapping ຍັງມີການໝຸນ kernel ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກ "
"(artifacts) ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການ under-sampling."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:541
msgid ""
"The Compatibility renderer supports shadow mapping for DirectionalLight3D, "
"OmniLight3D, and SpotLight3D lights."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Compatibility ຮອງຮັບ shadow mapping ສຳລັບ DirectionalLight3D, "
"OmniLight3D, ແລະ SpotLight3D."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:545
msgid "Temporal antialiasing"
msgstr "Temporal antialiasing (TAA)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:549
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:661
#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:743
msgid ""
"Only available in the Forward+ renderer, not the Mobile or Compatibility "
"renderers."
msgstr "ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີໃນ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:551
msgid ""
"Godot uses a custom TAA implementation based on the old TAA implementation "
"from `Spartan Engine <https://github.com/PanosK92/SpartanEngine>`__."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ການເຮັດ TAA ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ລະບົບ TAA ເກົ່າຈາກ `Spartan Engine "
"<https://github.com/PanosK92/SpartanEngine>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:554
msgid ""
"Temporal antialiasing requires motion vectors to work. If motion vectors are "
"not correctly generated, ghosting will occur when the camera or objects move."
msgstr ""
"TAA ຕ້ອງການ motion vectors ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກ. ຫາກ motion vectors ບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະເກີດ"
"ພາບຊ້ອນ (ghosting) ເມື່ອກ້ອງ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:557
msgid ""
"Motion vectors are generated on the GPU in the main material shader. This is "
"done by running the vertex shader corresponding to the previous rendered "
"frame (with the previous camera transform) in addition to the vertex shader "
"for the current rendered frame, then storing the difference between them in "
"a color buffer."
msgstr ""
"Motion vectors ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ GPU ພາຍໃນ main material shader. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການ ແລ່ນ "
"vertex shader ຂອງເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າ (ດ້ວຍຄ່າ transform ຂອງກ້ອງເກົ່າ) ຄວບຄູ່ໄປກັບ vertex "
"shader ຂອງເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລ້ວເກັບຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນໄວ້ໃນ color buffer."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:562
msgid ""
"Alternatively, FSR 2.2 can be used as an upscaling solution that also "
"provides its own temporal antialiasing algorithm. FSR 2.2 is implemented on "
"top of the RenderingDevice abstraction as opposed to using AMD's reference "
"code directly."
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ FSR 2.2 ເປັນຕົວ upscaling ເຊິ່ງມັນມີອັນກໍຣິທຶມ TAA ໃນຕົວເອງ. FSR "
"2.2 ຖືກພັດທະນາເທິງ RenderingDevice abstraction ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ reference code ຂອງ AMD ໂ"
"ດຍກົງ."

