#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:628
msgid "Depth of field"
msgstr "Depth of field (DOF)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:632
msgid ""
"Only available in the Forward+ and Mobile renderers, not the Compatibility "
"renderer."
msgstr "ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile, ບໍ່ມີໃນ Compatibility."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:635
msgid ""
"The Forward+ and Mobile renderers use different approaches to DOF rendering, "
"with different visual results. This is done to best match the performance "
"characteristics of the target hardware. In Forward+, DOF is performed using "
"a compute shader. In Mobile, DOF is performed using a fragment shader "
"(raster)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣັນເດີ DOF ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທາງພາບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າ"
"ງກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງຮາດແວເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນ Forward+, DOF ຈະໃຊ້ "
"compute shader. ສ່ວນໃນ Mobile, DOF ຈະໃຊ້ fragment shader (raster)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:640
msgid ""
"Box, hexagon and circle bokeh shapes are available (from fastest to "
"slowest). Depth of field can optionally be jittered every frame to improve "
"its appearance when temporal antialiasing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ມີຮູບຊົງ bokeh ແບບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ (Box), ຫົກຫຼ່ຽມ (Hexagon) ແລະ ວົງມົນ (Circle) ໃຫ້ເລືອກ (ລຽງຈາກໄວ"
"ທີ່ສຸດໄປຫາຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ). DOF ສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ມີການ jitter ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງດີຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ TAA."

