"`servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/4.6/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:833
msgid "Automatic mesh LOD"
msgstr "Mesh LOD ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:835
msgid ""
"The ImporterMesh class is used for the 3D mesh import workflow in the "
"editor. Its ``generate_lods()`` function handles generating using the "
"`meshoptimizer <https://meshoptimizer.org/>`__ library."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສ ImporterMesh ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ 3D mesh ໃນ editor. ຟັງຊັນ "
"``generate_lods()`` ຂອງມັນຈະຈັດການການສ້າງໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຣບຣາຣີ `meshoptimizer <https://"
"meshoptimizer.org/>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:839
msgid ""
"LOD mesh generation also generates shadow meshes at the same time. These are "
"meshes that have their vertices welded regardless of smoothing and "
"materials. This is used to improve shadow rendering performance by lowering "
"the vertex throughput required to render shadows."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ LOD mesh ຍັງມີການສ້າງ shadow meshes ພ້ອມກັນນຳ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນ meshes ທີ່ມີການເຊື່ອມ "
"vertex ເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈການ smoothing ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ. ສິ່ງນີ້ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຣັນເດີເງົາ "
"ໂດຍການຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ vertex ທີ່ຕ້ອງປະມວນຜົນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:844
msgid ""
"The RenderingSceneCull class's ``_render_scene()`` function determines which "
"mesh LOD should be used when rendering. Each viewport can render the same "
"mesh with different LODs (to allow for split screen rendering to look "
"correct)."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``_render_scene()`` ຂອງຄລາສ RenderingSceneCull ຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດວ່າ ຄວນໃຊ້ mesh "
"LOD ໃດໃນເວລາເຣັນເດີ. ແຕ່ລະ viewport ສາມາດເຣັນເດີ mesh ດຽວກັນ ດ້ວຍ LOD ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:848
msgid ""
"The mesh LOD is automatically chosen based on a screen coverage metric. This "
"takes resolution and camera FOV changes into account without requiring user "
"intervention. The threshold multiplier can be adjusted in the project "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Mesh LOD ຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມັນກວມເອົາເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຄຳນວນເຖິງຄວາມລະອຽ"
"ດ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງ FOV ຂອງກ້ອງ ໂດຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຕ້ອງ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງ. ຄ່າ threshold multiplier ສາມາດ"
"ປັບໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:852
msgid ""
"To improve performance, shadow rendering and reflection probe rendering also "
"choose their own mesh LOD thresholds (which can be different from the main "
"scene rendering)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ, ການເຣັນເດີເງົາ ແລະ reflection probe ກໍ່ຈະເລືອກ ຄ່າ mesh LOD "
"threshold ຂອງພວກມັນເອງ (ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຕ່າງຈາກການເຣັນເດີສາກຫຼັກ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:855
msgid "**Mesh LOD generation on import C++ code:**"
msgstr "**ລະຫັດ C++ ສຳລັບການສ້າງ Mesh LOD ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:857
msgid ""
"`scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/4.6/scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"`scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/4.6/scene/resources/3d/importer_mesh.cpp>`__"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/internal_rendering_architecture.rst:859
msgid "**Mesh LOD determination C++ code:**"
msgstr "**ລະຫັດ C++ ສຳລັບການກຳນົດ Mesh LOD:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:4
msgid "2D coordinate systems and 2D transforms"
msgstr "ລະບົບພິກັດ 2D ແລະ ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ 2D (2D transforms)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:9
msgid ""
"This is a detailed overview of the available 2D coordinate systems and 2D "
"transforms that are built in. The basic concepts are covered "
"in :ref:`doc_viewport_and_canvas_transforms`."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນພາບລວມລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບພິກັດ 2D ແລະ ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transforms) 2D ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ແນວຄິດພື້ນຖ"
"ານແມ່ນໄດ້ກວມເອົາໃນ :ref:`doc_viewport_and_canvas_transforms`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:12
msgid ""
":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` are matrices that convert coordinates "
"from one coordinate system to another. In order to use them, it is "
"beneficial to know which coordinate systems are available in Godot. For a "
"deeper understanding, the :ref:`doc_matrices_and_transforms` tutorial offers "
"insights to the underlying functionality."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` ແມ່ນເມທຣິກຊ໌ (matrices) ທີ່ແປງພິກັດ ຈາກລະບົບໜຶ່ງ"
"ໄປຫາອີກລະບົບໜຶ່ງ. ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ພວກມັນ, ການຮູ້ວ່າ Godot ມີລະບົບພິກັດໃດແດ່ ແມ່ນຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ. ສຳລັ"
"ບຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈທີ່ເລິກເຊິ່ງກວ່າ, ບົດຮຽນ :ref:`doc_matrices_and_transforms` ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບ"
"ການເຮັດວຽກພື້ນຖານຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:18
msgid "Godot 2D coordinate systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບພິກັດ 2D ຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:20
msgid ""
"The following graphic gives an overview of Godot 2D coordinate systems and "
"the available node-transforms, transform-functions and coordinate-system "
"related functions. At the left is the OS Window Manager screen, at the right "
"are the :ref:`CanvasItems <class_CanvasItem>`. For simplicity reasons this "
"graphic doesn't include :ref:`SubViewport "
"<class_SubViewport>`, :ref:`SubViewportContainer "
"<class_SubViewportContainer>`, :ref:`ParallaxLayer<class_ParallaxLayer>` "
"and :ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_ParallaxBackground>` all of which also "
"influence transforms."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບພິກັດ 2D ຂອງ Godot ແລະ node-transforms, "
"transform-functions ພ້ອມທັງຟັງຊັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລະບົບພິກັດ. ດ້ານຊ້າຍແມ່ນໜ້າຈໍຂອງ OS Window "
"Manager, ດ້ານຂວາແມ່ນ :ref:`CanvasItems <class_CanvasItem>`. ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ, ຮູບ"
"ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາ :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>`, "
":ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>`, "
":ref:`ParallaxLayer<class_ParallaxLayer>` ແລະ "
":ref:`ParallaxBackground<class_ParallaxBackground>` ເຊິ່ງທັງໝົດນີ້ກໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ "
"transforms ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:27
msgid ""
"The graphic is based on a node tree of the following form: ``Root Window "
"(embed Windows)`` ⇒ ``Window (don't embed Windows)`` ⇒ ``CanvasLayer`` ⇒ "
"``CanvasItem`` ⇒ ``CanvasItem`` ⇒ ``CanvasItem``. There are more complex "
"combinations possible, like deeply nested Window and SubViewports, however "
"this example intends to provide an overview of the methodology in general."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບນີ້ອີງຕາມໂຄງສ້າງໂນດ (node tree) ດັ່ງນີ້: ``Root Window (embed Windows)`` ⇒ "
"``Window (don't embed Windows)`` ⇒ ``CanvasLayer`` ⇒ ``CanvasItem`` ⇒ "
"``CanvasItem`` ⇒ ``CanvasItem``. ມັນອາດຈະມີການປະສົມປະສານທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່ານີ້ ເຊັ່ນ Window ແລ"
"ະ SubViewports ທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຫຼາຍຊັ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາບລວມຂອງວິທີການໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:35
msgid "Click graphic to enlarge."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຮູບເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:37
msgid "**Item Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດຂອງໄອເທັມ (Item Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:38
msgid ""
"This is the local coordinate system of a :ref:`CanvasItem "
"<class_CanvasItem>`."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local) ຂອງ :ref:`CanvasItem <class_CanvasItem>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:40
msgid "**Parent Item Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດຂອງໄອເທັມແມ່ (Parent Item Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:41
msgid ""
"This is the local coordinate system of the parent's *CanvasItem*. When "
"positioning *CanvasItems* in the *Canvas*, they usually inherit the "
"transformations of their parent *CanvasItems*. An exceptions "
"is :ref:`CanvasItems.top_level <class_CanvasItem_property_top_level>`."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ *CanvasItem* ທີ່ເປັນແມ່. ເມື່ອວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ *CanvasItems* ໃນ "
"*Canvas*, ພວກມັນມັກຈະສືບທອດ transformations ມາຈາກແມ່ຂອງພວກມັນ. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນຄື "
":ref:`CanvasItems.top_level <class_CanvasItem_property_top_level>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:46
msgid "**Canvas Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດແຄນວາສ (Canvas Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:47
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the previous tutorial :ref:`doc_canvas_layers`, there are "
"two types of canvases (*Viewport* canvas and *CanvasLayer* canvas) and both "
"have a canvas coordinate system. These are also called world coordinates. A "
"*Viewport* can contain multiple *Canvases* with different coordinate systems."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວໄວ້ໃນບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ :ref:`doc_canvas_layers`, ມີແຄນວາສ (canvas) ສອງປະເພດ "
"(*Viewport* canvas ແລະ *CanvasLayer* canvas) ແລະ ທັງສອງມີລະບົບພິກັດແຄນວາສ. ພວກມັນຍັງ"
"ຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ພິກັດໂລກ (world coordinates). *Viewport* ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍ *Canvases* ທີ່ມີລະບົບພິກັດ"
"ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:52
msgid "**Viewport Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດວິວພອດ (Viewport Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:53
msgid "This is the coordinate system of the :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:55
msgid "**Camera Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດກ້ອງ (Camera Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:56
msgid ""
"This is only used internally for functionality like 3D-camera ray "
"projections."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະພາຍໃນສຳລັບຟັງຊັນ ເຊັ່ນ 3D-camera ray projections."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:58
msgid "**Embedder Coordinates / Screen Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດ Embedder / ພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ (Screen Coordinates)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:59
msgid ""
"Every *Viewport* (*Window* or *SubViewport*) in the scene tree is embedded "
"either in a different node or in the OS Window Manager. This coordinate "
"system's origin is identical to the top-left corner of the *Window* or "
"*SubViewport* and its scale is the one of the embedder or the OS Window "
"Manager."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ *Viewport* (*Window* ຫຼື *SubViewport*) ໃນ scene tree ຈະຖືກຝັງ (embedded) ໄວ້ໃ"
"ນໂນດອື່ນ ຫຼື ໃນ OS Window Manager. ຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin) ຂອງລະບົບພິກັດນີ້ ແມ່ນຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງ "
"*Window* ຫຼື *SubViewport* ແລະ ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງມັນ ຈະເປັນໄປຕາມ embedder ຫຼື OS "
"Window Manager."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:64
msgid ""
"If the embedder is the OS Window Manager, then they are also called Screen "
"Coordinates."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ embedder ແມ່ນ OS Window Manager, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ (Screen "
"Coordinates)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:66
msgid "**Absolute Embedder Coordinates / Absolute Screen Coordinates**"
msgstr "**ພິກັດ Absolute Embedder / ພິກັດ Absolute Screen**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:67
msgid ""
"The origin of this coordinate system is the top-left corner of the embedding "
"node or the OS Window Manager screen. Its scale is the one of the embedder "
"or the OS Window Manager."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງລະບົບພິກັດນີ້ແມ່ນຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງໂນດທີ່ຝັງ ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍຂອງ OS Window Manager. ຂະໜາດຂອງມັ"
"ນຈະເປັນໄປຕາມ embedder ຫຼື OS Window Manager."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the embedder is the OS Window Manager, then they are also called Absolute "
"Screen Coordinates."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ embedder ແມ່ນ OS Window Manager, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ພິກັດ Absolute Screen."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:75
msgid "Node transforms"
msgstr "ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງຂອງໂນດ (Node transforms)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:77
msgid ""
"Each of the mentioned nodes have one or more transforms associated with them "
"and the combination of these nodes infer the transforms between the "
"different coordinate systems. With a few exceptions, the transforms "
"are :ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` and the following list shows "
"details and effects of each of them."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະໂນດທີ່ກ່າວມາມີ transform ໜຶ່ງຢ່າງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພວກມັນ ແລະ ການລວມກັນຂອງໂນດເຫຼົ່າ"
"ນີ້ຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດ transform ລະຫວ່າງລະບົບພິກັດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໂດຍສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວ, transform ຈະເປັນ "
":ref:`Transform2D <class_Transform2D>` ແລະ ລາຍການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຜົນກະທົບ"
"ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:82
msgid "**CanvasItem transform**"
msgstr "**CanvasItem transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:83
msgid "*CanvasItems* are either *Control*-nodes or *Node2D*-nodes."
msgstr "*CanvasItems* ແມ່ນໄດ້ແກ່ໂນດ *Control* ຫຼື ໂນດ *Node2D*."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:85
msgid ""
"For *Control* nodes this transform consists of a :ref:`position "
"<class_Control_property_position>` relative to the parent's origin and "
"a :ref:`scale <class_Control_property_scale>` and :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Control_property_rotation>` around a :ref:`pivot point "
"<class_Control_property_pivot_offset>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໂນດ *Control*, transform ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍ :ref:`position "
"<class_Control_property_position>` ທຽບກັບຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງແມ່ ແລະ :ref:`scale "
"<class_Control_property_scale>` ພ້ອມທັງ :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Control_property_rotation>` ຮອບ :ref:`pivot point "
"<class_Control_property_pivot_offset>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:90
msgid ""
"For *Node2D* nodes :ref:`transform <class_Node2D_property_transform>` "
"consists of :ref:`position <class_Node2D_property_position>`, :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Node2D_property_rotation>`, :ref:`scale "
"<class_Node2D_property_scale>` and :ref:`skew <class_Node2D_property_skew>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໂນດ *Node2D*, :ref:`transform <class_Node2D_property_transform>` ປະກອບດ້ວ"
"ຍ :ref:`position <class_Node2D_property_position>`, :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Node2D_property_rotation>`, :ref:`scale <class_Node2D_property_scale>"
"` ແລະ :ref:`skew <class_Node2D_property_skew>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:94
msgid ""
"The transform affects the item itself and usually also child-*CanvasItems* "
"and in the case of a *SubViewportContainer* it affects the contained "
"*SubViewport*."
msgstr ""
"Transform ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ໄອເທັມນັ້ນເອງ ແລະ ມັກຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ *CanvasItems* ທີ່ເປັນລູກ ແລະ ໃນກໍລະນີ"
"ຂອງ *SubViewportContainer* ມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ *SubViewport* ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:97
msgid "**CanvasLayer transform**"
msgstr "**CanvasLayer transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:98
msgid ""
"The *CanvasLayer's* :ref:`transform <class_CanvasLayer_property_transform>` "
"affects all *CanvasItems* within the *CanvasLayer*. It doesn't affect other "
"*CanvasLayers* or *Windows* in its *Viewport*."
msgstr ""
":ref:`transform <class_CanvasLayer_property_transform>` ຂອງ *CanvasLayer* ຈະສົ່"
"ງຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກໆ *CanvasItems* ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ *CanvasLayer* ນັ້ນ. ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ *CanvasLayers* ອື່ນ ຫຼື "
"*Windows* ໃນ *Viewport* ຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:102
msgid "**CanvasLayer follow viewport transform**"
msgstr "**CanvasLayer follow viewport transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:103
msgid ""
"The *follow viewport transform* is an automatically calculated transform, "
"that is based on the *Viewport's* :ref:`canvas transform "
"<class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>` and the "
"*CanvasLayer's* :ref:`follow viewport scale "
"<class_CanvasLayer_property_follow_viewport_scale>` and can be used, "
"if :ref:`enabled <class_CanvasLayer_property_follow_viewport_enabled>`, to "
"achieve a pseudo-3D effect. It affects the same child nodes as the "
"*CanvasLayer transform*."
msgstr ""
"*follow viewport transform* ແມ່ນ transform ທີ່ຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມ "
":ref:`canvas transform <class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>` ຂອງ "
"*Viewport* ແລະ :ref:`follow viewport scale "
"<class_CanvasLayer_property_follow_viewport_scale>` ຂອງ *CanvasLayer*. ມັນສາມາ"
"ດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ pseudo-3D ຫາກມີການ :ref:`ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"<class_CanvasLayer_property_follow_viewport_enabled>`. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດລູກຄືກັນກັບ "
"*CanvasLayer transform*."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:109
msgid "**Viewport canvas transform**"
msgstr "**Viewport canvas transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:110
msgid ""
"The :ref:`canvas transform <class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>` "
"affects all *CanvasItems* in the *Viewport's* default canvas. It also "
"affects *CanvasLayers*, that have follow viewport transform enabled. The "
"*Viewport's* active :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` works by changing this "
"transform. It doesn't affect this *Viewport's* embedded *Windows*."
msgstr ""
":ref:`canvas transform <class_Viewport_property_canvas_transform>` ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກ"
"ໆ *CanvasItems* ໃນແຄນວາສເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ *Viewport*. ມັນຍັງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ *CanvasLayers* ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ "
"follow viewport transform. ໂນດ :ref:`Camera2D <class_Camera2D>` ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ຈ"
"ະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການປ່ຽນ transform ນີ້. ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ *Windows* ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນ *Viewport* ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:115
msgid "**Viewport global canvas transform**"
msgstr "**Viewport global canvas transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:116
msgid ""
"*Viewports* also have a :ref:`global canvas transform "
"<class_Viewport_property_global_canvas_transform>`. This is the master "
"transform and affects all individual *Canvas Layer* and embedded *Window* "
"transforms. This is primarily used in Godot's CanvasItem Editor."
msgstr ""
"*Viewports* ຍັງມີ :ref:`global canvas transform "
"<class_Viewport_property_global_canvas_transform>`. ນີ້ແມ່ນ transform ຫຼັກ "
"(master) ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກໆ *Canvas Layer* ແລະ *Window* ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ "
"CanvasItem Editor ຂອງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:120
msgid "**Viewport stretch transform**"
msgstr "**Viewport stretch transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:121
msgid ""
"Finally, *Viewports* have a *stretch transform*, which is used when resizing "
"or stretching the viewport. This transform is used for :ref:`Windows "
"<class_Window>` as described in :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, but can "
"also be manually set on *SubViewports* by means of :ref:`size "
"<class_SubViewport_property_size>` and :ref:`size_2d_override "
"<class_SubViewport_property_size_2d_override>`. Its :ref:`translation "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_origin>`, :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_rotation>` and :ref:`skew "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_skew>` are the default values and it can only "
"have non-default :ref:`scale <class_Transform2D_method_get_scale>`."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, *Viewports* ຍັງມີ *stretch transform*, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຍືດ "
"viewport. Transform ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ :ref:`Windows <class_Window>` ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໃນ "
":ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, ແຕ່ກໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງໄດ້ໃນ *SubViewports* ຜ່ານ "
":ref:`size <class_SubViewport_property_size>` ແລະ :ref:`size_2d_override "
"<class_SubViewport_property_size_2d_override>`. ຄ່າ :ref:`translation "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_origin>`, :ref:`rotation "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_rotation>` ແລະ :ref:`skew "
"<class_Transform2D_method_get_skew>` ຂອງມັນຈະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ມັນສາມາດ ມີພຽງ "
":ref:`scale <class_Transform2D_method_get_scale>` ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:131
msgid "**Window transform**"
msgstr "**Window transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:132
msgid ""
"In order to scale and position the *Window's* content as described "
"in :ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, each :ref:`Window <class_Window>` "
"contains a *window transform*. It is for example responsible for the black "
"bars at the *Window's* sides so that the *Viewport* is displayed with a "
"fixed aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະສະເກລ ແລະ ວາງຕຳແໜ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງ *Window* ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໃນ "
":ref:`doc_multiple_resolutions`, ແຕ່ລະ :ref:`Window <class_Window>` ຈະມີ "
"*window transform*. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນມີໜ້າທີ່ ສ້າງແຖບສີດຳ (black bars) ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ Window ເພື່ອໃຫ້ "
"*Viewport* ສະແດງຜົນໃນ ອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect ratio) ທີ່ຄົງທີ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:137
msgid "**Window position**"
msgstr "**ຕຳແໜ່ງ Window (Window position)**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:138
msgid ""
"Every *Window* also has a :ref:`position <class_Window_property_position>` "
"to describe its position within its embedder. The embedder can be another "
"*Viewport* or the OS Window Manager."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ *Window* ມີ :ref:`position <class_Window_property_position>` ເພື່ອບອກຕຳແໜ່ງ ຂ"
"ອງມັນພາຍໃນ embedder. ເຊິ່ງ embedder ອາດຈະເປັນ *Viewport* ອື່ນ ຫຼື OS Window Manager."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:141
msgid "**SubViewportContainer shrink transform**"
msgstr "**SubViewportContainer shrink transform**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/2d_coordinate_systems.rst:142
msgid ""
":ref:`stretch <class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch>` together "
"with :ref:`stretch_shrink "
"<class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch_shrink>` declare for a "
"*SubViewportContainer* if and by what integer factor the contained "
"*SubViewport* should be scaled in comparison to the container's size."
msgstr ""
":ref:`stretch <class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch>` ຄວບຄູ່ກັບ "
":ref:`stretch_shrink <class_SubViewportContainer_property_stretch_shrink>` ຈະ"
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ *SubViewportContainer* ວ່າ *SubViewport* ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຄວນຈະ ຖືກສະເກລດ້ວຍປັດໄຈເລກ"
"ຖ້ວນເທົ່າໃດ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຂະໜາດຂອງ container."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:4
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:92
msgid "Unit testing"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບຢູນິດ (Unit testing)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:6
msgid ""
"Godot Engine allows to write unit tests directly in C++. The engine "
"integrates the `doctest <https://github.com/doctest/doctest>`_ unit testing "
"framework which gives ability to write test suites and test cases next to "
"production code, but since the tests in Godot go through a different "
"``main`` entry point, the tests reside in a dedicated ``tests/`` directory "
"instead, which is located at the root of the engine source code."
msgstr ""
"Godot Engine ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນ unit tests ດ້ວຍ C++ ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ເອນຈິນໄດ້ລວມເອົາ ເຟຣມເ"
"ວີກການທົດສອບ `doctest <https://github.com/doctest/doctest>`_ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ສາມາດຂຽນ "
"test suites ແລະ test cases ຄວບຄູ່ໄປກັບ production code ໄດ້. ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກການທົດສອບໃນ "
"Godot ຈະແລ່ນຜ່ານຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (entry point) ``main`` ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ການທົດສອບຈຶ່ງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟ"
"ນເດີ ``tests/`` ໂດຍສະເພາະ ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ທີ່ root ຂອງຊອສໂຄ້ດເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:14
msgid "Platform and target support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:16
msgid ""
"C++ unit tests can be run on Linux, macOS, and Windows operating systems."
msgstr ""
"Unit tests ດ້ວຍ C++ ສາມາດແລ່ນໄດ້ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:18
msgid ""
"Tests can only be run with editor ``tools`` enabled, which means that export "
"templates cannot be tested currently."
msgstr ""
"ການທົດສອບສາມາດແລ່ນໄດ້ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ editor ``tools`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ export "
"templates ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດທົດສອບໄດ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:22
msgid "Running tests"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນການທົດສອບ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:24
msgid ""
"Before tests can be actually run, the engine must be compiled with the "
"``tests`` build option enabled (and any other build option you typically "
"use), as the tests are not compiled as part of the engine by default:"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະແລ່ນການທົດສອບໄດ້, ເອນຈິນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກ compile ໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້ build option ``tests`` (ແລ"
"ະ build option ອື່ນໆທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເປັນປົກກະຕິ), ເພາະວ່າໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ ການທົດສອບຈະບໍ່ຖືກ compile ລວ"
"ມເຂົ້າເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເອນຈິນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:32
msgid ""
"Once the build is done, run the tests with a ``--test`` command-line option:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ compile ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແລ່ນການທົດສອບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``--test``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:38
msgid ""
"The test run can be configured with the various doctest-specific command-"
"line options. To retrieve the full list of supported options, run the ``--"
"test`` command with the ``--help`` option:"
msgstr ""
"ການແລ່ນການທົດສອບສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕ່າງໆຂອງ doctest. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການ ຄຳສັ່ງທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັ"
"ບ, ໃຫ້ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``--test`` ພ້ອມກັບອາຄິວເມນ ``--help``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:46
msgid ""
"Any other options and arguments after the ``--test`` command are treated as "
"arguments for doctest."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມນ ຫຼື ຄຳສັ່ງອື່ນໆທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງ ``--test`` ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນອາຄິວເມນສຳລັບ doctest."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:51
msgid ""
"Tests are compiled automatically if you use the ``dev_mode=yes`` SCons "
"option. ``dev_mode=yes`` is recommended if you plan on contributing to the "
"engine development as it will automatically treat compilation warnings as "
"errors. The continuous integration system will fail if any compilation "
"warnings are detected, so you should strive to fix all warnings before "
"opening a pull request."
msgstr ""
"ການທົດສອບຈະຖືກ compile ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ build option ``dev_mode=yes``. ແນະນຳ"
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``dev_mode=yes`` ຫາກທ່ານມີແຜນທີ່ຈະຮ່ວມພັດທະນາເອນຈິນ ເພາະມັນຈະຖືວ່າ ການເຕືອນ "
"(warnings) ໃນຕອນ compile ເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (errors). ລະບົບ CI ຈະຖືວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຫາກກວດພົບການເຕື"
"ອນໃດໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຄວນແກ້ໄຂທຸກການເຕືອນໃຫ້ສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດ pull request."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:59
msgid "Filtering tests"
msgstr "ການກັ່ນຕອງການທົດສອບ (Filtering tests)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:61
msgid ""
"By default, all tests are run if you don't supply any extra arguments after "
"the ``--test`` command. But if you're writing new tests or would like to see "
"the successful assertions output coming from those tests for debugging "
"purposes, you can run the tests of interest with the various filtering "
"options provided by doctest."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ທຸກການທົດສອບຈະຖືກແລ່ນຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃສ່ອາຄິວເມນເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼັງ ຄຳສັ່ງ ``--test``. ແຕ່ຫ"
"າກທ່ານກຳລັງຂຽນການທົດສອບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຢາກເຫັນຜົນລັບຂອງ ການກວດສອບ (assertions) ທີ່ສຳເລັດເພື່ອການ "
"debug, ທ່ານສາມາດແລ່ນການທົດສອບ ທີ່ສົນໃຈໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກການກັ່ນຕອງຕ່າງໆຂອງ doctest."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/unit_testing.rst:67
msgid ""
"The wildcard syntax ``*`` is supported for matching any number of characters "
"in test suites, test cases, and source file names:"
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ໄວດ໌ກາດ (wildcard) ``*`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕົວອັກສອນໃດໆກໍ່ໄດ້ ໃນ test suites, "
"test cases, ແລະ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຊອສ:"

