"case, ``True`` means it will build for every platform)."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນຈະຖືກຖາມວ່າມັນພ້ອມທີ່ຈະ build ສຳລັບ platform ທີ່ລະບຸຫຼືບໍ່ (ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ``True`` ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ"
"ມັນຈະ build ສຳລັບທຸກ platforms)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:222
msgid ""
"And that's it. Hope it was not too complex! Your module should look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"ແລະ ນັ້ນຄືທັງໝົດ. ຫວັງວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຊັບຊ້ອນເກີນໄປ! ໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະມີໜ້າຕາແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:234
msgid ""
"You can then zip it and share the module with everyone else. When building "
"for every platform (instructions in the previous sections), your module will "
"be included."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດ zip ມັນ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນໂມດູນໃຫ້ກັບຄົນອື່ນໆໄດ້. ເມື່ອມີການ build ສຳລັບທຸກ platform "
"(ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນພາກກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້), ໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານກໍຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໄປນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:239
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/binding_to_external_libraries.rst:212
msgid "Using the module"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໂມດູນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:241
#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/binding_to_external_libraries.rst:214
msgid "You can now use your newly created module from any script:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຈາກສະຄຣິບໃດກໍໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:253
msgid "The output will be ``60``."
msgstr "ຜົນລັດທີ່ໄດ້ຈະແມ່ນ ``60``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:255
msgid ""
"The previous Summator example is great for small, custom modules, but what "
"if you want to use a larger, external library? Refer "
"to :ref:`doc_binding_to_external_libraries` for details about binding to "
"external libraries."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ Summator ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນດີຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂມດູນກຳນົດເອງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ"
"ພາຍນອກທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່ານີ້ເດ? ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_binding_to_external_libraries` ສຳລັບລ"
"າຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການ binding ໄລບຣາຣີພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:260
msgid ""
"If your module is meant to be accessed from the running project (not just "
"from the editor), you must also recompile every export template you plan to "
"use, then specify the path to the custom template in each export preset. "
"Otherwise, you'll get errors when running the project as the module isn't "
"compiled in the export template. See the :ref:`Compiling <toc-devel-"
"compiling>` pages for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນແຕ່ຈາກ editor), ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງ "
"recompile ທຸກໆ export template ທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະໃຊ້, ຈາກນັ້ນກຳນົດ path ໄປຫາ custom "
"template ໃນແຕ່ລະ export preset. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ ເນື່ອງຈາກໂມດູນບໍ່ໄດ້"
"ຖືກ compile ໄວ້ໃນ export template. ເບິ່ງໜ້າ :ref:`Compiling <toc-devel-compiling>"
"` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:269
msgid "Compiling a module externally"
msgstr "ການ compile ໂມດູນຈາກພາຍນອກ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:271
msgid ""
"Compiling a module involves moving the module's sources directly under the "
"engine's ``modules/`` directory. While this is the most straightforward way "
"to compile a module, there are a couple of reasons as to why this might not "
"be a practical thing to do:"
msgstr ""
"ການ compile ໂມດູນແມ່ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຍ້າຍ sources ຂອງໂມດູນໄປໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ directory "
"``modules/`` ຂອງ engine ໂດຍກົງ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການ compile ໂມດູນ, ແຕ່ກໍ"
"ມີເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ວິທີນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ສະດວກໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:276
msgid ""
"Having to manually copy modules sources every time you want to compile the "
"engine with or without the module, or taking additional steps needed to "
"manually disable a module during compilation with a build option similar to "
"``module_summator_enabled=no``. Creating symbolic links may also be a "
"solution, but you may additionally need to overcome OS restrictions like "
"needing the symbolic link privilege if doing this via script."
msgstr ""
"ການຕ້ອງໄດ້ກ່າຍ sources ຂອງໂມດູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ compile engine ແບບມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີໂມດູ"
"ນ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການປິດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການ compile ດ້ວຍ build "
"option ເຊັ່ນ ``module_summator_enabled=no``. ການສ້າງ symbolic links ອາດຈະເປັນທາງອ"
"ອກໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຜ່ານຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ OS ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມຕ້ອງການສິດທິໃນການສ້າງ symbolic link ຖ້າ"
"ເຮັດຜ່ານສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:283
msgid ""
"Depending on whether you have to work with the engine's source code, the "
"module files added directly to ``modules/`` changes the working tree to the "
"point where using a VCS (like ``git``) proves to be cumbersome as you need "
"to make sure that only the engine-related code is committed by filtering "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານກັບ source code ຂອງ engine, ໄຟລ໌ໂມດູນທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ ``modules/`` "
"ໂດຍກົງຈະປ່ຽນແປງ working tree ຈົນເຖິງຂັ້ນທີ່ການໃຊ້ VCS (ເຊັ່ນ ``git``) ເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກ ເພາະທ່ານຕ້ອ"
"ງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຈະ commit ສະເພາະລະຫັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ engine ໂດຍການກັ່ນຕອງການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:289
msgid ""
"So if you feel like the independent structure of custom modules is needed, "
"lets take our \"summator\" module and move it to the engine's parent "
"directory:"
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ສຶກວ່າຕ້ອງການໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຂອງ custom modules, ໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຍ້າຍໂມດູນ "
"\"summator\" ໄປໄວ້ໃນ parent directory ຂອງ engine:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:297
msgid ""
"Compile the engine with our module by providing ``custom_modules`` build "
"option which accepts a comma-separated list of directory paths containing "
"custom C++ modules, similar to the following:"
msgstr ""
"Compile engine ພ້ອມກັບໂມດູນຂອງພວກເຮົາໂດຍການລະບຸ build option ``custom_modules`` ເຊິ່"
"ງຮອງຮັບລາຍຊື່ directory paths ຂອງ custom C++ modules ທີ່ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ, ຕົວຢ່າງດັ່ງ"
"ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:305
msgid ""
"The build system shall detect all modules under the ``../modules`` directory "
"and compile them accordingly, including our \"summator\" module."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບ build ຈະກວດຫາທຸກໆໂມດູນພາຍໃຕ້ directory ``../modules`` ແລະ compile ພວກມັນຕາມຄ"
"ວາມເໝາະສົມ, ລວມທັງໂມດູນ \"summator\" ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:310
msgid ""
"Any path passed to ``custom_modules`` will be converted to an absolute path "
"internally as a way to distinguish between custom and built-in modules. It "
"means that things like generating module documentation may rely on a "
"specific path structure on your machine."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ path ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ ``custom_modules`` ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ absolute path ພາຍໃນເພື່ອແຍກຄວາມແ"
"ຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ custom modules ແລະ built-in modules. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນການສ້າງເ"
"ອກະສານໂມດູນ ອາດຈະຂຶ້ນກັບໂຄງສ້າງ path ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:317
msgid ""
":ref:`Introduction to the buildsystem - Custom modules build option "
"<doc_buildsystem_custom_modules>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການແນະນຳລະບົບ build - ຕົວເລືອກການ build ໂມດູນກຳນົດເອງ "
"<doc_buildsystem_custom_modules>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:320
msgid "Customizing module types initialization"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະເພດໂມດູນ (initialization)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:322
msgid ""
"Modules can interact with other built-in engine classes during runtime and "
"even affect the way core types are initialized. So far, we've been using "
"``register_summator_types`` as a way to bring in module classes to be "
"available within the engine."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ built-in classes ອື່ນໆຂອງ engine ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ເຖິງຂັ້ນສົ່ງຜົນກະ"
"ທົບຕໍ່ວິທີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (initialize) ຂອງ core types. ທີ່ຜ່ານມາ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ໃຊ້ "
"``register_summator_types`` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ module classes ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານພາຍໃນ engine."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:327
msgid ""
"A crude order of the engine setup can be summarized as a list of the "
"following type registration methods:"
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ engine ແບບຄ່າວໆ ສາມາດສະຫຼຸບເປັນລາຍຊື່ຂອງເມທອດການລົງທະບຽນປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ດັ່ງ"
"ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:346
msgid ""
"Our ``Summator`` class is initialized during the ``register_module_types()`` "
"call. Imagine that we need to satisfy some common module runtime dependency "
"(like singletons), or allow us to override existing engine method callbacks "
"before they can be assigned by the engine itself. In that case, we want to "
"ensure that our module classes are registered *before* any other built-in "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດ ``Summator`` ຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"``register_module_types()``. ສົມມຸດວ່າພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕອບສະໜອງການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນຂອງໂມດູນໃນເວລ"
"າເຮັດວຽກທີ່ພົບທົ່ວໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ singletons), ຫຼື ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຂຽນທັບການເອີ້ນກັບຂອງເມັດທອດຂອງເອັນ"
"ຈິນທີ່ມີຢູ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໂດຍຕົວເອັນຈິນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄລາດໂມດູ"
"ນຂອງພວກເຮົາຖືກລົງທະບຽນ *ກ່ອນ* ປະເພດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:352
msgid ""
"This is where we can define an optional ``preregister_summator_types()`` "
"method which will be called before anything else during the "
"``preregister_module_types()`` engine setup stage."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດກຳນົດເມທອດ ``preregister_summator_types()`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກເ"
"ອີ້ນກ່ອນສິ່ງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ engine ``preregister_module_types()``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:356
msgid ""
"We now need to add this method to ``register_types`` header and source files:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເພີ່ມເມທອດນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ header ແລະ source ຂອງ ``register_types``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:367
msgid ""
"Unlike other register methods, we have to explicitly define "
"``MODULE_SUMMATOR_HAS_PREREGISTER`` to let the build system know what "
"relevant method calls to include at compile time. The module's name has to "
"be converted to uppercase as well."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກເມທອດການລົງທະບຽນອື່ນໆ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງກຳນົດ ``MODULE_SUMMATOR_HAS_PREREGISTER`` ຢ່"
"າງຊັດເຈນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບ build ຮູ້ວ່າຈະລວມເອົາເມທອດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນເວລາ compile. ຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນຕ້ອງຖືກປ່"
"ຽນເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ນຳອີກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:394
msgid "Writing custom documentation"
msgstr "ການຂຽນເອກະສານກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:396
msgid ""
"Writing documentation may seem like a boring task, but it is highly "
"recommended to document your newly created module to make it easier for "
"users to benefit from it. Not to mention that the code you've written one "
"year ago may become indistinguishable from the code that was written by "
"someone else, so be kind to your future self!"
msgstr ""
"ການຂຽນເອກະສານອາດເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເປັນວຽກທີ່ໜ້າເບື່ອ, ແຕ່ຂໍແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ຂຽນເອກະສານສຳລັບໂມດູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່"
"ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເວົ້າເຖິງເລື່ອງທີ່ວ່າລະຫັດທີ່ທ່ານຂຽນເມື່ອປີກ່ອ"
"ນ ອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືລະຫັດທີ່ຄົນອື່ນຂຽນຈົນທ່ານເອງກໍຈື່ບໍ່ໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈົ່ງເຫັນໃຈຕົວທ່ານເອງໃນອະນາຄົດ!"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:402
msgid "There are several steps in order to setup custom docs for the module:"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເອກະສານສຳລັບໂມດູນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:404
msgid ""
"Make a new directory in the root of the module. The directory name can be "
"anything, but we'll be using the ``doc_classes`` name throughout this "
"section."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ directory ໃໝ່ໃນ root ຂອງໂມດູນ. ຊື່ directory ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຫຍັງກໍໄດ້, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ "
"``doc_classes`` ໃນພາກນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:407
msgid "Now, we need to edit ``config.py``, add the following snippet:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ ``config.py`` ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ snippet ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:419
msgid ""
"The ``get_doc_path()`` function is used by the build system to determine the "
"location of the docs. In this case, they will be located in the ``modules/"
"summator/doc_classes`` directory. If you don't define this, the doc path for "
"your module will fall back to the main ``doc/classes`` directory."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ ``get_doc_path()`` ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບ build ເພື່ອກຳນົດສະຖານທີ່ຂອງເອກະສານ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພ"
"ວກມັນຈະຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ directory ``modules/summator/doc_classes``. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ກຳນົດສິ່ງນີ້, doc "
"path ສຳລັບໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ directory ``doc/classes`` ຫຼັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:425
msgid ""
"The ``get_doc_classes()`` method is necessary for the build system to know "
"which registered classes belong to the module. You need to list all of your "
"classes here. The classes that you don't list will end up in the main ``doc/"
"classes`` directory."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ ``get_doc_classes()`` ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບ build ຮູ້ວ່າ classes ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນອັນໃດເ"
"ປັນຂອງໂມດູນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍຊື່ classes ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ນີ້. classes ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຊື່ຈະໄປປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ "
"directory ``doc/classes`` ຫຼັກແທນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:432
msgid ""
"You can use Git to check if you have missed some of your classes by checking "
"the untracked files with ``git status``. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Git ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານລືມບາງ class ໄປຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດສອບ untracked files ດ້ວ"
"ຍ ``git status``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:439
msgid "Example output:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ output:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:453
msgid "Now we can generate the documentation:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດສ້າງເອກະສານໄດ້ແລ້ວ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:455
msgid ""
"We can do this via running Godot's doctool i.e. ``godot --doctool <path>``, "
"which will dump the engine API reference to the given ``<path>`` in XML "
"format."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນ doctool ຂອງ Godot ເຊັ່ນ ``godot --doctool <path>"
"``, ເຊິ່ງຈະ dump ຂໍ້ມູນ engine API reference ໄປຍັງ ``<path>`` ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນຮູບແບບ XML."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:458
msgid ""
"In our case we'll point it to the root of the cloned repository. You can "
"point it to an another folder, and just copy over the files that you need."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຈະຊີ້ມັນໄປທີ່ root ຂອງ cloned repository. ທ່ານສາມາດຊີ້ມັນໄປທີ່ໂຟນ"
"ເດີອື່ນ ແລະ ກ່າຍສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:461
msgid "Run command:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:467
msgid ""
"Now if you go to the ``godot/modules/summator/doc_classes`` folder, you will "
"see that it contains a ``Summator.xml`` file, or any other classes, that you "
"referenced in your ``get_doc_classes`` function."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີ ``godot/modules/summator/doc_classes``, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມັນມີໄຟລ໌ "
"``Summator.xml`` ຫຼື classes ອື່ນໆທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ອ້າງອີງໄວ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ ``get_doc_classes``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:471
msgid ""
"Edit the file(s) following the `class reference primer <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/class_reference/index.html>`__ "
"and recompile the engine."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ ຕາມ `class reference primer <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"latest/engine_details/class_reference/index.html>`__ ແລະ recompile engine."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:473
msgid ""
"Once the compilation process is finished, the docs will become accessible "
"within the engine's built-in documentation system."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຂະບວນການ compile ສຳເລັດ, ເອກະສານຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ພາຍໃນລະບົບເອກະສານ built-in ຂອ"
"ງ engine."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:476
msgid ""
"In order to keep documentation up-to-date, all you'll have to do is simply "
"modify one of the XML files and recompile the engine from now on."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເອກະສານທັນສະໄໝຢູ່ສະເໝີ, ສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຄືພຽງແຕ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ XML ແລະ recompile "
"engine ຕັ້ງແຕ່ນີ້ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:479
msgid ""
"If you change your module's API, you can also re-extract the docs, they will "
"contain the things that you previously added. Of course if you point it to "
"your godot folder, make sure you don't lose work by extracting older docs "
"from an older engine build on top of the newer ones."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນ API ຂອງໂມດູນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ re-extract ເອກະສານໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງພວກມັນຈະຍັງມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານເຄີ"
"ຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ແນ່ນອນວ່າຖ້າທ່ານຊີ້ມັນໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີ godot ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຈະບໍ່ເສຍວຽກໂດຍກາ"
"ນ extract ເອກະສານເກົ່າຈາກ engine build ເກົ່າໄປທັບອັນໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:484
msgid ""
"Note that if you don't have write access rights to your supplied ``<path>``, "
"you might encounter an error similar to the following:"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການຂຽນ (write access) ໃນ ``<path>`` ທີ່ລະບຸ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ"
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:495
msgid "Writing custom unit tests"
msgstr "ການຂຽນ unit tests ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:497
msgid ""
"It's possible to write self-contained unit tests as part of a C++ module. If "
"you are not familiar with the unit testing process in Godot yet, please "
"refer to :ref:`doc_unit_testing`."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຂຽນ unit tests ທີ່ເປັນເອກະລາດໃນຕົວເອງເພື່ອເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂມດູນ C++. ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່"
"ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບຂະບວນການ unit testing ໃນ Godot, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`doc_unit_testing`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:501
msgid "The procedure is the following:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:503
msgid "Create a new directory named ``tests/`` under your module's root:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ directory ໃໝ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``tests/`` ພາຍໃຕ້ root ຂອງໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:511
msgid ""
"Create a new test suite: ``test_summator.h``. The header must be prefixed "
"with ``test_`` so that the build system can collect it and include it as "
"part of the ``tests/test_main.cpp`` where the tests are run."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ test suite ໃໝ່: ``test_summator.h``. ໄຟລ໌ header ຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ``test_`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້"
"ລະບົບ build ສາມາດຮວບຮວມ ແລະ ລວມມັນເຂົ້າເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ ``tests/test_main.cpp`` ບ່ອນທີ່ກາ"
"ນທົດສອບຖືກລັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:515
msgid "Write some test cases. Here's an example:"
msgstr "ຂຽນບາງ test cases. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:517
msgid "godot/modules/summator/tests/test_summator.h"
msgstr "godot/modules/summator/tests/test_summator.h"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:547
msgid ""
"Compile the engine with ``scons tests=yes``, and run the tests with the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"Compile engine ດ້ວຍ ``scons tests=yes``, ແລະ ລັນການທົດສອບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:554
msgid "You should see the passing assertions now."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນການຢືນຢັນ (assertions) ທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບແລ້ວໃນຕອນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:559
msgid "Adding custom editor icons"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມໄອຄອນ editor ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:561
msgid ""
"Similarly to how you can write self-contained documentation within a module, "
"you can also create your own custom icons for classes to appear in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການຂຽນເອກະສານພາຍໃນໂມດູນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງໄອຄອນຂອງທ່ານເອງສຳລັບ classes ເພື່ອ"
"ໃຫ້ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ editor ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:564
msgid ""
"For the actual process of creating editor icons to be integrated within the "
"engine, please refer to :ref:`doc_editor_icons` first."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂະບວນການສ້າງໄອຄອນ editor ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນ engine, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ "
":ref:`doc_editor_icons` ກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:567
msgid "Once you've created your icon(s), proceed with the following steps:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໄອຄອນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:569
msgid ""
"Make a new directory in the root of the module named ``icons``. This is the "
"default path for the engine to look for module's editor icons."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ directory ໃໝ່ໃນ root ຂອງໂມດູນຊື່ວ່າ ``icons``. ນີ້ແມ່ນ path ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ engine ຈະກວດຫາ"
"ໄອຄອນ editor ຂອງໂມດູນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:572
msgid ""
"Move your newly created ``svg`` icons (optimized or not) into that folder."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍໄອຄອນ ``svg`` ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ (ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ ຫຼື ບໍ່ກໍຕາມ) ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:574
msgid ""
"Recompile the engine and run the editor. Now the icon(s) will appear in "
"editor's interface where appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Recompile engine ແລະ ລັນ editor. ຕອນນີ້ໄອຄອນຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ interface ຂອງ editor ໃນບ່ອນ"
"ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:577
msgid ""
"If you'd like to store your icons somewhere else within your module, add the "
"following code snippet to ``config.py`` to override the default path:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບໄອຄອນໄວ້ບ່ອນອື່ນພາຍໃນໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ code snippet ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນ "
"``config.py`` ເພື່ອ override path ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:586
msgid "Summing up"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:588
msgid "Remember to:"
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:590
msgid "Use ``GDCLASS`` macro for inheritance, so Godot can wrap it."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ ``GDCLASS`` macro ສຳລັບການສືບທອດ (inheritance), ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ສາມາດ wrap ມັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:591
msgid ""
"Use ``_bind_methods`` to bind your functions to scripting, and to allow them "
"to work as callbacks for signals."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ ``_bind_methods`` ເພື່ອ bind ຟັງຊັນຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າກັບການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ, ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຮັດວຽ"
"ກເປັນ callbacks ສຳລັບສັນຍານ (signals) ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:593
msgid ""
"**Avoid multiple inheritance for classes exposed to Godot**, as ``GDCLASS`` "
"doesn't support this. You can still use multiple inheritance in your own "
"classes as long as they're not exposed to Godot's scripting API."
msgstr ""
"**ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສືບທອດຫຼາຍທາງ (multiple inheritance) ສຳລັບ classes ທີ່ເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ Godot**, ເ"
"ນື່ອງຈາກ ``GDCLASS`` ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບສິ່ງນີ້. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ multiple inheritance ໃນ classes ຂອ"
"ງທ່ານເອງໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ scripting API ຂອງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:597
msgid ""
"But this is not all, depending what you do, you will be greeted with some "
"(hopefully positive) surprises."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໝົດພຽງເທົ່ານີ້, ອີງຕາມສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ພົບກັບສິ່ງທີ່ແປກໃໝ່ (ທີ່ຫວັງວ່າຈະເປັນໄປໃນທາງທີ່ດີ)"
"."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:600
msgid ""
"If you inherit from :ref:`class_Node` (or any derived node type, such as "
"Sprite2D), your new class will appear in the editor, in the inheritance tree "
"in the \"Add Node\" dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສືບທອດມາຈາກ :ref:`class_Node` (ຫຼື node type ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ສືບທອດມາ, ເຊັ່ນ Sprite2D)"
", class ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ editor, ໃນ inheritance tree ຂອງ dialog \"Add "
"Node\"."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:603
msgid ""
"If you inherit from :ref:`class_Resource`, it will appear in the resource "
"list, and all the exposed properties can be serialized when saved/loaded."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສືບທອດມາຈາກ :ref:`class_Resource`, ມັນຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ resource, ແລະ "
"properties ທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດເຜີຍໄວ້ສາມາດຖືກ serialize ໄດ້ເມື່ອມີການ save/load."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:606
msgid ""
"By this same logic, you can extend the Editor and almost any area of the "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍຫຼັກການດຽວກັນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ Editor ແລະ ເກືອບທຸກສ່ວນຂອງ engine ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:4
msgid "Vendor Runtime Module"
msgstr "Vendor Runtime Module"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:6
msgid ""
"A Vendor Runtime Module is a :ref:`Godot module <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` "
"which is only applicable at runtime in a running project. It is created like "
"a regular :ref:`custom C++ module <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>`, but is "
"packaged using an :ref:`editor plugin <doc_making_plugins>` to make the "
"functionality it provides easily accessible and usable within a *stock* "
"Godot project."
msgstr ""
"Vendor Runtime Module ແມ່ນ :ref:`ໂມດູນ Godot <doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້"
"ສະເພາະໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຄືກັບ :ref:`custom C++ module "
"<doc_custom_modules_in_cpp>` ທົ່ວໄປ, ແຕ່ຖືກບັນຈຸ (packaged) ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`editor "
"plugin <doc_making_plugins>` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ມັນໃຫ້ມານັ້ນເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ງ່າຍພາຍໃນໂ"
"ປຣເຈັກ Godot ແບບປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:15
msgid ""
"Vendor runtime modules provide developers with access to vendor-specific "
"optimizations, features, and/or platforms for their running projects."
msgstr ""
"Vendor runtime modules ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ພັດທະນາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການປັບແຕ່ງ, ຟີເຈີ ແລະ/ຫຼື platform ສະ"
"ເພາະຂອງ vendor ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:18
msgid ""
"This provides benefits to vendors who are able to expose their technologies "
"to all developers, and improve and refine them in a rapid, iterative, and "
"frictionless manner. This also provides benefits to developers and users who "
"are able to access and use a diverse range of vendor technologies to improve "
"their games."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ຜົນປະໂຫຍດແກ່ vendors ຜູ້ທີ່ສາມາດເປີດເຜີຍເຕັກໂນໂລຊີຂອງພວກເຂົາໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ພັດທະນາທຸກຄົນ, ແລະ ປັບ"
"ປຸງພວກມັນໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ມັນຍັງໃຫ້ຜົນປະໂຫຍດແກ່ຜູ້ພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິ"
"ງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍຂອງ vendor ເພື່ອປັບປຸງເກມຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:24
msgid "Creating a vendor runtime module"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ vendor runtime module"

