msgid "Generating export templates"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ export templates"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:29
msgid ""
"Make sure to follow the :ref:`instructions for creating a custom C++ module "
"<doc_creating_custom_modules_in_cpp>`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ custom C++ module "
"<doc_creating_custom_modules_in_cpp>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:31
msgid ""
"Since this is a runtime module whose functionality is meant to only be "
"accessed from the running project, you must generate an export template for "
"every platform you plan to support. See the :ref:`Compiling <toc-devel-"
"compiling>` pages for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ແມ່ນ runtime module ທີ່ມີຟັງຊັນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້"
"າງ export template ສຳລັບທຸກ platform ທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະຮອງຮັບ. ເບິ່ງໜ້າ :ref:`Compiling "
"<toc-devel-compiling>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

