"contents:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``init.h`` ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``src`` ໂດຍມີເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:146
msgid ""
"The functions declared here have the signatures expected by the GDExtension "
"API."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນທີ່ປະກາດຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ມີຮູບແບບ (signatures) ຕາມທີ່ GDExtension API ຄາດຫວັງໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:148
msgid ""
"Note the inclusion of the ``defs.h`` file. This is one of our helpers to "
"simplify writing the extension code. For now it will only contain the "
"definition of ``GDE_EXPORT``, a macro that makes the function public in the "
"shared library so Godot can properly call it. This macro helps abstracting "
"what each compiler expects."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນການລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ ``defs.h``. ນີ້ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຕົວຊ່ວຍຂອງພວກເຮົາເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດ "
"extension ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ສໍາລັບຕອນນີ້ ມັນຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການກໍານົດຂອງ ``GDE_EXPORT``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນ macro ທີ່"
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນເປັນສາທາລະນະ (public) ໃນ shared library ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກ"
"ຕ້ອງ. macro ນີ້ຊ່ວຍປົກປິດຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ແຕ່ລະ compiler ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:154
