msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີຈະຖືກຈັດສັນໃນ ``register_types.cpp``. Constructor ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ Static instance ແລ"
"ະ ``init()`` ຈະສ້າງເທຣດທີ່ຈັດການ; ສ່ວນ ``unregister_types.cpp`` ຈະທຳຄວາມສະອາດເຊີບເ"
"ວີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:323
msgid ""
"Since a Godot server class creates an instance and binds it to a static "
"singleton, binding the class might not reference the correct instance. "
"Therefore, a dummy class must be created to reference the proper Godot "
"server."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄລາດເຊີບເວີຂອງ Godot ສ້າງ Instance ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນເຂົ້າກັບ Static singleton, ການ"
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາດອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ Instance ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕ້ອງສ້າງຄລາດຫຼອກ (dummy class) "
"ຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອອ້າງອີງຫາເຊີບເວີຂອງ Godot ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:327
msgid ""
"In ``register_server_types()``, ``Engine::get_singleton()->add_singleton`` "
"is used to register the dummy class in GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ ``register_server_types()``, ``Engine::get_singleton()->add_singleton`` ແມ່"
"ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຄລາດຫຼອກໃນ GDScript."

