#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_audiostreams.rst:228
msgid "Resampling"
msgstr "ການປັບອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (Resampling)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_audiostreams.rst:230
msgid ""
"Godot's AudioServer currently uses 44100 Hz sample rate. When other sample "
"rates are needed such as 48000, either provide one or use "
"AudioStreamPlaybackResampled. Godot provides cubic interpolation for audio "
"resampling."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນ AudioServer ຂອງ Godot ໃຊ້ sample rate 44100 Hz. ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ sample rate ອື່"
"ນ ເຊັ່ນ 48000, ໃຫ້ລະບຸອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ AudioStreamPlaybackResampled. Godot ມີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນແບບຄິວບິກ (cubic interpolation) ສຳລັບການປັບອັດຕາສຽງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_audiostreams.rst:234
msgid ""
"Instead of overloading ``mix``, AudioStreamPlaybackResampled uses "
"``_mix_internal`` to query AudioFrames and ``get_stream_sampling_rate`` to "
"query current mix rate."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການ overload ``mix``, AudioStreamPlaybackResampled ຈະໃຊ້ "
"``_mix_internal`` ເພື່ອສອບຖາມ AudioFrames ແລະ ``get_stream_sampling_rate`` ເພື່ອສ"
"ອບຖາມອັດຕາການມິກ (mix rate) ປັດຈຸບັນ."

