#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:4
msgid "Custom platform ports"
msgstr "ການພອດ (Port) ລົງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:6
msgid ""
"Similar to :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`, Godot's multi-platform "
"architecture is designed in a way that allows creating platform ports "
"without modifying any existing source code."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`, ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມຂອງ Godot ຖືກອອ"
"ກແບບມາ ໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງການພອດລົງແພລັດຟອມໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source "
"code) ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:10
msgid ""
"An example of a custom platform port distributed independently from the "
"engine is `FRT <https://github.com/efornara/frt>`__, which targets single-"
"board computers. Note that this platform port currently targets Godot 3.x; "
"therefore, it does not use the :ref:`class_DisplayServer` abstraction that "
"is new in Godot 4."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງແຈກຢາຍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກເອນຈິນແມ່ນ `FRT <https://"
"github.com/efornara/frt>`__, ເຊິ່ງເນັ້ນໃສ່ຄອມພິວເຕີບອດດ່ຽວ (single-board computers). "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ການພອດແພລັດຟອມນີ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບ Godot 3.x; ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ "
":ref:`class_DisplayServer` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂອງໃໝ່ໃນ Godot 4."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:15
msgid "Some reasons to create custom platform ports might be:"
msgstr "ບາງເຫດຜົນໃນການສ້າງການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອາດຈະແມ່ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:17
msgid ""
"You want to port your game to consoles (see also the `Godot website on "
"console support <https://godotengine.org/consoles/>`_), but wish to write "
"the platform layer yourself. This is a long and arduous process, as it "
"requires signing NDAs with console manufacturers, but it allows you to have "
"full control over the console porting process."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການພອດເກມຂອງເຈົ້າລົງຄອນໂຊນ (ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ `Godot website on console "
"support <https://godotengine.org/consoles/>`_), ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການຂຽນຊັ້ນແພລັດຟອມ "
"(platform layer) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ຍາວນານ ແລະ ຍາກລຳບາກ, ເພາະມັນຕ້ອງມີການເຊັ"
"ນ ສັນຍາປິດລັບ (NDAs) ກັບຜູ້ຜະລິດຄອນໂຊນ, ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການພອດລົງຄອນໂຊນໄດ້ຢ່"
"າງເຕັມທີ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:22
msgid ""
"You want to port Godot to an exotic platform that isn't currently supported."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການພອດ Godot ລົງແພລັດຟອມໃໝ່ໆ ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:24
msgid ""
"If you have questions about creating a custom platform port, feel free to "
"ask in the ``#platforms`` channel of the `Godot Contributors Chat <https://"
"chat.godotengine.org/channel/platforms>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າມີຄຳຖາມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ທີ່ຊ່ອງ "
"``#platforms`` ໃນ `Godot Contributors Chat <https://chat.godotengine.org/"
"channel/platforms>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:30
msgid ""
"Godot is a modern engine with modern requirements. Even if you only intend "
"to run simple 2D projects on the target platform, it still requires an "
"amount of memory that makes it unviable to run on most retro consoles. For "
"reference, in Godot 4, an empty project with nothing visible requires about "
"100 MB of RAM to run on Linux (50 MB in headless mode)."
msgstr ""
"Godot ແມ່ນເອນຈິນທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ ທີ່ມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຕັ້ງໃຈແລ່ນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D ແບບງ່"
"າຍໆ ໃນແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ, ມັນກໍຍັງຕ້ອງການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນລະດັບທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແລ່ນໄດ້ໃນຄອນໂຊນລຸ້ນເກົ່"
"າ (retro consoles). ສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງ, ໃນ Godot 4, ໂປຣເຈັກເປົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເລີຍ ຕ້ອງການ RAM ປ"
"ະມານ 100 MB ເພື່ອແລ່ນໃນ Linux (50 MB ໃນໂໝດ headless)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:36
msgid ""
"If you want to run Godot on heavily memory-constrained platforms, older "
"Godot versions have lower memory requirements. The porting process is "
"similar, with the exception of :ref:`class_DisplayServer` not being split "
"from the :ref:`class_OS` singleton."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແລ່ນ Godot ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ, Godot ເວີຊັນເກົ່າຈະມີຄວາມຕ້ອງ"
"ການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ. ຂະບວນການພອດແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ຍົກເວັ້ນ :ref:`class_DisplayServer` ທີ່ບໍ່"
"ໄດ້ຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກ :ref:`class_OS` singleton."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:42
