#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:53
msgid ""
"While platform code is usually self-contained, there are exceptions to this "
"rule. For instance, audio drivers that are shared across several platforms "
"and rendering drivers are located in the `drivers/ folder <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/drivers>`__ of the Godot source "
"code."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງແພລັດຟອມມັກຈະແຍກເປັນເອກະລາດ, ແຕ່ກໍມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໄດຣເວີສຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃ"
"ນ ຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering) ຈະຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ `drivers/ folder "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/drivers>`__ ຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:60
msgid "Creating a custom platform port"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:62
msgid ""
"Creating a custom platform port is a large undertaking which requires prior "
"knowledge of the platform's SDKs. Depending on what features you need, the "
"amount of work needed varies:"
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງແມ່ນວຽກໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບ SDK ຂອງແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນມາກ່ອນ. ປະ"
"ລິມານວຽກຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຟີເຈີ (features) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:67
msgid "Required features of a platform port"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການພອດແພລັດຟອມ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:69
msgid ""
"At the very least, a platform port must have methods from "
"the :ref:`class_OS` singleton implemented to be buildable and usable for "
"headless operation. A ``logo.svg`` (32×32) vector image must also be present "
"within the platform folder. This logo is displayed in the Export dialog for "
"each export preset targeting the platform in question."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ, ການພອດແພລັດຟອມຕ້ອງມີການສ້າງເມັດທອດ (methods) ຈາກ :ref:`class_OS` "
"singleton ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດບິລ (build) ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານແບບ headless ໄດ້. ຕ້ອງມີຮູບພາບເວັກເຕີ "
"``logo.svg`` (32×32) ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຂອງແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນນຳ. ໂລໂກ້ນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Export ສຳລັ"
"ບແຕ່ລະຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການສົ່ງອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:75
msgid ""
"See `this implementation <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"platform/linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp>`__ for the Linux/\\*BSD platform as an "
"example. See also the `OS singleton header <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/master/core/os/os.h>`__ for reference."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ `ການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/"
"linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp>`__ ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ Linux/\\*BSD ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງ. ແລະ ເບິ່ງ `OS "
"singleton header <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/os/"
"os.h>`__ ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:82
msgid ""
"If your target platform is UNIX-like, consider inheriting from the "
"``OS_Unix`` class to get much of the work done automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງເຈົ້າແມ່ນແບບ UNIX, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການສືບທອດ (inherit) ຈາກຄລາສ "
"``OS_Unix`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບຈັດການວຽກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:85
msgid ""
"If the platform is not UNIX-like, you might use the `Windows port <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/windows/os_windows.cpp>`__ "
"as a reference."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກແພລັດຟອມບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ UNIX, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະໃຊ້ `Windows port <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/windows/os_windows.cpp>`__ ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີ"
"ງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:89
msgid "**detect.py file**"
msgstr "**ໄຟລ໌ detect.py**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:91
msgid ""
"A ``detect.py`` file must be created within the platform's folder with all "
"methods implemented. This file is required for SCons to detect the platform "
"as a valid option for compiling. See the `detect.py file <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/detect.py>`__ for the Linux/"
"\\*BSD platform as an example."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``detect.py`` ໄວ້ພາຍໃນໂຟນເດີຂອງແພລັດຟອມ ພ້ອມທັງຂຽນເມັດທອດທັງໝົດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ໄຟລ໌"
"ນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ SCons ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນກວດພົບວ່າແພລັດຟອມນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ "
"(compiling). ເບິ່ງ `ໄຟລ໌ detect.py <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/platform/linuxbsd/detect.py>`__ ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ Linux/\\*BSD ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:97
msgid "All methods should be implemented within ``detect.py`` as follows:"
msgstr "ທຸກເມັດທອດຄວນຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ໃນ ``detect.py`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:99
msgid ""
"``is_active()``: Can be used to temporarily disable building for a platform. "
"This should generally always return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"``is_active()``: ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດການບິລສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ "
"``True`` ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:101
msgid "``get_name()``: Returns the platform's user-visible name as a string."
msgstr ""
"``get_name()``: ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:102
msgid ""
"``can_build()``: Return ``True`` if the host system is able to build for the "
"target platform, ``False`` otherwise. Do not put slow checks here, as this "
"is queried when the list of platforms is requested by the user. Use "
"``configure()`` for extensive dependency checks instead."
msgstr ""
"``can_build()``: ສົ່ງຄືນ ``True`` ຫາກລະບົບຫຼັກ (host system) ສາມາດບິລສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝ"
"າຍໄດ້, ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ ``False``. ຫ້າມໃສ່ການກວດສອບທີ່ຊັກຊ້າຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ ເພາະມັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງ"
"ຂໍລາຍຊື່ແພລັດຟອມ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``configure()`` ສຳລັບການກວດສອບສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ລະອຽ"
"ດແທນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:106
msgid ""
"``get_opts()``: Returns the list of SCons build options that can be defined "
"by the user for this platform."
msgstr ""
"``get_opts()``: ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ທາງເລືອກໃນການບິລຂອງ SCons ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ"
"ນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:108
msgid ""
"``get_flags()``: Returns the list of overridden SCons flags for this "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"``get_flags()``: ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ SCons flags ທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນຄ່າ (overridden) ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:109
msgid ""
"``configure()``: Perform build configuration, such as selecting compiler "
"options depending on SCons options chosen."
msgstr ""
"``configure()``: ດຳເນີນການກຳນົດຄ່າການບິລ ເຊັ່ນ ການເລືອກທາງເລືອກຂອງຄອມໄພເລີ (compiler) "
"ຕາມທາງເລືອກຂອງ SCons ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:113
msgid "Optional features of a platform port"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີເສີມສຳລັບການພອດແພລັດຟອມ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:115
msgid ""
"In practice, headless operation doesn't suffice if you want to see anything "
"on screen and handle input devices. You may also want audio output for most "
"games."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ການເຮັດວຽກແບບ headless ອາດຈະບໍ່ພຽງພໍ ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຫັນບາງຢ່າງໃນໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ຈັ"
"ດການອຸປະກອນນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນ (input devices). ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສຽງອອກ (audio output) ສຳລັບເ"
"ກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:119
msgid ""
"*Some links on this list point to the Linux/\\*BSD platform implementation "
"as a reference.*"
msgstr ""
"*ບາງລິ້ງໃນລາຍການນີ້ຈະຊີ້ໄປຫາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແພລັດຟອມ Linux/\\*BSD ເພື່ອເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງ.*"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:121
msgid ""
"One or more `DisplayServers <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp>`__, with the windowing "
"methods implemented. DisplayServer also covers features such as mouse "
"support, touchscreen support and tablet driver (for pen input). See the "
"`DisplayServer singleton header <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/servers/display_server.h>`__ for reference."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍ `DisplayServers <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp>`__, ພ້ອມກັບການສ້າງເມັດທອດກ່ຽວກັບວິນໂດ "
"(windowing). DisplayServer ຍັງກວມເອົາຟີເຈີ ເຊັ່ນ ການຮອງຮັບເມົາສ໌, ໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີແທັບ"
"ເລັດ (ສຳລັບປາກກາ). ເບິ່ງ `DisplayServer singleton header <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/display_server.h>`__ ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:128
msgid ""
"For platforms not featuring full windowing support (or if it's not relevant "
"for the port you are making), most windowing functions can be left mostly "
"unimplemented. These functions can be made to only check if the window ID is "
"``MAIN_WINDOW_ID`` and specific operations like resizing may be tied to the "
"platform's screen resolution feature (if relevant). Any attempt to create or "
"manipulate other window IDs can be rejected."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບວິນໂດແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ (ຫຼື ຫາກມັນບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການພອດທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດ), ຟັງ"
"ຊັນກ່ຽວກັບວິນໂດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສາມາດປະໄວ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຂຽນລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້. ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່"
"ວ່າ Window ID ແມ່ນ ``MAIN_WINDOW_ID`` ຫຼື ບໍ່ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ ການປັບຂະໜາດ ອາ"
"ດຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ ຟີເຈີຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍຂອງແພລັດຟອມ (ຫາກກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ). ການພະຍາຍາມສ້າງ ຫຼື ຈັດການ "
"Window ID ອື່ນໆ ສາມາດຖືກປະຕິເສດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:134
msgid ""
"*If the target platform supports the graphics APIs in question:* Rendering "
"context for `Vulkan <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"platform/linuxbsd/x11/rendering_context_driver_vulkan_x11.cpp>`__, `Direct3D "
"12 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/d3d12/"
"rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp>`__ `OpenGL 3.3 or OpenGL ES 3.0 <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/"
"gl_manager_x11.cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"*ຫາກແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍຮອງຮັບ API ກຣາຟິກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:* Rendering context ສຳລັບ `Vulkan "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/"
"rendering_context_driver_vulkan_x11.cpp>`__, `Direct3D 12 <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/d3d12/"
"rendering_context_driver_d3d12.cpp>`__ `OpenGL 3.3 ຫຼື OpenGL ES 3.0 <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/"
"gl_manager_x11.cpp>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:138
msgid ""
"Input handlers for `keyboard <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/key_mapping_x11.cpp>`__ and `controller "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/"
"joypad_linux.cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການການນຳເຂົ້າ (Input handlers) ສຳລັບ `ຄີບອດ <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/key_mapping_x11.cpp>`__ ແລະ `ຄອນໂທຣເ"
"ລີ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/"
"joypad_linux.cpp>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:140
msgid ""
"One or more `audio drivers <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"drivers/pulseaudio/audio_driver_pulseaudio.cpp>`__. The audio driver can be "
"located in the ``platform/`` folder (this is done for the Android and Web "
"platforms), or in the ``drivers/`` folder if multiple platforms may be using "
"this audio driver. See the `AudioServer singleton header <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/audio_server.h>`__ for reference."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍ `ໄດຣເວີສຽງ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/"
"pulseaudio/audio_driver_pulseaudio.cpp>`__. ໄດຣເວີສຽງສາມາດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ "
"``platform/`` (ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ກັບແພລັດຟອມ Android ແລະ Web), ຫຼື ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``drivers/`` ຫາກມີຫຼາ"
"ຍແພລັດຟອມໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີສຽງນີ້ຮ່ວມກັນ. ເບິ່ງ `AudioServer singleton header <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/audio_server.h>`__ ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:146
msgid ""
"`Crash handler <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/"
"linuxbsd/crash_handler_linuxbsd.cpp>`__, for printing crash backtraces when "
"the game crashes. This allows for easier troubleshooting on platforms where "
"logs aren't readily accessible."
msgstr ""
"`Crash handler <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/"
"linuxbsd/crash_handler_linuxbsd.cpp>`__, ສຳລັບການພິມຂໍ້ມູນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຜິດພາດ (crash "
"backtraces) ເມື່ອເກມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກກະທັນຫັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າ"
"ເຖິງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (logs) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:149
msgid ""
"`Text-to-speech driver <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"platform/linuxbsd/tts_linux.cpp>`__ (for accessibility)."
msgstr ""
"`ໄດຣເວີປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງ <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/"
"platform/linuxbsd/tts_linux.cpp>`__ (ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:151
msgid ""
"`Export handler <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/platform/"
"linuxbsd/export>`__ (for exporting from the editor, including :ref:`doc_one-"
"click_deploy`). Not required if you intend to export only a PCK from the "
"editor, then run the export template binary directly by renaming it to match "
"the PCK file. See the `EditorExportPlatform header <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/export/editor_export_platform.h>`__ for "
"reference. ``run_icon.svg`` (16×16) should be present within the platform "
"folder if :ref:`doc_one-click_deploy` is implemented for the target "
"platform. This icon is displayed at the top of the editor when one-click "
"deploy is set up for the target platform."
msgstr ""
"`Export handler <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/platform/"
"linuxbsd/export>`__ (ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ລວມທັງ :ref:`doc_one-"
"click_deploy`). ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຫາກເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຈຈະສົ່ງອອກພຽງແຕ່ PCK ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວແລ່ນໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຂອ"
"ງແທັມເພດການສົ່ງອອກໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຊື່ໃຫ້ກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ PCK. ເບິ່ງ `EditorExportPlatform "
"header <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/export/"
"editor_export_platform.h>`__ ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງ. ຄວນມີ ``run_icon.svg`` (16×16) ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ"
"ແພລັດຟອມ ຫາກມີການສ້າງ :ref:`doc_one-click_deploy` ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະສະແ"
"ດງຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ one-click deploy ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:162
msgid ""
"If the target platform doesn't support running Vulkan, Direct3D 12, OpenGL "
"3.3, or OpenGL ES 3.0, you have two options:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການແລ່ນ Vulkan, Direct3D 12, OpenGL 3.3, ຫຼື OpenGL ES "
"3.0, ເຈົ້າມີສອງທາງເລືອກ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:165
msgid ""
"Use a library at runtime to translate Vulkan or OpenGL calls to another "
"graphics API. For example, `MoltenVK <https://moltengl.com/moltenvk/>`__ is "
"used on macOS to translate Vulkan to Metal at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີໃນຂະນະທີ່ແລ່ນ (runtime) ເພື່ອແປງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Vulkan ຫຼື OpenGL ໃຫ້ເປັນ API ກຣາຟິກອື່"
"ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, `MoltenVK <https://moltengl.com/moltenvk/>`__ ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ເພື່ອແປງ "
"Vulkan ໃຫ້ເປັນ Metal ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແລ່ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:168
msgid ""
"Create a new renderer from scratch. This is a large undertaking, especially "
"if you want to support both 2D and 3D rendering with advanced features."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວສະແດງຜົນ (renderer) ໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວຽກທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຮອງ"
"ຮັບ ທັງການສະແດງຜົນ 2D ແລະ 3D ພ້ອມກັບຟີເຈີລະດັບສູງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:172
msgid "Distributing a custom platform port"
msgstr "ການແຈກຢາຍການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:176
msgid ""
"Before distributing a custom platform port, make sure you're allowed to "
"distribute all the code that is being linked against. Console SDKs are "
"typically under NDAs which prevent redistribution to the public."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນຈະແຈກຢາຍການພອດແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແຈກຢາຍໂຄ້ດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອມ"
"ໂຍງນຳ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ SDK ຂອງຄອນໂຊນຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ສັນຍາ NDA ເຊິ່ງຫ້າມບໍ່ໃຫ້ແຈກຢາຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:180
msgid ""
"Platform ports are designed to be as self-contained as possible. Most of the "
"code can be kept within a single folder located in ``platform/``. "
"Like :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`, this allows for streamlining the "
"build process by making it possible to ``git clone`` a platform folder "
"within a Godot repository clone's ``platform/`` folder, then run ``scons "
"platform=<name>``. No other steps are necessary for building, unless third-"
"party platform-specific dependencies need to be installed first."
msgstr ""
"ການພອດແພລັດຟອມຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ແຍກເປັນເອກະລາດຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ໂຄ້ດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສາມາດເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວ ທີ່"
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ ``platform/``. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ :ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`, ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນ"
"ການບິລ ສະດວກຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດ ``git clone`` ໂຟນເດີແພລັດຟອມໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ "
"``platform/`` ຂອງ Godot repository, ແລ້ວແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons platform=<name>``. ບໍ່ມີຂັ້"
"ນຕອນອື່ນທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການບິລ, ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ສະເພາະຂອງແພລັດ"
"ຟອມຈາກພາຍນອກກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_platform_ports.rst:188
msgid ""
"However, when a custom rendering driver is needed, another folder must be "
"added in ``drivers/``. In this case, the platform port can be distributed as "
"a fork of the Godot repository, or as a collection of several folders that "
"can be added over a Godot Git repository clone."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໄດຣເວີການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຕ້ອງມີການເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີອື່ນໃນ "
"``drivers/``. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ການພອດແພລັດຟອມສາມາດແຈກຢາຍໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບ fork ຂອງ Godot "
"repository, ຫຼື ເປັນກຸ່ມຂອງ ຫຼາຍໂຟນເດີທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມໃສ່ Godot Git repository ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"The guides below explain how to work on the engine's codebase. If you plan "
"to contribute to the engine, please make sure to also read the `contribution "
"guidelines <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/"
"introduction.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຄູ່ມືລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດວຽກກັບ codebase ຂອງເອນຈິນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະປະກອບສ່ວນ "
"(contribute) ໃຫ້ກັບເອນຈິນ, ກະລຸນາແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ອ່ານ `ແນວທາງການປະກອບສ່ວນ <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html>`__ ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"We assume that you have already `cloned <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot>`_ and :ref:`compiled <toc-devel-compiling>` Godot."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດການ `cloned <https://github.com/godotengine/godot>`_ ແລະ "
":ref:`compiled <toc-devel-compiling>` Godot ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"You can easily develop Godot with any text editor and by invoking ``scons`` "
"on the command line, but if you want to work with an IDE (Integrated "
"Development Environment), here are setup instructions for some popular ones:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດພັດທະນາ Godot ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍດ້ວຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text editor) ໃດກໍໄດ້ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່"
"ງ ``scons`` ຜ່ານ command line, ແຕ່ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກກັບ IDE, ນີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັ"
"ບ IDE ທີ່ເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"It is possible to use other IDEs, but their setup is not documented yet."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ IDE ອື່ນໆ, ແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"If your editor supports the `language server protocol <https://"
"microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/>`__, you can use `clangd "
"<https://clangd.llvm.org>`__ for completion, diagnostics, and more. You can "
"generate a compilation database for use with clangd one of two ways:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງເຈົ້າຮອງຮັບ `language server protocol <https://microsoft.github.io/"
"language-server-protocol/>`__, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ `clangd <https://clangd.llvm.org>"
"`__ ສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍຕື່ມຄຳສັ່ງ (completion), ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (diagnostics) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ເຈົ້າ"
"ສາມາດສ້າງ compilation database ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ clangd ໄດ້ສອງວິທີ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:4
msgid "Android Studio"
msgstr "Android Studio"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:6
msgid ""
"`Android Studio <https://developer.android.com/studio>`_ is a free IDE for "
"Android development made by `Google <https://about.google/>`_ and `JetBrains "
"<https://www.jetbrains.com/>`_. It's based on `IntelliJ IDEA <https://"
"www.jetbrains.com/idea/>`_ and has a feature-rich editor which supports Java "
"and C/C++. It can be used to work on Godot's core engine as well as the "
"Android platform codebase."
msgstr ""
"`Android Studio <https://developer.android.com/studio>`_ ແມ່ນ IDE ຟຣີສຳລັບການພັດທ"
"ະນາ Android ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ `Google <https://about.google/>`_ ແລະ `JetBrains "
