#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:4
msgid "Qt Creator"
msgstr "Qt Creator"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:6
msgid ""
"`Qt Creator <https://doc.qt.io/qtcreator/index.html>`_ is a free, open "
"source IDE for all desktop platforms."
msgstr ""
"`Qt Creator <https://doc.qt.io/qtcreator/index.html>`_ ແມ່ນ IDE ຟຣີ ແລະ ໂອເພນຊອ"
"ດ ສຳລັບທຸກແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:11
msgid ""
"From the Qt Creator's main screen select **New Project > Import Project > "
"Import Existing Project**."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຂອງ Qt Creator ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **New Project > Import Project > Import "
"Existing Project**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:17
msgid "Under **Location** select the Godot root folder."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ **Location** ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:23
msgid ""
"Next, you can choose which folders and files will be visible to the project. "
"While C/C++ files are added automatically, other extensions can be "
"potentially useful: ``*.glsl`` for shader files, ``*.py`` for buildsystem "
"files, ``*.java`` for Android platform development, ``*.mm`` for macOS "
"platform development."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ມາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກວ່າໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ໃດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໄຟລ໌ C/C++ ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ"
"ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ນາມສະກຸນອື່ນໆກໍອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດ: ``*.glsl`` ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ shader, "
"``*.py`` ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ລະບົບບິລ, ``*.java`` ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາແພລັດຟອມ Android, ``*.mm`` ສຳລັ"
"ບການພັດທະນາແພລັດຟອມ macOS."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:32
msgid ""
"You can change this configuration later by right-clicking on your project "
"and selecting the **Edit Files...** option."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂປຣເຈັກແລ້ວເລືອກທາງເລືອກ **Edit "
"Files...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:40
msgid "Finish the import."
msgstr "ສິ້ນສຸດການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:41
msgid ""
"Open the ``project_name.includes`` file and add a line containing ``.`` to "
"it to correctly enable the code completion."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ``project_name.includes`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມແຖວທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``.`` ເຂົ້າໄປເພື່ອໃຫ້ code "
"completion ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:48
msgid "From the left-side menu select **Projects** and open the **Build** tab."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Projects** ແລ້ວເປີດແທັບ **Build**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:49
msgid "Delete the predefined ``make`` build step."
msgstr "ລຶບຂັ້ນຕອນການບິລ ``make`` ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແຕ່ຕົ້ນອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:55
msgid ""
"Click **Add Build Step > Custom Process Step** to add a new build step with "
"the following settings:"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ **Add Build Step > Custom Process Step** ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການບິລໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the build fails with ``Could not start process \"scons\"``, it can mean "
"that ``scons`` is not in your ``PATH`` environment variable. In this case, "
"you'll have to specify the full path to the SCons binary."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກການບິລລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Could not start process \"scons\"``, ມັນອາດຈະໝາຍຄວາມວ່"
"າ ``scons`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``PATH``. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມໄປຫາໄ"
"ຟລ໌ SCons binary."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:75
msgid "From the left-side menu select **Projects** and open the **Run** tab."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Projects** ແລ້ວເປີດແທັບ **Run**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:76
msgid ""
"Under **Executable** specify the path to your executable located in the "
"``<Godot root directory>/bin`` folder. The name depends on your build "
"configuration, e.g. ``godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64`` for 64-bit LinuxBSD "
"platform with ``platform=editor`` and ``dev_build=yes``. You can use ``%"
"{buildDir}`` to reference the project root, e.g: ``%{buildDir}/bin/"
"godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64``."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ **Executable** ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ executable ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``<Godot root "
"directory>/bin``. ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການບິລ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"``godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64``. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ ``%{buildDir}`` ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂ"
"ຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:81
msgid ""
"If you want to run a specific project, specify its root folder under "
"**Working directory**."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແລ່ນໂປຣເຈັກສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງມັນໃນ **Working directory**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:82
msgid ""
"If you want to run the editor, add ``-e`` to the **Command line arguments** "
"field."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແລ່ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor), ໃຫ້ຕື່ມ ``-e`` ໃນຊ່ອງ **Command line arguments**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:88
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:63
msgid ""
"To learn more about command line arguments, refer to the :ref:`command line "
"tutorial <doc_command_line_tutorial>`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ command line arguments, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`command line tutorial "
"<doc_command_line_tutorial>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:94
msgid ""
"Developers must follow the project's `code style <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html>`__ "
"and the IDE should help them follow it. By default, Qt Creator uses spaces "
"for indentation which doesn't match the Godot code style guidelines. You can "
"change this behavior by changing the **Code Style** in **Tools > Options > C+"
"+**."
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມ `ຮູບແບບໂຄ້ດ <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/"
"latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html>`__ ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ IDE ຄວນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເ"
"ຂົາເຮັດຕາມນັ້ນໄດ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, Qt Creator ໃຊ້ spaces ສຳລັບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ກົງກັບແນວທາງຂອ"
"ງ Godot. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ **Tools > Options > C++** ໃນສ່ວນ **Code Style**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/qt_creator.rst:103
msgid ""
"Click on **Edit** to change the current settings, then click on **Copy Built-"
"in Code Style** button to set a new code style. Set a name for it (e.g. "
"Godot) and change the Tab policy to be **Tabs Only**."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ **Edit** ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Copy Built-in Code Style** ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູ"
"ບແບບໂຄ້ດໃໝ່. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ມັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: Godot) ແລະ ປ່ຽນ Tab policy ເປັນ **Tabs Only**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:6
msgid ""
"`JetBrains Rider <https://www.jetbrains.com/rider/>`_ is a commercial "
"`JetBrains <https://www.jetbrains.com/>`_ IDE for C++, C# and GDScript that "
"uses the same solution system as Visual Studio."
msgstr ""
"`JetBrains Rider <https://www.jetbrains.com/rider/>`_ ແມ່ນ IDE ທາງການຄ້າຂອງ "
"`JetBrains <https://www.jetbrains.com/>`_ ສຳລັບ C++, C# ແລະ GDScript ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ລະບົ"
"ບ solution ແບບດຽວກັບ Visual Studio."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:11
msgid ""
"This documentation is for contributing to the game engine, not for using "
"JetBrains Rider as a C# or GDScript editor. To code C# or GDScript in an "
"external editor, see :ref:`the C# guide to configure an external editor "
"<doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບເອນຈິນເກມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ JetBrains Rider ເປັນຕົວແກ້"
"ໄຂ C# ຫຼື GDScript. ເພື່ອຂຽນໂຄ້ດ C# ຫຼື GDScript ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄູ່ມື C# ສ"
"ຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ <doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you already use Visual Studio as your main IDE, you can use the same "
"solution file in Rider. Rider and Visual Studio use the same solution "
"format, so you can switch between the two IDEs without rebuilding the "
"solution file. Debug configurations need to be changed when going from one "
"IDE to another."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ Visual Studio ເປັນ IDE ຫຼັກຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ solution ອັນດຽວກັນໃນ "
"Rider ໄດ້. Rider ແລະ Visual Studio ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ solution ດຽວກັນ, ເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າ"
"ງສອງ IDE ນີ້ໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ solution ໃໝ່. ແຕ່ຕ້ອງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ Debug configurations "
"ເມື່ອສະຫຼັບ IDE."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you are starting from the scratch, please "
"follow :ref:`instructions<doc_compiling_index>`, specifically:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ, ກະລຸນາເຮັດຕາມ :ref:`ຂັ້ນຕອນ<doc_compiling_index>`, ໂດຍສະເພາະ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:24
msgid "Install all the dependencies."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:25
msgid ""
"Figure out the scons command for compiling to target a specific platform."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຳສັ່ງ scons ສຳລັບການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄປຍັງແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:27
msgid ""
"Provide scons with additional arguments to request a solution file "
"generation:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ arguments ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ scons ເພື່ອຮ້ອງຂໍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ solution:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:29
msgid "Add `vsproj=yes dev_build=yes` to the scons command"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ `vsproj=yes dev_build=yes` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ scons"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:31
msgid ""
"The ``vsproj`` parameter signals that you want Visual Studio solution "
"generated. The ``dev_build`` parameter ensures the debug symbols are "
"included, allowing to e.g. step through code using breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``vsproj`` ບອກວ່າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ Visual Studio solution. ພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``dev_build`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລວມເອົາ debug symbols ເຂົ້ານຳ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"breakpoints ກວດສອບໂຄ້ດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:34
msgid "Open the generated ``godot.sln`` in Rider."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ``godot.sln`` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ Rider."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:36
msgid ""
"Ensure that the appropriate Solution configuration is selected on the Rider "
"toolbar. It affects resolve of the SDKs, code analysis, build, run, etc."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ Solution configuration ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຂອງ Rider. ມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ການກວ"
"ດຫາ SDK, ການວິເຄາະໂຄ້ດ, ການບິລ, ການແລ່ນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:42
msgid ""
"Rider comes with a built-in debugger that can be used to debug the Godot "
"project. You can launch the debugger by pressing the **Debug** icon at the "
"top of the screen, this only works for the Project Manager, if you want to "
"debug the editor, you need to configure the debugger first."
msgstr ""
"Rider ມີຕົວດີບັກໃນຕົວທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ດີບັກໂປຣເຈັກ Godot ໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດຕົວດີບັກໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດໄອຄອນ "
"**Debug** ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ແຕ່ວິທີນີ້ຈະດີບັກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ Project Manager ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ"
"ດີບັກ editor, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວດີບັກກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click on the **Godot > Edit Configurations** option at the top of the screen."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ທາງເລືອກ **Godot > Edit Configurations** ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:54
msgid "Ensure the following values for the C++ Project Run Configuration:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບ C++ Project Run Configuration:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:56
msgid "Exe Path : ``$(LocalDebuggerCommand)``"
msgstr "Exe Path : ``$(LocalDebuggerCommand)``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:57
msgid "Program Arguments: ``-e --path <path to the Godot project>``"
msgstr "Program Arguments: ``-e --path <ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂປຣເຈັກ Godot>``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:58
msgid "Working Directory: ``$(LocalDebuggerWorkingDirectory)``"
msgstr "Working Directory: ``$(LocalDebuggerWorkingDirectory)``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:59
msgid "Before Launch has a value of \"Build Project\""
msgstr "Before Launch ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າເປັນ \"Build Project\""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:61
msgid ""
"This will tell the executable to debug the specified project without opening "
"the Project Manager. Use the root path to the project folder, not "
"``project.godot`` file path."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບອກໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ executable ດີບັກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດ Project Manager. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງໄ"
"ປຫາໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ``project.godot``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:67
msgid "Finally click on \"Apply\" and \"OK\" to save the changes."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ຄລິກ \"Apply\" ແລະ \"OK\" ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:69
msgid ""
"When you press the **Debug** icon at the top of the screen, JetBrains Rider "
"will launch the Godot editor with the debugger attached."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກົດໄອຄອນ **Debug** ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, JetBrains Rider ຈະເປີດ Godot editor ພ້ອມກັ"
"ບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:71
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can use **Run > Attach to Process** to attach the debugger "
"to a running Godot instance."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ **Run > Attach to Process** ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກເຂົ້າກັບ Godot ທີ່ກຳລັງແລ່ນຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:76
msgid ""
"You can find the Godot instance by searching for ``godot.editor`` and then "
"clicking ``Attach with LLDB``"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຫາ Godot ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາ ``godot.editor`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ ``Attach with LLDB``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:84
msgid "Debug visualizers"
msgstr "ຕົວສະແດງຜົນການດີບັກ (Debug visualizers)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:85
msgid ""
"Debug visualizers customize how complex data structures are displayed during "
"debugging. For Windows \"natvis\" (short for \"Native Visualization\") built-"
"in with Godot are automatically used. For other operating systems, similar "
"functionality can be setup manually."
msgstr ""
"Debug visualizers ຈະປັບແຕ່ງການສະແດງຜົນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໃນລະຫວ່າງການດີບັກ. ສຳລັບ "
"Windows, \"natvis\" ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນ Godot ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆ, ເຈົ້"
"າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຟັງຊັນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:89
msgid ""
"Please follow `RIDER-123535 <https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/"
"RIDER-123535/nix-Debug-Godot-Cpp-from-Rider-pretty-printers-usability>`_."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຕິດຕາມໄດ້ທີ່ `RIDER-123535 <https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RIDER-"
"123535/nix-Debug-Godot-Cpp-from-Rider-pretty-printers-usability>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:93
msgid ""
"Leverage Rider :ref:`doctest<doc_unit_testing>` support. Please refer to "
"`the instructions <https://github.com/JetBrains/godot-support/wiki/Godot-"
"doctest-Unit-Tests>`_."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການຮອງຮັບ :ref:`doctest<doc_unit_testing>` ຂອງ Rider. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ `ຄຳແ"
"ນະນຳ <https://github.com/JetBrains/godot-support/wiki/Godot-doctest-Unit-"
"Tests>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:97
msgid "Profiling"
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບ (Profiling)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:98
msgid ""
"Please refer to `the profiling instructions <https://github.com/JetBrains/"
"godot-support/wiki/Profiling-Godot-engine-(native-code)-with-dotTrace-or-"
"JetBrains-Rider>`_."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ `ຄຳແນະນຳການເຮັດ Profiling <https://github.com/JetBrains/godot-"
"support/wiki/Profiling-Godot-engine-(native-code)-with-dotTrace-or-JetBrains-"
"Rider>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:100
msgid ""
"Please consult the `JetBrains Rider documentation <https://www.jetbrains.com/"
"rider/documentation/>`_ for any specific information about the JetBrains IDE."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາສຶກສາ `ເອກະສານຂອງ JetBrains Rider <https://www.jetbrains.com/rider/"
"documentation/>`_ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະກ່ຽວກັບ JetBrains IDE."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:103
msgid "Known issues"
msgstr "ບັນຫາທີ່ພົບ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/rider.rst:104
msgid ""
"Debugging Windows MinGV build - symbols are not loaded. Reported "
"`RIDER-106816 <https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RIDER-106816/Upgrade-"
"LLDB-to-actual-version>`_."
msgstr ""
"ການດີບັກ Windows MinGV build - ບໍ່ມີການໂຫຼດ symbols. ມີການລາຍງານໄວ້ທີ່ `RIDER-106816 "
"<https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RIDER-106816/Upgrade-LLDB-to-actual-"
"version>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:4
msgid "Visual Studio"
msgstr "Visual Studio"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:6
msgid ""
"`Visual Studio Community <https://visualstudio.microsoft.com>`__ is a "
"Windows-only IDE by `Microsoft <https://microsoft.com>`_ that's free for "
"individual use or non-commercial use within organizations. It has many "
"useful features, such as memory view, performance view, source control and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"`Visual Studio Community <https://visualstudio.microsoft.com>`__ ແມ່ນ IDE ສຳລັ"
"ບ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຈາກ `Microsoft <https://microsoft.com>`_ ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟຣີສຳລັບສ່ວນບຸກຄົ"
"ນ ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເພື່ອການຄ້າໃນອົງກອນ. ມັນມີຟີເຈີທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ: memory view, "
"performance view, source control ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:13
msgid ""
"This documentation is for contributions to the game engine, and not using "
"Visual Studio as a C# editor. To code C# in an external editor, "
"see :ref:`the C# guide to configure an external editor "
"<doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບເອນຈິນເກມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ Visual Studio ເປັນຕົວແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ C#. ເພື່ອຂຽນ C# ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄູ່ມື C# ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ "
"<doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:20
msgid ""
"Visual Studio requires a solution file to work on a project. While Godot "
"does not come with the solution file, it can be generated using SCons."
msgstr ""
"Visual Studio ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ solution ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບໂປຣເຈັກ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ Godot ຈະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ "
"solution ມາໃຫ້, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ SCons."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:23
msgid ""
"Navigate to the Godot root folder and open a Command Prompt or PowerShell "
"window."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ Godot ແລ້ວເປີດ Command Prompt ຫຼື PowerShell."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:0
msgid ""
"Run ``scons platform=windows vsproj=yes dev_build=yes`` to generate the "
"solution with debug symbols."
msgstr ""
"ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons platform=windows vsproj=yes dev_build=yes`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ solution ພ້"
"ອມກັບ debug symbols."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:0
msgid ""
"The ``vsproj`` parameter signals that you want Visual Studio solution "
"generated."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``vsproj`` ບອກວ່າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ Visual Studio solution."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:0
msgid ""
"The ``dev_build`` parameter makes sure the debug symbols are included, "
"allowing to e.g. step through code using breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``dev_build`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລວມ debug symbols ເຂົ້ານຳ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"breakpoints ກວດສອບໂຄ້ດໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:27
msgid ""
"You can now open the project by double-clicking on the ``godot.sln`` in the "
"project root or by using the **Open a project or solution** option inside of "
"the Visual Studio."
msgstr ""
"ດຽວນີ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບິລຄລິກທີ່ ``godot.sln`` ໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ "
"**Open a project or solution** ພາຍໃນ Visual Studio."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:29
msgid "Use the **Build** top menu to build the project."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເມນູ **Build** ດ້ານເທິງເພື່ອບິລໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:31
msgid ""
"Visual Studio must be configured with the C++ package. It can be selected in "
"the installer:"
msgstr ""
"Visual Studio ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ C++. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໃນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ (installer):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:40
msgid ""
"Visual Studio features a powerful debugger. This allows the user to examine "
"Godot's source code, stop at specific points in the code, inspect the "
"current execution context, and make live changes to the codebase."
msgstr ""
"Visual Studio ມີຕົວດີບັກທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກວດສອບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot, ຢຸດຢູ່ໃ"
"ນຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດ, ກວດສອບສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂ codebase ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:44
msgid ""
"You can launch the project with the debugger attached using the **Debug > "
"Start Debugging** option from the top menu. However, unless you want to "
"debug the Project Manager specifically, you'd need to configure debugging "
"options first. This is due to the fact that when the Godot Project Manager "
"opens a project, the initial process is terminated and the debugger gets "
"detached."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໂປຣເຈັກພ້ອມກັບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ **Debug > Start Debugging** ຈາ"
"ກເມນູດ້ານເທິງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕ້ອງການດີບັກສະເພາະ Project Manager, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າທາ"
"ງເລືອກໃນການດີບັກກ່ອນ. ເພາະເມື່ອ Godot Project Manager ເປີດໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່, ໂພຣເຊສເດີມຈະຖືກປິດລົ"
"ງ ແລະ ຕົວດີບັກຈະຫຼຸດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:49
msgid ""
"To configure the launch options to use with the debugger use **Project > "
"Properties** from the top menu:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ launch options ສຳລັບການດີບັກ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ **Project > Properties** ຈາກເມນູດ້ານເທິ"
"ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:55
msgid ""
"Open the **Debugging** section and under **Command Arguments** add two new "
"arguments: the ``-e`` flag opens the editor instead of the Project Manager, "
"and the ``--path`` argument tells the executable to open the specified "
"project (must be provided as an *absolute* path to the project root, not the "
"``project.godot`` file; if the path contains spaces be sure to pass it "
"inside double quotation marks)."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດສ່ວນ **Debugging** ແລະ ພາຍໃຕ້ **Command Arguments** ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສອງ arguments ໃໝ່: "
"``-e`` ເພື່ອເປີດ editor ແທນ Project Manager, ແລະ ``--path`` ເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ເປີດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ລະ"
"ບຸ (ຕ້ອງໃສ່ ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (absolute path) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ; ຫາກເສັ້ນທາງມີຫວ່າງໃຫ້ໃສ່ໃນ"
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:66
msgid ""
"Even if you start the project without a debugger attached it can still be "
"connected to the running process using **Debug > Attach to Process...** menu."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກ, ເຈົ້າກໍຍັງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນເຂົ້າກັບໂພຣເຊສ ທີ່ກຳລັງແລ່"
"ນຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູ **Debug > Attach to Process...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio.rst:69
msgid ""
"To check that everything is working, put a breakpoint in ``main.cpp`` and "
"press :kbd:`F5` to start debugging."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ລອງໃສ່ breakpoint ໃນ ``main.cpp`` ແລ້ວກົດ :kbd:`F5` ເ"
"ພື່ອເລີ່ມດີບັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:8
msgid ""
"This documentation is for contributions to the game engine, and not using "
"Visual Studio Code as a C# or GDScript editor. To code C# or GDScript in an "
"external editor, see :ref:`the C# guide to configure an external editor "
"<doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>` or :ref:`the GDScript guide to using an "
"external text editor <doc_external_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບເອນຈິນເກມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ Visual Studio Code ເປັນຕົ"
"ວແກ້ໄຂ C# ຫຼື GDScript. ເພື່ອຂຽນ C# ຫຼື GDScript ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄູ່ມື C# ສ"
"ຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ <doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>` ຫຼື :ref:`ຄູ່ມື "
"GDScript ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມພາຍນອກ <doc_external_editor>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:13
msgid ""
"`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com>`_ is a free cross-"
"platform code editor by `Microsoft <https://microsoft.com>`_ (not to be "
"confused with :ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs`)."
msgstr ""
"`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com>`_ ແມ່ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄ້ດຟຣີ ຈາກ "
"`Microsoft <https://microsoft.com>`_ (ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ "
":ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs`)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:19
msgid ""
"Make sure the C/C++ extension is installed. You can find instructions in the "
"`official documentation <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/languages/"
"cpp>`_. Alternatively, `clangd <https://open-vsx.org/extension/llvm-vs-code-"
"extensions/vscode-clangd>`_ can be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ C/C++ ແລ້ວ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳໄດ້ໃນ `ເອກະສານທາງການ "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/languages/cpp>`_. ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ `clangd "
"<https://open-vsx.org/extension/llvm-vs-code-extensions/vscode-clangd>`_ ແທນກໍ"
"ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:23
msgid "When using the clangd extension, run ``scons compiledb=yes``."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ clangd, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons compiledb=yes``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:24
msgid ""
"From the Visual Studio Code's main screen open the Godot root folder with "
"**File > Open Folder...**."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຂອງ VS Code ໃຫ້ເປີດໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ Godot ດ້ວຍ **File > Open Folder...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:26
msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P` to open the command prompt window and enter "
"*Configure Task*."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P` ເພື່ອເປີດ command prompt ແລ້ວພິມ *Configure Task*."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:31
msgid "Select the **Create tasks.json file from template** option."
msgstr "ເລືອກທາງເລືອກ **Create tasks.json file from template**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:36
msgid "Then select **Others**."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ **Others**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:41
msgid ""
"If there is no such option as **Create tasks.json file from template** "
"available, either delete the file if it already exists in your folder or "
"create a ``.vscode/tasks.json`` file manually. See `Tasks in Visual Studio "
"Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/tasks#_custom-tasks>`_ for "
"more details on tasks."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີທາງເລືອກ **Create tasks.json file from template**, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ເດີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງໄຟ"
"ລ໌ ``.vscode/tasks.json`` ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ `Tasks in Visual Studio Code <https://"
"code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/tasks#_custom-tasks>`_ ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:43
msgid ""
"Within the ``tasks.json`` file find the ``\"tasks\"`` array and add a new "
"section to it:"
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ ``tasks.json`` ໃຫ້ຫາອາເຣ (array) ``\"tasks\"`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມສ່ວນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:45
msgid ".vscode/tasks.json"
msgstr ".vscode/tasks.json"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:64
msgid "An example of a filled out ``tasks.json``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ ``tasks.json`` ທີ່ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:66
msgid ""
"Arguments can be different based on your own setup and needs. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` for a full list of arguments."
msgstr ""
"Arguments ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:72
msgid ""
"To run and debug the project you need to create a new configuration in the "
"``launch.json`` file."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແລ່ນ ແລະ ດີບັກໂປຣເຈັກ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງ configuration ໃໝ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``launch.json``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:74
msgid "Press :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + D` to open the Run panel."
msgstr "ກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + D` ເພື່ອເປີດແຜງ Run."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:75
msgid ""
"If ``launch.json`` file is missing you will be prompted to create a new one."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ ``launch.json`` ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:80
msgid ""
"Select **C++ (GDB/LLDB)**. There may be another platform-specific option "
"here. If selected, adjust the configuration example provided accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ **C++ (GDB/LLDB)**. ອາດຈະມີທາງເລືອກສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆຢູ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົ"
"ມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:82
msgid ""
"Within the ``launch.json`` file find the ``\"configurations\"`` array and "
"add a new section to it:"
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ ``launch.json`` ໃຫ້ຫາອາເຣ ``\"configurations\"`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມສ່ວນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:182
msgid "An example of a filled out ``launch.json``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ ``launch.json`` ທີ່ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:187
msgid ""
"Due to sporadic performance issues, it is recommended to use LLDB over GDB "
"on Unix-based systems. Make sure that the `CodeLLDB extension <https://"
"marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=vadimcn.vscode-lldb>`_ is "
"installed for configurations using `lldb`."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາປະສິດທິພາບ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ LLDB ແທນ GDB ໃນລະບົບ Unix. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ "
"`CodeLLDB extension <https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/"
"items?itemName=vadimcn.vscode-lldb>`_ ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ `lldb`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:191
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues with lldb, you may consider using gdb (see the "
"LinuxBSD_gdb configuration)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກພົບຫາບັນຫາກັບ lldb, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ gdb ແທນ (ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ LinuxBSD_gdb)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:193
msgid ""
"Do note that lldb may work better with LLVM-based builds. "
"See :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` for further information."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ lldb ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າກັບການບິລທີ່ອີງໃສ່ LLVM. ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:195
msgid ""
"The name under ``program`` depends on your build configuration, e.g. "
"``godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64`` for 64-bit LinuxBSD platform with "
"``target=editor`` and ``dev_build=yes``."
msgstr "ຊື່ໃນສ່ວນ ``program`` ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການບິລຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:200
msgid "Configuring IntelliSense"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IntelliSense"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:202
msgid "For the C/C++ extension:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ C/C++:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:204
msgid ""
"To fix include errors you may be having, you need to configure some settings "
"in the ``c_cpp_properties.json`` file."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກ່ຽວກັບ include, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງໃນໄຟລ໌ ``c_cpp_properties.json``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:206
msgid ""
"First, make sure to build the project since some files need to be generated."
msgstr ""
"ອັນດັບທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ບິລໂປຣເຈັກແລ້ວ ເພາະບາງໄຟລ໌ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:208
msgid "Edit the C/C++ Configuration file either with the UI or with text:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ C/C++ Configuration ຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື ຜ່ານຂໍ້ຄວາມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:213
msgid ""
"Add an include path for your platform, for example, ``${workspaceFolder}/"
"platform/windows``."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງ include ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``${workspaceFolder}/platform/"
"windows``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:215
msgid ""
"Add defines for the editor ``TOOLS_ENABLED``, debug builds "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``, and tests ``TESTS_ENABLED``."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການກຳນົດຄ່າ (defines) ສຳລັບ editor ``TOOLS_ENABLED``, debug builds "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``, ແລະ tests ``TESTS_ENABLED``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:217
msgid ""
"Make sure the compiler path is configured correctly to the compiler you are "
"using. See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` for further "
"information on your platform."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເສັ້ນທາງຄອມໄພເລີ (compiler path) ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:219
msgid ""
"The ``c_cpp_properties.json`` file should look similar to this for Windows:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ ``c_cpp_properties.json`` ສຳລັບ Windows ຄວນຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:221
msgid ".vscode/c_cpp_properties.json"
msgstr ".vscode/c_cpp_properties.json"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:250
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use the scons argument ``compiledb=yes`` and set the "
"compile commands setting ``compileCommands`` to ``compile_commands.json``, "
"found in the advanced section of the C/C++ Configuration UI."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ argument ``compiledb=yes`` ຂອງ scons ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"``compileCommands`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ ``compile_commands.json`` ໃນສ່ວນຂັ້ນສູງຂອງ C/C++ "
"Configuration UI."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:252
msgid ""
"This argument can be added to your build task in ``tasks.json`` since it "
"will need to be run whenever files are added or moved."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມັ້ນນີ້ສາມາດຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໜ້າວຽກການບິວຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ ``tasks.json`` ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບກາ"
"ນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:255
msgid "Linting class reference XML files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ (Linting) ໄຟລ໌ XML ຂອງ class reference"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:257
msgid ""
"To get linting on class reference XML files, install the `vscode-xml "
"extension <https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=redhat.vscode-"
"xml>`__."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການກວດສອບໃນໄຟລ໌ XML, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ `vscode-xml extension <https://"
"marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=redhat.vscode-xml>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:261
msgid "Displaying documentation on hover"
msgstr "ການສະແດງເອກະສານເມື່ອວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງສັນຍະລັກ (hover)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:263
msgid ""
"By installing the `Godot Hover Docs extension <https://"
"marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=RedMser.godot-hover-docs>`__, "
"you can make class reference documentation appear when hovering symbols in C+"
"+ source or header files. The information is sourced from local XML files, "
"so it works offline."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ `Godot Hover Docs extension <https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/"
"items?itemName=RedMser.godot-hover-docs>`__, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງເອກະສານອ້າງອີງເມື່ອ"
"ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງສັນຍະລັກໃນໄຟລ໌ C++. ຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ XML ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານແບບ "
"offline ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_code.rst:270
msgid ""
"This is only effective for symbols that are documented in the class "
"reference XML, i.e. those that are exposed to the scripting API. Internal "
"engine symbols will not show documentation on hover, unless they have a "
"comment right above their declaration."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໄດ້ຜົນສະເພາະກັບສັນຍະລັກທີ່ມີໃນ class reference XML ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສັນຍະລັກພາຍໃນຂອງເອນຈິນຈະບໍ່"
"ສະແດງເອກະສານ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ພວກມັນຈະມີຄອມເມັ້ນ (comment) ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:4
msgid "Xcode"
msgstr "Xcode"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:6
msgid ""
"`Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode>`_ is a free macOS-only IDE. You "
"can download it from the Mac App Store."
msgstr ""
"`Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode>`_ ແມ່ນ IDE ຟຣີ ສຳລັບ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຈົ້າ"
"ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ Mac App Store."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:12
msgid ""
"From Xcode's main screen create a new project using the **Other > External "
"Build System** template."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຂອງ Xcode ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ແທັມເພດ **Other > External Build "
"System**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:18
msgid ""
"Now choose a name for your project and set the path to scons executable in "
"build tool (to find the path you can type ``where scons`` in a terminal)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ scons executable ໃນ build tool (ເຈົ້າສາມາດຫາເສັ້ນທາງໄ"
"ດ້ໂດຍການພິມ ``where scons`` ໃນເທີມີນໍ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:24
msgid ""
"Open the main target from the **Targets** section and select the **Info** "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເປົ້າໝາຍຫຼັກ (main target) ຈາກສ່ວນ **Targets** ແລ້ວເລືອກແທັບ **Info**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:30
msgid "Fill out the form with the following settings:"
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຟອມດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:35
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Directory"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:35
msgid "A full path to the Godot root folder"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມໄປຫາໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:38
msgid ""
"Add a Command Line Tool target which will be used for indexing the project "
"by choosing **File > New > Target...**."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ Command Line Tool ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສ້າງດັດຊະນີ (indexing) ໂປຣເຈັກ ໂດຍເລືອກ "
"**File > New > Target...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:45
msgid "Select **macOS > Application > Command Line Tool**."
msgstr "ເລືອກ **macOS > Application > Command Line Tool**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:51
msgid ""
"Name it something so you know not to compile with this target (e.g. "
"``GodotXcodeIndex``)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ມັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າບໍ່ຄວນຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍເປົ້າໝາຍນີ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``GodotXcodeIndex``)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:53
msgid ""
"For this target open the **Build Settings** tab and look for **Header Search "
"Paths**."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍນີ້ ໃຫ້ເປີດແທັບ **Build Settings** ແລ້ວຊອກຫາ **Header Search Paths**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:54
msgid ""
"Set **Header Search Paths** to the absolute path to the Godot root folder. "
"You need to include subdirectories as well. To achieve that, add two two "
"asterisks (``**``) to the end of the path, e.g. ``/Users/me/repos/godot-"
"source/**``."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Header Search Paths** ໄປຫາເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມຂອງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ Godot ໂດຍຕື່ມ ``**`` ໃສ່"
"ທ້າຍເສັ້ນທາງເພື່ອລວມເອົາໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:58
msgid ""
"Add the Godot source to the project by dragging and dropping it into the "
"project file browser."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງໃສ່ໃນ project file browser."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:59
msgid ""
"Select **Create groups** for the **Added folders** option and check *only* "
"your command line indexing target in the **Add to targets** section."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ **Create groups** ສຳລັບ **Added folders** ແລະ ເລືອກ *ສະເພາະ* indexing "
"target ຂອງທ່ານໃນສ່ວນ **Add to targets**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:66
msgid "Xcode will now index the files. This may take a few minutes."
msgstr "Xcode ຈະເລີ່ມສ້າງດັດຊະນີໄຟລ໌. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once Xcode is done indexing, you should have jump-to-definition, "
"autocompletion, and full syntax highlighting."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ Xcode ສ້າງດັດຊະນີສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ jump-to-definition, autocompletion, "
"ແລະ syntax highlighting ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:73
msgid ""
"To enable debugging support you need to edit the external build target's "
"build and run schemes."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບການດີບັກ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ build and run schemes ຂອງ external build target."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:75
msgid "Open the scheme editor of the external build target."
msgstr "ເປີດຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄງຮ່າງ (scheme editor) ຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍການສ້າງພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:76
msgid "Locate the **Build > Post Actions** section."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ **Build > Post Actions**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:77
msgid "Add a new script run action"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກການຮັນສະຄຣິບໃໝ່"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:78
msgid ""
"Under **Provide build settings from** select your project. This allows to "
"reference the project directory within the script."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃຕ້ **Provide build settings from** ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດອ້າງອີ"
"ງເຖິງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກພາຍໃນສະຄຣິບໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:80
msgid ""
"Create a script that will give the binary a name that Xcode can recognize, "
"e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີ (binary) ທີ່ Xcode ສາມາດຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:90
msgid "Build the external build target."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (Build) ເປົ້າໝາຍການສ້າງພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:92
msgid "Open the scheme editor again and select **Run**."
msgstr "ເປີດຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄງຮ່າງຄືນໃໝ່ ແລ້ວເລືອກ **Run**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:98
msgid ""
"Set the **Executable** to the file you linked in your post-build action "
"script."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Executable** ໃຫ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ລິ້ງໄວ້ໃນສະຄຣິບ post-build action ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:99
msgid "Check **Debug executable**."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ **Debug executable**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:100
msgid ""
"You can add two arguments on the **Arguments** tab: the ``-e`` flag opens "
"the editor instead of the Project Manager, and the ``--path`` argument tells "
"the executable to open the specified project (must be provided as an "
"*absolute* path to the project root, not the ``project.godot`` file)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມສອງອາຄິວເມນ (arguments) ໃນແທັບ **Arguments**: ແຟລັກ ``-e`` ຈະເປີດຕົວແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ (editor) ແທນຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ (Project Manager), ແລະ ອາຄິວເມນ ``--path`` ຈະບອກໃຫ້"
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ເປີດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ (ຕ້ອງລະບຸເປັນ *absolute path* ໄປຫາຮາກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ "
"``project.godot``)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/xcode.rst:105
msgid ""
"To check that everything is working, put a breakpoint in ``platform/macos/"
"godot_main_macos.mm`` and run the project."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສອບເສັງວ່າທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ວາງຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ໃນ ``platform/macos/"
"godot_main_macos.mm`` ແລ້ວຮັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:6
msgid "Building from source"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ (Building from source)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Godot prides itself on being very easy to build, by C++ project "
"standards. :ref:`Godot uses the SCons build system <doc_faq_why_scons>`, and "
"after the initial setup compiling the engine for your current platform "
"should be as easy as running:"
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີຄວາມພາກພູມໃຈໃນຄວາມງ່າຍໃນການສ້າງ (build) ຕາມມາດຕະຖານຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ C++. "
":ref:`Godot ໃຊ້ລະບົບການສ້າງ SCons <doc_faq_why_scons>`, ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, "
"ການຄອມໄພລ (compile) ເຄື່ອງຈັກສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານກໍຈະງ່າຍຄືກັບການຮັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"But you will probably need to use at least some of the available options to "
"configure the build to match your specific needs, be it a custom engine "
"fork, a lightweight build stripped of extra modules, or an executable "
"targeting engine development."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ບາງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການສ້າງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັ"
"ນການຟອກ (fork) ເຄື່ອງຈັກເອງ, ການສ້າງແບບນ້ຳໜັກເບົາທີ່ຕັດໂມດູນເສີມອອກ, ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ສຳລັບການພັດທ"
"ະນາເຄື່ອງຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"The articles below should help you navigate configuration options available, "
"as well as prerequisites required to compile Godot exactly the way you need."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຄວາມລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່, ລວມທັງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີກ່ອນການຄອມໄພລ "
"Godot ໃຫ້ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:-1
msgid "Basics of building Godot"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານການສ້າງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"Let's start with basics, and learn how to get Godot's source code, and then "
"which options to use to compile it regardless of your target platform."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຈາກພື້ນຖານ, ຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການຮັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກໃດແດ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄອມໄພລ ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶ"
"ງເຖິງແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:-1
msgid "Building for target platforms"
msgstr "ການສ້າງສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Below you can find instructions for compiling the engine for your specific "
"target platform. Note that Godot supports cross-compilation, which means you "
"can compile it for a target platform that doesn't match your current "
"platform (say, target Linux while being on Windows). The guides will try "
"their best to cover all possible situations."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຄອມໄພລເຄື່ອງຈັກສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ລຸ່ມນີ້. ໝາຍເ"
"ຫດວ່າ Godot ຮອງຮັບການຄອມໄພລຂ້າມແພລັດຟອມ (cross-compilation), ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດ"
"ຄອມໄພລສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັບແພລັດຟອມປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຄອມໄພລສຳລັບ Linux ໃນຂະ"
"ນະທີ່ໃຊ້ Windows). ຄູ່ມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະພະຍາຍາມຄອບຄຸມທຸກສະຖານະການທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:-1
msgid "Other compilation targets and options"
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການຄອມໄພລ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:62
msgid ""
"Some additional universal compilation options require further setup. Namely, "
"while Godot does have C#/.NET support as a part of its main codebase, it "
"does not get compiled by default to reduce the executable size for users who "
"don't need C# for their projects."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການຄອມໄພລທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ເຊັ່ນວ່າ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ Godot ຈະຮອງຮັບ C#/"
".NET ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດຫຼັກ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ສຳລັບ"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ C# ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"Articles below explain how to configure the buildsystem for cases like this, "
"and also cover some optimization techniques."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຄວາມລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບການສ້າງສຳລັບກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ແລະ ຍັງຄອບຄຸມເຖິງເຕັກນິກການປັບແຕ່"
"ງໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບ (optimization) ບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:4
msgid "Getting the source"
msgstr "ການຮັບຊອດໂຄ້ດ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:9
msgid "Downloading the Godot source code"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:11
msgid ""
"Before :ref:`getting into the SCons build system "
"<doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem>` and compiling Godot, you need to "
"actually download the Godot source code."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ :ref:`ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບການສ້າງ SCons <doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem>` ແລະ "
"ການຄອມໄພລ Godot, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot ກ່ອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:14
msgid ""
"The source code is available on `GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot>`__ and while you can manually download it via the website, in general "
"you want to do it via the ``git`` version control system."
msgstr ""
"ຊອດໂຄ້ດມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນ `GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/godot>`__ ແລະ ເຖິງແມ່ນ"
"ວ່າທ່ານຈະສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຜ່ານເວັບໄຊໄດ້, ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ຄວນເຮັດຜ່ານລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ "
"``git``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you are compiling in order to make contributions or pull requests, you "
"should follow the instructions from the `Pull Request workflow <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/organization/pull_requests/"
"creating_pull_requests.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຄອມໄພລເພື່ອປະກອບສ່ວນ ຫຼື ສົ່ງ pull request, ທ່ານຄວນປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຈາກ `Pull "
"Request workflow <https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/"
"organization/pull_requests/creating_pull_requests.html>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:21
msgid ""
"If you don't know much about ``git`` yet, there are a great number of "
"`tutorials <https://git-scm.com/book>`__ available on various websites."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບ ``git`` ຫຼາຍປານໃດ, ມີ `ບົດຮຽນ <https://git-scm.com/book>`__ ຈຳນວນ"
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນເວັບໄຊຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:24
msgid ""
"In general, you need to install ``git`` and/or one of the various GUI "
"clients."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ ``git`` ແລະ/ຫຼື ໜຶ່ງໃນ GUI clients ຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:26
msgid ""
"Afterwards, to get the latest development version of the Godot source code "
"(the unstable ``master`` branch), you can use ``git clone``."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ເພື່ອຮັບຊອດໂຄ້ດ Godot ເວີຊັນພັດທະນາຫຼ້າສຸດ (master branch ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ຄົງທີ່), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``git clone``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you are using the ``git`` command line client, this is done by entering "
"the following in a terminal:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ git command line client, ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງລຸ່ມນີ້ໃນເທີມິນໍ "
"(terminal):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:38
msgid ""
"For any stable release, visit the `release page <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/releases>`__ and click on the link for the release you "
"want. You can then download and extract the source from the download link on "
"the page."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່ຄົງທີ່ (stable), ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ `release page <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/releases>`__ ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ແຕກໄຟ"
"ລ໌ຊອດໂຄ້ດຈາກລິ້ງດາວໂຫຼດໃນໜ້ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:42
msgid ""
"With ``git``, you can also clone a stable release by specifying its branch "
"or tag after the ``--branch`` (or just ``-b``) argument:"
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍ ``git``, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໂຄລນ (clone) ເວີຊັນທີ່ຄົງທີ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍການລະບຸ branch ຫຼື tag ຫຼັງຈາກອາ"
"ຄິວເມນ ``--branch`` (ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ ``-b``):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:59
msgid ""
"The `maintenance branches <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/branches/"
"all>`__ are used to release further patches on each minor version."
msgstr ""
"ສໍາລັບ `maintenance branches <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/branches/"
"all>`__ ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ອຍແພັດ (patch) ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:62
msgid ""
"You can get the source code for each release and pre-release in ``.tar.xz`` "
"format from `godotengine/godot-builds on GitHub <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-builds/releases>`__. This lacks version control "
"information but has a slightly smaller download size."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຮັບຊອດໂຄ້ດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນ ແລະ ເວີຊັນກ່ອນປ່ອຍຕົວຈິງໃນຮູບແບບ ``.tar.xz`` ໄດ້ຈາກ "
"`godotengine/godot-builds on GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"builds/releases>`__. ຮູບແບບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control) ແຕ່ຈະມີຂະໜາດດາ"
"ວໂຫຼດນ້ອຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/getting_source.rst:66
msgid ""
"After downloading the Godot source code, you can :ref:`continue to compiling "
"Godot <doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem>`."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກດາວໂຫຼດຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດ :ref:`ດຳເນີນການຄອມໄພລ Godot ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້ "
"<doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:4
msgid "Introduction to the buildsystem"
msgstr "ແນະນຳລະບົບການສ້າງ (buildsystem)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:9
msgid ""
"Godot is a primarily C++ project and it :ref:`uses the SCons build system. "
"<doc_faq_why_scons>` We love SCons for how maintainable and easy to set up "
"it makes our buildsystem. And thanks to that compiling Godot from source can "
"be as simple as running:"
msgstr ""
"Godot ເປັນໂປຣເຈັກ C++ ເປັນຫຼັກ ແລະ :ref:`ໃຊ້ລະບົບການສ້າງ SCons <doc_faq_why_scons>`. "
"ພວກເຮົາຮັກ SCons ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລະບົບການສ້າງຂອງພວກເຮົາສາມາດບຳລຸງຮັກສາໄດ້ງ່າຍ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າງ່າຍ. "
"ແລະ ຍ້ອນແນວນັ້ນ, ການຄອມໄພລ Godot ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດຈຶ່ງງ່າຍຄືກັບການຮັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:17
msgid ""
"This produces an editor build for your current platform, operating system, "
"and architecture. You can change what gets built by specifying a target, a "
"platform, and/or an architecture. For example, to build an export template "
"used for running exported games, you can run:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນສິ່ງທີ່ຈະສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸ ເປົ້າໝາຍ (target), ແພລັດຟອມ (platform), ແລະ/ຫຼື "
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (architecture). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອສ້າງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກ (export template) ທີ່ໃ"
"ຊ້ສຳລັບການຮັນເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຮັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you plan to debug or develop the engine, then you might want to enable "
"the ``dev_build`` option to enable dev-only debugging code:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະດີບັກ (debug) ຫຼື ພັດທະນາເຄື່ອງຈັກ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"``dev_build`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດດີບັກສຳລັບນັກພັດທະນາເທົ່ານັ້ນ:"

