#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:43
msgid ""
"These articles cover in great detail both how to setup your environment to "
"compile Godot on a specific platform, and how to compile for that platform. "
"Please feel free to go back and forth between them and this article to "
"reference platform-specific and universal configuration options."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຄອບຄຸມລາຍລະອຽດທັງວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຄອມໄພລ Godot ໃນແພລັດຟອ"
"ມສະເພາະ, ແລະ ວິທີການຄອມໄພລສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງໄປມາລະຫວ່າງບົດຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ບົດຄວາ"
"ມນີ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກທົ່ວໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:48
msgid "Using multi-threading"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ (multi-threading)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:50
msgid ""
"The build process may take a while, depending on how powerful your system "
"is. By default, Godot's SCons setup is configured to use all CPU threads but "
"one (to keep the system responsive during compilation). If the system has 4 "
"CPU threads or fewer, it will use all threads by default."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການສ້າງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ, ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານມີປະສິດທິພາບພຽງໃດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SCons ຂອງ Godot ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທຸກເທຣດ (thread) ຂອງ CPU ຍົກເວັ້ນເທຣດດຽວ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລ"
"ະບົບຍັງຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຄອມໄພລ). ຖ້າລະບົບມີ 4 ເທຣດ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ທຸກເທຣດໂດຍຄ່າ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you want to adjust how many CPU threads SCons will use, use the ``-"
"j<threads>`` parameter to specify how many threads will be used for the "
"build."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບຈຳນວນເທຣດ CPU ທີ່ SCons ຈະໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``-j<threads>`` ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າ"
"ຈະໃຊ້ຈັກເທຣດໃນການສ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:57
msgid "Example for using 12 threads:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບການໃຊ້ 12 ເທຣດ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:64
msgid "Platform selection"
msgstr "ການເລືອກແພລັດຟອມ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:66
msgid ""
"Godot's build system will begin by detecting the platforms it can build for. "
"If not detected, the platform will simply not appear on the list of "
"available platforms. The build requirements for each platform are described "
"in the rest of this tutorial section."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບການສ້າງຂອງ Godot ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການກວດສອບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ມັນສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້. ຖ້າກວດບໍ່ພົບ, ແພລັດຟອ"
"ມນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນລາຍຊື່ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການສ້າງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງບົ"
"ດຮຽນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:71
msgid ""
"SCons is invoked by just calling ``scons``. If no platform is specified, "
"SCons will detect the target platform automatically based on the host "
"platform. It will then start building for the target platform right away."
msgstr ""
"SCons ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ ``scons``. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການລະບຸແພລັດຟອມ, SCons ຈະກວດຫາແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝ"
"າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມແພລັດຟອມໂຮສ (host platform). ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະເລີ່ມສ້າງສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້"
"າໝາຍທັນທີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:75
msgid "To list the available target platforms, use ``scons platform=list``:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``scons platform=list``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:92
msgid ""
"To build for a platform (for example, ``linuxbsd``), run with the "
"``platform=`` (or ``p=`` to make it short) argument:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``linuxbsd``), ໃຫ້ຮັນດ້ວຍອາຄິວເມນ ``platform=`` (ຫຼື "
"``p=`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັ້ນລົງ):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:102
msgid "Resulting binary"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:104
msgid ""
"The resulting binaries will be placed in the ``bin/`` subdirectory, "
"generally with this naming convention:"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ``bin/``, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະມີຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:111
msgid "For the previous build attempt, the result would look like this:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການພະຍາຍາມສ້າງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:118
msgid ""
"This means that the binary is for Linux *or* \\*BSD (*not* both), is not "
"optimized, has the whole editor compiled in, and is meant for 64 bits."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີແມ່ນສຳລັບ Linux *ຫຼື* *BSD (ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງສອງ), ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ (optimized)"
", ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດຖືກຄອມໄພລໄວ້ຂ້າງໃນ, ແລະ ເປັນເວີຊັນ 64 ບິດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:121
msgid "A Windows binary with the same configuration will look like this:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຂອງ Windows ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:128
msgid ""
"Copy that binary to any location you like, as it contains the Project "
"Manager, editor and all means to execute the game. However, it lacks the "
"data to export it to the different platforms. For that the export templates "
"are needed (which can be either downloaded from `godotengine.org <https://"
"godotengine.org/>`__, or you can build them yourself)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີນັ້ນໄປໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ເພາະມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ, ຕົວແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ ແລະ ທຸກວິທີໃນການຮັນເກມ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນຍັງຂາດຂໍ້ມູນໃນການສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງແພລັດຟອມຕ່າງໆ. ສຳລັບ"
"ສິ່ງນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ "
"`godotengine.org <https://godotengine.org/>`__, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:134
msgid ""
"Aside from that, there are a few standard options that can be set in all "
"build targets, and which will be explained below."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກມາດຕະຖານບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນທຸກເປົ້າໝາຍການສ້າງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍຢູ່"
"ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:140
msgid "Target"
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍ (Target)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:142
msgid ""
"The ``target`` option controls if the editor is compiled and debug flags are "
"used. Optimization levels (``optimize``) and whether each build contains "
"debug symbols (``debug_symbols``) is controlled separately from the target. "
"Each mode means:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ ``target`` ຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ມີການໃຊ້ແຟລັກດີບັກຫຼືບໍ່. ລະດັບການປັບແ"
"ຕ່ງ (``optimize``) ແລະ ການທີ່ການສ້າງແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງມີສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກ (``debug_symbols``) ຫຼື ບໍ່ນັ້"
"ນ ຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ target. ແຕ່ລະໂໝດມີຄວາມໝາຍດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:146
msgid ""
"``target=editor``: Build an editor binary (defines ``TOOLS_ENABLED`` and "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``)"
msgstr ""
"``target=editor``: ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (ກຳນົດ ``TOOLS_ENABLED`` ແລະ "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:147
msgid ""
"``target=template_debug``: Build a debug export template (defines "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``)"
msgstr ""
"``target=template_debug``: ສ້າງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກແບບດີບັກ (ກຳນົດ ``DEBUG_ENABLED``)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:148
msgid "``target=template_release``: Build a release export template"
msgstr "``target=template_release``: ສ້າງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກແບບຣີລີສ (release)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:150
msgid ""
"The editor is enabled by default in all PC targets (Linux, Windows, macOS), "
"disabled for everything else. Disabling the editor produces a binary that "
"can run projects but does not include the editor or the Project Manager."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນທຸກເປົ້າໝາຍ PC (Linux, Windows, macOS), ແລະ ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ"
"ສຳລັບສິ່ງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ. ການປິດໃຊ້ງານຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ສາມາດຮັນໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ລວມຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"ຫຼື ຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:154
msgid ""
"The list of :ref:`command line arguments <doc_command_line_tutorial>` "
"available varies depending on the build type."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ :ref:`command line arguments <doc_command_line_tutorial>` ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າ"
"ງກັນໄປຕາມປະເພດຂອງການສ້າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:164
msgid "Development and production aliases"
msgstr "ນາມແຝງ (Aliases) ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:166
msgid ""
"When creating builds for development (running debugging/:ref:`profiling "
"<doc_using_cpp_profilers>` tools), you often have different goals compared "
"to production builds (making binaries as fast and small as possible)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງການສ້າງ (builds) ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ (ການຮັນເຄື່ອງມືດີບັກ/:ref:`profiling "
"<doc_using_cpp_profilers>`), ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານມັກຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການສ້າງສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງ (ກາ"
"ນເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີໄວ ແລະ ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:170
msgid "Godot provides two aliases for this purpose:"
msgstr "Godot ມີນາມແຝງສອງຢ່າງສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:172
msgid ""
"``dev_mode=yes`` is an alias for ``verbose=yes warnings=extra werror=yes "
"tests=yes``. This enables warnings-as-errors behavior (similar to Godot's "
"continuous integration setup) and also builds :ref:`unit tests "
"<doc_unit_testing>` so you can run them locally."
msgstr ""
"``dev_mode=yes`` ເປັນນາມແຝງສຳລັບ ``verbose=yes warnings=extra werror=yes "
"tests=yes``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ພຶດຕິກຳ warnings-as-errors (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ continuous "
"integration ຂອງ Godot) ແລະ ຍັງສ້າງ :ref:`unit tests <doc_unit_testing>` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່າ"
"ນສາມາດຮັນພວກມັນໄດ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:176
msgid ""
"``production=yes`` is an alias for ``use_static_cpp=yes debug_symbols=no "
"lto=auto``. Statically linking libstdc++ allows for better binary "
"portability when compiling for Linux. This alias also enables link-time "
"optimization when compiling for Linux, Web and Windows with MinGW, but keeps "
"LTO disabled when compiling for macOS, iOS or Windows with MSVC. This is "
"because LTO on those platforms is very slow to link or has issues with the "
"generated code."
msgstr ""
"``production=yes`` ເປັນນາມແຝງສຳລັບ ``use_static_cpp=yes debug_symbols=no "
"lto=auto``. ການລິ້ງ libstdc++ ແບບສະແຕຕິກຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໄດ້ດີກວ່າເມື່ອຄອມ"
"ໄພລສຳລັບ Linux. ນາມແຝງນີ້ຍັງເປີດໃຊ້ link-time optimization ເມື່ອຄອມໄພລສຳລັບ Linux, "
"Web ແລະ Windows ດ້ວຍ MinGW, ແຕ່ຈະປິດ LTO ໄວ້ເມື່ອຄອມໄພລສຳລັບ macOS, iOS ຫຼື Windows ດ້ວ"
"ຍ MSVC. ນີ້ກໍຍ້ອນວ່າ LTO ໃນແພລັດຟອມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃຊ້ເວລາລິ້ງດົນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ມີບັນຫາກັບໂຄ້ດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:183
msgid ""
"You can manually override options from those aliases by specifying them on "
"the same command line with different values. For example, you can use "
"``scons production=yes debug_symbols=yes`` to create production-optimized "
"binaries with debugging symbols included."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມ (override) ຕົວເລືອກຈາກນາມແຝງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ໂດຍການລະບຸຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນ "
"command line ດຽວກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ``scons production=yes "
"debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງແຕ່ຍັງລວມເອົາສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກໄ"
"ວ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:189
msgid "Dev build"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແບບພັດທະນາ (Dev build)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:193
msgid ""
"``dev_build`` should **not** be confused with ``dev_mode``, which is an "
"alias for several development-related options (see above)."
msgstr ""
"``dev_build`` ຕ້ອງ **ບໍ່** ສັບສົນກັບ ``dev_mode``, ເຊິ່ງເປັນນາມແຝງສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອ"
"ງກັບການພັດທະນາ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງເທິງ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:196
msgid ""
"When doing engine development the ``dev_build`` option can be used together "
"with ``target`` to enable dev-specific code. ``dev_build`` defines "
"``DEV_ENABLED``, disables optimization (``-O0``/``/0d``), enables generating "
"debug symbols, and does not define ``NDEBUG`` (so ``assert()`` works in "
"thirdparty libraries)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດການພັດທະນາເຄື່ອງຈັກ, ຕົວເລືອກ ``dev_build`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ ``target`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂ"
"ຄ້ດສະເພາະສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ. ``dev_build`` ຈະກຳນົດ ``DEV_ENABLED``, ປິດການປັບແຕ່ງ "
"(optimization) (``-O0``/``/0d``), ເປີດໃຊ້ການສ້າງສັນຍະລັກດີບັກ, ແລະ ບໍ່ກຳນົດ ``NDEBUG`` "
"(ເພື່ອໃຫ້ ``assert()`` ເຮັດວຽກໃນໄລບຣາຣີຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:205
msgid ""
"This flag appends the ``.dev`` suffix (for development) to the generated "
"binary name."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຕື່ມນາມສະກຸນ ``.dev`` (ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ) ໃສ່ທ້າຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:210
msgid ""
"There are additional SCons options to enable *sanitizers*, which are tools "
"you can enable at compile-time to better debug certain engine issues. "
"See :ref:`doc_using_sanitizers` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກ SCons ເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ *sanitizers*, ເຊິ່ງເປັນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໃນເວລາຄ"
"ອມໄພລເພື່ອດີບັກບັນຫາບາງຢ່າງຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_using_sanitizers` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:217
msgid "Debugging symbols"
msgstr "ສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກ (Debugging symbols)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:219
msgid ""
"By default, ``debug_symbols=no`` is used, which means **no** debugging "
"symbols are included in compiled binaries. Use ``debug_symbols=yes`` to "
"include debug symbols within compiled binaries, which allows debuggers and "
"profilers to work correctly. Debugging symbols are also required for Godot's "
"crash stacktraces to display with references to source code files and lines."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ ``debug_symbols=no``, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ **ບໍ່ມີ** ສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກລວ"
"ມຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ຄອມໄພລແລ້ວ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອລວມສັນຍະລັກດີບັກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ບາຍ"
"ນາຣີ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ debuggers ແລະ profilers ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກຍັງຈຳເປັນ"
"ສຳລັບ crash stacktraces ຂອງ Godot ເພື່ອສະແດງການອ້າງອີງເຖິງໄຟລ໌ຊອດໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ເລກແຖວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:225
msgid ""
"The downside is that debugging symbols are large files (significantly larger "
"than the binaries themselves). As a result, official binaries currently do "
"not include debugging symbols. This means you need to compile Godot yourself "
"to have access to debugging symbols."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກເປັນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຫຼາຍ). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຢ່າງເປັນ"
"ທາງການໃນປັດຈຸບັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ລວມສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຄອມໄພລ Godot ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່"
"ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:230
msgid ""
"When using ``debug_symbols=yes``, you can also use "
"``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` to put debug information in a separate file "
"with a ``.debug`` suffix. This allows distributing both files independently. "
"Note that on Windows, when compiling with MSVC, debugging information is "
"*always* written to a separate ``.pdb`` file regardless of "
"``separate_debug_symbols``."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ``debug_symbols=yes``, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ ``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອແ"
"ຍກຂໍ້ມູນການດີບັກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ ``.debug``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແຈກຢາຍທັງສອງໄຟລ໌ແຍກກັ"
"ນໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າໃນ Windows, ເມື່ອຄອມໄພລດ້ວຍ MSVC, ຂໍ້ມູນການດີບັກຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ ``.pdb`` "
"ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ *ສະເໝີ* ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ ``separate_debug_symbols``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:238
msgid ""
"Use the ``strip <path/to/binary>`` command to remove debugging symbols from "
"a binary you've already compiled."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``strip <path/to/binary>`` ເພື່ອລຶບສັນຍະລັກການດີບັກອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ທ່ານຄອມໄພລແ"
"ລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:242
msgid "Optimization level"
msgstr "ລະດັບການປັບແຕ່ງ (Optimization level)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:244
msgid "Several compiler optimization levels can be chosen from:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລະດັບການປັບແຕ່ງຂອງຄອມໄພເລີໄດ້ຫຼາຍລະດັບ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:246
msgid ""
"``optimize=speed_trace`` *(default when targeting non-Web platforms)*: "
"Favors execution speed at the cost of larger binary size. Optimizations may "
"sometimes negatively impact debugger usage (stack traces may be less "
"accurate. If this occurs to you, use ``optimize=debug`` instead."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=speed_trace`` *(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອເລືອກແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Web)*: ເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວໃນການເຮັ"
"ດວຽກໂດຍແລກກັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ການປັບແຕ່ງບາງຄັ້ງອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ debugger "
"(stack traces ອາດຈະຖືກຕ້ອງໜ້ອຍລົງ). ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``optimize=debug`` ແທນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:250
msgid ""
"``optimize=speed``: Favors even more execution speed, at the cost of even "
"larger binary size compared to ``optimize=speed_trace``. Even less friendly "
"to debugging compared to ``optimize=debug``, as this uses the most "
"aggressive optimizations available."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=speed``: ເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວໃນການເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍແລກກັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"``optimize=speed_trace``. ແລະ ຍັງດີບັກໄດ້ຍາກກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ ``optimize=debug``, ເພາະມັ"
"ນໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ຮຸນແຮງທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:254
msgid ""
"``optimize=size`` *(default when targeting the Web platform)*: Favors small "
"binaries at the cost of slower execution speed."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=size`` *(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອເລືອກແພລັດຟອມ Web)*: ເນັ້ນຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີນ້ອຍ ໂດຍແລກກັ"
"ບຄວາມໄວໃນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຊ້າລົງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:256
msgid ""
"``optimize=size_extra``: Favors even smaller binaries, at the cost of even "
"slower execution speed compared to ``optimize=size``."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=size_extra``: ເນັ້ນຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງໄປອີກ, ໂດຍແລກກັບຄວາມໄວໃນການເຮັດວ"
"ຽກທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າ ``optimize=size``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:258
msgid ""
"``optimize=debug``: Only enables optimizations that do not impact debugging "
"in any way. This results in faster binaries than ``optimize=none``, but "
"slower binaries than ``optimize=speed_trace``."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=debug``: ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການດີບັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາ"
"ຣີໄວວ່າ ``optimize=none``, ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ ``optimize=speed_trace``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:261
msgid ""
"``optimize=none``: Do not perform any optimization. This provides the "
"fastest build times, but the slowest execution times."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=none``: ບໍ່ມີການປັບແຕ່ງໃດໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການສ້າງໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຄວາມໄວໃນກາ"
"ນເຮັດວຽກຈະຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:263
msgid ""
"``optimize=custom`` *(advanced users only)*: Do not pass optimization "
"arguments to the C/C++ compilers. You will have to pass arguments manually "
"using the ``cflags``, ``ccflags`` and ``cxxflags`` SCons options."
msgstr ""
"``optimize=custom`` *(ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ)*: ບໍ່ສົ່ງອາຄິວເມນການປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ກັບ C/C++ "
"compilers. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງອາຄິວເມນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``cflags``, "
"``ccflags`` ແລະ ``cxxflags``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:270
msgid ""
"The ``arch`` option is meant to control the CPU or OS version intended to "
"run the binaries. It is focused mostly on desktop platforms and ignored "
"everywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ ``arch`` ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນຂອງ CPU ຫຼື OS ທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະໃຊ້ຮັນໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີ. ມັນຈະເນັ້ນໃ"
"ສ່ແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ (desktop) ເປັນຫຼັກ ແລະ ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:274
msgid ""
"Supported values for the ``arch`` option are **auto**, **x86_32**, "
"**x86_64**, **arm32**, **arm64**, **rv64**, **ppc32**, **ppc64** and "
"**wasm32**."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ ``arch`` ແມ່ນ **auto**, **x86_32**, **x86_64**, **arm32**, "
"**arm64**, **rv64**, **ppc32**, **ppc64** ແລະ **wasm32**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:281
msgid ""
"This flag appends the value of ``arch`` to resulting binaries when "
"relevant.  The default value ``arch=auto`` detects the architecture that "
"matches the host platform."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຕື່ມຄ່າຂອງ ``arch`` ໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"``arch=auto`` ຈະກວດຫາສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ກົງກັບແພລັດຟອມໂຮສ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:288
msgid "Custom modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (Custom modules)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:290
msgid ""
"It's possible to compile modules residing outside of Godot's directory tree, "
"along with the built-in modules."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຄອມໄພລໂມດູນທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງນອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງ Godot ພ້ອມກັບໂມດູນທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:293
msgid ""
"A ``custom_modules`` build option can be passed to the command line before "
"compiling. The option represents a comma-separated list of directory paths "
"containing a collection of independent C++ modules that can be seen as C++ "
"packages, just like the built-in ``modules/`` directory."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງ ``custom_modules`` ສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃນ command line ກ່ອນການຄອມໄພລ. ຕົວເລື"
"ອກນີ້ແທນລາຍຊື່ຂອງເສັ້ນທາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸຊຸດຂອງໂມດູນ C++ ທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເບິ່"
"ງໄດ້ວ່າເປັນ C++ packages ຄືກັນກັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``modules/`` ທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:298
msgid ""
"For instance, it's possible to provide both relative, absolute, and user "
"directory paths containing such modules:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະລະບຸທັງເສັ້ນທາງແບບ relative, absolute, ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບັ"
"ນຈຸໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:307
msgid ""
"If there's any custom module with the exact directory name as a built-in "
"module, the engine will only compile the custom one. This logic can be used "
"to override built-in module implementations."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຄືກັນກັບໂມດູນທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາ, ເຄື່ອງຈັກຈະຄອມໄພລສະເພາະໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເທົ່"
"ານັ້ນ. ຕັກກະນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂ້າມ (override) ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:313
msgid ":ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp`"
msgstr ":ref:`doc_custom_modules_in_cpp` (ໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃນ C++)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:316
msgid "Cleaning generated files"
msgstr "ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:318
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you may encounter an error due to generated files being present. "
"You can remove them by using ``scons --clean <options>``, where "
"``<options>`` is the list of build options you've used to build Godot "
"previously."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເນື່ອງຈາກມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວຄ້າງຢູ່. ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບພວກມັນອອກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"``scons --clean <options>``, ເຊິ່ງ ``<options>`` ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍໃຊ້ເພື່"
"ອສ້າງ Godot ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:322
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use ``git clean -fixd`` which will clean build "
"artifacts for all platforms and configurations. Beware, as this will remove "
"all untracked and ignored files in the repository. Don't run this command if "
"you have uncommitted work!"
msgstr ""
"ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ``git clean -fixd`` ເຊິ່ງຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການສ້າງ (build "
"artifacts) ສຳລັບທຸກແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຂໍໃຫ້ລະວັງ, ເພາະສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລຶບທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕາມ "
"(untracked) ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກລະເລີຍ (ignored) ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດ (repository). ຢ່າຮັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຖ້າ"
"ທ່ານມີວຽກທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຄອມມິດ (commit)!"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:328
msgid "Other build options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງອື່ນໆ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:330
msgid ""
"There are several other build options that you can use to configure the way "
"Godot should be built (compiler, debug options, etc.) as well as the "
"features to include/disable."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການສ້າງ Godot (ຄອມໄພເລີ, ຕົວເລືອກກາ"
"ນດີບັກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ລວມເຖິງຟີເຈີທີ່ຈະລວມເອົາ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:334
msgid ""
"Check the output of ``scons --help`` for details about each option for the "
"version you are willing to compile."
msgstr ""
"ກວດເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ (output) ຂອງ ``scons --help`` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະຄອມໄພລ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:340
msgid "Overriding the build options"
msgstr "ການຂ້າມ (Overriding) ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:343
msgid "Using a file"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:345
msgid ""
"The default ``custom.py`` file can be created at the root of the Godot "
"Engine source to initialize any SCons build options passed via the command "
"line:"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ ``custom.py`` ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນທີ່ຮາກຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ Godot Engine ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງ SCons ໃດໆທີ່ສົ່ງຜ່ານ command line:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:348
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:378
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:284
msgid "custom.py"
msgstr "custom.py"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:356
msgid ""
"You can also disable some of the built-in modules before compiling, saving "
"some time it takes to build the engine. See :ref:`doc_optimizing_for_size` "
"page for more details."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນການຄອມໄພລໄດ້ ເພື່ອປະຢັດເວລາໃນການສ້າງເຄື່ອງຈັກ. ເ"
"ບິ່ງໜ້າ :ref:`doc_optimizing_for_size` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:361
msgid ""
"You can use the online `Godot build options generator <https://godot-build-"
"options-generator.github.io/>`__ to generate a ``custom.py`` file containing "
"SCons options. You can then save this file and place it at the root of your "
"Godot source directory."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ `Godot build options generator <https://godot-build-options-"
"generator.github.io/>`__ ແບບອອນລາຍເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``custom.py`` ທີ່ບັນຈຸຕົວເລືອກ SCons. ຈ"
"າກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ ແລະ ວາງໄວ້ທີ່ຮາກຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊອດໂຄ້ດ Godot ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:366
msgid ""
"Another custom file can be specified explicitly with the ``profile`` command "
"line option, both overriding the default build configuration:"
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດລະບຸໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດເອງອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ command line ``profile``, ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງແ"
"ບບຈະຂ້າມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສ້າງທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:373
msgid ""
"Build options set from the file can be overridden by the command line "
"options."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກໄຟລ໌ສາມາດຖືກຂ້າມ (overridden) ໄດ້ໂດຍຕົວເລືອກໃນ command line."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:376
msgid "It's also possible to override the options conditionally:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດຂ້າມຕົວເລືອກແບບມີເງື່ອນໄຂໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:390
msgid "Using the SCONSFLAGS"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SCONSFLAGS"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:392
msgid ""
"``SCONSFLAGS`` is an environment variable which is used by the SCons to set "
"the options automatically without having to supply them via the command line."
msgstr ""
"``SCONSFLAGS`` ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variable) ທີ່ SCons ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວ"
"ເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຜ່ານ command line."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:395
msgid ""
"For instance, you may want to force a number of CPU threads with the "
"aforementioned ``-j`` option for all future builds:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການບັງຄັບຈຳນວນເທຣດ CPU ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ ``-j`` ທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງສຳລັບທຸກກ"
"ານສ້າງໃນອະນາຄົດ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:412
msgid "SCU (single compilation unit) build"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແບບ SCU (single compilation unit)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:414
msgid ""
"Regular builds tend to be bottlenecked by including large numbers of headers "
"in each compilation translation unit. Primarily to speed up development "
"(rather than for production builds), Godot offers a \"single compilation "
"unit\" build (aka \"Unity / Jumbo\" build)."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງແບບປົກກະຕິມັກຈະພົບກັບຄໍຂວດຍ້ອນການລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ header ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນແຕ່ລະ compilation "
"translation unit. ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການພັດທະນາເປັນຫຼັກ (ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການສ້າງສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງ), Godot "
"ຈຶ່ງມີການສ້າງແບບ \"single compilation unit\" (ຫຼືທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ \"Unity / Jumbo\" build)"
"."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:419
msgid ""
"For the folders accelerated by this option, multiple ``.cpp`` files are "
"compiled in each translation unit, so headers can be shared between multiple "
"files, which can dramatically decrease build times."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ຖືກເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ ``.cpp`` ຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລໃນແຕ່ລະ "
"translation unit, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ headers ຈຶ່ງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນ"
"ການສ້າງໄດ້ຢ່າງມະຫາສານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:423
msgid "To perform an SCU build, use the ``scu_build=yes`` SCons option."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດການສ້າງແບບ SCU, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``scu_build=yes``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:425
msgid ""
"When developing a Pull Request using SCU builds, be sure to make a regular "
"build prior to submitting the PR. This is because SCU builds by nature "
"include headers from earlier ``.cpp`` files in the translation unit, "
"therefore won't catch all the includes you will need in a regular build. The "
"CI will catch these errors, but it will usually be faster to catch them on a "
"local build on your machine."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອພັດທະນາ Pull Request ໂດຍໃຊ້ການສ້າງແບບ SCU, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເຮັດການສ້າງແບບປົກກະຕິກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່"
"ງ PR. ນີ້ກໍຍ້ອນວ່າໂດຍທຳມະຊາດແລ້ວການສ້າງແບບ SCU ຈະລວມເອົາ headers ຈາກໄຟລ໌ ``.cpp`` ກ່ອນໜ້"
"ານີ້ໃນ translation unit, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ກວດພົບ includes ທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃນການສ້າງແບບປົກກະ"
"ຕິ. CI ຈະກວດພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວການກວດສອບໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານເອງຈະໄວກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:435
msgid ""
"Official export templates are downloaded from the Godot Engine site: "
"`godotengine.org <https://godotengine.org/>`__. However, you might want to "
"build them yourself (in case you want newer ones, you are using custom "
"modules, or simply don't trust your own shadow)."
msgstr ""
"ແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການແມ່ນສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກເວັບໄຊ Godot Engine: "
"`godotengine.org <https://godotengine.org/>`__. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສ້າງມັ"
"ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ, ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ບໍ່ໄວ້ວາງໃຈສິ່"
"ງອື່ນ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:440
msgid ""
"If you download the official export templates package and unzip it, you will "
"notice that most files are optimized binaries or packages for each platform:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ແລະ ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ, ທ່ານຈະສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າໄຟລ໌"
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:481
msgid ""
"To create those yourself, follow the instructions detailed for each platform "
"in this same tutorial section. Each platform explains how to create its own "
"template."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມໃນພາກບົດຮຽນນີ້. ແຕ່ລ"
"ະແພລັດຟອມຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການສ້າງແທມເພດຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:485
msgid ""
"The ``version.txt`` file should contain the corresponding Godot version "
"identifier. This file is used to install export templates in a version-"
"specific directory to avoid conflicts. For instance, if you are building "
"export templates for Godot 4.4.1, ``version.txt`` should contain "
"``4.4.1.stable`` on the first line (and nothing else). This version "
"identifier is based on the ``major``, ``minor``, ``patch`` (if present) and "
"``status`` lines of the `version.py file in the Godot Git repository "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/version.py>`__."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ ``version.txt`` ຄວນບັນຈຸຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກົງກັນ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແທມເພດການສົ່"
"ງອອກໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສະເພາະເວີຊັນເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກສ"
"ຳລັບ Godot 4.4.1, ``version.txt`` ຄວນບັນຈຸ ``4.4.1.stable`` ໃນແຖວທຳອິດ (ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງ"
"ອື່ນ). ຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນນີ້ແມ່ນອີງຕາມແຖວ ``major``, ``minor``, ``patch`` (ຖ້າມີ) ແລະ "
"``status`` ຂອງ `ໄຟລ໌ version.py ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດ Git ຂອງ Godot <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/version.py>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/introduction_to_the_buildsystem.rst:493
msgid ""
"If you are developing for multiple platforms, macOS is definitely the most "
"convenient host platform for cross-compilation, since you can cross-compile "
"for every target. Linux and Windows come in second place, but Linux has the "
"advantage of being the easier platform to set this up."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງພັດທະນາສຳລັບຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມ, macOS ແມ່ນແພລັດຟອມໂຮສທີ່ສະດວກທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຄອມໄພລຂ້າມແພ"
"ລັດຟອມ, ເພາະທ່ານສາມາດຄອມໄພລຂ້າມໄປໄດ້ທຸກເປົ້າໝາຍ. Linux ແລະ Windows ມາເປັນອັນດັບສອງ, ແຕ່ "
"Linux ມີຂໍ້ໄດ້ປຽບໃນເລື່ອງຄວາມງ່າຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:4
msgid "Compiling for Windows"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລສຳລັບ Windows"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:10
msgid ""
"This page describes how to compile Windows editor and export template "
"binaries from source. If you're looking to export your project to Windows "
"instead, read :ref:`doc_exporting_for_windows`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຄອມໄພລຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Windows ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຂອງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ. ຖ້"
"າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ Windows, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ "
":ref:`doc_exporting_for_windows`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:16
msgid "For compiling under Windows, the following is required:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຄອມໄພລໃນ Windows, ຕ້ອງມີສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:18
msgid "A C++ compiler. Use one of the following:"
msgstr "ຄອມໄພເລີ C++. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Visual Studio Community <https://www.visualstudio.com/vs/community/>`_, "
"version 2019 or later. Visual Studio 2022 is recommended. **During "
"installation make sure to select C++ in the list of workflows, and select "
"the following individual components:**"
msgstr ""
"`Visual Studio Community <https://www.visualstudio.com/vs/community/>`_, ເວີຊັ"
"ນ 2019 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Visual Studio 2022. **ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອ"
"ກ C++ ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ workflows, ແລະ ເລືອກອົງປະກອບຍ່ອຍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:26
msgid "Visaul Studio 2019"
msgstr "Visual Studio 2019"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:27
msgid ""
"**MSVC v142 - VS 2019 C++ {arch} build tools (Latest)** for the target "
"architectures."
msgstr ""
