#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you've already installed Visual Studio without C++ support for the target "
"architecture, or without the Windows SDK, run the installer again; it should "
"present you a **Modify** button. Supports ``x86_64``, ``x86_32``, and "
"``arm64``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Visual Studio ໄປແລ້ວໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກການຮອງຮັບ C++ ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເປົ້າໝາ"
"ຍ, ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ Windows SDK, ໃຫ້ຮັນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງອີກຄັ້ງ; ມັນຄວນຈະມີປຸ່ມ **Modify** ໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກ. ຮອງຮັບ "
"``x86_64``, ``x86_32``, ແລະ ``arm64``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:41
msgid ""
"`MinGW-w64 <https://mingw-w64.org/>`_ with GCC can be used as an alternative "
"to Visual Studio. Be sure to install/configure it to use the ``posix`` "
"thread model. **Important:** When using MinGW to compile the ``master`` "
"branch, you need GCC 12 or later. Supports ``x86_64`` and ``x86_32`` only."
msgstr ""
"`MinGW-w64 <https://mingw-w64.org/>`_ ພ້ອມກັບ GCC ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ Visual "
"Studio ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ/ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ thread model ແບບ ``posix``. **ສິ່ງສຳຄັນ:** ເມື່"
"ອໃຊ້ MinGW ເພື່ອຄອມໄພລ branch ``master``, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ GCC 12 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຮອງຮັບສະເພ"
"າະ ``x86_64`` ແລະ ``x86_32`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:45
msgid ""
"`MinGW-LLVM <https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases>`_ with clang "
"can be used as an alternative to Visual Studio and MinGW-w64. **Important:** "
"When using MinGW to compile the ``master`` branch, you need clang 14 or "
"later. Supports ``x86_64``, ``x86_32``, and ``arm64``."
msgstr ""
"`MinGW-LLVM <https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases>`_ ພ້ອມກັບ clang ສ"
"າມາດໃຊ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ Visual Studio ແລະ MinGW-w64 ໄດ້. **ສິ່ງສຳຄັນ:** ເມື່ອໃຊ້ MinGW ເ"
"ພື່ອຄອມໄພລ branch ``master``, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ clang 14 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຮອງຮັບ ``x86_64``, "
"``x86_32``, ແລະ ``arm64``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:49
msgid ""
"`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/>`_. **Make sure to "
"enable the option to add Python to the** ``PATH`` **in the installer.**"
msgstr ""
"`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/>`_. **ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດຕົວ"
"ເລືອກເພື່ອເພີ່ມ Python ເຂົ້າໃນ** ``PATH`` **ໃນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ.**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:51
msgid ""
"`SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`_ build system. Using "
"the latest release is recommended, especially for proper support of recent "
"Visual Studio releases."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບການສ້າງ `SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`_. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີ"
"ຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ Visual Studio ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ໆ ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:54
msgid ""
":ref:`Direct3D 12 dependencies "
"<doc_compiling_for_windows_installing_d3d12_requirements>` (can be skipped "
"with the ``d3d12=no`` SCons option if Direct3D 12 support is not desired)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Direct3D 12 dependencies "
"<doc_compiling_for_windows_installing_d3d12_requirements>` (ສາມາດຂ້າມໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວເລື"
"ອກ SCons ``d3d12=no`` ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບ Direct3D 12)."

