msgid "Setting up SCons"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SCons"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:84
msgid ""
"To install SCons, open the command prompt and run the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ SCons, ໃຫ້ເປີດ command prompt ແລ້ວຮັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:90
msgid ""
"If you are prompted with the message ``Defaulting to user installation "
"because normal site-packages is not writeable``, you may have to run that "
"command again using elevated permissions. Open a new command prompt as an "
"Administrator then run the command again to ensure that SCons is available "
"from the ``PATH``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Defaulting to user installation because normal site-packages "
"is not writeable``, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຮັນຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນອີກຄັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ສິດທິຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ (Administrator). ໃຫ້"
"ເປີດ command prompt ໃໝ່ໃນຖານະ Administrator ແລ້ວຮັນຄຳສັ່ງອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ SCons ພ້ອມໃ"
"ຊ້ງານໃນ ``PATH``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:96
msgid ""
"To check whether you have installed Python and SCons correctly, you can type "
"``python --version`` and ``scons --version`` into a command prompt "
"(``cmd.exe``)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສອບເສັງວ່າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ແລະ SCons ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່, ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ ``python --"
"version`` ແລະ ``scons --version`` ໃນ command prompt (``cmd.exe``)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the commands above don't work, make sure to add Python to your ``PATH`` "
"environment variable after installing it, then check again. You can do so by "
"running the Python installer again and enabling the option to add Python to "
"the ``PATH``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຄຳສັ່ງຂ້າງເທິງເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເພີ່ມ Python ໃສ່ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``PATH`` ຫຼັງຈ"
"າກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ຈາກນັ້ນລອງກວດເບິ່ງອີກຄັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ເປີ"
"ດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອເພີ່ມ Python ໃສ່ໃນ ``PATH``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:105
msgid ""
"If SCons cannot detect your Visual Studio installation, it might be that "
"your SCons version is too old. Update it to the latest version with ``python "
"-m pip install --upgrade scons``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ SCons ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດຫາການຕິດຕັ້ງ Visual Studio ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້, ອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນເວີຊັນ SCons ຂອງ"
"ທ່ານເກົ່າເກີນໄປ. ໃຫ້ອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດດ້ວຍ ``python -m pip install --upgrade scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:112
msgid "Downloading Godot's source"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:114
msgid "Refer to :ref:`doc_getting_source` for detailed instructions."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_getting_source` ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳຢ່າງລະອຽດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:116
msgid ""
"The tutorial will assume from now on that you placed the source code in ``C:"
"\\godot``."
msgstr "ບົດຮຽນນີ້ຈະສົມມຸດຕໍ່ຈາກນີ້ໄປວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ວາງຊອດໂຄ້ດໄວ້ໃນ ``C:\\godot``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:121
msgid ""
"To prevent slowdowns caused by continuous virus scanning during compilation, "
"add the Godot source folder to the list of exceptions in your antivirus "
"software."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງທີ່ເກີດຈາກການສະແກນໄວຣັສຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການຄອມໄພລ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ"
"ຊອດໂຄ້ດ Godot ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຍົກເວັ້ນ (exceptions) ໃນຊອບແວຕ້ານໄວຣັສຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:125
msgid ""
"For Windows Defender, hit the :kbd:`Windows` key, type \"Windows Security\" "
"then hit :kbd:`Enter`. Click on **Virus & threat protection** on the left "
"panel. Under **Virus & threat protection settings** click on **Manage "
"Settings** and scroll down to **Exclusions**. Click **Add or remove "
"exclusions** then add the Godot source folder."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ Windows Defender, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ :kbd:`Windows`, ພິມ \"Windows Security\" ແລ້ວກົດ "
":kbd:`Enter`. ຄລິກທີ່ **Virus & threat protection** ໃນແຖບດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ພາຍໃຕ້ **Virus "
"& threat protection settings** ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ **Manage Settings** ແລະ ເລື່ອນລົງໄປຫາ "
"**Exclusions**. ຄລິກ **Add or remove exclusions** ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ "
"Godot ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:135
msgid "Selecting a compiler"
msgstr "ການເລືອກຄອມໄພເລີ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:137
msgid ""
"SCons will automatically find and use an existing Visual Studio "
"installation. If you do not have Visual Studio installed, it will attempt to "
"use MinGW instead. If you already have Visual Studio installed and want to "
"use MinGW-w64, pass ``use_mingw=yes`` to the SCons command line. Note that "
"MSVC builds cannot be performed from the MSYS2 or MinGW shells. Use either "
"``cmd.exe`` or PowerShell instead. If you are using MinGW-LLVM, pass both "
"``use_mingw=yes`` and ``use_llvm=yes`` to the SCons command line."
msgstr ""
"SCons ຈະຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Visual Studio ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Visual "
"Studio, ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ MinGW ແທນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີ Visual Studio ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວແຕ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ "
"MinGW-w64, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ ``use_mingw=yes`` ໄປໃນ SCons command line. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ການສ້າງດ້"
"ວຍ MSVC ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກ MSYS2 ຫຼື MinGW shells. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``cmd.exe`` ຫຼື PowerShell ແທ"
"ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ MinGW-LLVM, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງທັງ ``use_mingw=yes`` ແລະ ``use_llvm=yes`` ໄປໃນ "
"SCons command line."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:147
msgid ""
"During development, using the Visual Studio compiler is usually a better "
"idea, as it links the Godot binary much faster than MinGW. However, MinGW "
"can produce more optimized binaries using link-time optimization (see "
"below), making it a better choice for production use. This is particularly "
"the case for the GDScript VM which performs much better with MinGW compared "
"to MSVC. Therefore, it's recommended to use MinGW to produce builds that you "
"distribute to players."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາ, ການໃຊ້ຄອມໄພເລີ Visual Studio ມັກຈະເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ເພາະມັນລິ້ງໄຟລ໌"
"ບາຍນາຣີຂອງ Godot ໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ MinGW ຫຼາຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, MinGW ສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ"
"ໄດ້ດີກວ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ link-time optimization (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ), ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີກວ່າສຳລັບການນ"
"ຳໃຊ້ຈິງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ GDScript VM ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າຫຼາຍດ້ວຍ MinGW ເມື່ອທຽບກັ"
"ບ MSVC. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ MinGW ເພື່ອສ້າງການສ້າງທີ່ທ່ານຈະແຈກຢາຍໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:155
msgid ""
"All official Godot binaries are built in `custom containers <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/build-containers>`__ using MinGW."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຢ່າງເປັນທາງການທັງໝົດຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ `custom containers <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/build-containers>`__ ໂດຍໃຊ້ MinGW."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:160
msgid "Running SCons"
msgstr "ການຮັນ SCons"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:162
msgid ""
"After opening a command prompt, change to the root directory of the engine "
"source code (using ``cd``) and type:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດ command prompt ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຮາກຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດເຄື່ອງຈັກ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"``cd``) ແລ້ວພິມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:169
msgid ""
"When compiling with multiple CPU threads, SCons may warn about pywin32 being "
"missing. You can safely ignore this warning."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄອມໄພລດ້ວຍຫຼາຍເທຣດ CPU, SCons ອາດຈະເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບ pywin32 ທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ. ທ່ານສາມາດລະເລີ"
"ຍຄຳເຕືອນນີ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:173
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:263
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:69
msgid ""
"If you are compiling Godot to make changes or contribute to the engine, you "
"may want to use the SCons options ``dev_build=yes`` or ``dev_mode=yes``. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem_development_and_production_aliases` "
"for more info."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຄອມໄພລ Godot ເພື່ອເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງຈັກ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຕົ"
"ວເລືອກ SCons ``dev_build=yes`` ຫຼື ``dev_mode=yes``. ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem_development_and_production_aliases` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:178
msgid ""
"If all goes well, the resulting binary executable will be placed in ``C:"
"\\godot\\bin\\`` with the name ``godot.windows.editor.x86_32.exe`` or "
"``godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe``. By default, SCons will build a binary "
"matching your CPU architecture, but this can be overridden using "
"``arch=x86_64``, ``arch=x86_32``, or ``arch=arm64``."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງເປັນໄປດ້ວຍດີ, ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ (binary executable) ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ ``C:\\g"
"odot\\bin\\`` ໂດຍມີຊື່ວ່າ ``godot.windows.editor.x86_32.exe`` ຫຼື "
"``godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe``. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, SCons ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ກົງກັບສະຖ"
"າປັດຕະຍະກຳ CPU ຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຂ້າມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``arch=x86_64``, ``arch=x86_32``, "
"ຫຼື ``arch=arm64``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:184
msgid ""
"This executable file contains the whole engine and runs without any "
"dependencies. Running it will bring up the Project Manager."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຈັກທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີ dependencies ໃດໆ. ການຮັນມັນຈະເ"
"ປັນການເປີດຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:187
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:292
msgid ""
"If you are compiling Godot for production use, you can make the final "
"executable smaller and faster by adding the SCons option ``production=yes``. "
"This enables additional compiler optimizations and link-time optimization."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຄອມໄພລ Godot ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ສຸດທ້າຍມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍລົງ ແລ"
"ະ ໄວຂຶ້ນໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``production=yes``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງຄອມໄພເລີເພີ່ມເ"
"ຕີມ ແລະ link-time optimization."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:192
msgid ""
"LTO takes some time to run and requires up to 30 GB of available RAM while "
"compiling (depending on toolchain). If you're running out of memory with the "
"above option, use ``production=yes lto=none`` or ``production=yes lto=thin`` "
"(LLVM only) for a lightweight but less effective form of LTO."
msgstr ""
"LTO ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການເຮັດວຽກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການ RAM ຫວ່າງສູງເຖິງ 30 GB ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຄອມໄພລ "
"(ຂຶ້ນກັບ toolchain). ຖ້າທ່ານພົບວ່າໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໝົດດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``production=yes "
"lto=none`` ຫຼື ``production=yes lto=thin`` (ສຳລັບ LLVM ເທົ່ານັ້ນ) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ LTO ທີ່ເບົ"
"າບາງກວ່າແຕ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:197
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:302
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:82
msgid ""
"If you want to use separate editor settings for your own Godot builds and "
"official releases, you can enable :ref:`doc_data_paths_self_contained_mode` "
"by creating a file called ``._sc_`` or ``_sc_`` in the ``bin/`` folder."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບການສ້າງ Godot ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ປ່ອຍຢ່າງ"
"ເປັນທາງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`doc_data_paths_self_contained_mode` ໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າ"
"ງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ ``._sc_`` ຫຼື ``_sc_`` ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``bin/``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:205
msgid "Installing Direct3D 12 requirements"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Direct3D 12"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:207
msgid ""
"By default, Windows builds of Godot contain support for the Direct3D 12 "
"graphics API. Compiling with Direct3D 12 support requires additional "
"dependencies to be installed. If you wish to skip this step, you can use the "
"``d3d12=no`` SCons option; Vulkan and OpenGL support will remain available "
"if you do so."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການສ້າງ Godot ເວີຊັນ Windows ຈະຮອງຮັບ Direct3D 12 graphics API. ການຄອ"
"ມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ Direct3D 12 ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕ"
"ອນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``d3d12=no``; ການຮອງຮັບ Vulkan ແລະ OpenGL ຈະຍັງຄົງມີຢູ່"
"ຄືເກົ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:212
msgid ""
"You can install the required dependencies by running ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_d3d12_sdk_windows.py`` in the Godot source repository. After running "
"this script, compile Godot as usual. This will use the default paths for the "
"various dependencies, which match the ones used in the script."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນ ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_d3d12_sdk_windows.py`` ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot. ຫຼັງຈາກຮັນສະຄຣິບນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄອ"
"ມໄພລ Godot ຕາມປົກກະຕິ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ dependencies ຕ່າງໆ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃ"
"ນສະຄຣິບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:218
msgid ""
"You can find the detailed steps below if you wish to set up dependencies "
"manually, but the above script handles everything for you (including the "
"optional PIX and Agility SDK components)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນລະອຽດໄດ້ທີ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ dependencies ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ສະຄຣິບຂ້າງເ"
"ທິງຈະຈັດການທຸກຢ່າງໃຫ້ທ່ານແລ້ວ (ລວມເຖິງສ່ວນປະກອບເສີມຢ່າງ PIX ແລະ Agility SDK)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:222
msgid ""
"`godot-nir-static library <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-nir-static/"
"releases/>`_. We compile the Mesa libraries you will need into a static "
"library. Download it anywhere, unzip it and remember the path to the "
"unzipped folder, you will need it below."
msgstr ""
"`godot-nir-static library <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-nir-static/"
"releases/>`_. ພວກເຮົາຄອມໄພລ Mesa libraries ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນ static library. ໃຫ້ດ"
"າວໂຫຼດໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້, ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ ແລະ ຈື່ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີນັ້ນໄວ້, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ມັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄ"
"ປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:227
msgid ""
"You can optionally build the godot-nir-static libraries yourself with the "
"following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກສ້າງ godot-nir-static libraries ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:230
msgid ""
"Install the Python package `mako <https://www.makotemplates.org>`_ which is "
"needed to generate some files."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ Python package `mako <https://www.makotemplates.org>`_ ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການສ້າງໄ"
"ຟລ໌ບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:232
msgid ""
"Clone the `godot-nir-static <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-nir-"
"static>`_ directory and navigate to it."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄລນ (Clone) ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `godot-nir-static <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-"
"nir-static>`_ ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປໃນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:234
msgid "Run the following:"
msgstr "ຮັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:242
msgid ""
"If you are building with MinGW-w64, add ``use_mingw=yes`` to the ``scons`` "
"command, you can also specify the build architecture using "
"``arch={architecture}``. If you are building with MinGW-LLVM, add both "
"``use_mingw=yes`` and ``use_llvm=yes`` to the ``scons`` command."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW-w64, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``use_mingw=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons``, ທ່ານຍັງສາມ"
"າດລະບຸສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳການສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``arch={architecture}``. ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW-"
"LLVM, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທັງ ``use_mingw=yes`` ແລະ ``use_llvm=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:247
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:414
msgid ""
"If you are building with MinGW and the binaries are not located in the "
"``PATH``, add ``mingw_prefix=\"/path/to/mingw\"`` to the ``scons`` command."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ ``PATH``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``mingw_prefix=\"/path/"
"to/mingw\"`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:251
msgid ""
"The Mesa static library should be built using the same compiler and the same "
"CRT (if you are building with MinGW) you are using for building Godot."
msgstr ""
"Mesa static library ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄອມໄພເລີດຽວກັນ ແລະ CRT ດຽວກັນ (ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ "
"MinGW) ກັບທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:255
msgid "Optionally, you can compile with the following for additional features:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄອມໄພລດ້ວຍສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຟີເຈີເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:257
msgid ""
"`PIX <https://devblogs.microsoft.com/pix/download>`_ is a performance tuning "
"and debugging application for Direct3D12 applications. If you compile-in "
"support for it, you can get much more detailed information through PIX that "
"will help you optimize your game and troubleshoot graphics bugs. To use it, "
"download the WinPixEventRuntime package. You will be taken to a NuGet "
"package page where you can click \"Download package\" to get it. Once "
"downloaded, change the file extension to .zip and unzip the file to some "
"path."
msgstr ""
"`PIX <https://devblogs.microsoft.com/pix/download>`_ ເປັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສຳລັບປັບແຕ່ງປະສິ"
"ດທິພາບ ແລະ ດີບັກສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Direct3D12. ຖ້າທ່ານຄອມໄພລໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບມັນ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອ"
"ຽດກວ່າຫຼາຍຜ່ານ PIX ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງເກມ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂບັກທາງກຣາຟິກໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ໃຫ້ດາວ"
"ໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ WinPixEventRuntime. ທ່ານຈະຖືກນຳໄປຫາໜ້າ NuGet package ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກ "
"\"Download package\" ເພື່ອຮັບມັນ. ເມື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເປັນ .zip ແລະ ແຕກໄຟ"
"ລ໌ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:264
msgid ""
"`Agility SDK <https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/directx12agility>`_ can "
"be used to provide access to the latest Direct3D 12 features without relying "
"on driver updates. To use it, download the latest Agility SDK package. You "
"will be taken to a NuGet package page where you can click \"Download "
"package\" to get it. Once downloaded, change the file extension to .zip and "
"unzip the file to some path."
msgstr ""
"`Agility SDK <https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/directx12agility>`_ ສາມາ"
"ດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຟີເຈີຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງ Direct3D 12 ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖ້າການອັບເດດໄດຣເວີ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ໃຫ້"
"ດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ Agility SDK ຫຼ້າສຸດ. ທ່ານຈະຖືກນຳໄປຫາໜ້າ NuGet package ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກ "
"\"Download package\" ເພື່ອຮັບມັນ. ເມື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເປັນ .zip ແລະ ແຕກໄຟ"
"ລ໌ອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:271
msgid ""
"If you use a preview version of the Agility SDK, remember to enable "
"developer mode in Windows; otherwise it won't be used."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ Agility SDK ເວີຊັນພີວິວ (preview), ຢ່າລືມເປີດໃຊ້ developer mode ໃນ Windows; ຖ້"
"າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

