msgstr "AccessKit ໃຫ້ການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຕົວອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (screen readers)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:317
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:92
msgid ""
"Compiling with AccessKit requires additional dependencies to be installed. "
"If you wish to skip this step, you can use the ``accesskit=no`` SCons option."
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ AccessKit ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂ້າມ"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``accesskit=no``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:320
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:95
msgid ""
"You can install the required dependencies by running ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_accesskit.py`` in the Godot source repository. After running this "
"script, compile Godot as usual."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນ ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_accesskit.py`` ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot. ຫຼັງຈາກຮັນສະຄຣິບນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄອມໄພລ "
"Godot ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

