#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:350
msgid "Compiling with WinRT support"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ WinRT"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:352
msgid ""
"WinRT provides support for OneCore TTS (accessing Windows 10+ voices), HDR "
"color information monitoring, and emoji picker."
msgstr ""
"WinRT ໃຫ້ການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ OneCore TTS (ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສຽງຂອງ Windows 10+), ການຕິດຕາມຂໍ້ມູນສີ "
"HDR, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກອີໂມຈິ (emoji picker)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:354
msgid ""
"If you are building with MinGW, compiling with WinRT requires additional "
"dependencies to be installed. If you wish to skip this step, you can use the "
"``winrt=no`` SCons option."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW, ການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ WinRT ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ເພີ່ມ"
"ເຕີມ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``winrt=no``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:357
msgid ""
"You can install the required dependencies by running ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_winrt.py`` in the Godot source repository. After running this "
"script, compile Godot as usual."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນ ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_winrt.py`` ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot. ຫຼັງຈາກຮັນສະຄຣິບນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄອມໄພລ Godot ຕ"
"າມປົກກະຕິ."

