"SCons ວ່າຈະໄປຊອກຫາ AccessKit headers ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:383
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:124
msgid "Compiling with ANGLE support"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ ANGLE"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:385
msgid ""
"ANGLE provides a translation layer from OpenGL ES 3.x to Direct3D 11 and can "
"be used to improve support for the Compatibility renderer on some older GPUs "
"with outdated OpenGL drivers and on Windows for ARM."
msgstr ""
"ANGLE ເປັນຊັ້ນການແປ (translation layer) ຈາກ OpenGL ES 3.x ໄປຫາ Direct3D 11 ແລະ ສ"
"າມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບ Compatibility renderer ໃນ GPU ລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງລຸ້ນທີ່ມີ OpenGL "
"drivers ລ້າສະໄໝ ແລະ ໃນ Windows for ARM."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:389
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:130
msgid ""
"Compiling with ANGLE requires additional dependencies to be installed. If "
"you wish to skip this step, you can use the ``angle=no`` SCons option."
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ ANGLE ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອ"
"ນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ SCons ``angle=no``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:392
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:133
msgid ""
"You can install the required dependencies by running ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_angle.py`` in the Godot source repository. After running this "
"script, compile Godot as usual."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນ ``python misc/scripts/"
"install_angle.py`` ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot. ຫຼັງຈາກຮັນສະຄຣິບນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄອມໄພລ Godot ຕ"
"າມປົກກະຕິ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:396
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:329
