#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:399
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:140
msgid ""
"Clone the `godot-angle-static <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-angle-"
"static>`_ directory and navigate to it."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄລນ (Clone) ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `godot-angle-static <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-angle-static>`_ ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປໃນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:409
msgid ""
"If you are buildng with MinGW, add ``use_mingw=yes`` to the command, you can "
"also specify the build architecture using ``arch={architecture}``. If you "
"are building with MinGW-LLVM, add both ``use_mingw=yes`` and "
"``use_llvm=yes`` to the ``scons`` command."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``use_mingw=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳກ"
"ານສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``arch={architecture}``. ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW-LLVM, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທັງ "
"``use_mingw=yes`` ແລະ ``use_llvm=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:418
msgid ""
"The ANGLE static library should be built using the same compiler and the "
"same CRT (if you are building with MinGW) you are using for building Godot."
msgstr ""
"ANGLE static library ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄອມໄພເລີດຽວກັນ ແລະ CRT ດຽວກັນ (ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ "
"MinGW) ກັບທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:422
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:155
msgid ""
"To compile Godot with a custom build of ANGLE, add ``angle_libs={path}`` to "
"tell SCons where to look for the ANGLE libraries:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄອມໄພລ Godot ດ້ວຍ ANGLE ເວີຊັນທີ່ສ້າງເອງ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``angle_libs={path}`` ເພື່ອບອກ "
"SCons ວ່າຈະໄປຊອກຫາ ANGLE libraries ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:430
msgid "Development in Visual Studio"
msgstr "ການພັດທະນາໃນ Visual Studio"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:432
msgid ""
"Using an IDE is not required to compile Godot, as SCons takes care of "
"everything. But if you intend to do engine development or debugging of the "
"engine's C++ code, you may be interested in configuring a code editor or an "
"IDE."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ IDE ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການຄອມໄພລ Godot, ເພາະ SCons ຈະຈັດການທຸກຢ່າງໃຫ້ແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານ"
"ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະເຮັດການພັດທະນາເຄື່ອງຈັກ ຫຼື ດີບັກໂຄ້ດ C++ ຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ, ທ່ານອາດຈະສົນໃຈໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ code "
"editor ຫຼື IDE."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:436
msgid ""
"Folder-based editors don't require any particular setup to start working "
"with Godot's codebase. To edit projects with Visual Studio they need to be "
"set up as a solution."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບອີງຕາມໂຟນເດີ (Folder-based editors) ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າພິເສດໃດໆ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ"
"ກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot. ແຕ່ການແກ້ໄຂໂປຣເຈັກດ້ວຍ Visual Studio ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"solution."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:439
msgid ""
"You can create a Visual Studio solution via SCons by running SCons with the "
"``vsproj=yes`` parameter, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ Visual Studio solution ຜ່ານ SCons ໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັນ SCons ພ້ອມກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``vsproj=yes`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:446
msgid ""
"You will be able to open Godot's source in a Visual Studio solution now, and "
"able to build Godot using Visual Studio's **Build** button."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເປີດຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ Godot ໃນ Visual Studio solution ໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ສາມາດສ້າ"
"ງ Godot ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ **Build** ຂອງ Visual Studio ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:449
msgid "See :ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs` for further details."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:454
msgid ""
"If you get a compilation failure when using MSVC, make sure to apply the "
"latest updates. You can do so by starting the Visual Studio IDE and "
"using :button:`Continue without code`, then :menu:`Help > Check for Updates` "
"in the menu bar at the top. Install all updates, then try compiling again."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລເມື່ອໃຊ້ MSVC, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັ"
"ດໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ Visual Studio IDE ແລ້ວເລືອກ :button:`Continue without code`, ຈາກນັ້ນ"
"ໄປທີ່ :menu:`Help > Check for Updates` ໃນແຖບເມນູດ້ານເທິງ. ຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກການອັບເດດ, ແລ້ວລອງຄອ"
"ມໄພລອີກຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:460
msgid "Cross-compiling for Windows from other operating systems"
msgstr ""
