msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຄອມໄພລ, SCons ຈະກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``PATH`` ຂອງ"
"ທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:506
msgid ""
"If the binaries are not located in the ``PATH`` (e.g. ``/usr/bin``), you can "
"define the following environment variable to give a hint to the build system:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ ``PATH`` (ເຊັ່ນ ``/usr/bin``), ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄ"
"ປນີ້ເພື່ອບອກທາງໃຫ້ລະບົບການສ້າງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:514
msgid ""
"Where ``/path/to/mingw`` is the path containing the ``bin`` directory where "
"``i686-w64-mingw32-gcc`` and ``x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc`` are located (e.g. ``/"
