msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນທີ່ ``/path/to/mingw`` ຄືເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``bin`` ທີ່ ``i686-w64-mingw32-gcc`` ແ"
"ລະ ``x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc`` ຕັ້ງຢູ່ (ເຊັ່ນ ``/opt/mingw-w64`` ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຢູ່ໃນ ``/"
"opt/mingw-w64/bin``)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:518
msgid ""
"To make sure you are doing things correctly, executing the following in the "
"shell should result in a working compiler (the version output may differ "
"based on your system):"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເຮັດທຸກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການຮັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ shell ຄວນຈະສະແດງຜົນວ່າຄອມໄພເລີເຮັດວຽ"
"ກໄດ້ (ເວີຊັນທີ່ສະແດງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:527
msgid ""
"If you are building with MinGW-LLVM, add ``use_llvm=yes`` to the ``scons`` "
"command."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງດ້ວຍ MinGW-LLVM, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ``use_llvm=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:528
msgid ""
"When cross-compiling for Windows using MinGW-w64, keep in mind only "
"``x86_64`` and ``x86_32`` architectures are supported. MinGW-LLVM supports "
"``arm64`` as well. Be sure to specify the right ``arch=`` option when "
"invoking SCons if building from a different architecture."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄອມໄພລຂ້າມແພລັດຟອມສຳລັບ Windows ໂດຍໃຊ້ MinGW-w64, ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຮອງຮັບສະເພາະສະຖາປັດຕະຍ"
"ະກຳ ``x86_64`` ແລະ ``x86_32`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສ່ວນ MinGW-LLVM ຈະຮອງຮັບ ``arm64`` ນຳ. ໃຫ້ແ"
"ນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກ ``arch=`` ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ SCons ຖ້າສ້າງຈາກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັ"
"ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.rst:536
msgid ""
"Cross-compiling from some Ubuntu versions may lead to `this bug <https://"
