"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄອມໄພລ Godot 3.x, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ `ເອກະສານ branch 3.x <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/development/compiling/compiling_for_x11.html>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:268
msgid ""
"If all goes well, the resulting binary executable will be placed in the "
"\"bin\" subdirectory. This executable file contains the whole engine and "
"runs without any dependencies. Executing it will bring up the Project "
"Manager."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງເປັນໄປດ້ວຍດີ, ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ (binary executable) ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ "
"\"bin\". ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຈັກທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີ dependencies ໃດໆ. ກ"
"ານຮັນມັນຈະເປັນການເປີດຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:275
msgid "If you wish to compile using Clang rather than GCC, use this command:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄອມໄພລໂດຍໃຊ້ Clang ແທນ GCC, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:281
msgid ""
"Using Clang appears to be a requirement for OpenBSD, otherwise fonts would "
"not build. For RISC-V architecture devices, use the Clang compiler instead "
"of the GCC compiler."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ Clang ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ OpenBSD, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຟອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງ. ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະຖາ"
"ປັດຕະຍະກຳ RISC-V, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄອມໄພເລີ Clang ແທນ GCC."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:287
msgid ""
"Compiling on some platforms such as OpenBSD may require more memory than "
"available by default. To increase the memory limit on OpenBSD within the "
"maximum for the current user, run ``ulimit -d {new amount in kB}``."
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມໄພລໃນບາງແພລັດຟອມເຊັ່ນ OpenBSD ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອ"
"ເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ OpenBSD ໃຫ້ສູງສຸດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ຮັນ ``ulimit -d {new "
"amount in kB}``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:297
msgid ""
"LTO takes some time to run and requires about 7 GB of available RAM while "
"compiling. If you're running out of memory with the above option, use "
"``production=yes lto=none`` or ``production=yes lto=thin`` for a lightweight "
"but less effective form of LTO."
msgstr ""
"LTO ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການເຮັດວຽກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການ RAM ຫວ່າງປະມານ 7 GB ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຄອມໄພລ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານພົບວ່າໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໝົດດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``production=yes lto=none`` ຫຼື "
"``production=yes lto=thin`` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ LTO ທີ່ເບົາບາງກວ່າແຕ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:312
msgid ""
"By default, Godot is built with AccessKit dynamically linked. You can use it "
"by placing ``accesskit.so`` alongside the executable."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Godot ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍມີ AccessKit ທີ່ລິ້ງແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamically linked). "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການວາງ ``accesskit.so`` ໄວ້ຂ້າງໆ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:315
msgid ""
"You can use dynamically linked AccessKit with export templates as well, "
"rename the SO to ``accesskit.{architecture}.so`` and place them alongside "
"the export template executables, and the libraries will be automatically "
"copied during the export process."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ AccessKit ແບບລິ້ງໄດນາມິກກັບແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ SO ເປັ"
"ນ ``accesskit.{architecture}.so`` ແລະ ວາງພວກມັນໄວ້ຂ້າງໆ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮັນໄດ້ຂອງແທມເພດການສົ່ງອອ"
"ກ, ແລ້ວໄລບຣາຣີຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ."

