msgstr "(64 ບິດ)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:403
msgid ""
"Note that cross-compiling for the opposite bits (64/32) as your host "
"platform is not always straight-forward and might need a chroot environment."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ການຄອມພາຍຂ້າມເວທີ (cross-compiling) ສໍາລັບບິດທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມ (64/32) ກັບແພລັດຟອມຂອ"
"ງເຈົ້າ ນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງງ່າຍສະເໝີໄປ ແລະ ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ chroot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:406
msgid ""
"To create standard export templates, the resulting files in the ``bin/`` "
"folder must be copied to:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງແບບຈໍາລອງການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) ມາດຕະຖານ, ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃນໂຟນເດີ ``bin/`` "
"ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກກັອບປີ້ໄປທີ່:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:413
msgid ""
"and named like this (even for \\*BSD which is seen as \"Linux/X11\" by "
"Godot):"
msgstr ""
"ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ແບບນີ້ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນ \\*BSD ເຊິ່ງ Godot ເຫັນວ່າເປັນ \"Linux/X11\" ກໍຕາມ):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:426
msgid ""
"However, if you are writing your custom modules or custom C++ code, you "
"might instead want to configure your binaries as custom export templates in "
"the project export menu. You must have **Advanced Options** enabled to set "
"this."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າກໍາລັງຂຽນໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ລະຫັດ C++ ຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່"
"າໄຟລ໌ binaries ຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫ້ເປັນແບບຈໍາລອງການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃນເມນູການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເ"
"ປີດໃຊ້ **Advanced Options** ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:433
msgid ""
"You don't even need to copy them, you can just reference the resulting files "
"in the ``bin/`` directory of your Godot source folder, so the next time you "
"build, you automatically have the custom templates referenced."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ພວກມັນເລີຍ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດອ້າງອີງໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``bin/`` ຂອງໂຟນເດີຊ"
"ອດໂຄ້ດ Godot ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເພື່ອວ່າໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ເຈົ້າບິວ (build), ເຈົ້າຈະມີການອ້າງອີງແບບຈໍາລອງທີ່ກຳນົດເອ"
"ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:438
msgid "Cross-compiling for RISC-V devices"
msgstr "ການຄອມພາຍຂ້າມເວທີສໍາລັບອຸປະກອນ RISC-V"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:440
msgid ""
"To cross-compile Godot for RISC-V devices, we need to setup the following "
"items:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍຂ້າມເວທີ Godot ສໍາລັບອຸປະກອນ RISC-V, ພວກເຮົາຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງລາຍການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:442
msgid ""
"`riscv-gnu-toolchain <https://github.com/riscv-collab/riscv-gnu-toolchain/"
"releases>`__. While we are not going to use this directly, it provides us "
"with a sysroot, as well as header and libraries files that we will need. "
"There are many versions to choose from, however, the older the toolchain, "
"the more compatible our final binaries will be. If in doubt, `use this "
"version <https://github.com/riscv-collab/riscv-gnu-toolchain/releases/tag/"
"2023.07.07>`__, and download ``riscv64-glibc-ubuntu-20.04-gcc-"
"nightly-2023.07.07-nightly.tar.gz``. Extract it somewhere and remember its "
"path."
msgstr ""
"`riscv-gnu-toolchain <https://github.com/riscv-collab/riscv-gnu-toolchain/"
"releases>`__. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ມັນໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີ sysroot ໃຫ້ເຮົາ, ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ "
"header ແລະ libraries ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະຕ້ອງການ. ມີຫຼາຍເວີຊັນໃຫ້ເລືອກ, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍິ່ງ "
"toolchain ເກົ່າເທົ່າໃດ, ໄຟລ໌ binaries ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງພວກເຮົາກໍຈະຍິ່ງຮອງຮັບໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃ"
"ຈ, `ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນນີ້ <https://github.com/riscv-collab/riscv-gnu-toolchain/releases/"
"tag/2023.07.07>`__, ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດ ``riscv64-glibc-ubuntu-20.04-gcc-nightly-"
"2023.07.07-nightly.tar.gz``. ແຕກໄຟລ໌ມັນໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຈື່ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ຂອງມັນໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:449
msgid ""
"`mold <https://github.com/rui314/mold/releases>`__. This fast linker, is the "
"only one that correctly links the resulting binary. Download it, extract it, "
"and make sure to add its ``bin`` folder to your PATH. Run ``mold --help | "
"grep support`` to check if your version of Mold supports RISC-V. If you "
"don't see RISC-V, your Mold may need to be updated."
msgstr ""
"`mold <https://github.com/rui314/mold/releases>`__. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (linker) ທີ່ໄວ"
"ນີ້, ເປັນອັນດຽວທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ binary ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ດາວໂຫຼດມັນ, ແຕກໄຟລ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເພີ່"
"ມໂຟນເດີ ``bin`` ຂອງມັນເຂົ້າໃນ PATH ຂອງທ່ານ. ຣັນ (Run) ``mold --help | grep "
"support`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າເວີຊັນ Mold ຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ RISC-V ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນ RISC-V, ອາດຈະຕ້ອ"
"ງໄດ້ອັບເດດ Mold ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:455
msgid ""
"To make referencing our toolchain easier, we can set an environment variable "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການອ້າງອີງ toolchain ຂອງພວກເຮົາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"(environment variable) ແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:462
msgid ""
"This way, we won't have to manually set the directory location each time we "
"want to reference it."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການອ້າງອີງໃສ່ມັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:465
msgid "With all the above setup, we are now ready to build Godot."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງທັງໝົດຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນ, ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາພ້ອມແລ້ວທີ່ຈະບິວ (build) Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:467
msgid ""
"Go to the root of the source code, and execute the following build command:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ຮາກ (root) ຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ, ແລະ ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງບິວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:478
msgid ""
"RISC-V GCC has `bugs with its atomic operations <https://github.com/riscv-"
"collab/riscv-gcc/issues/15>`__ which prevent it from compiling Godot "
"correctly. That's why Clang is used instead. Make sure that it *can* compile "
"to RISC-V. You can verify by executing this command ``clang -print-"
"targets``, make sure you see ``riscv64`` on the list of targets."
msgstr ""
"RISC-V GCC ມີ `ບັກກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບ atomic ຂອງມັນ <https://github.com/riscv-"
"collab/riscv-gcc/issues/15>`__ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຄອມພາຍ Godot ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ນັ້ນແມ່ນ"
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ Clang ຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ແທນ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນ *ສາມາດ* ຄອມພາຍເປັນ RISC-V ໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດ"
"ສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການຣັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ ``clang -print-targets``, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເຫັນ ``riscv64`` ໃນລາຍ"
"ຊື່ຂອງ targets."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:483
msgid ""
"The code above includes adding ``$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/bin`` to the PATH, "
"but only for the following ``scons`` command. Since riscv-gnu-toolchain uses "
"its own Clang located in the ``bin`` folder, adding ``$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/"
"bin`` to your user's PATH environment variable may block you from accessing "
"another version of Clang if one is installed. For this reason it's not "
"recommended to make adding the bin folder permanent. You can also omit the "
"``PATH=\"$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/bin:$PATH\"`` line if you want to use scons "
"with self-installed version of Clang, but it may have compatibility issues "
"with riscv-gnu-toolchain."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຂ້າງເທິງລວມມີການເພີ່ມ ``$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/bin`` ເຂົ້າໃນ PATH, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ສໍາລັບຄໍາສັ່ງ "
"``scons`` ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ riscv-gnu-toolchain ໃຊ້ Clang ຂອງມັນເອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ "
"``bin``, ການເພີ່ມ ``$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/bin`` ເຂົ້າໃນຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ PATH ຂອງຜູ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Clang ເວີຊັນອື່ນໄດ້ຫາກມີການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນໍາໃ"
"ຫ້ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ bin ແບບຖາວອນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເວັ້ນແຖວ ``PATH=\"$RISCV_TOOLCHAIN_PATH/"
"bin:$PATH\"`` ໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ scons ກັບ Clang ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະມີບັນ"
"ຫາຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ riscv-gnu-toolchain."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:492
msgid ""
"The command is similar in nature, but with some key changes. ``ccflags`` and "
"``linkflags`` append additional flags to the build. ``--sysroot`` points to "
"a folder simulating a Linux system, it contains all the headers, libraries, "
"and ``.so`` files Clang will use. ``--gcc-toolchain`` tells Clang where the "
"complete toolchain is, and ``-target riscv64-unknown-linux-gnu`` indicates "
"to Clang the target architecture, and OS we want to build for."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງ. ``ccflags`` ແລະ ``linkflags`` ຈະ"
"ເພີ່ມ flag ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນການບິວ. ``--sysroot`` ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈຳລອງລະບົບ Linux, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບ"
"ມີ headers, libraries, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ ``.so`` ທັງໝົດທີ່ Clang ຈະໃຊ້. ``--gcc-toolchain`` ບ"
"ອກ Clang ວ່າ toolchain ທີ່ສົມບູນຢູ່ໃສ, ແລະ ``-target riscv64-unknown-linux-gnu`` ບອ"
"ກ Clang ເຖິງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ OS ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການບິວໃຫ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:499
msgid ""
"If all went well, you should now see a ``bin`` directory, and within it, a "
"binary similar to the following:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຜ່ານໄປດ້ວຍດີ, ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``bin``, ແລະ ພາຍໃນນັ້ນຈະມີໄຟລ໌ binary ທີ່ຄ້"
"າຍຄືກັບລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:506
msgid ""
"You can now copy this executable to your favorite RISC-V device, then launch "
"it there by double-clicking, which should bring up the project manager."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ executable ນີ້ໄປໃສ່ອຸປະກອນ RISC-V ຂອງທ່ານ, ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດມັນດ້ວຍການດັບເ"
"ບິລຄລິກ (double-clicking), ເຊິ່ງມັນຄວນຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ project manager ຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:510
msgid ""
"If you later decide to compile the export templates, copy the above build "
"command but change the value of ``target`` to ``template_debug`` for a debug "
"build, or ``template_release`` for a release build."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄອມພາຍ export templates ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ຄຳສັ່ງບິວຂ້າງເທິງ ແຕ່ປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງ "
"``target`` ເປັນ ``template_debug`` ສຳລັບການບິວແບບ debug, ຫຼື ``template_release`` "
"ສຳລັບການບິວແບບ release."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:515
msgid "Using Clang and LLD for faster development"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Clang ແລະ LLD ເພື່ອການພັດທະນາທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:517
msgid ""
"You can also use Clang and LLD to build Godot. This has two upsides compared "
"to the default GCC + GNU ld setup:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ Clang ແລະ LLD ເພື່ອບິວ Godot ໄດ້. ເຊິ່ງມີຂໍ້ດີ 2 ຢ່າງ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ GCC "
"+ GNU ld ແບບມາດຕະຖານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:520
msgid ""
"LLD links Godot significantly faster compared to GNU ld or gold. This leads "
"to faster iteration times."
msgstr ""
"LLD ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Godot ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ GNU ld ຫຼື gold. ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການເຮັດ"
"ວຽກໜ້ອຍລົງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:522
msgid "Clang tends to give more useful error messages compared to GCC."
msgstr "Clang ມັກຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ (error messages) ທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍກວ່າ GCC."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:524
msgid ""
"To do so, install Clang and the ``lld`` package from your distribution's "
"package manager then use the following SCons command:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Clang ແລະ ແພັກເກດ ``lld`` ຈາກຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຂອງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ຈາກນັ້"
"ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ SCons ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:531
msgid ""
"After the build is completed, a new binary with a ``.llvm`` suffix will be "
"created in the ``bin/`` folder."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກການບິວສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໄຟລ໌ binary ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ ``.llvm`` ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂຟນເດີ ``bin/"
"``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:534
msgid ""
"It's still recommended to use GCC for production builds as it's the compiler "
"used for official builds and is more rigorously tested."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງຄົງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ GCC ສຳລັບການບິວເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production) ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເປັນ compiler ທີ່ໃຊ້ສ"
"ຳລັບການບິວຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ແລະ ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:537
msgid "If this error occurs:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:543
msgid "There are two solutions:"
msgstr "ມີ 2 ວິທີແກ້ໄຂ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:545
msgid "In your SCons command, add the parameter ``use_static_cpp=no``."
msgstr "ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ ``use_static_cpp=no``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:546
msgid ""
"Follow `these instructions <https://github.com/ivmai/"
"libatomic_ops#installation-and-usage>`__ to configure, build, and install "
"``libatomic_ops``. Then, copy ``/usr/lib/libatomic_ops.a`` to ``/usr/lib/"
"libatomic.a``, or create a soft link to ``libatomic_ops`` by command ``ln "
"-s /usr/lib/libatomic_ops.a /usr/lib/libatomic.a``. The soft link can ensure "
"the latest ``libatomic_ops`` will be used without the need to copy it every "
"time when it is updated."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຕາມ `ຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ <https://github.com/ivmai/libatomic_ops#installation-and-"
"usage>`__ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ, ບິວ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ ``libatomic_ops``. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ກັອບປີ້ ``/usr/lib/"
"libatomic_ops.a`` ໄປທີ່ ``/usr/lib/libatomic.a``, ຫຼື ສ້າງ soft link ໄປຫາ "
"``libatomic_ops`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``ln -s /usr/lib/libatomic_ops.a /usr/lib/"
"libatomic.a``. ການໃຊ້ soft link ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ ``libatomic_ops`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດສະ"
"ເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອັບເດດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:552
msgid "Using mold for faster development"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ mold ເພື່ອການພັດທະນາທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:554
msgid ""
"For even faster linking compared to LLD, you can use `mold <https://"
"github.com/rui314/mold>`__. mold can be used with either GCC or Clang."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (linking) ທີ່ໄວກວ່າ LLD, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ `mold <https://github.com/"
"rui314/mold>`__. mold ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງກັບ GCC ຫຼື Clang."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:577
msgid ""
"Once mold is installed, use the following SCons command when compiling Godot:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ mold ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ SCons ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນເວລາກຳລັງຄອມພາຍ Godot:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:584
msgid "Using system libraries for faster development"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ system libraries ເພື່ອການພັດທະນາທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:586
msgid ""
"`Godot bundles the source code of various third-party libraries. <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/thirdparty>`__ You can choose to "
"use system versions of third-party libraries instead. This makes the Godot "
"binary faster to link, as third-party libraries are dynamically linked. "
"Therefore, they don't need to be statically linked every time you build the "
"engine (even on small incremental changes)."
msgstr ""
"`Godot ໄດ້ລວມເອົາຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ libraries ຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ (third-party) ຫຼາຍຢ່າງໄວ້ນຳກັນ. "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/thirdparty>`__ ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກ"
"ໃຊ້ libraries ເວີຊັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ (system versions) ແທນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot binary ເ"
"ຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ libraries ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamically linked). ດັ່ງນັ້"
"ນ, ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະແຕຕິກ (statically linked) ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານບິວ engine (ເຖິ"
"ງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນການປ່ຽນແປງພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍກໍຕາມ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:592
msgid ""
"However, not all Linux distributions have packages for third-party libraries "
"available (or they may not be up-to-date)."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆ Linux distribution ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດ libraries ພາກສ່ວນທີສາມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ "
"(ຫຼື ພວກມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:595
msgid ""
"Moving to system libraries can reduce linking times by several seconds on "
"slow CPUs, but it requires manual testing depending on your Linux "
"distribution. Also, you may not be able to use system libraries for "
"everything due to bugs in the system library packages (or in the build "
"system, as this feature is less tested)."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ system libraries ສາມາດຫຼຸດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລົງໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິນາທີໃນ CPU ທີ່ຊ້າ, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງ"
"ມີການທົດສອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ Linux distribution ຂອງທ່ານ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"system libraries ໄດ້ກັບທຸກໆຢ່າງ ເນື່ອງຈາກບັກໃນແພັກເກດ system library (ຫຼື ໃນລະບົບບິວ, ເນື່ອ"
"ງຈາກຟີເຈີນີ້ຍັງຜ່ານການທົດສອບໜ້ອຍຢູ່)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:601
msgid ""
"To compile Godot with system libraries, install these dependencies **on "
"top** of the ones listed in the :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd_oneliners`:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍ Godot ດ້ວຍ system libraries, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ **ເພີ່ມເຕີມ** ຈາກ"
"ລາຍການທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd_oneliners`:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:651
msgid ""
"After installing all required packages, use the following command to build "
"Godot:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອບິວ Godot:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:660
msgid ""
"On Debian stable, you will need to remove `builtin_embree=no` as the system-"
"provided Embree version is too old to work with Godot's latest `master` "
"branch (which requires Embree 4)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Debian stable, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເອົາ `builtin_embree=no` ອອກ ເນື່ອງຈາກ Embree ເວີຊັນທີ່ລະບົ"
"ບໃຫ້ມານັ້ນເກົ່າເກີນໄປ ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ Godot ບຣານຊ໌ (branch) `master` ຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ (ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນ Embree 4)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:664
msgid ""
"You can view a list of all built-in libraries that have system alternatives "
"by running ``scons -h``, then looking for options starting with ``builtin_``."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ built-in libraries ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກເປັນ system alternatives ໄດ້ໂ"
"ດຍການຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ ``scons -h``, ແລ້ວຊອກຫາຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ``builtin_``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.rst:669
msgid ""
"When using system libraries, the resulting binary is **not** portable across "
"Linux distributions anymore. Do not use this approach for creating binaries "
"you intend to distribute to others, unless you're creating a package for a "
"Linux distribution."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ system libraries, ໄຟລ໌ binary ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະ **ບໍ່** ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ຂ້າມ Linux "
"distributions ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ຢ່າໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ໃນການສ້າງ binaries ທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໃຈຈະແຈກຢາຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ອື່ນ, ເວັ້ນເສຍ"
"ແຕ່ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງແພັກເກດສຳລັບ Linux distribution ໂດຍສະເພາະ."

