#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:126
msgid ""
"ANGLE provides a translation layer from OpenGL ES 3.x to Metal and can be "
"used to improve support for the Compatibility renderer on some older GPUs "
"with outdated OpenGL drivers."
msgstr ""
"ANGLE ເປັນຕົວແປພາສາ (translation layer) ຈາກ OpenGL ES 3.x ໄປຫາ Metal ແລະ ສາມາດໃ"
"ຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Compatibility renderer ໃນ GPU ລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງລຸ້ນທີ່ມີ OpenGL "
"drivers ທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:150
msgid ""
"You can also specify the build architecture using ``arch={architecture}``."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໃນການບິວໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ``arch={architecture}``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:152
msgid ""
"The ANGLE static library should be built using the same compiler you are "
"using for building Godot."
msgstr ""
"ANGLE static library ຄວນຖືກບິວໂດຍໃຊ້ compiler ຕົວດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ບິວ Godot."

