msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍແບບ release *server* ເຊິ່ງຖືກປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຣັນ dedicated game servers, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:239
msgid ""
"To build macOS export templates, you have to compile using the targets "
"without the editor: ``target=template_release`` (release template) and "
"``target=template_debug``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອບິວ macOS export templates, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄອມພາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ targets ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ editor: "
"``target=template_release`` (ແບບຈໍາລອງລຸ້ນ release) ແລະ "
"``target=template_debug``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:243
msgid ""
"Official templates are *Universal 2* binaries which support both ARM64 and "
"Intel x86_64 architectures."
msgstr ""
"ແບບຈໍາລອງ (templates) ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການແມ່ນ binaries ແບບ *Universal 2* ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບທັງສະຖ"
"າປັດຕະຍະກຳ ARM64 ແລະ Intel x86_64."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:246
msgid "To support ARM64 (Apple Silicon) + Intel x86_64:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ ARM64 (Apple Silicon) + Intel x86_64:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:255
msgid ""
"To support ARM64 (Apple Silicon) only (smaller file size, but less "
"compatible with older hardware):"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ ARM64 (Apple Silicon) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ຈະນ້ອຍກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຈະຮອງຮັບກັບຮາດແ"
"ວລຸ້ນເກົ່າໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງ):"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:262
msgid ""
"To create a ``.app`` bundle like in the official builds, you need to use the "
"template located in ``misc/dist/macos_template.app``. This process can be "
"automated by using the ``generate_bundle=yes`` option on the *last* SCons "
"command used to build export templates (so that all binaries can be "
"included). This will create a ``godot_macos.zip`` file in ``bin/`` and "
"additionally takes care of calling ``lipo`` to create a *Universal 2* binary "
"from two separate ARM64 and x86_64 binaries (if both were compiled "
"beforehand)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ ``.app`` bundle ຄືກັບການບິວຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ template ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ ``misc/"
"dist/macos_template.app``. ຂະບວນການນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"``generate_bundle=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons *ສຸດທ້າຍ* ທີ່ໃຊ້ບິວ export templates (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມ"
"າດລວມເອົາ binaries ທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄດ້). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ``godot_macos.zip`` ໃນ ``bin/`` ແລ"
"ະ ຍັງຈັດການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``lipo`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ binary ແບບ *Universal 2* ຈາກສອງ binary ແຍກກັນ "
"(ARM64 ແລະ x86_64) (ຖ້າຫາກໄດ້ຄອມພາຍທັງສອງມາກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:271
msgid ""
"You also need to include support for the MoltenVK Vulkan portability "
"library. By default, it will be linked statically from your installation of "
"the Vulkan SDK for macOS. You can also choose to link it dynamically by "
"passing ``use_volk=yes`` and including the dynamic library in your ``.app`` "
"bundle:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວມເອົາການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ MoltenVK Vulkan portability library ນຳ. ໂດຍຄ່າ"
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະແຕຕິກຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ Vulkan SDK ສຳລັບ macOS ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາ"
"ດເລືອກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບໄດນາມິກໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງຄ່າ ``use_volk=yes`` ແລະ ລວມເອົາ dynamic library ເ"
"ຂົ້າໄປໃນ ``.app`` bundle ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:282
msgid ""
"In most cases, static linking should be preferred as it makes distribution "
"easier. The main upside of dynamic linking is that it allows updating "
"MoltenVK without having to recompile export templates."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະແຕຕິກ (static linking) ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ການແຈກຢາຍ"
"ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ຂໍ້ດີຫຼັກຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບໄດນາມິກແມ່ນມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອັບເດດ MoltenVK ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຄອມພາຍ "
"export templates ໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:286
msgid ""
"If you created the ``.app`` manually, you can zip the ``macos_template.app`` "
"folder to reproduce the ``macos.zip`` template from the official Godot "
"distribution:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງ ``.app`` ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດ zip ໂຟນເດີ ``macos_template.app`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ "
"template ``macos.zip`` ຄືກັບທີ່ມີການແຈກຢາຍ Godot ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:293
msgid ""
"To use your custom export templates, you can select the ``godot_macos.zip`` "
"file in the advanced options of your export presets:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ export templates ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ``godot_macos.zip`` ໃນຕົວເ"
"ລືອກຂັ້ນສູງ (advanced options) ຂອງ export presets ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:298
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you want all your presets to use your custom export "
"template, you can rename the ``godot_macos.zip`` file to ``macos.zip`` and "
"move it to the default location for export templates:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກ presets ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ custom export template ຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ``godot_macos.zip`` ເປັນ ``macos.zip`` ແລ້ວຍ້າຍມັນໄປໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນເກັ"
"ບ export templates ມາດຕະຖານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:302
msgid "::"
msgstr "::"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:303
msgid ""
"~/Library/Application Support/Godot/export_templates/<GODOT_VERSION>/"
"macos.zip"
msgstr ""
"~/Library/Application Support/Godot/export_templates/<GODOT_VERSION>/"
"macos.zip"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:306
msgid "Cross-compiling for macOS from Linux"
