msgstr ""
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຄອມພາຍສຳລັບ macOS ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Linux (ແລະ ອາດຈະລວມເຖິງໃນ Windows ໂດຍ"
"ໃຊ້ Windows Subsystem for Linux). ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ `OSXCross <https://"
"github.com/tpoechtrager/osxcross>`__ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ macOS ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍ (target) ໄ"
"ດ້. ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:313
msgid ""
"Clone the `OSXCross repository <https://github.com/tpoechtrager/osxcross>`__ "
"somewhere on your machine (or download a ZIP file and extract it somewhere), "
"e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"Clone `OSXCross repository <https://github.com/tpoechtrager/osxcross>`__ ໄວ້ບ່ອ"
