#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:320
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to package the SDK: https://github.com/tpoechtrager/"
"osxcross#packaging-the-sdk"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອແພັກ (package) SDK: https://github.com/tpoechtrager/"
"osxcross#packaging-the-sdk"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:322
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to install OSXCross: https://github.com/tpoechtrager/"
"osxcross#installation"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ OSXCross: https://github.com/tpoechtrager/"
"osxcross#installation"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:325
msgid ""
"After that, you will need to define the ``OSXCROSS_ROOT`` as the path to the "
"OSXCross installation (the same place where you cloned the repository/"
"extracted the zip), e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດ ``OSXCROSS_ROOT`` ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາບ່ອນຕິດຕັ້ງ "
"OSXCross (ບ່ອນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ clone repository ຫຼື ແຕກໄຟລ໌ zip), ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.rst:333
