#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:14
msgid "Note"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:16
msgid ""
"In most cases, using the built-in deployer and export templates is good "
"enough. Compiling the Android APK manually is mostly useful for custom "
"builds or custom packages for the deployer."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການໃຊ້ຕົວ deployer ທີ່ມີມານຳ ແລະ export templates ກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ການຄອມພາ"
"ຍ Android APK ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບການບິວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ແພັກເກດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຕົ"
"ວ deployer."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:20
msgid ""
"Also, you still need to follow the steps mentioned in "
"the :ref:`doc_exporting_for_android` tutorial before attempting to build a "
"custom export template."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນບົດຮຽນ "
":ref:`doc_exporting_for_android` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມບິວ custom export template."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:27
msgid "For compiling under Windows, Linux or macOS, the following is required:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຄອມພາຍພາຍໃຕ້ Windows, Linux ຫຼື macOS, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:31
msgid "Android SDK"
msgstr "Android SDK"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:33
msgid ""
"To install the Android SDK, follow the steps `here <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/export/"
"exporting_for_android.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Android SDK, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ `ຢູ່ນີ້ <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"stable/tutorials/export/exporting_for_android.html>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:34
msgid ""
"On Linux, **do not use an Android SDK provided by your distribution's "
"repositories** as it will often be outdated."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Linux, **ຢ່າໃຊ້ Android SDK ທີ່ມາຈາກ repository ຂອງ distribution ຂອງທ່ານ** ເພາະ"
"ມັນມັກຈະລ້າສະໄໝ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:35
msgid ""
"On macOS, **do not use an Android SDK provided by Homebrew** as it will not "
"be installed in a unified location."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ macOS, **ຢ່າໃຊ້ Android SDK ທີ່ມາຈາກ Homebrew** ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ເປັນມາດຕ"
"ະຖານດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:37
msgid "Gradle (will be downloaded and installed automatically if missing)."
msgstr "Gradle (ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:38
msgid "JDK 17 (either OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)."
msgstr "JDK 17 (ອາດຈະເປັນ OpenJDK ຫຼື Oracle JDK ກໍໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can download a build from `Adoptium <https://adoptium.net/temurin/"
"releases?variant=openjdk17&version=17&os=any&arch=any>`_."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ `Adoptium <https://adoptium.net/temurin/"
"releases?variant=openjdk17&version=17&os=any&arch=any>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:51
msgid "Setting up the buildsystem"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ buildsystem"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:53
msgid ""
"Set the environment variable ``ANDROID_HOME`` to point to the Android SDK. "
"If you downloaded the Android command-line tools, this would be the folder "
"where you extracted the contents of the ZIP archive."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``ANDROID_HOME`` ໃຫ້ຊີ້ໄປຫາ Android SDK. ຖ້າທ່ານດາວໂຫຼດ "
"Android command-line tools ມາ, ມັນຈະແມ່ນໂຟນເດີທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ແຕກໄຟລ໌ ZIP ອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:57
msgid ""
"Windows: Press :kbd:`Windows + R`, type \"control system\", then click on "
"**Advanced system settings** in the left pane, then click on **Environment "
"variables** on the window that appears."
msgstr ""
"Windows: ກົດ :kbd:`Windows + R`, ພິມ \"control system\", ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ **Advanced "
"system settings** ໃນແຖບດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ **Environment variables** ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ສະແດ"
"ງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:61
msgid ""
"Linux or macOS: Add the text ``export ANDROID_HOME=\"/path/to/android-"
"sdk\"`` to your ``.bashrc`` or ``.zshrc`` where ``/path/to/android-sdk`` "
"points to the root of the SDK directories."
msgstr ""
"Linux ຫຼື macOS: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``export ANDROID_HOME=\"/path/to/android-sdk\"`` ເຂົ້າໃ"
"ນໄຟລ໌ ``.bashrc`` ຫຼື ``.zshrc`` ໂດຍໃຫ້ ``/path/to/android-sdk`` ຊີ້ໄປຫາ root ຂອງ "
"SDK directories."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:65
msgid ""
"After setting up the SDK and environment variables, be sure to **restart "
"your terminal** to apply the changes. If you are using an IDE with an "
"integrated terminal, you need to restart the IDE."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDK ແລະ ຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ **restart terminal ຂອງທ່ານ** "
"ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ IDE ທີ່ມີ terminal ໃນຕົວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ restart IDE ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:69
msgid ""
"Run ``scons platform=android``. If this fails, go back and check the steps. "
"If you completed the setup correctly, the NDK will begin downloading. If you "
"are trying to compile GDExtension, you need to first compile the engine to "
"download the NDK, then you can compile GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"ຣັນ ``scons platform=android``. ຖ້າຫາກລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ກັບໄປກວດເບິ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸກ"
"ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ, NDK ຈະເລີ່ມດາວໂຫຼດ. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມຄອມພາຍ GDExtension, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄອມພາ"
"ຍ engine ກ່ອນເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດ NDK, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດຄອມພາຍ GDExtension ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:75
msgid "Building the export templates"
msgstr "ການບິວ export templates"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:77
msgid ""
"Godot needs three export templates for Android: the optimized \"release\" "
"template (``android_release.apk``), the debug template "
"(``android_debug.apk``), and the Gradle build template "
"(``android_source.zip``). As Google requires all APKs to include ARMv8 (64-"
"bit) libraries since August 2019, the commands below build templates "
"containing both ARMv7 and ARMv8 libraries."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຕ້ອງການ export templates 3 ຢ່າງສຳລັບ Android: ແບບຈໍາລອງ \"release\" ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່"
"ງແລ້ວ (``android_release.apk``), ແບບຈໍາລອງ debug (``android_debug.apk``), ແລະ ແ"
"ບບຈໍາລອງ Gradle build (``android_source.zip``). ເນື່ອງຈາກ Google ກຳນົດໃຫ້ທຸກໆ APK ຕ້"
"ອງລວມເອົາ libraries ARMv8 (64-bit) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເດືອນສິງຫາ 2019, ຄຳສັ່ງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະບິວ templates ທີ່ປ"
"ະກອບມີທັງ libraries ARMv7 ແລະ ARMv8."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:83
msgid ""
"Compiling the standard export templates is done by calling SCons from the "
"Godot root directory with the following arguments:"
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມພາຍ export templates ມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ SCons ຈາກ Godot root "
"directory ດ້ວຍອາຣກິວເມັນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:86
msgid ""
"Release template (used when exporting with **Debugging Enabled** unchecked)"
msgstr "Release template (ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂດຍປິດ **Debugging Enabled**)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:93
msgid "Debug template (used when exporting with **Debugging Enabled** checked)"
msgstr "Debug template (ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂດຍເປີດ **Debugging Enabled**)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:100
msgid "The resulting templates will be located under the ``bin`` directory:"
msgstr "Templates ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``bin``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:102
msgid "``bin/android_release.apk`` for the release template"
msgstr "``bin/android_release.apk`` ສຳລັບ release template"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:103
msgid "``bin/android_debug.apk`` for the debug template"
msgstr "``bin/android_debug.apk`` ສຳລັບ debug template"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:104
msgid "``bin/android_source.zip`` for the Gradle build template"
msgstr "``bin/android_source.zip`` ສຳລັບ Gradle build template"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:108
msgid ""
"If you are changing the list of architectures you're building, remember to "
"add ``generate_android_binaries=yes`` to the *last* architecture you're "
"building, so that the template files are generated after the build."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງປ່ຽນລາຍການສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ທ່ານບິວ, ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມ "
"``generate_android_binaries=yes`` ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ *ສຸດທ້າຍ* ທີ່ທ່ານບິວ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ "
"template ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກການບິວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:110
msgid ""
"To enable dev build (for use when troubleshooting) in the generated "
"templates, add the ``dev_build=yes`` parameters to the SCons command."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ dev build (ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ) ໃນ templates ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``dev_build=yes`` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:112
msgid ""
"To include debug symbols in the generated templates, add the "
"``debug_symbols=yes`` parameters to the SCons command."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລວມເອົາ debug symbols ເຂົ້າໃນ templates ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``debug_symbols=yes`` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:114
msgid ""
"Note that you can include ``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` to generate the "
"debug symbols in a separate ``*-native-debug-symbols.zip`` file."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ ``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ debug symbols ແຍກໄວ້"
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``*-native-debug-symbols.zip`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:118
msgid ""
"If you want to enable Vulkan validation layers, see :ref:`Vulkan validation "
"layers on Android <doc_vulkan_validation_layers_android>`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ Vulkan validation layers, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Vulkan validation "
"layers on Android <doc_vulkan_validation_layers_android>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:122
msgid "Adding support for x86 devices"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ x86"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:124
msgid ""
"If you also want to include support for x86 and x86_64 devices, run the "
"SCons command a third and fourth time with the ``arch=x86_32``, and "
"``arch=x86_64`` arguments before building the APK with Gradle. For example, "
"for the release template:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລວມເອົາການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ x86 ແລະ x86_64 ນຳ, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons ເປັນຄັ້ງທີ "
"3 ແລະ 4 ດ້ວຍອາຣກິວເມັນ ``arch=x86_32`` ແລະ ``arch=x86_64`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະບິວ APK ດ້ວຍ "
"Gradle. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບ release template:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:136
msgid ""
"This will create template binaries that works on all platforms. The final "
"binary size of exported projects will depend on the platforms you choose to "
"support when exporting; in other words, unused platforms will be removed "
"from the binary."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ template binaries ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນທຸກແພລັດຟອມ. ຂະໜາດ binary ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່"
"ສົ່ງອອກ ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຮອງຮັບໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກ; ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກເ"
"ອົາອອກຈາກ binary."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:142
msgid "Cleaning the generated export templates"
msgstr "ການລ້າງ export templates ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:144
msgid ""
"You can use the following commands to remove the generated export templates:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອລຶບ export templates ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:156
msgid "Using the export templates"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ export templates"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:158
msgid ""
"Godot needs release and debug binaries that were compiled against the same "
"version/commit as the editor. If you are using official binaries for the "
"editor, make sure to install the matching export templates, or build your "
"own from the same version."
msgstr ""
"Godot ຕ້ອງການ release ແລະ debug binaries ທີ່ຖືກຄອມພາຍມາຈາກເວີຊັນ ຫຼື commit ດຽວກັນກັບຕົ"
"ວ editor. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ binaries ທາງການສຳລັບ editor, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ export "
"templates ທີ່ກົງກັນ, ຫຼື ບິວຂຶ້ນມາເອງຈາກເວີຊັນດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:163
msgid ""
"When exporting your game, Godot uses the templates as a base, and updates "
"their content as needed."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເກມຂອງທ່ານ, Godot ຈະໃຊ້ templates ເປັນພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ອັບເດດເນື້ອຫາຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:166
msgid "Installing the templates"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ templates"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:168
msgid ""
"The newly-compiled templates (``android_debug.apk`` , "
"``android_release.apk``, and ``android_source.zip``) must be copied to "
"Godot's templates folder with their respective names. The templates folder "
"can be located in:"
msgstr ""
"Templates ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ຄອມພາຍໃໝ່ (``android_debug.apk``, ``android_release.apk``, ແລະ "
"``android_source.zip``) ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກກັອບປີ້ໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ templates ຂອງ Godot ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຂອງພ"
"ວກມັນ. ໂຟນເດີ templates ສາມາດຢູ່ທີ່:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:172
msgid "Windows: ``%APPDATA%\\Godot\\export_templates\\<version>\\``"
msgstr "Windows: ``%APPDATA%\\Godot\\export_templates\\<version>\\``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:173
msgid "Linux: ``$HOME/.local/share/godot/export_templates/<version>/``"
msgstr "Linux: ``$HOME/.local/share/godot/export_templates/<version>/``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:174
msgid ""
"macOS: ``$HOME/Library/Application Support/Godot/export_templates/<version>/"
"``"
msgstr ""
"macOS: ``$HOME/Library/Application Support/Godot/export_templates/<version>/"
"``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:176
msgid ""
"``<version>`` is of the form ``major.minor[.patch].status`` using values "
"from ``version.py`` in your Godot source repository (e.g. ``4.1.3.stable`` "
"or ``4.2.dev``). You also need to write this same version string to a "
"``version.txt`` file located next to your export templates."
msgstr ""
"``<version>`` ຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ``major.minor[.patch].status`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ "
"``version.py`` ໃນ Godot source repository ຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``4.1.3.stable`` ຫຼື "
"``4.2.dev``). ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນດຽວກັນນີ້ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ ``version.txt`` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ "
"export templates ຂອງທ່ານນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:183
msgid ""
"However, if you are writing your custom modules or custom C++ code, you "
"might instead want to configure your template binaries as custom export "
"templates in the project export menu. You must have **Advanced Options** "
"enabled to set this."
msgstr ""
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານຂຽນໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ລະຫັດ C++ ຂອງທ່ານເອງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່າ "
"binaries ຂອງທ່ານ ເປັນ custom export templates ໃນເມນູການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກແທນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດ"
"ໃຊ້ **Advanced Options** ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:189
msgid ""
"You don't even need to copy them, you can just reference the resulting file "
"in the ``bin\\`` directory of your Godot source folder, so that the next "
"time you build you will automatically have the custom templates referenced."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ພວກມັນເລີຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດອ້າງອີງໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``bin\\`` ຂອງໂຟນເດີ"
"ຊອດໂຄ້ດ Godot ຂອງທ່ານ, ເພື່ອວ່າໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ທ່ານບິວ ທ່ານຈະມີການອ້າງອີງ custom templates ໂດຍອັດ"
"ຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:195
msgid "Building the Godot editor"
msgstr "ການບິວ Godot editor"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:197
msgid ""
"Compiling the editor is done by calling SCons from the Godot root directory "
"with the following arguments:"
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມພາຍ editor ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ SCons ຈາກ Godot root directory ດ້ວຍອາຣກິວເ"
"ມັນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:207
msgid ""
"You can add the ``dev_build=yes`` parameter to generate a dev build of the "
"Godot editor."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ ``dev_build=yes`` ເພື່ອສ້າງ dev build ຂອງ Godot editor ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:209
msgid ""
"You can add the ``debug_symbols=yes`` parameters to include the debug "
"symbols in the generated build."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ ``debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອລວມເອົາ debug symbols ເຂົ້າໃນການບິວທີ່ສ້"
"າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:211
msgid ""
"Note that you can include ``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` to the *last* "
"architecture you're building, to generate the debug symbols in a separate "
"``*-native-debug-symbols.zip`` file."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ ``separate_debug_symbols=yes`` ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ *ສຸດທ້າຍ* ທີ່ທ່າ"
"ນບິວ ເພື່ອສ້າງ debug symbols ແຍກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``*-native-debug-symbols.zip`` ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:213
msgid ""
"You can skip certain architectures depending on your target device to speed "
"up compilation."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມບາງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໄດ້ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບອຸປະກອນເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຄອມພາຍໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:215
msgid ""
"Remember to add ``generate_android_binaries=yes`` to the *last* architecture "
"you're building, so that binaries are generated after the build."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມ ``generate_android_binaries=yes`` ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ *ສຸດທ້າຍ* ທີ່ທ່ານບິວ ເພື່ອໃ"
"ຫ້ binaries ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກການບິວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:217
msgid ""
"The resulting binaries will be located under ``bin/android_editor_builds/``."
msgstr "Binaries ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ ``bin/android_editor_builds/``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:220
msgid "Removing the Editor binaries"
msgstr "ການລຶບ Editor binaries"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:222
msgid ""
"You can use the following commands to remove the generated editor binaries:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອລຶບ editor binaries ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:233
msgid "Installing the Godot editor APK"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Godot editor APK"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:235
msgid ""
"With an Android device with Developer Options enabled, connect the Android "
"device to your computer via its charging cable to a USB/USB-C port. Open up "
"a Terminal/Command Prompt and run the following commands from the root "
"directory with the following arguments:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີອຸປະກອນ Android ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ Developer Options ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນນັ້ນເຂົ້າກັບຄອມພິວເຕີຂ"
"ອງທ່ານຜ່ານສາຍ USB/USB-C. ເປີດ Terminal/Command Prompt ແລ້ວຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ root "
"directory ດ້ວຍອາຣກິວເມັນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:246
msgid "Platform doesn't appear in SCons"
msgstr "Platform ບໍ່ປາກົດໃນ SCons"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:248
msgid ""
"Double-check that you've set the ``ANDROID_HOME`` environment variable. This "
"is required for the platform to appear in SCons' list of detected platforms. "
"See :ref:`Setting up the buildsystem "
"<doc_android_setting_up_the_buildsystem>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``ANDROID_HOME`` ແລ້ວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ "
"platform ປາກົດໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ platforms ທີ່ SCons ກວດພົບ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`Setting up the "
"buildsystem <doc_android_setting_up_the_buildsystem>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:255
msgid "Application not installed"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:257
msgid ""
"Android might complain the application is not correctly installed. If so:"
msgstr ""
"Android ອາດຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າເປັນແບບນັ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:260
msgid "Check that the debug keystore is properly generated."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ debug keystore ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:261
msgid "Check that the jarsigner executable is from JDK 8."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ jarsigner executable ແມ່ນມາຈາກ JDK 8."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:263
msgid ""
"If it still fails, open a command line and run `logcat <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/command-line/logcat>`_:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຍັງລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ command line ແລ້ວຣັນ `logcat <https://developer.android.com/"
"studio/command-line/logcat>`_:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:269
msgid ""
"Then check the output while the application is installed; the error message "
"should be presented there. Seek assistance if you can't figure it out."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນກວດສອບ output ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳລັງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ; ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຄວນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ຂໍຄ"
"ວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:274
msgid "Application exits immediately"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປິດຕົວລົງທັນທີ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:276
msgid ""
"If the application runs but exits immediately, this might be due to one of "
"the following reasons:"
msgstr "ຖ້າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຣັນແລ້ວປິດລົງທັນທີ, ມັນອາດຈະເກີດຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນເຫດຜົນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:279
msgid ""
"Make sure to use export templates that match your editor version; if you use "
"a new Godot version, you *have* to update the templates too."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໃຊ້ export templates ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນ editor ຂອງທ່ານ; ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ Godot ເວີຊັນໃໝ່, ທ່າ"
"ນ *ຕ້ອງ* ອັບເດດ templates ນຳ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:281
msgid ""
"``libgodot_android.so`` is not in ``libs/<arch>/`` where ``<arch>`` is the "
"device's architecture."
msgstr ""
"``libgodot_android.so`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ ``libs/<arch>/`` ເຊິ່ງ ``<arch>`` ແມ່ນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກ"
"ຳຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:283
msgid ""
"The device's architecture does not match the exported one(s). Make sure your "
"templates were built for that device's architecture, and that the export "
"settings included support for that architecture."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນບໍ່ກົງກັບອັນທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ templates ຂອງທ່ານຖືກບິວສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະ"
"ຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນນັ້ນ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ລວມເອົາການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳນັ້ນແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_android.rst:287
msgid "In any case, ``adb logcat`` should also show the cause of the error."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າໃນກໍລະນີໃດກໍຕາມ, ``adb logcat`` ຄວນຈະສະແດງສາເຫດຂອງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດອອກມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:4
msgid "Compiling for iOS"
msgstr "ການຄອມພາຍສຳລັບ iOS"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:10
msgid ""
"This page describes how to compile iOS export template binaries from source. "
"If you're looking to export your project to iOS instead, "
"read :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຄອມພາຍ iOS export template binaries ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ. ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງ"
"ອອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ iOS ແທນ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:18
