"`MoltenVK SDK <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK#fetching-moltenvk-"
"source-code>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:53
msgid ""
"Open a Terminal, go to the root folder of the engine source code and type "
"the following to compile a debug build:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ Terminal, ໄປທີ່ root folder ຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ engine ແລ້ວພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍແບບ "
"debug build:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:60
