#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:66
msgid ""
"To create an Xcode project like in the official builds, you need to use the "
"template located in ``misc/dist/ios_xcode``. The release and debug libraries "
"should be placed in ``libgodot.ios.debug.xcframework`` and "
"``libgodot.ios.release.xcframework`` respectively. This process can be "
"automated by using the ``generate_bundle=yes`` option on the *last* SCons "
"command used to build export templates (so that all binaries can be "
"included)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode ຄືກັບການບິວຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ template ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ ``misc/dist/"
"ios_xcode``. libraries ແບບ release ແລະ debug ຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ "
"``libgodot.ios.debug.xcframework`` ແລະ ``libgodot.ios.release.xcframework`` ຕ"
"າມລຳດັບ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"``generate_bundle=yes`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons *ສຸດທ້າຍ* ທີ່ໃຊ້ບິວ export templates (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມ"
"າດລວມເອົາ binaries ທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄດ້)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:73
msgid ""
"The MoltenVK static ``.xcframework`` folder must also be placed in the "
"``ios_xcode`` folder once it has been created. MoltenVK is always statically "
"linked on iOS; there is no dynamic linking option available, unlike macOS."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີ MoltenVK static ``.xcframework`` ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``ios_xcode`` ຫຼັງຈາ"
"ກທີ່ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. MoltenVK ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະແຕຕິກສະເໝີໃນ iOS; ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບໄດນາມິກ"
"ຄືກັບໃນ macOS."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:87
msgid ""
"To run on a device, follow these instructions: :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຣັນໃນອຸປະກອນ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້: :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.rst:90
msgid ""
"iOS exports can run directly on an Apple Silicon Mac. To run exported iOS "
"project on Mac, open exported project in Xcode and select ``My Mac`` in the "
"``Run Destinations`` dropdown."
msgstr ""
"iOS exports ສາມາດຣັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ Apple Silicon Mac. ເພື່ອຣັນໂປຣເຈັກ iOS ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນ "
"Mac, ໃຫ້ເປີດໂປຣເຈັກໃນ Xcode ແລ້ວເລືອກ ``My Mac`` ໃນລາຍການ ``Run Destinations``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_visionos.rst:4
msgid "Compiling for visionOS"
msgstr "ການຄອມພາຍສຳລັບ visionOS"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_visionos.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page describes how to compile visionOS export template binaries from "
"source. If you're looking to export your project to visionOS instead, "
"see :ref:`doc_exporting_for_visionos`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຄອມພາຍ visionOS export template binaries ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ. ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງ"
"ການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ visionOS ແທນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ "
":ref:`doc_exporting_for_visionos`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_visionos.rst:11
msgid ""
"Compiling instructions for visionOS are currently identical "
"to :ref:`doc_compiling_for_ios`, except you should replace instances of "
"``platform=ios`` with ``platform=visionos`` in the SCons options. See the "
"linked page for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຄອມພາຍສຳລັບ visionOS ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ "
":ref:`doc_compiling_for_ios`, ພຽງແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຈາກ ``platform=ios`` ເປັນ "
"``platform=visionos`` ໃນຕົວເລືອກຂອງ SCons. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:4
msgid "Compiling for the Web"
msgstr "ການຄອມພາຍສຳລັບ Web"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page describes how to compile HTML5 editor and export template binaries "
"from source. If you're looking to export your project to HTML5 instead, "
"read :ref:`doc_exporting_for_web`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຄອມພາຍ HTML5 editor ແລະ export template binaries ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ. ຖ້າຫ"
"າກທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ HTML5 ແທນ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ "
":ref:`doc_exporting_for_web`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:16
msgid "To compile export templates for the Web, the following is required:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄອມພາຍ export templates ສຳລັບ Web, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:18
msgid "`Emscripten 4.0.0+ <https://emscripten.org>`__."
msgstr "`Emscripten 4.0.0+ <https://emscripten.org>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:19
msgid "`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/>`__."
msgstr "`Python 3.9+ <https://www.python.org/>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:20
msgid "`SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`__ build system."
msgstr "ລະບົບການສ້າງ `SCons 4.4+ <https://scons.org/pages/download.html>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:31
msgid ""
"Before starting, confirm that ``emcc`` is available in your PATH. This is "
"usually configured by the Emscripten SDK, e.g. when invoking ``emsdk "
"activate`` and ``source ./emsdk_env.sh``/``emsdk_env.bat``."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ຢືນຢັນວ່າ ``emcc`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ PATH ຂອງທ່ານ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າໂດຍ Emscripten SDK, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ ``emsdk activate`` ແລະ ``source ./"
"emsdk_env.sh``/``emsdk_env.bat``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:35
msgid ""
"Open a terminal and navigate to the root directory of the engine source "
"code. Then instruct SCons to build the Web platform. Specify ``target`` as "
"either ``template_release`` for a release build or ``template_debug`` for a "
"debug build:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເທີມິນໍ (terminal) ແລະ ເຂົ້າໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງຊອສໂຄດເອນຈິນ. ຈາກນັ້ນສັ່ງໃຫ້ SCons ສ້າງແພລັດຟ"
"ອມ Web. ກຳນົດ ``target`` ເປັນ ``template_release`` ສຳລັບການສ້າງແບບ release ຫຼື "
"``template_debug`` ສຳລັບການສ້າງແບບ debug:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:44
msgid ""
"By default, the :ref:`JavaScriptBridge singleton "
"<doc_web_javascript_bridge>` will be built into the engine. Official export "
"templates also have the JavaScript singleton enabled. Since ``eval()`` calls "
"can be a security concern, the ``javascript_eval`` option can be used to "
"build without the singleton:"
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, :ref:`JavaScriptBridge singleton <doc_web_javascript_bridge>` ຈະຖື"
"ກສ້າງເຂົ້າໄປໃນເອນຈິນ. ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) ແບບເປັນທາງການກໍມີການເປີດໃຊ້ "
"JavaScript singleton ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການຮຽກໃຊ້ ``eval()`` ອາດມີບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ, "
"ຕົວເລືອກ ``javascript_eval`` ຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໂດຍບໍ່ມີ singleton ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:54
msgid ""
"By default, WebWorker threads support is enabled. To disable it and only use "
"a single thread, the ``threads`` option can be used to build the web "
"template without threads support:"
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຮອງຮັບ WebWorker threads ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ເພື່ອປິດມັນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເທຣດດ"
"ຽວ (single thread), ຕົວເລືອກ ``threads`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແມ່ແບບເວັບໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບເທຣດ"
"ໄດ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:62
msgid ""
"The engine will now be compiled to WebAssembly by Emscripten. Once finished, "
"the resulting file will be placed in the ``bin`` subdirectory. Its name is "
"``godot.web.template_release.wasm32.zip`` for release or "
"``godot.web.template_debug.wasm32.zip`` for debug."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເອນຈິນຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ເປັນ WebAssembly ໂດຍ Emscripten. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຖືກເກັບ"
"ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ``bin``. ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນ ``godot.web.template_release.wasm32.zip`` ສຳລັບ "
"release ຫຼື ``godot.web.template_debug.wasm32.zip`` ສຳລັບ debug."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:67
msgid ""
"Finally, rename the zip archive to ``web_release.zip`` for the release "
"template:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ zip ເປັນ ``web_release.zip`` ສຳລັບແມ່ແບບ release:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:74
msgid "And ``web_debug.zip`` for the debug template:"
msgstr "ແລະ ``web_debug.zip`` ສຳລັບແມ່ແບບ debug:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:83
msgid ""
"The default export templates do not include GDExtension support for "
"performance and compatibility reasons. See the :ref:`export page "
"<doc_javascript_export_options>` for more info."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາການຮອງຮັບ GDExtension ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ແລ"
"ະ ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`ໜ້າການສົ່ງອອກ <doc_javascript_export_options>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:87
msgid ""
"You can build the export templates using the option ``dlink_enabled=yes`` to "
"enable GDExtension support:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``dlink_enabled=yes`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ "
"GDExtension:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:95
msgid ""
"Once finished, the resulting file will be placed in the ``bin`` "
"subdirectory. Its name will have ``_dlink`` added."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ``bin``. ຊື່ຂອງມັນຈະມີຄຳວ່າ ``_dlink`` ເພີ່ມເ"
"ຂົ້າມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:98
msgid ""
"Finally, rename the zip archives to ``web_dlink_release.zip`` and "
"``web_dlink_release.zip`` for the release template:"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ zip ເປັນ ``web_dlink_release.zip`` ແລະ "
"``web_dlink_debug.zip`` ສຳລັບແມ່ແບບ release:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:107
msgid "Building the editor"
