"ານແນະນຳເທົ່າກັບແບບ native. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.rst:117
msgid ""
"Once finished, the resulting file will be placed in the ``bin`` "
"subdirectory. Its name will be ``godot.web.editor.wasm32.zip``. You can "
