"Now you should have the iOS toolchain binaries in ``$HOME/iostoolchain/usr/"
"bin``."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຄວນມີບາຍນາຣີຂອງ iOS toolchain ໃນ ``$HOME/iostoolchain/usr/bin``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:108
msgid "Compiling Godot for iPhone"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ Godot ສຳລັບ iPhone"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:110
msgid ""
"Once you've done the above steps, you should keep two things in your "
"environment: the built toolchain and the iPhoneOS SDK directory. Those can "
"stay anywhere you want since you have to provide their paths to the SCons "
"build command."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນເກັບສອງຢ່າງໄວ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຄື: toolchain "
"ທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ iPhoneOS SDK. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຢູ່ໃສກໍໄດ້ ເພາະທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດ Path ຂອງພວກມັ"
"ນໃຫ້ກັບຄຳສັ່ງການສ້າງຂອງ SCons."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:115
msgid ""
"For the iPhone platform to be detected, you need the ``OSXCROSS_IOS`` "
"environment variable defined to anything."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບກວດພົບແພລັດຟອມ iPhone, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ``OSXCROSS_IOS`` ເປັນ"
"ຄ່າໃດກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:122
msgid ""
"Now you can compile for iPhone using SCons like the standard Godot way, with "
"some additional arguments to provide the correct paths:"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄອມໄພລ໌ສຳລັບ iPhone ໂດຍໃຊ້ SCons ຄືກັບວິທີມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Godot, ໂດຍເພີ່ມບາງຄຳ"
"ສັ່ງເພື່ອລະບຸ Path ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:4
msgid "Compiling with .NET"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍ .NET"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:11
msgid "`.NET SDK 8.0+ <https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download>`_"
msgstr "`.NET SDK 8.0+ <https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download>`_"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:13
msgid ""
"You can use ``dotnet --info`` to check which .NET SDK versions are installed."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ``dotnet --info`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງ .NET SDK ເວີຊັນໃດແດ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:16
msgid "Enable the .NET module"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ .NET"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:18
msgid ""
"C# support for Godot has historically used the `Mono <https://www.mono-"
"project.com/>`_ runtime instead of the `.NET Runtime <https://github.com/"
"dotnet/runtime>`_ and internally many things are still named ``mono`` "
"instead of ``dotnet`` or otherwise referred to as ``mono``."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບ C# ສຳລັບ Godot ໃນເມື່ອກ່ອນແມ່ນໃຊ້ຕົວຣັນໄທມ໌ (runtime) ຂອງ `Mono <https://"
"www.mono-project.com/>`_ ແທນທີ່ `.NET Runtime <https://github.com/dotnet/"
"runtime>`_ ແລະ ພາຍໃນຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງຍັງຄົງຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ ``mono`` ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ``dotnet`` ຫຼື ອ້າງອີງເ"
"ຖິງໃນນາມ ``mono``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:24
msgid ""
"By default, the .NET module is disabled when building. To enable it, add the "
"option ``module_mono_enabled=yes`` to the SCons command line, while "
"otherwise following the instructions for building the desired Godot binaries."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂມດູນ .NET ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເມື່ອສ້າງ. ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກ "
"``module_mono_enabled=yes`` ໃສ່ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ SCons, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການສ້າງບາຍນາຣີ "
"Godot ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:29
msgid "Generate the glue"
msgstr "ສ້າງ glue (ສ່ວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:31
msgid ""
"Parts of the sources of the managed libraries are generated from the "
"ClassDB. These source files must be generated before building the managed "
"libraries. They can be generated by any .NET-enabled Godot editor binary by "
"running it with the parameters ``--headless --generate-mono-glue`` followed "
"by the path to an output directory. This path must be ``modules/mono/glue`` "
"in the Godot directory:"
msgstr ""
"ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຊອສໂຄດຂອງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການ (managed libraries) ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາຈາກ "
"ClassDB. ໄຟລ໌ຊອສເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສ້າງກ່ອນການສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການ. ພວກມັນສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂ"
"ດຍບາຍນາຣີຂອງ Godot editor ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ .NET ໂດຍການຣັນດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີ ``--headless --"
"generate-mono-glue`` ຕາມດ້ວຍ Path ຂອງໂຟນເດີຜົນຮັບ. Path ນີ້ຕ້ອງແມ່ນ ``modules/mono/"
"glue`` ໃນໂຟນເດີ Godot:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:42
msgid ""
"This command will tell Godot to generate the C# bindings for the Godot API "
"at ``modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Generated``, and the C# "
"bindings for the editor tools at ``modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/"
"GodotSharpEditor/Generated``. Once these files are generated, you can build "
"Godot's managed libraries for all the desired targets without having to "
"repeat this process."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະບອກໃຫ້ Godot ສ້າງ C# bindings ສຳລັບ Godot API ທີ່ ``modules/mono/glue/"
"GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Generated``, ແລະ C# bindings ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງມືເອດິເຕີທີ່ ``modules/"
"mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharpEditor/Generated``. ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມ"
"າດສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການຂອງ Godot ສຳລັບທຸກເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:48
msgid ""
"``<godot_binary>`` refers to the editor binary you compiled with the .NET "
"module enabled. Its exact name will differ based on your system and "
"configuration, but should be of the form ``bin/godot.<platform>.editor."
"<arch>.mono``, e.g. ``bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.mono`` or ``bin/"
"godot.windows.editor.x86_32.mono.exe``. Be especially aware of the **.mono** "
"suffix! If you've previously compiled Godot without .NET support, you might "
"have similarly named binaries without this suffix. These binaries can't be "
"used to generate the .NET glue."
msgstr ""
"``<godot_binary>`` ໝາຍເຖິງບາຍນາຣີຂອງເອດິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ .NET. ຊື່ທີ່ແນ່ນອ"
"ນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ຄວນຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ``bin/"
"godot.<platform>.editor.<arch>.mono``, ເຊັ່ນ: ``bin/"
"godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.mono``. ໃຫ້ລະວັງນາມສະກຸນ **.mono** ເປັນພິເສດ! ຖ້າທ່ານເຄີ"
"ຍຄອມໄພລ໌ Godot ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບ .NET ມາກ່ອນ, ທ່ານອາດມີບາຍນາຣີທີ່ມີຊື່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນແຕ່ບໍ່ມີນາມສະກຸນນີ້. ບ"
"າຍນາຣີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ .NET glue ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:57
msgid ""
"The glue sources must be regenerated every time the ClassDB-registered API "
"changes. That is, for example, when a new method is registered to the "
"scripting API or one of the parameters of such a method changes. Godot will "
"print an error at startup if there is an API mismatch between ClassDB and "
"the glue sources."
msgstr ""
"ຊອສໂຄດຂອງ Glue ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສ້າງໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ API ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ ClassDB ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງ: ເມື່ອມີການລົງທະບຽນເມທອດ (method) ໃໝ່ໃນ scripting API ຫຼື ພາລາມິເຕີຂອງເມທອດນັ້ນປ່ຽນແປ"
"ງ. Godot ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫາກ API ລະຫວ່າງ ClassDB ແລະ glue sources ບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:64
msgid "Building the managed libraries"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການ (managed libraries)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:66
msgid ""
"Once you have generated the .NET glue, you can build the managed libraries "
"with the ``build_assemblies.py`` script:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ .NET glue ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ "
"``build_assemblies.py``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:73
msgid ""
"If everything went well, the ``GodotSharp`` directory, containing the "
"managed libraries, should have been created in the ``bin`` directory."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍດີ, ໂຟນເດີ ``GodotSharp`` ທີ່ບັນຈຸໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ມີການຈັດການ ຄວນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂຟນເ"
"ດີ ``bin``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:76
msgid ""
"By default, all development builds share a version number, which can cause "
"some issues with caching of the NuGet packages. To solve this issue either "
"use ``GODOT_VERSION_STATUS`` to give every build a unique version or delete "
"``GodotNuGetFallbackFolder`` after every build to clear the package cache."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທຸກການສ້າງສຳລັບການພັດທະນາຈະໃຊ້ເລກເວີຊັນດຽວກັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບການເກັບ"
"ແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງແພັກເກດ NuGet. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``GODOT_VERSION_STATUS`` ເພື່ອກຳ"
"ນົດເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະການສ້າງ ຫຼື ລຶບ ``GodotNuGetFallbackFolder`` ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງທຸກຄັ້ງເ"
"ພື່ອລ້າງແຄຊຂອງແພັກເກດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:82
msgid ""
"Unlike \"classical\" Godot builds, when building with the .NET module "
"enabled (and depending on the target platform), a data directory may be "
"created both for the editor and for exported projects. This directory is "
"important for proper functioning and must be distributed together with "
"Godot. More details about this directory in :ref:`Data "
"directory<compiling_with_dotnet_data_directory>`."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກການສ້າງ Godot ແບບ \"ດັ້ງເດີມ\", ເມື່ອສ້າງໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ .NET (ແລະ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແພລັດຟອ"
"ມປາຍທາງ), ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນອາດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນທັງສຳລັບເອດິເຕີ ແລະ ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ໂຟນເດີນີ້ມີຄວາມສຳ"
"ຄັນຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແຈກຢາຍໄປພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ Godot. ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໂ"
"ຟນເດີນີ້ເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນ<compiling_with_dotnet_data_directory>`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:90
msgid "Build Platform"
msgstr "ແພລັດຟອມການສ້າງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:92
msgid ""
"Provide the ``--godot-platform=<platform>`` argument to control for which "
"platform specific the libraries are built. Omit this argument to build for "
"the current system."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄຳສັ່ງ ``--godot-platform=<platform>`` ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມສະເພ"
"າະໃດ. ຫາກບໍ່ລະບຸຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ ມັນຈະສ້າງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:96
msgid ""
"This currently only controls the inclusion of the support for Visual Studio "
"as an external editor, the libraries are otherwise identical."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມພຽງແຕ່ການລວມເອົາການຮອງຮັບ Visual Studio ເປັນເອດິເຕີພາຍນອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ສ່ວນໄລບ"
"ຣາຣີອື່ນໆແມ່ນຄືກັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:100
msgid "NuGet packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ NuGet"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:102
msgid ""
"The API assemblies, source generators, and custom MSBuild project SDK are "
"distributed as NuGet packages. This is all transparent to the user, but it "
"can make things complicated during development."
msgstr ""
"API assemblies, source generators, ແລະ MSBuild project SDK ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແມ່ນຖືກແຈ"
"ກຢາຍໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດ NuGet. ທັງໝົດນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກເບື້ອງຫຼັງໂດຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຮູ້ສຶກ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງຕ່າງໆຊັ"
"ບຊ້ອນຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:106
msgid ""
"In order to use Godot with a development version of those packages, a local "
"NuGet source must be created where MSBuild can find them."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Godot ກັບແພັກເກດເວີຊັນສຳລັບການພັດທະນາເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ຕ້ອງສ້າງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ NuGet ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ "
"(local) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ MSBuild ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາພວກມັນພົບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:109
msgid ""
"First, pick a location for the local NuGet source. If you don't have a "
"preference, create an empty directory at one of these recommended locations:"
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, ເລືອກບ່ອນເກັບສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ NuGet ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີບ່ອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂຟນເດີເປົ່າໃ"
"ນບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງທີ່ແນະນຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:112
msgid "On Windows, ``C:\\Users\\<username>\\MyLocalNugetSource``"
msgstr "ເທິງ Windows, ``C:\\Users\\<username>\\MyLocalNugetSource``"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:113
