msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ (Linux, \\*BSD)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:197
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:199
msgid ""
"The data directory is a dependency for Godot binaries built with the .NET "
"module enabled. It contains important files for the correct functioning of "
"Godot. It must be distributed together with the Godot executable."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບບາຍນາຣີຂອງ Godot ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ .NET. ມັນບັນຈຸໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ"
"ຳຄັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ມັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແຈກຢາຍໄປພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ຣັນ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:206
msgid ""
"The name of the data directory for the Godot editor will always be "
"``GodotSharp``. This directory contains an ``Api`` subdirectory with the "
"Godot API assemblies and a ``Tools`` subdirectory with the tools required by "
"the editor, like the ``GodotTools`` assemblies and its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ Godot editor ຈະເປັນ ``GodotSharp`` ສະເໝີ. ໂຟນເດີນີ້ບັນຈຸໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ "
"``Api`` ທີ່ມີ Godot API assemblies ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ``Tools`` ທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເອດິເຕີຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່"
"ນ ``GodotTools`` assemblies ແລະ ສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:211
msgid ""
"On macOS, if the Godot editor is distributed as a bundle, the ``GodotSharp`` "
"directory may be placed in the ``<bundle_name>.app/Contents/Resources/`` "
"directory inside the bundle."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງ macOS, ຫາກ Godot editor ຖືກແຈກຢາຍໃນຮູບແບບ bundle, ໂຟນເດີ ``GodotSharp`` ອາດຈ"
"ະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ ``<bundle_name>.app/Contents/Resources/`` ພາຍໃນ bundle."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:218
msgid ""
"The data directory for exported projects is generated by the editor during "
"the export. It is named ``data_<APPNAME>_<ARCH>``, where ``<APPNAME>`` is "
"the application name as specified in the project setting ``application/"
"config/name`` and ``<ARCH>`` is the current architecture of the export."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເອດິເຕີໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ "
"``data_<APPNAME>_<ARCH>``, ໂດຍທີ່ ``<APPNAME>`` ແມ່ນຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປ"
"ຣເຈັກ ``application/config/name`` ແລະ ``<ARCH>`` ແມ່ນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳປະຈຸບັນຂອງການສົ່ງອ"
"ອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:223
msgid ""
"In the case of multi-architecture exports multiple such data directories "
"will be generated."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການສົ່ງອອກແບບຫຼາຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (multi-architecture), ໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກສ້າງ"
"ຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍໂຟນເດີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:227
msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງ (Command-line options)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:229
msgid ""
"The following is the list of command-line options available when building "
"with the .NET module:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງດ້ວຍໂມດູນ .NET:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:232
msgid "**module_mono_enabled**\\ =yes | **no**"
msgstr "**module_mono_enabled**\\ =yes | **no**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:234
msgid "Build Godot with the .NET module enabled."
msgstr "ສ້າງ Godot ໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ .NET."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:4
msgid "Compiling with PCK encryption key"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍຄີເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:8
msgid ""
"The export dialog gives you the option to encrypt your PCK file with a 256-"
"bit AES key when releasing your project. This will make sure your scenes, "
"scripts and other resources are not stored in plain text and can not easily "
"be ripped by some script kiddie."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບການສົ່ງອອກ (export dialog) ໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ PCK ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຄີ AES "
"256-bit ເມື່ອປ່ອຍໂປຣເຈັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າສາກ (scenes), ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນໆຂອງ"
"ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກດຶງອອກໄປໃຊ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:13
msgid ""
"Of course, the key needs to be stored in the binary, but if it's compiled, "
"optimized and without symbols, it would take some effort to find it."
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນວ່າຄີຕ້ອງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນບາຍນາຣີ, ແຕ່ຫາກມັນຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌, ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ (optimized) ແລະ ບໍ່ມີສັນຍະລັ"
"ກ (symbols), ມັນກໍຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມພໍສົມຄວນໃນການຄົ້ນຫາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:16
msgid ""
"For this to work, you need to build the export templates from source, with "
"that same key."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກຈາກຊອສໂຄດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີດຽວກັນນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:21
msgid ""
"This will **not** work if you use official, precompiled export templates. It "
"is absolutely **required** to compile your own export templates to use PCK "
"encryption."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ **ບໍ່** ເຮັດວຽກ ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ມາແລ້ວ. ມັນ **ຈຳເປັ"
"ນ** ຢ່າງຍິ່ງທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຄອມໄພລ໌ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກຂອງທ່ານເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:28
msgid ""
"Generate a 256-bit AES key in hexadecimal format. You can use the aes-256-"
"cbc variant from `this service <https://asecuritysite.com/encryption/"
"keygen>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຄີ AES 256-bit ໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖານສິບຫົກ (hexadecimal). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ aes-256-"
"cbc ຈາກ `ບໍລິການນີ້ <https://asecuritysite.com/encryption/keygen>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:31
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can generate it yourself using `OpenSSL <https://"
"www.openssl.org/>`__ command-line tools:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງມັນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ `OpenSSL <https://www.openssl.org/>`__:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:38
msgid "The output in ``godot.gdkey`` should be similar to:"
msgstr "ຜົນຮັບໃນ ``godot.gdkey`` ຄວນຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັບ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_script_encryption_key.rst:45
msgid ""
"You can generate the key without redirecting the output to a file, but that "
"way you can minimize the risk of exposing the key."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຄີໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງບັນທຶກຜົນຮັບລົງໃນໄຟລ໌, ແຕ່ວິທີນັ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງໃນການເປີດເຜີຍຄີໄດ້."

