msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຄືຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄີບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສ້າງ Godot ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"Godot ກຳລັງເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ PCK ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານມັນໄດ້ໃນເວລາຣັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:4
msgid "Optimizing a build for size"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການສ້າງເພື່ອຂະໜາດທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:9
msgid "Rationale"
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:11
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is desired to optimize a build for size rather than speed. "
"This means not compiling unused functions from the engine, as well as using "
"specific compiler flags to aid on decreasing build size. Common situations "
"include creating builds for mobile and Web platforms."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ, ມັນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງການສ້າງໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍແທນທີ່ຈະເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງການບໍ່"
"ຄອມໄພລ໌ຟັງຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຈາກເອນຈິນ, ລວມທັງການໃຊ້ compiler flags ສະເພາະເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງການ"
"ສ້າງ. ສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປລວມມີການສ້າງສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມມືຖື ແລະ ເວັບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:16
msgid ""
"This tutorial aims to give an overview on different methods to create a "
"smaller binary. Before continuing, it is recommended to read the previous "
"tutorials on compiling Godot for each platform."
msgstr ""
"ບົດຮຽນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາບລວມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕ່າງໆໃນການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍລົງ. ກ່ອນຈະສືບຕໍ່, ແ"
"ນະນຳໃຫ້ອ່ານບົດຮຽນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ກ່ຽວກັບການຄອມໄພລ໌ Godot ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:20
msgid ""
"The options below are listed from the most important (greatest size savings) "
"to the least important (lowest size savings)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຖືກຈັດລຽງຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດ (ປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ) ໄປຫາສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ (ປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່"
"ໄດ້ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:24
msgid "Stripping binaries"
msgstr "ການຕັດຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນເກີນອອກຈາກບາຍນາຣີ (Stripping binaries)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:26
msgid "**Space savings:** Very high"
msgstr "**ການປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່:** ສູງຫຼາຍ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:27
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:56
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:78
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:123
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:160
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:178
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:225
msgid "**Difficulty:** Easy"
msgstr "**ຄວາມຍາກ:** ງ່າຍ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:28
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:57
msgid "**Performed in official builds:** Yes"
msgstr "**ມີໃນການສ້າງແບບເປັນທາງການ:** ແມ່ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you build Windows (MinGW), Linux or macOS binaries from source, remember "
"to strip debug symbols from binaries by installing the ``strip`` package "
"from your distribution then running:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງບາຍນາຣີ Windows (MinGW), Linux ຫຼື macOS ຈາກຊອສໂຄດ, ຢ່າລືມຕັດ debug "
"symbols ອອກຈາກບາຍນາຣີ ໂດຍການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ``strip`` ຈາກລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:38
msgid "On Windows, ``strip.exe`` is included in most MinGW toolchain setups."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງ Windows, ``strip.exe`` ຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ toolchain ຂອງ MinGW ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:40
msgid ""
"This will reduce the size of compiled binaries by a factor between 5× and "
"10×. The downside is that crash backtraces will no longer provide accurate "
"information (which is useful for troubleshooting the cause of a "
"crash). :ref:`C++ profilers <doc_using_cpp_profilers>` will also no longer "
"be able to display function names (this does not affect the built-in "
"GDScript profiler)."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງບາຍນາຣີທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວລົງປະມານ 5 ຫາ 10 ເທົ່າ. ຂໍ້ເສຍຄື ຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຕອນໂປ"
"ຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash backtraces) ຈະບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັດເຈນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"
"ສາເຫດການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ). :ref:`C++ profilers <doc_using_cpp_profilers>` ກໍຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະ"
"ແດງຊື່ຟັງຊັນໄດ້ (ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ GDScript profiler ທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:48
msgid ""
"The above command will not work on Windows binaries compiled with MSVC and "
"platforms such as Android and Web. Instead, pass ``debug_symbols=no`` on the "
"SCons command line when compiling."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງຂ້າງເທິງຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກັບບາຍນາຣີ Windows ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍ MSVC ແລະ ແພລັດຟອມເຊັ່ນ Android ແລະ "
"Web. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ ``debug_symbols=no`` ໃນ SCons ແທນໃນເວລາຄອມໄພລ໌."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:53
msgid "Compiling with link-time optimization"
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍການປັບແຕ່ງໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (link-time optimization)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:55
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:77
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:122
msgid "**Space savings:** High"
msgstr "**ການປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່:** ສູງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:59
msgid ""
"Enabling link-time optimization produces more efficient binaries, both in "
"terms of performance and file size. It works by eliminating duplicate "
"template functions and unused code. It can currently be used with the GCC "
"and MSVC compilers:"
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ link-time optimization (LTO) ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄດ້ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ທັງໃນດ້ານ"
"ຄວາມໄວ ແລະ ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌. ມັນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການກຳຈັດຟັງຊັນແມ່ແບບທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ ໂຄດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້. ປະຈຸບັນສາມ"
"າດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຕົວຄອມໄພລ໌ GCC ແລະ MSVC:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:68
msgid ""
"Linking becomes much slower and more RAM-consuming with this option, so it "
"should be used only for release builds. You need to have at least 8 GB of "
"RAM available for successful linking with LTO enabled. Since the operating "
"system and programs will take up some RAM, in practice, you need 12 GB of "
"RAM installed in your system (preferably 16 GB) to compile Godot with LTO "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Linking) ຈະຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຄວນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ"
"ານສ້າງແບບ release ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ RAM ຫວ່າງຢ່າງນ້ອຍ 8 GB ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ "
"LTO ສຳເລັດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນໆກໍໃຊ້ RAM ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ ທ່ານຄວນ"
"ມີ RAM ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງ 12 GB (ຫຼື ແນະນຳແມ່ນ 16 GB) ເພື່ອຄອມໄພລ໌ Godot ດ້ວຍການເປີດ LTO."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:75
msgid "Optimizing for size instead of speed"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຂະໜາດແທນຄວາມໄວ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:79
msgid "**Performed in official builds:** Yes, but only for web builds"
msgstr "**ມີໃນການສ້າງແບບເປັນທາງການ:** ແມ່ນ, ແຕ່ສະເພາະການສ້າງສຳລັບເວັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:81
msgid ""
"It is possible to compile Godot using size optimizations (instead of speed). "
"To enable this, set the ``optimize`` flag to ``size``:"
msgstr ""
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຄອມໄພລ໌ Godot ໂດຍໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງຂະໜາດ (ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄວາມໄວ). ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້, "
