#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:90
msgid ""
"Godot 4.5 introduced the ``size_extra`` option, which can further reduce "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Godot 4.5 ໄດ້ນຳສະເໜີຕົວເລືອກ ``size_extra`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດລົງໄດ້ຕື່ມອີກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:97
msgid ""
"Detecting used features from the current project and disabling unused "
