#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:103
msgid ""
"Godot features an :ref:`doc_engine_compilation_configuration_editor` tool "
"that can detect the features used in the current project and create a build "
"profile. Once saved, this build profile can then be passed to SCons when "
"compiling custom export templates:"
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີເຄື່ອງມື :ref:`doc_engine_compilation_configuration_editor` ທີ່ສາມາດກວດຫາຟີເ"
"ຈີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ສ້າງ build profile. ເມື່ອບັນທຶກແລ້ວ, build profile ນີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງໃ"
"ຫ້ SCons ໃນເວລາຄອມໄພລ໌ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:111
msgid ""
"Note that for certain projects, the feature detection may be too aggressive "
"and disable features that are actually needed at runtime. This can occur if "
"certain features are used in a way that their usage cannot be detected "
"statically (such as a script being procedurally created and run at runtime)."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ສຳລັບບາງໂປຣເຈັກ, ການກວດຫາຟີເຈື່ອາດຈະເຂັ້ມງວດເກີນໄປ ແລະ ປິດຟີເຈີທີ່ຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆໃນເວລາຣັ"
"ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຫາກບາງຟີເຈີຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດຫາໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຣັ"
"ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:116
msgid ""
"More specific features can be disabled by following the sections below, but "
"remember that many of them are automatically detected by the engine "
"compilation configuration detector."
msgstr ""
"ຟີເຈີສະເພາະບາງຢ່າງສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການເຮັດຕາມພາກສ່ວນຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ແຕ່ຢ່າລືມວ່າຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງແມ່ນຖືກກວດຫາໂດ"
"ຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍຕົວເຄື່ອງມືກວດຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄອມໄພລ໌ຂອງເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:120
msgid "Disabling advanced text server"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:126
msgid ""
"By default, Godot uses an advanced text server with the support for the "
"following features:"
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Godot ໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂັ້ນສູງ (advanced text server) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບຟີເຈີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:129
msgid ""
"Right-to-left typesetting and complex scripts, required to write languages "
"such as Arabic and Hebrew."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດພິມແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບພາສາເຊັ່ນ ອາຣັບ ແລະ ຮີບຣູ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:131
msgid ""
"Font ligatures and OpenType features (such as small capitals, fractions and "
"slashed zero)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຊື່ອມຕົວອັກສອນ (Font ligatures) ແລະ ຟີເຈີ OpenType (ເຊັ່ນ ຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ເລ"
"ກສ່ວນ ແລະ ເລກສູນທີ່ມີຂີດຂວາງ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:134
msgid ""
"Godot provides a fallback text server that isn't compiled by default. This "
"text server can be used as a lightweight alternative to the default advanced "
"text server:"
msgstr ""
"Godot ມີເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບສຳຮອງ (fallback text server) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເຊີເວີຂໍ້"
"ຄວາມນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາແທນເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂັ້ນສູງ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:142
msgid ""
"If you only intend on supporting Latin, Greek and Cyrillic-based languages "
"in your project, the fallback text server should suffice."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ ລາຕິນ, ກຣີກ ແລະ ຊີຣິລິກ ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊີເວີຂໍ້"
"ຄວາມແບບສຳຮອງກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:145
msgid ""
"This fallback text server can also process large amounts of text more "
"quickly than the advanced text server. This makes the fallback text server a "
"good fit for mobile/web projects."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບສຳຮອງນີ້ຍັງສາມາດປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໄດ້ໄວກວ່າເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂັ້ນສູງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນ"
"ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກມືຖື/ເວັບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:151
msgid ""
"Remember to always pass ``module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes`` when using "
"``module_text_server_adv_enabled=no``. Otherwise, the compiled binary won't "
"contain any text server, which means no text will be displayed at all when "
"running the project."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ ``module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes`` ສະເໝີເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"``module_text_server_adv_enabled=no``. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ບາຍນາຣີທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ມີເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມ"
"ໃດໆເລີຍ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂຶ້ນເລີຍໃນເວລາຣັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:157
msgid "Disabling 3D"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ 3D"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.rst:159
