msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເຊັນຊື່ເອດິເຕີໃໝ່:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/macos_debug.rst:44
msgid "Debugging exported project"
msgstr "ການດີບັກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/macos_debug.rst:46
msgid ""
"To allow debugging, select the ``codesign\\debugging`` "
"(``com.apple.security.get-task-allow``) entitlement during the export. When "
"it is selected, notarization is not supported and should be disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ດີບັກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສິດ ``codesign\\debugging`` (``com.apple.security.get-"
"task-allow``) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມື່ອເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຮັບຮອງ "
"(notarization) ແລະ ຄວນປິດໃຊ້ງານມັນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:4
msgid "Validation layers"
msgstr "ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບ (Validation layers)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:6
msgid ""
"Validation layers enable developers to verify their application's correct "
"use of the Vulkan API. Validation layers can be enabled in both debug and "
"release builds, including in exported projects."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາສາມາດກວດສອບການໃຊ້ Vulkan API ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄດ້. ຊັ້ນກ"
"ານກວດສອບສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນການສ້າງແບບ debug ແລະ release, ລວມທັງໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:12
msgid ""
"Enabling validation layers has a performance impact, so only enable them "
"when you actually need the output to debug the application."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອດີບັກແ"
"ອັບພລິເຄຊັນແທ້ໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:18
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:44
msgid ""
"Install the Vulkan SDK `<https://vulkan.lunarg.com/sdk/home>`__, which "
"contains validation layers as part of its default installation. No need to "
"enable any optional features in the installer; installing the core Vulkan "
"SDK suffices. You don't need to reboot after installing the SDK, but you may "
"need to close and reopen your current terminal."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ Vulkan SDK `<https://vulkan.lunarg.com/sdk/home>`__, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຊັ້ນການກວດ"
"ສອບເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີເສີມໃດໆໃນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ; ການຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຫຼັກຂອງ "
"Vulkan SDK ກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ SDK, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປິດ ແລະ "
"ເປີດເທີມິນໍຂອງທ່ານໃໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:24
msgid ""
"After installing the Vulkan SDK, run Godot with the ``--gpu-"
"validation`` :ref:`command line argument <doc_command_line_tutorial>`. You "
"can also specify ``--gpu-abort`` which will make Godot quit as soon as a "
"validation error happens. This can prevent your system from freezing if a "
"validation error occurs."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Vulkan SDK ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຣັນ Godot ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``--gpu-validation`` :ref:`ຄຳສັ່ງເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ <doc_command_line_tutorial>`. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ ``--gpu-abort`` ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ "
"Godot ປິດລົງທັນທີເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດປ້ອງກັນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄ້າງຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພ"
"າດໃນການກວດສອບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:34
msgid ""
"Official Godot macOS builds do **not** support validation layers, as these "
"are statically linked against the Vulkan SDK. Dynamic linking must be used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ບາຍນາຣີ Godot macOS ແບບທາງການແມ່ນ **ບໍ່** ຮອງຮັບຊັ້ນການກວດສອບ ເພາະພວກມັນຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະແ"
"ຕຕິກກັບ Vulkan SDK. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບໄດນາມິກແທນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:38
msgid ""
"In practice, this means that using validation layers on macOS **requires** "
"you to use a Godot build compiled with the ``use_volk=yes`` SCons "
"option. :ref:`doc_compiling_for_macos`. If testing validation layers on an "
"exported project, you must recompile the export template and specify it as a "
"custom export template in your project's macOS export preset."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການໃຊ້ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບໃນ macOS **ຈຳເປັນ** ໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ການສ້າງ "
"Godot ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ ``use_volk=yes`` ໃນ SCons. "
":ref:`doc_compiling_for_macos`. ຫາກຈະທົດສອບຊັ້ນການກວດສອບໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄອ"
"ມໄພລ໌ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກໃໝ່ ແລະ ລະບຸເປັນແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກ macOS "
"ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:50
msgid ""
"After installing the Vulkan SDK, run a Godot binary that was compiled with "
"``use_volk=yes`` SCons option. Specify the ``--gpu-"
"validation`` :ref:`command line argument <doc_command_line_tutorial>`. You "
"can also specify ``--gpu-abort`` which will make Godot quit as soon as a "
"validation error happens. This can prevent your system from freezing if a "
"validation error occurs."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Vulkan SDK ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຣັນບາຍນາຣີ Godot ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ "
"``use_volk=yes``. ລະບຸຄຳສັ່ງ ``--gpu-validation`` :ref:`ຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ "
"<doc_command_line_tutorial>`. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ ``--gpu-abort`` ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot "
"ປິດລົງທັນທີເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:60
msgid "Install Vulkan validation layers from your distribution's repositories:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Vulkan validation layers ຈາກຄັງເກັບແພັກເກດຂອງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:124
msgid ""
"You don't need to reboot after installing the validation layers, but you may "
"need to close and reopen your current terminal."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງຊັ້ນການກວດສອບ, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປິດ ແລະ ເປີດເທີມິນໍຂອງທ່ານໃ"
"ໝ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:127
msgid ""
"After installing the package, run Godot with the ``--gpu-"
"validation`` :ref:`command line argument <doc_command_line_tutorial>`. You "
"can also specify ``--gpu-abort`` which will make Godot quit as soon as a "
"validation error happens. This can prevent your system from freezing if a "
"validation error occurs."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຣັນ Godot ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``--gpu-validation``. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ "
"``--gpu-abort`` ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot ປິດລົງທັນທີເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:135
msgid "Validation layers are currently **not** supported on iOS."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນຊັ້ນການກວດສອບແມ່ນ **ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ** ເທິງ iOS."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:140
msgid ""
"Validation layers are **not** supported on the web platform, as there is no "
"support for Vulkan there."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບແມ່ນ **ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ** ເທິງເວັບ ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບ Vulkan ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:148
msgid ""
"After enabling validation layers on Android, a developer can see errors and "
"warning messages in the ``adb logcat`` output."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບໃນ Android, ນັກພັດທະນາສາມາດເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນໃນຜົນຮັບຂອ"
"ງ ``adb logcat``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:152
msgid "Enabling validation layers"
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:155
msgid "Build validation layers from official sources"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊັ້ນການກວດສອບຈາກຊອສໂຄດທາງການ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:157
msgid ""
"To build Android libraries, follow the instructions on `Khronos' repository  "
"<https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-ValidationLayers/blob/master/"
"BUILD.md#building-on-android>`__. After a successful build, the libraries "
"will be located in ``Vulkan-ValidationLayers/build-android/libs``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງໄລບຣາຣີ Android, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ `ຄັງເກັບໂຄດຂອງ Khronos <https://"
"github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-ValidationLayers/blob/master/"
"BUILD.md#building-on-android>`__. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງສຳເລັດ, ໄລບຣາຣີຈະຢູ່ທີ່ ``Vulkan-"
"ValidationLayers/build-android/libs``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:162
msgid "Copy libraries"
msgstr "ກ່າຍໄລບຣາຣີ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:164
msgid ""
"Copy libraries from ``Vulkan-ValidationLayers/build-android/libs`` to "
"``godot/platform/android/java/app/libs/debug/vulkan_validation_layers``."
msgstr ""
"ກ່າຍໄລບຣາຣີຈາກ ``Vulkan-ValidationLayers/build-android/libs`` ໄປຍັງ ``godot/"
"platform/android/java/app/libs/debug/vulkan_validation_layers``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:167
msgid "Your Godot source directory tree should look like on the example below:"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີຊອສໂຄດ Godot ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະຄືກັບຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:184
msgid ""
"If the subdirectory ``libs/debug/vulkan_validation_layers`` doesn't exist, "
"create it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ ``libs/debug/vulkan_validation_layers`` ບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:187
msgid "Compile and run the Android app"
msgstr "ຄອມໄພລ໌ ແລະ ຣັນແອັບ Android"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/vulkan/vulkan_validation_layers.rst:189
msgid ""
"Linked validation layers are automatically loaded and enabled in Android "
"debug builds. You can use Godot's :ref:`doc_one-click_deploy` feature to "
"quickly test your project with the validation layers enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນການກວດສອບທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການສ້າງແບບ debug ຂອງ "
"Android. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ :ref:`doc_one-click_deploy` ຂອງ Godot ເພື່ອທົດສອບໂປຣເຈັກຂອ"
"ງທ່ານພ້ອມກັບຊັ້ນການກວດສອບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:4
msgid "Using C++ profilers"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ C++ profilers"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"To optimize Godot's performance, you need to know what to optimize first. To "
"this end, profilers are useful tools."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ Godot, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮູ້ກ່ອນວ່າຄວນປັບແຕ່ງຈຸດໃດ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, profilers ຈຶ່ງເປັນ"
"ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"There is a :ref:`built-in GDScript profiler <doc_the_profiler>` in the "
"editor, but using a C++ profiler may be useful in cases where the GDScript "
"profiler is not accurate enough or is missing information due to bugs in the "
"profiler."
msgstr ""
"ມີ :ref:`GDScript profiler ທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວ <doc_the_profiler>` ໃນເອດິເຕີ, ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ C++ "
"profiler ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ GDScript profiler ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ຊັດເຈນພໍ ຫຼື ຂາດຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"There are two main types of profilers: sampling profilers and tracing "
"profilers."
msgstr ""
"ມີ profilers ຫຼັກໆຢູ່ສອງປະເພດຄື: sampling profilers ແລະ tracing profilers."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"Sampling profilers periodically interrupt the running program and take a "
"\"sample\", which records which functions are running. Using this "
"information, the profiler estimates which functions the program spent the "
"most time in."
msgstr ""
"Sampling profilers ຈະຂັດຈັງຫວະໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ກຳລັງຣັນຢູ່ເປັນໄລຍະ ແລະ ເກັບ \"ຕົວຢ່າງ\" "
"(sample) ເພື່ອບັນທຶກວ່າຟັງຊັນໃດກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະປະເມີນວ່າໂປຣແກຣມໃຊ້ເວລາສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄປກັບຟັ"
"ງຊັນໃດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"Tracing profilers work by recording application-specific events (such as the "
"start and end of a single frame), producing a log called a \"trace\". The "
"profiler can use the trace to produce a graph showing an accurate high-level "
"timeline of what happened. However, any code that is not explicitly "
"instrumented will not appear in a tracing profiler's timeline!"
msgstr ""
"Tracing profilers ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການບັນທຶກເຫດການສະເພາະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້"
"ນສຸດຂອງເຟຣມ), ແລ້ວສ້າງລາຍການທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"trace\". ຕົວ profiler ສາມາດໃຊ້ trace ນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງກ"
"ຣາຟສະແດງທາມລາຍ (timeline) ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ໂຄດໃດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມໂດຍສະເພາະຈ"
"ະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນທາມລາຍຂອງ tracing profiler!"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Godot supports both sampling profilers and tracing profilers, and already "
"includes the logging code for common Godot events for use with a tracing "
"profiler!"
msgstr ""
"Godot ຮອງຮັບທັງ sampling profilers ແລະ tracing profilers, ແລະ ໄດ້ລວມເອົາໂຄດການບັນທຶ"
"ກສຳລັບເຫດການທົ່ວໄປຂອງ Godot ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ tracing profiler ໄວ້ແລ້ວ!"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"Different problems may be easier to debug with one kind of profiler over the "
"other, but it's difficult to provide a set of rules for which to use. Give "
"both a try, and see what you can learn from them!"
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາທີ່ຕ່າງກັນອາດຈະດີບັກໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າດ້ວຍ profiler ປະເພດໃດໜຶ່ງ, ມັນຍາກທີ່ຈະກຳນົດກົດເກນວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ແບບ"
"ໃດ. ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ທັງສອງແບບ ແລະ ເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານສາມາດຮຽນຮູ້ຫຍັງໄດ້ຈາກພວກມັນ!"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:37
msgid "Sampling profilers"
msgstr "Sampling profilers"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:39
msgid "We recommend the following sampling profilers:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳ sampling profilers ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:41
msgid ":ref:`VerySleepy <doc_profiler_very_sleepy>` (Windows only)"
msgstr ":ref:`VerySleepy <doc_profiler_very_sleepy>` (ສະເພາະ Windows)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:42
msgid ":ref:`Hotspot <doc_profiler_hotspot>` (Linux only)"
msgstr ":ref:`Hotspot <doc_profiler_hotspot>` (ສະເພາະ Linux)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:43
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:90
msgid ":ref:`Instruments <doc_profiler_instruments>` (Apple only)"
msgstr ":ref:`Instruments <doc_profiler_instruments>` (ສະເພາະ Apple)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"These profilers may not be the most powerful or flexible options, but their "
"standalone operation and limited feature set tends to make them easier to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຊົງພະລັງ ຫຼື ຢືດຢຸ່ນທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ການເຮັດວຽກແບບອິດສະຫຼະ ແລ"
"ະ ຊຸດຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈຳກັດຂອງພວກມັນມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:49
msgid "Setting up Godot"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Godot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"To get useful profiling information, it is **absolutely required** to use a "
"Godot build that includes debugging symbols. Official binaries do not "
"include debugging symbols, since these would make the download size "
"significantly larger."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນ profiling ທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ, ມັນ **ຈຳເປັນຢ່າງຍິ່ງ** ທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການສ້າງ Godot ທີ່ລວມເອົ"
"າ debugging symbols. ບາຍນາຣີແບບທາງການຈະບໍ່ມີ debugging symbols ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດ"
"ໄຟລ໌ດາວໂຫຼດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"To get profiling data that best matches the production environment (but with "
"debugging symbols), you should compile binaries with the ``production=yes "
"debug_symbols=yes`` SCons options."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນ profiling ທີ່ກົງກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ (ແຕ່ຍັງມີ debugging "
"symbols), ທ່ານຄວນຄອມໄພລ໌ບາຍນາຣີດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ ``production=yes debug_symbols=yes`` ໃ"
"ນ SCons."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:58
msgid ""
"It is possible to run a profiler on less optimized builds (e.g. "
"``target=template_debug`` without LTO), but results will naturally be less "
"representative of real world conditions."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຣັນ profiler ໃນການສ້າງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼາຍປານໃດ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"``target=template_debug`` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ LTO), ແຕ່ຜົນຮັບກໍຈະບໍ່ສະທ້ອນເຖິງສະພາວະການໃຊ້ງານຈິງປານໃ"
"ດ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"Do *not* strip debugging symbols on the binaries using the ``strip`` command "
"after compiling the binaries. Otherwise, you will no longer get useful "
"profiling information when running a profiler."
msgstr ""
"**ຫ້າມ** ຕັດ debugging symbols ອອກຈາກບາຍນາຣີດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``strip`` ຫຼັງຈາກຄອມໄພລ໌. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງ"
"ນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ profiling ທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຣັນ profiler."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:68
msgid "Benchmarking startup/shutdown times"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບຄວາມໄວໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ/ປິດໂປຣແກຣມ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:70
msgid ""
"If you're looking into optimizing Godot's startup/shutdown performance, you "
"can tell the profiler to use the ``--quit`` command line option on the Godot "
"binary. This will exit Godot just after it's done starting. The ``--quit`` "
"option works with ``--editor``, ``--project-manager``, and ``--path <path to "
"project directory>`` (which runs a project directly)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາວິທີປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ/ປິດຂອງ Godot, ທ່ານສາມາດບອກໃຫ້ profiler ໃຊ້"
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``--quit`` ກັບບາຍນາຣີ Godot. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot ປິດລົງທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳເລັດ. ຄ"
"ຳສັ່ງ ``--quit`` ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ ``--editor``, ``--project-manager``, ແລະ ``--path "
"<Path ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ>``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_command_line_tutorial` for more command line arguments "
"supported by Godot."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`doc_command_line_tutorial` ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ Godot ຮອງຮັບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:84
msgid "Tracing profilers"
msgstr "Tracing profilers"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:86
msgid "Godot currently supports three tracing profilers:"
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ Godot ຮອງຮັບ tracing profilers ສາມຕົວ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:88
msgid ":ref:`Tracy <doc_profiler_tracy>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Tracy <doc_profiler_tracy>`"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:89
msgid ":ref:`Perfetto <doc_profiler_perfetto>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Perfetto <doc_profiler_perfetto>`"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:94
msgid ""
"Perfetto is the default tracing system for Android, so pre-built export "
"templates with Perfetto built-in and enabled are provided from the `GitHub "
"Releases page <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-builds/releases>`__."
msgstr ""
"Perfetto ແມ່ນລະບົບການຕິດຕາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Android, ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ສ້າງມາພ້ອມກັບ "
"Perfetto ຈຶ່ງມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດຈາກ `ໜ້າ GitHub Releases <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-builds/releases>`__."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:98
msgid ""
"In order to use either of them, you'll need to build the engine from source. "
"If you've never done this before, please read :ref:`these docs "
"<doc_compiling_index>` for the platform you want to profile on. You'll need "
"to perform the same steps here, but with some additional arguments for "
"``scons``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ພວກມັນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງເອນຈິນຈາກຊອສໂຄດ. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ເຄີຍເຮັດມາກ່ອນ, ໃຫ້ອ່ານ "
":ref:`ເອກະສານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ <doc_compiling_index>` ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດຕາ"
"ມຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວກັນ ແຕ່ເພີ່ມບາງຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບ ``scons``."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/index.rst:105
msgid "All recommended profilers"
msgstr "ທຸກ profilers ທີ່ແນະນຳ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:4
msgid "Hotspot"
msgstr "Hotspot"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:6
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/very_sleepy.rst:6
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`sampling profiler instructions "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ sampling profiler <doc_sampling_profilers>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້"
"ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:8
msgid ""
"Open `Hotspot <https://github.com/KDAB/hotspot>`__. Click **Record Data**:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ `Hotspot <https://github.com/KDAB/hotspot>`__. ຄລິກ **Record Data**:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:12
msgid ""
"In the next window, specify the path to the Godot binary that includes debug "
"symbols."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ Path ຂອງບາຍນາຣີ Godot ທີ່ມີ debug symbols."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:13
msgid ""
"Specify command line arguments to run a specific project, with or without "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຣັນໂປຣເຈັກສະເພາະ, ໂດຍຈະມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີເອດິເຕີກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:14
msgid ""
"The path to the working directory can be anything if an absolute path is "
"used for the ``--path`` command line argument. Otherwise, it must be set so "
"that the relative path to the project is valid."
msgstr ""
"Path ຂອງໂຟນເດີເຮັດວຽກ (working directory) ສາມາດເປັນຫຍັງກໍໄດ້ ຫາກໃຊ້ absolute path ສຳ"
"ລັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``--path``. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອໃຫ້ relative path ຫາໂປຣເຈັກຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:17
msgid ""
"Make sure **Elevate Privileges** is checked if you have administrative "
"privileges. While not essential for profiling Godot, this will ensure all "
"events can be captured. Otherwise, some events may be missing from the "
"capture. Your settings should now look something like this:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ **Elevate Privileges** ຫາກທ່ານມີສິດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrative "
"privileges). ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການ profiling Godot, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທຸກເຫດ"
"ການຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ບາງເຫດການອາດຈະຫາຍໄປຈາກການບັນທຶກ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັ"
"ນຄືແນວນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click **Start Recording** and perform the actions you wish to profile in the "
"editor/project."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ **Start Recording** ແລະ ເຮັດສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະ profile ໃນເອດິເຕີ/ໂປຣເຈັກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:25
msgid ""
"Quit the editor/project normally or use the **Stop Profiling** button in "
"Hotspot to stop profiling early. Stopping profiling early can result in "
"cleaner profiles if you're not interested in the engine's shutdown procedure."
msgstr ""
"ປິດເອດິເຕີ/ໂປຣເຈັກຕາມປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ **Stop Profiling** ໃນ Hotspot ເພື່ອຢຸດກ່ອນກຳນົດ. ການ"
"ຢຸດ profiling ກ່ອນກຳນົດອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະອາດກວ່າ ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂັ້ນຕອນການປິດຂອງເອນຈິນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click **View Results** and wait for the profiling visualization to be "
"generated:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ **View Results** ແລະ ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນ profiling ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use the tabs at the top to navigate between the different views. These views "
"show the same data, but in different ways. The **Flame Graph** tab is a good "
"way to see which functions take up the most time at a glance. These "
"functions are therefore the most important ones to optimize, since "
"optimizing them will improve performance the most."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແທັບຕ່າງໆຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງເພື່ອເບິ່ງມຸມມອງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ມຸມມອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນແຕ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. "
"ແທັບ **Flame Graph** ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການເບິ່ງວ່າຟັງຊັນໃດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຶ່ງເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່"
"ສຸດທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:37
msgid ""
"At the bottom of all tabs except **Summary**, you will also see a list of "
"CPU threads started by the engine along with the CPU utilization for each "
"thread. This lets you see threads that can be a bottleneck at a given point "
"in time."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງທຸກແທັບຍົກເວັ້ນ **Summary**, ທ່ານຍັງຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ CPU threads ທີ່ເອນຈິນສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ພ້ອ"
"ມກັບການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ຂອງແຕ່ລະເທຣດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນເທຣດທີ່ອາດຈະເປັນຄໍຂວດ (bottleneck) ໃນຊ່"
"ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:45
msgid ""
"If you don't want the startup procedure to be included in the profile, you "
"can also attach Hotspot to a running process by clicking **Record Data** "
"then setting the **Launch Application** dropdown option to **Attach To "
"Process(es)**."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລວມຢູ່ໃນ profile, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Hotspot ເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣເ"
"ຊສທີ່ກຳລັງຣັນຢູ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍຄລິກ **Record Data** ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຄ່າ **Launch Application** ເປັນ "
"**Attach To Process(es)**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/hotspot.rst:50
msgid ""
"This process attachment-based workflow is similar to the one used by "
"VerySleepy."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂປຣເຊສນີ້ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ VerySleepy."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:4
msgid "Instruments"
msgstr "Instruments"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:6
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`sampling profiler instructions "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` and the :ref:`tracing profiler instructions "
"<doc_tracing_profilers>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳຕົວວິເຄາະແບບສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sampling profiler) "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` ແລະ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳຕົວວິເຄາະແບບຕິດຕາມ (tracing "
"profiler) <doc_tracing_profilers>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:10
msgid ""
"Open `Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`__. Select **Open Developer "
"Tool** - **Instruments** from the **Xcode** app menu:"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ `Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`__. ເລືອກ **Open Developer "
"Tool** - **Instruments** ຈາກເມນູແອັບ **Xcode**:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:12
msgid "Double-click on **Time Profiler** in the **Instruments** window:"
msgstr "ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ **Time Profiler** ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ **Instruments**:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:16
msgid ""
"In the Time Profiler window, click on the **Target** menu, select **Choose "
"target...** and specify the path to the Godot binary, command line "
"arguments, and environment variables in the next window."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Time Profiler, ຄລິກໃສ່ເມນູ **Target**, ເລືອກ **Choose target...** ແລະ ລະບຸ"
"ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ Godot binary, command line arguments, ແລະ environment "
"variables ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:22
msgid ""
"You can also attach the Time Profiler to a running process by selecting it "
"from the **Target** menu."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Time Profiler ເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣເຊສທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍການເລືອກມັນຈາກເມນູ "
"**Target**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click the **Start an immediate mode recording** button to start profiling."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Start an immediate mode recording** ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:29
msgid ""
"Perform the actions you wish to profile in the editor or project. When "
"you're done, click the **Stop** button."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການຕ່າງໆທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການວິເຄາະໃນ editor ຫຼື ໂປຣເຈັກ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ **Stop**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:32
msgid "Wait for the results to appear."
msgstr "ຖ້າໃຫ້ຜົນລັບປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:33
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the window you will see a call tree for all CPU threads "
"started, and the **Heaviest Stack Trace** overview."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນ call tree ສຳລັບທຸກ CPU threads ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ພາບລວມຂອງ "
"**Heaviest Stack Trace**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:35
msgid ""
"Select **Hide system libraries** in the **Call Tree** menu (at the bottom of "
"the window) to remove external modules."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ **Hide system libraries** ໃນເມນູ **Call Tree** (ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ) ເພື່ອເອົາໂມດູ"
"ນພາຍນອກອອກ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/instruments.rst:37
msgid ""
"You can use the timeline at the top of the window to display details for the "
"specific time period."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ timeline ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:4
msgid "Perfetto"
msgstr "Perfetto"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:6
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:6
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`tracing profiler instructions <doc_tracing_profilers>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳຕົວວິເຄາະແບບຕິດຕາມ (tracing profiler) "
"<doc_tracing_profilers>` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Perfetto <https://perfetto.dev>`__ is the default tracing system for "
"Android. In fact, its system tracing service has been built into the "
"platform since Android 9."
msgstr ""
"`Perfetto <https://perfetto.dev>`__ ແມ່ນລະບົບຕິດຕາມ (tracing) ມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ "
"Android. ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິງແລ້ວ, ບໍລິການຕິດຕາມລະບົບຂອງມັນໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາພ້ອມກັບແພລັດຟອມຕັ້ງແຕ່ "
"Android 9 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:12
msgid "Using official Perfetto templates"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ Perfetto ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:14
msgid ""
"Starting with Godot 4.7, Perfetto export templates are provided for every "
"stable Godot release and can be downloaded from the `GitHub Releases page "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມແຕ່ Godot 4.7 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) ຂອງ Perfetto ຈະມີໃຫ້ສ"
"ຳລັບທຸກລຸ້ນທີ່ສະຖຽນຂອງ Godot ແລະ ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ `ໜ້າ GitHub Releases <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:18
msgid "Using the Gradle build template"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບການສ້າງ (build template) ແບບ Gradle"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:20
msgid ""
"Navigate to the release page and download the "
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_source.perfetto.zip`` release artifact "
"where ``godot_version`` corresponds to the version of the engine being used."
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ release ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ ``Godot_v<godot_version>"
"_android_source.perfetto.zip`` ໂດຍທີ່ ``godot_version`` ຈະກົງກັບເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ກຳລັງ"
"ໃຊ້ຢູ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:22
msgid ""
"In the **Project > Export** dialog, **Advanced Options** and **Use Gradle "
"Build** must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ **Project > Export**, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ **Advanced Options** ແລະ **Use "
"Gradle Build**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:23
msgid "Point **Android Source Template** to the downloaded export template."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ **Android Source Template** ໄປຫາແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:27
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:48
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in the :ref:`Configuration section "
"<doc_profiler_perfetto_configuration>` to learn how to configure and create "
"a trace."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ :ref:`ພາກສ່ວນການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configuration) "
"<doc_profiler_perfetto_configuration>` ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ່ວິທີກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ສ້າງການຕິດຕາມ "
"(trace)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:31
msgid "Using non-gradle build templates"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບການສ້າງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Gradle"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:33
msgid ""
"Navigate to the release page and download the following release artifacts "
"where ``godot_version`` corresponds to the version of the engine being used:"
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ release ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໂດຍທີ່ ``godot_version`` ກົງກັບເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ກຳລັງໃ"
"ຊ້ຢູ່:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:36
msgid ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_debug.perfetto.apk`` (for debug builds)"
msgstr ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_debug.perfetto.apk`` (ສຳລັບ debug builds)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:37
msgid ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_release.perfetto.apk`` (for release builds)"
msgstr ""
"``Godot_v<godot_version>_android_release.perfetto.apk`` (ສຳລັບ release builds)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:39
msgid "In the **Project > Export** dialog:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ **Project > Export**:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:41
msgid "**Advanced Options** must be enabled"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ **Advanced Options**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:42
msgid "**Use Gradle Build** must be disabled"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານ **Use Gradle Build**"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:44
msgid "Point **Custom Template** to the downloaded export templates."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ **Custom Template** ໄປຫາແມ່ແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:52
msgid "Custom Godot builds with Perfetto support"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (build) Godot ເອງໂດຍຮອງຮັບ Perfetto"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:54
msgid ""
"From the ``godot`` root directory, run the following python script to "
"install the latest version of the Perfetto SDK under ``thirdparty/perfetto``:"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງ ``godot``, ໃຫ້ລັນສະຄຣິບ python ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Perfetto SDK ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"
"ໄວ້ທີ່ ``thirdparty/perfetto``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:61
msgid ""
"Next, build the Android debug or release templates for your architecture "
"using ``scons`` (per :ref:`Compiling for Android "
"<doc_compiling_for_android>`), but adding the ``profiler=perfetto`` argument."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງແມ່ແບບ Android debug ຫຼື release ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"``scons`` (ຕາມ :ref:`ການຄອມໄພລ໌ສຳລັບ Android <doc_compiling_for_android>`), ແຕ່ໃ"
"ຫ້ເພີ່ມອາຣ໌ກິວເມັ້ນ ``profiler=perfetto`` ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:67
msgid ""
"It's generally recommended to profile release templates, because that is the "
"version your players will use, and it will perform differently than other "
"types of builds. However, in the case of Android, it can sometimes be useful "
"to use debug templates, because Godot can only do remote debugging of games "
"exported from debug templates."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບໃນ release templates ເພາະມັນແມ່ນເວີຊັນທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຈະໃຊ້ແທ້, "
"ແລະ ມັນຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຕ່າງຈາກການ build ແບບອື່ນໆ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບ Android ບາງຄັ້ງການໃຊ້ "
"debug templates ກໍມີປະໂຫຍກ ເພາະ Godot ສາມາດເຮັດ remote debugging ໄດ້ສະເພາະເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອ"
"ອກຈາກ debug templates ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:73
msgid "For example, to build the release templates for arm64:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການສ້າງ release templates ສຳລັບ arm64:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:84
msgid ""
"Perfetto requires a configuration file to tell it which events to track."
msgstr ""
"Perfetto ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອບອກວ່າມີເຫດການ (events) ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:86
msgid "Create a file called ``godot.config`` with this content:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``godot.config`` ໂດຍມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:114
msgid "Godot records two categories of track events:"
msgstr "Godot ຈະບັນທຶກເຫດການການຕິດຕາມເປັນສອງປະເພດ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:116
msgid ""
"**godot**: Used to record Godot engine events. This is used for performance "
"analysis. Event tracing overhead should not significantly impact "
"performance. This should be the typical tracing mode for most developers."
msgstr ""
"**godot**: ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເຫດການຂອງ Godot engine. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບ. ການຕິດຕາມເ"
"ຫດການນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ນີ້ຄວນເປັນໂໝດການຕິດຕາມປົກກະຕິສຳລັບນັກພັດທະນາສ່ວນໃຫ"
"ຍ່."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:119
msgid ""
"**godot_scripting**: Used to record Godot scripting events. This is a slow "
"category as it profiles the entire game scripting logic. This is used for "
"code understanding / debugging / finding what caused a frame hitch. "
"Performance is much slower, but it helps to find that one problematic "
"function call that was otherwise hidden."
msgstr ""
"**godot_scripting**: ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເຫດການການຂຽນສະຄຣິບຂອງ Godot. ປະເພດນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ ເພາະມັ"
"ນວິເຄາະຕັກກະການຂຽນສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດຂອງເກມ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈໂຄ້ດ / ດີບັກ / ຊອກຫາສາເຫດທີ່ເຮັດໃ"
"ຫ້ເຟຣມກະຕຸກ (frame hitch). ປະສິດທິພາບຈະຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຊອກຫາການເອີ້ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີບັນຫາທີ່ອາ"
"ດຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:125
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:83
msgid "Record a trace"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກການຕິດຕາມ (trace)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:127
msgid ""
"Finally, launch your game on an Android device using the export templates "
"you built earlier."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ລັນເກມຂອງທ່ານໃນອຸປະກອນ Android ໂດຍໃຊ້ export templates ທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:130
msgid ""
"When you're ready to record a trace (for example, when you've hit the part "
"of your game that is exhibiting performance issues), you can use `this "
"script from the Perfetto GitHub repository <https://github.com/google/"
"perfetto/blob/main/tools/record_android_trace>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າພ້ອມທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກການຕິດຕາມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອຮອດສ່ວນຂອງເກມທີ່ມີບັນຫາປະສິດທິພາບ), ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"`ສະຄຣິບນີ້ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ GitHub ຂອງ Perfetto <https://github.com/google/perfetto/"
"blob/main/tools/record_android_trace>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:138
msgid ""
"This will record for 10 seconds (per the configuration), or until you "
"press :kbd:`Ctrl + C`."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຈະບັນທຶກເປັນເວລາ 10 ວິນາທີ (ຕາມການກຳນົດຄ່າ), ຫຼື ຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະກົດ :kbd:`Ctrl + C`."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:142
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:105
msgid "Examining the trace"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການຕິດຕາມ (trace)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:144
msgid ""
"As soon as that script exits, it will launch the Perfetto UI in a web "
"browser."
msgstr "ທັນທີທີ່ສະຄຣິບນັ້ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ມັນຈະເປີດ Perfetto UI ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:146
msgid ""
"To see the Godot events, expand the row for your application by clicking on "
"its Android *Unique Name* / *Package Name* / *App ID* (Perfetto will also "
"include some events from system services in the trace)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເຫດການຂອງ Godot, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍແຖວຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ Android "
"*Unique Name* / *Package Name* / *App ID* (Perfetto ຈະລວມເອົາບາງເຫດການຈາກບໍລິການ"
"ຂອງລະບົບເຂົ້າໃນການຕິດຕາມນຳ)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:152
msgid "Then you can use the ``WASD`` keys to navigate the graph:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ ``WASD`` ເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງກຣາບ:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:154
msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`A` or :kbd:`D` to navigate forward or backward along the timeline"
msgstr "ກົດ :kbd:`A` ຫຼື :kbd:`D` ເພື່ອເລື່ອນໄປຂ້າງໜ້າ ຫຼື ຖອຍຫຼັງຕາມ timeline"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:155
msgid "Press :kbd:`W` or :kbd:`S` to zoom in or out"
msgstr "ກົດ :kbd:`W` ຫຼື :kbd:`S` ເພື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຊູມອອກ"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:157
msgid ""
"You'll probably need to zoom a bit before you're able to see the individual "
"events from Godot."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງຊູມເຂົ້າໄປໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດເຫັນແຕ່ລະເຫດການຈາກ Godot ໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/perfetto.rst:160
msgid ""
"To learn more, see the `Perfetto UI documentation <https://perfetto.dev/docs/"
"visualization/perfetto-ui>`_."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ `ເອກະສານການນຳໃຊ້ Perfetto UI <https://perfetto.dev/docs/"
"visualization/perfetto-ui>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:4
msgid "Tracy"
msgstr "Tracy"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Tracy <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy>`__ is an Open Source profiler that "
"runs on a wide variety of platforms, including Windows, Linux, and macOS. "
"While it is primarily a tracing profiler, it can also periodically sample "
"data like a :ref:`sampling profiler <doc_sampling_profilers>`, giving some "
"of the benefits of both approaches."
msgstr ""
"`Tracy <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy>`__ ແມ່ນຕົວວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບແບບ Open "
"Source ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມ, ລວມທັງ Windows, Linux, ແລະ macOS. ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະເປັນຕົວ"
"ວິເຄາະແບບຕິດຕາມ (tracing profiler) ເປັນຫຼັກ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງສາມາດສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂໍ້ມູນເປັນໄລຍະໆໄດ້ຄືກັບ "
":ref:`sampling profiler <doc_sampling_profilers>`, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກທັງສອງວິ"
"ທີ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:15
msgid "Build Godot with Tracy support"
msgstr "ສ້າງ (build) Godot ໂດຍຮອງຮັບ Tracy"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:17
msgid ""
"First, clone the latest version of the Tracy source code (\"0.13.0\" at the "
"time of writing) using Git:"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ clone source code ຂອງ Tracy ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ (\"0.13.0\" ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ຂຽນນີ້) ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"Git:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:24
msgid "This will create a ``tracy`` directory - you can place this anywhere."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``tracy`` ຂຶ້ນມາ - ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງມັນໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, build the release templates for your platform using ``scons``, but "
"adding the ``profiler=tracy profiler_path=path/to/tracy`` arguments with the "
"real path to the ``tracy`` directory, as well as ``debug_symbols=yes`` to "
"allow Tracy's sampling features to work."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ release templates ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ ``scons``, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມອາຣ໌ກິວເມັ້"
"ນ ``profiler=tracy profiler_path=path/to/tracy`` ໂດຍລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງແທ້ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ "
"``tracy``, ແລະ ໃສ່ ``debug_symbols=yes`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟີເຈີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Tracy ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:33
msgid ""
"You don't have to build release templates, you could also build debug "
"templates, or even the editor. However, it's generally recommended to "
"profile release templates, because that is the version your players will "
"use, and it will perform differently than other types of builds."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງແຕ່ release templates ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ debug templates ຫຼື ແມ່ນແ"
"ຕ່ຕົວ editor ເອງກໍໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແນະນຳໃຫ້ວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບໃນ release "
"templates ເພາະມັນແມ່ນເວີຊັນທີ່ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຈະໃຊ້ແທ້, ແລະ ມັນຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຕ່າງຈາກການ build ແບບອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:38
msgid "For example, to build release templates for Windows:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການສ້າງ release templates ສຳລັບ Windows:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:45
msgid "Get the Tracy \"server\""
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Tracy \"server\""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:47
msgid ""
"In Tracy terminology, the application you are profiling is the \"client\", "
"and the one receiving the data is the \"server\"."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄຳສັບຂອງ Tracy, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງວິເຄາະແມ່ນ \"client\", ແລະ ແອັບທີ່ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນ "
"\"server\"."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:50
msgid ""
"If you are on Windows, you can download a pre-built ``tracy-profiler.exe`` "
"from the Tracy `releases page <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases>`_."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ Windows, ເຈົ້າສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ ``tracy-profiler.exe`` ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວໄດ້ຈາກ `ໜ້າ "
"releases ຂອງ Tracy <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases>`_."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:53
msgid ""
"However, if you're on Linux or macOS, you'll either need to find a pre-built "
"binary from a package manager (like ``brew`` or ``nix``), or build it from "
"source yourself."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ Linux ຫຼື macOS, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງຊອກຫາ binary ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວຈາກ package "
"manager (ເຊັ່ນ ``brew`` ຫຼື ``nix``), ຫຼື ສ້າງມັນຈາກ source ເອງ."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:59
msgid ""
"If you do use a pre-built binary, be sure to use the same version that you "
"used when building Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ binary ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຕອນສ້າງ Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:63
msgid "Build the Tracy server from source"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Tracy server ຈາກ source"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:65
msgid ""
"In order to build Tracy, you'll need to install ``cmake``, which can be "
"downloaded from the `CMake website <https://cmake.org/download/>`_, or "
"possibly installed via a package manager (like ``brew`` or ``nix``)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ Tracy, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ ``cmake`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ `ເວັບໄຊ CMake <https://"
"cmake.org/download/>`_, ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ package manager (ເຊັ່ນ ``brew`` ຫຼື ``nix``)."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:69
msgid ""
"The full instructions for building Tracy from source can be found in the "
"`Tracy manual <https://github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases/latest/download/"
