msgstr ""
"ຄຳແນະນຳການສ້າງ Tracy ຈາກ source ແບບເຕັມສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ `ຄູ່ມື Tracy <https://"
"github.com/wolfpld/tracy/releases/latest/download/tracy.pdf>`_, ແຕ່ສະຫຼຸບຫຍໍ້ໆມີດັ່ງ"
"ນີ້:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/profiling/tracy.rst:79
msgid ""
"This will place the binary at ``tracy/profiler/build/tracy-profiler`` or "
